arket with 40 square feet of surface area. With a powder coated frame made of aircraft grade aluminum and 3mm thick steel brackets it has the strongest rebound of anything available. The angle adjusts to seven positions for all around training. The Tekk® Trainer is extremely strong and durable and built to last for years.Practice on your own and get better fasterWith the Tekk® Trainer you don't need anyone else. You can practice by yourself and get better on your own with the exact same product the pros use at their training sessions. The ball comes back to you at game speed, simulating real game situations. This enables field players and goalkeepers to master their technique and control. It is also perfect for baseball and lacrosse.Angle adjusts to seven positions for all around training.Field PlayersPractice side volleys, in-step, passing, shooting, trapping, and heading.Work on ball control with your thigh and chest.Strengthen your weaker foot.Increase leg strength.Control and shoot; control and dribble.Practice ball striking and finishing.Use it as a wall.GoalkeepersWork on your footwork and diving.Master your hand positions, catching, and body shape.Strengthen your arm and throwing accuracy.Improve quickness and agility.Allows you to react to game type situationsProduct FeaturesStrongest portable trainer on the market; crossbar withstands 125lb loadLargest fully portable trainer on the market that angles; 40 square feet of target areaSets up in five minutesAll in one-piece; folds up for easy storage; weighs 35lbsAngle adjusts to seven positions for all around trainingMade of aircraft grade aluminum and 3mm thick steel brackets. Built to last for years.Ball comes back to you at game speedUsed by the pros in soccer for daily trainingUsed by college athletes for soccer, baseball and lacrosseEasily convert into a soccer goal with the purchase of a Tekk® soccer goal conversion kitPractice target shooting for soccer and lacrosse and use the Tekk® Trainer for football and hockey with the purchase of a Tekk® target rebounder netSpecifications2 inch square aircraft grade aluminum tubingHeavy duty 3mm thick steel bracketsTubing and brackets are powder coatedFolded dimensions in inches: 60L x 10W x 4HSet-up dimensions in feet: 5H x 8W x 4DWeight: 35lbsAccessories IncludedRebounder Net: 45 ply P.E. knotted 1.75 inch square6mm Net bungee straps with stainless steel hooksHeavy duty 12 spikes with flangesRubber padsAbout Tekk®Tekk® was founded in 1999 with the sole purpose of developing innovative products to pioneer change in the training methods of professional and amateur athletes, resulting in the development of technically sound athletes around the world. All of our products are developed through the input of professional coaches and athletes.Our company policy, Tekk® products must first be consistently used by the pros or we will not introduce them into the market place. As a result, Tekk® products are of the highest quality and they are guaranteed to make you better. Tekk® is for those who have the desire and passion for excellence.*None of the individuals in the videos have been paid for their comments regarding Tekk® products.", "text": "Tekk Trainer Rebounder Goal (Soccer, Basketball, Lacrosse, Baseball) Tekk® is the leader in the next generation of training equipment. With its patented one-piece design it is the strongest and largest trainer on the market with 40 square feet of surface area. With a powder coated frame made of aircraft grade aluminum and 3mm thick steel brackets it has the strongest rebound of anything available. The angle adjusts to seven positions for all around training. The Tekk® Trainer is extremely strong and durable and built to last for years.Practice on your own and get better fasterWith the Tekk® Trainer you don't need anyone else. You can practice by yourself and get better on your own with the exact same product the pros use at their training sessions. The ball comes back to you at game speed, simulating real game situations. This enables field players and goalkeepers to master their technique and control. It is also perfect for baseball and lacrosse.Angle adjusts to seven positions for all around training.Field PlayersPractice side volleys, in-step, passing, shooting, trapping, and heading.Work on ball control with your thigh and chest.Strengthen your weaker foot.Increase leg strength.Control and shoot; control and dribble.Practice ball striking and finishing.Use it as a wall.GoalkeepersWork on your footwork and diving.Master your hand positions, catching, and body shape.Strengthen your arm and throwing accuracy.Improve quickness and agility.Allows you to react to game type situationsProduct FeaturesStrongest portable trainer on the market; crossbar withstands 125lb loadLargest fully portable trainer on the market that angles; 40 square feet of target areaSets up in five minutesAll in one-piece; folds up for easy storage; weighs 35lbsAngle adjusts to seven positions for all around trainingMade of aircraft grade aluminum and 3mm thick steel brackets. Built to last for years.Ball comes back to you at game speedUsed by the pros in soccer for daily trainingUsed by college athletes for soccer, baseball and lacrosseEasily convert into a soccer goal with the purchase of a Tekk® soccer goal conversion kitPractice target shooting for soccer and lacrosse and use the Tekk® Trainer for football and hockey with the purchase of a Tekk® target rebounder netSpecifications2 inch square aircraft grade aluminum tubingHeavy duty 3mm thick steel bracketsTubing and brackets are powder coatedFolded dimensions in inches: 60L x 10W x 4HSet-up dimensions in feet: 5H x 8W x 4DWeight: 35lbsAccessories IncludedRebounder Net: 45 ply P.E. knotted 1.75 inch square6mm Net bungee straps with stainless steel hooksHeavy duty 12 spikes with flangesRubber padsAbout Tekk®Tekk® was founded in 1999 with the sole purpose of developing innovative products to pioneer change in the training methods of professional and amateur athletes, resulting in the development of technically sound athletes around the world. All of our products are developed through the input of professional coaches and athletes.Our company policy, Tekk® products must first be consistently used by the pros or we will not introduce them into the market place. As a result, Tekk® products are of the highest quality and they are guaranteed to make you better. Tekk® is for those who have the desire and passion for excellence.*None of the individuals in the videos have been paid for their comments regarding Tekk® products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5105vA9JJhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZHAKCK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tekk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Soccer", "Field Equipment", "Goals"]], "price": 291.51}}
{"item_id": "B006ZMVN58", "title": "Brine King 250 Soccer Ball (White,Size 3)", "description": "Super-soft synthetic cover - Air-Tight Butyl bladder for superior air retention - Machine stitched - Optimal for training play - 2-year unconditional guarantee.", "text": "Brine King 250 Soccer Ball (White,Size 3) Super-soft synthetic cover - Air-Tight Butyl bladder for superior air retention - Machine stitched - Optimal for training play - 2-year unconditional guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kBKdZFInL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZMVN58.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Soccer", "Balls"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B006ZNCCSE", "title": "25 Pack - Prairie Dog Target 8 1/2\" by 11\" - Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Multi Color - See Your Hits Instantly - Gun and Rifle Targets", "description": "GlowShot Prairie Dog Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. Our Animal Targets Including Prairie Dogs and Turkeys come in 25 Packs", "text": "25 Pack - Prairie Dog Target 8 1/2\" by 11\" - Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Multi Color - See Your Hits Instantly - Gun and Rifle Targets GlowShot Prairie Dog Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. Our Animal Targets Including Prairie Dogs and Turkeys come in 25 Packs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NaZjvVRtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZNCCSE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B006ZNF8T4", "title": "25 Pack - 4 Bullseye - Reactive Splatter Targets - Tagboard and Adhesive Versions- GlowShot - Multi Color - Gun and Rifle Targets", "description": "GlowShot 4 Bullseye Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. These targets are made of either a heavy duty reinforced tag board or and Adhesive Sticker. They both withstand dozens of shots.", "text": "25 Pack - 4 Bullseye - Reactive Splatter Targets - Tagboard and Adhesive Versions- GlowShot - Multi Color - Gun and Rifle Targets GlowShot 4 Bullseye Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. These targets are made of either a heavy duty reinforced tag board or and Adhesive Sticker. They both withstand dozens of shots.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51khqwRos1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZNF8T4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B006ZP9W6M", "title": "Tac Force TF-688SF Assisted Opening Folding Knife 4.5-Inch Closed", "description": "Tac Force Rescue Linerlock A/O - Special Forces. 4 1/2\" closed. 3 1/4\" partially serrated black finish stainless assisted opening blade with dual thumb studs and extended tang. Black aluminum handles with black trim etched \"Special Forces\". Special Forces shield. Integrated glass breaker and seat belt cutter. Black finish stainess pocket clip.", "text": "Tac Force TF-688SF Assisted Opening Folding Knife 4.5-Inch Closed Tac Force Rescue Linerlock A/O - Special Forces. 4 1/2\" closed. 3 1/4\" partially serrated black finish stainless assisted opening blade with dual thumb studs and extended tang. Black aluminum handles with black trim etched \"Special Forces\". Special Forces shield. Integrated glass breaker and seat belt cutter. Black finish stainess pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PTo3BuIWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZP9W6M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TAC Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 8.57}}
{"item_id": "B006ZQWC5E", "title": "Replacement Foam Helmet Pads Universal Kit Bicycle Cycling Skating", "description": "BEWARE OF FRAUDULENT SELLERS, WE ARE THE MANUFACTURER OF THIS PRODUCT AND WE DO NOT SELL TO WHOLESALERS OR DISTRIBUTORS, IF YOU SEE THIS KIT FOR SALE FROM ANOTHER SELLER YOU WILL BE GETTING A FAKE, PLEASE DO NOT SUPPORT THESE FRAUDULENT SELLERS thank you. Thanks, for looking at our product, our kit is 5/16\" thick, others are only 1/16 our Professional grade universal foam replacement pad kit is designed to replace old worn pads or to add comfort with additional foam pads anywhere on your helmet. Works great in all helmets including: cycling, skate board helmets, motorcycle helmets, snowboarding helmets etc. Proudly made in the USA, made from industrial grade breathable washable soft foam that is guaranteed to provide a more comfortable fit than what came in your helmet from the factory. We take pride in our product and offer 100% full refund money back guarantee if you're not completely happy, thanks again for giving us the opportunity to do business with you.", "text": "Replacement Foam Helmet Pads Universal Kit Bicycle Cycling Skating BEWARE OF FRAUDULENT SELLERS, WE ARE THE MANUFACTURER OF THIS PRODUCT AND WE DO NOT SELL TO WHOLESALERS OR DISTRIBUTORS, IF YOU SEE THIS KIT FOR SALE FROM ANOTHER SELLER YOU WILL BE GETTING A FAKE, PLEASE DO NOT SUPPORT THESE FRAUDULENT SELLERS thank you. Thanks, for looking at our product, our kit is 5/16\" thick, others are only 1/16 our Professional grade universal foam replacement pad kit is designed to replace old worn pads or to add comfort with additional foam pads anywhere on your helmet. Works great in all helmets including: cycling, skate board helmets, motorcycle helmets, snowboarding helmets etc. Proudly made in the USA, made from industrial grade breathable washable soft foam that is guaranteed to provide a more comfortable fit than what came in your helmet from the factory. We take pride in our product and offer 100% full refund money back guarantee if you're not completely happy, thanks again for giving us the opportunity to do business with you.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DjUFcgUrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZQWC5E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 9.99}}
