 Bottle .6L , water bottle , water bottles , hydration bottles , hydration , bottles , camping", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BahzyD3VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZT87Z0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 13.97}}
