{"item_id": "B006ZT8YFI", "title": "Camelbak Eddy Bottle", "description": "Staying hydrated can either make or break your day, so keep your Camelbak Eddy 1L handy (and filled) and you'll never find yourself in that dehydrated slump again! PRODUCT FEATURES: Hydration Capacity: 32 oz (1 L) CamelBak Got Your Bak Guarantee: If we built it, we'll Bak it with our lifetime guarantee Redesigned cap and bite valve provide faster flow and enhanced durability Flip, Bite and Sip. No tipping required (though possible: just remove the straw) New redesigned bottle shape; 1L size lets you drink more, refill less Dishwasher Safe: All parts are top-rack dishwasher safe Durable and spill-proof Easy to carry: Integrated loop handle makes it easy to clip a carabiner or carry with the crook of a finger 100% BPA-Free Wide-mouth opening is easy to fill with ice and water and a breeze to clean New CamelBak Big Bite Valve is compatible with CamelBak eddy and CamelBak Groove bottles 53364 , Camelbak Eddy 1L , camel back water bottles , water bottles , hydration bottles , hydration , bottles , camping bpa free bottles", "text": "Camelbak Eddy Bottle Staying hydrated can either make or break your day, so keep your Camelbak Eddy 1L handy (and filled) and you'll never find yourself in that dehydrated slump again! PRODUCT FEATURES: Hydration Capacity: 32 oz (1 L) CamelBak Got Your Bak Guarantee: If we built it, we'll Bak it with our lifetime guarantee Redesigned cap and bite valve provide faster flow and enhanced durability Flip, Bite and Sip. No tipping required (though possible: just remove the straw) New redesigned bottle shape; 1L size lets you drink more, refill less Dishwasher Safe: All parts are top-rack dishwasher safe Durable and spill-proof Easy to carry: Integrated loop handle makes it easy to clip a carabiner or carry with the crook of a finger 100% BPA-Free Wide-mouth opening is easy to fill with ice and water and a breeze to clean New CamelBak Big Bite Valve is compatible with CamelBak eddy and CamelBak Groove bottles 53364 , Camelbak Eddy 1L , camel back water bottles , water bottles , hydration bottles , hydration , bottles , camping bpa free bottles", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31e%2B45zMtbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZT8YFI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 14.99}}
