{"item_id": "B006ZT9INU", "title": "Camelbak Eddy Stainless Bottle", "description": "Leak-proof, weird-stale-water-smell-proof, crash-proof. Camelbak's Eddy utilizes the tried-and-true drinking straw in conjunction with their infamous Bite Valve to allow you to easily sip your water when you're on the go.", "text": "Camelbak Eddy Stainless Bottle Leak-proof, weird-stale-water-smell-proof, crash-proof. Camelbak's Eddy utilizes the tried-and-true drinking straw in conjunction with their infamous Bite Valve to allow you to easily sip your water when you're on the go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314Q0%2BVR7tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZT9INU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 29.99}}
