{"item_id": "B006ZV62H8", "title": "Camelbak All Clear Bottle Pre-Filter", "description": "The 100-micron Pre-Filter screen attaches to the rim of your water bottle, allowing you to filter out any large particulate matter so you're not chewing on sand for the rest of your hike.", "text": "Camelbak All Clear Bottle Pre-Filter The 100-micron Pre-Filter screen attaches to the rim of your water bottle, allowing you to filter out any large particulate matter so you're not chewing on sand for the rest of your hike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rcsyZUgML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZV62H8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006ZV68J0", "title": "Eddy Stainless Insulated .5L Bottle", "description": "The Eddy Stainless Insulated .5L Bottle from Camelbak will keep your liquids cooler longer. The loop top makes it easy to clip to any pack or toss it in an external pouch in your pack for easy access. PRODUCT FEATURES: Hydration Capacity: 16 oz (.5 L) CamelBak Got Your Bak Guarantee: If we built it, we'll Bak it with our lifetime guarantee Double-Wall vacuum insulation keeps water cool for hours Flip, Bite and Sip. No tipping required (though possible: just remove the straw) Durable and spill-proof Easy to carry: Integrated loop handle makes it easy to clip a carabiner or carry with the crook of a finger Naturally 100% BPA-Free, taste-free stainless steel. No inner liners or plastic coatings that aluminum bottles require Wide-mouth opening is easy to fill with ice and water and a breeze to clean New CamelBak Big Bite Valve is compatible with CamelBak eddy and CamelBak Groove bottles Hydration Capacity: 16 oz (.5 L) 100% BPA-Free CamelBak Got Your Bak Lifetime Guarantee Dimensions: 3 x 3.5 x 10 in (8 x 9 x 25.5 cm) Big Bite Valve Material: medical grade silicone Straw Material: BPA-Free Bottle Material: Naturally BPA-Free 302 Stainless Steel Insulation: Double-Wall vacuum designed to keep water cool and reduce condensation 53388 , camelbak Eddy Stainless Insulated .5L bottle , water bottles , hydration bottles , hydration , bottles , camping", "text": "Eddy Stainless Insulated .5L Bottle The Eddy Stainless Insulated .5L Bottle from Camelbak will keep your liquids cooler longer. The loop top makes it easy to clip to any pack or toss it in an external pouch in your pack for easy access. PRODUCT FEATURES: Hydration Capacity: 16 oz (.5 L) CamelBak Got Your Bak Guarantee: If we built it, we'll Bak it with our lifetime guarantee Double-Wall vacuum insulation keeps water cool for hours Flip, Bite and Sip. No tipping required (though possible: just remove the straw) Durable and spill-proof Easy to carry: Integrated loop handle makes it easy to clip a carabiner or carry with the crook of a finger Naturally 100% BPA-Free, taste-free stainless steel. No inner liners or plastic coatings that aluminum bottles require Wide-mouth opening is easy to fill with ice and water and a breeze to clean New CamelBak Big Bite Valve is compatible with CamelBak eddy and CamelBak Groove bottles Hydration Capacity: 16 oz (.5 L) 100% BPA-Free CamelBak Got Your Bak Lifetime Guarantee Dimensions: 3 x 3.5 x 10 in (8 x 9 x 25.5 cm) Big Bite Valve Material: medical grade silicone Straw Material: BPA-Free Bottle Material: Naturally BPA-Free 302 Stainless Steel Insulation: Double-Wall vacuum designed to keep water cool and reduce condensation 53388 , camelbak Eddy Stainless Insulated .5L bottle , water bottles , hydration bottles , hydration , bottles , camping", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sI6kBYgqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZV68J0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 29.9}}
