{"item_id": "B00704IO48", "title": "Kidoozie Foam Pogo Jumper", "description": "Jumping fun for everyone! Made from soft, durable foam and great for indoor and outdoor play This lovable foam pogo jumper squeaks with every hop! The bungee stretches to accommodate children of all heights and can support up to 250 pounds. Kids and adults alike will have a hopping good time on the Hop & Squeak Pogo Jumper. (From ages 3 to 100 depending on the functionality of your bones at that age.", "text": "Kidoozie Foam Pogo Jumper Jumping fun for everyone! Made from soft, durable foam and great for indoor and outdoor play This lovable foam pogo jumper squeaks with every hop! The bungee stretches to accommodate children of all heights and can support up to 250 pounds. Kids and adults alike will have a hopping good time on the Hop & Squeak Pogo Jumper. (From ages 3 to 100 depending on the functionality of your bones at that age.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61Cm1vj9%2BjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00704IO48.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kidoozie", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Pogo Sticks"]], "price": 18.81}}
{"item_id": "B0070ISX36", "title": "Laserlyte Bersa Thunder Laser .380 + .380 CK-MS", "description": "LaserLyte proudly introduces the CK-MS for the popular personal defense pistols, the Bersa Thunder .380 and .380 Plus. The laser is easy and quick to mount on the Bersa trigger guard and snugs-up securely to the dust cover and simple to activate with the ambidextrous, ergonomic switch. The LaserLyte CK-MS laser is easily programmable to either constant on or pulse mode. Another great feature is the “auto-off” feature that displays a unique flash after 5-minutes of operation and automatically turns the unit off after 6-minutes.", "text": "Laserlyte Bersa Thunder Laser .380 + .380 CK-MS LaserLyte proudly introduces the CK-MS for the popular personal defense pistols, the Bersa Thunder .380 and .380 Plus. The laser is easy and quick to mount on the Bersa trigger guard and snugs-up securely to the dust cover and simple to activate with the ambidextrous, ergonomic switch. The LaserLyte CK-MS laser is easily programmable to either constant on or pulse mode. Another great feature is the “auto-off” feature that displays a unique flash after 5-minutes of operation and automatically turns the unit off after 6-minutes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B13kikAuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0070ISX36.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 83.05}}
{"item_id": "B0070LDKTU", "title": "The AmmoBroom -NO MORE BENDING OVER TO PICK UP AMMO! Save Time & Make Money Collecting Brass! Collect Pistol & Rifle Brass from 9mm to 45 AND .223 & .308 Rifle! Works on MULTIPLE Surfaces: Grass, Dirt, Concrete, or Range Floor! 100% Maintenance Free, NO Motor or Fuel Needed! FULL 12 MONTH WARRANTY!", "description": "\"I've collected about 75lbs of brass IN ONE MONTH!! I love this thing. It really saves time and makes me extra cash on the side!\"\"I can't tell you how much EASIER it is to save your brass with this little beauty!\"\"It works GREAT...Handiest shell picker upper ever!\"...TONS of shooters are experiencing the time-and-money-saving POWER of the AmmoBroom for themselves...and now you can too!*You'll NEVER Bend Over for Shells Again!*With the AmmoBroom on your side, picking up brass ammo off the ground goes from being a painful and time-consuming task, to being a complete BREEZE! In literally seconds, you'll have ALL your brass shells off the ground and where you want them with absolutely NO bending over, crouching, or straining!Collect ALL your centerfire brass from 9mm through 45, and .223 and .308! Plus, it WON'T pick up 22 caliber!*MORE for Your Money*We all know how expensive ammo is, and that's why reloading shells is the smart option. But, we also know how much time and energy it takes to collect shells from the ground...but NOT anymore! Some users have paid for their AmmoBroom just off the extra brass shells they're collecting at the range! Could you use the extra time you'll save, plus the extra cash you'll produce with all the shells you'll easily collect?There isn't ANYTHING else like the AmmoBroom. While other sellers offer you a cheaper price on a cheaper product, they offer you MUCH less. Do yourself a favor and start with the BEST. Remember, this isn't a purchase...it's an investment. It's your time and body at stake.Feel confident knowing the PROVEN technology behind our product, plus the overwhelmingly positive reviews, makes it truly unmatched.Try it now, click \"Add to Cart\" above!", "text": "The AmmoBroom -NO MORE BENDING OVER TO PICK UP AMMO! Save Time & Make Money Collecting Brass! Collect Pistol & Rifle Brass from 9mm to 45 AND .223 & .308 Rifle! Works on MULTIPLE Surfaces: Grass, Dirt, Concrete, or Range Floor! 100% Maintenance Free, NO Motor or Fuel Needed! FULL 12 MONTH WARRANTY! \"I've collected about 75lbs of brass IN ONE MONTH!! I love this thing. It really saves time and makes me extra cash on the side!\"\"I can't tell you how much EASIER it is to save your brass with this little beauty!\"\"It works GREAT...Handiest shell picker upper ever!\"...TONS of shooters are experiencing the time-and-money-saving POWER of the AmmoBroom for themselves...and now you can too!*You'll NEVER Bend Over for Shells Again!*With the AmmoBroom on your side, picking up brass ammo off the ground goes from being a painful and time-consuming task, to being a complete BREEZE! In literally seconds, you'll have ALL your brass shells off the ground and where you want them with absolutely NO bending over, crouching, or straining!Collect ALL your centerfire brass from 9mm through 45, and .223 and .308! Plus, it WON'T pick up 22 caliber!*MORE for Your Money*We all know how expensive ammo is, and that's why reloading shells is the smart option. But, we also know how much time and energy it takes to collect shells from the ground...but NOT anymore! Some users have paid for their AmmoBroom just off the extra brass shells they're collecting at the range! Could you use the extra time you'll save, plus the extra cash you'll produce with all the shells you'll easily collect?There isn't ANYTHING else like the AmmoBroom. While other sellers offer you a cheaper price on a cheaper product, they offer you MUCH less. Do yourself a favor and start with the BEST. Remember, this isn't a purchase...it's an investment. It's your time and body at stake.Feel confident knowing the PROVEN technology behind our product, plus the overwhelmingly positive reviews, makes it truly unmatched.Try it now, click \"Add to Cart\" above!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BYbSkmrxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0070LDKTU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B0070TZ7MA", "title": "Glass Water Bottle with Flip Cap & Silicone Sleeve, 22 oz, by Lifefactory", "description": "As a leader in the glass bottle movement, Lifefactory creates durable reusable bottles with elegant design that are meant to last. This 22 oz glass water bottle with narrow mouth flip top provides a clean tasting drink on-the-go any time. An integrated handle makes it easy to carry or clip to your bag or backpack, and stows out of the way while you drink. The colorful silicone sleeve (that's made in the USA!) helps prevent breakage and provides a gripping surface. A stylish, smart alternative to bottled water and plastic beverage bottles! Please note: While the flip cap seals when closed, it is not \"upside-down, bottom-of-the-bag leak-proof\" per the folks at Lifefactory. Also, as with any glass product, this durable glass bottle can break if dropped.", "text": "Glass Water Bottle with Flip Cap & Silicone Sleeve, 22 oz, by Lifefactory As a leader in the glass bottle movement, Lifefactory creates durable reusable bottles with elegant design that are meant to last. This 22 oz glass water bottle with narrow mouth flip top provides a clean tasting drink on-the-go any time. An integrated handle makes it easy to carry or clip to your bag or backpack, and stows out of the way while you drink. The colorful silicone sleeve (that's made in the USA!) helps prevent breakage and provides a gripping surface. A stylish, smart alternative to bottled water and plastic beverage bottles! Please note: While the flip cap seals when closed, it is not \"upside-down, bottom-of-the-bag leak-proof\" per the folks at Lifefactory. Also, as with any glass product, this durable glass bottle can break if dropped.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-qEo0xWCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0070TZ7MA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
