{"item_id": "B0071BRZ6S", "title": "Desantis Pocket-Tuk Holster fits 2-Inch Colt Detective Special", "description": "The Pocket-Tuk is a dual purpose pocket and tuck-able IWB holster. The clip can rotate 360 degrees to fit any carry position. The reinforced mouth aids in re-holstering and the suede construction helps keep it all in place. Each Pocket-Tuk is supplied with a hex key to facilitate clip removal for pocket use.", "text": "Desantis Pocket-Tuk Holster fits 2-Inch Colt Detective Special The Pocket-Tuk is a dual purpose pocket and tuck-able IWB holster. The clip can rotate 360 degrees to fit any carry position. The reinforced mouth aids in re-holstering and the suede construction helps keep it all in place. Each Pocket-Tuk is supplied with a hex key to facilitate clip removal for pocket use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tbs-xQNIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0071BRZ6S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.48}}
{"item_id": "B0071E98NI", "title": "Atwood Rope 1/16 inch Microcord 100 foot spool, Mosquito Cord, 2mm paracord, Micro Parachute Cord - BLACK", "description": "Great cord for smaller products. Same great Atwood quality. Micro rope, mini paracord, mosquito rope or call it what you want. Made in the USA and comes on a spool.", "text": "Atwood Rope 1/16 inch Microcord 100 foot spool, Mosquito Cord, 2mm paracord, Micro Parachute Cord - BLACK Great cord for smaller products. Same great Atwood quality. Micro rope, mini paracord, mosquito rope or call it what you want. Made in the USA and comes on a spool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hz-fS7dFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0071E98NI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 9.0}}
