{"item_id": "B0071HM06C", "title": "Warrior Ghillie Suit", "description": "Warrior Ghillie Suits by Arcturus Camo introduces their newest ghillie suit. Appropriately named the Warrior Ghillie Suit, this is a great, affordable ghillie suit for under $100. Don't let the price fool you. This is the ultimate 3D camouflage ghillie suit and it comes with everything you need to blend into any terrain. Made with lightweight synthetic threads sewn onto a breathable digital jacket and pants and weighting in at 3 lbs, this ghillie suit won't weigh you down. This synthetic material is fire retardent, mildew and moisture resistant.This ghillie suit is 4 pieces and comes with a button down front jacket, pants with draw cords, a boonie hat which covers the entire face, and a rifle cover. The entire suit comes in a stretchable carrying bag.It comes in two adult sizes, M/L (6'0\" and under) and XL/XXL (6'1 and over) and also four color patterns, Woodland, Field Grass, Night Ops, and Sage Brush. Also available in a woodland kids ghillie suit for kids 4'8\" to 5'4\". The field grass pattern is different from the standard desert because it does not contain browns or blacks. Field grass is predominately tan and light olive which will blend in perfectly in any fall or winter grassland situation.Features:Complete Ghillie Suit (Jacket, Pants, Boonie Hat with Face Veil and Rifle Wrap)Digital Woodland or Desert Camo PatternAdjustable DrawstringsUltra Light Double Mesh ShellFire Retardant Synthetic ThreadCamouflage Carrying BagNon-AllergenicJacket Specifications:Breathable Inner Mesh Shell5 Snap ButtonsElastic Waist and CuffsPants Specifications:Inner Camouflage Mesh ShellElastic Waist with Adjustable DrawstringElastic AnklesBoonie Hat Specifications:Digital Woodland or Desert Camo PatternSee through face veilFull head and face coverage", "text": "Warrior Ghillie Suit Warrior Ghillie Suits by Arcturus Camo introduces their newest ghillie suit. Appropriately named the Warrior Ghillie Suit, this is a great, affordable ghillie suit for under $100. Don't let the price fool you. This is the ultimate 3D camouflage ghillie suit and it comes with everything you need to blend into any terrain. Made with lightweight synthetic threads sewn onto a breathable digital jacket and pants and weighting in at 3 lbs, this ghillie suit won't weigh you down. This synthetic material is fire retardent, mildew and moisture resistant.This ghillie suit is 4 pieces and comes with a button down front jacket, pants with draw cords, a boonie hat which covers the entire face, and a rifle cover. The entire suit comes in a stretchable carrying bag.It comes in two adult sizes, M/L (6'0\" and under) and XL/XXL (6'1 and over) and also four color patterns, Woodland, Field Grass, Night Ops, and Sage Brush. Also available in a woodland kids ghillie suit for kids 4'8\" to 5'4\". The field grass pattern is different from the standard desert because it does not contain browns or blacks. Field grass is predominately tan and light olive which will blend in perfectly in any fall or winter grassland situation.Features:Complete Ghillie Suit (Jacket, Pants, Boonie Hat with Face Veil and Rifle Wrap)Digital Woodland or Desert Camo PatternAdjustable DrawstringsUltra Light Double Mesh ShellFire Retardant Synthetic ThreadCamouflage Carrying BagNon-AllergenicJacket Specifications:Breathable Inner Mesh Shell5 Snap ButtonsElastic Waist and CuffsPants Specifications:Inner Camouflage Mesh ShellElastic Waist with Adjustable DrawstringElastic AnklesBoonie Hat Specifications:Digital Woodland or Desert Camo PatternSee through face veilFull head and face coverage", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61zdVAqeGCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0071HM06C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0071HX97Q", "title": "Mosin Nagant 17.5\" Cleaning Rod M38, M44, M91/59, M91/38, T53", "description": "m44 cleaning rod", "text": "Mosin Nagant 17.5\" Cleaning Rod M38, M44, M91/59, M91/38, T53 m44 cleaning rod", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21R30K0jhzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0071HX97Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FieldSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 3.92}}
{"item_id": "B0071MOP3S", "title": "Pistol Carry Bag - Concealment Fanny Pack - Fits up to 50 in Waist", "description": "Gun concealment fanny pack features the look of a common waist pack yet is able to discreetly and safely store your hand gun. General waist pack functionality offers four storage pockets. An expandable mesh front pocket is able to hold more than one cell phone, or a camera or walkie. Small zippered slip pocket is great for storing change or small valuables. Medium zip pocket measures: 4.25in x 4.50in x 1.5in, while a third larger zip pocket measures: 8in x 5in x 1in. Front pockets are great for storing your wallet, extra ammunition or whatever you many need to have with you. The gun concealing pocket measures: 10.5in (widest) x 6.5in (tallest) x 3in (deepest) featuring right and left 'quick release' pull tabs. This pocket is lined with thick Velcro strips that hold the removable holster securely in place. Removable gun holster measures 5.5in (widest) x 3.75in (tallest) while the gun barrel hole measures 1.75in. Holster features a 1.5 inch loop at the top with a removable strip that has Velcro closure. These features may allow you to attach the holster to another accessory such as a belt. Fanny Pack with hidden gun pocket features a nylon waist strap that is adjustable up to a 50 inch waist. Created from 600 denier polyester to be durable and stain resistant. This top quality Gun Concealment Fanny Pack is a useful item for any gun carrying Man or Woman. Available in Black only.", "text": "Pistol Carry Bag - Concealment Fanny Pack - Fits up to 50 in Waist Gun concealment fanny pack features the look of a common waist pack yet is able to discreetly and safely store your hand gun. General waist pack functionality offers four storage pockets. An expandable mesh front pocket is able to hold more than one cell phone, or a camera or walkie. Small zippered slip pocket is great for storing change or small valuables. Medium zip pocket measures: 4.25in x 4.50in x 1.5in, while a third larger zip pocket measures: 8in x 5in x 1in. Front pockets are great for storing your wallet, extra ammunition or whatever you many need to have with you. The gun concealing pocket measures: 10.5in (widest) x 6.5in (tallest) x 3in (deepest) featuring right and left 'quick release' pull tabs. This pocket is lined with thick Velcro strips that hold the removable holster securely in place. Removable gun holster measures 5.5in (widest) x 3.75in (tallest) while the gun barrel hole measures 1.75in. Holster features a 1.5 inch loop at the top with a removable strip that has Velcro closure. These features may allow you to attach the holster to another accessory such as a belt. Fanny Pack with hidden gun pocket features a nylon waist strap that is adjustable up to a 50 inch waist. Created from 600 denier polyester to be durable and stain resistant. This top quality Gun Concealment Fanny Pack is a useful item for any gun carrying Man or Woman. Available in Black only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NbOHrusVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0071MOP3S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0071N0EVY", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Therm Barrier Cycling Tight", "description": "ELITE Thermal Fleece fabric panels provide superior moisture transfer and warmth ELITE Barrier fabric provides superior wind protection Constructed leg articulation for a full range of motion ELITE 3D Chamois 8'' lower leg zipper with internal draft flap and zipper garage Contoured leg opening provides additional coverage at top of shoe Silicone gripper at ankles to keep tights in place 360 degree reflectivity", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Therm Barrier Cycling Tight ELITE Thermal Fleece fabric panels provide superior moisture transfer and warmth ELITE Barrier fabric provides superior wind protection Constructed leg articulation for a full range of motion ELITE 3D Chamois 8'' lower leg zipper with internal draft flap and zipper garage Contoured leg opening provides additional coverage at top of shoe Silicone gripper at ankles to keep tights in place 360 degree reflectivity", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fcXwMZH7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0071N0EVY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]], "price": 108.71}}
{"item_id": "B0071N0G4O", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Amfib Cycling Bib Tight", "description": "ELITE Softshell fabric provides superior wind and water protection in key exposure areas ELITE Thermal Fleece fabric panels on back provide superior moisture transfer and warmth Internal stirrup and gasket allow tight to be worn over shoe covers Opening at top of waist for easy access allows nature breaks ELITE 3D Chamois Polyester/spandex mesh upper is comfortable and supportive 360 degree reflectivity", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Amfib Cycling Bib Tight ELITE Softshell fabric provides superior wind and water protection in key exposure areas ELITE Thermal Fleece fabric panels on back provide superior moisture transfer and warmth Internal stirrup and gasket allow tight to be worn over shoe covers Opening at top of waist for easy access allows nature breaks ELITE 3D Chamois Polyester/spandex mesh upper is comfortable and supportive 360 degree reflectivity", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jOI5vEEWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0071N0G4O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0071N1IWS", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Thermal Barrier Jacket", "description": "SELECT Thermal Fleece sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer Barrier layer on key areas provides resistance to wind and water Back is non Barrier for added breathability Full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth Single rear zippered pocket with wiring port Reflect elements for low-light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Thermal Barrier Jacket SELECT Thermal Fleece sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer Barrier layer on key areas provides resistance to wind and water Back is non Barrier for added breathability Full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth Single rear zippered pocket with wiring port Reflect elements for low-light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aM83E0r0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0071N1IWS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jackets"]]}}
