{"item_id": "B0071QVA82", "title": "Spy Optic Targa 3 Goggles", "description": "Rules were meant to be broken. The all new Targa 3 combines progressive design, technology, and durability in one heaping helping of a goggle. Take a walk on the wild side without breaking your wallet in the progress.", "text": "Spy Optic Targa 3 Goggles Rules were meant to be broken. The all new Targa 3 combines progressive design, technology, and durability in one heaping helping of a goggle. Take a walk on the wild side without breaking your wallet in the progress.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qAZZM2bOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0071QVA82.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Goggles"]], "price": 54.99}}
{"item_id": "B0071T5TF4", "title": "Gym Gloves Alternative | Leather - Neoprene Weightlifting Grips | Mens - Womens Workout", "description": "Workout your Body, not your Hands!GymPaws Leather Lifting Grips are perfect for everyone from serious GymRats to gym newbies!1. The compact design fits right in the palm of your hands to protect against friction causing calluses.2. Slight padding eases hand fatigue allowing you to bust out those extra couple of reps.3. GymPaws areMoisture Resistantwhich means they won't absorb sweat, and you can toss 'em right in the washing machine and dryer along with your gym clothes!The Neoprene Backing and 4 Finger Loops keep them in place even through the most grueling workouts!Ideal for cross-training, circuit training, and super sets. There's no need to take them on and off between exercises or sets.100% Genuine Leather allows your hands to naturally rotate around the bar, and allows the bar or weight to naturally rotate in your hands.Spongy straps and grips that \"stick\" to the bar don't allow your hands to rotate. This not only tears apart the grips, but it can throw off your form!Made in the USA!All GymPaws products come with a 100% Satisfaction Guarantee!", "text": "Gym Gloves Alternative | Leather - Neoprene Weightlifting Grips | Mens - Womens Workout Workout your Body, not your Hands!GymPaws Leather Lifting Grips are perfect for everyone from serious GymRats to gym newbies!1. The compact design fits right in the palm of your hands to protect against friction causing calluses.2. Slight padding eases hand fatigue allowing you to bust out those extra couple of reps.3. GymPaws areMoisture Resistantwhich means they won't absorb sweat, and you can toss 'em right in the washing machine and dryer along with your gym clothes!The Neoprene Backing and 4 Finger Loops keep them in place even through the most grueling workouts!Ideal for cross-training, circuit training, and super sets. There's no need to take them on and off between exercises or sets.100% Genuine Leather allows your hands to naturally rotate around the bar, and allows the bar or weight to naturally rotate in your hands.Spongy straps and grips that \"stick\" to the bar don't allow your hands to rotate. This not only tears apart the grips, but it can throw off your form!Made in the USA!All GymPaws products come with a 100% Satisfaction Guarantee!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HkiQNUIvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0071T5TF4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B0072084TK", "title": "Archery Bowstring - FINGER SAVERS - By Pine Ridge Protects - 1 Set - Multi Colors", "description": "Finger Savers are made of a strong yet soft material that allows the shooter to shoot a bow without using a finger tab or release. Wrap your fingers around the Finger Saver which is just below your nocking point and you'll be ready to shoot. Finger Savers save time, creates consistency for beginning shooters like young kids and archers getting started in archery and works great for bowfishing. When you're trying to put more fish in the boat, Finger Savers are the answer. Finger Savers allows you to take faster and more accurate shots.", "text": "Archery Bowstring - FINGER SAVERS - By Pine Ridge Protects - 1 Set - Multi Colors Finger Savers are made of a strong yet soft material that allows the shooter to shoot a bow without using a finger tab or release. Wrap your fingers around the Finger Saver which is just below your nocking point and you'll be ready to shoot. Finger Savers save time, creates consistency for beginning shooters like young kids and archers getting started in archery and works great for bowfishing. When you're trying to put more fish in the boat, Finger Savers are the answer. Finger Savers allows you to take faster and more accurate shots.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PsL6z6KOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0072084TK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pine Ridge Archery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Protective Gear", "Finger Tabs"]], "price": 4.29}}
{"item_id": "B007218IZE", "title": "Nalgene 12 oz Kids On the Fly Water Bottle", "description": "Too big for the Grip 'n Gulp? Too small for the On the Fly? Try this on for size. Nalgene has taken the 12 ounce bottle and paired it with the leak-proof On the Fly cap. The silicone stopper is a little softer so it's easier for the little peeps to push it closed.DurableOdor resistantBPA freeEasy drinking spoutLocking bail ensures leakproof seal", "text": "Nalgene 12 oz Kids On the Fly Water Bottle Too big for the Grip 'n Gulp? Too small for the On the Fly? Try this on for size. Nalgene has taken the 12 ounce bottle and paired it with the leak-proof On the Fly cap. The silicone stopper is a little softer so it's easier for the little peeps to push it closed.DurableOdor resistantBPA freeEasy drinking spoutLocking bail ensures leakproof seal", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DmaTVS7JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007218IZE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 9.89}}
{"item_id": "B00721VLBM", "title": "Spot it! MLB", "description": "Batter up! Test your visual skills and have a ball with Spot it! MLB Edition. It plays just like regular Spot it!, but features the logos of all 30 major league teams, plus assorted baseball icons and images. Spot it! is a truly one-of-a-kind card game. Each card contains 8 images, and between any 2 cards there is one, and only one, matching image. Players simultaneously try to gain or get rid of cards by spotting matches between their card and either a center card or an opponent’s card. There are 5 challenging mini party games in one pack of Spot it! Spot it! MLB Edition combines this great card game with the classic game of baseball. Whether the logo of your favorite team, a bitter rival, or another image such as a baseball diamond, a scoreboard, or a pennant, spot it and you’ll be running the bases to victory! At home, in the car, at the park, or anywhere else baseball and gamers gather, Spot it! MLB Edition provides innings of fun and excitement. Game facts: Ages: 7 to Adult 2 to 8 players", "text": "Spot it! MLB Batter up! Test your visual skills and have a ball with Spot it! MLB Edition. It plays just like regular Spot it!, but features the logos of all 30 major league teams, plus assorted baseball icons and images. Spot it! is a truly one-of-a-kind card game. Each card contains 8 images, and between any 2 cards there is one, and only one, matching image. Players simultaneously try to gain or get rid of cards by spotting matches between their card and either a center card or an opponent’s card. There are 5 challenging mini party games in one pack of Spot it! Spot it! MLB Edition combines this great card game with the classic game of baseball. Whether the logo of your favorite team, a bitter rival, or another image such as a baseball diamond, a scoreboard, or a pennant, spot it and you’ll be running the bases to victory! At home, in the car, at the park, or anywhere else baseball and gamers gather, Spot it! MLB Edition provides innings of fun and excitement. Game facts: Ages: 7 to Adult 2 to 8 players", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51x286CW74L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00721VLBM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blue Orange", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Toys & Game Room", "Games"]], "price": 10.62}}
{"item_id": "B00724OR4M", "title": "Bushwhacker Shasta Black - Insulated Bike Water Bottle Holder w/ 22 oz. Bottle - Two Point Bike Frame & Handlebar Attachment w/ Belt Loop", "description": "The Shasta mounts on your frame with two velcro loops and is insulated with a half-inch of foam. Sturdy heavyweight polyester construction ensures it will last. Twenty-two ounce water bottle included.", "text": "Bushwhacker Shasta Black - Insulated Bike Water Bottle Holder w/ 22 oz. Bottle - Two Point Bike Frame & Handlebar Attachment w/ Belt Loop The Shasta mounts on your frame with two velcro loops and is insulated with a half-inch of foam. Sturdy heavyweight polyester construction ensures it will last. Twenty-two ounce water bottle included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IqyqrX6zL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00724OR4M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Hydration", "Water Bottles"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B00725WUUO", "title": "MTECH USA MT-493 Fixed Blade Knife 8.5-Inch Overall", "description": "MTech Dagger. 8 1/2\" overall. 4 1/4\" black finish stainless double edge dagger blade with serrated section. Textured black rubber handle with integrated guard. Lanyard hole. Extended tang end could function as a glass breaker. Black nylon sheath with shoulder strap/leg tie.", "text": "MTECH USA MT-493 Fixed Blade Knife 8.5-Inch Overall MTech Dagger. 8 1/2\" overall. 4 1/4\" black finish stainless double edge dagger blade with serrated section. Textured black rubber handle with integrated guard. Lanyard hole. Extended tang end could function as a glass breaker. Black nylon sheath with shoulder strap/leg tie.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bXavHYldL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00725WUUO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mtech USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 9.05}}
{"item_id": "B00726XPUM", "title": "Proguard Elite Multi-Sport Cloth Tape - 1 Inch by 30 Yards", "description": "Multi-sport cloth tape from Proguard is great for hockey, baseball, softball and all other sports. 1 Inch by 30 Yard Roll", "text": "Proguard Elite Multi-Sport Cloth Tape - 1 Inch by 30 Yards Multi-sport cloth tape from Proguard is great for hockey, baseball, softball and all other sports. 1 Inch by 30 Yard Roll", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418QgYOGJbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00726XPUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro Guard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Ice Hockey", "Accessories", "Grips & Tapes"]], "price": 3.95}}
