{"item_id": "B0072BLPX6", "title": "Condor Drop Leg M4 Mag Pouch", "description": "The Condor Drop Leg M4 Mag Pouch features a fully adjustable strap with anti-slip stitching and quick release buckle. There is a quick release belt attachment allows detachment without removing duty belt and an adjustable hook & loop flap with quick release buckles. It fits two 30rd M4 mag in each pouch and has webbing on both sides for modular attachments.", "text": "Condor Drop Leg M4 Mag Pouch The Condor Drop Leg M4 Mag Pouch features a fully adjustable strap with anti-slip stitching and quick release buckle. There is a quick release belt attachment allows detachment without removing duty belt and an adjustable hook & loop flap with quick release buckles. It fits two 30rd M4 mag in each pouch and has webbing on both sides for modular attachments.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZAB3eAMGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0072BLPX6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]]}}
