{"item_id": "B0072K868Y", "title": "Condor MCR4 OPS Operator MOLLE Tactical Chest Rig - OD MCR4-001", "description": "The OPS Chest Rig has a compact low profile design. It is built to military specs with heavy webbing for modular attachments. This low profile low drag design is great for security detail, undercover operations, or quick deployments. The OPS Chest Rig is lightweight and very versatile! It features two open top mag pouches, inside of the vest has a 7 \" x 11\" map pocket with an internal hook & loop panel.", "text": "Condor MCR4 OPS Operator MOLLE Tactical Chest Rig - OD MCR4-001 The OPS Chest Rig has a compact low profile design. It is built to military specs with heavy webbing for modular attachments. This low profile low drag design is great for security detail, undercover operations, or quick deployments. The OPS Chest Rig is lightweight and very versatile! It features two open top mag pouches, inside of the vest has a 7 \" x 11\" map pocket with an internal hook & loop panel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Oz8yLSMdL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0072K868Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 26.94}}
