{"item_id": "B007386H86", "title": "Terminator 15000000V Stun Gun with LED Flashlight", "description": "This TERMINATOR brand stun gun is one of the most reliable stun guns available. Terminator is a registered US trademark. Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. If the sight and sound doesn't stop him a jolt from this stun gun certainly will bring an attacker down in just 2 seconds! When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts,Connecticut, Michigan, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County, IA", "text": "Terminator 15000000V Stun Gun with LED Flashlight This TERMINATOR brand stun gun is one of the most reliable stun guns available. Terminator is a registered US trademark. Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. If the sight and sound doesn't stop him a jolt from this stun gun certainly will bring an attacker down in just 2 seconds! When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts,Connecticut, Michigan, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County, IA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nlGb8HLNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007386H86.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 10.98}}
{"item_id": "B0073896AM", "title": "Tac Force Magnum Assisted Opening Rescue Knife - EMT", "description": "Fast spring assisted opening action-just flick the stud on the back spine of the knife for instant blade deployment! Tac Force Magnum Rescue Knife- 4.5\" closed. 3.25\" black stainless steel part serrated blade. Orange aluminum handle with black onlay and inlaid EMT emblem. Built in seat belt cutter and glass breaker. Metal pocket clip.", "text": "Tac Force Magnum Assisted Opening Rescue Knife - EMT Fast spring assisted opening action-just flick the stud on the back spine of the knife for instant blade deployment! Tac Force Magnum Rescue Knife- 4.5\" closed. 3.25\" black stainless steel part serrated blade. Orange aluminum handle with black onlay and inlaid EMT emblem. Built in seat belt cutter and glass breaker. Metal pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51S%2BKkax0IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0073896AM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TAC Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 8.25}}
