{"item_id": "B0073FX9RG", "title": "Terminator 15000000 V Stun Gun with Safety Pin and LED Flashlight", "description": "This TERMINATOR brand stun gun is one of the most powerful stun guns available. Terminator is a registered US trademark. Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. In addition to a safety switch this stun gun features a safety pin which provides an extra safety. The safety pin needs to be inserted in the safety pin receptacle to enable stun gun to spark. If you do not need this extra safety feature you may keep the safety pin plugged in all the time. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii,Connecticut, Massachusetts, Michigan, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County,IA", "text": "Terminator 15000000 V Stun Gun with Safety Pin and LED Flashlight This TERMINATOR brand stun gun is one of the most powerful stun guns available. Terminator is a registered US trademark. Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. In addition to a safety switch this stun gun features a safety pin which provides an extra safety. The safety pin needs to be inserted in the safety pin receptacle to enable stun gun to spark. If you do not need this extra safety feature you may keep the safety pin plugged in all the time. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii,Connecticut, Massachusetts, Michigan, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County,IA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tgzmQAoOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0073FX9RG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 10.98}}
{"item_id": "B0073GOA7S", "title": "Injinji - 2012 - Women's Performance Lightweight No-Show Sock, Canyon Pink, Large", "description": "The Performance Lightweight sock is Injinji's lightest sock option. It provides proper toe alignment, superior moisture management, better posture and balance, blitster and hotspot prevention and a tactile feel. The lighweight sock is built with superior fibers and designed to give you the most natural feel inside any shoe.", "text": "Injinji - 2012 - Women's Performance Lightweight No-Show Sock, Canyon Pink, Large The Performance Lightweight sock is Injinji's lightest sock option. It provides proper toe alignment, superior moisture management, better posture and balance, blitster and hotspot prevention and a tactile feel. The lighweight sock is built with superior fibers and designed to give you the most natural feel inside any shoe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CUfxuI8JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0073GOA7S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Women", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0073GZQRQ", "title": "Ka-Bar Becker Knife with Trailing Point, Short", "description": "The Becker Short Drop Point Knife is a solid one piece design. It is the perfect size for most tasks without being cumbersome. Clip Point Blade. Full Tang Construction. Black Epoxy Powder Coat. Includes extra set of handles. Includes Cordura sheath.", "text": "Ka-Bar Becker Knife with Trailing Point, Short The Becker Short Drop Point Knife is a solid one piece design. It is the perfect size for most tasks without being cumbersome. Clip Point Blade. Full Tang Construction. Black Epoxy Powder Coat. Includes extra set of handles. Includes Cordura sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/212l1dbH9TL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0073GZQRQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 59.99}}
