{"item_id": "B0073GZRG6", "title": "Ka-Bar Becker Clip, Short", "description": "Knife features a 4 3/8 in. black clip point blade made from 1095 Cro-van steel with black zytel handle with a lanyard hole and a cordura sheath. Knife has an overall length of 9 1/4 in. and includes an extra set of Olive green handles and fasteners.", "text": "Ka-Bar Becker Clip, Short Knife features a 4 3/8 in. black clip point blade made from 1095 Cro-van steel with black zytel handle with a lanyard hole and a cordura sheath. Knife has an overall length of 9 1/4 in. and includes an extra set of Olive green handles and fasteners.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31imwZ6tk2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0073GZRG6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B0073GZRYI", "title": "Ka-Bar Becker Machax Knife", "description": "The Becker Tac Machax features a 9 3/8 in. fixed black blade made from 1095 Cro-van steel with a black grivory handle that includes a lanyard hole. Knife has an overall length of 14 11/6 ins with a black Heavy duty polyester sheath with front pocket and has a green canvas micarta handle purchase option.", "text": "Ka-Bar Becker Machax Knife The Becker Tac Machax features a 9 3/8 in. fixed black blade made from 1095 Cro-van steel with a black grivory handle that includes a lanyard hole. Knife has an overall length of 14 11/6 ins with a black Heavy duty polyester sheath with front pocket and has a green canvas micarta handle purchase option.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mF4L32DIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0073GZRYI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 79.98}}
{"item_id": "B0073GZSM4", "title": "Ka-Bar Becker Scales Handles, Black/Orange", "description": "These durable Zytel handles will fit the Becker Eskabar #BK14. Kit includes one set blaze orange handles, one set black handles and fasteners.", "text": "Ka-Bar Becker Scales Handles, Black/Orange These durable Zytel handles will fit the Becker Eskabar #BK14. Kit includes one set blaze orange handles, one set black handles and fasteners.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KrGoHn7vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0073GZSM4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 12.82}}
{"item_id": "B0073H1UQQ", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits Dental Medic Kit", "description": "The wound closure medic contains the supplies you need for hospital-quality wound irrigation, cleaning, and closure. Treating a jagged cut or laceration the right way right away prevents infection, speeds healing, and minimizes scarring. Perfect as an addition to your ultralight first aid kit or on its own in your glove box or daypack. Each kit in the medic series features proprietary dryflexbags for the ultimate in ultralight, waterproof storage.", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits Dental Medic Kit The wound closure medic contains the supplies you need for hospital-quality wound irrigation, cleaning, and closure. Treating a jagged cut or laceration the right way right away prevents infection, speeds healing, and minimizes scarring. Perfect as an addition to your ultralight first aid kit or on its own in your glove box or daypack. Each kit in the medic series features proprietary dryflexbags for the ultimate in ultralight, waterproof storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cri-oDvnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0073H1UQQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 11.99}}
