{"item_id": "B0073ZA4K6", "title": "Tac Force TF-636DC Folding Knife 4.5-Inch Closed", "description": "Misc Linerlock Green Digital4 3/4\" closed. 3 1/2\" assisted opening black coated high carbon steel partially serrated clip point blade with extended tang, thumb stud and lashing hole. Green digital camo textured aluminum handles with integrated seat belt cutter and glass breaker. Also features a 3/8\" diameter bayonet ring. Black stainless pocket clip with slot cutout design.", "text": "Tac Force TF-636DC Folding Knife 4.5-Inch Closed Misc Linerlock Green Digital4 3/4\" closed. 3 1/2\" assisted opening black coated high carbon steel partially serrated clip point blade with extended tang, thumb stud and lashing hole. Green digital camo textured aluminum handles with integrated seat belt cutter and glass breaker. Also features a 3/8\" diameter bayonet ring. Black stainless pocket clip with slot cutout design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sh62ZEp5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0073ZA4K6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TAC Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 7.64}}
{"item_id": "B0073ZFAJQ", "title": "Tac Force YC-636BGN Folding Knife 4.5-Inch Closed", "description": "Misc Linerlock Black4 3/4\" closed. 3 1/2\" assisted opening black coated high carbon steel partially serrated clip point blade with extended tang, thumb stud and lashing hole. Black textured aluminum handles with OD green anodized accent end. Integrated seat belt cutter and glass breaker. Also features a 3/8\" diameter bayonet ring. Black stainless pocket clip with slot cutout design.", "text": "Tac Force YC-636BGN Folding Knife 4.5-Inch Closed Misc Linerlock Black4 3/4\" closed. 3 1/2\" assisted opening black coated high carbon steel partially serrated clip point blade with extended tang, thumb stud and lashing hole. Black textured aluminum handles with OD green anodized accent end. Integrated seat belt cutter and glass breaker. Also features a 3/8\" diameter bayonet ring. Black stainless pocket clip with slot cutout design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jK6WfycFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0073ZFAJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 9.75}}
{"item_id": "B0074024OO", "title": "MTM Ammo Can Organizer (Black)", "description": "MTM's ACO Ammo Can Organizer is a set of three, stacking trays that turn any 50 caliber ammo can into a tool box with 22 compartments. Constructed from strong, chemical-resistant polypropylene. Fits all metal U.S. 50 caliber ammo cans as well as MTM Case-Gard's all plastic AC-50 ammo cans.", "text": "MTM Ammo Can Organizer (Black) MTM's ACO Ammo Can Organizer is a set of three, stacking trays that turn any 50 caliber ammo can into a tool box with 22 compartments. Constructed from strong, chemical-resistant polypropylene. Fits all metal U.S. 50 caliber ammo cans as well as MTM Case-Gard's all plastic AC-50 ammo cans.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ywr1eJX6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074024OO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B007402AUW", "title": "MTM Handgun Conceal Carry Case (Red)", "description": "MTM HCC-30 Handgun Concealed-Carry Case: This excellent nondescript case makes carrying Concealed-Carry handguns and supplies to and from the range safe, simple and much more discreet. Guns are held at top of case with plenty of room below for ammo and supplies. It has a large, deep bucket bottom for ammo and accessories. Thick foam padding sandwiches handguns to protect and prevent shifting. Double padlock tabbed, tongue and groove O-Ring seal system for a superior water-resistant seal. It is molded out of rugged polypropylene plastic. Has a heavy-duty dual latching system and molded-in stacking ridges. Color: Red.", "text": "MTM Handgun Conceal Carry Case (Red) MTM HCC-30 Handgun Concealed-Carry Case: This excellent nondescript case makes carrying Concealed-Carry handguns and supplies to and from the range safe, simple and much more discreet. Guns are held at top of case with plenty of room below for ammo and supplies. It has a large, deep bucket bottom for ammo and accessories. Thick foam padding sandwiches handguns to protect and prevent shifting. Double padlock tabbed, tongue and groove O-Ring seal system for a superior water-resistant seal. It is molded out of rugged polypropylene plastic. Has a heavy-duty dual latching system and molded-in stacking ridges. Color: Red.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518QQ8FJ7CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007402AUW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 12.98}}
