{"item_id": "B0074A6KCQ", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pack Of 5 Buffers - Synthetic Wear Reducing Receiver Buffer For AR15 AR-15 AR 15 M4 M16 Rifle Cycling System", "description": "Pack of 5 . Tough, high-density synthetic rubber wedge drops into the space behind the takedown pin in the lower receiver to provide tension between the receiver halves and prevent movement for improved accuracy and performace so you shoot tight, consistent groups, reduce mis-feeds, and improve ammo feeding. Can be trimmed to accommodate any variation in upper-to-lower receiver fit. No Modifications required, this is the fastest and simplest accuracy improvement device for your AR.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pack Of 5 Buffers - Synthetic Wear Reducing Receiver Buffer For AR15 AR-15 AR 15 M4 M16 Rifle Cycling System Pack of 5 . Tough, high-density synthetic rubber wedge drops into the space behind the takedown pin in the lower receiver to provide tension between the receiver halves and prevent movement for improved accuracy and performace so you shoot tight, consistent groups, reduce mis-feeds, and improve ammo feeding. Can be trimmed to accommodate any variation in upper-to-lower receiver fit. No Modifications required, this is the fastest and simplest accuracy improvement device for your AR.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EPsAmNEgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074A6KCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B0074A6KVW", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pack Of 10 Buffers - Synthetic Wear Reducing Receiver Buffer For AR15 AR-15 AR 15 M4 M16 Rifle Cycling System", "description": "Pack of 10 . Tough, high-density synthetic rubber wedge drops into the space behind the takedown pin in the lower receiver to provide tension between the receiver halves and prevent movement for improved accuracy and performace so you shoot tight, consistent groups, reduce mis-feeds, and improve ammo feeding. Can be trimmed to accommodate any variation in upper-to-lower receiver fit. No Modifications required, this is the fastest and simplest accuracy improvement device for your AR.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pack Of 10 Buffers - Synthetic Wear Reducing Receiver Buffer For AR15 AR-15 AR 15 M4 M16 Rifle Cycling System Pack of 10 . Tough, high-density synthetic rubber wedge drops into the space behind the takedown pin in the lower receiver to provide tension between the receiver halves and prevent movement for improved accuracy and performace so you shoot tight, consistent groups, reduce mis-feeds, and improve ammo feeding. Can be trimmed to accommodate any variation in upper-to-lower receiver fit. No Modifications required, this is the fastest and simplest accuracy improvement device for your AR.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q5o-YLByL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074A6KVW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B0074A6N96", "title": "SKS Rifle High Density Polymer Recoil Reducing Impact Shock Absorbing Drop In Buffer", "description": "This easily installs on your Russian, Chinese or Romanian SKS Rifles.Reduces noise, felt recoil & muzzle climb and preserves the rifle from wear and tear by eliminating the violent bolt carrier impact with receiver which takes place each time you pull the trigger. Will greatly improve the performance and maintenace of zero of an installed scope by absorbing the recoil shock. Easy drop in installation, no modification required. Installs between bolt or bolt carrier and whatever the bolt or bolt carrier stops against when the bolt is fully retracted during firing (installation location varies with the specific firearm). Service life of the buffer is 800 to 1,000 rounds", "text": "SKS Rifle High Density Polymer Recoil Reducing Impact Shock Absorbing Drop In Buffer This easily installs on your Russian, Chinese or Romanian SKS Rifles.Reduces noise, felt recoil & muzzle climb and preserves the rifle from wear and tear by eliminating the violent bolt carrier impact with receiver which takes place each time you pull the trigger. Will greatly improve the performance and maintenace of zero of an installed scope by absorbing the recoil shock. Easy drop in installation, no modification required. Installs between bolt or bolt carrier and whatever the bolt or bolt carrier stops against when the bolt is fully retracted during firing (installation location varies with the specific firearm). Service life of the buffer is 800 to 1,000 rounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mVnN7tBmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074A6N96.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 4.41}}
