{"item_id": "B0074FDC72", "title": "Kershaw 1730SS Stainless Steel Zing Knife with SpeedSafe", "description": "Get the Zing of pure steel, now with SpeedSafe. With its unique design and pocket-perfect size, the Zing is one of our most popular knives. Now we're taking it to a new level with the Zing in Stainless Steel (#1730SS). It's larger, yet slimmer and offers the security of a frame lock. Designed by RJ Martin. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw 1730SS Stainless Steel Zing Knife with SpeedSafe Get the Zing of pure steel, now with SpeedSafe. With its unique design and pocket-perfect size, the Zing is one of our most popular knives. Now we're taking it to a new level with the Zing in Stainless Steel (#1730SS). It's larger, yet slimmer and offers the security of a frame lock. Designed by RJ Martin. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21s1ZuXVeLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074FDC72.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 19.69}}
{"item_id": "B0074FDKN8", "title": "Kershaw 1835TBLKST Kuro Black Serrated Tanto Knife with SpeedSafe", "description": "A modified tanto blade with partial serration is paired with textured, glass-filled nylon scales in this all-black beauty. Access the SpeedSafe assisted opening quickly and easily with an ambidextrous flipper. Drilled to accept a lanyard. An impressive look at a value price. Kershaw #1835TBLKST. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw 1835TBLKST Kuro Black Serrated Tanto Knife with SpeedSafe A modified tanto blade with partial serration is paired with textured, glass-filled nylon scales in this all-black beauty. Access the SpeedSafe assisted opening quickly and easily with an ambidextrous flipper. Drilled to accept a lanyard. An impressive look at a value price. Kershaw #1835TBLKST. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YaXdMn9RL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074FDKN8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B0074FGPKI", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool TPENWK Williams Tactical Pen", "description": "To everyone else they're stylish writing instruments designed with all of the fine qualities you would expect in a nice pen, but to you they're more than that. Former Army officer and martial arts instructor, James Williams applied his design expertise to the Williams tactical pen. For those of you familiar with the Hissatsu and the Hisshou, this new James Williams design is sure to be a welcome addition to your defensive edged tools. A clean, futuristic interpretation of one of mankind's basic tools, the tactical pen is a high-tech writing instrument that can be used as a self-defense enforcer if need be. Made from precision-machined aluminum and hard-coat color anodized, they offer long lasting durability and toughness. Available in non-reflective tactical black finish. The tapered body improves grip while adding a contemporary look. with some basic instruction or knowledge, one can readily use the pens against an assailant or attacker to inflict notice, pain or injury-thwarting an otherwise potentially defenseless act. And, they're just plain great writing instruments as well.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool TPENWK Williams Tactical Pen To everyone else they're stylish writing instruments designed with all of the fine qualities you would expect in a nice pen, but to you they're more than that. Former Army officer and martial arts instructor, James Williams applied his design expertise to the Williams tactical pen. For those of you familiar with the Hissatsu and the Hisshou, this new James Williams design is sure to be a welcome addition to your defensive edged tools. A clean, futuristic interpretation of one of mankind's basic tools, the tactical pen is a high-tech writing instrument that can be used as a self-defense enforcer if need be. Made from precision-machined aluminum and hard-coat color anodized, they offer long lasting durability and toughness. Available in non-reflective tactical black finish. The tapered body improves grip while adding a contemporary look. with some basic instruction or knowledge, one can readily use the pens against an assailant or attacker to inflict notice, pain or injury-thwarting an otherwise potentially defenseless act. And, they're just plain great writing instruments as well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21iBxhupW9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074FGPKI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 37.0}}
{"item_id": "B0074FH7N2", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SJ31-CP SlimJim Knife with Straight Edge Assisted Folding 3.18-Inch Steel Blade and Bead Blasted Handle, Satin Finish", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SJ31-CP SlimJim Knife with Straight Edge Assisted Folding 3.18-Inch Steel Blade and Bead Blasted Handle, Satin Finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/219sUfA4o6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074FH7N2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 37.6}}
{"item_id": "B0074FI28Q", "title": "Kershaw 1555TI Cryo SpeedSafe Folding Knife", "description": "This is a classic Rick Hinderer design, but built in pure steel with matte grey titanium carbo-nitride coating on both blade and handle. The Cryo (#1555TI) opens quickly with SpeedSafe assisted opening. Access it with the built-in Flipper or thumbstud. A sturdy framelock with lockbar stabilization ensures a solid lockup. This amazingly affordable Kershaw is destined to be the Hinderer for the rest of us. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw 1555TI Cryo SpeedSafe Folding Knife This is a classic Rick Hinderer design, but built in pure steel with matte grey titanium carbo-nitride coating on both blade and handle. The Cryo (#1555TI) opens quickly with SpeedSafe assisted opening. Access it 