{"item_id": "B0074VTV0S", "title": "Lint Free Micro Fiber Un-treated Gun Cleaning Cloth Qty 2", "description": "Micro Fiber Un-Treated gun cleaning cloth, both measure 16\" x 16\". Your favorite gun care product may be applied to either cloth. Lint free light gray cloth has a texture like terry cloth, the blue feels like a new golf shirt, it is also highly absorbent and lint free. With such a wide choice of gun care products our lint free un-treated micro fiber gun clothes let you make the choice.", "text": "Lint Free Micro Fiber Un-treated Gun Cleaning Cloth Qty 2 Micro Fiber Un-Treated gun cleaning cloth, both measure 16\" x 16\". Your favorite gun care product may be applied to either cloth. Lint free light gray cloth has a texture like terry cloth, the blue feels like a new golf shirt, it is also highly absorbent and lint free. With such a wide choice of gun care products our lint free un-treated micro fiber gun clothes let you make the choice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51W3vA6haeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074VTV0S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B0074WQYMA", "title": "B-50 Dacron REPLACEMENT RECURVE BOWSTRING - BOW STRING - AMO LENGTH - By Cir-Cut Archery Products (Multiple Sizes & Strand Count)", "description": "B-50 Dacron Recurve String Standard Endless Loop Type All lengths are A.M.O. specification measured on serving machine at 100 lbs. tension. READ CAREFULLY : A.M.O. RECURVE BOW STRING LENGTH DEFINED: THE ACTUAL PHYSICAL LENGTH OF THE BOW STRING WILL BE 4\" SHORTER THAN THE A.M.O. LENGTH. FOR EXAMPLE IF YOU ORDER A 52\" A.M.O LENGTH BOW STRING THE ACTUAL STRING LENGTH WILL BE 48\" MEASURED AT 100 LBS TENSION General Recurve & Longbow Bowstring Guidelines As a rule of thumb most Dacron ( B-50 ) recurve bowstrings measured out of the package and not under tension will be approximately 4\" less than the AMO ( Archery Manufacturer's Organization ) bow length. Longbows are generally 3\" less. A Dacron Bowstring (B-50) which depending on overall length will stretch up to an inch under 100 lbs of tension and will look \"out of the package\" like it is approximately 4 inches or more shorter than the bow. This is the reason you hear people speak about bowstrings being 4 inches shorter than the bow length. Endless loop type string lengths can be adjusted slightly by twisting or untwisting them, this allows for minor overall length variations. If your unsure of the length needed you can take your old string that has been unstrung from your bow and take the measurement from tip of loop end to the other tip loop end \"tip to tip\" while stretching it out hand tight with no slack in your string ( make sure the loops are flattened closed and extended out to give the greatest length possible ) assuming this will give you the approximate actual length of your string, now you can add 4\" to this measurement anf find your approximate AMO LENGTH. If you do not have a string on the bow and nothing printed on the bow handle or limb giving you the \"AMO\" length you can do a little research by trying to contact the bow manufacturer or doing a internet search on how to measure bowstring length, but once again as a rule of thumb the above guidelines are standard and should work in most cases.", "text": "B-50 Dacron REPLACEMENT RECURVE BOWSTRING - BOW STRING - AMO LENGTH - By Cir-Cut Archery Products (Multiple Sizes & Strand Count) B-50 Dacron Recurve String Standard Endless Loop Type All lengths are A.M.O. specification measured on serving machine at 100 lbs. tension. READ CAREFULLY : A.M.O. RECURVE BOW STRING LENGTH DEFINED: THE ACTUAL PHYSICAL LENGTH OF THE BOW STRING WILL BE 4\" SHORTER THAN THE A.M.O. LENGTH. FOR EXAMPLE IF YOU ORDER A 52\" A.M.O LENGTH BOW STRING THE ACTUAL STRING LENGTH WILL BE 48\" MEASURED AT 100 LBS TENSION General Recurve & Longbow Bowstring Guidelines As a rule of thumb most Dacron ( B-50 ) recurve bowstrings measured out of the package and not under tension will be approximately 4\" less than the AMO ( Archery Manufacturer's Organization ) bow length. Longbows are generally 3\" less. A Dacron Bowstring (B-50) which depending on overall length will stretch up to an inch under 100 lbs of tension and will look \"out of the package\" like it is approximately 4 inches or more shorter than the bow. This is the reason you hear people speak about bowstrings being 4 inches shorter than the bow length. Endless loop type string lengths can be adjusted slightly by twisting or untwisting them, this allows for minor overall length variations. If your unsure of the length needed you can take your old string that has been unstrung from your bow and take the measurement from tip of loop end to the other tip loop end \"tip to tip\" while stretching it out hand tight with no slack in your string ( make sure the loops are flattened closed and extended out to give the greatest length possible ) assuming this will give you the approximate actual length of your string, now you can add 4\" to this measurement anf find your approximate AMO LENGTH. If you do not have a string on the bow and nothing printed on the bow handle or limb giving you the \"AMO\" length you can do a little research by trying to contact the bow manufacturer or doing a internet search on how to measure bowstring length, but once again as a rule of thumb the above guidelines are standard and should work in most cases.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IYDphteEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074WQYMA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bowstrings"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B0074YM87I", "title": "Blue Force Gear Molded Acetal Adjuster No Quick Release Attached with TriGlide instead of Loop Lock Sling 2-Point Combat Sling Padded VCAS-200-OA-BK", "description": "Blue Force Gear Molded Acetal Adjuster No Quick Release Attached with TriGlide instead of Loop Lock Sling Black 2-Point Combat Sling Padded VCAS-200-OA-BK", "text": "Blue Force Gear Molded Acetal Adjuster No Quick Release Attached with TriGlide instead of Loop Lock Sling 2-Point Combat Sling Padded VCAS-200-OA-BK Blue Force Gear Molded Acetal Adjuster No Quick Release Attached with TriGlide instead of Loop Lock Sling Black 2-Point Combat Sling Padded VCAS-200-OA-BK", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a49qNvEKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074YM87I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blue Force Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 49.55}}
{"item_id": "B0074YR6BQ", "title": "Gamo Bone Collector Bull Whisper IGT Air Rifle air rifle", "description": "Gamo Bone Collector Bull Whisper IGT air rifle IGT gas piston (IGT=Inert Gas Technology) Breakbarrel Single-shot 11mm optics dovetail No open sights Bull Whisper noise dampener Rifled steel barrel with fluted polymer jacket All-weather synthetic green stock with black rubber inserts Dual raised cheekpieces (ambidextrous) Textured pistol grip and forearm Manual safety Smooth Action Trigger (SAT) 2-stage adjustable trigger Shock Wave Absorber (SWA) recoil pad absorbs up to 74% more recoil Includes 4x32 scope, mount, elasticized scope lens covers, hex wrench, cleaning cloth and PBA ammo Here are the benefits of the IGT over a metal mainspring: Smoother cocking Smoother shooting No spring torque No spring fatigue, even if you leave it cocked for hours Functions perfectly in cold weather Lasts longer than a metal spring ... ...", "text": "Gamo Bone Collector Bull Whisper IGT Air Rifle air rifle Gamo Bone Collector Bull Whisper IGT air rifle IGT gas piston (IGT=Inert Gas Technology) Breakbarrel Single-shot 11mm optics dovetail No open sights Bull Whisper noise dampener Rifled steel barrel with fluted polymer jacket All-weather synthetic green stock with black rubber inserts Dual raised cheekpieces (ambidextrous) Textured pistol grip and forearm Manual safety Smooth Action Trigger (SAT) 2-stage adjustable trigger Shock Wave Absorber (SWA) recoil pad absorbs up to 74% more recoil Includes 4x32 scope, mount, elasticized scope lens covers, hex wrench, cleaning cloth and PBA ammo Here are the benefits of the IGT over a metal mainspring: Smoother cocking Smoother shooting No spring torque No spring fatigue, even if you leave it cocked for hours Functions perfectly in cold weather Lasts longer than a metal spring ... ...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31eSQOQQVcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074YR6BQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0074YSVFQ", "title": "Burris 300210 AR-536 5x36 Sight (Black)", "description": "The Burris AR-536 Prism Sight is \"bigger and badder,\" setting a standard for tactical prism sight performance. It has a 5x magnification makes it easier to find and engage targets out to 600 yards, while the larger 36mm objective delivers brighter, crisper images. Burris' proven Ballistic/CQ lighted reticle is ideal for tactical operations or friendly competition. Shooters can choose the high contrast black reticle, or select red or green depending upon the situation. Five different illumination settings make it easy to match any light condition. This ruggedly built optic will stand up to recoil, abuse, and weather. Key features include multi-coated lenses, adjustable diopter, integrated lens covers, and three picatinny rail mounting points. Remove the bottom rail mount and it can be readily mounted to an AR carry handle. It is ready for the range right out of the box.", "text": "Burris 300210 AR-536 5x36 Sight (Black) The Burris AR-536 Prism Sight is \"bigger and badder,\" setting a standard for tactical prism sight performance. It has a 5x magnification makes it easier to find and engage targets out to 600 yards, while the larger 36mm objective delivers brighter, crisper images. Burris' proven Ballistic/CQ lighted reticle is ideal for tactical operations or friendly competition. Shooters can choose the high contrast black reticle, or select red or green depending upon the situation. Five different illumination settings make it easy to match any light condition. This ruggedly built optic will stand up to recoil, abuse, and weather. Key features include multi-coated lenses, adjustable diopter, integrated lens covers, and three picatinny rail mounting points. Remove the bottom rail mount and it can be readily mounted to an AR carry handle. It is ready for the range right out of the box.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B0L4EhidL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0074YSVFQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 359.99}}
{"item_id": "B007504SYC", "title": "Ruger P95; P97; SR9 Side Holster ***BRAND NEW***", "description": "Nylon, Black, Fully Lined Holster Ambidextrous Belt and Clip Combination Thumb break is adjustable with a steel shank for quick access Magazine pouch holds double stacked or two single stacked magazines Belt loops on both sides of holster 2\" metal clip can be moved to either side For security, these holsters are designed to wear with the clip on the pants and the belt through the loop to insure a more stable fit.", "text": "Ruger P95; P97; SR9 Side Holster ***BRAND NEW*** Nylon, Black, Fully Lined Holster Ambidextrous Belt and Clip Combination Thumb break is adjustable with a steel shank for quick access Magazine pouch holds double stacked or two single stacked magazines Belt loops on both sides of holster 2\" metal clip can be moved to either side For security, these holsters are designed to wear with the clip on the pants and the belt through the loop to insure a more stable fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iFmePYsdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007504SYC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Case", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.75}}
{"item_id": "B00750NBGI", "title": "MISSION Athletecare Court Grip", "description": "Mission’s Court Grip is a traction enhancer for indoor court athletes. This proprietary, breakthrough formula, co-developed by Dwyane Wade has been approved for play by the NCAA, NFHS and NBATA. Premier NBA players like Brandon Jennings, Steve Nash, Darren Collison, Mike Conley along with dozens of others have been seen applying Court Grip throughout this NBA season. In addition, legendary coaches like Jim Boeheim and Bill Self utilize Court Grip.Dwyane Wade GrippingDarren Collison GrippingKey Details• Easily Applied to Your Sneaker Soles • Dries in Seconds • Provides Instant, Sustainable Traction • Pressure Sensitive Technology, Activates on Cuts • Play Quick + More Explosive • Portable Traction for Any Gym • Official Athletecare of the NBA • Official Traction Partner of the NBATA • Approx. 50 uses per bottle (1 Application = Both Sneakers) • Also Recommended for all other Indoor Court Sports (Volleyball, Racquetball, Squash)How It Works• Easily applied to the bottom of the sneaker sole with proprietary ergonomic bottle & applicator • Features proprietary pressure-sensitive nanotechnology which activates on players cuts • Proprietary, patent-pending formula dries in seconds, and provides instant, sustained traction • Has been tested and proven to NOT have any detrimental effect(s) to sneaker soles or indoor courtsAbout Mission Athletecare™MISSION is the first and only line of Athlete-Engineered products designed to enhance performance in training and competition. Launched in 2009, MISSION Athletecare has quickly become a driving force of innovation in the sports industry uniquely focused on products that help athletes prepare, perform and rehab from competition. MISSION was co-founded by a premier group of world-class athletes including 13-time Grand Slam Tennis Champion Serena Williams, 7-time MLB All-Star David Wright and NBA Champion Dwyane Wade among others, all of whom wanted to be part of the solution to the void of Athletecare™ products available to athletes in the marketplace.", "text": "MISSION Athletecare Court Grip Mission’s Court Grip is a traction enhancer for indoor court athletes. This proprietary, breakthrough formula, co-developed by Dwyane Wade has been approved for play by the NCAA, NFHS and NBATA. Premier NBA players like Brandon Jennings, Steve Nash, Darren Collison, Mike Conley along with dozens of others have been seen applying Court Grip throughout this NBA season. In addition, legendary coaches like Jim Boeheim and Bill Self utilize Court Grip.Dwyane Wade GrippingDarren Collison GrippingKey Details• Easily Applied to Your Sneaker Soles • Dries in Seconds • Provides Instant, Sustainable Traction • Pressure Sensitive Technology, Activates on Cuts • Play Quick + More Explosive • Portable Traction for Any Gym • Official Athletecare of the NBA • Official Traction Partner of the NBATA • Approx. 50 uses per bottle (1 Application = Both Sneakers) • Also Recommended for all other Indoor Court Sports (Volleyball, Racquetball, Squash)How It Works• Easily applied to the bottom of the sneaker sole with proprietary ergonomic bottle & applicator • Features proprietary pressure-sensitive nanotechnology which activates on players cuts • Proprietary, patent-pending formula dries in seconds, and provides instant, sustained traction • Has been tested and proven to NOT have any detrimental effect(s) to sneaker soles or indoor courtsAbout Mission Athletecare™MISSION is the first and only line of Athlete-Engineered products designed to enhance performance in training and competition. Launched in 2009, MISSION Athletecare has quickly become a driving force of innovation in the sports industry uniquely focused on products that help athletes prepare, perform and rehab from competition. MISSION was co-founded by a premier group of world-class athletes including 13-time Grand Slam Tennis Champion Serena Williams, 7-time MLB All-Star David Wright and NBA Champion Dwyane Wade among others, all of whom wanted to be part of the solution to the void of Athletecare™ products available to athletes in the marketplace.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IewpX81fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00750NBGI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mission Athletecare", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Training Equipment"]], "price": 10.81}}
