{"item_id": "B007595CZW", "title": "VISM by NcStar Small Utility Pouch", "description": "1 Main Zippered Compartment, 1 Front Zippered Compartment, and 1 Quick-Flap Hook and Loop Compartment. Perfect for storing cell phones, GPS devices, cameras, medical supplies, flashlights, small tools, and everything else you need readily accessible. PALS Straps allow for attachment to virtually any MOLLE/PALS System. Constructed with Heavy Duty PVC Material.", "text": "VISM by NcStar Small Utility Pouch 1 Main Zippered Compartment, 1 Front Zippered Compartment, and 1 Quick-Flap Hook and Loop Compartment. Perfect for storing cell phones, GPS devices, cameras, medical supplies, flashlights, small tools, and everything else you need readily accessible. PALS Straps allow for attachment to virtually any MOLLE/PALS System. Constructed with Heavy Duty PVC Material.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ur7%2B2oYFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007595CZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 8.99}}
