{"item_id": "B0075D374Q", "title": "Moultrie Game Spy M80-XT Infrared Flash Camera", "description": "The Moultrie Game Spy M80XT Infrared Camera offers a plethora of options that will assist you in catching the game you are pursuing. The Illumi-Night Sensor allows the brightest and clearest night-time infrared pictures to be taken, and the night range assists this in being up to 60-ft. The new Fast Fire Continuous Shooting Mode captures up to 3 pictures per second, and the 16:9 widescreen images and videos provide a wider field of view than other game cameras, and videos are recorded with sound. There are three operational modes: IR triggered game camera, Hybrid time-lapse plot camera, and Plot camera by day, infrared camera at night. The new Motion Freeze technology reduces infrared night-time blur. The camera offers a picture delay of 5/15/30 seconds, and 1-60 minutes. There is also an easy to read photo strip with the temperature, moon phase, time, date and camera ID stamp. The camera requires 4 or 8 AA batteries (not included), has a battery life calculator, and has a battery life up to 1-year. There is an external power port for optional Moultrie PowerPanal, as well as an SD memory card slot (up to 32GB, card not included). The M80XT includes a USB cable, mounting strap, and Plot Stalker software CD.", "text": "Moultrie Game Spy M80-XT Infrared Flash Camera The Moultrie Game Spy M80XT Infrared Camera offers a plethora of options that will assist you in catching the game you are pursuing. The Illumi-Night Sensor allows the brightest and clearest night-time infrared pictures to be taken, and the night range assists this in being up to 60-ft. The new Fast Fire Continuous Shooting Mode captures up to 3 pictures per second, and the 16:9 widescreen images and videos provide a wider field of view than other game cameras, and videos are recorded with sound. There are three operational modes: IR triggered game camera, Hybrid time-lapse plot camera, and Plot camera by day, infrared camera at night. The new Motion Freeze technology reduces infrared night-time blur. The camera offers a picture delay of 5/15/30 seconds, and 1-60 minutes. There is also an easy to read photo strip with the temperature, moon phase, time, date and camera ID stamp. The camera requires 4 or 8 AA batteries (not included), has a battery life calculator, and has a battery life up to 1-year. There is an external power port for optional Moultrie PowerPanal, as well as an SD memory card slot (up to 32GB, card not included). The M80XT includes a USB cable, mounting strap, and Plot Stalker software CD.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lzZYMmunL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0075D374Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moultrie", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 170.77}}
{"item_id": "B0075JKJ2I", "title": "MSR Universal Zipper Pulls", "description": "FEATURES of the MSR Universal Zipper Pulls Reflective, lightweight upgrades for any zipper Replaces metal zipper pulls with a light, quiet alternative Easy to use with gloves or mittens", "text": "MSR Universal Zipper Pulls FEATURES of the MSR Universal Zipper Pulls Reflective, lightweight upgrades for any zipper Replaces metal zipper pulls with a light, quiet alternative Easy to use with gloves or mittens", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ugHRJmq1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0075JKJ2I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories"]], "price": 9.95}}
