{"item_id": "B0075JO1AO", "title": "Sentry Safe HDC11E Home Defense Center 2.1 Cubic Feet", "description": "New Home Defense Center offers quick and quiet retrieval of firearms when it matters most. The unique corner design and whisper quiet entry empowers customers to defend their families and home.", "text": "Sentry Safe HDC11E Home Defense Center 2.1 Cubic Feet New Home Defense Center offers quick and quiet retrieval of firearms when it matters most. The unique corner design and whisper quiet entry empowers customers to defend their families and home.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MIgBmn3TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0075JO1AO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SentrySafe", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 518.73}}
{"item_id": "B0075LKW78", "title": "Lee Precision Ergo Prime", "description": "Fingertip operation provides unmatched sensitivity and comfort especially for old hands. Absolutely no tools or disassembly required when changing primer size. Simply remove shell holder and swap primer trays. Premium hand held priming tool with all the features of the worlds most popular Auto-Prime, with a new ERGOnomic design. The Ergo-Prime has a highly sculpted body that fits your hand perfectly along with long smoothly contoured finger lever that easily installs the tightest primers. Powder coated metal body and polished chrome plated lever, makes the Ergo-Prime not only the most comfortable, but also the best looking tool made.", "text": "Lee Precision Ergo Prime Fingertip operation provides unmatched sensitivity and comfort especially for old hands. Absolutely no tools or disassembly required when changing primer size. Simply remove shell holder and swap primer trays. Premium hand held priming tool with all the features of the worlds most popular Auto-Prime, with a new ERGOnomic design. The Ergo-Prime has a highly sculpted body that fits your hand perfectly along with long smoothly contoured finger lever that easily installs the tightest primers. Powder coated metal body and polished chrome plated lever, makes the Ergo-Prime not only the most comfortable, but also the best looking tool made.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TCGfFN4wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0075LKW78.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 35.11}}
{"item_id": "B0075MOZ9S", "title": "NcStar Ultra Compact Pistol Green Laser with Quick Release Weaver Mount (AQPTLMG)", "description": "Green Laser: Freq. 532nm, Class IIIa LaserMaximum Output: <5mwQuick Release Weaver Style MountFully Adjustable for Windage and Elevation. Includes adjustment toolAmbidextrous Sliding On/Off SwitchUses 1 CR2 Lithium Type Battery (Included)Dimensions: 2.6\" L x 1.0\" W x 1.6\" HWeight: 3.3 ozNominal Operating temperature: 59 - 95 degrees Fahrenheit", "text": "NcStar Ultra Compact Pistol Green Laser with Quick Release Weaver Mount (AQPTLMG) Green Laser: Freq. 532nm, Class IIIa LaserMaximum Output: <5mwQuick Release Weaver Style MountFully Adjustable for Windage and Elevation. Includes adjustment toolAmbidextrous Sliding On/Off SwitchUses 1 CR2 Lithium Type Battery (Included)Dimensions: 2.6\" L x 1.0\" W x 1.6\" HWeight: 3.3 ozNominal Operating temperature: 59 - 95 degrees Fahrenheit", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415f9RPLPyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0075MOZ9S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 45.0}}
{"item_id": "B0075QMCNK", "title": "Fort Knox FTK-PN Personal Pistol Box Handgun Safe", "description": "Quick access in concealable security box. Protect your valuables in your car or in your home. These new high security pistol boxes are constructed with a heavy 10 gauge body and a 3/16? plate door. The Personal Pistol safe can be used in many applications. Spring assisted hinges. Simplex mechanical lock - user friendly with 1081 user combinations. 9? wide 12? deep 4? high. 20 lbs.", "text": "Fort Knox FTK-PN Personal Pistol Box Handgun Safe Quick access in concealable security box. Protect your valuables in your car or in your home. These new high security pistol boxes are constructed with a heavy 10 gauge body and a 3/16? plate door. The Personal Pistol safe can be used in many applications. Spring assisted hinges. Simplex mechanical lock - user friendly with 1081 user combinations. 9? wide 12? deep 4? high. 20 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Jrxw3qkeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0075QMCNK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fort Knox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 207.24}}
{"item_id": "B0075ZS096", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits Survive Outdoors Longer Escape, Bivvy Breathable Blanket", "description": "The SOL Escape Bivvy is nothing less than a revolution in backcountry shelters. The complaint with most ultralight emergency shelters is the same condensation builds up inside as you get warm, leaving your clothes soaking wet. With the Escape Bivvy, condensation is no longer an issue, and you never again have to choose between staying dry and staying warm. The proprietary fabric lets moisture escape at the same time that it keeps rain, snow, and wind on the outside all while reflecting your body heat back to you. Waterproof seams plus a drawstring hood closure and side zip mean you can seal out the elements entirely or use the bivvy like a traditional sleeping bag, and the high-visibility orange exterior makes it easy for rescuers to spot you even in areas with high tree cover.", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits Survive Outdoors Longer Escape, Bivvy Breathable Blanket The SOL Escape Bivvy is nothing less than a revolution in backcountry shelters. The complaint with most ultralight emergency shelters is the same condensation builds up inside as you get warm, leaving your clothes soaking wet. With the Escape Bivvy, condensation is no longer an issue, and you never again have to choose between staying dry and staying warm. The proprietary fabric lets moisture escape at the same time that it keeps rain, snow, and wind on the outside all while reflecting your body heat back to you. Waterproof seams plus a drawstring hood closure and side zip mean you can seal out the elements entirely or use the bivvy like a traditional sleeping bag, and the high-visibility orange exterior makes it easy for rescuers to spot you even in areas with high tree cover.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dbJn5aD-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0075ZS096.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits (ADVBA)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 38.14}}
{"item_id": "B00762O452", "title": "Aosom Solo Single-Wheel Bicycle Cargo Bike Trailer, Orange", "description": "Now you can travel wherever the road takes you because you will always have your possessions nearby with the Aosom single wheel cargo trailer. This steel framed trailer is perfect for going on long bike rides, picnics or for everyday use. The frame has a neon orange bag attached to it that snaps shut to keep your personal belongings safe and secure. The back wheel has a fender to keep mud and dirt off of the bag and prevent it from getting into your stuff. This trailer hooks straight up to the back wheel of your bike and can be folded up for easy storage. The Aosom single wheel cargo trailer is great for anyone who travels by bike and needs some extra room to carry things.", "text": "Aosom Solo Single-Wheel Bicycle Cargo Bike Trailer, Orange Now you can travel wherever the road takes you because you will always have your possessions nearby with the Aosom single wheel cargo trailer. This steel framed trailer is perfect for going on long bike rides, picnics or for everyday use. The frame has a neon orange bag attached to it that snaps shut to keep your personal belongings safe and secure. The back wheel has a fender to keep mud and dirt off of the bag and prevent it from getting into your stuff. This trailer hooks straight up to the back wheel of your bike and can be folded up for easy storage. The Aosom single wheel cargo trailer is great for anyone who travels by bike and needs some extra room to carry things.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NoAwIRyuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00762O452.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers", "Cargo Trailers"]], "price": 59.97}}
{"item_id": "B00762QKIG", "title": "Aosom Venture Large Cargo Bicycle Bike Trailer - Yellow", "description": "Whether you are on the road or riding off road, the Aosom Venture cargo trailer is perfect for your next bicycle trip. This bicycle trailer offers ample storage space and is exceptionally durable while holding up to 88 lbs. It is great for picnics, shopping, camping or wherever your travels take you. It attaches to most bikes and features a removable cover which helps protect your storage items. This cargo bike trailer is foldable and the hitch also folds under the trailer for easy storage. No matter where you go don't travel alone, take this all-purpose bike trailer with you on your long adventures.Features:- Made of steel, with solid bottom- Easily assembles and folds down for storage- Great for hauling- One bicycle hitch/connector included, you do not need anything else to connect the trailer to the bike- Includes a removable, washable cover- Waterproof material (We suggest not to leave trailer in the rain for long time)- Paint is non-toxic- Folding frame and tire is thicker than the competition- Specially strengthened bottomSpecifications:- Color: Yellow and Black- Material: 600D Oxford + PU waterproof material- Trailer Weight: 28.7lbs- Max loading: 88lbs- Trailer Size (excluding hitch arm): 33 7/8\"L x 24\"W x 15 1/2\"H- Total (Including Wheel) height: 25 5/8\"H- Size of the tires: 20\" (Diameter)", "text": "Aosom Venture Large Cargo Bicycle Bike Trailer - Yellow Whether you are on the road or riding off road, the Aosom Venture cargo trailer is perfect for your next bicycle trip. This bicycle trailer offers ample storage space and is exceptionally durable while holding up to 88 lbs. It is great for picnics, shopping, camping or wherever your travels take you. It attaches to most bikes and features a removable cover which helps protect your storage items. This cargo bike trailer is foldable and the hitch also folds under the trailer for easy storage. No matter where you go don't travel alone, take this all-purpose bike trailer with you on your long adventures.Features:- Made of steel, with solid bottom- Easily assembles and folds down for storage- Great for hauling- One bicycle hitch/connector included, you do not need anything else to connect the trailer to the bike- Includes a removable, washable cover- Waterproof material (We suggest not to leave trailer in the rain for long time)- Paint is non-toxic- Folding frame and tire is thicker than the competition- Specially strengthened bottomSpecifications:- Color: Yellow and Black- Material: 600D Oxford + PU waterproof material- Trailer Weight: 28.7lbs- Max loading: 88lbs- Trailer Size (excluding hitch arm): 33 7/8\"L x 24\"W x 15 1/2\"H- Total (Including Wheel) height: 25 5/8\"H- Size of the tires: 20\" (Diameter)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AEHQRDukL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00762QKIG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers", "Cargo Trailers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00766HCUM", "title": "Strider Knee and Elbow Pad Set, Black", "description": "STRIDER Knee and Elbow Pad Set is a fun way to introduce safety gear to your child. Pad set fits children 2 to 5 years old. Knee and elbow pads attach easily with Velcro straps, and outer shells are made from premium hard plastic to keep the pain of hitting the ground away from little legs and arms. These pads are TOUGH.", "text": "Strider Knee and Elbow Pad Set, Black STRIDER Knee and Elbow Pad Set is a fun way to introduce safety gear to your child. Pad set fits children 2 to 5 years old. Knee and elbow pads attach easily with Velcro straps, and outer shells are made from premium hard plastic to keep the pain of hitting the ground away from little legs and arms. These pads are TOUGH.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eT84EaM2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00766HCUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Strider", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Kids' Bikes & Accessories", "Kids' Protective Gear"]], "price": 15.0}}
