{"item_id": "B0076ZSFQI", "title": "MSR Lightning Ascent Snow Shoes", "description": "MSR's Lightning Ascent snow shoes are built on the outdoor outfitter's advanced 360-degree Traction frames and Torsion2 crampons. Dual-component PosiLock AT bindings offer secure attachment, while aggressive steel cross members and easily-engaged Ergo Televators back you up with every step. The shoes fit men's shoe sizes 4.5 to 15 and have an eight-inch width, and come with the all-condition adaptability of MSR's Modular Flotation tails.Two-piece, independently conforming PosiLock AT bindings create a comfortable, secure fit.FeaturesTraction:360-degreeTraction frames with edge-to-edge grip, and split teeth of Torsion2 crampons distribute forces and offer continuous contact on any terrain, in any conditionsSecure Attachment:Two-piece, independently conforming PosiLock AT bindings create secure, freeze-resistant attachment, regardless of footwearAll-condition Adaptability:Add-on Modular Flotation tails to allow the maneuverability of a smaller, primary snowshoe with on-demand flotation of optional five-inch tailsUphill Efficiency:Ergo Televators reduce fatigue and increase traction on the steeps, with an ergonomic design that engages with simple flick of a pole gripSpecifications22-inch length:Three-pound, 13-ounce weight180-pound weight capacity250-pound weight capacity with tails25-inch length:Three-pound, 15-ounce weight220-pound weight capacity280-pound weight capacity with tails30-inch length:Four-pound, seven-ounce weight280-pound weight capacity300-pound weight capacity with tailsLifetime WarrantyMSR products are made in Seattle, Washington, and include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About MSRMSR is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers -- Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs -- who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "text": "MSR Lightning Ascent Snow Shoes MSR's Lightning Ascent snow shoes are built on the outdoor outfitter's advanced 360-degree Traction frames and Torsion2 crampons. Dual-component PosiLock AT bindings offer secure attachment, while aggressive steel cross members and easily-engaged Ergo Televators back you up with every step. The shoes fit men's shoe sizes 4.5 to 15 and have an eight-inch width, and come with the all-condition adaptability of MSR's Modular Flotation tails.Two-piece, independently conforming PosiLock AT bindings create a comfortable, secure fit.FeaturesTraction:360-degreeTraction frames with edge-to-edge grip, and split teeth of Torsion2 crampons distribute forces and offer continuous contact on any terrain, in any conditionsSecure Attachment:Two-piece, independently conforming PosiLock AT bindings create secure, freeze-resistant attachment, regardless of footwearAll-condition Adaptability:Add-on Modular Flotation tails to allow the maneuverability of a smaller, primary snowshoe with on-demand flotation of optional five-inch tailsUphill Efficiency:Ergo Televators reduce fatigue and increase traction on the steeps, with an ergonomic design that engages with simple flick of a pole gripSpecifications22-inch length:Three-pound, 13-ounce weight180-pound weight capacity250-pound weight capacity with tails25-inch length:Three-pound, 15-ounce weight220-pound weight capacity280-pound weight capacity with tails30-inch length:Four-pound, seven-ounce weight280-pound weight capacity300-pound weight capacity with tailsLifetime WarrantyMSR products are made in Seattle, Washington, and include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About MSRMSR is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers -- Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs -- who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416Zz04Ol7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0076ZSFQI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowshoeing", "Snowshoes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0076ZSLGC", "title": "Platypus SoftBottle with Push-Pull Cap", "description": "There's not a hydration bottle out there that's cleaner, greener, and more flexable than a Platypus SoftBottle. Each one comes with out Clean-Taste Guarantee, and is made with zero BPA. Your SoftBottle is green, too, because it's ultra-reusable and lightweight, it uses less energy and materials. Finally, your SoftBottle defines flexible. It fits in a drink holder, a round pocket, a flat pocket, or any hand. When empty, it rolls up and fits any where you want it to fit. Plus, it weighs 80-Percent less than hard hydration bottles. The Platypus SoftBottle-less energy from the world, clean hydration when you need it. Available with Closure Cap or our new dual-valve HyperFlow cap. The HyperFlow cap is easy to drink from and has bite valve that delivers a superfast flow rate. It also has a twist-lock travel valve that shuts down the system during transport, which means it won't leak, even under pressure, making it fast and efficient hydration.", "text": "Platypus SoftBottle with Push-Pull Cap There's not a hydration bottle out there that's cleaner, greener, and more flexable than a Platypus SoftBottle. Each one comes with out Clean-Taste Guarantee, and is made with zero BPA. Your SoftBottle is green, too, because it's ultra-reusable and lightweight, it uses less energy and materials. Finally, your SoftBottle defines flexible. It fits in a drink holder, a round pocket, a flat pocket, or any hand. When empty, it rolls up and fits any where you want it to fit. Plus, it weighs 80-Percent less than hard hydration bottles. The Platypus SoftBottle-less energy from the world, clean hydration when you need it. Available with Closure Cap or our new dual-valve HyperFlow cap. The HyperFlow cap is easy to drink from and has bite valve that delivers a superfast flow rate. It also has a twist-lock travel valve that shuts down the system during transport, which means it won't leak, even under pressure, making it fast and efficient hydration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-Z3LPA2uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0076ZSLGC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007720JSC", "title": "Rapdom Tactical Constructed Operator Cap", "description": "Our Operator Cap is made of 100-Percent cotton and features hook and loop patches on the front, back and top. Has adjustable hook and loop closure.", "text": "Rapdom Tactical Constructed Operator Cap Our Operator Cap is made of 100-Percent cotton and features hook and loop patches on the front, back and top. Has adjustable hook and loop closure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41chM%2BMrScL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007720JSC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rapdom Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 14.22}}
{"item_id": "B007722ZPM", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Day Packer Utility Knife", "description": "Unlike other Swiss Army Knives, the Day Packer features one clip-point blade. The top of the clip-point is thick and defined, while the thinner blade is more utilitarian to fit the needs of many users. Our clip-point blade will perform a myriad of cutting tasks for the casual outdoor enthusiast – a great every day item and all around useful tool.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Day Packer Utility Knife Unlike other Swiss Army Knives, the Day Packer features one clip-point blade. The top of the clip-point is thick and defined, while the thinner blade is more utilitarian to fit the needs of many users. Our clip-point blade will perform a myriad of cutting tasks for the casual outdoor enthusiast – a great every day item and all around useful tool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3135OfBRtkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007722ZPM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 14.0}}
{"item_id": "B00772ZKQS", "title": "Hunter's Specialties Inc. Strut Push Button Yelper Call", "description": "This push button yelper call allow ease of use with great sounds that is very consistent to produce clucks, purrs and yelps.", "text": "Hunter's Specialties Inc. Strut Push Button Yelper Call This push button yelper call allow ease of use with great sounds that is very consistent to produce clucks, purrs and yelps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xeRJnN6oL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00772ZKQS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hunter&#39;s Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Turkey"]], "price": 18.61}}
{"item_id": "B007759UBG", "title": "Gun Holster for Ruger LC9 With LASER", "description": "\"The Intimidator\" - Belt and Clip on Holster for the Ruger LC9 with Laser has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! The Intimidator holster by Pro-Tech is Ambidextrous has a webbing loop behind the metal clip for your belt. Has plastic adjustable spring action thumb break.Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon,inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. AS WITH MANY OTHER NAME BRAND PRODUCTS, THERE ARE LOOK-A-LIKE HOLSTERS. All Pro-Tech holsters come packaged in the Pro-Tech bag. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE, USA HOLSTER IS A AUTHORIZED PRO-TECH DEALER. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Pro-Tech's WSB-20LZ holster is Custom fit for Ruger LC9 With Laser", "text": "Gun Holster for Ruger LC9 With LASER \"The Intimidator\" - Belt and Clip on Holster for the Ruger LC9 with Laser has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! The Intimidator holster by Pro-Tech is Ambidextrous has a webbing loop behind the metal clip for your belt. Has plastic adjustable spring action thumb break.Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon,inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. AS WITH MANY OTHER NAME BRAND PRODUCTS, THERE ARE LOOK-A-LIKE HOLSTERS. All Pro-Tech holsters come packaged in the Pro-Tech bag. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE, USA HOLSTER IS A AUTHORIZED PRO-TECH DEALER. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! Pro-Tech's WSB-20LZ holster is Custom fit for Ruger LC9 With Laser", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31F1ryatrrL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007759UBG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B007772I54", "title": "Camco 57236 Cylinder Stabilizing Base for 20 lbs and 30 lbs Propane Tank", "description": "Camco's Cylinder Stabilizing Base for propane tanks helps prevent accidental tipping of your propane cylinder, especially during transport. It is for use with 20 pound or 30 pound propane tanks. The impact resistant base attaches easily to the tank to keep the cylinder in place during storage or travel.", "text": "Camco 57236 Cylinder Stabilizing Base for 20 lbs and 30 lbs Propane Tank Camco's Cylinder Stabilizing Base for propane tanks helps prevent accidental tipping of your propane cylinder, especially during transport. It is for use with 20 pound or 30 pound propane tanks. The impact resistant base attaches easily to the tank to keep the cylinder in place during storage or travel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wIoLQvwML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007772I54.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B0077AXZSA", "title": "GHOST Grip Plug for Medium & Large Frames Glocks. \"G-PLUG\"", "description": "Grip Plug designed to keep dirt and debris out of the action of your Glock also serves as a magazine funnel to aid in reloading and prevents the butt of the Glock from ripping through your shirts. Fits: 17,19,20,21,22,23,31,32,34,35,37,38-Does not fit the 21-SF or GEN 4!", "text": "GHOST Grip Plug for Medium & Large Frames Glocks. \"G-PLUG\" Grip Plug designed to keep dirt and debris out of the action of your Glock also serves as a magazine funnel to aid in reloading and prevents the butt of the Glock from ripping through your shirts. Fits: 17,19,20,21,22,23,31,32,34,35,37,38-Does not fit the 21-SF or GEN 4!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313uWoXrUzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0077AXZSA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ghost", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 6.49}}
