{"item_id": "B0077CSRXQ", "title": "(10) Mylar Bags 20\"x30\" 5 Gallon Size 4.5 Mil for Long Term Emergency Food Storage Supply", "description": "Mylar bags combined with oxygen absorbers stored in a rigid container have been shown to be the ideal way to store dehydrated goods for long-term storage. Mylar bags protect your food investment from the effects of oxygen, moisture contamination, and light penetration. These Mylar bags are 4.5 mils, and provides excellent long-term storage of dehydrated foods and has an FDA approved sealant layer. Mylar, a Polyester bag is ideal for a broad array of applications in the electrical, electronics, magnetic media, industrial specialty, imaging and graphics, and packaging markets. These Mylar bags can be heat sealed with a standard clothes iron on the wool setting or a hair straightener. Add your dehydrated food to the Mylar bag, place appropriate number of oxygen absorber on top (2000cc-2500cc), and push out as much residual air as possible before sealing the bag. All Mylar bags should be placed in a rigid container such as a plastic bucket to protect the integrity of the bag as well as to avoid rodents and bug infestation. Unused oxygen absorbers can be resealed in their original bag, placed in a mason jar, or heat sealed in a Mylar bag.", "text": "(10) Mylar Bags 20\"x30\" 5 Gallon Size 4.5 Mil for Long Term Emergency Food Storage Supply Mylar bags combined with oxygen absorbers stored in a rigid container have been shown to be the ideal way to store dehydrated goods for long-term storage. Mylar bags protect your food investment from the effects of oxygen, moisture contamination, and light penetration. These Mylar bags are 4.5 mils, and provides excellent long-term storage of dehydrated foods and has an FDA approved sealant layer. Mylar, a Polyester bag is ideal for a broad array of applications in the electrical, electronics, magnetic media, industrial specialty, imaging and graphics, and packaging markets. These Mylar bags can be heat sealed with a standard clothes iron on the wool setting or a hair straightener. Add your dehydrated food to the Mylar bag, place appropriate number of oxygen absorber on top (2000cc-2500cc), and push out as much residual air as possible before sealing the bag. All Mylar bags should be placed in a rigid container such as a plastic bucket to protect the integrity of the bag as well as to avoid rodents and bug infestation. Unused oxygen absorbers can be resealed in their original bag, placed in a mason jar, or heat sealed in a Mylar bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21wGHx-eGxL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0077CSRXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dry-Packs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 12.49}}
{"item_id": "B0077E2974", "title": "UCO Waterproof Safety Matches with Water-Resistant Box and Striker (Pack of 4)", "description": "UCO Waterproof Matches have a durable coating that repels water to ensure they will light when you need them to. Easy to pack for hiking, camping, boating, and survival kits. Each package comes with 4 boxes of 40 matches.", "text": "UCO Waterproof Safety Matches with Water-Resistant Box and Striker (Pack of 4) UCO Waterproof Matches have a durable coating that repels water to ensure they will light when you need them to. Easy to pack for hiking, camping, boating, and survival kits. Each package comes with 4 boxes of 40 matches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DmTFQgMoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0077E2974.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 4.8}}
{"item_id": "B0077E34DC", "title": "UCO Windproof and Waterproof Survival Matches with Sealed Case and 2 Strikers - 15 Matches", "description": "UCO Survival Matches come in a sealed case that includes 15 matches and 2 strikers. The case features an integrated, replaceable striker on the outside to provide an easy location for lighting matches. Survival Matches are a compact version of UCO Stormproof Matches and are easy to light, and will stay lit for up to 12 seconds, even after being submerged in water! Being able to reliably make a fire is vital for cooking, generating warmth, and in survival situations, making signal fires. UCO Survival Matches are perfect for camping, emergency kits, and should be part of every 10 Essentials check list.", "text": "UCO Windproof and Waterproof Survival Matches with Sealed Case and 2 Strikers - 15 Matches UCO Survival Matches come in a sealed case that includes 15 matches and 2 strikers. The case features an integrated, replaceable striker on the outside to provide an easy location for lighting matches. Survival Matches are a compact version of UCO Stormproof Matches and are easy to light, and will stay lit for up to 12 seconds, even after being submerged in water! Being able to reliably make a fire is vital for cooking, generating warmth, and in survival situations, making signal fires. UCO Survival Matches are perfect for camping, emergency kits, and should be part of every 10 Essentials check list.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319KdqZatuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0077E34DC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns"]], "price": 4.95}}
