{"item_id": "B0077P92EQ", "title": "BudK Red Guardian 24 Inch Sword with Sheath", "description": "Sleek, dangerous, tactical! This 28\" fantasy sword is one solid piece of cold hard, stainless steel with a heat-treated black baked finish. The blade features fantasy cut outs, teeth like serrations, and a piercing point, and slides smoothly into the included nylon blade sheath. The red simulated leather wrapped handle adds a sure grip for easy maneuverability. If there is a sword that screams to be picked up, this one is it!", "text": "BudK Red Guardian 24 Inch Sword with Sheath Sleek, dangerous, tactical! This 28\" fantasy sword is one solid piece of cold hard, stainless steel with a heat-treated black baked finish. The blade features fantasy cut outs, teeth like serrations, and a piercing point, and slides smoothly into the included nylon blade sheath. The red simulated leather wrapped handle adds a sure grip for easy maneuverability. If there is a sword that screams to be picked up, this one is it!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QqcC7eINL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0077P92EQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 20.0}}
