{"item_id": "B0077SYASQ", "title": "SABRE RED Spitfire Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Most Advanced, Compact and Fastest Deploying Key Ring Spray with Refillable Red Case", "description": "The fastest deploying and most compact key chain pepper spray is now manufactured and sold exclusively by SABRE RED! Spitfire’s ergonomic patented design has become a favorite of pepper spray users for over a decade by deploying with less effort and with greater accuracy from your hip or over your shoulder. Weight of the Spitfire is 0. 21 ounces with approximately 8 bursts at 6-8 feet in a cone spray pattern with a point of aim to the center of face. Available in black, red and purple. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE RED Spitfire Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Most Advanced, Compact and Fastest Deploying Key Ring Spray with Refillable Red Case The fastest deploying and most compact key chain pepper spray is now manufactured and sold exclusively by SABRE RED! Spitfire’s ergonomic patented design has become a favorite of pepper spray users for over a decade by deploying with less effort and with greater accuracy from your hip or over your shoulder. Weight of the Spitfire is 0. 21 ounces with approximately 8 bursts at 6-8 feet in a cone spray pattern with a point of aim to the center of face. Available in black, red and purple. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tqHfqY29L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0077SYASQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 7.21}}
{"item_id": "B0077SYCPM", "title": "SABRE RED Spitfire Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Most Advanced, Compact & Fastest Deploying Key Ring Spray with Refillable, Black Case", "description": "Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. The Sabre Spitfire Pepper Spray comes in a super compact, easy to grip canister that easily attaches to your keychain. The built in safety requires the button to be slid forward and then pressed down in order to deploy to pepper spray. The design allows for the spray to easily be used over the shoulder or from the hip, making it ideal for any self-defense scenario. For quick access while in the car, a build in quick release allows the canister to easily be removed from your key chain for easy access in high stress situations. Refill canisters can be purchased, making the Sabre Spitfire Pepper Spray a tool that will last far into the future. SABRE RED, Spitfire, refillable pepper spray features the most compact key chain spray available. It ergonomic safety mechanism is the quickest to deploy in a high stress situation. Maximize your safety with Spitfire!. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE RED Spitfire Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Most Advanced, Compact & Fastest Deploying Key Ring Spray with Refillable, Black Case Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. The Sabre Spitfire Pepper Spray comes in a super compact, easy to grip canister that easily attaches to your keychain. The built in safety requires the button to be slid forward and then pressed down in order to deploy to pepper spray. The design allows for the spray to easily be used over the shoulder or from the hip, making it ideal for any self-defense scenario. For quick access while in the car, a build in quick release allows the canister to easily be removed from your key chain for easy access in high stress situations. Refill canisters can be purchased, making the Sabre Spitfire Pepper Spray a tool that will last far into the future. SABRE RED, Spitfire, refillable pepper spray features the most compact key chain spray available. It ergonomic safety mechanism is the quickest to deploy in a high stress situation. Maximize your safety with Spitfire!. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KCcc7eUyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0077SYCPM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B0077SYFB8", "title": "SABRE RED Spitfire Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Most Advanced, Compact & Fastest Deploying Key Ring Spray with Refillable, Purple Case", "description": "Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. The fastest deploying and most compact key chain pepper spray is now manufactured and sold exclusively by SABRE RED! Spitfire’s ergonomic patented design has become a favorite of pepper spray users for over a decade by deploying with less effort and with greater accuracy from your hip or over your shoulder. Weight of the Spitfire is 0. 21 ounces with approximately 8 bursts at 6-8 feet in a cone spray pattern with a point of aim to the center of face. SABRE RED, Spitfire, refillable pepper spray features the most compact key chain spray available. It ergonomic safety mechanism is the quickest to deploy in a high stress situation. Maximize your safety with Spitfire! Available in black, red, purple, pink and zombie green. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE RED Spitfire Pepper Spray - Police Strength - Most Advanced, Compact & Fastest Deploying Key Ring Spray with Refillable, Purple Case Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. The fastest deploying and most compact key chain pepper spray is now manufactured and sold exclusively by SABRE RED! Spitfire’s ergonomic patented design has become a favorite of pepper spray users for over a decade by deploying with less effort and with greater accuracy from your hip or over your shoulder. Weight of the Spitfire is 0. 21 ounces with approximately 8 bursts at 6-8 feet in a cone spray pattern with a point of aim to the center of face. SABRE RED, Spitfire, refillable pepper spray features the most compact key chain spray available. It ergonomic safety mechanism is the quickest to deploy in a high stress situation. Maximize your safety with Spitfire! Available in black, red, purple, pink and zombie green. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-pIP7138L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0077SYFB8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 9.5}}
