{"item_id": "B0077X0T5O", "title": "Black Paracord, 50 feet, Type III, 550 lb, 7 strand, Commercial version of Mil-Spec Mil-C-5040", "description": "Paracord made by an approved vendor of the United States Department of Defense, passing all of the government's quality control, first-article inspection requirements. Type III Commercial, made to Mil-Spec, 550 lb, 7 strand", "text": "Black Paracord, 50 feet, Type III, 550 lb, 7 strand, Commercial version of Mil-Spec Mil-C-5040 Paracord made by an approved vendor of the United States Department of Defense, passing all of the government's quality control, first-article inspection requirements. Type III Commercial, made to Mil-Spec, 550 lb, 7 strand", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kBPxOORqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0077X0T5O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Perpetual Revolution", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 5.76}}
{"item_id": "B00783N8MO", "title": "Gerber 30-000587 Crucial Multi-Tool, Black", "description": "The Crucial offers an entire toolbox of full-sized components in one rugged stainless steel package. The handles are ergonomically curved for a better grip and more torque. The liner-locking knife blade is half fine edge and half serrated. Built with a clip and weighing just five ounces, the Crucial can also be carried as an everyday pocket tool.", "text": "Gerber 30-000587 Crucial Multi-Tool, Black The Crucial offers an entire toolbox of full-sized components in one rugged stainless steel package. The handles are ergonomically curved for a better grip and more torque. The liner-locking knife blade is half fine edge and half serrated. Built with a clip and weighing just five ounces, the Crucial can also be carried as an everyday pocket tool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319IPfJbUPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00783N8MO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 28.0}}
{"item_id": "B0078MWM2W", "title": "RCBS Rock Chucker Supreme Master Reloading Kit, Green", "description": "We've taken the new benchmark of single stage presses and surrounded it with the equipment you need to start loading like a pro. A simple solution for the beginner and pro alike, it is easily upgraded to progressive operation with the optional Piggyback 4.", "text": "RCBS Rock Chucker Supreme Master Reloading Kit, Green We've taken the new benchmark of single stage presses and surrounded it with the equipment you need to start loading like a pro. A simple solution for the beginner and pro alike, it is easily upgraded to progressive operation with the optional Piggyback 4.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GqQGcE7pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0078MWM2W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 300.0}}
{"item_id": "B0078S91V6", "title": "Adarga Leather Handlebar Tape", "description": "Quite simply...this is the finest leather handlebar tape on the planet. The Adarga leather bar tape took years of product development, seriously tough testing, and has been race proven all over the US. Concerning maintenance, all you have to worry about is finding a damp rag...simply wipe the leather down. Simple, easy, tough, low maintenance leather handlebar tape will last longer than any other tape we've seen! Adarga Leather Handlebar Tape is made in Milwaukee, Wisconsin using American Full-Grain Cow Hide in the same building that the leather is made...in a real leather tannery! It's made by leather experts, (and bike enthusiasts) for bike enthusiasts.", "text": "Adarga Leather Handlebar Tape Quite simply...this is the finest leather handlebar tape on the planet. The Adarga leather bar tape took years of product development, seriously tough testing, and has been race proven all over the US. Concerning maintenance, all you have to worry about is finding a damp rag...simply wipe the leather down. Simple, easy, tough, low maintenance leather handlebar tape will last longer than any other tape we've seen! Adarga Leather Handlebar Tape is made in Milwaukee, Wisconsin using American Full-Grain Cow Hide in the same building that the leather is made...in a real leather tannery! It's made by leather experts, (and bike enthusiasts) for bike enthusiasts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WTJGSagGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0078S91V6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebar Tape"]], "price": 54.99}}
{"item_id": "B0078TALF0", "title": "Camo Form Tactical \"Multicam\" Camouflage Gun and Gear Self Cling Stretch Wrap (2\" and 4\")", "description": "When you need to conceal guns or camouflage gear without leaving behind a sticky residue only one gun camo will do. Camo Form by McNett Tactical is a self-adhering, camouflage wrap that is removable and reusable. Use it on guns, scopes, knives, treestands, flashlights - whatever you're taking into the field.Camo Form stretches and sticks to itself, and conforms to any shape for a custom fit. When it gets dirty or wet, simply remove, wash, let dry and reapply. The heavy-duty fabric not only protects and conceals tactical gear, but it also adds grip, insulates hands from hot or cold surfaces and quiets clanking objects.Available in 15 traditional and digital camo patterns, Camo Form keeps gear and guns concealed, covered and ready for action.", "text": "Camo Form Tactical \"Multicam\" Camouflage Gun and Gear Self Cling Stretch Wrap (2\" and 4\") When you need to conceal guns or camouflage gear without leaving behind a sticky residue only one gun camo will do. Camo Form by McNett Tactical is a self-adhering, camouflage wrap that is removable and reusable. Use it on guns, scopes, knives, treestands, flashlights - whatever you're taking into the field.Camo Form stretches and sticks to itself, and conforms to any shape for a custom fit. When it gets dirty or wet, simply remove, wash, let dry and reapply. The heavy-duty fabric not only protects and conceals tactical gear, but it also adds grip, insulates hands from hot or cold surfaces and quiets clanking objects.Available in 15 traditional and digital camo patterns, Camo Form keeps gear and guns concealed, covered and ready for action.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HmRjdLQPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0078TALF0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0078WMSZ8", "title": "P-38 Can Opener & P-51 Can Opener", "description": "This is one of the army's greatest tools. Can be used for dozens of jobs. Makes a great can opener, cutting edge, groove cleaner, screw drive, clean finger nails, open seams and many, many more practical uses. Now you can have one of each size... Made in the USA by US Shelby (Make sure they are stamped US Shelby to guarntee made in the USA)", "text": "P-38 Can Opener & P-51 Can Opener This is one of the army's greatest tools. Can be used for dozens of jobs. Makes a great can opener, cutting edge, groove cleaner, screw drive, clean finger nails, open seams and many, many more practical uses. Now you can have one of each size... Made in the USA by US Shelby (Make sure they are stamped US Shelby to guarntee made in the USA)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Pc-c6CgyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0078WMSZ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 1.99}}
{"item_id": "B0078ZTWP4", "title": "Lighting EVER LED Lantern, Ultra Bright 300lm, Home, Garden and Camping Lanterns", "description": "With ultra bright LED, optimized beams, rubber grips, tactical switches and 3 modes, Lighting EVER LED Lantern is widely used for Outdoor activities, such as camping, hiking, caving and so on. The high performance LED bulbs generate significantly greater brightness than conventional lantern and are extremely energy efficient, so they can be used to illuminate tents, giving campers the peace of mind that they wont get left in the dark. The lantern also features an integrated hook, ideal for hanging from your tent at night. The energy efficient LED bulbs are powered by three D batteries (not included). 3 modes(100%, 50%, and flashing) are available. Lighting EVER high quality standard. 90 days money back guarantee.About LELighting EVER, abbreviated LE, focus on LED lighting with better lighting experience.We are passionate about excellence so that with every LE brand purchase, you can expect to find better lighting experience, affordable prices, and great customer service.", "text": "Lighting EVER LED Lantern, Ultra Bright 300lm, Home, Garden and Camping Lanterns With ultra bright LED, optimized beams, rubber grips, tactical switches and 3 modes, Lighting EVER LED Lantern is widely used for Outdoor activities, such as camping, hiking, caving and so on. The high performance LED bulbs generate significantly greater brightness than conventional lantern and are extremely energy efficient, so they can be used to illuminate tents, giving campers the peace of mind that they wont get left in the dark. The lantern also features an integrated hook, ideal for hanging from your tent at night. The energy efficient LED bulbs are powered by three D batteries (not included). 3 modes(100%, 50%, and flashing) are available. Lighting EVER high quality standard. 90 days money back guarantee.About LELighting EVER, abbreviated LE, focus on LED lighting with better lighting experience.We are passionate about excellence so that with every LE brand purchase, you can expect to find better lighting experience, affordable prices, and great customer service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419NNK-AgpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0078ZTWP4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lighting EVER", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 29.99}}
