{"item_id": "B007945ZNW", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pack Of 5 AR-15 AR15 AR 15 M16 M4 .223 5.56 Rifle 1/2\"x28 Thread Steel Crush Washer For Barrel Flash Hider Choke Suppressor Muzzle Brake Compensator", "description": "Pack of 5 crush washers - Use this crush washer during the installation of a flash hider, muzzle brake or compensator on a barrel to guarantee proper fit and indexing of an aftermarket muzzle accessory.. Just place on the barrel, then thread on your compensator / muzzle brake / flash hider and torque to 15-20 ft-lbs. Quality steel construction can be used either together with or instead of peel washers when mounting muzzle devices.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pack Of 5 AR-15 AR15 AR 15 M16 M4 .223 5.56 Rifle 1/2\"x28 Thread Steel Crush Washer For Barrel Flash Hider Choke Suppressor Muzzle Brake Compensator Pack of 5 crush washers - Use this crush washer during the installation of a flash hider, muzzle brake or compensator on a barrel to guarantee proper fit and indexing of an aftermarket muzzle accessory.. Just place on the barrel, then thread on your compensator / muzzle brake / flash hider and torque to 15-20 ft-lbs. Quality steel construction can be used either together with or instead of peel washers when mounting muzzle devices.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I5BNj7cRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007945ZNW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 9.99}}
