{"item_id": "B00794LHOI", "title": "Crossfire II 6 - 18x44mm AO Riflescope", "description": "Crossfire II 6 - 18x44mm AO Riflescope brings you closer than ever! Clearer. Tougher. Brighter. Crossfire II Riflescopes are built to exceed the standards of other scopes in their class. Better performance at a better price. That's something to aim for! Specs: Fully multi-coated lenses for superior light transmission with low reflection; 1\" tube is O-ring sealed and nitrogen purged for waterproof / fogproof performance; Premium aircraft-grade aluminum construction with anodized, low-glare finish; Adjustable objective for fine tuning and reducing parallax error; Fast-focus eyepiece for quick, easy reticle focusing; Lenses are locked in place with machined locking rings for shockproof performance; Resettable, capped MOA turrets. 1 click = 1/4\"; Extended eye relief of 3.7-4.3\"; F .O.V. is 15.2-15.3 ft @ 100 yds. 6-18x magnification; 44mm objective lens diameter; Includes sunshade, removable lens covers and dust cloth; Measures approx. 13 1/2\" l x 2 1/4\" w. Weighs approx. 20 ozs. State Reticle. Eagle-eye performance at a great price! Order yours today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. Crossfire II 6-18x44mm AO Riflescope", "text": "Crossfire II 6 - 18x44mm AO Riflescope Crossfire II 6 - 18x44mm AO Riflescope brings you closer than ever! Clearer. Tougher. Brighter. Crossfire II Riflescopes are built to exceed the standards of other scopes in their class. Better performance at a better price. That's something to aim for! Specs: Fully multi-coated lenses for superior light transmission with low reflection; 1\" tube is O-ring sealed and nitrogen purged for waterproof / fogproof performance; Premium aircraft-grade aluminum construction with anodized, low-glare finish; Adjustable objective for fine tuning and reducing parallax error; Fast-focus eyepiece for quick, easy reticle focusing; Lenses are locked in place with machined locking rings for shockproof performance; Resettable, capped MOA turrets. 1 click = 1/4\"; Extended eye relief of 3.7-4.3\"; F .O.V. is 15.2-15.3 ft @ 100 yds. 6-18x magnification; 44mm objective lens diameter; Includes sunshade, removable lens covers and dust cloth; Measures approx. 13 1/2\" l x 2 1/4\" w. Weighs approx. 20 ozs. State Reticle. Eagle-eye performance at a great price! Order yours today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. Crossfire II 6-18x44mm AO Riflescope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31p4X4jVhML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00794LHOI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
