ck, easy reticle focusing; Lenses are locked in place with machined locking rings for shockproof performance; Resettable, capped MOA turrets. 1 click = 1/4\"; Extended eye relief of 3.9-4.4\"; F .O.V. is 24.7-8.4 ft. @ 100 yds.; 4-12x magnification; 40mm objective lens diameter; Includes sunshade, removable lens covers and dust cloth; Measures approx. 13 1/2\" l. x 2\" w. Weighs approx. 19 ozs.; State Reticle. Eagle-eye performance at a great price! Order yours today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. Crossfire II 4-12x40mm AO Riflescope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DSH8hAsgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00794LINS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00794N76O", "title": "Burris 300235 Fastfire III No Mount 3 MOA Sight (Black)", "description": "The Fast Fire III Red Dot Sight is the most versatile red dot sight on the market. Mount it on your favorite handgun, shotgun, or hunting rifle for greater accuracy and faster target acquisition. You won't need to worry about sight alignment, eye dominance, or finding your target. Just put the red dot on your target and pull the trigger.", "text": "Burris 300235 Fastfire III No Mount 3 MOA Sight (Black) The Fast Fire III Red Dot Sight is the most versatile red dot sight on the market. Mount it on your favorite handgun, shotgun, or hunting rifle for greater accuracy and faster target acquisition. You won't need to worry about sight alignment, eye dominance, or finding your target. Just put the red dot on your target and pull the trigger.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f5obGRNCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00794N76O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 239.0}}
{"item_id": "B00794VUJ0", "title": "Pool Table Billiard Ball Set by Felson Billiard Supply", "description": "Pool enthusiasts will appreciate this premium set of billiard balls. Made of high-quality hard resin, this set of 16 pool balls is a great addition to any home game. Made by Felson Billiard Supplies, each ball measures 2 inches and is precision engineered for perfect roundness. These billiard balls are packed in a soft bed of felt to ensure easy storage when not in use. Included in the set are seven striped balls in yellow, red, blue, purple, green, orange and maroon. The seven solid balls come in coordinating colors. A white cue ball and a black eight ball are also included.", "text": "Pool Table Billiard Ball Set by Felson Billiard Supply Pool enthusiasts will appreciate this premium set of billiard balls. Made of high-quality hard resin, this set of 16 pool balls is a great addition to any home game. Made by Felson Billiard Supplies, each ball measures 2 inches and is precision engineered for perfect roundness. These billiard balls are packed in a soft bed of felt to ensure easy storage when not in use. Included in the set are seven striped balls in yellow, red, blue, purple, green, orange and maroon. The seven solid balls come in coordinating colors. A white cue ball and a black eight ball are also included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ukfdw-NFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00794VUJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FELSON BILLIARD SUPPLIES", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Billiards & Pool", "Billiard Balls"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B00795ATW8", "title": "(Bag of 6) 22caliber Bore-tipsTM Cleaning Swabs: 41-2201", "description": "• Easier, faster and simpler than traditional patches and jags. • Replaces patches and jags in traditional firearms cleaning. • Provides superior barrel cleaning. • Provides 360 degree bore coverage. • Provides uniform application of oil for storage. • Lint free Bore-tips are plastic foam over a plastic core. • Economical, washable and reusable. • Stands up to most commercially available solvents. • Color coded for easy caliber identification. • Threaded to fit on standard 8/32 and 5/16-27 cleaning rods. • Made in the USA.", "text": "(Bag of 6) 22caliber Bore-tipsTM Cleaning Swabs: 41-2201 • Easier, faster and simpler than traditional patches and jags. • Replaces patches and jags in traditional firearms cleaning. • Provides superior barrel cleaning. • Provides 360 degree bore coverage. • Provides uniform application of oil for storage. • Lint free Bore-tips are plastic foam over a plastic core. • Economical, washable and reusable. • Stands up to most commercially available solvents. • Color coded for easy caliber identification. • Threaded to fit on standard 8/32 and 5/16-27 cleaning rods. • Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DNJT4m%2BAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00795ATW8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Swab-its Foam Swabs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 7.47}}
{"item_id": "B0079EMZJO", "title": "DB POWER Ultrafire 1000 Lumen Cree Wf-501b Xm-l T6 LED Flashlight Torch 5-modes New", "description": "Features:*Output bright can come to above 1000 lumens [lm]*Model of LED: CREE XM-L T6 LED*Internal wiring applies the high efficient booster circuit, working voltage is wide and can utilize the batteries in the largest extent.*Waterproofing design*Aluminum alloy casing*Aluminum alloy reflector*5 switch Mode: high / middle / low / strobe / sos*Power by : 1 x 18650 3.7v(Not Included)*Colour : Black*Size(mm):135 x 30(bezel)/25(body)*Weight : 96gDear Friend ,Please Click The Following Links:The Instructions:http://www.facebook.com/video/video.php?v=118330021619717Single Package List(Battery Not Included):*1 x UltraFire 501B CREE XM-L T6 LED High Power Flashlight Torch", "text": "DB POWER Ultrafire 1000 Lumen Cree Wf-501b Xm-l T6 LED Flashlight Torch 5-modes New Features:*Output bright can come to above 1000 lumens [lm]*Model of LED: CREE XM-L T6 LED*Internal wiring applies the high efficient booster circuit, working voltage is wide and can utilize the batteries in the largest extent.*Waterproofing design*Aluminum alloy casing*Aluminum alloy reflector*5 switch Mode: high / middle / low / strobe / sos*Power by : 1 x 18650 3.7v(Not Included)*Colour : Black*Size(mm):135 x 30(bezel)/25(body)*Weight : 96gDear Friend ,Please Click The Following Links:The Instructions:http://www.facebook.com/video/video.php?v=118330021619717Single Package List(Battery Not Included):*1 x UltraFire 501B CREE XM-L T6 LED High Power Flashlight Torch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410mNjo6%2B4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0079EMZJO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 10.58}}
{"item_id": "B0079IX4AE", "title": "Gamo Bone Collector Cone Backyard Trap with Paper Targets", "description": "Collapsible metal pellet trap recommended for use with lead airgun pellet and lead shot only. Do not use with BB's as they can ricochet and cause serious injury.", "text": "Gamo Bone Collector Cone Backyard Trap with Paper Targets Collapsible metal pellet trap recommended for use with lead airgun pellet and lead shot only. Do not use with BB's as they can ricochet and cause serious injury.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ooZdfqAkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0079IX4AE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Targets"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B0079Q6EGC", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Magazine Caps 3 Pack", "description": "Mags Caps Three Pack. The caps fit all high capacity magazines plus the factory magazines made for the Ruger 10/22 including the new Ruger BX-25 Magazine. The Mag Caps fit over the end of your magazines keeping them clean when not in use. The Mag Caps protect the lips of the magazine from damage. If you keep a spare magazine in your pocket it will be clean and ready to go. There's no wrong way to put the Mag caps on. They fit tightly in either direction, with a virtual waterproof seal, but are easily removed. Made from santoprene thermoplastic rubber, they are flexible and tough. This is a great little item for those of us that like to keep things clean. This little honey will fit all the Ruger 10/22 long rifle mags. Snug fitting cap off your mags today! Order a three pack today!", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Magazine Caps 3 Pack Mags Caps Three Pack. The caps fit all high capacity magazines plus the factory magazines made for the Ruger 10/22 including the new Ruger BX-25 Magazine. The Mag Caps fit over the end of your magazines keeping them clean when not in use. The Mag Caps protect the lips of the magazine from damage. If you keep a spare magazine in your pocket it will be clean and ready to go. There's no wrong way to put the Mag caps on. They fit tightly in either direction, with a virtual waterproof seal, but are easily removed. Made from santoprene thermoplastic rubber, they are flexible and tough. This is a great little item for those of us that like to keep things clean. This little honey will fit all the Ruger 10/22 long rifle mags. Snug fitting cap off your mags today! Order a three pack today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315N7C3-UHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0079Q6EGC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speed Beez", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B0079QF4Z4", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Jumbo Cocking Handle", "description": "Ruger 10/22 Jumbo Cocking Handle is a Great Low Cost Upgrade!. If you want a little bit more purchase to make the cocking handle easier to grab this is it. Gives you a large handle area if your wearing gloves or just have big hands. This kit comes with the Handle and the wrench to install it with. Easy drop-in installation comes with instructions. This is a great low cost upgrade to your favorite Ruger 10/22. A Speed Beez cold climate customer favorite.", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Jumbo Cocking Handle Ruger 10/22 Jumbo Cocking Handle is a Great Low Cost Upgrade!. If you want a little bit more purchase to make the cocking handle easier to grab this is it. Gives you a large handle area if your wearing gloves or just have big hands. This kit comes with the Handle and the wrench to install it with. Easy drop-in installation comes with instructions. This is a great low cost upgrade to your favorite Ruger 10/22. A Speed Beez cold climate customer favorite.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XMg5XQioL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0079QF4Z4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speed Beez", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B0079QHQ2S", "title": "Bundle Monster Cool Weather Camping Sleeping Bag for 3 Seasons (Spring, Summer, Fall) - Blue - Adults", "description": "Ideal for 3 season cool weather (Spring, Summer, Fall) camping. The Bundle Monster large sleeping bag is durably constructed of a polyester cover with a soft, 190T pongee lining and 3lbs of thermo insulation keeps you comfortable throughout the night and it measures 29.5\" x 86.6\" (W X D), meant to fit taller campers up to 6'2\" tall . A unique scoop shape creates a comfortable headrest, keeping your head and pillow off the ground. Surface constructed of waterproof material - keeping you dry. This sporty camping sleeping bag is constructed with features that keep you warm and comfortable, such as: Zip Plow: Prevents zipper snags by plowing fabric away from zipperRoll Control: Locks bag in place for easier rollingFiber Lock: Prevents insulation from shifting, increasing durabilityThermo Lock: Reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmerCertified Temperature Rating: Independently tested for temperature accuracyZipper Glide Tailoring: Allows smooth zipper operation around the cornerComfort Cuff: Surrounds your face with softness", "text": "Bundle Monster Cool Weather Camping Sleeping Bag for 3 Seasons (Spring, Summer, Fall) - Blue - Adults Ideal for 3 season cool weather (Spring, Summer, Fall) camping. The Bundle Monster large sleeping bag is durably constructed of a polyester cover with a soft, 190T pongee lining and 3lbs of thermo insulation keeps you comfortable throughout the night and it measures 29.5\" x 86.6\" (W X D), meant to fit taller campers up to 6'2\" tall . A unique scoop shape creates a comfortable headrest, keeping your head and pillow off the ground. Surface constructed of waterproof material - keeping you dry. This sporty camping sleeping bag is constructed with features that keep you warm and comfortable, such as: Zip Plow: Prevents zipper snags by plowing fabric away from zipperRoll Control: Locks bag in place for easier rollingFiber Lock: Prevents insulation from shifting, increasing durabilityThermo Lock: Reduces heat loss through the zipper, keeping you warmerCertified Temperature Rating: Independently tested for temperature accuracyZipper Glide Tailoring: Allows smooth zipper operation around the cornerComfort Cuff: Surrounds your face with softness", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313bxQZ9CXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0079QHQ2S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 37.5}}
{"item_id": "B0079QIUKK", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Recoil Buffer Pin", "description": "Ruger 10/22 Recoil Buffer Pin. Made from a proprietary blend (secret formula) of high density fiber filled polymer formulated for maximum shock-absorbing characteristics, the recoil buffer is a drop-in part. This is a great low cost upgrade to your favorite Ruger 10/22. A Speed Beez customer favorite. This is the last Recoil Buffer Pin your Ruger 10/22 will ever need. Fits Ruger 10/22 Long Rifle and 10/22 Magnum. This helps take some of the bump out of the recoil on your Ruger 10/22 too. This pin is so tough we guarantee it not to break if it does we'll send you a new one. Easy drop-in installation comes with instructions. When we say easy we mean do you know how to strip down you Ruger 10/22. If you don't check out some YouTube videos. If you still don't feel comfortable save yourself the frustration and continue to use your Ruger 10/22 as is. The Recoil Buffer Pin is a great little feature, but for some their just purchasing installation aggravation. Recoil buffers are an easy and inexpensive way to get yourself more shooting satisfaction.", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Recoil Buffer Pin Ruger 10/22 Recoil Buffer Pin. Made from a proprietary blend (secret formula) of high density fiber filled polymer formulated for maximum shock-absorbing characteristics, the recoil buffer is a drop-in part. This is a great low cost upgrade to your favorite Ruger 10/22. A Speed Beez customer favorite. This is the last Recoil Buffer Pin your Ruger 10/22 will ever need. Fits Ruger 10/22 Long Rifle and 10/22 Magnum. This helps take some of the bump out of the recoil on your Ruger 10/22 too. This pin is so tough we guarantee it not to break if it does we'll send you a new one. Easy drop-in installation comes with instructions. When we say easy we mean do you know how to strip down you Ruger 10/22. If you don't check out some YouTube videos. If you still don't feel comfortable save yourself the frustration and continue to use your Ruger 10/22 as is. The Recoil Buffer Pin is a great little feature, but for some their just purchasing installation aggravation. Recoil buffers are an easy and inexpensive way to get yourself more shooting satisfaction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Py9dPQ0%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0079QIUKK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speed Beez", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B0079QKBD4", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Extended Magazine Release (Black)", "description": "Trick out your Ruger 10/22 with a magazine release that looks like it belongs on your gun. Improve the function and look of your 10/22. Made from aircraft aluminum anodized in either black or clear to match up to your gun. Simple to operate by applying pressure in the forward direction, the magazine will drop free from the receiver. This extended magazine release is a great low cost upgrade to your favorite Ruger 10/22. Loads of Fun! Upgrade today!", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Extended Magazine Release (Black) Trick out your Ruger 10/22 with a magazine release that looks like it belongs on your gun. Improve the function and look of your 10/22. Made from aircraft aluminum anodized in either black or clear to match up to your gun. Simple to operate by applying pressure in the forward direction, the magazine will drop free from the receiver. This extended magazine release is a great low cost upgrade to your favorite Ruger 10/22. Loads of Fun! Upgrade today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310QDUVIdvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0079QKBD4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B0079QNRKS", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Quick & Easy Magazine Loader", "description": "Quick & Easy Loader for Ruger 10/22 high capacity magazines. A guaranteed thumb saver! This works with every aftermarket high-cap 10/22 mag out there. This mag loader is fast and easy to use a real thumb saver! With a little practice you'll be loading twice as fast and with out a sore fingers! This thing is simple to use, proven to be tough and reliable, no moving parts keep it simple. You operate it by sliding the Quick Easy Loader over the magazine body and engaging the magazine follower this gives you a hand hold to compress and hold the follower spring as you slide in ammunition. Try one today with a little practice you'll find out why we called it Quick and Easy. Loads of Fun! This is one of the simplest and handiest little devices you may ever stick in your range bag.", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Quick & Easy Magazine Loader Quick & Easy Loader for Ruger 10/22 high capacity magazines. A guaranteed thumb saver! This works with every aftermarket high-cap 10/22 mag out there. This mag loader is fast and easy to use a real thumb saver! With a little practice you'll be loading twice as fast and with out a sore fingers! This thing is simple to use, proven to be tough and reliable, no moving parts keep it simple. You operate it by sliding the Quick Easy Loader over the magazine body and engaging the magazine follower this gives you a hand hold to compress and hold the follower spring as you slide in ammunition. Try one today with a little practice you'll find out why we called it Quick and Easy. Loads of Fun! This is one of the simplest and handiest little devices you may ever stick in your range bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41T2uVeaJhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0079QNRKS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speed Beez", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B0079QOS24", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Auto Bolt Release", "description": "Auto Bolt Release for Ruger 10/22 Enables the shooter to simply pull back the bolt slightly to the rear and the bolt automatically releases, thus eliminating the need to push up and backward on the bolt lock mechanism to release the bolt. This 10/22 accessory is practically a must-have and is a Speed Beez customer favorite. Easy drop-in installation comes with instructions. When we say easy we mean do you know how to strip down you Ruger 10/22. If you don't check out some YouTube videos. If you still don't feel comfortable save yourself the frustration and continue to use your Ruger 10/22 as is. The Auto Bolt Release is a great little feature, but for some their just purchasing aggravation. Does not fit the Ruger 10/22 Magnum. The Auto Bolt Release is a great low cost upgrade for your favorite Ruger 10/22. Simple and easy Loads of Fun! Upgrade Your Ruger today!", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Auto Bolt Release Auto Bolt Release for Ruger 10/22 Enables the shooter to simply pull back the bolt slightly to the rear and the bolt automatically releases, thus eliminating the need to push up and backward on the bolt lock mechanism to release the bolt. This 10/22 accessory is practically a must-have and is a Speed Beez customer favorite. Easy drop-in installation comes with instructions. When we say easy we mean do you know how to strip down you Ruger 10/22. If you don't check out some YouTube videos. If you still don't feel comfortable save yourself the frustration and continue to use your Ruger 10/22 as is. The Auto Bolt Release is a great little feature, but for some their just purchasing aggravation. Does not fit the Ruger 10/22 Magnum. The Auto Bolt Release is a great low cost upgrade for your favorite Ruger 10/22. Simple and easy Loads of Fun! Upgrade Your Ruger today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Hfo-LwtdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0079QOS24.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ruger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.95}}
