{"item_id": "B007A0IT0Q", "title": "Grand Trunk Collapsible Micro Stool", "description": "FEATURES of the Grand Trunk Collapsible Micro Stool Gear Pocket On Bottom A Place To Sit Anywhere Collapsible Legs For Easy Transport Great For All Events SPECIFICATIONS of the Grand Trunk Collapsible Micro Stool Dimension: 9\" x 9.5\" x 9.5\" Weight: 10 oz Capacity: 250 lbs 1680D Synthetic Oxford Aluminum Tubing", "text": "Grand Trunk Collapsible Micro Stool FEATURES of the Grand Trunk Collapsible Micro Stool Gear Pocket On Bottom A Place To Sit Anywhere Collapsible Legs For Easy Transport Great For All Events SPECIFICATIONS of the Grand Trunk Collapsible Micro Stool Dimension: 9\" x 9.5\" x 9.5\" Weight: 10 oz Capacity: 250 lbs 1680D Synthetic Oxford Aluminum Tubing", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qiDw5E6vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007A0IT0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grand Trunk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Stools"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B007A2GF6E", "title": "Sightmark 6.8 Remington SPC Boresighter", "description": "The Sightmark 6.8 Remington SPC boresight provides the most convenient and accurate method for sighting in 6.8 Remington rifles. Simply chamber the boresight like a regular bullet and a laser dot will show exactly where the rifle is aiming. Its easy to sight in any scope without firing a single shot. Live fire is only needed to fine tune the weapon being sighted in order to compensate for inconsistencies, such as bullet drop due to distance. The 6.8 caliber was developed by the military and bridges the gap between .223 and 7.62x51 calibers, giving high power to AR15 shooters, who feature a 6.8 caliber on his or her upper receiver. With a 6.8 caliber receiver, AR15 shooters are able to utilize its performance improvements. The Sightmark boresight is sure to take the frustration out of sighting in almost any gun. Its easy to use and will quickly save both time and money by avoiding prolonged live fire tests at the range, use the extra ammo for honing those shooting skills and for the hunt. A lightweight carrying pouch protects the laser for convenient use in the field. Sightmark-Make Your Mark.", "text": "Sightmark 6.8 Remington SPC Boresighter The Sightmark 6.8 Remington SPC boresight provides the most convenient and accurate method for sighting in 6.8 Remington rifles. Simply chamber the boresight like a regular bullet and a laser dot will show exactly where the rifle is aiming. Its easy to sight in any scope without firing a single shot. Live fire is only needed to fine tune the weapon being sighted in order to compensate for inconsistencies, such as bullet drop due to distance. The 6.8 caliber was developed by the military and bridges the gap between .223 and 7.62x51 calibers, giving high power to AR15 shooters, who feature a 6.8 caliber on his or her upper receiver. With a 6.8 caliber receiver, AR15 shooters are able to utilize its performance improvements. The Sightmark boresight is sure to take the frustration out of sighting in almost any gun. Its easy to use and will quickly save both time and money by avoiding prolonged live fire tests at the range, use the extra ammo for honing those shooting skills and for the hunt. A lightweight carrying pouch protects the laser for convenient use in the field. Sightmark-Make Your Mark.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zpsTcSTBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007A2GF6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 29.87}}
{"item_id": "B007A2GUBE", "title": "Sightmark IR-805 Compact Infrared Illuminator Flashlight", "description": "Combined with any night vision riflescope or monocular, the Sightmark Infrared Illuminator acts as a flashlight during night vision use. With the Infrared Illuminator, the user can illuminate the target without the prey detecting it. The Sightmark IR Illuminator is great for indoor and outdoor use, where there is low ambient light, such as during a SWAT raid in a dark warehouse or varmint hunting out on a moonless night. Operable with two AAA batteries, the Sightmark Infrared Illuminator offers two power options, a low output at 70mw and a high output at 100mw for a more powerful and brighter experience. Featuring a battery life of 20 hours, the Infrared Illuminator also has an adjustable beam focus to widen or narrow the stream of light. The adjustable beam focus is perfect for not only user preference, but for adapting to long and short ranges and indoor/outdoor use. For closer ranges or indoor use, where target acquisition is important, the wider beam will cover a wider field of view. The design of the IR flashlight is great for handheld use and the location of the on/off switch makes it easy to operate with the thumb. As long as the enemy does not have night vision, the IR flashlight can be used for covert signaling at night. The Infrared Illuminator comes with a standard one inch weaver mount that fits most AR15s and average rifles and also comes with nylon carrying case for easy carry and storage.", "text": "Sightmark IR-805 Compact Infrared Illuminator Flashlight Combined with any night vision riflescope or monocular, the Sightmark Infrared Illuminator acts as a flashlight during night vision use. With the Infrared Illuminator, the user can illuminate the target without the prey detecting it. The Sightmark IR Illuminator is great for indoor and outdoor use, where there is low ambient light, such as during a SWAT raid in a dark warehouse or varmint hunting out on a moonless night. Operable with two AAA batteries, the Sightmark Infrared Illuminator offers two power options, a low output at 70mw and a high output at 100mw for a more powerful and brighter experience. Featuring a battery life of 20 hours, the Infrared Illuminator also has an adjustable beam focus to widen or narrow the stream of light. The adjustable beam focus is perfect for not only user preference, but for adapting to long and short ranges and indoor/outdoor use. For closer ranges or indoor use, where target acquisition is important, the wider beam will cover a wider field of view. The design of the IR flashlight is great for handheld use and the location of the on/off switch makes it easy to operate with the thumb. As long as the enemy does not have night vision, the IR flashlight can be used for covert signaling at night. The Infrared Illuminator comes with a standard one inch weaver mount that fits most AR15s and average rifles and also comes with nylon carrying case for easy carry and storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4146D2SyY6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007A2GUBE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 43.99}}
{"item_id": "B007A4NMWC", "title": "Fixie Freewheel Single Speed Wheel Wheelset Black", "description": "Brand: Stars-CircleFit Tire Size: 700cx19c to 28cApplications: 16 Tooth Fixed Gear or 16 Tooth Freewheel (Fixed gear and freewheel are included)Decals: Could be removed by handWeight: Front: 1000g or 2.2 lbs; Rear: 1235g or 2.7 lbsRims Material: 6061 AluminiumRims Size: 700c (Would be OK for old style 27\" wheel bikes, needs long drop out brake callipers)Rims Side Faces: CNC machined wall for brakesFront Hub: Quando Brand; Aluminium; Ball Bearings; Size: M10x 100 x 108mmRear Hub: Quando Brand; Aluminium; Ball Bearings; Size: M10x 130 x 140mmSpokes Material: Stainless Steel; Gauge: 14K; Type: BladedSpokes Count: Front: 24; Rear: 24Package: One front wheel and one rear wheel fully assembled with hubs, spokes, sprocket, freewheelWarranty: 1 year", "text": "Fixie Freewheel Single Speed Wheel Wheelset Black Brand: Stars-CircleFit Tire Size: 700cx19c to 28cApplications: 16 Tooth Fixed Gear or 16 Tooth Freewheel (Fixed gear and freewheel are included)Decals: Could be removed by handWeight: Front: 1000g or 2.2 lbs; Rear: 1235g or 2.7 lbsRims Material: 6061 AluminiumRims Size: 700c (Would be OK for old style 27\" wheel bikes, needs long drop out brake callipers)Rims Side Faces: CNC machined wall for brakesFront Hub: Quando Brand; Aluminium; Ball Bearings; Size: M10x 100 x 108mmRear Hub: Quando Brand; Aluminium; Ball Bearings; Size: M10x 130 x 140mmSpokes Material: Stainless Steel; Gauge: 14K; Type: BladedSpokes Count: Front: 24; Rear: 24Package: One front wheel and one rear wheel fully assembled with hubs, spokes, sprocket, freewheelWarranty: 1 year", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZBFbPGcvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007A4NMWC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Wheels & Accessories", "Wheels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007A6SR48", "title": "Topeak Joe Blow Max Hp Floor Pump (Black)", "description": "Topeak's Joe Blow Max HP floor pump packs plenty of features in an entry level pump. The Joe Blow Max HP is the perfect floor pump for all of your inflation needs. The new high pressure HP barrel can easily inflate road tires to their recommended pressure. The HP barrel efficiently inflates large volume tires such as mountain and cruiser tires as well. Ball and bladder needles are included to inflate exercise, beach and other sports related balls.", "text": "Topeak Joe Blow Max Hp Floor Pump (Black) Topeak's Joe Blow Max HP floor pump packs plenty of features in an entry level pump. The Joe Blow Max HP is the perfect floor pump for all of your inflation needs. The new high pressure HP barrel can easily inflate road tires to their recommended pressure. The HP barrel efficiently inflates large volume tires such as mountain and cruiser tires as well. Ball and bladder needles are included to inflate exercise, beach and other sports related balls.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qf6AuFeZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007A6SR48.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 39.95}}
