{"item_id": "B007AO6710", "title": "Dakine Snowboarding Spike Stomp (Charcoal, 4.7 x 4.7-Inch)", "description": "The Dakine Spike Stomp is made in a translucent spike pattern and can be cut apart and reconfigured to fit your needs.", "text": "Dakine Snowboarding Spike Stomp (Charcoal, 4.7 x 4.7-Inch) The Dakine Spike Stomp is made in a translucent spike pattern and can be cut apart and reconfigured to fit your needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lLev6PO9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007AO6710.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowboarding", "Stomp Pads"]]}}
