{"item_id": "B007AQ4FX0", "title": "Ultimate Body Press Ab Wheels (Black)", "description": "Why spend hours performing boring and repetitive crunches when you can get quicker results with the Ab Wheels from Ultimate Body Press? Our affordable and easy to use Ab Wheels offer a huge range of rewarding exercises and are one of the most effective abdominal and upper body training tools on the market today. The Ultimate Body Press Ab Wheels feature foam, non-slip grips for added comfort and smooth rolling ball bearings for outstanding performance. Our gym caliber Ab Wheels actively target the muscles in your lower abdomen which are notoriously difficult to train using traditional exercises. Ab Wheels are suitable for beginners or experienced users alike. In addition to being a powerful abdominal training tool, they are an advanced pushup device that not only train your abs, but also your chest, back and shoulders.", "text": "Ultimate Body Press Ab Wheels (Black) Why spend hours performing boring and repetitive crunches when you can get quicker results with the Ab Wheels from Ultimate Body Press? Our affordable and easy to use Ab Wheels offer a huge range of rewarding exercises and are one of the most effective abdominal and upper body training tools on the market today. The Ultimate Body Press Ab Wheels feature foam, non-slip grips for added comfort and smooth rolling ball bearings for outstanding performance. Our gym caliber Ab Wheels actively target the muscles in your lower abdomen which are notoriously difficult to train using traditional exercises. Ab Wheels are suitable for beginners or experienced users alike. In addition to being a powerful abdominal training tool, they are an advanced pushup device that not only train your abs, but also your chest, back and shoulders.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NuFSXdzcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007AQ4FX0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 41.0}}
{"item_id": "B007AUHO02", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Extended Magazine Release", "description": "The Eagle 10-22 Extended magazine release is made from a high impact delrin and is easy to install in your rifle without any modifications. The extended magazine release is much quicker and smoother than the factory magazine release.", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Extended Magazine Release The Eagle 10-22 Extended magazine release is made from a high impact delrin and is easy to install in your rifle without any modifications. The extended magazine release is much quicker and smoother than the factory magazine release.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AP7VYM5gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007AUHO02.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007AUW38U", "title": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Lubricant - MIS Kit #2 - (2) 16 oz Non-Aerosol Kit - Bonus Trigger Sprayer", "description": "Superior liquid for preserving airguns, firearms, marine equipment & more! Dissolves traces of copper, lead, brass, zinc & tombac. Cleans, lubes & protects every part of your gun. Forms a film against rust. Never gums up or hardens. Ideal for protecting & preserving gun metal and wood stocks. Removes rust & neutralizes bluing salts found in the barrels of new guns, including airguns. Neutralizes fingerprints (which are acidic). Actively propels itself & reaches areas inaccessible to the applicator. Originally invented for military use. Biodegradable & environmentally friendly. Non-toxic & contains no carcinogens. Two can kit, 16 oz. non-aerosol, with bonus trigger sprayer.", "text": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Lubricant - MIS Kit #2 - (2) 16 oz Non-Aerosol Kit - Bonus Trigger Sprayer Superior liquid for preserving airguns, firearms, marine equipment & more! Dissolves traces of copper, lead, brass, zinc & tombac. Cleans, lubes & protects every part of your gun. Forms a film against rust. Never gums up or hardens. Ideal for protecting & preserving gun metal and wood stocks. Removes rust & neutralizes bluing salts found in the barrels of new guns, including airguns. Neutralizes fingerprints (which are acidic). Actively propels itself & reaches areas inaccessible to the applicator. Originally invented for military use. Biodegradable & environmentally friendly. Non-toxic & contains no carcinogens. Two can kit, 16 oz. non-aerosol, with bonus trigger sprayer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510NcxXDhwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007AUW38U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ballistol", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 34.44}}
{"item_id": "B007AVDFKE", "title": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Lubricant - MIS Kit #3 - (3) Cans of 6 oz Aerosol Kit", "description": "Please Note, the White and Darker Green Labels are going away! As of 8/2012, we will only be receiving new shipments of the new Green, Multi-Purpose Oil. Ballistol Lube = Ballistol Multi-Purpose Oil. Same great product, different labels. We will ship whichever label we have in stock. If you require a specific label, please notify us. As stated however, they are exactly the same product. Superior liquid for preserving airguns, firearms, marine equipment & more! Dissolves traces of copper, lead, brass, zinc & tombac. Cleans, lubes & protects every part of your gun. Forms a film against rust. Never gums up or hardens. Ideal for protecting & preserving gun metal and wood stocks. Removes rust & neutralizes bluing salts found in the barrels of new guns, including airguns. Neutralizes fingerprints (which are acidic). Actively propels itself & reaches areas inaccessible to the applicator. Originally invented for military use. Biodegradable & environmentally friendly. Non-toxic & contains no carcinogens. Three can kit, 6 oz. aerosol", "text": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Lubricant - MIS Kit #3 - (3) Cans of 6 oz Aerosol Kit Please Note, the White and Darker Green Labels are going away! As of 8/2012, we will only be receiving new shipments of the new Green, Multi-Purpose Oil. Ballistol Lube = Ballistol Multi-Purpose Oil. Same great product, different labels. We will ship whichever label we have in stock. If you require a specific label, please notify us. As stated however, they are exactly the same product. Superior liquid for preserving airguns, firearms, marine equipment & more! Dissolves traces of copper, lead, brass, zinc & tombac. Cleans, lubes & protects every part of your gun. Forms a film against rust. Never gums up or hardens. Ideal for protecting & preserving gun metal and wood stocks. Removes rust & neutralizes bluing salts found in the barrels of new guns, including airguns. Neutralizes fingerprints (which are acidic). Actively propels itself & reaches areas inaccessible to the applicator. Originally invented for military use. Biodegradable & environmentally friendly. Non-toxic & contains no carcinogens. Three can kit, 6 oz. aerosol", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61szbo3axLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007AVDFKE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ballistol", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 37.49}}
{"item_id": "B007B2SYJO", "title": "AR M4 .223 Upper Replacement 4 pieces Spring Kit", "description": "Good back up replacement spring kit. Don't suffer when you lost one piece of spring. AR/M4 4pcs Upper Replacement Spring Set.", "text": "AR M4 .223 Upper Replacement 4 pieces Spring Kit Good back up replacement spring kit. Don't suffer when you lost one piece of spring. AR/M4 4pcs Upper Replacement Spring Set.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dLAffgSNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007B2SYJO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CoiTAC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 6.9}}
