{"item_id": "B007BEDOCY", "title": "Boker Plus Albatros Folding Knives, Silver", "description": "Jens Anso design. The Albatros boasts massive, 3.6mm thick titanium plates that form the basis for the frame lock. The thick blade with its bulbous edge and slight hollow grind allows versatility and excellent cutting performance. Blade length: 2 5/8\". Overall length: 6 1/2\". Weight: 5.9 oz.", "text": "Boker Plus Albatros Folding Knives, Silver Jens Anso design. The Albatros boasts massive, 3.6mm thick titanium plates that form the basis for the frame lock. The thick blade with its bulbous edge and slight hollow grind allows versatility and excellent cutting performance. Blade length: 2 5/8\". Overall length: 6 1/2\". Weight: 5.9 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313rR1HuMGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007BEDOCY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]]}}
