{"item_id": "B007BGSI5U", "title": "Howard Leight by Honeywell R-01902 Impact Pro Electronic Shooting Earmuffs", "description": "Protect your ears and communicate more clearly at the shooting range with this pair of Impact Pro electronic acoustic earmuffs from Howard Leight by Honeywell. The earmuffs amplify conversation and other low sounds four times while blocking noise over 82 decibels. Rubberized pressure points keep your gunstocks from getting scratched, while an input connection cord lets you plug in your MP3 player, smartphone, or scanner radio. The earmuffs offer up to 350 hours of use on one pair of AAA batteries.R-01902 Impact Pro Electronic Shooting EarmuffAt a Glance:Amplifies voices four timesBlocks sounds over 82 decibelsAllows you to connect a MP3 player, smartphone, or scanner radioBacked by a lifetime frame guaranteeThese earmuffs block sounds over 82 decibels, making them ideal for the shooting range (click to enlarge).An audio input cord lets you connect your smartphone, MP3 player, or scanner radio (click to enlarge).Amplify Conversation While Blocking Loud NoiseThis pair of Impact Pro electronic earmuffs from Howard Leight are well suited for an indoor shooting range or any other extremely loud shooting environment. They're designed to amplify voices and other low-level noise four times while blocking sounds over 82 decibels. As a result, you can communicate more easily with other people when you're at the range. The Impact Pro earmuffs have a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 30.Sturdy Construction for Heavy UseThese earmuffs feature an aggressive tactical styling for added durability, along with rubberized pressure points to help prevent gunstocks from getting scratched. A knob on the earmuffs allows you to turn them on and off and adjust the volume.Enjoy 350 Hours of Use on One Pair of BatteriesIncluded with these earmuffs are two AAA batteries that fit into an external battery compartment. Thanks to an energy-efficient design, the earmuffs offer approximately 350 hours of use on one pair of batteries. In addition, the earmuffs automatically shut off after four hours to further extend the battery life.Connect Your MP3 Player or SmartphoneThe earmuffs come equipped with an audio input connection cord that allows you to conveniently connect your MP3 player, smartphone, or scanner radio.About Howard Leight EarmuffsHoward Leight earmuffs are used by sport shooters, military personnel, police, and hobbyists. Whether you're shooting a rifle or a .22 caliber, you will incur noise-induced hearing loss (NIHL) if you're not wearing proper hearing protection. Howard Leight shooting earmuffs work nicely at indoor or outdoor ranges.Howard Leight sound amplification earmuffs are designed to give shooters the best of both worlds: instantaneous protection from hazardous noise along with distortion-free amplification of low-level sounds such as range commands and conversation. The Howard Leight passive hearing protection line provides consistent, passive noise protection--making it an excellent choice for hunters and shooters on a budget.About Howard LeightHoward Leight/Honeywell Safety Products is a leading global provider of passive and intelligent hearing protection solutions, and the founder of the HearForever initiative. For over 30 years, Howard Leight has pursued the prevention of occupational hearing loss through innovation in hearing protection design, technology, performance, and comfort, and the promotion of progressive Hearing Conservation Programs. Leading solutions include the highest attenuating Max single-use ear plug; patented Air Flow Control technology for optimal earmuff attenuation; QuietDose personal in-ear dosimetry; and the industry-changing VeriPRO ear plug fit testing system.What's in the BoxOne pair of Impact Pro electronic earmuffs, one audio input connection cord, and two AAA batteries.These earmuffs are great for indoor ranges and other loud shooting environments (click to enlarge).", "text": "Howard Leight by Honeywell R-01902 Impact Pro Electronic Shooting Earmuffs Protect your ears and communicate more clearly at the shooting range with this pair of Impact Pro electronic acoustic earmuffs from Howard Leight by Honeywell. The earmuffs amplify conversation and other low sounds four times while blocking noise over 82 decibels. Rubberized pressure points keep your gunstocks from getting scratched, while an input connection cord lets you plug in your MP3 player, smartphone, or scanner radio. The earmuffs offer up to 350 hours of use on one pair of AAA batteries.R-01902 Impact Pro Electronic Shooting EarmuffAt a Glance:Amplifies voices four timesBlocks sounds over 82 decibelsAllows you to connect a MP3 player, smartphone, or scanner radioBacked by a lifetime frame guaranteeThese earmuffs block sounds over 82 decibels, making them ideal for the shooting range (click to enlarge).An audio input cord lets you connect your smartphone, MP3 player, or scanner radio (click to enlarge).Amplify Conversation While Blocking Loud NoiseThis pair of Impact Pro electronic earmuffs from Howard Leight are well suited for an indoor shooting range or any other extremely loud shooting environment. They're designed to amplify voices and other low-level noise four times while blocking sounds over 82 decibels. As a result, you can communicate more easily with other people when you're at the range. The Impact Pro earmuffs have a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 30.Sturdy Construction for Heavy UseThese earmuffs feature an aggressive tactical styling for added durability, along with rubberized pressure points to help prevent gunstocks from getting scratched. A knob on the earmuffs allows you to turn them on and off and adjust the volume.Enjoy 350 Hours of Use on One Pair of BatteriesIncluded with these earmuffs are two AAA batteries that fit into an external battery compartment. Thanks to an energy-efficient design, the earmuffs offer approximately 350 hours of use on one pair of batteries. In addition, the earmuffs automatically shut off after four hours to further extend the battery life.Connect Your MP3 Player or SmartphoneThe earmuffs come equipped with an audio input connection cord that allows you to conveniently connect your MP3 player, smartphone, or scanner radio.About Howard Leight EarmuffsHoward Leight earmuffs are used by sport shooters, military personnel, police, and hobbyists. Whether you're shooting a rifle or a .22 caliber, you will incur noise-induced hearing loss (NIHL) if you're not wearing proper hearing protection. Howard Leight shooting earmuffs work nicely at indoor or outdoor ranges.Howard Leight sound amplification earmuffs are designed to give shooters the best of both worlds: instantaneous protection from hazardous noise along with distortion-free amplification of low-level sounds such as range commands and conversation. The Howard Leight passive hearing protection line provides consistent, passive noise protection--making it an excellent choice for hunters and shooters on a budget.About Howard LeightHoward Leight/Honeywell Safety Products is a leading global provider of passive and intelligent hearing protection solutions, and the founder of the HearForever initiative. For over 30 years, Howard Leight has pursued the prevention of occupational hearing loss through innovation in hearing protection design, technology, performance, and comfort, and the promotion of progressive Hearing Conservation Programs. Leading solutions include the highest attenuating Max single-use ear plug; patented Air Flow Control technology for optimal earmuff attenuation; QuietDose personal in-ear dosimetry; and the industry-changing VeriPRO ear plug fit testing system.What's in the BoxOne pair of Impact Pro electronic earmuffs, one audio input connection cord, and two AAA batteries.These earmuffs are great for indoor ranges and other loud shooting environments (click to enlarge).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412xe%2B2UTkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007BGSI5U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Honeywell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B007BHIUDO", "title": "Coleman Universal Paddle Leash (2 Meters)", "description": "Our 2.0M paddle leash is perfect for those times when you need hands free kayaking! This Leash is perfect for fishing or taking photos while on the go. The stretch material allows the paddle to float out of your way but not disappear. The convenient clip system lets you attach one end to your kayak while the Velcro clasp hooks cleanly to your paddle shaft.", "text": "Coleman Universal Paddle Leash (2 Meters) Our 2.0M paddle leash is perfect for those times when you need hands free kayaking! This Leash is perfect for fishing or taking photos while on the go. The stretch material allows the paddle to float out of your way but not disappear. The convenient clip system lets you attach one end to your kayak while the Velcro clasp hooks cleanly to your paddle shaft.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lktQyzANL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007BHIUDO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddle Accessories"]], "price": 24.99}}
