{"item_id": "B007BXCQ3I", "title": "M16A2 25 Meter Zeroing Target", "description": "25 Meter Zeroing Target M16A2 - This target is special in that it is designed around the time when the military was switching over from the 55gr bullet to the newer and current 62gr bullet. The instruction are at the bottom of every target and states the instructions for both the 55gr. bullet M193 round and the 62gr. bullet M855 round. The M193 round is design to zero the rifle at 250 meters, while the M855 round is designed to zero the rifle at 300 meters. Even thou the instructions are design for the U.S. Military M16A2 rifle, the civilian AR-15A2 platform would be the same in zeroing in the rifle. Printed on 8 1/2\" x 11\" 25lbs. paper. *** NEW *** If shipped PRIORITY MAIL, targets will be shipped enclosed in water resistant packaging.", "text": "M16A2 25 Meter Zeroing Target 25 Meter Zeroing Target M16A2 - This target is special in that it is designed around the time when the military was switching over from the 55gr bullet to the newer and current 62gr bullet. The instruction are at the bottom of every target and states the instructions for both the 55gr. bullet M193 round and the 62gr. bullet M855 round. The M193 round is design to zero the rifle at 250 meters, while the M855 round is designed to zero the rifle at 300 meters. Even thou the instructions are design for the U.S. Military M16A2 rifle, the civilian AR-15A2 platform would be the same in zeroing in the rifle. Printed on 8 1/2\" x 11\" 25lbs. paper. *** NEW *** If shipped PRIORITY MAIL, targets will be shipped enclosed in water resistant packaging.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xhuxn4LRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007BXCQ3I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B007C1Q9J6", "title": "Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Folding Knife", "description": "VG-10 Japanese Steel/Carbonitride Titanium will not peel, flake, blister or chip and is up to 10x harder than untreated steel so it stays sharper for a longer period of time. Ergonomic Carbon Fiber body. Drop Point blade. Liner lock and pocket clip. Lifetime warranty.", "text": "Camillus Carbonitride Titanium Folding Knife VG-10 Japanese Steel/Carbonitride Titanium will not peel, flake, blister or chip and is up to 10x harder than untreated steel so it stays sharper for a longer period of time. Ergonomic Carbon Fiber body. Drop Point blade. Liner lock and pocket clip. Lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UrDixRM4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007C1Q9J6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007C1SIOU", "title": "WatchFire Guthook Skinning Knife", "description": "The WatchFire Guthook Skinning Knife is 9\" in overall length. The stainless steel blade has a black finish. It has a skid proof black handle. It has a guthook blade . This knife comes with a sheath.", "text": "WatchFire Guthook Skinning Knife The WatchFire Guthook Skinning Knife is 9\" in overall length. The stainless steel blade has a black finish. It has a skid proof black handle. It has a guthook blade . This knife comes with a sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41umUJCBKWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007C1SIOU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WatchFire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 10.21}}
{"item_id": "B007C1VSRO", "title": "Tramontina 414 14\" Machete with Natural Color Hardwood Handles", "description": "Tramontina Machete Wood.19\" overall. 14\" blade. Natural color hardwood handle.These machetes feature carbon steel blades and are made in Brazil.", "text": "Tramontina 414 14\" Machete with Natural Color Hardwood Handles Tramontina Machete Wood.19\" overall. 14\" blade. Natural color hardwood handle.These machetes feature carbon steel blades and are made in Brazil.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/215Jj1ldfuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007C1VSRO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tramontina", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 9.58}}
{"item_id": "B007C5LDV6", "title": "Nebo 5959 Eco Lantern 24 Super Bright LEDs Solar Power or Wind Up Energy", "description": "NEBO ECO LANTERN is a portable, reliable energy-saving lantern with 24 super bright energy efficient white LEDs that guarantee continuous supreme illumination. ECO LANTERN uses a 6V 2.5AH Valve Regulated Rechargeable Battery to give you supreme illumination every time! This lantern generates and stores power by 4 methods of charging: Solar power, AC power, DC power and wind up. No batteries needed. EVER, just super bright white light whenever you need it. The ECO LANTERN has an LED indicator light that changes from red to green when fully charged. Perfect for camping, fishing, hunting, boating, road trips, RVing, power outages, at home use, or any emergency situation.", "text": "Nebo 5959 Eco Lantern 24 Super Bright LEDs Solar Power or Wind Up Energy NEBO ECO LANTERN is a portable, reliable energy-saving lantern with 24 super bright energy efficient white LEDs that guarantee continuous supreme illumination. ECO LANTERN uses a 6V 2.5AH Valve Regulated Rechargeable Battery to give you supreme illumination every time! This lantern generates and stores power by 4 methods of charging: Solar power, AC power, DC power and wind up. No batteries needed. EVER, just super bright white light whenever you need it. The ECO LANTERN has an LED indicator light that changes from red to green when fully charged. Perfect for camping, fishing, hunting, boating, road trips, RVing, power outages, at home use, or any emergency situation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kXC9eRVHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007C5LDV6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 18.94}}
{"item_id": "B007C6PDFM", "title": "KZ Butt Stock Adapter", "description": "The Buttstock Adapter allows the operator to attach any of our 2 Point Slings (including the Long Range Sling) to a traditionally styled rifle stock.", "text": "KZ Butt Stock Adapter The Buttstock Adapter allows the operator to attach any of our 2 Point Slings (including the Long Range Sling) to a traditionally styled rifle stock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ShwR3VryL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007C6PDFM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Stocks"]], "price": 10.66}}
{"item_id": "B007C6QZS6", "title": "KZ CRT Carbon Removal Tool", "description": "A single tool that can remove the carbon from both the bolt tail & bolt carrier with ease and precision. Revolutionary 2-piece adjustable fork design & Dual Scraping Tip Carrier Cleaner / Reamer makes carbon removal faster and more efficient than ever before. Manufactured on state of the art CNC machines from the highest quality tool steel. Compact design is a perfect fit for your range bag or buttstock storage compartment. Features / Specifications: Fast & Highly Efficient Carbon Cleaning Tool Adjustable 2-Piece Fork Bolt Cleaner / Scraper Dual Scraping Tip Carrier Cleaner / Reamer CNC Machined From Solid Bar Stock AISI SAE 0-1 Tool Steel Rockwell Hardness 36 Black Oxide Finish 3.1 Inches Long Bead Blasted. Non Reflective Matte Finish 1.2oz 100% USA MADE", "text": "KZ CRT Carbon Removal Tool A single tool that can remove the carbon from both the bolt tail & bolt carrier with ease and precision. Revolutionary 2-piece adjustable fork design & Dual Scraping Tip Carrier Cleaner / Reamer makes carbon removal faster and more efficient than ever before. Manufactured on state of the art CNC machines from the highest quality tool steel. Compact design is a perfect fit for your range bag or buttstock storage compartment. Features / Specifications: Fast & Highly Efficient Carbon Cleaning Tool Adjustable 2-Piece Fork Bolt Cleaner / Scraper Dual Scraping Tip Carrier Cleaner / Reamer CNC Machined From Solid Bar Stock AISI SAE 0-1 Tool Steel Rockwell Hardness 36 Black Oxide Finish 3.1 Inches Long Bead Blasted. Non Reflective Matte Finish 1.2oz 100% USA MADE", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wTDq9ey7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007C6QZS6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Marker Maintenance Equipment"]], "price": 15.6}}
