{"item_id": "B007CK1MNU", "title": "Spyderco Tenacious Folding Knife, G-10, Plain Edge, Black", "description": "The mid-sized Tenacious has a black G-10 laminate handle, ergonomically milled with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Skeletonized steel liners tucked inside the handle, increase the handle's rigidity and strength without non-functional weight or thickness. The 8Cr13MoV stainless blade is coated in a non-reflective black coating and ground-flat from spine to cutting-edge for non-stop cutting. The blade's shape, coupled with an oversized Spyderco Round Hole, position the hand for instant and confident blade opening. Sharp from tip to hilt, the Tenacious offers the most cutting edge possible for the blade's length. A black 4-way pocket clip lets the folder be set in a variety of carry and draw positions: Tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand.", "text": "Spyderco Tenacious Folding Knife, G-10, Plain Edge, Black The mid-sized Tenacious has a black G-10 laminate handle, ergonomically milled with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Skeletonized steel liners tucked inside the handle, increase the handle's rigidity and strength without non-functional weight or thickness. The 8Cr13MoV stainless blade is coated in a non-reflective black coating and ground-flat from spine to cutting-edge for non-stop cutting. The blade's shape, coupled with an oversized Spyderco Round Hole, position the hand for instant and confident blade opening. Sharp from tip to hilt, the Tenacious offers the most cutting edge possible for the blade's length. A black 4-way pocket clip lets the folder be set in a variety of carry and draw positions: Tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415ocJhn4TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007CK1MNU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 43.05}}
{"item_id": "B007CK46RO", "title": "Spyderco Tenacious G-10 Combo Blk", "description": "Being tenacious means you are persistent and cohesive. It's being tough and tireless in achieving your best performance; all worthy descriptive words for a hard-use knife.The mid-sized Tenacious has a black G-10 laminate handle, ergonomically milled with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Skeletonized steel liners tucked inside the handle, increase the handle's rigidity and strength without non-functional weight or thickness. The 8Cr13MoV stainless blade is coated in a non-reflective black coating and ground-flat from spine to cutting-edge for non-stop cutting.The blade's shape, coupled with an oversized Spyderco Round Hole, position the hand for instant and confident blade opening. Sharp from tip to hilt, the Tenacious offers the most cutting edge possible for the blade's length. A black 4-way pocket clip lets the folder be set in a variety of carry and draw positions: Tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand. Walker Linerlock (with jimped liner). Screw together construction, screws and pivots are also blackened. length overall: 7.76\" (197 mm) blade length: 3.39\" (86 mm) blade steel: 8Cr13MoVlength closed: 4.45\" (113 mm) cutting edge: 3.39\" (86 mm) hole diameter: .51\" (13 mm) blade thickness: .118\" (3 mm) handle material: G-10", "text": "Spyderco Tenacious G-10 Combo Blk Being tenacious means you are persistent and cohesive. It's being tough and tireless in achieving your best performance; all worthy descriptive words for a hard-use knife.The mid-sized Tenacious has a black G-10 laminate handle, ergonomically milled with prolonged fatigue-free cutting in mind. Skeletonized steel liners tucked inside the handle, increase the handle's rigidity and strength without non-functional weight or thickness. The 8Cr13MoV stainless blade is coated in a non-reflective black coating and ground-flat from spine to cutting-edge for non-stop cutting.The blade's shape, coupled with an oversized Spyderco Round Hole, position the hand for instant and confident blade opening. Sharp from tip to hilt, the Tenacious offers the most cutting edge possible for the blade's length. A black 4-way pocket clip lets the folder be set in a variety of carry and draw positions: Tip-up/tip-down left-hand/right-hand. Walker Linerlock (with jimped liner). Screw together construction, screws and pivots are also blackened. length overall: 7.76\" (197 mm) blade length: 3.39\" (86 mm) blade steel: 8Cr13MoVlength closed: 4.45\" (113 mm) cutting edge: 3.39\" (86 mm) hole diameter: .51\" (13 mm) blade thickness: .118\" (3 mm) handle material: G-10", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318mqo7H5xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007CK46RO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 41.41}}
{"item_id": "B007CMNQDC", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Thermal Cycling Tight", "description": "SELECT Thermal Fleece fabric sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer Anatomic multi-panel design Flatlock and double needle seam 8'' lower leg zipper with zipper garage Plush elastic leg gripper 3D Tour Chamois optimizes riding comfort Reflective elements for low-light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Thermal Cycling Tight SELECT Thermal Fleece fabric sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer Anatomic multi-panel design Flatlock and double needle seam 8'' lower leg zipper with zipper garage Plush elastic leg gripper 3D Tour Chamois optimizes riding comfort Reflective elements for low-light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tV2Y6%2B14L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007CMNQDC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007CMNVF0", "title": "Pearl Izumi Quest Jersey - Long-Sleeve - Men's", "description": "For late fall training, or those early spring warm-ups, a long-sleeved jersey is often the ideal companion (besides a human companion, of course) for touring, commuting, low-tempo training, or just for hitting your favorite stretch of singletrack. The Pearl Izumi Quest Jersey is an essential piece of gear when the mercury hovers in the 50-degree range. This classic jersey is designed with a semi-form fit. This slightly slimmed-down profile makes it an ideal next-to-skin layer, should you need to layer it together with a vest or jacket. It's made from UltraSensor fabric which uses a moisture transfer construction designed to take advantage of one-way capillary action, perhaps best described as a straw of sorts, which draws the moisture up away from your skin, but will not allow any moisture to reach it. It comes with a three-quarter length hidden zipper so that you will be able to ventilate, but you wonAAAt have any issues with the hem staying solidly placed on your waist when the jersey is open. To add to that secure fit, the hem is elastic. It has three rear pockets, and Pearl Izumi added reflective piping so that youAAAll be visible to cars when the sun starts to go down. The Pearl Izumi Quest Long Sleeve Jersey is available in four standard colors: True Red, Black, True Blue, or White. You may also choose between two high-visibility colors in Safety Orange and Screaming Yellow. It is available in sizes Small through XX-Large.Product FeaturesMaterial: polyesterFit: slimPockets: 3 backZip: 3/4-lengthWindproof Rating:SPF Rating:UPF Rating:Recommended Use: cool weather cyclingManufacturer Warranty:", "text": "Pearl Izumi Quest Jersey - Long-Sleeve - Men's For late fall training, or those early spring warm-ups, a long-sleeved jersey is often the ideal companion (besides a human companion, of course) for touring, commuting, low-tempo training, or just for hitting your favorite stretch of singletrack. The Pearl Izumi Quest Jersey is an essential piece of gear when the mercury hovers in the 50-degree range. This classic jersey is designed with a semi-form fit. This slightly slimmed-down profile makes it an ideal next-to-skin layer, should you need to layer it together with a vest or jacket. It's made from UltraSensor fabric which uses a moisture transfer construction designed to take advantage of one-way capillary action, perhaps best described as a straw of sorts, which draws the moisture up away from your skin, but will not allow any moisture to reach it. It comes with a three-quarter length hidden zipper so that you will be able to ventilate, but you wonAAAt have any issues with the hem staying solidly placed on your waist when the jersey is open. To add to that secure fit, the hem is elastic. It has three rear pockets, and Pearl Izumi added reflective piping so that youAAAll be visible to cars when the sun starts to go down. The Pearl Izumi Quest Long Sleeve Jersey is available in four standard colors: True Red, Black, True Blue, or White. You may also choose between two high-visibility colors in Safety Orange and Screaming Yellow. It is available in sizes Small through XX-Large.Product FeaturesMaterial: polyesterFit: slimPockets: 3 backZip: 3/4-lengthWindproof Rating:SPF Rating:UPF Rating:Recommended Use: cool weather cyclingManufacturer Warranty:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Jc%2BDRIO9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007CMNVF0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007CP6UK0", "title": "Fantastic Wind & Waterproof Survival Matches: 2 Packs of 20 Matches Each In Waterproof Containers = 40 Matches & Two Waterproof Holders!", "description": "Elite Forces Survival Waterproof Matches 2 Pack These superior Elite Forces survival waterproof matches burn in the strongest wind and rain situations. They are wax-coated for tough waterproofing. Each waterproof canister is bright orange for easy identification, and includes 20 matches and built-in striking paper. Perfect for camping, hiking, and emergency survial situations.", "text": "Fantastic Wind & Waterproof Survival Matches: 2 Packs of 20 Matches Each In Waterproof Containers = 40 Matches & Two Waterproof Holders! Elite Forces Survival Waterproof Matches 2 Pack These superior Elite Forces survival waterproof matches burn in the strongest wind and rain situations. They are wax-coated for tough waterproofing. Each waterproof canister is bright orange for easy identification, and includes 20 matches and built-in striking paper. Perfect for camping, hiking, and emergency survial situations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OaO02PeJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007CP6UK0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OldPhatVet Brand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 3.08}}
