{"item_id": "B007DMW3BC", "title": "BlackHawk® CQC™ Carbon Fiber Holster Matte Finish Glock 19 / 23 / 32, BLACK, RH", "description": "BlackHawk CQC Carbon - Fiber Holster with SERPA Technology, Matte Finish, with active retention system! Here's good news... you can forget about those thumb-breaks that slow down your draw and make re-holstering awkward! It has patented SERPA Technology lock engages the trigger guard as you holster the pistol and will not let go until you release it. The release is made using your normal drawing motion, with the trigger finger beside the holster body. Buy now at an affordable, budget-pleasing Guide price! SERPA Technology features: Trigger finger naturally comes to rest on the SERPA Technology lock release mechanism; Push the mechanism as you draw the weapon and it releases the gun for a smooth, fast draw; Swivel buckles on belt loops allow articulation for maximum flexibility; All BlackHawk CQC SERPA Technology holsters come with both belt loop and paddle platform; Belt loops: 2 1/4\"; Black color; Made in the USA. State Gun Type, and Left or Right-Hand Holster. Order your Holster today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish S&W; J-Frame; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Springfield Xd; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 220 / 226; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 228 / 229; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Beretta 92 / 96; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Colt 1911; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 17 / 22 / 31; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 26 / 27 / 33 - word search in our store for 'BlackHawk'. BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Glock 19 / 23 / 32", "text": "BlackHawk® CQC™ Carbon Fiber Holster Matte Finish Glock 19 / 23 / 32, BLACK, RH BlackHawk CQC Carbon - Fiber Holster with SERPA Technology, Matte Finish, with active retention system! Here's good news... you can forget about those thumb-breaks that slow down your draw and make re-holstering awkward! It has patented SERPA Technology lock engages the trigger guard as you holster the pistol and will not let go until you release it. The release is made using your normal drawing motion, with the trigger finger beside the holster body. Buy now at an affordable, budget-pleasing Guide price! SERPA Technology features: Trigger finger naturally comes to rest on the SERPA Technology lock release mechanism; Push the mechanism as you draw the weapon and it releases the gun for a smooth, fast draw; Swivel buckles on belt loops allow articulation for maximum flexibility; All BlackHawk CQC SERPA Technology holsters come with both belt loop and paddle platform; Belt loops: 2 1/4\"; Black color; Made in the USA. State Gun Type, and Left or Right-Hand Holster. Order your Holster today! AVAILABLE SEPARATELY: BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish S&W; J-Frame; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Springfield Xd; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 220 / 226; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish SIG 228 / 229; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Beretta 92 / 96; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Colt 1911; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 17 / 22 / 31; BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish, Glock 26 / 27 / 33 - word search in our store for 'BlackHawk'. BlackHawk CQC Carbon Fiber Holster, Matte Finish Glock 19 / 23 / 32", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fqOYSLS8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007DMW3BC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.16}}
{"item_id": "B007DN3AVI", "title": "Apex Tactical M&P 9/40 Trigger Kit for Competition", "description": "Compared to the Apex Tactical M&P; 9/40 Trigger Kit for Duty/Carry, this kit has a trigger that is 1.5 pounds lighter. The Duty/Carry Kit has a 5.5 pound pull while this one has a 3 pound pull. For competition, this is the best choice. For self defense and duty carry, the Duty/Carry is better.Designed for the action shooting sports competitor. Whether the game is IDPA,USPSA or Steel Challenge our Comp-AEK will withstand the rigors of high speed competition.The kit contains:- Apex Fully Machined Sear (Hard Sear)- Apex Ultimate Striker Block kit- Apex Competition striker spring- Apex Competition sear spring (Two sear springs of different sizes are included with kit)- Apex Competition trigger return spring- Apex Aluminum Slave pin for installing the Trigger Return Spring- Our competition striker spring and trigger return spring are shot peened to extend service life.*For competition use only - NOT FOR DUTY/CARRY OR SELF-DEFENSE APPLICATIONS***This kit will reduce most of the over travel in the M&P; trigger system but will not reduce pre-travel/up-take. To reduce pre-travel/up-take, see our Forward Set Sear and Trigger Kit.", "text": "Apex Tactical M&P 9/40 Trigger Kit for Competition Compared to the Apex Tactical M&P; 9/40 Trigger Kit for Duty/Carry, this kit has a trigger that is 1.5 pounds lighter. The Duty/Carry Kit has a 5.5 pound pull while this one has a 3 pound pull. For competition, this is the best choice. For self defense and duty carry, the Duty/Carry is better.Designed for the action shooting sports competitor. Whether the game is IDPA,USPSA or Steel Challenge our Comp-AEK will withstand the rigors of high speed competition.The kit contains:- Apex Fully Machined Sear (Hard Sear)- Apex Ultimate Striker Block kit- Apex Competition striker spring- Apex Competition sear spring (Two sear springs of different sizes are included with kit)- Apex Competition trigger return spring- Apex Aluminum Slave pin for installing the Trigger Return Spring- Our competition striker spring and trigger return spring are shot peened to extend service life.*For competition use only - NOT FOR DUTY/CARRY OR SELF-DEFENSE APPLICATIONS***This kit will reduce most of the over travel in the M&P; trigger system but will not reduce pre-travel/up-take. To reduce pre-travel/up-take, see our Forward Set Sear and Trigger Kit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f-Bu82VkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007DN3AVI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apex Tactical Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 88.89}}
