{"item_id": "B007DN3JAA", "title": "Apex Tactical Smith & Wesson SD Trigger Spring Kit", "description": "This drop in kit produces a smoother trigger pull and improved reset along with lowering the trigger pull weight from 8 to approximately 5.5 lbs. Specified for Duty/Carry use, this kit is the perfect compliment to any Smith & Wesson SD pistol. For use in the S&W; SD line of pistols (i.e. SD9, SD40, SD9VE & SD40VE)* SD Spring Kit Install Video Kit contains (1 each): Apex Trigger Return Spring Apex Striker Block Spring Apex Striker Spring Apex SD Slave pin (to assist installation of TRS) *Not for use in the Sigma Series pistols. If your gun is a SW9VE or SW40VE, this kit will not work in your gun.", "text": "Apex Tactical Smith & Wesson SD Trigger Spring Kit This drop in kit produces a smoother trigger pull and improved reset along with lowering the trigger pull weight from 8 to approximately 5.5 lbs. Specified for Duty/Carry use, this kit is the perfect compliment to any Smith & Wesson SD pistol. For use in the S&W; SD line of pistols (i.e. SD9, SD40, SD9VE & SD40VE)* SD Spring Kit Install Video Kit contains (1 each): Apex Trigger Return Spring Apex Striker Block Spring Apex Striker Spring Apex SD Slave pin (to assist installation of TRS) *Not for use in the Sigma Series pistols. If your gun is a SW9VE or SW40VE, this kit will not work in your gun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mCwFc540L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007DN3JAA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apex Tactical Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 22.84}}
{"item_id": "B007DN5QRO", "title": "KNS AR15 Post Sight Pack, Black", "description": "KNS Post Sight Assortment For: M-16, AR-15, AR-10, SR-25. All post sight bodies are steel, with black oxide finish. There are 7 sight configurations: -3 square post—widths: .034, .052, .072; -3 round dot post—diameter: .034, .052, .072, and one V-notch & inverted.", "text": "KNS AR15 Post Sight Pack, Black KNS Post Sight Assortment For: M-16, AR-15, AR-10, SR-25. All post sight bodies are steel, with black oxide finish. There are 7 sight configurations: -3 square post—widths: .034, .052, .072; -3 round dot post—diameter: .034, .052, .072, and one V-notch & inverted.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mFkj0GN%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007DN5QRO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KNS Precision", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 29.95}}
