{"item_id": "B007EEA6PO", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Drop In Uprade Value Pack", "description": "This essential easy drop-in installation comes with instructions. The Value Pack includes three must have low cost upgrades the recoil buffer pin, the auto bolt release and the extended mag release. Every Ruger 10/22 should have these. When we say easy drop-in installation we mean do you know how to strip down you Ruger 10/22. If you don't check out some YouTube videos. If you still don't feel comfortable save yourself the frustration and continue to use your Ruger 10/22 as is. This is a low cost must have upgrade kit for your favorite Ruger 10/22. We combined our customers two favorite upgrades into a value pack to save you money. Trick out your Ruger today!", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Drop In Uprade Value Pack This essential easy drop-in installation comes with instructions. The Value Pack includes three must have low cost upgrades the recoil buffer pin, the auto bolt release and the extended mag release. Every Ruger 10/22 should have these. When we say easy drop-in installation we mean do you know how to strip down you Ruger 10/22. If you don't check out some YouTube videos. If you still don't feel comfortable save yourself the frustration and continue to use your Ruger 10/22 as is. This is a low cost must have upgrade kit for your favorite Ruger 10/22. We combined our customers two favorite upgrades into a value pack to save you money. Trick out your Ruger today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21fyZuVnfyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007EEA6PO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 24.99}}
