{"item_id": "B007ELA7YM", "title": "Shock Doctor Ultra 2 STC Convertible Mouthguard", "description": "• Advanced Gel-Fit™ Liner custom molds to teeth for a tight, comfortable fit • Shock Transfer Core™ directs impact away from point of contact • Tri-Bite aligns and stabilizes the upper and lower jaw to enhance fit and protection • Aero-Cushion Anti-Shock Pads create stronger, more comfortable jaw cushioning • MORA Performance Enhancement positions lower jaw down and forward which may increase strength and athletic performance • Convertible Tether allows the mouthguard to be used strapped or strapless", "text": "Shock Doctor Ultra 2 STC Convertible Mouthguard • Advanced Gel-Fit™ Liner custom molds to teeth for a tight, comfortable fit • Shock Transfer Core™ directs impact away from point of contact • Tri-Bite aligns and stabilizes the upper and lower jaw to enhance fit and protection • Aero-Cushion Anti-Shock Pads create stronger, more comfortable jaw cushioning • MORA Performance Enhancement positions lower jaw down and forward which may increase strength and athletic performance • Convertible Tether allows the mouthguard to be used strapped or strapless", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31d3EsrLm%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ELA7YM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Mouthguards"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007ELWHJ0", "title": "SA Sports Fever Crossbow Package", "description": "The SA Sports Fever Recurve package includes 175 Lb Recurve Crossbow, premium 4x32 Multi Reticle Scope, Quick Detach Quiver with 4 arrows, padded shoulder sling, and adjustable weaver style scope mount. The pattern is Full Coverage Dipped Camo. Features ambidextrous auto safety, large boot style foot stirrup, speeds up to 240 FPS, lightweight compact ambidextrous rear stock, assembly tools (hex keys included). The suggested arrow is 16\" 2219 Aluminum which is included or 20\" carbon which is not included.", "text": "SA Sports Fever Crossbow Package The SA Sports Fever Recurve package includes 175 Lb Recurve Crossbow, premium 4x32 Multi Reticle Scope, Quick Detach Quiver with 4 arrows, padded shoulder sling, and adjustable weaver style scope mount. The pattern is Full Coverage Dipped Camo. Features ambidextrous auto safety, large boot style foot stirrup, speeds up to 240 FPS, lightweight compact ambidextrous rear stock, assembly tools (hex keys included). The suggested arrow is 16\" 2219 Aluminum which is included or 20\" carbon which is not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G6McnPXuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ELWHJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SA Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Crossbows"]], "price": 139.99}}
