{"item_id": "B007ESS75G", "title": "Spyderco Matriarch Spyder Edge Knife, Black", "description": "Matriarch2 has a thicker tip, hollow-ground, VG-10, reverse \"S\" blade that's well suited to defense and everyday carry purposes. The black FRN handle is an upgrade over the original Matriarch. It has a back lock with a David Boye Dent, a four-way pocket clip, screw together construction and phosphor-bronze washers.", "text": "Spyderco Matriarch Spyder Edge Knife, Black Matriarch2 has a thicker tip, hollow-ground, VG-10, reverse \"S\" blade that's well suited to defense and everyday carry purposes. The black FRN handle is an upgrade over the original Matriarch. It has a back lock with a David Boye Dent, a four-way pocket clip, screw together construction and phosphor-bronze washers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411xyGsnGZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ESS75G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 70.04}}
{"item_id": "B007F09ETG", "title": "Wheeler Engineering Anti Cant Indicator, 1-Inch", "description": "Keeping your scope perfectly aligned is critical to long-range accuracy and the Wheeler Anti-Cant Indicator is a pivotal tool for ensuring your rifles accuracy. Canting your scope, even just a couple of degrees, can cause error in point of impact. With modern \"Drop-Compensating\" scopes, an Anti-Cant Indicator is a necessity. If your gun isn't aligned correctly dialing up the turrets, or using hold-over marks, will just throw your shot off. This error can easily be enough to cause misses. The Wheeler Anti-Cant Indicator ensures that your rifle is always held near perfectly vertical, eliminating any chance for \"Cant Error\" to cause a miss.", "text": "Wheeler Engineering Anti Cant Indicator, 1-Inch Keeping your scope perfectly aligned is critical to long-range accuracy and the Wheeler Anti-Cant Indicator is a pivotal tool for ensuring your rifles accuracy. Canting your scope, even just a couple of degrees, can cause error in point of impact. With modern \"Drop-Compensating\" scopes, an Anti-Cant Indicator is a necessity. If your gun isn't aligned correctly dialing up the turrets, or using hold-over marks, will just throw your shot off. This error can easily be enough to cause misses. The Wheeler Anti-Cant Indicator ensures that your rifle is always held near perfectly vertical, eliminating any chance for \"Cant Error\" to cause a miss.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310o%2BvVgXGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007F09ETG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler (WHEAG)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 25.08}}
