{"item_id": "B007F5GZHA", "title": "Yankee Hill Machine Forearm End Cap", "description": "Use theseYankee Hill Machine screw-in forearm end capsto dress up and provide protection for the end of your YHM forearm. Does not interfere with the free floating of your barrel and helps keep out debris. Drilled to allow for proper heat venting.15/16 inch inside diameter.", "text": "Yankee Hill Machine Forearm End Cap Use theseYankee Hill Machine screw-in forearm end capsto dress up and provide protection for the end of your YHM forearm. Does not interfere with the free floating of your barrel and helps keep out debris. Drilled to allow for proper heat venting.15/16 inch inside diameter.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-ZuEMY%2B3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007F5GZHA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 23.93}}
{"item_id": "B007F7IWGU", "title": "5.11 Tactical Appendix IWB Holster", "description": "5.11 Tactical Appendix IWB Holster delivers concealed - carry convenience! Hide it inside! World-class 5.11 Tactical Holster cradles your favorite firearm safely, securely and out-of-sight. In-the-pant design keeps it handy, but hidden until needed. When only you know it's there, you maintain the element of surprise, and a tactical edge. Don't miss out! Inside-the-pant design; Can be worn in kidney or appendix positions; Sturdy belt clip with space to accomodate a tactical light; Heat, grease and oil-resistant polymer; State Style. Don't \"waist\" this opportunity! Order yours now! Size / Style Glock 19/23 26/27 RH, MP Compact RH 5.11 Tactical Appendix IWB Holster", "text": "5.11 Tactical Appendix IWB Holster 5.11 Tactical Appendix IWB Holster delivers concealed - carry convenience! Hide it inside! World-class 5.11 Tactical Holster cradles your favorite firearm safely, securely and out-of-sight. In-the-pant design keeps it handy, but hidden until needed. When only you know it's there, you maintain the element of surprise, and a tactical edge. Don't miss out! Inside-the-pant design; Can be worn in kidney or appendix positions; Sturdy belt clip with space to accomodate a tactical light; Heat, grease and oil-resistant polymer; State Style. Don't \"waist\" this opportunity! Order yours now! Size / Style Glock 19/23 26/27 RH, MP Compact RH 5.11 Tactical Appendix IWB Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LGNZagjVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007F7IWGU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007F87PVC", "title": "New 9mm Brass Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresight", "description": "Made of High Quality Brass. Fits 9mm Cartridge. Sighting or zeroing in your iron sights, red dots, or scopes quickly and easily. Included Batteries: 2 x LR621 Button Cell", "text": "New 9mm Brass Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresight Made of High Quality Brass. Fits 9mm Cartridge. Sighting or zeroing in your iron sights, red dots, or scopes quickly and easily. Included Batteries: 2 x LR621 Button Cell", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SBvf1BqaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007F87PVC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 12.76}}
{"item_id": "B007FAQJ0I", "title": "Thermor Bios Indoor Hygrometer with Thermometer (Aluminum Face, 3-Inch x 3.125-Inch x 1.5-Inch)", "description": "BIOS Digital Indoor Hygrometer measures relative humidity and temperature and is perfect for use in environments where humidity is important; basements, wine cellars, baby's room, etc.", "text": "Thermor Bios Indoor Hygrometer with Thermometer (Aluminum Face, 3-Inch x 3.125-Inch x 1.5-Inch) BIOS Digital Indoor Hygrometer measures relative humidity and temperature and is perfect for use in environments where humidity is important; basements, wine cellars, baby's room, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AVMDvLBAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FAQJ0I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 8.48}}
{"item_id": "B007FFWX3A", "title": "Winchester Model M 14 Semi-Automatic CO2 Air Rifle", "description": "Over 1.3 million M14 combat rifles were issued to U.S. Military Veterans of the 1960s and early 70s. The standard service rifle for U.S. Army and Marine infantry was a modification of the famous M1 Garand, developed in the 1930s and utilized throughout World War II. Winchester was one of four firearms manufacturers contracted by the U.S. military to supply M14s. More than forty years later, Winchester Air Rifles is proud to introduce this M14 air rifle as a salute to our military and to this gun which set a standard for power, accuracy and reliability. This M14 features a rifled steel barrel, a blade front sight and adjustable rear sight for accuracy. The Winchester Air Rifle model M14, with durable composite stock, is a semi-automatic, dual ammo gun which shoots both BBs and pellets. The CO2 clip holds two standard 12 gram cylinders to produce a maximum muzzle velocity of 700 feet per second. Load two CO2 cylinders into the clip then insert it into the gun. The clip also holds two 8-round magazine for a total of 16 shots without reloading. Load BBs, pellets or any combination of BBs and pellets into the magazine then re-insert the magazine into the clip. After 8 shots, flip the clip to continue shooting. You might pick up the Winchester Air Rifle M14 for its historical significance. But the pure backyard fun, serious marksmanship, and realistic semi-automatic action will make it the most enjoyable airgun you’ve ever owned.", "text": "Winchester Model M 14 Semi-Automatic CO2 Air Rifle Over 1.3 million M14 combat rifles were issued to U.S. Military Veterans of the 1960s and early 70s. The standard service rifle for U.S. Army and Marine infantry was a modification of the famous M1 Garand, developed in the 1930s and utilized throughout World War II. Winchester was one of four firearms manufacturers contracted by the U.S. military to supply M14s. More than forty years later, Winchester Air Rifles is proud to introduce this M14 air rifle as a salute to our military and to this gun which set a standard for power, accuracy and reliability. This M14 features a rifled steel barrel, a blade front sight and adjustable rear sight for accuracy. The Winchester Air Rifle model M14, with durable composite stock, is a semi-automatic, dual ammo gun which shoots both BBs and pellets. The CO2 clip holds two standard 12 gram cylinders to produce a maximum muzzle velocity of 700 feet per second. Load two CO2 cylinders into the clip then insert it into the gun. The clip also holds two 8-round magazine for a total of 16 shots without reloading. Load BBs, pellets or any combination of BBs and pellets into the magazine then re-insert the magazine into the clip. After 8 shots, flip the clip to continue shooting. You might pick up the Winchester Air Rifle M14 for its historical significance. But the pure backyard fun, serious marksmanship, and realistic semi-automatic action will make it the most enjoyable airgun you’ve ever owned.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21Qyl3JrR0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FFWX3A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Winchester", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B007FFX4LA", "title": "Winchester Model 11 Semi-Automatic BB Pistol", "description": "There’s no need to go to the range or drop a load of cash on expensive firearm ammo to experience the fun of shooting a semi-automatic pistol with blowback action. In most locations, you can shoot the Winchester Air Pistol Model 11 semi-automatic pistol at a target box indoors or in the backyard. You’ll love the 1.9 lb. heft of this metal CO2 -powered pistol and the realistic blowback action. Just load the 16-shot BB clip and get ready to hone your marksmanship skills.", "text": "Winchester Model 11 Semi-Automatic BB Pistol There’s no need to go to the range or drop a load of cash on expensive firearm ammo to experience the fun of shooting a semi-automatic pistol with blowback action. In most locations, you can shoot the Winchester Air Pistol Model 11 semi-automatic pistol at a target box indoors or in the backyard. You’ll love the 1.9 lb. heft of this metal CO2 -powered pistol and the realistic blowback action. Just load the 16-shot BB clip and get ready to hone your marksmanship skills.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ALfj3xijL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FFX4LA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Winchester", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 67.9}}
{"item_id": "B007FFX8Q6", "title": "Winchester Pointed .177 Caliber Pellets", "description": "Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Winchester brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. For pest control or small game, you can't go wrong with Winchester’s pointed field pellets.", "text": "Winchester Pointed .177 Caliber Pellets Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Winchester brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. For pest control or small game, you can't go wrong with Winchester’s pointed field pellets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PP1JEe7XL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FFX8Q6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Winchester", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 11.29}}
{"item_id": "B007FFXA7S", "title": "Winchester Hollow Point .177 Caliber Pellets", "description": "Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Winchester brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. If you’re hunting small game, step up to Winchester's hollow point pellets for high impact.", "text": "Winchester Hollow Point .177 Caliber Pellets Choosing the right pellet is important for optimum performance. Your first choice is easy: choose the Winchester brand; the brand that's synonymous with airguns. Your next choice is based on how and what you'll be shooting. If you’re hunting small game, step up to Winchester's hollow point pellets for high impact.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qFCZvDBML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FFXA7S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Winchester", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 4.19}}
{"item_id": "B007FGPJK8", "title": "Voodoo Tactical 20-8916 Breacher's Shotgun Scabbard", "description": "Ever since we introduced the Voodoo Tactical Shotgun Scabbard, customers have been asking us for a shorter version for their breaching shotguns. We're happy to announce that it is now available.The MOLLE compatible breaching shotgun scabbard is designed to carry a short barrel or pistol grip shotgun such as those used by law enforcement and military personnel in breaching operations. Two MOLLE straps on each side allow for ambidextrous mounting to your entry vest, plate carrier or chest rig. The weapon can also be slung with the padded, adjustable, and removable shoulder strap. The scabbard is padded to protect the weapon in tight spaces.A row of elastic shell loops down the spine allows for easy access to five breacher rounds.item measures: 6 1/2\"L x 2\"W x 19 1/2\"H", "text": "Voodoo Tactical 20-8916 Breacher's Shotgun Scabbard Ever since we introduced the Voodoo Tactical Shotgun Scabbard, customers have been asking us for a shorter version for their breaching shotguns. We're happy to announce that it is now available.The MOLLE compatible breaching shotgun scabbard is designed to carry a short barrel or pistol grip shotgun such as those used by law enforcement and military personnel in breaching operations. Two MOLLE straps on each side allow for ambidextrous mounting to your entry vest, plate carrier or chest rig. The weapon can also be slung with the padded, adjustable, and removable shoulder strap. The scabbard is padded to protect the weapon in tight spaces.A row of elastic shell loops down the spine allows for easy access to five breacher rounds.item measures: 6 1/2\"L x 2\"W x 19 1/2\"H", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311EUb321qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FGPJK8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 29.5}}
{"item_id": "B007FHBZMS", "title": "Nike Fuel + Band", "description": "NIKE NIKE+ FUEL BAND Style# WM0075 Size: L UNISEX", "text": "Nike Fuel + Band NIKE NIKE+ FUEL BAND Style# WM0075 Size: L UNISEX", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Im6VK%2B62L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FHBZMS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007FJZWQG", "title": "SGT KNOTS® Shock Cord 3/16\" - 100 Feet", "description": "100 feet of premium quality shock (bungee) cord made in the USA. Full size 3/16\" with 100% hard stretch and an extra heavy nylon cover. Most other bungee cords are made of polypropylene which does not have good abrasion and UV characteristics - which results in the cord losing elasticity. This is an ultra-premium bungee cord that is not readily available at any \"big box\" retail stores.", "text": "SGT KNOTS® Shock Cord 3/16\" - 100 Feet 100 feet of premium quality shock (bungee) cord made in the USA. Full size 3/16\" with 100% hard stretch and an extra heavy nylon cover. Most other bungee cords are made of polypropylene which does not have good abrasion and UV characteristics - which results in the cord losing elasticity. This is an ultra-premium bungee cord that is not readily available at any \"big box\" retail stores.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zv1FptHfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FJZWQG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B007FLHW3K", "title": "MonkeyLectric M210 10 LED Wheel Light", "description": "Show Your Style!The Monkey Light M210 is a rugged, practical, high performance bicycle light that keeps you visible in all weather conditions. The M210 straps to your spokes and displays brilliant patterns on your spinning bike wheel. Show your style with cutting edge themes designed by our electronic artists.The Monkey Light provides great front, rear and side visibility at any speed. It creates full color patterns on your spinning bike wheel at 15 to 65 km/h. The 8-bit themes are instantly customizable - with on-board buttons you can choose the themes and colors to fit any situation.The M210 is easy to mount on the spokes of nearly any bike - Road, City, Cruiser, Mountain and BMX bikes. The light is perfect for daily commuters, urban cyclists, casual evening riders - anytime you want to be visible after dark or in the rain.What's included:* 1 Monkey Light M210 Bike Light* 1 Hub-mounted battery holder* 20 language instruction sheet* 3 rubber mounting pads* 1 stainless steel anti-theft strap* 8 plastic mounting straps* 2 year warrantySpecifications* Power: 3 x AA batteries (any type), NIMH rechargeable provide best performance* Battery life: up to 40 hours* Fit: bicycle wheels 20\" or larger.* Riding speed: up to 65 km/h. Patterns visible above 12-15km/h.* Visibility: front and side visibility when mounted on front wheel. rear and side visibility when mounted on rear wheel.* Mounting: straps to spokes of wheel with vibration-proof 3-point mount (included).* Rugged IP67 fiber composite construction designed for daily use in all weather conditions* 10 ultra bright full color LEDs (5 on each side)* Made in USA", "text": "MonkeyLectric M210 10 LED Wheel Light Show Your Style!The Monkey Light M210 is a rugged, practical, high performance bicycle light that keeps you visible in all weather conditions. The M210 straps to your spokes and displays brilliant patterns on your spinning bike wheel. Show your style with cutting edge themes designed by our electronic artists.The Monkey Light provides great front, rear and side visibility at any speed. It creates full color patterns on your spinning bike wheel at 15 to 65 km/h. The 8-bit themes are instantly customizable - with on-board buttons you can choose the themes and colors to fit any situation.The M210 is easy to mount on the spokes of nearly any bike - Road, City, Cruiser, Mountain and BMX bikes. The light is perfect for daily commuters, urban cyclists, casual evening riders - anytime you want to be visible after dark or in the rain.What's included:* 1 Monkey Light M210 Bike Light* 1 Hub-mounted battery holder* 20 language instruction sheet* 3 rubber mounting pads* 1 stainless steel anti-theft strap* 8 plastic mounting straps* 2 year warrantySpecifications* Power: 3 x AA batteries (any type), NIMH rechargeable provide best performance* Battery life: up to 40 hours* Fit: bicycle wheels 20\" or larger.* Riding speed: up to 65 km/h. Patterns visible above 12-15km/h.* Visibility: front and side visibility when mounted on front wheel. rear and side visibility when mounted on rear wheel.* Mounting: straps to spokes of wheel with vibration-proof 3-point mount (included).* Rugged IP67 fiber composite construction designed for daily use in all weather conditions* 10 ultra bright full color LEDs (5 on each side)* Made in USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vv5MOVJ-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FLHW3K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B007FMAGM8", "title": "Magpul PTS MBUS Front & Rear Back-Up Sight Set Dark Earth Color Polymer", "description": "The Magpul PTS Back-up sights are not any ordinary sights, they really are handsome-looking things. There's something quite muscular and \"beefy\" about the shape of this that give it a futuristic, cutting-edge look. ***Product Details: - A Sight Designed As A Low-Cost. Folding Back-Up Sight - Spring Loaded Flip-Up system, release lever can be reached on left, right & top position - Solid click sound when sights are locked into position - No need to release lock to fold - Standard Adjustable M16 Style Sight Post - Rear sight comes with Dual Apertures and Adjustable Windage - The MBUS Fits All 20mm Rail Equipped Weapons - Constructed of same DuPont Polyer material as the Famous PMAG.*** ===---MAGPUL PTS PRODUCT FAQ: 1. What is the difference between Magpul PTS and Magpul Industries? - Magpul PTS (Professional Training and Simulation) is a division of Magpul Industries USA that is specifically creates products for the sport of airsoft/simuation. 2. Can I use Magpul PTS on my real steel AR/Rifle? - We highly advise against it. 3. Why are Magpul PTS prices so much lower than Magpul USA products? - Because many airsoft rifles are built with a less expensive material (aka polymer vs. steel), Magpul PTS products also uses inexpensive but high quality materials vs. Magpul USA. 4. Will this item fit my (insert brand/make/model/type) AEG or GBB airsoft rifle? - Magpul products are designed to fit 95% of all M4/M16 type rifles and styles. However, due to literally dozens of different airsoft manufacturers, we cannot 100% guarantee fitment. We recommend doing research at airsoft rorums and websites if you have any doubts.---===", "text": "Magpul PTS MBUS Front & Rear Back-Up Sight Set Dark Earth Color Polymer The Magpul PTS Back-up sights are not any ordinary sights, they really are handsome-looking things. There's something quite muscular and \"beefy\" about the shape of this that give it a futuristic, cutting-edge look. ***Product Details: - A Sight Designed As A Low-Cost. Folding Back-Up Sight - Spring Loaded Flip-Up system, release lever can be reached on left, right & top position - Solid click sound when sights are locked into position - No need to release lock to fold - Standard Adjustable M16 Style Sight Post - Rear sight comes with Dual Apertures and Adjustable Windage - The MBUS Fits All 20mm Rail Equipped Weapons - Constructed of same DuPont Polyer material as the Famous PMAG.*** ===---MAGPUL PTS PRODUCT FAQ: 1. What is the difference between Magpul PTS and Magpul Industries? - Magpul PTS (Professional Training and Simulation) is a division of Magpul Industries USA that is specifically creates products for the sport of airsoft/simuation. 2. Can I use Magpul PTS on my real steel AR/Rifle? - We highly advise against it. 3. Why are Magpul PTS prices so much lower than Magpul USA products? - Because many airsoft rifles are built with a less expensive material (aka polymer vs. steel), Magpul PTS products also uses inexpensive but high quality materials vs. Magpul USA. 4. Will this item fit my (insert brand/make/model/type) AEG or GBB airsoft rifle? - Magpul products are designed to fit 95% of all M4/M16 type rifles and styles. However, due to literally dozens of different airsoft manufacturers, we cannot 100% guarantee fitment. We recommend doing research at airsoft rorums and websites if you have any doubts.---===", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dzYYFBbnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FMAGM8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]]}}
