{"item_id": "B007FTGH06", "title": "Pearl Izumi Elite Softshell Gloves - Closeout", "description": "If you're not scared off the bike by harsh winds and white, fluffy stuff falling from the sky, these cycling gloves were designed for you. They're made with ELITE Softshell technology and Primaloft insulation to keep your digits warm and dry, no matter how bad the weather is. ELITE Softshell technology blocks wind and water Primaloft insulation traps in heat to keep you warm Clarino synthetic leather palms are soft and abrasion-resistant Comfort Bridge Gel palm padding relieves pressure to improve your comfort, especially on longer rides Soft, windproof fleece thumb wipe Longer wrist gauntlet extends over your jacket cuff to seal out the draft Anatomic fit improves dexterity Silicone finger tips improve grip", "text": "Pearl Izumi Elite Softshell Gloves - Closeout If you're not scared off the bike by harsh winds and white, fluffy stuff falling from the sky, these cycling gloves were designed for you. They're made with ELITE Softshell technology and Primaloft insulation to keep your digits warm and dry, no matter how bad the weather is. ELITE Softshell technology blocks wind and water Primaloft insulation traps in heat to keep you warm Clarino synthetic leather palms are soft and abrasion-resistant Comfort Bridge Gel palm padding relieves pressure to improve your comfort, especially on longer rides Soft, windproof fleece thumb wipe Longer wrist gauntlet extends over your jacket cuff to seal out the draft Anatomic fit improves dexterity Silicone finger tips improve grip", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41By70lAmzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FTGH06.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007FU0NJG", "title": "All Steel Ambidexous Tactical Latch", "description": "Close quarter combat can't get any more efficient with ambi tact latch. Designed with the operator in mind when your life depends on it.", "text": "All Steel Ambidexous Tactical Latch Close quarter combat can't get any more efficient with ambi tact latch. Designed with the operator in mind when your life depends on it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ODNblw-DL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FU0NJG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Field Sport Inc", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 5.96}}
{"item_id": "B007FUOIHY", "title": "Camillus Titanium Bonded Carnivore Machete, Camouflage, 18-Inch", "description": "Full Tang 440 Stainless Steel, Titanium Bonded, Multi-Grind Blade, ABS Handle, 12\" Blade with Chisel, Cutting, Sawing and Wire Cutter Capabilities. Includes Sheath. Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Camillus Titanium Bonded Carnivore Machete, Camouflage, 18-Inch Full Tang 440 Stainless Steel, Titanium Bonded, Multi-Grind Blade, ABS Handle, 12\" Blade with Chisel, Cutting, Sawing and Wire Cutter Capabilities. Includes Sheath. Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kimo24o%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FUOIHY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camillus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 32.22}}
{"item_id": "B007FUYXYW", "title": "UST JetScream Whistle", "description": "Hearing is believing… You can't possibly out-scream the JetScreamwhistle! ¶Almost everyone, from small children to seniors, can benefit from JetScream'spiercing shriek. This whistle is one of the loudest in the world. You can hear JetScream'samazing 122Db above most natural or man-made noises. You can use JetScreamin the city or woods for emergency communication and personal protection. You don't need a big bulky whistle to make a loud blast when you carry the JetScreamin its stead. ¶Keep your children safe by giving them a JetScreamwhistle to take wherever they go, especially when unaccompanied by an adult - playing in the woods, in the street, or when they walk to school. You can protect yourself with a JetScreamin the city against crime or to signal for help in the event of an emergency. And of course, you should always carry it with you in the great outdoors - whether you're camping, hiking, or hunting, you never know when you may need some help. In addition, JetScream’s unique design allows it to be used when wet, making it the perfect accompaniment to all outdoor activities near rivers, lakes, or oceans. The JetScreamwhistle is uniquely designed to be sleek and streamlined and fit comfortably in your pocket. In addition, it includes a short lanyard attachment allowing you to hook it to your key chain, your purse, your backpack, your wrist, or anywhere that is easily accessible. You will want to have a few so you can make sure you always have one with you -- in your survival kit, with your camping gear, in your tackle box, with the kids, on your keys, in the glove box and on the boat. The one time you don’t have it might be the one time you really need it. Specifications Material: High-strength plastic Length:2.3 inches (5.8 cm) Weight:0.3 oz (8.5g) Colors: Black, Orange", "text": "UST JetScream Whistle Hearing is believing… You can't possibly out-scream the JetScreamwhistle! ¶Almost everyone, from small children to seniors, can benefit from JetScream'spiercing shriek. This whistle is one of the loudest in the world. You can hear JetScream'samazing 122Db above most natural or man-made noises. You can use JetScreamin the city or woods for emergency communication and personal protection. You don't need a big bulky whistle to make a loud blast when you carry the JetScreamin its stead. ¶Keep your children safe by giving them a JetScreamwhistle to take wherever they go, especially when unaccompanied by an adult - playing in the woods, in the street, or when they walk to school. You can protect yourself with a JetScreamin the city against crime or to signal for help in the event of an emergency. And of course, you should always carry it with you in the great outdoors - whether you're camping, hiking, or hunting, you never know when you may need some help. In addition, JetScream’s unique design allows it to be used when wet, making it the perfect accompaniment to all outdoor activities near rivers, lakes, or oceans. The JetScreamwhistle is uniquely designed to be sleek and streamlined and fit comfortably in your pocket. In addition, it includes a short lanyard attachment allowing you to hook it to your key chain, your purse, your backpack, your wrist, or anywhere that is easily accessible. You will want to have a few so you can make sure you always have one with you -- in your survival kit, with your camping gear, in your tackle box, with the kids, on your keys, in the glove box and on the boat. The one time you don’t have it might be the one time you really need it. Specifications Material: High-strength plastic Length:2.3 inches (5.8 cm) Weight:0.3 oz (8.5g) Colors: Black, Orange", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414%2Bb8s0RzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007FUYXYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Survival Technologies", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 6.45}}
