{"item_id": "B007G2EKSI", "title": "Laserlyte Zombie Pistol Bayonet", "description": "Be the first to own a Pistol Bayonet that looks as good as it works. This razor-sharp Ka-Bar blade fits any medium to large pistol with a rail and slides on and off easily with the press of two buttons. The blade handle is constructed from 30% glass-filled nylon for strength and durability. Its carbon steel blade is sharpened to a fine edge and finished with a black Teflon coating for protection. A LaserLyte original, the Pistol Bayonet is ready for any zombie attack—or just looking cool on your favorite gun! Blade length 2.75\" with an overall length of 5.75\".", "text": "Laserlyte Zombie Pistol Bayonet Be the first to own a Pistol Bayonet that looks as good as it works. This razor-sharp Ka-Bar blade fits any medium to large pistol with a rail and slides on and off easily with the press of two buttons. The blade handle is constructed from 30% glass-filled nylon for strength and durability. Its carbon steel blade is sharpened to a fine edge and finished with a black Teflon coating for protection. A LaserLyte original, the Pistol Bayonet is ready for any zombie attack—or just looking cool on your favorite gun! Blade length 2.75\" with an overall length of 5.75\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v2fN8B9lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007G2EKSI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 20.24}}
{"item_id": "B007G8EXH0", "title": "EyezOff GP96 Alloy Mini Bike Pump (Black/Aluminium) w/ mounting bracket", "description": "EyezOff GP96 Mini Alloy Bike Pump (Black/Aluminium). Includes mounting bracket and velcro fastening strap. Reversible valve attachment for Presta and Schrader valves. Soft-touch T-handle for better grip, reinforced barrel and dust cap. Includes bolts for mounting on bicycle frame. Weight 120g, length 215mm.", "text": "EyezOff GP96 Alloy Mini Bike Pump (Black/Aluminium) w/ mounting bracket EyezOff GP96 Mini Alloy Bike Pump (Black/Aluminium). Includes mounting bracket and velcro fastening strap. Reversible valve attachment for Presta and Schrader valves. Soft-touch T-handle for better grip, reinforced barrel and dust cap. Includes bolts for mounting on bicycle frame. Weight 120g, length 215mm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QTLJohb-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007G8EXH0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B007GB2V5S", "title": "Topeak Mega Red lite (3x1.5x1.5-Inch)", "description": "Features 1 Piranha high-flux red LED and 4 additional super bright LEDs (2 red / 2 yellow) to provide an impressively bright and extremely visible signal to approaching motorists. 5 modes of operation alert drivers of your location on the road and maximizes your safety when cycling at night.", "text": "Topeak Mega Red lite (3x1.5x1.5-Inch) Features 1 Piranha high-flux red LED and 4 additional super bright LEDs (2 red / 2 yellow) to provide an impressively bright and extremely visible signal to approaching motorists. 5 modes of operation alert drivers of your location on the road and maximizes your safety when cycling at night.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GEVwmRcdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007GB2V5S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 20.88}}
{"item_id": "B007GB86PM", "title": "Topeak Fuel Tank", "description": "The top opening, zipper accessed, divided main compartment keeps contents organized and secure.", "text": "Topeak Fuel Tank The top opening, zipper accessed, divided main compartment keeps contents organized and secure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zJE7bNPnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007GB86PM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007GDME8K", "title": "DPx HEST Original fixed blade survival knife. Made by Ontario Knife Company", "description": "The HEST Original is designed by DPx Gear owner, Robert Young Pelton. The Pull-the-DOT snaps are heavy duty, with a three sided locking snap fastener that is designed to withstand extreme pressure on three sides without unlocking. The sheath is also designed with a tension screw so you can adjust how tight you would like the sheath to hold the knife. Comes with MOLLE Compatible Kydex Sheath.", "text": "DPx HEST Original fixed blade survival knife. Made by Ontario Knife Company The HEST Original is designed by DPx Gear owner, Robert Young Pelton. The Pull-the-DOT snaps are heavy duty, with a three sided locking snap fastener that is designed to withstand extreme pressure on three sides without unlocking. The sheath is also designed with a tension screw so you can adjust how tight you would like the sheath to hold the knife. Comes with MOLLE Compatible Kydex Sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PLcCLPfwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007GDME8K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 110.75}}
{"item_id": "B007GDR0I4", "title": "Aimpoint PRO Patrol Rifle Optic", "description": "Aimpoint PRO Patrol Rifle Optic 12841Designed with input from a distinguished group of current and former professionals, the Patrol Rifle Optic incorporates many never before seen features to maximize this sight's performance within the challenging conditions faced by modern law enforcement. A hard-anodized 30mm tube was utilized, enclosing a high efficiency circuit that allows the sight to be turned on and left on for up to three years using a single battery. The Aimpoint PRO Patrol Rifle Optic's front lens utilizes a unique band-pass coating, which allows the sight to be used with all generations of night vision devices. The modular QRP2 mount includes a removable spacer that indexes the sight at the optimal height for co-witness with the standard iron sights on AR15/M16/M4 Carbine style weapons. This spacer can be removed to enable the use of the sight on police shotguns or sub-machine guns. The QRP2 mount for the PRO Optic also incorporates a torque-limiting twist knob that provides the optimal level of pressure on the rail while completely eliminating the possibility of over-tightening. Both the PRO Optic's front and rear lenses are recessed within the sight body to provide protection against impact damage, scratches and fingerprints.", "text": "Aimpoint PRO Patrol Rifle Optic Aimpoint PRO Patrol Rifle Optic 12841Designed with input from a distinguished group of current and former professionals, the Patrol Rifle Optic incorporates many never before seen features to maximize this sight's performance within the challenging conditions faced by modern law enforcement. A hard-anodized 30mm tube was utilized, enclosing a high efficiency circuit that allows the sight to be turned on and left on for up to three years using a single battery. The Aimpoint PRO Patrol Rifle Optic's front lens utilizes a unique band-pass coating, which allows the sight to be used with all generations of night vision devices. The modular QRP2 mount includes a removable spacer that indexes the sight at the optimal height for co-witness with the standard iron sights on AR15/M16/M4 Carbine style weapons. This spacer can be removed to enable the use of the sight on police shotguns or sub-machine guns. The QRP2 mount for the PRO Optic also incorporates a torque-limiting twist knob that provides the optimal level of pressure on the rail while completely eliminating the possibility of over-tightening. Both the PRO Optic's front and rear lenses are recessed within the sight body to provide protection against impact damage, scratches and fingerprints.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GrXA2j9AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007GDR0I4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AimPoint", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 439.99}}
{"item_id": "B007GERHZE", "title": "Extreme Cold Military Sleeping bag U.S. G.I.", "description": "This genuine G.I. sleeping bag is labeled \"Sleeping Bag, Extreme Cold w/Hood, w/o Carrying Bag\" It comes in a vacuum sealed heavy plastic bag so you will know that it has never been used. Six pounds of down/polyester mix insures warmth at sub zero temps. Our troops stake their lives on these bags so you can too. Might be a good idea to keep one in your vehicle, as we know that things can go bad in a minute.'", "text": "Extreme Cold Military Sleeping bag U.S. G.I. This genuine G.I. sleeping bag is labeled \"Sleeping Bag, Extreme Cold w/Hood, w/o Carrying Bag\" It comes in a vacuum sealed heavy plastic bag so you will know that it has never been used. Six pounds of down/polyester mix insures warmth at sub zero temps. Our troops stake their lives on these bags so you can too. Might be a good idea to keep one in your vehicle, as we know that things can go bad in a minute.'", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WEpfFQ6uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007GERHZE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tennier Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B007GGPN26", "title": "New High Quality Aluminum 12 Gauge Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresight", "description": "Fits 12 Gauge Cartridge. Sighting or zeroing in your iron sights, red dots, or scopes quickly and easily. Insert the entire assembly into the chamber, gently close the action, and aim at a target 20-30 yards away. Adjust windage and elevation of the scope or sights so point-of-aim is zeroed on. Included 3 x LR44 Button Cell Batteries.", "text": "New High Quality Aluminum 12 Gauge Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresight Fits 12 Gauge Cartridge. Sighting or zeroing in your iron sights, red dots, or scopes quickly and easily. Insert the entire assembly into the chamber, gently close the action, and aim at a target 20-30 yards away. Adjust windage and elevation of the scope or sights so point-of-aim is zeroed on. Included 3 x LR44 Button Cell Batteries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318pzUiqNjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007GGPN26.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DYZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 11.8}}
{"item_id": "B007GNWCK0", "title": "Burris 300236 Fastfire III with Picatinny Mount 8 MOA Sight (Black)", "description": "The Fast Fire III Red Dot Sight is the most versatile red dot sight on the market. Mount it on your favorite handgun, shotgun, or hunting rifle for greater accuracy and faster target acquisition. You won't need to worry about sight alignment, eye dominance, or finding your target. Just put the red dot on your target and pull the trigger.", "text": "Burris 300236 Fastfire III with Picatinny Mount 8 MOA Sight (Black) The Fast Fire III Red Dot Sight is the most versatile red dot sight on the market. Mount it on your favorite handgun, shotgun, or hunting rifle for greater accuracy and faster target acquisition. You won't need to worry about sight alignment, eye dominance, or finding your target. Just put the red dot on your target and pull the trigger.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jLxDTIuHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007GNWCK0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 229.95}}
{"item_id": "B007GPMMQW", "title": "Under Armour Men's UA Tech™ Sleeveless T-Shirt", "description": "Updated lightweight UA TechTM fabric with an ultra-soft, natural feel for unrivaled comfort. 4-way stretch fabrication improves mobility, while helping to maintain shape. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the body, keeping you cooler and drier. Anti-odor technology prevents the growth of odor causing microbes, keeping your gear fresher, longer. Smooth flatlock seams allow a full range of motion without chafing. Full, loose fit for enhanced range of motion & breathable comfort. 3.9 oz. Polyester. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Men's UA Tech™ Sleeveless T-Shirt Updated lightweight UA TechTM fabric with an ultra-soft, natural feel for unrivaled comfort. 4-way stretch fabrication improves mobility, while helping to maintain shape. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the body, keeping you cooler and drier. Anti-odor technology prevents the growth of odor causing microbes, keeping your gear fresher, longer. Smooth flatlock seams allow a full range of motion without chafing. Full, loose fit for enhanced range of motion & breathable comfort. 3.9 oz. Polyester. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IZ5kIsZeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007GPMMQW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Clothing", "Women", "Shirts"]]}}
