{"item_id": "B007H4HM9O", "title": "Innova Champion Discs Standard Disc Golf Bag", "description": "Innova small golf bag holds 8-10 golf discs. Water resistant, padded carry strap, divided compartments,water bottle holder and towel ring. Two outer compartments and velcro closed inner compartment. (Discs not included)", "text": "Innova Champion Discs Standard Disc Golf Bag Innova small golf bag holds 8-10 golf discs. Water resistant, padded carry strap, divided compartments,water bottle holder and towel ring. Two outer compartments and velcro closed inner compartment. (Discs not included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414fAYULrpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007H4HM9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Innova - Champion Discs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Bags & Accessories"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B007HA9IVI", "title": "Smith and Wesson SWMP6S M and P M.A.G.I.C. Assisted Opening Folding Knife", "description": "These assisted opening knives feature thumb-knobs and index finger actuators, with liner locks and safety switches designed for quick and easy single-handed opening and closing.", "text": "Smith and Wesson SWMP6S M and P M.A.G.I.C. Assisted Opening Folding Knife These assisted opening knives feature thumb-knobs and index finger actuators, with liner locks and safety switches designed for quick and easy single-handed opening and closing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jKnKQQYdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007HA9IVI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 35.85}}
{"item_id": "B007HANR38", "title": "Condor MA52 Triple Pistol Mag Pouch", "description": "Tactical MOLLE Compatible triple pistol mag pouch. Holds most single and double stack mags", "text": "Condor MA52 Triple Pistol Mag Pouch Tactical MOLLE Compatible triple pistol mag pouch. Holds most single and double stack mags", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Id917PbhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007HANR38.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B007HC23GS", "title": "ACH Ballistic Helmet Upgrade System", "description": "Size: 6 (3/4\" padding) Kit Contents: 7 Pads, Velcro coins and alcohol wipes, hardware and instructionsState of the Art moisture wicking fabric. Quick Dry Reticulated Comfort Layer does not absorb moisture and increases air circulation.SKYDEX Impact Absorbing Layer absorbs more shock in less space than incumbent foam", "text": "ACH Ballistic Helmet Upgrade System Size: 6 (3/4\" padding) Kit Contents: 7 Pads, Velcro coins and alcohol wipes, hardware and instructionsState of the Art moisture wicking fabric. Quick Dry Reticulated Comfort Layer does not absorb moisture and increases air circulation.SKYDEX Impact Absorbing Layer absorbs more shock in less space than incumbent foam", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nqGQB01hL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007HC23GS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Protective Gear", "Catcher's Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007HDNOT2", "title": "Park CM-5.2 Cyclone Chain Scrubber", "description": "Keeping your chain clean is an essential part of good bike maintenance. The CM-5.2 Cyclone Chain Scrubber uses an extra large solvent reservoir and a series of rotating brushes to get chains really clean.", "text": "Park CM-5.2 Cyclone Chain Scrubber Keeping your chain clean is an essential part of good bike maintenance. The CM-5.2 Cyclone Chain Scrubber uses an extra large solvent reservoir and a series of rotating brushes to get chains really clean.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511i1wSnq7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007HDNOT2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 18.6}}
{"item_id": "B007HFIH8I", "title": "Vigilant Gear® Tinder-Quik 50 pack (1 packet)", "description": "Tinder-Quik fire tabs complement your Spark-Lite purchase and make sure you've got plenty of fire-starting ability. Each Tinder-Quik is specially treated to high standards to ensure the cotton is waterproof and provides more than adequate burn times for starting fires.", "text": "Vigilant Gear® Tinder-Quik 50 pack (1 packet) Tinder-Quik fire tabs complement your Spark-Lite purchase and make sure you've got plenty of fire-starting ability. Each Tinder-Quik is specially treated to high standards to ensure the cotton is waterproof and provides more than adequate burn times for starting fires.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q1-8uHn8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007HFIH8I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007HJBWZO", "title": "Human Gear capCAP BPA Free - Blue / Gray", "description": "capCAP is the civilized 2-in-1 accessory cap for Nalgene, CamelBak and other popular wide-mouth drink bottles. Most wide-mouth bottles are easy to fill and clean, but the standard opening is too big to drink from easily without spilling. Narrow-mouth bottles are great to drink from but you can forget about putting ice cubes in them, let alone clean them. And bottle inserts don't really fix a spout that was never meant for daily drinking.", "text": "Human Gear capCAP BPA Free - Blue / Gray capCAP is the civilized 2-in-1 accessory cap for Nalgene, CamelBak and other popular wide-mouth drink bottles. Most wide-mouth bottles are easy to fill and clean, but the standard opening is too big to drink from easily without spilling. Narrow-mouth bottles are great to drink from but you can forget about putting ice cubes in them, let alone clean them. And bottle inserts don't really fix a spout that was never meant for daily drinking.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sCUSXgc6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007HJBWZO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 6.84}}
{"item_id": "B007HJJVL6", "title": "Smith and Wesson SWPEN3BK Tactical Pen with Stylus Tip", "description": "This tactical stylus/pen allows you to select, sketch, draw, take notes, and express yourself creatively on most touch screen devices, yet can still be used as a normal pen. The cap can be screwed onto the opposite end of the pen for easy storage.", "text": "Smith and Wesson SWPEN3BK Tactical Pen with Stylus Tip This tactical stylus/pen allows you to select, sketch, draw, take notes, and express yourself creatively on most touch screen devices, yet can still be used as a normal pen. The cap can be screwed onto the opposite end of the pen for easy storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31y0oTV0P%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007HJJVL6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 24.25}}
{"item_id": "B007HJNK68", "title": "Nite Ize Clip-On Marker with Wave Pattern (Red, 10 -Inch)", "description": "An ecologically responsible alternative to disposable chemical glow sticks, the Nite Ize LED Clip-On Marker is a flexible polymer strip encased in lightweight, durable nylon fabric. Decorated with a reflective pattern for extra visibility, the Clip-On Marker is illuminated on both sides by an efficient (over 100,000 hour) LED bulb and powered by a 2032 replaceable battery (included). Lightweight, thin, and weather-resistant, its sturdy plastic S-Biner Clip can be attached to almost anything with a hook or ring—from zippers and tent lines to belt loops and bicycle seats. It has a utility D-Ring on the opposite end, too, so you can also clip it to itself and create a loop of light to wear on your wrist, or wrap around anything up to 3\" in diameter. The bright red LED has two modes to choose from—steady glow or continuous flash. The Clip-On Marker is perfect for creating safety visibility in any situation.", "text": "Nite Ize Clip-On Marker with Wave Pattern (Red, 10 -Inch) An ecologically responsible alternative to disposable chemical glow sticks, the Nite Ize LED Clip-On Marker is a flexible polymer strip encased in lightweight, durable nylon fabric. Decorated with a reflective pattern for extra visibility, the Clip-On Marker is illuminated on both sides by an efficient (over 100,000 hour) LED bulb and powered by a 2032 replaceable battery (included). Lightweight, thin, and weather-resistant, its sturdy plastic S-Biner Clip can be attached to almost anything with a hook or ring—from zippers and tent lines to belt loops and bicycle seats. It has a utility D-Ring on the opposite end, too, so you can also clip it to itself and create a loop of light to wear on your wrist, or wrap around anything up to 3\" in diameter. The bright red LED has two modes to choose from—steady glow or continuous flash. The Clip-On Marker is perfect for creating safety visibility in any situation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YRgjJjRZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007HJNK68.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 10.94}}
{"item_id": "B007HNDHH6", "title": "Pellet Pen and Pellet Seater, Loads & Seats .177 Pellets", "description": "Air Venturi Pellet Pen System with PellSet Holds up to 22 .177-cal. pellets (any .177 pellet fits) For breakbarrel air rifles and air pistols Correctly orients & loads pellets Unique PellSet seating tool adjusts for different seating depths to perfectly seat your pellets! Faster loading & seating Maximum stealth while hunting (no noisy pellet tins) Load & seat pellets even while wearing gloves No fumbling with awkward pellet containers Lanyard keeps everything conveniently located If lanyard gets caught or tangled, breakaway feature requires min. pressure to release • Load pellets head first. To see all the features of the new Air Venturi Pellet Pen System with PellSet, click on the detail images and read the accompanying text.", "text": "Pellet Pen and Pellet Seater, Loads & Seats .177 Pellets Air Venturi Pellet Pen System with PellSet Holds up to 22 .177-cal. pellets (any .177 pellet fits) For breakbarrel air rifles and air pistols Correctly orients & loads pellets Unique PellSet seating tool adjusts for different seating depths to perfectly seat your pellets! Faster loading & seating Maximum stealth while hunting (no noisy pellet tins) Load & seat pellets even while wearing gloves No fumbling with awkward pellet containers Lanyard keeps everything conveniently located If lanyard gets caught or tangled, breakaway feature requires min. pressure to release • Load pellets head first. To see all the features of the new Air Venturi Pellet Pen System with PellSet, click on the detail images and read the accompanying text.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CgrJTRllL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007HNDHH6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pellet Pen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B007HOB4FC", "title": "MRE (Meals, Ready to Eat) Premium case of 12 Fresh MREs with Heaters. 5 Year Shelf Life.", "description": "Our MREs are Perfect for Emergency food and field use - Our case of 12 MRE has the best entrees, desserts and condiments available.In addition to the following menu, each MRE also contains a Flameless Ration Heater, Wheat Snack Bread or MRE cracker, 6\", instant coffee, creamer, sugar, salt, pepper, wet nap and napkin.Each case contains 4 Hot sauce packets.The case also has 7 Cocoa Beverage Powder (CBP) mixes, a high energy chocolate shake.Menus1 : Spaghetti, Potatoes Au Gratin, Strawberry Banana Dairy Shake, Cheese Spread, Grape Electrolyte,2 : Chili With Beans, Fried Rice, Strawberry Dairy Shake, Strawberry Jam, Lemon Lime Electrolyte3 : Vegetarian Ratatouille, Potatoes, Au Gratin, Chocolate Chip Cookie, Peanut Butter Fortified, Lemon Lime Electrolyte4 : Chicken with Noodles, Fried Rice, Pop Tart, Cheese Spread, Grape Electrolyte5 : Beef Ravioli, Potato Cheddar Soup, Instant Chocolate Pudding, Cheese Spread, Lemon Lime Electrolyte, CBP6 : Apple Maple Rolled Oats, Brown Sugar Pop Tart, Maple Muffin Top, Blackberry Jam, Fruit Punch Electrolyte, CBP7 : Meatballs in Marinara Sauce, Potato Cheddar Soup, Instant Vanilla Pudding, Peanut Butter, Lemon Lime Electrolyte8 : Vegetable Lasagna, Zapplesauce Fudge Brownie, Grape Jelly, Orange Electrolyte, CBP9 : Chicken Fajita, Fried Rice, Spice Pound Cake, Tortillas, Orange Electrolyte, CBP10 : Pork Sausage Patty, Hash Browns With Bacon, Strawberry Pop Tart, Orange Electrolyte,Grape Jelly, CBP11 : Pork Sausage Patty, Hash Browns With Bacon, Chocolate Pop Tart, Blackberry Jam, Orange Electrolyte, CBP12 : Apple Maple Rolled Oats, Zapplesauce, Brown Sugar Pop Tart, Peanut Butter Fortified, Fruit Punch Electrolyte, CBP", "text": "MRE (Meals, Ready to Eat) Premium case of 12 Fresh MREs with Heaters. 5 Year Shelf Life. Our MREs are Perfect for Emergency food and field use - Our case of 12 MRE 