{"item_id": "B007HSDJPQ", "title": "25 mm Liquid Filled Survival Button Compasses - Set of 5", "description": "1 set (5 pcs) new, 25 mm, liquid filled mini button compasses. These well-made mini compasses are perfect for use in compact, mini, or pocket survival kits. The compasses are flat on the back allowing you to easily attach them to your walking stick, knife, binoculars, backpack, etc. The easy to read compass dial is sealed with clear acrylic top and black plastic base. The grooved edge allows for easy carrying with a lanyard.", "text": "25 mm Liquid Filled Survival Button Compasses - Set of 5 1 set (5 pcs) new, 25 mm, liquid filled mini button compasses. These well-made mini compasses are perfect for use in compact, mini, or pocket survival kits. The compasses are flat on the back allowing you to easily attach them to your walking stick, knife, binoculars, backpack, etc. The easy to read compass dial is sealed with clear acrylic top and black plastic base. The grooved edge allows for easy carrying with a lanyard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51I5m5EOJKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007HSDJPQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]]}}
