{"item_id": "B007IG0EX2", "title": "AR15/M16 Front And Rear Flip-up Sight Combination Sale", "description": "1.Details for AR15/M16 Front flip-up Sight: Folds down and stays flat when not in use Locking push button on side to prevent sight from flipping down Locked in place firmly with knurled nut. Installs in seconds A2-style front post is adjustable for elevation with ? turns for 1.25\" MOA at 100 yards Protective \"ears\" guard the post Fits onto picatinny and weaver style rails. Gas Block Front Sight clamps to a gas block with a Picatinny rail on top Made of heavy duty high quality aluminum alloy color:Black 2.Details for AR15/M16 Rear flip-up Sight: 2 Aperture sizes in one with easy adjustment Knurled aperture wheel turns easily in both directions Folds down and stays flat when not in use.(pic 6) Locking push button on side to prevent sight from flipping down Fits onto picatinny and weaver style rails. Made of heavy duty high quality aluminum alloy color:Black Need a screwdriver to tied it up", "text": "AR15/M16 Front And Rear Flip-up Sight Combination Sale 1.Details for AR15/M16 Front flip-up Sight: Folds down and stays flat when not in use Locking push button on side to prevent sight from flipping down Locked in place firmly with knurled nut. Installs in seconds A2-style front post is adjustable for elevation with ? turns for 1.25\" MOA at 100 yards Protective \"ears\" guard the post Fits onto picatinny and weaver style rails. Gas Block Front Sight clamps to a gas block with a Picatinny rail on top Made of heavy duty high quality aluminum alloy color:Black 2.Details for AR15/M16 Rear flip-up Sight: 2 Aperture sizes in one with easy adjustment Knurled aperture wheel turns easily in both directions Folds down and stays flat when not in use.(pic 6) Locking push button on side to prevent sight from flipping down Fits onto picatinny and weaver style rails. Made of heavy duty high quality aluminum alloy color:Black Need a screwdriver to tied it up", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wreISX6-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007IG0EX2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DYZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B007IGSWQI", "title": "Cateye Micro Wireless Cycling Computer", "description": "No more scrolling through functions - the Micro Wireless allows you to customize your display and view it on a larger, LED backlit screen. It also features a slim body and is available in black or white. Functions include Current speed, Maximum speed, Average speed, Odometer, Trip distance 1 & 2, Elapsed time, Stopwatch and Clock.", "text": "Cateye Micro Wireless Cycling Computer No more scrolling through functions - the Micro Wireless allows you to customize your display and view it on a larger, LED backlit screen. It also features a slim body and is available in black or white. Functions include Current speed, Maximum speed, Average speed, Odometer, Trip distance 1 & 2, Elapsed time, Stopwatch and Clock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41goGshX8ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007IGSWQI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 42.77}}
{"item_id": "B007IHQ91C", "title": "Umarex 2252600 Morph3X Rifle /Pistol", "description": "Umarex MORPH 3X Uses a 12-gram CO2 cartridge Non-removable 30rd BB magazine Double-action only Fixed fiber optic sights Adjustable power 2 integral Weaver/Picatinny rails Pistol specs: 380 fps, 4.5 barrel, 11.5 overall length, 1.5 lbs. Rifle specs: 600 fps, 12 barrel, 38.5 overall length, 2.5 lbs., 15 length of pull Includes pistol, detachable skeletonized shoulder stock, forearm (attaches to lower Weaver rail) and barrel extender ... 600 fps with barrel extender, 380 fps without it. Converts from pistol to carbine to rifle!...", "text": "Umarex 2252600 Morph3X Rifle /Pistol Umarex MORPH 3X Uses a 12-gram CO2 cartridge Non-removable 30rd BB magazine Double-action only Fixed fiber optic sights Adjustable power 2 integral Weaver/Picatinny rails Pistol specs: 380 fps, 4.5 barrel, 11.5 overall length, 1.5 lbs. Rifle specs: 600 fps, 12 barrel, 38.5 overall length, 2.5 lbs., 15 length of pull Includes pistol, detachable skeletonized shoulder stock, forearm (attaches to lower Weaver rail) and barrel extender ... 600 fps with barrel extender, 380 fps without it. Converts from pistol to carbine to rifle!...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/219IPnmKcVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007IHQ91C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Umarex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 70.99}}
{"item_id": "B007IHQJN0", "title": "UTG Compensation Mount for RWS Airgun with T06 Trigger, Black", "description": "Scope ELeapersvation Compensation Mount – Slope 1.1/120 for 10-Inch Upward Compensation at 30 Yds, Dual Stop Pins to Prevent Bi-directional Recoil, 4 Side Screws for Solid Locking on All Airgun Dovetails, 11 Picatinny Slots, Works with RWS Models with T06 Trigger.", "text": "UTG Compensation Mount for RWS Airgun with T06 Trigger, Black Scope ELeapersvation Compensation Mount – Slope 1.1/120 for 10-Inch Upward Compensation at 30 Yds, Dual Stop Pins to Prevent Bi-directional Recoil, 4 Side Screws for Solid Locking on All Airgun Dovetails, 11 Picatinny Slots, Works with RWS Models with T06 Trigger.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lXVGVT5-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007IHQJN0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 15.59}}
{"item_id": "B007II2R44", "title": "NipEaze - 15pair", "description": "NipEAZE is the clear choice for runners and other athletes who experience nipple chafing. With its durable adhesive and sweat resistant design, NipEAZE is like a shield that protects you from the constant friction between you and your clothing. Because it is thin and breathable, it gives you the freedom to wear whatever you want while you run - no more special shirts or messy roll-ons! NipEAZE is easy to apply, discreet, and comfortable enough to be worn all day. Surfers and Bodyboarders use NipEAZE because it is water-resistant and transparent, so wearing a pair is hardly noticeable yet it protects the nips from the constant friction between you and your board or vest. Available in 2 sizes (for best results, NipEAZE should not be larger than the outside diameter of the areola) Regular \"(fits most men, some women)/includes 15pair Extra 1\"(fits most women, some men)/includes 12pair For Extra size, use another listing (Surfer) by clicking on our profile", "text": "NipEaze - 15pair NipEAZE is the clear choice for runners and other athletes who experience nipple chafing. With its durable adhesive and sweat resistant design, NipEAZE is like a shield that protects you from the constant friction between you and your clothing. Because it is thin and breathable, it gives you the freedom to wear whatever you want while you run - no more special shirts or messy roll-ons! NipEAZE is easy to apply, discreet, and comfortable enough to be worn all day. Surfers and Bodyboarders use NipEAZE because it is water-resistant and transparent, so wearing a pair is hardly noticeable yet it protects the nips from the constant friction between you and your board or vest. Available in 2 sizes (for best results, NipEAZE should not be larger than the outside diameter of the areola) Regular \"(fits most men, some women)/includes 15pair Extra 1\"(fits most women, some men)/includes 12pair For Extra size, use another listing (Surfer) by clicking on our profile", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nRmWuLCiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007II2R44.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B007II3FQS", "title": "Umarex 2252549 .177 Precison Steel", "description": "Umarex Precision steel BBs .177 cal 1,500 rds Speedloader bottleLoad up your BB guns with this speedloader bottle.", "text": "Umarex 2252549 .177 Precison Steel Umarex Precision steel BBs .177 cal 1,500 rds Speedloader bottleLoad up your BB guns with this speedloader bottle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PeF2DBxOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007II3FQS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Umarex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 7.61}}
{"item_id": "B007INX4UK", "title": "Maxpedition Tactical Gear Retractor Strap", "description": "The Kevlar cord breaks at 53 lbs. and the end fitting breaks away at 18 lbs Handy cord lock Quick disconnect gear attachment Subdued stainless steel hardware Highest quality and extreme duty Made in U.S.A.", "text": "Maxpedition Tactical Gear Retractor Strap The Kevlar cord breaks at 53 lbs. and the end fitting breaks away at 18 lbs Handy cord lock Quick disconnect gear attachment Subdued stainless steel hardware Highest quality and extreme duty Made in U.S.A.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PbyDbJT3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007INX4UK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007INYN6O", "title": "Barnett Zombie 350 CRT Crossbow, Black", "description": "The Zombie 350 CRT crossbow package comes complete with Quiver, 3 - 20' Arrows, Rope Cocking Device and a 3x32 Illuminated Scope. The Zombie 350 CRT is one of the lightest bows to ever come out of the Barnett factory. The Carbon Riser Technology (CRT) removes enough weight out of the front end to move the center of gravity back to the end of the stock. It shoulders with great comfort and is much easier to carry around to your hunting spot and provides more than enough power for any occasion.", "text": "Barnett Zombie 350 CRT Crossbow, Black The Zombie 350 CRT crossbow package comes complete with Quiver, 3 - 20' Arrows, Rope Cocking Device and a 3x32 Illuminated Scope. The Zombie 350 CRT is one of the lightest bows to ever come out of the Barnett factory. The Carbon Riser Technology (CRT) removes enough weight out of the front end to move the center of gravity back to the end of the stock. It shoulders with great comfort and is much easier to carry around to your hunting spot and provides more than enough power for any occasion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OmADufTrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007INYN6O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Crossbows"]], "price": 702.04}}
