{"item_id": "B007IWJX3S", "title": "Cross Draw Tactical Vest - Color: Black", "description": "Right side has 3 ammo pouches, above the ammo pouches, the right side has a large shell carrying pouch and a shooting pad. - Left side features a pistol holster capable of carrying most medium-framed pistols, 3 pistol magazine pouches which are fully adjustable to the height of most normal-sized magazines. - Vest is mounted on tough nylon mesh material which aids ventilation. - Shoulders on vest can be adjusted with long velcro strips, and also have 2 mental D-rings for the attachment of carabiners or other material. - Vest zips up in front and can be secured additionally with a pistol belt (included) threaded through the loops on the bottom. - Interior of vest has two zip-up document pockets left and right. - Rear of vest is double-ply mesh which allows for the addition of a hydration bladder. - A carrying handle is provided as well as strips across the back for the addition of camouflage material or other pouches. - Left and right sides can be adjusted for width via drawstrings. Size", "text": "Cross Draw Tactical Vest - Color: Black Right side has 3 ammo pouches, above the ammo pouches, the right side has a large shell carrying pouch and a shooting pad. - Left side features a pistol holster capable of carrying most medium-framed pistols, 3 pistol magazine pouches which are fully adjustable to the height of most normal-sized magazines. - Vest is mounted on tough nylon mesh material which aids ventilation. - Shoulders on vest can be adjusted with long velcro strips, and also have 2 mental D-rings for the attachment of carabiners or other material. - Vest zips up in front and can be secured additionally with a pistol belt (included) threaded through the loops on the bottom. - Interior of vest has two zip-up document pockets left and right. - Rear of vest is double-ply mesh which allows for the addition of a hydration bladder. - A carrying handle is provided as well as strips across the back for the addition of camouflage material or other pouches. - Left and right sides can be adjusted for width via drawstrings. Size", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516hhlr4KnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007IWJX3S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tactical Vests"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007IWZMA6", "title": "Condor Speedy 2 Point Sling", "description": "The Condor SPEEDY is a two point sling with quick adjustment capability.", "text": "Condor Speedy 2 Point Sling The Condor SPEEDY is a two point sling with quick adjustment capability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4128LK414uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007IWZMA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B007IZE70O", "title": "Aluminum Picatinny Sling Mount with Weaver Picatinny Rail Rifle", "description": "Attaches Your Front Part of The Sling to Your Picatinny Rail. Accepts All Slings up to 1.25\" wide. Mounts To Any Picatinny & Weaver Rails. Easy to Install with One Locking Bolt. Great For Rifles shotguns, Paintball, Airsoft.", "text": "Aluminum Picatinny Sling Mount with Weaver Picatinny Rail Rifle Attaches Your Front Part of The Sling to Your Picatinny Rail. Accepts All Slings up to 1.25\" wide. Mounts To Any Picatinny & Weaver Rails. Easy to Install with One Locking Bolt. Great For Rifles shotguns, Paintball, Airsoft.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wDGs3ipcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007IZE70O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DYZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 4.94}}
{"item_id": "B007J3E9PI", "title": "Stack-On SPAL-300 Motion Sensitive LED Security / Gun Safe Light", "description": "Illuminate the inside of your safe or security cabinet with this battery operated LED light. There are 3 light heads – each with 4 LED lights, that pivot independently for directional lighting. There is a manual on/off switch with 2 levels of brightness. This is a battery operated light with no wiring needed. It is easy to install with mounting plate or hook & eye tape (both are included). The lights can turn on automatically when the safe or cabinet door is opened when using the optional motion detection setting. Great for any safe or security cabinet you have!", "text": "Stack-On SPAL-300 Motion Sensitive LED Security / Gun Safe Light Illuminate the inside of your safe or security cabinet with this battery operated LED light. There are 3 light heads – each with 4 LED lights, that pivot independently for directional lighting. There is a manual on/off switch with 2 levels of brightness. This is a battery operated light with no wiring needed. It is easy to install with mounting plate or hook & eye tape (both are included). The lights can turn on automatically when the safe or cabinet door is opened when using the optional motion detection setting. Great for any safe or security cabinet you have!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NmkUJcrXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007J3E9PI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "STACK-ON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 17.9}}
{"item_id": "B007JBUA62", "title": "Versacarry Inside the Waistband Ambidextrous Gun Holster for .45 Cal Barrels", "description": "VersaCarry is a revolutionary new inside the waistband concealment holster unlike anything else you've ever seen. It uses a new patent pending design that carries the firearm by the inner barrel diameter. This design allows for unlimited carry possibilities, while remaining one of the smallest carry devices in the world. Its ambidextrous trigger guard features a self-locking design. A Versacarry holster is available for almost every semi-automatic handgun available and they work with most accessories (like under the barrel mounted lasers and flashlights). With its easy on/off design and 75% less holster bulk; the Versacarry is great for deep concealment. With the new Versacarry you have the option to choose any gun you wish to carry, in any accessory combination for sturdy, inside-the-waistband concealment. Versacarry is designed to be minimal, quick to use and highly effective at accommodating a variety of firearm configurations.", "text": "Versacarry Inside the Waistband Ambidextrous Gun Holster for .45 Cal Barrels VersaCarry is a revolutionary new inside the waistband concealment holster unlike anything else you've ever seen. It uses a new patent pending design that carries the firearm by the inner barrel diameter. This design allows for unlimited carry possibilities, while remaining one of the smallest carry devices in the world. Its ambidextrous trigger guard features a self-locking design. A Versacarry holster is available for almost every semi-automatic handgun available and they work with most accessories (like under the barrel mounted lasers and flashlights). With its easy on/off design and 75% less holster bulk; the Versacarry is great for deep concealment. With the new Versacarry you have the option to choose any gun you wish to carry, in any accessory combination for sturdy, inside-the-waistband concealment. Versacarry is designed to be minimal, quick to use and highly effective at accommodating a variety of firearm configurations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TwKpxokCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JBUA62.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
