{"item_id": "B007JC6ABA", "title": "Versacarry IWB Holster", "description": "Versacarry IWB Holster... the only zero-bulk concealed carry Holster giving you a safe, quick draw. Compact and covert. Just clip, click and conceal!As soon as you try it, you'll immediately see why these Inside the Waistband Holsters are being used by both civilians and law enforcement officers across America. The Holster's narrow, zero-bulk design allows for secure concealed carry while being one of the smallest carrying devices in the world. It carries your firearm by the barrel on a Derlin plastic retention rod that won't harm the barrel... perfect for a safe, quick draw. Gotcha: Belt clip for easy IWB concealment; Self-locking trigger guard for use on either side; Works with most lasers or accessories; Sturdy and well-built; All rods are approx. 1 1/2\"l. State Caliber and Size, Order today and get ready to go deep cover! Versacarry IWB Holster", "text": "Versacarry IWB Holster Versacarry IWB Holster... the only zero-bulk concealed carry Holster giving you a safe, quick draw. Compact and covert. Just clip, click and conceal!As soon as you try it, you'll immediately see why these Inside the Waistband Holsters are being used by both civilians and law enforcement officers across America. The Holster's narrow, zero-bulk design allows for secure concealed carry while being one of the smallest carrying devices in the world. It carries your firearm by the barrel on a Derlin plastic retention rod that won't harm the barrel... perfect for a safe, quick draw. Gotcha: Belt clip for easy IWB concealment; Self-locking trigger guard for use on either side; Works with most lasers or accessories; Sturdy and well-built; All rods are approx. 1 1/2\"l. State Caliber and Size, Order today and get ready to go deep cover! Versacarry IWB Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41owjmvp78L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JC6ABA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
