{"item_id": "B007JL4IQ0", "title": ".410/.45 Speed Loader", "description": "The .410/.45 Judge Speed Loaders are machined from high grade billet aluminum. They are both light and durable. Each one utilizes internal o-rings which reduce the need for lubrication. They are custom designed to fit the Taurus Judge both .410 and .45. PLEASE NOTE: .45 LC rim diameter must be larger than .508\" to work with this loader.", "text": ".410/.45 Speed Loader The .410/.45 Judge Speed Loaders are machined from high grade billet aluminum. They are both light and durable. Each one utilizes internal o-rings which reduce the need for lubrication. They are custom designed to fit the Taurus Judge both .410 and .45. PLEASE NOTE: .45 LC rim diameter must be larger than .508\" to work with this loader.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/210tb1ETzaL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JL4IQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B007JL4JIM", "title": "Chiappa Rhino Speed Loader", "description": "The Chiappa Rhino Speed Loaders are machined from high grade billet aluminum. They are both light and durable. Each one utilizes internal o-rings which reduce the need for lubrication. They are custom designed to fit the Chiappa Rhino.", "text": "Chiappa Rhino Speed Loader The Chiappa Rhino Speed Loaders are machined from high grade billet aluminum. They are both light and durable. Each one utilizes internal o-rings which reduce the need for lubrication. They are custom designed to fit the Chiappa Rhino.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O5JZ8K6bL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JL4JIM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B007JL4JUU", "title": "JII-357/38 Speed Loader", "description": "The JII-357/38 Speed Loaders are machined from high grade billet aluminum. They are both light and durable. Each one utilizes internal o-rings which reduce the need for lubrication. They are custom designed to fit: Ruger LCR; Smith & Wesson models 36, 60, 340, 640, & 642; Smith & Wesson Airweight models 36, 37, 38, 42, 48; and the Smith and Wesson Bodyguard.", "text": "JII-357/38 Speed Loader The JII-357/38 Speed Loaders are machined from high grade billet aluminum. They are both light and durable. Each one utilizes internal o-rings which reduce the need for lubrication. They are custom designed to fit: Ruger LCR; Smith & Wesson models 36, 60, 340, 640, & 642; Smith & Wesson Airweight models 36, 37, 38, 42, 48; and the Smith and Wesson Bodyguard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DmTcCKckL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JL4JUU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B007JNQCYY", "title": "Speed Block Case Combo 617 10 Shot", "description": "With a Speed Block for your S&W; 617 10 Shot Speedloader you can pre stage your rounds for some fast and fun shooting. A simple push down on the Speedloader clicks in 10 rounds in less than 1 second.... transfer them to the cylinder.... push again and click your 10 empty chambers are full. The average person with a little practice can be reloading their revolver in less than 5 seconds. The Speed Block speed block holds 100 rounds of 22 Long Rifle. Fits the 617 10 shot speed loader, load up close the case toss it in the range bag no more spills. This is a great why to keep everything nice and neat and ready to go when you get to your favorite shooting hole. New Combo now includes the block and the case. Get more enjoyment out of your SpeedBeez 617 10 shot speed loader and save money buy the combo. Speed Block and case both included. Get it all with one click. Now your ready for Loads of Fun!", "text": "Speed Block Case Combo 617 10 Shot With a Speed Block for your S&W; 617 10 Shot Speedloader you can pre stage your rounds for some fast and fun shooting. A simple push down on the Speedloader clicks in 10 rounds in less than 1 second.... transfer them to the cylinder.... push again and click your 10 empty chambers are full. The average person with a little practice can be reloading their revolver in less than 5 seconds. The Speed Block speed block holds 100 rounds of 22 Long Rifle. Fits the 617 10 shot speed loader, load up close the case toss it in the range bag no more spills. This is a great why to keep everything nice and neat and ready to go when you get to your favorite shooting hole. New Combo now includes the block and the case. Get more enjoyment out of your SpeedBeez 617 10 shot speed loader and save money buy the combo. Speed Block and case both included. Get it all with one click. Now your ready for Loads of Fun!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-4e8Z-KoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JNQCYY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B007JPJKUU", "title": "Generic Offset Ring Side Mount for Flashlight/Laser, Black", "description": "45 degree angle design for attachment of lasers, flashlights, R/G dot sights, scope QD thumb Nut, quickly mounted and released. Mounts to any Picatinny or Weaver Style Rail. Easy to Use, quickly mounted and released.", "text": "Generic Offset Ring Side Mount for Flashlight/Laser, Black 45 degree angle design for attachment of lasers, flashlights, R/G dot sights, scope QD thumb Nut, quickly mounted and released. Mounts to any Picatinny or Weaver Style Rail. Easy to Use, quickly mounted and released.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A-w%2BgKjiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JPJKUU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Generic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 4.24}}
{"item_id": "B007JPOUWI", "title": "SkinGripz \"OPERATOR\" 1911 Grips (Full Size-Black)", "description": "OUR \"OPERATOR\" GRIPZ FEATURE FINGER GROOVES ON BOTH SIDES FOR LEFT AND RIGHT HANDED SHOOTERS. THEY ARE THE MODERN UPGRADE OF A TIMELESS STYLE.\"OPERATOR\" GRIPZ HAVE BEEN TESTED BY MILITARY, LAW ENFORCEMENT, AND PRIVATE SECURITY PERSONNEL AND HAVE BEEN FOUND TO HAVE EXCELLENT WEAPON RETENTION WITH THE DEEP FINGER GROOVES, YET FEEL EXTREMELY COMFORTABLE IN THE HAND.\"OPERATOR\" GRIPZ ARE AVAILABLE IN BOTH FULL SIZE AND COMPACT, SO CHECK OUR OTHER LISTINGS.AT SKINGRIPZ, WE TAKE THE CUSTOMIZATION OF YOUR 1911 PISTOL TO THE NEXT LEVEL WITH OUR AWARD WINNING GRIP DESIGNS. FROM MILD TO WILD, YOU CAN BE SURE WE HAVE YOU COVERED. NOTHING COMPARES TO A WELL DRESSED 1911...SKINGRIPZ HAS BEEN PRODUCING THE FINEST QUALITY 1911 GRIPS SINCE 2004. EACH SET OF SKINGRIPZ IS COMPLETELY HANDMADE, ONE AT A TIME, BY OUR SMALL SHOP OF CRAFTSMAN. ALL COMPONENTS ARE MADE BY US USING OUR PROPRIETARY MANUFACTURING PROCESS. WE DO NOT USE COMPONENTS MADE BY OTHER MANUFACTURERS IN THE PRODUCTION OF OUR GRIPS. THE END RESULT OF MANUFACTURING THIS WAY IS QUALITY CONTROL SECOND TO NONE.OUR CUSTOMERS LIKE KNOWING THEIR GRIPS HAVE BEEN MADE BY CAREFUL HUMAN HANDS INSTEAD OF A WAREHOUSE OF MACHINES.EVERY SET IS MADE LIKE WE WERE PUTTING THEM ON OUR OWN WEAPONS.***FITMENT***SKINGRIPZ FIT STANDARD 1911's. THEY ARE NOT CUT FOR AMBI SAFETIES THOUGH IT IS VERY EASY FOR THE CUSTOMER TO DO IF NEEDED TO FIT YOUR WEAPON. THE TAURUS PT 1911 AND MOST DOUBLE STACKS (PARA) DO NOT ACCEPT STANDARD CUT GRIPS WITHOUT MINOR MODIFICATION. PLEASE KNOW YOUR WEAPON.", "text": "SkinGripz \"OPERATOR\" 1911 Grips (Full Size-Black) OUR \"OPERATOR\" GRIPZ FEATURE FINGER GROOVES ON BOTH SIDES FOR LEFT AND RIGHT HANDED SHOOTERS. THEY ARE THE MODERN UPGRADE OF A TIMELESS STYLE.\"OPERATOR\" GRIPZ HAVE BEEN TESTED BY MILITARY, LAW ENFORCEMENT, AND PRIVATE SECURITY PERSONNEL AND HAVE BEEN FOUND TO HAVE EXCELLENT WEAPON RETENTION WITH THE DEEP FINGER GROOVES, YET FEEL EXTREMELY COMFORTABLE IN THE HAND.\"OPERATOR\" GRIPZ ARE AVAILABLE IN BOTH FULL SIZE AND COMPACT, SO CHECK OUR OTHER LISTINGS.AT SKINGRIPZ, WE TAKE THE CUSTOMIZATION OF YOUR 1911 PISTOL TO THE NEXT LEVEL WITH OUR AWARD WINNING GRIP DESIGNS. FROM MILD TO WILD, YOU CAN BE SURE WE HAVE YOU COVERED. NOTHING COMPARES TO A WELL DRESSED 1911...SKINGRIPZ HAS BEEN PRODUCING THE FINEST QUALITY 1911 GRIPS SINCE 2004. EACH SET OF SKINGRIPZ IS COMPLETELY HANDMADE, ONE AT A TIME, BY OUR SMALL SHOP OF CRAFTSMAN. ALL COMPONENTS ARE MADE BY US USING OUR PROPRIETARY MANUFACTURING PROCESS. WE DO NOT USE COMPONENTS MADE BY OTHER MANUFACTURERS IN THE PRODUCTION OF OUR GRIPS. THE END RESULT OF MANUFACTURING THIS WAY IS QUALITY CONTROL SECOND TO NONE.OUR CUSTOMERS LIKE KNOWING THEIR GRIPS HAVE BEEN MADE BY CAREFUL HUMAN HANDS INSTEAD OF A WAREHOUSE OF MACHINES.EVERY SET IS MADE LIKE WE WERE PUTTING THEM ON OUR OWN WEAPONS.***FITMENT***SKINGRIPZ FIT STANDARD 1911's. THEY ARE NOT CUT FOR AMBI SAFETIES THOUGH IT IS VERY EASY FOR THE CUSTOMER TO DO IF NEEDED TO FIT YOUR WEAPON. THE TAURUS PT 1911 AND MOST DOUBLE STACKS (PARA) DO NOT ACCEPT STANDARD CUT GRIPS WITHOUT MINOR MODIFICATION. PLEASE KNOW YOUR WEAPON.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51oWozsoVLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JPOUWI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 29.0}}
{"item_id": "B007JPS0GA", "title": "Smith & Wesson Border Guard SWPROM-12-4CP Rescue Kit", "description": "This Smith & Wesson knife features a 7Cr17 High Carbon Stainless Steel Blade, in an Aluminum Handle. The Handle Features a strap/belt cutter, a glass breaker, and a liner blade-lock. A diamond dust sharpening rod is included.", "text": "Smith & Wesson Border Guard SWPROM-12-4CP Rescue Kit This Smith & Wesson knife features a 7Cr17 High Carbon Stainless Steel Blade, in an Aluminum Handle. The Handle Features a strap/belt cutter, a glass breaker, and a liner blade-lock. A diamond dust sharpening rod is included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NU1009KGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JPS0GA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 22.11}}
{"item_id": "B007JTLKCC", "title": "TETON Sports TrailHead +20 Degree F Ultralight Sleeping Bag (2.9 lbs, 87\"x 32\"x 22\", Orange/Grey)", "description": "Innovative PolarLite insulation keeps you warm even though entire bag is thin and light. 87-Inch L x 32-Inch W (at widest point) provides shoulder and leg room while foot box design lets you lie with toes up and still be comfortable. Zipper pullers inside and outside of bag for easy closure. Mummy hood with shoulder baffle and drawstring. Taped, anti-snag zippers and full-length zipper draft tube. Zippered inner pocket for valuables. Weighs 2.9 pound.", "text": "TETON Sports TrailHead +20 Degree F Ultralight Sleeping Bag (2.9 lbs, 87\"x 32\"x 22\", Orange/Grey) Innovative PolarLite insulation keeps you warm even though entire bag is thin and light. 87-Inch L x 32-Inch W (at widest point) provides shoulder and leg room while foot box design lets you lie with toes up and still be comfortable. Zipper pullers inside and outside of bag for easy closure. Mummy hood with shoulder baffle and drawstring. Taped, anti-snag zippers and full-length zipper draft tube. Zippered inner pocket for valuables. Weighs 2.9 pound.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317pOKtoK5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JTLKCC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 60.08}}
{"item_id": "B007JTLT1Y", "title": "TETON Sports Outfitter XXL Quick Tent (82\"x 39\"x 32\", Orange/Yellow)", "description": "Cot-top tent fits snugly on the Outfitter XXL Cot and other over sized cots and locks in place. Easy pop-up assembly and two-finger takedown. Durable coated with taped seams. Spacious mesh walls and clip-on rain fly for privacy and weather protection. Built in zipper guard and guy lines for staking in high winds. Rain fly vestibule keeps water off sleeping area at entry. Ultra light 4.3 pound weight. Well-built, water resistant, and guaranteed. Simply the best cot-top tent available. May also be used directly on ground.", "text": "TETON Sports Outfitter XXL Quick Tent (82\"x 39\"x 32\", Orange/Yellow) Cot-top tent fits snugly on the Outfitter XXL Cot and other over sized cots and locks in place. Easy pop-up assembly and two-finger takedown. Durable coated with taped seams. Spacious mesh walls and clip-on rain fly for privacy and weather protection. Built in zipper guard and guy lines for staking in high winds. Rain fly vestibule keeps water off sleeping area at entry. Ultra light 4.3 pound weight. Well-built, water resistant, and guaranteed. Simply the best cot-top tent available. May also be used directly on ground.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A0WhM5fmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JTLT1Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Teton Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B007JTO4MK", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Utility Knife or Fillet Knife Combo", "description": "This Best Selling, two-knife combo set includes 3.5' Serrated Paring Knife and 6\" Filet knife for all of your hunting and fishing adventures.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Utility Knife or Fillet Knife Combo This Best Selling, two-knife combo set includes 3.5' Serrated Paring Knife and 6\" Filet knife for all of your hunting and fishing adventures.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uXNo3-8eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JTO4MK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 29.29}}
{"item_id": "B007JTO5ZG", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Skinning Knife wih Blade Guard", "description": "4\" Skinning Blade with ergonomic, slip resistant Fibrox handle. Lifetime Warranty. Blade guard to protect and secure.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Skinning Knife wih Blade Guard 4\" Skinning Blade with ergonomic, slip resistant Fibrox handle. Lifetime Warranty. Blade guard to protect and secure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317ifE7z-4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JTO5ZG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 18.78}}
{"item_id": "B007JTO7DQ", "title": "Victorinox Tinker 6 Filet", "description": "This spring, Victorinox Swiss Army has combined their commercial-grade Cutlery and Swiss Army Knives to offer their superior blades within key assortments for Hunting and Fishing. This useful product mix has been designed to suit specific Hunting and Fishing tasks in one convenient package. A mainstay in our Swiss Army Knife collection, the 3 1/2\" Tinker includes all of the implements needed for work or play. The stainless steel blades carry a lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship, and are durable enough to last forever. When separating meat, poultry or fish from the bone, no other tool gives you more precise control than our 6\" Flexible Boning Knife. The blade is constructed of high-carbon stainless steel that retains its sharpness over time and carries a lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. This professional, multi-purpose fillet & boning knife has a 6 inch blade and incorporate Victorinox's patented Fibrox handle which has a textured, slip-resistant grip. This flexible blade fillet knife is ergonomically designed for balance, comfort and ease of use and comes with a protective sheath with a built in blade protector and belt clip.", "text": "Victorinox Tinker 6 Filet This spring, Victorinox Swiss Army has combined their commercial-grade Cutlery and Swiss Army Knives to offer their superior blades within key assortments for Hunting and Fishing. This useful product mix has been designed to suit specific Hunting and Fishing tasks in one convenient package. A mainstay in our Swiss Army Knife collection, the 3 1/2\" Tinker includes all of the implements needed for work or play. The stainless steel blades carry a lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship, and are durable enough to last forever. When separating meat, poultry or fish from the bone, no other tool gives you more precise control than our 6\" Flexible Boning Knife. The blade is constructed of high-carbon stainless steel that retains its sharpness over time and carries a lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. This professional, multi-purpose fillet & boning knife has a 6 inch blade and incorporate Victorinox's patented Fibrox handle which has a textured, slip-resistant grip. This flexible blade fillet knife is ergonomically designed for balance, comfort and ease of use and comes with a protective sheath with a built in blade protector and belt clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tJRUDlbTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JTO7DQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B007JU9K32", "title": "Coleman 22007 7.5W Folding Panel", "description": "Sunforce Coleman 7.5W Folding Panel helps to charge USB or 12 volt devices with the Coleman 7.5 watt folding solar charger. It easily charges smartphones, cell phones, digital cameras, GPS systems and more anywhere and at anytime. This folding solar charger is a portable unit, perfect for traveling, hiking, camping, emergency power solutions and a variety of outdoor activities. It has a lightweight and compact design. Place this unit in a backpack or suit case. The charger can be unfolded to charge an electrical device and fold it up when the device is fully charged. This foldable solar unit provides for ultimate convenience, making it a permanent staple for all traveling and outdoor needs.", "text": "Coleman 22007 7.5W Folding Panel Sunforce Coleman 7.5W Folding Panel helps to charge USB or 12 volt devices with the Coleman 7.5 watt folding solar charger. It easily charges smartphones, cell phones, digital cameras, GPS systems and more anywhere and at anytime. This folding solar charger is a portable unit, perfect for traveling, hiking, camping, emergency power solutions and a variety of outdoor activities. It has a lightweight and compact design. Place this unit in a backpack or suit case. The charger can be unfolded to charge an electrical device and fold it up when the device is fully charged. This foldable solar unit provides for ultimate convenience, making it a permanent staple for all traveling and outdoor needs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oYCgxuX0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JU9K32.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 48.23}}
{"item_id": "B007JXX0CG", "title": "CROSSBOW Unit Issue, NSN is 4240-01-583-5742", "description": "When you try on the Crossbow, you'll discover it's unlike any other ballistic eyeshield. Experience the Tri-Tech FitTM frame that achieves an amazing universal fit with max comfort and zero pressure points. Then notice the lenses. They won't fog. That's thanks to groundbreaking ClearZoneTM FlowCoat technology, engineered to eliminate fog inside and prevent scratches outside. As you stare down your objective through distortion-free ESSOPTICSTM, you'll see just how optically precise vision can be. When you're ready to switch tints, the innovative DedBoltTM Lens Lock pivots up for easy release, then clamps down for rock solid retention under impact. It's from ESS, so of course the Crossbow is compliant with U.S. Federal OSHA, ANSI Z87.1+, CE EN 166 and U.S. MIL-PRF-31013. Form, Fit, Function...Perfected.", "text": "CROSSBOW Unit Issue, NSN is 4240-01-583-5742 When you try on the Crossbow, you'll discover it's unlike any other ballistic eyeshield. Experience the Tri-Tech FitTM frame that achieves an amazing universal fit with max comfort and zero pressure points. Then notice the lenses. They won't fog. That's thanks to groundbreaking ClearZoneTM FlowCoat technology, engineered to eliminate fog inside and prevent scratches outside. As you stare down your objective through distortion-free ESSOPTICSTM, you'll see just how optically precise vision can be. When you're ready to switch tints, the innovative DedBoltTM Lens Lock pivots up for easy release, then clamps down for rock solid retention under impact. It's from ESS, so of course the Crossbow is compliant with U.S. Federal OSHA, ANSI Z87.1+, CE EN 166 and U.S. MIL-PRF-31013. Form, Fit, Function...Perfected.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KkA%2B8gfcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JXX0CG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ESS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 90.0}}
{"item_id": "B007JYUP0A", "title": "Aim Sports AR Front Sight Tower Mount with Double Plates, Small, Black", "description": "AR FRONT SIGHT TOWER MOUNT W/DOUBLE PLATES", "text": "Aim Sports AR Front Sight Tower Mount with Double Plates, Small, Black AR FRONT SIGHT TOWER MOUNT W/DOUBLE PLATES", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ENw2A2GoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007JYUP0A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 19.95}}
