{"item_id": "B007K1FQ3S", "title": "Smith Optics Scope Goggle", "description": "Hidden just below bold graphics and our performance mirrored lenses lies all the technology you'd expect from goggles twice the price.", "text": "Smith Optics Scope Goggle Hidden just below bold graphics and our performance mirrored lenses lies all the technology you'd expect from goggles twice the price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AtEm%2Bmh%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007K1FQ3S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Goggles"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B007K4ZYNC", "title": "United Cutlery GH5027 Hibben Legacy Combat Fighter with Sheath", "description": "Renowned knife maker Gil Hibben has been designing and producing top-quality edged collectibles for more than fifty years. Wesley has been making and designing custom knives for more than 25 years. For the first time ever, Gil and Wes have teamed up to create this priceless collectible. This adult collectible offers a 5 7/8-Inch razor-sharp, 7CR17 stainless steel blade with a sharp, spear-point tip. Polished black micarta handle scales wrap the full-tang blade for a stylish, smooth grip. A raised thumb rest on the back of the blade and a trigger-finger grip allows for excellent control when wielding this knife. Each blade is laser serial-numbered and etched with Gil & Wesley Hibben's signatures for authenticity. Includes a custom leather sheath stamped with the Hibben Knives Custom Design Series logo. This unique collectible should be passed down for many future generations to enjoy.", "text": "United Cutlery GH5027 Hibben Legacy Combat Fighter with Sheath Renowned knife maker Gil Hibben has been designing and producing top-quality edged collectibles for more than fifty years. Wesley has been making and designing custom knives for more than 25 years. For the first time ever, Gil and Wes have teamed up to create this priceless collectible. This adult collectible offers a 5 7/8-Inch razor-sharp, 7CR17 stainless steel blade with a sharp, spear-point tip. Polished black micarta handle scales wrap the full-tang blade for a stylish, smooth grip. A raised thumb rest on the back of the blade and a trigger-finger grip allows for excellent control when wielding this knife. Each blade is laser serial-numbered and etched with Gil & Wesley Hibben's signatures for authenticity. Includes a custom leather sheath stamped with the Hibben Knives Custom Design Series logo. This unique collectible should be passed down for many future generations to enjoy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/219RVBXO47L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007K4ZYNC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 43.06}}
{"item_id": "B007K50H10", "title": "United Cutlery UC2905 M48 Kommando Survival Axe", "description": "The M48 Survival Axe is the perfect companion for hiking and camping. With a 37\" overall length, it's great as a walking staff while camping. A cast 7Cr17 stainless steel blade is razor-sharp and can chop through saplings with ease. A 30% fiberglass handle is nearly indestructible and the axe head is attached to it with three separate metal bolts. Includes a snap-on rubberize blade cover for when not in use for cutting.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2905 M48 Kommando Survival Axe The M48 Survival Axe is the perfect companion for hiking and camping. With a 37\" overall length, it's great as a walking staff while camping. A cast 7Cr17 stainless steel blade is razor-sharp and can chop through saplings with ease. A 30% fiberglass handle is nearly indestructible and the axe head is attached to it with three separate metal bolts. Includes a snap-on rubberize blade cover for when not in use for cutting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/217EEzirBuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007K50H10.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery (UNIGY)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 61.96}}
{"item_id": "B007K63SEC", "title": "Champion Sports Mesh Equipment Bag", "description": "Our mesh bags are made of heavy-duty nylon with drawstring cord, lock and I.D. tag", "text": "Champion Sports Mesh Equipment Bag Our mesh bags are made of heavy-duty nylon with drawstring cord, lock and I.D. tag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41upM6ZJAUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007K63SEC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Accessories", "Equipment Bags"]]}}
