{"item_id": "B007K7IG1G", "title": "Umarex 2252270 Brwning Buck Mark URX", "description": "Browning Buck Mark URX Breakbarrel Single-shot Only 19.8 lbs. cocking effort! Weaver optics rail Fixed front sight Rear sight adjustable for windage and elevation Ambidextrous grip with finger grooves Automatic safety 320 fps/lead pellet, 360 fps/alloy pellet* *The owner's manual and the packaging for the gun show different velocity figures. According to the importer, the figures we show here are correct velocities.... Super all-day plinker...indoors or out360 fps w/alloy pellets, 320 fps w/lead pellets...", "text": "Umarex 2252270 Brwning Buck Mark URX Browning Buck Mark URX Breakbarrel Single-shot Only 19.8 lbs. cocking effort! Weaver optics rail Fixed front sight Rear sight adjustable for windage and elevation Ambidextrous grip with finger grooves Automatic safety 320 fps/lead pellet, 360 fps/alloy pellet* *The owner's manual and the packaging for the gun show different velocity figures. According to the importer, the figures we show here are correct velocities.... Super all-day plinker...indoors or out360 fps w/alloy pellets, 320 fps w/lead pellets...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316o7yGNp2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007K7IG1G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Umarex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B007KA5VWA", "title": "Acczilla Stainless Steel Travel Hike Folding Collapsible 5 Ounce Cup With Key Ring", "description": "This stainless steel folding travel cup by Acczilla has a 150ml capacity which is big enough to quench most any one's thirst with just a few drinks! This cup collapses flat for easy carrying and storage. Each cup is made from high quality, food grade, stainless steel which is great for safe drinking. Perfect for backpacking, camping, tailgating, shopping and much more! Our metal cups are made in a way that when the cup is open the rings fit snugly together making this collapsible steel cup leek-proof! Features a belt loop clasp and individually packed in plain white cardboard box. 1 year warranty against defects.", "text": "Acczilla Stainless Steel Travel Hike Folding Collapsible 5 Ounce Cup With Key Ring This stainless steel folding travel cup by Acczilla has a 150ml capacity which is big enough to quench most any one's thirst with just a few drinks! This cup collapses flat for easy carrying and storage. Each cup is made from high quality, food grade, stainless steel which is great for safe drinking. Perfect for backpacking, camping, tailgating, shopping and much more! Our metal cups are made in a way that when the cup is open the rings fit snugly together making this collapsible steel cup leek-proof! Features a belt loop clasp and individually packed in plain white cardboard box. 1 year warranty against defects.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A-4OnlYQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007KA5VWA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007KAQ2NC", "title": "Ka-Bar Zombie Mule Serrated Edge Folder Knife", "description": "This heavy duty piece of equipment is the folding knife's answer to the traditional KA-BAR fixed blade. Sturdy construction and pure heft ensure this knife will withstand any test you dare put it through. In an ever-changing world, the need for preparedness has never been greater. Without notice the game can change and the rules no longer apply. Questioning your gear at a crucial moment is not an option. Whether setting up camp or securing your perimeter, the Original Zombie knives are designed to perform under the most rigorous, unexpected and apocalyptic situations.", "text": "Ka-Bar Zombie Mule Serrated Edge Folder Knife This heavy duty piece of equipment is the folding knife's answer to the traditional KA-BAR fixed blade. Sturdy construction and pure heft ensure this knife will withstand any test you dare put it through. In an ever-changing world, the need for preparedness has never been greater. Without notice the game can change and the rules no longer apply. Questioning your gear at a crucial moment is not an option. Whether setting up camp or securing your perimeter, the Original Zombie knives are designed to perform under the most rigorous, unexpected and apocalyptic situations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31t1dXs6XsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007KAQ2NC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 44.86}}
