{"item_id": "B007KTPAYK", "title": "Ruger LCR 22 8 Shot Speed Loader", "description": "Why load your revolver one cartridge at a time? With the Ruger LCR 8 Shot Speed Loader Shot Speed Loader, your revolver can be as much fun to load as it is to shoot. When used with an optional loading block, just a simple push of the loader clicks in 8 rounds! Loading is a snap! Give a Speed Beez Speedloader a try and give yourself more shooting satisfaction. Tough and durable, it's ready to survive the abuse of Steel Challenge or just a fun day at the range. Buy your Ruger LCR22 8 shot 22lr Speed Loader today and head to the range and unload!", "text": "Ruger LCR 22 8 Shot Speed Loader Why load your revolver one cartridge at a time? With the Ruger LCR 8 Shot Speed Loader Shot Speed Loader, your revolver can be as much fun to load as it is to shoot. When used with an optional loading block, just a simple push of the loader clicks in 8 rounds! Loading is a snap! Give a Speed Beez Speedloader a try and give yourself more shooting satisfaction. Tough and durable, it's ready to survive the abuse of Steel Challenge or just a fun day at the range. Buy your Ruger LCR22 8 shot 22lr Speed Loader today and head to the range and unload!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EdE16J8EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007KTPAYK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 29.99}}
