{"item_id": "B007LO34HO", "title": "Pinemeadow Men's PGX Golf Set-Driver, 3 Wood, Hybrid, 5-PW Irons (Regular Flex)", "description": "If you are looking for a new set these are the perfect clubs for you. The PGX golf set features a 460cc driver built for accuracy and distance. The set also includes a 3 wood and hybrid. The driver, fairway wood and hybrid all have a white finish for easy visibility during the address position. The oversized wide sole irons were designed for optimal launch and spin. Set includes 3 custom head covers.", "text": "Pinemeadow Men's PGX Golf Set-Driver, 3 Wood, Hybrid, 5-PW Irons (Regular Flex) If you are looking for a new set these are the perfect clubs for you. The PGX golf set features a 460cc driver built for accuracy and distance. The set also includes a 3 wood and hybrid. The driver, fairway wood and hybrid all have a white finish for easy visibility during the address position. The oversized wide sole irons were designed for optimal launch and spin. Set includes 3 custom head covers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OM84dsI8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007LO34HO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pinemeadow Golf", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Clubs", "Complete Sets"]], "price": 174.22}}
{"item_id": "B007LUT4BS", "title": "Hogue Handall Grip Sleeve Hybrid, Ruger LCP CT, Black", "description": "Hugs the contours of your gun better than standard tube style sleeves. Features proportioned finger grooves, cobblestone texture, non-slip surface and ambidextrous palm swells. Installs with no lubrication. Specifications: - Fits: Ruger LCP Crimson Trace", "text": "Hogue Handall Grip Sleeve Hybrid, Ruger LCP CT, Black Hugs the contours of your gun better than standard tube style sleeves. Features proportioned finger grooves, cobblestone texture, non-slip surface and ambidextrous palm swells. Installs with no lubrication. Specifications: - Fits: Ruger LCP Crimson Trace", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41egOBi72fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007LUT4BS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 9.4}}
{"item_id": "B007M0TOK8", "title": "Compact CQB 2.5-10x40mm Scope Red/Green Illumination", "description": "Objective: 40mm Magnification: 2.5x-10x Tube Diameter: 1\" Parallax Setting: 100 Reticle Type: Range Finder Field of View (ft @ 100 yds): 32.0-11.0 Eye Relief (in): 3.3 Exit Pupil (mm): 7.0-3.6 Weight (oz): 15.5 Length (in): 13.50 Battery: CR2032 3V W/E Click Value @ 100 yds 1/4\" Overview Superior multi-coated optics sets the sniper line of scopes apart from the competition without costing you an arm and a leg. Comparable if not the same as the manufacturing process to that of the Japanese and German optics. A hint of yellowish tint can be found on most Chinese optics offered by companies such as NcStar, Aimsports, Leapers, and Barska. Sniper line of scope is crystal clear and full of useful features such as quick windage/elevation locking adjustment plate. Sniper offers not a limited lifetime warranty (as stated, you are limited to conditions in fine prints) but a 100% satisfaction guaranty on the workmanship and against any manufacturer's defect. Rule the game with your new sniper scope. Rule the battle with this 2.5-10x40 close quarter combat tactical scope.", "text": "Compact CQB 2.5-10x40mm Scope Red/Green Illumination Objective: 40mm Magnification: 2.5x-10x Tube Diameter: 1\" Parallax Setting: 100 Reticle Type: Range Finder Field of View (ft @ 100 yds): 32.0-11.0 Eye Relief (in): 3.3 Exit Pupil (mm): 7.0-3.6 Weight (oz): 15.5 Length (in): 13.50 Battery: CR2032 3V W/E Click Value @ 100 yds 1/4\" Overview Superior multi-coated optics sets the sniper line of scopes apart from the competition without costing you an arm and a leg. Comparable if not the same as the manufacturing process to that of the Japanese and German optics. A hint of yellowish tint can be found on most Chinese optics offered by companies such as NcStar, Aimsports, Leapers, and Barska. Sniper line of scope is crystal clear and full of useful features such as quick windage/elevation locking adjustment plate. Sniper offers not a limited lifetime warranty (as stated, you are limited to conditions in fine prints) but a 100% satisfaction guaranty on the workmanship and against any manufacturer's defect. Rule the game with your new sniper scope. Rule the battle with this 2.5-10x40 close quarter combat tactical scope.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BpVYZBvWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007M0TOK8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GRG MFG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 65.42}}
{"item_id": "B007M2KVVW", "title": "Body-Bands Loop Resistance Band", "description": "Body Bands Light Orange 1/4\" Wide Loop Resistance Band. The Light Orange 1/4\" training band is ideal for light resistance exercises or therapy that will improve your flexibility. These are also great Pilates Bands and can be used with P90X and Yoga exercise programs. Body-Bands are an incredible versatile tool for adding resistance to stretching, lifting, and bodyweight training exercises.Body Bands are great for:* Cross Training Programs such as P90X & CrossFit* Pilates and Yoga for Strength and Flexibility* Personal Trainers and Fitness Instructors* Business travelers or anyone on the go* Athletes through any fitness level*A Simple, Fast, and Effective WorkoutAll bands are made of 100% natural latex through a continuous layering process to ensure long life. All bands are 41\" in length and 3/8\" thick. These high quality bands are made from natural rubber latex using a single continuous layering process. This gives each band 11 layers of latex for added strength and performance...much better than molded bands most others sell at this price point.Loop Band Resistance Levels:* 1/4\" | Light Orange | 5 to 15 Pounds of Resistance* 1/2\" | Red | 10 to 35 Pounds of Resistance* 3/4\" | Black | 30 to 50 Pounds of Resistance* 1 1/8\" | Purple | 40 to 80 Pounds of Resistance* 1 3/4\" | Green | 50 to 120 Pounds of Resistance* 2 1/2\" | Blue | 60 to 150 Pounds of Resistance* 3 1/4\" | Orange | 70 to 180 Pounds of Resistance* 4\" | Grey | 80 to 200 Pounds of ResistanceWhy Body-Bands?Body-Bands offers you great high quality products, a 60-Day Money Back Guaranty, and a1-year warranty..", "text": "Body-Bands Loop Resistance Band Body Bands Light Orange 1/4\" Wide Loop Resistance Band. The Light Orange 1/4\" training band is ideal for light resistance exercises or therapy that will improve your flexibility. These are also great Pilates Bands and can be used with P90X and Yoga exercise programs. Body-Bands are an incredible versatile tool for adding resistance to stretching, lifting, and bodyweight training exercises.Body Bands are great for:* Cross Training Programs such as P90X & CrossFit* Pilates and Yoga for Strength and Flexibility* Personal Trainers and Fitness Instructors* Business travelers or anyone on the go* Athletes through any fitness level*A Simple, Fast, and Effective WorkoutAll bands are made of 100% natural latex through a continuous layering process to ensure long life. All bands are 41\" in length and 3/8\" thick. These high quality bands are made from natural rubber latex using a single continuous layering process. This gives each band 11 layers of latex for added strength and performance...much better than molded bands most others sell at this price point.Loop Band Resistance Levels:* 1/4\" | Light Orange | 5 to 15 Pounds of Resistance* 1/2\" | Red | 10 to 35 Pounds of Resistance* 3/4\" | Black | 30 to 50 Pounds of Resistance* 1 1/8\" | Purple | 40 to 80 Pounds of Resistance* 1 3/4\" | Green | 50 to 120 Pounds of Resistance* 2 1/2\" | Blue | 60 to 150 Pounds of Resistance* 3 1/4\" | Orange | 70 to 180 Pounds of Resistance* 4\" | Grey | 80 to 200 Pounds of ResistanceWhy Body-Bands?Body-Bands offers you great high quality products, a 60-Day Money Back Guaranty, and a1-year warranty..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TiQtw5j%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007M2KVVW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007M2S52E", "title": "Body-Bands Pull Up Band Set #2 (Set of 2 Bands)", "description": "Pull Band Set 2 is the best beginner set for Pull Ups for most adults between 120 to 225 lbs. It includes the Purple 1 1/8\" & Green 1 3/4\" Wide Loop Resistance Bands. Loop the Band your pull up bar, tie a knot, put one foot inside the loop, and begin doing assisted pull ups. Once you can do 20 Reps with the Green Band, move to the Purple Band and repeat until you can do unassisted Pull Ups.Body Bands are great for:* Cross Training Programs such as P90X & CrossFit* Pilates and Yoga for Strength and Flexibility* Personal Trainers and Fitness Instructors* Business travelers or anyone on the go* Athletes through any fitness level*A Simple, Fast, and Effective WorkoutAll bands are made of 100% natural latex through a continuous layering process to ensure long life. All bands are 41\" in length and 3/8\" thick. These high quality bands are made from natural rubber latex using a single continuous layering process. This gives each band 11 layers of latex for added strength and performance...much better than molded bands most others sell at this price point.Loop Band Resistance Levels:* 1/4\" | Light Orange | 5 to 15 Pounds of Resistance* 1/2\" | Red | 10 to 35 Pounds of Resistance* 3/4\" | Black | 30 to 50 Pounds of Resistance* 1 1/8\" | Purple | 40 to 80 Pounds of Resistance* 1 3/4\" | Green | 50 to 120 Pounds of Resistance* 2 1/2\" | Blue | 60 to 150 Pounds of Resistance* 3 1/4\" | Orange | 70 to 180 Pounds of Resistance* 4\" | Grey | 80 to 200 Pounds of ResistanceWhy Body-Bands?Body-Bands offers you great high quality products, a 60-Day Money Back Guaranty, and a1-year warranty..", "text": "Body-Bands Pull Up Band Set #2 (Set of 2 Bands) Pull Band Set 2 is the best beginner set for Pull Ups for most adults between 120 to 225 lbs. It includes the Purple 1 1/8\" & Green 1 3/4\" Wide Loop Resistance Bands. Loop the Band your pull up bar, tie a knot, put one foot inside the loop, and begin doing assisted pull ups. Once you can do 20 Reps with the Green Band, move to the Purple Band and repeat until you can do unassisted Pull Ups.Body Bands are great for:* Cross Training Programs such as P90X & CrossFit* Pilates and Yoga for Strength and Flexibility* Personal Trainers and Fitness Instructors* Business travelers or anyone on the go* Athletes through any fitness level*A Simple, Fast, and Effective WorkoutAll bands are made of 100% natural latex through a continuous layering process to ensure long life. All bands are 41\" in length and 3/8\" thick. These high quality bands are made from natural rubber latex using a single continuous layering process. This gives each band 11 layers of latex for added strength and performance...much better than molded bands most others sell at this price point.Loop Band Resistance Levels:* 1/4\" | Light Orange | 5 to 15 Pounds of Resistance* 1/2\" | Red | 10 to 35 Pounds of Resistance* 3/4\" | Black | 30 to 50 Pounds of Resistance* 1 1/8\" | Purple | 40 to 80 Pounds of Resistance* 1 3/4\" | Green | 50 to 120 Pounds of Resistance* 2 1/2\" | Blue | 60 to 150 Pounds of Resistance* 3 1/4\" | Orange | 70 to 180 Pounds of Resistance* 4\" | Grey | 80 to 200 Pounds of ResistanceWhy Body-Bands?Body-Bands offers you great high quality products, a 60-Day Money Back Guaranty, and a1-year warranty..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XcUhHOuQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007M2S52E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 37.95}}
