{"item_id": "B007MC4AP0", "title": "Condor Tools & Knives Village Parang Machete, 12-Inch", "description": "This machete has a 12 inch blade and comes with a leather brown sheath. It has a hardwood handle and a condor classic blade finish.", "text": "Condor Tools & Knives Village Parang Machete, 12-Inch This machete has a 12 inch blade and comes with a leather brown sheath. It has a hardwood handle and a condor classic blade finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317mv8L9lKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007MC4AP0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Tools &amp; Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives"]], "price": 57.34}}
{"item_id": "B007MI13HW", "title": "Ibera Extra Lightweight Alloy Bottle Cage", "description": "The ultra thin and sleek bottle cage is the lightest of Ibera's bottle cages, weighing only 29g, constructed from lightweight heat-treated aluminum alloy. Other bottle cages usually weigh from 40g to 70g. The bottle cage is light, but still has the strength of a regular bottle cage. The oval and ergonomic design helps to strengthen its hold, keeping bottles securely in place while providing easy access for riders. Great for rides around town or for touring. At only 29 grams, it is perfect for those who want a stylish cage to lighten their load as they ride. 2 glossy finishes in a carbon pattern and white and 2 matte finishes in black and silver make it easy to match bikes of all colors. Specifications: Material: Heat-treated aluminum plate. Weight: 29 g (1 oz.). Dimensions: 4.5\" x 3\" x 3.5\". Note: Not for rough or off-road riding.", "text": "Ibera Extra Lightweight Alloy Bottle Cage The ultra thin and sleek bottle cage is the lightest of Ibera's bottle cages, weighing only 29g, constructed from lightweight heat-treated aluminum alloy. Other bottle cages usually weigh from 40g to 70g. The bottle cage is light, but still has the strength of a regular bottle cage. The oval and ergonomic design helps to strengthen its hold, keeping bottles securely in place while providing easy access for riders. Great for rides around town or for touring. At only 29 grams, it is perfect for those who want a stylish cage to lighten their load as they ride. 2 glossy finishes in a carbon pattern and white and 2 matte finishes in black and silver make it easy to match bikes of all colors. Specifications: Material: Heat-treated aluminum plate. Weight: 29 g (1 oz.). Dimensions: 4.5\" x 3\" x 3.5\". Note: Not for rough or off-road riding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AVJ-CDkpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007MI13HW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ibera", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B007MMC44O", "title": "Cobrabraid USA 550 Paracord Survival Adjustable Velcro Bracelet-Large", "description": "550 paracord bracelets were born from the deserts of Iraq and originally brought to the U.S. by our soldiers. Cobrabraid 550 Paracord Gear utilizes paracord produced in the USA by a government contractor. Our paracord has 7 inner woven strands surrounded by a tightly woven sheath and exceeds all standards, with a break strength of 550+ pounds. Paracord is the ultimate survival tool. It can be used as a tie down, tourniquet, animal snare, boot lace, clothes line, fishing line and hundreds of other things Depending on the item, our products contain 4 feet to 100 feet of paracord. If you are found in an emergency situation where you need paracord, simply unwind your Cobrabraid gear", "text": "Cobrabraid USA 550 Paracord Survival Adjustable Velcro Bracelet-Large 550 paracord bracelets were born from the deserts of Iraq and originally brought to the U.S. by our soldiers. Cobrabraid 550 Paracord Gear utilizes paracord produced in the USA by a government contractor. Our paracord has 7 inner woven strands surrounded by a tightly woven sheath and exceeds all standards, with a break strength of 550+ pounds. Paracord is the ultimate survival tool. It can be used as a tie down, tourniquet, animal snare, boot lace, clothes line, fishing line and hundreds of other things Depending on the item, our products contain 4 feet to 100 feet of paracord. If you are found in an emergency situation where you need paracord, simply unwind your Cobrabraid gear", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W-USeg5rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007MMC44O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cobrabraid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Wristbands"]], "price": 5.33}}
{"item_id": "B007MQC6O8", "title": "STICKY HOLSTER XD XDM M&P GLOCK IWB or Pocket (LG-6S)", "description": "Redefining Concealment. Sticky Holsters are self-securing, modular, state of the art in-the-waist band (IWB) and pocket holsters that use the compression of your waistband against your body to secure both holster and weapon. Ambidextrous (left or right) Deploy and adjust in seconds No bulky clips or straps to get in the way Lightweight (less than 3 oz.) 3 Sizes to choose from Closed-end design keeps lint and dust out Keeps gun oil off of you Body heat and use conforms holster to your gun MADE IN THE USA ! Lifetime \"No Questions\" Warranty (covers materials and workmanship) All sizes - $24.95 --------------- LG-6S --------------- Large Framed Automatics up to 4\" barrel WITHOUT LASER Sig Sauer P239, P250C Smith & Wesson M&P; Compacts (up to 4\" barrel) Springfield XD/M Compacts, 9/40 (up to 3.8\" barrel)", "text": "STICKY HOLSTER XD XDM M&P GLOCK IWB or Pocket (LG-6S) Redefining Concealment. Sticky Holsters are self-securing, modular, state of the art in-the-waist band (IWB) and pocket holsters that use the compression of your waistband against your body to secure both holster and weapon. Ambidextrous (left or right) Deploy and adjust in seconds No bulky clips or straps to get in the way Lightweight (less than 3 oz.) 3 Sizes to choose from Closed-end design keeps lint and dust out Keeps gun oil off of you Body heat and use conforms holster to your gun MADE IN THE USA ! Lifetime \"No Questions\" Warranty (covers materials and workmanship) All sizes - $24.95 --------------- LG-6S --------------- Large Framed Automatics up to 4\" barrel WITHOUT LASER Sig Sauer P239, P250C Smith & Wesson M&P; Compacts (up to 4\" barrel) Springfield XD/M Compacts, 9/40 (up to 3.8\" barrel)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4106qWw1mmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007MQC6O8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sticky Holsters", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.95}}
