{"item_id": "B007MXM6NC", "title": "Smith & Wesson Bodyguard 380 Extra Long 1.25\" GARRISON Grip Extension", "description": "Finally, a 1.25\" Extra Long (XL) grip extension that fits the large and extra large hand. Now all of your fingers can fit on the handle of your firearm. Our grip extensions are made from quality materials and expertly manufactured to create improved Comfort, Control and Accuracy. This product DOES NOT increase magazine capacity. If you are not satisfied for any reason, just send the extension back for a full refund.", "text": "Smith & Wesson Bodyguard 380 Extra Long 1.25\" GARRISON Grip Extension Finally, a 1.25\" Extra Long (XL) grip extension that fits the large and extra large hand. Now all of your fingers can fit on the handle of your firearm. Our grip extensions are made from quality materials and expertly manufactured to create improved Comfort, Control and Accuracy. This product DOES NOT increase magazine capacity. If you are not satisfied for any reason, just send the extension back for a full refund.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ew-oHNKtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007MXM6NC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B007N5YRY0", "title": "eGear Survival Essentials Floating Whistle/Mirror Combo", "description": "26-019-143 (blister) • Combination of two essential survival items: signaling mirror and whistle • Highly visible orange float minimizes chance of loss in water • Lightweight • Break-away lanyard attached", "text": "eGear Survival Essentials Floating Whistle/Mirror Combo 26-019-143 (blister) • Combination of two essential survival items: signaling mirror and whistle • Highly visible orange float minimizes chance of loss in water • Lightweight • Break-away lanyard attached", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z6SvhZ-zL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007N5YRY0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "eGear Survival Essentials", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 2.49}}
{"item_id": "B007N5ZULO", "title": "Plano 2-3700 Prolatch Stowaway (four pack)", "description": "The 2-3700 is one of our most popular size stowaways. It is great for organizational tool for tackle or any small items. The clear lid allows you to see what is inside. This one is a 4 pack.", "text": "Plano 2-3700 Prolatch Stowaway (four pack) The 2-3700 is one of our most popular size stowaways. It is great for organizational tool for tackle or any small items. The clear lid allows you to see what is inside. This one is a 4 pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417%2BgsQi1oL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007N5ZULO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Tackle Storage", "Tackle Boxes & Trays", "Tackle Boxes"]], "price": 38.59}}
{"item_id": "B007N61MK6", "title": "3-in-1 Universal Emergency Survival Hatchet Hammer Pry Bar Utility Tool", "description": "This unique multi-tool features a hatchet, hammer, and pry bar. It is one solid single piece of steel, making it extra durable. The long padded handle provides a comfortable, effective grip.As this tool is so versatile, it is great for any situation. Handy to have around the home, garage, boat, camping, even in your car for emergencies. It is compact and lightweight enough that you could take it with you backpacking.While its rough edges may not be pretty, this tool is sturdy and will get the job done. No emergency kit is complete without this tool!", "text": "3-in-1 Universal Emergency Survival Hatchet Hammer Pry Bar Utility Tool This unique multi-tool features a hatchet, hammer, and pry bar. It is one solid single piece of steel, making it extra durable. The long padded handle provides a comfortable, effective grip.As this tool is so versatile, it is great for any situation. Handy to have around the home, garage, boat, camping, even in your car for emergencies. It is compact and lightweight enough that you could take it with you backpacking.While its rough edges may not be pretty, this tool is sturdy and will get the job done. No emergency kit is complete without this tool!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310iMmsdEQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007N61MK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ASR Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 3.73}}
