{"item_id": "B007NBZ3AQ", "title": "Ibera Lightweight Alloy Water Bottle Cage", "description": "Ibera's BC10 has an extra strength oval design constructed from heat-treated aluminum alloy. At only 30g (1.1 oz.), it is a lightweight bottle cage that is strong and high in quality (bottle cages usually weigh 40-70g). Water bottles are held firmly in place for rides around town or for touring and the ergonomic side-access design allows for easy access hydration. Great for bicycles with compact frames.2 glossy finishes in a carbon pattern and white and 2 matte finishes in black and silver make it easy to match bikes of all colors. Fits most standard-sized bottles.SpecificationsMaterial:Heat-treated aluminum plateWeight:30 g (1.1 oz.)Dimensions:4.5\" x 3\" x 3.5\".", "text": "Ibera Lightweight Alloy Water Bottle Cage Ibera's BC10 has an extra strength oval design constructed from heat-treated aluminum alloy. At only 30g (1.1 oz.), it is a lightweight bottle cage that is strong and high in quality (bottle cages usually weigh 40-70g). Water bottles are held firmly in place for rides around town or for touring and the ergonomic side-access design allows for easy access hydration. Great for bicycles with compact frames.2 glossy finishes in a carbon pattern and white and 2 matte finishes in black and silver make it easy to match bikes of all colors. Fits most standard-sized bottles.SpecificationsMaterial:Heat-treated aluminum plateWeight:30 g (1.1 oz.)Dimensions:4.5\" x 3\" x 3.5\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EahmLpJhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007NBZ3AQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ibera", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 8.99}}
