{"item_id": "B007NDKP2U", "title": "The Friendly Swede Paracord Survival Bracelets Bundle - Lifetime Warranty", "description": "CONTENTS - In The Friendly Swede Retail Packaging:Branded premium paracord survival bracelets bundle as shown on main imageSUITABLE FOR:8-inch bracelet fits 6-7 inch wrists9-inch bracelet fits 7-8 inch wristsCircumference needs to be approx 1 inch larger than your wrist for a good fitINTENDED USE:Bracelets can be completely disassembled in one minuteTHE FRIENDLY SWEDE - Survival Bracelet Paracord Series specifications:7/8\" Branded side release buckle with 4-cord attachment. 4-strand bracelet coreCord: 7 inner yarns* and a true** rated maximum load of 350lb (159kg)Untied cord of 8\" bracelet measures 11.8 feet (3.6 meters)Untied cord of 9\" bracelet measures 13.1 feet (4.0 meters)Assembled by hand. Specifications and quality guaranteed** Note(2): 350 lb is the true rated load. Bracelets similar/inferior to these are commonly/incorrectly marketed as \"Type III 550 spec\". The Friendly Swede gives you what is described. Cord may still carry >550lb but 350lb is the guaranteed rated load.THE FRIENDLY SWEDE - Selected Accessories:If for any reason not happy with any product supplied by The Friendly Swede, please contact us and we will get back to you within 24 hours and do our best to solve your problem. At The Friendly Swede we take full ownership and responsibility for the quality of our products. The Friendly Swede - USPTO serial: 85494642, 85511082, 85521942 - is a registered trademark protected by US Trademark Law. All products by The Friendly Swede are exclusively manufactured by The Friendly Swede", "text": "The Friendly Swede Paracord Survival Bracelets Bundle - Lifetime Warranty CONTENTS - In The Friendly Swede Retail Packaging:Branded premium paracord survival bracelets bundle as shown on main imageSUITABLE FOR:8-inch bracelet fits 6-7 inch wrists9-inch bracelet fits 7-8 inch wristsCircumference needs to be approx 1 inch larger than your wrist for a good fitINTENDED USE:Bracelets can be completely disassembled in one minuteTHE FRIENDLY SWEDE - Survival Bracelet Paracord Series specifications:7/8\" Branded side release buckle with 4-cord attachment. 4-strand bracelet coreCord: 7 inner yarns* and a true** rated maximum load of 350lb (159kg)Untied cord of 8\" bracelet measures 11.8 feet (3.6 meters)Untied cord of 9\" bracelet measures 13.1 feet (4.0 meters)Assembled by hand. Specifications and quality guaranteed** Note(2): 350 lb is the true rated load. Bracelets similar/inferior to these are commonly/incorrectly marketed as \"Type III 550 spec\". The Friendly Swede gives you what is described. Cord may still carry >550lb but 350lb is the guaranteed rated load.THE FRIENDLY SWEDE - Selected Accessories:If for any reason not happy with any product supplied by The Friendly Swede, please contact us and we will get back to you within 24 hours and do our best to solve your problem. At The Friendly Swede we take full ownership and responsibility for the quality of our products. The Friendly Swede - USPTO serial: 85494642, 85511082, 85521942 - is a registered trademark protected by US Trademark Law. All products by The Friendly Swede are exclusively manufactured by The Friendly Swede", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IdCg4zJQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007NDKP2U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
