{"item_id": "B007OC8W8O", "title": "Brunton Brunton O.S.S. 10B Tool-Free", "description": "Drawing upon the legacy of our classic base plate compass, the 10B is the jumping off point for all compass users.", "text": "Brunton Brunton O.S.S. 10B Tool-Free Drawing upon the legacy of our classic base plate compass, the 10B is the jumping off point for all compass users.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jbMo8v%2BnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OC8W8O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brunton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 10.0}}
{"item_id": "B007OCGNF8", "title": "Fury Sure Thrower Set of 3 Carbon Steel Throwing Knives, 6.5-Inch", "description": "The Fury Sure Thrower 6.5-Inch Carbon Steel Throwing Knives, Set of 3 Cord Wrapped with Tactical Nylon Case is manufactured by Joy Enterprises the owners of Fury, Fury Tactical and Mustang products and the importer of Muela of Spain. With production in the USA, Europe and Asia, Joy has been providing high-quality, valued priced products since 1941. Many of our products are proprietary designs (often copied) and others inspired by classic survival/defensive tools and edged weapons. Joy is proud to offer a limited lifetime warranty on all products. Enjoy and be careful.", "text": "Fury Sure Thrower Set of 3 Carbon Steel Throwing Knives, 6.5-Inch The Fury Sure Thrower 6.5-Inch Carbon Steel Throwing Knives, Set of 3 Cord Wrapped with Tactical Nylon Case is manufactured by Joy Enterprises the owners of Fury, Fury Tactical and Mustang products and the importer of Muela of Spain. With production in the USA, Europe and Asia, Joy has been providing high-quality, valued priced products since 1941. Many of our products are proprietary designs (often copied) and others inspired by classic survival/defensive tools and edged weapons. Joy is proud to offer a limited lifetime warranty on all products. Enjoy and be careful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W7Ly5Ms5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OCGNF8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fury Martial Arts", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B007OGALQ6", "title": "UTG Model 4 Extended Tactical Charging Handle Latch, Black", "description": "UTG Extended Tactical Charging Handle Latch–Practical & Ergonomic Design for Most Efficient Speed-charge While Maintaining Firing Grip Position, Robust Steel Construction, Black Matte Finish, Fits All Standard AR15 Charging Handles,No Gunsmithing Required", "text": "UTG Model 4 Extended Tactical Charging Handle Latch, Black UTG Extended Tactical Charging Handle Latch–Practical & Ergonomic Design for Most Efficient Speed-charge While Maintaining Firing Grip Position, Robust Steel Construction, Black Matte Finish, Fits All Standard AR15 Charging Handles,No Gunsmithing Required", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31l4zLgEQlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OGALQ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 9.5}}
{"item_id": "B007OJKI2U", "title": "Olicamp Hard Anodized XTS Pot (1-Litre)", "description": "Our XTS pot can reduce boil times by as much as 40% thanks to the heat transfer system on the bottom of the pot. More surface area capturing the heat from your stove boils water faster. Saves time and fuel. Silicon covered pot handles and lid. Graduations stamped into pot. Fuel canisters nest inside with your Olicamp stove for saving space in your pack and helps protect your stove from damage along the trail.", "text": "Olicamp Hard Anodized XTS Pot (1-Litre) Our XTS pot can reduce boil times by as much as 40% thanks to the heat transfer system on the bottom of the pot. More surface area capturing the heat from your stove boils water faster. Saves time and fuel. Silicon covered pot handles and lid. Graduations stamped into pot. Fuel canisters nest inside with your Olicamp stove for saving space in your pack and helps protect your stove from damage along the trail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413Njb6gUpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OJKI2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Olicamp", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]], "price": 27.56}}
{"item_id": "B007OJW7QU", "title": "Coleman 4-Person Evanston Tent with Screened Porch Canopy 9 Ft x 7 Ft Fits Queen Bed", "description": "Great for backpacking - Sleeps 4, room to move - Fits 1 Queen airbed - Waterproof floor - Strong Frame - Easy Setup", "text": "Coleman 4-Person Evanston Tent with Screened Porch Canopy 9 Ft x 7 Ft Fits Queen Bed Great for backpacking - Sleeps 4, room to move - Fits 1 Queen airbed - Waterproof floor - Strong Frame - Easy Setup", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415LmeiD7XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OJW7QU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 94.99}}
{"item_id": "B007OQALWK", "title": "Emergency Zone Personal Water Filter Straw (Pack of 2)", "description": "With a blend of microscopic carbon, binder and particles, the filter will remove more than 99.9 percent of cryptosporidium and Giardia, and even improves the taste of the water. Easy to operate, simply attach the straw to the filter unit, place the filter in the water source and dring through the straw. Note although the filter does reduce bacteria and viruses, it is not certified to remove more than 99.99 percent required by the US EPA water purifier standard. for maximum protection, use in conjunction with water treatment drops or tablets.", "text": "Emergency Zone Personal Water Filter Straw (Pack of 2) With a blend of microscopic carbon, binder and particles, the filter will remove more than 99.9 percent of cryptosporidium and Giardia, and even improves the taste of the water. Easy to operate, simply attach the straw to the filter unit, place the filter in the water source and dring through the straw. Note although the filter does reduce bacteria and viruses, it is not certified to remove more than 99.99 percent required by the US EPA water purifier standard. for maximum protection, use in conjunction with water treatment drops or tablets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HQ40EtmlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OQALWK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B007OQR2WM", "title": "2 Pack Smith & Wesson Bodyguard 380 Extra Long 1.25\" GARRISON Grip Extension", "description": "Finally, a 1.25\" Extra Long (XL) grip extension that fits the large and extra large hand. Now all of your fingers can fit on the handle of your firearm. Our grip extensions are made from quality materials and expertly manufactured to create improved Comfort, Control and Accuracy. This product DOES NOT increase magazine capacity. If you are not satisfied for any reason, just send the extension back for a full refund.", "text": "2 Pack Smith & Wesson Bodyguard 380 Extra Long 1.25\" GARRISON Grip Extension Finally, a 1.25\" Extra Long (XL) grip extension that fits the large and extra large hand. Now all of your fingers can fit on the handle of your firearm. Our grip extensions are made from quality materials and expertly manufactured to create improved Comfort, Control and Accuracy. This product DOES NOT increase magazine capacity. If you are not satisfied for any reason, just send the extension back for a full refund.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rxqD6dihL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OQR2WM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007OU4DJ8", "title": "Blackhawk Sportster Standard Holster with Belt Loop and Right Paddle with Matte Finish (Glock 17/22/31)", "description": "The Sportster Standard Holster features a pressure adjustable detent retention system that allows the shooter to customize the amount of retention on the handgun. This innovative system grabs onto the pistol’s trigger guard and holds tight.", "text": "Blackhawk Sportster Standard Holster with Belt Loop and Right Paddle with Matte Finish (Glock 17/22/31) The Sportster Standard Holster features a pressure adjustable detent retention system that allows the shooter to customize the amount of retention on the handgun. This innovative system grabs onto the pistol’s trigger guard and holds tight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jVf3I76PL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OU4DJ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 18.07}}
{"item_id": "B007OWOKD0", "title": "Compact Tactical 150 Lumen LED Flashlight For SubCompact and Compact Pistols Fits Beretta PX4 M9A1 Glock 19 23 25 SR9 XD Compact Taurus 24/7 SIG P250 S&W SW99", "description": "SUPER BRIGHT COMPACT/SUBCOMPACT PISTOL FLASHLIGHT 150 LUMEN LED LED CREE T5 BULB THIS IS THE BRIGHTEST AND SMALLEST ONE BATTERY WEAPON LIGHT MADE !!! 150 Lumen TRUE Output LED WEAPON LIGHT USED BY SEVERAL POLICE DEPARTMENTS HEAVY DUTY CONSTRUCTION SUPER TOUGH!! MADE OF 6061 AIRCRAFT GRADE ALUMINUM PUSH BUTTON ON SWITCH • Quick Detach System Easy to take On And Off The Gun But Holds Secure • Fits Weaver / Picatinny Rails Rail length needed .89 of an inch • Length: 2.5 Inches • Width: 1 Inches • Height: 1.6 Inches Fits all Weaver/Picatinny Rails All Rifles and Shotgun's Too !! • Can Be Mounted On Shotguns/Rifles mount may be needed • Operating Voltage: 3V DC • Operation Current: <300mA • • One year Warranty • Battery type - 1 CR2 Lithium SUPER FAST SHIPPING!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "text": "Compact Tactical 150 Lumen LED Flashlight For SubCompact and Compact Pistols Fits Beretta PX4 M9A1 Glock 19 23 25 SR9 XD Compact Taurus 24/7 SIG P250 S&W SW99 SUPER BRIGHT COMPACT/SUBCOMPACT PISTOL FLASHLIGHT 150 LUMEN LED LED CREE T5 BULB THIS IS THE BRIGHTEST AND SMALLEST ONE BATTERY WEAPON LIGHT MADE !!! 150 Lumen TRUE Output LED WEAPON LIGHT USED BY SEVERAL POLICE DEPARTMENTS HEAVY DUTY CONSTRUCTION SUPER TOUGH!! MADE OF 6061 AIRCRAFT GRADE ALUMINUM PUSH BUTTON ON SWITCH • Quick Detach System Easy to take On And Off The Gun But Holds Secure • Fits Weaver / Picatinny Rails Rail length needed .89 of an inch • Length: 2.5 Inches • Width: 1 Inches • Height: 1.6 Inches Fits all Weaver/Picatinny Rails All Rifles and Shotgun's Too !! • Can Be Mounted On Shotguns/Rifles mount may be needed • Operating Voltage: 3V DC • Operation Current: <300mA • • One year Warranty • Battery type - 1 CR2 Lithium SUPER FAST SHIPPING!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4