{"item_id": "B007OZE7GW", "title": "NcStar AR-15 A1/A2 Front Sight Combo Tool (TARFSCT)", "description": "The NcSTAR Front Sight Tool is Designed for Use on AR15/M16 A2, A1, and M4 Profile Front Sights. 4-Prongs on One End for A2 and M4 Style Front Sights and 5-Prong on the Other for A1 Style Front Sights. Front Sight Combo Tool Simplifies Adjustment for Elevation on AR15/M16 Front Sight. High Quality Steel Construction.", "text": "NcStar AR-15 A1/A2 Front Sight Combo Tool (TARFSCT) The NcSTAR Front Sight Tool is Designed for Use on AR15/M16 A2, A1, and M4 Profile Front Sights. 4-Prongs on One End for A2 and M4 Style Front Sights and 5-Prong on the Other for A1 Style Front Sights. Front Sight Combo Tool Simplifies Adjustment for Elevation on AR15/M16 Front Sight. High Quality Steel Construction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PDPglrBBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OZE7GW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 6.89}}
{"item_id": "B007OZGYCC", "title": "VISM by NcStar Tactical Apron", "description": "The Gunsmith Apron is a doubled layered apron that helps protect the user’s clothing from getting soiled by oil/grease/dirt. The front of the apron is Constructed from Heavy Duty PVC Fabric for durability, and the inside material is made from a lighter and smoother PVC fabric for comfort.", "text": "VISM by NcStar Tactical Apron The Gunsmith Apron is a doubled layered apron that helps protect the user’s clothing from getting soiled by oil/grease/dirt. The front of the apron is Constructed from Heavy Duty PVC Fabric for durability, and the inside material is made from a lighter and smoother PVC fabric for comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dNTEUiTLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OZGYCC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Protective Body Equipment"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B007OZHIZO", "title": "VISM by NcStar Folding Dump Pouch", "description": "The New VISM Folding Dump Pouch allows you to quickly store your Shooting Gear into a convenient pouch when you need it. The Dump Pouch folds flat into a compact size when not in use. Size Folded: 5”L X 5”H X 1¼”W. This unit unfolds into a large pouch, able to hold 7 AR or AK 30 round magazines. Size Opened: 7½”L X 8½”H X 3½”W. A Large Adjustable Elastic Draw Cord Opening allows easy access into the pouch. With the Elastic Draw Cord pulled in it helps secure the contents into the pouch. Velcro Flap to secure contents inside the pouch. A 2nd Elastic Draw Cord to secure the Velcro Flap out of the way of the Opening for easy access into the pouch. The Dump Pouch has two PAL Straps on the back side to secure onto MOLLE Compatible Gear. Drain Grommet located on the bottom of the Dump Pouch. Constructed with Heavy Duty PVC Fabric.", "text": "VISM by NcStar Folding Dump Pouch The New VISM Folding Dump Pouch allows you to quickly store your Shooting Gear into a convenient pouch when you need it. The Dump Pouch folds flat into a compact size when not in use. Size Folded: 5”L X 5”H X 1¼”W. This unit unfolds into a large pouch, able to hold 7 AR or AK 30 round magazines. Size Opened: 7½”L X 8½”H X 3½”W. A Large Adjustable Elastic Draw Cord Opening allows easy access into the pouch. With the Elastic Draw Cord pulled in it helps secure the contents into the pouch. Velcro Flap to secure contents inside the pouch. A 2nd Elastic Draw Cord to secure the Velcro Flap out of the way of the Opening for easy access into the pouch. The Dump Pouch has two PAL Straps on the back side to secure onto MOLLE Compatible Gear. Drain Grommet located on the bottom of the Dump Pouch. Constructed with Heavy Duty PVC Fabric.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BA7xJd8pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OZHIZO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 8.98}}
{"item_id": "B007OZZWV6", "title": "VISM by NcStar Tactical Shotshell Carrier", "description": "The Shot Shell Pouch has Elastic Loops to hold a total of 17 Shot Shells. There are 2 rows of 6 Elastic loops inside the Pouch and a single row of 5 Elastic Loops of the front Flap of the Pouch. This unit is MOLLE Compatible and has three PALS straps located on the back panel for securing the pouch onto the MOLLE webbing. The Flap is secured to the front of the pouch with Heavy Duty Velcro. The Flap can also be secured onto itself, using the extra strip of Loop Velcro sewn onto the inside of the Flap. This will give the shooter an open and easy access to the Shot Shells inside the Pouch. There are also two each 2 1/4\" Blet Loops on the backside of teh pouch for securing it onto a belt. All edge seams are double stitched and re-enforced with web material.", "text": "VISM by NcStar Tactical Shotshell Carrier The Shot Shell Pouch has Elastic Loops to hold a total of 17 Shot Shells. There are 2 rows of 6 Elastic loops inside the Pouch and a single row of 5 Elastic Loops of the front Flap of the Pouch. This unit is MOLLE Compatible and has three PALS straps located on the back panel for securing the pouch onto the MOLLE webbing. The Flap is secured to the front of the pouch with Heavy Duty Velcro. The Flap can also be secured onto itself, using the extra strip of Loop Velcro sewn onto the inside of the Flap. This will give the shooter an open and easy access to the Shot Shells inside the Pouch. There are also two each 2 1/4\" Blet Loops on the backside of teh pouch for securing it onto a belt. All edge seams are double stitched and re-enforced with web material.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510q1yQPWaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007OZZWV6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 11.99}}
