{"item_id": "B007PAJOGE", "title": "Hogue AK-47 Overmolded Forend Rubber Grip Area, Black", "description": "This 2-Piece OverMolded Handguard for the AK-47 or AK-74 is made from rubber-covered fiberglass which offers the ultimate combination of comfort and durability. Modular design includes both railed and smooth top cover as well as 3 short sections of picatinny rail that can be attached to the sides and bottom of the lower portion for accessories. Complete set allows a truly customizable handguard Specifications: - Fits: AK-47/AK-74 Standard Chinese and Russian - Color: Black", "text": "Hogue AK-47 Overmolded Forend Rubber Grip Area, Black This 2-Piece OverMolded Handguard for the AK-47 or AK-74 is made from rubber-covered fiberglass which offers the ultimate combination of comfort and durability. Modular design includes both railed and smooth top cover as well as 3 short sections of picatinny rail that can be attached to the sides and bottom of the lower portion for accessories. Complete set allows a truly customizable handguard Specifications: - Fits: AK-47/AK-74 Standard Chinese and Russian - Color: Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TOeYtaz%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PAJOGE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 51.89}}
{"item_id": "B007PALJ5S", "title": "Hogue Ruger 22/45 RP Grip w/Finger Grooves, Black", "description": "Hogue Wraparound Rubber Grips are the perfect choice for the shooter that is looking for a sleek grip that is both attractive as well as functional. This grip is manufactured from a soft durable rubber and features a lightweight, synthetic skeleton insert that makes up the rigid interior of the grip. The synthetic insert is chemically bonded to the exterior rubber grip insuring that the grip won't delaminate or come apart. Lots of grips have irritating medallions or funky features that can feel uncomfortable during use, the cobblestone (stippled) surface of this grip replaces traditional checkering and allows for good grip control. The material is solvent and oil resistant which means it will not deteriorate or dissolve due to cleaning your firearm. Specifications: - Fits: Ruger 22/45 RP with Finger Grooves - Color: Black These Hogue rubber grip panels for a Ruger Mark III 22/45 feature molded in double diamond checkering for reliable grip in any shooting situation. The rubber overmold can stand up to any abuse for years of reliable service. Specifications: - Fits: Ruger 22/45 RP Checkered W/Diamonds - Color: Black", "text": "Hogue Ruger 22/45 RP Grip w/Finger Grooves, Black Hogue Wraparound Rubber Grips are the perfect choice for the shooter that is looking for a sleek grip that is both attractive as well as functional. This grip is manufactured from a soft durable rubber and features a lightweight, synthetic skeleton insert that makes up the rigid interior of the grip. The synthetic insert is chemically bonded to the exterior rubber grip insuring that the grip won't delaminate or come apart. Lots of grips have irritating medallions or funky features that can feel uncomfortable during use, the cobblestone (stippled) surface of this grip replaces traditional checkering and allows for good grip control. The material is solvent and oil resistant which means it will not deteriorate or dissolve due to cleaning your firearm. Specifications: - Fits: Ruger 22/45 RP with Finger Grooves - Color: Black These Hogue rubber grip panels for a Ruger Mark III 22/45 feature molded in double diamond checkering for reliable grip in any shooting situation. The rubber overmold can stand up to any abuse for years of reliable service. Specifications: - Fits: Ruger 22/45 RP Checkered W/Diamonds - Color: Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K6SeweSKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PALJ5S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 17.47}}
{"item_id": "B007PAP4WM", "title": "Basecamp by Mr. Heater Aquacube Digital Shower (Blk/Silver)", "description": "The Aquacube Series III is the most advanced portable hot water generator in the world. This great new product is both DIGITAL and CORDLESS. just dial in the output temperature and watch it deliver. All you need is a water source, a 1 -Pounds propane cylinder and a fully charged unit and you have hot water at your fingertips in even the most remote places. Features push button controls - on or off, showerhead or tap and water pump. LCD display showing - flame ignition, battery power, water mode and both water inlet and outlet temperatures. Built in rechargeable battery runs without the need for an external power source. With a built in gas regulator , uses a disposable 1 -Pounds propane cylinder which is enough gas for continuous operation on full power for over 40 minutes. Enough gas for 8 x 5 minute showers from one convenient and space saving cartridge. NOTE: Due to the manufactures function and quality testing procedures, there is a possibility for trace amounts of residual water to be left in the inlet/outlet tubing lines of the Acqucube. The residual water should not effect the function or components of the unit.", "text": "Basecamp by Mr. Heater Aquacube Digital Shower (Blk/Silver) The Aquacube Series III is the most advanced portable hot water generator in the world. This great new product is both DIGITAL and CORDLESS. just dial in the output temperature and watch it deliver. All you need is a water source, a 1 -Pounds propane cylinder and a fully charged unit and you have hot water at your fingertips in even the most remote places. Features push button controls - on or off, showerhead or tap and water pump. LCD display showing - flame ignition, battery power, water mode and both water inlet and outlet temperatures. Built in rechargeable battery runs without the need for an external power source. With a built in gas regulator , uses a disposable 1 -Pounds propane cylinder which is enough gas for continuous operation on full power for over 40 minutes. Enough gas for 8 x 5 minute showers from one convenient and space saving cartridge. NOTE: Due to the manufactures function and quality testing procedures, there is a possibility for trace amounts of residual water to be left in the inlet/outlet tubing lines of the Acqucube. The residual water should not effect the function or components of the unit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417S0wJdMwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PAP4WM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BaseCamp", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 328.93}}
{"item_id": "B007PAP7OC", "title": "Basecamp by Mr. Heater Tent Fan with LED Light (Black/Red)", "description": "The Basecamp tent fan is perfect for keeping the air moving inside your tent. It will keep you cooler in the summer and help eliminate condensation during the colder months. This fan also features a battery operated light that will certainly be a benefit when moving around in the tent at dark.", "text": "Basecamp by Mr. Heater Tent Fan with LED Light (Black/Red) The Basecamp tent fan is perfect for keeping the air moving inside your tent. It will keep you cooler in the summer and help eliminate condensation during the colder months. This fan also features a battery operated light that will certainly be a benefit when moving around in the tent at dark.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41D5lGtWWXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PAP7OC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007PEL05S", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Classis SD Animal Prints Multi Tool", "description": "From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army knife a century ago comes the Animal Print Swiss Army pocketknife, a compact multi-tool for campers, hikers, boy scouts, and just about everyone else. Measuring a mere 2.3-Inch long, this version of the Classic is stylishly cased in a uniquely patterned housing with the familiar Victorinox logo on the side. The pattern is covered with a top lacquer that protects the imprint against scratches while standing up to the neighboring keys in your pocket. The design is perfect for users who want to add a little style to their functionality. More importantly, the unit contains several stainless Swiss Army tools, including a small cutting blade, a nail file with a screwdriver, a pair of mini scissors, a plastic toothpick, metal tweezers, and a key ring for transport. As with all Victorinox items, the Classic is made to exacting standards, with dozens of steps going into its construction. Victorinox attends to every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. The Classic Pink Camo knife measures 2.3 by 0.35 by 0.71 (W x H x D), weighs 0.77-Ounce, and carries a lifetime warranty.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Classis SD Animal Prints Multi Tool From the renowned company that created the Swiss Army knife a century ago comes the Animal Print Swiss Army pocketknife, a compact multi-tool for campers, hikers, boy scouts, and just about everyone else. Measuring a mere 2.3-Inch long, this version of the Classic is stylishly cased in a uniquely patterned housing with the familiar Victorinox logo on the side. The pattern is covered with a top lacquer that protects the imprint against scratches while standing up to the neighboring keys in your pocket. The design is perfect for users who want to add a little style to their functionality. More importantly, the unit contains several stainless Swiss Army tools, including a small cutting blade, a nail file with a screwdriver, a pair of mini scissors, a plastic toothpick, metal tweezers, and a key ring for transport. As with all Victorinox items, the Classic is made to exacting standards, with dozens of steps going into its construction. Victorinox attends to every detail, from selecting the finest materials to performing the final inspection. In addition, each individual tool has been hardened in a different way to stand up to its designated use. The Classic Pink Camo knife measures 2.3 by 0.35 by 0.71 (W x H x D), weighs 0.77-Ounce, and carries a lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rDGMZVq3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PEL05S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 16.86}}
{"item_id": "B007PERIHW", "title": "Nikon P-Series Mount", "description": "Nikon AR MountsThe importance and benefits of matching the right optic to your AR has been discussed many times before, but just as important is the mount that you use to attach it. AR platform rifles are much different in basic design than your typical bolt action rifle. The comb height of the stock, the eye relief allowed by stock length, the necessary access to the charging handle, typical shooting distances and other characteristics must be considered when choosing the mount.Nikon has a full range of AR scope mounts that offer shooters exactly what they need for a particular optic and for their particular AR. All built of strong, lightweight alloy, the mounts securely attach your preferred optic to your AR platform’s Picattiny rail.", "text": "Nikon P-Series Mount Nikon AR MountsThe importance and benefits of matching the right optic to your AR has been discussed many times before, but just as important is the mount that you use to attach it. AR platform rifles are much different in basic design than your typical bolt action rifle. The comb height of the stock, the eye relief allowed by stock length, the necessary access to the charging handle, typical shooting distances and other characteristics must be considered when choosing the mount.Nikon has a full range of AR scope mounts that offer shooters exactly what they need for a particular optic and for their particular AR. All built of strong, lightweight alloy, the mounts securely attach your preferred optic to your AR platform’s Picattiny rail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aS1rSH23L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PERIHW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
