{"item_id": "B007PKBAH0", "title": "Shoreline Marine Kayak Paddle Leash", "description": "Bungee Paddle Leash easily secures your paddle to your kayak. Helps prevent paddle loss and does not inhibit paddling. Attaches to any eye strap using snap. Built in quick release buckle.", "text": "Shoreline Marine Kayak Paddle Leash Bungee Paddle Leash easily secures your paddle to your kayak. Helps prevent paddle loss and does not inhibit paddling. Attaches to any eye strap using snap. Built in quick release buckle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MbojFsXxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PKBAH0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shoreline Marine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddle Accessories"]], "price": 7.98}}
{"item_id": "B007PMJR64", "title": "Hogue Zombie Handall Grip Sleeve Glowing Zombie Green", "description": "Hogue Handall Grip Sleeves. Keep your aim on target! Hogue has the top-quality, ultra-affordable solution with these Handall Grip Sleeves. Look: Exclusive shape fits securely on your pistol, with no loose spots; Proportioned finger grooves; No-slip cobblestone texturing; Ambidextrous palm swells; Fits most medium to full-size semiauto pistols. Order yours today! Hogue Zombie Handall Grip Sleeve, Glowing Zombie Green", "text": "Hogue Zombie Handall Grip Sleeve Glowing Zombie Green Hogue Handall Grip Sleeves. Keep your aim on target! Hogue has the top-quality, ultra-affordable solution with these Handall Grip Sleeves. Look: Exclusive shape fits securely on your pistol, with no loose spots; Proportioned finger grooves; No-slip cobblestone texturing; Ambidextrous palm swells; Fits most medium to full-size semiauto pistols. Order yours today! Hogue Zombie Handall Grip Sleeve, Glowing Zombie Green", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oSjtfqL3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PMJR64.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007PMK5X8", "title": "Hogue Colt & 1911 Government Grips Rubber, w/Finger Grooves, Zombie Green", "description": "Hogue 45005 Wraparound Rubber Grips are the perfect choice for the shooter that is looking for a sleek grip that is both attractive as well as functional. This grip is manufactured from a soft durable rubber and features a lightweight, synthetic skeleton insert that makes up the rigid interior of the grip. The synthetic insert is chemically bonded to the exterior rubber grip insuring that the grip won't delaminate or come apart. Lots of grips have irritating medallions or funky features that can feel uncomfortable during use, the cobblestone (stippled) surface of this grip replaces traditional checkering and allows for good grip control. The material is solvent and oil resistant which means it will not deteriorate or dissolve due to cleaning your firearm. Specifications: - Color: Zombie Green - Fits 1911 Government, Commander", "text": "Hogue Colt & 1911 Government Grips Rubber, w/Finger Grooves, Zombie Green Hogue 45005 Wraparound Rubber Grips are the perfect choice for the shooter that is looking for a sleek grip that is both attractive as well as functional. This grip is manufactured from a soft durable rubber and features a lightweight, synthetic skeleton insert that makes up the rigid interior of the grip. The synthetic insert is chemically bonded to the exterior rubber grip insuring that the grip won't delaminate or come apart. Lots of grips have irritating medallions or funky features that can feel uncomfortable during use, the cobblestone (stippled) surface of this grip replaces traditional checkering and allows for good grip control. The material is solvent and oil resistant which means it will not deteriorate or dissolve due to cleaning your firearm. Specifications: - Color: Zombie Green - Fits 1911 Government, Commander", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZcyWMjWUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PMK5X8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 21.74}}
