{"item_id": "B007PSIA8O", "title": "Knog Blinder Standard 4-LED Bicycle Head Light - w/White Light", "description": "The Knog Blinder 4 has four super bright LEDs that pump out upto 80 Lumens of front light and 44-Lumens of rear light. Its optimized optics focus and directs a smooth beam pattern that makes the Blinder visible over 800 metres. With 5 dfferent modes (Steady, Fast Flash,Organic Flash 1, Organic Flash 2, Eco flash) and a burn time of up to 3-hours in constant beam and up to 50-hours in eco-flash mode, they will keep you well seen.", "text": "Knog Blinder Standard 4-LED Bicycle Head Light - w/White Light The Knog Blinder 4 has four super bright LEDs that pump out upto 80 Lumens of front light and 44-Lumens of rear light. Its optimized optics focus and directs a smooth beam pattern that makes the Blinder visible over 800 metres. With 5 dfferent modes (Steady, Fast Flash,Organic Flash 1, Organic Flash 2, Eco flash) and a burn time of up to 3-hours in constant beam and up to 50-hours in eco-flash mode, they will keep you well seen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d6N63RsvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PSIA8O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KNOG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 32.5}}
