{"item_id": "B007PXVQN0", "title": "Nikon M-223 Mount", "description": "Nikon AR MountsThe importance and benefits of matching the right optic to your AR has been discussed many times before, but just as important is the mount that you use to attach it. AR platform rifles are much different in basic design than your typical bolt action rifle. The comb height of the stock, the eye relief allowed by stock length, the necessary access to the charging handle, typical shooting distances and other characteristics must be considered when choosing the mount.Nikon has a full range of AR scope mounts that offer shooters exactly what they need for a particular optic and for their particular AR. All built of strong, lightweight alloy, the mounts securely attach your preferred optic to your AR platform’s Picattiny rail.", "text": "Nikon M-223 Mount Nikon AR MountsThe importance and benefits of matching the right optic to your AR has been discussed many times before, but just as important is the mount that you use to attach it. AR platform rifles are much different in basic design than your typical bolt action rifle. The comb height of the stock, the eye relief allowed by stock length, the necessary access to the charging handle, typical shooting distances and other characteristics must be considered when choosing the mount.Nikon has a full range of AR scope mounts that offer shooters exactly what they need for a particular optic and for their particular AR. All built of strong, lightweight alloy, the mounts securely attach your preferred optic to your AR platform’s Picattiny rail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S74XNZT%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PXVQN0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 56.95}}
{"item_id": "B007PXVQNU", "title": "Nikon P-22 2-7x32 Matte NP (Extra Turret)", "description": "Nikon P-22 AR Rimfire 2-7x32 Riflescope The new P-22 Series riflescopes is the Rimfire optimized variant of Nikon’s growing line-up of precision optics for AR rifles. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior accuracy from Rimfire AR platform rifles and the .22 long rifle cartridge, the P-22 is offered in 2-7x32 with BDC 150 reticle or 2-7x32 with Nikoplex reticle and Nikon’s Rapid Action Turret system. Both P-22s features tactical-style turrets with Zero-Reset feature and are parallax set at 50 yards. With fully multicoated optics for extreme brightness, the P-22 provides incredibly high light transmission for most light conditions.", "text": "Nikon P-22 2-7x32 Matte NP (Extra Turret) Nikon P-22 AR Rimfire 2-7x32 Riflescope The new P-22 Series riflescopes is the Rimfire optimized variant of Nikon’s growing line-up of precision optics for AR rifles. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior accuracy from Rimfire AR platform rifles and the .22 long rifle cartridge, the P-22 is offered in 2-7x32 with BDC 150 reticle or 2-7x32 with Nikoplex reticle and Nikon’s Rapid Action Turret system. Both P-22s features tactical-style turrets with Zero-Reset feature and are parallax set at 50 yards. With fully multicoated optics for extreme brightness, the P-22 provides incredibly high light transmission for most light conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eoze3DkZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PXVQNU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 179.95}}
