{"item_id": "B007PXVS8S", "title": "Nikon M-308 Riflescopes 4-16x42 SF -Matte Nikoplex", "description": "The new M-308 4-16x42 represents Nikon’s Precision AR Optic technology for heavier caliber rifles capable of long-range accuracy. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior long-range accuracy with the popular 308 Win AR platform rifles, the new M-308 4-16x42 features a choice of either the new BDC 800 reticle, or Nikoplex reticle and precise Rapid Action Turrets, each calibrated for the trajectory of the .308 Win/7.62 NATO Match round with 168gr. HPBT bullet. The high magnification range zoom makes it the ideal optic for AR10 platforms as well as for long range bolt action rifle applications. Includes M-308 one-piece mount, with built-in 20 MOA slope.", "text": "Nikon M-308 Riflescopes 4-16x42 SF -Matte Nikoplex The new M-308 4-16x42 represents Nikon’s Precision AR Optic technology for heavier caliber rifles capable of long-range accuracy. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior long-range accuracy with the popular 308 Win AR platform rifles, the new M-308 4-16x42 features a choice of either the new BDC 800 reticle, or Nikoplex reticle and precise Rapid Action Turrets, each calibrated for the trajectory of the .308 Win/7.62 NATO Match round with 168gr. HPBT bullet. The high magnification range zoom makes it the ideal optic for AR10 platforms as well as for long range bolt action rifle applications. Includes M-308 one-piece mount, with built-in 20 MOA slope.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QIh9buuHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PXVS8S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 429.95}}
{"item_id": "B007PXVSSI", "title": "Nikon M-308 4-16x42 BDC 800 (Black)", "description": "M-308 4-16x42 Nikoplex with Rapid Action TurretThe new M-308 4-16x42 with Rapid Action Turrets represents Nikon’s Precision AR Optic technology for heavier caliber rifles capable of long range accuracy. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior long-range accuracy with 308 Caliber AR platform rifles, the new M-308 4-16x42 features Nikon’s Nikoplex reticle and precise, tactical-style RAPID ACTION turrets. The high magnification range zoom makes it the ideal optic for AR10 platforms as well as for long range turn-bolt rifle applications. The M-308 , like all Nikon AR riflescopes, is optimized for use with Nikon Spot On Ballistic Match Technology. Spot On allows you to discover all of the exact aiming points on the BDC 800 reticle for your exact ammunition and load. Nikon includes its removable ARD objective lens glare eliminator with all 42mm objective M-308 models. The M-308 riflescope comes complete with the new M-223 XR one-piece mount. With built-in 20 MOA slope, the M-223 XR mount enables extreme long range shooting by adding 20 minutes of angle elevation adjustment to the overall system.", "text": "Nikon M-308 4-16x42 BDC 800 (Black) M-308 4-16x42 Nikoplex with Rapid Action TurretThe new M-308 4-16x42 with Rapid Action Turrets represents Nikon’s Precision AR Optic technology for heavier caliber rifles capable of long range accuracy. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior long-range accuracy with 308 Caliber AR platform rifles, the new M-308 4-16x42 features Nikon’s Nikoplex reticle and precise, tactical-style RAPID ACTION turrets. The high magnification range zoom makes it the ideal optic for AR10 platforms as well as for long range turn-bolt rifle applications. The M-308 , like all Nikon AR riflescopes, is optimized for use with Nikon Spot On Ballistic Match Technology. Spot On allows you to discover all of the exact aiming points on the BDC 800 reticle for your exact ammunition and load. Nikon includes its removable ARD objective lens glare eliminator with all 42mm objective M-308 models. The M-308 riflescope comes complete with the new M-223 XR one-piece mount. With built-in 20 MOA slope, the M-223 XR mount enables extreme long range shooting by adding 20 minutes of angle elevation adjustment to the overall system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QIh9buuHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007PXVSSI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 547.59}}
