{"item_id": "B007Q4NCZI", "title": "Park Tool Chain Gang Chain Cleaning System - CG-2.2", "description": "Preventative maintenance -- there's those who get it and those who don't. But, if you're of the earlier sect, you'll appreciate the Park Tool's CG-2. 2 Chain Gang Chain Cleaning System. It has everything that's needed to quickly clean your chain, rings, cogs, and pulley's. So, you're able to both prolong the life of your drivetrain and minimize mechanical drag. This kit includes the CM-5 chain scrubber, GSC-1 Brush, and eight ounces of Park Tool's Chain Bright. All you have to do is added Clean Bright into the CM-5 and spin the cranks. This runs the chain through multiple rotating brushes in order to knock off grime and cut through any buildup. The GSC-1 brush makes quick work of getting into the nooks and crannies found around derailleurs, the cassette, cranks, and chainrings.", "text": "Park Tool Chain Gang Chain Cleaning System - CG-2.2 Preventative maintenance -- there's those who get it and those who don't. But, if you're of the earlier sect, you'll appreciate the Park Tool's CG-2. 2 Chain Gang Chain Cleaning System. It has everything that's needed to quickly clean your chain, rings, cogs, and pulley's. So, you're able to both prolong the life of your drivetrain and minimize mechanical drag. This kit includes the CM-5 chain scrubber, GSC-1 Brush, and eight ounces of Park Tool's Chain Bright. All you have to do is added Clean Bright into the CM-5 and spin the cranks. This runs the chain through multiple rotating brushes in order to knock off grime and cut through any buildup. The GSC-1 brush makes quick work of getting into the nooks and crannies found around derailleurs, the cassette, cranks, and chainrings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zrJHSziiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007Q4NCZI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 31.46}}
{"item_id": "B007Q4NW58", "title": "Shimano SM-RT 6-bolt Rotor", "description": "", "text": "Shimano SM-RT 6-bolt Rotor", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UcDNxEbEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007Q4NW58.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Rotors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007Q4O41E", "title": "Topeak Defender XC1 2-Piece Front Fender", "description": "Topeak's Defender XC1 2-Piece Front Fender is a two-piece, moto-inspired fender that attaches to suspension fork lowers for a close fit with excellent spray protection. It uses a precision clamp that secures the fender to the lower legs with a special safety feature, which allows it to disengage if a large obstruction enters the wheel, preventing front wheel lock up. Lightweight, impact-resistant plastic provides durability without weighing the front end down, and the underside is polished to prevent buildup and aid in cleaning. The quick release attachment fits 36 to 48. 5mm fork legs, and the Topeak Defender XC1 2-Piece Front fender measures 13 x 24 x 19 cm.", "text": "Topeak Defender XC1 2-Piece Front Fender Topeak's Defender XC1 2-Piece Front Fender is a two-piece, moto-inspired fender that attaches to suspension fork lowers for a close fit with excellent spray protection. It uses a precision clamp that secures the fender to the lower legs with a special safety feature, which allows it to disengage if a large obstruction enters the wheel, preventing front wheel lock up. Lightweight, impact-resistant plastic provides durability without weighing the front end down, and the underside is polished to prevent buildup and aid in cleaning. The quick release attachment fits 36 to 48. 5mm fork legs, and the Topeak Defender XC1 2-Piece Front fender measures 13 x 24 x 19 cm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iD%2BZgwNrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007Q4O41E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 26.97}}
{"item_id": "B007Q4PBO8", "title": "Shimano PD-MX80 Saint Pedals", "description": "For a long time running, DX Flat pedals fulfilled the needs of the BMX and mountain biking market with a solid aluminum body, adjustable traction pins, and legendary Shimano serviceability. It's safe to say that pedal is a now a classic. Much has changed over the years, however, and the PD-MX80 Saint Pedals address the needs of modern riders and their tacky shoes. One of those issues is with the traction pins. They are essentially set screws with a headless, internal Allen drive that's easily damaged by rocks and impacts, and then the Allen head would no longer be usable. For the PD-MX80 Saint Pedals, the pins screw in from the back of the platform. This solved the dilemma of not being able to remove pins once damaged, but sacrifices one of the DX defining features -- adjustable pin height. Because the pins threaded into the body, you could thread them in to a height depending on traction needs. To work around this, Shimano includes washers with the PD-MX80s so you can lower pins where necessary and fine tune the pedals to your shoes and personal preference. There are nine pins in total that thread into the low-profile alloy body. The new platform mirrors current market trends, placing your foot closer to the axle, and its large openings are optimized to shed mud. The Shimano PD-MX80 Saint Pedals feature durable chromoly axles and sealed cartridge bearings to ensure mountain biking strength for the park and shuttle run after shuttle run.", "text": "Shimano PD-MX80 Saint Pedals For a long time running, DX Flat pedals fulfilled the needs of the BMX and mountain biking market with a solid aluminum body, adjustable traction pins, and legendary Shimano serviceability. It's safe to say that pedal is a now a classic. Much has changed over the years, however, and the PD-MX80 Saint Pedals address the needs of modern riders and their tacky shoes. One of those issues is with the traction pins. They are essentially set screws with a headless, internal Allen drive that's easily damaged by rocks and impacts, and then the Allen head would no longer be usable. For the PD-MX80 Saint Pedals, the pins screw in from the back of the platform. This solved the dilemma of not being able to remove pins once damaged, but sacrifices one of the DX defining features -- adjustable pin height. Because the pins threaded into the body, you could thread them in to a height depending on traction needs. To work around this, Shimano includes washers with the PD-MX80s so you can lower pins where necessary and fine tune the pedals to your shoes and personal preference. There are nine pins in total that thread into the low-profile alloy body. The new platform mirrors current market trends, placing your foot closer to the axle, and its large openings are optimized to shed mud. The Shimano PD-MX80 Saint Pedals feature durable chromoly axles and sealed cartridge bearings to ensure mountain biking strength for the park and shuttle run after shuttle run.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51pEjx7CdwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007Q4PBO8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 79.29}}
{"item_id": "B007Q78M8M", "title": "Titanium Buzzz (Color may vary)", "description": "More players agree: Buzzz is the best golf disc you can buy, period. It's an ultra-dependable, straight flying midrange that you'll reach for again and again. Throw it hard and versatile Buzzz will hold any line you put it on. Discraft's 30-year reputation for consistency means that if you lose it, just pull out a new one and you're back in business. Colors may vary. Please contact us by email for more specific weight or color requests.", "text": "Titanium Buzzz (Color may vary) More players agree: Buzzz is the best golf disc you can buy, period. It's an ultra-dependable, straight flying midrange that you'll reach for again and again. Throw it hard and versatile Buzzz will hold any line you put it on. Discraft's 30-year reputation for consistency means that if you lose it, just pull out a new one and you're back in business. Colors may vary. Please contact us by email for more specific weight or color requests.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Yaebvm%2BhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007Q78M8M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Discs", "Midrange Discs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007Q8EIUW", "title": "MAX 11mm Dovetail to Weaver Adapter, Adjustable,Mount/Scope Mount /Scope Adapter", "description": ".22/airgun mount base to Weaver/Picatinny tactical rail adaptor Made from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy with matte black finish Top rail with 9 slots and middle V-cut Complete with one vertical stop pin Specifications: Material: Aluminum Weight: 2.3 ounces Pieces: 1 Rail Type: Picatinny/Weaver No. of Rails: 1 Length: 3.9 inches", "text": "MAX 11mm Dovetail to Weaver Adapter, Adjustable,Mount/Scope Mount /Scope Adapter .22/airgun mount base to Weaver/Picatinny tactical rail adaptor Made from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy with matte black finish Top rail with 9 slots and middle V-cut Complete with one vertical stop pin Specifications: Material: Aluminum Weight: 2.3 ounces Pieces: 1 Rail Type: Picatinny/Weaver No. of Rails: 1 Length: 3.9 inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318mU8MsH8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007Q8EIUW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 9.45}}
