{"item_id": "B007QEUXIM", "title": "BARSKA 6-24x50 IR 2nd Generation Sniper Riflescope", "description": "6-24x50 2nd Generation Sniper Scope is 100% waterproof and fogproof and built with an extra rigid shockproof construction, the ergonomic rubber design protects the scope and offers a secure non-slip grip. The multi-coated optics deliver bright, clear, high contrast views in all types of lighting and weather conditions. Illuminated red and green mil-dot reticles make targeting easy in any type of light condition. Other features include 30mm tube construction, easy-grip target-style windage and elevation adjustments, convenient side parallax adjustment with 1/8 MOA click adjustment and a fast focus eyebell. The built-in sniper edged sun-shade is set back in the housing to allow the sun shade to cast a shadow and reduce glare for use in bright sun. This Sniper Scope is precise and easy-to-use for tactical environments.Included Accessories: Scope Caps, Mounting Rings, Lens Cloth and Battery. Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "BARSKA 6-24x50 IR 2nd Generation Sniper Riflescope 6-24x50 2nd Generation Sniper Scope is 100% waterproof and fogproof and built with an extra rigid shockproof construction, the ergonomic rubber design protects the scope and offers a secure non-slip grip. The multi-coated optics deliver bright, clear, high contrast views in all types of lighting and weather conditions. Illuminated red and green mil-dot reticles make targeting easy in any type of light condition. Other features include 30mm tube construction, easy-grip target-style windage and elevation adjustments, convenient side parallax adjustment with 1/8 MOA click adjustment and a fast focus eyebell. The built-in sniper edged sun-shade is set back in the housing to allow the sun shade to cast a shadow and reduce glare for use in bright sun. This Sniper Scope is precise and easy-to-use for tactical environments.Included Accessories: Scope Caps, Mounting Rings, Lens Cloth and Battery. Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418IKYHTEGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007QEUXIM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 178.91}}
{"item_id": "B007QG6ZGE", "title": "Second Generation Deep Concealed Crotch Carry Handgun Holster - The smart way to carry!", "description": "Now with Duck Back Water Resistant Layer to help keep body moisture from reaching your weapon. Our Deep Concealment Holster will allow you to wear the clothing of your choice. You will have complete freedom of your body movements with no restrictions. Your firearm will be close and very secure without anyone being able to detect you are carrying. The deep concealment method is particularly useful for active people. Works equally well for men or women or right or left handed individuals. You will not want to leave home without it. Our quality of construction is second to none. We have built our holster from tough yet light weight padded Denim. Now includes Duck Back water resistant layer between your holster and body to keep body moisture from reaching your gun. There are many excellent how to videos on You Tube dealing with Deep Concealment Holsters be sure to check these out for more detailed information on how deep smart CCW holsters. WAIST Size 42-48 also available by request.", "text": "Second Generation Deep Concealed Crotch Carry Handgun Holster - The smart way to carry! Now with Duck Back Water Resistant Layer to help keep body moisture from reaching your weapon. Our Deep Concealment Holster will allow you to wear the clothing of your choice. You will have complete freedom of your body movements with no restrictions. Your firearm will be close and very secure without anyone being able to detect you are carrying. The deep concealment method is particularly useful for active people. Works equally well for men or women or right or left handed individuals. You will not want to leave home without it. Our quality of construction is second to none. We have built our holster from tough yet light weight padded Denim. Now includes Duck Back water resistant layer between your holster and body to keep body moisture from reaching your gun. There are many excellent how to videos on You Tube dealing with Deep Concealment Holsters be sure to check these out for more detailed information on how deep smart CCW holsters. WAIST Size 42-48 also available by request.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518CH50sT1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007QG6ZGE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.92}}
{"item_id": "B007QH9EWA", "title": "MAX OFF SET TACTICAL Weapon Mount For Olight M20/M21/M30, Fenix TK11, TK12, TA21, JETBeam M1X/M2S/JET-III M/RRT-1/RRT-2 and many more 1\" Diameter size Flashlight", "description": "The Off-Set Weapon Mount is a heavy duty 1\" light mount designed for the M20 & M30 series flashlights, Fenix TK11, TK12, TA21 flashlights. Constructed of aluminum with a black annodized finish for long lasting performance. Designed to be compatible with all weaver/picatinny style rails. Features large knurled knob for secure \"no-tool\" rail mounting. Includes flashlight mounting wrench. This mount will fit many of todays most popular tactical flashlights including: Olight M20 Warrior, Olight M30 Triton, Fenix TK10/11/12 TA21, Surefire 6P, G2 and many other 1\" diameter lights!", "text": "MAX OFF SET TACTICAL Weapon Mount For Olight M20/M21/M30, Fenix TK11, TK12, TA21, JETBeam M1X/M2S/JET-III M/RRT-1/RRT-2 and many more 1\" Diameter size Flashlight The Off-Set Weapon Mount is a heavy duty 1\" light mount designed for the M20 & M30 series flashlights, Fenix TK11, TK12, TA21 flashlights. Constructed of aluminum with a black annodized finish for long lasting performance. Designed to be compatible with all weaver/picatinny style rails. Features large knurled knob for secure \"no-tool\" rail mounting. Includes flashlight mounting wrench. This mount will fit many of todays most popular tactical flashlights including: Olight M20 Warrior, Olight M30 Triton, Fenix TK10/11/12 TA21, Surefire 6P, G2 and many other 1\" diameter lights!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zGJRFrygL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007QH9EWA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DYZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Trophy Mounts"]], "price": 5.5}}
{"item_id": "B007QKQMW2", "title": "Alite Designs Monarch Chair", "description": "If effortless portability made a baby with serious comfort, the result would be our Monarch Chair. Weighing in at a feather light 21 ounces, it's perfect for backyard hangouts, picnics, camping, or any occasion that calls for your rear end in a seated position", "text": "Alite Designs Monarch Chair If effortless portability made a baby with serious comfort, the result would be our Monarch Chair. Weighing in at a feather light 21 ounces, it's perfect for backyard hangouts, picnics, camping, or any occasion that calls for your rear end in a seated position", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QB8-66WwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007QKQMW2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 79.95}}
