{"item_id": "B007QTB4I0", "title": "NFL Clean Up Adjustable Hat, One Size Fits All Fits All", "description": "Introducing the '47 Brand Arizona Cardinals Clean Up Adjustable cap. Officially licensed by National Football League, this '47 Brand exclusive features a relaxed and adjustable fit with that classic, vintage throwback look, and is available for all your favorite teams", "text": "NFL Clean Up Adjustable Hat, One Size Fits All Fits All Introducing the '47 Brand Arizona Cardinals Clean Up Adjustable cap. Officially licensed by National Football League, this '47 Brand exclusive features a relaxed and adjustable fit with that classic, vintage throwback look, and is available for all your favorite teams", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aouXvOxlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007QTB4I0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "&#39;47 Brand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Clothing Accessories", "Caps & Hats", "Baseball Caps"]], "price": 14.78}}
