{"item_id": "B007QUVIX0", "title": "Condor Tools & Knives Kephart Knife, 4 1/2-Inch", "description": "This knife has a 4 ½ inch blade and comes with a leather brown sheath. It has a Micarta handle and natural blade finish.", "text": "Condor Tools & Knives Kephart Knife, 4 1/2-Inch This knife has a 4 ½ inch blade and comes with a leather brown sheath. It has a Micarta handle and natural blade finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QMnJx7frL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007QUVIX0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Tools &amp; Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 35.8}}
{"item_id": "B007QUVJ84", "title": "Condor Tools & Knives Heavy Duty Kukri Knife, 10-Inch", "description": "This knife had a 10-Inch blade and comes with a leather black sheath. It has a hardwood handle and blasted satin blade finish.", "text": "Condor Tools & Knives Heavy Duty Kukri Knife, 10-Inch This knife had a 10-Inch blade and comes with a leather black sheath. It has a hardwood handle and blasted satin blade finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21p4TJFnqzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007QUVJ84.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Tools &amp; Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 69.09}}
{"item_id": "B007QXU5L8", "title": "Smith and Wesson Tactical Knives and Flashlight Kit", "description": "Two of Smith and Wessons' most-popular tactical folding knife styles in one kit with a AA LED flashlight. Both knives feature stainless 3.3\" 7Cr17 High Carbon Stainless Steel blades, pocket clip, belt cutters, and window breakers. They both have a 1/2 serrated blade, with a lock-back mechanism housed in the handle liner.", "text": "Smith and Wesson Tactical Knives and Flashlight Kit Two of Smith and Wessons' most-popular tactical folding knife styles in one kit with a AA LED flashlight. Both knives feature stainless 3.3\" 7Cr17 High Carbon Stainless Steel blades, pocket clip, belt cutters, and window breakers. They both have a 1/2 serrated blade, with a lock-back mechanism housed in the handle liner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416BG%2BquIeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007QXU5L8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007QXU9EQ", "title": "Schrade 10\" Bowie Knife with Sheath", "description": "This small machete bowie knife is tough, yet easy to carry with the accompanying leather sheath. The 3Cr13 stainless steel blade is tough, and keeps and edge well. The rubberized aluminum handle allows for a sure and comfortable grip.", "text": "Schrade 10\" Bowie Knife with Sheath This small machete bowie knife is tough, yet easy to carry with the accompanying leather sheath. The 3Cr13 stainless steel blade is tough, and keeps and edge well. The rubberized aluminum handle allows for a sure and comfortable grip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BhZVs0HbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007QXU9EQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 20.5}}
{"item_id": "B007R2H2Y6", "title": "GRIP POWER PADS® - Alternative To Gym Gloves | Lifting Grips | Workout Gloves | Men Workout Gloves", "description": "Grip Power Pads - ALTERNATIVE TO GYM GLOVES Terrific Gym accessory for those who don't like to use gym gloves and prefer to use a Pad Alternative. Designed specifically to push harder and lift more weights! Will help you to reach your potential faster and easier. Can protect your hands during workout from Calluses & Blisters. Unlike bulky workout gloves, these PADS are compact and fit into your pocket. Grip Power Pads Designed to fit all standard bar or dumbbell circumference. No sweaty hands or palm suffocation. These GRIPS provide you more than just protection from sweat, skin break down, callus's and irritations. The GRIP POWER PADS help conform to any size and shape of hand to provide maximal grip and comfort. Most lifters will feel increase Grip strength. Some of the bars in the gym are thinner in girth, this puts your hand grip in a mechanical disadvantage which is related to poor length tension relationship caused by a passive / active muscle insufficiency. Grip Power Pads not only you'll get better traction also directly increases the barbell/dumbbell grip diameter creating greater strength and power output. All Grip Power pads are universal and can accommodate all hand types and sizes. Physical Therapy Doctors and an avid weight lifters highly recommend the GRIP POWER PADS for daily gym use. The GRIP POWER PADS are by far my favorite than any gym gloves.", "text": "GRIP POWER PADS® - Alternative To Gym Gloves | Lifting Grips | Workout Gloves | Men Workout Gloves Grip Power Pads - ALTERNATIVE TO GYM GLOVES Terrific Gym accessory for those who don't like to use gym gloves and prefer to use a Pad Alternative. Designed specifically to push harder and lift more weights! Will help you to reach your potential faster and easier. Can protect your hands during workout from Calluses & Blisters. Unlike bulky workout gloves, these PADS are compact and fit into your pocket. Grip Power Pads Designed to fit all standard bar or dumbbell circumference. No sweaty hands or palm suffocation. These GRIPS provide you more than just protection from sweat, skin break down, callus's and irritations. The GRIP POWER PADS help conform to any size and shape of hand to provide maximal grip and comfort. Most lifters will feel increase Grip strength. Some of the bars in the gym are thinner in girth, this puts your hand grip in a mechanical disadvantage which is related to poor length tension relationship caused by a passive / active muscle insufficiency. Grip Power Pads not only you'll get better traction also directly increases the barbell/dumbbell grip diameter creating greater strength and power output. All Grip Power pads are universal and can accommodate all hand types and sizes. Physical Therapy Doctors and an avid weight lifters highly recommend the GRIP POWER PADS for daily gym use. The GRIP POWER PADS are by far my favorite than any gym gloves.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61z6bADjQUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007R2H2Y6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B007R4OQUM", "title": "Blackburn Anyvalve Head (Black)", "description": "Universal-style heads have always been overly complicated and unreliable - until now. The Blackburn AnyValve head is a real game changer. A super-clean design that utilizes highly durable materials, it will provide years of trouble-free performance. Backed by a lifetime warranty, it is available separately and is standard on all Blackburn floor pumps.", "text": "Blackburn Anyvalve Head (Black) Universal-style heads have always been overly complicated and unreliable - until now. The Blackburn AnyValve head is a real game changer. A super-clean design that utilizes highly durable materials, it will provide years of trouble-free performance. Backed by a lifetime warranty, it is available separately and is standard on all Blackburn floor pumps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ey3qdE3UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007R4OQUM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B007R74K8C", "title": "Ruger LCR 8 Shot 4 Banger Speed Block", "description": "With a Loading Block for the New Ruger LCR-22 8 Shot Speedloader you can pre-stage your rounds for some fast and fun shooting. A simple push down on the Speedloader clicks in 8 rounds in less than 1 second.... transfer them to the cylinder.... push again and click your 8 empty chambers are full. The average person with a little practice can be reloading their revolver in less than 5 seconds. The Four Banger speed block holds 32 rounds of 22 Long Rifle. If you load 8 rounds in your Speedloader and 32 rounds in the loading block you'll have a total of 40 rounds ready to snap into your revolver. Buy one today and see how fast you can empty it. Loads of fun!", "text": "Ruger LCR 8 Shot 4 Banger Speed Block With a Loading Block for the New Ruger LCR-22 8 Shot Speedloader you can pre-stage your rounds for some fast and fun shooting. A simple push down on the Speedloader clicks in 8 rounds in less than 1 second.... transfer them to the cylinder.... push again and click your 8 empty chambers are full. The average person with a little practice can be reloading their revolver in less than 5 seconds. The Four Banger speed block holds 32 rounds of 22 Long Rifle. If you load 8 rounds in your Speedloader and 32 rounds in the loading block you'll have a total of 40 rounds ready to snap into your revolver. Buy one today and see how fast you can empty it. Loads of fun!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Bh-LV2M8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007R74K8C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B007RAIJJK", "title": "Primos Hunting Speak Easy Electronic Deer Calling System", "description": "Speak Easy Electronic Deer Calling System Professional call sound at the push of a button. 50 yard remote gets the sound where you send it. Clear, natural and loud sounds without distortion. Six pre-programmed Primos calls: Grunt, Challenge Wheeze, Roar, Bucks Sparring, Doe Bleat, Estrus Bleat. Quick, adjustable LED indicated sound level. Compact remote attaches to speaker housing for convenient storage.", "text": "Primos Hunting Speak Easy Electronic Deer Calling System Speak Easy Electronic Deer Calling System Professional call sound at the push of a button. 50 yard remote gets the sound where you send it. Clear, natural and loud sounds without distortion. Six pre-programmed Primos calls: Grunt, Challenge Wheeze, Roar, Bucks Sparring, Doe Bleat, Estrus Bleat. Quick, adjustable LED indicated sound level. Compact remote attaches to speaker housing for convenient storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413CEG4Q3EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007RAIJJK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Deer"]], "price": 44.08}}
{"item_id": "B007REOKIU", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Stealth Black Lightweight Edition Tactical Scenario Military-Hunting Assault Vest w/ Right Handed Quick Draw Pistol Holster", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation Lightweight Edition Tactical Black Tactical Assault Vest (Right Handed). A true tactial vest made with high grade sturdy and weatherproof nylon loaded with features designed for military/law enforcement purposes, and can also be used for airsoft or paintball. Completely breathable mesh ventilation system for enhanced comfort and heat release. Features a behind the neck rescue pull handle for extraction of a wounded team member, a reinforced and texturized shooter/sniper non-slip shoulder pad, The back of the vest features sturdy nylon horizontal webbing loops to hold swords, shovels, or other gear as well as a large secure webbing pocket for hydration systems/bladders or a ballistic shield . The front of the vest features: 3 Rifle Mag Pouches for All Size Magazines, 3 (Upper Left) Universal Pistol Mag or Flashlight/Grenade Pouch, 1 Radio/Cell Phone/Light Pouch, and Also features 2 (1-right 1-Left on inside of the vest) large internal zippered secure pockets for maps or documents, and a Universal Pistol holster w/ additional mag pouch. The holster can be easily removed or adjusted to a customized position. One size fits most, fully adjustable in height and girth to fit from a small to X-Large adult. Great for hunters, military, and law enforecement.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Stealth Black Lightweight Edition Tactical Scenario Military-Hunting Assault Vest w/ Right Handed Quick Draw Pistol Holster Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation Lightweight Edition Tactical Black Tactical Assault Vest (Right Handed). A true tactial vest made with high grade sturdy and weatherproof nylon loaded with features designed for military/law enforcement purposes, and can also be used for airsoft or paintball. Completely breathable mesh ventilation system for enhanced comfort and heat release. Features a behind the neck rescue pull handle for extraction of a wounded team member, a reinforced and texturized shooter/sniper non-slip shoulder pad, The back of the vest features sturdy nylon horizontal webbing loops to hold swords, shovels, or other gear as well as a large secure webbing pocket for hydration systems/bladders or a ballistic shield . The front of the vest features: 3 Rifle Mag Pouches for All Size Magazines, 3 (Upper Left) Universal Pistol Mag or Flashlight/Grenade Pouch, 1 Radio/Cell Phone/Light Pouch, and Also features 2 (1-right 1-Left on inside of the vest) large internal zippered secure pockets for maps or documents, and a Universal Pistol holster w/ additional mag pouch. The holster can be easily removed or adjusted to a customized position. One size fits most, fully adjustable in height and girth to fit from a small to X-Large adult. Great for hunters, military, and law enforecement.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U1%2BjE5-vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007REOKIU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B007RFG0NM", "title": "Klymit - Static V Air Pad", "description": "The Klymit Static V Air Pad is a comfortable place to sleep. Very comfortable. The Static V, with its innovative V-Chamber design, limits air movement and heat loss for better support and comfort. It folds to fit in multiple bag types and sizes. The side rails keep you on the pad and well insulated. Built with a rugged 75D polyester on top and bottom. It inflates quickly and easily. Usually taking between 10-15 breaths to inflate, which is way quicker than some of those bright yellow pads. And when it is inflated it is a comfy 2.5 inches thick and you will notice the difference. And when it is packed up you will hardly notice such a small package.Packs small.Includes stuff sack.Patch Kit included.Weight = 1 lb 4 oz.Dimensions - Inflated = 72\"x 23\" x 2..5\" - Packed = 9\" x 4\".Materials - 75D Polyester.", "text": "Klymit - Static V Air Pad The Klymit Static V Air Pad is a comfortable place to sleep. Very comfortable. The Static V, with its innovative V-Chamber design, limits air movement and heat loss for better support and comfort. It folds to fit in multiple bag types and sizes. The side rails keep you on the pad and well insulated. Built with a rugged 75D polyester on top and bottom. It inflates quickly and easily. Usually taking between 10-15 breaths to inflate, which is way quicker than some of those bright yellow pads. And when it is inflated it is a comfy 2.5 inches thick and you will notice the difference. And when it is packed up you will hardly notice such a small package.Packs small.Includes stuff sack.Patch Kit included.Weight = 1 lb 4 oz.Dimensions - Inflated = 72\"x 23\" x 2..5\" - Packed = 9\" x 4\".Materials - 75D Polyester.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31doJkUfciL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007RFG0NM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klymit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 50.0}}
{"item_id": "B007RFNF0I", "title": "Ka-Bar Zombie Chop Stick Machete", "description": "In an ever-changing world, the need for preparedness has never been greater. Without notice the game can change and the rules no longer apply. Questioning your gear at a crucial moment is not an option. Whether setting up camp or securing your perimeter, the Original Zombie knives are designed to perform under the most rigorous, unexpected and apocalyptic situations. Knife comes mounted with \"toxic green\" handles. Extra set of black scales included.", "text": "Ka-Bar Zombie Chop Stick Machete In an ever-changing world, the need for preparedness has never been greater. Without notice the game can change and the rules no longer apply. Questioning your gear at a crucial moment is not an option. Whether setting up camp or securing your perimeter, the Original Zombie knives are designed to perform under the most rigorous, unexpected and apocalyptic situations. Knife comes mounted with \"toxic green\" handles. Extra set of black scales included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21YDFFeV3SL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007RFNF0I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007RGKAGY", "title": "Rothco Polyester Paracord, 100 Feet", "description": "Specifications: Made From 100% Heavy Duty Polyester Material. 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core. 5/32\" Diameter. 100 Feet Long. Better Than Military Specifications. NOT USA MADE - Made In China. Import.This new cord is just as strong if not stronger than then nylon cord. The average test strength of the polyester cord is 727 lbs, well above the 550 lb industry standard and despite the fact that the item is imported, the quality equals or exceeds that of the U.S. made. The polyester paracord allows for a more flexible finished product, and there are NO problems melting the cut ends of the cord. Comparing the USA made vs. the Imported polyester paracord people have found that the finished bracelets and necklaces seems less stiff and bend around the wrist/neck more comfortably and freely.", "text": "Rothco Polyester Paracord, 100 Feet Specifications: Made From 100% Heavy Duty Polyester Material. 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core. 5/32\" Diameter. 100 Feet Long. Better Than Military Specifications. NOT USA MADE - Made In China. Import.This new cord is just as strong if not stronger than then nylon cord. The average test strength of the polyester cord is 727 lbs, well above the 550 lb industry standard and despite the fact that the item is imported, the quality equals or exceeds that of the U.S. made. The polyester paracord allows for a more flexible finished product, and there are NO problems melting the cut ends of the cord. Comparing the USA made vs. the Imported polyester paracord people have found that the finished bracelets and necklaces seems less stiff and bend around the wrist/neck more comfortably and freely.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mPuovxHKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007RGKAGY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007RGWQB6", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Mosin Nagant M44 91/30 M38 Rifle Stock 1\"Recoil Buttpad Butt Pad - Brown", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear Mosin Nagant 1\" Recoil Buttpad, will fit Mosin Nagant rifles including Russian-Polish-Chinese & Hungarian models of M44, M91/30, M38 & 91/59 RIFLES. Brown colored highly durable crack proof rubber, this installs in minutes by using your existing butt plate screws. A great addition to the Mosin Nagant rifle, the extra inch this provides makes aiming easier and more accurate, and the recoil is greatly reduced.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Mosin Nagant M44 91/30 M38 Rifle Stock 1\"Recoil Buttpad Butt Pad - Brown Official Ultimate Arms Gear Mosin Nagant 1\" Recoil Buttpad, will fit Mosin Nagant rifles including Russian-Polish-Chinese & Hungarian models of M44, M91/30, M38 & 91/59 RIFLES. Brown colored highly durable crack proof rubber, this installs in minutes by using your existing butt plate screws. A great addition to the Mosin Nagant rifle, the extra inch this provides makes aiming easier and more accurate, and the recoil is greatly reduced.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KycmfvlvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007RGWQB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B007RH8HJU", "title": "KAI USA Pure Komachi2 Steak Knife Set, 4-Piece", "description": "Pure Komachi2's colorful cutlery goes classic black and grey for the perfect everyday steak knife set. These great-looking serrated steak knives cut through meat quickly, easily and make a delicious steak even better. The serrated edges stay sharp longer and the food-safe resin coating help the blades glide through the steak with ease. The sleek and contemporary design works well with most table decor styles. Ideal for casual dining, the Pure Komachi2 Steak Knife Set also makes a great addition to an RV kitchen or camping gear. The entire line of Pure Komachi2 features bold blade colors achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knives glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi2 color handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable and fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting. Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "text": "KAI USA Pure Komachi2 Steak Knife Set, 4-Piece Pure Komachi2's colorful cutlery goes classic black and grey for the perfect everyday steak knife set. These great-looking serrated steak knives cut through meat quickly, easily and make a delicious steak even better. The serrated edges stay sharp longer and the food-safe resin coating help the blades glide through the steak with ease. The sleek and contemporary design works well with most table decor styles. Ideal for casual dining, the Pure Komachi2 Steak Knife Set also makes a great addition to an RV kitchen or camping gear. The entire line of Pure Komachi2 features bold blade colors achieved by bonding food-safe FDA approved resin to high-carbon stainless-steel blades. This non-stick coating resists corrosion, makes cleaning simple and helps the knives glide through food with ease. The Pure Komachi2 color handles are lightweight and ergonomically contoured for a comfortable and fatigue-reducing grip. Incredibly sharp and decidedly attention-getting. Pure Komachi 2 knives make a delightful addition to any kitchen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31arQMRkRfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007RH8HJU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kai USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 16.9}}
{"item_id": "B007RI9N4M", "title": "Benchmade Contego Axis Lock Black Serrated Folding Knife 4\" - 810SBK", "description": "Cpm-M4 Steel Blade With Clear Or Black CerakoteTM (62-64Hrc). Textured And Contoured G10 Handle Scales With Stainless Steel Backspacer. Limited First run edition. Reverse Tanto Blade With Ambidextrous Thumb-Stud Openers. Carbide Glass Breaker , Deep Carry Pocket Clip.", "text": "Benchmade Contego Axis Lock Black Serrated Folding Knife 4\" - 810SBK Cpm-M4 Steel Blade With Clear Or Black CerakoteTM (62-64Hrc). Textured And Contoured G10 Handle Scales With Stainless Steel Backspacer. Limited First run edition. Reverse Tanto Blade With Ambidextrous Thumb-Stud Openers. Carbide Glass Breaker , Deep Carry Pocket Clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PdmcCCWzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007RI9N4M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 169.95}}
