{"item_id": "B007RUGLZO", "title": "12 Gauge Shotgun Safety Ammo - Dummy Ammunition", "description": "Completely inert 12 gauge shotgun dummy training rounds. Excellent for classroom training, loading/reloading drills, gun handling drills, malfunction drills and diagnosing shooting problems. 5 rounds per package. Perfect for Cowboy Action/SASS practice.", "text": "12 Gauge Shotgun Safety Ammo - Dummy Ammunition Completely inert 12 gauge shotgun dummy training rounds. Excellent for classroom training, loading/reloading drills, gun handling drills, malfunction drills and diagnosing shooting problems. 5 rounds per package. Perfect for Cowboy Action/SASS practice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KQdFYLBlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007RUGLZO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B007RX2V14", "title": "MASSIVE SALE\" Knife King Custom Damascus Handmade Hunting Knife. With Leather Sheath. Top Quality", "description": "Important Note:When you checkout make sure you are buying from the seller \"Knife King\" if you want the original top quality item , Buy original item from \"Knife King\" only. All other sellers are selling fake copies of our knives on this listing. All the good reviews on this knife are earned by knives made in our workshop and some people are trying to take advantage of these good reviews and listing their low quality copies on our listings. Blade: 6.5 inch handle 4.5 inch. Walnut wood handle. Damascus guard and pomel. Comes with leather sheath. Please note the sheath may vary from the pictures. You have to be over the age of 18 to buy this item.", "text": "MASSIVE SALE\" Knife King Custom Damascus Handmade Hunting Knife. With Leather Sheath. Top Quality Important Note:When you checkout make sure you are buying from the seller \"Knife King\" if you want the original top quality item , Buy original item from \"Knife King\" only. All other sellers are selling fake copies of our knives on this listing. All the good reviews on this knife are earned by knives made in our workshop and some people are trying to take advantage of these good reviews and listing their low quality copies on our listings. Blade: 6.5 inch handle 4.5 inch. Walnut wood handle. Damascus guard and pomel. Comes with leather sheath. Please note the sheath may vary from the pictures. You have to be over the age of 18 to buy this item.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Y7N3DEb%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007RX2V14.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 45.0}}
