{"item_id": "B007RXL048", "title": "Walther Universal Tactical Pinpoint Casual Laser Sight", "description": "Umarex universal tactical laser Class IIIA laser Fits any Weaver/Picatinny accessory rail 650nm wavelength <1mW output power On/off switch with indicator light Windage and elevation adjustments 0.89 oz. 2.30x1.58x1.29 Includes hex key and 3 round silver oxide batteries (303/357, SR44 or LR44). Slide this universal laser on any gun that has a Weaver or Picatinny rail. Lasers help deliver pinpoint accuracy, as you'll know exactly where your muzzle is pointing.", "text": "Walther Universal Tactical Pinpoint Casual Laser Sight Umarex universal tactical laser Class IIIA laser Fits any Weaver/Picatinny accessory rail 650nm wavelength <1mW output power On/off switch with indicator light Windage and elevation adjustments 0.89 oz. 2.30x1.58x1.29 Includes hex key and 3 round silver oxide batteries (303/357, SR44 or LR44). Slide this universal laser on any gun that has a Weaver or Picatinny rail. Lasers help deliver pinpoint accuracy, as you'll know exactly where your muzzle is pointing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E9BbsFqWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007RXL048.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RWS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 21.18}}
