{"item_id": "B007S0PG0Y", "title": "Gun Storage Solutions Kikstands (Pack of 2)", "description": "Put guns at an angle to increase visibility to customers. When set at an angle, instead of flat on the shelf, more guns are able to fit in the same area. Also, the Kikstand will insure that every time the gun is taken out of the cabinet it is returned to the same position. Set guns at desired spacing and angle once and never worry about straightening up your display case again. The Kikstand is for bottom shelves - where there is no glass to clip onto, as with Clipstand. MADE IN THE USA.", "text": "Gun Storage Solutions Kikstands (Pack of 2) Put guns at an angle to increase visibility to customers. When set at an angle, instead of flat on the shelf, more guns are able to fit in the same area. Also, the Kikstand will insure that every time the gun is taken out of the cabinet it is returned to the same position. Set guns at desired spacing and angle once and never worry about straightening up your display case again. The Kikstand is for bottom shelves - where there is no glass to clip onto, as with Clipstand. MADE IN THE USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3124drkdhSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007S0PG0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B007S3M8MA", "title": "Serfas Men's RX Glove", "description": "Serfas' RX Gel cycling glove is designed by doctors to increase blood flow and eliminate numbness. Ulnar nerve damage, better known as handlebar palsy, happens quite frequently to avid cyclists. It's usually irritated by heavy vibration while riding and is more common for mountain bikers. Serfas' RX gloves significantly reduce this discomfort by relieving the pressure on this area of the palm and putting pressure on the area of the palm made for holding weight. Don't forget about Serfas' trademark \"Easy-Off Loops\" which make removing the gloves easier than ever.", "text": "Serfas Men's RX Glove Serfas' RX Gel cycling glove is designed by doctors to increase blood flow and eliminate numbness. Ulnar nerve damage, better known as handlebar palsy, happens quite frequently to avid cyclists. It's usually irritated by heavy vibration while riding and is more common for mountain bikers. Serfas' RX gloves significantly reduce this discomfort by relieving the pressure on this area of the palm and putting pressure on the area of the palm made for holding weight. Don't forget about Serfas' trademark \"Easy-Off Loops\" which make removing the gloves easier than ever.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51o-2Ub09SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007S3M8MA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007S3MP0U", "title": "Kershaw Echelon Speedsafe Knife", "description": "Designed for great looks and solid performance, the Echelon (#1880) features SpeedSafe® assisted opening and opens with a thumb stud that seems to float on air—hovering in the middle of an over-sized blade cutout. To add to the airy feeling, we used natural G-10 to create a semi-translucent handle that allows you to see the operation of the SpeedSafe® mechanism inside. The Echelon also features our Inset Liner Lock and new reversible deep-carry pocket clip for discreet pocket carry. Made in the USA. To build an Inset Liner Lock, Kershaw insets a strip of steel inside a knife’s handle—most commonly when the handle is G-10. In-setting the lock in this way enables us to create a slimmer knife, while still providing the strength and security of a locking liner. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw Echelon Speedsafe Knife Designed for great looks and solid performance, the Echelon (#1880) features SpeedSafe® assisted opening and opens with a thumb stud that seems to float on air—hovering in the middle of an over-sized blade cutout. To add to the airy feeling, we used natural G-10 to create a semi-translucent handle that allows you to see the operation of the SpeedSafe® mechanism inside. The Echelon also features our Inset Liner Lock and new reversible deep-carry pocket clip for discreet pocket carry. Made in the USA. To build an Inset Liner Lock, Kershaw insets a strip of steel inside a knife’s handle—most commonly when the handle is G-10. In-setting the lock in this way enables us to create a slimmer knife, while still providing the strength and security of a locking liner. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21PtX7C0ogL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007S3MP0U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 68.18}}
{"item_id": "B007S3MWJO", "title": "Olicamp Hard Anodized Space Saver Mug", "description": "The Space Saver Mug fits snuggly over the bottom of a 1 quart, round Nalgene bottle saving valuable space in your pack. Hard anodized surface makes this nearly scratch proof, easy to clean, and it looks great too. Innovative handle design feels more like your favorite mug at home while still folding compactly. Large enough to boil water for freeze dried meals. This will be your go too pot for fast and light trips. Graduations on the side for measuring just the right amount of water. Holds 24 oz to the brim or 20 oz to the top graduation. Wt: 3.2 oz.", "text": "Olicamp Hard Anodized Space Saver Mug The Space Saver Mug fits snuggly over the bottom of a 1 quart, round Nalgene bottle saving valuable space in your pack. Hard anodized surface makes this nearly scratch proof, easy to clean, and it looks great too. Innovative handle design feels more like your favorite mug at home while still folding compactly. Large enough to boil water for freeze dried meals. This will be your go too pot for fast and light trips. Graduations on the side for measuring just the right amount of water. Holds 24 oz to the brim or 20 oz to the top graduation. Wt: 3.2 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418CWPpM1uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007S3MWJO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Olicamp", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 12.57}}
{"item_id": "B007S3OJTU", "title": "Titanium Emergency Whistle", "description": "Built using extra-strong titanium material, this safety whistle won?t let you down in the case of an emergency. Because this whistle weighs just 1/10th of an ounce, it?s a great addition to your pack and provides peace of mind if things go wrong. Wt: 0.1 oz.", "text": "Titanium Emergency Whistle Built using extra-strong titanium material, this safety whistle won?t let you down in the case of an emergency. Because this whistle weighs just 1/10th of an ounce, it?s a great addition to your pack and provides peace of mind if things go wrong. Wt: 0.1 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rZkoVfhkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007S3OJTU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vargo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 10.91}}
{"item_id": "B007SHB4H6", "title": "Rear Slide Cover Plate Laser Engraved for Glock Pistols Si Vis Pacem Para Bellum", "description": "Molon Labe LLC rear cover plate is manufactured from 6061 T6 aluminum. Hard coat anodized for a long lasting durable finish. Permanent laser engraving of design. Fits most Glock models and is easy to install.", "text": "Rear Slide Cover Plate Laser Engraved for Glock Pistols Si Vis Pacem Para Bellum Molon Labe LLC rear cover plate is manufactured from 6061 T6 aluminum. Hard coat anodized for a long lasting durable finish. Permanent laser engraving of design. Fits most Glock models and is easy to install.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i6c8d8PML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007SHB4H6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B007SIGYNE", "title": "DTOM Law Enforcement Concealed Carry Fanny Pack CORDURA NYLON - Black", "description": "Buyer BEWARE: We have a reviewer who says they purchased 3 packs from us over the past 2 years and they all fell apart. We have only been selling this pack on Amazon since Summer of 2012. These have not even been on sale for a full year. The review is completely bogus. The DTOM Law Enforcement Fanny Pack is built from the best quality materials available. We use only YKK zippers and 1000 Denier Cordura Nylon. We have a 30 day money back guarantee. Purchase and see the difference quality construction makes in a fanny pack.", "text": "DTOM Law Enforcement Concealed Carry Fanny Pack CORDURA NYLON - Black Buyer BEWARE: We have a reviewer who says they purchased 3 packs from us over the past 2 years and they all fell apart. We have only been selling this pack on Amazon since Summer of 2012. These have not even been on sale for a full year. The review is completely bogus. The DTOM Law Enforcement Fanny Pack is built from the best quality materials available. We use only YKK zippers and 1000 Denier Cordura Nylon. We have a 30 day money back guarantee. Purchase and see the difference quality construction makes in a fanny pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Jk-qqPVXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007SIGYNE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 39.92}}
{"item_id": "B007SIY422", "title": "MEDIUM - DTOM Concealed Carry Fanny Pack CORDURA NYLON-Black", "description": "*****We now have a LARGE and SMALL size also available on Amazon. It is new here so you have to specifically search on \"DTOM large or small fanny pack.*** Medium Size Slim Fit Concealed Carry Fanny Pack CORDURA NYLON - Black Our specialty is a slim fit fanny pack that fits close to the body yet allows you to carry a medium size gun such as the Springfield XD 9mm compact and subcompact without anyone realizing that this is a concealed weapon fanny pack. It will NOT work with the full size Ruger 1911 due to the length of the grip on the 1911. Fanny pack belt is adjustable to 40\" and the width is 1 1/2\". Fast Break Away Zipper for Quick Easy Weapon Access. Also includes a large zippered pocket for wallet and keys and a smaller zippered pocket that is large enough for the largest of smartphones (The 4.5\" Samsung Galaxy 2 fits nicely). Includes another small zippered pocket in front of the cell phone space that works well to carry charging cable for your phone. Works for Right or Left Handed shooters", "text": "MEDIUM - DTOM Concealed Carry Fanny Pack CORDURA NYLON-Black *****We now have a LARGE and SMALL size also available on Amazon. It is new here so you have to specifically search on \"DTOM large or small fanny pack.*** Medium Size Slim Fit Concealed Carry Fanny Pack CORDURA NYLON - Black Our specialty is a slim fit fanny pack that fits close to the body yet allows you to carry a medium size gun such as the Springfield XD 9mm compact and subcompact without anyone realizing that this is a concealed weapon fanny pack. It will NOT work with the full size Ruger 1911 due to the length of the grip on the 1911. Fanny pack belt is adjustable to 40\" and the width is 1 1/2\". Fast Break Away Zipper for Quick Easy Weapon Access. Also includes a large zippered pocket for wallet and keys and a smaller zippered pocket that is large enough for the largest of smartphones (The 4.5\" Samsung Galaxy 2 fits nicely). Includes another small zippered pocket in front of the cell phone space that works well to carry charging cable for your phone. Works for Right or Left Handed shooters", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410NCxd9%2BwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007SIY422.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 36.92}}
{"item_id": "B007SNV0YM", "title": "Eotech HHS l (EXPS3-4 with G33 3x Magnifier)", "description": "HHS Features the EXPS3-4 with a G33.STS magnifier for engaing threats in close quarter combat situations and quickly transforming to a 500 m surveillance or targeting situation. Instant transition is achieved through a quick switch to side (STS) mount that offers a simple quick disengatement of the magnifier. This durable, night vision compatible system offers a wide field optical performance with superior light transmission for visibility in extreme low light conditions. After extensive testing of various optical sights, US Special Operations Command (SSOCOM) has standardized on the HWS as its weapon optic for close quarter battle. Offering true 2 eyes open shooting, a transversely-mounted lithium 123 battery, and 7 mm raised base offering iron sight access, the Extreme-XPS3-4 (EXPS) features easy to adjust side buttons and an adjustable, locking quick detach lever for easy attachment and removal. Battery life is 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12.", "text": "Eotech HHS l (EXPS3-4 with G33 3x Magnifier) HHS Features the EXPS3-4 with a G33.STS magnifier for engaing threats in close quarter combat situations and quickly transforming to a 500 m surveillance or targeting situation. Instant transition is achieved through a quick switch to side (STS) mount that offers a simple quick disengatement of the magnifier. This durable, night vision compatible system offers a wide field optical performance with superior light transmission for visibility in extreme low light conditions. After extensive testing of various optical sights, US Special Operations Command (SSOCOM) has standardized on the HWS as its weapon optic for close quarter battle. Offering true 2 eyes open shooting, a transversely-mounted lithium 123 battery, and 7 mm raised base offering iron sight access, the Extreme-XPS3-4 (EXPS) features easy to adjust side buttons and an adjustable, locking quick detach lever for easy attachment and removal. Battery life is 600 continuous hours at nominal setting 12.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iSyRwL3hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007SNV0YM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EOTech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007SNV7B8", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools F15N-CP Jungle Canopy Knife with Straight Edge Fixed 9.75-Inch Steel Clip Point Blade and Digi-Grip Kraton Handle, Satin", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools F15N-CP Jungle Canopy Knife with Straight Edge Fixed 9.75-Inch Steel Clip Point Blade and Digi-Grip Kraton Handle, Satin", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3198pCmPjpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007SNV7B8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 44.35}}
{"item_id": "B007SNVJB6", "title": "Enfield Monte Carlo Stock 7.62x54R No. 4 Mk 1, 2 & 5", "description": "Convert Your Mosin Nagant into a Modern Hunting Rifle! Recoil Impact is absorbed. Shooting any Load Size can now be done with no pain being transferred to the shooter. Reduces the challenge to reacquire the Target by minimizing the muzzle lift. It is not affected by chemicals, remaining flexible in extreme temperatures. Eliminates the Felt Punch of the Recoil. Other features include 3M Soft Touch Cheekrest Pad for improved comfort when shooting, Two Sling Swivel Studs, Checkered Forearm/Grip, easy drop-in installation, and DuPont® Extreme Temperature Glass Reinforced Polymer. Fits Most 91/30 Rifles & M-38, M-44 Carbines and Mosin Nagant Variants 7.62x54R Note: Some Minor Modification may be Required", "text": "Enfield Monte Carlo Stock 7.62x54R No. 4 Mk 1, 2 & 5 Convert Your Mosin Nagant into a Modern Hunting Rifle! Recoil Impact is absorbed. Shooting any Load Size can now be done with no pain being transferred to the shooter. Reduces the challenge to reacquire the Target by minimizing the muzzle lift. It is not affected by chemicals, remaining flexible in extreme temperatures. Eliminates the Felt Punch of the Recoil. Other features include 3M Soft Touch Cheekrest Pad for improved comfort when shooting, Two Sling Swivel Studs, Checkered Forearm/Grip, easy drop-in installation, and DuPont® Extreme Temperature Glass Reinforced Polymer. Fits Most 91/30 Rifles & M-38, M-44 Carbines and Mosin Nagant Variants 7.62x54R Note: Some Minor Modification may be Required", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31y7KPOOWEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007SNVJB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ATI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 72.79}}
{"item_id": "B007STLCVC", "title": "Haas-Jordan by Westcott The Urbanite Folding Umbrella (44-Inch)", "description": "This 44-inch umbrella has double canopy, and is a sturdy compact folding umbrella. When a compact umbrella needs to be up to the challenge of a full size storm, choose the Haas-Jordan umbrella.", "text": "Haas-Jordan by Westcott The Urbanite Folding Umbrella (44-Inch) This 44-inch umbrella has double canopy, and is a sturdy compact folding umbrella. When a compact umbrella needs to be up to the challenge of a full size storm, choose the Haas-Jordan umbrella.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CXJLVOfqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007STLCVC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Haas-Jordan", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Umbrellas"]], "price": 22.5}}
