{"item_id": "B007SWL7A0", "title": "Black Rack - Deer Rattling Antlers w/ Instructional video", "description": "The New Black Rack Rattling System by Illusion. This System beats all other rattling methods in three ways. 1. FULL-RACK design: The Black Rack's two full racks can create more tine-to-tine contact than any other system on the market. 2. BONE-CORE: The Black Rack was designed with an inner bone-core, so it sounds just like real antlers when the tines make contact. 3. CONCEALMENT: This system is black for a reason. You can rattle in deer at much closer distances than ever before. The Black Rack is the most effective system on the market. It comes with an hour long instructional DVD, featuring Olympic Gold Medalist Rod White. This video is packed with hunting instructions, scenarios, and strategies for using your Black Rack. The Black Rack is proudly made in the U.S.A. by Illusion Game Call Systems. They are lightweight and easy to stack for transportation.", "text": "Black Rack - Deer Rattling Antlers w/ Instructional video The New Black Rack Rattling System by Illusion. This System beats all other rattling methods in three ways. 1. FULL-RACK design: The Black Rack's two full racks can create more tine-to-tine contact than any other system on the market. 2. BONE-CORE: The Black Rack was designed with an inner bone-core, so it sounds just like real antlers when the tines make contact. 3. CONCEALMENT: This system is black for a reason. You can rattle in deer at much closer distances than ever before. The Black Rack is the most effective system on the market. It comes with an hour long instructional DVD, featuring Olympic Gold Medalist Rod White. This video is packed with hunting instructions, scenarios, and strategies for using your Black Rack. The Black Rack is proudly made in the U.S.A. by Illusion Game Call Systems. They are lightweight and easy to stack for transportation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hgdvqLM7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007SWL7A0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 28.49}}
