{"item_id": "B007T3NQUM", "title": "MAGPUL PTS MBUS 2 Gen 2 Front & Rear Rifle Sights (Black) for AirSoft Generation 2 M4 AR15", "description": "MAGPUL PTS MBUS GEN 2 FLIP-UP SIGHTS FRONT & REAR WITH SIGHT KEY (Black) Up for sale is a pair of MBUS PTS GEN 2 Flip up sights. One front sight. One rear sight. These are made by Magpul's PTS division. Sights are skillfully manufactured using a high quality and durable color injected polymer. These can be mounted on a varity of firearms/ black rifles. Fits standard Picatinny rails. All MAGPUL PTS ITEMS ARE FOR TRAINING USE, AIR-SOFT, SIMULATION, RIM-FIRE, ECT. •Front Sight is adjustable for elevation. •Rear is adjustable for windage and also has flip aperture. •Impact resistant and light weight. •Spring release can be easily manumitted from either side or by pressing the top. •Spring pressure and detent keeps sight erect but allows for smooth and crisp folding in the case of impact to avoid damage. •Protective wings shield the adjustable spring-locking A2 front sight post. Once installed these provide the same bore height as standard A2 irons. •Fits stranded 20MM Picatinny rails. •Do not mount to railed gas block due to high heat. Specifications: Weight: 1.2 oz. Length stowed: 2.6 in. Length deployed: 1.5 in. Color: Black", "text": "MAGPUL PTS MBUS 2 Gen 2 Front & Rear Rifle Sights (Black) for AirSoft Generation 2 M4 AR15 MAGPUL PTS MBUS GEN 2 FLIP-UP SIGHTS FRONT & REAR WITH SIGHT KEY (Black) Up for sale is a pair of MBUS PTS GEN 2 Flip up sights. One front sight. One rear sight. These are made by Magpul's PTS division. Sights are skillfully manufactured using a high quality and durable color injected polymer. These can be mounted on a varity of firearms/ black rifles. Fits standard Picatinny rails. All MAGPUL PTS ITEMS ARE FOR TRAINING USE, AIR-SOFT, SIMULATION, RIM-FIRE, ECT. •Front Sight is adjustable for elevation. •Rear is adjustable for windage and also has flip aperture. •Impact resistant and light weight. •Spring release can be easily manumitted from either side or by pressing the top. •Spring pressure and detent keeps sight erect but allows for smooth and crisp folding in the case of impact to avoid damage. •Protective wings shield the adjustable spring-locking A2 front sight post. Once installed these provide the same bore height as standard A2 irons. •Fits stranded 20MM Picatinny rails. •Do not mount to railed gas block due to high heat. Specifications: Weight: 1.2 oz. Length stowed: 2.6 in. Length deployed: 1.5 in. Color: Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VwpNASCVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007T3NQUM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007T95EQ0", "title": "Weehoo iGo Pro Bicycle Trailer (Silver/Red)", "description": "Safe, engaging, and fun, the Weehoo iGo and iGo 2 pedal trailers are the new benchmark in bicycle trailers. The balanced, streamlined design of the iGo gives you the ability to share your style of riding with your children. And riding is easy with the patented, self-aligning hitch, and single wheel design. This fresh approach to family mobility allows children to eat, sleep, pedal, or just sit back and enjoy the ride. Let The Adventures Begin!!! ---- Easily adjustable seat accommodates kids 2 to 9 years old. For either iGo model, the maximum per seat weight limit is 65 lbs. Maximum total weight limit for the single seat iGo trailer with cargo and passenger is 65 lbs. Maximum total weight limit for the iGo 2 trailer with cargo and passengers is 100 lbs. Keep little ones safe and secure by using the foot straps and the adjustable 3-point harness with chest buckle. Removable push bar easily detaches for travel and storage. There is lots of storage provided in the seat and in the panniers on both sides of the rear wheel. The sprocket and chain are enclosed to keep little fingers grease free and away from harm. The comfortable handgrips give children something to hold on to. Optional canopy and cargo basket accessories are sold separately.", "text": "Weehoo iGo Pro Bicycle Trailer (Silver/Red) Safe, engaging, and fun, the Weehoo iGo and iGo 2 pedal trailers are the new benchmark in bicycle trailers. The balanced, streamlined design of the iGo gives you the ability to share your style of riding with your children. And riding is easy with the patented, self-aligning hitch, and single wheel design. This fresh approach to family mobility allows children to eat, sleep, pedal, or just sit back and enjoy the ride. Let The Adventures Begin!!! ---- Easily adjustable seat accommodates kids 2 to 9 years old. For either iGo model, the maximum per seat weight limit is 65 lbs. Maximum total weight limit for the single seat iGo trailer with cargo and passenger is 65 lbs. Maximum total weight limit for the iGo 2 trailer with cargo and passengers is 100 lbs. Keep little ones safe and secure by using the foot straps and the adjustable 3-point harness with chest buckle. Removable push bar easily detaches for travel and storage. There is lots of storage provided in the seat and in the panniers on both sides of the rear wheel. The sprocket and chain are enclosed to keep little fingers grease free and away from harm. The comfortable handgrips give children something to hold on to. Optional canopy and cargo basket accessories are sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415aZxA2DXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007T95EQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weehoo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers", "Child Carrier Trailers"]], "price": 398.99}}
{"item_id": "B007T9VI9C", "title": "Froglube 2-Pk with 4oz Paste, 4oz Liquid, Storage Tube and Cloth", "description": "", "text": "Froglube 2-Pk with 4oz Paste, 4oz Liquid, Storage Tube and Cloth", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51t57oAbMoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007T9VI9C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007TAJIVG", "title": "White Lightning Bike Chain Cleaner Kit", "description": "Quick, efficient and easy to use. No removal of your bicycle chain necessary. The Chain Cleaner features 3-Brush rotating brushes for fast, thorough cleaning. Clips onto chain and in just 60 seconds, your chain is clean. Use once a month to maximize bicycle chain life and enjoy a cleaner, smoother and more efficient drivetrain. Includes Degreaser. The Chain Cleaner's 3-Brush design is what makes it clean so fast and thorough – the brushes rotate with the chain, each bristle tuft cleaning inside each chain link. The White Lightning Chain Cleaner will make you wonder why you ever suffered along with a dirty, grimy, messy chain – it's that easy to use.", "text": "White Lightning Bike Chain Cleaner Kit Quick, efficient and easy to use. No removal of your bicycle chain necessary. The Chain Cleaner features 3-Brush rotating brushes for fast, thorough cleaning. Clips onto chain and in just 60 seconds, your chain is clean. Use once a month to maximize bicycle chain life and enjoy a cleaner, smoother and more efficient drivetrain. Includes Degreaser. The Chain Cleaner's 3-Brush design is what makes it clean so fast and thorough – the brushes rotate with the chain, each bristle tuft cleaning inside each chain link. The White Lightning Chain Cleaner will make you wonder why you ever suffered along with a dirty, grimy, messy chain – it's that easy to use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HXP01PfoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TAJIVG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaning Tools"]], "price": 12.12}}
{"item_id": "B007TCIHJS", "title": "Under Armour Men's Tactical Winter Blackout Glove", "description": "Silicone grip printed palm provides superior grip. Velcro® enclosure delivers a secure, comfortable fit. Leather/Neoprene/Mesh. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Men's Tactical Winter Blackout Glove Silicone grip printed palm provides superior grip. Velcro® enclosure delivers a secure, comfortable fit. Leather/Neoprene/Mesh. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4150EVhaB0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TCIHJS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Gloves, Mittens & Liners", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007TDGXIO", "title": "Sport Squad FX48 Foosball Table, 48-Inch", "description": "Kids and adults of all ages will have loads of fun and excitement. High quality MDF used in the construction of the CARB certified environmentally friendly materials. Hours of fun can be spent competing with friends and family to see who can be the first to reach 10 goals and be titled the foosball table champion. The table features manual sliding scorers on each end of the table to help players keep track of the game's score. Goals have been specially designed to allow for the ball to be easily accessible. 1/2 inch chrome plated tubular steel rods will withstand hours of intense game play and will not warp over time. Ergonomic handles are specially designed to fit comfortably in your hand and allow for additional grip for creating stronger and faster passes and shots. Durable plastic players have been strategically molded to enhance ball control and table action. Colorful graphics and green interior play field add to the excellent dynamics of the table. Includes two high quality foosballs.", "text": "Sport Squad FX48 Foosball Table, 48-Inch Kids and adults of all ages will have loads of fun and excitement. High quality MDF used in the construction of the CARB certified environmentally friendly materials. Hours of fun can be spent competing with friends and family to see who can be the first to reach 10 goals and be titled the foosball table champion. The table features manual sliding scorers on each end of the table to help players keep track of the game's score. Goals have been specially designed to allow for the ball to be easily accessible. 1/2 inch chrome plated tubular steel rods will withstand hours of intense game play and will not warp over time. Ergonomic handles are specially designed to fit comfortably in your hand and allow for additional grip for creating stronger and faster passes and shots. Durable plastic players have been strategically molded to enhance ball control and table action. Colorful graphics and green interior play field add to the excellent dynamics of the table. Includes two high quality foosballs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418T4liadDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TDGXIO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sport Squad", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Arcade & Table Games", "Foosball", "Foosball Tables"]], "price": 129.95}}
