{"item_id": "B007TJ8S0Y", "title": "Troy Fixed M4 Front Rifle Battle Sight, Black", "description": "Looking for rock solid stability and dead on accuracy in a fixed sight, Troy Industries Fixed Battle Sights get the job done. This permanent, rail mounted alternative to a standard A2 sight allows limitless mounting options on all length rails with a serrated ramp to eliminate glare.", "text": "Troy Fixed M4 Front Rifle Battle Sight, Black Looking for rock solid stability and dead on accuracy in a fixed sight, Troy Industries Fixed Battle Sights get the job done. This permanent, rail mounted alternative to a standard A2 sight allows limitless mounting options on all length rails with a serrated ramp to eliminate glare.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gG0I%2BRbqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TJ8S0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 46.5}}
{"item_id": "B007TM996S", "title": "Condor Battle Belt - 211", "description": "Condor Battle Belt is designed to help the adventurer in you keep your gear secure while helping you bear the load. Constructed of 1000D CORDURA Nylon for durability and breathability, it also features padded mesh with non-slip lining. (NOTE: Rigger Belt Not Included).", "text": "Condor Battle Belt - 211 Condor Battle Belt is designed to help the adventurer in you keep your gear secure while helping you bear the load. Constructed of 1000D CORDURA Nylon for durability and breathability, it also features padded mesh with non-slip lining. (NOTE: Rigger Belt Not Included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ilu3V416L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TM996S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007TNCOD2", "title": "Bushwhacker Diablo Black - Bicycle Top Tube Bag Cycling Frame Pack Bike Stem Bag", "description": "The Bushwhacker top tube frame bag attaches with a 4-point mounting system. Four velcro straps attach to top tube and handlebar stem. Dual pull zipper allows for quick and easy one hand access. Quarter inch foam padding protects sensitive items. Exterior Dimensions: 6\" L x 2.5\" W x 4.5\" H", "text": "Bushwhacker Diablo Black - Bicycle Top Tube Bag Cycling Frame Pack Bike Stem Bag The Bushwhacker top tube frame bag attaches with a 4-point mounting system. Four velcro straps attach to top tube and handlebar stem. Dual pull zipper allows for quick and easy one hand access. Quarter inch foam padding protects sensitive items. Exterior Dimensions: 6\" L x 2.5\" W x 4.5\" H", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qxXrr3YmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TNCOD2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B007TNWRR0", "title": "BSI Deluxe Single Ball Tote Bag", "description": "", "text": "BSI Deluxe Single Ball Tote Bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GskWhyltL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TNWRR0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Bowling", "Bags", "Bowling Totes"]], "price": 25.2}}
{"item_id": "B007TNX9ZE", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Sonic Cleaner II (110 Volt)", "description": "The Lock-N-Load Sonic Cleaner 2L features and 80 watt ceramic heater that enhances cleaning action and especially helps when cleaning gun parts. Its large two liter stainless steel tank holds up to three hundred .223 cases or one hundred fifty .308 cases. Combined with One Shot Sonic Clean solution, the microjet action of the Lock-N-Load Sonic Cleaner 2L removes carbon residue and other debris from cartridge cases, small gun parts and other small metal equipment and it cleans internal and external surfaces of cartridge cases and primer pockets. The cleaner's 5 to 30 minute timer allows you to choose the appropriate cycle time for you application.", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Sonic Cleaner II (110 Volt) The Lock-N-Load Sonic Cleaner 2L features and 80 watt ceramic heater that enhances cleaning action and especially helps when cleaning gun parts. Its large two liter stainless steel tank holds up to three hundred .223 cases or one hundred fifty .308 cases. Combined with One Shot Sonic Clean solution, the microjet action of the Lock-N-Load Sonic Cleaner 2L removes carbon residue and other debris from cartridge cases, small gun parts and other small metal equipment and it cleans internal and external surfaces of cartridge cases and primer pockets. The cleaner's 5 to 30 minute timer allows you to choose the appropriate cycle time for you application.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419iZxdt5rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TNX9ZE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B007TNXAGM", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Case Prep Trio", "description": "Make case preparation faster and easier than ever with the new Lock-N-Load Case Prep Trio. It's durable brushed aluminum housing and high torque, low speed motor will provide years of dependable use. Speed up your case prep process with the 3-tool capacity and utilize onboard storage for optional accessories like our primer pocket cleaners, primer pocket reamers, case neck brushes and any other 8-32 thread tools. With three active stations, you can chamfer, deburr and clean primer pockets without having to change tools. The Lock-N-Load Case Prep Trio comes with both inside diameter and outside diameter chamfer and deburr tools Compatible with 110V or 220V", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Case Prep Trio Make case preparation faster and easier than ever with the new Lock-N-Load Case Prep Trio. It's durable brushed aluminum housing and high torque, low speed motor will provide years of dependable use. Speed up your case prep process with the 3-tool capacity and utilize onboard storage for optional accessories like our primer pocket cleaners, primer pocket reamers, case neck brushes and any other 8-32 thread tools. With three active stations, you can chamfer, deburr and clean primer pockets without having to change tools. The Lock-N-Load Case Prep Trio comes with both inside diameter and outside diameter chamfer and deburr tools Compatible with 110V or 220V", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bHkER7fJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TNXAGM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 98.19}}
{"item_id": "B007TNXFM6", "title": "Hornady .300 AAC/Whisper .308 Custom Grade Reloading Dies (Series I, Two die set)", "description": "Hornady's Custom-Grade Dies provide a lifetime of reloading. They're so well-crafted that they're guaranteed never to break or wear out from normal use and now they're better than ever! The new Zip Spindle design features a series of light threads cut on the spindle and spindle collet. This design eliminates spindle slippage and takes the knuckle-busting out of tightening the spindle lock while making spindle adjustments a snap. Hornady's new Zip spindle is nothing short of genius!", "text": "Hornady .300 AAC/Whisper .308 Custom Grade Reloading Dies (Series I, Two die set) Hornady's Custom-Grade Dies provide a lifetime of reloading. They're so well-crafted that they're guaranteed never to break or wear out from normal use and now they're better than ever! The new Zip Spindle design features a series of light threads cut on the spindle and spindle collet. This design eliminates spindle slippage and takes the knuckle-busting out of tightening the spindle lock while making spindle adjustments a snap. Hornady's new Zip spindle is nothing short of genius!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41m7FfPiChL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TNXFM6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 42.08}}
{"item_id": "B007TNXGMK", "title": "Hornady One Shot Gun Cleaner with DynaGlide Plus (14 fl oz.Aerosol Spray Can )", "description": "Hornady One Shot with DynaGlide Plus is a revolutionary formula developed to rid firearms of malfunctions caused by a buildup of lubricants and grime. The unique DynaGlide Plus formula cleans the actions of firearms and leaves a micro-thin layer of dry lubricant. Because One Shot is a dry, non-tacky lube, it smoothes actions and eliminates mechanical fouling due to powder and dirt adhering to the lubricant", "text": "Hornady One Shot Gun Cleaner with DynaGlide Plus (14 fl oz.Aerosol Spray Can ) Hornady One Shot with DynaGlide Plus is a revolutionary formula developed to rid firearms of malfunctions caused by a buildup of lubricants and grime. The unique DynaGlide Plus formula cleans the actions of firearms and leaves a micro-thin layer of dry lubricant. Because One Shot is a dry, non-tacky lube, it smoothes actions and eliminates mechanical fouling due to powder and dirt adhering to the lubricant", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G60fr-ZEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TNXGMK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 24.07}}
{"item_id": "B007TNXJTK", "title": "Hornady One Shot TAP HD-Extreme Gun Cleaner/Conditioner and Dry Lube", "description": "Formulated for extreme shooting and weather conditions, this all-purpose cleaner/conditioner/dry lube contains 4X Metal Protector additive which prevents tarnish, and in turn, reduces friction and decreases jamming problems in semi-automatics", "text": "Hornady One Shot TAP HD-Extreme Gun Cleaner/Conditioner and Dry Lube Formulated for extreme shooting and weather conditions, this all-purpose cleaner/conditioner/dry lube contains 4X Metal Protector additive which prevents tarnish, and in turn, reduces friction and decreases jamming problems in semi-automatics", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tvg8iBv-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TNXJTK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 10.29}}
{"item_id": "B007TO5FZK", "title": "JSB Diabolo EXACT .22 Caliber Air Gun Pellets 250 ct.", "description": "JSB Diablo Exact is a 15.8 grain pellet.", "text": "JSB Diabolo EXACT .22 Caliber Air Gun Pellets 250 ct. JSB Diablo Exact is a 15.8 grain pellet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517GAZMJ-0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TO5FZK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JSB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 15.94}}
{"item_id": "B007TOHDQY", "title": "Plano 1109-00 Protector Series Ultra Compact Bow Case (Black)", "description": "The ultra-compact bow case is designed to safely store and transport smaller-sized bows, including the original Genesis bow, Mission Craze, Menace, PSE Mini-Burner, Diamond Nuclear Ice and many others. Featuring tie-down straps, arrow holders, dense foam padding and Plano's patented crush-proof PillarLock system, this small case is big on high-end amenities.", "text": "Plano 1109-00 Protector Series Ultra Compact Bow Case (Black) The ultra-compact bow case is designed to safely store and transport smaller-sized bows, including the original Genesis bow, Mission Craze, Menace, PSE Mini-Burner, Diamond Nuclear Ice and many others. Featuring tie-down straps, arrow holders, dense foam padding and Plano's patented crush-proof PillarLock system, this small case is big on high-end amenities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cxiryQvlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TOHDQY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano Molding Company", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 39.99}}
