{"item_id": "B007TRGZ7Y", "title": "Otis LE 7.62mm Chamber Brush #FG-368 HT", "description": "The tapered bronze bristles of the Otis chamber brush scrub the chamber, neck and shoulder. The steel bristles at the base scrub the star chamber of the locking lugs. The brass stem is cold welded to the core, and the tip is folded, not cut. The chamber brush has a standard 8-32 thread.", "text": "Otis LE 7.62mm Chamber Brush #FG-368 HT The tapered bronze bristles of the Otis chamber brush scrub the chamber, neck and shoulder. The steel bristles at the base scrub the star chamber of the locking lugs. The brass stem is cold welded to the core, and the tip is folded, not cut. The chamber brush has a standard 8-32 thread.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kVIO5k0NL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TRGZ7Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 7.36}}
{"item_id": "B007TWY86E", "title": "Military Style 3 Day Tactical MOLLE Backpack", "description": "Military Style 3 Day Tactical MOLLE Backpack. Comes in Black, Tan (Coyote Brown), ACU Digital Camo and Woodland Digital Camo. Brand is Hanks Surplus. Adjustable chest, waist and shoulder straps. Heavy duty top carry handle. 4 zippers. Main compartment has one mesh zipper pocket and on backside of pack is one hydration pocket with bungy cord. The second main compartment has utility pocket to hold pens and such items. Third outer pocket has no internal pockets. The backside of pack has one zipper pocket. Padded waist pad and shoulders straps. Padded backside of pack. Approximate size 19\" H x 14\" W x 9\" Deep. Approximate Weight 3.5 lbs. Please note the zipper pull tabs have been updated and do not include the plastic end cap.", "text": "Military Style 3 Day Tactical MOLLE Backpack Military Style 3 Day Tactical MOLLE Backpack. Comes in Black, Tan (Coyote Brown), ACU Digital Camo and Woodland Digital Camo. Brand is Hanks Surplus. Adjustable chest, waist and shoulder straps. Heavy duty top carry handle. 4 zippers. Main compartment has one mesh zipper pocket and on backside of pack is one hydration pocket with bungy cord. The second main compartment has utility pocket to hold pens and such items. Third outer pocket has no internal pockets. The backside of pack has one zipper pocket. Padded waist pad and shoulders straps. Padded backside of pack. Approximate size 19\" H x 14\" W x 9\" Deep. Approximate Weight 3.5 lbs. Please note the zipper pull tabs have been updated and do not include the plastic end cap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UQ995EsjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007TWY86E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B007U5OJQO", "title": "Crimson Trace Rail Master Universal Rail Mount Light (Black)", "description": "How do you enhance a Rail-Equipped firearm? Lock a Crimson Trace Laser or Light or Both, right up front. The Rail Master is here and once you lock it on, it will not move, thanks to advanced secure-lock your handgun frame has a rail, we've got its Rail Master technology™. Activation is instant. Just tap on, and tap off.", "text": "Crimson Trace Rail Master Universal Rail Mount Light (Black) How do you enhance a Rail-Equipped firearm? Lock a Crimson Trace Laser or Light or Both, right up front. The Rail Master is here and once you lock it on, it will not move, thanks to advanced secure-lock your handgun frame has a rail, we've got its Rail Master technology™. Activation is instant. Just tap on, and tap off.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sdHaaQ3xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007U5OJQO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 109.98}}
{"item_id": "B007U5ZNOG", "title": "Ka-Bar Combat Kukri Knife", "description": "It's tough to argue with the success of the world's most recognizable, time-tested fixed-blade knife so Kabar did what any smart company would do: they didn't change the original design, they expanded upon it. This knife features a high-carbon, epoxy powder-coated 1095 steel non-reflective black blade. Tests prove the finish is more durable than ever. The classic oval shape of the original Kabar remains and has been modernized with a material, nearly impervious to sweat, chemicals, water and wear. The Combat Kukri has a Kraton G handle.", "text": "Ka-Bar Combat Kukri Knife It's tough to argue with the success of the world's most recognizable, time-tested fixed-blade knife so Kabar did what any smart company would do: they didn't change the original design, they expanded upon it. This knife features a high-carbon, epoxy powder-coated 1095 steel non-reflective black blade. Tests prove the finish is more durable than ever. The classic oval shape of the original Kabar remains and has been modernized with a material, nearly impervious to sweat, chemicals, water and wear. The Combat Kukri has a Kraton G handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21leSnWFl8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007U5ZNOG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 71.69}}
{"item_id": "B007U6CJ6U", "title": "SE 55in. Walking Stick Hand Carved Bear Rope Wrapped Around Stick", "description": "Hand Carved Design on Body Design : GRIZZLY BEAR ? Removable Metal Reinforced Rubber Tip ? Metal Tip for Better Traction ? Use: For Support while Hiking and Walking ? Material: Wood ? Height : 55 ? Wrist Strap", "text": "SE 55in. Walking Stick Hand Carved Bear Rope Wrapped Around Stick Hand Carved Design on Body Design : GRIZZLY BEAR ? Removable Metal Reinforced Rubber Tip ? Metal Tip for Better Traction ? Use: For Support while Hiking and Walking ? Material: Wood ? Height : 55 ? Wrist Strap", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R9Cb1P4-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007U6CJ6U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 11.94}}
{"item_id": "B007U80NAW", "title": "Mosin Nagant 9130 See-Thru Scout Scope Mount by Brass Stacker", "description": "FEATURES: Allows for mounting of Scout Scope or other long eye relief optics to Mosin Nagant model 91/30′s without the need to drill & tap receiver or make any permanent modifications to firearm. It is designed to fit over rear sight block in order to allow for continued use of the original fixed/iron sights up to 100 meters. The Mount is rigid steel construction with Black Oxide finish. 100% Lifetime Warranty! SPECIFICATIONS: The Mount will accommodate a front to back (horizontal) pin center distance of 1.39\" (35.3mm) to 1.82\" (46.7mm) and allows for .039\" (1mm) of up and down (vertical) movement. The Mount is designed to fit over rear sight blocks that measure between .750″(19.05mm) and .787″(20.00mm) wide. The total weight including hardware is 5.5 oz. Please note that we have made every reasonable effort to ensure that our Mount will work with the vast majority of 9130's. If for any reason our Mount does not work with your specific 9130 it can be returned (undamaged) for a full refund. UNIT: Mount: CNC laser cut perimeter, die punched holes and mounting slots, form tapped threads and die press formed. 3/32\" (13 ga.) thick HR, P&O; type CS-B A569 carbon steel; 40000 psi yield strength. Black Oxide plated. Picatinny Rail: CNC machined to MIL-STD-1913. 8″ long. HR ATSM A36 low carbon steel; 36000 psi yield strength. Black Oxide plated. Screws: #10-32 x \" flat head socket cap screws. Alloy steel; Rc 38-45 hardness. HARDWARE: Bolts: M3x.5 X 30mm socket head cap screw. Grade 12.9 medium carbon Q&T; alloy steel; Rc 38-44 hardness; 160000 psi yield strength, 177000 psi tensile strength; 1.67 ft lbs tightening torque. Nuts: M3x.5 Hex Nut. Grade 2 low carbon steel; Rc 32 hardness; 60000 psi tensile strength. Black Oxide plated. Lock Washers: 3mm cut spring lock washer. Steel. Black Oxide plated. Flat Washers: 3mm plain flat washer. Steel. Black Oxide plated", "text": "Mosin Nagant 9130 See-Thru Scout Scope Mount by Brass Stacker FEATURES: Allows for mounting of Scout Scope or other long eye relief optics to Mosin Nagant model 91/30′s without the need to drill & tap receiver or make any permanent modifications to firearm. It is designed to fit over rear sight block in order to allow for continued use of the original fixed/iron sights up to 100 meters. The Mount is rigid steel construction with Black Oxide finish. 100% Lifetime Warranty! SPECIFICATIONS: The Mount will accommodate a front to back (horizontal) pin center distance of 1.39\" (35.3mm) to 1.82\" (46.7mm) and allows for .039\" (1mm) of up and down (vertical) movement. The Mount is designed to fit over rear sight blocks that measure between .750″(19.05mm) and .787″(20.00mm) wide. The total weight including hardware is 5.5 oz. Please note that we have made every reasonable effort to ensure that our Mount will work with the vast majority of 9130's. If for any reason our Mount does not work with your specific 9130 it can be returned (undamaged) for a full refund. UNIT: Mount: CNC laser cut perimeter, die punched holes and mounting slots, form tapped threads and die press formed. 3/32\" (13 ga.) thick HR, P&O; type CS-B A569 carbon steel; 40000 psi yield strength. Black Oxide plated. Picatinny Rail: CNC machined to MIL-STD-1913. 8″ long. HR ATSM A36 low carbon steel; 36000 psi yield strength. Black Oxide plated. Screws: #10-32 x \" flat head socket cap screws. Alloy steel; Rc 38-45 hardness. HARDWARE: Bolts: M3x.5 X 30mm socket head cap screw. Grade 12.9 medium carbon Q&T; alloy steel; Rc 38-44 hardness; 160000 psi yield strength, 177000 psi tensile strength; 1.67 ft lbs tightening torque. Nuts: M3x.5 Hex Nut. Grade 2 low carbon steel; Rc 32 hardness; 60000 psi tensile strength. Black Oxide plated. Lock Washers: 3mm cut spring lock washer. Steel. Black Oxide plated. Flat Washers: 3mm plain flat washer. Steel. Black Oxide plated", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419SO2JBplL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007U80NAW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 64.95}}
