{"item_id": "B007UCBUUA", "title": "DTOM Combination POCKET/IWB Holster for Ruger LCR revolver CC6", "description": "****** Second Generation - The rivet from the clip is now buried beneath the lining material and is no longer expoused to the gun*******You will love the comfort and convenience of this holster. Only model with a Patent Pending Design that allows for it t be almost instantly converted from ITWB (in the waist band) to Pocket Holster. Exterior is made from Armadillo Nylon for extreme toughness while inside lining is smooth for easy draw. You will not find a better or more versatile CCW holster for the Ruger LCR Revolver on the market today. Try it risk free with a 30 day money back guarantee.", "text": "DTOM Combination POCKET/IWB Holster for Ruger LCR revolver CC6 ****** Second Generation - The rivet from the clip is now buried beneath the lining material and is no longer expoused to the gun*******You will love the comfort and convenience of this holster. Only model with a Patent Pending Design that allows for it t be almost instantly converted from ITWB (in the waist band) to Pocket Holster. Exterior is made from Armadillo Nylon for extreme toughness while inside lining is smooth for easy draw. You will not find a better or more versatile CCW holster for the Ruger LCR Revolver on the market today. Try it risk free with a 30 day money back guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OJ%2BhspLaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007UCBUUA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.92}}
{"item_id": "B007UKEHAW", "title": "Terminator 9900000 V Stun Gun and LED Flashlight", "description": "At 8,800,000 Volts this TERMINATOR brand stun gun is the highest voltage stun gun available. Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. If the sight and sound doesn't stop him a jolt from this stun gun certainly will bring an attacker down in just 2 seconds! When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Connecticut, Michigan, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County,IA", "text": "Terminator 9900000 V Stun Gun and LED Flashlight At 8,800,000 Volts this TERMINATOR brand stun gun is the highest voltage stun gun available. Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. If the sight and sound doesn't stop him a jolt from this stun gun certainly will bring an attacker down in just 2 seconds! When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Connecticut, Michigan, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County,IA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bhoFp1WUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007UKEHAW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B007UKL9FI", "title": "DTOM Combination POCKET/IWB Holster for both Ruger LCP and Keltec P3AT, P32 w/ Crimson Trace Lasers, CC5", "description": "You will love the comfort and convenience of this holster. Only model with a Patent Pending Design that allows for it t be almost instantly converted from ITWB (in the waist band) to Pocket Holster. Exterior is made from Armadillo Nylon for extreme toughness and excellent trigger protection while the inside lining is a silky smooth nylon for easy draw. You will not find a better or more versatile CCW holster for both the Ruger LCP and Keltec P3AT, P32 equipped w/ Crimson Trace Lasers on the market today. Try it risk free with a 30 day money back guarantee.", "text": "DTOM Combination POCKET/IWB Holster for both Ruger LCP and Keltec P3AT, P32 w/ Crimson Trace Lasers, CC5 You will love the comfort and convenience of this holster. Only model with a Patent Pending Design that allows for it t be almost instantly converted from ITWB (in the waist band) to Pocket Holster. Exterior is made from Armadillo Nylon for extreme toughness and excellent trigger protection while the inside lining is a silky smooth nylon for easy draw. You will not find a better or more versatile CCW holster for both the Ruger LCP and Keltec P3AT, P32 equipped w/ Crimson Trace Lasers on the market today. Try it risk free with a 30 day money back guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rDJs8ewrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007UKL9FI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 21.92}}
