{"item_id": "B007USKAKA", "title": "Aqua Lung Sport Scuba Snorkeling Dive Mask", "description": "Designed for Adult Divers Snorkelers or Swimmers, this Mask gives an Exceptionally Wide Field of View. Mask is equipped with Aqua Lung's Easy Adjust Buckles and has a Wide Silicone Rubber Split Strap Designed Mask Strap for even dispersion of pressure for increased Fit and Comfort. Mask has an Easy-to-Reach One-Hand Nose Pocket for Ear Equalization which can be utilized even when wearing thick gloves.", "text": "Aqua Lung Sport Scuba Snorkeling Dive Mask Designed for Adult Divers Snorkelers or Swimmers, this Mask gives an Exceptionally Wide Field of View. Mask is equipped with Aqua Lung's Easy Adjust Buckles and has a Wide Silicone Rubber Split Strap Designed Mask Strap for even dispersion of pressure for increased Fit and Comfort. Mask has an Easy-to-Reach One-Hand Nose Pocket for Ear Equalization which can be utilized even when wearing thick gloves.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417qPqbh3lL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007USKAKA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B007USLBJY", "title": "Talon S&W J Frame Taurus 5 shot and Colt Detective Special IWB", "description": "Talon Holsters are designed by professional Law Enforcement Officers who have dedicated themselves to providing citizens with firearms instruction, a place to shoot and a quality concealed carry holster. Made in the USA, our holsters offer a ton of possibilities. If a holster is not simple, comfortable, and easy to put on and take off, you probably won?t wear it. Our IWB holsters are designed in two types, the thicker guns like Glocks will have the ?Stay Open Top? with a steel cable in the top band to hold the mouth of the holster open when reholstering. The XD, Glock and a couple of others feature this. The thinner guns like 1911?s and most all small guns don?t seem to need this. The double leather top keeps the holster open and safe for single hand holstering. Cheap nylon holsters are out, they are junk. Polymer seems to wear the finish off your pistol. Complicated wrap around holsters are not our style. We keep things simple, easy and traditional. Check out demo videos on YouTube by searching for TalonHolsters or Talon Training Group. These are really nice quality and the career law enforcement officers who own the company have spent a lot of time developing them. All our holsters are made in the USA and are constructed exclusively of Hermann Oak Leather, and made from US Steers. Hermann Oak Leather Company supplies our leather and has been in business since 1881. Nothing foreign touches our holsters. Grown, tanned, constructed and delivered to and from the USA. These are vegetable tanned and dyed with a water based dye so nothing will harm the firearm. Most holsters are made from leather tanned using a chromium based process. Not ours. Designed by our instructors at Talon Training, and tried and tested to ensure you are getting the best there is, we stand behind our holsters. Our NO-Bull warranty guarantees that if you don't like it, send it back for a full refund. If it breaks, ever, we will replace it. (Routine age and wear, is normal, of course.) See", "text": "Talon S&W J Frame Taurus 5 shot and Colt Detective Special IWB Talon Holsters are designed by professional Law Enforcement Officers who have dedicated themselves to providing citizens with firearms instruction, a place to shoot and a quality concealed carry holster. Made in the USA, our holsters offer a ton of possibilities. If a holster is not simple, comfortable, and easy to put on and take off, you probably won?t wear it. Our IWB holsters are designed in two types, the thicker guns like Glocks will have the ?Stay Open Top? with a steel cable in the top band to hold the mouth of the holster open when reholstering. The XD, Glock and a couple of others feature this. The thinner guns like 1911?s and most all small guns don?t seem to need this. The double leather top keeps the holster open and safe for single hand holstering. Cheap nylon holsters are out, they are junk. Polymer seems to wear the finish off your pistol. Complicated wrap around holsters are not our style. We keep things simple, easy and traditional. Check out demo videos on YouTube by searching for TalonHolsters or Talon Training Group. These are really nice quality and the career law enforcement officers who own the company have spent a lot of time developing them. All our holsters are made in the USA and are constructed exclusively of Hermann Oak Leather, and made from US Steers. Hermann Oak Leather Company supplies our leather and has been in business since 1881. Nothing foreign touches our holsters. Grown, tanned, constructed and delivered to and from the USA. These are vegetable tanned and dyed with a water based dye so nothing will harm the firearm. Most holsters are made from leather tanned using a chromium based process. Not ours. Designed by our instructors at Talon Training, and tried and tested to ensure you are getting the best there is, we stand behind our holsters. Our NO-Bull warranty guarantees that if you don't like it, send it back for a full refund. If it breaks, ever, we will replace it. (Routine age and wear, is normal, of course.) See", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CKAQaGJ9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007USLBJY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B007UT14FO", "title": "ShotLock Shotgun Solo-Vault", "description": "Made of heavy duty 14 gauge steel, and super compact only the ShotLock features adjustable felt lined trigger guard blocks that can be moved to accommodate either left or right handed shotguns, a reversible door that can open either to the right or to the left and a heavy duty mechanical 5-button push button lock with a 1,000+ lock combinations. The ShotLock secures your semi-auto, pump, or over and under shotgun both comfortably and securely with virtually no access to the trigger assembly. The ShotLock can be mounted in a variety of home or vehicle applications. The ShotLock Solo-Vault was designed as a universal shotgun mounting platform with the ability to integrate with the greater majority of pump, semi-auto, O/U, side by side and pistol grip shotguns on the market today. Some aftermarket applications (scopes, side saddles, ghost rings, etc) may not be supported by this product. Some aftermarket applications (tactical rails, lights, etc) may not be supported. Please check with manufacturer by calling 800-967-8107.", "text": "ShotLock Shotgun Solo-Vault Made of heavy duty 14 gauge steel, and super compact only the ShotLock features adjustable felt lined trigger guard blocks that can be moved to accommodate either left or right handed shotguns, a reversible door that can open either to the right or to the left and a heavy duty mechanical 5-button push button lock with a 1,000+ lock combinations. The ShotLock secures your semi-auto, pump, or over and under shotgun both comfortably and securely with virtually no access to the trigger assembly. The ShotLock can be mounted in a variety of home or vehicle applications. The ShotLock Solo-Vault was designed as a universal shotgun mounting platform with the ability to integrate with the greater majority of pump, semi-auto, O/U, side by side and pistol grip shotguns on the market today. Some aftermarket applications (scopes, side saddles, ghost rings, etc) may not be supported by this product. Some aftermarket applications (tactical rails, lights, etc) may not be supported. Please check with manufacturer by calling 800-967-8107.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bX5Hg01kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007UT14FO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SHOT LOCK", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 158.94}}
