{"item_id": "B007UT3O3O", "title": "CVLIFE 9-13 Inches Rifle Bipod with 3 Different Solid Sling Adapters Base", "description": "1.Mounts onto rifles with sling stud or with Picatinny rails under forend2.Made of durable, light-weight aluminum3.Quickly attach to or detach from the rifle using existing swivel stud4.Kit Includes a sling adapter which attaches to Picatinny RAS rails and then works with the bipod5.Bipod has an attachment point for sling with bipod installed6.Rubber padded on top to protect forend of gun7.Spring loaded foldable legs are notched to extend to multiple lengths8.This bipod does not have swivel top and does not tilt from side to side9.Anodized matte finish10.Notched leg design for fast and accurate height adjustment11.Presents 3 Adaptors AR-15 hand guard adapter,Universal barrel mount,and Picatinny rail sling studPackage Included-- 1x tactical 9-13 inches bipod-- 1x Hand guard adapter-- 1x Universal barrel mount adapter-- 1x Weaver style picatinny rail sling mount adapter", "text": "CVLIFE 9-13 Inches Rifle Bipod with 3 Different Solid Sling Adapters Base 1.Mounts onto rifles with sling stud or with Picatinny rails under forend2.Made of durable, light-weight aluminum3.Quickly attach to or detach from the rifle using existing swivel stud4.Kit Includes a sling adapter which attaches to Picatinny RAS rails and then works with the bipod5.Bipod has an attachment point for sling with bipod installed6.Rubber padded on top to protect forend of gun7.Spring loaded foldable legs are notched to extend to multiple lengths8.This bipod does not have swivel top and does not tilt from side to side9.Anodized matte finish10.Notched leg design for fast and accurate height adjustment11.Presents 3 Adaptors AR-15 hand guard adapter,Universal barrel mount,and Picatinny rail sling studPackage Included-- 1x tactical 9-13 inches bipod-- 1x Hand guard adapter-- 1x Universal barrel mount adapter-- 1x Weaver style picatinny rail sling mount adapter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RRLJHB0nL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007UT3O3O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 28.99}}
