{"item_id": "B007UXTSTE", "title": "SanDisk 64GB Mobile Ultra MicroSDXC Class 10 UHS-1 30MB/s Memory Card with SD Adapter (NEW VERSION) Retail packaging", "description": "DECENT FEATURES of the Sandisk 64GB Micro SD Card Ultra - Class 10 Combines the highest performance storage capacity and blazing data transfer rates Excellent performance and value Represents ideal recording media for your camera Waterproof, temperature proof, shock proof, vibration proof, and x-ray proof memory cards Deliver professional-grade performance for Sandisk videos The SPECS of the Sandisk 64GB Micro SD Card Ultra - Class 10 1 SanDisk 64GB Ultra microSDXC (Class 10) This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "text": "SanDisk 64GB Mobile Ultra MicroSDXC Class 10 UHS-1 30MB/s Memory Card with SD Adapter (NEW VERSION) Retail packaging DECENT FEATURES of the Sandisk 64GB Micro SD Card Ultra - Class 10 Combines the highest performance storage capacity and blazing data transfer rates Excellent performance and value Represents ideal recording media for your camera Waterproof, temperature proof, shock proof, vibration proof, and x-ray proof memory cards Deliver professional-grade performance for Sandisk videos The SPECS of the Sandisk 64GB Micro SD Card Ultra - Class 10 1 SanDisk 64GB Ultra microSDXC (Class 10) This product can only be shipped within the United States. Please don't hate us.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d%2BFUtKk-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007UXTSTE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SanDisk", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Souvenirs", "Trading Cards"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B007V4JL26", "title": "Vincere Sports Sand Socks: Beach Volleyball or Soccer, Snorkeling, Watersports", "description": "Protect your feet from hot sand, mud, dirt, slime, and seaweed this summer with these Vincere Unisex Neoprene Sand Socks! These slip on booties are perfect for beach volleyball or soccer, scuba diving, snorkeling, surfing, boating, watersports, or just a day at the beach. The neoprene soles are tough for protection yet comfortable to wear all day long. The lycra upper has a UV protection rating of 50 to shield your skin from burns. These sand socks are slim enough to be worn with shoes or sandals. Available in a variety of adult unisex sizes.", "text": "Vincere Sports Sand Socks: Beach Volleyball or Soccer, Snorkeling, Watersports Protect your feet from hot sand, mud, dirt, slime, and seaweed this summer with these Vincere Unisex Neoprene Sand Socks! These slip on booties are perfect for beach volleyball or soccer, scuba diving, snorkeling, surfing, boating, watersports, or just a day at the beach. The neoprene soles are tough for protection yet comfortable to wear all day long. The lycra upper has a UV protection rating of 50 to shield your skin from burns. These sand socks are slim enough to be worn with shoes or sandals. Available in a variety of adult unisex sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41adlicVtvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007V4JL26.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Volleyball", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007V5BM4U", "title": "Drago Gear 36\" Double Gun Case Black", "description": "Firearms provide protection and defense to those who bear them. Return the favor. Drago Tactical Weapon Cases are designed to optimally secure and protect long guns, and come equipped with multiple storage areas to efficiently organize ammunition and accessories.", "text": "Drago Gear 36\" Double Gun Case Black Firearms provide protection and defense to those who bear them. Return the favor. Drago Tactical Weapon Cases are designed to optimally secure and protect long guns, and come equipped with multiple storage areas to efficiently organize ammunition and accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CtCxGHQyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007V5BM4U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ATI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 66.5}}
