{"item_id": "B007VHX8LS", "title": "Olive Drab NBC Anti-Spill Military Canteen Cap", "description": "Polypropylene, rubber and stainless steel material. Enables user to drink from a canteen while wearing a gas mask. Fits standard 1-and 2-quart military and NATO standard 28mm military canteens. Adapter has a pressure valve fitting gasket, cover, and a coupling with a self-sealing valve. Receives the drinking hose from any NATO standard military gas mask like the msa millennium, m-40 and MCU-2p. Dimensions: cap: 1.85\" diameter. Cap height: 1.36\", Snap height: 2 5/8\" (inches). NBC is an acronym for Nuclear, Biological and Chemical. MIL-C-51278D. (Olive Drab). This product is GSA Compliant.", "text": "Olive Drab NBC Anti-Spill Military Canteen Cap Polypropylene, rubber and stainless steel material. Enables user to drink from a canteen while wearing a gas mask. Fits standard 1-and 2-quart military and NATO standard 28mm military canteens. Adapter has a pressure valve fitting gasket, cover, and a coupling with a self-sealing valve. Receives the drinking hose from any NATO standard military gas mask like the msa millennium, m-40 and MCU-2p. Dimensions: cap: 1.85\" diameter. Cap height: 1.36\", Snap height: 2 5/8\" (inches). NBC is an acronym for Nuclear, Biological and Chemical. MIL-C-51278D. (Olive Drab). This product is GSA Compliant.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CjXHA4i9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007VHX8LS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Atlantco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 0.5}}
{"item_id": "B007VSXAHE", "title": "Gamo Airgun Cleaning 3 Piece Rod Kit (.177 Caliber)", "description": "Cleaning rod set includes three-piece cleaning rod that disassembles for easy storage.", "text": "Gamo Airgun Cleaning 3 Piece Rod Kit (.177 Caliber) Cleaning rod set includes three-piece cleaning rod that disassembles for easy storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2ByuoSoL-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007VSXAHE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B007VSXAZG", "title": "Gamo Airgun Cleaning Kit", "description": "Gamo Cleaning kit is the solution to keep the external and internal parts of your air gun in good condition. Kit includes: Cleaning rod and barrel brush for .177, .22, .25 calibers. Cotton pellets, cotton patches, cleaning oil and cleaning brush.", "text": "Gamo Airgun Cleaning Kit Gamo Cleaning kit is the solution to keep the external and internal parts of your air gun in good condition. Kit includes: Cleaning rod and barrel brush for .177, .22, .25 calibers. Cotton pellets, cotton patches, cleaning oil and cleaning brush.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DQ6YnxlfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007VSXAZG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B007VSZCPC", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Vise Block Combo : 2 Piece .223 5.56 AR15 AR-15 M4 M16 A1 A2 Rifle Upper & Lower Receiver Mag Magazine Polymer Gunsmith Bench Action Vise Blocks", "description": "Upper Block : Constructed of black injection molded polymer.Fits both carry handles & flattop uppers. Easy to use, the block lets you tightly clamp a carry handle receiver or flattop receiver in a large bench vise. The vise block is locked into the users table/workbench vise. Holds the rifle firm so you can work on your rifle securely without scratching or damaging the finish for effective cleaning, assembly, and repair. Made In the USA. Lower Block: Constructed of black injection molded polymer.Easy to use, the block allows the user to work on and install parts to AR-15 / M16 lower receivers. The vise block is locked into the users table/workbench vise. The block slips into the rifle's magazine well and is held in place by the rifle's magazine catch.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Vise Block Combo : 2 Piece .223 5.56 AR15 AR-15 M4 M16 A1 A2 Rifle Upper & Lower Receiver Mag Magazine Polymer Gunsmith Bench Action Vise Blocks Upper Block : Constructed of black injection molded polymer.Fits both carry handles & flattop uppers. Easy to use, the block lets you tightly clamp a carry handle receiver or flattop receiver in a large bench vise. The vise block is locked into the users table/workbench vise. Holds the rifle firm so you can work on your rifle securely without scratching or damaging the finish for effective cleaning, assembly, and repair. Made In the USA. Lower Block: Constructed of black injection molded polymer.Easy to use, the block allows the user to work on and install parts to AR-15 / M16 lower receivers. The vise block is locked into the users table/workbench vise. The block slips into the rifle's magazine well and is held in place by the rifle's magazine catch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316VE0QjN0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007VSZCPC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 48.99}}
{"item_id": "B007VUONPU", "title": "Race Face Light Bash Guard", "description": "Protect your precious chainrings with the lightweight RaceFace Light Bash Guard. The Light Bash Guard is CNC'd from tough heat-treated aluminum. All unnecessary material is removed to make the Light Bash Guard a super-tough featherweight.", "text": "Race Face Light Bash Guard Protect your precious chainrings with the lightweight RaceFace Light Bash Guard. The Light Bash Guard is CNC'd from tough heat-treated aluminum. All unnecessary material is removed to make the Light Bash Guard a super-tough featherweight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41phW5ucOHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007VUONPU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Chain Guards"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007W1QCIY", "title": "Kershaw Volt SS Stainless Steel SpeedSafe Knife", "description": "High voltage looks and a slimmer profile. The Volt SS (#3655) picks up where the Volt II left off—and gets even better. While it’s larger than the original, it’s slimmer, too, and features a solid frame lock. And this time, the popular and versatile Volt blade and handle style gets the all-stainless steel treatment. From the tip of its slightly dropped point blade to the end of its comfortable, contoured handle, the Volt SS is pure stainless steel. The Volt SS offers the convenience of SpeedSafe assisted opening accessed with a handy flipper and features aggressive jimping on the back of the blade for a secure grip. Designed by RJ Martin, this slimmer Volt offers comfortable pocket carry and a reversible pocket clip. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw Volt SS Stainless Steel SpeedSafe Knife High voltage looks and a slimmer profile. The Volt SS (#3655) picks up where the Volt II left off—and gets even better. While it’s larger than the original, it’s slimmer, too, and features a solid frame lock. And this time, the popular and versatile Volt blade and handle style gets the all-stainless steel treatment. From the tip of its slightly dropped point blade to the end of its comfortable, contoured handle, the Volt SS is pure stainless steel. The Volt SS offers the convenience of SpeedSafe assisted opening accessed with a handy flipper and features aggressive jimping on the back of the blade for a secure grip. Designed by RJ Martin, this slimmer Volt offers comfortable pocket carry and a reversible pocket clip. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HUwv5pZeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007W1QCIY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 26.95}}
{"item_id": "B007W5WNYW", "title": "Spalding Extreme Volleyball - Gold", "description": "A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "text": "Spalding Extreme Volleyball - Gold A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OR0hAWdZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007W5WNYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spalding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Volleyball", "Volleyballs", "Outdoor Volleyballs"]], "price": 16.5}}
