{"item_id": "B007W68GFG", "title": "Spalding NBA 6lb Weighted Trainer Basketball", "description": "A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "text": "Spalding NBA 6lb Weighted Trainer Basketball A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vReWunugL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007W68GFG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Equipment", "Basketball Equipment", "Basketballs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007W968YO", "title": "Kershaw Leek Folding Knife", "description": "The Leek series includes some of Kershaw's most popular knives. This particular knife features a distinctive design by celebrated knife maker Ken Onion, who created the Speed Safe ambidextrous assisted opening system. With Speed Safe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. This makes it ideal for sporting and work situations in which one-handed opening is easier and safer, such as when hunting, fishing, or working with your hands on the job site. The Leek also comes with a Kershaw pocket clip, which is meant to be clipped with the handle on the inside of your pocket. The clip is not to be worn on a belt, as this is an unsafe way to carry your belt. Other features include a frame lock, which locks the blade into position after the blade is deployed, and a thumb stud for easier one-handed opening. Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw Leek Folding Knife The Leek series includes some of Kershaw's most popular knives. This particular knife features a distinctive design by celebrated knife maker Ken Onion, who created the Speed Safe ambidextrous assisted opening system. With Speed Safe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. This makes it ideal for sporting and work situations in which one-handed opening is easier and safer, such as when hunting, fishing, or working with your hands on the job site. The Leek also comes with a Kershaw pocket clip, which is meant to be clipped with the handle on the inside of your pocket. The clip is not to be worn on a belt, as this is an unsafe way to carry your belt. Other features include a frame lock, which locks the blade into position after the blade is deployed, and a thumb stud for easier one-handed opening. Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-5ZZq0i-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007W968YO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 50.76}}
{"item_id": "B007W968ZS", "title": "Kershaw Funxion Knife and Firestarter Gift Set", "description": "Kershaw #8000OL412 Funxion Gift set includes a Funxion Outdoor knife and a fire starter accessory in an attractive Kershaw gift tin. The Funxion Outdoor is the one to attach to your pack, stash in your gear, clip to your belt, or slip in your pocket. It offers a sturdy all-around multi-tasking blade that opens quickly, easily, and one-handed thanks to SpeedSafe assisted opening. This drop-point blade is suited for just about every outdoor and campsite task, from opening food packages to sharpening sticks for the weenie roast. The 8CR13MoV blade steel is wear resistant, tough, and enables the blade to hold its edge for a good long time. In addition to its general-use blade, the Funxion Outdoor has a second blade that’s pretty handy too. The saw blade is great for making kindling, sawing through the toughest rope, or removing that branch that keeps slapping you in the face on the way to the latrine. Both main blade and saw blade have a dedicated locking liner. This ensures sturdy blade lockup and prevents the blade from closing back on your hand during use. The anodized aluminum handle features a rubber insert for a secure grip. There’s a deep-carry pocket clip so the tool can be carried in the pocket securely. A built-in carabiner clip lets you hang it conveniently from your pack rings or the tent’s gear loops. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw Funxion Knife and Firestarter Gift Set Kershaw #8000OL412 Funxion Gift set includes a Funxion Outdoor knife and a fire starter accessory in an attractive Kershaw gift tin. The Funxion Outdoor is the one to attach to your pack, stash in your gear, clip to your belt, or slip in your pocket. It offers a sturdy all-around multi-tasking blade that opens quickly, easily, and one-handed thanks to SpeedSafe assisted opening. This drop-point blade is suited for just about every outdoor and campsite task, from opening food packages to sharpening sticks for the weenie roast. The 8CR13MoV blade steel is wear resistant, tough, and enables the blade to hold its edge for a good long time. In addition to its general-use blade, the Funxion Outdoor has a second blade that’s pretty handy too. The saw blade is great for making kindling, sawing through the toughest rope, or removing that branch that keeps slapping you in the face on the way to the latrine. Both main blade and saw blade have a dedicated locking liner. This ensures sturdy blade lockup and prevents the blade from closing back on your hand during use. The anodized aluminum handle features a rubber insert for a secure grip. There’s a deep-carry pocket clip so the tool can be carried in the pocket securely. A built-in carabiner clip lets you hang it conveniently from your pack rings or the tent’s gear loops. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416lOcuYq9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007W968ZS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007WA4MYQ", "title": "M6 Tactical Red Laser & Cree LED Flashlight Sight Combo", "description": "Specification:* Model: M6 BK* Weight :105g* Over Length:95mm* Color :Black* Rail Type: 5/8\" 20mm Weaver rail* Material: ABS PlasticFeatures:* High quality.* Use for airsoft.* Laser resettable windage and elevation adjustment.* Laser power lower than 5mw.* Led power 180 Lumens.* Cree Led bulbs.* Remote pressure swith tail switch included.* Integrated 5/8\" or 20mm Weaver rail.* Operate by two 3V CR123A battery(not included)* Three Type of Switch Mode: Laser / Flashlight / Laser+FlashlightPackage Includes:* 1 x M6 Red Laser & Flashlight* 1 x Tail switch", "text": "M6 Tactical Red Laser & Cree LED Flashlight Sight Combo Specification:* Model: M6 BK* Weight :105g* Over Length:95mm* Color :Black* Rail Type: 5/8\" 20mm Weaver rail* Material: ABS PlasticFeatures:* High quality.* Use for airsoft.* Laser resettable windage and elevation adjustment.* Laser power lower than 5mw.* Led power 180 Lumens.* Cree Led bulbs.* Remote pressure swith tail switch included.* Integrated 5/8\" or 20mm Weaver rail.* Operate by two 3V CR123A battery(not included)* Three Type of Switch Mode: Laser / Flashlight / Laser+FlashlightPackage Includes:* 1 x M6 Red Laser & Flashlight* 1 x Tail switch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qRmcbYDmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007WA4MYQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007WADKN0", "title": "Grace USA Steel Roll Spring Punch Set", "description": "This high quality hardened steel 7 piece punch set is designed to easily remove roll pins from firearms. Balled tip helps locate the punch on the pin and protects pin ends from damage during removal or installation", "text": "Grace USA Steel Roll Spring Punch Set This high quality hardened steel 7 piece punch set is designed to easily remove roll pins from firearms. Balled tip helps locate the punch on the pin and protects pin ends from damage during removal or installation", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u%2BjMxCucL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007WADKN0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grace USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 38.0}}
