{"item_id": "B007WHCFC0", "title": "Tac Force TF-705 Series Assisted Opening Folding Knife 4.5-Inch Closed", "description": "Tac Force Linerlock. 4 3/4\" closed. 3 3/8\" high carbon stainless assisted opening partially serrated drop point blade with thumb slot and extended tang with lashing hole. Block style grooved aluminum handles with drilled hole design and integrated bottle opener and glass breaker. Dual lanyard slot on spine. Stainless pocket clip with slot cutout design.Black blade. Red handles with \"Fire Fighter\" stamp. Black pocket clip.", "text": "Tac Force TF-705 Series Assisted Opening Folding Knife 4.5-Inch Closed Tac Force Linerlock. 4 3/4\" closed. 3 3/8\" high carbon stainless assisted opening partially serrated drop point blade with thumb slot and extended tang with lashing hole. Block style grooved aluminum handles with drilled hole design and integrated bottle opener and glass breaker. Dual lanyard slot on spine. Stainless pocket clip with slot cutout design.Black blade. Red handles with \"Fire Fighter\" stamp. Black pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Gq5KwYgiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007WHCFC0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TAC Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 10.22}}
