{"item_id": "B007WQJBZU", "title": "Caldwell Pink Low Profile E-Max Electronic Ear Muffs", "description": "The new pink low-profile E-MaxTM hearing protection combines great circuitry with a low profile earcup that's ideal for all shooting styles. The two microphones in the E-MaxTM amplify sounds below 85 decibels, which amplifies normal communication, range commands, and environmental sounds. Above 85 decibels, the microphones shut off for a split second to protect the shooter's hearing. Two microphones - one in each cup - give the user true stereo sound and allow the user to identify the directional source of a sound. Includes an auxillary input allowing the user to listen to a radio or MP3 device.", "text": "Caldwell Pink Low Profile E-Max Electronic Ear Muffs The new pink low-profile E-MaxTM hearing protection combines great circuitry with a low profile earcup that's ideal for all shooting styles. The two microphones in the E-MaxTM amplify sounds below 85 decibels, which amplifies normal communication, range commands, and environmental sounds. Above 85 decibels, the microphones shut off for a split second to protect the shooter's hearing. Two microphones - one in each cup - give the user true stereo sound and allow the user to identify the directional source of a sound. Includes an auxillary input allowing the user to listen to a radio or MP3 device.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41c7aBW2DZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007WQJBZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Hearing Enhancement Aids"]], "price": 29.3}}
{"item_id": "B007WQJC1I", "title": "Frankford Arsenal EZ Sonic Cleaner", "description": "The EZ Sonic Cleaner is the perfect size ultrasonic cleaner for the average shooter and gives you the most bang for your buck. Great cleaning power with moderate sized capacities makes it a perfect cleaner for most shooters. Eliminate the frustration of cleaning primer pockets or small parts and appreciate all the benefits of ultrasonic cleaning with an EZ Sonic Cleaner!", "text": "Frankford Arsenal EZ Sonic Cleaner The EZ Sonic Cleaner is the perfect size ultrasonic cleaner for the average shooter and gives you the most bang for your buck. Great cleaning power with moderate sized capacities makes it a perfect cleaner for most shooters. Eliminate the frustration of cleaning primer pockets or small parts and appreciate all the benefits of ultrasonic cleaning with an EZ Sonic Cleaner!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WTCWN8XTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007WQJC1I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford Arsenal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 49.55}}
{"item_id": "B007WQJCWC", "title": "Wheeler Laser Bore Sighter", "description": "The Professional Laser Bore Sighter uses a high power daylight visible green laser and a high-strength magnetic connection to the barrel to deliver fast accurate bore sighting. This system works with virtually all firearms; rifles, shotguns, handguns. The magnetic connection to the end of the muzzle provides more precise alignment with the bore without the risk of damaging the bore, compared to arbor style bore devices. A machined aluminum body with soft rubber over-molding houses the laser module. Each unit is hand tuned during the manufacturing process with an innovative calibration mechanism. This allows for maximum precision, thus ensuring the best bore/optic alignment possible. Once precision calibration is completed the laser module is permanently secured in place insuring reliable performance and durability.", "text": "Wheeler Laser Bore Sighter The Professional Laser Bore Sighter uses a high power daylight visible green laser and a high-strength magnetic connection to the barrel to deliver fast accurate bore sighting. This system works with virtually all firearms; rifles, shotguns, handguns. The magnetic connection to the end of the muzzle provides more precise alignment with the bore without the risk of damaging the bore, compared to arbor style bore devices. A machined aluminum body with soft rubber over-molding houses the laser module. Each unit is hand tuned during the manufacturing process with an innovative calibration mechanism. This allows for maximum precision, thus ensuring the best bore/optic alignment possible. Once precision calibration is completed the laser module is permanently secured in place insuring reliable performance and durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21o5rid%2BOBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007WQJCWC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 126.79}}
{"item_id": "B007WQKT1K", "title": "Smart Health Walking FIT", "description": "BE FIT. BE FREE. BE SMART. With Smart Health Technology that Makes Living Fit…Simple!Simply Put It On and Go! With our Auto Tracking Technology, Smart Health Walking FIT accounts for your daily activity level, and calculates your calories burned with ease! Smart Health also integrates your Heart Rate and Basal Metabolic Rate into the calorie calculation, resulting in the most accurate calorie calculation of its kind. Smart Health introduces the “free living” concept where the watch does all the work for you. Best of all, the Smart Health Walking FIT watch requires absolutely NO PERSONAL SET UP. Just set the time and start improving your fitness level today.Features:AUTOMATIC TRACKING Monitors your Calorie Burn, Distance Walked & Steps Taken over the entire day. There is no user set up required, just set the time, and start monitoring your daily activity.ALL DAY CALORIES A proprietary technique provides an All Day calorie burn that includes Basal Metabolic Rate, Activity (intensity & duration), and includes your EKG accurate Heart Rate into the calculation each time a reading is taken.DISTANCE The Smart Health dynamic pace calibration determines the length of your stride based on the speed of your pace. This unique feature eliminates the need to input a stride measurement during set up.HEART RATE Smart Health uses S-PulseTM Technology to deliver EKG accurate heart rate. S-PulseTM is the established leader in episodic heart rate for Sports Brands and international commercial cardio equipment.Smart Health Can Help You:-Lose Weight and keep it off-Lower blood pressure-Improve cardiac health", "text": "Smart Health Walking FIT BE FIT. BE FREE. BE SMART. With Smart Health Technology that Makes Living Fit…Simple!Simply Put It On and Go! With our Auto Tracking Technology, Smart Health Walking FIT accounts for your daily activity level, and calculates your calories burned with ease! Smart Health also integrates your Heart Rate and Basal Metabolic Rate into the calorie calculation, resulting in the most accurate calorie calculation of its kind. Smart Health introduces the “free living” concept where the watch does all the work for you. Best of all, the Smart Health Walking FIT watch requires absolutely NO PERSONAL SET UP. Just set the time and start improving your fitness level today.Features:AUTOMATIC TRACKING Monitors your Calorie Burn, Distance Walked & Steps Taken over the entire day. There is no user set up required, just set the time, and start monitoring your daily activity.ALL DAY CALORIES A proprietary technique provides an All Day calorie burn that includes Basal Metabolic Rate, Activity (intensity & duration), and includes your EKG accurate Heart Rate into the calculation each time a reading is taken.DISTANCE The Smart Health dynamic pace calibration determines the length of your stride based on the speed of your pace. This unique feature eliminates the need to input a stride measurement during set up.HEART RATE Smart Health uses S-PulseTM Technology to deliver EKG accurate heart rate. S-PulseTM is the established leader in episodic heart rate for Sports Brands and international commercial cardio equipment.Smart Health Can Help You:-Lose Weight and keep it off-Lower blood pressure-Improve cardiac health", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mJ9FahFVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007WQKT1K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smarthealth", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B007WX609S", "title": "Air Mattress (Single Size:73\"x29\"x7.5\")", "description": "You'll sleep comfortably on this inflatable single size airbed. The bed features a standard coil and leak-proof valve, and a flocked top for comfort. The mattress is constructed of sturdy PVC and supports up to 350 pounds. The mattress weighs 4Lb", "text": "Air Mattress (Single Size:73\"x29\"x7.5\") You'll sleep comfortably on this inflatable single size airbed. The bed features a standard coil and leak-proof valve, and a flocked top for comfort. The mattress is constructed of sturdy PVC and supports up to 350 pounds. The mattress weighs 4Lb", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aBPlMZBfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007WX609S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 18.99}}
