{"item_id": "B007X098QC", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Rechargeable Air Bed", "description": "Whether you’re headed out for a weekend of camping or staying with out-of-town friends, bring along an ALPS air bed to ensure you’ll sleep just as well as you do in your bed at home. ALPS air beds feature special, top-of-the line fabric and coil construction to provide the best durability and comfort, making them perfect for indoor or outdoor use. The reinforced bed construction provides a comfortable, uniform sleeping surface and the outer ring provides a stable edge support. Our beds are constructed of industry leading, extra thick and durable PVC materials helping to make them puncture resistant, along with welded seams for extra durability. The air bed bottom and side fabric is 17% thicker than the leading competition and the top is 10% thicker … that’s impressive! Our plush, velvety soft flocked top provides a luxurious sleep surface and prevents bedding from slipping or sliding around. Plus, all beds are 100% factory inspected.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Rechargeable Air Bed Whether you’re headed out for a weekend of camping or staying with out-of-town friends, bring along an ALPS air bed to ensure you’ll sleep just as well as you do in your bed at home. ALPS air beds feature special, top-of-the line fabric and coil construction to provide the best durability and comfort, making them perfect for indoor or outdoor use. The reinforced bed construction provides a comfortable, uniform sleeping surface and the outer ring provides a stable edge support. Our beds are constructed of industry leading, extra thick and durable PVC materials helping to make them puncture resistant, along with welded seams for extra durability. The air bed bottom and side fabric is 17% thicker than the leading competition and the top is 10% thicker … that’s impressive! Our plush, velvety soft flocked top provides a luxurious sleep surface and prevents bedding from slipping or sliding around. Plus, all beds are 100% factory inspected.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31c04NoRLWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007X098QC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007X2B8JK", "title": "Wild Sports Anywhere Table Tennis Set", "description": "The Wild Sports Anywhere Table Tennis Set is perfect for travel or home use. It's compact design makes it easy to store and take anywhere. An expandable and retractable table tennis net with adjustable posts that attach to any table lets you play on surfaces up to 75 inches wide and 1.75 inches thick. Two \"pips out\" rubber paddles, three 38-millimeter balls, and a convenient mesh storage and travel bag round out the package.", "text": "Wild Sports Anywhere Table Tennis Set The Wild Sports Anywhere Table Tennis Set is perfect for travel or home use. It's compact design makes it easy to store and take anywhere. An expandable and retractable table tennis net with adjustable posts that attach to any table lets you play on surfaces up to 75 inches wide and 1.75 inches thick. Two \"pips out\" rubber paddles, three 38-millimeter balls, and a convenient mesh storage and travel bag round out the package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5142cELd5gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007X2B8JK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wild Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Table Tennis", "Table Tennis Sets"]], "price": 25.5}}
{"item_id": "B007X3EAPS", "title": "Finis Agility Hand Paddles", "description": "Description: The ergonomically advanced design of the Agility Paddles helps teach swimmers the correct palm positive hand position. Due to the paddles strapless design, incorrect technique will cause the paddle to fall off the swimmer's hand. The Agility Paddles' convex design also promotes an early catch and reminds the swimmer to maintain an early vertical forearm position. This versatile paddle works for all four strokes and accommodates most hand sizes. Not only are the Agility Paddles durable, but the absence of straps makes them more comfortable for the swimmers and easier for coaches, who no longer have to hassle with broken straps during practice. Specifications : Palm Positive Paddle will remain in place if swimmer maintains early vertical forearm position Strapless Design Ergonomic shape is designed to fit the natural contour of the hand Promotes Early Catch Convex design encourages paddle to have increased traction with the water All Four Swim Strokes Versatile paddle works for freestyle, backstroke, breaststroke and butterfly < Lateral Side Contours Accommodates most hand sizes including narrow hands Comfortable Thumb Hole Creates proper hand placement with thumb and fingers in ideal position Easy for Coaches No more broken straps or looking for replacements during practice Durable Design No pieces to loose or break Improved Circulation No straps to cut off circulation of hands and wrist", "text": "Finis Agility Hand Paddles Description: The ergonomically advanced design of the Agility Paddles helps teach swimmers the correct palm positive hand position. Due to the paddles strapless design, incorrect technique will cause the paddle to fall off the swimmer's hand. The Agility Paddles' convex design also promotes an early catch and reminds the swimmer to maintain an early vertical forearm position. This versatile paddle works for all four strokes and accommodates most hand sizes. Not only are the Agility Paddles durable, but the absence of straps makes them more comfortable for the swimmers and easier for coaches, who no longer have to hassle with broken straps during practice. Specifications : Palm Positive Paddle will remain in place if swimmer maintains early vertical forearm position Strapless Design Ergonomic shape is designed to fit the natural contour of the hand Promotes Early Catch Convex design encourages paddle to have increased traction with the water All Four Swim Strokes Versatile paddle works for freestyle, backstroke, breaststroke and butterfly < Lateral Side Contours Accommodates most hand sizes including narrow hands Comfortable Thumb Hole Creates proper hand placement with thumb and fingers in ideal position Easy for Coaches No more broken straps or looking for replacements during practice Durable Design No pieces to loose or break Improved Circulation No straps to cut off circulation of hands and wrist", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31F6i1gtgmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007X3EAPS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007X9J85Y", "title": "JT Elite Prime Goggle - Black", "description": "Get in the game with the JT Elite Raptor Single Paintball Goggle. This full paintball mask features a flexible design with inner padding for comfort and safety. Full-face coverage gives you maximum protection against any accidental impact. The JT paintball goggle comes with an integrated visor to shield you from the elements and the attack. The 180-degree lens ensures you have a wide view to effectively plan your strategy and dominate your competition. The Raptor paintball mask is fog resistant so you have clear vision even in misty weather.", "text": "JT Elite Prime Goggle - Black Get in the game with the JT Elite Raptor Single Paintball Goggle. This full paintball mask features a flexible design with inner padding for comfort and safety. Full-face coverage gives you maximum protection against any accidental impact. The JT paintball goggle comes with an integrated visor to shield you from the elements and the attack. The 180-degree lens ensures you have a wide view to effectively plan your strategy and dominate your competition. The Raptor paintball mask is fog resistant so you have clear vision even in misty weather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414AmGpsyRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007X9J85Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JT Toxins", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 13.99}}
