{"item_id": "B007XP20EY", "title": "Szco Supplies Full Tang Hunter Knife", "description": "The Full Tang Hunter Knife is 9.5\" in overall length. It has a color wood handle. Blade is made of stainless steel. The blade is full tang. This knife comes with a sheath.", "text": "Szco Supplies Full Tang Hunter Knife The Full Tang Hunter Knife is 9.5\" in overall length. It has a color wood handle. Blade is made of stainless steel. The blade is full tang. This knife comes with a sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41063fH1GIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007XP20EY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SZCO Supplies", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 12.1}}
{"item_id": "B007XPK7PS", "title": "Shotgun Shell Elastic Buttstock Holder Holds 8 Shells", "description": "This shell holder fits snugly over the buttstock on your shotgun It has elastic loops to hold 8 shells. 20 ga. 12 ga. to .410 ga. This is a great little accessory to insure you never run out of ammo. It loads and installs quickly and easily and fits most standard shotgun buttstocks.", "text": "Shotgun Shell Elastic Buttstock Holder Holds 8 Shells This shell holder fits snugly over the buttstock on your shotgun It has elastic loops to hold 8 shells. 20 ga. 12 ga. to .410 ga. This is a great little accessory to insure you never run out of ammo. It loads and installs quickly and easily and fits most standard shotgun buttstocks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mhZzXCSrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007XPK7PS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 6.95}}
