{"item_id": "B007XW6264", "title": "TT3660 36\" X 60\" Monster Tee Golf Turf", "description": "Made of 100% spring crimped nylon material. It will not fade, bunch, weather or leave marks on your clubs.The mat is 1.125\" thick with a urethane backing that will withstand repeated abuse. You do not need special rubber tees. No more hitting off of a predetermined height of a rubber tee. Our mat will accept a real wooden tee which allows you to choose different clubs you want to hit at different heights. Rubber tees also give you a different feel because they obstruct your club at impact. Our mat gives you that on the course feel. Our dense fiber mat allows you to feel the difference on a fat shot because if you go to deep the thick fibers will slow your club head speed resulting in a fat shot. In practice you will learn to eliminate your mishit shots. Our competitors golf mat will \"bounce\" which will result in mishit shots. Our mat lets you hit down and through the ball for better practice.", "text": "TT3660 36\" X 60\" Monster Tee Golf Turf Made of 100% spring crimped nylon material. It will not fade, bunch, weather or leave marks on your clubs.The mat is 1.125\" thick with a urethane backing that will withstand repeated abuse. You do not need special rubber tees. No more hitting off of a predetermined height of a rubber tee. Our mat will accept a real wooden tee which allows you to choose different clubs you want to hit at different heights. Rubber tees also give you a different feel because they obstruct your club at impact. Our mat gives you that on the course feel. Our dense fiber mat allows you to feel the difference on a fat shot because if you go to deep the thick fibers will slow your club head speed resulting in a fat shot. In practice you will learn to eliminate your mishit shots. Our competitors golf mat will \"bounce\" which will result in mishit shots. Our mat lets you hit down and through the ball for better practice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zv-KjpFaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007XW6264.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Hitting Mats"]], "price": 93.86}}
{"item_id": "B007XXPHDC", "title": "Ello Pure 20-oz Glass Water Bottle with Silicone Sleeve", "description": "Water never tasted so good. Simple, clean, green... Ello's Pure glass water bottles. The clarity and quality of glass meets style. Our glass bottles are annealed to give them the extra strength and durability for on-the-go use, and they exceed all FDA and California Prop65 standards (Lead & Cadmium free). Food safe silicone sleeves protect the glass and provide ample grip surface when you're on the move. The sleeve also features a triple-thick boot at the base to provide extra impact protection and the leak-proof cap has a unique double-wall construction for greater protection. The drink opening is sized to allow you to add ice, while being small enough to control the water flow to prevent over-flow spills. The whole bottle is dishwasher perfect with no need to remove the sleeve for washing. 100% BPA-Free. 20-ounce capacity.", "text": "Ello Pure 20-oz Glass Water Bottle with Silicone Sleeve Water never tasted so good. Simple, clean, green... Ello's Pure glass water bottles. The clarity and quality of glass meets style. Our glass bottles are annealed to give them the extra strength and durability for on-the-go use, and they exceed all FDA and California Prop65 standards (Lead & Cadmium free). Food safe silicone sleeves protect the glass and provide ample grip surface when you're on the move. The sleeve also features a triple-thick boot at the base to provide extra impact protection and the leak-proof cap has a unique double-wall construction for greater protection. The drink opening is sized to allow you to add ice, while being small enough to control the water flow to prevent over-flow spills. The whole bottle is dishwasher perfect with no need to remove the sleeve for washing. 100% BPA-Free. 20-ounce capacity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CJESOGHQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007XXPHDC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 9.99}}
