{"item_id": "B007Y30YWK", "title": "X20 4 Buckle Dual Sized USCG Approved Floatation Life Vest", "description": "Adult Coast Guard Approved Floatation DeviceVersatile, comfortable, аnԁ affordable, thе 4-buckle, universal fit adult life vest frοm X20 іѕ a ɡοοԁ сhοісе fοr active sports οn thе water. Grеаt fοr waterskiing, boating, wakeboarding, jet skiing, οr canoeing, thе life vest boasts 3 fully adjustable straps fοr a perfect, secure fit wіth YKK fаѕt click buckles fοr easy οn аnԁ οff. Thanks tο UL approved materials аnԁ construction, уου саn trust thіѕ X20 Life Jacket tο keep уου safe οn thе water.", "text": "X20 4 Buckle Dual Sized USCG Approved Floatation Life Vest Adult Coast Guard Approved Floatation DeviceVersatile, comfortable, аnԁ affordable, thе 4-buckle, universal fit adult life vest frοm X20 іѕ a ɡοοԁ сhοісе fοr active sports οn thе water. Grеаt fοr waterskiing, boating, wakeboarding, jet skiing, οr canoeing, thе life vest boasts 3 fully adjustable straps fοr a perfect, secure fit wіth YKK fаѕt click buckles fοr easy οn аnԁ οff. Thanks tο UL approved materials аnԁ construction, уου саn trust thіѕ X20 Life Jacket tο keep уου safe οn thе water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512UO-9inrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007Y30YWK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Wear & Apparel", "Fishing Jackets & Vests", "Vests"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007Y5EN1Q", "title": "M-Wave Double Leg Bicycle Kickstand (Black)", "description": "This double leg kickstand has adjustable feet to fit 24\"-28\" bicycles. Upon retracting the feet fold together for optimal pedal clearance.", "text": "M-Wave Double Leg Bicycle Kickstand (Black) This double leg kickstand has adjustable feet to fit 24\"-28\" bicycles. Upon retracting the feet fold together for optimal pedal clearance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41byZ7m9RCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007Y5EN1Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007Y8IQRA", "title": "Elite CO Shooters Belt with Cobra Buckle", "description": "One of the newest and most durable shooter's belts on the market, the Elite CO Shooter's Belt incorporates Mil-Spec nylon webbing and a patented CobraTM load bearing quick release buckle to fashion Elite's toughest-built shooter's belt yet. CobraTM buckles are without equal. They are the world's safest, most finely crafted, and strongest load bearing, quick-release fasteners available. They are also the only buckle style fastener in the safety products market that was designed to not open under load. The CO Shooter's Belt is constructed of double-layered 1.5\" Mil-Spec nylon with an internal stiffener to support holsters and pouches. The belt is velcro-adjustable at one end for a perfect fit. A great belt for concealed-carry, general shooting or everyday wear. Made in the USA - built to last! Sizes: SM: Fits 26\"-31\" waist, M: Fits 32\"-38\" waist, L: Fits 39\"-44\" waist, XL: Fits 45\"-50\" waist", "text": "Elite CO Shooters Belt with Cobra Buckle One of the newest and most durable shooter's belts on the market, the Elite CO Shooter's Belt incorporates Mil-Spec nylon webbing and a patented CobraTM load bearing quick release buckle to fashion Elite's toughest-built shooter's belt yet. CobraTM buckles are without equal. They are the world's safest, most finely crafted, and strongest load bearing, quick-release fasteners available. They are also the only buckle style fastener in the safety products market that was designed to not open under load. The CO Shooter's Belt is constructed of double-layered 1.5\" Mil-Spec nylon with an internal stiffener to support holsters and pouches. The belt is velcro-adjustable at one end for a perfect fit. A great belt for concealed-carry, general shooting or everyday wear. Made in the USA - built to last! Sizes: SM: Fits 26\"-31\" waist, M: Fits 32\"-38\" waist, L: Fits 39\"-44\" waist, XL: Fits 45\"-50\" waist", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51037E%2BEaGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007Y8IQRA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007Y8YJ62", "title": "Paracord Planet Type III 7 Strand 550 Paracord - Made in the USA - Largest In Stock Selection of Paracord Colors", "description": "Paracord Planet paracord is authentic commerical paracord made in the USA. With a 550-lb line strength,7 inner nylon cores, and UV, rot, and mildew resistance, this parachute cord is great for camping, hiking, survival, and much more. Choose from our hundreds of paracord colors to make a variety of things from paracord bracelets to specific paracord knots and weaves. The inner strands can be easily removed and used for quick and convenient repairs while in the outdoors. Paracord Planet paracord hanks are made exclusively by Paracord Planet. If you don't see the Paracord Planet label on your paracord, it is not authentic Paracord Planet parachute cord.", "text": "Paracord Planet Type III 7 Strand 550 Paracord - Made in the USA - Largest In Stock Selection of Paracord Colors Paracord Planet paracord is authentic commerical paracord made in the USA. With a 550-lb line strength,7 inner nylon cores, and UV, rot, and mildew resistance, this parachute cord is great for camping, hiking, survival, and much more. Choose from our hundreds of paracord colors to make a variety of things from paracord bracelets to specific paracord knots and weaves. The inner strands can be easily removed and used for quick and convenient repairs while in the outdoors. Paracord Planet paracord hanks are made exclusively by Paracord Planet. If you don't see the Paracord Planet label on your paracord, it is not authentic Paracord Planet parachute cord.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61jkfQJFdvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007Y8YJ62.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
