{"item_id": "B007YIQ9ZQ", "title": "Rage X-treme Two Blade Broadhead", "description": "Rage Outdoors introduced the most lethal broadhead to ever hit the market: The Rage X-Treme. With a 2.3-inch cutting diameter, the sweeping blade angle on the X-Treme maintains kinetic energy longer and penetrates deeper than any other blade, and produces larger entry and exit wounds for even better blood trails. For dependable blade containment and deployment at all times, the Rage X-Treme has been designed with with the ly patented Shock Collar. This design will ensure that your blades will remain in place until that ultimate moment of truth. The Rage X-Treme broadheads are easily recognizable by their yellow ferrule design, and they were designed for use", "text": "Rage X-treme Two Blade Broadhead Rage Outdoors introduced the most lethal broadhead to ever hit the market: The Rage X-Treme. With a 2.3-inch cutting diameter, the sweeping blade angle on the X-Treme maintains kinetic energy longer and penetrates deeper than any other blade, and produces larger entry and exit wounds for even better blood trails. For dependable blade containment and deployment at all times, the Rage X-Treme has been designed with with the ly patented Shock Collar. This design will ensure that your blades will remain in place until that ultimate moment of truth. The Rage X-Treme broadheads are easily recognizable by their yellow ferrule design, and they were designed for use", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SRXs4k94L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007YIQ9ZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rage Broadheads", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]], "price": 29.0}}
{"item_id": "B007YJ3SCC", "title": "Fyxation Mesa MP Replaceable Platform Pedal Pin, Black", "description": "The Fyxation Mesa MP Pedal is the ultimate multi-purpose pedal and is ideal for free ride, fat-bikes, BMX and urban riders that want a hard hitting pedal built to withstand abuse and provide a solid platform for any style of riding﻿.", "text": "Fyxation Mesa MP Replaceable Platform Pedal Pin, Black The Fyxation Mesa MP Pedal is the ultimate multi-purpose pedal and is ideal for free ride, fat-bikes, BMX and urban riders that want a hard hitting pedal built to withstand abuse and provide a solid platform for any style of riding﻿.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NuM4%2BHujL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007YJ3SCC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 53.96}}
{"item_id": "B007YJYAAG", "title": "Blackhawk Sportster Standard Holster with Belt Loop and Right Paddle with Matte Finish (Glock 19/23/32/36)", "description": "The Sportster Standard Holster features a pressure adjustable detent retention system that allows the shooter to customize the amount of retention on the handgun. This innovative system grabs onto the pistol’s trigger guard and holds tight.", "text": "Blackhawk Sportster Standard Holster with Belt Loop and Right Paddle with Matte Finish (Glock 19/23/32/36) The Sportster Standard Holster features a pressure adjustable detent retention system that allows the shooter to customize the amount of retention on the handgun. This innovative system grabs onto the pistol’s trigger guard and holds tight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41afElj1DdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007YJYAAG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 14.95}}
