{"item_id": "B007YT854S", "title": "BAFX Products (TM) - 2 Pack - Anti Shock Hiking / Walking / Trekking Trail Poles - 1 Pair", "description": "The BAFX Products hiking / walking / trekking poles are made from light weight durable aluminum and come in a stylish royal blue; Silver; or black color depending on your selection! ---------- Each pole can be extended to any length from 25.5 to 53 inches in length ---------- Poles extend by turn locking system and each pole has measuring on the middle section for easy adjustment to your preferred height on every trip ---------- They also have a durable steel tip hidden under the rubber foot at the bottom for trekking on more rocky and uneven terrain ---------- They also each include an optional snow disk for year round enjoyment ---------- Each stick contains an anti shock spring located in the upper section of each pole for more comfortable walking ---------- They also have very comfortable soft plastic grips with attached wrist straps and mini compass ---------- There is also a very soft foam grip located just below the standard grip for use when pole is in the collapsed position for easier more comfortable carrying ---------- EACH POLE COMES WITH 2 SPARE TIPS FOR A TOTAL OF 4 RUBBER TIPS TO GET YOU STARTED! --------------- 1-YEAR WARRANTY DIRECTLY FROM BAFX PRODUCTS AGAINST ANY DEFECT! ---------- These BAFX Products walking sticks are guaranteed to make your walks more enjoyable or your money back, that's the BAFX promise!", "text": "BAFX Products (TM) - 2 Pack - Anti Shock Hiking / Walking / Trekking Trail Poles - 1 Pair The BAFX Products hiking / walking / trekking poles are made from light weight durable aluminum and come in a stylish royal blue; Silver; or black color depending on your selection! ---------- Each pole can be extended to any length from 25.5 to 53 inches in length ---------- Poles extend by turn locking system and each pole has measuring on the middle section for easy adjustment to your preferred height on every trip ---------- They also have a durable steel tip hidden under the rubber foot at the bottom for trekking on more rocky and uneven terrain ---------- They also each include an optional snow disk for year round enjoyment ---------- Each stick contains an anti shock spring located in the upper section of each pole for more comfortable walking ---------- They also have very comfortable soft plastic grips with attached wrist straps and mini compass ---------- There is also a very soft foam grip located just below the standard grip for use when pole is in the collapsed position for easier more comfortable carrying ---------- EACH POLE COMES WITH 2 SPARE TIPS FOR A TOTAL OF 4 RUBBER TIPS TO GET YOU STARTED! --------------- 1-YEAR WARRANTY DIRECTLY FROM BAFX PRODUCTS AGAINST ANY DEFECT! ---------- These BAFX Products walking sticks are guaranteed to make your walks more enjoyable or your money back, that's the BAFX promise!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ll4iuyP3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007YT854S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B007YV1GFQ", "title": "Cateye Velo 9 Cycling Computer", "description": "CatEye’s Velo 9 is user friendly, features a large screen, simple one-button operation and a universal bracket that fits both stem and handlebar. Functions include Current/Average/Max speed, Elapsed time, Calorie Consumption, Trip/ Total Distance, Clock and Carbon Offset", "text": "Cateye Velo 9 Cycling Computer CatEye’s Velo 9 is user friendly, features a large screen, simple one-button operation and a universal bracket that fits both stem and handlebar. Functions include Current/Average/Max speed, Elapsed time, Calorie Consumption, Trip/ Total Distance, Clock and Carbon Offset", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Bb2JXnhlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007YV1GFQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 18.49}}
