{"item_id": "B007Z1IDC4", "title": "Intermediate Cold Weather Sleeping Bag, Black, Genuine Military Surplus", "description": "Black Intermediate Cold Weather BagNSN: 8465-01-398-0687The Intermediate Cold Weather Sleeping Bag is designed to fit around the Patrol Bag for use in much colder conditions, from freezing to 10 below zero. Also lightweight with an adjustable hood, it is made of rip-stop nylon and very well constructed.Water resistantRip-stop NylonCold weather climates (30F to -10F)Mid-layer or single unitAdjustable hood90 inches long x 36 inches wideSolid black", "text": "Intermediate Cold Weather Sleeping Bag, Black, Genuine Military Surplus Black Intermediate Cold Weather BagNSN: 8465-01-398-0687The Intermediate Cold Weather Sleeping Bag is designed to fit around the Patrol Bag for use in much colder conditions, from freezing to 10 below zero. Also lightweight with an adjustable hood, it is made of rip-stop nylon and very well constructed.Water resistantRip-stop NylonCold weather climates (30F to -10F)Mid-layer or single unitAdjustable hood90 inches long x 36 inches wideSolid black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kbA7zT9yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007Z1IDC4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 41.71}}
