{"item_id": "B007ZCOO8A", "title": "Military Carabiner Grimloc D-Ring Vest Backpack Keychain Clip Snap Foliage Green (Lot of 4)", "description": "The GrimLOCTM is designed for use by operators in a tactical environment as a lightweight corrosion resistant replacement for heavy metal climbing carabineers. The high strength polymer structure easily supports weapon sling connection points to body armor, and features a break away design to eliminate snags. The GrimLOCTM is perfectly suited for connecting your tactical accessories that require quick and easy one-handed access. Self Purging [SP] ports to eliminate sand from blocking the mechanism", "text": "Military Carabiner Grimloc D-Ring Vest Backpack Keychain Clip Snap Foliage Green (Lot of 4) The GrimLOCTM is designed for use by operators in a tactical environment as a lightweight corrosion resistant replacement for heavy metal climbing carabineers. The high strength polymer structure easily supports weapon sling connection points to body armor, and features a break away design to eliminate snags. The GrimLOCTM is perfectly suited for connecting your tactical accessories that require quick and easy one-handed access. Self Purging [SP] ports to eliminate sand from blocking the mechanism", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gYMNMfNIL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZCOO8A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ITW Nexus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Locking"]], "price": 9.9}}
{"item_id": "B007ZDQQGM", "title": "ActiveProGear DeepConcealment Shoulder Holster", "description": "Our shoulder holster will conceal your gun without the need to wear a suit or jacket! Unlike other shoulder holster rigs that make you wear a suit or jacket, you can wear it under your regular shirt! Provides fast access to your gun in case of emergency. The DeepConcealment shoulder holster distributes the weight of your gun to your shoulders and across your back for a comfortable, all day carry. It is fully adjustable and since it's made from elastic, it will adjust to any body type. Won't show through most clothing. Features extra padding to protect your gun from perspiration and for comfort. Comes with two extra magazine holders and a handgun retention strap. There's no other shoulder holster anywhere that conceals better. Period. See for yourself-at no-risk to you. Made in USA.", "text": "ActiveProGear DeepConcealment Shoulder Holster Our shoulder holster will conceal your gun without the need to wear a suit or jacket! Unlike other shoulder holster rigs that make you wear a suit or jacket, you can wear it under your regular shirt! Provides fast access to your gun in case of emergency. The DeepConcealment shoulder holster distributes the weight of your gun to your shoulders and across your back for a comfortable, all day carry. It is fully adjustable and since it's made from elastic, it will adjust to any body type. Won't show through most clothing. Features extra padding to protect your gun from perspiration and for comfort. Comes with two extra magazine holders and a handgun retention strap. There's no other shoulder holster anywhere that conceals better. Period. See for yourself-at no-risk to you. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Sb9eqxnFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZDQQGM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B007ZFROES", "title": "Large 3 Gun Soft Carry Case with Shooting Mat - Holds up to 45 Inch Rifle", "description": "With plenty of space for 3 rifles and multiple hand-guns this one bag will handle a small arsenal of shooting or hunting gear. Designed with extreme field use in mind, the heavily padded case with reinforced wrap-around edge guard will protect your finest firearms and stand up to the harshest abuse. A 600 denier weather resistant polyester shell and YKK zippers are just another reason this is a case that will last a lifetime. The included sniper/shooting mat which doubles as extra interior padding is an added bonus not found in other gun cases. The removable and adequately padded shoulder strap can be configured in several different ways to allow you to pack this over your shoulder or on your back. Plus, with the added pockets and mag pouches, you'll be able to carry enough ammo and spare gear to take on a small insurgency!Features- Weatherproof 600D Polyester shell- YKK Zippers- Included interior divider and padded shooting/sniper mat- MOLLE compatible attachment zones- Padded and divided hand-gun compartment- 3 mag pockets large enough for 2-3 mags each- Large central dump pouch with side release buckles- Hook & Loop interior straps to secure and protect rifles- Heavily padded integrated edge guard- Removable padded shoulder strap with 4 different mounting points- External ID pocketDimensions:45 or 40 inches long x 13.5 inches wide x 4 inches thick (external pouches add to the thickness)", "text": "Large 3 Gun Soft Carry Case with Shooting Mat - Holds up to 45 Inch Rifle With plenty of space for 3 rifles and multiple hand-guns this one bag will handle a small arsenal of shooting or hunting gear. Designed with extreme field use in mind, the heavily padded case with reinforced wrap-around edge guard will protect your finest firearms and stand up to the harshest abuse. A 600 denier weather resistant polyester shell and YKK zippers are just another reason this is a case that will last a lifetime. The included sniper/shooting mat which doubles as extra interior padding is an added bonus not found in other gun cases. The removable and adequately padded shoulder strap can be configured in several different ways to allow you to pack this over your shoulder or on your back. Plus, with the added pockets and mag pouches, you'll be able to carry enough ammo and spare gear to take on a small insurgency!Features- Weatherproof 600D Polyester shell- YKK Zippers- Included interior divider and padded shooting/sniper mat- MOLLE compatible attachment zones- Padded and divided hand-gun compartment- 3 mag pockets large enough for 2-3 mags each- Large central dump pouch with side release buckles- Hook & Loop interior straps to secure and protect rifles- Heavily padded integrated edge guard- Removable padded shoulder strap with 4 different mounting points- External ID pocketDimensions:45 or 40 inches long x 13.5 inches wide x 4 inches thick (external pouches add to the thickness)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UR0t2Zz8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZFROES.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B007ZFROI4", "title": "Explorer 3 Rifles Weapon Case (43 x 13.50-Inch)", "description": "M.O.C. U.S. Military Double Gun Case has the ability to carry up to 3 rifles or shotguns and 4 pistols. This padded rifle carrying case is what you need to protect your rifle during transport, whether in your vehicle or in the field. With its heavy thick foam and adjustable tie downs, you can be sure your optics are not going to get knocked about. The zippers are tough enough to meet the demanding conditions required by the military and law enforcement. There is plenty of storage space for magazines, boxes of ammo, cleaning kits and other accessories. This gun case features three carrying methods: A standard handle in center of the bag, a shoulder strap and back-pack style shoulder harness. For muddy or rough terrain the padded insert can also double as a shooting mat by attaching to the case via Velcro. Measures 45 x 13.5 Inch.", "text": "Explorer 3 Rifles Weapon Case (43 x 13.50-Inch) M.O.C. U.S. Military Double Gun Case has the ability to carry up to 3 rifles or shotguns and 4 pistols. This padded rifle carrying case is what you need to protect your rifle during transport, whether in your vehicle or in the field. With its heavy thick foam and adjustable tie downs, you can be sure your optics are not going to get knocked about. The zippers are tough enough to meet the demanding conditions required by the military and law enforcement. There is plenty of storage space for magazines, boxes of ammo, cleaning kits and other accessories. This gun case features three carrying methods: A standard handle in center of the bag, a shoulder strap and back-pack style shoulder harness. For muddy or rough terrain the padded insert can also double as a shooting mat by attaching to the case via Velcro. Measures 45 x 13.5 Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415UXYU%2BK9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZFROI4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Explorer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 78.94}}
{"item_id": "B007ZGOWZQ", "title": "Helinox Chair One Camp Chair", "description": "The ultimate camp chair has arrived. Featuring the same aluminum pole technology used by DAC in their Helinox trekking poles and tent poles, this camp chair is light, strong and comfortable. With a carrying case and breathable mesh, this chair may not ever leave your pack or gear bin.", "text": "Helinox Chair One Camp Chair The ultimate camp chair has arrived. Featuring the same aluminum pole technology used by DAC in their Helinox trekking poles and tent poles, this camp chair is light, strong and comfortable. With a carrying case and breathable mesh, this chair may not ever leave your pack or gear bin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519AtHVizBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZGOWZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Big Agnes", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B007ZMWDDS", "title": "CREE Q5 Led 240 Lumens bike Bicycle Head Light Torch Mount Holder Set (Red)", "description": "Q5 flashlight with mount", "text": "CREE Q5 Led 240 Lumens bike Bicycle Head Light Torch Mount Holder Set (Red) Q5 flashlight with mount", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LV-yocj9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZMWDDS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Meco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 7.83}}
{"item_id": "B007ZNT8MQ", "title": "Weaver Soft Side Gunsmith Tool Kit", "description": "Take care of all your gun repair needs at home or on the go with the new Weaver Soft-Sided Tool Kit. Filled with the tools needed for a wide range of firearm repair jobs, this new tool kit is like a portable gunsmith shop—giving shooters the extra confidence they need when away from their home bench. From scope mounting to firearm disassembly and more, the Weaver Soft-Sided Tool Kit is capable of tackling even the most difficult gun problems.", "text": "Weaver Soft Side Gunsmith Tool Kit Take care of all your gun repair needs at home or on the go with the new Weaver Soft-Sided Tool Kit. Filled with the tools needed for a wide range of firearm repair jobs, this new tool kit is like a portable gunsmith shop—giving shooters the extra confidence they need when away from their home bench. From scope mounting to firearm disassembly and more, the Weaver Soft-Sided Tool Kit is capable of tackling even the most difficult gun problems.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q%2BJqxLSuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZNT8MQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 21.49}}
{"item_id": "B007ZNTDEO", "title": "Champion Metal Pop-Up Target (Diamond Shape)", "description": "Champion now offers a large, highly-visible, diamond-shaped metal target affixed to a pop-up ground mount. The sturdy target automatically returns upright after being shot and is made of solid steel for lasting durability. Secure target in ground using four stakes (included), or use holes in the metal base to install target onto an elevated wood base with screws. Designed for .22 Long Rifle, use it for hours of interactive shooting fun––hear the metal clang and see target spring back up with every hit!", "text": "Champion Metal Pop-Up Target (Diamond Shape) Champion now offers a large, highly-visible, diamond-shaped metal target affixed to a pop-up ground mount. The sturdy target automatically returns upright after being shot and is made of solid steel for lasting durability. Secure target in ground using four stakes (included), or use holes in the metal base to install target onto an elevated wood base with screws. Designed for .22 Long Rifle, use it for hours of interactive shooting fun––hear the metal clang and see target spring back up with every hit!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nWIKVgtEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZNTDEO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B007ZNTN8U", "title": "Champion Over-Spec Ballistic Glasses (Clear)", "description": "See clearly. Shoot straight. Protect your eyes. These new Champion ballistic-grade shooting glasses are designed to comfortably fit over standard prescription eyeglasses. Two models are offered in either a clear or amber color. The ballistic rated lenses provide four times greater impact protection than ANSI Z87.1, meeting military standard MIL-PRF-31013. Designed for shooters, these lenses reduce glare and enhance target image sharpness. With a molded nose piece and wrap around style these lightweight glasses will feel great. Made with comfortable slip resistant materials they’ll stay where you put them, even during the most strenuous of activities.", "text": "Champion Over-Spec Ballistic Glasses (Clear) See clearly. Shoot straight. Protect your eyes. These new Champion ballistic-grade shooting glasses are designed to comfortably fit over standard prescription eyeglasses. Two models are offered in either a clear or amber color. The ballistic rated lenses provide four times greater impact protection than ANSI Z87.1, meeting military standard MIL-PRF-31013. Designed for shooters, these lenses reduce glare and enhance target image sharpness. With a molded nose piece and wrap around style these lightweight glasses will feel great. Made with comfortable slip resistant materials they’ll stay where you put them, even during the most strenuous of activities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qyMr0boYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZNTN8U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 12.49}}
{"item_id": "B007ZNU532", "title": "Blackhawk Bedside Holster-Ambidextrous", "description": "Mounting platform slips between mattress and box springs and holds pistol beside bed for rapid access. This holster works with both revolvers and semi-autos and is made with HawkTex material on mounting platform provides added stability", "text": "Blackhawk Bedside Holster-Ambidextrous Mounting platform slips between mattress and box springs and holds pistol beside bed for rapid access. This holster works with both revolvers and semi-autos and is made with HawkTex material on mounting platform provides added stability", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jqIzye%2BUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZNU532.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 27.99}}
{"item_id": "B007ZNUG9K", "title": "Blackhawk Black TraverseTrack Bipod - 10 - BH71BP10BK", "description": "Horizontal traverse for smooth target acquisition and tracking. Pivot action for level shooting on uneven terrain. Rapid-adjust lever lock. Robust tubular leg construction. Durable all-metal construction. Spring-return telescoping legs. Easily attaches to sling swivel stud.", "text": "Blackhawk Black TraverseTrack Bipod - 10 - BH71BP10BK Horizontal traverse for smooth target acquisition and tracking. Pivot action for level shooting on uneven terrain. Rapid-adjust lever lock. Robust tubular leg construction. Durable all-metal construction. Spring-return telescoping legs. Easily attaches to sling swivel stud.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41is%2BcUlOkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZNUG9K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 50.98}}
{"item_id": "B007ZQV312", "title": "MSR Mini Groundhog Stake - 6 pk", "description": "The MSR Mini Groundhog stake is tough, light, (very light, .25 oz) durable and has exceptional holding power for its small size. This stake builds on the proven Y-beam design the original MSR Groundhog™ stake. The smaller, lighter design saves weight while offering similar performance in medium to firm soil. 7000-series aluminum provides years of strength and durability. Sold in a package of 6.Perfect backpacking stake.'Y' design holds firmly.", "text": "MSR Mini Groundhog Stake - 6 pk The MSR Mini Groundhog stake is tough, light, (very light, .25 oz) durable and has exceptional holding power for its small size. This stake builds on the proven Y-beam design the original MSR Groundhog™ stake. The smaller, lighter design saves weight while offering similar performance in medium to firm soil. 7000-series aluminum provides years of strength and durability. Sold in a package of 6.Perfect backpacking stake.'Y' design holds firmly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o04gxH%2BcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZQV312.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B007ZSRCI8", "title": "TekMat 11-Inch X 17-Inch Handgun Cleaning Mat with Springfield Armory XDM Imprint, Black", "description": "Your gun is a proud possession as well as an investment and should be protected as such. TekMats depict the fascinating mechanical assembly of each firearm accompanied with data, history and details on each gun. We don't want cleaning, repairing or storing your firearm to be a chore and when seated in front of one of these gun mats, it certainly won't be. Aside from the aesthetic and intellectual appeal; TekMats also serve a very purposeful and functional role in protecting your firearms. They worked with numerous suppliers and tested many materials to find one that would be suited for both the imprinting of the design as well as protection of your firearm. The top surface of the gun mat is soft and made to protect your gun from scratches while the rubber backing will help to absorb damaging impacts from accidentally dropping your gun or parts while working on them and it also helps hold the mat in place while it is in use. We also utilize a special printing technology that prevents the ink from simply sitting on top of the material but instead fuses the ink into the fibers of the cloth via sublimation. This keeps the surface of the gun pads completely soft and even and helps ensure the print will last through repeated washing and cleaning of the gun mat.", "text": "TekMat 11-Inch X 17-Inch Handgun Cleaning Mat with Springfield Armory XDM Imprint, Black Your gun is a proud possession as well as an investment and should be protected as such. TekMats depict the fascinating mechanical assembly of each firearm accompanied with data, history and details on each gun. We don't want cleaning, repairing or storing your firearm to be a chore and when seated in front of one of these gun mats, it certainly won't be. Aside from the aesthetic and intellectual appeal; TekMats also serve a very purposeful and functional role in protecting your firearms. They worked with numerous suppliers and tested many materials to find one that would be suited for both the imprinting of the design as well as protection of your firearm. The top surface of the gun mat is soft and made to protect your gun from scratches while the rubber backing will help to absorb damaging impacts from accidentally dropping your gun or parts while working on them and it also helps hold the mat in place while it is in use. We also utilize a special printing technology that prevents the ink from simply sitting on top of the material but instead fuses the ink into the fibers of the cloth via sublimation. This keeps the surface of the gun pads completely soft and even and helps ensure the print will last through repeated washing and cleaning of the gun mat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51flcU3ZgzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZSRCI8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TekMat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 12.25}}
{"item_id": "B007ZURALK", "title": "Teeter Hang Ups EP-960 Inversion Table with Healthy Back DVD", "description": "In just minutes a day, the Teeter Hang Ups EP-960 Inversion Table can help relieve back pain, improve joint health, increase flexibility, and tone muscles through inverted exercise. Target back pain by lengthening and relaxing tense muscles and decompressing the spine to help realign, rehydrate discs and reduce nerve pressure. Decompression benefits hips, knees and ankles with better shock absorption and ligament strength. Key to a balanced workout, inversion increases flexibility and performance by keeping joints and muscles healthy. The UL Listing gives you confidence in the EP-960's durability so you can perform fully inverted core, leg and glute exercises.Built for the Benefits: The ComforTrak bed flexes during stretching to allow greater range of motion for back pain relief through realignment and relaxation. Its smooth surface promotes better decompression of the spine and joints. The EP-960's EZ-Reach Ankle System is ideal for back pain sufferers with its extended handle, triple-lock security and comfortable Ergo-Embrace Supports. Add stretching and decompression with built-in Grip-and-Stretch Handles and Stretch Max Handles that also assist beginners. The EZ-Angle Tether has pre-set angles at 20, 40 and 60 degrees. Precision balancing offers the best control for rotation and oscillation. Secure, full inversion lock-out allows exercises to tone the abs, glutes and legs with faster results.Certified Quality, Top Rated: The EP-960 is independently certified for quality and was rated the best inversion table against competing brands, outlasting in endurance, strength, rotation control, and assembly. The industry leader since 1981, Teeter produces the best value inversion equipment with time-proven design that ensure dependability and user security.Added Value: The EP-960 comes with an attached, Owner's Manual for quick-reference, a DVD to guide through assembly and use, and FIVE bonus Healthy Back Routines by Dr Shawn.", "text": "Teeter Hang Ups EP-960 Inversion Table with Healthy Back DVD In just minutes a day, the Teeter Hang Ups EP-960 Inversion Table can help relieve back pain, improve joint health, increase flexibility, and tone muscles through inverted exercise. Target back pain by lengthening and relaxing tense muscles and decompressing the spine to help realign, rehydrate discs and reduce nerve pressure. Decompression benefits hips, knees and ankles with better shock absorption and ligament strength. Key to a balanced workout, inversion increases flexibility and performance by keeping joints and muscles healthy. The UL Listing gives you confidence in the EP-960's durability so you can perform fully inverted core, leg and glute exercises.Built for the Benefits: The ComforTrak bed flexes during stretching to allow greater range of motion for back pain relief through realignment and relaxation. Its smooth surface promotes better decompression of the spine and joints. The EP-960's EZ-Reach Ankle System is ideal for back pain sufferers with its extended handle, triple-lock security and comfortable Ergo-Embrace Supports. Add stretching and decompression with built-in Grip-and-Stretch Handles and Stretch Max Handles that also assist beginners. The EZ-Angle Tether has pre-set angles at 20, 40 and 60 degrees. Precision balancing offers the best control for rotation and oscillation. Secure, full inversion lock-out allows exercises to tone the abs, glutes and legs with faster results.Certified Quality, Top Rated: The EP-960 is independently certified for quality and was rated the best inversion table against competing brands, outlasting in endurance, strength, rotation control, and assembly. The industry leader since 1981, Teeter produces the best value inversion equipment with time-proven design that ensure dependability and user security.Added Value: The EP-960 comes with an attached, Owner's Manual for quick-reference, a DVD to guide through assembly and use, and FIVE bonus Healthy Back Routines by Dr Shawn.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VRH1XFkaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZURALK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Inversion Equipment"]], "price": 399.0}}
{"item_id": "B007ZWIJR2", "title": "Omron HJ-321 Tri-Axis Pedometer, Black", "description": "", "text": "Omron HJ-321 Tri-Axis Pedometer, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QwGybiF-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZWIJR2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Omron", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]], "price": 19.75}}
{"item_id": "B007ZYQUNK", "title": "Otis 3-Gun Competition Cleaning System", "description": "Todays 3-gun courses demand accuracy, agility and expertise with a variety of firearms in multiple situations. Carry the only cleaning system portable and versatile enough to keep up with you. Designed to clean and maintain all 5.56MM, 9MM, 40cal, 45cal and 12 gauge shotguns.", "text": "Otis 3-Gun Competition Cleaning System Todays 3-gun courses demand accuracy, agility and expertise with a variety of firearms in multiple situations. Carry the only cleaning system portable and versatile enough to keep up with you. Designed to clean and maintain all 5.56MM, 9MM, 40cal, 45cal and 12 gauge shotguns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DQLASno4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZYQUNK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B007ZYQUO4", "title": "Otis Zombie Gun Cleaning System", "description": "When you're trying to save your life from the walking dead the last thing you want is a jam. Make sure your apocalyptic survival kit includes the Zombie Gun Cleaning System. Designed to clean all 5.56MM, 9MM, 40 & 45 caliber pistols and 12 gauge shotguns. Keep it clean; Stay Alive.", "text": "Otis Zombie Gun Cleaning System When you're trying to save your life from the walking dead the last thing you want is a jam. Make sure your apocalyptic survival kit includes the Zombie Gun Cleaning System. Designed to clean all 5.56MM, 9MM, 40 & 45 caliber pistols and 12 gauge shotguns. Keep it clean; Stay Alive.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E29hsu1JL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZYQUO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 55.89}}
{"item_id": "B007ZYQUUI", "title": "Otis Modern Sporting Rifle and AR Cleaning System", "description": "Even with the versatiility and ruged construction of modern sporting rifles, conditions in the field can be extremely tough on your firearm. Give your gun a quick, effective cleaning in the field without disassembly with this lightweight system. Designed to clean and maintain all .223 caliber and 5.56-mm rifles.", "text": "Otis Modern Sporting Rifle and AR Cleaning System Even with the versatiility and ruged construction of modern sporting rifles, conditions in the field can be extremely tough on your firearm. Give your gun a quick, effective cleaning in the field without disassembly with this lightweight system. Designed to clean and maintain all .223 caliber and 5.56-mm rifles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51R8Df3RKgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZYQUUI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 52.42}}
{"item_id": "B007ZZAZVM", "title": "Commando 360rd Full Metal High Capacity Flash Magazine", "description": "The ALL New FLASH MAGS are high capacity airsoft magazine that can be fully wound in less than ten seconds. It's easy to see why airsoft players are rushing to get their hands on these. They are also more durable than most standard high capacity airsoft AEG magazines. If you are tired of wasting critical time during intense airsoft battles winding your high capacity magazines, pick up some of the best Flash Magazine on the market today.", "text": "Commando 360rd Full Metal High Capacity Flash Magazine The ALL New FLASH MAGS are high capacity airsoft magazine that can be fully wound in less than ten seconds. It's easy to see why airsoft players are rushing to get their hands on these. They are also more durable than most standard high capacity airsoft AEG magazines. If you are tired of wasting critical time during intense airsoft battles winding your high capacity magazines, pick up some of the best Flash Magazine on the market today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Txs7KpU%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZZAZVM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Commando", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 12.53}}
{"item_id": "B007ZZO41E", "title": "Gunslick AR-10 Bore Guide", "description": "This cool, little target delivers big fun at the range. It features a weighted-round bottom that provides an easy-to-see wobbling reaction when shot. Its double-profile design allows for a full-sized round target to aim at. No matter how it wobbles and bobbles after each hit, it always returns to its upright position. Dura Seal is a non-metal, self-sealing material that absorbs thousands of rounds, yet still keeps its shape: Designed for hours of interactive shooting fun.", "text": "Gunslick AR-10 Bore Guide This cool, little target delivers big fun at the range. It features a weighted-round bottom that provides an easy-to-see wobbling reaction when shot. Its double-profile design allows for a full-sized round target to aim at. No matter how it wobbles and bobbles after each hit, it always returns to its upright position. Dura Seal is a non-metal, self-sealing material that absorbs thousands of rounds, yet still keeps its shape: Designed for hours of interactive shooting fun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311Zejlo-EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZZO41E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 36.49}}
{"item_id": "B007ZZO9QE", "title": "Blackhawk Offset Flashlight Rail Mount", "description": "Designed for mounting flashlights to Picatinny-style rails, the offset design provides multiple options for optimal positioning. This flashlight rail mount is compatible with 1” body flashlights and is constructed of 6061 T6 aluminium with type-III hard-coat anodized finish.", "text": "Blackhawk Offset Flashlight Rail Mount Designed for mounting flashlights to Picatinny-style rails, the offset design provides multiple options for optimal positioning. This flashlight rail mount is compatible with 1” body flashlights and is constructed of 6061 T6 aluminium with type-III hard-coat anodized finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NKNe6QZsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZZO9QE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 21.25}}
{"item_id": "B007ZZOAX6", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Sportster Adjustable Bi-Pod, 6\" - 9\"", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Sportster Bipod easily attaches to swing swivels and provides unshakable shooting from a bench or in the prone position. The spring-return telescoping legs are constructed from no-rust anodized steel. Compact and lightweight, these bipods are ready for the challenge.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Sportster Adjustable Bi-Pod, 6\" - 9\" The BLACKHAWK! Sportster Bipod easily attaches to swing swivels and provides unshakable shooting from a bench or in the prone position. The spring-return telescoping legs are constructed from no-rust anodized steel. Compact and lightweight, these bipods are ready for the challenge.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3174eV1NqDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZZOAX6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 30.67}}
{"item_id": "B007ZZQHSW", "title": "Spec-Ops Brand Recon-Wrap Multi-Season Multi-Mode Head Gear", "description": "The Recon-Wrap is one-piece headgear providing comfort & concealment. It can be used as a sweatband, balaclava, neck gaiter, helmet liner, contour conforming face cover, dew rag, etc. Made of high-tech micro fiber; this versatile design works well in both hot and cold weather conditions- keeps user cool in Summer/ warm in Winter. Spec-Ops Brand has recently improved the design of this already great headwrap-It's now two inches longer with enhanced stretch and wicking capability, while its seamless construction with Lock-Knit stitching ensures it will not unravel. One size fits all. Easy care, just wash and wear. Will not shrink.", "text": "Spec-Ops Brand Recon-Wrap Multi-Season Multi-Mode Head Gear The Recon-Wrap is one-piece headgear providing comfort & concealment. It can be used as a sweatband, balaclava, neck gaiter, helmet liner, contour conforming face cover, dew rag, etc. Made of high-tech micro fiber; this versatile design works well in both hot and cold weather conditions- keeps user cool in Summer/ warm in Winter. Spec-Ops Brand has recently improved the design of this already great headwrap-It's now two inches longer with enhanced stretch and wicking capability, while its seamless construction with Lock-Knit stitching ensures it will not unravel. One size fits all. Easy care, just wash and wear. Will not shrink.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aaF6dtvxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B007ZZQHSW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spec.-Ops. Brand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Neck Protectors"]], "price": 19.8}}
{"item_id": "B00801654G", "title": "Tango Down Vicker Tactical Extended Mag Release For Generation 4 Glocks", "description": "Now, a proper fix for the hard to use factory Gen 4 Glock magazine release! The Vickers Generation 4 Tactical Extended Release is easy to install and made of the same tough polymer as the factory part. Now anyone with average - to small-size hands can release the magazine rapidly without shifting their grip on the weapon.", "text": "Tango Down Vicker Tactical Extended Mag Release For Generation 4 Glocks Now, a proper fix for the hard to use factory Gen 4 Glock magazine release! The Vickers Generation 4 Tactical Extended Release is easy to install and made of the same tough polymer as the factory part. Now anyone with average - to small-size hands can release the magazine rapidly without shifting their grip on the weapon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z6EqyRVIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00801654G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TangoDown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B008069ZB6", "title": "Leatherman Z Rex Tool", "description": "Leatherman's Z-Rex combines 4 emergency and tactical tools into one lightweight, intuitive and comfortable to use multi-tool. Replaceable and index friendly V-notch cutters can simply be flipped around for a fresh edge on-the-spot, or replaced completely when you're back home. Two wrenches?oxygen and Hex?are built right into the body and, while other companies use stainless steel that takes much more force (if it even works at all) Leatherman uses one-strike, Tungsten Carbide for the glass breaker tool. After all, if you're down to breaking glass, this is not the time to be beating your fist against the window.1/4in Hex Bit Driver.Features:.Finger Hole.Ergo Grip.Powder-coated Aluminum Body.MOLLE Sheath.Size: Length- 6.6\".Weight: 1.6 oz.", "text": "Leatherman Z Rex Tool Leatherman's Z-Rex combines 4 emergency and tactical tools into one lightweight, intuitive and comfortable to use multi-tool. Replaceable and index friendly V-notch cutters can simply be flipped around for a fresh edge on-the-spot, or replaced completely when you're back home. Two wrenches?oxygen and Hex?are built right into the body and, while other companies use stainless steel that takes much more force (if it even works at all) Leatherman uses one-strike, Tungsten Carbide for the glass breaker tool. After all, if you're down to breaking glass, this is not the time to be beating your fist against the window.1/4in Hex Bit Driver.Features:.Finger Hole.Ergo Grip.Powder-coated Aluminum Body.MOLLE Sheath.Size: Length- 6.6\".Weight: 1.6 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aAPn7iUXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008069ZB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leatherman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 19.59}}
{"item_id": "B00806BS52", "title": "Wheeler 156700 AR Combo Tool with", "description": "The Wheeler Delta Series AR Combo Tool with Torque Wrench construction method allows the use of hardened steel barrel nut pins designed to hold up to heavy torque requirements. A cut out for a ½'' drive allows the tool to be used with a torque wrench or ratchet driver. Profiles for buffer tube lock nut and flash hider are included. The addition of a bit driver and bit holder with six common bits adds to the versatility.", "text": "Wheeler 156700 AR Combo Tool with The Wheeler Delta Series AR Combo Tool with Torque Wrench construction method allows the use of hardened steel barrel nut pins designed to hold up to heavy torque requirements. A cut out for a ½'' drive allows the tool to be used with a torque wrench or ratchet driver. Profiles for buffer tube lock nut and flash hider are included. The addition of a bit driver and bit holder with six common bits adds to the versatility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KgSltg78L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00806BS52.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B00806BXRA", "title": "SA Sports Fever String", "description": "Why take chances on that old worn out string, why not replace it now before you find yourself in front of the trophy of a lifetime with the SA Sports Fever 583 String.", "text": "SA Sports Fever String Why take chances on that old worn out string, why not replace it now before you find yourself in front of the trophy of a lifetime with the SA Sports Fever 583 String.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kOQKCg84L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00806BXRA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SA Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bowstrings"]], "price": 13.24}}
{"item_id": "B00808BP4E", "title": "BiKASE Handy Andy Smartphone Holder", "description": "Fits Iphone (TM), Iphone (TM) in an average-sized case, Androids (TM) such as Motorola Bionic (TM) & Motorola Razor (TM), Samsung Galaxy (TM) and many more. Easily mounts to bike with two neoprene velcro straps. Simply wrap the straps around your handlebars, the stem, top tube, or even your backpack for easy access to your smart phone while riding. No tools required for this easy set up! This cell phone pouch makes calling or navigating with a GPS or training app simple. The see through window allows you to view information while keeping your phone or device protected with easy operation of the touch screen while in the pouch. Includes removable pad for those really thick phones.", "text": "BiKASE Handy Andy Smartphone Holder Fits Iphone (TM), Iphone (TM) in an average-sized case, Androids (TM) such as Motorola Bionic (TM) & Motorola Razor (TM), Samsung Galaxy (TM) and many more. Easily mounts to bike with two neoprene velcro straps. Simply wrap the straps around your handlebars, the stem, top tube, or even your backpack for easy access to your smart phone while riding. No tools required for this easy set up! This cell phone pouch makes calling or navigating with a GPS or training app simple. The see through window allows you to view information while keeping your phone or device protected with easy operation of the touch screen while in the pouch. Includes removable pad for those really thick phones.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CcJA7ZVdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00808BP4E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BiKase", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 14.77}}
