{"item_id": "B0080IYV3Q", "title": "Zero Tolerance ZT0350TS G10 Handle Folding Tiger Striped Blade with SpeedSafe", "description": "The Zero Tolerance 0350st is 10% smaller and lighter than the classic 0300, with a new non-serrated blade with unique Tiger Stripe finish, for added cutting versatility, while maintaining the cutting and piercing power that made the original such a popular model. It's equipped with SpeedSafe manual assist for easy one-handed opening, meaning you can easily deploy the blade while wearing tactical gloves by using the large, ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion. The stout, sharp blade is made of S30V stainless steel with a rugged Tungsten DLC (Diamond-like Carbon) coating. Textured, matte-black G-10 scales on the synthetic handle provide an extra-secure grip, and the knife comes complete with a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left-, or right-handed clip carry.SpecificationsS30V stainless-steel with tungsten DLC coatingNon-serrated blade with Tiger Stripe finishTextured matte black G-10 handle3.25-inch blade length4.625-inch closed length7.75-inch overall length5.6-ounce weightMade in the USALifetime WarrantyZero Tolerance knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Zero ToleranceDesigned and manufactured to stand up to heavy-duty use, Zero Tolerance knives are built of high-end materials and designed to provide users with strength, versatility, and field-ready reliability. All Zero Tolerance Knives are intended to handle the professional, hard-use requirements of armed forces personnel, law enforcement officers, other first responders, and discerning knife owners who simply want to be ready for anything the world might throw at them.", "text": "Zero Tolerance ZT0350TS G10 Handle Folding Tiger Striped Blade with SpeedSafe The Zero Tolerance 0350st is 10% smaller and lighter than the classic 0300, with a new non-serrated blade with unique Tiger Stripe finish, for added cutting versatility, while maintaining the cutting and piercing power that made the original such a popular model. It's equipped with SpeedSafe manual assist for easy one-handed opening, meaning you can easily deploy the blade while wearing tactical gloves by using the large, ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion. The stout, sharp blade is made of S30V stainless steel with a rugged Tungsten DLC (Diamond-like Carbon) coating. Textured, matte-black G-10 scales on the synthetic handle provide an extra-secure grip, and the knife comes complete with a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left-, or right-handed clip carry.SpecificationsS30V stainless-steel with tungsten DLC coatingNon-serrated blade with Tiger Stripe finishTextured matte black G-10 handle3.25-inch blade length4.625-inch closed length7.75-inch overall length5.6-ounce weightMade in the USALifetime WarrantyZero Tolerance knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Zero ToleranceDesigned and manufactured to stand up to heavy-duty use, Zero Tolerance knives are built of high-end materials and designed to provide users with strength, versatility, and field-ready reliability. All Zero Tolerance Knives are intended to handle the professional, hard-use requirements of armed forces personnel, law enforcement officers, other first responders, and discerning knife owners who simply want to be ready for anything the world might throw at them.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RY0iopgdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080IYV3Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zero Tolerance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 119.95}}
{"item_id": "B0080J74OS", "title": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Lubricant - MIS Kit #7 - Non-Aerosol, 1 - 16 oz. can, With Spray Trigger, Wipes, Bottles, Caps", "description": "Superior liquid for preserving airguns, firearms, marine equipment & more! Dissolves traces of copper, lead, brass, zinc & tombac. Cleans, lubes & protects every part of your gun. Forms a film against rust. Never gums up or hardens. Ideal for protecting & preserving gun metal and wood stocks. Removes rust & neutralizes bluing salts found in the barrels of new guns, including airguns. Neutralizes fingerprints (which are acidic). Actively propels itself & reaches areas inaccessible to the applicator. Originally invented for military use. Biodegradable & environmentally friendly. Non-toxic & contains no carcinogens.", "text": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Lubricant - MIS Kit #7 - Non-Aerosol, 1 - 16 oz. can, With Spray Trigger, Wipes, Bottles, Caps Superior liquid for preserving airguns, firearms, marine equipment & more! Dissolves traces of copper, lead, brass, zinc & tombac. Cleans, lubes & protects every part of your gun. Forms a film against rust. Never gums up or hardens. Ideal for protecting & preserving gun metal and wood stocks. Removes rust & neutralizes bluing salts found in the barrels of new guns, including airguns. Neutralizes fingerprints (which are acidic). Actively propels itself & reaches areas inaccessible to the applicator. Originally invented for military use. Biodegradable & environmentally friendly. Non-toxic & contains no carcinogens.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516xRD%2B5mZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080J74OS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ballistol", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 28.77}}
{"item_id": "B0080JEQOY", "title": "Uzi UZI-TACPEN6-GM Defender Aircraft Aluminum Tactical Pen with Glassbreaker and Cuff Key, Gun Metal", "description": "The UZI UZI-TACPEN6-GM Defender Tactical Pen is made from lightweight aircraft aluminum and features a glass breaker and cuff key. UZI combines advanced technical concepts with innovative designs to produce products used and trusted by the Army, Secret Service and Special Forces. Since its launch in the 1950s, UZI has become one of the world's most famous firearm brands and a 20th century icon.", "text": "Uzi UZI-TACPEN6-GM Defender Aircraft Aluminum Tactical Pen with Glassbreaker and Cuff Key, Gun Metal The UZI UZI-TACPEN6-GM Defender Tactical Pen is made from lightweight aircraft aluminum and features a glass breaker and cuff key. UZI combines advanced technical concepts with innovative designs to produce products used and trusted by the Army, Secret Service and Special Forces. Since its launch in the 1950s, UZI has become one of the world's most famous firearm brands and a 20th century icon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Wx36IKpjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080JEQOY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uzi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 17.89}}
{"item_id": "B0080KBL46", "title": "Maxpedition Gear WDK4 Khaki Web Dominator", "description": "Maxpedition Web Dominator. Khaki. Designed primarily to manage the floppy excess 1\" webbing on backpack shoulder straps once they are tightened. Simply install the Web DominatorTM on end of strap, roll/fold it up, and engage the shock (bungee) cord. Also excellent on backpack sternum straps to position hydration drink tube. Made from durable, low IR signature material. Color: Khaki Packet of four.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear WDK4 Khaki Web Dominator Maxpedition Web Dominator. Khaki. Designed primarily to manage the floppy excess 1\" webbing on backpack shoulder straps once they are tightened. Simply install the Web DominatorTM on end of strap, roll/fold it up, and engage the shock (bungee) cord. Also excellent on backpack sternum straps to position hydration drink tube. Made from durable, low IR signature material. Color: Khaki Packet of four.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XzqNlW54L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080KBL46.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Web Dominator", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]], "price": 9.9}}
{"item_id": "B0080KGHRC", "title": "2 Pack Taurus PT709 and PT740 Extra Long 1.25\" Grip Extension by Garrison Grip", "description": "Finally, a 1.25\" Extra Long (XL) grip extension that fits the large and extra large hand. Now all of your fingers can fit on the handle of your firearm. Our grip extensions are made from quality materials and expertly manufactured to create improved Comfort, Control and Accuracy. This product DOES NOT increase magazine capacity. If you are not satisfied for any reason, just send the extension back for a full refund.", "text": "2 Pack Taurus PT709 and PT740 Extra Long 1.25\" Grip Extension by Garrison Grip Finally, a 1.25\" Extra Long (XL) grip extension that fits the large and extra large hand. Now all of your fingers can fit on the handle of your firearm. Our grip extensions are made from quality materials and expertly manufactured to create improved Comfort, Control and Accuracy. This product DOES NOT increase magazine capacity. If you are not satisfied for any reason, just send the extension back for a full refund.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XucXq7dNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080KGHRC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B0080KK3WW", "title": "Tac Force TF-428WB Assisted Opening Folding Knife 5-Inch Closed", "description": "Tac Force Knives - 5\" Black Blade Folder Knife with Wood Handles. Model: TF428WB.", "text": "Tac Force TF-428WB Assisted Opening Folding Knife 5-Inch Closed Tac Force Knives - 5\" Black Blade Folder Knife with Wood Handles. Model: TF428WB.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lyiLh%2BsbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080KK3WW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TAC Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B0080MPWSA", "title": "Tango Down Vickers Tactical Base Plate for Glock", "description": "Vickers Tactical Floor Plates also provide a larger, more positive surface when pulling magazines from pouches, speeding reloads. Concaved dots allow easy numbering & marking of spare magazines. For Glock magazine calibers: 9x19mm, .40 Smith & Wesson, .357 SIG, .45 GAP Sold in packs of 5, because any serious fighting handgun should have 5 reliability-proven magazines close by.", "text": "Tango Down Vickers Tactical Base Plate for Glock Vickers Tactical Floor Plates also provide a larger, more positive surface when pulling magazines from pouches, speeding reloads. Concaved dots allow easy numbering & marking of spare magazines. For Glock magazine calibers: 9x19mm, .40 Smith & Wesson, .357 SIG, .45 GAP Sold in packs of 5, because any serious fighting handgun should have 5 reliability-proven magazines close by.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NSvMwqOeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080MPWSA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TangoDown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 18.5}}
{"item_id": "B0080R1XCY", "title": "Laser Max CF-Shield Laser for", "description": "LaserMax CenterFire Laser for Smith & Wesson MP Shield for pinpoint accuracy for all of your shots! Built specifically to enhance your MP Shield pistol, this LaserMax offering gives you the confidence and enhanced accuracy to perform under duress! Mounts to the frame without altering parts... no Picatinny or Weaver style rail required! Just switch it on (ambidextrous activation!) and the searing red laser cuts through the night for point-and-shoot ease. Runs for up to 5 hours on the included, powerful lithium battery. Precise aim: Tactical design matches contours of the MP Shield; Distinct on / off switch; Installs in mere minutes; Wavelength: 5mW; User-adjustable windage / elevation; One year manufacturer's warranty. Weighs 0.5 ozs. Dead-center firing made possible, with a little help from LaserMax! Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA or Puerto Rico. Lasers cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. LaserMax CenterFire Laser for Smith & Wesson MP Shield", "text": "Laser Max CF-Shield Laser for LaserMax CenterFire Laser for Smith & Wesson MP Shield for pinpoint accuracy for all of your shots! Built specifically to enhance your MP Shield pistol, this LaserMax offering gives you the confidence and enhanced accuracy to perform under duress! Mounts to the frame without altering parts... no Picatinny or Weaver style rail required! Just switch it on (ambidextrous activation!) and the searing red laser cuts through the night for point-and-shoot ease. Runs for up to 5 hours on the included, powerful lithium battery. Precise aim: Tactical design matches contours of the MP Shield; Distinct on / off switch; Installs in mere minutes; Wavelength: 5mW; User-adjustable windage / elevation; One year manufacturer's warranty. Weighs 0.5 ozs. Dead-center firing made possible, with a little help from LaserMax! Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA or Puerto Rico. Lasers cannot be shipped Parcel Post. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. LaserMax CenterFire Laser for Smith & Wesson MP Shield", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N6TtbNItL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080R1XCY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserMax", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 74.97}}
{"item_id": "B0080REUY2", "title": "1911LgB - The Original Concealed Carry Clipdraw for Colt 1911 FullSize or Commander", "description": "The perfect solution for left or right handed shooters. Mounts on either side and is super comfortable. The \"Original\" Clipdraw - Improved with aircraft grade aluminum slide cover plate for extra strength. Made from specially tempered spring steel with black oxide coating, Clipdraws are available to fit standard or large frame Glocks. The Clipdraw comes with a slide cover plate that replaces the original and is drilled and tapped for attaching the Clipdraw. This model was tested by Combat Handguns magazine and was given a stellar write-up. >>> Here is what one buyer said about his Clipdraw \"\"Just bought a Clipdraw OM. I am a left-handed shooter and I have problems with IWB Holsters and my range of motion in my left wrist. I found that my best carry position was IWB MOB with the butt to the left. There is absolutely nothing in holsters that will work. I bought the Clipdraw and it has worked really well! It's sturdy and really reduces my fret level about the weapon being noticed when carrying concealed.\"\"", "text": "1911LgB - The Original Concealed Carry Clipdraw for Colt 1911 FullSize or Commander The perfect solution for left or right handed shooters. Mounts on either side and is super comfortable. The \"Original\" Clipdraw - Improved with aircraft grade aluminum slide cover plate for extra strength. Made from specially tempered spring steel with black oxide coating, Clipdraws are available to fit standard or large frame Glocks. The Clipdraw comes with a slide cover plate that replaces the original and is drilled and tapped for attaching the Clipdraw. This model was tested by Combat Handguns magazine and was given a stellar write-up. >>> Here is what one buyer said about his Clipdraw \"\"Just bought a Clipdraw OM. I am a left-handed shooter and I have problems with IWB Holsters and my range of motion in my left wrist. I found that my best carry position was IWB MOB with the butt to the left. There is absolutely nothing in holsters that will work. I bought the Clipdraw and it has worked really well! It's sturdy and really reduces my fret level about the weapon being noticed when carrying concealed.\"\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eTNB%2B5XbL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080REUY2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ClipDraw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 15.0}}
{"item_id": "B0080RIO9O", "title": "Bike Mount for LED Flashlight", "description": "This mount allows you to utilize the amazing brightness of your Bonfire series flashlight without having to use your hands while riding a bicycle. It straps securely onto your bike's handlebar without any tools required and allows the flashlight to swivel 360 degrees as needed. The flashlight slips in and out of the mount easily, but stays securely when mounted.", "text": "Bike Mount for LED Flashlight This mount allows you to utilize the amazing brightness of your Bonfire series flashlight without having to use your hands while riding a bicycle. It straps securely onto your bike's handlebar without any tools required and allows the flashlight to swivel 360 degrees as needed. The flashlight slips in and out of the mount easily, but stays securely when mounted.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pkXhOmbsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080RIO9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bright Medic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 1.68}}
{"item_id": "B0080S67EM", "title": "Military Tactical Dark Black HD Replacement Lens for Oakley Half Jacket XLJ", "description": "Limited Edition Military Stealth Black HD Lenses for the Oakley Half Jacket XLJ style. This is our Military style lens which meets ANSI Z87 High Mass and High Velocity Impact. These lenses meet the army standard AR 670-1 for dress wear. They are non-mirrored black lenses. (They do have a stealth reflective coating that prevents the wearers eye movement from being seen as well as blocking IR rays. This stealth coating complies with army standards.) In addition, these select lenses feature the highest optical clarity we provide. As we are only selling the lenses (no frames) we are not allowed to endorse them for active combat and should not be a replacement and/or alternative to government issued protective eyewear in combat situations. Our lenses are tough and it is the buyer's responsibility to install them in authentic Oakley frames in order to gain the level of protection they can provide. DISCLAIMER: Chamelius Sunglasses LLC are not affiliated nor associated in any capacity with Oakley, Inc. Chamelius Sunglasses, LLC manufactures only custom aftermarket replacement and alternative lenses. The lenses for sale in this listing were not manufactured by Oakley. The lenses are manufactured by Chamelius Sunglasses, LLC. Oakley, Half Jacket, XLJ are registered trademarks of Oakley, Inc. We respect the intellectual property rights of Oakley and the remarkable brand they represent.", "text": "Military Tactical Dark Black HD Replacement Lens for Oakley Half Jacket XLJ Limited Edition Military Stealth Black HD Lenses for the Oakley Half Jacket XLJ style. This is our Military style lens which meets ANSI Z87 High Mass and High Velocity Impact. These lenses meet the army standard AR 670-1 for dress wear. They are non-mirrored black lenses. (They do have a stealth reflective coating that prevents the wearers eye movement from being seen as well as blocking IR rays. This stealth coating complies with army standards.) In addition, these select lenses feature the highest optical clarity we provide. As we are only selling the lenses (no frames) we are not allowed to endorse them for active combat and should not be a replacement and/or alternative to government issued protective eyewear in combat situations. Our lenses are tough and it is the buyer's responsibility to install them in authentic Oakley frames in order to gain the level of protection they can provide. DISCLAIMER: Chamelius Sunglasses LLC are not affiliated nor associated in any capacity with Oakley, Inc. Chamelius Sunglasses, LLC manufactures only custom aftermarket replacement and alternative lenses. The lenses for sale in this listing were not manufactured by Oakley. The lenses are manufactured by Chamelius Sunglasses, LLC. Oakley, Half Jacket, XLJ are registered trademarks of Oakley, Inc. We respect the intellectual property rights of Oakley and the remarkable brand they represent.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zYMlySApL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080S67EM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0080TG4QW", "title": "Terminator 19,000,000 V Stun Gun w/ Flashlight", "description": "This TERMINATOR stun gun is one of the most powerful stun guns available. Terminator is a registered US trademark and is exclusively distributed by ZigZagMart on Amazon. Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. If the sight and sound doesn't stop him a jolt from this stun gun certainly will bring an attacker down in just 2 seconds! When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, Connecticut, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County,IA", "text": "Terminator 19,000,000 V Stun Gun w/ Flashlight This TERMINATOR stun gun is one of the most powerful stun guns available. Terminator is a registered US trademark and is exclusively distributed by ZigZagMart on Amazon. Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. If the sight and sound doesn't stop him a jolt from this stun gun certainly will bring an attacker down in just 2 seconds! When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, Connecticut, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County,IA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414zIg5YMEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0080TG4QW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 19.99}}
