{"item_id": "B00811WQT8", "title": "VENZO Bicycle Bike Torque Wrench Allen Key Tool Socket Set Kit", "description": "Comes with Guage perfect for bicycle carbon parts1/4'' Torque Fix Set,Torque range: 2-24 NMTolerance in : Accuracy +/- 4%Allen Keys 3 /4 / 5 / 6 / 8 / 10 mm, plus 5mm Longer Allen Key for easy useT25 and T30 TorquesHigh quality. Great for bicycle parts or bolts. (Note: please do not try to use cheap quality tools, they will damage the parts)Made in TaiwanWarranty: One yearNote: Stop turning when you feel a \"click\". \"Click\" means the torque has reached preset value.", "text": "VENZO Bicycle Bike Torque Wrench Allen Key Tool Socket Set Kit Comes with Guage perfect for bicycle carbon parts1/4'' Torque Fix Set,Torque range: 2-24 NMTolerance in : Accuracy +/- 4%Allen Keys 3 /4 / 5 / 6 / 8 / 10 mm, plus 5mm Longer Allen Key for easy useT25 and T30 TorquesHigh quality. Great for bicycle parts or bolts. (Note: please do not try to use cheap quality tools, they will damage the parts)Made in TaiwanWarranty: One yearNote: Stop turning when you feel a \"click\". \"Click\" means the torque has reached preset value.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qJk0o9PxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00811WQT8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 59.0}}
