{"item_id": "B00814FK1Q", "title": "RainStoppers 68-Inch Oversize Windproof Golf Umbrella", "description": "This RainStoppers 68\" oversize golf umbrella is large enough to cover three or more people. Umbrella frame constructed with fiberglass shaft and ribs for maximum stability. Canopy is made of 190T Nylon fabric. Complete with a foam non slip handle. Matching sleeve included. Length when closed is 43\".", "text": "RainStoppers 68-Inch Oversize Windproof Golf Umbrella This RainStoppers 68\" oversize golf umbrella is large enough to cover three or more people. Umbrella frame constructed with fiberglass shaft and ribs for maximum stability. Canopy is made of 190T Nylon fabric. Complete with a foam non slip handle. Matching sleeve included. Length when closed is 43\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419m6Xo0TjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00814FK1Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Umbrellas"]], "price": 16.8}}
