{"item_id": "B0082B42GW", "title": "SPYDERCO Endura 4 Lightweight Combination Edge Knife", "description": "First introduced in 1990, the Spyderco Endura was one of the first lightweight, high-performance, one-hand-open pocketknives ever developed. A consistent best seller, it has evolved steadily over the years through Spyderco's CQI (Constant Quality Improvement) process. The Endura 4 features enhanced ergonomics, screw-together construction, and a four-position clip for versatile carry options. Its fiberglass reinforced nylon handles are molded with Bi-Directional Texturing for improved traction and control and are supported by dual skeletonized stainless steel liners. The liners increase structural strength without adding weight and provide a framework to anchor all external and internal components. Its VG-10 blade is flat saber-ground with a stronger tip and larger 13mm opening hole. Phosphor bronze washers ensure a smooth action, and textured jimping on the spine guarantees positive control during use.", "text": "SPYDERCO Endura 4 Lightweight Combination Edge Knife First introduced in 1990, the Spyderco Endura was one of the first lightweight, high-performance, one-hand-open pocketknives ever developed. A consistent best seller, it has evolved steadily over the years through Spyderco's CQI (Constant Quality Improvement) process. The Endura 4 features enhanced ergonomics, screw-together construction, and a four-position clip for versatile carry options. Its fiberglass reinforced nylon handles are molded with Bi-Directional Texturing for improved traction and control and are supported by dual skeletonized stainless steel liners. The liners increase structural strength without adding weight and provide a framework to anchor all external and internal components. Its VG-10 blade is flat saber-ground with a stronger tip and larger 13mm opening hole. Phosphor bronze washers ensure a smooth action, and textured jimping on the spine guarantees positive control during use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NK-hSHCBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0082B42GW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 65.49}}
