{"item_id": "B0082CW056", "title": "Condor Ambidextrous MOLLE Holster for 1911 with Mag Pouch - Black", "description": "Condor Ambidextrous MOLLE Holsters for Glock, 1911, Beretta and Similar Pistols with Mag Pouch Description : • Modular design for left or right hand • Retention system with secondary elastic cord to secure weapon • One single pistol mag pouch included • Three different models for 1911, Beretta, Glock or similar pistols • Each holster comes with two removable MOLLE straps Colors Available : O.D., Black, Coyote Tan, ACU", "text": "Condor Ambidextrous MOLLE Holster for 1911 with Mag Pouch - Black Condor Ambidextrous MOLLE Holsters for Glock, 1911, Beretta and Similar Pistols with Mag Pouch Description : • Modular design for left or right hand • Retention system with secondary elastic cord to secure weapon • One single pistol mag pouch included • Three different models for 1911, Beretta, Glock or similar pistols • Each holster comes with two removable MOLLE straps Colors Available : O.D., Black, Coyote Tan, ACU", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41snj5FmOCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0082CW056.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.79}}
