{"item_id": "B0082CW6U0", "title": "Condor HCB Molle Hydration Carrier With 2.5 L Bladder - Black", "description": "Condor HCB Molle Hydration Carrier With 2.5 L Bladder Description: • INCLUDES 2.5 L Bladder, Drinking tube and Bite Valve • Carrier has MOLLE webbing to attach additional pouches • Hook and loop bladder compartment closure • Removable shoulder straps included • Can also be securely Attached to any MOLLE Platform, Vest or Pack via MOLLE straps Available Colors: O.D., Black, Coyote Tan, ACU", "text": "Condor HCB Molle Hydration Carrier With 2.5 L Bladder - Black Condor HCB Molle Hydration Carrier With 2.5 L Bladder Description: • INCLUDES 2.5 L Bladder, Drinking tube and Bite Valve • Carrier has MOLLE webbing to attach additional pouches • Hook and loop bladder compartment closure • Removable shoulder straps included • Can also be securely Attached to any MOLLE Platform, Vest or Pack via MOLLE straps Available Colors: O.D., Black, Coyote Tan, ACU", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IyPos7EtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0082CW6U0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 28.95}}
