{"item_id": "B00834YARY", "title": "CVLIFE 16x40 Compact Sports Monocular Telescope Pocket Mono Spotting Scope With Pouch Black", "description": "Focus adjustableFold down rubber eyepiece will be convenient for users wear glassesLarge eyepiece provides a very comfortable view when looking through the eye lensEasy carrying and use", "text": "CVLIFE 16x40 Compact Sports Monocular Telescope Pocket Mono Spotting Scope With Pouch Black Focus adjustableFold down rubber eyepiece will be convenient for users wear glassesLarge eyepiece provides a very comfortable view when looking through the eye lensEasy carrying and use", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417GbtTuWcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00834YARY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00836HLMI", "title": "Gerber 31-001159 Myth Field Dress Kit Includes Pro Gut Hook Knife, Compact Fixed Blade, and Piggyback-Style Sheath with Sharpener", "description": "The Myth Field Dress Kit is a packable dual knife kit for the modern hunter. The Myth Field Dressing Kit brings the same sleek design as it's namesake family while housing two field dressing essentials - the Myth Fixed Blade Pro with Guthook knife and the Myth Compact Fixed Blade knife. Packaged together in a slim, piggyback-style puncture-proof sheath, this hunting kit will fit neatly into your pack or on your belt loop. The base of the sheath houses a built-in carbide sharpener for sharpening on the go. The Myth Field Dressing Kit is the ultimate hunting companion.", "text": "Gerber 31-001159 Myth Field Dress Kit Includes Pro Gut Hook Knife, Compact Fixed Blade, and Piggyback-Style Sheath with Sharpener The Myth Field Dress Kit is a packable dual knife kit for the modern hunter. The Myth Field Dressing Kit brings the same sleek design as it's namesake family while housing two field dressing essentials - the Myth Fixed Blade Pro with Guthook knife and the Myth Compact Fixed Blade knife. Packaged together in a slim, piggyback-style puncture-proof sheath, this hunting kit will fit neatly into your pack or on your belt loop. The base of the sheath houses a built-in carbide sharpener for sharpening on the go. The Myth Field Dressing Kit is the ultimate hunting companion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319VDdzdVtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00836HLMI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 51.95}}
{"item_id": "B00838YDS6", "title": "Brass Stacker G4A Guide Rod Recoil Spring Assembly Adapter for Glock Generation 4 Pistols, Black", "description": "Quality CNC machined adapter for Glock Gen 4 pistols allows you to use standard single stage guide rod assemblies. Drop in adapter is inserted into the slide and adapter end ring to standard diameter. It can be used with both captured and non captured guide rod systems. Not for use in sub compact pistols. Made in America with a 100% Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Brass Stacker G4A Guide Rod Recoil Spring Assembly Adapter for Glock Generation 4 Pistols, Black Quality CNC machined adapter for Glock Gen 4 pistols allows you to use standard single stage guide rod assemblies. Drop in adapter is inserted into the slide and adapter end ring to standard diameter. It can be used with both captured and non captured guide rod systems. Not for use in sub compact pistols. Made in America with a 100% Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Bi3a1-nkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00838YDS6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 10.0}}
{"item_id": "B0083D1WVM", "title": "Brass Stacker Drop in Guide Rod Assembly for Glock 20 20SF 21 21SF", "description": "Brass Stacker - Solid stainless steel captured recoil guide rod assembly for Glock 20 20SF 21 21SF. Quality aftermarket CNC machined single stage replacement for Glock generation 1, 2 and 3 pistols. If you have a Glock Gen 4 pistol you will also need the \"http://brassstacker.com/Guide-Rod-Adapter-for-Glock-Gen-4.html\" GG4A guide rod adapter. The completely assembled drop in unit includes a heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved premium flat wire spring with a modified button head cap screw and black nylon washer. Black screws are hardened alloy steel and polished screws are stainless steel. The Brass Stacker guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the ISMI recoil spring has a one year replacement warranty. Both are made in America. \"Factory\" Spring Weight is 17 lbs. Free domestic shipping.", "text": "Brass Stacker Drop in Guide Rod Assembly for Glock 20 20SF 21 21SF Brass Stacker - Solid stainless steel captured recoil guide rod assembly for Glock 20 20SF 21 21SF. Quality aftermarket CNC machined single stage replacement for Glock generation 1, 2 and 3 pistols. If you have a Glock Gen 4 pistol you will also need the \"http://brassstacker.com/Guide-Rod-Adapter-for-Glock-Gen-4.html\" GG4A guide rod adapter. The completely assembled drop in unit includes a heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved premium flat wire spring with a modified button head cap screw and black nylon washer. Black screws are hardened alloy steel and polished screws are stainless steel. The Brass Stacker guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the ISMI recoil spring has a one year replacement warranty. Both are made in America. \"Factory\" Spring Weight is 17 lbs. Free domestic shipping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31p5uIMzfoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083D1WVM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0083D1X20", "title": "Brass Stacker Drop In Guide Rod Assembly for Glock 17 17L 22 24 31 34 35 37", "description": "Brass Stacker - Solid stainless steel captured recoil guide rod assembly for Glock 17 17L 22 24 31 34 35 37. Quality aftermarket CNC machined single stage replacement for Glock generation 1, 2 and 3 pistols. If you have a Glock Gen 4 pistol you will also need the Brass Stacker Gen 4 GG4A guide rod adapter. The completely assembled drop in unit includes a heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved premium flat wire spring with a modified button head cap screw and black nylon washer. Black screws are hardened alloy steel and polished screws are stainless steel. The Brass Stacker guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the ISMI recoil spring has a one year replacement warranty. Both are made in America. \"Factory\" Spring Weight is 17 lbs. Free domestic shipping.", "text": "Brass Stacker Drop In Guide Rod Assembly for Glock 17 17L 22 24 31 34 35 37 Brass Stacker - Solid stainless steel captured recoil guide rod assembly for Glock 17 17L 22 24 31 34 35 37. Quality aftermarket CNC machined single stage replacement for Glock generation 1, 2 and 3 pistols. If you have a Glock Gen 4 pistol you will also need the Brass Stacker Gen 4 GG4A guide rod adapter. The completely assembled drop in unit includes a heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved premium flat wire spring with a modified button head cap screw and black nylon washer. Black screws are hardened alloy steel and polished screws are stainless steel. The Brass Stacker guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the ISMI recoil spring has a one year replacement warranty. Both are made in America. \"Factory\" Spring Weight is 17 lbs. Free domestic shipping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31b7YelciBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083D1X20.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0083D1XNE", "title": "Brass Stacker Crown Series Recoil Spring Assembly for Glock Sub Compact G26 G27 G33 or G39 pistols", "description": "Brass Stacker Crown Series - Solid stainless steel drop-in captured guide rod RSA (recoil spring assembly) for Glock G26, G27, G33 or G39. Quality CNC machined dual stage replacement for ALL generation Glock Sub Compact pistols including GEN 4. Guide rod end is crowned producing a sleek distinctive look. The completely assembled drop in unit includes heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved premium round wire springs. Black exposed face rod ends are black oxide plated alloy steel and stainless exposed face rod ends are stainless steel. The Brass Stacker guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the ISMI recoil springs have a one year replacement warranty. Both are Made in America. Recoil spring weight is factory 16lbs. Free domestic shipping.", "text": "Brass Stacker Crown Series Recoil Spring Assembly for Glock Sub Compact G26 G27 G33 or G39 pistols Brass Stacker Crown Series - Solid stainless steel drop-in captured guide rod RSA (recoil spring assembly) for Glock G26, G27, G33 or G39. Quality CNC machined dual stage replacement for ALL generation Glock Sub Compact pistols including GEN 4. Guide rod end is crowned producing a sleek distinctive look. The completely assembled drop in unit includes heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved premium round wire springs. Black exposed face rod ends are black oxide plated alloy steel and stainless exposed face rod ends are stainless steel. The Brass Stacker guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the ISMI recoil springs have a one year replacement warranty. Both are Made in America. Recoil spring weight is factory 16lbs. Free domestic shipping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MVUoHez6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083D1XNE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 43.0}}
{"item_id": "B0083D1Y7Y", "title": "Brass Stacker Crown Series Recoil Spring Assembly for Glock Sub Compact G29 G29SF G30 G30SF G30S or G36 pistols", "description": "Brass Stacker Crown Series - Solid stainless steel drop-in captured guide rod RSA (recoil spring assembly) for Glock G29, G29SF, G30, G30SF, G30S or G36. Quality CNC machined dual stage replacement for ALL generation Glock Sub Compact pistols including GEN 4. Guide rod end is crowned producing a sleek distinctive look. The completely assembled drop in unit includes heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved premium round wire springs. Black exposed face rod ends are black oxide plated alloy steel and stainless exposed face rod ends are stainless steel. The Brass Stacker guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the ISMI recoil springs have a one year replacement warranty. Both are Made in America. Recoil spring weight is factory 17lbs. Free domestic shipping.", "text": "Brass Stacker Crown Series Recoil Spring Assembly for Glock Sub Compact G29 G29SF G30 G30SF G30S or G36 pistols Brass Stacker Crown Series - Solid stainless steel drop-in captured guide rod RSA (recoil spring assembly) for Glock G29, G29SF, G30, G30SF, G30S or G36. Quality CNC machined dual stage replacement for ALL generation Glock Sub Compact pistols including GEN 4. Guide rod end is crowned producing a sleek distinctive look. The completely assembled drop in unit includes heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved premium round wire springs. Black exposed face rod ends are black oxide plated alloy steel and stainless exposed face rod ends are stainless steel. The Brass Stacker guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the ISMI recoil springs have a one year replacement warranty. Both are Made in America. Recoil spring weight is factory 17lbs. Free domestic shipping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MVUoHez6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083D1Y7Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brass Stacker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 42.0}}
{"item_id": "B0083D1YLA", "title": "Brass Stacker Drop in Guide Rod Assembly for Glock 19 23 25 32 38", "description": "Brass Stacker - Solid stainless steel captured recoil guide rod assembly for Glock 19 23 25 32 38. Quality aftermarket CNC machined single stage replacement for Glock generation 1, 2 and 3 pistols. If you have a Glock Gen 4 pistol you will also need the Brass Stacker Gen 4 GG4A guide rod adapter. The completely assembled drop in unit includes a heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved premium flat wire spring with a modified button head cap screw and black nylon washer. Black screws are hardened alloy steel and polished screws are stainless steel. The Brass Stacker guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the ISMI recoil spring has a one year replacement warranty. Both are made in America. \"Factory\" Spring Weight is 18 lbs. Free domestic shipping.", "text": "Brass Stacker Drop in Guide Rod Assembly for Glock 19 23 25 32 38 Brass Stacker - Solid stainless steel captured recoil guide rod assembly for Glock 19 23 25 32 38. Quality aftermarket CNC machined single stage replacement for Glock generation 1, 2 and 3 pistols. If you have a Glock Gen 4 pistol you will also need the Brass Stacker Gen 4 GG4A guide rod adapter. The completely assembled drop in unit includes a heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved premium flat wire spring with a modified button head cap screw and black nylon washer. Black screws are hardened alloy steel and polished screws are stainless steel. The Brass Stacker guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the ISMI recoil spring has a one year replacement warranty. Both are made in America. \"Factory\" Spring Weight is 18 lbs. Free domestic shipping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31p5uIMzfoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083D1YLA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
