{"item_id": "B0083F0JKA", "title": "Sport Cap 3.0", "description": "Updated and improved, the Sport Cap 3.0 from Klean Kanteen is the perfect upgrade to make your Kanteen even easier to use! For your drinking enjoyment, the valve is now \"chirp\" and \"whistle\" free and delivers a higher flow rate than the previous model. Still BPA free and dishwasher safe, the Sport Cap 3.0 is safe to use and easy to clean. It also still sports an easy loop attachment to make your Kanteen easily transportable. PRODUCT FEATURES: Soft silicone spout delivers 25% higher flow rate Relief valve is \"chirp\" and \"whistle\" free Quick attachment loop Cap is leak resistant No BPA, phthalates, lead or other toxins Interchangeable with all Kanteen Classic sizes Dishwasher safe Weight: 1.5 ounces Size: 2.875\" H x 2.5\" W BPA-free polypropylene (pp#5) Silicone spout and relief valve Cap is NOT leakproof KCPPS-BK , Klean Kanteen Sport Cap 3.0 , water bottles , kleen kanteen , klean kantean , clean canteen , cleen canteen , clean cantean , sport cap , 3.0 sport cap , sport cap klean kanteen , sport cap 3.0 klean kanteen , clean canteen sport cap , sport kap , water bottles , water bottle lid , water bottle cap , water bottle top , hydration bottle , stainless steel bottle , BPA free , ss water bottle , canteen , backpacking , camping , hiking , drinking", "text": "Sport Cap 3.0 Updated and improved, the Sport Cap 3.0 from Klean Kanteen is the perfect upgrade to make your Kanteen even easier to use! For your drinking enjoyment, the valve is now \"chirp\" and \"whistle\" free and delivers a higher flow rate than the previous model. Still BPA free and dishwasher safe, the Sport Cap 3.0 is safe to use and easy to clean. It also still sports an easy loop attachment to make your Kanteen easily transportable. PRODUCT FEATURES: Soft silicone spout delivers 25% higher flow rate Relief valve is \"chirp\" and \"whistle\" free Quick attachment loop Cap is leak resistant No BPA, phthalates, lead or other toxins Interchangeable with all Kanteen Classic sizes Dishwasher safe Weight: 1.5 ounces Size: 2.875\" H x 2.5\" W BPA-free polypropylene (pp#5) Silicone spout and relief valve Cap is NOT leakproof KCPPS-BK , Klean Kanteen Sport Cap 3.0 , water bottles , kleen kanteen , klean kantean , clean canteen , cleen canteen , clean cantean , sport cap , 3.0 sport cap , sport cap klean kanteen , sport cap 3.0 klean kanteen , clean canteen sport cap , sport kap , water bottles , water bottle lid , water bottle cap , water bottle top , hydration bottle , stainless steel bottle , BPA free , ss water bottle , canteen , backpacking , camping , hiking , drinking", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31otmL6SxAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083F0JKA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottle Accessories"]], "price": 7.97}}
{"item_id": "B0083F0RKM", "title": "Kleen Kanteen All Stainless Loop Cap", "description": "Kleen Kanteen's All Stainless Loop Cap transforms any Klean Kanteen Classic bottle into a 100% stainless water bottle. The handy attachment loop was designed with athletes and multi-taskers in mind and makes it easy to clip your Klean Kanteen onto your backpack, climbing harness, messenger bag or any other place you need quick easy access to your drink. Dishwasher safe.Cap is leakproof.Made of 18/8, food-grade stainless steel.Size: 2.75\" H x 2\" W.Weight: 1.875 oz.", "text": "Kleen Kanteen All Stainless Loop Cap Kleen Kanteen's All Stainless Loop Cap transforms any Klean Kanteen Classic bottle into a 100% stainless water bottle. The handy attachment loop was designed with athletes and multi-taskers in mind and makes it easy to clip your Klean Kanteen onto your backpack, climbing harness, messenger bag or any other place you need quick easy access to your drink. Dishwasher safe.Cap is leakproof.Made of 18/8, food-grade stainless steel.Size: 2.75\" H x 2\" W.Weight: 1.875 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31OA%2B8kPFcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083F0RKM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottle Accessories"]], "price": 9.66}}
{"item_id": "B0083F0TQ4", "title": "Klean Kanteen Kids 3.0 Sport Cap (Green)", "description": "The Kid Kanteen new Sport Cap 3.0 features a 25-Percent higher flow rate and is leak free", "text": "Klean Kanteen Kids 3.0 Sport Cap (Green) The Kid Kanteen new Sport Cap 3.0 features a 25-Percent higher flow rate and is leak free", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZMg0zG1qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083F0TQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 6.5}}
{"item_id": "B0083G0NB4", "title": "Cobrabraid USA 550 Paracord Survival Adjustable Belt", "description": "550 paracord bracelets were born from the deserts of Iraq and originally brought to the U.S. by our soldiers. Cobrabraid 550 Paracord Gear utilizes paracord produced in the USA by a government contractor. Our paracord has 7 inner woven strands surrounded by a tightly woven sheath and exceeds all standards, with a break strength of 550+ pounds. Paracord is the ultimate survival tool. It can be used as a tie down, tourniquet, animal snare, boot lace, clothes line, fishing line and hundreds of other things Depending on the item, our products contain 4 feet to 100 feet of paracord. If you are found in an emergency situation where you need paracord, simply unwind your Cobrabraid gear", "text": "Cobrabraid USA 550 Paracord Survival Adjustable Belt 550 paracord bracelets were born from the deserts of Iraq and originally brought to the U.S. by our soldiers. Cobrabraid 550 Paracord Gear utilizes paracord produced in the USA by a government contractor. Our paracord has 7 inner woven strands surrounded by a tightly woven sheath and exceeds all standards, with a break strength of 550+ pounds. Paracord is the ultimate survival tool. It can be used as a tie down, tourniquet, animal snare, boot lace, clothes line, fishing line and hundreds of other things Depending on the item, our products contain 4 feet to 100 feet of paracord. If you are found in an emergency situation where you need paracord, simply unwind your Cobrabraid gear", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wja6NAe5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083G0NB4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Wristbands"]], "price": 30.9}}
