{"item_id": "B0083JHEG8", "title": "Aosom Wanderer Bicycle Bike Cargo / Luggage Trailer - Black Black", "description": "Our popular Wanderer model of cargo trailer attaches to any bicycle and has plenty of space for groceries and running routine errands. It's sturdy steel frames make this cart exceptionally durable and can hold up to110lb! Easy assembly and fold down. (1) Aosom type 'B' bicycle hitch included.", "text": "Aosom Wanderer Bicycle Bike Cargo / Luggage Trailer - Black Black Our popular Wanderer model of cargo trailer attaches to any bicycle and has plenty of space for groceries and running routine errands. It's sturdy steel frames make this cart exceptionally durable and can hold up to110lb! Easy assembly and fold down. (1) Aosom type 'B' bicycle hitch included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61Ry4MMmB5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083JHEG8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Child Seats & Cargo Trailers", "Trailers", "Cargo Trailers"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B0083JHMC4", "title": "WCI Quality Bicycle Computer With Speed, Distance And Time Readings Display - Monitors Biking Exercise And Training Data", "description": "Introducing The New Cyclo Computer From WCI, Designed To Provide Clear And Accurate Data Which Is Vital To Your Biking And Training Success. Simply Install The Mini Computer On Your Handlebar Or Other Spot On The Bike, And Track Your Progress In Real Time. Easy, User Friendly And Affordable.", "text": "WCI Quality Bicycle Computer With Speed, Distance And Time Readings Display - Monitors Biking Exercise And Training Data Introducing The New Cyclo Computer From WCI, Designed To Provide Clear And Accurate Data Which Is Vital To Your Biking And Training Success. Simply Install The Mini Computer On Your Handlebar Or Other Spot On The Bike, And Track Your Progress In Real Time. Easy, User Friendly And Affordable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415cRLKpj5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083JHMC4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B0083O3UPC", "title": "Crosman DES22 .22Cal Destroyer", "description": ".22 caliber 14.3 grains Pointed expanding 175ct Expanding pointed pellets have a special head that allows additional expansion over traditional pointed or hollowpoint pellets. Increased expansion is a benefit for hunters since it delivers a wider wound channel, resulting in a more profound hit.", "text": "Crosman DES22 .22Cal Destroyer .22 caliber 14.3 grains Pointed expanding 175ct Expanding pointed pellets have a special head that allows additional expansion over traditional pointed or hollowpoint pellets. Increased expansion is a benefit for hunters since it delivers a wider wound channel, resulting in a more profound hit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4118So4rqoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083O3UPC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B0083OC7VA", "title": "Blackhawk Sportster Bipod Picatinny Firearm Rail Adaptor", "description": "Mount your favorite bipod to any MIL STD 1913 Picatinny rail with this Sportster Bipod Picatinny Rail Adapter. This rail adapter provides a solid platform for mounting a bipod to any firearm with a Picatinny rail. It provides maximum versatility for bipod placement options.", "text": "Blackhawk Sportster Bipod Picatinny Firearm Rail Adaptor Mount your favorite bipod to any MIL STD 1913 Picatinny rail with this Sportster Bipod Picatinny Rail Adapter. This rail adapter provides a solid platform for mounting a bipod to any firearm with a Picatinny rail. It provides maximum versatility for bipod placement options.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tSgLnIGEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083OC7VA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 14.17}}
{"item_id": "B0083OHL7U", "title": "ProMag Archangel Ruger 10/22 Picatinny Rail Scope Mount, Black", "description": "The ARCHANGEL 10/22 Picatinny rail mounts to the factory tapped holes on a Ruger 10/22 rifle receiver. It accepts both Picatinny and Weaver style scope rings, as well as red dot and holographic optical sights designed for Picatinny rails. The mount is constructed of an aircraft grade aluminum alloy and has a black hard anodized finish.", "text": "ProMag Archangel Ruger 10/22 Picatinny Rail Scope Mount, Black The ARCHANGEL 10/22 Picatinny rail mounts to the factory tapped holes on a Ruger 10/22 rifle receiver. It accepts both Picatinny and Weaver style scope rings, as well as red dot and holographic optical sights designed for Picatinny rails. The mount is constructed of an aircraft grade aluminum alloy and has a black hard anodized finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bSQ1mrokL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083OHL7U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 21.59}}
{"item_id": "B0083OHTG8", "title": "Bulldog Cases Extreme Large Modular Molle Assault Pack, Black, 20 x 19 x 12-Inch", "description": "Extreme Large Modular MOLLE Assault Pack - Black (20\" x 19\" x 12\") Large load cargo capacity compartment with separate pocket to fit up to two 3L hydration bladders Body contoured shoulder straps with D-Rings for equipment attachment Sternum strap and waist belt External side compression straps Heavy-Duty carry and drag handle Two double zipper pulls on the main compartment for easy access Individual foam padded back panel for extra comfort and maximum airflow Grommets on all compartments for drainage Total of seven compartments: Main Compartment with gear straps to secure gears and two extra mesh pockets Second Compartment contains three map/document pockets, two radio pockets and penholders Two large pockets on the back, bottom pocket (12.5\" x 6\" x 3\") with three elastic closure mash pocket and a zipper mash pocket Two side pockets (9\" x 5\" x 2.5\") one on each side One Compartment for hydration systems.", "text": "Bulldog Cases Extreme Large Modular Molle Assault Pack, Black, 20 x 19 x 12-Inch Extreme Large Modular MOLLE Assault Pack - Black (20\" x 19\" x 12\") Large load cargo capacity compartment with separate pocket to fit up to two 3L hydration bladders Body contoured shoulder straps with D-Rings for equipment attachment Sternum strap and waist belt External side compression straps Heavy-Duty carry and drag handle Two double zipper pulls on the main compartment for easy access Individual foam padded back panel for extra comfort and maximum airflow Grommets on all compartments for drainage Total of seven compartments: Main Compartment with gear straps to secure gears and two extra mesh pockets Second Compartment contains three map/document pockets, two radio pockets and penholders Two large pockets on the back, bottom pocket (12.5\" x 6\" x 3\") with three elastic closure mash pocket and a zipper mash pocket Two side pockets (9\" x 5\" x 2.5\") one on each side One Compartment for hydration systems.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kiauL8QSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083OHTG8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 65.94}}
{"item_id": "B0083TXHEQ", "title": "Pro Carry Belt Ride Ranch Series© Taurus Judge Public Defender Polymer - Right Hand - Black", "description": "The Pro Carry Ranch Series is a High Ride, Belt Slide, outside the waistband holster for concealed or open carry. The Ranch Series can be worn strong side carry, cross draw or small of the back. Right handed shooters wishing to wear this holster S.O.B. will require the Left Hand Option. The Pro Carry Ranch Series is made with an open belt slot on one end and a Belt slide Faub in the center of the holster, giving the user two points of belt security for a tight and secure fit. The pro Carry Ranch Series is a high ride, close fitting holster, designed to carry the weapon close to the users body thus preventing the holster from leaning out with the weight of the gun like so many holsters of this design are known to do. We use the same Bonded Polyester thread we use in all of our quality gun leather products and the heaviest Top Grain American cowhide any maker of this style of holster uses. The Ranch Series is a molded holster. Our exclusive molding process insures a perfect fit every time by actually duplicating the fine details of each handgun the holster is custom made to fit. The retention provided is more akin to that of a thumbreak than it is to an open top design. Do to its small footprint and overall compact design, the Ranch Series easilly conceals under a light jacket or untucked shirt and allows its user fast and efficient access to their handgun. This Holster will handle up to a 1 and 3/4 inch gunbelt and works well with a light 1 Inch dress belt also.", "text": "Pro Carry Belt Ride Ranch Series© Taurus Judge Public Defender Polymer - Right Hand - Black The Pro Carry Ranch Series is a High Ride, Belt Slide, outside the waistband holster for concealed or open carry. The Ranch Series can be worn strong side carry, cross draw or small of the back. Right handed shooters wishing to wear this holster S.O.B. will require the Left Hand Option. The Pro Carry Ranch Series is made with an open belt slot on one end and a Belt slide Faub in the center of the holster, giving the user two points of belt security for a tight and secure fit. The pro Carry Ranch Series is a high ride, close fitting holster, designed to carry the weapon close to the users body thus preventing the holster from leaning out with the weight of the gun like so many holsters of this design are known to do. We use the same Bonded Polyester thread we use in all of our quality gun leather products and the heaviest Top Grain American cowhide any maker of this style of holster uses. The Ranch Series is a molded holster. Our exclusive molding process insures a perfect fit every time by actually duplicating the fine details of each handgun the holster is custom made to fit. The retention provided is more akin to that of a thumbreak than it is to an open top design. Do to its small footprint and overall compact design, the Ranch Series easilly conceals under a light jacket or untucked shirt and allows its user fast and efficient access to their handgun. This Holster will handle up to a 1 and 3/4 inch gunbelt and works well with a light 1 Inch dress belt also.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4127oH04EaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083TXHEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 59.95}}
