uire the Left Hand Option. The Pro Carry Ranch Series is made with an open belt slot on one end and a Belt slide Faub in the center of the holster, giving the user two points of belt security for a tight and secure fit. The pro Carry Ranch Series is a high ride, close fitting holster, designed to carry the weapon close to the users body thus preventing the holster from leaning out with the weight of the gun like so many holsters of this design are known to do. We use the same Bonded Polyester thread we use in all of our quality gun leather products and the heaviest Top Grain American cowhide any maker of this style of holster uses. The Ranch Series is a molded holster. Our exclusive molding process insures a perfect fit every time by actually duplicating the fine details of each handgun the holster is custom made to fit. The retention provided is more akin to that of a thumbreak than it is to an open top design. Do to its small footprint and overall compact design, the Ranch Series easilly conceals under a light jacket or untucked shirt and allows its user fast and efficient access to their handgun. This Holster will handle up to a 1 and 3/4 inch gunbelt and works well with a light 1 Inch dress belt also.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Z5127oy9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083U3E0W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B0083UUTIM", "title": "Ar15 M4 Front Sight Tool", "description": "AR15 FRONT SIGHT TOOL Made of Steel double ended 4 and 5 prong front sight postsA1 and A2 front sight posts fits ALL front sight posts makes and models", "text": "Ar15 M4 Front Sight Tool AR15 FRONT SIGHT TOOL Made of Steel double ended 4 and 5 prong front sight postsA1 and A2 front sight posts fits ALL front sight posts makes and models", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21rO5inX%2BKL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083UUTIM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Veriforce Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 14.98}}
{"item_id": "B0083UUZHM", "title": "AR15 Armorers Wrench by Guntec USA", "description": "AR15 ARMORERS WRENCH Specially designed for all your need in taking apart your M4, AR-15, M16 Made by Guntec USA Patent # D548,552 Made of Heat treated steel Take off barrel, stocks (collapsible and fixed), muzzle brakes, flash hiders, and free floating handguardsDO NOT BE FOOLED, this is the only heat treated wrench. BEWARE of Chinese knockoffs, they are not heat treated and are powder coated Lifetime guarantee", "text": "AR15 Armorers Wrench by Guntec USA AR15 ARMORERS WRENCH Specially designed for all your need in taking apart your M4, AR-15, M16 Made by Guntec USA Patent # D548,552 Made of Heat treated steel Take off barrel, stocks (collapsible and fixed), muzzle brakes, flash hiders, and free floating handguardsDO NOT BE FOOLED, this is the only heat treated wrench. BEWARE of Chinese knockoffs, they are not heat treated and are powder coated Lifetime guarantee", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21o7uvqWAjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083UUZHM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Guntec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 32.95}}
{"item_id": "B0083VOIDS", "title": "550 Paracord Kit - Five Colors (Olive Drab, ACU, Woodland Camo, Desert Camo, & Black) 100 Feet Total w/10 3/8\" Black Side Release Buckles", "description": "20 feet of Digital ACU, Woodland Camo (BDU), Olive Drab, Black, and Desert Camo. 10 - 3/8\" Black Side Release Buckles.", "text": "550 Paracord Kit - Five Colors (Olive Drab, ACU, Woodland Camo, Desert Camo, & Black) 100 Feet Total w/10 3/8\" Black Side Release Buckles 20 feet of Digital ACU, Woodland Camo (BDU), Olive Drab, Black, and Desert Camo. 10 - 3/8\" Black Side Release Buckles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Gj3tbs-0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083VOIDS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Para-Cord", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 13.17}}
{"item_id": "B0083WGFEW", "title": "The Shave Well Company Unbreakable Camping Mirror", "description": "Camping mirrors...Most camping mirrors have sharp edges, are easily broken, or are not clear enough to see yourself. But not The Shave Well Company Camping Mirror. No sir (or ma'am), our mirror stands out through its crystal clear reflection, smooth, polished edges and superior durabilitySo, 7 years good luck?Yes, the Shave Well camping mirror was designed to stand up to camping and backpacking's roughest challenges. The mirror is virtually unbreakable, which will allow it to survive your journey unscathed! We are so confident that you can't/won't break it that we will replace it if you are ableSize Matters...We wanted this mirror to be large enough to signal a plane, but small enough to fit anywhere in your camping gear. So we did! The mirror measures 6\" x 4\" x 1/8\"Hold it or Hang itDue to its size, many campers like to hold the mirror in their hand while doing life's personal tasks. If you're fond of a hanging mirror, we've included a chain to hang it on a tent, tree, etc. So feel free to leave the nails at homeLipstick campers and hikers rejoice!Having a mirror to help wash your face, take off make up, or put on sun screen can prove most helpful. With a quality reflection in a durable, unbreakable mirror, even a lipstick camper will enjoy having this mirror in their packHow is the Shave Well mirror truly fog free?In a hot shower, the Shave Well camping mirror is fog free simply by design! In the few seconds you hold it under the shower spray the temperature of the moist air and the mirror equalize to create a long lasting, truly fog free image for the duration of your shower. No more temperature difference - no more fog", "text": "The Shave Well Company Unbreakable Camping Mirror Camping mirrors...Most camping mirrors have sharp edges, are easily broken, or are not clear enough to see yourself. But not The Shave Well Company Camping Mirror. No sir (or ma'am), our mirror stands out through its crystal clear reflection, smooth, polished edges and superior durabilitySo, 7 years good luck?Yes, the Shave Well camping mirror was designed to stand up to camping and backpacking's roughest challenges. The mirror is virtually unbreakable, which will allow it to survive your journey unscathed! We are so confident that you can't/won't break it that we will replace it if you are ableSize Matters...We wanted this mirror to be large enough to signal a plane, but small enough to fit anywhere in your camping gear. So we did! The mirror measures 6\" x 4\" x 1/8\"Hold it or Hang itDue to its size, many campers like to hold the mirror in their hand while doing life's personal tasks. If you're fond of a hanging mirror, we've included a chain to hang it on a tent, tree, etc. So feel free to leave the nails at homeLipstick campers and hikers rejoice!Having a mirror to help wash your face, take off make up, or put on sun screen can prove most helpful. With a quality reflection in a durable, unbreakable mirror, even a lipstick camper will enjoy having this mirror in their packHow is the Shave Well mirror truly fog free?In a hot shower, the Shave Well camping mirror is fog free simply by design! In the few seconds you hold it under the shower spray the temperature of the moist air and the mirror equalize to create a long lasting, truly fog free image for the duration of your shower. No more temperature difference - no more fog", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SU1USk8xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0083WGFEW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 8.99}}
