{"item_id": "B0084MMDRY", "title": "Extreme ZAP Light 1 Million Volt Rechargeable Stun Gun & Flashlight w/ Holster - 2 YEAR WARRANTY", "description": "TheZAPLight Extremehas 6 ultra-sharp penetrating spike electrodes emit 1,000,000 volts of power.Rechargeablevia included wall and car chargers.With 1 million volts of tooth-jarring power, theZAPLight Extremeis one of the strongest stun guns on the market.TheZAPLight Extremefeatures a safety switch with on/off LED indicator.TheZAPLight Extremeis rechargeable and never needs batteries. A full charge will power the flashlight for over 5 continuous hours. Includes recharging cord that plugs into standard wall outlet and high quality nylon carrying case with belt clip.This product is sold as new in retail packaging. products weighs 8.5 oz & Measures 6.25\" tall x 1.5\" wide - Includes carry case & 2 Year Warranty *Restricted States & Cities: HI,IL,MA,MI,NJ,NY,RI,WI, Annapolis,MD / Baltimore,MD / Baltimore County,MD / District of Columbia / Philadelphia,PA.", "text": "Extreme ZAP Light 1 Million Volt Rechargeable Stun Gun & Flashlight w/ Holster - 2 YEAR WARRANTY TheZAPLight Extremehas 6 ultra-sharp penetrating spike electrodes emit 1,000,000 volts of power.Rechargeablevia included wall and car chargers.With 1 million volts of tooth-jarring power, theZAPLight Extremeis one of the strongest stun guns on the market.TheZAPLight Extremefeatures a safety switch with on/off LED indicator.TheZAPLight Extremeis rechargeable and never needs batteries. A full charge will power the flashlight for over 5 continuous hours. Includes recharging cord that plugs into standard wall outlet and high quality nylon carrying case with belt clip.This product is sold as new in retail packaging. products weighs 8.5 oz & Measures 6.25\" tall x 1.5\" wide - Includes carry case & 2 Year Warranty *Restricted States & Cities: HI,IL,MA,MI,NJ,NY,RI,WI, Annapolis,MD / Baltimore,MD / Baltimore County,MD / District of Columbia / Philadelphia,PA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lspWwSbPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0084MMDRY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zap", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 59.49}}
{"item_id": "B0084NREKE", "title": "Do-All Outdoors Pigeon Perch shoot and Bust Clay Target Holder", "description": "Pigeon Perch Clay Target Specifications: - Self healing material - Holder re-seals when bullet passes through - Long life technology won't crack or break - All Caliber Pistols - All Caliber Rifles - Pellet/BB Guns* - Archery - Engineered for soft nosed 38-44 caliber pistol or rifle shooters - Each target spins and locks in upright position as a bullet strikes - Shooting center reset targets swings the targets back into lower position - Stabilizing ground spikes & forward leaning for downward bullet deflection increase safety - High visibility targets.", "text": "Do-All Outdoors Pigeon Perch shoot and Bust Clay Target Holder Pigeon Perch Clay Target Specifications: - Self healing material - Holder re-seals when bullet passes through - Long life technology won't crack or break - All Caliber Pistols - All Caliber Rifles - Pellet/BB Guns* - Archery - Engineered for soft nosed 38-44 caliber pistol or rifle shooters - Each target spins and locks in upright position as a bullet strikes - Shooting center reset targets swings the targets back into lower position - Stabilizing ground spikes & forward leaning for downward bullet deflection increase safety - High visibility targets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cW40JI5nL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0084NREKE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Do-All Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 21.43}}
{"item_id": "B0084O87OA", "title": "Universal IWB & SOB Concealed Carry Clip Pistol Holster for Medium & Large Frame Semi-autos. Fits Sig Sauer, Colt 1911, Beretta 92F, Ruger, Glock and S&W", "description": "This is a universal inside the waist band holster designed to fit most popular medium and large frame semi-autos. The holster holds your weapon very securely, yet you can draw it in a flash.This a favorite holster for shooters who have several different sidearms.This is an ideal holster for anyone who owns different firearms or when you need to load up quick --Just clip it on and go.You can even clip it to the side pocket of your car, so when you get into the car, take your pistol out of your regular and slide it in the side pocket holster for easy access.And, Ladies can use it to convert a handbag into a concealed carry hand bag. Just clip the holster to an inside panel in the bag and you are good to go.Cebeci holsters are all formed and sewn by hand - not mass produced. They are only distributed to small independent stores --you won't find them in the big super store chains.", "text": "Universal IWB & SOB Concealed Carry Clip Pistol Holster for Medium & Large Frame Semi-autos. Fits Sig Sauer, Colt 1911, Beretta 92F, Ruger, Glock and S&W This is a universal inside the waist band holster designed to fit most popular medium and large frame semi-autos. The holster holds your weapon very securely, yet you can draw it in a flash.This a favorite holster for shooters who have several different sidearms.This is an ideal holster for anyone who owns different firearms or when you need to load up quick --Just clip it on and go.You can even clip it to the side pocket of your car, so when you get into the car, take your pistol out of your regular and slide it in the side pocket holster for easy access.And, Ladies can use it to convert a handbag into a concealed carry hand bag. Just clip the holster to an inside panel in the bag and you are good to go.Cebeci holsters are all formed and sewn by hand - not mass produced. They are only distributed to small independent stores --you won't find them in the big super store chains.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ha5ioclZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0084O87OA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cebeci Arms", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 17.95}}
