{"item_id": "B0084X9F6A", "title": "CVLIFE Red Dot Laser Sight Outside Adjust Rifle Gun Scope 2 Switch Rail Mounts Box Set", "description": "output power: 5mWwavelength: 630-680nmsize: approx. 25.6 mm in barrel diameter, 115 mm longcolor: blackcompact sizewindage and elevation adjustmentadjusted by switching the 2 knobs (remove head cover & adjust the knobs with allen wrench)high grade alumium constructionincludes remote pressure switch and cap switchoperated by 1 x CR123A battery (INCLUDED)weaver mount:20mm Weaver mount suitable for Weaver 20mm Railfits most weaver/RIS/picatinny railsWith \"8\" figured mount for Laser 1\"(25.4mm) and Scope 1\"(25.4mm)", "text": "CVLIFE Red Dot Laser Sight Outside Adjust Rifle Gun Scope 2 Switch Rail Mounts Box Set output power: 5mWwavelength: 630-680nmsize: approx. 25.6 mm in barrel diameter, 115 mm longcolor: blackcompact sizewindage and elevation adjustmentadjusted by switching the 2 knobs (remove head cover & adjust the knobs with allen wrench)high grade alumium constructionincludes remote pressure switch and cap switchoperated by 1 x CR123A battery (INCLUDED)weaver mount:20mm Weaver mount suitable for Weaver 20mm Railfits most weaver/RIS/picatinny railsWith \"8\" figured mount for Laser 1\"(25.4mm) and Scope 1\"(25.4mm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ouhRE4nLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0084X9F6A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CVLIFE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B0084Y9N0M", "title": "ALPS OutdoorZ Matrix Hunting Pack", "description": "Finally, a pack that can comfortably carry a Crossbow, Compound Bow and Rifle! There is a unique fastening system that secures your weapon of choice to both sides of the pack, making this pack extremely versatile. The secret is that there are two padded straps at the top of the pack that start in the middle and wrap around the weapon, then fasten to each side. There are also two “Wing Pockets” on the front of the pack that will help secure and protect your weapon even more. If you do not wish to carry your weapon on the pack then the “Wing Pockets” work great to carry extra gear or strap down heavier loads. We even include two extension lashing straps for larger loads. At the bottom of the pack there is a drop down pocket that helps keep your weapon secure. Inside of the main compartment there is an organizational pocket to help keep some of your smaller gear organized. It has a padded waist belt with two pockets, one on each side. Also, it has a padded shoulder harness for a very comfortable carry. It has a center aluminium stay for added support when you are carrying heavier loads. Also included is a blaze orange rain cover in case you run into a rain shower or need extra orange in your attire. It has a hydration pocket and port. If you’re a hunter, this is the pack for you. It will make your hunts more enjoyable because your hands will be free to battle the terrain or to carry other gear if necessary.", "text": "ALPS OutdoorZ Matrix Hunting Pack Finally, a pack that can comfortably carry a Crossbow, Compound Bow and Rifle! There is a unique fastening system that secures your weapon of choice to both sides of the pack, making this pack extremely versatile. The secret is that there are two padded straps at the top of the pack that start in the middle and wrap around the weapon, then fasten to each side. There are also two “Wing Pockets” on the front of the pack that will help secure and protect your weapon even more. If you do not wish to carry your weapon on the pack then the “Wing Pockets” work great to carry extra gear or strap down heavier loads. We even include two extension lashing straps for larger loads. At the bottom of the pack there is a drop down pocket that helps keep your weapon secure. Inside of the main compartment there is an organizational pocket to help keep some of your smaller gear organized. It has a padded waist belt with two pockets, one on each side. Also, it has a padded shoulder harness for a very comfortable carry. It has a center aluminium stay for added support when you are carrying heavier loads. Also included is a blaze orange rain cover in case you run into a rain shower or need extra orange in your attire. It has a hydration pocket and port. If you’re a hunter, this is the pack for you. It will make your hunts more enjoyable because your hands will be free to battle the terrain or to carry other gear if necessary.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LLh-aWmBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0084Y9N0M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS OutdoorZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B0084ZIIFC", "title": "Cap Barbell Neoprene Dumbbell", "description": "CAP Barbell's neoprene dumbbells have comfortable contoured grips for easy handling. Ideal for toning and sculpting arms, shoulders and back. Hexogonal shape is designed to prevent rolling and easy storage. The neoprene coating helps protect your floor and equipment. Sold as each.", "text": "Cap Barbell Neoprene Dumbbell CAP Barbell's neoprene dumbbells have comfortable contoured grips for easy handling. Ideal for toning and sculpting arms, shoulders and back. Hexogonal shape is designed to prevent rolling and easy storage. The neoprene coating helps protect your floor and equipment. Sold as each.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sxep41x0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0084ZIIFC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00852684M", "title": "LED Flash Tyre Wheel Valve Cap Light for Car Bike bicycle Motorbicycle Wheel Light Tire Light BLUE-GREEN-COLORFUL (Pack of 6)", "description": "These LED Bike Wheel Lights fits most bicycles, motorcycles and cars.LED Bike Wheel Light features motion sensors, LEDs and replaceable batteries.LED lights will turn on when the vehicle is moving and off when the vehicle comes to a stop.Screws onto the valve stem of your car, bicycle or motorcycle in seconds.Enhances safety by increasing visibility at night and during bad weather conditions. Easy to install and remove.Cap Color: Silver. Light Color: Neon Green. Blue & Colorful.Batteries: 18 x AG10 batteries, 3 batteries per lightbatteries included.Package Includes: A total of 6 LED Bike Lights!2 x Green LED Bike Wheel Lights;2 x Blue LED Bike Light2 x Colorful LED Bike Light.6 x Valve Covers.", "text": "LED Flash Tyre Wheel Valve Cap Light for Car Bike bicycle Motorbicycle Wheel Light Tire Light BLUE-GREEN-COLORFUL (Pack of 6) These LED Bike Wheel Lights fits most bicycles, motorcycles and cars.LED Bike Wheel Light features motion sensors, LEDs and replaceable batteries.LED lights will turn on when the vehicle is moving and off when the vehicle comes to a stop.Screws onto the valve stem of your car, bicycle or motorcycle in seconds.Enhances safety by increasing visibility at night and during bad weather conditions. Easy to install and remove.Cap Color: Silver. Light Color: Neon Green. Blue & Colorful.Batteries: 18 x AG10 batteries, 3 batteries per lightbatteries included.Package Includes: A total of 6 LED Bike Lights!2 x Green LED Bike Wheel Lights;2 x Blue LED Bike Light2 x Colorful LED Bike Light.6 x Valve Covers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OTIOioCwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00852684M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B008535YYQ", "title": "U.S. Armed Forces Standard AR-15 AR15 and M-16 M16 Carry Handle Scope Mount", "description": "AR15 carry handle adapter is weaver style rail conversion for AR/M16 carry handle. Weight: 2.47 oz, length: 5.5 inch.", "text": "U.S. Armed Forces Standard AR-15 AR15 and M-16 M16 Carry Handle Scope Mount AR15 carry handle adapter is weaver style rail conversion for AR/M16 carry handle. Weight: 2.47 oz, length: 5.5 inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dmAXG6L%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008535YYQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DYZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 6.63}}
{"item_id": "B00856E1H4", "title": "Scorpion Armaments BS99 Crane SOPMOD Inspired Buttstock - Sold By 22mods4all", "description": "Inspired by the Military Crane SOPMOD (Special Operations Peculiar MODification).Scorpion ArmamentsTM BS99 features improved cheek weld for better shooting position. Watertight battery storage compartments. Padded buttplate reduces felt recoil and provides no-slip surface against web gear and body armor. For Mil-Spec carbine receiver extensions. This is for the Buttstock ONLY, does not include a receiver buffer tube.", "text": "Scorpion Armaments BS99 Crane SOPMOD Inspired Buttstock - Sold By 22mods4all Inspired by the Military Crane SOPMOD (Special Operations Peculiar MODification).Scorpion ArmamentsTM BS99 features improved cheek weld for better shooting position. Watertight battery storage compartments. Padded buttplate reduces felt recoil and provides no-slip surface against web gear and body armor. For Mil-Spec carbine receiver extensions. This is for the Buttstock ONLY, does not include a receiver buffer tube.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319vertVLxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00856E1H4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]]}}
