{"item_id": "B00858T8MU", "title": "Retrospec Bicycles Urban/Fixed Gear Saddle", "description": "This Retrospec Saddle is perfect for your road bike, fixed-gear, single-speed, urban commuter, mountain, or really any type of bike. It's available in Black, White, Green, Red, Yellow, Blue, Pink, or Orange. It feautures a classic road bike shape with just enough cushion for supreme comfort, yet stiffness to maximize performance.", "text": "Retrospec Bicycles Urban/Fixed Gear Saddle This Retrospec Saddle is perfect for your road bike, fixed-gear, single-speed, urban commuter, mountain, or really any type of bike. It's available in Black, White, Green, Red, Yellow, Blue, Pink, or Orange. It feautures a classic road bike shape with just enough cushion for supreme comfort, yet stiffness to maximize performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VOgSfIXeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00858T8MU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 16.0}}
{"item_id": "B00859N87U", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Army Classic Knife, 58mm, Pink", "description": "The Victorinox Swiss Army Classic SD is our best seller. The Classic is compact enough to fit in your pocket and, with its seven implements, is functional enough to save the day. The perfect sidekick. Available in several colors, you cant have just one.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Army Classic Knife, 58mm, Pink The Victorinox Swiss Army Classic SD is our best seller. The Classic is compact enough to fit in your pocket and, with its seven implements, is functional enough to save the day. The perfect sidekick. Available in several colors, you cant have just one.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NMhKtqr4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00859N87U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 14.3}}
{"item_id": "B0085A34EG", "title": "Gerber 31-001516 Bear Grylls Ultra Compact Fixed Blade Knife with Sheath", "description": "The reality is you’re unlikely to be wrestling an alligator or slicing open a camel carcass anytime soon—things Bear Grylls has taken on—but we designed the Bear Grylls Ultra Compact Fixed Blade for just such occasions, as well as to meet more utilitarian demands of the backcountry. Combining Gerber’s decades of experience crafting tools and Bear’s survival knowledge, this is a smaller size of Bear’s favorite fixed blade knife, with an added paracord lanyard. The Ultra Compact Fixed Blade Knife is lightweight and easy to handle, yet able to perform like a pro when called into action in the woods. At 3.25 inches with full tang construction, the fine edge blade is plenty long, and stout enough to slice into a carcass, should the need arise. Even better, it’s small enough to strap to a boot or hang around your neck for easy access. The handle’s ergonomic shape and rubber-molded grip feel natural and fit securely in your hand. The knife’s balanced feel is matched by a well-placed bolster and textured thumb rise on the spine, adding grip security when your task requires pulling and pushing actions. Like the knife it holds, the Ultra Compact’s sheath is slim and multi-functional. The molded nylon sheath locks the knife securely into place for safekeeping on and off trail. It’s designed for easy access in a range of carry executions; strap it to your belt, wear it around your neck or secure it to your pack. The clip is reversible, and accommodates either tip-up or tip-down placement, and is removable for a minimalist approach, or to customize the attachment with webbing or cord.", "text": "Gerber 31-001516 Bear Grylls Ultra Compact Fixed Blade Knife with Sheath The reality is you’re unlikely to be wrestling an alligator or slicing open a camel carcass anytime soon—things Bear Grylls has taken on—but we designed the Bear Grylls Ultra Compact Fixed Blade for just such occasions, as well as to meet more utilitarian demands of the backcountry. Combining Gerber’s decades of experience crafting tools and Bear’s survival knowledge, this is a smaller size of Bear’s favorite fixed blade knife, with an added paracord lanyard. The Ultra Compact Fixed Blade Knife is lightweight and easy to handle, yet able to perform like a pro when called into action in the woods. At 3.25 inches with full tang construction, the fine edge blade is plenty long, and stout enough to slice into a carcass, should the need arise. Even better, it’s small enough to strap to a boot or hang around your neck for easy access. The handle’s ergonomic shape and rubber-molded grip feel natural and fit securely in your hand. The knife’s balanced feel is matched by a well-placed bolster and textured thumb rise on the spine, adding grip security when your task requires pulling and pushing actions. Like the knife it holds, the Ultra Compact’s sheath is slim and multi-functional. The molded nylon sheath locks the knife securely into place for safekeeping on and off trail. It’s designed for easy access in a range of carry executions; strap it to your belt, wear it around your neck or secure it to your pack. The clip is reversible, and accommodates either tip-up or tip-down placement, and is removable for a minimalist approach, or to customize the attachment with webbing or cord.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HKpw2lAvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085A34EG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 28.6}}
{"item_id": "B0085ADWQQ", "title": "Bike Mechanic Adjustable Repair Stand - Bicycle Rack", "description": "The Mechanic Repair Stand features a rotating head and quick release clamp to hold virtually any bike. The quick release adjustable height allows for quick positioning to the ideal height. The tri leg design provides a stable work platform for bikes up to 50 lbs.FeaturesRotating head adjusts clamp to virtual any angleQuick release height adjustable from 40\" to 57\"Clamp allows for clamping of tubes from 30mm to 75mm3 Leg base provides superior stabilityFREE Tool Tray Included", "text": "Bike Mechanic Adjustable Repair Stand - Bicycle Rack The Mechanic Repair Stand features a rotating head and quick release clamp to hold virtually any bike. The quick release adjustable height allows for quick positioning to the ideal height. The tri leg design provides a stable work platform for bikes up to 50 lbs.FeaturesRotating head adjusts clamp to virtual any angleQuick release height adjustable from 40\" to 57\"Clamp allows for clamping of tubes from 30mm to 75mm3 Leg base provides superior stabilityFREE Tool Tray Included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318cW2tj-OL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085ADWQQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B0085ADXCO", "title": "Bicycle Floor Stand Bike Repair / Storage Stand", "description": "Tired of leaning your bike against a wall and scratching it? This stand provides and easy way to safely store your bike when not in use. You can even use it for quick adjustments.FeaturesProvides easy storage for bikes without a kickstandHolds rear wheel off the ground for easy derailleur adjustmentsSmall compact design fits just about anywhere", "text": "Bicycle Floor Stand Bike Repair / Storage Stand Tired of leaning your bike against a wall and scratching it? This stand provides and easy way to safely store your bike when not in use. You can even use it for quick adjustments.FeaturesProvides easy storage for bikes without a kickstandHolds rear wheel off the ground for easy derailleur adjustmentsSmall compact design fits just about anywhere", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/217BMt-7h4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085ADXCO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Indoor Bike Storage"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B0085ADXP6", "title": "Portable Home Bike Repair Stand Adjustable Height Bicycle Stand", "description": "This portable bike repair stand allows you to comfortably work on your bike. If you're short on garage space, it quickly folds for storage. The 360 degree roatating head and adjustable clamp allow you to work on virtually any bike.FeaturesRotating head adjusts clamp to any angleHeight adjustable from 45\" to 72\"Clamp allows for clamping of tubes from 30mm to 75mmFolding legs allow for easy transportationFREE To0l Tray Included", "text": "Portable Home Bike Repair Stand Adjustable Height Bicycle Stand This portable bike repair stand allows you to comfortably work on your bike. If you're short on garage space, it quickly folds for storage. The 360 degree roatating head and adjustable clamp allow you to work on virtually any bike.FeaturesRotating head adjusts clamp to any angleHeight adjustable from 45\" to 72\"Clamp allows for clamping of tubes from 30mm to 75mmFolding legs allow for easy transportationFREE To0l Tray Included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CrLd2OCdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085ADXP6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B0085AOZIK", "title": "Spalding NBA Slam Jam Over-The-Door Mini Basketball Hoop", "description": "A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "text": "Spalding NBA Slam Jam Over-The-Door Mini Basketball Hoop A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ex1YFLeiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085AOZIK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spalding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Court Equipment", "Basketball Hoops & Goals", "Wall-Mount"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B0085B15EQ", "title": "Shake Weight Pro", "description": "Shake Weight Pro. The \"smart\" dumbbell just got smarter! Introducing the NEWEST funnest way to shake and tone your arms, shoulders and chest! It provides the same, fun effective workout as the original, but this time around, it has adjustable resistance to increase intensity with a mere twist of your hands. Your muscles will contract up to 240 times a minutes for fast results in just six minutes a day! Available in Men's and Women's sizes, it's the smart, effective way to shake up your fitness routine! State Men's or Women's. Order yours today! Shake Weight Pro Men's Weighs 5 lbs., measures 15\" l. Women's Weighs 3 lbs., measures 13\"l.", "text": "Shake Weight Pro Shake Weight Pro. The \"smart\" dumbbell just got smarter! Introducing the NEWEST funnest way to shake and tone your arms, shoulders and chest! It provides the same, fun effective workout as the original, but this time around, it has adjustable resistance to increase intensity with a mere twist of your hands. Your muscles will contract up to 240 times a minutes for fast results in just six minutes a day! Available in Men's and Women's sizes, it's the smart, effective way to shake up your fitness routine! State Men's or Women's. Order yours today! Shake Weight Pro Men's Weighs 5 lbs., measures 15\" l. Women's Weighs 3 lbs., measures 13\"l.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uEmpRkgNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085B15EQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "As Seen On TV", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weights"]], "price": 15.99}}
