{"item_id": "B0085CE1B4", "title": "Multi Function Bike Multitool Bicycle Tool Patch Kit & Tire Levers 16 Function", "description": "This convenient 18 function tool provides virtually anything you need while on the road. It also includes a patch kit, tire levers and carry bag.Features16 Function all-in-one toolAllen Keys: 2, 2.5, 3, 4, 5, 6Wrench: 8, 10, 15 (pedal) & 14ge spoke & 8, 9, 10 socketsTire levers and patch kitNylon case with belt loop includedPhillips and Flat head screwdriver", "text": "Multi Function Bike Multitool Bicycle Tool Patch Kit & Tire Levers 16 Function This convenient 18 function tool provides virtually anything you need while on the road. It also includes a patch kit, tire levers and carry bag.Features16 Function all-in-one toolAllen Keys: 2, 2.5, 3, 4, 5, 6Wrench: 8, 10, 15 (pedal) & 14ge spoke & 8, 9, 10 socketsTire levers and patch kitNylon case with belt loop includedPhillips and Flat head screwdriver", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51a4jFin24L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085CE1B4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Conquer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 10.99}}
