{"item_id": "B0085N7KDY", "title": "Hidden Low Profile Magnet for Bicycle Cadence Sensor, Polar, Garmin, Sigma, Cat Eye", "description": "Innovative magnet for cadence sensor that can be installed directly on the pedal axle (as long as its magnetic of course) and uses magnetic attraction to stay anchored to the crank. So its not necessary to use clamps, glues and tapes, or ties. Mounts flush - stays in place - and easily removed if neccesary. On some carbon cranks a small washer can be used to \"space or shim\" the cadence magnet closer to flush on the back side of the crank. Washer included. Yes it works with the gaps pictured and on mountain bikes that are raced and ridden hard in dirt and mud. It stays attached no problem.", "text": "Hidden Low Profile Magnet for Bicycle Cadence Sensor, Polar, Garmin, Sigma, Cat Eye Innovative magnet for cadence sensor that can be installed directly on the pedal axle (as long as its magnetic of course) and uses magnetic attraction to stay anchored to the crank. So its not necessary to use clamps, glues and tapes, or ties. Mounts flush - stays in place - and easily removed if neccesary. On some carbon cranks a small washer can be used to \"space or shim\" the cadence magnet closer to flush on the back side of the crank. Washer included. Yes it works with the gaps pictured and on mountain bikes that are raced and ridden hard in dirt and mud. It stays attached no problem.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21NsPtBPrnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085N7KDY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 3.95}}
{"item_id": "B0085O1LCE", "title": "Womens- Kutting Weight (cutting weight) neoprene weight loss sauna shirt", "description": "The Kutting Weight neoprene clothing is made of elastic neoprene that is made to move with you through any type of exercise. The Sauna Pant is 1.7mm thick, is triple reinforced and built for your toughest workouts. You can expect to sweat a lot, increase your metabolism, burn more calories, increase your mental and physical toughness, detoxify your immune system, and increase flexibility therefore decreasing the likelihood of injury. The Sauna pant is designed to fit men and women and is made of neoprene that is guaranteed to last! To learn more about Cutting Weight and how to Cut Weight check out the Kutting Weight Youtube page. To find the best size follow the size chart and go by your height and weight. If you have any questions about sizing don't be afraid to ask. Safety Message: Do not overexert yourself. Stop exercising immediately and consult your doctor if you experience pain or tightness in your chest, irregular heartbeat, shortness in breath, or if you fee faint, nauseous, or dizzy. Before starting this or any exercise program, consult a physician or health professional. Make sure to have water and a towel while exercising. For questions about sizing call us at Kutting Weight. For questions about Returns call Amazon.com directly.", "text": "Womens- Kutting Weight (cutting weight) neoprene weight loss sauna shirt The Kutting Weight neoprene clothing is made of elastic neoprene that is made to move with you through any type of exercise. The Sauna Pant is 1.7mm thick, is triple reinforced and built for your toughest workouts. You can expect to sweat a lot, increase your metabolism, burn more calories, increase your mental and physical toughness, detoxify your immune system, and increase flexibility therefore decreasing the likelihood of injury. The Sauna pant is designed to fit men and women and is made of neoprene that is guaranteed to last! To learn more about Cutting Weight and how to Cut Weight check out the Kutting Weight Youtube page. To find the best size follow the size chart and go by your height and weight. If you have any questions about sizing don't be afraid to ask. Safety Message: Do not overexert yourself. Stop exercising immediately and consult your doctor if you experience pain or tightness in your chest, irregular heartbeat, shortness in breath, or if you fee faint, nauseous, or dizzy. Before starting this or any exercise program, consult a physician or health professional. Make sure to have water and a towel while exercising. For questions about sizing call us at Kutting Weight. For questions about Returns call Amazon.com directly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415ooPGouNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085O1LCE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Sauna Suits"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B0085OQKC0", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical New Generation CQB 4 Reticle Red Dot Open Reflex Sight with Integral Sunshade And Rifle Shotgun Pistol Crossbow Weaver-Picatinny Rail Mount Includes Battery And Lens Cleaning Kit", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Gen. Tactical CQB 4 Reticle Dual Red DotOpen Reflex Sight with Weaver-Picatinny Rail Mount. High quality aircraft grade aluminum construction, shock proof, fog proof, water resistant ideal for military-law enforcement-hunters. 4 Different Reticle Designs for every Tactical Solution. 7 Brightness Settings . Tubeless Design. 1x Magnification. Objective (mm)-24x34. Unlimited Eye Relief. Multi-Coated Lens. Black Finish. Windage & Elevation Adjustments. Weight-7.2oz. Length-3.25\". Wide Sharp Field of View. Weaver-Picatinny Rail Base-Great For Rifles-Shotguns or Any Weapon with A Weaver-Picatinny Rail. Integral sunshade . CR2032 Lithum Battery as well as lens cleaning kit come Included.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical New Generation CQB 4 Reticle Red Dot Open Reflex Sight with Integral Sunshade And Rifle Shotgun Pistol Crossbow Weaver-Picatinny Rail Mount Includes Battery And Lens Cleaning Kit Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Gen. Tactical CQB 4 Reticle Dual Red DotOpen Reflex Sight with Weaver-Picatinny Rail Mount. High quality aircraft grade aluminum construction, shock proof, fog proof, water resistant ideal for military-law enforcement-hunters. 4 Different Reticle Designs for every Tactical Solution. 7 Brightness Settings . Tubeless Design. 1x Magnification. Objective (mm)-24x34. Unlimited Eye Relief. Multi-Coated Lens. Black Finish. Windage & Elevation Adjustments. Weight-7.2oz. Length-3.25\". Wide Sharp Field of View. Weaver-Picatinny Rail Base-Great For Rifles-Shotguns or Any Weapon with A Weaver-Picatinny Rail. Integral sunshade . CR2032 Lithum Battery as well as lens cleaning kit come Included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tgSz8arkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085OQKC0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 30.99}}
{"item_id": "B0085OUN1O", "title": "BV Steel Floor Pump with Gauge, 160 psi, Yellow", "description": "The GF55P is a high pressure floor pump with a large easy to read gauge. The maximum pressure is 160 psi and it is reversible for Presta and Schrader valves. The ergonomic design and stable foot makes handling the pump easier and faster.", "text": "BV Steel Floor Pump with Gauge, 160 psi, Yellow The GF55P is a high pressure floor pump with a large easy to read gauge. The maximum pressure is 160 psi and it is reversible for Presta and Schrader valves. The ergonomic design and stable foot makes handling the pump easier and faster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aDlLpRTcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085OUN1O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 38.99}}
{"item_id": "B0085P2FKK", "title": "Shotgun Sling hold 15 shell with free hold 50 shell bandolier combo", "description": "This combo set include 1 Shotgun sling with hooks hold 15 shell and 1 shotgun bandolier hold 50 shell. Great buy 1 get 1 free deal.", "text": "Shotgun Sling hold 15 shell with free hold 50 shell bandolier combo This combo set include 1 Shotgun sling with hooks hold 15 shell and 1 shotgun bandolier hold 50 shell. Great buy 1 get 1 free deal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QtEiRKNSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085P2FKK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "COI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 25.8}}
{"item_id": "B0085P4TWW", "title": "T3 Tactical Triage & Auto Rescue Tool", "description": "The StatGear T3 Tactical Auto Rescue Tool was designed by a New York City Paramedic. It is a complete auto rescue tool which includes a 440c stainless steel serrated blade, 440c stainless steel seatbelt cutter, spring-loaded window punch and LED light. The tool includes a heavy duty sheath. No one knows the importance of rescue tools better than First Responders; sometimes your life depends on it. Use a tool that was created by a First Responder and never be unprepared with the StatGear T3 Tactical Auto Rescue Tool. The serrated knife blade and seatbelt cutter blade are easily folded away into the tool body by pushing down the liner-lock. Batteries for the LED light are easily removed for replacement by using your thumb to pull out the battery compartment.", "text": "T3 Tactical Triage & Auto Rescue Tool The StatGear T3 Tactical Auto Rescue Tool was designed by a New York City Paramedic. It is a complete auto rescue tool which includes a 440c stainless steel serrated blade, 440c stainless steel seatbelt cutter, spring-loaded window punch and LED light. The tool includes a heavy duty sheath. No one knows the importance of rescue tools better than First Responders; sometimes your life depends on it. Use a tool that was created by a First Responder and never be unprepared with the StatGear T3 Tactical Auto Rescue Tool. The serrated knife blade and seatbelt cutter blade are easily folded away into the tool body by pushing down the liner-lock. Batteries for the LED light are easily removed for replacement by using your thumb to pull out the battery compartment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417MyWcNKgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085P4TWW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StatGear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 36.99}}
{"item_id": "B0085PPSIQ", "title": "Lansky PS-MED01 BladeMedic", "description": "The Blademedic Knife Sharpener is the first Responder for Field Repairs on all types of Knife Blades. It’s like having an entire Sharpening Kit right in your Pocket-Able to tackle Regular or Serrated Blades, Gut Hooks, Hunting, Fishing, just about any Knife.", "text": "Lansky PS-MED01 BladeMedic The Blademedic Knife Sharpener is the first Responder for Field Repairs on all types of Knife Blades. It’s like having an entire Sharpening Kit right in your Pocket-Able to tackle Regular or Serrated Blades, Gut Hooks, Hunting, Fishing, just about any Knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nSrQhZCJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085PPSIQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lansky", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 10.0}}
