{"item_id": "B0085X1ELS", "title": "Holster for Ruger LC9 with Underbarrel Laser", "description": "This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The poly sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Holster for Ruger LC9 with Underbarrel Laser This holster combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The poly sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51su15IWM5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085X1ELS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.9}}
{"item_id": "B0085XQBQG", "title": "Skyline Center Inc. - Gun Cleaning Patches - 1 3/4\" Square Bulk 1000ct. - 7mm - .38/.357 Caliber - 9mm - Made in USA", "description": "Skyline Stack Pack patches are 100% Cotton Flannel for exceptional absorption and cleaning. Packaged in resealable bags of 1000 for convenient transportation and storage uses in the field, at the shop or on the range. Gun Cleaning 7mm - .38/.357 Caliber", "text": "Skyline Center Inc. - Gun Cleaning Patches - 1 3/4\" Square Bulk 1000ct. - 7mm - .38/.357 Caliber - 9mm - Made in USA Skyline Stack Pack patches are 100% Cotton Flannel for exceptional absorption and cleaning. Packaged in resealable bags of 1000 for convenient transportation and storage uses in the field, at the shop or on the range. Gun Cleaning 7mm - .38/.357 Caliber", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I11MYcKTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085XQBQG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 18.18}}
