{"item_id": "B0085ZHANM", "title": "Front and Rear Sight for AR-15 M16 Flat Top Rifles Low Profile Flip-Up Sight Set", "description": "These sights are rail mounted with a quick deploy latch and are adjustable for elevation. THEY LEAN TO THE REAR SO AS TO FOLD IN THE CORRECT DIRECTION IF DROPPED, THUS MAINTAINING THEIR ZERO FOR ACCURACY AND GIVE LONGER TROUBLE FREE SERVICE LIFE!", "text": "Front and Rear Sight for AR-15 M16 Flat Top Rifles Low Profile Flip-Up Sight Set These sights are rail mounted with a quick deploy latch and are adjustable for elevation. THEY LEAN TO THE REAR SO AS TO FOLD IN THE CORRECT DIRECTION IF DROPPED, THUS MAINTAINING THEIR ZERO FOR ACCURACY AND GIVE LONGER TROUBLE FREE SERVICE LIFE!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Wlx5DH7iL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0085ZHANM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Rifle Scope Accessories"]], "price": 24.0}}
