{"item_id": "B00861AW08", "title": "SHOTGUN AMMO SLING FOR REMINGTON 870 ***MADE IN U.S.A.***", "description": "Welcome to Big Daddy Holsters. We specialize in providing quality holsters, ammo carriers, belts, as well as other gun & self-defense products at affordable prices! We carry only high-quality name brand products. We offer fair, economic prices the old-fashioned way; by offering quality merchandise, and superior customer service. We are able to operate because of the volume we sell. Treat others as you would like to be treated - especially in this economy! Please e-mail us with any questions!", "text": "SHOTGUN AMMO SLING FOR REMINGTON 870 ***MADE IN U.S.A.*** Welcome to Big Daddy Holsters. We specialize in providing quality holsters, ammo carriers, belts, as well as other gun & self-defense products at affordable prices! We carry only high-quality name brand products. We offer fair, economic prices the old-fashioned way; by offering quality merchandise, and superior customer service. We are able to operate because of the volume we sell. Treat others as you would like to be treated - especially in this economy! Please e-mail us with any questions!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xwC0MKCYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00861AW08.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 18.95}}
