{"item_id": "B0086573KQ", "title": "Red Rock Outdoor Gear Rover Sling Pack", "description": "The most popular concealed carry sling pack is the Red Rock Outdoor Gear Rover Sling Pack. This is an ambidextrous sling bag for quick and hands-free carry. A concealed carry sleeve on the back panel of the bag easily and comfortably packs your pistol. The four storage compartments are large enough to tote a first aid kit, binoculars, ammunition, and an iPad will fit perfectly.", "text": "Red Rock Outdoor Gear Rover Sling Pack The most popular concealed carry sling pack is the Red Rock Outdoor Gear Rover Sling Pack. This is an ambidextrous sling bag for quick and hands-free carry. A concealed carry sleeve on the back panel of the bag easily and comfortably packs your pistol. The four storage compartments are large enough to tote a first aid kit, binoculars, ammunition, and an iPad will fit perfectly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51V0R3WYBLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0086573KQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Red Rock Outdoor Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 27.4}}
