{"item_id": "B00865NBZC", "title": "Condor Tactical H-Harness", "description": "Condor Tactical H-HarnessCondor's H Harness adds support to any battle belt system. Use this harness to keep your battle belt from slipping down and carry a small backpack or hydration carrier. It will mount to any belt system using the belt's D rings, and keep you cool thanks to the mesh material.Features:", "text": "Condor Tactical H-Harness Condor Tactical H-HarnessCondor's H Harness adds support to any battle belt system. Use this harness to keep your battle belt from slipping down and carry a small backpack or hydration carrier. It will mount to any belt system using the belt's D rings, and keep you cool thanks to the mesh material.Features:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415fgmMleIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00865NBZC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 14.95}}
