{"item_id": "B00865O9CQ", "title": "Condor HHR Pouch", "description": "The Condor HHR pouch holds a handheld radio with hook & loop flap closure and a drawstring with cord lock. Can be carried via MOLLE, belt or carabiner. Size: 4\"H x 2\"W x 1.5\" D", "text": "Condor HHR Pouch The Condor HHR pouch holds a handheld radio with hook & loop flap closure and a drawstring with cord lock. Can be carried via MOLLE, belt or carabiner. Size: 4\"H x 2\"W x 1.5\" D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417gva722GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00865O9CQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00867EDCK", "title": "Meade 81015 Spotting Scope (Black)", "description": "The Meade 81015 Spotting Scope is ideal for sportsmen, bird watchers and camping with its wide zoom range. This rugged zoom spotting scope features fully coated optics and the BK-7 Porro prism transmits bright images full of contrast anywhere in the 20 to 60-times zoom range. This scope has a 60-millimeter objective lens and a 45-degree angled eyepiece. Its weather sealed polycarbonate housing is made to withstand heavy rainfall and extreme humidity without fogging in the wilderness. The Meade spotting scope is waterproof and rubber armored for years of use. It includes a waterproof carry case, full height tripod and a scope carry bag. The Meade 81015 Spotting Scope comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Meade has everything you need to capture the night sky for experienced star-shooters, serious researchers and beginners alike. Serious astronomers for years have flocked to Meade telescopes for their quality optical systems and patented technology. Consumers know that \"Meade Optics Inside\" means that what they see through our telescopes will be views that are detailed, crisp and full of contrast. Look through a Meade this evening and see what you've been missing.", "text": "Meade 81015 Spotting Scope (Black) The Meade 81015 Spotting Scope is ideal for sportsmen, bird watchers and camping with its wide zoom range. This rugged zoom spotting scope features fully coated optics and the BK-7 Porro prism transmits bright images full of contrast anywhere in the 20 to 60-times zoom range. This scope has a 60-millimeter objective lens and a 45-degree angled eyepiece. Its weather sealed polycarbonate housing is made to withstand heavy rainfall and extreme humidity without fogging in the wilderness. The Meade spotting scope is waterproof and rubber armored for years of use. It includes a waterproof carry case, full height tripod and a scope carry bag. The Meade 81015 Spotting Scope comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Meade has everything you need to capture the night sky for experienced star-shooters, serious researchers and beginners alike. Serious astronomers for years have flocked to Meade telescopes for their quality optical systems and patented technology. Consumers know that \"Meade Optics Inside\" means that what they see through our telescopes will be views that are detailed, crisp and full of contrast. Look through a Meade this evening and see what you've been missing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31J5oZCXPyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00867EDCK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Meade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 71.49}}
{"item_id": "B00869ORDS", "title": "FoxX Holsters Low Profile Kydex Belt Clips Pair of 2", "description": "Our new Kydex belt loops are a great upgrade from the standard steel clips to the FoxX IWB Holsters. These clips are designed to hook over your pants just like the spring steel clips, however they have no protruding edges. The Kydex surface is also not reflective, so these low profile clips can go unnoticed. Add a set to your Hybrid FoxX Holster and decide which system is right for you.", "text": "FoxX Holsters Low Profile Kydex Belt Clips Pair of 2 Our new Kydex belt loops are a great upgrade from the standard steel clips to the FoxX IWB Holsters. These clips are designed to hook over your pants just like the spring steel clips, however they have no protruding edges. The Kydex surface is also not reflective, so these low profile clips can go unnoticed. Add a set to your Hybrid FoxX Holster and decide which system is right for you.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hyWZy%2B31L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00869ORDS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 7.99}}
