{"item_id": "B0086QFYYW", "title": "Modern Warrior Woodland and Forest Design Ghillie Suit, 3-Piece, One Size Fits All Children", "description": "Ghillie Suit Woodland and Forest Camouflage by Modern Warrior Tactical Gear. Our ghillie suits are top quality and will help you blend into any environment. Our 3 piece child suit fits children ages 5 and up, and is fairly adjustable. The suit features Natural Jute Thread, and the pants are adjustable with draw strings. Buy our natural looking, top quality Ghillie Suit today.", "text": "Modern Warrior Woodland and Forest Design Ghillie Suit, 3-Piece, One Size Fits All Children Ghillie Suit Woodland and Forest Camouflage by Modern Warrior Tactical Gear. Our ghillie suits are top quality and will help you blend into any environment. Our 3 piece child suit fits children ages 5 and up, and is fairly adjustable. The suit features Natural Jute Thread, and the pants are adjustable with draw strings. Buy our natural looking, top quality Ghillie Suit today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519hf66ckbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0086QFYYW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Decoys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0086U6KI2", "title": "Guard Dog iStun Cell Phone Stun Gun", "description": "The Guard Dog Security introduces the world’s first and only iStun. The iStun is a cognitive self defense stun gun designed to resemble popular smart phones, yet emits a staggering electric shock capable to incapacitate an assailant. Although the patented iStun will not make calls or browse the web, it delivers the peace of mind of personal security. FACT: In a recent 2012 study conducted by the FCC, more than 40% of robberies involve smart phones and cell phones. In some areas, that rate is higher than 50%. The next time an attacker demands your smart phone, give them a surprise that will truly daze them- give them the iStun.", "text": "Guard Dog iStun Cell Phone Stun Gun The Guard Dog Security introduces the world’s first and only iStun. The iStun is a cognitive self defense stun gun designed to resemble popular smart phones, yet emits a staggering electric shock capable to incapacitate an assailant. Although the patented iStun will not make calls or browse the web, it delivers the peace of mind of personal security. FACT: In a recent 2012 study conducted by the FCC, more than 40% of robberies involve smart phones and cell phones. In some areas, that rate is higher than 50%. The next time an attacker demands your smart phone, give them a surprise that will truly daze them- give them the iStun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510ki2dFMlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0086U6KI2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Guard Dog Security", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 23.37}}
{"item_id": "B0086Y0WT6", "title": "Modern Warrior Tactical Shoulder Holster-Multiple Colors", "description": "Lightweight tactical shoulder holster by Modern Warrior tactical gear. This shoulder holster is a single/double-draw shoulder holster, manufactured with a modular design that allows it to be used by both right and left handed individuals. Simply remove the pouch and holster and switch them to the other side. Additionally it can be combined with our other shoulder holster products by Modern Warrior to create holsters with two pouches or two holsters. The shoulder holster features an easy thumb release, and a universal design to hold most pistol designs. It also features straps to attach it to a tactical belt or utility belt. Designed for use with airsoft and for toys.", "text": "Modern Warrior Tactical Shoulder Holster-Multiple Colors Lightweight tactical shoulder holster by Modern Warrior tactical gear. This shoulder holster is a single/double-draw shoulder holster, manufactured with a modular design that allows it to be used by both right and left handed individuals. Simply remove the pouch and holster and switch them to the other side. Additionally it can be combined with our other shoulder holster products by Modern Warrior to create holsters with two pouches or two holsters. The shoulder holster features an easy thumb release, and a universal design to hold most pistol designs. It also features straps to attach it to a tactical belt or utility belt. Designed for use with airsoft and for toys.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418741AXv%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0086Y0WT6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Modern Warrior", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B0086Y5E30", "title": "Modern Warrior Tactical M88 ABS Helmet with Adjustable Chin Strap", "description": "Black M88 Tactical Helmet manufactured by Modern Warrior tactical gear. This helmet features an adjustable chin and head strap to allow one size to fit most individuals. The helmet is great for tactical environments, such as airsoft and paintball. Each helmet is fairly lightweight, weighing about 2lbs. Resembles SWAT helmets, Kevlar helmet, PASGT.", "text": "Modern Warrior Tactical M88 ABS Helmet with Adjustable Chin Strap Black M88 Tactical Helmet manufactured by Modern Warrior tactical gear. This helmet features an adjustable chin and head strap to allow one size to fit most individuals. The helmet is great for tactical environments, such as airsoft and paintball. Each helmet is fairly lightweight, weighing about 2lbs. Resembles SWAT helmets, Kevlar helmet, PASGT.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kVHaVpA2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0086Y5E30.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Modern Warrior", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Helmets"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B0086Y7PDW", "title": "Modern Warrior Tactical Drop Leg Holster (Black)", "description": "Black Drop Leg Holster Tactical Gear and Accessory by Modern Warrior . Our drop leg holsters feature a top quality holster assemble with a side holster pouch for ammo or magazines. The adjustable closures allows it to be a universal holster and work with most pistols. The holster features a fully adjustable and removeable strap for the leg, and a slip-resistant pad in the holster. The holster is designed for maximum functionality while maintaining comfort. And the lightweight designs means the holster weights under 1lb, which prevents it from slowing you down in tactical environments. Holster meant for use in paintball or airsoft.", "text": "Modern Warrior Tactical Drop Leg Holster (Black) Black Drop Leg Holster Tactical Gear and Accessory by Modern Warrior . Our drop leg holsters feature a top quality holster assemble with a side holster pouch for ammo or magazines. The adjustable closures allows it to be a universal holster and work with most pistols. The holster features a fully adjustable and removeable strap for the leg, and a slip-resistant pad in the holster. The holster is designed for maximum functionality while maintaining comfort. And the lightweight designs means the holster weights under 1lb, which prevents it from slowing you down in tactical environments. Holster meant for use in paintball or airsoft.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GvQisZbnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0086Y7PDW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Modern Warrior", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.99}}
