{"item_id": "B00873JF6M", "title": "UTAC® 2.5-10x40 Dual Illuminated Tactical Rifle Scope with Green Laser Combo & Weaver-Picatinny Quick Detach (QD) Mount with Cut Sunshade", "description": "Description: 2.5-10X40 Dual Illuminated Scope w/ Green LaserMagnification: 2.5X-10XLens Coating: GreenIllumination: Red and GreenTube Diameter: 25.4mmObjective Diameter: 40mmLength: 8.46\"N.W.(OZ): 21.1Exit Pupil (mm): 13.3-4.4Eye Relieve (mm): 69-50Click Value (inch at 100 yard): 1/4FOV (Feet at 100 yards): 34.86-11.53Reticle: rangefinderWater Proof: YesMount: Weaver-Picatinny Quick Detach (QD) MountShock Proof & Fully Coated With An Anodized Finish For Heavy Duty RecoilLaser Sight:Wavelength: 635/655nm Green LaserPower: 5mWBattery: CR2 lithiumOperating Temperature: 14F-113FRange: 500mPlease note the green beam in the picture is drawn to show the laser beam path and you will not see a green beam like it during actual use of the laser sight.Covered by UTAC 1 year limited warranty", "text": "UTAC® 2.5-10x40 Dual Illuminated Tactical Rifle Scope with Green Laser Combo & Weaver-Picatinny Quick Detach (QD) Mount with Cut Sunshade Description: 2.5-10X40 Dual Illuminated Scope w/ Green LaserMagnification: 2.5X-10XLens Coating: GreenIllumination: Red and GreenTube Diameter: 25.4mmObjective Diameter: 40mmLength: 8.46\"N.W.(OZ): 21.1Exit Pupil (mm): 13.3-4.4Eye Relieve (mm): 69-50Click Value (inch at 100 yard): 1/4FOV (Feet at 100 yards): 34.86-11.53Reticle: rangefinderWater Proof: YesMount: Weaver-Picatinny Quick Detach (QD) MountShock Proof & Fully Coated With An Anodized Finish For Heavy Duty RecoilLaser Sight:Wavelength: 635/655nm Green LaserPower: 5mWBattery: CR2 lithiumOperating Temperature: 14F-113FRange: 500mPlease note the green beam in the picture is drawn to show the laser beam path and you will not see a green beam like it during actual use of the laser sight.Covered by UTAC 1 year limited warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41koT00GJnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00873JF6M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0087554J2", "title": "UTAC 1.5x-5x Variable Magnifier For Red Dot Sight with Mount Ring", "description": "The MS155 Magnifier mounts behind red dot scope on Picatinny Rail to provide magnification from 1.5x to 5x. The MS155 Magnifier is used to increase the range of your red dot sight with precision. The MS155 Magnifier does not need to be sighted-in - only sight in your red dot scope, and attach the MS155 Magnifier. It s easy to install right behind the scope to magnify your targets, and simple to use. The MS155 also doubles as a hand-held monocular. Zoom in on your targets easily just by looking through the tube.Magnification: 1.5x - 5xObjective Diameter: 21mmOcular Diameter: 26mmField Angel: 7 degree - 4.5 degreeExit Pupil: 4-10mmEye Relief: 55-100mmWeight: 210GLength: 120mmWaterproof: YesShock Proof & Fully Coated With An Anodized Finish For Heavy Duty Recoil Fit 30mm Flip-to-side Picatinny mount (NOT included)Package include: 1.5x-5x magnifier, mount ring. Red dot or quad rail shown in product picture is not included.", "text": "UTAC 1.5x-5x Variable Magnifier For Red Dot Sight with Mount Ring The MS155 Magnifier mounts behind red dot scope on Picatinny Rail to provide magnification from 1.5x to 5x. The MS155 Magnifier is used to increase the range of your red dot sight with precision. The MS155 Magnifier does not need to be sighted-in - only sight in your red dot scope, and attach the MS155 Magnifier. It s easy to install right behind the scope to magnify your targets, and simple to use. The MS155 also doubles as a hand-held monocular. Zoom in on your targets easily just by looking through the tube.Magnification: 1.5x - 5xObjective Diameter: 21mmOcular Diameter: 26mmField Angel: 7 degree - 4.5 degreeExit Pupil: 4-10mmEye Relief: 55-100mmWeight: 210GLength: 120mmWaterproof: YesShock Proof & Fully Coated With An Anodized Finish For Heavy Duty Recoil Fit 30mm Flip-to-side Picatinny mount (NOT included)Package include: 1.5x-5x magnifier, mount ring. Red dot or quad rail shown in product picture is not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oEA7h-9RL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0087554J2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 84.99}}
