{"item_id": "B0087MLCGY", "title": "Venum Challenger 2.0 Boxing Gloves", "description": "The perfect lightweight performance boxing gloves from beginner to intermediate level. Venum is a Mixed Martial Arts & related combat sports brand designed for the professional athlete, amateur competitor and hardcore fan. Our passion for Mixed Martial Arts combined with our technical expertise allows us to create innovative training equipment and lifestyle apparel. Venum products are widely recognized as the best training equipment in the industry.", "text": "Venum Challenger 2.0 Boxing Gloves The perfect lightweight performance boxing gloves from beginner to intermediate level. Venum is a Mixed Martial Arts & related combat sports brand designed for the professional athlete, amateur competitor and hardcore fan. Our passion for Mixed Martial Arts combined with our technical expertise allows us to create innovative training equipment and lifestyle apparel. Venum products are widely recognized as the best training equipment in the industry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Na7BYINtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0087MLCGY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Gloves", "Training Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0087O6BSQ", "title": "DeSantis Scabbard S&W Shield Right Hand Black", "description": "The firearm rides high and is presented at an optimal draw angle. Its thumb break and exact molding, together with a tension device, allow for a secure and highly concealable carry. Belt slots are 1 3/4-Inch wide. Available in black or tan leather, with or without suede lining, plain or basket-weave finish. Some models come with two belt slots and without a tension device.", "text": "DeSantis Scabbard S&W Shield Right Hand Black The firearm rides high and is presented at an optimal draw angle. Its thumb break and exact molding, together with a tension device, allow for a secure and highly concealable carry. Belt slots are 1 3/4-Inch wide. Available in black or tan leather, with or without suede lining, plain or basket-weave finish. Some models come with two belt slots and without a tension device.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31U9CKw97aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0087O6BSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 46.34}}
{"item_id": "B0087O6CSK", "title": "DeSantis S and W Shield Mini Scabbard Holster", "description": "This unique holster has been reduced to the barest of essentials, yet offers a secure grip on the handgun thanks to its exact molding and adjustable tension device. The Mini Scabbard will accommodate belts up to 1 1/2-Inch wide. Available in black or tan unlined leather. Note: Some models do not have the adjustable tension device.", "text": "DeSantis S and W Shield Mini Scabbard Holster This unique holster has been reduced to the barest of essentials, yet offers a secure grip on the handgun thanks to its exact molding and adjustable tension device. The Mini Scabbard will accommodate belts up to 1 1/2-Inch wide. Available in black or tan unlined leather. Note: Some models do not have the adjustable tension device.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZuC7XIONL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0087O6CSK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 35.4}}
{"item_id": "B0087O6FU0", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Retractor w/ Strap Small - OD Green", "description": "Maxpedition Gear - OD Green Tactical Gear Retractor - Small/Strap. Model: MXRS2G. Keep your gear & tools safe, secure and ready for action! All-weather severe environment capability. 24\" (61cm) Kevlar tether. 4 oz. (113g) retraction force. The Kevlar cord breaks at 53 lbs. and the end fitting breaks away at 18 lbs. Quick disconnect strap gear attachment. Subdued stainless steel hardware. Highest quality and extreme duty. Color: OD Green. MAP Price is 14.39", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Retractor w/ Strap Small - OD Green Maxpedition Gear - OD Green Tactical Gear Retractor - Small/Strap. Model: MXRS2G. Keep your gear & tools safe, secure and ready for action! All-weather severe environment capability. 24\" (61cm) Kevlar tether. 4 oz. (113g) retraction force. The Kevlar cord breaks at 53 lbs. and the end fitting breaks away at 18 lbs. Quick disconnect strap gear attachment. Subdued stainless steel hardware. Highest quality and extreme duty. Color: OD Green. MAP Price is 14.39", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hNzGhmxPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0087O6FU0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]]}}
