{"item_id": "B008894538", "title": "Mosin Nagant Headspace Gauges - 7.62x54R 3 Pc Set - Go, No-go, Field by Firewerks", "description": "These Firewerks headspace gauges are for Mosin Nagant 7.62x54r military rifles. This three piece set includes: Go, No go, and Field gauges.Firewerks Headspace Gauges are made from high quality stainless steel for corrosion resistance, heat treated for wear resistance, and precision ground for superb accuracy.SUPERIOR QUALITYFirewerks headspace gauges are the original and only coin-style gauges on the market that are made from stainless steel for superior corrosion resistance. Manufactured right here in the USA, Firewerks headspace gauges are precision built and made to last.PRECISION ACCURACYEvery single gauge is precision ground to very tight tolerances with top of the line machines. Then, each gauge is double checked by hand with micrometers before it ever gets packaged and leaves our shop.SIMPLE TO USE!As easy as 1-2-3. These high quality stainless steel Go, No-go, and Field headspace gauges are specially designed so that you don't have to remove the extractor to check your rifle's headspace.EASY TO IDENTIFYEasily identify which gauge is which with the laser etched letter identifiers - \"G\" (go gauge), \"N\" (no-go gauge), \"F\" (field gauge). Now you no longer have to guess what gauge you are looking at.What is Headspace?In simple terms, headspace is the clearance allowed between the base of the cartridge case and the face of the bolt. Too little headspace and the bolt may not function correctly. Too much headspace may cause ruptured cases that can harm the gun and may cause personal injury and/or death. When purchasing a used firearm, it is very important to always check the headspace before firing it - especially surplus military rifles! Military surplus rifles have had thousands of rounds put through them and were often exposed to harsh use. You never know what kind of condition your gun may be in. It's best to play it safe and check the headspace.", "text": "Mosin Nagant Headspace Gauges - 7.62x54R 3 Pc Set - Go, No-go, Field by Firewerks These Firewerks headspace gauges are for Mosin Nagant 7.62x54r military rifles. This three piece set includes: Go, No go, and Field gauges.Firewerks Headspace Gauges are made from high quality stainless steel for corrosion resistance, heat treated for wear resistance, and precision ground for superb accuracy.SUPERIOR QUALITYFirewerks headspace gauges are the original and only coin-style gauges on the market that are made from stainless steel for superior corrosion resistance. Manufactured right here in the USA, Firewerks headspace gauges are precision built and made to last.PRECISION ACCURACYEvery single gauge is precision ground to very tight tolerances with top of the line machines. Then, each gauge is double checked by hand with micrometers before it ever gets packaged and leaves our shop.SIMPLE TO USE!As easy as 1-2-3. These high quality stainless steel Go, No-go, and Field headspace gauges are specially designed so that you don't have to remove the extractor to check your rifle's headspace.EASY TO IDENTIFYEasily identify which gauge is which with the laser etched letter identifiers - \"G\" (go gauge), \"N\" (no-go gauge), \"F\" (field gauge). Now you no longer have to guess what gauge you are looking at.What is Headspace?In simple terms, headspace is the clearance allowed between the base of the cartridge case and the face of the bolt. Too little headspace and the bolt may not function correctly. Too much headspace may cause ruptured cases that can harm the gun and may cause personal injury and/or death. When purchasing a used firearm, it is very important to always check the headspace before firing it - especially surplus military rifles! Military surplus rifles have had thousands of rounds put through them and were often exposed to harsh use. You never know what kind of condition your gun may be in. It's best to play it safe and check the headspace.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51yV5ZeNwGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008894538.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B008894APQ", "title": "Trademark Innovations Plastic Disc Cone Sports Training Gear with Carrier, Pack of 24", "description": "2\" Plastic Disc Cone - 24 Pack Orange. These sports training cones are manufactured with superior quality by Trademark Innovations . These 24 packs of cones each include a carrier for easy transport and storage. Whatever sport you are playing or coaching, these cones will help you set boundaries and lines, and run drills and exercises. Get your sports training and practice cones today.", "text": "Trademark Innovations Plastic Disc Cone Sports Training Gear with Carrier, Pack of 24 2\" Plastic Disc Cone - 24 Pack Orange. These sports training cones are manufactured with superior quality by Trademark Innovations . These 24 packs of cones each include a carrier for easy transport and storage. Whatever sport you are playing or coaching, these cones will help you set boundaries and lines, and run drills and exercises. Get your sports training and practice cones today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410ZPG9pJ8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008894APQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trademark Innovations", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Soccer", "Training Equipment", "Training Cones"]], "price": 13.25}}
{"item_id": "B00889AU64", "title": "Badger(TM) Velcro-Patch Neck Lanyard w/ Key Ring and Credit Card Organizer by Hazard 4(R)", "description": "You may need to display velcro-back modular patches, such as our new small i.d. window but will not be carrying a pack, bag, or uniform that has velcro panels. Use Badger(TM) instead. It has a neck-lanyard but it can also be worn on a belt or woven into MOLLE on modular packs/bags. There is even a basic wallet/organizer on the other side!", "text": "Badger(TM) Velcro-Patch Neck Lanyard w/ Key Ring and Credit Card Organizer by Hazard 4(R) You may need to display velcro-back modular patches, such as our new small i.d. window but will not be carrying a pack, bag, or uniform that has velcro panels. Use Badger(TM) instead. It has a neck-lanyard but it can also be worn on a belt or woven into MOLLE on modular packs/bags. There is even a basic wallet/organizer on the other side!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412yhWV3RsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00889AU64.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HAZARD 4", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B00889AWJ4", "title": "SunTac(TM) Cotton Boonie Hat w/ MOLLE by Hazard 4(R)", "description": "The tropical, sun, or boonie hat is a classic and functional accessory, but in need of modernization. Hazard 4(R)'s introduces new features that make it a modern classic. A generously comfortable pattern is constructed of high quality cotton twill that will last years, and a multitude of innovative features make it an exclusive original for active duty military, police, etc. or avid outdoor users/professionals.", "text": "SunTac(TM) Cotton Boonie Hat w/ MOLLE by Hazard 4(R) The tropical, sun, or boonie hat is a classic and functional accessory, but in need of modernization. Hazard 4(R)'s introduces new features that make it a modern classic. A generously comfortable pattern is constructed of high quality cotton twill that will last years, and a multitude of innovative features make it an exclusive original for active duty military, police, etc. or avid outdoor users/professionals.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416%2BOi1fT1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00889AWJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Hats", "Men's"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0088AEBDG", "title": "Mosin Nagant Headspace Gauge - 7.62x54r Field Gauge - By Firewerks", "description": "This Firewerks Headspace Gauge is for Mosin Nagant 7.62x54r military rifles. Package includes (1) Field Gauge.Firewerks Headspace Gauges are made from high quality stainless steel for corrosion resistance, heat treated for wear resistance, and precision ground for superb accuracy.SUPERIOR QUALITYFirewerks headspace gauges are the original and only coin-style gauges on the market that are made from stainless steel for superior corrosion resistance. Manufactured right here in the USA, Firewerks headspace gauges are precision built and made to last.PRECISION ACCURACYEvery single gauge is precision ground to very tight tolerances with top of the line machines. Then, each gauge is double checked by hand with micrometers before it ever gets packaged and leaves our shop.SIMPLE TO USE!As easy as 1-2-3. These high quality stainless steel Go, No-go, and Field headspace gauges are specially designed so that you don't have to remove the extractor to check your rifle's headspace.EASY TO IDENTIFYEasily identify which gauge is which with the laser etched letter identifiers - \"G\" (go gauge), \"N\" (no-go gauge), \"F\" (field gauge). Now you no longer have to guess what gauge you are looking at.What is Headspace?In simple terms, headspace is the clearance allowed between the base of the cartridge case and the face of the bolt. Too little headspace and the bolt may not function correctly. Too much headspace may cause ruptured cases that can harm the gun and may cause personal injury and/or death. When purchasing a used firearm, it is very important to always check the headspace before firing it - especially surplus military rifles! Military surplus rifles have had thousands of rounds put through them and were often exposed to harsh use. You never know what kind of condition your gun may be in. It's best to play it safe and check the headspace.", "text": "Mosin Nagant Headspace Gauge - 7.62x54r Field Gauge - By Firewerks This Firewerks Headspace Gauge is for Mosin Nagant 7.62x54r military rifles. Package includes (1) Field Gauge.Firewerks Headspace Gauges are made from high quality stainless steel for corrosion resistance, heat treated for wear resistance, and precision ground for superb accuracy.SUPERIOR QUALITYFirewerks headspace gauges are the original and only coin-style gauges on the market that are made from stainless steel for superior corrosion resistance. Manufactured right here in the USA, Firewerks headspace gauges are precision built and made to last.PRECISION ACCURACYEvery single gauge is precision ground to very tight tolerances with top of the line machines. Then, each gauge is double checked by hand with micrometers before it ever gets packaged and leaves our shop.SIMPLE TO USE!As easy as 1-2-3. These high quality stainless steel Go, No-go, and Field headspace gauges are specially designed so that you don't have to remove the extractor to check your rifle's headspace.EASY TO IDENTIFYEasily identify which gauge is which with the laser etched letter identifiers - \"G\" (go gauge), \"N\" (no-go gauge), \"F\" (field gauge). Now you no longer have to guess what gauge you are looking at.What is Headspace?In simple terms, headspace is the clearance allowed between the base of the cartridge case and the face of the bolt. Too little headspace and the bolt may not function correctly. Too much headspace may cause ruptured cases that can harm the gun and may cause personal injury and/or death. When purchasing a used firearm, it is very important to always check the headspace before firing it - especially surplus military rifles! Military surplus rifles have had thousands of rounds put through them and were often exposed to harsh use. You never know what kind of condition your gun may be in. It's best to play it safe and check the headspace.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KADaaILOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0088AEBDG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B0088AESY8", "title": "Mosin Nagant Headspace Gauge - 7.62x54r No-go Gauge - By Firewerks", "description": "This Firewerks Headspace Gauge is for Mosin Nagant 7.62x54r military rifles. Package includes (1) No-go Gauge.Firewerks Headspace Gauges are made from high quality stainless steel for corrosion resistance, heat treated for wear resistance, and precision ground for superb accuracy.SUPERIOR QUALITYFirewerks headspace gauges are the original and only coin-style gauges on the market that are made from stainless steel for superior corrosion resistance. Manufactured right here in the USA, Firewerks headspace gauges are precision built and made to last.PRECISION ACCURACYEvery single gauge is precision ground to very tight tolerances with top of the line machines. Then, each gauge is double checked by hand with micrometers before it ever gets packaged and leaves our shop.SIMPLE TO USE!As easy as 1-2-3. These high quality stainless steel Go, No-go, and Field headspace gauges are specially designed so that you don't have to remove the extractor to check your rifle's headspace.EASY TO IDENTIFYEasily identify which gauge is which with the laser etched letter identifiers - \"G\" (go gauge), \"N\" (no-go gauge), \"F\" (field gauge). Now you no longer have to guess what gauge you are looking at.What is Headspace?In simple terms, headspace is the clearance allowed between the base of the cartridge case and the face of the bolt. Too little headspace and the bolt may not function correctly. Too much headspace may cause ruptured cases that can harm the gun and may cause personal injury and/or death. When purchasing a used firearm, it is very important to always check the headspace before firing it - especially surplus military rifles! Military surplus rifles have had thousands of rounds put through them and were often exposed to harsh use. You never know what kind of condition your gun may be in. It's best to play it safe and check the headspace.", "text": "Mosin Nagant Headspace Gauge - 7.62x54r No-go Gauge - By Firewerks This Firewerks Headspace Gauge is for Mosin Nagant 7.62x54r military rifles. Package includes (1) No-go Gauge.Firewerks Headspace Gauges are made from high quality stainless steel for corrosion resistance, heat treated for wear resistance, and precision ground for superb accuracy.SUPERIOR QUALITYFirewerks headspace gauges are the original and only coin-style gauges on the market that are made from stainless steel for superior corrosion resistance. Manufactured right here in the USA, Firewerks headspace gauges are precision built and made to last.PRECISION ACCURACYEvery single gauge is precision ground to very tight tolerances with top of the line machines. Then, each gauge is double checked by hand with micrometers before it ever gets packaged and leaves our shop.SIMPLE TO USE!As easy as 1-2-3. These high quality stainless steel Go, No-go, and Field headspace gauges are specially designed so that you don't have to remove the extractor to check your rifle's headspace.EASY TO IDENTIFYEasily identify which gauge is which with the laser etched letter identifiers - \"G\" (go gauge), \"N\" (no-go gauge), \"F\" (field gauge). Now you no longer have to guess what gauge you are looking at.What is Headspace?In simple terms, headspace is the clearance allowed between the base of the cartridge case and the face of the bolt. Too little headspace and the bolt may not function correctly. Too much headspace may cause ruptured cases that can harm the gun and may cause personal injury and/or death. When purchasing a used firearm, it is very important to always check the headspace before firing it - especially surplus military rifles! Military surplus rifles have had thousands of rounds put through them and were often exposed to harsh use. You never know what kind of condition your gun may be in. It's best to play it safe and check the headspace.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IrkEupiUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0088AESY8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.99}}
