{"item_id": "B0088FVZZI", "title": "Solo Stove with Backup Solo Alcohol Burner - Light Weight Wood Burning Backpacking & Camp Stove. Great Survival Camp Stove for Emergency Disaster Preparedness, Bug Out Bags, Preppers, Freeze Dried Food Storage.", "description": "The patented Solo Stove is a woodgas stove that incorporates a secondary combustion for a more efficient and cleaner burn. The bottom vents allow air to enter and flow up the bottom of the grate to feed the primary combustion, a top down smolder. In addition, air entering in from the bottom vents heats up within the inner wall and rises up and out the top firebox vents causing a secondary combustion at the top of the stove. This technique makes for a cleaner burn which means less smoke and also allows the stove to burn more efficiently.Forget the Fuel:Our stoves cook your meals with nothing but the twigs you collect on your journey, eliminating the need for heavy, expensive, polluting petroleum gas. It's easy to light, fast to boil and clean to use.Gasify your Wood:A unique gasification and secondary combustion process lets our stoves achieve a highly efficient and more complete burn. This means you'll use fewer twigs to achieve a boil. It also means less smoke while cooking.Travel Lighter:The Solo Stove only weighs 9 oz and eliminates the need to carry fuel canisters - a great way to lighten your load. It also nests inside most pots leaving you with more space in your pack.Stay Green:By using renewable resources for fuel instead of petroleum, you're reducing your carbon footprint. You'll also keep fuel canisters out of the landfill.Be Prepared:The Solo Stove is great for any emergency situation. You'll be able to cook and will never need to worry about running out of fuel.Solo Stove Alcohol Burner Included", "text": "Solo Stove with Backup Solo Alcohol Burner - Light Weight Wood Burning Backpacking & Camp Stove. Great Survival Camp Stove for Emergency Disaster Preparedness, Bug Out Bags, Preppers, Freeze Dried Food Storage. The patented Solo Stove is a woodgas stove that incorporates a secondary combustion for a more efficient and cleaner burn. The bottom vents allow air to enter and flow up the bottom of the grate to feed the primary combustion, a top down smolder. In addition, air entering in from the bottom vents heats up within the inner wall and rises up and out the top firebox vents causing a secondary combustion at the top of the stove. This technique makes for a cleaner burn which means less smoke and also allows the stove to burn more efficiently.Forget the Fuel:Our stoves cook your meals with nothing but the twigs you collect on your journey, eliminating the need for heavy, expensive, polluting petroleum gas. It's easy to light, fast to boil and clean to use.Gasify your Wood:A unique gasification and secondary combustion process lets our stoves achieve a highly efficient and more complete burn. This means you'll use fewer twigs to achieve a boil. It also means less smoke while cooking.Travel Lighter:The Solo Stove only weighs 9 oz and eliminates the need to carry fuel canisters - a great way to lighten your load. It also nests inside most pots leaving you with more space in your pack.Stay Green:By using renewable resources for fuel instead of petroleum, you're reducing your carbon footprint. You'll also keep fuel canisters out of the landfill.Be Prepared:The Solo Stove is great for any emergency situation. You'll be able to cook and will never need to worry about running out of fuel.Solo Stove Alcohol Burner Included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vYXP5YylL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0088FVZZI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Backpacking Stoves"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B0088HMP9Q", "title": "Spyderco Persistence Blue G-10 Plain Edge Limited", "description": "Limited Edition Persistence with the Blue G-10 handles. Only 2000 were made and are only offered exclusively through JB Outman Distributing. Overall Length: 6 13/16Blade Length: 2 3/4Handle Material: Blue G-10Locking Mechaniam: Liner Lock Blade Material: 8CR13MoV Stainless SteelPocket Clip: 4-Way; Tip-Up/Tip Down; Left/Right Carry", "text": "Spyderco Persistence Blue G-10 Plain Edge Limited Limited Edition Persistence with the Blue G-10 handles. Only 2000 were made and are only offered exclusively through JB Outman Distributing. Overall Length: 6 13/16Blade Length: 2 3/4Handle Material: Blue G-10Locking Mechaniam: Liner Lock Blade Material: 8CR13MoV Stainless SteelPocket Clip: 4-Way; Tip-Up/Tip Down; Left/Right Carry", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-MX9zxqKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0088HMP9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
