{"item_id": "B0088J8BQU", "title": "Primos \"The Original CAN\" Deer Call with Grip Rings", "description": "Estrus Bleats tell bucks that a doe is ready to breed. Whitetail, Blacktail and Mule Deer can all respond quickly and dramatically to the \"quivering\" doe Estrus Bleat produced by \"THE Original CAN\". This is, by far, the best call we know of to call in bucks during the pre-rut, rut and post-rut. Perfect for Whitetail, Blacktail and Mule Deer.", "text": "Primos \"The Original CAN\" Deer Call with Grip Rings Estrus Bleats tell bucks that a doe is ready to breed. Whitetail, Blacktail and Mule Deer can all respond quickly and dramatically to the \"quivering\" doe Estrus Bleat produced by \"THE Original CAN\". This is, by far, the best call we know of to call in bucks during the pre-rut, rut and post-rut. Perfect for Whitetail, Blacktail and Mule Deer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ru3qJ2c1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0088J8BQU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Deer"]], "price": 9.95}}
