{"item_id": "B00891H4BK", "title": "myMAT Your Yoga and Fitness Mat, 1/4-Inch Thick, Black", "description": "myMAT - THE yoga & fitness mat made just for you - your body, your schedule, your fitness, your happiness. Extra thick (1/4-inch) design creates an unstoppable foundation of strength and support. Just say NO to baggage -- Light weight construction won't weigh you down. myMat = ultimate durability and stability, so you can stay focused on your mind, body & spirit (not to mention abs, arms, gams, & glutes!). Work it. Own it. Live it. Name it. myMAT.", "text": "myMAT Your Yoga and Fitness Mat, 1/4-Inch Thick, Black myMAT - THE yoga & fitness mat made just for you - your body, your schedule, your fitness, your happiness. Extra thick (1/4-inch) design creates an unstoppable foundation of strength and support. Just say NO to baggage -- Light weight construction won't weigh you down. myMat = ultimate durability and stability, so you can stay focused on your mind, body & spirit (not to mention abs, arms, gams, & glutes!). Work it. Own it. Live it. Name it. myMAT.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Op4kn-bAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00891H4BK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]]}}
