{"item_id": "B008973E54", "title": "Tactical 45 Degree Off-set Rail Mount - Weaver Style", "description": "Precision Machined From Aircraft-grade Aluminum Alloy with Anodized Black Matte Finish. Robust and User Friendly Ergonomic Quick Detach/Lock Lever Mount, Fully Adjustable to Fit on Any Picatinny Rail. Tight Tolerance Control with Anti-rotation Feature to Guarantee Most Positive and Repeatable Zero and Re-zero Capability.Smart Rail for Versatile Accessory Placement at 45 Degree Angle to Allow for Instant Aiming, Switching Between Iron Sight, Optical Sight, Laser and/or Flashlight.", "text": "Tactical 45 Degree Off-set Rail Mount - Weaver Style Precision Machined From Aircraft-grade Aluminum Alloy with Anodized Black Matte Finish. Robust and User Friendly Ergonomic Quick Detach/Lock Lever Mount, Fully Adjustable to Fit on Any Picatinny Rail. Tight Tolerance Control with Anti-rotation Feature to Guarantee Most Positive and Repeatable Zero and Re-zero Capability.Smart Rail for Versatile Accessory Placement at 45 Degree Angle to Allow for Instant Aiming, Switching Between Iron Sight, Optical Sight, Laser and/or Flashlight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vOsA1WFaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008973E54.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DYZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 9.48}}
{"item_id": "B00897DINM", "title": "AK 47 and Saiga Quick Detachable Double Rail Side Mount", "description": "AK Double Picatinny Rail Side Mount With Quick Detachable/Lock Lever. Fully Adjustable For Most Side Rail Variants. Precision Machined to Fit Most AKs and AK Variants. Easy hook up, install in just seconds/may require taping holes if your model is not equiped with any near mounting surface.", "text": "AK 47 and Saiga Quick Detachable Double Rail Side Mount AK Double Picatinny Rail Side Mount With Quick Detachable/Lock Lever. Fully Adjustable For Most Side Rail Variants. Precision Machined to Fit Most AKs and AK Variants. Easy hook up, install in just seconds/may require taping holes if your model is not equiped with any near mounting surface.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YQUu6oueL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00897DINM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 26.94}}
{"item_id": "B00897H68U", "title": "UTG Discreet Pistol Case for Sub-Compact Pistol and Revolver, Black, Small", "description": "UTG Discreet Pistol Case with Tough Synthetic Material, Well Padded Foam, ConceaLeapersd Stitching and LockabLeapers Zipper Heads for Compact/Sub-Compact Pistols/Revolvers, DoubLeapers Premium Elastics to Hold Handgun and Spare Mag, Firm and Nice Back Support, 5.5-InchX7.5-Inch.", "text": "UTG Discreet Pistol Case for Sub-Compact Pistol and Revolver, Black, Small UTG Discreet Pistol Case with Tough Synthetic Material, Well Padded Foam, ConceaLeapersd Stitching and LockabLeapers Zipper Heads for Compact/Sub-Compact Pistols/Revolvers, DoubLeapers Premium Elastics to Hold Handgun and Spare Mag, Firm and Nice Back Support, 5.5-InchX7.5-Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61xK6SAYnsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00897H68U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 13.3}}
{"item_id": "B00899KT0A", "title": "Hiviz Walther P22 Frnt Sight Intrchg", "description": "HiViz interchangeable, front pistol sight, in the fiber optic family, fits the Walther P22 and the Walther P22Q pistols. The sight height is 0.215 inches, equivalent to the factory #3 front sight. It comes with six fiber optic family Litepipes, red and green. Also includes a Litepipe carry case and an Allen wrench to install the sight. All HiViz products are covered against defects in materials and workmanship for a full year.", "text": "Hiviz Walther P22 Frnt Sight Intrchg HiViz interchangeable, front pistol sight, in the fiber optic family, fits the Walther P22 and the Walther P22Q pistols. The sight height is 0.215 inches, equivalent to the factory #3 front sight. It comes with six fiber optic family Litepipes, red and green. Also includes a Litepipe carry case and an Allen wrench to install the sight. All HiViz products are covered against defects in materials and workmanship for a full year.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oLmYd7YEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00899KT0A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Viz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 28.5}}
{"item_id": "B00899Z95A", "title": "Sure-Pak MRE Meal Case Packs With Flameless Ration Heater-Pack Of 12", "description": "Each Sure-Pak 12 Meal case contains 12 individual meal kits—two each of six menus— which may include vegetarian options. Each meal kit contains an entrée, side dish, dessert item, cracker or wheat bread and spread, beverage powder, and a condiment pack with a spoon, napkin, wet nap, salt, pepper, coffee, creamer and sugar. Sure-Pak 12 menus vary and can include these favorites: Beef Ravioli, Beef Stew, Cheese Omelet with Vegetables, Cheese Tortellini, Chili Macaroni, Grilled Chicken Breast, Chicken with Noodles, Meatloaf with Gravy, Penne Pasta with Veggie Sausage Crumbles, Sloppy Joes, Spaghetti with Meat Sauce, Vegetable Lasagna. This pack includes the flameless Heater. Sure-Pak Meals contain between 900 to 1,250 calories per meal, depending on the entrée and individual components. A minimum of two meals per person per day is recommended for a 72-hour period.", "text": "Sure-Pak MRE Meal Case Packs With Flameless Ration Heater-Pack Of 12 Each Sure-Pak 12 Meal case contains 12 individual meal kits—two each of six menus— which may include vegetarian options. Each meal kit contains an entrée, side dish, dessert item, cracker or wheat bread and spread, beverage powder, and a condiment pack with a spoon, napkin, wet nap, salt, pepper, coffee, creamer and sugar. Sure-Pak 12 menus vary and can include these favorites: Beef Ravioli, Beef Stew, Cheese Omelet with Vegetables, Cheese Tortellini, Chili Macaroni, Grilled Chicken Breast, Chicken with Noodles, Meatloaf with Gravy, Penne Pasta with Veggie Sausage Crumbles, Sloppy Joes, Spaghetti with Meat Sauce, Vegetable Lasagna. This pack includes the flameless Heater. Sure-Pak Meals contain between 900 to 1,250 calories per meal, depending on the entrée and individual components. A minimum of two meals per person per day is recommended for a 72-hour period.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31coy-EFo0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00899Z95A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sure Pak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 90.4}}
