{"item_id": "B0089CHAT0", "title": "Ultralite German Mirror", "description": "This Ultralite German Mirror is imported by Ortlieb USA. Touted by many to be the best touring and commuting mirror available. So here you go. Designed for touring and commuting or just about anytime you need added visibility; the UltraLite Bike Mirror offers versatility; light weight; and durability. At less than 2 ozs., it provides an amazingly wide field of view. Can be mounted almost anywhere you need it on your bike, handlebars of all types as well as forks and challenging applications like recumbents.", "text": "Ultralite German Mirror This Ultralite German Mirror is imported by Ortlieb USA. Touted by many to be the best touring and commuting mirror available. So here you go. Designed for touring and commuting or just about anytime you need added visibility; the UltraLite Bike Mirror offers versatility; light weight; and durability. At less than 2 ozs., it provides an amazingly wide field of view. Can be mounted almost anywhere you need it on your bike, handlebars of all types as well as forks and challenging applications like recumbents.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414RSJGxW-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089CHAT0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 27.49}}
{"item_id": "B0089DFHAI", "title": "Spyderco Chaparral Titanium Plain Edge Knife", "description": "The second installment in the Chaparral series is a serious contender in the gent's knife genre. The titanium handle is sculpted to capture light and create texture in your hand with a diamond, stealth-like pattern. A left-right, tip-up pocket clip and mid-positioned backblock complement the folder and its' CTS XHP leaf shaped, full flat ground blade is Plain Edged for advanced cutting performance.", "text": "Spyderco Chaparral Titanium Plain Edge Knife The second installment in the Chaparral series is a serious contender in the gent's knife genre. The titanium handle is sculpted to capture light and create texture in your hand with a diamond, stealth-like pattern. A left-right, tip-up pocket clip and mid-positioned backblock complement the folder and its' CTS XHP leaf shaped, full flat ground blade is Plain Edged for advanced cutting performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Pi52mInnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089DFHAI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 181.95}}
{"item_id": "B0089DFLSQ", "title": "Spyderco Man Bug British Racing ZDP-189 Plain Edge Knife, Green", "description": "When compared to the Spiders Ladybug, the Man bug is a contrast in gender-related differences. It is thicker and more robust than the thinner, lighter Ladybug. The VG-10 modified clip-point blade is fully flat-ground. Precise alignment of the Spiders Round Hole in relation to the pivot and the backblock, allows for smooth one-hand opening. Clip less.", "text": "Spyderco Man Bug British Racing ZDP-189 Plain Edge Knife, Green When compared to the Spiders Ladybug, the Man bug is a contrast in gender-related differences. It is thicker and more robust than the thinner, lighter Ladybug. The VG-10 modified clip-point blade is fully flat-ground. Precise alignment of the Spiders Round Hole in relation to the pivot and the backblock, allows for smooth one-hand opening. Clip less.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319MiRdLVIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089DFLSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 48.62}}
