{"item_id": "B0089DOLLY", "title": "Asics Men's Core Pocketed Short", "description": "With great colors to choose from, and with just as many great performance features, these could quite well become your favorite shorts. Comes with a 7\" inseam, hand pockets, and a wrinkle-free Hydrology® fabric.", "text": "Asics Men's Core Pocketed Short With great colors to choose from, and with just as many great performance features, these could quite well become your favorite shorts. Comes with a 7\" inseam, hand pockets, and a wrinkle-free Hydrology® fabric.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B4jCrD9BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089DOLLY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0089DOWKO", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Fly Evo Cap", "description": "P.R.O. Softshell Lite provides optimal wind and water protection Adjustable hook and loop closure Silicone prints grip sunglasses Reflective elements for low light visibility Black bill underside protects eyes from the sun's reflection", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Fly Evo Cap P.R.O. Softshell Lite provides optimal wind and water protection Adjustable hook and loop closure Silicone prints grip sunglasses Reflective elements for low light visibility Black bill underside protects eyes from the sun's reflection", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g0V1J4oDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089DOWKO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0089DOZII", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Barrier Skull Cap", "description": "Barrier windproof front panel keeps your forehead shielded from the wind; Barrier fabric's single layer lays next to skin for simpler and more effective function P.R.O. Thermal with Minerale provides optimal warmth, moisture transfer and odor absorbance Ergonomic cut layers easily under a helmet Ponytail compatible Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Barrier Skull Cap Barrier windproof front panel keeps your forehead shielded from the wind; Barrier fabric's single layer lays next to skin for simpler and more effective function P.R.O. Thermal with Minerale provides optimal warmth, moisture transfer and odor absorbance Ergonomic cut layers easily under a helmet Ponytail compatible Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Zn1VBwQPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089DOZII.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearl iZUMi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Skull Caps"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B0089DP04Q", "title": "Pearl Izumi Thermal Skull Cap", "description": "Pearl Izumi Thermal Skull Cap :: P.R.O. Thermal with Minerale™ provides optimal warmth, moisture transfer and odor absorbance. This web exclusive item ships separately within the continental U.S. only. You can count on this item to ship in 3-5 business days!", "text": "Pearl Izumi Thermal Skull Cap Pearl Izumi Thermal Skull Cap :: P.R.O. Thermal with Minerale™ provides optimal warmth, moisture transfer and odor absorbance. This web exclusive item ships separately within the continental U.S. only. You can count on this item to ship in 3-5 business days!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o3tEbwOOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089DP04Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearl iZUMi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Cold Weather Hats"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B0089DP1TU", "title": "Pearl Izumi Thermal Headband", "description": "Pearl Izumi Thermal Headband :: P.R.O. Thermal with Minerale™ provides optimal warmth, moisture transfer and odor absorbance. This web exclusive item ships separately within the continental U.S. only. You can count on this item to ship in 3-5 business days!", "text": "Pearl Izumi Thermal Headband Pearl Izumi Thermal Headband :: P.R.O. Thermal with Minerale™ provides optimal warmth, moisture transfer and odor absorbance. This web exclusive item ships separately within the continental U.S. only. You can count on this item to ship in 3-5 business days!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LYKKKAVuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089DP1TU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearl iZUMi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Cold Weather Hats"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B0089FYE78", "title": "BX-25 Ruger 10/22 Quick and Easy Magazine Loader", "description": "Quick & Easy Loader for NEW Ruger BX-25 10/22 high capacity magazines. A guaranteed super thumb saver! This works with New Ruger Factory high-cap 10/22 mag. This mag loader is fast and easy to use a real thumb saver! With a little practice you'll be loading twice as fast and with out a sore fingers! This thing is simple and easy to use, proven to be tough and reliable, no moving parts keep it simple. You operate it by sliding the Quick Easy Loader over the magazine body and engaging the magazine follower this gives you a hand hold to compress and hold the follower spring as you slide in ammunition. Try one today with a little practice you'll find out why we called it Quick and Easy. Loads of Fun! This is one of the simplest and handiest little devices you may ever stick in your range bag. Gets you loaded fast for more shooting satisfaction.", "text": "BX-25 Ruger 10/22 Quick and Easy Magazine Loader Quick & Easy Loader for NEW Ruger BX-25 10/22 high capacity magazines. A guaranteed super thumb saver! This works with New Ruger Factory high-cap 10/22 mag. This mag loader is fast and easy to use a real thumb saver! With a little practice you'll be loading twice as fast and with out a sore fingers! This thing is simple and easy to use, proven to be tough and reliable, no moving parts keep it simple. You operate it by sliding the Quick Easy Loader over the magazine body and engaging the magazine follower this gives you a hand hold to compress and hold the follower spring as you slide in ammunition. Try one today with a little practice you'll find out why we called it Quick and Easy. Loads of Fun! This is one of the simplest and handiest little devices you may ever stick in your range bag. Gets you loaded fast for more shooting satisfaction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21TrgFrzDLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089FYE78.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B0089FZ9B8", "title": "Tactical Medium Assault Pack 17\" - Heavy Duty 600D Military & Tactical Backpack, Day Pack", "description": "Like all 3V packs and bags, this medium sized functional tactical pack is built to exacting standards using heavy-duty nylon material, reinforced double-stitched nylon seaming, molded nylon buckles, and heavy duty coil zippers. The pack measures 17\" x 10\" x 10\" - compact yet brimming with features. Three external pockets, a large rear velcro pocket, and a spacious main compartment provide maximum storage room for all your gear. This small pack is covered top-to-bottom with MOLLE strips, and both side- and top-mounted compression straps to help stabilize load and keep the pack's potential bulk under control.The main compartment features both a deep mesh zippered pocket and a shallower zippered pocket. The outside of the backpack features a large secondary zippered pocket with extra sleeves and pockets adorning the inside. Two additional smaller pleated pockets are sewn on to the outside of this zippered pocket. The larger of these pleated pockets contains an integrated nylon organizer for pens, a day planner, or a digital device. The rear of the pack also possesses a velcro-sealed sleeve for additional carrying capacity, this hide-away pocket can hold a 72 oz water bladder. The pack also features padded shoulder, sternum straps and adjustable hip belt. A reinforced carry handle is sewn to the top of the pack.Features:* Heavy-duty 600D nylon* Reinforced double-stitched* Molded nylon buckles* Heavy duty coil zippers* Spacious main compartment with two internal zippered pockets* Hydration bladder compatible* Roomy external zippered compartments* Integrated polyester organizer for pens, day planner, or a digital device* Side- and top-mounted compression straps* Adjustable padded shoulder, hip and sternum straps* MOLLE and PALs compatible", "text": "Tactical Medium Assault Pack 17\" - Heavy Duty 600D Military & Tactical Backpack, Day Pack Like all 3V packs and bags, this medium sized functional tactical pack is built to exacting standards using heavy-duty nylon material, reinforced double-stitched nylon seaming, molded nylon buckles, and heavy duty coil zippers. The pack measures 17\" x 10\" x 10\" - compact yet brimming with features. Three external pockets, a large rear velcro pocket, and a spacious main compartment provide maximum storage room for all your gear. This small pack is covered top-to-bottom with MOLLE strips, and both side- and top-mounted compression straps to help stabilize load and keep the pack's potential bulk under control.The main compartment features both a deep mesh zippered pocket and a shallower zippered pocket. The outside of the backpack features a large secondary zippered pocket with extra sleeves and pockets adorning the inside. Two additional smaller pleated pockets are sewn on to the outside of this zippered pocket. The larger of these pleated pockets contains an integrated nylon organizer for pens, a day planner, or a digital device. The rear of the pack also possesses a velcro-sealed sleeve for additional carrying capacity, this hide-away pocket can hold a 72 oz water bladder. The pack also features padded shoulder, sternum straps and adjustable hip belt. A reinforced carry handle is sewn to the top of the pack.Features:* Heavy-duty 600D nylon* Reinforced double-stitched* Molded nylon buckles* Heavy duty coil zippers* Spacious main compartment with two internal zippered pockets* Hydration bladder compatible* Roomy external zippered compartments* Integrated polyester organizer for pens, day planner, or a digital device* Side- and top-mounted compression straps* Adjustable padded shoulder, hip and sternum straps* MOLLE and PALs compatible", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GB0jpC%2BdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089FZ9B8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3V Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 39.97}}
{"item_id": "B0089JOTJ2", "title": "Roswheel Bicycle Frame Pannier and Front Tube Cell Phone Bag", "description": "Material: 600D polyester PU clear PVC .Size: L16CM*W7.5CM*H8.5CM .Color: Green .Packing each on in a poly bag, strong carton out packing .Clear PVC window for phone. U-shaped rear zipper.PE padding for main compartment. Reflective strip both sides.PE plate inside to keep steady. Velcro fasten.", "text": "Roswheel Bicycle Frame Pannier and Front Tube Cell Phone Bag Material: 600D polyester PU clear PVC .Size: L16CM*W7.5CM*H8.5CM .Color: Green .Packing each on in a poly bag, strong carton out packing .Clear PVC window for phone. U-shaped rear zipper.PE padding for main compartment. Reflective strip both sides.PE plate inside to keep steady. Velcro fasten.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413pP5mDmDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089JOTJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Roswheel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 5.49}}
{"item_id": "B0089M363E", "title": "Undead Apocalypse Zombie Fun Kit", "description": "Train for the zombie invasion and keep your skills sharp with the Zombie Fun Kit! Includes four spring powered clear and black airsoft pistols, each with a different colored pistol grip, four, 500-count packages of airsoft BBs, four pairs of safety glasses, sixteen paper zombie targets, four designs, one airsoft target trap that collects BBs for convenient cleanup", "text": "Undead Apocalypse Zombie Fun Kit Train for the zombie invasion and keep your skills sharp with the Zombie Fun Kit! Includes four spring powered clear and black airsoft pistols, each with a different colored pistol grip, four, 500-count packages of airsoft BBs, four pairs of safety glasses, sixteen paper zombie targets, four designs, one airsoft target trap that collects BBs for convenient cleanup", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rAGKMGPvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089M363E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 54.99}}
{"item_id": "B0089M4HLY", "title": "HiMart Side Picatinny Mount for Tactical Flashlight/Laser Surefire Light", "description": "Designed to install a Flashlight or Laser Sight onto the Rifle BarrelSuitable for 25mm Flashlight & Laser Sight Tube mounting needFlashlight Mount can also be installed on standard weaver rail aloneFully adjustable with nuts & screws includedGreat look for attaching onto rifle scope with extra accessories installedComplete solution for Mounting Flashlight & Laser Sight on rifleConstructed of Full Metal Material, extra Strong Shock Absorption abilityMatte Black Finish look so COOL on any rifleWeight: 84.5gRing Diameter: 25mmRail Type: 20mm Weaver Standard RailBuilt Material: Aluminum AlloyColor: Matte BlackIncludes1 x Flashlight Laser Mount Surefire for Gun/Rifle/Shotgun1 x Allen Key1 x HiMart Logo Random Color Ribbon", "text": "HiMart Side Picatinny Mount for Tactical Flashlight/Laser Surefire Light Designed to install a Flashlight or Laser Sight onto the Rifle BarrelSuitable for 25mm Flashlight & Laser Sight Tube mounting needFlashlight Mount can also be installed on standard weaver rail aloneFully adjustable with nuts & screws includedGreat look for attaching onto rifle scope with extra accessories installedComplete solution for Mounting Flashlight & Laser Sight on rifleConstructed of Full Metal Material, extra Strong Shock Absorption abilityMatte Black Finish look so COOL on any rifleWeight: 84.5gRing Diameter: 25mmRail Type: 20mm Weaver Standard RailBuilt Material: Aluminum AlloyColor: Matte BlackIncludes1 x Flashlight Laser Mount Surefire for Gun/Rifle/Shotgun1 x Allen Key1 x HiMart Logo Random Color Ribbon", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lZLF3wqDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089M4HLY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Generic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Rifle Scope Accessories"]], "price": 4.15}}
{"item_id": "B0089O58BU", "title": "Olive Drab Wool Bed Blanket, Genuine U.S. Military Surplus; NSN: 7210-00-282-7950", "description": "Olive drab in color with U.S. in black at center of blanket. Blanket used by U S Army and USMC. Official Military Issued Blanket. \"U.S.\" Printed In Black On Blanket. Fire Retardant. USA Made.", "text": "Olive Drab Wool Bed Blanket, Genuine U.S. Military Surplus; NSN: 7210-00-282-7950 Olive drab in color with U.S. in black at center of blanket. Blanket used by U S Army and USMC. Official Military Issued Blanket. \"U.S.\" Printed In Black On Blanket. Fire Retardant. USA Made.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vuG6GNXDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089O58BU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Blankets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0089OKZ68", "title": "Southern Homewares Portable Car Safe", "description": "Most thieves are opportunists who take a chance when they see items left unattended. This portable steel and aluminium safe offers full protection and peace of mind when on holiday, enjoying a picnic, or even just parking in public places.", "text": "Southern Homewares Portable Car Safe Most thieves are opportunists who take a chance when they see items left unattended. This portable steel and aluminium safe offers full protection and peace of mind when on holiday, enjoying a picnic, or even just parking in public places.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vO1CSCCrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089OKZ68.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Southern Homewares", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 37.78}}
{"item_id": "B0089PWH3G", "title": "Columbia Men's Permit II Short", "description": "Crafted with an incredible collection of (10.) storage pockets, this super-wicking and sun-repelling short dries quickly and artfully stashes your stuff to keep you hands free out on the water.", "text": "Columbia Men's Permit II Short Crafted with an incredible collection of (10.) storage pockets, this super-wicking and sun-repelling short dries quickly and artfully stashes your stuff to keep you hands free out on the water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BnT1qyT7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089PWH3G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0089Q3HOS", "title": "Mil-Spec 550 Paracord Type III MIL-C 5040H (Camo Green, 100 Ft.)", "description": "Manufactured by a Certified US Government Contractor. Made from 100% heavy duty nylon material. 550 lbs. strength tested. 7 strand cord with 3 ply inner strands. 5/32\" (4 mm) in diameter. A must have for any survival kit. Cord is quick drying and also mold, mildew, rot and UV resistant.To be certified for military and government use the paracord must pass rigorous tests of strength, durability, consistency, and quality. This paracord is made of continuous filament nylon with an intricately woven outer sheath and 7 twisted strands of nylon inside. The sheath alone has a break strength of approximately 300 lbs and each of the 7 strands of twisted nylon inside have a break strength of approximately 50lbs (each of these twisted 7 strands are comprised of 3 individual strands). In tests this paracord meets and in many cases well exceeds the 550 lb break strength. This cord is very useful in a survival situation because the many parts make it very versatile and its overall strength is unbeatable for its size. It is easy to cut and splice back together by melting to form different shapes and lengths. The outer sheath is very resistant to abrasion which makes the cord very reliable even under harsh conditions.Uses for this cord include: Survival Kits, Tie Lines, Securing Equipment, Shoelaces, Hanging Food from Bears, Vehicle Tie Downs, Repairing Equipment, Handle Wraps, Making a Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String for a Bow, Making a Shelter, Trail Markers, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares, Clothes Lines, Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, Bracelets, & Other Paracord Crafts.", "text": "Mil-Spec 550 Paracord Type III MIL-C 5040H (Camo Green, 100 Ft.) Manufactured by a Certified US Government Contractor. Made from 100% heavy duty nylon material. 550 lbs. strength tested. 7 strand cord with 3 ply inner strands. 5/32\" (4 mm) in diameter. A must have for any survival kit. Cord is quick drying and also mold, mildew, rot and UV resistant.To be certified for military and government use the paracord must pass rigorous tests of strength, durability, consistency, and quality. This paracord is made of continuous filament nylon with an intricately woven outer sheath and 7 twisted strands of nylon inside. The sheath alone has a break strength of approximately 300 lbs and each of the 7 strands of twisted nylon inside have a break strength of approximately 50lbs (each of these twisted 7 strands are comprised of 3 individual strands). In tests this paracord meets and in many cases well exceeds the 550 lb break strength. This cord is very useful in a survival situation because the many parts make it very versatile and its overall strength is unbeatable for its size. It is easy to cut and splice back together by melting to form different shapes and lengths. The outer sheath is very resistant to abrasion which makes the cord very reliable even under harsh conditions.Uses for this cord include: Survival Kits, Tie Lines, Securing Equipment, Shoelaces, Hanging Food from Bears, Vehicle Tie Downs, Repairing Equipment, Handle Wraps, Making a Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String for a Bow, Making a Shelter, Trail Markers, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares, Clothes Lines, Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, Bracelets, & Other Paracord Crafts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417Yo1BJSPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089Q3HOS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0089RFQB4", "title": "Cornhole Bags (Set of 8) by SC Cornhole (Choose Your Colors)", "description": "Since 2005, SC Cornhole has been the leader in quality cornhole gear online. We have been selling the all weather cornhole bag for over 6 years. The bags are made to the ACA specifications, but instead of corn, they are filled with plastic pellets. This makes the bags weather resistant, critter resistant, and means the contents of the bags won't break down. We have sold hundreds of thousands of these bags and they are a favorite of our customers because it mimics the feel of a cornhole bag, while having the benefits of a weather resistant bag.", "text": "Cornhole Bags (Set of 8) by SC Cornhole (Choose Your Colors) Since 2005, SC Cornhole has been the leader in quality cornhole gear online. We have been selling the all weather cornhole bag for over 6 years. The bags are made to the ACA specifications, but instead of corn, they are filled with plastic pellets. This makes the bags weather resistant, critter resistant, and means the contents of the bags won't break down. We have sold hundreds of thousands of these bags and they are a favorite of our customers because it mimics the feel of a cornhole bag, while having the benefits of a weather resistant bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xflQKuuWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089RFQB4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games", "Cornhole", "Cornhole Bags"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B0089SI412", "title": "Burketek Pocket Wrench II Set", "description": "The original Pocketwrench II has multiple functions, fits in multi-tool sheath or small enough to fit on a key ring. Made of 400 series high-carbon stailess steel (sugical grade) which is then heat treated and tempered for maxiumum durability, and then polished to a fine, lustrous, brushed finish. Grips both inch or metric sizes, helx or square nuts, anything that fits in the opening.", "text": "Burketek Pocket Wrench II Set The original Pocketwrench II has multiple functions, fits in multi-tool sheath or small enough to fit on a key ring. Made of 400 series high-carbon stailess steel (sugical grade) which is then heat treated and tempered for maxiumum durability, and then polished to a fine, lustrous, brushed finish. Grips both inch or metric sizes, helx or square nuts, anything that fits in the opening.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31C9DKlcNwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089SI412.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burketek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 16.0}}
{"item_id": "B0089SZKQE", "title": "StoveTec Deluxe 1 Door Stove (Wood & Biomass Fuel Options)", "description": "The Deluxe Refractory Metal Lined One Door Stove protects the ceramic insulated combustion chamber, increasing long lasting stove life and improving combustion efficiency. Reinforced door frame stick support attachment guides hold the improved stick support in place outside the combustion chamber. The deluxe metal lined ceramic one door stove burns any available wood or flammable biomass. The large one door stove opening provides versatility for burning anything from palm fronds to coconut shells, or other irregular shaped biomass. One door stoves are ideal to make charcoal from wood, as a soil amendment for your garden. A metal stick support fixed to the one door frame opening allows wood or biomass to be slid into the flame and provides ventilation along the floor of the combustion chamber. The vertical section of the combustion chamber is 10cm in diameter and forces the gases to mix with the flame, decreasing harmful emissions. The stove comes with a cast iron stove top and adjustable galvanized metal skirt that increase heat transfer efficiency to the pot. Dimensions: Stove: D-10 3/4 in H-11 1/2 in Door: W-4 1/2 in H-4 1/4 in Features • Refractory metal lined combustion chamber • Lightweight ceramic combustion chamber • Double thick cast iron stove top with 6 pot supports • Adjustable galvanized steel pot skirt • Stick support with door frame attachment guides • Painted sheet metal body with reinforced door frame • Double layered kiln-fired combustion chamber floor tiles • Heat resistant plastic and steel handles Free FedEx Home Delivery Shipping inside Continental US, excluding Alaska, Hawaii, & Puerto Rico. Hawaii & Alaska, & Puerto Rico customers pay an additional $50.00 USPS shipping. Call for all International shipping quotes: 541-741-4108 Pacific Time Zone, additional USPS charges are applicable and processed only through our StoveTec Warehouse. StoveTec 3400 Franklin Blvd Eugene, OR 97405 541-741-4108 Pacific Time Zone", "text": "StoveTec Deluxe 1 Door Stove (Wood & Biomass Fuel Options) The Deluxe Refractory Metal Lined One Door Stove protects the ceramic insulated combustion chamber, increasing long lasting stove life and improving combustion efficiency. Reinforced door frame stick support attachment guides hold the improved stick support in place outside the combustion chamber. The deluxe metal lined ceramic one door stove burns any available wood or flammable biomass. The large one door stove opening provides versatility for burning anything from palm fronds to coconut shells, or other irregular shaped biomass. One door stoves are ideal to make charcoal from wood, as a soil amendment for your garden. A metal stick support fixed to the one door frame opening allows wood or biomass to be slid into the flame and provides ventilation along the floor of the combustion chamber. The vertical section of the combustion chamber is 10cm in diameter and forces the gases to mix with the flame, decreasing harmful emissions. The stove comes with a cast iron stove top and adjustable galvanized metal skirt that increase heat transfer efficiency to the pot. Dimensions: Stove: D-10 3/4 in H-11 1/2 in Door: W-4 1/2 in H-4 1/4 in Features • Refractory metal lined combustion chamber • Lightweight ceramic combustion chamber • Double thick cast iron stove top with 6 pot supports • Adjustable galvanized steel pot skirt • Stick support with door frame attachment guides • Painted sheet metal body with reinforced door frame • Double layered kiln-fired combustion chamber floor tiles • Heat resistant plastic and steel handles Free FedEx Home Delivery Shipping inside Continental US, excluding Alaska, Hawaii, & Puerto Rico. Hawaii & Alaska, & Puerto Rico customers pay an additional $50.00 USPS shipping. Call for all International shipping quotes: 541-741-4108 Pacific Time Zone, additional USPS charges are applicable and processed only through our StoveTec Warehouse. StoveTec 3400 Franklin Blvd Eugene, OR 97405 541-741-4108 Pacific Time Zone", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q1hNCdVdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089SZKQE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 114.95}}
