{"item_id": "B0089YI8AI", "title": "Push-Up Pump", "description": "The Push Up Pump was developed to solve a serious quandary in the exercise world, Most people are simply unable to do pushups Pushups provide an excellent full body workout that combines cardio with muscle building, yet many of us can barely do a singe pushup This is where the brilliance of the Push Up Pump comes in. This system allows you to enjoy the benefits of pushups without straining your back or falling on your face. The pump's unique design supports your body while you lift so that you can execute numerous types of pushups and planks to target your core muscle groups including: Biceps, triceps, oblique's, chest, shoulders and even back. This system can also help you achieve those rock hard abs that you've always wanted With 1000s of satisfied customers, the Push Up Pump is guaranteed to pump your workout to the next level .", "text": "Push-Up Pump The Push Up Pump was developed to solve a serious quandary in the exercise world, Most people are simply unable to do pushups Pushups provide an excellent full body workout that combines cardio with muscle building, yet many of us can barely do a singe pushup This is where the brilliance of the Push Up Pump comes in. This system allows you to enjoy the benefits of pushups without straining your back or falling on your face. The pump's unique design supports your body while you lift so that you can execute numerous types of pushups and planks to target your core muscle groups including: Biceps, triceps, oblique's, chest, shoulders and even back. This system can also help you achieve those rock hard abs that you've always wanted With 1000s of satisfied customers, the Push Up Pump is guaranteed to pump your workout to the next level .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414kZMoTfWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089YI8AI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pushup Stands"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B0089YV15W", "title": "Wilson A1010S Official High School Leather Blem Baseballs (Dozen)", "description": "Wilson has become the undisputed ruler of sporting goods, with awesome gear for every athlete no matter their game. Everything they make recieves the same intensive craftsmanship and dedication to superior quality, however sometimes a product doesn't come out as pretty as their demanding standards require. \"Blems\" as they are called, have slight cosmetic blemishes which have no impact on performance. Wilson sells these products off at a huge discount, and that means some incredible savings for you! These balls hit just like regulation baseballs, making them excellent for practice or even just playing catch in the back yard. Jump on this amazing deal before they're all gone!Features: Professional Quality Baseball Very Minor Blemish, Great Practice Ball Model A1010 High raised seams Premium grade full grain leather cover Premium quality wool windings Red cushioned cork center Model No: WTA1010S Quanitity: 12 Size: Official High school size and weight Color: White & Red Condition: Brand New (Blem) MSRP: $69.99", "text": "Wilson A1010S Official High School Leather Blem Baseballs (Dozen) Wilson has become the undisputed ruler of sporting goods, with awesome gear for every athlete no matter their game. Everything they make recieves the same intensive craftsmanship and dedication to superior quality, however sometimes a product doesn't come out as pretty as their demanding standards require. \"Blems\" as they are called, have slight cosmetic blemishes which have no impact on performance. Wilson sells these products off at a huge discount, and that means some incredible savings for you! These balls hit just like regulation baseballs, making them excellent for practice or even just playing catch in the back yard. Jump on this amazing deal before they're all gone!Features: Professional Quality Baseball Very Minor Blemish, Great Practice Ball Model A1010 High raised seams Premium grade full grain leather cover Premium quality wool windings Red cushioned cork center Model No: WTA1010S Quanitity: 12 Size: Official High school size and weight Color: White & Red Condition: Brand New (Blem) MSRP: $69.99", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414MmGnaZdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089YV15W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wilson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Baseballs"]], "price": 36.5}}
{"item_id": "B0089ZTVGM", "title": "EXPLORER TACTICAL ASSAULT MILITARY BACKPACK", "description": "This heavy duty backpack has one large compartment, six pockets, and three handles, making it a great backpack for storing and organizing your stuff. It also has one hydration water bladder pocket. The two back straps are padded and adjustable, and can be hidden inside. M.O.L.L.E straps on front and bottom allow for endless carry possibilities. This backpack can even expand an additional 3 inches, if you happen to have filled it to the brim. This is a high quality backpack well suited for all of your weekend excursions, airsoft or paintball gear or as a 72 Hour Go pack. Available in Black only. Features: * Hydration compatible * Adjustable compression straps * Adjustable sternum and waist straps * Padded adjustable shoulder straps * Durable 600D polyester * Mesh internal zippered pocket * 3 Handles and 6 Pockets * Expands 3\" * Front Pockets, 2 Left and Right Pockets * Shoulder straps and belt can be hidden * MOLLE strap and PALS compatible * Size: 20\" x 11.5\" x 11\" * Main compartment dimensions: 20\" H x 11.5\" W x 6\" D * Side pockets, two on each side: 5\" H x 5\" W x 1\" D * Front pockets: Top 8\" H x 4\" W x 2\" D & Bottom 9\"H x 9\"W x 3\" D", "text": "EXPLORER TACTICAL ASSAULT MILITARY BACKPACK This heavy duty backpack has one large compartment, six pockets, and three handles, making it a great backpack for storing and organizing your stuff. It also has one hydration water bladder pocket. The two back straps are padded and adjustable, and can be hidden inside. M.O.L.L.E straps on front and bottom allow for endless carry possibilities. This backpack can even expand an additional 3 inches, if you happen to have filled it to the brim. This is a high quality backpack well suited for all of your weekend excursions, airsoft or paintball gear or as a 72 Hour Go pack. Available in Black only. Features: * Hydration compatible * Adjustable compression straps * Adjustable sternum and waist straps * Padded adjustable shoulder straps * Durable 600D polyester * Mesh internal zippered pocket * 3 Handles and 6 Pockets * Expands 3\" * Front Pockets, 2 Left and Right Pockets * Shoulder straps and belt can be hidden * MOLLE strap and PALS compatible * Size: 20\" x 11.5\" x 11\" * Main compartment dimensions: 20\" H x 11.5\" W x 6\" D * Side pockets, two on each side: 5\" H x 5\" W x 1\" D * Front pockets: Top 8\" H x 4\" W x 2\" D & Bottom 9\"H x 9\"W x 3\" D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YK8CXRf6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0089ZTVGM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Explorer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 46.48}}
{"item_id": "B008A4LEI0", "title": "Troy Battle Rail Cover (Pack of 3)", "description": "Troy Rail Covers are engineered to survive the most extreme conditions. Constructed from durable, heat & chemical resistant synthetic polymer resin, the Troy Rail Cover quickly and easily slides onto a 1913 Picatinny Rail and locks into place with a built-in retaining clip. Scientifically engineered and proven to reduce heat transfer and abrasions to the operator's hand. No tools required.- Patent Pending. Made in the U.S.A.- Black- 3 Pack.", "text": "Troy Battle Rail Cover (Pack of 3) Troy Rail Covers are engineered to survive the most extreme conditions. Constructed from durable, heat & chemical resistant synthetic polymer resin, the Troy Rail Cover quickly and easily slides onto a 1913 Picatinny Rail and locks into place with a built-in retaining clip. Scientifically engineered and proven to reduce heat transfer and abrasions to the operator's hand. No tools required.- Patent Pending. Made in the U.S.A.- Black- 3 Pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31m57hY52uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008A4LEI0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Tools & Accessories", "Rails"]], "price": 20.0}}
{"item_id": "B008A7SOH6", "title": "Talon S&W Shield Taurus PT709 9/40 IWB Holster", "description": "Talon Holsters are designed by professional Law Enforcement Officers who have dedicated themselves to providing citizens with firearms instruction, a place to shoot and a quality concealed carry holster. Made in the USA, our holsters offer a ton of possibilities. If a holster is not simple, comfortable, and easy to put on and take off, you probably won?t wear it. Our IWB holsters are designed in two types, the thicker guns like Glocks will have the ?Stay Open Top? with a steel cable in the top band to hold the mouth of the holster open when reholstering. The XD, Glock and a couple of others feature this. The thinner guns like 1911?s and most all small guns don?t seem to need this. The double leather top keeps the holster open and safe for single hand holstering. Cheap nylon holsters are out, they are junk. Polymer seems to wear the finish off your pistol. Complicated wrap around holsters are not our style. We keep things simple, easy and traditional. Check out demo videos on YouTube by searching for TalonHolsters or Talon Training Group. These are really nice quality and the career law enforcement officers who own the company have spent a lot of time developing them. All our holsters are made in the USA and are constructed exclusively of Hermann Oak Leather, and made from US Steers. Hermann Oak Leather Company supplies our leather and has been in business since 1881. Nothing foreign touches our holsters. Grown, tanned, constructed and delivered to and from the USA. These are vegetable tanned and dyed with a water based dye so nothing will harm the firearm. Most holsters are made from leather tanned using a chromium based process. Not ours. Designed by our instructors at Talon Training, and tried and tested to ensure you are getting the best there is, we stand behind our holsters. Our NO-Bull warranty guarantees that if you don't like it, send it back for a full refund. If it breaks, ever, we will replace it. (Routine age and wear, is normal, of course.) See", "text": "Talon S&W Shield Taurus PT709 9/40 IWB Holster Talon Holsters are designed by professional Law Enforcement Officers who have dedicated themselves to providing citizens with firearms instruction, a place to shoot and a quality concealed carry holster. Made in the USA, our holsters offer a ton of possibilities. If a holster is not simple, comfortable, and easy to put on and take off, you probably won?t wear it. Our IWB holsters are designed in two types, the thicker guns like Glocks will have the ?Stay Open Top? with a steel cable in the top band to hold the mouth of the holster open when reholstering. The XD, Glock and a couple of others feature this. The thinner guns like 1911?s and most all small guns don?t seem to need this. The double leather top keeps the holster open and safe for single hand holstering. Cheap nylon holsters are out, they are junk. Polymer seems to wear the finish off your pistol. Complicated wrap around holsters are not our style. We keep things simple, easy and traditional. Check out demo videos on YouTube by searching for TalonHolsters or Talon Training Group. These are really nice quality and the career law enforcement officers who own the company have spent a lot of time developing them. All our holsters are made in the USA and are constructed exclusively of Hermann Oak Leather, and made from US Steers. Hermann Oak Leather Company supplies our leather and has been in business since 1881. Nothing foreign touches our holsters. Grown, tanned, constructed and delivered to and from the USA. These are vegetable tanned and dyed with a water based dye so nothing will harm the firearm. Most holsters are made from leather tanned using a chromium based process. Not ours. Designed by our instructors at Talon Training, and tried and tested to ensure you are getting the best there is, we stand behind our holsters. Our NO-Bull warranty guarantees that if you don't like it, send it back for a full refund. If it breaks, ever, we will replace it. (Routine age and wear, is normal, of course.) See", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411vZ78zR9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008A7SOH6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B008A7TUL0", "title": "Premium EZGO TXT Golf Cart Headlight - LED Tail Light Kit", "description": "This high quality headlight and tail light kit is recessed in the body for a clean sleek look. The \"King\" only sells premium light kits and backs it with 100% satisfaction guarantee. Everything needed to install this light kit is included in one box. Our kits are always in stock and ship out quickly. Feel free to call us if you have any questions.", "text": "Premium EZGO TXT Golf Cart Headlight - LED Tail Light Kit This high quality headlight and tail light kit is recessed in the body for a clean sleek look. The \"King\" only sells premium light kits and backs it with 100% satisfaction guarantee. Everything needed to install this light kit is included in one box. Our kits are always in stock and ship out quickly. Feel free to call us if you have any questions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q1A8P4rZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008A7TUL0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Golf Cart King", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Cart Accessories"]], "price": 61.0}}
{"item_id": "B008ABWZ72", "title": "Emergency Survival 72 Hour Bugout Bag Bug Out Bag with Fox Tactical Field Operator's Action Pack Black with MRE Star MRE, SOS Food Lab 2400 calorie bars, emergency drinking water, flashlight, magnesium firestarter, emergency blanket, emergency poncho, double palm work gloves, N95 masks, wetnaps and more", "description": "This Survival Bag provides food, water and basic supplies for one person for 72 hours. The Basic Survival Bag includes: FOX Tactical Field Operator's Action Pack (Black): 22\" x 16\" x 9\". Food/Water: 2 2400 Calorie Food Bar Packets by SOS Food Lab-Made in USA/U.S. Coast Guard Approved. Each packet contains six (6) fortified bars (400 calories each); 2 MRE Star Ready to Eat Meals w/ Flameless Heaters emergency food (MREs)-Made in USA; 18 4.22 ounces drinking water packets by SOS Food Lab-Made in USA/U.S. Coast Guard Approved. Shelter/Warmth/Safety: Magnesium Fire Starter; Emergency Poncho; Emergency Blanket; Two Pairs of Disposable Hand Warmers; Super Bright 19-LED Flashlight with batteries & case; pair Heavy-Duty Work Gloves Sanitation/Hygiene: Three (3) N95 Particulate Respirator Mask; toothbrush with toothpaste; toilet paper & tissue; body/bath shampoo; package Shower-in-a-Bag (8 cloths); 12 wet naps (also can be used as fire starters); 2 sanitary pads (also can be used to stop bleeding). Also included is 100 Feet of Gladding Paracord. 2012 72 Hour Survival Bugout Bug Out Doomsday Prepper Emergency Bag Zombie Kit. We reserve the right to substitute items of equal or greater value", "text": "Emergency Survival 72 Hour Bugout Bag Bug Out Bag with Fox Tactical Field Operator's Action Pack Black with MRE Star MRE, SOS Food Lab 2400 calorie bars, emergency drinking water, flashlight, magnesium firestarter, emergency blanket, emergency poncho, double palm work gloves, N95 masks, wetnaps and more This Survival Bag provides food, water and basic supplies for one person for 72 hours. The Basic Survival Bag includes: FOX Tactical Field Operator's Action Pack (Black): 22\" x 16\" x 9\". Food/Water: 2 2400 Calorie Food Bar Packets by SOS Food Lab-Made in USA/U.S. Coast Guard Approved. Each packet contains six (6) fortified bars (400 calories each); 2 MRE Star Ready to Eat Meals w/ Flameless Heaters emergency food (MREs)-Made in USA; 18 4.22 ounces drinking water packets by SOS Food Lab-Made in USA/U.S. Coast Guard Approved. Shelter/Warmth/Safety: Magnesium Fire Starter; Emergency Poncho; Emergency Blanket; Two Pairs of Disposable Hand Warmers; Super Bright 19-LED Flashlight with batteries & case; pair Heavy-Duty Work Gloves Sanitation/Hygiene: Three (3) N95 Particulate Respirator Mask; toothbrush with toothpaste; toilet paper & tissue; body/bath shampoo; package Shower-in-a-Bag (8 cloths); 12 wet naps (also can be used as fire starters); 2 sanitary pads (also can be used to stop bleeding). Also included is 100 Feet of Gladding Paracord. 2012 72 Hour Survival Bugout Bug Out Doomsday Prepper Emergency Bag Zombie Kit. We reserve the right to substitute items of equal or greater value", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31r5k06Wt6L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008ABWZ72.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 169.0}}
