{"item_id": "B008ALO5DO", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical New Generation Anodized Aluminum USA Made AR15 AR-15 AR-10 M4 M-4 .223 5.56 SR-25 Rifle Oversized Extended Latch For Charging Handle", "description": "The Ultimate Arms Gear anodized aluminum tactical latch is an extended charging handle latch and was developed to allow the rapid operation of charging handles with the right or left hand, gloves, wet, mud and snow or ice. This is perfect for a flat top AR-15, M16, or M4 series rifles which utilize a scope and limit access to the charging handle. It replaces the standard latch on your charging handle. Only one pin to punch out and replace. Easy installation.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical New Generation Anodized Aluminum USA Made AR15 AR-15 AR-10 M4 M-4 .223 5.56 SR-25 Rifle Oversized Extended Latch For Charging Handle The Ultimate Arms Gear anodized aluminum tactical latch is an extended charging handle latch and was developed to allow the rapid operation of charging handles with the right or left hand, gloves, wet, mud and snow or ice. This is perfect for a flat top AR-15, M16, or M4 series rifles which utilize a scope and limit access to the charging handle. It replaces the standard latch on your charging handle. Only one pin to punch out and replace. Easy installation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418Y8uoD11L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008ALO5DO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B008AP02L4", "title": "New Balance Men's 5-Inch Go 2 Shorts", "description": "No shortage of New Balance technology in the 5” Go 2 Short. With open side seam pockets, front and back reflectivity and internal crepe brief, the breathable Lightning Dry fabric wicks moisture away from your body almost faster than you can sweat.", "text": "New Balance Men's 5-Inch Go 2 Shorts No shortage of New Balance technology in the 5” Go 2 Short. With open side seam pockets, front and back reflectivity and internal crepe brief, the breathable Lightning Dry fabric wicks moisture away from your body almost faster than you can sweat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gXN0Q6JDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008AP02L4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008AP09XA", "title": "New Balance Men's 7-Inch Go 2 Shorts", "description": "No shortage of New Balance technology in the 7” Go 2 Short. With open side seam pockets, front and back reflectivity and internal crepe brief, the breathable Lightning Dry fabric wicks moisture away from your body almost faster than you can sweat.", "text": "New Balance Men's 7-Inch Go 2 Shorts No shortage of New Balance technology in the 7” Go 2 Short. With open side seam pockets, front and back reflectivity and internal crepe brief, the breathable Lightning Dry fabric wicks moisture away from your body almost faster than you can sweat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41svIHfcIjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008AP09XA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts"]], "price": 32.0}}
{"item_id": "B008AXE2S0", "title": "Legendary Whitetails Men's Realtree Camo Outfitter Hoodie", "description": "Ultimate comfort has been taken to the next level with this heavyweight hoodie featuring Realtree AP camo accents. No need to rip that tight neck opening, we've done it for you by engineering in a casual v-neck to provide extra comfort. Might become the new standard for hoodies! Imported.(Talls: Add 2\" in body length and 1 \" in sleeve length)", "text": "Legendary Whitetails Men's Realtree Camo Outfitter Hoodie Ultimate comfort has been taken to the next level with this heavyweight hoodie featuring Realtree AP camo accents. No need to rip that tight neck opening, we've done it for you by engineering in a casual v-neck to provide extra comfort. Might become the new standard for hoodies! Imported.(Talls: Add 2\" in body length and 1 \" in sleeve length)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519nBFPZ9TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008AXE2S0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]]}}
