{"item_id": "B008AYAIAU", "title": "Global Sportsman Tactical Combat Military 2-Piece AR15 AR-15 M4 Carbine Rifle Quad 4-Weaver/Picatinny Rail Aluminum Handguard", "description": "Official Global Sportsman Product, Brand new. Replaces your existing Ar-15, M4 Carbine Rifle HAndguards. Provides 4-Weaver/Picatinny rails to allow use of Lights-lasers-grips-Bipods-Sights with a weaver/Picatinny base. Easy 2pc Installation. Lightweight Aluminum Construction. Precision Machined. Black Anondized. Heavy Duty Premium Weapon Accessories.", "text": "Global Sportsman Tactical Combat Military 2-Piece AR15 AR-15 M4 Carbine Rifle Quad 4-Weaver/Picatinny Rail Aluminum Handguard Official Global Sportsman Product, Brand new. Replaces your existing Ar-15, M4 Carbine Rifle HAndguards. Provides 4-Weaver/Picatinny rails to allow use of Lights-lasers-grips-Bipods-Sights with a weaver/Picatinny base. Easy 2pc Installation. Lightweight Aluminum Construction. Precision Machined. Black Anondized. Heavy Duty Premium Weapon Accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31r9pz%2B570L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008AYAIAU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GS-Global Sportsman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Rails"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B008AYNVFY", "title": "Heavy-Duty Stainless Steel Camping Mirror - Personal Use, Emergency Signaling", "description": "", "text": "Heavy-Duty Stainless Steel Camping Mirror - Personal Use, Emergency Signaling", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31h6%2BCzkkLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008AYNVFY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camping Tools", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Showers"]], "price": 5.56}}
{"item_id": "B008B0K73Q", "title": "TEK-LOK Glock 10/45 Single Magazine Pouch", "description": "Our proprietary blend (secret formula) of polymers will provide you with a lifetime of performance. The secret formula holds up in extreme heat and doesn't become fragile in low temperatures. When your magazine is inserted into your pouch you will have positive retention peace of mind knowing you mag is secure. Retention screws can be tightened or loosened to your personal preference. TEK-LOK mag pouches have a low profile for easy indexing and faster reloads. Secure one to your belt today includes the easy fitting and innovative Positive Latching System \"TEK-LOK\".", "text": "TEK-LOK Glock 10/45 Single Magazine Pouch Our proprietary blend (secret formula) of polymers will provide you with a lifetime of performance. The secret formula holds up in extreme heat and doesn't become fragile in low temperatures. When your magazine is inserted into your pouch you will have positive retention peace of mind knowing you mag is secure. Retention screws can be tightened or loosened to your personal preference. TEK-LOK mag pouches have a low profile for easy indexing and faster reloads. Secure one to your belt today includes the easy fitting and innovative Positive Latching System \"TEK-LOK\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21vgQXWUtaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008B0K73Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008B3GXVI", "title": "Lee Precision Bench Plate Now with Steel Base Block", "description": "Lee Bench Plate allows for quick press removal without unbolting from bench. Includes 3 base blocks; one drilled to fit all current Lee metallic presses. Special elevator bolt hardware included. Powder coated, thick steel mounts quickly and securely to any bench or tabletop. Wide steel plate distributes load, adding rigidity to the lightest bench top.", "text": "Lee Precision Bench Plate Now with Steel Base Block Lee Bench Plate allows for quick press removal without unbolting from bench. Includes 3 base blocks; one drilled to fit all current Lee metallic presses. Special elevator bolt hardware included. Powder coated, thick steel mounts quickly and securely to any bench or tabletop. Wide steel plate distributes load, adding rigidity to the lightest bench top.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cs2hubDvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008B3GXVI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 26.39}}
{"item_id": "B008B7AXJC", "title": "Wheeler Delta Series AR-15 Mag Well Vise Block", "description": "The Delta Series AR-15 Mag Well Vise Block is quite possibly the handiest tool an AR-15 owner could ask for. Designed for use with the Tipton Best Gun ViseTM, this center support slides into the magazine well and provides a steady base for cleaning or light gunsmithing on your AR-15, in either breech or closed position. Users without a Best Gun Vise can mount the Mag Well Vise Block directly to their bench top with the included fasteners. Loaded with handy features, this tool is a must have for anyone with an AR-15.", "text": "Wheeler Delta Series AR-15 Mag Well Vise Block The Delta Series AR-15 Mag Well Vise Block is quite possibly the handiest tool an AR-15 owner could ask for. Designed for use with the Tipton Best Gun ViseTM, this center support slides into the magazine well and provides a steady base for cleaning or light gunsmithing on your AR-15, in either breech or closed position. Users without a Best Gun Vise can mount the Mag Well Vise Block directly to their bench top with the included fasteners. Loaded with handy features, this tool is a must have for anyone with an AR-15.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41p9y6XRqvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008B7AXJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Delta Children&#39;s Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 21.49}}
{"item_id": "B008B91KGU", "title": "Elevation 2.0 Training Mask, Small", "description": "Training Mask 2.0 has been a work in progress for over 2 years. Training Mask 2.0 gives the end user a redesigned look and feel along with the resistance levels that they desire. Elevation Training Mask mimics the effects of High Altitude Training. When elite athletes want to improve their performance they go to high altitude levels to train. When they come back to sea level they perform much stronger, faster and have increased endurance. Training Mask 2.0 makes your work out more efficient allowing you to take your work out from 60 minutes to 20 minutes. From the average daily walker to the marathon runner, Training Mask 2.0 appeals to every athlete who wants to improve their overall health and performance.", "text": "Elevation 2.0 Training Mask, Small Training Mask 2.0 has been a work in progress for over 2 years. Training Mask 2.0 gives the end user a redesigned look and feel along with the resistance levels that they desire. Elevation Training Mask mimics the effects of High Altitude Training. When elite athletes want to improve their performance they go to high altitude levels to train. When they come back to sea level they perform much stronger, faster and have increased endurance. Training Mask 2.0 makes your work out more efficient allowing you to take your work out from 60 minutes to 20 minutes. From the average daily walker to the marathon runner, Training Mask 2.0 appeals to every athlete who wants to improve their overall health and performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a-OIpytHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008B91KGU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elevation", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Fencing", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B008B9D0AO", "title": "Women's Spandex Exercise Compression Workout Shorts", "description": "Aero Tech Designs' classic compression short. Ideal for exercise, the two-panel design allows the tricot knit microfiber to hug and compress your muscles during exertion. Why compression? Proper fitting spandex/nylon activewear increases blood circulation which oxidizes the muscles during exercise. More oxygen, in turn, will reduce the buildup of painful lactic acid. Muscle fatigue is reduced and your body's performance is increased. Post-workout, increased blood flow helps heal muscles and limit delayed onset muscle soreness (DOMS). Compression shorts will feel like your second skin and we guarantee that our full product line will provide years of functionality, support, and performance-enhancing comfort. Composition: 84% nylon/16% spandex four-way stretch tricot knit fabric; 3/4 inch elastic waist; smooth flatlock seams to prevent chafing. Five color choices in regular and plus sizes. Machine wash and air dry. All shorts are made in the USA.", "text": "Women's Spandex Exercise Compression Workout Shorts Aero Tech Designs' classic compression short. Ideal for exercise, the two-panel design allows the tricot knit microfiber to hug and compress your muscles during exertion. Why compression? Proper fitting spandex/nylon activewear increases blood circulation which oxidizes the muscles during exercise. More oxygen, in turn, will reduce the buildup of painful lactic acid. Muscle fatigue is reduced and your body's performance is increased. Post-workout, increased blood flow helps heal muscles and limit delayed onset muscle soreness (DOMS). Compression shorts will feel like your second skin and we guarantee that our full product line will provide years of functionality, support, and performance-enhancing comfort. Composition: 84% nylon/16% spandex four-way stretch tricot knit fabric; 3/4 inch elastic waist; smooth flatlock seams to prevent chafing. Five color choices in regular and plus sizes. Machine wash and air dry. All shorts are made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kT8A%2B2HGL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008B9D0AO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Shorts", "Workout Shorts"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B008BAKDKS", "title": "Euro-Cuisine R11020 Yogurt Starter", "description": "Euro-Cuisine RI1020 Yogurt Starter. Substitutes for plain yogurt in the cooking process. Get \"cultured\" by creating your own healthful yogurt at home with this Yogurt Starter mix. Precisely balanced to make smooth, creamy yogurt every time. In the mix: Contains ten 5-gram packs; Ingredients include skim milk powder, sucrose, ascorbic acid and lactic bacteria; Can be used in place of plain yogurt during cooking process; Includes instructions; Made in Canada.; Order yours today! Euro-Cuisine R11020 Yogurt Starter", "text": "Euro-Cuisine R11020 Yogurt Starter Euro-Cuisine RI1020 Yogurt Starter. Substitutes for plain yogurt in the cooking process. Get \"cultured\" by creating your own healthful yogurt at home with this Yogurt Starter mix. Precisely balanced to make smooth, creamy yogurt every time. In the mix: Contains ten 5-gram packs; Ingredients include skim milk powder, sucrose, ascorbic acid and lactic bacteria; Can be used in place of plain yogurt during cooking process; Includes instructions; Made in Canada.; Order yours today! Euro-Cuisine R11020 Yogurt Starter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WHaaIOuRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008BAKDKS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Euro Cuisine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 14.29}}
