{"item_id": "B008BH5D56", "title": "Runtastic Sports Armband for Smartphones (iPhone 4/5, Samsung Galaxy S3/4, BlackBerry, Nokia, HTC, LG, etc.)", "description": "View your stats on your Runtastic apps as you workout without having to dig your phone out of your pocket or carry it in your hand. The Runtastic Sports Armband for Smartphones gives you a hands-free alternative. Ergonomically designed of lightweight neoprene, it can withstand sweat keeping your phone dry and providing maximum comfort during fitness activities. A plastic cover protects your phone yet allows excellent touchscreen control. Reflector adds safety and visibility and there is a handy pocket to carry a key or coins. Earphone cord storage keeps you from getting tangled up with your cable as you workout. Fits arms from 7.9 to 12.2 inches. The Runtastic Sports Armband Extender is available for larger arm sizes.", "text": "Runtastic Sports Armband for Smartphones (iPhone 4/5, Samsung Galaxy S3/4, BlackBerry, Nokia, HTC, LG, etc.) View your stats on your Runtastic apps as you workout without having to dig your phone out of your pocket or carry it in your hand. The Runtastic Sports Armband for Smartphones gives you a hands-free alternative. Ergonomically designed of lightweight neoprene, it can withstand sweat keeping your phone dry and providing maximum comfort during fitness activities. A plastic cover protects your phone yet allows excellent touchscreen control. Reflector adds safety and visibility and there is a handy pocket to carry a key or coins. Earphone cord storage keeps you from getting tangled up with your cable as you workout. Fits arms from 7.9 to 12.2 inches. The Runtastic Sports Armband Extender is available for larger arm sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Vvx%2BQsfLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008BH5D56.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Runtastic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 17.27}}
