{"item_id": "B008BR5XBK", "title": "OtterBox Commuter Series Case for HTC One V - Retail Packaging - Black", "description": "The Commuter Series is a slim and tough protective case made of a durable silicone mid-layer and a one-piece, custom-molded polycarbonate shell. Its smooth finish allows it to slide easily in and out of pockets. This case provides added protection against scratches, bumps, and shock.", "text": "OtterBox Commuter Series Case for HTC One V - Retail Packaging - Black The Commuter Series is a slim and tough protective case made of a durable silicone mid-layer and a one-piece, custom-molded polycarbonate shell. Its smooth finish allows it to slide easily in and out of pockets. This case provides added protection against scratches, bumps, and shock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xIt6eSUFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008BR5XBK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OtterBox", "categories": [["Electronics", "Accessories & Supplies"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Cell Phone Accessories"]], "price": 12.79}}
{"item_id": "B008BR7FKC", "title": "Wise Company Outdoor Meal Sampler Kit", "description": "Variety Pack of 4 different entres. Each Two serving pouches. Amazing Taste and Quality. 7 Year Shelf Life. Perfect for backpacking, camping, hunting, RV traveling, 72 hour emergency kits and for everyday use. Variety Pack of 6 different entres: Pasta Alfredo w/ Chicken, Chili Mac w/ Beef, Cheesy Lasagna, Teriyaki Chicken and Rice, Creamy Pasta w/ Chicken, Noodles and Beef. Amazing Taste and Quality - Each a Very Hearty 2 Serving Cook-in-the-Pouch Meal.", "text": "Wise Company Outdoor Meal Sampler Kit Variety Pack of 4 different entres. Each Two serving pouches. Amazing Taste and Quality. 7 Year Shelf Life. Perfect for backpacking, camping, hunting, RV traveling, 72 hour emergency kits and for everyday use. Variety Pack of 6 different entres: Pasta Alfredo w/ Chicken, Chili Mac w/ Beef, Cheesy Lasagna, Teriyaki Chicken and Rice, Creamy Pasta w/ Chicken, Noodles and Beef. Amazing Taste and Quality - Each a Very Hearty 2 Serving Cook-in-the-Pouch Meal.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Sm872NzVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008BR7FKC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]]}}
