{"item_id": "B008BTE62K", "title": "FoxX Holsters Ruger LC9 In The Waist Band Hybrid Holster", "description": "In The Waist Band FoxX Leather & Kydex Hybrid Holster Handcrafted for the Ruger LC9. Firearm for demonstration purposes Only and not included Description: 9 oz. Premium Leather *.06\" Kydex (Black) *Black Spring Steel Belt Clips ( 1-3/4\" X 1/4\" Belt) *Adjustable for Ride Height and Forward Cant *Holster Worn Inside the Waistband Between 3 and 5 O'Clock *Easy to Conceal *Very Comfortable *Molds to Your Body *Tuckable", "text": "FoxX Holsters Ruger LC9 In The Waist Band Hybrid Holster In The Waist Band FoxX Leather & Kydex Hybrid Holster Handcrafted for the Ruger LC9. Firearm for demonstration purposes Only and not included Description: 9 oz. Premium Leather *.06\" Kydex (Black) *Black Spring Steel Belt Clips ( 1-3/4\" X 1/4\" Belt) *Adjustable for Ride Height and Forward Cant *Holster Worn Inside the Waistband Between 3 and 5 O'Clock *Easy to Conceal *Very Comfortable *Molds to Your Body *Tuckable", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418gxpcnAaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008BTE62K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.0}}
