{"item_id": "B008BZRPCM", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Ride Select Thermal Tight", "description": "This lightweight tight will keep you comfortable before, during or after your ride when the weather starts to turn cool. SELECT Thermal Fleece fabric sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer Anatomic multi-panel design Flatlock and double needle seam 8'' lower leg zipper with zipper garage Plush elastic leg gripper Reflective elements for low-light visibility. This style is a continuation from 2012.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Ride Select Thermal Tight This lightweight tight will keep you comfortable before, during or after your ride when the weather starts to turn cool. SELECT Thermal Fleece fabric sets the benchmark in warmth and moisture transfer Anatomic multi-panel design Flatlock and double needle seam 8'' lower leg zipper with zipper garage Plush elastic leg gripper Reflective elements for low-light visibility. This style is a continuation from 2012.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fHZqi7hCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008BZRPCM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]]}}
