{"item_id": "B008CK5JHY", "title": "Pair of Pace Maker Flip Lock \"Expedition\" Trekking Poles with Vulcanized Rubber Feet and Attachments", "description": "Suitable for people of all sizes. Three sections telescope from 27 to 54 inches long using patented flip lock technology. Superior ultralight 7075 Aluminum. Sweat absorbing and durable cork grips. only 10.5 ounces/pole. Tungsten tips, Vulcanized \"extra life\" rubber feet are some of the features that other sticks on the market do not match. These sticks compare favorably with other, more expensive brands", "text": "Pair of Pace Maker Flip Lock \"Expedition\" Trekking Poles with Vulcanized Rubber Feet and Attachments Suitable for people of all sizes. Three sections telescope from 27 to 54 inches long using patented flip lock technology. Superior ultralight 7075 Aluminum. Sweat absorbing and durable cork grips. only 10.5 ounces/pole. Tungsten tips, Vulcanized \"extra life\" rubber feet are some of the features that other sticks on the market do not match. These sticks compare favorably with other, more expensive brands", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PvV78otKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008CK5JHY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 59.95}}
