{"item_id": "B008CPU4CY", "title": "Type-III 100pc Gun Cleaning 6 Inch American Made Cotton Swabs", "description": "These swabs are made by a Certified US Government Contractor and are identical to the ones used by the service men and women of our United States Armed Forces. What is offered here is five variations to purge your firearm of performance robbing gunk and carbon build up. Defend your nation with a well maintained weapon!Please note our Ultra Fine Double Sided Tapered Tips do not have as much cotton as the others because of their narrow nature.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "text": "Type-III 100pc Gun Cleaning 6 Inch American Made Cotton Swabs These swabs are made by a Certified US Government Contractor and are identical to the ones used by the service men and women of our United States Armed Forces. What is offered here is five variations to purge your firearm of performance robbing gunk and carbon build up. Defend your nation with a well maintained weapon!Please note our Ultra Fine Double Sided Tapered Tips do not have as much cotton as the others because of their narrow nature.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cj38V3QmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008CPU4CY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008CQ90FK", "title": "Blade Tech Drop and Offset Holster Attachment", "description": "The Blade-Tech Drop and Offset Holster Attachment lowers and cants the holster away from the body to help the shooter gain a better positive indexing grip. Preferred by female shooters.", "text": "Blade Tech Drop and Offset Holster Attachment The Blade-Tech Drop and Offset Holster Attachment lowers and cants the holster away from the body to help the shooter gain a better positive indexing grip. Preferred by female shooters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31A62veoITL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008CQ90FK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B008CQXY34", "title": "Pair of Pace Maker \"Aerostride\" Nordic Walking Poles with Vulcanized Rubber Feet", "description": "Suitable for people of all sizes. Three sections telescope from 26 to 54 inches long. Superior ultralight 7075 Aluminum. Sweat absorbing and durable cork grips. At only 8 ounces/pole these poles are among the lightest on the market Tungsten tips, Vulcanized \"extra life\" rubber feet are some of the features that other sticks on the market do not match. These sticks compare favorably with other, more expensive brands.", "text": "Pair of Pace Maker \"Aerostride\" Nordic Walking Poles with Vulcanized Rubber Feet Suitable for people of all sizes. Three sections telescope from 26 to 54 inches long. Superior ultralight 7075 Aluminum. Sweat absorbing and durable cork grips. At only 8 ounces/pole these poles are among the lightest on the market Tungsten tips, Vulcanized \"extra life\" rubber feet are some of the features that other sticks on the market do not match. These sticks compare favorably with other, more expensive brands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318TK%2BwgHgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008CQXY34.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B008CR4R84", "title": "Tactical Barrel Clamp Mount With Rail For 12 Gauge Shotguns And Magazine Tubes Fits Remington 870 1100 11-87 SP-10 Mossberg 500 835 Maverick 88Winchetser 1300", "description": "M1SURPLUS brings you this exclusive Tactical mount for your favorite Shotgun. Be aware there are other seller offering low quality knock-off counterfeit copies that are not M1SURPLUS authorized products. To warranty you are purchasing an authentic legitimate product with a full warranty, just check the sellers name and make sure it says - Ships from and sold by m1surplus ------------------------------------------------------------Material: Aluminum, Color: Matte black, Will fit most 12 gauge magazine tube extensions and also directly to long scope tubes with a 1\" tube diameter. Due to varying dimensions on different brand shotguns, please make sure to measure the location where you plan on attaching this item. You will need an external diameter between 15/16\" - 1\" in order to attach this item. Includes a clamp mount adapter with a short 1-3/4\" integral rail for attaching tactical accessories. The rail will accept 7/8\" Weaver and Picatinny style accessories. Easy bolt-on installation requires no gunsmithing. Due to the heavy recoil of 12 gauge shotguns, you must use a quality thread locking compound on all the screws or they will come loose from the heavy recoil. Thread lock is not included. Manufacture warranty against defects. Note that on some shotguns you may need to remove the magazine tube in order to have full access to so that you may properly install this mount. Manufacture warranty against defects. Brand New", "text": "Tactical Barrel Clamp Mount With Rail For 12 Gauge Shotguns And Magazine Tubes Fits Remington 870 1100 11-87 SP-10 Mossberg 500 835 Maverick 88Winchetser 1300 M1SURPLUS brings you this exclusive Tactical mount for your favorite Shotgun. Be aware there are other seller offering low quality knock-off counterfeit copies that are not M1SURPLUS authorized products. To warranty you are purchasing an authentic legitimate product with a full warranty, just check the sellers name and make sure it says - Ships from and sold by m1surplus ------------------------------------------------------------Material: Aluminum, Color: Matte black, Will fit most 12 gauge magazine tube extensions and also directly to long scope tubes with a 1\" tube diameter. Due to varying dimensions on different brand shotguns, please make sure to measure the location where you plan on attaching this item. You will need an external diameter between 15/16\" - 1\" in order to attach this item. Includes a clamp mount adapter with a short 1-3/4\" integral rail for attaching tactical accessories. The rail will accept 7/8\" Weaver and Picatinny style accessories. Easy bolt-on installation requires no gunsmithing. Due to the heavy recoil of 12 gauge shotguns, you must use a quality thread locking compound on all the screws or they will come loose from the heavy recoil. Thread lock is not included. Manufacture warranty against defects. Note that on some shotguns you may need to remove the magazine tube in order to have full access to so that you may properly install this mount. Manufacture warranty against defects. Brand New", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GdO9ExnUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008CR4R84.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "m1surplus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 7.26}}
