{"item_id": "B008CXLWKO", "title": "HiViz HHVS001 Henry Rifle Sight", "description": "HiViz replacement front rifle sight for Henry lever action rifles. It fits H001, H001L and H001Y long rifle models, in .22 Long Rifle caliber only. The interchangeable style front sight comes with red, green, black and white fiber optic family Litepipes plus rotating carry case. Does not fit Golden boy model. All HiViz products are covered against defects in materials and workmanship for a full year.", "text": "HiViz HHVS001 Henry Rifle Sight HiViz replacement front rifle sight for Henry lever action rifles. It fits H001, H001L and H001Y long rifle models, in .22 Long Rifle caliber only. The interchangeable style front sight comes with red, green, black and white fiber optic family Litepipes plus rotating carry case. Does not fit Golden boy model. All HiViz products are covered against defects in materials and workmanship for a full year.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JwUyhwNkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008CXLWKO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Viz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 29.48}}
