{"item_id": "B008CXMFKK", "title": "DeSantis Pocket Shot S&W Bodyguard 380 Black", "description": "The Pocket Shot is our latest way to conceal and rapidly access your small auto. The #110 disguises itself as a wallet but can be brought into action instantly without removing the gun. It's made of black leather, is ambidextrous, and will carry several different 380 and 32 autos.", "text": "DeSantis Pocket Shot S&W Bodyguard 380 Black The Pocket Shot is our latest way to conceal and rapidly access your small auto. The #110 disguises itself as a wallet but can be brought into action instantly without removing the gun. It's made of black leather, is ambidextrous, and will carry several different 380 and 32 autos.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OBkkuKBOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008CXMFKK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Belts"]], "price": 31.99}}
