{"item_id": "B008CZZV6I", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits Adventure Medical Sportsman Bighorn Kit, 5.872 Ounce", "description": "Hunting and fishing demand specially tailored gear, which is why Adventure Medical Kits hs created the sportsman kit. Designed for recreational hunters and fishermen on trips up to four days long, the Sportsman contains supplies to treat the most common injuries, including penetration wounds from bullets or arrows, fish hook removal, stabilizing sprains, and stopping severe bleeding. Weighing just over a pound and compact enough to fit in any pack, the sportsman is required equipment on your next hunting/fishing adventure.", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits Adventure Medical Sportsman Bighorn Kit, 5.872 Ounce Hunting and fishing demand specially tailored gear, which is why Adventure Medical Kits hs created the sportsman kit. Designed for recreational hunters and fishermen on trips up to four days long, the Sportsman contains supplies to treat the most common injuries, including penetration wounds from bullets or arrows, fish hook removal, stabilizing sprains, and stopping severe bleeding. Weighing just over a pound and compact enough to fit in any pack, the sportsman is required equipment on your next hunting/fishing adventure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51oaLbulg9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008CZZV6I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits (ADVBA)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B008CZZVB8", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits Adventure Medical Sportsman Grizzly Kit, 4.75 Ounce", "description": "Hunting and fishing demand specially tailored gear, which is why Adventure Medical Kits hs created the sportsman kit. Designed for recreational hunters and fishermen on trips up to four days long, the Sportsman contains supplies to treat the most common injuries, including penetration wounds from bullets or arrows, fish hook removal, stabilizing sprains, and stopping severe bleeding. Weighing just over a pound and compact enough to fit in any pack, the sportsman is required equipment on your next hunting/fishing adventure.", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits Adventure Medical Sportsman Grizzly Kit, 4.75 Ounce Hunting and fishing demand specially tailored gear, which is why Adventure Medical Kits hs created the sportsman kit. Designed for recreational hunters and fishermen on trips up to four days long, the Sportsman contains supplies to treat the most common injuries, including penetration wounds from bullets or arrows, fish hook removal, stabilizing sprains, and stopping severe bleeding. Weighing just over a pound and compact enough to fit in any pack, the sportsman is required equipment on your next hunting/fishing adventure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SK-zZCZKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008CZZVB8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits (ADVBA)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B008D1CVIC", "title": "Maxam Digital Camo Sleeping Bag", "description": "This travel-friendly sleeping bag rolls out to provide you with comfortable sleeping coverage for your next indoor or outdoor overnight trip. Features polyester construction and drawstring bag. Measures 74-3/4 inches x 29-1/2 inches.", "text": "Maxam Digital Camo Sleeping Bag This travel-friendly sleeping bag rolls out to provide you with comfortable sleeping coverage for your next indoor or outdoor overnight trip. Features polyester construction and drawstring bag. Measures 74-3/4 inches x 29-1/2 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fZmWwDkUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008D1CVIC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BF Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 25.14}}
