{"item_id": "B008D4Q7HA", "title": "Acid Tactical 1\" See-Through Riser AR15 M4 High Top Rail Scope Mount - Full Length Hi-Profile", "description": "BEWARE of NON-Genuine Counterfeit Acid Tactical gear. Unless you are buying directly from Acid Tactical, you're likely purchasing a fake.This riser allows you to mount a scope to your AR, M4 and many other rifles and still be able to use your fixed metal sights.* Includes:* 1 Riser MountSpecifications:14 SlotsLength: 6 1/2 inchesMaterial: Aircraft-grade Aluminum T6160 AlloyMounts to a common 20mm rail system.Quick release Thumb tightening systemCompletely see through (see image below showing front sights through the rear site and the riser.)These risers are 100% solid Aluminum. They secure tightly to a standard weaver/Picatinny rail. Will not be disappointed with the quality of these risers.Tightening screws my be hexagon or screw driver tightening system. Picture depicts screw driver bolt version.AS DESCRIBEDMay not work with some AR, M4 Fixed sights.***Please Note***In order to provide our customers with the best prices on quality products and reduce waste, most of our items are shipped without retail packaging. If you require retail packaging, we may be able to provide it at an additional cost.NOTE!Acid Tacticalis the UPC owner of this item. Any other seller claiming to sell this items under the same UPC is not selling the same product. Quality, quantity, and description may not apply to any other seller under this listing.", "text": "Acid Tactical 1\" See-Through Riser AR15 M4 High Top Rail Scope Mount - Full Length Hi-Profile BEWARE of NON-Genuine Counterfeit Acid Tactical gear. Unless you are buying directly from Acid Tactical, you're likely purchasing a fake.This riser allows you to mount a scope to your AR, M4 and many other rifles and still be able to use your fixed metal sights.* Includes:* 1 Riser MountSpecifications:14 SlotsLength: 6 1/2 inchesMaterial: Aircraft-grade Aluminum T6160 AlloyMounts to a common 20mm rail system.Quick release Thumb tightening systemCompletely see through (see image below showing front sights through the rear site and the riser.)These risers are 100% solid Aluminum. They secure tightly to a standard weaver/Picatinny rail. Will not be disappointed with the quality of these risers.Tightening screws my be hexagon or screw driver tightening system. Picture depicts screw driver bolt version.AS DESCRIBEDMay not work with some AR, M4 Fixed sights.***Please Note***In order to provide our customers with the best prices on quality products and reduce waste, most of our items are shipped without retail packaging. If you require retail packaging, we may be able to provide it at an additional cost.NOTE!Acid Tacticalis the UPC owner of this item. Any other seller claiming to sell this items under the same UPC is not selling the same product. Quality, quantity, and description may not apply to any other seller under this listing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MascLIahL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008D4Q7HA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B008D60RH4", "title": "Condor Double Kangaroo Pouch (OD Green)", "description": "The Condor Kangaroo Pouch is design to hold both the M4 Mag and Pistol Mag with one single pouch. This is was a aftermath of our popular open-top style mag pouches, and few suggestion from LE/MIL personnel. The Kangaroo pouch has been tested and recommanded by NTAO.", "text": "Condor Double Kangaroo Pouch (OD Green) The Condor Kangaroo Pouch is design to hold both the M4 Mag and Pistol Mag with one single pouch. This is was a aftermath of our popular open-top style mag pouches, and few suggestion from LE/MIL personnel. The Kangaroo pouch has been tested and recommanded by NTAO.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417vWtvcYgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008D60RH4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B008D7M2B2", "title": "S&W M&P 9/40/45/22 Blade Tech Revolution OWB Holster (Paddle and ASR Belt Attachment)", "description": "New Revolution Holster holds your M&P; 9/40 safely and securely with the Positive Lock Trigger Guard. There are two retention screws, allowing the users to fine tune their draw to their specific needs. As an added Bonus you get BOTH the Adjustable Sting Ray AND the Paddle attachment to accommodate to your personal carry preference. High quality molded IDPA legal Holster at an affordable price.", "text": "S&W M&P 9/40/45/22 Blade Tech Revolution OWB Holster (Paddle and ASR Belt Attachment) New Revolution Holster holds your M&P; 9/40 safely and securely with the Positive Lock Trigger Guard. There are two retention screws, allowing the users to fine tune their draw to their specific needs. As an added Bonus you get BOTH the Adjustable Sting Ray AND the Paddle attachment to accommodate to your personal carry preference. High quality molded IDPA legal Holster at an affordable price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qi0LNXvNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008D7M2B2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blade-Tech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.3}}
{"item_id": "B008DEYAZ6", "title": "ER Emergency Ration 2400+ Calorie, 5-Year Emergency Food Bar for Survival Kits and Disaster Preparedness (Pack of 4)", "description": "The 18 ounce, 2,400+ calorie ER Bar is formulated specifically in accordance with the stringent requirements of the US Department of Homeland Security and the US Coast Guard for emergency victims. Ideal for emergency situations, each packet contains six individual 410 calorie rations that are ready-to-eat with no preparation. With a non-thirst provoking formula and a perfect balance of quality ingredients, the ER Bar provides nutrition specifically formulated for disaster victims, including an optimum balance of salt, carbohydrates, protein, fat and enriched with the recommended daily allowance of vitamins and minerals. Food requirements will vary from person to person and may also vary depending upon environmental circumstances (cold weather requires more energy to stay warm, for example). Just one 2,400+ calorie ER Bar can minimally sustain an average person up to three days if necessary, but it’s advisable to evaluate the needs of your family and prepare accordingly. Following a disaster, food supplies may become disrupted, stores closed and power outages could last for days. The US Department of Homeland Security and FEMA recommend stocking a three-day supply of non-perishable food per person to prepare for emergencies. Even canned foods can spoil within 6 months. Get quality food rations that you can count on and store ER Bars in multiple locations for easy access to essential nutrition in an emergency. The special re-sealable package is vacuum sealed and certified by the USCG to maintain a 5-year shelf life. ER bars contain no tropical oils, coconut or nuts which may cause dangerous allergic reactions when no medical aid is available.", "text": "ER Emergency Ration 2400+ Calorie, 5-Year Emergency Food Bar for Survival Kits and Disaster Preparedness (Pack of 4) The 18 ounce, 2,400+ calorie ER Bar is formulated specifically in accordance with the stringent requirements of the US Department of Homeland Security and the US Coast Guard for emergency victims. Ideal for emergency situations, each packet contains six individual 410 calorie rations that are ready-to-eat with no preparation. With a non-thirst provoking formula and a perfect balance of quality ingredients, the ER Bar provides nutrition specifically formulated for disaster victims, including an optimum balance of salt, carbohydrates, protein, fat and enriched with the recommended daily allowance of vitamins and minerals. Food requirements will vary from person to person and may also vary depending upon environmental circumstances (cold weather requires more energy to stay warm, for example). Just one 2,400+ calorie ER Bar can minimally sustain an average person up to three days if necessary, but it’s advisable to evaluate the needs of your family and prepare accordingly. Following a disaster, food supplies may become disrupted, stores closed and power outages could last for days. The US Department of Homeland Security and FEMA recommend stocking a three-day supply of non-perishable food per person to prepare for emergencies. Even canned foods can spoil within 6 months. Get quality food rations that you can count on and store ER Bars in multiple locations for easy access to essential nutrition in an emergency. The special re-sealable package is vacuum sealed and certified by the USCG to maintain a 5-year shelf life. ER bars contain no tropical oils, coconut or nuts which may cause dangerous allergic reactions when no medical aid is available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GD81QdsDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008DEYAZ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ER Emergency Ration", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 16.36}}
{"item_id": "B008DEYC86", "title": "ER Emergency Ration 3600+ Calorie, 5-Year Emergency Food Bar for Survival Kits and Disaster Preparedness", "description": "The 27 ounce, 3,600+ calorie ER Bar is formulated specifically in accordance with the stringent requirements of the US Department of Homeland Security and the US Coast Guard for emergency victims. Ideal for emergency situations, each packet contains nine individual 410 calorie rations that are ready-to-eat with no preparation. With a non-thirst provoking formula and a perfect balance of quality ingredients, it provides nutrition specifically formulated for disaster victims, including an optimum balance of salt, carbohydrates, protein, fat and enriched with the recommended daily allowance of vitamins and minerals. Food requirements will vary from person to person and may also vary depending upon environmental circumstances (cold weather requires more energy to stay warm, for example). Just one 3,600+ calorie ER Bar can minimally sustain an average person up to four days if necessary, but it’s advisable to evaluate the needs of your family and prepare accordingly. Following a disaster, food supplies may become disrupted, stores closed and power outages could last for days. The US Department of Homeland Security and FEMA recommend stocking a three-day supply of non-perishable food per person to prepare for emergencies. Even canned foods can spoil within 6 months. Get quality food rations that you can count on and store ER Bars in multiple locations for easy access to essential nutrition in an emergency. The special re-sealable package is vacuum sealed and certified by the USCG to maintain a 5-year shelf life. ER bars contain no tropical oils, coconut or nuts which may cause dangerous allergic reactions when no medical aid is available.", "text": "ER Emergency Ration 3600+ Calorie, 5-Year Emergency Food Bar for Survival Kits and Disaster Preparedness The 27 ounce, 3,600+ calorie ER Bar is formulated specifically in accordance with the stringent requirements of the US Department of Homeland Security and the US Coast Guard for emergency victims. Ideal for emergency situations, each packet contains nine individual 410 calorie rations that are ready-to-eat with no preparation. With a non-thirst provoking formula and a perfect balance of quality ingredients, it provides nutrition specifically formulated for disaster victims, including an optimum balance of salt, carbohydrates, protein, fat and enriched with the recommended daily allowance of vitamins and minerals. Food requirements will vary from person to person and may also vary depending upon environmental circumstances (cold weather requires more energy to stay warm, for example). Just one 3,600+ calorie ER Bar can minimally sustain an average person up to four days if necessary, but it’s advisable to evaluate the needs of your family and prepare accordingly. Following a disaster, food supplies may become disrupted, stores closed and power outages could last for days. The US Department of Homeland Security and FEMA recommend stocking a three-day supply of non-perishable food per person to prepare for emergencies. Even canned foods can spoil within 6 months. Get quality food rations that you can count on and store ER Bars in multiple locations for easy access to essential nutrition in an emergency. The special re-sealable package is vacuum sealed and certified by the USCG to maintain a 5-year shelf life. ER bars contain no tropical oils, coconut or nuts which may cause dangerous allergic reactions when no medical aid is available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51slSOHgMOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008DEYC86.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ER Emergency Ration", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 4.95}}
{"item_id": "B008DEYGJQ", "title": "ER Emergency Ready Thermal Mylar Blankets, Pack of 4", "description": "Emergency Blanket, also called a solar blanket - the blanket can prevent you from losing body heat. Perfect for emergency protection in all weather conditions Waterprood and windeproof Will not crack, mildew or shrink Reflects 90 percent of your body heat back to you Generous size 84\"X52\"", "text": "ER Emergency Ready Thermal Mylar Blankets, Pack of 4 Emergency Blanket, also called a solar blanket - the blanket can prevent you from losing body heat. Perfect for emergency protection in all weather conditions Waterprood and windeproof Will not crack, mildew or shrink Reflects 90 percent of your body heat back to you Generous size 84\"X52\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SRXLX4gHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008DEYGJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ER Emergency Ready", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 5.76}}
{"item_id": "B008DI5XRQ", "title": "Premium Jumbo Car Folding Spring Sun Shade for vans, SUVs, or cars with larger windshield", "description": "Premium Jumbo Sun Shade for vans, SUVs, or cars with larger windshields. The shade is made of highly reflective and durable fabric with foldable metal frame. When opened up it covers the whole windshield, protects car dash board and interior from sun damage, and keeps car interior cooler. When folded up it reduces into a small package that may fit inside glove compartment or door pocket. The shade has a unique trapezoid design for better coverage of windshiled, and is finished in attractive silver/gray/black with red color accent. It is about 64\" wide and 29\" tall. \"We are dedicated to fast shipping and customer service\"", "text": "Premium Jumbo Car Folding Spring Sun Shade for vans, SUVs, or cars with larger windshield Premium Jumbo Sun Shade for vans, SUVs, or cars with larger windshields. The shade is made of highly reflective and durable fabric with foldable metal frame. When opened up it covers the whole windshield, protects car dash board and interior from sun damage, and keeps car interior cooler. When folded up it reduces into a small package that may fit inside glove compartment or door pocket. The shade has a unique trapezoid design for better coverage of windshiled, and is finished in attractive silver/gray/black with red color accent. It is about 64\" wide and 29\" tall. \"We are dedicated to fast shipping and customer service\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51yR3MpZB1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008DI5XRQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Auto Accessories", "Windshield Sun Shades"]], "price": 10.9}}
{"item_id": "B008DLVKES", "title": "Ozeri 4x3sport Digital Pocket 3D Pedometer with Tri-Axis Technology and 30 Day Memory, Gray/Black", "description": "Introducing the 4x3sport Digital Pedometer by Ozeri - the world's most advanced 3D pedometer. Unlike conventional pedometers that miss steps and do not work accurately unless placed vertically on a belt, the 4x3sport Digital Pedometer utilizes the latest generation in Tri-Axis technology to provide superior accuracy in your pocket or purse, and in any position, whether up, down, flat, on its side, or at any angle. The 4x3sport Digital Pedometer utilizes a digital 3D acceleration sensor which is far more accurate than mechanical sensors used in many of the latest generation of pedometers. Compact, sleek and slim, the 4x3sport Digital Pedometer fits is any pocket and is the ultimate personal trainer. Used by professional 100 mile ultra runners such as Evan Kimber, the 4x3sport Pedometer records your steps, stairs climbed, distance, calories burned and time spent exercising. It counts up to 1 million steps and includes built-in memory that records your daily activity for up to 30 days. The new 4x3sport Pedometer features a Steps2Target feature tracks and calculates your steps toward your daily target and graphical displays your progress on its bright LCD screen. The 4x3sport Digital Pedometer filters out vibrations and only begins counting after it detects a sequence of continuous steps for greater accuracy. The 4x3sport Digital Pedometer ships with a lithium battery, lanyard, belt clip and instruction manual. Your satisfaction is 100% guaranteed.", "text": "Ozeri 4x3sport Digital Pocket 3D Pedometer with Tri-Axis Technology and 30 Day Memory, Gray/Black Introducing the 4x3sport Digital Pedometer by Ozeri - the world's most advanced 3D pedometer. Unlike conventional pedometers that miss steps and do not work accurately unless placed vertically on a belt, the 4x3sport Digital Pedometer utilizes the latest generation in Tri-Axis technology to provide superior accuracy in your pocket or purse, and in any position, whether up, down, flat, on its side, or at any angle. The 4x3sport Digital Pedometer utilizes a digital 3D acceleration sensor which is far more accurate than mechanical sensors used in many of the latest generation of pedometers. Compact, sleek and slim, the 4x3sport Digital Pedometer fits is any pocket and is the ultimate personal trainer. Used by professional 100 mile ultra runners such as Evan Kimber, the 4x3sport Pedometer records your steps, stairs climbed, distance, calories burned and time spent exercising. It counts up to 1 million steps and includes built-in memory that records your daily activity for up to 30 days. The new 4x3sport Pedometer features a Steps2Target feature tracks and calculates your steps toward your daily target and graphical displays your progress on its bright LCD screen. The 4x3sport Digital Pedometer filters out vibrations and only begins counting after it detects a sequence of continuous steps for greater accuracy. The 4x3sport Digital Pedometer ships with a lithium battery, lanyard, belt clip and instruction manual. Your satisfaction is 100% guaranteed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DdujsMq1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008DLVKES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ozeri", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]], "price": 24.75}}
{"item_id": "B008DMVGIM", "title": "Tagua Glock Inside the Pant Holster, Brown, Right Hand", "description": "The Tagua Glock Inside The Pant Holster is designed to be worn inside the waistband. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. Combat grip. Clip on design. Open muzzle.", "text": "Tagua Glock Inside the Pant Holster, Brown, Right Hand The Tagua Glock Inside The Pant Holster is designed to be worn inside the waistband. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. Combat grip. Clip on design. Open muzzle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41brFMco53L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008DMVGIM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tagua", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 28.07}}
