{"item_id": "B008DT9218", "title": "Greenfield Retro Kit Kickstand (305-mm, Black)", "description": "The RetroKit Kickstand has many of the same great features as the standard Greenfield Kickstand with the addition of a cutaway plate. This allows it to mount to the bike to avoid inturupting the cable of some Shimano derailleurs.", "text": "Greenfield Retro Kit Kickstand (305-mm, Black) The RetroKit Kickstand has many of the same great features as the standard Greenfield Kickstand with the addition of a cutaway plate. This allows it to mount to the bike to avoid inturupting the cable of some Shimano derailleurs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zwuHDbnRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008DT9218.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Greenfield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components"]], "price": 9.38}}
