{"item_id": "B008E0S84I", "title": "ID-Window-Patch(TM) Rubber 3D Velcro Backed w/ Company Logo (Small Model) by Hazard 4(R)", "description": "This velcro-backed i.d./card holder is a perfect size to place on one of our packs, bags, or apparel products. It fits most identification cards such as a drivers license and has a moulded-in loop for attaching to lanyards or carabiners. This extra security means that the i.d. holder can't be easily peeled off a velcro patch while travelling. The 3-d rubber moulding makes the product durable and easily washable.", "text": "ID-Window-Patch(TM) Rubber 3D Velcro Backed w/ Company Logo (Small Model) by Hazard 4(R) This velcro-backed i.d./card holder is a perfect size to place on one of our packs, bags, or apparel products. It fits most identification cards such as a drivers license and has a moulded-in loop for attaching to lanyards or carabiners. This extra security means that the i.d. holder can't be easily peeled off a velcro patch while travelling. The 3-d rubber moulding makes the product durable and easily washable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rZfy-GN5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008E0S84I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HAZARD 4", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 8.25}}
{"item_id": "B008E1VHYK", "title": "Darn Tough Vermont Men's 1/4 Merino Wool Cushion Hiking Socks", "description": "Made in Vermont - We live and work in Vermont. Our backyard is the perfect testing ground to make the finest Premium All Weather Performance Socks. We ski, snowboard, hike, bike and run in the most unforgiving climate in the lower 48. It is under these conditions that we design, test and manufacture our socks.", "text": "Darn Tough Vermont Men's 1/4 Merino Wool Cushion Hiking Socks Made in Vermont - We live and work in Vermont. Our backyard is the perfect testing ground to make the finest Premium All Weather Performance Socks. We ski, snowboard, hike, bike and run in the most unforgiving climate in the lower 48. It is under these conditions that we design, test and manufacture our socks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UuEbdxKeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008E1VHYK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008E7PHTA", "title": "Free Donkey Sports Cornhole Bags (Pack of 8) (Pick Two Colors)", "description": "Free Donkey Sports focuses on the construction of high quality, regulation cornhole bags. We make our bags strictly in accordance to ACA regulations. Please contact us within two days of your purchase by sending a product customization request with your two color selections, or as a default 4 black and 4 red will be shipped. Once you purchase, you will receive an email with our color selections to which you can respond and choose your colors.", "text": "Free Donkey Sports Cornhole Bags (Pack of 8) (Pick Two Colors) Free Donkey Sports focuses on the construction of high quality, regulation cornhole bags. We make our bags strictly in accordance to ACA regulations. Please contact us within two days of your purchase by sending a product customization request with your two color selections, or as a default 4 black and 4 red will be shipped. Once you purchase, you will receive an email with our color selections to which you can respond and choose your colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hGNtmPIcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008E7PHTA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games", "Cornhole", "Cornhole Bags"]], "price": 14.95}}
