diating material6. 3rd Skin Design: to make more comfortable than others7. Upgraded Non Slip Elastic Bands on Top & Bottom9. For Cycling, Fishing, Golf, Drive, Jogging, Claiming and all other outside activities10. Suitable for Indoor Activites too, even your workplaces (Your arms won't sticky on your desk)11. Hand Wash separately, No Bleach or Detergent, No Squeeze, Dry in ShadeDesign is subject to change without notice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FBs3UUmLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008EQ1LOQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Armwarmers"]], "price": 17.9}}
