{"item_id": "B008FEMFIS", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical AK-47 AK47 AK 47 Rifle 1 Inch Extended Recoil Reducing Ported Non Slip Black Rubber Buttpad Butt Pad For Original Wood Stock", "description": "Experience significant recoil absorption and enhanced slip prevention after installing the Ultimate Arms Gear rubber buttpad on your Wood AK47 Stock. Extends the length the stock by 1\", and installs by utilizing the required existing plate screws - No drilling or tapping needed. Ported to accommodate the butt stock cleaning kit.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical AK-47 AK47 AK 47 Rifle 1 Inch Extended Recoil Reducing Ported Non Slip Black Rubber Buttpad Butt Pad For Original Wood Stock Experience significant recoil absorption and enhanced slip prevention after installing the Ultimate Arms Gear rubber buttpad on your Wood AK47 Stock. Extends the length the stock by 1\", and installs by utilizing the required existing plate screws - No drilling or tapping needed. Ported to accommodate the butt stock cleaning kit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316mJKxNWSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008FEMFIS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B008FF11SW", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Complete AR15 AR-15 AR 15 M4 M16 Rifle Armorer Kit Includes: Gunsmith Cleaning Work Tool Bench Gun Mat + Deluxe .223 5.56 AR15 M-16 Rifle Cleaning Kit", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear, Brand New. AR15 M4 M16 Combination Package Takes Care of All Your Glock Disassembly And Cleaning Needs. Cleaning Kit: Made For .223/5.56 Caliber Rifles - AR-15, M4 , M16. Gun Cleaning Mat: Large Exploded View Schematics Diagram of Rifle and Parts List : 12\" x 36\". Made From Neoprene Rubber Backing Prevents Fluids from Penetrating Through to Work Surface. Soft Polyester Top Protects Gun and Parts from Scratches. The Perfect Cleaning Kit and Repair Gunsmith Mat for Your AR-15, M4 or M-16. Have Fun and Learn While You Work on Your Rifle. Great For Field Operations Or At Home Cleaning. Perfect For Military, Law Enforcement, Hunters. Cleaning Kit Includes : 5 Piece Rods With Handle, Slotted Adapter Rod, Oil Bottle, .223 Caliber Bore Brush, .223 Caliber Chamber Brush, Dual End Nylon Cleaning Brush, Nylon Pouch With 2 Pockets & Alice Clip.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Complete AR15 AR-15 AR 15 M4 M16 Rifle Armorer Kit Includes: Gunsmith Cleaning Work Tool Bench Gun Mat + Deluxe .223 5.56 AR15 M-16 Rifle Cleaning Kit Official Ultimate Arms Gear, Brand New. AR15 M4 M16 Combination Package Takes Care of All Your Glock Disassembly And Cleaning Needs. Cleaning Kit: Made For .223/5.56 Caliber Rifles - AR-15, M4 , M16. Gun Cleaning Mat: Large Exploded View Schematics Diagram of Rifle and Parts List : 12\" x 36\". Made From Neoprene Rubber Backing Prevents Fluids from Penetrating Through to Work Surface. Soft Polyester Top Protects Gun and Parts from Scratches. The Perfect Cleaning Kit and Repair Gunsmith Mat for Your AR-15, M4 or M-16. Have Fun and Learn While You Work on Your Rifle. Great For Field Operations Or At Home Cleaning. Perfect For Military, Law Enforcement, Hunters. Cleaning Kit Includes : 5 Piece Rods With Handle, Slotted Adapter Rod, Oil Bottle, .223 Caliber Bore Brush, .223 Caliber Chamber Brush, Dual End Nylon Cleaning Brush, Nylon Pouch With 2 Pockets & Alice Clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LnNc9dZ8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008FF11SW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 37.95}}
