{"item_id": "B008FHHLP2", "title": "Columbia Men's Coolhead Ball Cap III (Omni-Freeze ZERO)", "description": "Built for supreme temperature regulation and sun protection in the outdoors, this performance ball cap is outfitted with UPF 50 fabrication, a wicking, cooling sweatband and our advanced Omni-Freeze ZERO technology, which accelerates the wicking process and delivers amazing next-to-skin coolness.", "text": "Columbia Men's Coolhead Ball Cap III (Omni-Freeze ZERO) Built for supreme temperature regulation and sun protection in the outdoors, this performance ball cap is outfitted with UPF 50 fabrication, a wicking, cooling sweatband and our advanced Omni-Freeze ZERO technology, which accelerates the wicking process and delivers amazing next-to-skin coolness.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TtPoyVElL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008FHHLP2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"]], "price": 41.89}}
