{"item_id": "B008FUAPVG", "title": "Neewer 2.5L Foldable TPU Mouth Water Pack Bladder Bag Hydration Packs for Camping Hiking Cycling", "description": "Features:2.5L Hydration Wide Mouth Water Bladder Bag-Cycling HikingMade of durable sealed PVCTube connected to the bottom of the bladderCan be used to store water with -20 to 50degree Celsius, but juice and milk are not recommended.Can be put into backpack and backpack's shoulder strapTurn on the water through opening the cover and drawing out the outletFoldable design, saving your pack space when not in useSuitable for camping, hiking, cyclingExcellent for campers, backpackers and bushwalkersSpecifications:Material: TPUContent: 2.5 LitreBag Size: 395 x 175mmTube length: 1mWeight: 200gColor: GreenPackage Contents:1x 2.5L Water Bladder Bag", "text": "Neewer 2.5L Foldable TPU Mouth Water Pack Bladder Bag Hydration Packs for Camping Hiking Cycling Features:2.5L Hydration Wide Mouth Water Bladder Bag-Cycling HikingMade of durable sealed PVCTube connected to the bottom of the bladderCan be used to store water with -20 to 50degree Celsius, but juice and milk are not recommended.Can be put into backpack and backpack's shoulder strapTurn on the water through opening the cover and drawing out the outletFoldable design, saving your pack space when not in useSuitable for camping, hiking, cyclingExcellent for campers, backpackers and bushwalkersSpecifications:Material: TPUContent: 2.5 LitreBag Size: 395 x 175mmTube length: 1mWeight: 200gColor: GreenPackage Contents:1x 2.5L Water Bladder Bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nC55X%2BTCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008FUAPVG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Neewer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 7.8}}
