{"item_id": "B008G1DMQ4", "title": "Cycleops Powercal With Heart Rate", "description": "Power meters are a great way to train...if you have a spare grand or two laying around. Fortunately, for those of us of more modest means, there's the CycleOps Powercal. This innovative little computer uses your heart rate and a special algorithm to determine how much power you're putting out. And the best part is, it costs about 1/10th of a traditional power meter. Just pair it with your power-meter compatible cycling computer and you're good to go. World's first-ever power meter calculated from heart rate gives you easy to use, accurate power data Displays your wattage output without needing to modify any components on your bicycle Displays real data in real time to aid in your training Easy to install, set up and maintain Multisport functionality lets you get consistent measurements across different sport activities ANT+ compatibility lets you pair with any ANT+ display or computer capable of supporting a power meter", "text": "Cycleops Powercal With Heart Rate Power meters are a great way to train...if you have a spare grand or two laying around. Fortunately, for those of us of more modest means, there's the CycleOps Powercal. This innovative little computer uses your heart rate and a special algorithm to determine how much power you're putting out. And the best part is, it costs about 1/10th of a traditional power meter. Just pair it with your power-meter compatible cycling computer and you're good to go. World's first-ever power meter calculated from heart rate gives you easy to use, accurate power data Displays your wattage output without needing to modify any components on your bicycle Displays real data in real time to aid in your training Easy to install, set up and maintain Multisport functionality lets you get consistent measurements across different sport activities ANT+ compatibility lets you pair with any ANT+ display or computer capable of supporting a power meter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-zp3b5FnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008G1DMQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cyclops", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B008G3Z8U0", "title": "Huge Double Sleeping Bag 23F/-5C 2 Person Camping Hiking 86\"x60\" W/2 Pillows New", "description": "This envelope-style sleeping bag is light-weight and can keep you warm at your camp site after a day of hiking and climbing. It's great for use in cabins and camping tents outdoor in temperate conditions. It's made of 210T Polyester, waterproof, comes with 2 pillows and a side zipper for easy entrance.FEATURES: Black and blue envelope style; Easy to roll up into the carrying sack; Warming design with a weatherstrip around it; Full Length Zipper with two zipper pullers (one zipper with double sliders, the other with one slider; Velcro strap on the side; Temperature Rating: -5 C/23F, 0 C/32F, 10 C/14F; Performance Rating: 2-3 Seasons; Two (2) person design for High Comfort Level; Two (2) small pillows; Carrying sackSPECIFICATIONS: Shell material: 210T Polyester, waterproof; Filling material: 300G /M2 Hollow Fibre; Lining material: Blue T/R; Pillow material: Blue T/R; Bag dimensions: 84\" x 55\"; Pillow dimension: 16\" x 10\"; Black compression stuff sack: 210T Fabic cloth", "text": "Huge Double Sleeping Bag 23F/-5C 2 Person Camping Hiking 86\"x60\" W/2 Pillows New This envelope-style sleeping bag is light-weight and can keep you warm at your camp site after a day of hiking and climbing. It's great for use in cabins and camping tents outdoor in temperate conditions. It's made of 210T Polyester, waterproof, comes with 2 pillows and a side zipper for easy entrance.FEATURES: Black and blue envelope style; Easy to roll up into the carrying sack; Warming design with a weatherstrip around it; Full Length Zipper with two zipper pullers (one zipper with double sliders, the other with one slider; Velcro strap on the side; Temperature Rating: -5 C/23F, 0 C/32F, 10 C/14F; Performance Rating: 2-3 Seasons; Two (2) person design for High Comfort Level; Two (2) small pillows; Carrying sackSPECIFICATIONS: Shell material: 210T Polyester, waterproof; Filling material: 300G /M2 Hollow Fibre; Lining material: Blue T/R; Pillow material: Blue T/R; Bag dimensions: 84\" x 55\"; Pillow dimension: 16\" x 10\"; Black compression stuff sack: 210T Fabic cloth", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hdZhTHDCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008G3Z8U0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B008GI7KKG", "title": "Bundle - 3 Items: 3 Twin-Packs 0f UCO Stormproof Matches (150 Matches)", "description": "Unlike other \"waterproof\" or \"windproof\" matches, the UCO Stormproof Matches are easy to light, and will stay lit for up to 15 seconds, even after being submerged in water! Being able to reliably make a fire is vital for cooking, generating warmth, and in survival situations, making signal fires. The UCO Stormproof Matches are perfect for camping, emergency kits, and should be part of every 10 Essentials check list. Each single box contains 25 matches and spare strikers.", "text": "Bundle - 3 Items: 3 Twin-Packs 0f UCO Stormproof Matches (150 Matches) Unlike other \"waterproof\" or \"windproof\" matches, the UCO Stormproof Matches are easy to light, and will stay lit for up to 15 seconds, even after being submerged in water! Being able to reliably make a fire is vital for cooking, generating warmth, and in survival situations, making signal fires. The UCO Stormproof Matches are perfect for camping, emergency kits, and should be part of every 10 Essentials check list. Each single box contains 25 matches and spare strikers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FiWgNlA3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008GI7KKG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 18.5}}
