{"item_id": "B008GQRP12", "title": "Organized Fishing 8 - Rod Modular Wall Rack", "description": "Organized Fishing 8 - Rod Modular Wall Rack. Store your equipment up and out of the way. As unique as it is attractive, because with its clever fish design, this Rack could even double as wall art! Holds up to eight rod-and-reel combos. As your collection grows, just buy another Rack to expand your capacity, since these Modular units link together and look great. Easily mounts to most walls. Exclusive Track Rack system allows for perfect rod alignment and capacity. Rugged rubber diamond plate inlays hold rod butts securely in place. Your choice of oak or black. From Organized Fishing, offering a variety of options for storing and organizing fishing gear. Very a-lure-ing: Room for additional clips; Comes with an assortment of clip sizes; Modular design, additional units fit together; Easy to mount and install; Each approx. 4 1/2 x 20 4/5 x 2 3/4\", 2.6 lbs.; State Color. Don't cast this off! Order your Modular Wall Rack today! Organized Fishing 8-Rod Modular Wall Rack", "text": "Organized Fishing 8 - Rod Modular Wall Rack Organized Fishing 8 - Rod Modular Wall Rack. Store your equipment up and out of the way. As unique as it is attractive, because with its clever fish design, this Rack could even double as wall art! Holds up to eight rod-and-reel combos. As your collection grows, just buy another Rack to expand your capacity, since these Modular units link together and look great. Easily mounts to most walls. Exclusive Track Rack system allows for perfect rod alignment and capacity. Rugged rubber diamond plate inlays hold rod butts securely in place. Your choice of oak or black. From Organized Fishing, offering a variety of options for storing and organizing fishing gear. Very a-lure-ing: Room for additional clips; Comes with an assortment of clip sizes; Modular design, additional units fit together; Easy to mount and install; Each approx. 4 1/2 x 20 4/5 x 2 3/4\", 2.6 lbs.; State Color. Don't cast this off! Order your Modular Wall Rack today! Organized Fishing 8-Rod Modular Wall Rack", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Xb-wajnKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008GQRP12.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Organized Fishing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Storage", "Rod Racks"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B008GS3T1K", "title": "Northstar Tactical Gator Top Pistol Gun Range Bag 12 X 9 inch (Black)", "description": "Northstar Tactical Range Bags, 1050 HD Tuff Cloth with Diamond Rip stop are built to last. Stay open top lets you leave the bag open for quick access to all of your contents. Built Northstar Tough.", "text": "Northstar Tactical Gator Top Pistol Gun Range Bag 12 X 9 inch (Black) Northstar Tactical Range Bags, 1050 HD Tuff Cloth with Diamond Rip stop are built to last. Stay open top lets you leave the bag open for quick access to all of your contents. Built Northstar Tough.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41atjNM0BtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008GS3T1K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Northstar Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B008GSOBTY", "title": "Mark III (22/45) Hammer Bushing for Magazine Disconnect - Steel", "description": "Now manufactured in steel on Amazon! All TANDEMKROSS MKIIIMD series bushings come with a LIFETIME guarantee! We all know the Ruger Mark III (22/45) is a terrific 22lr handgun that has proven its worth over and over. However many owners complain about the magazine disconnect and the problems it causes for quick mag changes and feed issues. This high quality steel bushing replaces the Ruger factory bushing and allows you to safely remove the Magazine Disconnect from the firearm. In doing so your magazine will seat better in the magwell minimizing failure to feeds and allow the magazine to drop freely when released. This is essential for tactical competition shooting and self defense scenarios. Although there are instructions on the internet showing the use of washers and other parts this can be unreliable and unsafe! Why not use an actual part that is designed for the job? This part is machined to the right tolerances and lets the hammer move properly at the correct speed. If you know how to clean this gun you can easily remove the disconnect and you will be pleased with the fit and final result. Buyer assumes all liability. Please check your local laws regarding the requirement for a Magazine Disconnect. MKIII MKIII 22-45 MKIII 22-45 Competition MKIII 22-45 Government Target MKIII 22-45 Target MKIII Competition MKIII Government Target MKIII Target MKIII LITE MKIII Hunter", "text": "Mark III (22/45) Hammer Bushing for Magazine Disconnect - Steel Now manufactured in steel on Amazon! All TANDEMKROSS MKIIIMD series bushings come with a LIFETIME guarantee! We all know the Ruger Mark III (22/45) is a terrific 22lr handgun that has proven its worth over and over. However many owners complain about the magazine disconnect and the problems it causes for quick mag changes and feed issues. This high quality steel bushing replaces the Ruger factory bushing and allows you to safely remove the Magazine Disconnect from the firearm. In doing so your magazine will seat better in the magwell minimizing failure to feeds and allow the magazine to drop freely when released. This is essential for tactical competition shooting and self defense scenarios. Although there are instructions on the internet showing the use of washers and other parts this can be unreliable and unsafe! Why not use an actual part that is designed for the job? This part is machined to the right tolerances and lets the hammer move properly at the correct speed. If you know how to clean this gun you can easily remove the disconnect and you will be pleased with the fit and final result. Buyer assumes all liability. Please check your local laws regarding the requirement for a Magazine Disconnect. MKIII MKIII 22-45 MKIII 22-45 Competition MKIII 22-45 Government Target MKIII 22-45 Target MKIII Competition MKIII Government Target MKIII Target MKIII LITE MKIII Hunter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41obACZiVIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008GSOBTY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 9.99}}
