{"item_id": "B008H7HOFC", "title": "Cheek Rest for Model 15 Buttstock Low", "description": "This durable, yet comfortable low rise cheek rest mounts onto your M4 style buttstock allowing you to rest your cheek when looking down your iron sight or into your optic. This allows for optimum sight picture and accurate and comfortable shooting.", "text": "Cheek Rest for Model 15 Buttstock Low This durable, yet comfortable low rise cheek rest mounts onto your M4 style buttstock allowing you to rest your cheek when looking down your iron sight or into your optic. This allows for optimum sight picture and accurate and comfortable shooting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EziF87c5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008H7HOFC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GRG MFG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B008H7PSUA", "title": "Enhanced AR15 Armorer Stock Spanner Wrench with Handle", "description": "Precision machined from heat treated steel, any AR enthusiast or builder will find this tool very helpful. This tool includes a Mil-Spec castle nut wrench, a standard length receiver extension removal wrench, and an A1/A2 Flash Suppressor wrench. Offering an improved grip, each tool has a rubberized grip for both safety and comfort. Every tool is coated in manganese phosphate for reduced visibility and corrosion resistance.", "text": "Enhanced AR15 Armorer Stock Spanner Wrench with Handle Precision machined from heat treated steel, any AR enthusiast or builder will find this tool very helpful. This tool includes a Mil-Spec castle nut wrench, a standard length receiver extension removal wrench, and an A1/A2 Flash Suppressor wrench. Offering an improved grip, each tool has a rubberized grip for both safety and comfort. Every tool is coated in manganese phosphate for reduced visibility and corrosion resistance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31u4WhoqN0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008H7PSUA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Field Sport Inc", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 5.58}}
