{"item_id": "B008HGKJXM", "title": "Pelican ProGear 35 Quart Elite Marine Cooler", "description": "Coolers built by the folks who make famous Pelican boxes are just as you expect: tough as he!! So tough, they are guaranteed for life! Features include freezer grade gasket, 2\" polyurethane insulation molded-in & hinged handles, wide press & pull latches, molded-In tie downs, non-skid & non-marking raised feet, molded-in lock hasp, sloped drain & tethered threaded plug, corrosion resistant stainless steel hardware, and integrated fish scale on lid. 35 Qt. Size: 26.41\" x 20\" x 18.75\", 5 Qt. Size: 29.66\" x 20\" x 19.25\", and 65 Qt. Size: 37.16\" x 20\" x 19.75\". Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Pelican ProGear 35 Quart Elite Marine Cooler Coolers built by the folks who make famous Pelican boxes are just as you expect: tough as he!! So tough, they are guaranteed for life! Features include freezer grade gasket, 2\" polyurethane insulation molded-in & hinged handles, wide press & pull latches, molded-In tie downs, non-skid & non-marking raised feet, molded-in lock hasp, sloped drain & tethered threaded plug, corrosion resistant stainless steel hardware, and integrated fish scale on lid. 35 Qt. Size: 26.41\" x 20\" x 18.75\", 5 Qt. Size: 29.66\" x 20\" x 19.25\", and 65 Qt. Size: 37.16\" x 20\" x 19.75\". Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K5qXuqfpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008HGKJXM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]]}}
