{"item_id": "B008HUF4L0", "title": "Us Army 3L Hydration Water Backpack and 2L Bicycle Mouth Water Bladder Bag and Outdoor Military Backpack Tactical Backpacks 35L", "description": "FEATURES: Backpack made by high density Nylon material. Large filling port with secure seal. Bite valve design, convenient for switch on/off the flow of water. Comes with bite valve cover. Completely safe to use. With hand carry strap and adjustable shoulder strap. Keep water cool for hours. Extra carrying space for storage. 3L hydration water reservoir is installed in the backpack.", "text": "Us Army 3L Hydration Water Backpack and 2L Bicycle Mouth Water Bladder Bag and Outdoor Military Backpack Tactical Backpacks 35L FEATURES: Backpack made by high density Nylon material. Large filling port with secure seal. Bite valve design, convenient for switch on/off the flow of water. Comes with bite valve cover. Completely safe to use. With hand carry strap and adjustable shoulder strap. Keep water cool for hours. Extra carrying space for storage. 3L hydration water reservoir is installed in the backpack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YMZInKhbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008HUF4L0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AirSoft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 15.56}}
{"item_id": "B008HUFLE0", "title": "Airsoft Element Clot 1911 M1911 Pistol Under Rail Mount Black", "description": "FEATURES:ABS polymer constructed.Provide extension 20mm RIS under rail for Colt 1911.For installing flashlight/laser in under rail position.Attach to trigger guard area of the pistol.Includes screws and nuts for installation.DETAILS:Element SKU - PA0205 Color - Matte black Weight - 25g Rail length - 50mm Rail type - 20mm Gun suitable - Colt 1911", "text": "Airsoft Element Clot 1911 M1911 Pistol Under Rail Mount Black FEATURES:ABS polymer constructed.Provide extension 20mm RIS under rail for Colt 1911.For installing flashlight/laser in under rail position.Attach to trigger guard area of the pistol.Includes screws and nuts for installation.DETAILS:Element SKU - PA0205 Color - Matte black Weight - 25g Rail length - 50mm Rail type - 20mm Gun suitable - Colt 1911", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313MGchRrBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008HUFLE0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 11.99}}
