{"item_id": "B008I5QA8U", "title": "Lone Wolf 4 in 1 Armorers Tool", "description": "The Lone Wolf Ultimate Armorers tool for Glock Pistols is the only tool you will ever need to completely disassemble your Glock pistol. This handy little life saver clips right in your shirt pocket and is actually four tools rolled into one.Fits easily in any range bag.", "text": "Lone Wolf 4 in 1 Armorers Tool The Lone Wolf Ultimate Armorers tool for Glock Pistols is the only tool you will ever need to completely disassemble your Glock pistol. This handy little life saver clips right in your shirt pocket and is actually four tools rolled into one.Fits easily in any range bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yj%2BVhxaML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008I5QA8U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B008I5VF9Y", "title": "AcidTactical® Red Dot Rifle Laser with Picatinny & Shotgun Mounts - Pressure Switch or Button - Aluminum Alloy", "description": "This is a solid RED DOT laser crafted in 100% Aircraft Grade Aluminum Alloy. It comes with all the allen wrenches to adjust windage/alignment, battery, and switches to either mount it with a vertical grip, or using the on/off button switch.Specifications:Tube width: 3/4\"Mount: 20mm Standard Picatinny/WeaverLength: 3.5\"Power: 5mW***Please Note***In order to provide our customers with the best prices on quality products and reduce waste, most of our items are shipped without retail packaging. If you require retail packaging, we may be able to provide it at an additional cost.NOTE!Acid Tacticalis the UPC owner of this item. Any other seller claiming to sell this items under the same UPC is not selling the same product. Quality, quantity, and description may not apply to any other seller under this listing. Be AwareNOTE!* It is the buyers responsibility to know their state and local gun laws. Some accessories may not be legally added to a firearm in particular states or in combination with other accessories. Please be aware of your local laws before adding any accessory to a firearm.", "text": "AcidTactical® Red Dot Rifle Laser with Picatinny & Shotgun Mounts - Pressure Switch or Button - Aluminum Alloy This is a solid RED DOT laser crafted in 100% Aircraft Grade Aluminum Alloy. It comes with all the allen wrenches to adjust windage/alignment, battery, and switches to either mount it with a vertical grip, or using the on/off button switch.Specifications:Tube width: 3/4\"Mount: 20mm Standard Picatinny/WeaverLength: 3.5\"Power: 5mW***Please Note***In order to provide our customers with the best prices on quality products and reduce waste, most of our items are shipped without retail packaging. If you require retail packaging, we may be able to provide it at an additional cost.NOTE!Acid Tacticalis the UPC owner of this item. Any other seller claiming to sell this items under the same UPC is not selling the same product. Quality, quantity, and description may not apply to any other seller under this listing. Be AwareNOTE!* It is the buyers responsibility to know their state and local gun laws. Some accessories may not be legally added to a firearm in particular states or in combination with other accessories. Please be aware of your local laws before adding any accessory to a firearm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YDig2O8tL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008I5VF9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B008I6B016", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Original Russian Military Surplus Mosin Nagant M38 M44 91/30 1891 91 30 7.62x54 Leather Srap Cartridge Ammo Ammunition Rounds Dual Pouch + Pack Of 5 Reusable Steel Stripper Clips Clip", "description": "The WWII style ammo pouch is an original unissued condition part made of an ored vinyl-coated canvas with pebble finish, a leather strap closures and 2\" belt loops. Measures 6 1/4 x 1 1/2 x 4\"h. Keep Mosin Nagant ammo (or similar) at the ready and within easy reach. The dual Pouches are ready for travel on either side of your belt for a balancing effect. Package of 5 Stripper clips for 7.62x54R ammo (Ammunition NOT included) . Use these stripper clips with your Mosin Nagant Rifle. Place these into the already existing guide on your rifle and press cartridges down at the base for the easiest and quickest loading possible. Can be used in the 9130, M38 and M44 rifles and carbines.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Original Russian Military Surplus Mosin Nagant M38 M44 91/30 1891 91 30 7.62x54 Leather Srap Cartridge Ammo Ammunition Rounds Dual Pouch + Pack Of 5 Reusable Steel Stripper Clips Clip The WWII style ammo pouch is an original unissued condition part made of an ored vinyl-coated canvas with pebble finish, a leather strap closures and 2\" belt loops. Measures 6 1/4 x 1 1/2 x 4\"h. Keep Mosin Nagant ammo (or similar) at the ready and within easy reach. The dual Pouches are ready for travel on either side of your belt for a balancing effect. Package of 5 Stripper clips for 7.62x54R ammo (Ammunition NOT included) . Use these stripper clips with your Mosin Nagant Rifle. Place these into the already existing guide on your rifle and press cartridges down at the base for the easiest and quickest loading possible. Can be used in the 9130, M38 and M44 rifles and carbines.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nXVuk3EPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008I6B016.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 14.95}}
