{"item_id": "B008ITZ4A6", "title": "G-Tip Gun Cleaning Low Lint Swabs Pointed 100-pk", "description": "G-Tips are made of the highest quality cotton and are perfect for cleaning small areas. LOW Lint and HIGH Strength. No more weak puffed out swabs. These are tightly woven and will not FUZZ out like common swabs. 100 in a pack! It's WORTH it!", "text": "G-Tip Gun Cleaning Low Lint Swabs Pointed 100-pk G-Tips are made of the highest quality cotton and are perfect for cleaning small areas. LOW Lint and HIGH Strength. No more weak puffed out swabs. These are tightly woven and will not FUZZ out like common swabs. 100 in a pack! It's WORTH it!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KD%2BqtDpRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008ITZ4A6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008IXHXWE", "title": "G.I. US Army ACU MOLLE II Waist Pack", "description": "G.I. US Army ACU MOLLE II Waist Pack. NSN: 8465-01-524-7263. This is the official \"issue\" waist pack that the Army distributes to deploying units, in addition to the MOLLE Rifleman Set, Rucksack, Assault Pack, and other items in the RFI ensemble. It attaches to the rucksack or assault pack, FLC vest, or can be worn by itself.", "text": "G.I. US Army ACU MOLLE II Waist Pack G.I. US Army ACU MOLLE II Waist Pack. NSN: 8465-01-524-7263. This is the official \"issue\" waist pack that the Army distributes to deploying units, in addition to the MOLLE Rifleman Set, Rucksack, Assault Pack, and other items in the RFI ensemble. It attaches to the rucksack or assault pack, FLC vest, or can be worn by itself.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GXkSWjD0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008IXHXWE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Protective Body Equipment", "Tactical Vests"]], "price": 17.0}}
{"item_id": "B008IXP6WI", "title": "Under Armour Men's ColdGear® Evo Scent Control Leggings", "description": "Exclusive UA Scent Control technology lasts longer and works better, keeping you undetected. Dual-layer fabric gives you a soft, ultra-warm interior and a slick, fast-drying exterior. 4-way stretch fabrication allows greater mobility and maintains shape. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the body. Quick-dry fabrication keeps you light and comfortable. Anti-odor technology prevents the growth of odor causing microbes. Smooth, chafe-free flatlock seam construction. Branded elastic waistband. Working fly. Polyester/Elastane. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Men's ColdGear® Evo Scent Control Leggings Exclusive UA Scent Control technology lasts longer and works better, keeping you undetected. Dual-layer fabric gives you a soft, ultra-warm interior and a slick, fast-drying exterior. 4-way stretch fabrication allows greater mobility and maintains shape. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the body. Quick-dry fabrication keeps you light and comfortable. Anti-odor technology prevents the growth of odor causing microbes. Smooth, chafe-free flatlock seam construction. Branded elastic waistband. Working fly. Polyester/Elastane. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-vuf3Vk4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008IXP6WI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]], "price": 62.99}}
{"item_id": "B008J0TOHS", "title": "Sportsman SSCC5 5-Ounce Stainless Steel Collapsible Cup (Discontinued by Manufacturer)", "description": "The pocket size Sportsman Series Stainless Steel Collapsible Cup fits in the palm of your hand so you always have a cup when you are out and about. The convenient collapsible size easily slips into your pocket, purse, or backpack, making it a great accessory to have while traveling, hiking, camping, attending concerts or watching your favorite team. When assembled, the Collapsible Cup holds 5-ounces of fluid. The keychain clip easily attaches to your backpack or belt loop.", "text": "Sportsman SSCC5 5-Ounce Stainless Steel Collapsible Cup (Discontinued by Manufacturer) The pocket size Sportsman Series Stainless Steel Collapsible Cup fits in the palm of your hand so you always have a cup when you are out and about. The convenient collapsible size easily slips into your pocket, purse, or backpack, making it a great accessory to have while traveling, hiking, camping, attending concerts or watching your favorite team. When assembled, the Collapsible Cup holds 5-ounces of fluid. The keychain clip easily attaches to your backpack or belt loop.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XojS92p3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008J0TOHS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sportsman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 6.68}}
{"item_id": "B008J4BBXY", "title": "Aurorae's Slip Free Yoga Mat sized Towel. Great for Hot/Active Yoga. Eco Safe, Hygienic, Super Absorbent Multi-purpose Lush Micro-fiber material. Sport Size 30\" x 20\", Long Mat Size 72\"x24\", 9 New Beautiful Colors that will Match/Coordinate with our Mats", "description": "Aurorae's Eco Safe, Hygienic, Super Absorbent Multipurpose Micro-fiber Towel. Light weight and easy to care for. This towel will easily out perform any ordinary cotton towel. For Yoga you can easily place this towel on the top of your yoga mat to prevent your hands from slipping. It will also absorb any perspiration that may accumulate on your body as well as your mat while practicing. Select from our 9 beautiful colors that will match your mat.", "text": "Aurorae's Slip Free Yoga Mat sized Towel. Great for Hot/Active Yoga. Eco Safe, Hygienic, Super Absorbent Multi-purpose Lush Micro-fiber material. Sport Size 30\" x 20\", Long Mat Size 72\"x24\", 9 New Beautiful Colors that will Match/Coordinate with our Mats Aurorae's Eco Safe, Hygienic, Super Absorbent Multipurpose Micro-fiber Towel. Light weight and easy to care for. This towel will easily out perform any ordinary cotton towel. For Yoga you can easily place this towel on the top of your yoga mat to prevent your hands from slipping. It will also absorb any perspiration that may accumulate on your body as well as your mat while practicing. Select from our 9 beautiful colors that will match your mat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AnmqbLsRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008J4BBXY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008JA02CO", "title": "Condor Double Kangaroo Pouch (Tan)", "description": "The Condor Kangaroo Pouch is design to hold both the M4 Mag and Pistol Mag with one single pouch. This is was a aftermath of our popular open-top style mag pouches, and few suggestion from LE/MIL personnel. The Kangaroo pouch has been tested and recommanded by NTAO.", "text": "Condor Double Kangaroo Pouch (Tan) The Condor Kangaroo Pouch is design to hold both the M4 Mag and Pistol Mag with one single pouch. This is was a aftermath of our popular open-top style mag pouches, and few suggestion from LE/MIL personnel. The Kangaroo pouch has been tested and recommanded by NTAO.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Iv57V5X0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JA02CO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B008JA2X5S", "title": "Schwinn AD6 Airdyne Exercise Bike (Black)", "description": "The Schwinn AD6 Airdyne bike is the perfect cardio machine for a home gym. It offers a cardio workout for both upper and lower body. With updated styling, and new features all over the bike, the Schwinn AD6 has the same dual motion benefits as its predecessor and a few cool surprises. The advantage of the unique air resistance system is that it offers as much resistance as you can handle.The Airdyne's dual-action arms help you work out your entire body.The harder you pedal, the greater the resistance. The dual-action design, meanwhile, synchronizes your arm and leg movements to simulate your natural motion, helping you work your upper and lower body at the same time. Finally, the air resistance system creates streams of cooling air while you pedal, making for a comfortable home workout.The Airdyne includes a comprehensive computer console that provides feedback on time, distance, workload level, calories burned, Watts, heart rate, and RPM. As a result, it's easy to keep track of your overall fitness level. The AD6 features an extra-padded anatomically seat and a capacity of 300 pounds. The Airdyne measures 50 by 26 by 51 inches (L x W x H), weighs 115 pounds, and carries the following warranties: 15 years on the frame, three years on parts, two years on electronics, and six months on labor items.About SchwinnIgnaz Schwinn and his partner Adolph Arnold incorporated Arnold, Schwinn & Company on October 22, 1895. Within a few short years of its inception, the company had become an acknowledged technical and quality leader within the bicycle industry. Now, more than 100 years later, Schwinn has become an American icon and built some of the best-known and best-loved bicycles of all time, including the Aerocycle, Paramount, Phantom, Varsity, Sting-Ray, Krate, Homegrown, and more. The company is also a leading purveyor of home and fitness equipment, and has been an indispensable player in revolutionizing biking and fitness around the world.airdyne2Compare these Airdyne ModelsModel Schwinn AD2 AirdyneSchwinn AD4 AirdyneSchwinn Airdyne Evo CompSchwinn AD6 AirdyneMSRP$599.00$750.00$900.00$999.00Resistance LevelsInfiniteInfiniteInfiniteInfiniteResistance SystemAirAirAirAirDrive SystemSingle stage-belt driveDual-stage chain and belt driveDual-stage Super Torque belt drivesDual-stage Super Torque belt drivesNumber of Workout Programs22WorkoutsSimultaneous upper / lower body or upper body workout onlySimultaneous upper / lower body or upper body workout onlySimultaneous upper / lower body or upper body workout onlySimultaneous upper / lower body or upper body workout onlyHeart RateTelemetry enabledTelemetry enabledTelemetry enabledDisplay TypeLCDLCDLCDLCDDisplay ReadoutsTime, Distance, Calories, RPMTime, Distance, Calories, Calories per Hour, RPM, Workload, and Heart RateTime, Distance, Calories, Calories per Hour, RPM, Workload, and Heart RateRevMeter, Time, Distance, Calories, RPM, Watts and Heart RatePower Requirements2 AA Batteries (not included)2 AA Batteries (not included)2 AA Batteries (not included)2 AA Batteries (not included)SeatPaddedExtra-padded, oversizedExtra-padded, oversizedExtra-padded, oversizedProduct Dimensions (L x W x H)58 x 25 x 48 inches50 x 23 x 48 inches50 x 23 x 48 inches50 x 26 x 51 inchesProduct Weight96 pounds96 pounds104 pounds115 poundsWarrantyFrame: 5 years, Parts: 1 year, Electronics: 1 year, Labor: 90 days, Wear Items: 90 daysFrame: 30 years, Parts: 3 years, Electronics: 3 years, Labor: 1 year, Wear Items: 1 yearFrame: 30 years, Parts: 3 years, Electronics: 3 years, Labor: 1 year, Wear Items: 1 yearFrame: 15 years, Parts: 3 years, Electronics: 2 years, Labor: 6 monthsMaxium User Weight250 pounds300 lbs300 lbs300 lbs", "text": "Schwinn AD6 Airdyne Exercise Bike (Black) The Schwinn AD6 Airdyne bike is the perfect cardio machine for a home gym. It offers a cardio workout for both upper and lower body. With updated styling, and new features all over the bike, the Schwinn AD6 has the same dual motion benefits as its predecessor and a few cool surprises. The advantage of the unique air resistance system is that it offers as much resistance as you can handle.The Airdyne's dual-action arms help you work out your entire body.The harder you pedal, the greater the resistance. The dual-action design, meanwhile, synchronizes your arm and leg movements to simulate your natural motion, helping you work your upper and lower body at the same time. Finally, the air resistance system creates streams of cooling air while you pedal, making for a comfortable home workout.The Airdyne includes a comprehensive computer console that provides feedback on time, distance, workload level, calories burned, Watts, heart rate, and RPM. As a result, it's easy to keep track of your overall fitness level. The AD6 features an extra-padded anatomically seat and a capacity of 300 pounds. The Airdyne measures 50 by 26 by 51 inches (L x W x H), weighs 115 pounds, and carries the following warranties: 15 years on the frame, three years on parts, two years on electronics, and six months on labor items.About SchwinnIgnaz Schwinn and his partner Adolph Arnold incorporated Arnold, Schwinn & Company on October 22, 1895. Within a few short years of its inception, the company had become an acknowledged technical and quality leader within the bicycle industry. Now, more than 100 years later, Schwinn has become an American icon and built some of the best-known and best-loved bicycles of all time, including the Aerocycle, Paramount, Phantom, Varsity, Sting-Ray, Krate, Homegrown, and more. The company is also a leading purveyor of home and fitness equipment, and has been an indispensable player in revolutionizing biking and fitness around the world.airdyne2Compare these Airdyne ModelsModel Schwinn AD2 AirdyneSchwinn AD4 AirdyneSchwinn Airdyne Evo CompSchwinn AD6 AirdyneMSRP$599.00$750.00$900.00$999.00Resistance LevelsInfiniteInfiniteInfiniteInfiniteResistance SystemAirAirAirAirDrive SystemSingle stage-belt driveDual-stage chain and belt driveDual-stage Super Torque belt drivesDual-stage Super Torque belt drivesNumber of Workout Programs22WorkoutsSimultaneous upper / lower body or upper body workout onlySimultaneous upper / lower body or upper body workout onlySimultaneous upper / lower body or upper body workout onlySimultaneous upper / lower body or upper body workout onlyHeart RateTelemetry enabledTelemetry enabledTelemetry enabledDisplay TypeLCDLCDLCDLCDDisplay ReadoutsTime, Distance, Calories, RPMTime, Distance, Calories, Calories per Hour, RPM, Workload, and Heart RateTime, Distance, Calories, Calories per Hour, RPM, Workload, and Heart RateRevMeter, Time, Distance, Calories, RPM, Watts and Heart RatePower Requirements2 AA Batteries (not included)2 AA Batteries (not included)2 AA Batteries (not included)2 AA Batteries (not included)SeatPaddedExtra-padded, oversizedExtra-padded, oversizedExtra-padded, oversizedProduct Dimensions (L x W x H)58 x 25 x 48 inches50 x 23 x 48 inches50 x 23 x 48 inches50 x 26 x 51 inchesProduct Weight96 pounds96 pounds104 pounds115 poundsWarrantyFrame: 5 years, Parts: 1 year, Electronics: 1 year, Labor: 90 days, Wear Items: 90 daysFrame: 30 years, Parts: 3 years, Electronics: 3 years, Labor: 1 year, Wear Items: 1 yearFrame: 30 years, Parts: 3 years, Electronics: 3 years, Labor: 1 year, Wear Items: 1 yearFrame: 15 years, Parts: 3 years, Electronics: 2 years, Labor: 6 monthsMaxium User Weight250 pounds300 lbs300 lbs300 lbs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416dXrFOUIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JA2X5S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 544.3}}
{"item_id": "B008JA2Y0W", "title": "Bowflex SelectTech Dumbbell Stand (2013)", "description": "The perfect complement to your Bowflex SelectTech Dumbbells, the Bowflex SelectTech Dumbbell Stand features an ergonomic design that helps protect your lower back. You'll never have to bend down to pick up your weights again. The handsome, ultra-sleek design will fit well in any workout area. It also comes with a built-in rack for hanging towels. This stand measures 20\" x 26\" x 23\" inches Assembly is required.Manufacturer Warranty5-year warranty", "text": "Bowflex SelectTech Dumbbell Stand (2013) The perfect complement to your Bowflex SelectTech Dumbbells, the Bowflex SelectTech Dumbbell Stand features an ergonomic design that helps protect your lower back. You'll never have to bend down to pick up your weights again. The handsome, ultra-sleek design will fit well in any workout area. It also comes with a built-in rack for hanging towels. This stand measures 20\" x 26\" x 23\" inches Assembly is required.Manufacturer Warranty5-year warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GCYsfOmlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JA2Y0W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bowflex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Racks", "Dumbbell Racks"]], "price": 129.98}}
{"item_id": "B008JEBKNA", "title": "NiteRider MiNewt Mini 350 Light", "description": "As the sun goes down, and you're on your way home for the night, your 20 lumen light provides some visibility but lacks the ability to light up the ground in front of you. So, if you love blindly hitting potholes at speed, we recommend keeping your wimpy light. However, if you want to see and be seen, you need to step up your light-game with the new NiteRider MiNewt Mini 350 Light. The MiNewt Mini 350 packs 350 lumens into a small light that, instead of projecting a concentrated beam, casts a broad beam in front of you. It has three solid light levels -- high, medium, and low, and it also has a flash setting that lets you adjust the brightness during your ride. Depending on your setting, the battery will last two hours at 350 lumens, four hours at 200 lumens, and six hours at 125 lumens. And to save you from a mid-ride blackout, the battery indicator tells you when it is time to recharge. With unsightly, bulky constructions that clutters your handlebars, most high-lumen lights are beyond frustrating to use -- not so with MiNewt Mini. The lights compact construction keeps the body low on your bars, and NiteRider also made it a breeze to install and remove in hurry. To minimize its profile and visibility on the bars, the battery pack mounts under your stem. And for versatility between your bikes, the light mount accommodates handlebars up to 31. 8mm. The NiteRider MiNewt Mini 350 Light comes with a USB charger, and takes about 4-1/2 hours to fully charge. The entire assembly weighs in around 175 grams.", "text": "NiteRider MiNewt Mini 350 Light As the sun goes down, and you're on your way home for the night, your 20 lumen light provides some visibility but lacks the ability to light up the ground in front of you. So, if you love blindly hitting potholes at speed, we recommend keeping your wimpy light. However, if you want to see and be seen, you need to step up your light-game with the new NiteRider MiNewt Mini 350 Light. The MiNewt Mini 350 packs 350 lumens into a small light that, instead of projecting a concentrated beam, casts a broad beam in front of you. It has three solid light levels -- high, medium, and low, and it also has a flash setting that lets you adjust the brightness during your ride. Depending on your setting, the battery will last two hours at 350 lumens, four hours at 200 lumens, and six hours at 125 lumens. And to save you from a mid-ride blackout, the battery indicator tells you when it is time to recharge. With unsightly, bulky constructions that clutters your handlebars, most high-lumen lights are beyond frustrating to use -- not so with MiNewt Mini. The lights compact construction keeps the body low on your bars, and NiteRider also made it a breeze to install and remove in hurry. To minimize its profile and visibility on the bars, the battery pack mounts under your stem. And for versatility between your bikes, the light mount accommodates handlebars up to 31. 8mm. The NiteRider MiNewt Mini 350 Light comes with a USB charger, and takes about 4-1/2 hours to fully charge. The entire assembly weighs in around 175 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hS5wn0t3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JEBKNA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NiteRider", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 74.23}}
{"item_id": "B008JFC7I6", "title": "Replacement Thicker Helmet Foam Pads Cushions Kit for Giro Atmos", "description": "Atermarket Thicker upgrade/replacement foam padding kit for your Giro Atmos, If you're considering buying this kit, dont wait, this is a great way to get more use out of a helmet that can no longer be used due to old worn out padding or if you simply want to add a higher level of comfort to your helmet , it's an excellent way to save money, instead of buying a new helmet just buy the replacement foam pads and it'll feel more comfortable than when you first bought it, we guarantee you'll be happy with this item or we'll refund your money. they stick to the velcro thats already in your existing helmet, high quality ultracell foam washable and durable, if your helmet needs new foam pads or you want to upgrade to a thicker version of whats already in your helmet, take advantage of this opportunity your satisfaction is guaranteed or your money back. Note: these were removed from the package in order to take the picture you will recieve a brand new kit in the sealed package. PLEASE NOTE THIS IS NOT MADE BY GIRO OR BELL IT IS CUSTOM MANUFACTURED BY US, YOUR SATISFACTION IS GUARANTEED OR YOUR MONEY BACK", "text": "Replacement Thicker Helmet Foam Pads Cushions Kit for Giro Atmos Atermarket Thicker upgrade/replacement foam padding kit for your Giro Atmos, If you're considering buying this kit, dont wait, this is a great way to get more use out of a helmet that can no longer be used due to old worn out padding or if you simply want to add a higher level of comfort to your helmet , it's an excellent way to save money, instead of buying a new helmet just buy the replacement foam pads and it'll feel more comfortable than when you first bought it, we guarantee you'll be happy with this item or we'll refund your money. they stick to the velcro thats already in your existing helmet, high quality ultracell foam washable and durable, if your helmet needs new foam pads or you want to upgrade to a thicker version of whats already in your helmet, take advantage of this opportunity your satisfaction is guaranteed or your money back. Note: these were removed from the package in order to take the picture you will recieve a brand new kit in the sealed package. PLEASE NOTE THIS IS NOT MADE BY GIRO OR BELL IT IS CUSTOM MANUFACTURED BY US, YOUR SATISFACTION IS GUARANTEED OR YOUR MONEY BACK", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414P3bUzukL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JFC7I6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B008JG2TBA", "title": "OD Green Military Issue 2 Quart Water Canteen with New issue Carrier and sling free ship", "description": "The canteen is 2 Quart, Army Issue, and OD Green. The Pouch is OD Color, brand with carry sling. Military issue 2 Quart Collapsible Water Canteen and Carry Pouch / Cover with Adjustable Sling", "text": "OD Green Military Issue 2 Quart Water Canteen with New issue Carrier and sling free ship The canteen is 2 Quart, Army Issue, and OD Green. The Pouch is OD Color, brand with carry sling. Military issue 2 Quart Collapsible Water Canteen and Carry Pouch / Cover with Adjustable Sling", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xduy63jaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JG2TBA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Military issue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B008JG5U2A", "title": "Penn Spinfisher V Spinning Reel", "description": "Water Tight Design A total of 6 seals (9 seals on the live liner models) are used to create the new Water Tight Design used in the Spinfisher V. Whether you dunk the reel in the surf, or let it ride in the spray all the way home, you don't have to worry about saltwater getting into the gearbox or drag system. Slammer Drag System A truly sealed drag system with a total of 3 HT-100 drag washers (1 on the top of the spool, 2 underneath the spool). All HT-100 washers are greased for smoothness and longevity. Extreme range, endless adjustment, and a large diameter drag knob so you can easily crank down to max drag. Full Metal Body A full metal body and sideplate keep precise gear alignment under heavy loads. Superline SpoolTM No backing needed because the rubber gasket keeps superline from slipping. Line Capacity Rings Eliminates the question of how much line you have left when fighting a fish. The three lines on the spool flange let you know when you have 1/3rd, 2/3rd or a full spool of line. Also if you respool often these lines find you a benchmark for backing your superlines with monofilament which will help eliminate wasted time and line.", "text": "Penn Spinfisher V Spinning Reel Water Tight Design A total of 6 seals (9 seals on the live liner models) are used to create the new Water Tight Design used in the Spinfisher V. Whether you dunk the reel in the surf, or let it ride in the spray all the way home, you don't have to worry about saltwater getting into the gearbox or drag system. Slammer Drag System A truly sealed drag system with a total of 3 HT-100 drag washers (1 on the top of the spool, 2 underneath the spool). All HT-100 washers are greased for smoothness and longevity. Extreme range, endless adjustment, and a large diameter drag knob so you can easily crank down to max drag. Full Metal Body A full metal body and sideplate keep precise gear alignment under heavy loads. Superline SpoolTM No backing needed because the rubber gasket keeps superline from slipping. Line Capacity Rings Eliminates the question of how much line you have left when fighting a fish. The three lines on the spool flange let you know when you have 1/3rd, 2/3rd or a full spool of line. Also if you respool often these lines find you a benchmark for backing your superlines with monofilament which will help eliminate wasted time and line.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BYIhpLbSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JG5U2A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008JGYRZQ", "title": "Pro-Shot .223 Caliber/5.56-mm Bore Guide for AR15/M16 Style Rifle", "description": "Bore Guides protect the bore throat and keep cleaning solvent from getting into the trigger mechanism.", "text": "Pro-Shot .223 Caliber/5.56-mm Bore Guide for AR15/M16 Style Rifle Bore Guides protect the bore throat and keep cleaning solvent from getting into the trigger mechanism.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kNxSkf83L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JGYRZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro Shot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 20.69}}
{"item_id": "B008JH04TS", "title": "Polar Insulated Water Bottle (24-Ounce, USA Pro Cycling Challenge Yellow Leader Jersey)", "description": "Designated as the Official Water Bottle of the USA Pro Cycling Challenge, Polar Bottle has created a variety of bottles designed for the race. The graphics are inspired by each of the five Leader's Jerseys: Overall Leader, Best Young Rider, Best Sprinter, King of The Mountains and Most Aggressive Rider along with a Commemorative Stage Route bottle.Dual-wall construction: Insulating layer of air keeps heat out and cold inInner foil liner reflects solar rays for added thermal protectionConstructed of low density polyethylene (LDPE #4): a durable, lightweight, and FDA food-grade approved material that complies with the Consumer Product Safety Improvement Act of 2008 (CPSIA) and California Proposition 74Reusable and durable; a practical and environmentally friendly alternative to disposable water bottles24 oz bottle includes a removable carrying strap so you can easily carry it or clip it to your gear", "text": "Polar Insulated Water Bottle (24-Ounce, USA Pro Cycling Challenge Yellow Leader Jersey) Designated as the Official Water Bottle of the USA Pro Cycling Challenge, Polar Bottle has created a variety of bottles designed for the race. The graphics are inspired by each of the five Leader's Jerseys: Overall Leader, Best Young Rider, Best Sprinter, King of The Mountains and Most Aggressive Rider along with a Commemorative Stage Route bottle.Dual-wall construction: Insulating layer of air keeps heat out and cold inInner foil liner reflects solar rays for added thermal protectionConstructed of low density polyethylene (LDPE #4): a durable, lightweight, and FDA food-grade approved material that complies with the Consumer Product Safety Improvement Act of 2008 (CPSIA) and California Proposition 74Reusable and durable; a practical and environmentally friendly alternative to disposable water bottles24 oz bottle includes a removable carrying strap so you can easily carry it or clip it to your gear", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41y2iDUQyxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JH04TS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B008JH56AA", "title": "Caldwell Bipod Adaptor for Picatinny Rail", "description": "The Bipod adaptor quickly and easily attaches to a picatinny rail. Any standard bipod or sling can then be attached to the integrated swivel stud. A curved \"fore-end style\" profile assures the perfect fit for the bipod to mate with. Light weight yet durable machined anodized aluminum construction provide durable and reliable performance. Two integrated fasteners ensure a secure attachment that won't rattle loose during heavy use.", "text": "Caldwell Bipod Adaptor for Picatinny Rail The Bipod adaptor quickly and easily attaches to a picatinny rail. Any standard bipod or sling can then be attached to the integrated swivel stud. A curved \"fore-end style\" profile assures the perfect fit for the bipod to mate with. Light weight yet durable machined anodized aluminum construction provide durable and reliable performance. Two integrated fasteners ensure a secure attachment that won't rattle loose during heavy use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3190YIhcwuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JH56AA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 12.89}}
{"item_id": "B008JH65DC", "title": "AK Pistol Grip Screw Set for MAK90", "description": "PISTOL GRIP SCREW & BASE HAS A LENGTH OF 4.25 INCH. COMPATIBLE WITH AK & MAK90. ATTACHES THE PISTOL GRIP TO THE STOCK AND FEATURES ALL STEEL CONSTRUCTION.", "text": "AK Pistol Grip Screw Set for MAK90 PISTOL GRIP SCREW & BASE HAS A LENGTH OF 4.25 INCH. COMPATIBLE WITH AK & MAK90. ATTACHES THE PISTOL GRIP TO THE STOCK AND FEATURES ALL STEEL CONSTRUCTION.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31j1lEH5QaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JH65DC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.93}}
{"item_id": "B008JHQRDU", "title": "SRAM X9 Type-2 10 Speed Rear Derailleur", "description": "Type 2 adds the Roller Bearing Clutch to a normal X.9 derailleur to deliver maximum drivetrain stability, even through rough terrain. This clutch eliminates bounce and chain slap without sacrificing precision. Clutch is self-lubricating, maintenance free, uses needle bearings, and comes factory calibrated from SRAM.", "text": "SRAM X9 Type-2 10 Speed Rear Derailleur Type 2 adds the Roller Bearing Clutch to a normal X.9 derailleur to deliver maximum drivetrain stability, even through rough terrain. This clutch eliminates bounce and chain slap without sacrificing precision. Clutch is self-lubricating, maintenance free, uses needle bearings, and comes factory calibrated from SRAM.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CkwX9q3pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JHQRDU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Derailleurs", "Rear Derailleurs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008JO4SHK", "title": "Pinemeadow Golf Men's PGX Putter", "description": "The putter features a precise white finish which stands out when the putter is in the address position on the green. This contrast of the white color against the green grass really helps maintain focus on the alignment lines that help ensure that your putter is on target at start. At 380g the additional 40g weight of the mallet putter is “tour-weighted”, suited best for the faster greens that are more and more common around the world. You’ll also get a smooth forward spinning ball at impact with reduced skid giving you stability in your putting game.", "text": "Pinemeadow Golf Men's PGX Putter The putter features a precise white finish which stands out when the putter is in the address position on the green. This contrast of the white color against the green grass really helps maintain focus on the alignment lines that help ensure that your putter is on target at start. At 380g the additional 40g weight of the mallet putter is “tour-weighted”, suited best for the faster greens that are more and more common around the world. You’ll also get a smooth forward spinning ball at impact with reduced skid giving you stability in your putting game.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ykEOpSrGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JO4SHK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Clubs", "Putters"]], "price": 35.64}}
{"item_id": "B008JX0QP4", "title": "Sawyer Inline Adapters for Screw On Filters", "description": "FEATURES of the Sawyer Inline Adapters for Screw On Filters Turn your Sawyer screw on/off filter into an inline filtration system for your hydration pack with this simple accessory Compatible with the Sawyer Squeeze Filter and the All in One Filter Hydration pack not included", "text": "Sawyer Inline Adapters for Screw On Filters FEATURES of the Sawyer Inline Adapters for Screw On Filters Turn your Sawyer screw on/off filter into an inline filtration system for your hydration pack with this simple accessory Compatible with the Sawyer Squeeze Filter and the All in One Filter Hydration pack not included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tIlcK29AL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JX0QP4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sawyer Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 8.06}}
{"item_id": "B008JXV2PM", "title": "Woodland Camouflage Waterproof Bivy Cover", "description": "The Waterproof GORE-TEX Bivy Cover is produced utilizing waterproof, moisture-vapor-permeable material with all seams heat sealed. A component of the Military Modular Sleep System, the Bivy is designed to cover the Patrol and Intermediate Cold Weather sleeping bags and fit into the compression stuff sack. 81-83\" Long, 34-36\" Wide (top) 27-29\" Wide (foot) Less than 3 pounds", "text": "Woodland Camouflage Waterproof Bivy Cover The Waterproof GORE-TEX Bivy Cover is produced utilizing waterproof, moisture-vapor-permeable material with all seams heat sealed. A component of the Military Modular Sleep System, the Bivy is designed to cover the Patrol and Intermediate Cold Weather sleeping bags and fit into the compression stuff sack. 81-83\" Long, 34-36\" Wide (top) 27-29\" Wide (foot) Less than 3 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51leJxSmdqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008JXV2PM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tennier Indistries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Bivy Sacks"]], "price": 50.45}}
{"item_id": "B008K7WQ8E", "title": "550lbs Paracord Type III 7 Strand Polyester Cord Rope 100 Feet", "description": "Manufactured by a Certified US Government Contractor. Made From 100% Heavy Duty POLYESTER Material. 550 LBS Strength Tested. 7 Strand Cord. Removable Inner Strands by 2 ply. 5/32\" Diameter. A must have for any survival kit. Better Than Military Specifications. Top Quality Craftsmanship, Detailed Construction. Quick Drying & Will Not Rot or Mildew. 100 Feet Long. PROUDLY MADE IN THE USA!Paracord direct from the manufacturer. Commercial Grade Paracord not Mil-Spec. When reliability is a must, this is what you want. This is the real thing, not a cheap imitation. Some uses for this cord can be: Ridgelines for Tarps Securing Equipment Shoelaces, Hanging Food from Bears, Vehicle Tie Downs, Sewing Fabric, Repairing Equipment, Making a Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String for a Bow, Making a Shelter, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares Clothes Lines, Paracord Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, Bracelets, Paracord Bracelets & Other Paracord Crafts. This is just a small list of what paracords can be used for. Use your imagination and the possibilities are endless!Specifications- Made From 100% Heavy Duty Polyester Material- 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core- 5/32\" Diameter- Removable Inner Strands by 2 Ply- GSA Compliant- Quick Drying & Will Not Rot or Mildew- 100 Feet Long- Better Than Military Specifications- Made In The USATHESE PARACORDS ARE MADE SPECIFICALLY BY ARMYUNIVERSE & NOT ANY OTHER BRAND. THEY COME SEALED IN A PLASTIC BAG WITH HANG TAG & OFFICIAL ARMYUNIVERSE LOGO & PACKAGING.", "text": "550lbs Paracord Type III 7 Strand Polyester Cord Rope 100 Feet Manufactured by a Certified US Government Contractor. Made From 100% Heavy Duty POLYESTER Material. 550 LBS Strength Tested. 7 Strand Cord. Removable Inner Strands by 2 ply. 5/32\" Diameter. A must have for any survival kit. Better Than Military Specifications. Top Quality Craftsmanship, Detailed Construction. Quick Drying & Will Not Rot or Mildew. 100 Feet Long. PROUDLY MADE IN THE USA!Paracord direct from the manufacturer. Commercial Grade Paracord not Mil-Spec. When reliability is a must, this is what you want. This is the real thing, not a cheap imitation. Some uses for this cord can be: Ridgelines for Tarps Securing Equipment Shoelaces, Hanging Food from Bears, Vehicle Tie Downs, Sewing Fabric, Repairing Equipment, Making a Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String for a Bow, Making a Shelter, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares Clothes Lines, Paracord Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, Bracelets, Paracord Bracelets & Other Paracord Crafts. This is just a small list of what paracords can be used for. Use your imagination and the possibilities are endless!Specifications- Made From 100% Heavy Duty Polyester Material- 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core- 5/32\" Diameter- Removable Inner Strands by 2 Ply- GSA Compliant- Quick Drying & Will Not Rot or Mildew- 100 Feet Long- Better Than Military Specifications- Made In The USATHESE PARACORDS ARE MADE SPECIFICALLY BY ARMYUNIVERSE & NOT ANY OTHER BRAND. THEY COME SEALED IN A PLASTIC BAG WITH HANG TAG & OFFICIAL ARMYUNIVERSE LOGO & PACKAGING.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41srbUEx3YL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008K7WQ8E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B008K8SZGK", "title": "AR-15 Bullet Button Magazine Clip Drop Release Tool - ThumBee - CA legal Black", "description": "The ThumBee is an elastic band with a metal \"stinger\" (like a bee) that slides onto your thumb. Position the \"stinger\" towards the bullet button and you can drop the magazine from your gun right into your hand - not on the floor (unless you want to let it drop). Your ThumBee never gets in the way of anything and is always there when you need it. Remember, to be LEGAL, you must use an external tool. Anything that attaches to the gun, such as a magnet button is ILLEGAL. ThumBee is 100% legal, so no need to look over your shoulder when using it. A great gift for someone looking for AR-15 parts, tools, or who is building their own AR15.", "text": "AR-15 Bullet Button Magazine Clip Drop Release Tool - ThumBee - CA legal Black The ThumBee is an elastic band with a metal \"stinger\" (like a bee) that slides onto your thumb. Position the \"stinger\" towards the bullet button and you can drop the magazine from your gun right into your hand - not on the floor (unless you want to let it drop). Your ThumBee never gets in the way of anything and is always there when you need it. Remember, to be LEGAL, you must use an external tool. Anything that attaches to the gun, such as a magnet button is ILLEGAL. ThumBee is 100% legal, so no need to look over your shoulder when using it. A great gift for someone looking for AR-15 parts, tools, or who is building their own AR15.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HyW7cS8nL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008K8SZGK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 7.5}}
{"item_id": "B008K9GDWW", "title": "Frog Lube Paste Wipes 5Pk", "description": "NEW Pre-Moistened Wipes Saturated With the Power of Froglube CLP. This product is a cutting edge biodegradable lubricant made from \"food-grade\" ingredients products in the USA using a proprietary formula. It is a non-toxic substance that dissolves carbon, grease and sludge on contact. It has a heavy specific gravity which allows it to \"season\" the metal through absorption deep into the pores and results in a durable slippery surface that reduces friction. Metal, plastic, urethan, nylon or other durable surfaced treated with FROGLUBE are rejuvenated, perserved and will give extended years of service. FROGLUBE will not harm the environment. It can be disposed of without the need of HAZMAT controls. If used in the workplace, employees will be protected from the affects of other toxic chemicals. Includes: 1 package of 5 sheets.", "text": "Frog Lube Paste Wipes 5Pk NEW Pre-Moistened Wipes Saturated With the Power of Froglube CLP. This product is a cutting edge biodegradable lubricant made from \"food-grade\" ingredients products in the USA using a proprietary formula. It is a non-toxic substance that dissolves carbon, grease and sludge on contact. It has a heavy specific gravity which allows it to \"season\" the metal through absorption deep into the pores and results in a durable slippery surface that reduces friction. Metal, plastic, urethan, nylon or other durable surfaced treated with FROGLUBE are rejuvenated, perserved and will give extended years of service. FROGLUBE will not harm the environment. It can be disposed of without the need of HAZMAT controls. If used in the workplace, employees will be protected from the affects of other toxic chemicals. Includes: 1 package of 5 sheets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ri8XnPTyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008K9GDWW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frog Lube", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 7.49}}
{"item_id": "B008KCL6YO", "title": "NightRider Lumina Handlebar Mount", "description": "The NightRider Lumina Handlebar Mount provides rock solid mounting for riding on or off road.", "text": "NightRider Lumina Handlebar Mount The NightRider Lumina Handlebar Mount provides rock solid mounting for riding on or off road.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41we5MlshvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008KCL6YO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NiteRider", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 12.74}}
