{"item_id": "B008KKNMBG", "title": "Light & Motion Urban 550", "description": "Light technology has evolved so rapidly in the past five years, it's hard to imagine we now have the luxury of mounting self-contained lights as powerful as car headlights on our handlebars. But pure power isn't always the best option for every rider. The Urban 180/200/300/400/500/550/700 Light from Light & Motion lacks some of the impressive illuminating capabilities of its older brothers, but not coming at the cost of supreme portability, weatherproofing, or ease of use. The Urban 200 makes for an excellent commuting light, as it's powerful enough to set afire those darkened streets and alleys that the city commission forgot, without running the risk of blinding an oncoming driver. Few cycling lights come with the pedigree of those from Light & Motion -- a company who has been designing lights for over 20 years. But not always bicycle lights. In fact, the small Monterey, California company cut its teeth making ocean-proof diving lights that adhered to some of the most stringent safety standards in consumer products. The DNA for safe, highly visible and weatherproof lights for cycling was already in place, and thus we have the Urban 200. Just as its title implies, the Urban 200 casts a bright 200 lumens beam to help you see and be seen. For the sake of comparison, a typical car headlight tends to put out around 200 or 200 lumens. Even with its lowered power, the level of performance that the Urban 200 delivers still grants a significant degree of forward visibility, giving you plenty of time to react to anything that might lie in waiting on the road. And like the Vis series, Light and Motion's Urban lights have amber side lights to increase your cone of visibility, adding to your safety. Accident data tells us that most car/bike accidents occur at intersections, and not surprisingly, with cars turning into or across cyclist's paths as they thread their way through the intersection. So the more light you can project in all directions, the better.", "text": "Light & Motion Urban 550 Light technology has evolved so rapidly in the past five years, it's hard to imagine we now have the luxury of mounting self-contained lights as powerful as car headlights on our handlebars. But pure power isn't always the best option for every rider. The Urban 180/200/300/400/500/550/700 Light from Light & Motion lacks some of the impressive illuminating capabilities of its older brothers, but not coming at the cost of supreme portability, weatherproofing, or ease of use. The Urban 200 makes for an excellent commuting light, as it's powerful enough to set afire those darkened streets and alleys that the city commission forgot, without running the risk of blinding an oncoming driver. Few cycling lights come with the pedigree of those from Light & Motion -- a company who has been designing lights for over 20 years. But not always bicycle lights. In fact, the small Monterey, California company cut its teeth making ocean-proof diving lights that adhered to some of the most stringent safety standards in consumer products. The DNA for safe, highly visible and weatherproof lights for cycling was already in place, and thus we have the Urban 200. Just as its title implies, the Urban 200 casts a bright 200 lumens beam to help you see and be seen. For the sake of comparison, a typical car headlight tends to put out around 200 or 200 lumens. Even with its lowered power, the level of performance that the Urban 200 delivers still grants a significant degree of forward visibility, giving you plenty of time to react to anything that might lie in waiting on the road. And like the Vis series, Light and Motion's Urban lights have amber side lights to increase your cone of visibility, adding to your safety. Accident data tells us that most car/bike accidents occur at intersections, and not surprisingly, with cars turning into or across cyclist's paths as they thread their way through the intersection. So the more light you can project in all directions, the better.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d1LVYiBOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008KKNMBG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Light and Motion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 91.95}}
{"item_id": "B008KKNNKG", "title": "Light and Motion Urban 400 Bike Head Light", "description": "Handlebar lights are rarely as powerful as they are portable, and if they are, rarely weatherproof as well. The Urban 400 Light from Light & Motion handily delivers that trifecta, while also packing in plenty of style and ease of use to boot. Few cycling lights come with the pedigree of those from Light & Motion -- a company who has been designing lights for over 20 years. But not always bicycle lights though. In fact, the small Monterey, California company cut its teeth making ocean-proof diving lights that adhered to some of the most stringent safety standards in consumer products. The DNA for safe, highly visible and weatherproof lights for cycling was already in place, and thus we have the Urban 400. Just as its title implies, the Urban 400 casts a bright 400 lumens beam to help you see and be seen. For the sake of comparison, a typical car headlight tends to put out around 700 or 800 lumens. The level of performance that the Urban 400 delivers allows you to fly over broken pavement at night, seeing the obstacles and having time to avoid them before you run over them. Like the Vis series, Light and Motion's Urban lights have amber side lights to increase your cone of visibility, adding to your safety. Accident data tells us that most car/bike accidents occur at intersections, and not surprisingly, with cars turning into or across cyclist's paths as they thread their way through the intersection. So the more light you can project in all directions, the better. The Light and Motion Urban 400 Light will run for 2 hours on the high setting and for 4 hours on medium. The lowest setting stretches the lithium-ion battery life out to 8 hours, and once it's dead, a complete charge by means of the included USB-Micro charge cable requires around 5 hours. It's designed to be mounted onto your handlebars and comes with a rubberized, tool-free strap that secures the light in an instant.", "text": "Light and Motion Urban 400 Bike Head Light Handlebar lights are rarely as powerful as they are portable, and if they are, rarely weatherproof as well. The Urban 400 Light from Light & Motion handily delivers that trifecta, while also packing in plenty of style and ease of use to boot. Few cycling lights come with the pedigree of those from Light & Motion -- a company who has been designing lights for over 20 years. But not always bicycle lights though. In fact, the small Monterey, California company cut its teeth making ocean-proof diving lights that adhered to some of the most stringent safety standards in consumer products. The DNA for safe, highly visible and weatherproof lights for cycling was already in place, and thus we have the Urban 400. Just as its title implies, the Urban 400 casts a bright 400 lumens beam to help you see and be seen. For the sake of comparison, a typical car headlight tends to put out around 700 or 800 lumens. The level of performance that the Urban 400 delivers allows you to fly over broken pavement at night, seeing the obstacles and having time to avoid them before you run over them. Like the Vis series, Light and Motion's Urban lights have amber side lights to increase your cone of visibility, adding to your safety. Accident data tells us that most car/bike accidents occur at intersections, and not surprisingly, with cars turning into or across cyclist's paths as they thread their way through the intersection. So the more light you can project in all directions, the better. The Light and Motion Urban 400 Light will run for 2 hours on the high setting and for 4 hours on medium. The lowest setting stretches the lithium-ion battery life out to 8 hours, and once it's dead, a complete charge by means of the included USB-Micro charge cable requires around 5 hours. It's designed to be mounted onto your handlebars and comes with a rubberized, tool-free strap that secures the light in an instant.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VUPJvlQyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008KKNNKG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Light and Motion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 82.95}}
{"item_id": "B008KKQ68W", "title": "GLOCK FACTORY TAKEDOWN ARMORERS TOOL 17 18 19 20 21 22 23 26 27 32 33 35 36 37 - Glock® Disassembly Tool, Black, GT03374", "description": "The simple punch is the right size to work with all of the Glock pins and helps facilitate breakdown. The Glock dis-assembly tool is an official Glock product and is part of the issued equipment given to Glock Certified Armorers. The Glock dis-assembly tool will work on all Glock pistols.", "text": "GLOCK FACTORY TAKEDOWN ARMORERS TOOL 17 18 19 20 21 22 23 26 27 32 33 35 36 37 - Glock® Disassembly Tool, Black, GT03374 The simple punch is the right size to work with all of the Glock pins and helps facilitate breakdown. The Glock dis-assembly tool is an official Glock product and is part of the issued equipment given to Glock Certified Armorers. The Glock dis-assembly tool will work on all Glock pistols.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31c-ZYX%2BLcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008KKQ68W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 6.44}}
{"item_id": "B008KKXXVU", "title": "Singapore Sling Throwing Axe Silver With Sheath", "description": "Constructed from solid 420 stainless steel. Designed to slash through the air and nail the bullseye with ease. Includes custom sheath. 5 3/8\" blade, 11 3/8\" overall.", "text": "Singapore Sling Throwing Axe Silver With Sheath Constructed from solid 420 stainless steel. Designed to slash through the air and nail the bullseye with ease. Includes custom sheath. 5 3/8\" blade, 11 3/8\" overall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21lJtzW4gjL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008KKXXVU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 17.52}}
{"item_id": "B008KMOSAI", "title": "Pocket Pro Timer II CEI001", "description": "Competition Electronics is one of the big players in the electronic timer and chronograph business. The Pocket Pro Timer II is the timer of choice for three reasons: it's easy to use, it's extremely durable and it's not only the lowest price, full function timer available...it's the best! Adjustable sensitivity, saves batteries with automatic power down, instant or random delayed start buzzer, review, split and par time standard. You can use it to time your shooting speed and tm increase your shooting speed. You'll be able to see the progress you make by the lower times you record. Features: • Size fits nicely in your hand with the start button on the side. • Powerful 105 dB buzzer transmits well through hearing protection • Separate shot sensor and buzzer for best performance • Large buttons are positioned with enough space for big hands. • Intuitive menu and navigation that's easy to learn and remember. • Automatically turns off after 10 minutes of inactivity. • Large clothespin style belt clip fits over your shooting belt. • Display position is readable from your belt or the bench.", "text": "Pocket Pro Timer II CEI001 Competition Electronics is one of the big players in the electronic timer and chronograph business. The Pocket Pro Timer II is the timer of choice for three reasons: it's easy to use, it's extremely durable and it's not only the lowest price, full function timer available...it's the best! Adjustable sensitivity, saves batteries with automatic power down, instant or random delayed start buzzer, review, split and par time standard. You can use it to time your shooting speed and tm increase your shooting speed. You'll be able to see the progress you make by the lower times you record. Features: • Size fits nicely in your hand with the start button on the side. • Powerful 105 dB buzzer transmits well through hearing protection • Separate shot sensor and buzzer for best performance • Large buttons are positioned with enough space for big hands. • Intuitive menu and navigation that's easy to learn and remember. • Automatically turns off after 10 minutes of inactivity. • Large clothespin style belt clip fits over your shooting belt. • Display position is readable from your belt or the bench.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sdqXlOiTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008KMOSAI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Competition Electronics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets"]], "price": 119.09}}
{"item_id": "B008KOFDEG", "title": "ZT Zero Tolerance 0561 Hinderer Collaboration Dark Earth Scale Folder", "description": "Based on Rick's crave-worthy XM-18, the new ZT 0561 is one completely amazing knife. First, the blade. It's pure ELMAX powdered steel for the extreme edge retention, high strength, and toughness a hard-use knife demands. It rolls out of the handle on the KVT ball-bearing system so deployment is rapid and it's ready when you need it. The handle is 3-D machined G-10 on the front, and equally 3-D machined titanium on the back. A framelock with lockbar stabilizer ensures a rocksolid lockup every time. To ensure this big bear of a knife carries at a comfortable weight, ZT has skeletonized the liner and machined pockets in the titanium handle and framelock. And to top it all off, the 0561 is equipped with ZT's new deep-carry pocketclip. With flat dark earth front scale.", "text": "ZT Zero Tolerance 0561 Hinderer Collaboration Dark Earth Scale Folder Based on Rick's crave-worthy XM-18, the new ZT 0561 is one completely amazing knife. First, the blade. It's pure ELMAX powdered steel for the extreme edge retention, high strength, and toughness a hard-use knife demands. It rolls out of the handle on the KVT ball-bearing system so deployment is rapid and it's ready when you need it. The handle is 3-D machined G-10 on the front, and equally 3-D machined titanium on the back. A framelock with lockbar stabilizer ensures a rocksolid lockup every time. To ensure this big bear of a knife carries at a comfortable weight, ZT has skeletonized the liner and machined pockets in the titanium handle and framelock. And to top it all off, the 0561 is equipped with ZT's new deep-carry pocketclip. With flat dark earth front scale.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v-jcp-THL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008KOFDEG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zero Tolerance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 191.87}}
{"item_id": "B008KPAB8S", "title": "Belly Band Gun Concealment Holster", "description": "Looking for a an easy carry solution for under sweats or shorts? Consider a belly band. Great for carrying while exercising, hot weather, or just being 'comfortable'. The wide, 6\" elastic band 'breathes', and the extra width keeps it in place comfortably. The band is kept closed with 4 inches of heavy-duty Velcro hook and 6\" of loop, so you can be assured of a comfortable fit even after a Thanksgiving feast. Holster is 4\" wide, and made of the same tough elastic banding. The holster can be positioned for either left or right-handed carry, and will accomodate most handguns. A 4\" pocket is also on the belly band for holding 2 extra magazines. Available in 2 colors, black and white, and 4 sizes for your perfect combination. Sizes available, by waist measurement, are SMALL (30-34\"), MEDIUM (34-38\"), LARGE (38-42\"), and XLarge (42-46\"). Made in the USA", "text": "Belly Band Gun Concealment Holster Looking for a an easy carry solution for under sweats or shorts? Consider a belly band. Great for carrying while exercising, hot weather, or just being 'comfortable'. The wide, 6\" elastic band 'breathes', and the extra width keeps it in place comfortably. The band is kept closed with 4 inches of heavy-duty Velcro hook and 6\" of loop, so you can be assured of a comfortable fit even after a Thanksgiving feast. Holster is 4\" wide, and made of the same tough elastic banding. The holster can be positioned for either left or right-handed carry, and will accomodate most handguns. A 4\" pocket is also on the belly band for holding 2 extra magazines. Available in 2 colors, black and white, and 4 sizes for your perfect combination. Sizes available, by waist measurement, are SMALL (30-34\"), MEDIUM (34-38\"), LARGE (38-42\"), and XLarge (42-46\"). Made in the USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ne%2BlnG16L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008KPAB8S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 29.0}}
{"item_id": "B008KS4DGQ", "title": "FNH 45 Revolution Blade Tech OWB Holster (with both Paddle and ASR Belt attachment)", "description": "New Revolution Holster holds your FNH 45 safely and securely with the Positive Lock Trigger Guard. There are two retention screws, allowing the users to fine tune their draw to their specific needs. As an added Bonus you get BOTH the Adjustable Sting Ray AND the Paddle attachment to accommodate to your personal carry preference. High quality molded IDPA legal Holster at an affordable price.", "text": "FNH 45 Revolution Blade Tech OWB Holster (with both Paddle and ASR Belt attachment) New Revolution Holster holds your FNH 45 safely and securely with the Positive Lock Trigger Guard. There are two retention screws, allowing the users to fine tune their draw to their specific needs. As an added Bonus you get BOTH the Adjustable Sting Ray AND the Paddle attachment to accommodate to your personal carry preference. High quality molded IDPA legal Holster at an affordable price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41geTBtm-WL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008KS4DGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blade-Tech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B008KSI1LE", "title": "Light and Motion Vis 180 Micro Bike Tail Light", "description": "Vis 180 isn't just a clever name, it's the truth. The Light & Motion Vis 180 Micro Light provides a full 180 degrees of visibility in traffic with a large light bar in the back and a flashing light on each side, so drivers will be able to see you. The Vis 180 is extremely easy to install. No tools are necessary. You simply place the mount pad where you want it on the seatpost, wrap the strap around and through the loop, and pull tight. It's just like putting on a belt to hold your pants up. The light itself then attaches to this bracket with an adjustable quick-release system so you can take it with you quickly and easily.", "text": "Light and Motion Vis 180 Micro Bike Tail Light Vis 180 isn't just a clever name, it's the truth. The Light & Motion Vis 180 Micro Light provides a full 180 degrees of visibility in traffic with a large light bar in the back and a flashing light on each side, so drivers will be able to see you. The Vis 180 is extremely easy to install. No tools are necessary. You simply place the mount pad where you want it on the seatpost, wrap the strap around and through the loop, and pull tight. It's just like putting on a belt to hold your pants up. The light itself then attaches to this bracket with an adjustable quick-release system so you can take it with you quickly and easily.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w4NVG1BSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008KSI1LE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Light and Motion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B008KUXRAW", "title": "WindFire Waterproof Cree XM-L U2 LED Bicycle Light & Rechargeable Battery Pack & Charger, CREE XM-L U2 LED Bicycle bike HeadLight Lamp Flashlight, Cree LED Bike Lmap Light Super Bright Lighting Lamp for Outdoor Sports Like Cmaping, Hiking Activities", "description": "Aluminum alloy casing, waterproof design, long service life.Equipped with an elastic & adjustable headlamp band and 2 plastic rings, very convenient.Suitable for cycling, climbing, fishing, hunting, camping and other outdoor activities.Description:Function: CREE XM-L T6 U2 LED Bicycle Light and Headlamp.2 in 1 functions: It can be used both as a Bicycle light and Head Light.Brand: WIndFireType of LED: CREE XM-L T6 U2 LED.Material:- Aluminum alloy casing, avoid high temperature, anti fall-off.- Aluminum alloy reflector.- Coated Glass Lens.Switch Modes:High / Low / Strobe.Runtime: Up to 2 hours run-time at 100% brightness (manufacturer rated).Power Source: 1 x 8.4v rechargeable Battery Pack.Input: 100V-240V, 50/60Hz.Output:- Voltage: DC 8.4V.- Current: 1A.Package include:1 x WindFire? CREE XM-L T6 U2 LED Bicycle Lamp Headlightt.1 x Adjustable headband.2 x Rubber ring for installation.1 x 6400mAh Battery Pack.1 x AC charger (100-240V).1 x Plug Adaptor (if need).WindFire After Sale Service: 30 days money back, one year warranty.", "text": "WindFire Waterproof Cree XM-L U2 LED Bicycle Light & Rechargeable Battery Pack & Charger, CREE XM-L U2 LED Bicycle bike HeadLight Lamp Flashlight, Cree LED Bike Lmap Light Super Bright Lighting Lamp for Outdoor Sports Like Cmaping, Hiking Activities Aluminum alloy casing, waterproof design, long service life.Equipped with an elastic & adjustable headlamp band and 2 plastic rings, very convenient.Suitable for cycling, climbing, fishing, hunting, camping and other outdoor activities.Description:Function: CREE XM-L T6 U2 LED Bicycle Light and Headlamp.2 in 1 functions: It can be used both as a Bicycle light and Head Light.Brand: WIndFireType of LED: CREE XM-L T6 U2 LED.Material:- Aluminum alloy casing, avoid high temperature, anti fall-off.- Aluminum alloy reflector.- Coated Glass Lens.Switch Modes:High / Low / Strobe.Runtime: Up to 2 hours run-time at 100% brightness (manufacturer rated).Power Source: 1 x 8.4v rechargeable Battery Pack.Input: 100V-240V, 50/60Hz.Output:- Voltage: DC 8.4V.- Current: 1A.Package include:1 x WindFire? CREE XM-L T6 U2 LED Bicycle Lamp Headlightt.1 x Adjustable headband.2 x Rubber ring for installation.1 x 6400mAh Battery Pack.1 x AC charger (100-240V).1 x Plug Adaptor (if need).WindFire After Sale Service: 30 days money back, one year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513KonG0e6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008KUXRAW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cree", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets"]], "price": 16.52}}
