{"item_id": "B008L33VH2", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear AR-15 AR15 AR M4 Stock Spanner Multi Armorer's Wrench Tool For Castle Nut , Buffer Tube Installation / Uninstallation & A1 / A2 Flash Suppressor Wrench - Steel With Rubberized Grip", "description": "Designed to install and uninstall a carbine style AR-15 buttstock nut, this AR-15/M4 Stock Wrench contacts the castle nut securely in three notches to ensure a smooth and uniform installation. This tool also provides a boxed end wrench for removing the fixed stock receiver extensions (buffer tubes) found on full size rifles, and an A1/A2 flash suppressor wrench. Manufactured from steel with a soft rubber handle, this tool will provide you with years of use. A must have for any AR owner. Length: 8 Inches , Weight: 4.7 oz", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear AR-15 AR15 AR M4 Stock Spanner Multi Armorer's Wrench Tool For Castle Nut , Buffer Tube Installation / Uninstallation & A1 / A2 Flash Suppressor Wrench - Steel With Rubberized Grip Designed to install and uninstall a carbine style AR-15 buttstock nut, this AR-15/M4 Stock Wrench contacts the castle nut securely in three notches to ensure a smooth and uniform installation. This tool also provides a boxed end wrench for removing the fixed stock receiver extensions (buffer tubes) found on full size rifles, and an A1/A2 flash suppressor wrench. Manufactured from steel with a soft rubber handle, this tool will provide you with years of use. A must have for any AR owner. Length: 8 Inches , Weight: 4.7 oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nu5uCiTAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008L33VH2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AR-GEAR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 13.95}}
