{"item_id": "B008L6BCIO", "title": "Mil Spec Standard AR-15 Front Sight with A2 Sight Post", "description": "Features: Quickly detachable low-profile front sight tower A2 square post assembly to fit all Picatinny/Weaver style rails Designed to be used with handguard rails or high-profile gas blocks Thumb nut with locking retention Precision elevation adjustments to enhance shooting accuracy Specifications: Material: Aluminum Weight: 2.1 ounces Pieces: 1 Rail Type: Picatinny/Weaver Dimensions: 1.4 by 1.9 by 1.75 inches (L x W x H", "text": "Mil Spec Standard AR-15 Front Sight with A2 Sight Post Features: Quickly detachable low-profile front sight tower A2 square post assembly to fit all Picatinny/Weaver style rails Designed to be used with handguard rails or high-profile gas blocks Thumb nut with locking retention Precision elevation adjustments to enhance shooting accuracy Specifications: Material: Aluminum Weight: 2.1 ounces Pieces: 1 Rail Type: Picatinny/Weaver Dimensions: 1.4 by 1.9 by 1.75 inches (L x W x H", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31B7jsVUvxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008L6BCIO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SNIPER", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B008L71FAS", "title": "CREE XML XM-L T6 LED Bike Bicycle Light HeadLight HeadLamp 1200LM Red", "description": "Aluminum alloy casing, waterproof design, long service life.Equipped with an elastic & adjustable headlamp band and 2 plastic rings, very convenient.Suitable for cycling, climbing, fishing, hunting, camping and other outdoor activities.Specifications:Color: Black + RedReflector: Flat LensMaterial: Aluminum alloy + PlasticModel of LED: CREE XML T6Switch: End-cap press ON/OFFBattery: 8800mA Li-ion (included)Input: 100V-240V, 50/60HzOutput: 4.2V DC/1.APlug: USHeadLamp size: 4.2 * 5.8cm(D*H) (1.6 * 2.28in)HeadLamp weight: 112g / 4.0ozPackage size: 23.5* 7.5 * 7.5cm (9.3 * 3.0 * 3.0in)Package weight: 480g / 16.9ozPackage including:1 * CREE XML T6 HeadLight1 * HeadLight Band1 * Battery1 * Power Charger2 * Plastic Rings1 * User manual", "text": "CREE XML XM-L T6 LED Bike Bicycle Light HeadLight HeadLamp 1200LM Red Aluminum alloy casing, waterproof design, long service life.Equipped with an elastic & adjustable headlamp band and 2 plastic rings, very convenient.Suitable for cycling, climbing, fishing, hunting, camping and other outdoor activities.Specifications:Color: Black + RedReflector: Flat LensMaterial: Aluminum alloy + PlasticModel of LED: CREE XML T6Switch: End-cap press ON/OFFBattery: 8800mA Li-ion (included)Input: 100V-240V, 50/60HzOutput: 4.2V DC/1.APlug: USHeadLamp size: 4.2 * 5.8cm(D*H) (1.6 * 2.28in)HeadLamp weight: 112g / 4.0ozPackage size: 23.5* 7.5 * 7.5cm (9.3 * 3.0 * 3.0in)Package weight: 480g / 16.9ozPackage including:1 * CREE XML T6 HeadLight1 * HeadLight Band1 * Battery1 * Power Charger2 * Plastic Rings1 * User manual", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xmiW5LecL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008L71FAS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cree", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B008L958Z4", "title": "SE - Hatchet - Multi-use, 3 in 1, Rubberized Handle, 13in. - 881MA", "description": "This multi-function hatchet has 3 functions: hatchet, hammer, and crow bar. It has an overall length of 13in., has a black metal body, and a comfort grip handle.", "text": "SE - Hatchet - Multi-use, 3 in 1, Rubberized Handle, 13in. - 881MA This multi-function hatchet has 3 functions: hatchet, hammer, and crow bar. It has an overall length of 13in., has a black metal body, and a comfort grip handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31X5r%2BG%2BUEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008L958Z4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 1.0}}
{"item_id": "B008LHMFMK", "title": "Apex Tactical S&W Shield Trigger Kit for 9mm and .40 S&W", "description": "Products included: 1 ea. (7 total pieces in the package) A) Apex Fully Machined Sear B) Ultimate Striker Block Kit (Striker Block, Spring & Talon Tactical Rear Sight Tool) C) Shield Spring Kit (Trigger Return Spring, Shield Slave Pin & Sear spring) What each part does: A) Fully Machined Sear: Reduces trigger pull weight, over travel and reset. B) Ultimate Striker Block Kit: Smoothes trigger uptake and reduces the double click reset. C) Springs balance out the whole system so it works smoothly Duty/Carry Spring Kit: 1) Trigger return spring: Sets the trigger pull weight into the 5 lb range and increases uptake pressure 2) Shield Slave Pin: Used to hold tension on the trigger return spring during installation. 3) Sear Spring: Aids in returning the Sear to its ready to fire position and maintains trigger pull weight. Expected results 1) Trigger Pull in the mid 5lb range 2) Smooth Uptake and reset 3) Reduced over travel 4) Reduced reset This is a do-it-yourself drop in trigger enhancement kit designed to allow for the home gunsmith to easily modify their pistol without the excessive costs of shipping firearms. Applicable to what guns? Smith & Wesson Shield only. Both 9 and 40 Caliber.", "text": "Apex Tactical S&W Shield Trigger Kit for 9mm and .40 S&W Products included: 1 ea. (7 total pieces in the package) A) Apex Fully Machined Sear B) Ultimate Striker Block Kit (Striker Block, Spring & Talon Tactical Rear Sight Tool) C) Shield Spring Kit (Trigger Return Spring, Shield Slave Pin & Sear spring) What each part does: A) Fully Machined Sear: Reduces trigger pull weight, over travel and reset. B) Ultimate Striker Block Kit: Smoothes trigger uptake and reduces the double click reset. C) Springs balance out the whole system so it works smoothly Duty/Carry Spring Kit: 1) Trigger return spring: Sets the trigger pull weight into the 5 lb range and increases uptake pressure 2) Shield Slave Pin: Used to hold tension on the trigger return spring during installation. 3) Sear Spring: Aids in returning the Sear to its ready to fire position and maintains trigger pull weight. Expected results 1) Trigger Pull in the mid 5lb range 2) Smooth Uptake and reset 3) Reduced over travel 4) Reduced reset This is a do-it-yourself drop in trigger enhancement kit designed to allow for the home gunsmith to easily modify their pistol without the excessive costs of shipping firearms. Applicable to what guns? Smith & Wesson Shield only. Both 9 and 40 Caliber.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YtmEXEQ9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008LHMFMK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apex Tactical Specialties", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 89.9}}
{"item_id": "B008LOW38E", "title": "Mountain House Scrambled Eggs with Bacon - 1.5 Servings", "description": "An essential addition to your backpack for your next camping trip! In addition, freeze-dried meals are perfect to keep for your home disaster/emergency survival kit, due to their long shelf life. Freeze dried, scrambled-egg mix, flavored with real bacon. Stand-up pouch creates an easy way to cook and eat your meal; made from high-barrier foil, the pouch keeps your meal hot. Just add boiling water and enjoy an egg breakfast in only minutes. Nutrition facts displayed here and on packaging may differ. Information on packaging reflects actual contents. INGREDIENTS: Freeze Dried Precooked Scrambled Eggs: (whole eggs, egg yolks, nonfat dry milk, modified corn starch, corn oil, salt, yeast extact, sunflower oil and smoke flavor, xanthan gum). BACON: Bacon (cured with water, salt, sugar, sodium phosphates, sodium erythorbate, sodium nitrite), and Smoke Flavor Contains: Eggs, Milk", "text": "Mountain House Scrambled Eggs with Bacon - 1.5 Servings An essential addition to your backpack for your next camping trip! In addition, freeze-dried meals are perfect to keep for your home disaster/emergency survival kit, due to their long shelf life. Freeze dried, scrambled-egg mix, flavored with real bacon. Stand-up pouch creates an easy way to cook and eat your meal; made from high-barrier foil, the pouch keeps your meal hot. Just add boiling water and enjoy an egg breakfast in only minutes. Nutrition facts displayed here and on packaging may differ. Information on packaging reflects actual contents. INGREDIENTS: Freeze Dried Precooked Scrambled Eggs: (whole eggs, egg yolks, nonfat dry milk, modified corn starch, corn oil, salt, yeast extact, sunflower oil and smoke flavor, xanthan gum). BACON: Bacon (cured with water, salt, sugar, sodium phosphates, sodium erythorbate, sodium nitrite), and Smoke Flavor Contains: Eggs, Milk", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YGVfv49jL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008LOW38E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Liberty Mountain", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 9.68}}
{"item_id": "B008LX5Y04", "title": "UTAC AR Ar15 M4 Flat Top Compact 1/2 Inch Riser Mount Picatinny-Weaver Rail", "description": "1) 8 Slots Compact See-Through Weaver /Picatinny Rail2) 1/2\" Low Profile3) Quick-Attach Thumb Nuts4) Fits AR15/ M16 /FALs Flat Tops5) Hard-coat Anodized Finish6) Premium Aircraft Grade 6061 Aluminum", "text": "UTAC AR Ar15 M4 Flat Top Compact 1/2 Inch Riser Mount Picatinny-Weaver Rail 1) 8 Slots Compact See-Through Weaver /Picatinny Rail2) 1/2\" Low Profile3) Quick-Attach Thumb Nuts4) Fits AR15/ M16 /FALs Flat Tops5) Hard-coat Anodized Finish6) Premium Aircraft Grade 6061 Aluminum", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TwRWm4hWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008LX5Y04.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Rails"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B008LY0F84", "title": "1911 Torx Grip Screws with Black Zinc Coating x4 pcs", "description": "Featuring the Strike Industries 1911 Torx Pistol Grip Screws and Bushings (sold separately). This SI hardware not only provides a secure fasten for your 1911 grip, it also provides a finishing touch to the user's 1911 platform. These screws and bushings come in two versions: standard and slimline (see specs below) and are made of 100% stainless steel. Both items are fitted with Torx heads to not only ensure a secure fasten but also add a cosmetic dimension to the pistol. The SI 1911 screws and bushings will be available in several finishes; BLUE finish, Zinc, Chrome, and Gold-plated. Purchase your set while supplies last!", "text": "1911 Torx Grip Screws with Black Zinc Coating x4 pcs Featuring the Strike Industries 1911 Torx Pistol Grip Screws and Bushings (sold separately). This SI hardware not only provides a secure fasten for your 1911 grip, it also provides a finishing touch to the user's 1911 platform. These screws and bushings come in two versions: standard and slimline (see specs below) and are made of 100% stainless steel. Both items are fitted with Torx heads to not only ensure a secure fasten but also add a cosmetic dimension to the pistol. The SI 1911 screws and bushings will be available in several finishes; BLUE finish, Zinc, Chrome, and Gold-plated. Purchase your set while supplies last!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31X441GK6HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008LY0F84.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B008LY1MWM", "title": "1911 Grip Screw Bushings with Black Zinc Coating x4 pcs", "description": "Featuring the Strike Industries 1911 Torx Pistol Grip Screws and Bushings (sold separately). This SI hardware not only provides a secure fasten for your 1911 grip, it also provides a finishing touch to the user's 1911 platform. These screws and bushings come in two versions: standard and slimline (see specs below) and are made of 100% stainless steel. Both items are fitted with Torx heads to not only ensure a secure fasten but also add a cosmetic dimension to the pistol. The SI 1911 screws and bushings will be available in several finishes; BLUE finish, Zinc, Chrome, and Gold-plated. Purchase your set while supplies last!", "text": "1911 Grip Screw Bushings with Black Zinc Coating x4 pcs Featuring the Strike Industries 1911 Torx Pistol Grip Screws and Bushings (sold separately). This SI hardware not only provides a secure fasten for your 1911 grip, it also provides a finishing touch to the user's 1911 platform. These screws and bushings come in two versions: standard and slimline (see specs below) and are made of 100% stainless steel. Both items are fitted with Torx heads to not only ensure a secure fasten but also add a cosmetic dimension to the pistol. The SI 1911 screws and bushings will be available in several finishes; BLUE finish, Zinc, Chrome, and Gold-plated. Purchase your set while supplies last!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bfcOa-mhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008LY1MWM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft"]], "price": 6.99}}
