{"item_id": "B008LYHZIM", "title": "UTAC 1.5x-5x Variable Magnifier For Red Dot Sight with Flip-to-Side Mount", "description": "The MS155 Magnifier mounts behind red dot scope on Picatinny Rail to provide magnification from 1.5x to 5x. The MS155 Magnifier is used to increase the range of your red dot sight with precision. The MS155 Magnifier does not need to be sighted-in - only sight in your red dot scope, and attach the MS155 Magnifier. It s easy to install right behind the scope to magnify your targets, and simple to use. The MS155 also doubles as a hand-held monocular. Zoom in on your targets easily just by looking through the tube.Magnification: 1.5x - 5xObjective Diameter: 21mmOcular Diameter: 26mmField Angel: 7 degree - 4.5 degreeExit Pupil: 4-10mmEye Relief: 55-100mmWeight: 210GLength: 120mmWaterproof: YesShock Proof & Fully Coated With An Anodized Finish For Heavy Duty RecoilPackage include: 1.5x-5x magnifier, 30mm flip-to-side mount. Red dot or quad rail shown in product picture is not included.", "text": "UTAC 1.5x-5x Variable Magnifier For Red Dot Sight with Flip-to-Side Mount The MS155 Magnifier mounts behind red dot scope on Picatinny Rail to provide magnification from 1.5x to 5x. The MS155 Magnifier is used to increase the range of your red dot sight with precision. The MS155 Magnifier does not need to be sighted-in - only sight in your red dot scope, and attach the MS155 Magnifier. It s easy to install right behind the scope to magnify your targets, and simple to use. The MS155 also doubles as a hand-held monocular. Zoom in on your targets easily just by looking through the tube.Magnification: 1.5x - 5xObjective Diameter: 21mmOcular Diameter: 26mmField Angel: 7 degree - 4.5 degreeExit Pupil: 4-10mmEye Relief: 55-100mmWeight: 210GLength: 120mmWaterproof: YesShock Proof & Fully Coated With An Anodized Finish For Heavy Duty RecoilPackage include: 1.5x-5x magnifier, 30mm flip-to-side mount. Red dot or quad rail shown in product picture is not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LRrmvBUoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008LYHZIM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B008M5TSCG", "title": "Lee Precision Classic Turret Press Kit", "description": "This kit and a set of Lee dies is everything you need to begin reloading. The Classic turret press is fast and convenient when loading handgun cartridges, with rates in excess of 250 rounds per hour possible. The kit includes the Pro Auto-Disk powder measure and riser, perfect for all handgun and small rifle cartridges. Large and Small Safety Primeare included making on press priming an ease. Instant change turret makes changing calibers a snap. Deactivate the auto-index and batch load the longest and largest rifle cartridges. Complementing your press kit are the case conditioning tools to prepare your brass for loading. Includes Cutter, Lock Stud, Chamfer Tool, small and large Primer Pocket Cleaner, and a tube of Lee case sizing lube. Complete it with the cartridge specific Case Length Gauge. Verify your loads with the included Lee Safety powder scale. Completing the kit is Modern Reloading Second Editionrecently revised with all new load data covering 167 cartridges with over 28,000 loads. Note: the Bench Plate system the Classic Turret Press is mounted to in the photo is sold separately.", "text": "Lee Precision Classic Turret Press Kit This kit and a set of Lee dies is everything you need to begin reloading. The Classic turret press is fast and convenient when loading handgun cartridges, with rates in excess of 250 rounds per hour possible. The kit includes the Pro Auto-Disk powder measure and riser, perfect for all handgun and small rifle cartridges. Large and Small Safety Primeare included making on press priming an ease. Instant change turret makes changing calibers a snap. Deactivate the auto-index and batch load the longest and largest rifle cartridges. Complementing your press kit are the case conditioning tools to prepare your brass for loading. Includes Cutter, Lock Stud, Chamfer Tool, small and large Primer Pocket Cleaner, and a tube of Lee case sizing lube. Complete it with the cartridge specific Case Length Gauge. Verify your loads with the included Lee Safety powder scale. Completing the kit is Modern Reloading Second Editionrecently revised with all new load data covering 167 cartridges with over 28,000 loads. Note: the Bench Plate system the Classic Turret Press is mounted to in the photo is sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TBRqm6G5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008M5TSCG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 229.98}}
