{"item_id": "B008MAUI1Q", "title": "ES12 Portable Launch Monitor and Digital Golf Assistant\"", "description": "Ernest Sports ES12 Digital Golf Assistant New Instant Biofeedback TechnologyThe ES12 is an incredibly accurate portable launch monitor that provides for an enjoyable and informative golf experience.Combined with the Ernest Sports app, the ES12 is great for golfers of all levels of expertise. From junior golfers to scratch golfers, this system incorporates technique with enjoyment, bringing new life to your golf game.This complete package includes Range Data, Scorecard, Video Analysis, Bluetooth Audible Feedback and much more.", "text": "ES12 Portable Launch Monitor and Digital Golf Assistant\" Ernest Sports ES12 Digital Golf Assistant New Instant Biofeedback TechnologyThe ES12 is an incredibly accurate portable launch monitor that provides for an enjoyable and informative golf experience.Combined with the Ernest Sports app, the ES12 is great for golfers of all levels of expertise. From junior golfers to scratch golfers, this system incorporates technique with enjoyment, bringing new life to your golf game.This complete package includes Range Data, Scorecard, Video Analysis, Bluetooth Audible Feedback and much more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SM8bD75xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MAUI1Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ernest Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Swing Trainers"]], "price": 194.99}}
