{"item_id": "B008MBQWIS", "title": "Zero Tolerance ZT0350TSST G10 Handle Folding Tiger Striped Partial Serrated Blade with SpeedSafe", "description": "The Zero Tolerance 0350st is 10% smaller and lighter than the classic 0300, with a new partially serrated blade for added cutting versatility, while maintaining the cutting and piercing power that made the original such a popular model. It's equipped with SpeedSafe manual assist for easy one-handed opening, meaning you can easily deploy the blade while wearing tactical gloves by using the large, ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion. The stout, sharp blade is made of S30V stainless steel with a rugged Tungsten DLC (Diamond-like Carbon) coating. Textured, matte-black G-10 scales on the synthetic handle provide an extra-secure grip, and the knife comes complete with a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left-, or right-handed clip carry.SpecificationsS30V stainless-steel with tungsten DLC coatingTextured matte black G-10 handle3.25-inch blade length4.625-inch closed length7.75-inch overall length5.6-ounce weightMade in the USALifetime WarrantyZero Tolerance knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Zero ToleranceDesigned and manufactured to stand up to heavy-duty use, Zero Tolerance knives are built of high-end materials and designed to provide users with strength, versatility, and field-ready reliability. All Zero Tolerance Knives are intended to handle the professional, hard-use requirements of armed forces personnel, law enforcement officers, other first responders, and discerning knife owners who simply want to be ready for anything the world might throw at them.", "text": "Zero Tolerance ZT0350TSST G10 Handle Folding Tiger Striped Partial Serrated Blade with SpeedSafe The Zero Tolerance 0350st is 10% smaller and lighter than the classic 0300, with a new partially serrated blade for added cutting versatility, while maintaining the cutting and piercing power that made the original such a popular model. It's equipped with SpeedSafe manual assist for easy one-handed opening, meaning you can easily deploy the blade while wearing tactical gloves by using the large, ambidextrous thumb stud or blade protrusion. The stout, sharp blade is made of S30V stainless steel with a rugged Tungsten DLC (Diamond-like Carbon) coating. Textured, matte-black G-10 scales on the synthetic handle provide an extra-secure grip, and the knife comes complete with a quad mounting system for tip-up, tip-down, left-, or right-handed clip carry.SpecificationsS30V stainless-steel with tungsten DLC coatingTextured matte black G-10 handle3.25-inch blade length4.625-inch closed length7.75-inch overall length5.6-ounce weightMade in the USALifetime WarrantyZero Tolerance knives include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Zero ToleranceDesigned and manufactured to stand up to heavy-duty use, Zero Tolerance knives are built of high-end materials and designed to provide users with strength, versatility, and field-ready reliability. All Zero Tolerance Knives are intended to handle the professional, hard-use requirements of armed forces personnel, law enforcement officers, other first responders, and discerning knife owners who simply want to be ready for anything the world might throw at them.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313CdRz55bL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MBQWIS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zero Tolerance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 120.26}}
{"item_id": "B008MBUBQW", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical OD Olive Drab Green 56 Round Shotgun Shotshell Ammo 10 , 12 & 20 Gauge Shot Shell Shoulder Bandolier Bandoleer Carrier", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear. 56 shell shotgun Bandolier - OD Green Color. Constructed of durable and long lasting ballistic PVC high grade nylon, this bandolier is a \"one piece\" design for wearing on your shoulder. The shell holders are elastic and expandable and will fit up to 56 rounds of 10, 12, as well as 20 gauge shells snugly and securely while on the go. This bandolier is approximately 2.15\" wide ,70\" long.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical OD Olive Drab Green 56 Round Shotgun Shotshell Ammo 10 , 12 & 20 Gauge Shot Shell Shoulder Bandolier Bandoleer Carrier Official Ultimate Arms Gear. 56 shell shotgun Bandolier - OD Green Color. Constructed of durable and long lasting ballistic PVC high grade nylon, this bandolier is a \"one piece\" design for wearing on your shoulder. The shell holders are elastic and expandable and will fit up to 56 rounds of 10, 12, as well as 20 gauge shells snugly and securely while on the go. This bandolier is approximately 2.15\" wide ,70\" long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i83iKfqVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MBUBQW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B008MBUCDY", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Coyote Tan 56 Round Shotgun Shotshell Ammo 10 , 12 & 20 Gauge Shot Shell Shoulder Bandolier Bandoleer Carrier", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear. 56 shell shotgun Bandolier - Coyote Tan Color. Constructed of durable and long lasting ballistic PVC high grade nylon, this bandolier is a \"one piece\" design for wearing on your shoulder. The shell holders are elastic and expandable and will fit up to 56 rounds of 10, 12, as well as 20 gauge shells snugly and securely while on the go. This bandolier is approximately 2.15\" wide ,70\" long.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Coyote Tan 56 Round Shotgun Shotshell Ammo 10 , 12 & 20 Gauge Shot Shell Shoulder Bandolier Bandoleer Carrier Official Ultimate Arms Gear. 56 shell shotgun Bandolier - Coyote Tan Color. Constructed of durable and long lasting ballistic PVC high grade nylon, this bandolier is a \"one piece\" design for wearing on your shoulder. The shell holders are elastic and expandable and will fit up to 56 rounds of 10, 12, as well as 20 gauge shells snugly and securely while on the go. This bandolier is approximately 2.15\" wide ,70\" long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RINCOsCvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MBUCDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B008MCUOH2", "title": "3M OCS1135 Ear Soft Yellow Neons, Earplugs (Case of 200)", "description": "3M™ E-A-Rsoft™ Yellow Neons™ Earplugs seal the earcanal with soft, slow-recovery foam for noise reduction and reliable hearing protection. The tapered earplugs are easy to roll down and insert, then expand within the earcanal for a comfortable, secure fit. Earplugs come in a poly bag to keep them clean prior to use. Regular size E-A-Rsoft Yellow Neons earplugs fit most earcanals. The large size is ideal for persons with larger earcanals. Recommended applications include assembly and mechanical, chipping, chiseling, cleaning, drilling, furnace operations, grinding, heavy equipment operations, machining, metal repair, painting, pouring/casting, power fastening, riveting, sanding, sawing and welding. These earplugs are commonly used in the following industries: agriculture, automotive, chemicals, construction, general manufacturing, healthcare, oil and gas, and pharmaceuticals.These soft polyurethane foam earplugs have a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 33 dB and are test compatible with the 3M E-A-Rfit™ Validation System.Not only is noise present in our daily routines and recreational activities, but millions of Americans work in hazardous noise on a daily basis. Estimates from the National Institutes of Health suggest that hearing loss afflicts 28 million Americans. About one third of those cases are at least partially attributable to noise. Hearing loss due to noise is almost entirely preventable by judicious use of hearing protection.For more than a century, 3M has applied innovation and technology to improving our customers’ lives and supporting their business goals. Today the company, from its headquarters in St. Paul, Minnesota, serves industrial and commercial customers and consumers in nearly 200 countries. Occupational Health and Environmental Safety products, focused on worker safety, include respirators, hearing-protection products, air-monitoring devices, environmental-safety products, and comprehensive training programs. The 3M brand, across thousands of products, represents consistency, superior quality, and value.", "text": "3M OCS1135 Ear Soft Yellow Neons, Earplugs (Case of 200) 3M™ E-A-Rsoft™ Yellow Neons™ Earplugs seal the earcanal with soft, slow-recovery foam for noise reduction and reliable hearing protection. The tapered earplugs are easy to roll down and insert, then expand within the earcanal for a comfortable, secure fit. Earplugs come in a poly bag to keep them clean prior to use. Regular size E-A-Rsoft Yellow Neons earplugs fit most earcanals. The large size is ideal for persons with larger earcanals. Recommended applications include assembly and mechanical, chipping, chiseling, cleaning, drilling, furnace operations, grinding, heavy equipment operations, machining, metal repair, painting, pouring/casting, power fastening, riveting, sanding, sawing and welding. These earplugs are commonly used in the following industries: agriculture, automotive, chemicals, construction, general manufacturing, healthcare, oil and gas, and pharmaceuticals.These soft polyurethane foam earplugs have a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 33 dB and are test compatible with the 3M E-A-Rfit™ Validation System.Not only is noise present in our daily routines and recreational activities, but millions of Americans work in hazardous noise on a daily basis. Estimates from the National Institutes of Health suggest that hearing loss afflicts 28 million Americans. About one third of those cases are at least partially attributable to noise. Hearing loss due to noise is almost entirely preventable by judicious use of hearing protection.For more than a century, 3M has applied innovation and technology to improving our customers’ lives and supporting their business goals. Today the company, from its headquarters in St. Paul, Minnesota, serves industrial and commercial customers and consumers in nearly 200 countries. Occupational Health and Environmental Safety products, focused on worker safety, include respirators, hearing-protection products, air-monitoring devices, environmental-safety products, and comprehensive training programs. The 3M brand, across thousands of products, represents consistency, superior quality, and value.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kLGaVR4UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MCUOH2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3M", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earplugs"]], "price": 22.81}}
{"item_id": "B008MFBGKI", "title": "Crimson Trace LG-489 Laser-Guard for S and W Shield, Black", "description": "Laserguard® truly is the finest laser system for ultra-compact polymer frame semi-automatics. We’ve kept the Laserguard® platform lightweight in tune with the DNA of these handguns. Seamless integration with the trigger guard yields repeatable accuracy, yet adds remarkably little mass. And still provides instinctive activation. Al in all, the Laserguard® platform delivers the high performance Crimson Trace Customers demand.", "text": "Crimson Trace LG-489 Laser-Guard for S and W Shield, Black Laserguard® truly is the finest laser system for ultra-compact polymer frame semi-automatics. We’ve kept the Laserguard® platform lightweight in tune with the DNA of these handguns. Seamless integration with the trigger guard yields repeatable accuracy, yet adds remarkably little mass. And still provides instinctive activation. Al in all, the Laserguard® platform delivers the high performance Crimson Trace Customers demand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RXBja23oL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MFBGKI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 194.06}}
