{"item_id": "B008MOQ618", "title": "Mtech USA Mt-628 Axe, 10.75-Inch Overall", "description": "The MT-628, another of MTech sleek design is a 10.75\" long camping axe. Equipped with a 3.25\" blade that is entirely made of stainless steel, this camping axe allows operators to use it as a ninja throwing hatchet and chopper, a glass breaker and many other practical purposes. Included is a heavy duty black nylon sheath for added safety of user and tool.", "text": "Mtech USA Mt-628 Axe, 10.75-Inch Overall The MT-628, another of MTech sleek design is a 10.75\" long camping axe. Equipped with a 3.25\" blade that is entirely made of stainless steel, this camping axe allows operators to use it as a ninja throwing hatchet and chopper, a glass breaker and many other practical purposes. Included is a heavy duty black nylon sheath for added safety of user and tool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311w2eLMEzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MOQ618.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mtech USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 12.13}}
{"item_id": "B008MPX0AW", "title": "Punisher Small Laser Engraved Aluminum (LEA)", "description": "We bring the 1st and 2nd Amendment together. Our small Laser Engraved Aluminum (LEA) rail covers are made of high strength, abrasion and solvent resistant thermoplastic bonded with a hardcoat anodized, laser engraved aluminum insert. The anodization process prevents the image from chipping, cracking or peeling. They are secured on your rail using two side tension screws that apply pressure to two locking tabs (we throw in an allen wrench with every order). There is absolutely no metal to metal contact. This prevents heat transference and prevents damage to the rail. The small LEA's measure 1 3/8\" x 1 3/8\" and weigh about 11 grams (that's about as much as two nickels). Proudly made in the U.S.A. The patent pending snap on/slide on clamp allows you to easily place your CGR rail guard anywhere there is space available without having to remove position sensitive accessories. All CGR products have been designed for placement flexibility, minimum obstruction and unparalleled durability. They fit on any mil-spec 1913 rails, including paintball and airsoft guns. No CGR products exceed 1/4\" height above the top of your rail preventing interfering with other accessories. CGR's relentless passion for perfection ensures that all of our products meet the absolute highest of standards. Practically, tactically and aesthetically there is simply no comparison. Not only are CGR products a great way to identify your gun from others, it is also a fun way to express yourself without permanently altering your weapon. Our products have been deployed with Special Ops and conventional units all over the world and the feedback has been overwhelmingly positive. CGR products are the weapons customization industry standard for everyone from the serious weapons enthusiast and operator to the occasional shooter.", "text": "Punisher Small Laser Engraved Aluminum (LEA) We bring the 1st and 2nd Amendment together. Our small Laser Engraved Aluminum (LEA) rail covers are made of high strength, abrasion and solvent resistant thermoplastic bonded with a hardcoat anodized, laser engraved aluminum insert. The anodization process prevents the image from chipping, cracking or peeling. They are secured on your rail using two side tension screws that apply pressure to two locking tabs (we throw in an allen wrench with every order). There is absolutely no metal to metal contact. This prevents heat transference and prevents damage to the rail. The small LEA's measure 1 3/8\" x 1 3/8\" and weigh about 11 grams (that's about as much as two nickels). Proudly made in the U.S.A. The patent pending snap on/slide on clamp allows you to easily place your CGR rail guard anywhere there is space available without having to remove position sensitive accessories. All CGR products have been designed for placement flexibility, minimum obstruction and unparalleled durability. They fit on any mil-spec 1913 rails, including paintball and airsoft guns. No CGR products exceed 1/4\" height above the top of your rail preventing interfering with other accessories. CGR's relentless passion for perfection ensures that all of our products meet the absolute highest of standards. Practically, tactically and aesthetically there is simply no comparison. Not only are CGR products a great way to identify your gun from others, it is also a fun way to express yourself without permanently altering your weapon. Our products have been deployed with Special Ops and conventional units all over the world and the feedback has been overwhelmingly positive. CGR products are the weapons customization industry standard for everyone from the serious weapons enthusiast and operator to the occasional shooter.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DaL-PqidL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MPX0AW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 19.0}}
{"item_id": "B008MT00I8", "title": "UTAC Super Bright Tactical Green Laser Sight with Pressure Switch and Manual On/Off Switch with Picatinny-Weaver Rail Mount & Shotgun Barrel Clamp Mount", "description": "UTAC Ultra Bright Green Laser Sight is far superior to Red Lasers used during daylight operations because the green beam produced is the most sensitive to the human eye allowing true daylight visibility up to 100 yards in bright daylight. The 532nm wavelength laser and exceptional glass optics produce a beam visible 10,000 yards at night 100 yards during true daylight viewing. We use a 5mw output laser to meet legal limits while providing a green laser that is as bright as a 20mw laser just by cutting out all non-visible laser light. Constructed by high grade Aluminum Alloy and Waterproofing seals to keep out the elements, this ULTRA Powerful green laser sight is visible in strong sunlight, makes it perfect for any Rifle. The laser can be installed on Rifle in seconds with no gunsmith or permanent modification. Allen Wrenches allow you to adjust the laser sight to align with your gun scope or sights. Includes high quality pressure switch. This is one of the brightest legal lasers on the market!Specification:1. Max reach capacity: 1000 yards2. Adjustment type: windage/elevation3. Output power: <=5mW4. Two mounts: Picatinny-Weaver Rail Mount & Shotgun Barrel Clamp Mount. The barrel clamp mount fits 1 inch diameter 12 Gauge shotgun.5. Windage and elevation adjustment6. High grade alumium construction7. Includes corded remote pressure switch and manual on/off switch8. Sharp image laser point9. Compact size10. Wavelength: 532nm11. Operated by 1 x 3V CR123A battery (INCLUDED)12. Length: 120mm, Height: 36mm, Weight: 144gPackage includes1. Green Laser sight2. Metal 20mm Picatinny Rail Mount & Rifle 1\" Barrel Clamp Mount3. Switch button4. Pressure Pad Switch and \"8\"type mount5. Allen Wrench6. 1XCR123A 3V Lithium Battery", "text": "UTAC Super Bright Tactical Green Laser Sight with Pressure Switch and Manual On/Off Switch with Picatinny-Weaver Rail Mount & Shotgun Barrel Clamp Mount UTAC Ultra Bright Green Laser Sight is far superior to Red Lasers used during daylight operations because the green beam produced is the most sensitive to the human eye allowing true daylight visibility up to 100 yards in bright daylight. The 532nm wavelength laser and exceptional glass optics produce a beam visible 10,000 yards at night 100 yards during true daylight viewing. We use a 5mw output laser to meet legal limits while providing a green laser that is as bright as a 20mw laser just by cutting out all non-visible laser light. Constructed by high grade Aluminum Alloy and Waterproofing seals to keep out the elements, this ULTRA Powerful green laser sight is visible in strong sunlight, makes it perfect for any Rifle. The laser can be installed on Rifle in seconds with no gunsmith or permanent modification. Allen Wrenches allow you to adjust the laser sight to align with your gun scope or sights. Includes high quality pressure switch. This is one of the brightest legal lasers on the market!Specification:1. Max reach capacity: 1000 yards2. Adjustment type: windage/elevation3. Output power: <=5mW4. Two mounts: Picatinny-Weaver Rail Mount & Shotgun Barrel Clamp Mount. The barrel clamp mount fits 1 inch diameter 12 Gauge shotgun.5. Windage and elevation adjustment6. High grade alumium construction7. Includes corded remote pressure switch and manual on/off switch8. Sharp image laser point9. Compact size10. Wavelength: 532nm11. Operated by 1 x 3V CR123A battery (INCLUDED)12. Length: 120mm, Height: 36mm, Weight: 144gPackage includes1. Green Laser sight2. Metal 20mm Picatinny Rail Mount & Rifle 1\" Barrel Clamp Mount3. Switch button4. Pressure Pad Switch and \"8\"type mount5. Allen Wrench6. 1XCR123A 3V Lithium Battery", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315vvHd%2B1BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MT00I8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008MV8SX0", "title": "Speedo Butterfly Ink Silicone Swim Cap", "description": "Speedo water accessories are unmatched in performance, fit, and feel. The Butterfly Ink Cap is an artsy silicone print on an ombre backdrop. Make a statement during your next swim No matter where or why you dive in training, fitness, or fun those moments in the water are always better with Speedo.", "text": "Speedo Butterfly Ink Silicone Swim Cap Speedo water accessories are unmatched in performance, fit, and feel. The Butterfly Ink Cap is an artsy silicone print on an ombre backdrop. Make a statement during your next swim No matter where or why you dive in training, fitness, or fun those moments in the water are always better with Speedo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515Oa3xfkRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MV8SX0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]], "price": 15.54}}
{"item_id": "B008MZ0A3M", "title": "OnGuard Pitbull STD U-Lock, Black, 4.53 x 9.06-Inch", "description": "The superior protection of our X4P locking mechanism mated to a standard length 230mm 9.06'' 14mm 0.55'' TriRadius hardened steel shackle for more locking options.", "text": "OnGuard Pitbull STD U-Lock, Black, 4.53 x 9.06-Inch The superior protection of our X4P locking mechanism mated to a standard length 230mm 9.06'' 14mm 0.55'' TriRadius hardened steel shackle for more locking options.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sqpJnQEML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MZ0A3M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OnGuard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Cable Locks"]], "price": 43.96}}
{"item_id": "B008MZYOTI", "title": "Wood Gymnastic Olympic Rings for Crossfit - Pair (Free Shipping & Lifetime Warranty)", "description": "You will not find a higher quality wooden ring on the market. MDUSA Wood Rings are made in the US of high grade multi-laminated wood and finished to perfection. We do not use putty to fill open spaces in the wood, if the rings do not pass inspection, they are not sold. Each set contains two rings and two straps. Rings and straps are guaranteed for life. Made in USA* / China *85% of this products cost is the result of US manufacturing.", "text": "Wood Gymnastic Olympic Rings for Crossfit - Pair (Free Shipping & Lifetime Warranty) You will not find a higher quality wooden ring on the market. MDUSA Wood Rings are made in the US of high grade multi-laminated wood and finished to perfection. We do not use putty to fill open spaces in the wood, if the rings do not pass inspection, they are not sold. Each set contains two rings and two straps. Rings and straps are guaranteed for life. Made in USA* / China *85% of this products cost is the result of US manufacturing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51C%2BTty-CBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008MZYOTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unknown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Gymnastics", "Gym & Competition Equipment", "Rings"]], "price": 69.88}}
{"item_id": "B008N6NJJ2", "title": "Saltwater Fishing Tackle Silver Pen Shape Rod Pole & Reel Combos", "description": "Specifications:Pen Fishing RodMaterial: Fibre glass, aluminum alloyColor: Silver, Black, Purple, Golden, Blue, RedClosed length: 20cm / 7.87inExtended length: 96.2cm / 37.87inWeight: 55gMini Baitcasting ReelMaterial: Aluminum alloyRotate Speed Ratio: 5.1:1Weight: 147g / 5.19ozLine spooling capacity: 51b/180yrd or 0.5mm/190mrtPackage size: 24.5 * 14.5 * 6.5cm / 9.65 * 5.71 * 2.56inPackage weight: 243g / 8.57ozPackage List:1 * Fishing rod1 * Fishing reel (with fishing line)", "text": "Saltwater Fishing Tackle Silver Pen Shape Rod Pole & Reel Combos Specifications:Pen Fishing RodMaterial: Fibre glass, aluminum alloyColor: Silver, Black, Purple, Golden, Blue, RedClosed length: 20cm / 7.87inExtended length: 96.2cm / 37.87inWeight: 55gMini Baitcasting ReelMaterial: Aluminum alloyRotate Speed Ratio: 5.1:1Weight: 147g / 5.19ozLine spooling capacity: 51b/180yrd or 0.5mm/190mrtPackage size: 24.5 * 14.5 * 6.5cm / 9.65 * 5.71 * 2.56inPackage weight: 243g / 8.57ozPackage List:1 * Fishing rod1 * Fishing reel (with fishing line)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Sm-pLRAGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008N6NJJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Docooler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Fly Fishing Combos"]], "price": 10.89}}
{"item_id": "B008N6X49C", "title": "Special Sales: Yes4All Marble Blue or Black True High Density Foam Roller - Size 36\", 24\", or 12\"x6\" Full or Half Round (D-Shape) FOR YOGA PILATES THERAPY - Limited Special Promotion", "description": "The full round shape is high density which is 20% - 30% firmer than other. The half - round (D-shape), due to its nature, may not be perfectly straight but when you press it down, it will be perfectly functional.", "text": "Special Sales: Yes4All Marble Blue or Black True High Density Foam Roller - Size 36\", 24\", or 12\"x6\" Full or Half Round (D-Shape) FOR YOGA PILATES THERAPY - Limited Special Promotion The full round shape is high density which is 20% - 30% firmer than other. The half - round (D-shape), due to its nature, may not be perfectly straight but when you press it down, it will be perfectly functional.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LUTwKj91L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008N6X49C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]]}}
