{"item_id": "B008NAAYW8", "title": "Tipton Cleaning Rod Rack", "description": "Want to organize and keep all your cleaning rods handy? The Tipton Cleaning Rod Rack will hold a wide variety of cleaning rods in various shapes and sizes. Accommodates up to six rods plus has hanging hooks on either end for additional accessories. The Rod Rack even has molded in bumpers designed for securing T-handle rods. Constructed of a durable molded material. Mounting holes and screws included.", "text": "Tipton Cleaning Rod Rack Want to organize and keep all your cleaning rods handy? The Tipton Cleaning Rod Rack will hold a wide variety of cleaning rods in various shapes and sizes. Accommodates up to six rods plus has hanging hooks on either end for additional accessories. The Rod Rack even has molded in bumpers designed for securing T-handle rods. Constructed of a durable molded material. Mounting holes and screws included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21WMkkCHY%2BL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008NAAYW8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tipton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 9.68}}
{"item_id": "B008NABK4E", "title": "Wheeler Stainless Steel Picks", "description": "You'll wonder how you ever got along without these handy tools. Useful for scraping dirt and residue from hard to reach places. Four picks each with two unique for a total of eight different picks.", "text": "Wheeler Stainless Steel Picks You'll wonder how you ever got along without these handy tools. Useful for scraping dirt and residue from hard to reach places. Four picks each with two unique for a total of eight different picks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DYJh0n6uL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008NABK4E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tipton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 16.75}}
{"item_id": "B008NEFDK2", "title": "Special Sales: Ultra Deluxe Yes4All AccuPoint Roller 5\" x 13\" / 4\" x 12\" Deep Tissue Massage - Lowest Price, Best Quality in Class - Limited Special Promotion - Ship Fast Daily", "description": "Highest quality & Lowest Price! Another great product from the most efficient company - IDzo. We ship by priority mail daily to our value customer. HARD or SOFT is just PERSONAL PREFERENCE. Please read the review from \"janedoe consumer\" below to make your decision. We (and no other foam roller company) can't guaranty that our softness or hardness would exactly meet yours (both colors have the same stiffness) Check out our store for more great products", "text": "Special Sales: Ultra Deluxe Yes4All AccuPoint Roller 5\" x 13\" / 4\" x 12\" Deep Tissue Massage - Lowest Price, Best Quality in Class - Limited Special Promotion - Ship Fast Daily Highest quality & Lowest Price! Another great product from the most efficient company - IDzo. We ship by priority mail daily to our value customer. HARD or SOFT is just PERSONAL PREFERENCE. Please read the review from \"janedoe consumer\" below to make your decision. We (and no other foam roller company) can't guaranty that our softness or hardness would exactly meet yours (both colors have the same stiffness) Check out our store for more great products", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IMQbPeKsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008NEFDK2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008NJPP14", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool K220KKS Onion Foresight Serrated Edge Knife, Black", "description": "The new CRKT Foresight folding knife designed by Ken Onion draws on the tried and true formula of \"form follows function\". Its formidable profile looks like a chiseled physique just waiting to pounce on your next cutting task with all of the control and efficiencies you would expect in a high-quality folding knife. The cold-forged aluminum handle of the Foresight is purposefully styled and shaped with swept finger grooves and proper palm swell to provide a confident, comfortable grip no matter the use at hand. Ken designed the 3.5-inch modified drop-point blade with a generous belly and re-curve cutting edge to maximize tool utility. And, the IKBS ball bearing pivot system coupled with Interframe style mechanism, make opening and closing the blade as smooth as silk. Precision ground of AUS 8 stainless steel and coated with Black Ti Nitride finish... this Ken Onion knife looks cool and is plenty sharp. Available in both Plain Edge and Combined Razor-Sharp and Triple-Point Serrated Edge models. Bottom line, some say hindsight is 20/20, but perhaps a smarter way to think is that having the Foresight shows you plan ahead when it comes to having the right tools.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool K220KKS Onion Foresight Serrated Edge Knife, Black The new CRKT Foresight folding knife designed by Ken Onion draws on the tried and true formula of \"form follows function\". Its formidable profile looks like a chiseled physique just waiting to pounce on your next cutting task with all of the control and efficiencies you would expect in a high-quality folding knife. The cold-forged aluminum handle of the Foresight is purposefully styled and shaped with swept finger grooves and proper palm swell to provide a confident, comfortable grip no matter the use at hand. Ken designed the 3.5-inch modified drop-point blade with a generous belly and re-curve cutting edge to maximize tool utility. And, the IKBS ball bearing pivot system coupled with Interframe style mechanism, make opening and closing the blade as smooth as silk. Precision ground of AUS 8 stainless steel and coated with Black Ti Nitride finish... this Ken Onion knife looks cool and is plenty sharp. Available in both Plain Edge and Combined Razor-Sharp and Triple-Point Serrated Edge models. Bottom line, some say hindsight is 20/20, but perhaps a smarter way to think is that having the Foresight shows you plan ahead when it comes to having the right tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zJY5LL2qL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008NJPP14.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 69.94}}
{"item_id": "B008NOYQ6E", "title": "TOAKS Titanium 450ml Cup", "description": "Titanium cup is light and strong, corrosion-resistant and lasts for years. Rounded bottom edges make cleaning easy and improves heating efficiency. Handles fold away for compact storage. Titanium leaves no metallic smell or taste.", "text": "TOAKS Titanium 450ml Cup Titanium cup is light and strong, corrosion-resistant and lasts for years. Rounded bottom edges make cleaning easy and improves heating efficiency. Handles fold away for compact storage. Titanium leaves no metallic smell or taste.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WHiCKWAnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008NOYQ6E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 19.95}}
