{"item_id": "B008NVMOLQ", "title": "50 Pack Venom BlowgunsTM Target Darts for True .40c Blowguns with Exclusive Tactical Peep Site", "description": "50 pack of Venom BlowgunsTM .40c target darts, compatible with all TRUE .40c blowguns. Includes Tactical Peep Site", "text": "50 Pack Venom BlowgunsTM Target Darts for True .40c Blowguns with Exclusive Tactical Peep Site 50 pack of Venom BlowgunsTM .40c target darts, compatible with all TRUE .40c blowguns. Includes Tactical Peep Site", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417GXDHPJ1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008NVMOLQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B008O0XB0Y", "title": "Diamondback 2013 Response Mountain Bike with 26-Inch Wheels (Red, 18-Inch/Medium)", "description": "Whether you are new to the trails or a seasoned singletrack rider, the Response series offers uncompromised performance without compromising your bank account. Compared to a full-suspension mountain bike, a hardtail is better suited to several situations, such as riding to class, buffed-out trails, or just cruising around the neighborhood. Combining the perfect blend of hardtail performance with rugged utility, the Diamondback Response is a value oriented build ready for any new rider or common-sense lover. At the heart of each Response is our rugged Diamondback 6061-T6 aluminum frame with formed top and down tubes providing strength and style with clean lines. A machined headtube adds strength and style while forged drop outs with a replaceable hanger add the finer touches. The components provide more proof of our commitment to providing you with the most appropriate package and value for your money. A SR Suntour XCT 100mm travel fork soaks up bumps large and small, without being overkill. Also on deck is a set of Tektro Alloy Linear Pull brakes which are a light and simple solution to stopping your rig on a dime. 32h Weinmann MX260R Double wall rims laced to 32h MX260H alloy hubs combine to make a durable and long lasting wheelset. The tough alloy arm crank set (24/32/42t) is a good match for the Shimano TX50 front derailleur, the Shimano Altus 7spd rear derailleur and Shimano HG20 7spd Cassette (12-28t). This combo provides more than enough gearing options to get you where you want to go when you want to go there. Diamondbacks signature alloy SL318s stem and riser bar create the perfect cockpit while the SL309p Alloy Micro Adjust 30.9mm post and DB low profile All Mountain saddle ensure that you can pedal all day long. The Response is red and is available in XS (14\"), SM (16\"), MD (18\"), LG (20\"), XL (22\"). If a solid, reliable, and affordable all-purpose mountain bike is what you’re after; a Response is the obvious choice.", "text": "Diamondback 2013 Response Mountain Bike with 26-Inch Wheels (Red, 18-Inch/Medium) Whether you are new to the trails or a seasoned singletrack rider, the Response series offers uncompromised performance without compromising your bank account. Compared to a full-suspension mountain bike, a hardtail is better suited to several situations, such as riding to class, buffed-out trails, or just cruising around the neighborhood. Combining the perfect blend of hardtail performance with rugged utility, the Diamondback Response is a value oriented build ready for any new rider or common-sense lover. At the heart of each Response is our rugged Diamondback 6061-T6 aluminum frame with formed top and down tubes providing strength and style with clean lines. A machined headtube adds strength and style while forged drop outs with a replaceable hanger add the finer touches. The components provide more proof of our commitment to providing you with the most appropriate package and value for your money. A SR Suntour XCT 100mm travel fork soaks up bumps large and small, without being overkill. Also on deck is a set of Tektro Alloy Linear Pull brakes which are a light and simple solution to stopping your rig on a dime. 32h Weinmann MX260R Double wall rims laced to 32h MX260H alloy hubs combine to make a durable and long lasting wheelset. The tough alloy arm crank set (24/32/42t) is a good match for the Shimano TX50 front derailleur, the Shimano Altus 7spd rear derailleur and Shimano HG20 7spd Cassette (12-28t). This combo provides more than enough gearing options to get you where you want to go when you want to go there. Diamondbacks signature alloy SL318s stem and riser bar create the perfect cockpit while the SL309p Alloy Micro Adjust 30.9mm post and DB low profile All Mountain saddle ensure that you can pedal all day long. The Response is red and is available in XS (14\"), SM (16\"), MD (18\"), LG (20\"), XL (22\"). If a solid, reliable, and affordable all-purpose mountain bike is what you’re after; a Response is the obvious choice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Cj3N2g-2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008O0XB0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Mountain Bikes", "Hardtail Mountain Bikes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008O0XCKS", "title": "Diamondback 2013 Sorrento Mountain Bike with 26-Inch Wheels (Black, 16-Inch/Small)", "description": "The path has met its match - the Diamondback Sorrento. The Sorrento is the perfect bike for the beginning rider looking to take the next step, or the experienced cyclist that appreciates using the right tool for the job. The Sorrento features a DB 6061-T6 heat-treated and butted aluminum frame with a replaceable derailleur hanger and a 60mm travel Trail XC fork with an alloy crown makes worrying about bumps a thing of the past. A Shimano drivetrain provides 21 gears to help you climb up anything and the Tektro alloy linear pull brakes will help you stop on the way down. The double wall alloy rims provide stability and comfort the entire ride. The 2013 Diamondback Sorrento is grey and comes in five sizes: XS (14\"), SM (16\"), MD (18\"), LG (20\"), XL (22\").Whether you are looking to ride around town, the neighborhood, or paths: the Sorrento has you covered.", "text": "Diamondback 2013 Sorrento Mountain Bike with 26-Inch Wheels (Black, 16-Inch/Small) The path has met its match - the Diamondback Sorrento. The Sorrento is the perfect bike for the beginning rider looking to take the next step, or the experienced cyclist that appreciates using the right tool for the job. The Sorrento features a DB 6061-T6 heat-treated and butted aluminum frame with a replaceable derailleur hanger and a 60mm travel Trail XC fork with an alloy crown makes worrying about bumps a thing of the past. A Shimano drivetrain provides 21 gears to help you climb up anything and the Tektro alloy linear pull brakes will help you stop on the way down. The double wall alloy rims provide stability and comfort the entire ride. The 2013 Diamondback Sorrento is grey and comes in five sizes: XS (14\"), SM (16\"), MD (18\"), LG (20\"), XL (22\").Whether you are looking to ride around town, the neighborhood, or paths: the Sorrento has you covered.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510Fz%2BRIUfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008O0XCKS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Mountain Bikes", "Hardtail Mountain Bikes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008O0XKPA", "title": "Diamondback 2013 Men's Edgewood Sport Hybrid Bike with 700c Wheels", "description": "", "text": "Diamondback 2013 Men's Edgewood Sport Hybrid Bike with 700c Wheels", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tgG0G9%2BUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008O0XKPA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Diamondback Bicycles", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Hybrid Bikes"]], "price": 397.99}}
{"item_id": "B008O26PUK", "title": "Bluecell 30 Pairs of Black Color Barrel Connector Buckle for DIY Outdoor Paracord Lanyard/Necklace", "description": "These barrel connectors fits for paracord DIY project, like lanyard, bracelet, or necklace. This product is sold exclusively by Bluecell Power. Buy only the authentic products from Bluecell Power and get 6-month WARRANTY.", "text": "Bluecell 30 Pairs of Black Color Barrel Connector Buckle for DIY Outdoor Paracord Lanyard/Necklace These barrel connectors fits for paracord DIY project, like lanyard, bracelet, or necklace. This product is sold exclusively by Bluecell Power. Buy only the authentic products from Bluecell Power and get 6-month WARRANTY.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/210H0wcxnvL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008O26PUK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Generic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B008O2FLQE", "title": "Diamondback 2013 Overdrive 29'er Mountain Bike with 29-Inch Wheels (Red, 18-Inch/Medium)", "description": "The bike industry sees fads come and go. Innovation doesn’t always assure success or even relevance. Luckily, the 29er revolution is one that’s here to stay--and for good reason. There’s no denying the rock crawling, root crushing power of a larger wheel. Making the largest of obstacles the smallest of matters is a defining trait of these muddy beasts. By offering decreased rolling resistance, increased traction when cornering and improved ground clearance, one ride upon one of these massive behemoths is sure to sway even the staunchest skeptic. The Diamondback Overdrive packs a punch in terms of value and affordability and takes 29ers to a new level. The improved 2013 6061-T6 Aluminum Overdrive series frame boasts of newly formed top and down tubes, a machined headtube, and forged drop outs with a replaceable derailleur hanger. The Geometry is spot on. The ever so sloping top tube provides ample standover clearance. A 71° head tube angle and a 73° seat tube angle create the perfect XC/trail geometry. The 390mm (15.4 inch) chainstays equate to an extremely snappy rig and the ability to easily get the front wheel off the ground – something that not all 29ers can be so proud of. The Overdrive is a fantastic entry level 29er well balanced between value and performance. The SR Suntour XCT gives you 100mm of travel for the perfect amount of cushion up front. Add to that Disc brakes courtesy of Tektro and you have one of the best in class values for an entry level 29er period.", "text": "Diamondback 2013 Overdrive 29'er Mountain Bike with 29-Inch Wheels (Red, 18-Inch/Medium) The bike industry sees fads come and go. Innovation doesn’t always assure success or even relevance. Luckily, the 29er revolution is one that’s here to stay--and for good reason. There’s no denying the rock crawling, root crushing power of a larger wheel. Making the largest of obstacles the smallest of matters is a defining trait of these muddy beasts. By offering decreased rolling resistance, increased traction when cornering and improved ground clearance, one ride upon one of these massive behemoths is sure to sway even the staunchest skeptic. The Diamondback Overdrive packs a punch in terms of value and affordability and takes 29ers to a new level. The improved 2013 6061-T6 Aluminum Overdrive series frame boasts of newly formed top and down tubes, a machined headtube, and forged drop outs with a replaceable derailleur hanger. The Geometry is spot on. The ever so sloping top tube provides ample standover clearance. A 71° head tube angle and a 73° seat tube angle create the perfect XC/trail geometry. The 390mm (15.4 inch) chainstays equate to an extremely snappy rig and the ability to easily get the front wheel off the ground – something that not all 29ers can be so proud of. The Overdrive is a fantastic entry level 29er well balanced between value and performance. The SR Suntour XCT gives you 100mm of travel for the perfect amount of cushion up front. Add to that Disc brakes courtesy of Tektro and you have one of the best in class values for an entry level 29er period.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kCcUAM%2BiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008O2FLQE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Mountain Bikes", "Hardtail Mountain Bikes"]]}}
