{"item_id": "B008O6JIXM", "title": "Therm-a-Rest NeoAir Camper Mattress, Ink Blue, Large", "description": "One of the thickest air mattresses on the market and the most durable, puncture-resistant NeoAir mattress yet, the NeoAir Camper offers 3 inches (7.6 cm) of soft, cushioning support. Its internal structure contours to your body and provides unmatched stability and warmth without the weight or bulk of conventional insulation. Perfect for trips that demand the most reliable and comfortable sleep support, the Camper remains lighter and more packable than most mattresses you’ll find in camp. Stuff sack and repair kit included.", "text": "Therm-a-Rest NeoAir Camper Mattress, Ink Blue, Large One of the thickest air mattresses on the market and the most durable, puncture-resistant NeoAir mattress yet, the NeoAir Camper offers 3 inches (7.6 cm) of soft, cushioning support. Its internal structure contours to your body and provides unmatched stability and warmth without the weight or bulk of conventional insulation. Perfect for trips that demand the most reliable and comfortable sleep support, the Camper remains lighter and more packable than most mattresses you’ll find in camp. Stuff sack and repair kit included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RgATWvE%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008O6JIXM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Therm-A-Rest", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 119.95}}
{"item_id": "B008O8D0KC", "title": "Paracord Planet Brand Contoured Side Release Black Buckle - Multiple Size and Quantity", "description": "These side release buckles are the perfect accessory for your paracord bracelets. These buckles are contoured to ensure your paracord bracelet is a comfortable fit. Choose your prefered amount and size!", "text": "Paracord Planet Brand Contoured Side Release Black Buckle - Multiple Size and Quantity These side release buckles are the perfect accessory for your paracord bracelets. These buckles are contoured to ensure your paracord bracelet is a comfortable fit. Choose your prefered amount and size!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DzPAWdQGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008O8D0KC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008OB6JO8", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical SKS 4x30 mm Rangefinder Reticle Rifle Hunting Sniper Scope with See Thru Lens Caps + Stealth Black Steel SKS 7.62x39 Rifle See Through Receiver Cover Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount Complete With Rings", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation 4x30 Rangefinder Reticle scope. This package includes the scope, see thru protective lens caps + SKS Rifle Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount . The scope weighs 8.5 oz and is constructed primarily of ultra durable solid aluminum, it has a Black Matte finish color, and a compact length of approximately 7.3\". This scope is built for hunters, military, law enforcement. Built to last and absorb heavy duty recoil, this scope is nitrogen filled, fully coated, shockproof, fogproof, and water resistant. The lenses are multi coated and blue for lowlight conditions, and will provide a sharp, bright field of view @100' -26.2 and an eye relief of 7.5mm. The windage and elevation adjustments have a click value @100yds 1/4\".The scope's rangefinder reticle allows the shooter to estimate the range of the target to allow the shooter a significant tactical advantage. Mount: No Drilling Tapping Or Alteration To The Rifle Required Whatsoever - Simply Replaces The Existing Receiver Cover. Most users will be able to install this mount in under a minute without any modification. Due to the many variants on some SKS rifles, the front prongs on this mount may need to be slightly filed in order to achieve a perfect secure fit on your SKS rifle. Those prongs are intentionally made to be slightly longer in order to accommodate all the SKS variants. DO NOT OVER FILE, only a minimal amount of filing would be required. File just a bit, check the fit, repeat if necessary but only 1-2 filing strokes. File at the same angle of the mount prongs to maintain their angle and shape and this mount will work great and fit properly on your SKS.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical SKS 4x30 mm Rangefinder Reticle Rifle Hunting Sniper Scope with See Thru Lens Caps + Stealth Black Steel SKS 7.62x39 Rifle See Through Receiver Cover Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount Complete With Rings Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation 4x30 Rangefinder Reticle scope. This package includes the scope, see thru protective lens caps + SKS Rifle Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount . The scope weighs 8.5 oz and is constructed primarily of ultra durable solid aluminum, it has a Black Matte finish color, and a compact length of approximately 7.3\". This scope is built for hunters, military, law enforcement. Built to last and absorb heavy duty recoil, this scope is nitrogen filled, fully coated, shockproof, fogproof, and water resistant. The lenses are multi coated and blue for lowlight conditions, and will provide a sharp, bright field of view @100' -26.2 and an eye relief of 7.5mm. The windage and elevation adjustments have a click value @100yds 1/4\".The scope's rangefinder reticle allows the shooter to estimate the range of the target to allow the shooter a significant tactical advantage. Mount: No Drilling Tapping Or Alteration To The Rifle Required Whatsoever - Simply Replaces The Existing Receiver Cover. Most users will be able to install this mount in under a minute without any modification. Due to the many variants on some SKS rifles, the front prongs on this mount may need to be slightly filed in order to achieve a perfect secure fit on your SKS rifle. Those prongs are intentionally made to be slightly longer in order to accommodate all the SKS variants. DO NOT OVER FILE, only a minimal amount of filing would be required. File just a bit, check the fit, repeat if necessary but only 1-2 filing strokes. File at the same angle of the mount prongs to maintain their angle and shape and this mount will work great and fit properly on your SKS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ulxtSxRUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008OB6JO8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B008OB6L1O", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical SKS 4x30 mm Mil Dot Reticle Rifle Hunting Sniper Scope with See Thru Lens Caps + Stealth Black Steel SKS 7.62x39 Rifle See Through Receiver Cover Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount Complete With Rings", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical SKS 4x30 mm Mil Dot Reticle Rifle Hunting Sniper Scope with See Thru Lens Caps + Stealth Black Steel SKS 7.62x39 Rifle See Through Receiver Cover Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount Complete With Rings. 4x30 P4 MIL DOT Reticle Scope, lens cleaning kit, and see through protective lens covers. The compact scope measures approximately 7 inches and weighs in at just 7.9oz. The scope is housed in T6 Aluminum, is Nitrogen filled, fogproof, and shock proof to withstand and perfrom under the highest recoil, and water resistant. Features a non illuminating mil dot crosshair reticle for sharper aiming points and a clear and bright field of view. Lenses are multi coated blue for lowlight conditions and is fully adjustable for windage and elevation click adjustments. Ultimate Arms Gear Lifetime Manufacturer's Warranty Included. SKS Mount: No Drilling Tapping Or Alteration To The Rifle Required Whatsoever - Simply Replaces The Existing Receiver Cover. Most users will be able to install this mount in under a minute without any modification. Due to the many variants on some SKS rifles, the front prongs on this mount may need to be slightly filed in order to achieve a perfect secure fit on your SKS rifle. Those prongs are intentionally made to be slightly longer in order to accommodate all the SKS variants. DO NOT OVER FILE, only a minimal amount of filing would be required. File just a bit, check the fit, repeat if necessary but only 1-2 filing strokes. File at the same angle of the mount prongs to maintain their angle and shape and this mount will work great and fit properly on your SKS.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical SKS 4x30 mm Mil Dot Reticle Rifle Hunting Sniper Scope with See Thru Lens Caps + Stealth Black Steel SKS 7.62x39 Rifle See Through Receiver Cover Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount Complete With Rings Official Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical SKS 4x30 mm Mil Dot Reticle Rifle Hunting Sniper Scope with See Thru Lens Caps + Stealth Black Steel SKS 7.62x39 Rifle See Through Receiver Cover Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount Complete With Rings. 4x30 P4 MIL DOT Reticle Scope, lens cleaning kit, and see through protective lens covers. The compact scope measures approximately 7 inches and weighs in at just 7.9oz. The scope is housed in T6 Aluminum, is Nitrogen filled, fogproof, and shock proof to withstand and perfrom under the highest recoil, and water resistant. Features a non illuminating mil dot crosshair reticle for sharper aiming points and a clear and bright field of view. Lenses are multi coated blue for lowlight conditions and is fully adjustable for windage and elevation click adjustments. Ultimate Arms Gear Lifetime Manufacturer's Warranty Included. SKS Mount: No Drilling Tapping Or Alteration To The Rifle Required Whatsoever - Simply Replaces The Existing Receiver Cover. Most users will be able to install this mount in under a minute without any modification. Due to the many variants on some SKS rifles, the front prongs on this mount may need to be slightly filed in order to achieve a perfect secure fit on your SKS rifle. Those prongs are intentionally made to be slightly longer in order to accommodate all the SKS variants. DO NOT OVER FILE, only a minimal amount of filing would be required. File just a bit, check the fit, repeat if necessary but only 1-2 filing strokes. File at the same angle of the mount prongs to maintain their angle and shape and this mount will work great and fit properly on your SKS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ab2J1URHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008OB6L1O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B008OCYNI6", "title": "UTG RGB Full Size AO Mil-Dot Zero Locking Reset Scope with Rings and 3-Inch Sunshade, Black, 1-Inch 4-16 x 50", "description": "UTG New Gen 1-Inch 4-16X50 Full Size Scope with TS Platform, Front AO, Side Wheel Red/Green Illumination, Mil-Dot, F/B Emerald Coating, Zero Reset/Locking Target with E Knobs, Include Flip-open Leapersns Cover, 3-Inch Super Sniper StackabLeapers Sunshade and RG2W1204 MS Rings.", "text": "UTG RGB Full Size AO Mil-Dot Zero Locking Reset Scope with Rings and 3-Inch Sunshade, Black, 1-Inch 4-16 x 50 UTG New Gen 1-Inch 4-16X50 Full Size Scope with TS Platform, Front AO, Side Wheel Red/Green Illumination, Mil-Dot, F/B Emerald Coating, Zero Reset/Locking Target with E Knobs, Include Flip-open Leapersns Cover, 3-Inch Super Sniper StackabLeapers Sunshade and RG2W1204 MS Rings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31J3py6-2%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008OCYNI6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 129.97}}
{"item_id": "B008OGIC66", "title": "MASSIVE SALE\" Knife King Custom damascus bowie knife. Burl wood handle. Damascus guard & pomel", "description": "Important Note: When you checkout make sure you are buying from the seller \"Knife King\" if you want the original top quality item , Buy original item from \"Knife King\" only. All other sellers are selling fake copies of our knives on this listing. All the good reviews on this knife are earned by knives made in our workshop and some people are trying to take advantage of these good reviews and listing their low quality copies on our listings. Blade 8 inch handle 5 inch. Burl wood handle. Damascus guard & pomel. Comes with leather sheath. Please note the sheath may vary from the pictures. You have to be over the age of 18 to buy this item.", "text": "MASSIVE SALE\" Knife King Custom damascus bowie knife. Burl wood handle. Damascus guard & pomel Important Note: When you checkout make sure you are buying from the seller \"Knife King\" if you want the original top quality item , Buy original item from \"Knife King\" only. All other sellers are selling fake copies of our knives on this listing. All the good reviews on this knife are earned by knives made in our workshop and some people are trying to take advantage of these good reviews and listing their low quality copies on our listings. Blade 8 inch handle 5 inch. Burl wood handle. Damascus guard & pomel. Comes with leather sheath. Please note the sheath may vary from the pictures. You have to be over the age of 18 to buy this item.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51s2faE8vgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008OGIC66.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]]}}
