{"item_id": "B008OQUWDM", "title": "Lowepro LP36433-PWW Photo Hatchback 22L AW (Pepper Red)", "description": "Maximize your carrying options for all-day adventures with this lightweight and high-performance photo backpack/flexible daypack that features body-side access and a removable, padded camera box.", "text": "Lowepro LP36433-PWW Photo Hatchback 22L AW (Pepper Red) Maximize your carrying options for all-day adventures with this lightweight and high-performance photo backpack/flexible daypack that features body-side access and a removable, padded camera box.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BVZEFaEEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008OQUWDM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lowepro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 89.95}}
