{"item_id": "B008OX7YP4", "title": "Endurance Short Sleeve Cycling Jersey Road / MTB", "description": "The Conquer endurance jersey is soft, lightweight, breathable and quick drying. It features a full length front zipper with 3 genearou rear pockets and a center waterproof zippered pocket for wallet or cell phones.FeaturesLess Restrictive Cut for Comfort FitBright Colors & Full Length Front Zipper100% Polyester Dry Wicking Fabric; Machine washable hang drySilicone Elasto Gripper Base Trim3 Large Back Pockets w/ Waterproof Center Zippered Pocket", "text": "Endurance Short Sleeve Cycling Jersey Road / MTB The Conquer endurance jersey is soft, lightweight, breathable and quick drying. It features a full length front zipper with 3 genearou rear pockets and a center waterproof zippered pocket for wallet or cell phones.FeaturesLess Restrictive Cut for Comfort FitBright Colors & Full Length Front Zipper100% Polyester Dry Wicking Fabric; Machine washable hang drySilicone Elasto Gripper Base Trim3 Large Back Pockets w/ Waterproof Center Zippered Pocket", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410epNQpyCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008OX7YP4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B008OXZNDO", "title": "ENO - Atlas Straps - Polyester Hammock Hanging Straps", "description": "The ENO Atlas Hammock Hanging Strap System is the simply the best hammock hanging strap system out there. And that is because they are made of polyester and do not stretch. Oh wait! They have more places to hook a hammock than anyone else (15ea =30ea for the set). And they are longer than most other hammock system straps (9'). Together they support up to 400 lbs. And set up is easy, just slide one end through the loop on the other end, hook the hammock to it and you are done. And you didn't even have to tie a knot. So if you need to hang a hammock, this is it! It does not get any easier. Promise.Color - Black.Pack Size - 6\"x3\"x2.5\".Dimensions - 9'x1\".Materials - Polyester.Weight = 11 oz..", "text": "ENO - Atlas Straps - Polyester Hammock Hanging Straps The ENO Atlas Hammock Hanging Strap System is the simply the best hammock hanging strap system out there. And that is because they are made of polyester and do not stretch. Oh wait! They have more places to hook a hammock than anyone else (15ea =30ea for the set). And they are longer than most other hammock system straps (9'). Together they support up to 400 lbs. And set up is easy, just slide one end through the loop on the other end, hook the hammock to it and you are done. And you didn't even have to tie a knot. So if you need to hang a hammock, this is it! It does not get any easier. Promise.Color - Black.Pack Size - 6\"x3\"x2.5\".Dimensions - 9'x1\".Materials - Polyester.Weight = 11 oz..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2B6t4sVRNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008OXZNDO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eagles Nest Outfitters", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B008OZVDD6", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical SKS 4x30 mm Illuminated Red Mil Dot Rangefinder Reticle Hunting Sniper Rifle Scope with See Thru Lens Caps & Lithium Battery + Stealth Black Steel SKS 7.62x39 Rifle See Through Receiver Cover Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount Complete With Rings", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear, Brand New. This Package Includes the Scope, see thru protective lens caps, a lithium CR-2032 3V battery & SKS Scope Mount. The scope weighs 8.5 oz and is constructed primarily of ultra durable solid aluminum, it has a Black Matte finish color, and a compact length of approximately 7.3\". This scope is built for hunters, military, law enforcement. The lenses are multi coated and blue for lowlight conditions, and will provide a sharp, bright field of view @100' -26.2 and an eye relief of 7.5mm. The windage and elevation adjustments have a click value @100yds 1/4\".The scope's illuminated rangefinder reticle allows the shooter to estimate the range of the target, and is able to be viewed with 12 different settings -either black(when illumination is turned off), or 11 illumated red settings to allow the shooter the best tactical advantage in any setting. Mount: No Drilling Tapping Or Alteration To The Rifle Required Whatsoever - Simply Replaces The Existing Receiver Cover. Most users will be able to install this mount in under a minute without any modification. Due to the many variants on some SKS rifles, the front prongs on this mount may need to be slightly filed in order to achieve a perfect secure fit on your SKS rifle. Those prongs are intentionally made to be slightly longer in order to accommodate all the SKS variants. DO NOT OVER FILE, only a minimal amount of filing would be required. File just a bit, check the fit, repeat if necessary but only 1-2 filing strokes. File at the same angle of the mount prongs to maintain their angle and shape and this mount will work great and fit properly on your SKS.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical SKS 4x30 mm Illuminated Red Mil Dot Rangefinder Reticle Hunting Sniper Rifle Scope with See Thru Lens Caps & Lithium Battery + Stealth Black Steel SKS 7.62x39 Rifle See Through Receiver Cover Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount Complete With Rings Official Ultimate Arms Gear, Brand New. This Package Includes the Scope, see thru protective lens caps, a lithium CR-2032 3V battery & SKS Scope Mount. The scope weighs 8.5 oz and is constructed primarily of ultra durable solid aluminum, it has a Black Matte finish color, and a compact length of approximately 7.3\". This scope is built for hunters, military, law enforcement. The lenses are multi coated and blue for lowlight conditions, and will provide a sharp, bright field of view @100' -26.2 and an eye relief of 7.5mm. The windage and elevation adjustments have a click value @100yds 1/4\".The scope's illuminated rangefinder reticle allows the shooter to estimate the range of the target, and is able to be viewed with 12 different settings -either black(when illumination is turned off), or 11 illumated red settings to allow the shooter the best tactical advantage in any setting. Mount: No Drilling Tapping Or Alteration To The Rifle Required Whatsoever - Simply Replaces The Existing Receiver Cover. Most users will be able to install this mount in under a minute without any modification. Due to the many variants on some SKS rifles, the front prongs on this mount may need to be slightly filed in order to achieve a perfect secure fit on your SKS rifle. Those prongs are intentionally made to be slightly longer in order to accommodate all the SKS variants. DO NOT OVER FILE, only a minimal amount of filing would be required. File just a bit, check the fit, repeat if necessary but only 1-2 filing strokes. File at the same angle of the mount prongs to maintain their angle and shape and this mount will work great and fit properly on your SKS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XY4mqLXPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008OZVDD6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B008P19NZ4", "title": "Explorer Concealed Gun, Travel Bag", "description": "Large delux police &shooters; tactical range bag. Heavy duty high density durable with water repellents ,#1o zipper.", "text": "Explorer Concealed Gun, Travel Bag Large delux police &shooters; tactical range bag. Heavy duty high density durable with water repellents ,#1o zipper.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AoeysiAML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008P19NZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Explorer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 28.49}}
{"item_id": "B008P6FQZK", "title": "GDT AR15 AR 15 M4 Cantilever 1\" (25.4mm) offset scope rings one piece front and rear tactical CQB battle mount", "description": "A heavy duty offset ring mount to install scope for easier eye relief setup. Very helpful when mounting a scope with longer eyepiece tube, especially ones with illuminated reticles. Ring Size: 1\" (25.4mm) Machined from aluminum alloy Hard anodized black matte finish", "text": "GDT AR15 AR 15 M4 Cantilever 1\" (25.4mm) offset scope rings one piece front and rear tactical CQB battle mount A heavy duty offset ring mount to install scope for easier eye relief setup. Very helpful when mounting a scope with longer eyepiece tube, especially ones with illuminated reticles. Ring Size: 1\" (25.4mm) Machined from aluminum alloy Hard anodized black matte finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Kh0bFYe4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008P6FQZK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GDT", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 23.43}}
{"item_id": "B008P8EU50", "title": "Pro-Shot .270-.38 Caliber 2-Inch RD. 1000 Count Patches", "description": "Our reputation for superior quality products began when we made our first bag of patches in 1982.Now after manufacturing millions of patches, our quality and superior cleaning patches have become sought after by the most accurate-minded shooters in the world.", "text": "Pro-Shot .270-.38 Caliber 2-Inch RD. 1000 Count Patches Our reputation for superior quality products began when we made our first bag of patches in 1982.Now after manufacturing millions of patches, our quality and superior cleaning patches have become sought after by the most accurate-minded shooters in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NXeKCUyzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008P8EU50.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 20.64}}
{"item_id": "B008P92196", "title": "Lifetime Pickleball, Badminton, & Quickstart Tennis Net Set", "description": "The Lifetime Driveway 3 Sport Set is perfect for Pickleball, QuickStart Tennis, Badminton and other fun family games. The all-weather net and poles have an easy, telescoping adjustment that creates two different height settings (36\", 61\") to accommodate a variety of games. The portable bases are filled with sand or water and can be moved to any desired location. This portable design makes the set perfect for driveway, beach, pool or backyard play! The set-up is quick an easy, and the all-weather materials will last for years of family fun. The Lifetime Driveway Tennis Set comes with 4 wooden paddles, 2 Pickleballs, 2 QuickStart Tennis balls, and 2 Paddle Birdies. It also includes 2 carry bags for the poles and accessories.", "text": "Lifetime Pickleball, Badminton, & Quickstart Tennis Net Set The Lifetime Driveway 3 Sport Set is perfect for Pickleball, QuickStart Tennis, Badminton and other fun family games. The all-weather net and poles have an easy, telescoping adjustment that creates two different height settings (36\", 61\") to accommodate a variety of games. The portable bases are filled with sand or water and can be moved to any desired location. This portable design makes the set perfect for driveway, beach, pool or backyard play! The set-up is quick an easy, and the all-weather materials will last for years of family fun. The Lifetime Driveway Tennis Set comes with 4 wooden paddles, 2 Pickleballs, 2 QuickStart Tennis balls, and 2 Paddle Birdies. It also includes 2 carry bags for the poles and accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51H%2BOsHg1aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008P92196.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lifetime", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Court Equipment", "Nets"]], "price": 122.37}}
{"item_id": "B008PEKA9O", "title": "Sightmark Ultra Shot Z-Series Reflex Sight", "description": "The Sightmark Ultra Shot Z Series reflex sight is the perfect accessory in the fight against the undead. Featuring an illuminated, four pattern, green colored reticle, protective hood and quick detach mount, any shooter is ready for the zombie apocalypse. A side mounted weaver rail, located on the protective hood, allows users to mount accessories to the unit, ensuring a beefed up arsenal. With 5 brightness settings located on a rotary switch and constructed from aircraft grade aluminum, the Ultra Shot Z Series is ideal for any lighting condition and durable enough to withstand high recoil so you never have worry about poor performance when zombies attack. Designed to return to the rail and still hold zero, the Sightmark Z Series eliminates in-the-field adjustments making it reliable to take out the undead in an instant. Featuring a wide field of view, it is useful for close quarter combat to mid-range target shooting. The Ultra Shot Z Series features a weaver mount and matte black finish eliminating reflections. Highly durable and accurate, this is one product that is a must have to kill the undead (again) and save your brains.", "text": "Sightmark Ultra Shot Z-Series Reflex Sight The Sightmark Ultra Shot Z Series reflex sight is the perfect accessory in the fight against the undead. Featuring an illuminated, four pattern, green colored reticle, protective hood and quick detach mount, any shooter is ready for the zombie apocalypse. A side mounted weaver rail, located on the protective hood, allows users to mount accessories to the unit, ensuring a beefed up arsenal. With 5 brightness settings located on a rotary switch and constructed from aircraft grade aluminum, the Ultra Shot Z Series is ideal for any lighting condition and durable enough to withstand high recoil so you never have worry about poor performance when zombies attack. Designed to return to the rail and still hold zero, the Sightmark Z Series eliminates in-the-field adjustments making it reliable to take out the undead in an instant. Featuring a wide field of view, it is useful for close quarter combat to mid-range target shooting. The Ultra Shot Z Series features a weaver mount and matte black finish eliminating reflections. Highly durable and accurate, this is one product that is a must have to kill the undead (again) and save your brains.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-p--milEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008PEKA9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 94.99}}
{"item_id": "B008PENWMG", "title": "NiteRider Lumina 500 Light", "description": "Whether you need to navigate through rough terrain, or you're looking for a light that'll hold to your bars like the jaws of life, pick up the NiteRider Lumina 500 Light. This budget conscious light puts out nearly half the light of a car headlight at a price that leaves room for more bike upgrades.The newest light from NiteRider, the Lumina is smaller and lighter than lights with external batteries. The battery and light are housed together in a self-contained Black and Silver body that saves weight by eliminating extra cords and straps. With the same power output as other NiteRider 500 lumen lights, the Lumina casts a broad beam to light up potholes or any other unseen hazard along the way.The light has four solid light levels -- high, medium, low, and walk, plus a flash mode that lets you adjust the brightness during your ride. Depending on your setting, the light will last 1.5 hours at 500 lumens, three hours at 250 lumens, 5.5 hours at 150 lumens, and 18 hours at 40 lumens.The single-piece construction of the Lumina 500 not only looks fabulous, but to avoid a mid-ride blackout , it also protects the battery from volatile weather. The newly designed handlebar mount also adds to its versatility. The quick-release mount holds securely in any riding condition and accommodates bars up to 31.8mm in diameter.The NiteRider Lumina 500 Light comes with a USB charger and takes about 5.5 hours to reach full-charge. The entire assembly weighs in around 172 grams.", "text": "NiteRider Lumina 500 Light Whether you need to navigate through rough terrain, or you're looking for a light that'll hold to your bars like the jaws of life, pick up the NiteRider Lumina 500 Light. This budget conscious light puts out nearly half the light of a car headlight at a price that leaves room for more bike upgrades.The newest light from NiteRider, the Lumina is smaller and lighter than lights with external batteries. The battery and light are housed together in a self-contained Black and Silver body that saves weight by eliminating extra cords and straps. With the same power output as other NiteRider 500 lumen lights, the Lumina casts a broad beam to light up potholes or any other unseen hazard along the way.The light has four solid light levels -- high, medium, low, and walk, plus a flash mode that lets you adjust the brightness during your ride. Depending on your setting, the light will last 1.5 hours at 500 lumens, three hours at 250 lumens, 5.5 hours at 150 lumens, and 18 hours at 40 lumens.The single-piece construction of the Lumina 500 not only looks fabulous, but to avoid a mid-ride blackout , it also protects the battery from volatile weather. The newly designed handlebar mount also adds to its versatility. The quick-release mount holds securely in any riding condition and accommodates bars up to 31.8mm in diameter.The NiteRider Lumina 500 Light comes with a USB charger and takes about 5.5 hours to reach full-charge. The entire assembly weighs in around 172 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Mu1GSJLuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008PENWMG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NiteRider", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 83.95}}
