{"item_id": "B008PNU108", "title": "Projekt Fixie - Urban Track Cycling Fixed Gear Road Bike Single-speed Saddle", "description": "Projekt Fixie saddles are soft, comfortable saddles made with extremely durable material. Cushion to soften the ride during extreme riding conditions. Works well with any type of bicycle: road, mountain, track, single-speed, fixed gear. No branding to keep the clean design of the saddle and the bike.", "text": "Projekt Fixie - Urban Track Cycling Fixed Gear Road Bike Single-speed Saddle Projekt Fixie saddles are soft, comfortable saddles made with extremely durable material. Cushion to soften the ride during extreme riding conditions. Works well with any type of bicycle: road, mountain, track, single-speed, fixed gear. No branding to keep the clean design of the saddle and the bike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Rr-d76uUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008PNU108.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 15.64}}
{"item_id": "B008PNUEF0", "title": "Projekt Fixie - 80mm Cycling Fixed-Gear Single-speed Road Bicycle Stem", "description": "Projekt Fixie stems don't have branding to go along with clean lines and finish. Anodized colors are used for stronger, vibrant colors and to prevent color fading. UV-resistant and top quality materials used to design our stems for great performance even in extreme weather conditions. Built to last and durable for any type of cycling needs. Compatible with, but not limited to road, track, mountain, fixed gear, single-speed bicycles. Top-quality looks and feel are reflective of the materials and kind of attention to detail we give to our products. Works with all our handlebars and will provide strong handlebar clamp strength.", "text": "Projekt Fixie - 80mm Cycling Fixed-Gear Single-speed Road Bicycle Stem Projekt Fixie stems don't have branding to go along with clean lines and finish. Anodized colors are used for stronger, vibrant colors and to prevent color fading. UV-resistant and top quality materials used to design our stems for great performance even in extreme weather conditions. Built to last and durable for any type of cycling needs. Compatible with, but not limited to road, track, mountain, fixed gear, single-speed bicycles. Top-quality looks and feel are reflective of the materials and kind of attention to detail we give to our products. Works with all our handlebars and will provide strong handlebar clamp strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310%2BQn%2B0rmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008PNUEF0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Stems"]], "price": 16.89}}
{"item_id": "B008PTYGXK", "title": "Compact Micro Holographic Reflex Red Dot 2 MOA Combat Sight Mini", "description": "FREE ACID TACTICAL DECAL WITH EVERY ORDER!!100% Aircraft grade Aluminum. Coated Anti-glare lenses.Includes:1 AT MiniH Red Dot Reflex Sight1 Allen wrench1 Cleaning Pad2 batteries - (1 spare) CR20321 Carrying gift box1 Screwdriver1 Deg Alignment tool1 Lense CoverSpecifications:On/Off switch located on back.(not pictured in images) Window Size: 22mm x 17mmMagnification: 1xMaximum Field of View at 100 Yards: 19 YardsObjective Lens: 25mmReticle: 2 MOA Red DotEye Relief: UnlimitedBuilt in picatinny mountShock Proof Design to hold sight alignment.Fog resistantAnti-Glare coatingMountable on Rifles or Pistols that have standard20-21mm rails.NOTE!Acid Tacticalis the UPC owner of this item. Any other seller claiming to sell this items under the same UPC is not selling the same product. Quality, quantity, and description may not apply to any other seller under this listing. Be AwareNOTE!* It is the buyers responsibility to know their state and local gun laws. Some accessories may not be legally added to a firearm in particular states or in combination with other accessories. Please be aware of your local laws before adding any accessory to a firearm.", "text": "Compact Micro Holographic Reflex Red Dot 2 MOA Combat Sight Mini FREE ACID TACTICAL DECAL WITH EVERY ORDER!!100% Aircraft grade Aluminum. Coated Anti-glare lenses.Includes:1 AT MiniH Red Dot Reflex Sight1 Allen wrench1 Cleaning Pad2 batteries - (1 spare) CR20321 Carrying gift box1 Screwdriver1 Deg Alignment tool1 Lense CoverSpecifications:On/Off switch located on back.(not pictured in images) Window Size: 22mm x 17mmMagnification: 1xMaximum Field of View at 100 Yards: 19 YardsObjective Lens: 25mmReticle: 2 MOA Red DotEye Relief: UnlimitedBuilt in picatinny mountShock Proof Design to hold sight alignment.Fog resistantAnti-Glare coatingMountable on Rifles or Pistols that have standard20-21mm rails.NOTE!Acid Tacticalis the UPC owner of this item. Any other seller claiming to sell this items under the same UPC is not selling the same product. Quality, quantity, and description may not apply to any other seller under this listing. Be AwareNOTE!* It is the buyers responsibility to know their state and local gun laws. Some accessories may not be legally added to a firearm in particular states or in combination with other accessories. Please be aware of your local laws before adding any accessory to a firearm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aykERn%2BEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008PTYGXK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AT", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 33.0}}
{"item_id": "B008PX9BF4", "title": "Srixon Men's Soft Feel Golf Ball", "description": "Ideal for a wide range of players, especially those with low swing speeds. The soft core maximizes energy transfer for greater distance and softer feel from tee to green. The Soft Feel has a resilient core that gets progressively softer toward its center while the Ionomer cover delivers greater ball speed and lower spin off the driver for incredible distance and amazing soft feel. The higher trajectory and greater lift force make high, long ball flights effortless for golfers of all abilities.", "text": "Srixon Men's Soft Feel Golf Ball Ideal for a wide range of players, especially those with low swing speeds. The soft core maximizes energy transfer for greater distance and softer feel from tee to green. The Soft Feel has a resilient core that gets progressively softer toward its center while the Ionomer cover delivers greater ball speed and lower spin off the driver for incredible distance and amazing soft feel. The higher trajectory and greater lift force make high, long ball flights effortless for golfers of all abilities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61wH-Gj9r-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008PX9BF4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Srixon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Standard Balls"]], "price": 19.88}}
