{"item_id": "B008QFVK4G", "title": "Springfield XD-S Hybrid IWB Holster, SHTF Gear ACE-1", "description": "SHTF Gear ACE-1This holster is made specifically for the Springfield XD-S, single-stack pistolOur line of ACE (Always Combat Effective) holsters provides the perfect combination of comfort and rapid deployment for concealed carry. Our holsters are designed to allow the shooter to get a full shooting grip on the gun while it is holstered, ensuring that the second the gun is out it's ready for action. Our first and most successful product sets a new standard for comfort and concealment. The ACE line of holsters are an IWB (inside the waistband) holster built on premium leather paired with custom molded Kydex to create the perfect draw and allow for easy holstering. Both of these components are held together with a combination of rivets and hand-sewn Kevlar thread that ensure long lasting durability and strength.All holsters come with a Lifetime Warranty, a 30-day money-back guaranteeAll orders will be filled with a right handed holster. If you need a left handed holster, please specify by sending a message via AmazonYou are buying direct from the maker. Each holster is hand made and fitted (some wear marks may result) and does not come in retail packaging.", "text": "Springfield XD-S Hybrid IWB Holster, SHTF Gear ACE-1 SHTF Gear ACE-1This holster is made specifically for the Springfield XD-S, single-stack pistolOur line of ACE (Always Combat Effective) holsters provides the perfect combination of comfort and rapid deployment for concealed carry. Our holsters are designed to allow the shooter to get a full shooting grip on the gun while it is holstered, ensuring that the second the gun is out it's ready for action. Our first and most successful product sets a new standard for comfort and concealment. The ACE line of holsters are an IWB (inside the waistband) holster built on premium leather paired with custom molded Kydex to create the perfect draw and allow for easy holstering. Both of these components are held together with a combination of rivets and hand-sewn Kevlar thread that ensure long lasting durability and strength.All holsters come with a Lifetime Warranty, a 30-day money-back guaranteeAll orders will be filled with a right handed holster. If you need a left handed holster, please specify by sending a message via AmazonYou are buying direct from the maker. Each holster is hand made and fitted (some wear marks may result) and does not come in retail packaging.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g7tjx3jqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008QFVK4G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B008QGYMP4", "title": "Helmet Replacement Pads Universal Fit Red Cycling Bike Bicycle Includes Velcro", "description": "Strips with oval round edges are 14/16\" by 4\", the thin strips are 1/2\" by 5\", Before you spend your hard earned cash on a replacement foam kit please consider that ours is 5/16 inch thick. If your'e thinking about buying another kit always ask them exactly how thick the foam is, others are only 1/16\" which provides virtually no comfort, we take pride in the design and quality of our product. If you're considering buying this kit, dont wait, this is a great way to get more use out of a helmet that can no longer be used due to old worn out padding , it's an excellent way to save money, instead of buying a new helmet just buy the replacement foam pads and it'll feel as comfortable as when you first bought it, we guarantee you'll be happy with this item or we'll refund your money. brand new unused universal foam pad replacement kit for your road bike or mtb helmet, comes with 9 pieces that you simply cut to size and they stick to the velcro thats already in your existing helmet, includes enough for virtually any helmet, high quality ultracell foam washable and durable, if your helmet needs new foam pads take advantage of this opportunity your satisfaction is guaranteed or your money back. Note: these were removed from the package in order to take the picture you will recieve a brand new kit in the sealed package. PLEASE NOTE THIS IS A UNIVERSAL KIT WHICH ITS OVER 95 PERCENT OF BICYCLE HELMETS, IT IS NOT MADE BY GIRO OR BELL IT IS CUSTOM MANUFACTURED BY US, YOUR SATISFACTION IS GUARANTEED OR YOUR MONEY BACK", "text": "Helmet Replacement Pads Universal Fit Red Cycling Bike Bicycle Includes Velcro Strips with oval round edges are 14/16\" by 4\", the thin strips are 1/2\" by 5\", Before you spend your hard earned cash on a replacement foam kit please consider that ours is 5/16 inch thick. If your'e thinking about buying another kit always ask them exactly how thick the foam is, others are only 1/16\" which provides virtually no comfort, we take pride in the design and quality of our product. If you're considering buying this kit, dont wait, this is a great way to get more use out of a helmet that can no longer be used due to old worn out padding , it's an excellent way to save money, instead of buying a new helmet just buy the replacement foam pads and it'll feel as comfortable as when you first bought it, we guarantee you'll be happy with this item or we'll refund your money. brand new unused universal foam pad replacement kit for your road bike or mtb helmet, comes with 9 pieces that you simply cut to size and they stick to the velcro thats already in your existing helmet, includes enough for virtually any helmet, high quality ultracell foam washable and durable, if your helmet needs new foam pads take advantage of this opportunity your satisfaction is guaranteed or your money back. Note: these were removed from the package in order to take the picture you will recieve a brand new kit in the sealed package. PLEASE NOTE THIS IS A UNIVERSAL KIT WHICH ITS OVER 95 PERCENT OF BICYCLE HELMETS, IT IS NOT MADE BY GIRO OR BELL IT IS CUSTOM MANUFACTURED BY US, YOUR SATISFACTION IS GUARANTEED OR YOUR MONEY BACK", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LWrHiFxqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008QGYMP4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B008QK3R2O", "title": "Omron HJ-323USB Pedometer with Web-Based Solution", "description": "", "text": "Omron HJ-323USB Pedometer with Web-Based Solution", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eg0N-xx6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008QK3R2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Omron", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B008QVXBJC", "title": "CatEye Nano Shot Plus USB Rechargeable Bicycle Headlight HL-EL625RC", "description": "For the focused, on-the-go multi-tasker, the Nano Shot + gives you one less thing to worry about, no matter where your travels take you. 2 super-bright, ultra-efficient LED's fire up 600 lumens in a lightweight design and rechargeable via any USB port, so you'll never ride home in darkness again no matter how busy you get.", "text": "CatEye Nano Shot Plus USB Rechargeable Bicycle Headlight HL-EL625RC For the focused, on-the-go multi-tasker, the Nano Shot + gives you one less thing to worry about, no matter where your travels take you. 2 super-bright, ultra-efficient LED's fire up 600 lumens in a lightweight design and rechargeable via any USB port, so you'll never ride home in darkness again no matter how busy you get.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-ZsZJXtML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008QVXBJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 95.99}}
{"item_id": "B008QVXOI0", "title": "CatEye Rapid 3 Bicycle Front Safety Light TL-LD630-F", "description": "The CatEye Rapid 3 head and tail lights include a high power center SMD-LED and two 5mm LEDs for outstanding visibility. Three modes allow you to customize your visibility. The Rapid mode is a specifically designed flashing pattern created to improve visibility and quickly capture driver’s attention. A SP-11 (rear) or SP-12-F (front) FlexTight handlebar bracket is included and the Rapid 3 is also compatible with the RM-1 Saddle Rail bracket (rear) and the clothing clip, available separately.", "text": "CatEye Rapid 3 Bicycle Front Safety Light TL-LD630-F The CatEye Rapid 3 head and tail lights include a high power center SMD-LED and two 5mm LEDs for outstanding visibility. Three modes allow you to customize your visibility. The Rapid mode is a specifically designed flashing pattern created to improve visibility and quickly capture driver’s attention. A SP-11 (rear) or SP-12-F (front) FlexTight handlebar bracket is included and the Rapid 3 is also compatible with the RM-1 Saddle Rail bracket (rear) and the clothing clip, available separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ydGjoZllL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008QVXOI0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B008QVXQ1K", "title": "CatEye Omni 5 Bicycle Rear Safety Light TL-LD155-R", "description": "Five bright LEDs deliver great brightness with impressive runtime. New Omni Directional Technology increases safety while three modes – rapid, flashing and constant, let you select the right level of visibility. With two AAA batteries, the TL-LD155 will run up to 120 hours. The simple, tool-free FlexTight bracket and included clothing clip allow you to easily attach the Omni 5 anywhere you’d like. 360 degree visibility design for rear version.", "text": "CatEye Omni 5 Bicycle Rear Safety Light TL-LD155-R Five bright LEDs deliver great brightness with impressive runtime. New Omni Directional Technology increases safety while three modes – rapid, flashing and constant, let you select the right level of visibility. With two AAA batteries, the TL-LD155 will run up to 120 hours. The simple, tool-free FlexTight bracket and included clothing clip allow you to easily attach the Omni 5 anywhere you’d like. 360 degree visibility design for rear version.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VfNv-UQpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008QVXQ1K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 15.0}}
{"item_id": "B008QVXREG", "title": "CatEye Omni 5 Bicycle Front Safety Light TL-LD155-F", "description": "Five bright LEDs deliver great brightness with impressive runtime. New Omni Directional Technology increases safety while three modes – rapid, flashing and constant, let you select the right level of visibility. With two AAA batteries, the TL-LD155 will run up to 120 hours. The simple, tool-free FlexTight bracket and included clothing clip allow you to easily attach the Omni 5 anywhere you’d like. 360 degree visibility design for rear version.", "text": "CatEye Omni 5 Bicycle Front Safety Light TL-LD155-F Five bright LEDs deliver great brightness with impressive runtime. New Omni Directional Technology increases safety while three modes – rapid, flashing and constant, let you select the right level of visibility. With two AAA batteries, the TL-LD155 will run up to 120 hours. The simple, tool-free FlexTight bracket and included clothing clip allow you to easily attach the Omni 5 anywhere you’d like. 360 degree visibility design for rear version.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uGNrKr6TL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008QVXREG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 16.86}}
{"item_id": "B008QVXSE0", "title": "CatEye Omni 3 Tail Light TL-LD135-R", "description": "The Cat EYE Omni 3 Tail Light Features awesome triple-LED performance at an economical price. The Omni 3 rear light tail provides 360 degrees of visibility and New Omni Directional Technology increases safety while three modes ? rapid, flashing and constant, let you decide how flashy you want to be. Two AAA batteries provide up to 200 hours of run time. CatEye exclusive FlexTight bracket and included clothing clip allow you to mount the Omni 3 virtually anywhere you'd like.Mount size: f12.0,32.0mm (FlexTight SP-11).Other: Clothing clip included.", "text": "CatEye Omni 3 Tail Light TL-LD135-R The Cat EYE Omni 3 Tail Light Features awesome triple-LED performance at an economical price. The Omni 3 rear light tail provides 360 degrees of visibility and New Omni Directional Technology increases safety while three modes ? rapid, flashing and constant, let you decide how flashy you want to be. Two AAA batteries provide up to 200 hours of run time. CatEye exclusive FlexTight bracket and included clothing clip allow you to mount the Omni 3 virtually anywhere you'd like.Mount size: f12.0,32.0mm (FlexTight SP-11).Other: Clothing clip included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41c6e25yq5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008QVXSE0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 10.0}}
{"item_id": "B008QVXTLM", "title": "CatEye Omni 3 Headlight", "description": "You love your bike commute to work each morning and back home each evening, but in the winter when the days are short, or even in the summer when you're working long hours, you need light. That's why CatEye offers its Omni 3 Headlight at a low price so you don't have to sacrifice safety for your bank account. And its inexpensive price tag doesn't mean CatEye made some scrappy light either. On the contrary, three white LED lights provide 360 visibility that makes sure oncoming traffic sees you, and three different modes (constant, flashing, and rapid) let you decide how flashy you want to be. This headlight comes with two AAA alkaline batteries that can power it for up to 200 hours. And both the FlexTight bracket and a clothing clip let you attach this light anywhere you'd like.", "text": "CatEye Omni 3 Headlight You love your bike commute to work each morning and back home each evening, but in the winter when the days are short, or even in the summer when you're working long hours, you need light. That's why CatEye offers its Omni 3 Headlight at a low price so you don't have to sacrifice safety for your bank account. And its inexpensive price tag doesn't mean CatEye made some scrappy light either. On the contrary, three white LED lights provide 360 visibility that makes sure oncoming traffic sees you, and three different modes (constant, flashing, and rapid) let you decide how flashy you want to be. This headlight comes with two AAA alkaline batteries that can power it for up to 200 hours. And both the FlexTight bracket and a clothing clip let you attach this light anywhere you'd like.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Qgoe-FtML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008QVXTLM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B008R0712A", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Standard Drop In Replacement Blue Alumininum Magazine Mag Release Button For AR-15 AR15 AR 15 M16 M4 Lower Receiver / Rifle", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear T6 Aluminum hardcoat anodized drop-in replacement button for standard factory release;Simply unscrew your exisiting button and replace it with this one ( uses your gun's existing factory magazine release spring). Fits all AR15/M16 type lower receivers / rifles. - Blue Color", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Standard Drop In Replacement Blue Alumininum Magazine Mag Release Button For AR-15 AR15 AR 15 M16 M4 Lower Receiver / Rifle Official Ultimate Arms Gear T6 Aluminum hardcoat anodized drop-in replacement button for standard factory release;Simply unscrew your exisiting button and replace it with this one ( uses your gun's existing factory magazine release spring). Fits all AR15/M16 type lower receivers / rifles. - Blue Color", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r6DldakRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008R0712A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B008R071CU", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Standard Drop In Replacement Red Alumininum Magazine Mag Release Button For AR-15 AR15 AR 15 M16 M4 Lower Receiver / Rifle", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear T6 Aluminum hardcoat anodized drop-in replacement button for standard factory release;Simply unscrew your exisiting button and replace it with this one ( uses your gun's existing factory magazine release spring). Fits all AR15/M16 type lower receivers / rifles. - Red Color", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Standard Drop In Replacement Red Alumininum Magazine Mag Release Button For AR-15 AR15 AR 15 M16 M4 Lower Receiver / Rifle Official Ultimate Arms Gear T6 Aluminum hardcoat anodized drop-in replacement button for standard factory release;Simply unscrew your exisiting button and replace it with this one ( uses your gun's existing factory magazine release spring). Fits all AR15/M16 type lower receivers / rifles. - Red Color", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414P9ezJLiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008R071CU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 3.95}}
{"item_id": "B008R072C4", "title": "Tactical Gear Stealth Black Deluxe Roll Up Protective Shooter's Shooting Sniper Hunting Mat", "description": "Protect your weapon and your body with this Roll Up Tactical Shooter's Mat that features all the amenities you will need for that perfect shot: Data Book Pouch, Bullet Slots and fold out elbow wings. All on a compact padded platform to make those critical shots count. So, whether you are a member of an elite sniper team in some large city, or a contender in a national shooting competition, this shooter's mat will hold your necessities, keep you and your weapon protected from the environment, and provide a clean supported surface from which to take that critical shot.", "text": "Tactical Gear Stealth Black Deluxe Roll Up Protective Shooter's Shooting Sniper Hunting Mat Protect your weapon and your body with this Roll Up Tactical Shooter's Mat that features all the amenities you will need for that perfect shot: Data Book Pouch, Bullet Slots and fold out elbow wings. All on a compact padded platform to make those critical shots count. So, whether you are a member of an elite sniper team in some large city, or a contender in a national shooting competition, this shooter's mat will hold your necessities, keep you and your weapon protected from the environment, and provide a clean supported surface from which to take that critical shot.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sJjzUI9OL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008R072C4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008R0XTYO", "title": "Fold & Go Trampoline", "description": "This is FINEST children's Bouncer- Nursery Trampoline ever made. The Original Toy Company's Fold and Go Trampoline is a unique design. The Original Toy Company wanted to design and build, from their years as trampoline designers, a model that is totally unique, compact and quick to assemble and able to withstand the test of time. They have designed and manufactured one of the finest, small Nursery Trampolines on the market today. The Original Toy Company designed the Original Folding (Nursery) Trampoline that has been on the market for many years, manufactured to our rigid specifications, sold by us and copied by many. Our new Fold and Go model offers total safety in design. This trampoline is ASTM F963-08 Part 1 and Part 2 ,3. Safety approved, along with the USA HR 4040 Federal Government Toy Safety Standard. Extension tubes available for older children as a separate purchase.", "text": "Fold & Go Trampoline This is FINEST children's Bouncer- Nursery Trampoline ever made. The Original Toy Company's Fold and Go Trampoline is a unique design. The Original Toy Company wanted to design and build, from their years as trampoline designers, a model that is totally unique, compact and quick to assemble and able to withstand the test of time. They have designed and manufactured one of the finest, small Nursery Trampolines on the market today. The Original Toy Company designed the Original Folding (Nursery) Trampoline that has been on the market for many years, manufactured to our rigid specifications, sold by us and copied by many. Our new Fold and Go model offers total safety in design. This trampoline is ASTM F963-08 Part 1 and Part 2 ,3. Safety approved, along with the USA HR 4040 Federal Government Toy Safety Standard. Extension tubes available for older children as a separate purchase.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41--hmWoJiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008R0XTYO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "The Original Toy Company", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Trampolines & Accessories", "Trampolines"]], "price": 87.95}}
