{"item_id": "B008R5L82E", "title": "Lezyne Side Load Flow Bottle Cage-Pair", "description": "Constructed of durable, fiber reinforced Composite Matrix material for a high-strength, low weight bottle cage with a great value. X-Grip architecture and dual upper bottle catches ensure that bottles will stay in place. The wide opening in front allows for easy on the bike bottle access. The integrated low profile pump bracket is molded directly into the cage body while the Velcro strap securely holds a Lezyne High-Pressure pump in place. The dual color artwork makes this cage sleek and stylish.", "text": "Lezyne Side Load Flow Bottle Cage-Pair Constructed of durable, fiber reinforced Composite Matrix material for a high-strength, low weight bottle cage with a great value. X-Grip architecture and dual upper bottle catches ensure that bottles will stay in place. The wide opening in front allows for easy on the bike bottle access. The integrated low profile pump bracket is molded directly into the cage body while the Velcro strap securely holds a Lezyne High-Pressure pump in place. The dual color artwork makes this cage sleek and stylish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TIF7-OJpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008R5L82E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008R5RQ2A", "title": "Lezyne Caddy Sack Bag", "description": "A simple, reusable sack that can beused to carry all necessities, even smartphones. It has been redesigned with PVC fabrics, welded seams and a rolled velcro closure making this new sack extremely water resistant. The wide opening makes it quick and easy to see and extract contents. It is available in two sizes to accommodate a wide range of accessories.", "text": "Lezyne Caddy Sack Bag A simple, reusable sack that can beused to carry all necessities, even smartphones. It has been redesigned with PVC fabrics, welded seams and a rolled velcro closure making this new sack extremely water resistant. The wide opening makes it quick and easy to see and extract contents. It is available in two sizes to accommodate a wide range of accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410cSf4RYVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008R5RQ2A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lezyne", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 13.99}}
