{"item_id": "B008RK9FW4", "title": "Xmark Rubber Hex Dumbbell Pair", "description": "Ladies, firm triceps, beautiful, lean legs, tight glutes, and a feminine physique begin with a pair of XMark 5 lb. Rubber Hex Dumbbells. Designed with an ergonomic handle to reduce hand fatigue, the XMark rubber hex dumbbell will be your go-to dumbbell for getting slim and fit. The six-sided hex design prevents rolling and the odorless, premium rubber casing protects your floors, increases the long-lasting durability and enhances your dumbbell's visual appeal. Perform everything from tricep kick-backs and extensions to lunges and squats and many more with XMark's rubber hex dumbbells. Shape and tone your body with XMark, the mark of excellence.", "text": "Xmark Rubber Hex Dumbbell Pair Ladies, firm triceps, beautiful, lean legs, tight glutes, and a feminine physique begin with a pair of XMark 5 lb. Rubber Hex Dumbbells. Designed with an ergonomic handle to reduce hand fatigue, the XMark rubber hex dumbbell will be your go-to dumbbell for getting slim and fit. The six-sided hex design prevents rolling and the odorless, premium rubber casing protects your floors, increases the long-lasting durability and enhances your dumbbell's visual appeal. Perform everything from tricep kick-backs and extensions to lunges and squats and many more with XMark's rubber hex dumbbells. Shape and tone your body with XMark, the mark of excellence.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mHHZzzxXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RK9FW4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008RK9J52", "title": "Magpul Ladder Rail Protector, Od Green", "description": "Extended Rail Length Protector, Accessory, Fits Picatinny Rail, OD Green.", "text": "Magpul Ladder Rail Protector, Od Green Extended Rail Length Protector, Accessory, Fits Picatinny Rail, OD Green.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a94kVaGGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RK9J52.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MAGPUL INDUSTRIES CORPORATION", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 11.35}}
{"item_id": "B008RK9L6E", "title": "Magpul Industries Enhanced XTM Rail Panels Accessory Rail Covers Picatinny MAG510-BLK", "description": "The XTM Enhanced Rail Panels are low-profile, two-piece covers that attach anywhere on a 1913 Picatinny rail without having to remove previously mounted accessories. Replacing the original XTM Panels, The Enhanced XTM Panels feature an aggressive anti-slip texture and dual-side routing clips for retention of light/laser cables. The design and reinforced material construction ensure the panels will remain in place under all operating conditions, but allows for easy removal using the tips of two rounds when necessary. Each set comes with four (4) two piece panels which will cover ONE side of a carbine rail.", "text": "Magpul Industries Enhanced XTM Rail Panels Accessory Rail Covers Picatinny MAG510-BLK The XTM Enhanced Rail Panels are low-profile, two-piece covers that attach anywhere on a 1913 Picatinny rail without having to remove previously mounted accessories. Replacing the original XTM Panels, The Enhanced XTM Panels feature an aggressive anti-slip texture and dual-side routing clips for retention of light/laser cables. The design and reinforced material construction ensure the panels will remain in place under all operating conditions, but allows for easy removal using the tips of two rounds when necessary. Each set comes with four (4) two piece panels which will cover ONE side of a carbine rail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iXYH8kWgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RK9L6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MAGPUL INDUSTRIES CORPORATION", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 7.49}}
