{"item_id": "B008RK9SL2", "title": "Xmark Premium Vinyl Coated Kettlebell", "description": "Achieve a full body workout with intense cardio benefits with the XMark's Premium Vinyl Coated Kettlebells. Research shows a 20 minute kettlebell workout burns almost 300 calories. Each kettlebell movement engages multiple muscles due to the weight imbalance and the results are a combination of muscle-sculpting and heart-pumping cardio in one high intensity workout. Kettlebell training with XMark's Premium Vinyl Coated Kettlebells is one of the most effective weight training workouts to burn fat, lose weight and build muscle. All XMark Premium Vinyl Coated Kettlebells are encased in high quality vinyl to reduce noise and protect floors. Swing, curl and lift your way to an amazing body with XMark, the mark of excellence.", "text": "Xmark Premium Vinyl Coated Kettlebell Achieve a full body workout with intense cardio benefits with the XMark's Premium Vinyl Coated Kettlebells. Research shows a 20 minute kettlebell workout burns almost 300 calories. Each kettlebell movement engages multiple muscles due to the weight imbalance and the results are a combination of muscle-sculpting and heart-pumping cardio in one high intensity workout. Kettlebell training with XMark's Premium Vinyl Coated Kettlebells is one of the most effective weight training workouts to burn fat, lose weight and build muscle. All XMark Premium Vinyl Coated Kettlebells are encased in high quality vinyl to reduce noise and protect floors. Swing, curl and lift your way to an amazing body with XMark, the mark of excellence.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41T1nDiPnaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RK9SL2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Kettlebells"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008RKA5U0", "title": "XMark Fitness Rubber Coated Olympic Plate Weight Pair", "description": "XMark 2.5 lb. Commercial Rubber Coated Olympic Plate Weights (pair) XM-3377-2.5-P XMark's Rubber Coated Olympic Plates feature heavy-duty, split, crack and peel resistant rubber casing to protect your floors and equipment. Ideal for commercial or residential use, XMark's Rubber Coated Olympic Plates are an excellent choice to lift, push and sculpt strong, powerful muscles. Achieve real results as you train with XMark, the mark of excellence. Features: - Pair of 2.5 lb. rubber coated Olympic plate weights - Plate weight diameter: 2\" (Olympic) - Rubber coated iron plate weights - Odorless premium rubber casing - Split, crack and peel resistant - Ideal for commercial and home use.", "text": "XMark Fitness Rubber Coated Olympic Plate Weight Pair XMark 2.5 lb. Commercial Rubber Coated Olympic Plate Weights (pair) XM-3377-2.5-P XMark's Rubber Coated Olympic Plates feature heavy-duty, split, crack and peel resistant rubber casing to protect your floors and equipment. Ideal for commercial or residential use, XMark's Rubber Coated Olympic Plates are an excellent choice to lift, push and sculpt strong, powerful muscles. Achieve real results as you train with XMark, the mark of excellence. Features: - Pair of 2.5 lb. rubber coated Olympic plate weights - Plate weight diameter: 2\" (Olympic) - Rubber coated iron plate weights - Odorless premium rubber casing - Split, crack and peel resistant - Ideal for commercial and home use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wOHtutTeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RKA5U0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Plates"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008RLRMNC", "title": "NiteRider Lumina 350 Light", "description": "NiteRider introduces the Lumina as the everyday, rough-road lighting solution in its highly popular cordless series. Whether you're commuting in the city or riding trails at dusk, the Lumina 350 Light has a lumen output to will keep your path illuminated and make others aware of your presence. The newest light from NiteRider, the Lumina is smaller and lighter than lights with external batteries. The battery and light are housed together in a self-contained Black and Silver body that saves weight by eliminating extra cords and straps. With the same power output as other NiteRider 350 lumen lights, the Lumina casts a broad beam to light up potholes or any other unseen hazard along the way. The light has four solid light levels -- high, medium, low, and walk, plus a flash mode that lets you adjust the brightness during your ride. Depending on your setting, the light will last two hours at 350 lumens, four hours at 200 lumens, six hours at 125 lumens, and 21 hours at 30 lumens. The single-piece construction of the Lumina 350 not only looks fabulous, but to avoid a mid-ride blackout, it also protects the battery from volatile weather. The newly designed handlebar mount also adds to its versatility. The quick-release mount holds securely in any riding condition and accommodates bars up to 31.8mm in diameter. The NiteRider Lumina 350 Light comes with a USB charger and takes about 4.5 hours to reach a full-charge. The entire assembly weighs in around 172 grams.", "text": "NiteRider Lumina 350 Light NiteRider introduces the Lumina as the everyday, rough-road lighting solution in its highly popular cordless series. Whether you're commuting in the city or riding trails at dusk, the Lumina 350 Light has a lumen output to will keep your path illuminated and make others aware of your presence. The newest light from NiteRider, the Lumina is smaller and lighter than lights with external batteries. The battery and light are housed together in a self-contained Black and Silver body that saves weight by eliminating extra cords and straps. With the same power output as other NiteRider 350 lumen lights, the Lumina casts a broad beam to light up potholes or any other unseen hazard along the way. The light has four solid light levels -- high, medium, low, and walk, plus a flash mode that lets you adjust the brightness during your ride. Depending on your setting, the light will last two hours at 350 lumens, four hours at 200 lumens, six hours at 125 lumens, and 21 hours at 30 lumens. The single-piece construction of the Lumina 350 not only looks fabulous, but to avoid a mid-ride blackout, it also protects the battery from volatile weather. The newly designed handlebar mount also adds to its versatility. The quick-release mount holds securely in any riding condition and accommodates bars up to 31.8mm in diameter. The NiteRider Lumina 350 Light comes with a USB charger and takes about 4.5 hours to reach a full-charge. The entire assembly weighs in around 172 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BgSsr2-4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RLRMNC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NiteRider", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 62.95}}
{"item_id": "B008RM08X2", "title": "Cygolite Metro 300 Lumen USB Rechargeable Bicycle Headlight, Black, One Size", "description": "Light up every pothole and crack far up the road ahead with a real commuting light that won't break the bank. The Metro 300 incorporates a super bright 3.5 watt LED with an internal Li-Ion battery, to shine 300 lumens of powerful light for hours on end, then recharges conveniently through a USB port to save you the cost of replacing batteries day after day. Cygolite new 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination provides added safety by alerting motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path. Compact, rechargeable and super bright, the Metro 300 is the light for road riders who want to ride safely.", "text": "Cygolite Metro 300 Lumen USB Rechargeable Bicycle Headlight, Black, One Size Light up every pothole and crack far up the road ahead with a real commuting light that won't break the bank. The Metro 300 incorporates a super bright 3.5 watt LED with an internal Li-Ion battery, to shine 300 lumens of powerful light for hours on end, then recharges conveniently through a USB port to save you the cost of replacing batteries day after day. Cygolite new 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination provides added safety by alerting motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path. Compact, rechargeable and super bright, the Metro 300 is the light for road riders who want to ride safely.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31u6mmlZ-xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RM08X2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cygo Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B008RRP3UA", "title": "SODIAL(TM) Ranger FIRE STEEL Flint & Striker SAS Survival Tool Kit - Outdoor Camping Living Survival Tool", "description": "This is the most compact and lightweight flint and striker on the marketIt is designed to fit into the smallest survival packs, the striker can also be used as a sawStriking the flint produces a spray of sparks that will ignite tinder in a matter of seconds This fire lighter is included in the british armys and NATO's survival kitRugged water resistant flint", "text": "SODIAL(TM) Ranger FIRE STEEL Flint & Striker SAS Survival Tool Kit - Outdoor Camping Living Survival Tool This is the most compact and lightweight flint and striker on the marketIt is designed to fit into the smallest survival packs, the striker can also be used as a sawStriking the flint produces a spray of sparks that will ignite tinder in a matter of seconds This fire lighter is included in the british armys and NATO's survival kitRugged water resistant flint", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YFaLwe65L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RRP3UA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SODIAL(TM)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 2.39}}
{"item_id": "B008RSZ6NI", "title": "Elevation Training Mask 2.0 MMA Crossfit Yoga Fitness", "description": "What's new with Training Mask 2.0? Training Mask 2.0 makes your work out more efficient allowing you to take your work out from 60 minutes to 20 minutes. From the average daily walker to the marathon runner, Training Mask 2.0 appeals to every athlete who wants to improve their overall health and performance. We have changed the look! It started with the first version made from an Israeli civilian gas mask and has been revamped and remolded into Training Mask 2.0. With reconstruction of an entirely new mask mould, and neoprene that is stretched over the rubber resistance mask, and caps give Training Mask 2.0 a smooth, sleek look and comfortable feel. Training Mask 2.0 is held on the face with a comfortable neoprene strap that over lays the air tight silicone piece that rests against the face. The neoprene strap is held onto the mask by 3 \"Resistance caps\". The resistance caps make for a nice snug fit against the neoprene and hold the neoprene in place acting as a \"post\" against the silicone that rests on your face. Training Mask 2.0 is completely washable! We have constructed the Training Mask 2.0 out of high grade neoprene as well as high quality printing that is able to with stand outdoor training, rain or shine, or any other weather condition that may have been keeping you away from training at your peak performance. DO NOT MACHINE WASH!! What benefits does Training Mask 2.0 resistance breathing have? Conditions the lungs by creating pulmonary resistance Strengthens the diaphragm Increases surface area and elasticity in alveoli Increases lung capacity Increase anaerobic thresholds Decrease workout time Includes three nose pieces for three levels of intensity: 1x, 3x, 6x and 9x restricted breathing What does the Training Mask 2.0 come with ? (6 Air Resistance Caps) (3 Base pieces with flux valve plungers) (1 Silicone Training Mask) (1 Neoprene Sleeve) Brochures, Fitness Workout booklet / Instructional booklet Instructional DVD SIZING Diagram", "text": "Elevation Training Mask 2.0 MMA Crossfit Yoga Fitness What's new with Training Mask 2.0? Training Mask 2.0 makes your work out more efficient allowing you to take your work out from 60 minutes to 20 minutes. From the average daily walker to the marathon runner, Training Mask 2.0 appeals to every athlete who wants to improve their overall health and performance. We have changed the look! It started with the first version made from an Israeli civilian gas mask and has been revamped and remolded into Training Mask 2.0. With reconstruction of an entirely new mask mould, and neoprene that is stretched over the rubber resistance mask, and caps give Training Mask 2.0 a smooth, sleek look and comfortable feel. Training Mask 2.0 is held on the face with a comfortable neoprene strap that over lays the air tight silicone piece that rests against the face. The neoprene strap is held onto the mask by 3 \"Resistance caps\". The resistance caps make for a nice snug fit against the neoprene and hold the neoprene in place acting as a \"post\" against the silicone that rests on your face. Training Mask 2.0 is completely washable! We have constructed the Training Mask 2.0 out of high grade neoprene as well as high quality printing that is able to with stand outdoor training, rain or shine, or any other weather condition that may have been keeping you away from training at your peak performance. DO NOT MACHINE WASH!! What benefits does Training Mask 2.0 resistance breathing have? Conditions the lungs by creating pulmonary resistance Strengthens the diaphragm Increases surface area and elasticity in alveoli Increases lung capacity Increase anaerobic thresholds Decrease workout time Includes three nose pieces for three levels of intensity: 1x, 3x, 6x and 9x restricted breathing What does the Training Mask 2.0 come with ? (6 Air Resistance Caps) (3 Base pieces with flux valve plungers) (1 Silicone Training Mask) (1 Neoprene Sleeve) Brochures, Fitness Workout booklet / Instructional booklet Instructional DVD SIZING Diagram", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-bk0tz7UL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RSZ6NI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Fencing", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B008RTKEPW", "title": "Police Magnum Pepper Spray with UV Dye and Flip Top (Pack of 4), Black, 3-Ounce", "description": "Police Magnum OC-17 Pepper Spray offers one of the most powerful concentration of pepper spray allowed by law. This is the same spray used by police officers. Each unit also includes UV dye for later identification of the subject by law enforcement. The unit allows for one hand operation and can be used to provide multiple blasts. A suspect will be immediately affected with burning skin, coughing, watery eyes, runny nose, difficulty breathing but will have no permanent injuries. It is both non-toxic and non-flammable. Effective against: muggers, carjackers, rapists, vicious animals, etc. Keep away from children and do not store in high heat.", "text": "Police Magnum Pepper Spray with UV Dye and Flip Top (Pack of 4), Black, 3-Ounce Police Magnum OC-17 Pepper Spray offers one of the most powerful concentration of pepper spray allowed by law. This is the same spray used by police officers. Each unit also includes UV dye for later identification of the subject by law enforcement. The unit allows for one hand operation and can be used to provide multiple blasts. A suspect will be immediately affected with burning skin, coughing, watery eyes, runny nose, difficulty breathing but will have no permanent injuries. It is both non-toxic and non-flammable. Effective against: muggers, carjackers, rapists, vicious animals, etc. Keep away from children and do not store in high heat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51n6jpLJvfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RTKEPW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 28.75}}
{"item_id": "B008RTKEQG", "title": "Police Magnum Pepper Spray with UV Dye and Twist Top, Black, 4-Ounce", "description": "Police Magnum OC-17 Pepper Spray offers one of the most powerful concentration of pepper spray allowed by law. This is the same spray used by police officers. Each unit also includes UV dye for later identification of the subject by law enforcement. The unit allows for one hand operation and can be used to provide multiple blasts. A suspect will be immediately affected with burning skin, coughing, watery eyes, runny nose, difficulty breathing but will have no permanent injuries. It is both non-toxic and non-flammable. Effective against: muggers, carjackers, rapists, vicious animals, etc. Keep away from children and do not store in high heat.", "text": "Police Magnum Pepper Spray with UV Dye and Twist Top, Black, 4-Ounce Police Magnum OC-17 Pepper Spray offers one of the most powerful concentration of pepper spray allowed by law. This is the same spray used by police officers. Each unit also includes UV dye for later identification of the subject by law enforcement. The unit allows for one hand operation and can be used to provide multiple blasts. A suspect will be immediately affected with burning skin, coughing, watery eyes, runny nose, difficulty breathing but will have no permanent injuries. It is both non-toxic and non-flammable. Effective against: muggers, carjackers, rapists, vicious animals, etc. Keep away from children and do not store in high heat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gK1Ot9iwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RTKEQG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 10.0}}
{"item_id": "B008RTKF1U", "title": "Police Magnum Faux Leather Holster Pepper Spray with UV Dye and Twist Top (Pack of 2), Black, 0.5-Ounce", "description": "Police Magnum Pepper Spray - Keychain Unit ORMD Pepper Spray with Black Leatherette Keychain Holster. Model: PM400. Measures 3\". Black leatherette keychain holster. Contains 0.5 ounces of pepper spray.", "text": "Police Magnum Faux Leather Holster Pepper Spray with UV Dye and Twist Top (Pack of 2), Black, 0.5-Ounce Police Magnum Pepper Spray - Keychain Unit ORMD Pepper Spray with Black Leatherette Keychain Holster. Model: PM400. Measures 3\". Black leatherette keychain holster. Contains 0.5 ounces of pepper spray.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4101-DzLxUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RTKF1U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Police", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 7.75}}
{"item_id": "B008RYF2RM", "title": "VZ Grips Turbo Screws", "description": "These are some pretty awesome TORX screws that will dress up your gun. Hand made here in the USA. They take a T-15 torx driver. Sold in sets of four. When your buying online you want to be confident in the company you are buying from and that is exactly how you should feel about purchasing from VZ Grips. We have been a leading manufacturer of the finest grips on the planet for your beloved weapon since 2003. With all the write-ups in biggest gun magazines in the world and our valued customers that stand behind our products on forums as hard as we do, that can only mean one thing, our products and company are the REAL DEAL. We stand strong behind our products with a 100% money back guarantee and our reputation is bulletproof. All purchases come with a Return Authorization form so if for any reason you are not happy simply return the product within the guidelines specified and we will refund your money NO QUESTIONS ASKED. So, browse our products and buy with confidence knowing that you are getting the highest quality grip for your firearm with world class customer service backing it. Your firearm doesn't deserve anything less.", "text": "VZ Grips Turbo Screws These are some pretty awesome TORX screws that will dress up your gun. Hand made here in the USA. They take a T-15 torx driver. Sold in sets of four. When your buying online you want to be confident in the company you are buying from and that is exactly how you should feel about purchasing from VZ Grips. We have been a leading manufacturer of the finest grips on the planet for your beloved weapon since 2003. With all the write-ups in biggest gun magazines in the world and our valued customers that stand behind our products on forums as hard as we do, that can only mean one thing, our products and company are the REAL DEAL. We stand strong behind our products with a 100% money back guarantee and our reputation is bulletproof. All purchases come with a Return Authorization form so if for any reason you are not happy simply return the product within the guidelines specified and we will refund your money NO QUESTIONS ASKED. So, browse our products and buy with confidence knowing that you are getting the highest quality grip for your firearm with world class customer service backing it. Your firearm doesn't deserve anything less.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pA6xuRAsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RYF2RM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 19.0}}
