{"item_id": "B008RZWU76", "title": "Maxpedition Gear WDB4 Black Web Dominator", "description": "Product Details :Designed primarily to manage the floppy excess 1” webbing on backpack shoulder straps once they are tightenedSimply install the Web Dominator on end of strap roll/fold it up and engage the shock (bungee) cordAlso excellent on backpack sternum straps to position hydration drink tubeMade from durable low IR signature materialColor Options: Black / Khaki / Foliage Green (Single Color: Packet of 4)", "text": "Maxpedition Gear WDB4 Black Web Dominator Product Details :Designed primarily to manage the floppy excess 1” webbing on backpack shoulder straps once they are tightenedSimply install the Web Dominator on end of strap roll/fold it up and engage the shock (bungee) cordAlso excellent on backpack sternum straps to position hydration drink tubeMade from durable low IR signature materialColor Options: Black / Khaki / Foliage Green (Single Color: Packet of 4)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hSM6v5adL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008RZWU76.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Max", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B008S8PSDA", "title": "SODIAL(TM) Bicycle Chain Breaker Spliter Chain Tool Repairing", "description": "Designed to quickly and accurately remove and install chain pins.Along with superior strength and durability, it features a handy \"loosening shelf\" to remedy stiff links after reassembly.The fine thread and comfortable size enable easy removal of even the toughest chain pins.Fits the following : Common bicycle chains of 8/9/10 speed, Works for all common bicycle chains.Durable Steel ConstructionThis small but powerful and precise tool is specially designed to quickly and accurately remove and install chain pins.It is of the same quality as the one used by the specialized factory.Along with superior strength and durability, it features a handy \"loosening shelf\" to remedy stiff links after reassembly.The fine thread and comfortable size enable easy removal of even the toughest chain pins.Light weight, it's the perfect take-along chain tool.Fits the following : Common bicycle chains of 8/9/10 speed, Works for all common bicycle chains.Durable Steel Construction -With perfectly contoured cushioned rubber coated handlesWith a \"shelf\" for loosening tight linksPackage included: 1 x BICYCLE CHAIN TOOL BREAKER SPLITTER", "text": "SODIAL(TM) Bicycle Chain Breaker Spliter Chain Tool Repairing Designed to quickly and accurately remove and install chain pins.Along with superior strength and durability, it features a handy \"loosening shelf\" to remedy stiff links after reassembly.The fine thread and comfortable size enable easy removal of even the toughest chain pins.Fits the following : Common bicycle chains of 8/9/10 speed, Works for all common bicycle chains.Durable Steel ConstructionThis small but powerful and precise tool is specially designed to quickly and accurately remove and install chain pins.It is of the same quality as the one used by the specialized factory.Along with superior strength and durability, it features a handy \"loosening shelf\" to remedy stiff links after reassembly.The fine thread and comfortable size enable easy removal of even the toughest chain pins.Light weight, it's the perfect take-along chain tool.Fits the following : Common bicycle chains of 8/9/10 speed, Works for all common bicycle chains.Durable Steel Construction -With perfectly contoured cushioned rubber coated handlesWith a \"shelf\" for loosening tight linksPackage included: 1 x BICYCLE CHAIN TOOL BREAKER SPLITTER", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410xgQN1lEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008S8PSDA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SODIAL(TM)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 5.43}}
{"item_id": "B008SACY0I", "title": "United Cutlery UC2863 Marine Force Recon Sawback Bowie", "description": "\"Anything, anytime, anywhere.\" You'll never find a mission the Marine Force Recon can't accomplish - especially with the help of this massive sawback bowie. It features a 11 1/2\" coated AUS-6 stainless steel blade that is corrosive resistant and offers a non-glare finish. An over-molded rubber handle grip feels great in your hand and the coated metal hand-guard will keep your fingers from slipping onto the blade. Includes a durable nylon sheath.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2863 Marine Force Recon Sawback Bowie \"Anything, anytime, anywhere.\" You'll never find a mission the Marine Force Recon can't accomplish - especially with the help of this massive sawback bowie. It features a 11 1/2\" coated AUS-6 stainless steel blade that is corrosive resistant and offers a non-glare finish. An over-molded rubber handle grip feels great in your hand and the coated metal hand-guard will keep your fingers from slipping onto the blade. Includes a durable nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ouieR9nKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008SACY0I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 27.99}}
