{"item_id": "B008SRWWUI", "title": "Venum \"Kontact\" Gel Glove Wraps, Black", "description": "Expert in wrist protection, the Kontact glove wraps are an essential tool for Combat Sports. Wear under bag gloves and training gloves as a convenient and more protective alternative to hand wraps, or wear alone for light bag work, mitts, speed bag, grappling and more. Gel Shock protector supplies state of the art cushioning and support over knuckles, hands and wrist.", "text": "Venum \"Kontact\" Gel Glove Wraps, Black Expert in wrist protection, the Kontact glove wraps are an essential tool for Combat Sports. Wear under bag gloves and training gloves as a convenient and more protective alternative to hand wraps, or wear alone for light bag work, mitts, speed bag, grappling and more. Gel Shock protector supplies state of the art cushioning and support over knuckles, hands and wrist.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518z5mQ7EKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008SRWWUI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Venum", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Hand Wraps"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B008SYMU62", "title": "SNIPER Tactical Precision Machined Aluminum QD Weaver Picatinny Front And Rear Combo Set Flip Up Backup AR15 AR-15 M16 M4 M-4 Flattop A1 A2 Post Back Up Iron Sight Mount", "description": "Tactical Combo Of Front And Rear Aluminum Iron Sights. • Quick Detachable Front Sight with Adjustable A2 Square Post Assembly to Fit All Picatinny/Weaver Style Rails • Equipped with Locking Retention Thumb Nut andClever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Condition • Precision Elevation Adjustments to Enhance Shooting Accuracy • Profile Designed for Installation on Gas Block • Integral Picatinny Mounting Deck to Fit All Flat Tops • Dual Aiming Apertures for All Shooting Requirements • Precision Windage Adjustments • Clever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Conditions • User Friendly Locking Thumb Nut for Easy Installation", "text": "SNIPER Tactical Precision Machined Aluminum QD Weaver Picatinny Front And Rear Combo Set Flip Up Backup AR15 AR-15 M16 M4 M-4 Flattop A1 A2 Post Back Up Iron Sight Mount Tactical Combo Of Front And Rear Aluminum Iron Sights. • Quick Detachable Front Sight with Adjustable A2 Square Post Assembly to Fit All Picatinny/Weaver Style Rails • Equipped with Locking Retention Thumb Nut andClever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Condition • Precision Elevation Adjustments to Enhance Shooting Accuracy • Profile Designed for Installation on Gas Block • Integral Picatinny Mounting Deck to Fit All Flat Tops • Dual Aiming Apertures for All Shooting Requirements • Precision Windage Adjustments • Clever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Conditions • User Friendly Locking Thumb Nut for Easy Installation", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jLdx%2B6QWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008SYMU62.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B008TVGIIK", "title": "Bionicon C.Guide V.02 Bicycle Chain Retention System", "description": "The lightest chainguide available for your drivetrain. Split design allows fitment over the chain and gear cable without breaking the chain. Can be fitted over the gear cable or directly to the chain stay allowing it to be used on almost any bike. Pivot tube is replaceable. 19 grams.", "text": "Bionicon C.Guide V.02 Bicycle Chain Retention System The lightest chainguide available for your drivetrain. Split design allows fitment over the chain and gear cable without breaking the chain. Can be fitted over the gear cable or directly to the chain stay allowing it to be used on almost any bike. Pivot tube is replaceable. 19 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r0RABO4mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008TVGIIK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Chain Tension Idlers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008TWJSGS", "title": "Cygolite Expilion 600 Lumen USB Rechargeable Bicycle Headlight, Black, One Size", "description": "The new Expilion raises the bar for one-piece lighting systems with the super-bright 600 lumen output Expilion that utilizes an optimized reflector and top-of-the-line Cree LED for flawless illumination on the road and trail. For trail rides, the convenient quick release battery stick can be swapped on-the-fly when your ride goes longer, ensuring you never get left in the dark. Road rides benefit from Cygolite new 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination that alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path. Convenient USB charging, run time flexibility with swappable batteries and super bright illumination on the road or trail make the Expilion the choice for any avid rider that needs an all around light.", "text": "Cygolite Expilion 600 Lumen USB Rechargeable Bicycle Headlight, Black, One Size The new Expilion raises the bar for one-piece lighting systems with the super-bright 600 lumen output Expilion that utilizes an optimized reflector and top-of-the-line Cree LED for flawless illumination on the road and trail. For trail rides, the convenient quick release battery stick can be swapped on-the-fly when your ride goes longer, ensuring you never get left in the dark. Road rides benefit from Cygolite new 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination that alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path. Convenient USB charging, run time flexibility with swappable batteries and super bright illumination on the road or trail make the Expilion the choice for any avid rider that needs an all around light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kvQpgEExL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008TWJSGS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cygo Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B008U822QY", "title": "B5 Sopmod Stk Mil-spec Fde", "description": "Introducing the B5 Systems Enhanced Sopmod Buttstock. Designed to fit a MILSPEC Receiver Extension (Buffer Tube). The NSWC CRANE developed Sopmod Buttstock was born from the unique needs of Special Operation Forces. B5 Systems has taken the venerable design of the Sopmod Buttstock and incorporated the features sought by military professionals and firearm enthusiasts. Building upon its exceptional cheekweld and storage capabilities the B5 Systems Enhanced Sopmod Buttstock features an ambidextrous quick disconnect sling swivel mount, color matching hardware, and construction of milspec materials and finishes. The B5 Systems Enhanced Sopmod Buttstock is available in molded colors of Black and Flat Dark Earth. As a long time defense contractor, B5 Systems is committed to bringing the highest quality products to serve the needs of the warfighting community. B5 Systems commitment to quality is evident in its 2009 selection as the United States Army supplier of the Sopmod Buttstock (Contract # W52H09-10-D-0024). Building upon its history of serving the Defense Sector and its renewed commitment to bringing the best products to market, B5 Systems is proud to introduce its Enhanced Sopmod Buttstock.", "text": "B5 Sopmod Stk Mil-spec Fde Introducing the B5 Systems Enhanced Sopmod Buttstock. Designed to fit a MILSPEC Receiver Extension (Buffer Tube). The NSWC CRANE developed Sopmod Buttstock was born from the unique needs of Special Operation Forces. B5 Systems has taken the venerable design of the Sopmod Buttstock and incorporated the features sought by military professionals and firearm enthusiasts. Building upon its exceptional cheekweld and storage capabilities the B5 Systems Enhanced Sopmod Buttstock features an ambidextrous quick disconnect sling swivel mount, color matching hardware, and construction of milspec materials and finishes. The B5 Systems Enhanced Sopmod Buttstock is available in molded colors of Black and Flat Dark Earth. As a long time defense contractor, B5 Systems is committed to bringing the highest quality products to serve the needs of the warfighting community. B5 Systems commitment to quality is evident in its 2009 selection as the United States Army supplier of the Sopmod Buttstock (Contract # W52H09-10-D-0024). Building upon its history of serving the Defense Sector and its renewed commitment to bringing the best products to market, B5 Systems is proud to introduce its Enhanced Sopmod Buttstock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aupZ3Y-gL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008U822QY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008U8C7BO", "title": "Ghost Rocket 3.5 LB Trigger Kit For Self Defense", "description": "The ROCKET Trigger Control Connector is the King of all \"Ghost Maker\" Triggers! This kit is for self defense, target and competion. Fits all generations.", "text": "Ghost Rocket 3.5 LB Trigger Kit For Self Defense The ROCKET Trigger Control Connector is the King of all \"Ghost Maker\" Triggers! This kit is for self defense, target and competion. Fits all generations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wAv65SIDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008U8C7BO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "King Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 39.89}}
{"item_id": "B008U9C0BU", "title": "Springfield XDS Pro Carry LT CCW IWB Leather Gun Holster New Black", "description": "THIS IS ONE OF THE FINEST INSIDE THE PANTS, CLIP ON, SUPER LIGHT WEIGHT HOLSTERS AVAILABLE TODAY. THIS Black FINISHED LEATHER HOLSTER HAS A SMOOTH LEATHER LINING ,ALLOWING FOR A FAST AND EASY DRAW. THIS HOLSTER IS COMFORTABLE WHEN SITTING OR STANDING. This is 100% AMERICAN cowhide - American made product - the very BEST! This is not HORSE HIDE - This is not some imported inexpensive leather. Please compare the cuts on our leather and the stitching to ANY OTHERS and see the quality we put into each and every holster. The Holster Store Holsters are double back stitched at the stress points, and provide maximum durability. This item is for Right handed shooters - LH available upon request", "text": "Springfield XDS Pro Carry LT CCW IWB Leather Gun Holster New Black THIS IS ONE OF THE FINEST INSIDE THE PANTS, CLIP ON, SUPER LIGHT WEIGHT HOLSTERS AVAILABLE TODAY. THIS Black FINISHED LEATHER HOLSTER HAS A SMOOTH LEATHER LINING ,ALLOWING FOR A FAST AND EASY DRAW. THIS HOLSTER IS COMFORTABLE WHEN SITTING OR STANDING. This is 100% AMERICAN cowhide - American made product - the very BEST! This is not HORSE HIDE - This is not some imported inexpensive leather. Please compare the cuts on our leather and the stitching to ANY OTHERS and see the quality we put into each and every holster. The Holster Store Holsters are double back stitched at the stress points, and provide maximum durability. This item is for Right handed shooters - LH available upon request", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319V2iaWC7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008U9C0BU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B008UB4BV0", "title": "Ultimate Survival Technologies Wetfire Tinder", "description": "The perfect accompaniment to any fire starter, the Ultimate Survival Technologies WetFire™ tinder can help you get a blaze going even in a downpour. In fact, the cubes actually burn longer when wet! It is individually packaged in a lightweight solid cube form that can't leak or foul up your other gear. It leaves none of the residue of inferior petroleum-based products and is non-toxic. The cubes burn without smoke and can be started even in high winds and nasty weather. At high altitude you have enough to worry about without wasting energy trying to light an uncooperative stove. With WetFire™ tinder, this problem is solved. Just sprinkle a small amount of tinder shavings around the backpacker stove, and it lights instantly. Use it to light your backyard barbecue, or to start a fire in your living room fireplace. Make yourself popular when only you can start the late night beach bonfire.Over 1,300 degree Fahrenheit flame..Fire can start with only a small pile of shavings..For use with any UST or other?sparking device, stormproof lighter ?and/or stove..5-year shelf life..", "text": "Ultimate Survival Technologies Wetfire Tinder The perfect accompaniment to any fire starter, the Ultimate Survival Technologies WetFire™ tinder can help you get a blaze going even in a downpour. In fact, the cubes actually burn longer when wet! It is individually packaged in a lightweight solid cube form that can't leak or foul up your other gear. It leaves none of the residue of inferior petroleum-based products and is non-toxic. The cubes burn without smoke and can be started even in high winds and nasty weather. At high altitude you have enough to worry about without wasting energy trying to light an uncooperative stove. With WetFire™ tinder, this problem is solved. Just sprinkle a small amount of tinder shavings around the backpacker stove, and it lights instantly. Use it to light your backyard barbecue, or to start a fire in your living room fireplace. Make yourself popular when only you can start the late night beach bonfire.Over 1,300 degree Fahrenheit flame..Fire can start with only a small pile of shavings..For use with any UST or other?sparking device, stormproof lighter ?and/or stove..5-year shelf life..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tVmL9DokL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008UB4BV0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UST", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 8.09}}
{"item_id": "B008UG5B9Q", "title": "DTOM Combination POCKET/IWB Holster for S&W Bodyguard 380, CC4", "description": "You will love the comfort and convenience of this holster. Only model with a Patent Pending Design that allows for it t be almost instantly converted from ITWB (in the waist band) to Pocket Holster. Exterior is made from Armadillo Nylon for extreme toughness while inside lining is smooth for easy draw. You will not find a better or more versatile CCW holster for the S&W; Bodyguard 380 cal pistol on the market today. Try it risk free with a 30 day money back guarantee.", "text": "DTOM Combination POCKET/IWB Holster for S&W Bodyguard 380, CC4 You will love the comfort and convenience of this holster. Only model with a Patent Pending Design that allows for it t be almost instantly converted from ITWB (in the waist band) to Pocket Holster. Exterior is made from Armadillo Nylon for extreme toughness while inside lining is smooth for easy draw. You will not find a better or more versatile CCW holster for the S&W; Bodyguard 380 cal pistol on the market today. Try it risk free with a 30 day money back guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BWRb83vNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008UG5B9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 18.92}}
{"item_id": "B008UGE6B0", "title": "DTOM Combination POCKET/IWB Holster for Keltec P32 P3AT, Taurus 738 TCP 380, Ruger LCP 380, CC3", "description": "You will love the comfort and convenience of this holster. Only model with a Patent Pending Design that allows for it t be almost instantly converted from IWB (in the waist band) to Pocket Holster. Exterior is made from Armadillo Nylon for extreme toughness while inside lining is smooth for easy draw. You will not find a better or more versatile CCW holster for the Keltec P32 P3AT, Taurus 738 TCP 380, or Ruger LCP 380 on the market today. Try it risk free with a 30 day money back guarantee.", "text": "DTOM Combination POCKET/IWB Holster for Keltec P32 P3AT, Taurus 738 TCP 380, Ruger LCP 380, CC3 You will love the comfort and convenience of this holster. Only model with a Patent Pending Design that allows for it t be almost instantly converted from IWB (in the waist band) to Pocket Holster. Exterior is made from Armadillo Nylon for extreme toughness while inside lining is smooth for easy draw. You will not find a better or more versatile CCW holster for the Keltec P32 P3AT, Taurus 738 TCP 380, or Ruger LCP 380 on the market today. Try it risk free with a 30 day money back guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nTGcl8RrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008UGE6B0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 21.92}}
{"item_id": "B008UJ7INU", "title": "GoSports Premium Ladder Toss Game (includes carrying case)", "description": "[if gte mso 9]> Normal 0 false false false EN-US X-NONE X-NONE MicrosoftInternetExplorer4 /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-para-margin:0in; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",\"serif\";} <![endif]Whether you are upgrading an old ladder toss set or finally joining the fun, the GoSports Ladder Toss game is the perfect choice. We built this set using premium materials so it will last for years, and we also simplified the assembly so you can be setup and playing within minutes. While some of the cheaper games out there use ultra thin, low quality PVC (less than 1mm thickness), we used robust 2.5mm PVC that can handle even the hardest tosses. There is nothing worse than having a game constantly interrupted by the PVC joints falling apart, so we didn’t skimp like the others. Our Bolas (projectiles you throw at the targets) are made from real golf balls connected by high density woven nylon, which provide the best feel and their thick rope prevents tangles. Everything can be conveniently stowed in the included zip-up carrying case for maximum portability (upgraded to durable polyester since Jan 2013). Our goal is to provide you with the best possible game so you can get out there and have the most possible fun with friends and family. If you are looking for a more economical Ladder Toss set, please checkout our GoSports Standard Ladder Toss Set.", "text": "GoSports Premium Ladder Toss Game (includes carrying case) [if gte mso 9]> Normal 0 false false false EN-US X-NONE X-NONE MicrosoftInternetExplorer4 /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-para-margin:0in; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",\"serif\";} <![endif]Whether you are upgrading an old ladder toss set or finally joining the fun, the GoSports Ladder Toss game is the perfect choice. We built this set using premium materials so it will last for years, and we also simplified the assembly so you can be setup and playing within minutes. While some of the cheaper games out there use ultra thin, low quality PVC (less than 1mm thickness), we used robust 2.5mm PVC that can handle even the hardest tosses. There is nothing worse than having a game constantly interrupted by the PVC joints falling apart, so we didn’t skimp like the others. Our Bolas (projectiles you throw at the targets) are made from real golf balls connected by high density woven nylon, which provide the best feel and their thick rope prevents tangles. Everything can be conveniently stowed in the included zip-up carrying case for maximum portability (upgraded to durable polyester since Jan 2013). Our goal is to provide you with the best possible game so you can get out there and have the most possible fun with friends and family. If you are looking for a more economical Ladder Toss set, please checkout our GoSports Standard Ladder Toss Set.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bOo5L3s%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008UJ7INU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GoSports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games"]], "price": 54.99}}
