{"item_id": "B008UYCT8O", "title": "Fox Head Men's Dirtpaw Race Glove", "description": "A high performing glove without the high price tag. The freshly-renovated Dirtpaw uses a completely padded knuckle, palm and superior flex-point comfort to remain the top choice for the entry-level rider.", "text": "Fox Head Men's Dirtpaw Race Glove A high performing glove without the high price tag. The freshly-renovated Dirtpaw uses a completely padded knuckle, palm and superior flex-point comfort to remain the top choice for the entry-level rider.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51n5ECZHgiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008UYCT8O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008UYW9P2", "title": "Military USGI Desert Camo 1 Quart Canteen Pouch/General Purpose Dump Pouch", "description": "Multi function utility pouch will hold the 1qt canteen and cup or can be used as a general purpose pouch. Pocket features elastic draw cord compression, two outside pockets are sized to hold compression bandages or any other immediate need items. BUCKLES WILL BE TAN Features: Fits 1 qt canteen and cup or GPS pouch Flap with quick-release buckle Elastic draw cord compression cinch Two outside pockets Measures: 6.5 H x 4.25 W x 3.5 D inches", "text": "Military USGI Desert Camo 1 Quart Canteen Pouch/General Purpose Dump Pouch Multi function utility pouch will hold the 1qt canteen and cup or can be used as a general purpose pouch. Pocket features elastic draw cord compression, two outside pockets are sized to hold compression bandages or any other immediate need items. BUCKLES WILL BE TAN Features: Fits 1 qt canteen and cup or GPS pouch Flap with quick-release buckle Elastic draw cord compression cinch Two outside pockets Measures: 6.5 H x 4.25 W x 3.5 D inches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61CkuntaFgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008UYW9P2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "US Government", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B008UZMBN6", "title": "Sniper Scope LT4-16x40AOL with Side R/G/B Ill,qta W/e,ring,flip Open Lens Cover", "description": "Mil-Dot range estimating reticle for most optimal aiming and shooting performance One piece tube with front AO Limited lifetime warranty Magnification: 4.00X - 16X Tube Diameter: 1 Inch Objective Diameter: 40mm Field of View @ 100 yards: 23' - 5.8' Eye Relief: 3.9\" - 3.5\" Exit Pupil: 10.0mm - 2.5mm Click Value @100 yards: 1/4\" Length: 365mm Weight: 20.1 oz Parallax Setting: 5 Yds - Infinity Batteries: CR2032 3V", "text": "Sniper Scope LT4-16x40AOL with Side R/G/B Ill,qta W/e,ring,flip Open Lens Cover Mil-Dot range estimating reticle for most optimal aiming and shooting performance One piece tube with front AO Limited lifetime warranty Magnification: 4.00X - 16X Tube Diameter: 1 Inch Objective Diameter: 40mm Field of View @ 100 yards: 23' - 5.8' Eye Relief: 3.9\" - 3.5\" Exit Pupil: 10.0mm - 2.5mm Click Value @100 yards: 1/4\" Length: 365mm Weight: 20.1 oz Parallax Setting: 5 Yds - Infinity Batteries: CR2032 3V", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oVuMJHN1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008UZMBN6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Handgun Scopes"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B008V1GHLG", "title": "Shotgun Fiber Optic Green Front Sight for 12 / 20 Gauge", "description": "Pro: snap on 12/20GA shotgun barrel, bright and high visibility fiber optic sight, durable polymer plastic construction, and no gunsmith knowledge require. Con: hard to remove the sight once is install (unless you have very strong thumb).", "text": "Shotgun Fiber Optic Green Front Sight for 12 / 20 Gauge Pro: snap on 12/20GA shotgun barrel, bright and high visibility fiber optic sight, durable polymer plastic construction, and no gunsmith knowledge require. Con: hard to remove the sight once is install (unless you have very strong thumb).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OV6UsCP-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008V1GHLG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CoiTAC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 12.9}}
{"item_id": "B008V1HQGQ", "title": "Black Diamond Alpine Carbon Cork Trekking Poles (Pair) - 2013", "description": "For ounce-sensitive missions on the trail or in the snow, the lightweight, 100% carbon fiber Black Diamond Carbon Cork trekking pole offers a super-comfortable, premium cork grip and the supremely functional adjustability of dual FlickLock Pro. Interchangeable carbide Tech Tips can easily be switched out for rubber Tech Tips (sold separately) and two sets of baskets can be tailored to trail or snow activities.", "text": "Black Diamond Alpine Carbon Cork Trekking Poles (Pair) - 2013 For ounce-sensitive missions on the trail or in the snow, the lightweight, 100% carbon fiber Black Diamond Carbon Cork trekking pole offers a super-comfortable, premium cork grip and the supremely functional adjustability of dual FlickLock Pro. Interchangeable carbide Tech Tips can easily be switched out for rubber Tech Tips (sold separately) and two sets of baskets can be tailored to trail or snow activities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PUgZK7%2BUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008V1HQGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Diamond", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowshoeing", "Poles"]], "price": 159.94}}
