{"item_id": "B008VJZFIY", "title": "MAKO GMG Global Military Gear Large Universal Tactical Stealth Black 42\" MOLLE Modular Pals System Compatible Multi Compartment Double Gun Carrying Soft Padded Protective Case Gear Bag Holds Up to 2 Rifles GSG-5 H&K MP5 CETME AK47 AR15 M16 M4", "description": "Mako Global Military Gear Official Product, Universal Black 42\" MOLLE Compatible Multi Compartment Rifle Gun Carrying Soft Protective Case Gear Bag GSG-5 H&K; MP5 CETME AK47 AR15 M16 M4. This Case is Equipped with Multiple Storage Areas to Efficiently Organize Ammunition and Accessories. 1 Dual Zippered Main Compartment with a Protective Divider. 4 Retentive Velcro Security Straps. 3 Large (8x8x2.5\") Accessory Pouches. 27x11\" Front Dual Zippered Compartment with 2 Interior Zipper Storage Pockets. Overall the Case Measures 42 x 12 x 4\". It is Fully Closed Cell Foam Padded to Protect your Rifle and Gear Equipment. It can Accommodate 1 or 2 Long Rifle Guns up to 40.5\" Long. Constructed of Ultra Durable and Weatherproof 600D Polyester, Heavy Duty Zippers, Double Stitched Handles, QD Quick Release Buckles, and MOLLE Modular PALS System Equipment Webbing Panels throughout the Front. Versatily Carry Options Includes: Padded Backpack Straps for Hands Free Transport, an Ergonomic Shoulder Strap, as well as a Traditional Side Luggage Carry Handle. A Favorite with Military and Law Enforcement Personnel.", "text": "MAKO GMG Global Military Gear Large Universal Tactical Stealth Black 42\" MOLLE Modular Pals System Compatible Multi Compartment Double Gun Carrying Soft Padded Protective Case Gear Bag Holds Up to 2 Rifles GSG-5 H&K MP5 CETME AK47 AR15 M16 M4 Mako Global Military Gear Official Product, Universal Black 42\" MOLLE Compatible Multi Compartment Rifle Gun Carrying Soft Protective Case Gear Bag GSG-5 H&K; MP5 CETME AK47 AR15 M16 M4. This Case is Equipped with Multiple Storage Areas to Efficiently Organize Ammunition and Accessories. 1 Dual Zippered Main Compartment with a Protective Divider. 4 Retentive Velcro Security Straps. 3 Large (8x8x2.5\") Accessory Pouches. 27x11\" Front Dual Zippered Compartment with 2 Interior Zipper Storage Pockets. Overall the Case Measures 42 x 12 x 4\". It is Fully Closed Cell Foam Padded to Protect your Rifle and Gear Equipment. It can Accommodate 1 or 2 Long Rifle Guns up to 40.5\" Long. Constructed of Ultra Durable and Weatherproof 600D Polyester, Heavy Duty Zippers, Double Stitched Handles, QD Quick Release Buckles, and MOLLE Modular PALS System Equipment Webbing Panels throughout the Front. Versatily Carry Options Includes: Padded Backpack Straps for Hands Free Transport, an Ergonomic Shoulder Strap, as well as a Traditional Side Luggage Carry Handle. A Favorite with Military and Law Enforcement Personnel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JKBYibzpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VJZFIY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GMG-Global Military Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B008VOS3AQ", "title": "Fox Labs 4 Ounce 2% OC 5.3-mm UV Flip Top Stream Pepper Spray", "description": "Fast becoming the unit of choice, because the safety flip top prevents accidental discharge. We now sell more of these than all other tops combined! Simply put your finger or thumb under the top, it rises easily with a spring, and depress the button for a powerful blast. Fox Labs is the first and only company offering a true 5.3 million SHU resin in a 2% solution.", "text": "Fox Labs 4 Ounce 2% OC 5.3-mm UV Flip Top Stream Pepper Spray Fast becoming the unit of choice, because the safety flip top prevents accidental discharge. We now sell more of these than all other tops combined! Simply put your finger or thumb under the top, it rises easily with a spring, and depress the button for a powerful blast. Fox Labs is the first and only company offering a true 5.3 million SHU resin in a 2% solution.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41trRXLJNuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VOS3AQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fox Labs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 20.51}}
{"item_id": "B008VOS3C4", "title": "Fox Labs 2 Ounce 2% OC 5.3-mm Flip Top Stream Pepper Spray", "description": "Fast becoming the unit of choice, because the safety flip top prevents accidental discharge. We now sell more of these than all other tops combined! Simply put your finger or thumb under the top, it rises easily with a spring, and depress the button for a powerful blast. Fox Labs is the first and only company offering a true 5.3 million SHU resin in a 2% solution.", "text": "Fox Labs 2 Ounce 2% OC 5.3-mm Flip Top Stream Pepper Spray Fast becoming the unit of choice, because the safety flip top prevents accidental discharge. We now sell more of these than all other tops combined! Simply put your finger or thumb under the top, it rises easily with a spring, and depress the button for a powerful blast. Fox Labs is the first and only company offering a true 5.3 million SHU resin in a 2% solution.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-8BjhvW%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VOS3C4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fox Labs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 17.07}}
{"item_id": "B008VOS3E2", "title": "Fox Labs 2 Ounce 2% OC 5.3-mm Flip Top Medium Cone Fog Pepper Spray", "description": "Fast becoming the unit of choice, because the safety flip top prevents accidental discharge. We now sell more of these than all other tops combined! Simply put your finger or thumb under the top, it rises easily with a spring, and depress the button for a powerful blast. Fox Labs is the first and only company offering a true 5.3 million SHU resin in a 2% solution.", "text": "Fox Labs 2 Ounce 2% OC 5.3-mm Flip Top Medium Cone Fog Pepper Spray Fast becoming the unit of choice, because the safety flip top prevents accidental discharge. We now sell more of these than all other tops combined! Simply put your finger or thumb under the top, it rises easily with a spring, and depress the button for a powerful blast. Fox Labs is the first and only company offering a true 5.3 million SHU resin in a 2% solution.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41trRXLJNuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VOS3E2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fox Labs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 15.24}}
{"item_id": "B008VPC4LO", "title": "TekMat 12-Inch X 36-Inch Long Gun Cleaning Mat with AR15 Imprint, OD Green", "description": "Your gun is a proud possession as well as an investment and should be protected as such. TekMats depict the fascinating mechanical assembly of each firearm accompanied with data, history and details on each gun. We don't want cleaning, repairing or storing your firearm to be a chore and when seated in front of one of these gun mats, it certainly won't be. Aside from the aesthetic and intellectual appeal; TekMats also serve a very purposeful and functional role in protecting your firearms. They worked with numerous suppliers and tested many materials to find one that would be suited for both the imprinting of the design as well as protection of your firearm. The top surface of the gun mat is soft and made to protect your gun from scratches while the rubber backing will help to absorb damaging impacts from accidentally dropping your gun or parts while working on them and it also helps hold the mat in place while it is in use. We also utilize a special printing technology that prevents the ink from simply sitting on top of the material but instead fuses the ink into the fibers of the cloth via sublimation. This keeps the surface of the gun pads completely soft and even and helps ensure the print will last through repeated washing and cleaning of the gun mat.", "text": "TekMat 12-Inch X 36-Inch Long Gun Cleaning Mat with AR15 Imprint, OD Green Your gun is a proud possession as well as an investment and should be protected as such. TekMats depict the fascinating mechanical assembly of each firearm accompanied with data, history and details on each gun. We don't want cleaning, repairing or storing your firearm to be a chore and when seated in front of one of these gun mats, it certainly won't be. Aside from the aesthetic and intellectual appeal; TekMats also serve a very purposeful and functional role in protecting your firearms. They worked with numerous suppliers and tested many materials to find one that would be suited for both the imprinting of the design as well as protection of your firearm. The top surface of the gun mat is soft and made to protect your gun from scratches while the rubber backing will help to absorb damaging impacts from accidentally dropping your gun or parts while working on them and it also helps hold the mat in place while it is in use. We also utilize a special printing technology that prevents the ink from simply sitting on top of the material but instead fuses the ink into the fibers of the cloth via sublimation. This keeps the surface of the gun pads completely soft and even and helps ensure the print will last through repeated washing and cleaning of the gun mat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AnL77QNtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VPC4LO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TekMat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B008VQ6YSM", "title": "Rubena V99 City Hopper Bicycle Tire with Anti-Puncture System and Reflective Sidewall (Black, 28x2.0-Inch)", "description": "Rubena Cityhopper is the ultimate cruising tire with just the right blend of good looks, smooth ride, and technology. with APS (Anti Puncture System) and RS (Reflective Stripe with 3M technology).", "text": "Rubena V99 City Hopper Bicycle Tire with Anti-Puncture System and Reflective Sidewall (Black, 28x2.0-Inch) Rubena Cityhopper is the ultimate cruising tire with just the right blend of good looks, smooth ride, and technology. with APS (Anti Puncture System) and RS (Reflective Stripe with 3M technology).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GW9U9RiyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VQ6YSM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rubena", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 26.78}}
{"item_id": "B008VQDKRA", "title": "Shimano Tourney Shift Lever SL-RS45", "description": "Shimano Revo shifters are light action twist shifters that take the thinking out of shifting. Just rotate grip and you shift gears.", "text": "Shimano Tourney Shift Lever SL-RS45 Shimano Revo shifters are light action twist shifters that take the thinking out of shifting. Just rotate grip and you shift gears.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aAfWnlapL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VQDKRA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Shift Levers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008VS8M58", "title": ".223 5.56x45mm Caliber Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresighter", "description": "", "text": ".223 5.56x45mm Caliber Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresighter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xNbPUkQZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VS8M58.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Generic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 11.48}}
{"item_id": "B008VUTP9I", "title": "Cygolite Metro 420 Lumen USB Rechargeable Bicycle Headlight, Black, One Size", "description": "The go-to headlight for your daily ride is finally here. The Metro 420 lights up every crevice on the road ahead like no other. Incorporating an ultra bright 5 watt LED with an internal Li-Ion battery, the Metro shines 420 lumens of powerful light down any street, then recharges conveniently through a USB port to save you the cost of replacing batteries day after day. Cygolite new 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination provides added safety by alerting motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path. Compact, rechargeable and super bright, the Metro 420 is the ultimate commuting light.", "text": "Cygolite Metro 420 Lumen USB Rechargeable Bicycle Headlight, Black, One Size The go-to headlight for your daily ride is finally here. The Metro 420 lights up every crevice on the road ahead like no other. Incorporating an ultra bright 5 watt LED with an internal Li-Ion battery, the Metro shines 420 lumens of powerful light down any street, then recharges conveniently through a USB port to save you the cost of replacing batteries day after day. Cygolite new 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination provides added safety by alerting motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path. Compact, rechargeable and super bright, the Metro 420 is the ultimate commuting light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iWF2wvqQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VUTP9I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B008VVFVLI", "title": "Civilian MRE Gift Set", "description": "Designed for use without batteries or power cords, the Dynamo radio gets all the juice it needs from exposure to the sun or hand-powered cranking. A great choice for emergencies or power outages, but it can also serve as a daily device for folks who like to tune in while outdoors or take their station with them as they move about the house. A compact little unit, the Dynamo features a dial tuner, a simple on/off slider switch, and a collapsible antenna. Finished with an attractive two tone housing, it receives both AM/FM & Weatherband signals and measures approximately 3 by 2-1/4 by 3-1/4 inches. /// Each Full Meal is contained in an air tight, water proof, bug proof, polly bag. *NOT for vegans or people with food allergies - Meals May contain meat, peanut, dairy, soy, wheat, etc. /// Two classic first aid vinyl stickers ready for application wherever desired. /// Used German MILSURP decontamination box makes a great housing for your own emergency kit and houses all items included in this gift set. Adjustable nylon strap makes for easy carry. Please understand that these are Used and have a lot of wear and tear.", "text": "Civilian MRE Gift Set Designed for use without batteries or power cords, the Dynamo radio gets all the juice it needs from exposure to the sun or hand-powered cranking. A great choice for emergencies or power outages, but it can also serve as a daily device for folks who like to tune in while outdoors or take their station with them as they move about the house. A compact little unit, the Dynamo features a dial tuner, a simple on/off slider switch, and a collapsible antenna. Finished with an attractive two tone housing, it receives both AM/FM & Weatherband signals and measures approximately 3 by 2-1/4 by 3-1/4 inches. /// Each Full Meal is contained in an air tight, water proof, bug proof, polly bag. *NOT for vegans or people with food allergies - Meals May contain meat, peanut, dairy, soy, wheat, etc. /// Two classic first aid vinyl stickers ready for application wherever desired. /// Used German MILSURP decontamination box makes a great housing for your own emergency kit and houses all items included in this gift set. Adjustable nylon strap makes for easy carry. Please understand that these are Used and have a lot of wear and tear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FgfFYtWrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VVFVLI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008VVHQ3Y", "title": "Segway Reticle Leveler", "description": "The Segway Reticle Leveler is the best scope mounting \"anti cant\" device on the market. Its simple, clean design makes it easy to align your scope's reticle with your gun. No more guessing, no more frustration, and no more hassle. The Segway Reticle Leveler does the job better, faster and cheaper than other, more complicated devices and it works with rifles, handguns or shotguns. Made in the U.S.A. Here's how it works: the Segway Reticle Leveler is made with two rectangular white plastic squares connected by a square brass rod. The plastic squares have four bold black horizontal stripes about 1/8\" wide, spaced about 3/16\" apart. Mount the scope, leaving the rings loose enough for a little bit of play. Pull the plastic squares apart on the reticle leveler, sliding the brass rod between the mount and the scope. Once you've done that, push the plastic squares toward each other so that they touch the scope on both sides. Hook the provided rubber band to the rings underneath the plastic squares to hold the Segway steady. Look through the scope, using the black lines on the plastic squares to align the reticle. Tighten your scope's rings, and you're good to go.", "text": "Segway Reticle Leveler The Segway Reticle Leveler is the best scope mounting \"anti cant\" device on the market. Its simple, clean design makes it easy to align your scope's reticle with your gun. No more guessing, no more frustration, and no more hassle. The Segway Reticle Leveler does the job better, faster and cheaper than other, more complicated devices and it works with rifles, handguns or shotguns. Made in the U.S.A. Here's how it works: the Segway Reticle Leveler is made with two rectangular white plastic squares connected by a square brass rod. The plastic squares have four bold black horizontal stripes about 1/8\" wide, spaced about 3/16\" apart. Mount the scope, leaving the rings loose enough for a little bit of play. Pull the plastic squares apart on the reticle leveler, sliding the brass rod between the mount and the scope. Once you've done that, push the plastic squares toward each other so that they touch the scope on both sides. Hook the provided rubber band to the rings underneath the plastic squares to hold the Segway steady. Look through the scope, using the black lines on the plastic squares to align the reticle. Tighten your scope's rings, and you're good to go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IKDBmTQ4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VVHQ3Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Rifle Scope Accessories"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B008VVNNX6", "title": "SimplySleeper SS-27Q Inflatable Full Air Mattress Bed with Built-In Foot Pump (Inflates in 4 mins) - Best material in the market!", "description": "Highest Quality and Super Durable DurmothaneTM Polyester Laminate MaterialEasy-to-use patented integrated built-in manual foot pumpInflated to 78\" x 55\" x 6\"; Supported Weight: 600 lbUnique three-layers of puncture resistant, lightweight (10 pounds), stretch resistant, soft touch and air-tight materialsManual Built-In Foot Pump inflates the bed in 4 mins - perfect for camping!The SimplySleeper airbed is a perfect sleeping solution for even the weariest traveler. Combining top-of-the-line quality and weightless comfort into one convenient package can turn any room or place into a comfortable bedroom in only 4 minutes.The SimplySleeper airbed offers a best-in-class feature, a patented breathable DurmothaneTM Polyester Laminate Technology that is topped with a lustrous 100% microfiber surface moderates your changing body temperature during sleep by wicking moisture away. The unique three-layers of materials perfectly sealed together to make SimplySleep airbeds incredibly puncture resistant and durable, yet sensually soft and silky to your skin. The thermo-induced laminate adhesive layer works to bind heavy gauge PVC together with a Polyester coating to reduce stretch and prevent airbed pressure loss, which is very common to lower quality airbeds.Other Features Include:- Easy-to-use integrated manual foot pump inflates the bed in approximately 4 minutes- Special I-Beam coil construction provides comfort and support that conforms to the body- Release valve to adjust the firmness to your liking- Stylish and convenient storage/travel bag included- Repair kit included- Dimension: Full 78\" x 55\" x 6\" inflated- Weight: 10 lbs", "text": "SimplySleeper SS-27Q Inflatable Full Air Mattress Bed with Built-In Foot Pump (Inflates in 4 mins) - Best material in the market! Highest Quality and Super Durable DurmothaneTM Polyester Laminate MaterialEasy-to-use patented integrated built-in manual foot pumpInflated to 78\" x 55\" x 6\"; Supported Weight: 600 lbUnique three-layers of puncture resistant, lightweight (10 pounds), stretch resistant, soft touch and air-tight materialsManual Built-In Foot Pump inflates the bed in 4 mins - perfect for camping!The SimplySleeper airbed is a perfect sleeping solution for even the weariest traveler. Combining top-of-the-line quality and weightless comfort into one convenient package can turn any room or place into a comfortable bedroom in only 4 minutes.The SimplySleeper airbed offers a best-in-class feature, a patented breathable DurmothaneTM Polyester Laminate Technology that is topped with a lustrous 100% microfiber surface moderates your changing body temperature during sleep by wicking moisture away. The unique three-layers of materials perfectly sealed together to make SimplySleep airbeds incredibly puncture resistant and durable, yet sensually soft and silky to your skin. The thermo-induced laminate adhesive layer works to bind heavy gauge PVC together with a Polyester coating to reduce stretch and prevent airbed pressure loss, which is very common to lower quality airbeds.Other Features Include:- Easy-to-use integrated manual foot pump inflates the bed in approximately 4 minutes- Special I-Beam coil construction provides comfort and support that conforms to the body- Release valve to adjust the firmness to your liking- Stylish and convenient storage/travel bag included- Repair kit included- Dimension: Full 78\" x 55\" x 6\" inflated- Weight: 10 lbs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318u4PU-wYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VVNNX6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008VVXHT6", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Set Of 4 Original Russian Military Surplus Mosin Nagant M38 M44 91/30 1891 91 30 7.62x54 Leather Srap Cartridge Ammo Ammunition Rounds Dual Pouch Pouches", "description": "Listing For 4 ammo pouches in original unissued surplus condition. These WWII style pouches are made of an ored vinyl-coated canvas with pebble finish, leather strap closures and 2\" belt loops.Each measures 6 1/4 x 1 1/2 x 4\"h. Keep Mosin Nagant ammo (or similar) at the ready and within easy reach. The dual pouch is ready for travel on either side of your belt for a balancing effect.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Set Of 4 Original Russian Military Surplus Mosin Nagant M38 M44 91/30 1891 91 30 7.62x54 Leather Srap Cartridge Ammo Ammunition Rounds Dual Pouch Pouches Listing For 4 ammo pouches in original unissued surplus condition. These WWII style pouches are made of an ored vinyl-coated canvas with pebble finish, leather strap closures and 2\" belt loops.Each measures 6 1/4 x 1 1/2 x 4\"h. Keep Mosin Nagant ammo (or similar) at the ready and within easy reach. The dual pouch is ready for travel on either side of your belt for a balancing effect.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NwEwuhF9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VVXHT6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B008VZ91WO", "title": "Solo Alcohol Burner - Spirit Alcohol Stove for Backpacking, Camping, Hiking or Use With Solo Stove.", "description": "The Solo Alcohol Burner is a great backup fuel source and companion to our wood burning Solo Stove. When used inside the Solo Stove, this alcohol burner benefits from the Solo Stove's efficient air flow system and which means achieving faster boil times. A convenient flame regulator lets you control and delete the flame with ease. The screw top cap features a rubber gasket which allows you to store fuel directly in the alcohol burner for extended periods of time without leakage. When you're on the move, save your precious pack space and store your Solo Alcohol Burner directly inside the Solo Stove itself. The Solo Alcohol Burners uses denatured alcohol (a.k.a. ethanol, methylated spirits, marine stove fuel), methanol or similar fuels. Denatured alcohol is readily available at hardware stores and is fairly inexpensive. Denatured alcohol burns very efficiently and produces no soot or smoke. Unlike petroleum fuels, denatured alcohol is a renewable fuel (made from plant material). It's vapors are non-explosive and it can be extinguished with water in an emergency making it safer than petroleum fuels. Another great feature of denatured alcohol is that it can be carried in virtually any plastic container making it very easy to transport and dispense.", "text": "Solo Alcohol Burner - Spirit Alcohol Stove for Backpacking, Camping, Hiking or Use With Solo Stove. The Solo Alcohol Burner is a great backup fuel source and companion to our wood burning Solo Stove. When used inside the Solo Stove, this alcohol burner benefits from the Solo Stove's efficient air flow system and which means achieving faster boil times. A convenient flame regulator lets you control and delete the flame with ease. The screw top cap features a rubber gasket which allows you to store fuel directly in the alcohol burner for extended periods of time without leakage. When you're on the move, save your precious pack space and store your Solo Alcohol Burner directly inside the Solo Stove itself. The Solo Alcohol Burners uses denatured alcohol (a.k.a. ethanol, methylated spirits, marine stove fuel), methanol or similar fuels. Denatured alcohol is readily available at hardware stores and is fairly inexpensive. Denatured alcohol burns very efficiently and produces no soot or smoke. Unlike petroleum fuels, denatured alcohol is a renewable fuel (made from plant material). It's vapors are non-explosive and it can be extinguished with water in an emergency making it safer than petroleum fuels. Another great feature of denatured alcohol is that it can be carried in virtually any plastic container making it very easy to transport and dispense.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PFVeA8qWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008VZ91WO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B008W0BNWE", "title": "Solo Aluminum Windscreen: For Use with Solo Stove and Other Backpacking Stoves, Camping Stoves, Butane Stoves, Alcohol Stoves", "description": "The Solo Aluminum Windscreen is meant to work in conjunction with our wood burning Solo Stove. Added protection against the elements will allow you to achieve faster boil times. With the wind blocked, efficiency increases and you'll also use less fuel for each burn. The extendable ground pegs allows for a stable setup. The 8-panel design allows you to configure the windscreen in a number of shapes and folds together nicely after each use.", "text": "Solo Aluminum Windscreen: For Use with Solo Stove and Other Backpacking Stoves, Camping Stoves, Butane Stoves, Alcohol Stoves The Solo Aluminum Windscreen is meant to work in conjunction with our wood burning Solo Stove. Added protection against the elements will allow you to achieve faster boil times. With the wind blocked, efficiency increases and you'll also use less fuel for each burn. The extendable ground pegs allows for a stable setup. The 8-panel design allows you to configure the windscreen in a number of shapes and folds together nicely after each use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316041WscqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008W0BNWE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B008W0DRNM", "title": "Solo Pot 900: Lightweight Stainless Steel Backpacking Pot for Solo Stove and Other Backpacking & Camping Stoves", "description": "The lightweight Solo Pot 900 is the companion pot crafted specifically for use with the Solo Stove. When nested, the Solo Stove fits inside the Solo Pot 900 for easy storage. Made with premium grade 304 stainless steel, the Solo Pot 900 is more durable than aluminum pots and arguably, a safer and healthier choice. The Solo Pot features: Easy to use lid with a rubber coated lift tab (lockable in the upright position) Pour spout for easy pouring Double fold out handles Volume markings in oz and ml Black nylon stuff sack with drawstring", "text": "Solo Pot 900: Lightweight Stainless Steel Backpacking Pot for Solo Stove and Other Backpacking & Camping Stoves The lightweight Solo Pot 900 is the companion pot crafted specifically for use with the Solo Stove. When nested, the Solo Stove fits inside the Solo Pot 900 for easy storage. Made with premium grade 304 stainless steel, the Solo Pot 900 is more durable than aluminum pots and arguably, a safer and healthier choice. The Solo Pot features: Easy to use lid with a rubber coated lift tab (lockable in the upright position) Pour spout for easy pouring Double fold out handles Volume markings in oz and ml Black nylon stuff sack with drawstring", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZDziR551L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008W0DRNM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B008W0MJJU", "title": "Solo Stove & Solo Pot 900 Combo: Lightweight Woodburning Cooking System for Backpacking, Camping, Kayaking, Cycling, Boy Scouts, Emergency Preparation", "description": "The patented Solo Stove is a woodgas stove that incorporates a secondary combustion for a more efficient and cleaner burn. The bottom vents allow air to enter and flow up the bottom of the grate to feed the primary combustion, a top down smolder. In addition, air entering in from the bottom vents heats up within the inner wall and rises up and out the top firebox vents causing a secondary combustion at the top of the stove. This technique makes for a cleaner burn which means less smoke and also allows the stove to burn more efficiently.Forget the Fuel:Our stoves cook your meals with nothing but the twigs you collect on your journey, eliminating the need for heavy, expensive, polluting petroleum gas. It's easy to light, fast to boil and clean to use.Gasify your Wood:A unique gasification and secondary combustion process lets our stoves achieve a highly efficient and more complete burn. This means you'll use fewer twigs to achieve a boil. It also means less smoke while cooking.Travel Lighter:The Solo Stove only weighs 9 oz and eliminates the need to carry fuel canisters - a great way to lighten your load. It also nests inside most pots leaving you with more space in your pack.Stay Green:By using renewable resources for fuel instead of petroleum, you're reducing your carbon footprint. You'll also keep fuel canisters out of the landfill.Be Prepared:The Solo Stove is great for any emergency situation. You'll be able to cook and will never need to worry about running out of fuel.Solo Stove Pot 900 Included", "text": "Solo Stove & Solo Pot 900 Combo: Lightweight Woodburning Cooking System for Backpacking, Camping, Kayaking, Cycling, Boy Scouts, Emergency Preparation The patented Solo Stove is a woodgas stove that incorporates a secondary combustion for a more efficient and cleaner burn. The bottom vents allow air to enter and flow up the bottom of the grate to feed the primary combustion, a top down smolder. In addition, air entering in from the bottom vents heats up within the inner wall and rises up and out the top firebox vents causing a secondary combustion at the top of the stove. This technique makes for a cleaner burn which means less smoke and also allows the stove to burn more efficiently.Forget the Fuel:Our stoves cook your meals with nothing but the twigs you collect on your journey, eliminating the need for heavy, expensive, polluting petroleum gas. It's easy to light, fast to boil and clean to use.Gasify your Wood:A unique gasification and secondary combustion process lets our stoves achieve a highly efficient and more complete burn. This means you'll use fewer twigs to achieve a boil. It also means less smoke while cooking.Travel Lighter:The Solo Stove only weighs 9 oz and eliminates the need to carry fuel canisters - a great way to lighten your load. It also nests inside most pots leaving you with more space in your pack.Stay Green:By using renewable resources for fuel instead of petroleum, you're reducing your carbon footprint. You'll also keep fuel canisters out of the landfill.Be Prepared:The Solo Stove is great for any emergency situation. You'll be able to cook and will never need to worry about running out of fuel.Solo Stove Pot 900 Included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413tInpEZZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008W0MJJU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Backpacking Stoves"]], "price": 104.98}}
