{"item_id": "B008W43MRE", "title": "Okeba Red Dot Accurate Laser Bore Sighter Boresighter Collimator for 0.22 to 0.50 Caliber Cartridge Sights & Riflescopes", "description": "Red laser dot suit for darklight or indoor, visual range up to 300yardWavelength: 630-680mmMax Output: < 5mWColor: blackLength: 155mmHead Dia: 16mmTail Dia: 5mmWeight: 29gPackage included:1 x Laser Bore1 x Screwdriver1 x Installation Stick4 x Adjustable Adapters3 x AG13 Batteries1 x User ManualNOET 1: If the item can't work when you install the battery, please change the direction of battery and try it againNOTE 2: the rubber adapter can be expandedTrademark OKEBA products are marketed exclusively by USA OKEBA INC.", "text": "Okeba Red Dot Accurate Laser Bore Sighter Boresighter Collimator for 0.22 to 0.50 Caliber Cartridge Sights & Riflescopes Red laser dot suit for darklight or indoor, visual range up to 300yardWavelength: 630-680mmMax Output: < 5mWColor: blackLength: 155mmHead Dia: 16mmTail Dia: 5mmWeight: 29gPackage included:1 x Laser Bore1 x Screwdriver1 x Installation Stick4 x Adjustable Adapters3 x AG13 Batteries1 x User ManualNOET 1: If the item can't work when you install the battery, please change the direction of battery and try it againNOTE 2: the rubber adapter can be expandedTrademark OKEBA products are marketed exclusively by USA OKEBA INC.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419H3ChUBCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008W43MRE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B008WNR5K0", "title": "Pedusa PE-771 Tri-Axis Multi-Function Pocket Pedometer (Pink)", "description": "Whether simply walking or taking the right steps to meet individual fitness goals, Pedusa Tri-Axis Pocket Pedometers are the perfect choice to track progress easily, and accurately. The Pedusa PE771 Tri-Axis Accelerometer pedometer is a highly accurate, multifunction activity monitor offering Steps, Distance, Calories Burned, Active Time, 7 Day Memory and Target Goal Setting. Also, In order to recognize actual walking activity and eliminate False Step readings, The Tri-Axis sensor has a 10 steps filter. If you move less than 10 steps and take about 5 seconds no-motion break, previous 10 or less steps will not be counted. Contents- pedometer, manual, safety leash, battery.", "text": "Pedusa PE-771 Tri-Axis Multi-Function Pocket Pedometer (Pink) Whether simply walking or taking the right steps to meet individual fitness goals, Pedusa Tri-Axis Pocket Pedometers are the perfect choice to track progress easily, and accurately. The Pedusa PE771 Tri-Axis Accelerometer pedometer is a highly accurate, multifunction activity monitor offering Steps, Distance, Calories Burned, Active Time, 7 Day Memory and Target Goal Setting. Also, In order to recognize actual walking activity and eliminate False Step readings, The Tri-Axis sensor has a 10 steps filter. If you move less than 10 steps and take about 5 seconds no-motion break, previous 10 or less steps will not be counted. Contents- pedometer, manual, safety leash, battery.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VKlxqkEjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008WNR5K0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B008WTWKEA", "title": "Mildot Master", "description": "The Mildot Master is an analog calculator designed along the principle of a slide rule, utilizing logarithmic and inverse logarithmic scales developed specifically for performing the following operations: Rapid and simple calculation of range to target, based on a measurement of the target with a mildot reticle, by aligning the estimated target size directly opposite the mildot measurement, and then reading the range at an index mark. Rapid and simple calculation of the amount of sight correction necessary to compensate for bullet drop and/or wind drift for a given range, enabling the shooter to determine either the equivalent telescopic sight adjustment (minute-of-angle, or MOA) or the equivalent hold-over (mils), by reading equivalents in both MOA and mils directly opposite the bullet drop/wind drift figure. Additionally, angle of fire for uphill or downhill shots can be accurately measured, and the up/down compensation can be closely calculated to reduce the errors such shots can induce.", "text": "Mildot Master The Mildot Master is an analog calculator designed along the principle of a slide rule, utilizing logarithmic and inverse logarithmic scales developed specifically for performing the following operations: Rapid and simple calculation of range to target, based on a measurement of the target with a mildot reticle, by aligning the estimated target size directly opposite the mildot measurement, and then reading the range at an index mark. Rapid and simple calculation of the amount of sight correction necessary to compensate for bullet drop and/or wind drift for a given range, enabling the shooter to determine either the equivalent telescopic sight adjustment (minute-of-angle, or MOA) or the equivalent hold-over (mils), by reading equivalents in both MOA and mils directly opposite the bullet drop/wind drift figure. Additionally, angle of fire for uphill or downhill shots can be accurately measured, and the up/down compensation can be closely calculated to reduce the errors such shots can induce.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QDBK%2BGwmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008WTWKEA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mildot Master", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Rifle Scope Accessories"]], "price": 24.8}}
{"item_id": "B008WZCZTE", "title": "Gun Storage Solutions Duelies (Pack of 2)", "description": "These pistol racks will double up gun storage without taking up the whole shelf. They work with hadgunsof almost any size, down to .22 caliber. For larger handguns, just bend the prong more upright for larger guns, closer to level for smaller ones. Can be used on a shelf or mounted to a wall with screws and washers (not included). Like all products from Gun Storage Solutions, the Duelies are made in the USA.", "text": "Gun Storage Solutions Duelies (Pack of 2) These pistol racks will double up gun storage without taking up the whole shelf. They work with hadgunsof almost any size, down to .22 caliber. For larger handguns, just bend the prong more upright for larger guns, closer to level for smaller ones. Can be used on a shelf or mounted to a wall with screws and washers (not included). Like all products from Gun Storage Solutions, the Duelies are made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xcLvPqJhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008WZCZTE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gun Storage Solutions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 14.95}}
