{"item_id": "B008X85R6S", "title": "Bullet Button AR-15 Wonder Wrench Tool - CA Compliant", "description": "The Bullet Button Wonder Wrench is a great tool and addition to any Bullet Button magazine lock. Use it to install your Bullet button, to release your fixed magazine, to tighten down the inner nut during installation, or as a tool to drop the magazine while at the range. When you travel out of California or use it on a rimfire rifle, you can screw it on a few extra turns and use it like a normal magazine release button! When you unscrew the wrench, it returns the inner nut to the original position. The red anodized finish warns you to remove the wrench to return your rifle to a CA-legal configuration. Another must have for the CA Compliant AR shooter! The Bullet Button has not yet been approved by the California DOJ.", "text": "Bullet Button AR-15 Wonder Wrench Tool - CA Compliant The Bullet Button Wonder Wrench is a great tool and addition to any Bullet Button magazine lock. Use it to install your Bullet button, to release your fixed magazine, to tighten down the inner nut during installation, or as a tool to drop the magazine while at the range. When you travel out of California or use it on a rimfire rifle, you can screw it on a few extra turns and use it like a normal magazine release button! When you unscrew the wrench, it returns the inner nut to the original position. The red anodized finish warns you to remove the wrench to return your rifle to a CA-legal configuration. Another must have for the CA Compliant AR shooter! The Bullet Button has not yet been approved by the California DOJ.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LI8QyqBbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008X85R6S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 7.47}}
