{"item_id": "B008XMJ9OA", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear AR AR-15 AR15 M16 .223 Rifle Extra Heavy Duty Steel Armorer's Wrench Combo Barrel Nut & A1 A2 Flash Suppressor Muzzle Brake Installation & Removal Multi Tool", "description": "Ultimate Arms Gear extra-heavy duty AR-15/M16 .223 armorers wrench provides easier installation and removal of barrels up to 1\" diameter with either encapsulated or peg-style barrel nuts. Handle features smooth, contoured edges for comfortable use. Includes 5?8\" and \" slots to fit receiver extensions and A1/A2 flash suppressors. Also features a convenient hole in the handle to hang up the tool when not in use. 7.75\" Long, 1\" Wide Handle, 0.4\" Thick , 14.5oz Weight . All steel construction with black paint & scratch resistance coating to minimize any part damage or marring and maximize comfort and durability .", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear AR AR-15 AR15 M16 .223 Rifle Extra Heavy Duty Steel Armorer's Wrench Combo Barrel Nut & A1 A2 Flash Suppressor Muzzle Brake Installation & Removal Multi Tool Ultimate Arms Gear extra-heavy duty AR-15/M16 .223 armorers wrench provides easier installation and removal of barrels up to 1\" diameter with either encapsulated or peg-style barrel nuts. Handle features smooth, contoured edges for comfortable use. Includes 5?8\" and \" slots to fit receiver extensions and A1/A2 flash suppressors. Also features a convenient hole in the handle to hang up the tool when not in use. 7.75\" Long, 1\" Wide Handle, 0.4\" Thick , 14.5oz Weight . All steel construction with black paint & scratch resistance coating to minimize any part damage or marring and maximize comfort and durability .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31e%2BPnYUlQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008XMJ9OA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 17.95}}
