{"item_id": "B008Y1HG5E", "title": "Springfield XDS 3.3 barrel IWB Dual Snaps Holster R/H Black - 0309", "description": "This is a custom hand made Black Holster for the Springfield XDS IWB holster. Item #0309 This holster was made for Inside the Waistband, it has belt loops 1.5\" size. This holster is made for the right hand shooter, left available as a custom order. We use 7 to 8 oz. premium leather, wet molded to fit the gun. Our recommended wearing position is 3:30 - 4:00; positioning the front of the holster with the side seam of your pants, the back of the holster towards your back pocket.", "text": "Springfield XDS 3.3 barrel IWB Dual Snaps Holster R/H Black - 0309 This is a custom hand made Black Holster for the Springfield XDS IWB holster. Item #0309 This holster was made for Inside the Waistband, it has belt loops 1.5\" size. This holster is made for the right hand shooter, left available as a custom order. We use 7 to 8 oz. premium leather, wet molded to fit the gun. Our recommended wearing position is 3:30 - 4:00; positioning the front of the holster with the side seam of your pants, the back of the holster towards your back pocket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SBtu97eWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008Y1HG5E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 55.0}}
{"item_id": "B008Y1IK9U", "title": "Talon Springfield XDS-45, XDS-9 IWB Holster", "description": "Talon Holsters are designed by professional Law Enforcement Officers who have dedicated themselves to providing citizens with firearms instruction, a place to shoot and a quality concealed carry holster. Made in the USA, our holsters offer a ton of possibilities. If a holster is not simple, comfortable, and easy to put on and take off, you probably won?t wear it. Our IWB holsters are designed in two types, the thicker guns like Glocks will have the ?Stay Open Top? with a steel cable in the top band to hold the mouth of the holster open when reholstering. The XD, Glock and a couple of others feature this. The thinner guns like 1911?s and most all small guns don?t seem to need this. The double leather top keeps the holster open and safe for single hand holstering. Cheap nylon holsters are out, they are junk. Polymer seems to wear the finish off your pistol. Complicated wrap around holsters are not our style. We keep things simple, easy and traditional. Check out demo videos on YouTube by searching for TalonHolsters or Talon Training Group. These are really nice quality and the career law enforcement officers who own the company have spent a lot of time developing them. All our holsters are made in the USA and are constructed exclusively of Hermann Oak Leather, and made from US Steers. Hermann Oak Leather Company supplies our leather and has been in business since 1881. Nothing foreign touches our holsters. Grown, tanned, constructed and delivered to and from the USA. These are vegetable tanned and dyed with a water based dye so nothing will harm the firearm. Most holsters are made from leather tanned using a chromium based process. Not ours. Designed by our instructors at Talon Training, and tried and tested to ensure you are getting the best there is, we stand behind our holsters. Our NO-Bull warranty guarantees that if you don't like it, send it back for a full refund. If it breaks, ever, we will replace it. (Routine age and wear, is normal, of course.) See", "text": "Talon Springfield XDS-45, XDS-9 IWB Holster Talon Holsters are designed by professional Law Enforcement Officers who have dedicated themselves to providing citizens with firearms instruction, a place to shoot and a quality concealed carry holster. Made in the USA, our holsters offer a ton of possibilities. If a holster is not simple, comfortable, and easy to put on and take off, you probably won?t wear it. Our IWB holsters are designed in two types, the thicker guns like Glocks will have the ?Stay Open Top? with a steel cable in the top band to hold the mouth of the holster open when reholstering. The XD, Glock and a couple of others feature this. The thinner guns like 1911?s and most all small guns don?t seem to need this. The double leather top keeps the holster open and safe for single hand holstering. Cheap nylon holsters are out, they are junk. Polymer seems to wear the finish off your pistol. Complicated wrap around holsters are not our style. We keep things simple, easy and traditional. Check out demo videos on YouTube by searching for TalonHolsters or Talon Training Group. These are really nice quality and the career law enforcement officers who own the company have spent a lot of time developing them. All our holsters are made in the USA and are constructed exclusively of Hermann Oak Leather, and made from US Steers. Hermann Oak Leather Company supplies our leather and has been in business since 1881. Nothing foreign touches our holsters. Grown, tanned, constructed and delivered to and from the USA. These are vegetable tanned and dyed with a water based dye so nothing will harm the firearm. Most holsters are made from leather tanned using a chromium based process. Not ours. Designed by our instructors at Talon Training, and tried and tested to ensure you are getting the best there is, we stand behind our holsters. Our NO-Bull warranty guarantees that if you don't like it, send it back for a full refund. If it breaks, ever, we will replace it. (Routine age and wear, is normal, of course.) See", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A7a8cFiVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008Y1IK9U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B008Y1LGOQ", "title": "Springfield XDS 3.3 barrel OWB Shield Holster R/H Black - 0310", "description": "This is a custom hand made Black Holster for the Springfield XDS OWB w/shield holster. Item #0310 This holster was made for Outside the Waistband, it has 1.5\" belt slots. This holster is made for the right hand shooter, left available as a custom order. We use 7 to 8 oz. premium leather, wet molded to fit the gun. Our recommended wearing position is 3:30 - 4:00; positioning the front of the holster with the side seam of your pants, the back of the holster towards your back pocket.", "text": "Springfield XDS 3.3 barrel OWB Shield Holster R/H Black - 0310 This is a custom hand made Black Holster for the Springfield XDS OWB w/shield holster. Item #0310 This holster was made for Outside the Waistband, it has 1.5\" belt slots. This holster is made for the right hand shooter, left available as a custom order. We use 7 to 8 oz. premium leather, wet molded to fit the gun. Our recommended wearing position is 3:30 - 4:00; positioning the front of the holster with the side seam of your pants, the back of the holster towards your back pocket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LK9uJvtrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008Y1LGOQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B008Y2TXFY", "title": "UNIVERSAL TACTICAL PISTOL SCOPE MOUNT WEAVER & PICATINNY RAIL SIGHT LASER LIGHT", "description": "This Universal pistol mount will fit any pistol with picatinny/weaver rail under the frame in front of the trigger guard. Perfect for adding pistol scope or red dot sight on the top rail, flashlight on the bottom rail under the barrel, and laser sight on the side rail. Total height: 2.95 inches Total length: 5.1 inches Top rail length: 4.13 inches Top rail width: 7/8 wide Bottom rail length: 1.38 inches Bottom rail width: 7/8 wide Side rail length: 1.5 inches Side rail width: 7/8 inches This mount enable you to still use your iron sights. You can easily mount most tactical accessories with this mount. All hardware Included! 5.1\" long with 10 Weaver/Picatinny Slots on Top, 3 slots on the bottom, and 1 slots on the side.", "text": "UNIVERSAL TACTICAL PISTOL SCOPE MOUNT WEAVER & PICATINNY RAIL SIGHT LASER LIGHT This Universal pistol mount will fit any pistol with picatinny/weaver rail under the frame in front of the trigger guard. Perfect for adding pistol scope or red dot sight on the top rail, flashlight on the bottom rail under the barrel, and laser sight on the side rail. Total height: 2.95 inches Total length: 5.1 inches Top rail length: 4.13 inches Top rail width: 7/8 wide Bottom rail length: 1.38 inches Bottom rail width: 7/8 wide Side rail length: 1.5 inches Side rail width: 7/8 inches This mount enable you to still use your iron sights. You can easily mount most tactical accessories with this mount. All hardware Included! 5.1\" long with 10 Weaver/Picatinny Slots on Top, 3 slots on the bottom, and 1 slots on the side.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YRPIT4C6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008Y2TXFY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 14.93}}
{"item_id": "B008Y3LW4S", "title": "Original Unissued Russian Mosin Nagant Surplus Cleaning Kit For M38 M44 91/30 1891 91 30 Rifle / Carbine & All Models", "description": "All items are original surplus that were unused and unissued. Mosin Nagant Cleaning kit consists of 1 screwdriver/firing pin protrusion gauge, 1 cleaning rod head, 1 muzzle crown protector, 1 rod cleaning jag, 1 rod handle/punch, and 1 carrying pouch. Each kit is packed in a Cortec heat sealed package to prevent rust/oxidation.", "text": "Original Unissued Russian Mosin Nagant Surplus Cleaning Kit For M38 M44 91/30 1891 91 30 Rifle / Carbine & All Models All items are original surplus that were unused and unissued. Mosin Nagant Cleaning kit consists of 1 screwdriver/firing pin protrusion gauge, 1 cleaning rod head, 1 muzzle crown protector, 1 rod cleaning jag, 1 rod handle/punch, and 1 carrying pouch. Each kit is packed in a Cortec heat sealed package to prevent rust/oxidation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uPmHYWFOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008Y3LW4S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mosin Nagant", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B008Y40P9A", "title": "Tagua 1911 3 Inch Inside the Pant Holster, Brown, Right Hand", "description": "The Tagua 1911 3 Inch Inside The Part Holster is designed to be worn inside the waistband. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. Combat grip. Clip on design. Open muzzle.", "text": "Tagua 1911 3 Inch Inside the Pant Holster, Brown, Right Hand The Tagua 1911 3 Inch Inside The Part Holster is designed to be worn inside the waistband. Reinforced saddle leather construction retains its shape when the handgun is removed. Combat grip. Clip on design. Open muzzle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O5dwdr7iL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008Y40P9A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tagua", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.25}}
{"item_id": "B008Y5GO58", "title": "Liberty Mountain Aluminium Guyline Adjuster, Pack of 10", "description": "Use these to adjust the tent guy lines for a secure night's rest. 3 hole design provides a firm grip on the line and easy use. Will adjust the line to any length. Each style contains 10 Guy Line Adjusters.", "text": "Liberty Mountain Aluminium Guyline Adjuster, Pack of 10 Use these to adjust the tent guy lines for a secure night's rest. 3 hole design provides a firm grip on the line and easy use. Will adjust the line to any length. Each style contains 10 Guy Line Adjusters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Did8Avb4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008Y5GO58.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 9.74}}
{"item_id": "B008Y5H6WI", "title": "The Learning Journey Techno Gears Marble Mania MineShaft 2.0", "description": "Young architects will have great fun designing and building their own mining operation with the Techno Gears Marble Mania Mine Shaft. With over 400 pieces, the Mine Shaft will come to life running its bucket and chain system to move the marbles through the twisting and turning mine chutes and shaft, bringing the marbles down to the waiting mining cart ready to take them back to the buckets for another ride. Cool \"mining\" sounds and flashing lights add to the fun. Colors may vary. Requires one \"AA\" battery (not included) and five button cell batteries (included). Ages 8+ years.", "text": "The Learning Journey Techno Gears Marble Mania MineShaft 2.0 Young architects will have great fun designing and building their own mining operation with the Techno Gears Marble Mania Mine Shaft. With over 400 pieces, the Mine Shaft will come to life running its bucket and chain system to move the marbles through the twisting and turning mine chutes and shaft, bringing the marbles down to the waiting mining cart ready to take them back to the buckets for another ride. Cool \"mining\" sounds and flashing lights add to the fun. Colors may vary. Requires one \"AA\" battery (not included) and five button cell batteries (included). Ages 8+ years.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61POsrf262L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008Y5H6WI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "The Learning Journey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Dartboards"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B008Y8F4KQ", "title": "SODIAL- 2PCS Green LED Flash Tyre Wheel Valve Cap Light for Car Bike bicycle Motorbicycle Wheel Light Tire Light", "description": "Single Color Wheel Light, Easy to setMore energy-efficient,with light & motion sensorsDurable, High Impact, Rust Resistant,Auto shining No switch, 100% waterproofInclude:2*Green LED Flash lightPls Note: don't use in freeway!This LED Bike Wheel Light fits most bicycles, motorcycles and cars.LED Bike Wheel Light features motion sensors, LEDs and replaceable batteries. LED lights will turn on when the vehicle is moving and off when the vehicle comes to a stop.Screws onto the valve stem of your car, bicycle or motorcycle in seconds.Enhances safety by increasing visibility at night and during bad weather conditions.Easy to install and remove.Cap Color: Silver. Light Color: Neon Green.Batteries: 6 x AG10 batteries, 3 batteries per light (batteries not included).Package Includes: 2 x LED Bike Wheel Lights; 2 x Valve Covers.", "text": "SODIAL- 2PCS Green LED Flash Tyre Wheel Valve Cap Light for Car Bike bicycle Motorbicycle Wheel Light Tire Light Single Color Wheel Light, Easy to setMore energy-efficient,with light & motion sensorsDurable, High Impact, Rust Resistant,Auto shining No switch, 100% waterproofInclude:2*Green LED Flash lightPls Note: don't use in freeway!This LED Bike Wheel Light fits most bicycles, motorcycles and cars.LED Bike Wheel Light features motion sensors, LEDs and replaceable batteries. LED lights will turn on when the vehicle is moving and off when the vehicle comes to a stop.Screws onto the valve stem of your car, bicycle or motorcycle in seconds.Enhances safety by increasing visibility at night and during bad weather conditions.Easy to install and remove.Cap Color: Silver. Light Color: Neon Green.Batteries: 6 x AG10 batteries, 3 batteries per light (batteries not included).Package Includes: 2 x LED Bike Wheel Lights; 2 x Valve Covers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415KdmkX%2BeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008Y8F4KQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SODIAL(TM)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 2.1}}
{"item_id": "B008Y8O862", "title": "3 Loop Bands Set for Exercise (Light, Medium, Heavy) by Zensufu (tm)", "description": "Set of three 10\"x2\" premium latex loop bands. Set includes: 1 Low strength green band, 1 Medium strength yellow band, 1 Heavy strength red band. Allergy warning: Bands contain Natural Rubber Latex (NRL). Do not use if allergic to latex. Zensufu (tm) is a registered trademark and protected by copyright and trademark laws under U.S. and international law. All rights reserved.", "text": "3 Loop Bands Set for Exercise (Light, Medium, Heavy) by Zensufu (tm) Set of three 10\"x2\" premium latex loop bands. Set includes: 1 Low strength green band, 1 Medium strength yellow band, 1 Heavy strength red band. Allergy warning: Bands contain Natural Rubber Latex (NRL). Do not use if allergic to latex. Zensufu (tm) is a registered trademark and protected by copyright and trademark laws under U.S. and international law. All rights reserved.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IVeL%2BTN6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008Y8O862.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 12.99}}
