{"item_id": "B008YEROMG", "title": "Tagua Gunleather Right Handed S&W SHIELD Inside Pants Gun Holster", "description": "This holster is designed to be worn inside the waistband. The reinforced saddle leather construction allow the holster to retain its shape when the handgun is removed. It features a combat grip, a clip on design and an open muzzle design.", "text": "Tagua Gunleather Right Handed S&W SHIELD Inside Pants Gun Holster This holster is designed to be worn inside the waistband. The reinforced saddle leather construction allow the holster to retain its shape when the handgun is removed. It features a combat grip, a clip on design and an open muzzle design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BtQwM74lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008YEROMG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tagua Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 29.99}}
