{"item_id": "B008YV3L9E", "title": "FlipBelt - World's Best Running Belt & Fitness Workout Belt", "description": "The FlipBelt is a really simple but revolutionary product to go hands free. Made of machine-washable high tech Spandex-Lycra blend material with an internal pocket system accessible from four openings around the belts exterior. The four pockets lets you easily tuck in your phone, keys, gel packs, credit cards or whatever you may need for your workout. You then flip the belt inside out and everything gets locked in place. Because there are no clasps or buttons, you simply pull the belt on like a pair of pants and wear it wherever it feels most comfortable. It doesn't move, jiggle, bounce or chafe and you could easily forget it's even there. A simple, elegant and fashionable solution to a problem for all active types, gym rats, runners, hikers, bikers, and travelers. Weighing a mere 3 ounces, the FlipBelt is so sleek you can even wear it to go out under your clothes without having to carry a wallet or purse.", "text": "FlipBelt - World's Best Running Belt & Fitness Workout Belt The FlipBelt is a really simple but revolutionary product to go hands free. Made of machine-washable high tech Spandex-Lycra blend material with an internal pocket system accessible from four openings around the belts exterior. The four pockets lets you easily tuck in your phone, keys, gel packs, credit cards or whatever you may need for your workout. You then flip the belt inside out and everything gets locked in place. Because there are no clasps or buttons, you simply pull the belt on like a pair of pants and wear it wherever it feels most comfortable. It doesn't move, jiggle, bounce or chafe and you could easily forget it's even there. A simple, elegant and fashionable solution to a problem for all active types, gym rats, runners, hikers, bikers, and travelers. Weighing a mere 3 ounces, the FlipBelt is so sleek you can even wear it to go out under your clothes without having to carry a wallet or purse.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rNWcNmcSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008YV3L9E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Waist Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B008Z593YG", "title": "Tactical Precision Machined Aluminum QD Weaver Picatinny 45 Degree Front And Rear Combo Set Flip Up Rapid Backup AR15 AR-15 M16 M4 M-4 Flattop A1 A2 Post Back Up Iron Sight Mount Fits Any Weaver / Picatinny Rail System", "description": "Brand New, Tactical Precision Machined Aluminum QD Weaver Picatinny 45 Degree Front And Rear Combo Set Flip Up Rapid Backup AR15 AR-15 M16 M4 M-4 Flattop A1 A2 Post Back Up Iron Sight Mount Fits Any Weaver / Picatinny Rail System. Military quality 45 Degree Flip-Up Front and Rear Sight Towers Complete with A2 Square Post Assembly with Locking Retention and Precision Elevation Adjustments for Greater Accuracy. Mounting Decks Designed to be Used with Handguard Rails and Both Will Fit All 7/8\" Picatinny / Weaver Style Rails. Locking Retention For Maintaning Zero Under Heavy Conditions. Locking Retention For Maintaning Zero Under Heavy Conditions. Easy And Quick Installation. 6061 Aircraft Aluminum and T6 Heat treated Aluminum Body.", "text": "Tactical Precision Machined Aluminum QD Weaver Picatinny 45 Degree Front And Rear Combo Set Flip Up Rapid Backup AR15 AR-15 M16 M4 M-4 Flattop A1 A2 Post Back Up Iron Sight Mount Fits Any Weaver / Picatinny Rail System Brand New, Tactical Precision Machined Aluminum QD Weaver Picatinny 45 Degree Front And Rear Combo Set Flip Up Rapid Backup AR15 AR-15 M16 M4 M-4 Flattop A1 A2 Post Back Up Iron Sight Mount Fits Any Weaver / Picatinny Rail System. Military quality 45 Degree Flip-Up Front and Rear Sight Towers Complete with A2 Square Post Assembly with Locking Retention and Precision Elevation Adjustments for Greater Accuracy. Mounting Decks Designed to be Used with Handguard Rails and Both Will Fit All 7/8\" Picatinny / Weaver Style Rails. Locking Retention For Maintaning Zero Under Heavy Conditions. Locking Retention For Maintaning Zero Under Heavy Conditions. Easy And Quick Installation. 6061 Aircraft Aluminum and T6 Heat treated Aluminum Body.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31H81QH7wKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008Z593YG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 24.52}}
