{"item_id": "B008ZQ05P6", "title": "Charging Handle - Laser Engraved - Zombie Outbreak Response Team", "description": "Mil-Spec Charging handle manufactured from Aircraft grade aluminum and then Type 3 hardcoat anodized. Permanently Laser engraved. The latch and spring are already installed. This Item is ready to be used in your AR style rifle and will provide a unique custom look to you rifle.", "text": "Charging Handle - Laser Engraved - Zombie Outbreak Response Team Mil-Spec Charging handle manufactured from Aircraft grade aluminum and then Type 3 hardcoat anodized. Permanently Laser engraved. The latch and spring are already installed. This Item is ready to be used in your AR style rifle and will provide a unique custom look to you rifle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FKXYYZe3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008ZQ05P6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 39.95}}
