{"item_id": "B008ZTLR3C", "title": "SKS S-Blade Road Bicycle Fenders", "description": "The S-BLADE is the little brother of our top-selling X-TRA-DRY for the ambitious racing cyclist. With our quick release mounting, the S-BLADE can be fitted on virtually any racing bike and the angle setting optimally adjusted.", "text": "SKS S-Blade Road Bicycle Fenders The S-BLADE is the little brother of our top-selling X-TRA-DRY for the ambitious racing cyclist. With our quick release mounting, the S-BLADE can be fitted on virtually any racing bike and the angle setting optimally adjusted.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qNBLq9JQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008ZTLR3C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS-Germany", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Fenders"]], "price": 17.09}}
{"item_id": "B008ZTLSJA", "title": "NiteRider Solas Tail Light", "description": "The NiteRider New design,2 Watt Solas Taillight! USB Rechargeable!:The Solas 2 Watt Tail Light is brand new for 2012/13 and features a powerful 2 watt LED, 4 modes (2 flash/2 steady) and is USB rechargeable. We've implemented what we call \"Group Ride Mode\" for cyclists who need to still want to stay visible and safer but not annoy others in the pack.Product Features:2 Watt LED4 Light Levels 2 Flash Modes And 2 Stedy ModesUSB RechargeableRun Time:18:00 HRS 1st Flash 7:00 HRS 2nd Flash 4:30 HRS High Steady 36:00 HRS Low Steady", "text": "NiteRider Solas Tail Light The NiteRider New design,2 Watt Solas Taillight! USB Rechargeable!:The Solas 2 Watt Tail Light is brand new for 2012/13 and features a powerful 2 watt LED, 4 modes (2 flash/2 steady) and is USB rechargeable. We've implemented what we call \"Group Ride Mode\" for cyclists who need to still want to stay visible and safer but not annoy others in the pack.Product Features:2 Watt LED4 Light Levels 2 Flash Modes And 2 Stedy ModesUSB RechargeableRun Time:18:00 HRS 1st Flash 7:00 HRS 2nd Flash 4:30 HRS High Steady 36:00 HRS Low Steady", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-xwbRuhEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008ZTLSJA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NiteRider", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B008ZTLX7C", "title": "Lizard Skins DSP 3.2mm Bar Tape", "description": "Over the years, Lizard Skins has continually met the demands for something a little bit thicker. First it was with the 2. 5mm bar tape and now it's the DSP 3. 2mm Bar Tape. If you're like us, and you need to cushion the pain of cobbled streets and country roads, wrap your bars with a Roubaix-tested tape like the DSP 3. 2mm. We understand if you're concerned that 3. 2mm of padding may put too much squish under your hands. We, and Vacansoleil-DCM, can assure you that it doesn't. Instead of creating a foam-like volume, Lizard Skins opted to add density. This gives your bars the feeling of comfort and normalcy -- not bulk. And believe us, while we love the high-volume, shellacked look of cork tape just as much as you, the durability and vibration-absorption make the DSP 3. 2mm our obvious choice between the two. In addition to more density, the DSP 3. 2mm tape has been given a textured surface. The cross-crossed pattern resembles the tread of an all-weather road tire, and it provides a similar effect. Whether you're riding with or without gloves, or in wet or hot weather, your hands have more traction on the shoulders and drops with DSP 3. 2mm. Each roll of tape is 82 inches long. So, you'll be able to wrap your bars thick without having to over pull and stretch the tape. In fact, Lizard Skins is keen to caution you against doing just that. When applying, be firm in pressing the tape into place, spacing it evenly. And unless you want to decrease the durability for some odd reason, don't pull it too tightly in the wrap. The Lizard Skins DSP 3. 2mm Bar Tape is available in the colors Black, Blue, Grey, Red, and White. Each package includes two rolls of tape, two bar-end plugs, and two finishing strips.", "text": "Lizard Skins DSP 3.2mm Bar Tape Over the years, Lizard Skins has continually met the demands for something a little bit thicker. First it was with the 2. 5mm bar tape and now it's the DSP 3. 2mm Bar Tape. If you're like us, and you need to cushion the pain of cobbled streets and country roads, wrap your bars with a Roubaix-tested tape like the DSP 3. 2mm. We understand if you're concerned that 3. 2mm of padding may put too much squish under your hands. We, and Vacansoleil-DCM, can assure you that it doesn't. Instead of creating a foam-like volume, Lizard Skins opted to add density. This gives your bars the feeling of comfort and normalcy -- not bulk. And believe us, while we love the high-volume, shellacked look of cork tape just as much as you, the durability and vibration-absorption make the DSP 3. 2mm our obvious choice between the two. In addition to more density, the DSP 3. 2mm tape has been given a textured surface. The cross-crossed pattern resembles the tread of an all-weather road tire, and it provides a similar effect. Whether you're riding with or without gloves, or in wet or hot weather, your hands have more traction on the shoulders and drops with DSP 3. 2mm. Each roll of tape is 82 inches long. So, you'll be able to wrap your bars thick without having to over pull and stretch the tape. In fact, Lizard Skins is keen to caution you against doing just that. When applying, be firm in pressing the tape into place, spacing it evenly. And unless you want to decrease the durability for some odd reason, don't pull it too tightly in the wrap. The Lizard Skins DSP 3. 2mm Bar Tape is available in the colors Black, Blue, Grey, Red, and White. Each package includes two rolls of tape, two bar-end plugs, and two finishing strips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51d2%2B1qWjRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008ZTLX7C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lizard Skins", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebar Tape"]], "price": 37.8}}
{"item_id": "B008ZV5ZV0", "title": "Waterproof LED Bike Bicycle Head Light+Rear Flashlight", "description": "Bike Head Light Head Light Size ( about ):10 x 6.5 x 3.3 cm The Bicycle headlight adopt latest light-focusing technology Triple brightness than similar products Water proof Releasable bracket Multi-function, guiding your way in the darkness Multi-functional of the 5 Led bicycle headlight: bike light, torch, diving ( up to 20m/66ft )etc Long lasting: up to 150 hours With 4 X AAA 1.5V batteries ( Battery NOT included ) 2 operation mode: Continuous or Flash, change mode by pressing the button on the top Rear Safety Flashlight Rear Light Size ( about ):7.0 x 4.0 x 3.0 cm 5 super bright red LEDs, wide beam Visible range up to 800m / 2500 ft Waterproof Adjustable inclination with elastic head strap Water, oil and shock resistant Universal Quick release bracket for front or rear use IC controlled steady on and 7 different flashing modes Long lasting: Up to 150 hours operation with 2 x \"AAA\" batteries (not included) Suitable for any bicycle to give alert in bad weather Suitable for bicycle, jogging, climbing, baby trolley/stroller, wheelchair Package Content: 1 x Bike Head Light 1 x Rear Safety Flashlight", "text": "Waterproof LED Bike Bicycle Head Light+Rear Flashlight Bike Head Light Head Light Size ( about ):10 x 6.5 x 3.3 cm The Bicycle headlight adopt latest light-focusing technology Triple brightness than similar products Water proof Releasable bracket Multi-function, guiding your way in the darkness Multi-functional of the 5 Led bicycle headlight: bike light, torch, diving ( up to 20m/66ft )etc Long lasting: up to 150 hours With 4 X AAA 1.5V batteries ( Battery NOT included ) 2 operation mode: Continuous or Flash, change mode by pressing the button on the top Rear Safety Flashlight Rear Light Size ( about ):7.0 x 4.0 x 3.0 cm 5 super bright red LEDs, wide beam Visible range up to 800m / 2500 ft Waterproof Adjustable inclination with elastic head strap Water, oil and shock resistant Universal Quick release bracket for front or rear use IC controlled steady on and 7 different flashing modes Long lasting: Up to 150 hours operation with 2 x \"AAA\" batteries (not included) Suitable for any bicycle to give alert in bad weather Suitable for bicycle, jogging, climbing, baby trolley/stroller, wheelchair Package Content: 1 x Bike Head Light 1 x Rear Safety Flashlight", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HrbjGr8EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008ZV5ZV0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SODIAL(TM)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 4.58}}
{"item_id": "B008ZXOAN2", "title": "KLOUD City ® 190T Nylon Waterproof Bike/ Bicycle Cover (Size: L)", "description": "Kloud also sell bike covers with other sizes and colors.", "text": "KLOUD City ® 190T Nylon Waterproof Bike/ Bicycle Cover (Size: L) Kloud also sell bike covers with other sizes and colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w-xvCE6JL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B008ZXOAN2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KLOUD City", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Covers"]], "price": 10.9}}
{"item_id": "B00904UBI8", "title": "Camelbak Products Kid's Eddy Water Bottle", "description": "Kid sized bottles for Big adventures and easy for parents to clean.", "text": "Camelbak Products Kid's Eddy Water Bottle Kid sized bottles for Big adventures and easy for parents to clean.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oonHeLccL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00904UBI8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 11.62}}
{"item_id": "B009062MJC", "title": "Petzl Tikka 2 LED Headlamp", "description": "TIKKA 4 LED headlamp, three lighting modes (two continuous and one strobe) The TIKKA offers great versatility with its three lighting modes (maximum, economic and flashing) which are accessed by a simple electronic push-button switch. In maximum mode, the four LEDs deliver 40 lumens of light and provide enough light to see over a distance of 29 meters. The economic mode optimizes battery life and therefore provides a long burn-time of up to 120 hours. The battery compartment is now hinged for easier access along with an easier to use closure system.", "text": "Petzl Tikka 2 LED Headlamp TIKKA 4 LED headlamp, three lighting modes (two continuous and one strobe) The TIKKA offers great versatility with its three lighting modes (maximum, economic and flashing) which are accessed by a simple electronic push-button switch. In maximum mode, the four LEDs deliver 40 lumens of light and provide enough light to see over a distance of 29 meters. The economic mode optimizes battery life and therefore provides a long burn-time of up to 120 hours. The battery compartment is now hinged for easier access along with an easier to use closure system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JglKmSaZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009062MJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Petzl", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B009064MHW", "title": "Petzl Tikka Improved Lumen Output Plus 2 Headlamp", "description": "TIKKA PLUS Headlamp with 1 high-output LED, 1 red LED and five lighting modes (three continuous and two strobe)The TIKKA PLUS headlamp integrates two light sources for versatility: one white, high-output LED and one red LED. The white LED delivers 50 lumens in maximum mode and lights up to 35 meters. In economic mode, it can reach a burn-time of 140 hours. The red LED provides spare lighting to preserve night vision or to become a strobe light for increased safety, for example in an urban environment, etc. The TIKKA PLUS can be used with lithium batteries to decrease weight or increase performance in cold weather.", "text": "Petzl Tikka Improved Lumen Output Plus 2 Headlamp TIKKA PLUS Headlamp with 1 high-output LED, 1 red LED and five lighting modes (three continuous and two strobe)The TIKKA PLUS headlamp integrates two light sources for versatility: one white, high-output LED and one red LED. The white LED delivers 50 lumens in maximum mode and lights up to 35 meters. In economic mode, it can reach a burn-time of 140 hours. The red LED provides spare lighting to preserve night vision or to become a strobe light for increased safety, for example in an urban environment, etc. The TIKKA PLUS can be used with lithium batteries to decrease weight or increase performance in cold weather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GPrELpz0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009064MHW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Petzl", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 31.96}}
{"item_id": "B0090BG6AI", "title": "AR-15 Stripper Clip Guides (5 Count)", "description": "These are 5 new 5.56/ .223 stripper clip guides. They are made of galvanized steel. These are not surplus Colt guides. They are newly manufactured facsimiles. Packaging is economy. No shipments to D.C.", "text": "AR-15 Stripper Clip Guides (5 Count) These are 5 new 5.56/ .223 stripper clip guides. They are made of galvanized steel. These are not surplus Colt guides. They are newly manufactured facsimiles. Packaging is economy. No shipments to D.C.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sWbnSk6iL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090BG6AI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0090BRD4Q", "title": "AR-15 Stripper Clip Guides (10 Count)", "description": "These are 10 new 5.56/ .223 stripper clip guides. They are made of galvanized steel. These are not surplus Colt guides. They are newly manufactured facsimiles. Packaging is economy. No shipments to D.C.", "text": "AR-15 Stripper Clip Guides (10 Count) These are 10 new 5.56/ .223 stripper clip guides. They are made of galvanized steel. These are not surplus Colt guides. They are newly manufactured facsimiles. Packaging is economy. No shipments to D.C.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SEfW2FwYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090BRD4Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0090OEBHK", "title": "Halo-V Velcro adjustable Closure Headband", "description": "The Halo V - Velcro adjustable headband is very similar to the original Halo Headband except with a Velcro closure. The Velcro closure allows the user to custom fit the headband to their preference. The Halo V – Velcro also comes with Halo’s patented SweatBlock Seal which evaporates, wicks and channels sweat away from your face during your activity.", "text": "Halo-V Velcro adjustable Closure Headband The Halo V - Velcro adjustable headband is very similar to the original Halo Headband except with a Velcro closure. The Velcro closure allows the user to custom fit the headband to their preference. The Halo V – Velcro also comes with Halo’s patented SweatBlock Seal which evaporates, wicks and channels sweat away from your face during your activity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21TzkavJrTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090OEBHK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Halo Headbands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Headbands"]], "price": 7.25}}
{"item_id": "B0090OKG38", "title": "Marcy Foldable Excercise Bike", "description": "Looking for an easy way to shed unwanted pounds and increase cardiovascular endurance, without sacrificing precious floor space? The NS-652 is the answer. Benefit from the same type of exercise features offered on larger and more expensive exercise bikes at a fraction of the cost.", "text": "Marcy Foldable Excercise Bike Looking for an easy way to shed unwanted pounds and increase cardiovascular endurance, without sacrificing precious floor space? The NS-652 is the answer. Benefit from the same type of exercise features offered on larger and more expensive exercise bikes at a fraction of the cost.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bSk6aXTDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090OKG38.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marcy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 135.85}}
{"item_id": "B0090PYHZU", "title": "Fallkniven DC3 Whetstone Diamond Ceramic Knife Sharpener", "description": "Fallkniven Combination Whetstone. One side is diamond the other ceramic. Measures 3\" x 1\". Comes in leather slip pouch.", "text": "Fallkniven DC3 Whetstone Diamond Ceramic Knife Sharpener Fallkniven Combination Whetstone. One side is diamond the other ceramic. Measures 3\" x 1\". Comes in leather slip pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kI3QztDPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090PYHZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fallkniven", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 18.4}}
{"item_id": "B0090Q5CTY", "title": "Cygolite Expilion 700 Lumen USB Rechargeable Bicycle Headlight, Black, One Size", "description": "The Expilion 700 sets the highest standard for one-piece lighting systems with class leading 700 lumens from a top-of-the-line Cree LED for flawless illumination on the road and trail. With helmet and handlebar mounting options included, avid riders get a light fit for both worlds. For trail rides, the convenient quick release battery stick can be swapped on the fly when your ride goes longer, ensuring you never get left in the dark. Road rides benefit from Cygolite new 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination that alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path. Convenient USB charging, run time flexibility with swappable batteries and super bright illumination on the road or trail make the Expilion 700 the choice for any avid rider that needs an all around light.", "text": "Cygolite Expilion 700 Lumen USB Rechargeable Bicycle Headlight, Black, One Size The Expilion 700 sets the highest standard for one-piece lighting systems with class leading 700 lumens from a top-of-the-line Cree LED for flawless illumination on the road and trail. With helmet and handlebar mounting options included, avid riders get a light fit for both worlds. For trail rides, the convenient quick release battery stick can be swapped on the fly when your ride goes longer, ensuring you never get left in the dark. Road rides benefit from Cygolite new 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination that alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path. Convenient USB charging, run time flexibility with swappable batteries and super bright illumination on the road or trail make the Expilion 700 the choice for any avid rider that needs an all around light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H6MKRi89L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090Q5CTY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cygo Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 109.99}}
{"item_id": "B0090QJAC4", "title": "Halo Headbands Super Wide Cycling Headband", "description": "All Halo Products offer Sweat Block technology and fits great under helmets. Every Halo Headband included our soft and comfortable Sweat Block water-tight seal that redirects sweat away from your face. All Halo Products are made with High Performance DRYLINE Visa Endurance Fabric. The Dry line Fabric absorbs, evaporates and wicks sweat away quickly while channeling the sweat away from your eyes.", "text": "Halo Headbands Super Wide Cycling Headband All Halo Products offer Sweat Block technology and fits great under helmets. Every Halo Headband included our soft and comfortable Sweat Block water-tight seal that redirects sweat away from your face. All Halo Products are made with High Performance DRYLINE Visa Endurance Fabric. The Dry line Fabric absorbs, evaporates and wicks sweat away quickly while channeling the sweat away from your eyes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BwcNIZw%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090QJAC4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Halo Headbands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Headbands"]], "price": 12.31}}
{"item_id": "B0090R4WBC", "title": "Fallkniven Knives DC4 Diamond Ceramic Whetstone Knife Sharpener", "description": "DC4 Diamond Ceramic Whetstone 32 x 100 mm Knife Sharpener DC4 whetstones consist of a fine diamond stone (25 micron) and a very special ceramic stone, made of synthetic sapphires The advantage of these materials, although they get worn, will still keep their flat shape this is important when you sharpen your knife And, since these materials are the hardest we know of, they will sharpen any steel, even these extremely hard powder steels You don't need any lubrication for these stone but now and then you should consider cleaning them with warm water and liquid soap The stones might feel coarse from the start but will become smoother/better after some use Leather pouch is included How to use your DC whetstone: If your knife is dull, we advise you to start with the diamond stone After restoring the edge to original shape, de-burr the edge lightly with the ceramic stone in order to get a razor-sharp edge. Use no oil or water. Start by laying the blade flat on the stone, raise the blade spine approx. the thickness of the blade, and start moving the knife in circular motions The ink trick: Color the edge with a felt-tip pen You can check your progress in sharpening the knife by observing where the color is removed How to check the sharpness: To check the sharpness of your knife, pull the edge very lightly on your finger nail If it cuts, the knife is certainly sharp enough for most tasks. Break-in-period: Upon delivery, your new DC whetstone will appear very coarse This coarseness will disappear when the tool is put to use", "text": "Fallkniven Knives DC4 Diamond Ceramic Whetstone Knife Sharpener DC4 Diamond Ceramic Whetstone 32 x 100 mm Knife Sharpener DC4 whetstones consist of a fine diamond stone (25 micron) and a very special ceramic stone, made of synthetic sapphires The advantage of these materials, although they get worn, will still keep their flat shape this is important when you sharpen your knife And, since these materials are the hardest we know of, they will sharpen any steel, even these extremely hard powder steels You don't need any lubrication for these stone but now and then you should consider cleaning them with warm water and liquid soap The stones might feel coarse from the start but will become smoother/better after some use Leather pouch is included How to use your DC whetstone: If your knife is dull, we advise you to start with the diamond stone After restoring the edge to original shape, de-burr the edge lightly with the ceramic stone in order to get a razor-sharp edge. Use no oil or water. Start by laying the blade flat on the stone, raise the blade spine approx. the thickness of the blade, and start moving the knife in circular motions The ink trick: Color the edge with a felt-tip pen You can check your progress in sharpening the knife by observing where the color is removed How to check the sharpness: To check the sharpness of your knife, pull the edge very lightly on your finger nail If it cuts, the knife is certainly sharp enough for most tasks. Break-in-period: Upon delivery, your new DC whetstone will appear very coarse This coarseness will disappear when the tool is put to use", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515QG74F7LL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090R4WBC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fallkniven Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B0090UGFIW", "title": "Bundle Monster 5pc Stretch Sport UV Protection Sleeve Sets Covers Arm Golf, etc", "description": "", "text": "Bundle Monster 5pc Stretch Sport UV Protection Sleeve Sets Covers Arm Golf, etc", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419j7deXsUL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090UGFIW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Armwarmers"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B0090UWNH4", "title": "Columbia River Cruiser Folding Knife Black", "description": "Columbia River Desert Cruiser Folding Knife is a tactical, custom-built work tool. Swift. Silent. Razor-sharp! Knife guru Jim Hammond created this highly tactical Cruiser Folding Knife for utility, work and sport. It's just begging to travel in your pocket or pack. Details: Handle has a forward slanted friction-grooved thumb ramp and deep finger choil for a \"fencer's grip\"; Friction-grooved flipper for swift opening; InterFrame build with 420J2 stainless steel liners, one locking; Injection-molded Black textured Zytel scales are contoured to fit the hand perfectly; Secure long handle; 3 3/4\"l. tough 8CR14MoV stainless steel clip-point blade, 55-57 HRC; Dual thumb studs; Teflon blade bearings at the pivot for smooth, 1-hand opening; Paddle style, stainless pocket clip can be attached in 4 positions; 2 clips and 3 extra screws included.; 5 1/4\"l. closed, 6 ozs.; Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Cutlery. Cutlery cannot be shipped to Marin, Napa, Ventura and Yolo counties, CA; CO; D.C.; MA; Miami-Dade and Sarasota counties, FL; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Cutlery. Columbia River Cruiser Folding Knife, Black", "text": "Columbia River Cruiser Folding Knife Black Columbia River Desert Cruiser Folding Knife is a tactical, custom-built work tool. Swift. Silent. Razor-sharp! Knife guru Jim Hammond created this highly tactical Cruiser Folding Knife for utility, work and sport. It's just begging to travel in your pocket or pack. Details: Handle has a forward slanted friction-grooved thumb ramp and deep finger choil for a \"fencer's grip\"; Friction-grooved flipper for swift opening; InterFrame build with 420J2 stainless steel liners, one locking; Injection-molded Black textured Zytel scales are contoured to fit the hand perfectly; Secure long handle; 3 3/4\"l. tough 8CR14MoV stainless steel clip-point blade, 55-57 HRC; Dual thumb studs; Teflon blade bearings at the pivot for smooth, 1-hand opening; Paddle style, stainless pocket clip can be attached in 4 positions; 2 clips and 3 extra screws included.; 5 1/4\"l. closed, 6 ozs.; Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Cutlery. Cutlery cannot be shipped to Marin, Napa, Ventura and Yolo counties, CA; CO; D.C.; MA; Miami-Dade and Sarasota counties, FL; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Cutlery. Columbia River Cruiser Folding Knife, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51URIbYUjEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090UWNH4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.05}}
{"item_id": "B0090UWVCG", "title": "Carry All Folding Knife Belt Sheath Black nylon construction with velcro closure", "description": "Carry All Folding Knife Belt Sheath. Black nylon construction with velcro closure. Fits folding knife up to 4 1/2\" closed. Can be worn on belt in horizontal or vertical position. Hang packaged.", "text": "Carry All Folding Knife Belt Sheath Black nylon construction with velcro closure Carry All Folding Knife Belt Sheath. Black nylon construction with velcro closure. Fits folding knife up to 4 1/2\" closed. Can be worn on belt in horizontal or vertical position. Hang packaged.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kuqCR2fsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090UWVCG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0090X054O", "title": "Sole Fitness F80 Folding Treadmill", "description": "The SOLE F80 treadmill offers an industry-leading warranty and a proprietary Cushion Flex Whisper Deck, shown in a study to reduce impact on your joints by up to 40% compared to running on asphalt. A strong, 3.5 continuous duty HP motor delivers challenging speeds up to 12 MPH and inclines up to 15%. For added convenience and space savings when not in use, the treadmill deck folds and locks into place. Enjoy six preset programs, two customizable workout programs, two heart rate programs, and other safety features include a large stop switch, starts from only 0.5 mph and low-profile running hood.A vibrant LED display includes a message board for clear instruction and feedback. The information that is displayed at all times includes Speed, Incline, Time, Distance Traveled, Calories, Pulse and Pace, and there is also a 1/4 mile track feature and a Peak and Valley graph for different programs. The console also has built in speakers which allow you to hook up any MP3 player to listen to your favorite playlist during your workout.TechnologyFolding Deck:The design features a patented all gear rack and pinion system with a Safety Lock Deck that locks the deck into place when the treadmill is in the upright position. The F80 also comes with an Easy Assist Folding Deck Design, which allows you to release the deck, step back, and the deck will unfold itself silently while you watch.Convenient Controls:A streamlined control console features quick speed and incline adjustment buttons along the sides of the LCD for in-workout adjustment convenience.Cushion Flex Whisper Deck:Proprietary stealth technology provides a comfortable, quiet workout while reducing impact by up to 40%.Precision Welded Frame:The durable, solidly-built frame is strong enough to handle repeated use by users of all weights and heights.SOLE LCD Display:A vibrant blue screen with large, clean readouts provide users with helpful information, including heart rate, speed, pace, calories burned, and other useful bits of information.Integrated Message Board:An alphanumeric text center sends scrolling messages to the user in an effort to guide them through all of the details of every workout. The message board will also recap your entire workout after you are finished, so you can see your progress.High Torque Motor with Flywheels:All SOLE treadmills feature the heaviest duty chassis and motors in their class. Features include powder-coated, all-steel welded frames and heavy duty stable inclines, industrial quality motors with large diameter, all-steel zinc coated balanced flywheels for a vibration-free secure running/walking surface.Rollers:2.75-inch rollers have a sealed bearing design and copper ground wires for each roller to reduce static. Larger rollers make for a larger contact surface against the belt and longer roller and belt life.Belts:Woven two-ply belts with four layers, including two rubber layers over a middle PVC layer with a nylon backing that rolls over the deck and rollers. The rubber provides the durability, the PVC stops the belt from over-stretching, and the nylon provides a smooth, static-free surface to glide over the deck and rollers.DimensionsMeasures 35 by 58 by 80 inches (W x H x D)Deck measures 35 by 80 inches (W x D)Running surface measures 22 by 60 inches (W x D)265-pound weight375-pound weight limit2.75-inch rollersControls & Features3.5 CHP, DC Type motor0.5-to-12 MPH speed range0-to-15% rack-and-pinion gear design inclineTwo-ply beltPulse grip and chest strap heart rate monitoringSix standard programsTwo custom programsTwo heart programsCooling fansMP3-compatible sound system7.5-inch LCD workout displayWarrantiesThis piece of SOLE equipment includes the following manufacturer's warranties against defects in materials and workmanship:Frame, motor, and deck: LifetimeElectronics: Five yearsLabor: Two years", "text": "Sole Fitness F80 Folding Treadmill The SOLE F80 treadmill offers an industry-leading warranty and a proprietary Cushion Flex Whisper Deck, shown in a study to reduce impact on your joints by up to 40% compared to running on asphalt. A strong, 3.5 continuous duty HP motor delivers challenging speeds up to 12 MPH and inclines up to 15%. For added convenience and space savings when not in use, the treadmill deck folds and locks into place. Enjoy six preset programs, two customizable workout programs, two heart rate programs, and other safety features include a large stop switch, starts from only 0.5 mph and low-profile running hood.A vibrant LED display includes a message board for clear instruction and feedback. The information that is displayed at all times includes Speed, Incline, Time, Distance Traveled, Calories, Pulse and Pace, and there is also a 1/4 mile track feature and a Peak and Valley graph for different programs. The console also has built in speakers which allow you to hook up any MP3 player to listen to your favorite playlist during your workout.TechnologyFolding Deck:The design features a patented all gear rack and pinion system with a Safety Lock Deck that locks the deck into place when the treadmill is in the upright position. The F80 also comes with an Easy Assist Folding Deck Design, which allows you to release the deck, step back, and the deck will unfold itself silently while you watch.Convenient Controls:A streamlined control console features quick speed and incline adjustment buttons along the sides of the LCD for in-workout adjustment convenience.Cushion Flex Whisper Deck:Proprietary stealth technology provides a comfortable, quiet workout while reducing impact by up to 40%.Precision Welded Frame:The durable, solidly-built frame is strong enough to handle repeated use by users of all weights and heights.SOLE LCD Display:A vibrant blue screen with large, clean readouts provide users with helpful information, including heart rate, speed, pace, calories burned, and other useful bits of information.Integrated Message Board:An alphanumeric text center sends scrolling messages to the user in an effort to guide them through all of the details of every workout. The message board will also recap your entire workout after you are finished, so you can see your progress.High Torque Motor with Flywheels:All SOLE treadmills feature the heaviest duty chassis and motors in their class. Features include powder-coated, all-steel welded frames and heavy duty stable inclines, industrial quality motors with large diameter, all-steel zinc coated balanced flywheels for a vibration-free secure running/walking surface.Rollers:2.75-inch rollers have a sealed bearing design and copper ground wires for each roller to reduce static. Larger rollers make for a larger contact surface against the belt and longer roller and belt life.Belts:Woven two-ply belts with four layers, including two rubber layers over a middle PVC layer with a nylon backing that rolls over the deck and rollers. The rubber provides the durability, the PVC stops the belt from over-stretching, and the nylon provides a smooth, static-free surface to glide over the deck and rollers.DimensionsMeasures 35 by 58 by 80 inches (W x H x D)Deck measures 35 by 80 inches (W x D)Running surface measures 22 by 60 inches (W x D)265-pound weight375-pound weight limit2.75-inch rollersControls & Features3.5 CHP, DC Type motor0.5-to-12 MPH speed range0-to-15% rack-and-pinion gear design inclineTwo-ply beltPulse grip and chest strap heart rate monitoringSix standard programsTwo custom programsTwo heart programsCooling fansMP3-compatible sound system7.5-inch LCD workout displayWarrantiesThis piece of SOLE equipment includes the following manufacturer's warranties against defects in materials and workmanship:Frame, motor, and deck: LifetimeElectronics: Five yearsLabor: Two years", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a1FstYMBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090X054O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Treadmills"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0090X09KY", "title": "Sole Fitness E95 Elliptical Machine", "description": "The SOLE E95 elliptical machine provides a challenging cardio workout, supported by a blue, backlit LDC display that helps you track essential training data. The console includes a built-in cooling fan, water bottle holder, and speakers that allow you to plug in an MP3 player and listen to your favorite playlist while you work out.TechnologyQuiet drive system:Fluid, natural motion functions in both forward and reverse. The combination of a heavy, 34-pound flywheel and high gear ratio equates to an extremely smooth feel.Power incline:Additional resistance and variable positions mean a diverse, challenging cardio workout with the touch of a button. The ramp angle is fully adjustable from 0 to 30 degrees, allowing you to target and individually work all major lower body muscle groups.Advanced sensor systems:Stationary handle bars with built-in pulse sensors for monitoring your heart rate and a heart rate chest strap are great for ongoing pulse monitoring, and heart rate interactive programs.Custom foot pedals:Pedals were designed in collaboration with a leading physical therapist, and SOLE SOLE engineers have created a two-degree inward slope to the foot pedals, reducing ankle and knee stress common in many elliptical machines. The foot beds are also adjustable for customized comfort.Articulating pedals:Not everyone walks the same, which is why SOLE designed pedals that articulate to fit your stride. This feature also reduces the \"numb toe effect\" and sore Achilles tendons.Four rear wheels on heavy-duty rails:The design ensures a smoother, more stable feel, and reduce side-to-side foot pedal motion.DimensionsMeasures 27 by 62 by 83 inches (W x H x D)215-pound weight400-pound weight limitControls & FeaturesPower adjustable stride20-to-22-inch maximum stride lengthSix standard programsTwo custom programsTwo heart rate programsPulse grip and chest strap heart rate monitoringIncludes heart rate chest strapLCD console with nine-inch displayECB resistanceBuilt-in fan15-inch pedalsIncludes sound system and water bottle holderWarrantiesThis piece of SOLE equipment includes the following manufacturer's warranties against defects in materials and workmanship:Frame: LifetimeElectronics and parts: Five yearsLabor: Two years", "text": "Sole Fitness E95 Elliptical Machine The SOLE E95 elliptical machine provides a challenging cardio workout, supported by a blue, backlit LDC display that helps you track essential training data. The console includes a built-in cooling fan, water bottle holder, and speakers that allow you to plug in an MP3 player and listen to your favorite playlist while you work out.TechnologyQuiet drive system:Fluid, natural motion functions in both forward and reverse. The combination of a heavy, 34-pound flywheel and high gear ratio equates to an extremely smooth feel.Power incline:Additional resistance and variable positions mean a diverse, challenging cardio workout with the touch of a button. The ramp angle is fully adjustable from 0 to 30 degrees, allowing you to target and individually work all major lower body muscle groups.Advanced sensor systems:Stationary handle bars with built-in pulse sensors for monitoring your heart rate and a heart rate chest strap are great for ongoing pulse monitoring, and heart rate interactive programs.Custom foot pedals:Pedals were designed in collaboration with a leading physical therapist, and SOLE SOLE engineers have created a two-degree inward slope to the foot pedals, reducing ankle and knee stress common in many elliptical machines. The foot beds are also adjustable for customized comfort.Articulating pedals:Not everyone walks the same, which is why SOLE designed pedals that articulate to fit your stride. This feature also reduces the \"numb toe effect\" and sore Achilles tendons.Four rear wheels on heavy-duty rails:The design ensures a smoother, more stable feel, and reduce side-to-side foot pedal motion.DimensionsMeasures 27 by 62 by 83 inches (W x H x D)215-pound weight400-pound weight limitControls & FeaturesPower adjustable stride20-to-22-inch maximum stride lengthSix standard programsTwo custom programsTwo heart rate programsPulse grip and chest strap heart rate monitoringIncludes heart rate chest strapLCD console with nine-inch displayECB resistanceBuilt-in fan15-inch pedalsIncludes sound system and water bottle holderWarrantiesThis piece of SOLE equipment includes the following manufacturer's warranties against defects in materials and workmanship:Frame: LifetimeElectronics and parts: Five yearsLabor: Two years", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EmHlM1H3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0090X09KY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Elliptical Trainers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00913UY1C", "title": "Cygolite Metro 300 Lumen Headlight/Hotshot Taillight USB Rechargeable Bicycle Light System, Black", "description": "The Metro headlight and Hotshot tail light are one of the brightest USB rechargeable light sets for everyday riding, firing 300 lumens of intense light forward and shooting 2 watts of powerful flashes back. The Metro's 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path as the Hotshot's adjustable flash speeds bring motorist awareness to a whole new level. With their powerful illumination and exclusive safety features, the Metro/Hotshot light set brightens your ride and saves you the cost of replacement batteries year after year.", "text": "Cygolite Metro 300 Lumen Headlight/Hotshot Taillight USB Rechargeable Bicycle Light System, Black The Metro headlight and Hotshot tail light are one of the brightest USB rechargeable light sets for everyday riding, firing 300 lumens of intense light forward and shooting 2 watts of powerful flashes back. The Metro's 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path as the Hotshot's adjustable flash speeds bring motorist awareness to a whole new level. With their powerful illumination and exclusive safety features, the Metro/Hotshot light set brightens your ride and saves you the cost of replacement batteries year after year.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314mIyt7zqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00913UY1C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cygo Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 77.79}}
{"item_id": "B00919GF8W", "title": "Reinforced Looper Series Gun Belt", "description": "The Looper Belt Series is a U.S. made, Thermoplastic reinforced, premium cow hide leather belt, with a solid brass buckle. Blade-Tech has made a name for itself by making some of the best thermoformed plastic holsters available on the market today. The same high quality material that is used in many of our holsters gives the Looper Belt Series its structure and vertical rigidity.These belts are made not to flex or breakdown under the weight of a weapon worn for concealment or competition. The seemingly casual looking design of the belt helps with overall concealment of a carry weapon. The Looper Belt Series of quality belts by Blade-Tech are lightweight and are produced in such a way as to eliminate stretching for the life of the belt.Our belts have their exterior leather dyed in such a way as to help prevent surface discoloration that can occur from frequent wearing of a holster. Black belts come with a silver plated coating over the brass to increase bonding and durability.SIZING INSTRUCTIONSBelts are sized in actual inches around your waist and then we add length into the belt to accommodate an Inside the Waist Band holster. (DO NOT GO BY THE SIZE OF YOUR PANTS) If you measure around your waist (without a holster or another belt on) with a tape measure and you get 38 inches, then you would order a size 38 belt to accommodate an IWB or belt holster.", "text": "Reinforced Looper Series Gun Belt The Looper Belt Series is a U.S. made, Thermoplastic reinforced, premium cow hide leather belt, with a solid brass buckle. Blade-Tech has made a name for itself by making some of the best thermoformed plastic holsters available on the market today. The same high quality material that is used in many of our holsters gives the Looper Belt Series its structure and vertical rigidity.These belts are made not to flex or breakdown under the weight of a weapon worn for concealment or competition. The seemingly casual looking design of the belt helps with overall concealment of a carry weapon. The Looper Belt Series of quality belts by Blade-Tech are lightweight and are produced in such a way as to eliminate stretching for the life of the belt.Our belts have their exterior leather dyed in such a way as to help prevent surface discoloration that can occur from frequent wearing of a holster. Black belts come with a silver plated coating over the brass to increase bonding and durability.SIZING INSTRUCTIONSBelts are sized in actual inches around your waist and then we add length into the belt to accommodate an Inside the Waist Band holster. (DO NOT GO BY THE SIZE OF YOUR PANTS) If you measure around your waist (without a holster or another belt on) with a tape measure and you get 38 inches, then you would order a size 38 belt to accommodate an IWB or belt holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UfAXHLQPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00919GF8W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Belts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0091DJM24", "title": "Franklin Sports Table Tennis To Go (Multi-color)", "description": "Franklin Sports Table Tennis To Go is perfect for the table tennis player on the go. It includes 2 paddles, 2 balls, expandable/retractable net with post that opens to 6.25 feet and a mesh carry bag to tote the equipment. It attaches to a surface area measuring 75 wide and 1.75-Inch thick.", "text": "Franklin Sports Table Tennis To Go (Multi-color) Franklin Sports Table Tennis To Go is perfect for the table tennis player on the go. It includes 2 paddles, 2 balls, expandable/retractable net with post that opens to 6.25 feet and a mesh carry bag to tote the equipment. It attaches to a surface area measuring 75 wide and 1.75-Inch thick.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qmRB95ddL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0091DJM24.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Franklin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Table Tennis", "Table Tennis Sets"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B0091DVNNK", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits SOL 2-Person Emergency Bivvy", "description": "FEATURES of the Adventure Medical Kits Survive Outdoors Longer 2-Person Emergency Bivvy Sealed on the sides for full protection from rain, wind, and snow Heatsheets material is waterproof and windproof giving this unbelievable durability Reflects 90% of radiated body heat to keep you warm Sized for two people", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits SOL 2-Person Emergency Bivvy FEATURES of the Adventure Medical Kits Survive Outdoors Longer 2-Person Emergency Bivvy Sealed on the sides for full protection from rain, wind, and snow Heatsheets material is waterproof and windproof giving this unbelievable durability Reflects 90% of radiated body heat to keep you warm Sized for two people", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51iiyAh6ptL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0091DVNNK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 17.91}}
