{"item_id": "B0091MNAGY", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Universal Precision Machined Aluminum No Gunsmithing Weaver Picatinny Top & Bottom Rail Pistol Handgun Scope Mount for Sights , Lasers , Lights & Accessories Fits Pistols with Front Accessorie Rail", "description": "Brand New , Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Universal Precision Machined Aluminum No Gunsmithing Weaver Picatinny Top & Bottom Rail Pistol Handgun Scope Mount for Sights , Lasers , Lights & Accessories. Constructed from Precision Machined Aircraft Grade Aluminum Alloy. Fits on Most Pistol Accessory Rails to Provide a Solid Weaver Style Platform for Most Optics. Provides A Standard 7/8\" 12 Slot Top See-Thru Designed Weaver & 3 Slot Bottom Weaver - Picatinny Rail For Attaching Scopes, Sights, light, lasers etc. Specifications: Length 5\" inches. Weight 3 oz. Easy to Install , No Gunsmitthing Required.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Universal Precision Machined Aluminum No Gunsmithing Weaver Picatinny Top & Bottom Rail Pistol Handgun Scope Mount for Sights , Lasers , Lights & Accessories Fits Pistols with Front Accessorie Rail Brand New , Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Universal Precision Machined Aluminum No Gunsmithing Weaver Picatinny Top & Bottom Rail Pistol Handgun Scope Mount for Sights , Lasers , Lights & Accessories. Constructed from Precision Machined Aircraft Grade Aluminum Alloy. Fits on Most Pistol Accessory Rails to Provide a Solid Weaver Style Platform for Most Optics. Provides A Standard 7/8\" 12 Slot Top See-Thru Designed Weaver & 3 Slot Bottom Weaver - Picatinny Rail For Attaching Scopes, Sights, light, lasers etc. Specifications: Length 5\" inches. Weight 3 oz. Easy to Install , No Gunsmitthing Required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4141lZDvN2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0091MNAGY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes",