{"item_id": "B0091UCYHM", "title": "Bushwhacker Laredo Black - Bicycle Frame Bag Cycling Triangle Pack Bike Top Tube Bag - w/ Reflective trim", "description": "The Laredo attaches to your frame with a 3-point mounting system. One long zippered compartment is trimmed with Scotchlite to increase visibility.", "text": "Bushwhacker Laredo Black - Bicycle Frame Bag Cycling Triangle Pack Bike Top Tube Bag - w/ Reflective trim The Laredo attaches to your frame with a 3-point mounting system. One long zippered compartment is trimmed with Scotchlite to increase visibility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uGPfeqlNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0091UCYHM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 12.95}}
