{"item_id": "B0091UK86G", "title": "Mil-Comm TW25B Firearms Maintenance Kit Grease", "description": "TW25B Light Synthetic Grease is Mil-Comm Products' original formula and a top selling firearms lubricant worldwide. Its exceptional performance in adverse conditions has made it the choice of the U.S. Military and its Allies. TW25B grease is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A. The plastic, tapered tip reclosable 0.5 oz. syringe is handy for applying a drop or bead to small or hard to reach areas. The tip head rotates to open or close flow.MC25 Firearm Cleaner Degreaser is Mil-Comm Products' environmentally safe, water based, pH balanced, non-toxic formula that emulsifies organic substances on contact including gun lubricants, powder residue and other debris. This non-toxic cleaner properly prepares all kinds of firearms for application of one of Mil-Comm Products' extreme performance lubricants. MC25 is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A.", "text": "Mil-Comm TW25B Firearms Maintenance Kit Grease TW25B Light Synthetic Grease is Mil-Comm Products' original formula and a top selling firearms lubricant worldwide. Its exceptional performance in adverse conditions has made it the choice of the U.S. Military and its Allies. TW25B grease is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A. The plastic, tapered tip reclosable 0.5 oz. syringe is handy for applying a drop or bead to small or hard to reach areas. The tip head rotates to open or close flow.MC25 Firearm Cleaner Degreaser is Mil-Comm Products' environmentally safe, water based, pH balanced, non-toxic formula that emulsifies organic substances on contact including gun lubricants, powder residue and other debris. This non-toxic cleaner properly prepares all kinds of firearms for application of one of Mil-Comm Products' extreme performance lubricants. MC25 is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411pxSeIbDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0091UK86G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Solvents"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B0091YINMS", "title": "CRKT 7904DB Hammond Cruiser Black Blade Desert Handle Knife Plain Edge", "description": "CRKT Hammond Cruiser. 5 1/4\" closed linerlock. 3 3/4\" black coated stainless modified clip point blade with dual thumb studs. Features LAWKS safety system. Desert tan Zytel handles. Dual lanyard holes. Reversible black finish stainless pocket clip. Also includes an extra pocket clip with screws.BRK Exclusive!", "text": "CRKT 7904DB Hammond Cruiser Black Blade Desert Handle Knife Plain Edge CRKT Hammond Cruiser. 5 1/4\" closed linerlock. 3 3/4\" black coated stainless modified clip point blade with dual thumb studs. Features LAWKS safety system. Desert tan Zytel handles. Dual lanyard holes. Reversible black finish stainless pocket clip. Also includes an extra pocket clip with screws.BRK Exclusive!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416P7zPT4kL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0091YINMS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 21.29}}
{"item_id": "B00926ANUK", "title": "Sightmark LoPro Green Laser Designator Sight", "description": "The Sightmark LoPro Green Laser features a low profile design, allowing it to be mounted in front of a riflescope without interference with field of view. Designed to be mounted on a picatinny or weaver rail for an AR15, the LoPro Green Laser can also be mounted on the side of the quad rail. The laser is offset for clearing front sight post. Featuring 1 MOA click value adjustments, the hand adjustable windage and elevation turrets allow the user to zero in the laser dot for close range shooting. Visibility ranges from 50 yards in the daytime to 600 yards at night. Featuring a matte black finish, the LoPro Green Laser is constructed of a high performance thermoplastic, so it is heat and corrosion resistant, impact resistant, waterproof and shockproof. Reliable and durable, the Sightmark LoPro Green Laser takes one CR123 battery and has 27 hours of battery life and comes with a Velcro strips so switch can be mounted for easy turn on/off.", "text": "Sightmark LoPro Green Laser Designator Sight The Sightmark LoPro Green Laser features a low profile design, allowing it to be mounted in front of a riflescope without interference with field of view. Designed to be mounted on a picatinny or weaver rail for an AR15, the LoPro Green Laser can also be mounted on the side of the quad rail. The laser is offset for clearing front sight post. Featuring 1 MOA click value adjustments, the hand adjustable windage and elevation turrets allow the user to zero in the laser dot for close range shooting. Visibility ranges from 50 yards in the daytime to 600 yards at night. Featuring a matte black finish, the LoPro Green Laser is constructed of a high performance thermoplastic, so it is heat and corrosion resistant, impact resistant, waterproof and shockproof. Reliable and durable, the Sightmark LoPro Green Laser takes one CR123 battery and has 27 hours of battery life and comes with a Velcro strips so switch can be mounted for easy turn on/off.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418awZDXcGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00926ANUK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 90.0}}
{"item_id": "B009287QF8", "title": "Magpul Industries SGA Stock Type 1 Sling Mount Gun Swivel Kit", "description": "Sling Mount Kit - Type 1 can be added to either the right or left side of the SGA Shotgun Stock or the MOE Rifle Stock for use with push-button QD sling swivels. Heavy-duty black phosphatized steel construction easily installs with provided hardware. Swivels not included. Made in U.S.A.", "text": "Magpul Industries SGA Stock Type 1 Sling Mount Gun Swivel Kit Sling Mount Kit - Type 1 can be added to either the right or left side of the SGA Shotgun Stock or the MOE Rifle Stock for use with push-button QD sling swivels. Heavy-duty black phosphatized steel construction easily installs with provided hardware. Swivels not included. Made in U.S.A.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hJ7ydpFNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009287QF8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MAGPUL INDUSTRIES CORPORATION", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 14.49}}
{"item_id": "B0092DV0Y6", "title": "Hydro Flask Wide Mouth Flip Lid, Black", "description": "The BPA-free lid features a flip-top opening with rubber stopper to plug the opening and help prevent spills when not in use.", "text": "Hydro Flask Wide Mouth Flip Lid, Black The BPA-free lid features a flip-top opening with rubber stopper to plug the opening and help prevent spills when not in use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AvQWvCD4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0092DV0Y6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hydro Flask", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottle Accessories"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B0092DV1PE", "title": "Hydro Flask Wide Mouth Flat Cap", "description": "Hydro Flask Wide Mouth Flat Cap is designed for the rigors of the outdoors as well as everyday use, with insulation to aid in keeping your bottle's contents cold or hot and at the optimal temperature.", "text": "Hydro Flask Wide Mouth Flat Cap Hydro Flask Wide Mouth Flat Cap is designed for the rigors of the outdoors as well as everyday use, with insulation to aid in keeping your bottle's contents cold or hot and at the optimal temperature.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418-eYavjaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0092DV1PE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hydro Flask", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottle Accessories"]], "price": 3.99}}
{"item_id": "B0092ECRJM", "title": "Outlander Packable Handy Lightweight Travel Backpack Daypack", "description": "It is a compact daypack for people on the go. When you're not using the daypack, however, it fits into an ultra-compact pouch, so you can easily pack it in your suitcase for use at their destination and/or as an extra bag for the trip home !About OutlanderSince 1988, Outlander has built affordable, reliable backpack that enables everyone make travel easier and more fun. Outlander's success extends across the globe, where they have become a leading designer and manufacturer of durable backpacks.If for any reason you are not happy with any product sold from our store , please do not hesitate to contact us and we'll do our best to solve your problem quickly and efficiently! We take full ownership and responsibility for the quality of our products.Outlander is a registered trademark. Outlander products are sold by authorized sellers only.", "text": "Outlander Packable Handy Lightweight Travel Backpack Daypack It is a compact daypack for people on the go. When you're not using the daypack, however, it fits into an ultra-compact pouch, so you can easily pack it in your suitcase for use at their destination and/or as an extra bag for the trip home !About OutlanderSince 1988, Outlander has built affordable, reliable backpack that enables everyone make travel easier and more fun. Outlander's success extends across the globe, where they have become a leading designer and manufacturer of durable backpacks.If for any reason you are not happy with any product sold from our store , please do not hesitate to contact us and we'll do our best to solve your problem quickly and efficiently! We take full ownership and responsibility for the quality of our products.Outlander is a registered trademark. Outlander products are sold by authorized sellers only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415mjwwFPIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0092ECRJM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 19.89}}
{"item_id": "B0092ERGAC", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool K220KKP Onion Foresight Razor Edge Knife, Black", "description": "The new CRKT Foresight folding knife designed by Ken Onion draws on the tried and true formula of \"form follows function\". Its formidable profile looks like a chiseled physique just waiting to pounce on your next cutting task with all of the control and efficiencies you would expect in a high-quality folding knife. The cold-forged aluminum handle of the Foresight is purposefully styled and shaped with swept finger grooves and proper palm swell to provide a confident, comfortable grip no matter the use at hand. Ken designed the 3.5-inch modified drop-point blade with a generous belly and re-curve cutting edge to maximize tool utility. And, the IKBS ball bearing pivot system coupled with Inter frame style mechanism, make opening and closing the blade as smooth as silk. Precision ground of AUS 8 stainless steel and coated with Black Ti Nitride finish. this Ken Onion knife looks cool and is plenty sharp. Available in both Plain Edge and Combined Razor-Sharp and Triple-Point Serrated Edge models. Bottom line, some say hindsight is 20/20, but perhaps a smarter way to think is that having the Foresight shows you plan ahead when it comes to having the right tools.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool K220KKP Onion Foresight Razor Edge Knife, Black The new CRKT Foresight folding knife designed by Ken Onion draws on the tried and true formula of \"form follows function\". Its formidable profile looks like a chiseled physique just waiting to pounce on your next cutting task with all of the control and efficiencies you would expect in a high-quality folding knife. The cold-forged aluminum handle of the Foresight is purposefully styled and shaped with swept finger grooves and proper palm swell to provide a confident, comfortable grip no matter the use at hand. Ken designed the 3.5-inch modified drop-point blade with a generous belly and re-curve cutting edge to maximize tool utility. And, the IKBS ball bearing pivot system coupled with Inter frame style mechanism, make opening and closing the blade as smooth as silk. Precision ground of AUS 8 stainless steel and coated with Black Ti Nitride finish. this Ken Onion knife looks cool and is plenty sharp. Available in both Plain Edge and Combined Razor-Sharp and Triple-Point Serrated Edge models. Bottom line, some say hindsight is 20/20, but perhaps a smarter way to think is that having the Foresight shows you plan ahead when it comes to having the right tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31s3dbzOLGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0092ERGAC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 65.54}}
{"item_id": "B0092SBX4I", "title": "Gun-tipsTM 9-piece firearm cleaning kit", "description": "ABOUT GUN-TIPSTM • Gun-tipsTM foam swabs are reusable and replace cotton swabs. • Fiber free, does not shed or leave lint behind. • Perfect for cleaning and lubricating hard to reach places. • Available in a variety of shapes, sizes and packages. • Economical, washable and reusable, just like Bore-tips. • Made in the USA.", "text": "Gun-tipsTM 9-piece firearm cleaning kit ABOUT GUN-TIPSTM • Gun-tipsTM foam swabs are reusable and replace cotton swabs. • Fiber free, does not shed or leave lint behind. • Perfect for cleaning and lubricating hard to reach places. • Available in a variety of shapes, sizes and packages. • Economical, washable and reusable, just like Bore-tips. • Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kPfsIDK1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0092SBX4I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Swab-its", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 8.97}}
{"item_id": "B0092ZVY8Q", "title": "Klean Kanteen Kid's Stainless Steel Bottle with 3.0 Sport Cap", "description": "The Kid Kanteen 12 oz stainless steel water bottle with Sport Cap 3.0 is kid tested and parent approved. Relax knowing your child is drinnking from a completely healthy and hygenic sippy for safe, flavor-free hydration.", "text": "Klean Kanteen Kid's Stainless Steel Bottle with 3.0 Sport Cap The Kid Kanteen 12 oz stainless steel water bottle with Sport Cap 3.0 is kid tested and parent approved. Relax knowing your child is drinnking from a completely healthy and hygenic sippy for safe, flavor-free hydration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315PaO9zF1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0092ZVY8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 15.45}}
{"item_id": "B00930O1US", "title": "Bravo Company Gunfighter's Grip Mod 1 Grip Black AR Rifles BCM-GFG-MOD-1-BLACK", "description": "Upon introduction of the M16 in the 1960s the manual of arms for shooting positions included a bladed stance with an extended elbow on the fire control side. Because of numerous changes in the dynamics of the current fighting techniques we now virtually square off with the bad guy when engaging the target. The Gun Fighter's Grip by BCM allows for a reduced angle and improved ergonomics when shooting in the modern gun fighting stances.", "text": "Bravo Company Gunfighter's Grip Mod 1 Grip Black AR Rifles BCM-GFG-MOD-1-BLACK Upon introduction of the M16 in the 1960s the manual of arms for shooting positions included a bladed stance with an extended elbow on the fire control side. Because of numerous changes in the dynamics of the current fighting techniques we now virtually square off with the bad guy when engaging the target. The Gun Fighter's Grip by BCM allows for a reduced angle and improved ergonomics when shooting in the modern gun fighting stances.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21h9e93aHDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00930O1US.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bravo Company", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B00930XSOI", "title": "UST Blastmatch Fire starter", "description": "The patented BlastMatch generates a stream of super heated sparks literally three times the heat of a standard match. You can easily light any material (wood, paper, bark, cloth, or man-made fire starting tinder) that a match will ignite. Best of all, you can accurately aim the sparks to ignite a roaring fire in all weather conditions and the BlastMatch will last a thousand strikes.If your BlastMatch becomes wet, simply wipe it off and it is ready for use. In combination with Ultimate Survival Technologies' WetFire Tinder, an all weather starting tinder, you can start a fire even in the rain.At the heart of the BlastMatch is a custom bar of high performance flint material. Spring loaded for compactness, the flint bar also rotates 360 degrees to help prevent uneven wear. A carbide striker built into the striker button is set at the perfect angle for maximum sparking-making it easy for you to start a fire.The BlastMatch is also perfectly safe. To prevent accidental ignition the unique design requires you to press the thumb button in order to engage the striker mechanism. Specifications: Material/Flint Unit:7/16 inch diameter spring-loaded flint bar in ABS case Closed length: 4-Inch (10.2 cm) Weight: 2.2 oz (65g) Colors: Black, Orange US. Patent No. 5,919,037", "text": "UST Blastmatch Fire starter The patented BlastMatch generates a stream of super heated sparks literally three times the heat of a standard match. You can easily light any material (wood, paper, bark, cloth, or man-made fire starting tinder) that a match will ignite. Best of all, you can accurately aim the sparks to ignite a roaring fire in all weather conditions and the BlastMatch will last a thousand strikes.If your BlastMatch becomes wet, simply wipe it off and it is ready for use. In combination with Ultimate Survival Technologies' WetFire Tinder, an all weather starting tinder, you can start a fire even in the rain.At the heart of the BlastMatch is a custom bar of high performance flint material. Spring loaded for compactness, the flint bar also rotates 360 degrees to help prevent uneven wear. A carbide striker built into the striker button is set at the perfect angle for maximum sparking-making it easy for you to start a fire.The BlastMatch is also perfectly safe. To prevent accidental ignition the unique design requires you to press the thumb button in order to engage the striker mechanism. Specifications: Material/Flint Unit:7/16 inch diameter spring-loaded flint bar in ABS case Closed length: 4-Inch (10.2 cm) Weight: 2.2 oz (65g) Colors: Black, Orange US. Patent No. 5,919,037", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FWQi7ehzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00930XSOI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Survival Technologies", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 16.0}}
{"item_id": "B009312P5A", "title": "UST Wet Fire Tinder, Pack of 5", "description": "WetFire tinder was born from the need for a universal lighting material that was safe, easy-to-carry, and unaffected by wind or water. Originally designed for military troops, you now can also be prepared like them. If you are into the outdoors and find yourself hiking, camping, or backpacking-you never know where you might end up and with what kind of weather. Ultimate Survival Technologies' WetFire tinder is hands down the best fire-starting tinder material available anywhere in the world. It is individually packaged in a lightweight solid cube form that won't leak or damage your gear. It leaves none of the residue of other petroleum-based products and is non-toxic and has virtually no odor. The tinder cubes burn with almost no smoke and can be started even in high winds and inclement weather. In fact, the tinder burns while floating in water and actually burns longer when wet. WetFire tinder is non-toxic and extinguishes instantly.", "text": "UST Wet Fire Tinder, Pack of 5 WetFire tinder was born from the need for a universal lighting material that was safe, easy-to-carry, and unaffected by wind or water. Originally designed for military troops, you now can also be prepared like them. If you are into the outdoors and find yourself hiking, camping, or backpacking-you never know where you might end up and with what kind of weather. Ultimate Survival Technologies' WetFire tinder is hands down the best fire-starting tinder material available anywhere in the world. It is individually packaged in a lightweight solid cube form that won't leak or damage your gear. It leaves none of the residue of other petroleum-based products and is non-toxic and has virtually no odor. The tinder cubes burn with almost no smoke and can be started even in high winds and inclement weather. In fact, the tinder burns while floating in water and actually burns longer when wet. WetFire tinder is non-toxic and extinguishes instantly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tVmL9DokL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009312P5A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UST", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 5.1}}
