{"item_id": "B00932SA5I", "title": "BestDealUSA New Skull Skeleton Army Airsoft Paintball Full Face Game Protect Mask", "description": "* Color: as picture* Size: Approx 250 x 200 mm* Foam padded insidePackage contents:1 x Skull Mask", "text": "BestDealUSA New Skull Skeleton Army Airsoft Paintball Full Face Game Protect Mask * Color: as picture* Size: Approx 250 x 200 mm* Foam padded insidePackage contents:1 x Skull Mask", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R3Cm76%2BSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00932SA5I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Neewer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 10.47}}
{"item_id": "B00933WSTQ", "title": "Pure Fix Cycles Bike Pro Foot Strap", "description": "Pure Fix Cycles Pro foot straps are perfect for securing shoes to pedals for fixed gear riding. The straps give you the ability to skip stop, skid stop and slow your bike down with back pressure on your pedals.", "text": "Pure Fix Cycles Bike Pro Foot Strap Pure Fix Cycles Pro foot straps are perfect for securing shoes to pedals for fixed gear riding. The straps give you the ability to skip stop, skid stop and slow your bike down with back pressure on your pedals.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kknuNotsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00933WSTQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B00938XIP4", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical 2-7x32 Long Eye Relief Scout Rifle Pistol Scope Kit With Level & Duplex Reticle Kit With Included 7/8\" Weaver-Picatinny Scope Rings+ See Through Lens Covers+Lens Cleaning Kit", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear 2-7x32 Long Eye relief scope package. Includes the 2-7x32 Duplex & Level Reticle Long Eye Relief scope, premium aluminum weaver picatinny rail rings, lens cleaning kit, and see through lens covers. The scope is Nitrogen filled, fogproof, shock proof to withstand and perfrom under the highest recoil, and is water resistant. Features a duplex reticle for sharper aiming points and a clear and bright field of view. Lenses are multi coated blue for lowlight conditions and is fully adjustable for windage and elevation click adjustments (1/4\" Click Value @ 100 yards) . Scope length : 10.4\" , Weight: 12.5 oz.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical 2-7x32 Long Eye Relief Scout Rifle Pistol Scope Kit With Level & Duplex Reticle Kit With Included 7/8\" Weaver-Picatinny Scope Rings+ See Through Lens Covers+Lens Cleaning Kit Official Ultimate Arms Gear 2-7x32 Long Eye relief scope package. Includes the 2-7x32 Duplex & Level Reticle Long Eye Relief scope, premium aluminum weaver picatinny rail rings, lens cleaning kit, and see through lens covers. The scope is Nitrogen filled, fogproof, shock proof to withstand and perfrom under the highest recoil, and is water resistant. Features a duplex reticle for sharper aiming points and a clear and bright field of view. Lenses are multi coated blue for lowlight conditions and is fully adjustable for windage and elevation click adjustments (1/4\" Click Value @ 100 yards) . Scope length : 10.4\" , Weight: 12.5 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vr9tTKwhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00938XIP4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00939SS8U", "title": "Springefield XDS Sneaky Pete Holster (Belt Clip)", "description": "The Springfield XDS Sneaky Pete Holster has double belt clips which can accommodate a belt up to 1.75\" inches wide. The holster is made of high quality soft leather, and when worn on the belt resembles a cell phone case. The advantage of this design is that it allows you to carry your XDS concealed, but with full and easy access. Now it's possible to wear whatever you want, whenever you want to. Don't dress around your gun anymore. The holster is made inside and out of glove-quality leather, and uses two magnets to stay closed. Each holster is designed for your specific firearm, and the opening is made in such a way that you cannot accidentally place your finger on the trigger during draw. The Kydex insert ensures that a smooth, silent draw occurs every time. The use of double stitching and steel rivets guarantees that this holster will last for years to come. All available options are listed above, and the holster can be ordered either with the belt loop, or optional belt clip. We design every holster to be as small as possible and still fit your pistol. The size of this holster is: 4.3in x 6.7in x 1.6in. PLEASE BE CERTAIN THAT YOUR PISTOL HAS THE MAGAZINE BOTTOM THAT IS PICTURED. A DIFFERENT MAGAZINE WILL NOT WORK WITH THIS HOLSTER.", "text": "Springefield XDS Sneaky Pete Holster (Belt Clip) The Springfield XDS Sneaky Pete Holster has double belt clips which can accommodate a belt up to 1.75\" inches wide. The holster is made of high quality soft leather, and when worn on the belt resembles a cell phone case. The advantage of this design is that it allows you to carry your XDS concealed, but with full and easy access. Now it's possible to wear whatever you want, whenever you want to. Don't dress around your gun anymore. The holster is made inside and out of glove-quality leather, and uses two magnets to stay closed. Each holster is designed for your specific firearm, and the opening is made in such a way that you cannot accidentally place your finger on the trigger during draw. The Kydex insert ensures that a smooth, silent draw occurs every time. The use of double stitching and steel rivets guarantees that this holster will last for years to come. All available options are listed above, and the holster can be ordered either with the belt loop, or optional belt clip. We design every holster to be as small as possible and still fit your pistol. The size of this holster is: 4.3in x 6.7in x 1.6in. PLEASE BE CERTAIN THAT YOUR PISTOL HAS THE MAGAZINE BOTTOM THAT IS PICTURED. A DIFFERENT MAGAZINE WILL NOT WORK WITH THIS HOLSTER.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JA-k%2Bl%2BdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00939SS8U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B0093CMYQY", "title": "(Single) Vinyl Coated Kettbell @ LOWEST PRICE from 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30 35, 40 or 45 lbs - Great quality - Promotinal Price", "description": "", "text": "(Single) Vinyl Coated Kettbell @ LOWEST PRICE from 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30 35, 40 or 45 lbs - Great quality - Promotinal Price", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CW8AB1iBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0093CMYQY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Kettlebells"]], "price": 42.0}}
{"item_id": "B0093F9LW6", "title": "Infuser Water Bottle 27 Ounce - Made of durable Eastman Tritan - Create Your Own Flavored Water, Naturally, with Ingredients YOU Select | The Fun & Healthy Way to Enjoy Your Daily Water | Free Recipe Booklet* Included!", "description": "Create your own flavored beverage with fresh, natural ingredients. Made of durable Eastman TRITAN (not glass). Fill the removable snap lock infuser basket with lemons, limes, strawberries, orange slices, mint leaves, tea bags and much more. The combinations are endless! Our Infuser Water Bottle is a fun way to help you consume the recommended amount of daily water. Solid construction and the perfect size, this 27oz Infuser Bottle has a classy look is sure to get noticed. Expandable Basket allows more room for your favorite ingredients! *Each purchase qualifies for a free Infuser Recipe Booklet Download! (PDF) Infuser Directions - 1) 'Pop off' press-fit basket from lid. 2) Fill infuser basket with fruit or any other ingredient that you wish to use to flavor your liquid. Basket will expand slightly, as it gets filled. 3) Add water or other liquid of choice. NOTE: Filling with 'almost boiling' water is OK, if you plan to refrigerate at once. Hot water will pull much flavor from ingredients. CAUTION: BOTTLE WILL BE HOT TO HOLD. Use protection. 4) Close lid tightly, check for leaks, then Shake well! 6) ENJOY! Many prepare drinks at night, to be ready for the next day (this is where the hot water comes into play). This allows for 'Longer Infusion Time'. For best results, 'Shake Well & Often' during the day to keep fruit wet and water infused. Shaking is the key! Whatever size infuser basket your bottle has, gentle shaking is a must. The agitation caused by shaking is what will infuse your beverage quickly and effectively. Shake before and during use for best results. See our other exclusive items and more in our Amazon web-store. Feel free to contact us, if you need anything. Thank you :-)", "text": "Infuser Water Bottle 27 Ounce - Made of durable Eastman Tritan - Create Your Own Flavored Water, Naturally, with Ingredients YOU Select | The Fun & Healthy Way to Enjoy Your Daily Water | Free Recipe Booklet* Included! Create your own flavored beverage with fresh, natural ingredients. Made of durable Eastman TRITAN (not glass). Fill the removable snap lock infuser basket with lemons, limes, strawberries, orange slices, mint leaves, tea bags and much more. The combinations are endless! Our Infuser Water Bottle is a fun way to help you consume the recommended amount of daily water. Solid construction and the perfect size, this 27oz Infuser Bottle has a classy look is sure to get noticed. Expandable Basket allows more room for your favorite ingredients! *Each purchase qualifies for a free Infuser Recipe Booklet Download! (PDF) Infuser Directions - 1) 'Pop off' press-fit basket from lid. 2) Fill infuser basket with fruit or any other ingredient that you wish to use to flavor your liquid. Basket will expand slightly, as it gets filled. 3) Add water or other liquid of choice. NOTE: Filling with 'almost boiling' water is OK, if you plan to refrigerate at once. Hot water will pull much flavor from ingredients. CAUTION: BOTTLE WILL BE HOT TO HOLD. Use protection. 4) Close lid tightly, check for leaks, then Shake well! 6) ENJOY! Many prepare drinks at night, to be ready for the next day (this is where the hot water comes into play). This allows for 'Longer Infusion Time'. For best results, 'Shake Well & Often' during the day to keep fruit wet and water infused. Shaking is the key! Whatever size infuser basket your bottle has, gentle shaking is a must. The agitation caused by shaking is what will infuse your beverage quickly and effectively. Shake before and during use for best results. See our other exclusive items and more in our Amazon web-store. Feel free to contact us, if you need anything. Thank you :-)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bQcg30zRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0093F9LW6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 14.99}}
