{"item_id": "B0093IKQT0", "title": "Klean Kanteen Loop Cap for Kanteen Classic", "description": "FEATURES of the Klean Kanteen Loop Cap for Kanteen Classic The handy attachment loop gives you multiple carry options No BPA, phthalates, lead or other toxins because those are awful Super versatile because it is interchangeable with all Kanteen Classic sizes Dishwasher safe for those days you really just want to be lazy and throw it in the dishwasher SPECIFICATIONS of the Klean Kanteen Loop Cap for Kanteen Classic Weight: 1 oz Size: 2.75\" (height) x 2\" (width) BPA-free polypropylene", "text": "Klean Kanteen Loop Cap for Kanteen Classic FEATURES of the Klean Kanteen Loop Cap for Kanteen Classic The handy attachment loop gives you multiple carry options No BPA, phthalates, lead or other toxins because those are awful Super versatile because it is interchangeable with all Kanteen Classic sizes Dishwasher safe for those days you really just want to be lazy and throw it in the dishwasher SPECIFICATIONS of the Klean Kanteen Loop Cap for Kanteen Classic Weight: 1 oz Size: 2.75\" (height) x 2\" (width) BPA-free polypropylene", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ym5EcNAuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0093IKQT0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 5.69}}
{"item_id": "B0093IKZGY", "title": "Stainless Flip D-Ring Wide", "description": "Add the low-profile Stainless Flip D-Ring from Klean Kanteen to any of your Classic Kanteens for some sleek profiling, while still having the option to clip it to something. The inside is all food-grade stainless steel so you know your water is being stored in a safe material that won't impart or retain any off-flavors from whatever drinks you may pour in the bottle. This cap is BPA free, dishwasher safe, and creates a leak-proof seal on your Kanteen. PRODUCT FEATURES: 100% stainless interior Low-profile design Multifunctional flat or loop No BPA, phthalates, lead or other toxins Works on all Wide, Insulated, and Kid Kanteen Baby Bottles Dishwasher safe Cap is leakproof Weight: 2.5 ounces Size: 1.1875\" H x 2.625\" W 18/8 stainless steel interior KWSSFD-BK , Klean Kanteen Stainless Flip D-Ring Wide , water bottles , kleen kanteen , klean kantean , clean canteen , cleen canteen , clean cantean , flip-ring cap klean kanteen , d-ring flip up cap , klean kanteen cap , stainless steel cap , wide kanteen cap , d-ring flip cap klean kanteen , water bottles , hydration bottles , bottle caps , water bottle caps , water bottle tops , water bottle lids , stainless steel , stainless steal , ss bottle cap , stainless cap , camping , hiking , backpacking", "text": "Stainless Flip D-Ring Wide Add the low-profile Stainless Flip D-Ring from Klean Kanteen to any of your Classic Kanteens for some sleek profiling, while still having the option to clip it to something. The inside is all food-grade stainless steel so you know your water is being stored in a safe material that won't impart or retain any off-flavors from whatever drinks you may pour in the bottle. This cap is BPA free, dishwasher safe, and creates a leak-proof seal on your Kanteen. PRODUCT FEATURES: 100% stainless interior Low-profile design Multifunctional flat or loop No BPA, phthalates, lead or other toxins Works on all Wide, Insulated, and Kid Kanteen Baby Bottles Dishwasher safe Cap is leakproof Weight: 2.5 ounces Size: 1.1875\" H x 2.625\" W 18/8 stainless steel interior KWSSFD-BK , Klean Kanteen Stainless Flip D-Ring Wide , water bottles , kleen kanteen , klean kantean , clean canteen , cleen canteen , clean cantean , flip-ring cap klean kanteen , d-ring flip up cap , klean kanteen cap , stainless steel cap , wide kanteen cap , d-ring flip cap klean kanteen , water bottles , hydration bottles , bottle caps , water bottle caps , water bottle tops , water bottle lids , stainless steel , stainless steal , ss bottle cap , stainless cap , camping , hiking , backpacking", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fI0gW7NUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0093IKZGY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 9.2}}
{"item_id": "B0093IL0O0", "title": "Klean Kanteen Cafe Cap for Kanteen Wide", "description": "FEATURES of the Klean Kanteen Cafe Cap for Kanteen Wide Has a low-profile design Takes your bottle to new levels by making it a splashproof to-go mug Only has one moving part No BPA, phthalates, lead or other toxins This is super versatile and works on all Wide, Insulated, and Kid Kanteen Baby Bottles Dishwasher safe for when you are feeling really lazy SPECIFICATIONS of the Klean Kanteen Cafe Cap for Kanteen Wide Weight: 1.5 oz Size: 1.5\" (height) x 2.625\" (width) BPA-free polypropylene Cap is NOT leakproof. Don't say I didn't warn you.", "text": "Klean Kanteen Cafe Cap for Kanteen Wide FEATURES of the Klean Kanteen Cafe Cap for Kanteen Wide Has a low-profile design Takes your bottle to new levels by making it a splashproof to-go mug Only has one moving part No BPA, phthalates, lead or other toxins This is super versatile and works on all Wide, Insulated, and Kid Kanteen Baby Bottles Dishwasher safe for when you are feeling really lazy SPECIFICATIONS of the Klean Kanteen Cafe Cap for Kanteen Wide Weight: 1.5 oz Size: 1.5\" (height) x 2.625\" (width) BPA-free polypropylene Cap is NOT leakproof. Don't say I didn't warn you.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TiC0pBmbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0093IL0O0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 6.57}}
{"item_id": "B0093IQT5A", "title": "Klean Kanteen Stainless Steel Bottle with 3.0 Sport Cap", "description": "The Classic Klean Kanteen Stainless Steel Bottle is the perfect alternative to disposable plastics and provides a sustainable, reusable bottle for staying hydrated and BPA-free.", "text": "Klean Kanteen Stainless Steel Bottle with 3.0 Sport Cap The Classic Klean Kanteen Stainless Steel Bottle is the perfect alternative to disposable plastics and provides a sustainable, reusable bottle for staying hydrated and BPA-free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SwDOwcg0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0093IQT5A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0093IS0GQ", "title": "Klean Kanteen Wide Mouth Bottle with Stainless Loop Cap", "description": "The Klean Kanteen Wide Mouth water bottle features an extra-wide mouth for easy filling and pouring-makes it easy to add ice cubes and use as a drinking cup or food container.", "text": "Klean Kanteen Wide Mouth Bottle with Stainless Loop Cap The Klean Kanteen Wide Mouth water bottle features an extra-wide mouth for easy filling and pouring-makes it easy to add ice cubes and use as a drinking cup or food container.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pdO40ELoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0093IS0GQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0093IS4WQ", "title": "Klean Kanteen Wide Insulated Water Bottle with Stainless Loop Cap", "description": "Equipped with a leak-proof Stainless Loop Cap, you can clip it onto your bag or throw it inside without a second thought. For drinking on the go, a Cafe Cap quickly converts the Kanteen into a splash proof to-go mug. The slim design of the Kanteen Insulated is compatible with most cup holders. Rounded corners make the bottle easy to clean and the 100% stainless steel interior won't retain or impart flavors. Go from lattes to lemonade with no lingering tastes.", "text": "Klean Kanteen Wide Insulated Water Bottle with Stainless Loop Cap Equipped with a leak-proof Stainless Loop Cap, you can clip it onto your bag or throw it inside without a second thought. For drinking on the go, a Cafe Cap quickly converts the Kanteen into a splash proof to-go mug. The slim design of the Kanteen Insulated is compatible with most cup holders. Rounded corners make the bottle easy to clean and the 100% stainless steel interior won't retain or impart flavors. Go from lattes to lemonade with no lingering tastes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PbYvRp3GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0093IS4WQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Home & Kitchen", "Kitchen & Dining", "Travel Mugs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0093NQNSI", "title": "Ontario Knives 8848CB Satin Finish RAT-1 Linerlock Knife with Coyote Brown Handles", "description": "Ontario Knives - Satin Finish RAT-1 Linerlock Knife with Coyote Brown Nylon Handles. Model: ON8848CB. 5\" closed linerlock. Satin finish AUS-8 stainless blade with dual thumb studs. Coyote Brown nylon handles with reversible stainless pocket clip.l", "text": "Ontario Knives 8848CB Satin Finish RAT-1 Linerlock Knife with Coyote Brown Handles Ontario Knives - Satin Finish RAT-1 Linerlock Knife with Coyote Brown Nylon Handles. Model: ON8848CB. 5\" closed linerlock. Satin finish AUS-8 stainless blade with dual thumb studs. Coyote Brown nylon handles with reversible stainless pocket clip.l", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BnNc9YgJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0093NQNSI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 35.15}}
