{"item_id": "B0094FSFXQ", "title": "Save Phace Grunt Black Goggles with Clear Single Pane Both Sides Anti Fog Coating", "description": "Save Phace’s Grunt Goggle is your Tactical dream come true. 100% UVA/UVB protection, Distortion free viewing, Comfortable Adjustable Sure Grip strap, and Military Grade Anti Fog & Anti Scratch Coatings. Pair it up with tear away lens protectors and you’re ready for battle.", "text": "Save Phace Grunt Black Goggles with Clear Single Pane Both Sides Anti Fog Coating Save Phace’s Grunt Goggle is your Tactical dream come true. 100% UVA/UVB protection, Distortion free viewing, Comfortable Adjustable Sure Grip strap, and Military Grade Anti Fog & Anti Scratch Coatings. Pair it up with tear away lens protectors and you’re ready for battle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-iKgjY83L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0094FSFXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Save Phace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 15.11}}
{"item_id": "B0094J48KQ", "title": "Bones Bearings Press Puller - Bones Bearing Tool - Bones Skate Tool", "description": "Bones Bearings new bearing tool. It acts as both a bearing press and a puller as well. It works with 8mm bearing and for the 90% of people not using spacers in their wheels. It is designed to press the bearings putting only force on the inner race so you wont dent your shields. Ball detent technology and small enough to fit in your pocket and make it your key chain. This tool will not work as a bearing puller if spacers are used.", "text": "Bones Bearings Press Puller - Bones Bearing Tool - Bones Skate Tool Bones Bearings new bearing tool. It acts as both a bearing press and a puller as well. It works with 8mm bearing and for the 90% of people not using spacers in their wheels. It is designed to press the bearings putting only force on the inner race so you wont dent your shields. Ball detent technology and small enough to fit in your pocket and make it your key chain. This tool will not work as a bearing puller if spacers are used.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311zihXL6ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0094J48KQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bones Wheels &amp; Bearings", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Tools"]], "price": 13.4}}
