{"item_id": "B0094UEJHM", "title": "Lasermax CF-Nano Centerfire Laser", "description": "LaserMax CenterFire Laser for pinpoint accuracy for all of your shots! Quick target acquisition under extreme conditions! Outfit your carry pistol with this LaserMax CenterFire. Red laser cuts through the confusion for point-and-shoot ease. Easily mounts to your frame without altering parts... no Picatinny or Weaver style rail required. Just switch it on! Runs for up to 5 hours on the included, powerful lithium battery. Precise aim: Designed to match the contours of your pistol; Distinct on / off switch, with ambidextrous activation! Installs in mere minutes; Wavelength: 5mW; User-adjustable windage / elevation. Weighs 0.5 ozs. Dead-center firing made possible, with a little help from LaserMax! Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. WARNING: Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. LaserMax CenterFire Laser for Beretta Nano", "text": "Lasermax CF-Nano Centerfire Laser LaserMax CenterFire Laser for pinpoint accuracy for all of your shots! Quick target acquisition under extreme conditions! Outfit your carry pistol with this LaserMax CenterFire. Red laser cuts through the confusion for point-and-shoot ease. Easily mounts to your frame without altering parts... no Picatinny or Weaver style rail required. Just switch it on! Runs for up to 5 hours on the included, powerful lithium battery. Precise aim: Designed to match the contours of your pistol; Distinct on / off switch, with ambidextrous activation! Installs in mere minutes; Wavelength: 5mW; User-adjustable windage / elevation. Weighs 0.5 ozs. Dead-center firing made possible, with a little help from LaserMax! Order Today! WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. WARNING: Lasers cannot be shipped to New York City; D.C.; MA or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers. LaserMax CenterFire Laser for Beretta Nano", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lyxQisF%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0094UEJHM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserMax", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B0094XSD62", "title": "Special Sales: Yes4All Abdominal / Ab Exercise Core Exercise Hybrid Mat", "description": "An abdominal mat provides a complete core exercises and training for the abs, back and oblique. High density, yet soft foam designed to contour to your back to provide support and help prevent injury. Also designed to offer a full range of motion while targeting the entire abdominal muscle group. Very durable and portable, weighing just a little over one pound.", "text": "Special Sales: Yes4All Abdominal / Ab Exercise Core Exercise Hybrid Mat An abdominal mat provides a complete core exercises and training for the abs, back and oblique. High density, yet soft foam designed to contour to your back to provide support and help prevent injury. Also designed to offer a full range of motion while targeting the entire abdominal muscle group. Very durable and portable, weighing just a little over one pound.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F56vRntaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0094XSD62.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 13.0}}
