{"item_id": "B0095W6YGS", "title": "Butler Creek LULA M16/AR-15 All-in-One Magazine Speed Loader & Free MSP Silicone Gun Cloth", "description": "Turn on the fastest, most comfortable loading experience possible. The lever engages spring, so rounds slide in and out effortlessly no finger or mag abuse. Slips on and off your mag with ease. LULA is a trademark of Maglula Ltd. and is used by permission. Manufacturer: Butler Creek Type: Mag Loader/Unloader Model: Maglula Caliber: 223 Rem Finish/Color: Black Cloth May be use over and over again untill it wears out, Dot not wash this cloth. Sise: 14\" x 15\" Use on: Guns Gun Sights Fishing Reels Fishing Tactle Golf Clubs Tools Auto Accessories", "text": "Butler Creek LULA M16/AR-15 All-in-One Magazine Speed Loader & Free MSP Silicone Gun Cloth Turn on the fastest, most comfortable loading experience possible. The lever engages spring, so rounds slide in and out effortlessly no finger or mag abuse. Slips on and off your mag with ease. LULA is a trademark of Maglula Ltd. and is used by permission. Manufacturer: Butler Creek Type: Mag Loader/Unloader Model: Maglula Caliber: 223 Rem Finish/Color: Black Cloth May be use over and over again untill it wears out, Dot not wash this cloth. Sise: 14\" x 15\" Use on: Guns Gun Sights Fishing Reels Fishing Tactle Golf Clubs Tools Auto Accessories", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ewuyz9T-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0095W6YGS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 26.95}}
{"item_id": "B009605VI6", "title": "Fat Gripz Extreme Hand Strengthener, Orange", "description": "Fat Gripz ORIGINAL are the new worldwide training phenomenon which helps add muscle & strength to your upper body (especially your arms) in record time. TO AVOID MISSING OUT ON GAINS, WE STRONGLY SUGGEST MASTERING THE FAT GRIPZ ORIGINAL FIRST OR USING THE FAT GRIPZ EXTREMES IN CONJUNCTION WITH THE ORIGINALS (IN A DROP-SET MANNER). CAUTION: WE DO NOT RECOMMEND BUYING THESE FAT GRIPZ EXTREMES BY THEMSELVES. THEY WERE DESIGNED AS A PROGRESSION FROM FAT GRIPZ ORIGINAL (BLUE). Fat Gripz instantly convert barbells, dumbbells and chin-up bars into THICK BARS (more than twice as thick) so that you can train the way many pro athletes do. Used by thousands of athletes and military, including many Special Forces soldiers, NFL players, top MMA fighters, bodybuilders and Cross Fitters.", "text": "Fat Gripz Extreme Hand Strengthener, Orange Fat Gripz ORIGINAL are the new worldwide training phenomenon which helps add muscle & strength to your upper body (especially your arms) in record time. TO AVOID MISSING OUT ON GAINS, WE STRONGLY SUGGEST MASTERING THE FAT GRIPZ ORIGINAL FIRST OR USING THE FAT GRIPZ EXTREMES IN CONJUNCTION WITH THE ORIGINALS (IN A DROP-SET MANNER). CAUTION: WE DO NOT RECOMMEND BUYING THESE FAT GRIPZ EXTREMES BY THEMSELVES. THEY WERE DESIGNED AS A PROGRESSION FROM FAT GRIPZ ORIGINAL (BLUE). Fat Gripz instantly convert barbells, dumbbells and chin-up bars into THICK BARS (more than twice as thick) so that you can train the way many pro athletes do. Used by thousands of athletes and military, including many Special Forces soldiers, NFL players, top MMA fighters, bodybuilders and Cross Fitters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415dwahplOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009605VI6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fat Gripz", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 45.0}}
{"item_id": "B00961LY54", "title": "POLICE 15,000,000 V Stun Gun w/ Flashlight BLACK", "description": "PoliceMart is specializes in selling self-defense products for everybody who is looking for protection they can have in their purse or pocket when danger comes along. And here you are looking at the perfect \"You must have\" little self-defense gadget that can stop any violent or dangerous activity. This is the strongest stun gun on the market you can find today. In most cases just pulling the trigger and fire stun gun in the air is more than enough to stop the attacker as the bright electrical light followed by the terrifying noise comes out when it fires up. Well and if it is not enough to stop the attacker than a simple touch of a powerful voltage this stun gun produces will definitely do the job. As it will create electrical shock and put your enemy down and prevent him from any further aggression giving u enough time to run away or call a police. This unit also features installed flash light, no battery's needed for stun gun to operate as it charges from any wall socket. Defend yourself, defend your friends. Be safe. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County, IA. Attention: You must be 18 years of age to order stun guns or tasers. Also it is the customer's responsibility to check with local ordinances to determine legality of stun guns in the home locality.", "text": "POLICE 15,000,000 V Stun Gun w/ Flashlight BLACK PoliceMart is specializes in selling self-defense products for everybody who is looking for protection they can have in their purse or pocket when danger comes along. And here you are looking at the perfect \"You must have\" little self-defense gadget that can stop any violent or dangerous activity. This is the strongest stun gun on the market you can find today. In most cases just pulling the trigger and fire stun gun in the air is more than enough to stop the attacker as the bright electrical light followed by the terrifying noise comes out when it fires up. Well and if it is not enough to stop the attacker than a simple touch of a powerful voltage this stun gun produces will definitely do the job. As it will create electrical shock and put your enemy down and prevent him from any further aggression giving u enough time to run away or call a police. This unit also features installed flash light, no battery's needed for stun gun to operate as it charges from any wall socket. Defend yourself, defend your friends. Be safe. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County, IA. Attention: You must be 18 years of age to order stun guns or tasers. Also it is the customer's responsibility to check with local ordinances to determine legality of stun guns in the home locality.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RgCvYe9fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00961LY54.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 10.98}}
