{"item_id": "B0096C08D2", "title": "Lone Wolf Plug for Glock model 30 only", "description": "The Lone Wolf plug is designed to close the open cavity at the bottom of theGlockgrip. This willprevent debris from entering and reaching the trigger assembly and firing pin.Also eliminates possible snagging from open cavity.", "text": "Lone Wolf Plug for Glock model 30 only The Lone Wolf plug is designed to close the open cavity at the bottom of theGlockgrip. This willprevent debris from entering and reaching the trigger assembly and firing pin.Also eliminates possible snagging from open cavity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sEjv3spmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0096C08D2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 6.95}}
