{"item_id": "B0096OBKWI", "title": "EyezOff 18-Function Folding Bicycle Multi Tool (Black/Silver)", "description": "Bicycle multi tool with 18 essential functions to help you get back on the road again! Ultra-compact and lightweight so it fits in any saddle bag or pocket. Solid construction in quality materials. Weight 220g - dimensions 88mm x 44mm x 18mm. Functions include: Hex keys: 2mm, 2.5mm, 3mm, 4mm, 5mm, 6mm, 8mm - Philips and flat screwdrivers - 2 tyre levers - Chain splitting tool - Torque T-25 - 3 spoke wrench sizes - Mavic and Shimano wrench", "text": "EyezOff 18-Function Folding Bicycle Multi Tool (Black/Silver) Bicycle multi tool with 18 essential functions to help you get back on the road again! Ultra-compact and lightweight so it fits in any saddle bag or pocket. Solid construction in quality materials. Weight 220g - dimensions 88mm x 44mm x 18mm. Functions include: Hex keys: 2mm, 2.5mm, 3mm, 4mm, 5mm, 6mm, 8mm - Philips and flat screwdrivers - 2 tyre levers - Chain splitting tool - Torque T-25 - 3 spoke wrench sizes - Mavic and Shimano wrench", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4164nZ7CCCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0096OBKWI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Multifunction Tools"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B0096V7E4Y", "title": "Usa Made Deluxe Belt & Clip-on Side Holster for Ruger Sr9c Sr40c Sr-9c Sr-40c Compact 3.5\" 9 and 40 CAL", "description": "100% MADE IN THE USA BY U.S. CITIZENS. HOLSTER IS MADE TO FIT THE GUN MENTIONED IN THE LISTING TITLE HAS SOFT LINER INSIDE TO PROTECT YOUR GUN, NOT NYLON LIKE THE COMPETITION. HOLSTER ISN'T AN IMPORT FROM ANOTHER COUNTRY. VERY TOUGH DENIER NYLON HOLSTER WARRANTED AGAINST DEFECTS 100 % EDGES ARE TURNED UNDER. INSIDE SIGHT CHANNEL HAS BEEN REINFORCED TO ALLOW FOR SMOOTH RETRIEVAL OF FIREARM AND PREVENTS FRONT SITES FROM HANGING UP WHEN YOU NEED IT MOST! WORN ON THE BELT USING THE WEBBING LOOPS OR CAN BE CLIPPED ON THE PANTS/ BELT USING THE STEEL CLIP", "text": "Usa Made Deluxe Belt & Clip-on Side Holster for Ruger Sr9c Sr40c Sr-9c Sr-40c Compact 3.5\" 9 and 40 CAL 100% MADE IN THE USA BY U.S. CITIZENS. HOLSTER IS MADE TO FIT THE GUN MENTIONED IN THE LISTING TITLE HAS SOFT LINER INSIDE TO PROTECT YOUR GUN, NOT NYLON LIKE THE COMPETITION. HOLSTER ISN'T AN IMPORT FROM ANOTHER COUNTRY. VERY TOUGH DENIER NYLON HOLSTER WARRANTED AGAINST DEFECTS 100 % EDGES ARE TURNED UNDER. INSIDE SIGHT CHANNEL HAS BEEN REINFORCED TO ALLOW FOR SMOOTH RETRIEVAL OF FIREARM AND PREVENTS FRONT SITES FROM HANGING UP WHEN YOU NEED IT MOST! WORN ON THE BELT USING THE WEBBING LOOPS OR CAN BE CLIPPED ON THE PANTS/ BELT USING THE STEEL CLIP", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51h6zIoWHPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0096V7E4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 13.95}}
