{"item_id": "B009766CQ4", "title": "WindFire® NEW Cree XM-L T6 LED 1600 Lumens Waterproof 3 Modes Headlamp CREE LED Headlight 3 Modes Super Bright Headlamp/Bicycle Light Torch Flashlight Cree LED Powerful Bicycle Lamp Head Bike Light Torch with AC Charger and 8.4V 6400mAh Battery Pack for Camping, Hiking, Climbing, Cycling", "description": "Specifications:Brand:WindFire.Function: WindFire. CREE XM-L T6 U2 LED 1600Lm Headlamp Bicycle Light.2 in 1 functions: Bicycle light + Head Light.Output brightness comes to max 1600 lumens.Material:- Aluminum alloy casing, avoiding high temperature, anti fall off.- Aluminum smooth reflector.- Coated glass lens.LED:- Type: CREE XM-L T6 U2- Quantity: 1- Luminous Flux: 1600lm (Maximum)- Lifespan: 50,000 hoursSwitch:- Type: Button.- Location: Middle of the Light.3 Switch Modes: High, Low, Strobe.Mode Memory: No.Package Content:1 x WindFire 1 x CREE XM-L T6 U2 LED 1600 Lumens Headlamp Light.2 x Rubber ring for installation.1 X 6400mAh rechargeable battery pack.1 x Charger (100v-240v)1 x Headband.WindFire After Service: 30 Days Money Back Guarantee, 12 Months Warranty!", "text": "WindFire® NEW Cree XM-L T6 LED 1600 Lumens Waterproof 3 Modes Headlamp CREE LED Headlight 3 Modes Super Bright Headlamp/Bicycle Light Torch Flashlight Cree LED Powerful Bicycle Lamp Head Bike Light Torch with AC Charger and 8.4V 6400mAh Battery Pack for Camping, Hiking, Climbing, Cycling Specifications:Brand:WindFire.Function: WindFire. CREE XM-L T6 U2 LED 1600Lm Headlamp Bicycle Light.2 in 1 functions: Bicycle light + Head Light.Output brightness comes to max 1600 lumens.Material:- Aluminum alloy casing, avoiding high temperature, anti fall off.- Aluminum smooth reflector.- Coated glass lens.LED:- Type: CREE XM-L T6 U2- Quantity: 1- Luminous Flux: 1600lm (Maximum)- Lifespan: 50,000 hoursSwitch:- Type: Button.- Location: Middle of the Light.3 Switch Modes: High, Low, Strobe.Mode Memory: No.Package Content:1 x WindFire 1 x CREE XM-L T6 U2 LED 1600 Lumens Headlamp Light.2 x Rubber ring for installation.1 X 6400mAh rechargeable battery pack.1 x Charger (100v-240v)1 x Headband.WindFire After Service: 30 Days Money Back Guarantee, 12 Months Warranty!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uu-9b0cSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009766CQ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cree", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 22.78}}
