{"item_id": "B0097DHMGQ", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Bolt-On Knurled Oversized Extended Large Charging Handle Latch Saiga & AK AK47 AK-47 AK74 AK-74 Rifle Shotguns", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear, Brand New. Tactical Bolt-On Extended Large Vertical Charging Handle Latch Saiga AK47 AK-47 AK74 AK-74 Rifles Shotguns. Bolts on to the Existing Charging Handle to Give you a Vertical Handle Making Operating your Weapon Easier. This will work on all Saiga Rifles, Shotguns and Most AK 47's. May Require Minor Fitting as Charging Handles May Differ From One Country to Another.Made in the USA. Slips Over your Factory Charge Handle and Locks Down with a Set Screw. Loctite is Recommended for the Set Screw.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Bolt-On Knurled Oversized Extended Large Charging Handle Latch Saiga & AK AK47 AK-47 AK74 AK-74 Rifle Shotguns Official Ultimate Arms Gear, Brand New. Tactical Bolt-On Extended Large Vertical Charging Handle Latch Saiga AK47 AK-47 AK74 AK-74 Rifles Shotguns. Bolts on to the Existing Charging Handle to Give you a Vertical Handle Making Operating your Weapon Easier. This will work on all Saiga Rifles, Shotguns and Most AK 47's. May Require Minor Fitting as Charging Handles May Differ From One Country to Another.Made in the USA. Slips Over your Factory Charge Handle and Locks Down with a Set Screw. Loctite is Recommended for the Set Screw.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N7UfgRpPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0097DHMGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0097DUIOE", "title": "Ibera Clip-On Quick-Release Bicycle Handlebar DSLR Camera Bag with All Weather Rain Cover", "description": "Protect and quickly access your cameras and gear on commutes, day trips, or extended tours. Fits large DSLRs, lenses and additional camera accessories.The lid is angled with a clear map sleeve for easy viewing of maps or even a phone. With multiple compartments, padded shoulder strap for off-road use, padded removable divider, and padded and reinforced sides to protect fragile items, it is extremely versatile in functionality.Holds phones, wallets, keys, snacks, tools, clothing, small cameras or DSLR cameras. Reflective trim adds to low light or nighttime safety. Size adjustable clamp fits most handlebars (0.8\" - 1.3\" (22.2 mm - 31.8 mm)).The All Weather rain cover shields bag and precious cargo from the elements.SpecificationsMount:Clip-on quick-releaseRain cover:YesDimensions:11.75\" x 8.6\" x 9\"Capacity:7 LWeight:1.5 lbs.Load weight:Carries up to 11 lbs. (5 kg)", "text": "Ibera Clip-On Quick-Release Bicycle Handlebar DSLR Camera Bag with All Weather Rain Cover Protect and quickly access your cameras and gear on commutes, day trips, or extended tours. Fits large DSLRs, lenses and additional camera accessories.The lid is angled with a clear map sleeve for easy viewing of maps or even a phone. With multiple compartments, padded shoulder strap for off-road use, padded removable divider, and padded and reinforced sides to protect fragile items, it is extremely versatile in functionality.Holds phones, wallets, keys, snacks, tools, clothing, small cameras or DSLR cameras. Reflective trim adds to low light or nighttime safety. Size adjustable clamp fits most handlebars (0.8\" - 1.3\" (22.2 mm - 31.8 mm)).The All Weather rain cover shields bag and precious cargo from the elements.SpecificationsMount:Clip-on quick-releaseRain cover:YesDimensions:11.75\" x 8.6\" x 9\"Capacity:7 LWeight:1.5 lbs.Load weight:Carries up to 11 lbs. (5 kg)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jPrr58CJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0097DUIOE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ibera", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Protective Gear"]], "price": 39.99}}
