{"item_id": "B0097H8XI8", "title": "CoiTAC 4x32 Mil-dot Recticle CQB Tactical Fix Power Scope with Picatinny 1\" Ring", "description": "Most affordable high quality CoiTAC 4x32 Mil-dot tactical compact rifle scope. MAGNIFICATION: 4X OBJECTIVE DIA. MM: 32MM FINISH: BLACK LEN COATING: BLUE TUBE DIA. INCHES: 1\" LENGTH INCHES: 7.68\" WT. OUNCE: 1lbs EYE RELIEF INCHES: 3.15\"-2.75\" RETICLE Mil-dot Tacitcal 1\" Ring Included", "text": "CoiTAC 4x32 Mil-dot Recticle CQB Tactical Fix Power Scope with Picatinny 1\" Ring Most affordable high quality CoiTAC 4x32 Mil-dot tactical compact rifle scope. MAGNIFICATION: 4X OBJECTIVE DIA. MM: 32MM FINISH: BLACK LEN COATING: BLUE TUBE DIA. INCHES: 1\" LENGTH INCHES: 7.68\" WT. OUNCE: 1lbs EYE RELIEF INCHES: 3.15\"-2.75\" RETICLE Mil-dot Tacitcal 1\" Ring Included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41U0n-vxxGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0097H8XI8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 29.95}}
