{"item_id": "B0097N2HNY", "title": "Yak Gear Deluxe Anchor Trolley Kit", "description": "The Deluxe Anchor Trolley will help you stop being a victim of changing currents while fishing in the anchored position. The Yak Gear Deluxe Anchor Trolley Kit allows deployment of any anchor, drift chute, or stake out pole before judging the current and wind while still remaining in a favorable fishing position. Without a trolley you are limited to anchoring to where you can reach, causing your boat to swing back and forth. Mounted just off of one gunwale of any kayak or canoe, the deluxe trolley kit uses a nylon pulley system to select a desirable position anywhere from bow to stern, then maintains the positioning through the use of a 2-5/16 inch mini zig zag cleat. The deluxe system uses pulleys to seamlessly pass trolley rope from bow to stern, without the standard rubbing of rope along slightly less smooth pad eyes. The mounted pulleys are raised off of the boat enough to eliminate any unnecessary rubbing or scratching of the boat. As always, this complete kit comes with all stainless steel installation hardware, installation instructions and rigging tips from Yak Gear. Water proof silicone and anchor recommended, but not included.", "text": "Yak Gear Deluxe Anchor Trolley Kit The Deluxe Anchor Trolley will help you stop being a victim of changing currents while fishing in the anchored position. The Yak Gear Deluxe Anchor Trolley Kit allows deployment of any anchor, drift chute, or stake out pole before judging the current and wind while still remaining in a favorable fishing position. Without a trolley you are limited to anchoring to where you can reach, causing your boat to swing back and forth. Mounted just off of one gunwale of any kayak or canoe, the deluxe trolley kit uses a nylon pulley system to select a desirable position anywhere from bow to stern, then maintains the positioning through the use of a 2-5/16 inch mini zig zag cleat. The deluxe system uses pulleys to seamlessly pass trolley rope from bow to stern, without the standard rubbing of rope along slightly less smooth pad eyes. The mounted pulleys are raised off of the boat enough to eliminate any unnecessary rubbing or scratching of the boat. As always, this complete kit comes with all stainless steel installation hardware, installation instructions and rigging tips from Yak Gear. Water proof silicone and anchor recommended, but not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415MkaK0-rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0097N2HNY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Yak-Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing"]], "price": 29.49}}
{"item_id": "B0097NJKIE", "title": "UKARMS Tactical Airsoft Metal Mesh Goggles", "description": "UKARMS' mesh goggles are the best solution for airsofters who experience fogging issues when they wear low quality masks and goggles. Made of high strength metal, the mesh lens is able to withstand BB impacts up to 400 FPS. The mesh design allows for both visibility and breathability. You will barely notice the mesh while you are skirmishing and will not impede your field of view in any way. The goggles features an adjustable head strap to fit around heads and helmets. And features a plastic/rubber lining that will ensure secure, non-slip grip and fit.", "text": "UKARMS Tactical Airsoft Metal Mesh Goggles UKARMS' mesh goggles are the best solution for airsofters who experience fogging issues when they wear low quality masks and goggles. Made of high strength metal, the mesh lens is able to withstand BB impacts up to 400 FPS. The mesh design allows for both visibility and breathability. You will barely notice the mesh while you are skirmishing and will not impede your field of view in any way. The goggles features an adjustable head strap to fit around heads and helmets. And features a plastic/rubber lining that will ensure secure, non-slip grip and fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tFB1ki0-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0097NJKIE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B0097OJ376", "title": "UKARMS Hard Knuckle Tactical Assault Gloves", "description": "Gloves are an ideal piece of kit for any airsofter to own. Not only do they look cool, but they also help protect your hands from any hazards you might encounter on the field. Featuring a harden, reinforced knuckle - it can deflect and greatly reduce the amount of force of most impacts an airsofter might encounter while skirmishing. The gloves also have a nice goat skin palm that allows users to gain more grip on objects and is padded where it counts. Even with the addition of more padding and full-finger coverage, these gloves barely hinder the wearer's dexterity.", "text": "UKARMS Hard Knuckle Tactical Assault Gloves Gloves are an ideal piece of kit for any airsofter to own. Not only do they look cool, but they also help protect your hands from any hazards you might encounter on the field. Featuring a harden, reinforced knuckle - it can deflect and greatly reduce the amount of force of most impacts an airsofter might encounter while skirmishing. The gloves also have a nice goat skin palm that allows users to gain more grip on objects and is padded where it counts. Even with the addition of more padding and full-finger coverage, these gloves barely hinder the wearer's dexterity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tiEZcQfbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0097OJ376.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0097UJKPA", "title": "Type-III 3/8\" Side Release Contoured Buckles for Paracord Bracelets (Ships from USA)", "description": "These heavy duty plastic buckles are perfect for paracord bracelets. The 3/8\" loop fits two strands of 550 cord. They measure just over 1\" long and are slightly contoured to fit your wrist comfortably. The side release design is specifically made for bracelets.These are not break-away buckles, and are not recommended for pet collars.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "text": "Type-III 3/8\" Side Release Contoured Buckles for Paracord Bracelets (Ships from USA) These heavy duty plastic buckles are perfect for paracord bracelets. The 3/8\" loop fits two strands of 550 cord. They measure just over 1\" long and are slightly contoured to fit your wrist comfortably. The side release design is specifically made for bracelets.These are not break-away buckles, and are not recommended for pet collars.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414ob2PTqeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0097UJKPA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
