{"item_id": "B0098HR0RC", "title": "Weber 1211001 Jumbo Joe Gold Charcoal Grill, 18-Inch", "description": "Need a larger cooking surface from a portable grill? Tailgaters, campers and all grillers on-the-go will appreciate the Jumbo Joe Gold – an extra large, but still very portable, charcoal grill.", "text": "Weber 1211001 Jumbo Joe Gold Charcoal Grill, 18-Inch Need a larger cooking surface from a portable grill? Tailgaters, campers and all grillers on-the-go will appreciate the Jumbo Joe Gold – an extra large, but still very portable, charcoal grill.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gy9ehdRXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0098HR0RC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B0098IDDQS", "title": "SecurityIng® Super Bright 3 x CREE XPG R5 1800Lm 3 Models White LED Bike Lamp, Cree LED Solid Bicycle Light and Powerful Riding Lamp Light with 4400mAh Rechargeable Battery Pack, US Plug Charger Set For Outdoor Hiking, Riding, Camping and Other Activites", "description": "Specifications:Type: Bicycle/Bike Light.Bulb Type: XPG R5 LED.Number of LEDs: 3.Lasting Lighting Hour:2-3hours.Material:aluminum alloy.Reflector:Aluminum Smooth/SMO Reflector.Battery:18650 lithium cell,4400mA,Cable Length:67.5cm/26.57inch.Discharge Time:180 minutes (100% brightness).LED Colour: White.Input Voltage:8.4V-12V.Power Rating:10W.Intelligent circuit control, 3 Mode Switch:1) high light:circuit 2800mA,brightness 1800LM.2) low light: the circuit 1500mA,brightness 300LM.3) strobe mode: circuit 2800mA,brightness 1800LM.With LED indication for Power On, Charging, Full charge.Power Source: 1 x 8.4v 4400mAh Battery Pack.Working Time: 2 ~ 3 hours after full charging.Charging:- 100V ~ 240V Battery Charger.- Charging Note: You should charge the battery pack at least 2 hours for the first time Charger:Input:100-240V,50/60HZ,,0.35AMAX,Output:8.4V,1A,Cable Length:140cm/55.11inch.Lamp Cable Length:26.57oz/67.5cm.Demension:4.1x4.1x5.5cm/1.61 x 1.61 x 2.17inch(L x W x H).What's In The Box:1 x CREE 3 x CREE XPG R5 1800Lm Bicycle Lamp bike light.1 x 8.4v 4400mAh Battery pack.1 x US plug charger.1 x Bicycle Light Holder Bracket.ePathDirect After Service: 30 Days Money Back Guarantee, 12 Months Warranty!Pls note:ePathDirect is the owner of trademark SecurityIng, only purchasing from ePathDirect that you can get 100%quality guarantee,and you can receive it just within 3-5 working days.", "text": "SecurityIng® Super Bright 3 x CREE XPG R5 1800Lm 3 Models White LED Bike Lamp, Cree LED Solid Bicycle Light and Powerful Riding Lamp Light with 4400mAh Rechargeable Battery Pack, US Plug Charger Set For Outdoor Hiking, Riding, Camping and Other Activites Specifications:Type: Bicycle/Bike Light.Bulb Type: XPG R5 LED.Number of LEDs: 3.Lasting Lighting Hour:2-3hours.Material:aluminum alloy.Reflector:Aluminum Smooth/SMO Reflector.Battery:18650 lithium cell,4400mA,Cable Length:67.5cm/26.57inch.Discharge Time:180 minutes (100% brightness).LED Colour: White.Input Voltage:8.4V-12V.Power Rating:10W.Intelligent circuit control, 3 Mode Switch:1) high light:circuit 2800mA,brightness 1800LM.2) low light: the circuit 1500mA,brightness 300LM.3) strobe mode: circuit 2800mA,brightness 1800LM.With LED indication for Power On, Charging, Full charge.Power Source: 1 x 8.4v 4400mAh Battery Pack.Working Time: 2 ~ 3 hours after full charging.Charging:- 100V ~ 240V Battery Charger.- Charging Note: You should charge the battery pack at least 2 hours for the first time Charger:Input:100-240V,50/60HZ,,0.35AMAX,Output:8.4V,1A,Cable Length:140cm/55.11inch.Lamp Cable Length:26.57oz/67.5cm.Demension:4.1x4.1x5.5cm/1.61 x 1.61 x 2.17inch(L x W x H).What's In The Box:1 x CREE 3 x CREE XPG R5 1800Lm Bicycle Lamp bike light.1 x 8.4v 4400mAh Battery pack.1 x US plug charger.1 x Bicycle Light Holder Bracket.ePathDirect After Service: 30 Days Money Back Guarantee, 12 Months Warranty!Pls note:ePathDirect is the owner of trademark SecurityIng, only purchasing from ePathDirect that you can get 100%quality guarantee,and you can receive it just within 3-5 working days.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ohBkqeLGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0098IDDQS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B0098IW9JU", "title": "Portable Water Heater - SunRocket Solar Thermos and Kettle - Boil Water With Only Sunlight", "description": "SunRocket Solar Kettle Using the latest in solar thermal technology, the SunRocket uses an evacuated tube, boosted by reflective panels to heat and boil water. When opened it can heat water in as little as 30 minutes (weather dependent) and then closes to act like a thermos, keeping water hot for hours. The SunRocket is perfect for home energy saving, camping, picnics, sports events, fishing, boating or disaster preparation. The SunRocket is an essential part of any emergency preparation or first aid pack. It can melt snow, pasturise stream water or make sterile water for medical use through heat treatment. The SunRocket is scratch and weather resistant, compact and lightweight. The SunRocket is made from quality materials under ethical and environmentally sensitive manufacturing processes. Great gift idea for those hard to buy for! Specifications: Dimensions: 45x11x11cm (17.7x4.3x4.3 inches) Volume: 500ml (17oz) Weight: 1kg (2.2lbs) Materials: Evacuated vacuum glass tube made from Vycor glass (95% silica, high temperature and thermal shock resistant) and copper / aluminium absorption. Reflective aluminium panels, high quality scratch and weather resistant plastics, pressure release valve.", "text": "Portable Water Heater - SunRocket Solar Thermos and Kettle - Boil Water With Only Sunlight SunRocket Solar Kettle Using the latest in solar thermal technology, the SunRocket uses an evacuated tube, boosted by reflective panels to heat and boil water. When opened it can heat water in as little as 30 minutes (weather dependent) and then closes to act like a thermos, keeping water hot for hours. The SunRocket is perfect for home energy saving, camping, picnics, sports events, fishing, boating or disaster preparation. The SunRocket is an essential part of any emergency preparation or first aid pack. It can melt snow, pasturise stream water or make sterile water for medical use through heat treatment. The SunRocket is scratch and weather resistant, compact and lightweight. The SunRocket is made from quality materials under ethical and environmentally sensitive manufacturing processes. Great gift idea for those hard to buy for! Specifications: Dimensions: 45x11x11cm (17.7x4.3x4.3 inches) Volume: 500ml (17oz) Weight: 1kg (2.2lbs) Materials: Evacuated vacuum glass tube made from Vycor glass (95% silica, high temperature and thermal shock resistant) and copper / aluminium absorption. Reflective aluminium panels, high quality scratch and weather resistant plastics, pressure release valve.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v5oQoOcFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0098IW9JU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SunRocket", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 50.99}}
