{"item_id": "B0099UYYD6", "title": "7.5\" Black Batman Dark Knight Twin Blade Batarang Style Pocket Knife", "description": "The same knife as the ever so popular Twin Blade Batarang Style knife, we are pleased to announce the mini version of the item. This knife is truly a knife to behold. It is well built on a solid stainless with metal bolts holding it down while it offers its uses an assisted action open mechanism with each blade. Each blade is made from a thick 440 stainless steel black anodize finish and comes razor sharp. It has a liner locking mechanism for a safe opening and closing. The Double Bladed Assisted Action Open Black Bat Pocket Knife comes with the belt clip and sports an ambidextrous thumb-studs on both blades. Specifications: Overall Length: 7.5 inch Open Blade Length: 2.5 inch Closed: 3.5\"", "text": "7.5\" Black Batman Dark Knight Twin Blade Batarang Style Pocket Knife The same knife as the ever so popular Twin Blade Batarang Style knife, we are pleased to announce the mini version of the item. This knife is truly a knife to behold. It is well built on a solid stainless with metal bolts holding it down while it offers its uses an assisted action open mechanism with each blade. Each blade is made from a thick 440 stainless steel black anodize finish and comes razor sharp. It has a liner locking mechanism for a safe opening and closing. The Double Bladed Assisted Action Open Black Bat Pocket Knife comes with the belt clip and sports an ambidextrous thumb-studs on both blades. Specifications: Overall Length: 7.5 inch Open Blade Length: 2.5 inch Closed: 3.5\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31S9NydrAwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0099UYYD6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Swordsaxe", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B0099XIJKC", "title": "Hammers 3-9x40AO Magnum Spring Air Gun Rifle Scope with One Piece Mount", "description": "Hammers 3-9x40AO Air Rifle Scope with One-Piece Mount-Variable 3x-9x power and 40mm parallex adjustable objective.-MilDot reticle.-Standard 1inch one-piece main tube.-Fingertight windage/elevation adjustments.-Internally reinforced to stand the unique shocking from piston type high power air rifle.-One piece airgun mount with 3 clamping screws plus built-in removable stop pin helps the scope to stay in place against powerful shocking during shooting.-Integral rings for better alignment of the scope.-Fits onto 3/8\" & 11mm dovetail rail or groove on top of the receiver.-Anodized black matte finish.-Overall Length: 13 1/2\".", "text": "Hammers 3-9x40AO Magnum Spring Air Gun Rifle Scope with One Piece Mount Hammers 3-9x40AO Air Rifle Scope with One-Piece Mount-Variable 3x-9x power and 40mm parallex adjustable objective.-MilDot reticle.-Standard 1inch one-piece main tube.-Fingertight windage/elevation adjustments.-Internally reinforced to stand the unique shocking from piston type high power air rifle.-One piece airgun mount with 3 clamping screws plus built-in removable stop pin helps the scope to stay in place against powerful shocking during shooting.-Integral rings for better alignment of the scope.-Fits onto 3/8\" & 11mm dovetail rail or groove on top of the receiver.-Anodized black matte finish.-Overall Length: 13 1/2\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WYt-y8XyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0099XIJKC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Tools & Accessories", "Mounts"]], "price": 57.9}}
{"item_id": "B0099XTLUO", "title": "Hammers AR15 1-4x20 Compact Short CQB Tactical Rifle Scope w/ One Piece Offset Mount", "description": "Hammers 1-4x20 MT223Hammers 1-4x20mm MT223 is the ideal scope of a super-wide field of view and extra long eye relief for rapid-fire precision out to 200 yards. If you are looking for reliable shooting accuracy, Hammers 1-4x20 gives you a new level of shooting confidence. Designed for carbines and popular 3 gun competitions, Hammers 1-4x20 with its CQB reticle features an extremely large exit pupil for low light performance and a super wide field of view. The highly visible CQB reticle is accurate and fast shooting from zero to 200 yards and its purpose-designed 3-MOA center dot gives instant targeting on paper or steel plates.Reticle: CQB: 20moa circle & 3moa center dotMagnification: 1x-4xEffective Objective Diameter: 20mmExit Pupil (mm): 4 (@4x)Eye Relief (in.): 4.5\"-5\"FOV at 100 yds (ft.): 77.1-23.3Tube Diameter: 1 inchObjective O.D. (mm/in): 25.4/1Eyepiece O.D. (mm/in): 41.50/1.63Length (in): 9 \"Weight : 17oz.Adjustment Graduation (1 click): 1/2 MOAMax Internal Adjustment: 150 MOAParallax setting (yds): 100Features:• 4-time zoom and 4.5-5 inches of extra long eye relief• Etched glass CQB reticle: 20moa circle plus 3moa dot• Finger adjustable elevation and windage screws• Compact and lightweight: 9 1/2inch full length• Two color RED/GREEN illumination when better contrast is needed under low light conditions.• High quality lens give crystal clear view picture of targets• One-piece main body tubes: For minimum weight and maximum strength and durability• Waterproof, fogproof, shockproof: Nitrogen-filled and O-ring sealed• Bungee corded lens caps included• Battery used: One CR2032 Lithium cell (included)• Scope comes packaged with one piece offset scope mount: mount center height 30mm; Offset length: 37mm", "text": "Hammers AR15 1-4x20 Compact Short CQB Tactical Rifle Scope w/ One Piece Offset Mount Hammers 1-4x20 MT223Hammers 1-4x20mm MT223 is the ideal scope of a super-wide field of view and extra long eye relief for rapid-fire precision out to 200 yards. If you are looking for reliable shooting accuracy, Hammers 1-4x20 gives you a new level of shooting confidence. Designed for carbines and popular 3 gun competitions, Hammers 1-4x20 with its CQB reticle features an extremely large exit pupil for low light performance and a super wide field of view. The highly visible CQB reticle is accurate and fast shooting from zero to 200 yards and its purpose-designed 3-MOA center dot gives instant targeting on paper or steel plates.Reticle: CQB: 20moa circle & 3moa center dotMagnification: 1x-4xEffective Objective Diameter: 20mmExit Pupil (mm): 4 (@4x)Eye Relief (in.): 4.5\"-5\"FOV at 100 yds (ft.): 77.1-23.3Tube Diameter: 1 inchObjective O.D. (mm/in): 25.4/1Eyepiece O.D. (mm/in): 41.50/1.63Length (in): 9 \"Weight : 17oz.Adjustment Graduation (1 click): 1/2 MOAMax Internal Adjustment: 150 MOAParallax setting (yds): 100Features:• 4-time zoom and 4.5-5 inches of extra long eye relief• Etched glass CQB reticle: 20moa circle plus 3moa dot• Finger adjustable elevation and windage screws• Compact and lightweight: 9 1/2inch full length• Two color RED/GREEN illumination when better contrast is needed under low light conditions.• High quality lens give crystal clear view picture of targets• One-piece main body tubes: For minimum weight and maximum strength and durability• Waterproof, fogproof, shockproof: Nitrogen-filled and O-ring sealed• Bungee corded lens caps included• Battery used: One CR2032 Lithium cell (included)• Scope comes packaged with one piece offset scope mount: mount center height 30mm; Offset length: 37mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NEo3lWeNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0099XTLUO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hammers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 88.0}}
{"item_id": "B0099YZ05I", "title": "Under Armour Men's UA Tactical Liner Gloves", "description": "WARNING! This product will melt when exposed to extreme heat or open flames, posing a risk of serious injury where melted product comes into contact with skin. Dual-layer fabric gives you a soft, ultra-warm interior and a slick, fast-drying exterior. 4-way stretch fabrication allows greater mobility and maintains shape. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the hand. Anti-odor technology prevents the growth of odor causing microbes. Silicone palm for grip. Tonal logo for use with a uniform. 6.8 oz. Nylon/Polyester/Elastane. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Men's UA Tactical Liner Gloves WARNING! This product will melt when exposed to extreme heat or open flames, posing a risk of serious injury where melted product comes into contact with skin. Dual-layer fabric gives you a soft, ultra-warm interior and a slick, fast-drying exterior. 4-way stretch fabrication allows greater mobility and maintains shape. Signature Moisture Transport System wicks sweat away from the hand. Anti-odor technology prevents the growth of odor causing microbes. Silicone palm for grip. Tonal logo for use with a uniform. 6.8 oz. Nylon/Polyester/Elastane. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hhQh5WDML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0099YZ05I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]], "price": 24.99}}
