{"item_id": "B009A2JVFO", "title": "Ultimate Survival Technologies Base All Weather Tarp", "description": "Ultimate Survival Technologies B.A.S.E. All Weather Tarp has multi uses as a ground cloth, tarp or thermal insulation. It's also great with UST Bug Tent (Campmor sku# 85367) for protection against the elements. Lightweight and compact, the B.A.S.E. protects against sun and foul weather as well as your safety with one side that's aluminized for thermal insulation and reflectivity for signaling, the other side high-visibility orange. Includes tarp, guy lines and steel stakes and stuff sack.Includes tarp, guy lines and steel stakes and stuff sack for carrying components when not in use.Material: 68 denier polyester.Size: Expanded 6' x 8' / Packed in stuff sack 15.5\" x 3\" x 2\".Weight: 12.7 oz..", "text": "Ultimate Survival Technologies Base All Weather Tarp Ultimate Survival Technologies B.A.S.E. All Weather Tarp has multi uses as a ground cloth, tarp or thermal insulation. It's also great with UST Bug Tent (Campmor sku# 85367) for protection against the elements. Lightweight and compact, the B.A.S.E. protects against sun and foul weather as well as your safety with one side that's aluminized for thermal insulation and reflectivity for signaling, the other side high-visibility orange. Includes tarp, guy lines and steel stakes and stuff sack.Includes tarp, guy lines and steel stakes and stuff sack for carrying components when not in use.Material: 68 denier polyester.Size: Expanded 6' x 8' / Packed in stuff sack 15.5\" x 3\" x 2\".Weight: 12.7 oz..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41klHtppfaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009A2JVFO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Survival Technologies", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Tarps"]], "price": 22.37}}
{"item_id": "B009AHXZY2", "title": "Multicam Hydration Pack Drink Tube Cover", "description": "Protect and Conceal your insulated Hydration Pack Drink tube with this 36\" tube cover. The 500 Denier Cordura tube covers will fit over bare or neoprene insulated tube covers. The Cordura cover is great for concealing your drink tube. For those who have a neoprene insulated drink tube, these Cordura covers will help prevent snags from the outdoors! For maximum drink tube insulation, we recommend adding a neoprene tube cover. These drink tube covers are great for matching your Multicam Military Tactical Packs, Military Uniforms, Paintball, Airsoft, and Hunting Vests.", "text": "Multicam Hydration Pack Drink Tube Cover Protect and Conceal your insulated Hydration Pack Drink tube with this 36\" tube cover. The 500 Denier Cordura tube covers will fit over bare or neoprene insulated tube covers. The Cordura cover is great for concealing your drink tube. For those who have a neoprene insulated drink tube, these Cordura covers will help prevent snags from the outdoors! For maximum drink tube insulation, we recommend adding a neoprene tube cover. These drink tube covers are great for matching your Multicam Military Tactical Packs, Military Uniforms, Paintball, Airsoft, and Hunting Vests.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jQdXtE40L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009AHXZY2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 7.0}}
{"item_id": "B009AMPW3Y", "title": "LaserLyte NAA-VM Laser Sight for Black Widow Pistol", "description": "The VENOM laser for the Black Widow Pistol and the Mini Master by North American Arms. The ultra-concealable .22 Mag NAA pistols are now even more formidable with the addition of the just-over-half-an-ounce programmable laser. The VENOM quickly and easily mounts by simply twisting out the existing cylinder pin and twist in the new LaserLyte integrated laser and cylinder pin configuration. The VENOM integrated laser holds the tiny 4x377 batteries, the switch and laser all in one compact package (less than two Inch). The VENOM adds very little bulk to the gun, yet provides the user with the gained confidence of aiming accuracy. No sighting in is required with the VENOM due to the fixed-point-of-aim provided at the LaserLyte factory. The minuscule circuitry within the LaserLyte VENOM laser holds a programmable laser with: constant on, pulse mode and an auto-off after 6 minutes. The battery life is five hours in constant on and ten hours in the pulse mode.", "text": "LaserLyte NAA-VM Laser Sight for Black Widow Pistol The VENOM laser for the Black Widow Pistol and the Mini Master by North American Arms. The ultra-concealable .22 Mag NAA pistols are now even more formidable with the addition of the just-over-half-an-ounce programmable laser. The VENOM quickly and easily mounts by simply twisting out the existing cylinder pin and twist in the new LaserLyte integrated laser and cylinder pin configuration. The VENOM integrated laser holds the tiny 4x377 batteries, the switch and laser all in one compact package (less than two Inch). The VENOM adds very little bulk to the gun, yet provides the user with the gained confidence of aiming accuracy. No sighting in is required with the VENOM due to the fixed-point-of-aim provided at the LaserLyte factory. The minuscule circuitry within the LaserLyte VENOM laser holds a programmable laser with: constant on, pulse mode and an auto-off after 6 minutes. The battery life is five hours in constant on and ten hours in the pulse mode.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319awYUqOIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009AMPW3Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 106.98}}
{"item_id": "B009AMPWRU", "title": "LaserLyte CM-15 Center Mass Kryptonyte Laser Sight", "description": "The Kryptonyte Center Mass Laser; an industry-first, laser system displaying a ring of green laser dots surrounding the center aiming laser for rifle and shotgun. Developed to decrease target acquisition time and increase levels of accuracy for rifles and shotguns with a Picatinny rail (3 Inch or longer), the LaserLyte CM-15 helps the user quickly center the shot within the ring. The CM-15 projects a ring of 8 green laser dots with one green laser dot in the center as the aiming laser. The circle grows at one-inch per yard, approximately the same configuration as a shotgun aimed at a moving target. The green laser, which aids in daylight visibility, gives the user the advantage of a wide field-of-view while using both eyes for aiming. The user-friendly, military-styled laser with clear laser engraved markings has a recessed activation selector that can be changed to off, constant on and momentary on. The remote switch is used with the 10-inch length, 2-inch tape switch area with copper braided cord.", "text": "LaserLyte CM-15 Center Mass Kryptonyte Laser Sight The Kryptonyte Center Mass Laser; an industry-first, laser system displaying a ring of green laser dots surrounding the center aiming laser for rifle and shotgun. Developed to decrease target acquisition time and increase levels of accuracy for rifles and shotguns with a Picatinny rail (3 Inch or longer), the LaserLyte CM-15 helps the user quickly center the shot within the ring. The CM-15 projects a ring of 8 green laser dots with one green laser dot in the center as the aiming laser. The circle grows at one-inch per yard, approximately the same configuration as a shotgun aimed at a moving target. The green laser, which aids in daylight visibility, gives the user the advantage of a wide field-of-view while using both eyes for aiming. The user-friendly, military-styled laser with clear laser engraved markings has a recessed activation selector that can be changed to off, constant on and momentary on. The remote switch is used with the 10-inch length, 2-inch tape switch area with copper braided cord.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21lCvuMi7hL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009AMPWRU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 240.6}}
{"item_id": "B009AO19MK", "title": "TOAKS Titanium Spork", "description": "Ultralight titanium spork with matte finish handle.", "text": "TOAKS Titanium Spork Ultralight titanium spork with matte finish handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PEZ9bGpyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009AO19MK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Flatware"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B009AP2ZFY", "title": "TOAKS Titanium 375ml Cup", "description": "Titanium cup is light and strong, corrosion-resistant and lasts for years. Rounded bottom edges make cleaning easy and improves heating efficiency. Handles fold away for compact storage. Titanium leaves no metallic smell or taste. Comes with a mesh storage sack.", "text": "TOAKS Titanium 375ml Cup Titanium cup is light and strong, corrosion-resistant and lasts for years. Rounded bottom edges make cleaning easy and improves heating efficiency. Handles fold away for compact storage. Titanium leaves no metallic smell or taste. Comes with a mesh storage sack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41esHFL3QJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009AP2ZFY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B009APIWUQ", "title": "Cycling Bike Bicycle BMX Chain Whip Wheel Sprocket Remove Tool", "description": "Features:* Silver color chain whip w/ red non-slip coated handle for comfort and ease of use.* It is constructed from steel for durability.Specification:* Material: 45# Carbon Steel* Surface finish: Nickel Plating* Color: Silver and Red* Weight: 266g* Size: 29.1 x 2.7(red handle) x 2.1(silver chain whip widest part) cmPackage contents:* 1 X Bicycle Chain Whip Wheel Sprocket Remove Tool", "text": "Cycling Bike Bicycle BMX Chain Whip Wheel Sprocket Remove Tool Features:* Silver color chain whip w/ red non-slip coated handle for comfort and ease of use.* It is constructed from steel for durability.Specification:* Material: 45# Carbon Steel* Surface finish: Nickel Plating* Color: Silver and Red* Weight: 266g* Size: 29.1 x 2.7(red handle) x 2.1(silver chain whip widest part) cmPackage contents:* 1 X Bicycle Chain Whip Wheel Sprocket Remove Tool", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q9w37selL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009APIWUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Neewer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 8.52}}
{"item_id": "B009ATM0UK", "title": "As Seen On Tv Olde Brooklyn Lantern", "description": "Olde Brooklyn Lantern the vintage style lantern with today's LED lighting technology. Now you can enjoy the soft light of an antique lantern without the danger of an open flame. The Olde Brooklyn Lantern, as seen on TV, stays cool to the touch and has a built-in dimmer. The Old Brooklyn Lantern has 9 ultra-bright LED bulbs that last up to 100,000 hours. This lantern is crafted just like antique lanterns from genuine metal so you're sure to enjoy it for many years to come. Uses 2 D\" batteries (not included). The Olde Brooklyn Lantern's dimensions are: 6.5\" wide x 4.5\" deep x 9.5\" high (14\" high when using swing-up handle). Great for the home, camping, patio and more! Buy the Olde Brooklyn Lantern today!Features", "text": "As Seen On Tv Olde Brooklyn Lantern Olde Brooklyn Lantern the vintage style lantern with today's LED lighting technology. Now you can enjoy the soft light of an antique lantern without the danger of an open flame. The Olde Brooklyn Lantern, as seen on TV, stays cool to the touch and has a built-in dimmer. The Old Brooklyn Lantern has 9 ultra-bright LED bulbs that last up to 100,000 hours. This lantern is crafted just like antique lanterns from genuine metal so you're sure to enjoy it for many years to come. Uses 2 D\" batteries (not included). The Olde Brooklyn Lantern's dimensions are: 6.5\" wide x 4.5\" deep x 9.5\" high (14\" high when using swing-up handle). Great for the home, camping, patio and more! Buy the Olde Brooklyn Lantern today!Features", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41N5YaJk%2B4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ATM0UK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "As Seen On TV", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 10.47}}
{"item_id": "B009AVOH7M", "title": "Tagua Gunleather Taurus 709 Slim Inside Pants Gun Holster, Black, Right Hand", "description": "This holster is designed to be worn inside the waistband. The reinforced saddle leather construction allow the holster to retain its shape when the handgun is removed. It features a combat grip, a clip on design and an open muzzle design.", "text": "Tagua Gunleather Taurus 709 Slim Inside Pants Gun Holster, Black, Right Hand This holster is designed to be worn inside the waistband. The reinforced saddle leather construction allow the holster to retain its shape when the handgun is removed. It features a combat grip, a clip on design and an open muzzle design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316C80JIf%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009AVOH7M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tagua Gunleather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 31.61}}
{"item_id": "B009B1SB78", "title": "750 Paracord - 5col Survival Supply: US Military Spec MIL-C-5040h & PIA-C-5040 Type IV Nylon Parachute Cord", "description": "5col Survival Supply MIL-C-5040h & PIA-C-5040 Type IV Paracord is the highest quality parachute cord available anywhere. Our Type IV 750 cord is suitable for use in parachutes, and a factory certificate of conformance is available (upon request) for all 5col Survival Supply cord. 5col Survival Supply paracord is manufactured in the United States by a company that supplies parachutes and related supplies to the US military. The cord for sale here is typically used to rig cargo parachutes. Why settle for less when you can have the best, strongest, and most reliable paracord on the market?", "text": "750 Paracord - 5col Survival Supply: US Military Spec MIL-C-5040h & PIA-C-5040 Type IV Nylon Parachute Cord 5col Survival Supply MIL-C-5040h & PIA-C-5040 Type IV Paracord is the highest quality parachute cord available anywhere. Our Type IV 750 cord is suitable for use in parachutes, and a factory certificate of conformance is available (upon request) for all 5col Survival Supply cord. 5col Survival Supply paracord is manufactured in the United States by a company that supplies parachutes and related supplies to the US military. The cord for sale here is typically used to rig cargo parachutes. Why settle for less when you can have the best, strongest, and most reliable paracord on the market?", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61tklhpCJBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009B1SB78.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
