{"item_id": "B009BA447U", "title": "Apocalyptic Decapitator Sword (Zombies)", "description": "Add it to your emergency bug-out bag, apocalypse kit, 2012 survival gear! Razor sharp 440 Stainless Steel makes this blade a useful cutting tool for your targets, or wall display. This sword is so sharp, you just might want to shave with it. The unique clip point and very powerful at piercing through any surface. Slice and dice your target of choice. Three cutouts are incorporated into the blade, one of which is wrapped to the spine with nylon. Both leather and burgundy nylon make the grip easy and natural to handle. Two cutouts are balanced on the pommel. A thick nylon sheath with shoulder strap is included free.", "text": "Apocalyptic Decapitator Sword (Zombies) Add it to your emergency bug-out bag, apocalypse kit, 2012 survival gear! Razor sharp 440 Stainless Steel makes this blade a useful cutting tool for your targets, or wall display. This sword is so sharp, you just might want to shave with it. The unique clip point and very powerful at piercing through any surface. Slice and dice your target of choice. Three cutouts are incorporated into the blade, one of which is wrapped to the spine with nylon. Both leather and burgundy nylon make the grip easy and natural to handle. Two cutouts are balanced on the pommel. A thick nylon sheath with shoulder strap is included free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414V1qsfUNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009BA447U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Armory Replicas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 26.95}}
{"item_id": "B009BA47OU", "title": "US WWII Bayonet M1 Garand Rifle Knife", "description": "Azan World War II Knife Bayonet - thick carbon steel and prepared for cutting, stabbing, and survival. If you like WWII stuff, this bayonet reflects all of the heritage you can cherish. It is replicated from the original WWII Garand M1 assault rifle bayonet. The 22 inch carbon steel blade is finished black. The bayonet blade features a blood groove, like one that was used on the battlefield. Since the carbon steel blade is treated with an oxide coating it will resist rust and deterioration. The guard on this knife has been cast from stainless steel and antiqued to match the blade. The shape of the guard is actually symbolic for the bayonet, making it a classic and recognizable by a true WWII collector. The black ABS handle is pinned to the blade with a durable rivet. It has a 5mm thick blade that is very strong and ready for use. This bayonet will ship with an authentically styled sheath that is also uniquely made to match this bayonet. \"U. S. \" is engraved on the sheath.", "text": "US WWII Bayonet M1 Garand Rifle Knife Azan World War II Knife Bayonet - thick carbon steel and prepared for cutting, stabbing, and survival. If you like WWII stuff, this bayonet reflects all of the heritage you can cherish. It is replicated from the original WWII Garand M1 assault rifle bayonet. The 22 inch carbon steel blade is finished black. The bayonet blade features a blood groove, like one that was used on the battlefield. Since the carbon steel blade is treated with an oxide coating it will resist rust and deterioration. The guard on this knife has been cast from stainless steel and antiqued to match the blade. The shape of the guard is actually symbolic for the bayonet, making it a classic and recognizable by a true WWII collector. The black ABS handle is pinned to the blade with a durable rivet. It has a 5mm thick blade that is very strong and ready for use. This bayonet will ship with an authentically styled sheath that is also uniquely made to match this bayonet. \"U. S. \" is engraved on the sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410HpF3cjqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009BA47OU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Armory Replicas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 27.78}}
{"item_id": "B009BA4DO4", "title": "Denzel Washington The Book Of Eli Sword Large", "description": "Straight out of The Book Of Eli, this is a replica of the massive 26 inch blade carried by Denzel Washington and it comes fully sharpened and wrapped with faux leather with a genuine leather sheath with belt loop and shoulder strap.", "text": "Denzel Washington The Book Of Eli Sword Large Straight out of The Book Of Eli, this is a replica of the massive 26 inch blade carried by Denzel Washington and it comes fully sharpened and wrapped with faux leather with a genuine leather sheath with belt loop and shoulder strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bzZNH-s1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009BA4DO4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Armory Replicas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 28.45}}
