{"item_id": "B009DHD7CY", "title": "AlphaHolster Belly Gun Holster - Abdominal Band Pistol Holster", "description": "The AlphaHolster belly holster discreetly and securely holds your concealed hand gun close to the body under the clothes. When worn under a golf shirt or t-shirt it's hard to tell you are even caring, even when you ware your shirt tucked in. The AlphaHolster is made from patented ventilated elastic and secures in the front with Velcro. Your small to medium sized firearm fits snugly and securely into the pocket and there it a strap that fastens over the back of the gun. There are two additional holsters for extra clips. This product is very lightweight, breathable, simple and secure. Made in USA.Size GuideFor correct size measure around the abdomenSmall 28\"-34\"Medium 34\"-40\"Large 40\"-46\"X-Large 46\"-52\"", "text": "AlphaHolster Belly Gun Holster - Abdominal Band Pistol Holster The AlphaHolster belly holster discreetly and securely holds your concealed hand gun close to the body under the clothes. When worn under a golf shirt or t-shirt it's hard to tell you are even caring, even when you ware your shirt tucked in. The AlphaHolster is made from patented ventilated elastic and secures in the front with Velcro. Your small to medium sized firearm fits snugly and securely into the pocket and there it a strap that fastens over the back of the gun. There are two additional holsters for extra clips. This product is very lightweight, breathable, simple and secure. Made in USA.Size GuideFor correct size measure around the abdomenSmall 28\"-34\"Medium 34\"-40\"Large 40\"-46\"X-Large 46\"-52\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uzxyBDMDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009DHD7CY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009DIXZUC", "title": "STICKY HOLSTER Medium Size Autos 2 to 3.3\" barrel IWB or Pocket (MD-2)", "description": "This Sticky Holster is a self-securing, modular, state of the art in-the-waist band (IWB) and pocket holster that use the compression of your waistband against your body to secure both holster and weapon. This holster is ambidextrous (left or right) and is easy to deploy and adjust in seconds No bulky clips or straps to get in the way, and it is extremely lightweight (less than 3 oz.) This MD-2 Holster fits small semi-autos up to 3.3\" barrel length.", "text": "STICKY HOLSTER Medium Size Autos 2 to 3.3\" barrel IWB or Pocket (MD-2) This Sticky Holster is a self-securing, modular, state of the art in-the-waist band (IWB) and pocket holster that use the compression of your waistband against your body to secure both holster and weapon. This holster is ambidextrous (left or right) and is easy to deploy and adjust in seconds No bulky clips or straps to get in the way, and it is extremely lightweight (less than 3 oz.) This MD-2 Holster fits small semi-autos up to 3.3\" barrel length.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Qv-JT9YyL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009DIXZUC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sticky Holsters", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B009DJCQIS", "title": "STICKY HOLSTER Baby Glocks - Medium Autos up to 3.6\" barrel. IWB or Pocket (MD-4)", "description": "This Sticky Holster is a self-securing, modular, state of the art in-the-waist band (IWB) and pocket holster that use the compression of your waistband against your body to secure both holster and weapon. This holster is ambidextrous (left or right) and is easy to deploy and adjust in seconds No bulky clips or straps to get in the way, and it is extremely lightweight (less than 3 oz. This holster MD-4 fits semi auto pistols up to 3.6\" barrel length.", "text": "STICKY HOLSTER Baby Glocks - Medium Autos up to 3.6\" barrel. IWB or Pocket (MD-4) This Sticky Holster is a self-securing, modular, state of the art in-the-waist band (IWB) and pocket holster that use the compression of your waistband against your body to secure both holster and weapon. This holster is ambidextrous (left or right) and is easy to deploy and adjust in seconds No bulky clips or straps to get in the way, and it is extremely lightweight (less than 3 oz. This holster MD-4 fits semi auto pistols up to 3.6\" barrel length.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yPZm2Lf9L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009DJCQIS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sticky Holsters", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B009DJE488", "title": "STICKY HOLSTER Small - Medium Autos up to 3.3\" barrel. IWB or Pocket (MD-1)", "description": "This Sticky Holster is a self-securing, modular, state of the art in-the-waist band (IWB) and pocket holster that use the compression of your waistband against your body to secure both holster and weapon. This holster is ambidextrous (left or right) and is easy to deploy and adjust in seconds No bulky clips or straps to get in the way, and it is extremely lightweight (less than 3 oz.) This MD-1 Holster fits small semi-autos up to 3.5\" barrel length.", "text": "STICKY HOLSTER Small - Medium Autos up to 3.3\" barrel. IWB or Pocket (MD-1) This Sticky Holster is a self-securing, modular, state of the art in-the-waist band (IWB) and pocket holster that use the compression of your waistband against your body to secure both holster and weapon. This holster is ambidextrous (left or right) and is easy to deploy and adjust in seconds No bulky clips or straps to get in the way, and it is extremely lightweight (less than 3 oz.) This MD-1 Holster fits small semi-autos up to 3.5\" barrel length.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O5Wpmh11L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009DJE488.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sticky Holsters", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B009DKRZC4", "title": "Hip Holster with Magazine Pouch for Ruger SR22 with Underbarrel Laser", "description": "This is a brand new holster that combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Hip Holster with Magazine Pouch for Ruger SR22 with Underbarrel Laser This is a brand new holster that combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. An extra magazine pouch mounted on the front channel of the holster is standard. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51h1hEbpIGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009DKRZC4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.9}}
{"item_id": "B009DP8CLM", "title": "Redfield 117851 BattleZone Fog and Waterproof Rifle Scope with 9X Magnification and 42-Millimeter Objective Lens, Black Matte Finish", "description": "The Redfield 117851 BattleZone Fog and Waterproof Rifle Scope features a weather-sealed housing and Tac-MOA ballistic reticle. This close to mid-range scope uses Redfield's advanced fully multicoated lens system to produce high-contrast views that are bright throughout the zoom range.", "text": "Redfield 117851 BattleZone Fog and Waterproof Rifle Scope with 9X Magnification and 42-Millimeter Objective Lens, Black Matte Finish The Redfield 117851 BattleZone Fog and Waterproof Rifle Scope features a weather-sealed housing and Tac-MOA ballistic reticle. This close to mid-range scope uses Redfield's advanced fully multicoated lens system to produce high-contrast views that are bright throughout the zoom range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dnVo83UPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009DP8CLM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Redfield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 164.76}}
{"item_id": "B009EEMU1K", "title": "Panteo Productions Make Ready with Sonny Puzikas Fighting with the AK Lost in Translation DVD", "description": "Sonny Puzikas, former Soviet Special Purpose unit operator reviews the myths of the AK, balancing marksmanship, speed and mobility, transitions, reloading, components of speed, marksmanship, low platform basics, and more.", "text": "Panteo Productions Make Ready with Sonny Puzikas Fighting with the AK Lost in Translation DVD Sonny Puzikas, former Soviet Special Purpose unit operator reviews the myths of the AK, balancing marksmanship, speed and mobility, transitions, reloading, components of speed, marksmanship, low platform basics, and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OicxnJzVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009EEMU1K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009ENXHJU", "title": "Cosmos ® 8 inches with Stainless Steel D Shackle Survival Bracelet Strap with Cosmos Fastening Strap (Pattern 50)", "description": "Made of high quality and capacity fiber material, with stainless steel D shackle. It's used for camping, hiking and other outdoor sports.", "text": "Cosmos ® 8 inches with Stainless Steel D Shackle Survival Bracelet Strap with Cosmos Fastening Strap (Pattern 50) Made of high quality and capacity fiber material, with stainless steel D shackle. It's used for camping, hiking and other outdoor sports.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FqDi1kWZL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ENXHJU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Sailing", "Rigging", "Shackles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009EREXNU", "title": "US Marine 1942 Knife & Sheath", "description": "This durable fighter knife is an exact replica of the Combat Fighter knives carried by United States Marines in WWII. Don't miss this opportunity to pick up this classic knife at a rock-bottom price. Hurry, this deal won't last long!", "text": "US Marine 1942 Knife & Sheath This durable fighter knife is an exact replica of the Combat Fighter knives carried by United States Marines in WWII. Don't miss this opportunity to pick up this classic knife at a rock-bottom price. Hurry, this deal won't last long!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pxn1C-rFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009EREXNU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 19.89}}
{"item_id": "B009ERKCNK", "title": "ILBE Main Pack USMC Generation 2", "description": "The main pack (rucksack) features an internal aluminum frame covered by a removable frame sheet and both back and lumbar foam pads. Features an elastic rimmed, open top side pocket and 3 adjustable side compression straps and an open flap with external MOLLE webbing on each side. The front features 8 rows of webbing and straps to connect the assault pack. The front flap can self stores straps and features a snap closure. The interior has a fold and store flap to separate gear horizontally. The shoulder straps are padded and fully adjustable. The padded, 3D molded hip belt (men's medium) is adjustable and expands approximately 32-52\". The lid is fully detachable, features 3 rows of PALS webbing and a zippered storage compartment. The detachable MARPAT radio pouch is approximately 8 x 11 and can expand to about 5″ deep. Two adjustable compression straps on each side and one on top help keep items secure. Pouch is open on both ends of bottom.", "text": "ILBE Main Pack USMC Generation 2 The main pack (rucksack) features an internal aluminum frame covered by a removable frame sheet and both back and lumbar foam pads. Features an elastic rimmed, open top side pocket and 3 adjustable side compression straps and an open flap with external MOLLE webbing on each side. The front features 8 rows of webbing and straps to connect the assault pack. The front flap can self stores straps and features a snap closure. The interior has a fold and store flap to separate gear horizontally. The shoulder straps are padded and fully adjustable. The padded, 3D molded hip belt (men's medium) is adjustable and expands approximately 32-52\". The lid is fully detachable, features 3 rows of PALS webbing and a zippered storage compartment. The detachable MARPAT radio pouch is approximately 8 x 11 and can expand to about 5″ deep. Two adjustable compression straps on each side and one on top help keep items secure. Pouch is open on both ends of bottom.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51iYjRSUW-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ERKCNK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 140.0}}
{"item_id": "B009ES1OK4", "title": "ILBE Main Pack USMC Generation 2 With Assault Pack", "description": "You are buying a Marpat Main Pack and Assault Pack only. Brand New Marpat ILBE made by Propper International Main Pack and Assault Pack Generation 2 with Hip Belt, Lid, Radio Pouch and Shoulder Straps. Hip belt Approximately 51\" fully Extended and fully adjustable for smaller waist. This is the real McCoy issued to the USMC. NSN # 8465-01-515-8620", "text": "ILBE Main Pack USMC Generation 2 With Assault Pack You are buying a Marpat Main Pack and Assault Pack only. Brand New Marpat ILBE made by Propper International Main Pack and Assault Pack Generation 2 with Hip Belt, Lid, Radio Pouch and Shoulder Straps. Hip belt Approximately 51\" fully Extended and fully adjustable for smaller waist. This is the real McCoy issued to the USMC. NSN # 8465-01-515-8620", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hUU7qiQeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ES1OK4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009EVIXLY", "title": "VENOM TACTICAL EXCLUSIVE AR15 AR 15 Front and Rear 45 Degree Rapid Transition BUIS Backup Iron Sight", "description": "For AR-15 / M16 type rifles, optical sights provide superior performance at longer ranges, but iron sights can be more effective for close-range engagements. However, attaching an optical sight either prevents the use of iron sights or results in a setup that produces a front sight \"shadow\" on the optical image, and/or results in problematic transitions from optical to backup iron sights. Not anymore. Rapid Transition Sights (RTS) provide shooters with the quickest possible transition between longer- and closer-range target acquisition, greatly increasing their efficiency and effectiveness in battle and competition. these sights mount directly to a weapon's Picatinny rail, offset from center by approximately 45. This unique offset position makes transitioning from optical to iron sights simply a matter of quickly canting the weapon with your wrists and locking on to the target. There's no removing a hand from the weapon or making a manual adjustment, and no cluttered field of vision or iron sights blocking the optical sight. Just smooth, quick transitions that could mean the difference between winning or losing a competition, or more importantly-a gunfight.", "text": "VENOM TACTICAL EXCLUSIVE AR15 AR 15 Front and Rear 45 Degree Rapid Transition BUIS Backup Iron Sight For AR-15 / M16 type rifles, optical sights provide superior performance at longer ranges, but iron sights can be more effective for close-range engagements. However, attaching an optical sight either prevents the use of iron sights or results in a setup that produces a front sight \"shadow\" on the optical image, and/or results in problematic transitions from optical to backup iron sights. Not anymore. Rapid Transition Sights (RTS) provide shooters with the quickest possible transition between longer- and closer-range target acquisition, greatly increasing their efficiency and effectiveness in battle and competition. these sights mount directly to a weapon's Picatinny rail, offset from center by approximately 45. This unique offset position makes transitioning from optical to iron sights simply a matter of quickly canting the weapon with your wrists and locking on to the target. There's no removing a hand from the weapon or making a manual adjustment, and no cluttered field of vision or iron sights blocking the optical sight. Just smooth, quick transitions that could mean the difference between winning or losing a competition, or more importantly-a gunfight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uufaUurPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009EVIXLY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Ops Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 19.58}}
{"item_id": "B009EWIQ7E", "title": "Crown Sporting Goods Stainless Steel Coach Whistle with Lanyard", "description": "No matter what sport you coach, this stainless steel coach's whistle features a bold, crisp sound each time you use it.A black lanyard is included with each whistle, so you don't have to worry about it getting lost, or finding a place to put it during a game.Unlike traditional whistles plated with nickel, our whistle is made from stainless steel, ensuring you have a top-quality product that will function for years to come.Our whistles also make great favors for goody bags or giveaways at sporting events. Additionally, the gold ball on each lanyard acts as a counter balance that helps maintain the whistle's position during physical activity.Get the attention you deserve with this coach's whistle from Crown Sporting Goods!", "text": "Crown Sporting Goods Stainless Steel Coach Whistle with Lanyard No matter what sport you coach, this stainless steel coach's whistle features a bold, crisp sound each time you use it.A black lanyard is included with each whistle, so you don't have to worry about it getting lost, or finding a place to put it during a game.Unlike traditional whistles plated with nickel, our whistle is made from stainless steel, ensuring you have a top-quality product that will function for years to come.Our whistles also make great favors for goody bags or giveaways at sporting events. Additionally, the gold ball on each lanyard acts as a counter balance that helps maintain the whistle's position during physical activity.Get the attention you deserve with this coach's whistle from Crown Sporting Goods!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dwx-OJ-PL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009EWIQ7E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crown Sporting Goods", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Coach & Referee Gear", "Whistles"]], "price": 2.99}}
{"item_id": "B009F6STIK", "title": "Pro-Tec Athletics The Y Roller Contoured Foam Roller", "description": "", "text": "Pro-Tec Athletics The Y Roller Contoured Foam Roller", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418oQA7777L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009F6STIK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro-tec Athletics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 34.66}}
{"item_id": "B009F93S9C", "title": "Ritchey Tool Torque Key", "description": "The Ritchey 5nm Torque Key provides a quick and affordable way to ensure that the correct torque is applied to your Ritchey carbon bar and WCS stem combination. This wrench is preset to 5NM. Fortunately, though, there are a plethora of other bicycle components that require a torque spec of 5NM, so it's a very useful tool for those of us who don't own Ritchey components, too. The Ritchey 5nm Torque Key includes 3mm, 4mm, 5mm, and T20 bits, and weighs in around 53 grams.", "text": "Ritchey Tool Torque Key The Ritchey 5nm Torque Key provides a quick and affordable way to ensure that the correct torque is applied to your Ritchey carbon bar and WCS stem combination. This wrench is preset to 5NM. Fortunately, though, there are a plethora of other bicycle components that require a torque spec of 5NM, so it's a very useful tool for those of us who don't own Ritchey components, too. The Ritchey 5nm Torque Key includes 3mm, 4mm, 5mm, and T20 bits, and weighs in around 53 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41D8haeyXZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009F93S9C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ritchey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 16.25}}
{"item_id": "B009F95DHC", "title": "Park Tool Big Blue Book of Bike Repair 3rd Edition - BBB-3", "description": "As good as the industry's rapid technology evolution is for our experience on the bike, the constant changes make servicing and maintenance a hassle. Thankfully, though, Park Tool's Big Blue Book of Bike Repair, 3rd Edition is a complete, up-to-date repair manual for everyone from novices to veterans. Written by Park Tool Director of Education, Calvin Jones, the Big Blue Book features step-by-step instructions on everything from trail-side repairs to major overhauls on road, mountain, and BMX bikes. The third edition adds Tubeless tire systems, 11-speed drivetrains, BB30 and PF30, along with many other detailed instructions to this respected reference book. The book also contains headset standards and SHIS standards, along with updated torque and tool tables. Keep Park Tool's 3rd Edition of the Big Blue Book of Bike Repair in your home shop and you'll have the power to tackle any repair at arms length.", "text": "Park Tool Big Blue Book of Bike Repair 3rd Edition - BBB-3 As good as the industry's rapid technology evolution is for our experience on the bike, the constant changes make servicing and maintenance a hassle. Thankfully, though, Park Tool's Big Blue Book of Bike Repair, 3rd Edition is a complete, up-to-date repair manual for everyone from novices to veterans. Written by Park Tool Director of Education, Calvin Jones, the Big Blue Book features step-by-step instructions on everything from trail-side repairs to major overhauls on road, mountain, and BMX bikes. The third edition adds Tubeless tire systems, 11-speed drivetrains, BB30 and PF30, along with many other detailed instructions to this respected reference book. The book also contains headset standards and SHIS standards, along with updated torque and tool tables. Keep Park Tool's 3rd Edition of the Big Blue Book of Bike Repair in your home shop and you'll have the power to tackle any repair at arms length.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51a6XjK5JeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009F95DHC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 22.46}}
