{"item_id": "B009FBVGDU", "title": "Self Defense Guardian Executive Tactical Ink Pen", "description": "Self defense and personal security can never be more important. Protect yourself with a solid high-craft aluminum constructed defense pen. An unsuspecting attacker will not even know what hit him. This heavy high-craft aluminum personal security pen will be more than enough to use as a defense weapon. It is heavy and sturdy enough to bust a glass window. This is also a real pen that writes in black ink and the ink cartridge is refillable or replaceable. Clip it to your pocket or belt easily with the high quality steel pocket clip. Who would even suspect a pen to be designed as a full on self defense and personal security weapon. Where your own personal safety and security is concerned, you should have an Azan Tactical Pen ready by your side.", "text": "Self Defense Guardian Executive Tactical Ink Pen Self defense and personal security can never be more important. Protect yourself with a solid high-craft aluminum constructed defense pen. An unsuspecting attacker will not even know what hit him. This heavy high-craft aluminum personal security pen will be more than enough to use as a defense weapon. It is heavy and sturdy enough to bust a glass window. This is also a real pen that writes in black ink and the ink cartridge is refillable or replaceable. Clip it to your pocket or belt easily with the high quality steel pocket clip. Who would even suspect a pen to be designed as a full on self defense and personal security weapon. Where your own personal safety and security is concerned, you should have an Azan Tactical Pen ready by your side.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ySTR0opSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009FBVGDU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Office Products", "Pens"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009FMMBPQ", "title": "Joe's USA Lacrosse Balls - All Colors (also used for Back Massage Ball Therapy)", "description": "Joe's USA Lacrosse Balls - All Colors (also used for Back Massage Ball Therapy). Vulcanized rubber, Colors: Yellow, White, Orange, Red, Blue, Works great for massaging out trigger points/muscle knots, Lacrosse Balls work wonders for back pain, Lacrosse Balls work great for back massage, Lacrosse Balls work great for dog toy balls, lacrosse ball is good as both equipment for the game lacrosse and an excellent toy for the dog. *always consult your doctor before trying something new.*Always consult your doctor before trying a new back pain treatment. *", "text": "Joe's USA Lacrosse Balls - All Colors (also used for Back Massage Ball Therapy) Joe's USA Lacrosse Balls - All Colors (also used for Back Massage Ball Therapy). Vulcanized rubber, Colors: Yellow, White, Orange, Red, Blue, Works great for massaging out trigger points/muscle knots, Lacrosse Balls work wonders for back pain, Lacrosse Balls work great for back massage, Lacrosse Balls work great for dog toy balls, lacrosse ball is good as both equipment for the game lacrosse and an excellent toy for the dog. *always consult your doctor before trying something new.*Always consult your doctor before trying a new back pain treatment. *", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31K8cQbsCWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009FMMBPQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Lacrosse", "Balls"]]}}
