{"item_id": "B009FVI7GO", "title": "Callaway X Hot Glove", "description": "Callaway Mens X Hot Glove Thin and soft cabretta leather in the palm and thumb of the Callaway Mens X Hot Glove delivers a great feel, while the smooth, synthetic, microfiber leather is durable and comfortable in any weather condition. Coolmax mesh provides moisture wicking and breathability, and the Vent Flex mesh is lightweight and flexible.", "text": "Callaway X Hot Glove Callaway Mens X Hot Glove Thin and soft cabretta leather in the palm and thumb of the Callaway Mens X Hot Glove delivers a great feel, while the smooth, synthetic, microfiber leather is durable and comfortable in any weather condition. Coolmax mesh provides moisture wicking and breathability, and the Vent Flex mesh is lightweight and flexible.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417l1UGw83L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009FVI7GO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009G8MGMW", "title": "BARSKA Red Laser with 200 Lumen Flashlight", "description": "Keep your target in sight with the 5mW red laser flashlight combo. Features include a 200 Lumen intense bright light and 5mW high power red laser sight intergraded into one compact unit with a built-in quick release weaver/picatinny mount.", "text": "BARSKA Red Laser with 200 Lumen Flashlight Keep your target in sight with the 5mW red laser flashlight combo. Features include a 200 Lumen intense bright light and 5mW high power red laser sight intergraded into one compact unit with a built-in quick release weaver/picatinny mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gmv7La6VL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009G8MGMW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 60.67}}
{"item_id": "B009GB4RNA", "title": "Condor MA61-003 MOLLE 25 Rd Shotgun Reload Pouch, Tan", "description": "TAN, Black or OD", "text": "Condor MA61-003 MOLLE 25 Rd Shotgun Reload Pouch, Tan TAN, Black or OD", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Np%2B%2BMfpHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009GB4RNA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B009GDCK5K", "title": "Armed Ops Tactical Flip to Side 30mm Tactical Qd Pivot FTS Mount with 1\" Inserts for Aimpoint, Eotech, Magnifier, Scope 3x 4x 5x Ar15 M4 + (FREE Push Button Sling Swivel)", "description": "NOW INCLUDES FREE PUSH BUTTON SLING SWIVEL! Armed Ops Tactical Flip to Side (FTS) Mount with QD, positions. The centerline of the optic is 1.6\" above the top of the rail. Tested on real firearms to ensure stability. Includes removable 1\" inserts With durability and simplicity in-mind, the spring-tensioned pivot rotates on a robust 5/16\" shaft. No buttons, no switches, no delicate places to fill with sand. You simply grab the optic one-handed, pull back, move it in-position, release, and you're good-to-go. Once it's locked into position, it does not move Fits 30mm & 25mm bodies such as the Aimpoint 3X Magnifier. Allows the Aimpoint 3X to fit over the top of most flip-up rear sights. Compatible with Aimpoint Comp M optic with a Aimpoint mount. Compatible with Eotech 512 and 552 optics mounted directly to your flat top receiver.", "text": "Armed Ops Tactical Flip to Side 30mm Tactical Qd Pivot FTS Mount with 1\" Inserts for Aimpoint, Eotech, Magnifier, Scope 3x 4x 5x Ar15 M4 + (FREE Push Button Sling Swivel) NOW INCLUDES FREE PUSH BUTTON SLING SWIVEL! Armed Ops Tactical Flip to Side (FTS) Mount with QD, positions. The centerline of the optic is 1.6\" above the top of the rail. Tested on real firearms to ensure stability. Includes removable 1\" inserts With durability and simplicity in-mind, the spring-tensioned pivot rotates on a robust 5/16\" shaft. No buttons, no switches, no delicate places to fill with sand. You simply grab the optic one-handed, pull back, move it in-position, release, and you're good-to-go. Once it's locked into position, it does not move Fits 30mm & 25mm bodies such as the Aimpoint 3X Magnifier. Allows the Aimpoint 3X to fit over the top of most flip-up rear sights. Compatible with Aimpoint Comp M optic with a Aimpoint mount. Compatible with Eotech 512 and 552 optics mounted directly to your flat top receiver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gNV5tOnzL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009GDCK5K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]]}}
