{"item_id": "B009GJX77E", "title": "Sig Sauer P938 OWB Shield NO laser Holster R/H Black - 0319", "description": "This is a custom hand made Black Holster for the Sig P938. Item #0319 This holster was made for Outside the Waistband, it has Dual 1.5\" Belt slots. This holster is made for the right hand shooter, left available as a custom order. We use 7 to 8 oz. premium leather, wet molded to fit the gun. Our recommended wearing position is 3:30 - 4:00; positioning the front of the holster with the side seam of your pants, the back of the holster towards your back pocket.", "text": "Sig Sauer P938 OWB Shield NO laser Holster R/H Black - 0319 This is a custom hand made Black Holster for the Sig P938. Item #0319 This holster was made for Outside the Waistband, it has Dual 1.5\" Belt slots. This holster is made for the right hand shooter, left available as a custom order. We use 7 to 8 oz. premium leather, wet molded to fit the gun. Our recommended wearing position is 3:30 - 4:00; positioning the front of the holster with the side seam of your pants, the back of the holster towards your back pocket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51khIGKr2%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009GJX77E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 38.95}}
{"item_id": "B009GLSSN0", "title": "B1 5.5mm 22 Caliber Air Pellet Gun Rifle Real Wood", "description": "Caliber 5.5mm Muzzle Velocity 400 FPS Overall Length 990mm Weight 2.4 KG Rifle Line 12 Strong Metal Caliber Wood body Good Quality", "text": "B1 5.5mm 22 Caliber Air Pellet Gun Rifle Real Wood Caliber 5.5mm Muzzle Velocity 400 FPS Overall Length 990mm Weight 2.4 KG Rifle Line 12 Strong Metal Caliber Wood body Good Quality", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31x04r6DJQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009GLSSN0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 65.99}}
{"item_id": "B009GLVGNO", "title": "New Air Pellet Rifle Gun B3 5.5mm 22 Caliber Real Wood", "description": "Caliber 5.5mm Muzzle Velocity 650/600 FPS Overall Length 1045mm Strong Metal Caliber Wood body Good Quality", "text": "New Air Pellet Rifle Gun B3 5.5mm 22 Caliber Real Wood Caliber 5.5mm Muzzle Velocity 650/600 FPS Overall Length 1045mm Strong Metal Caliber Wood body Good Quality", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310CECj3cDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009GLVGNO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009GMKVJI", "title": "Padded Deluxe Tactical Range and Gear Bag - Rangemaster Gear Bag", "description": "This perfectly sized bag is large enough to hold all the necessary range and duty items and compact enough that it can easily be used in the field, on duty or stored in a vehicle as a go-bag. Padding helps ensure that sensitive contents are protected and the variety of pocket types, gear loops, and compartments ensures everything has its place and is ready for quick deployment. The quick detach padded shoulder strap can quickly be removed when not in use.COMPARTMENTS & ORGANIZATION* Main dual zippered Fast Access Compartment* Two gun/weapon pockets with center support strap in Fast Access Compartment* Gear/magazine nylon elastic loops in Fast Access Compartment* Two beverage or cylindrical pockets in Fast Access Compartment* Dual exterior front pockets and ID pocket* Large front padded compartment for additional weapon or gear lined with nylon elastic gear/magazine loops* Additional weapon or gear pocket on back of bag with two interior pockets and additional nylon elastic gear loops* Two side pockets on both ends of the bag perfect for smaller items", "text": "Padded Deluxe Tactical Range and Gear Bag - Rangemaster Gear Bag This perfectly sized bag is large enough to hold all the necessary range and duty items and compact enough that it can easily be used in the field, on duty or stored in a vehicle as a go-bag. Padding helps ensure that sensitive contents are protected and the variety of pocket types, gear loops, and compartments ensures everything has its place and is ready for quick deployment. The quick detach padded shoulder strap can quickly be removed when not in use.COMPARTMENTS & ORGANIZATION* Main dual zippered Fast Access Compartment* Two gun/weapon pockets with center support strap in Fast Access Compartment* Gear/magazine nylon elastic loops in Fast Access Compartment* Two beverage or cylindrical pockets in Fast Access Compartment* Dual exterior front pockets and ID pocket* Large front padded compartment for additional weapon or gear lined with nylon elastic gear/magazine loops* Additional weapon or gear pocket on back of bag with two interior pockets and additional nylon elastic gear loops* Two side pockets on both ends of the bag perfect for smaller items", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mzHT7UeaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009GMKVJI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Explorer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 48.94}}
{"item_id": "B009GSLUR4", "title": "MagicShine 2013 Model MJ-808U Bicycle Light with Improved Battery Pack, 1100-Lumen, Black", "description": "This is the latest MJ-808U model from MagicShine. This MJ-808U features the latest super bright CREE XM-L U2 LED. The new battery pack was made from a UL/CE/TUV/PSE certified supplier. It includes a small protection circuit board with over-charge, over-discharge and short-circuit protection function. All MagicShine lights come with 1 year limited warranty for lighthead and a 6 months limited warranty for the battery pack, charger and other accessories. MagicShine MJ-808U 1100 Lumen light head (105 grams, 3.7 oz.)offers two great new improvements: The 5 stage power meter and integrated control circuit to protect against overheating and separate them from the competition. As the battery depletes from 100% the backlit button will change colors from Green - Blue - Yellow - Red. High (100%) - Low (50%) - Off (hold 2 seconds) - Strobe (hold 4 seconds) Push and hold the switch for 2 seconds will turn off the light from any mode 5 Stage power meter: Green (75% - 100%), Blue (50% - 75%), Yellow (25%-50%), Red (10% - 25%), Flash red (less than 10%) Light Source: Cree XM-L U2 Luminous flux: Max 1100 Lumens (LED Emitter Rating.) LED lifespan: 50,000+ hours Shell material: 6061-T6 Aluminum alloy Surface treatment: Type III hard-anodized anti-abrasive finish Switch Type: Click switch Battery: 4 x 18650 Li-ion LCD battery (8.4V 4.4 AH) Runtime: 3.5 hours (100% brightness) Battery life: 500 times cycle Charging time: 3 - 3.5 hours.", "text": "MagicShine 2013 Model MJ-808U Bicycle Light with Improved Battery Pack, 1100-Lumen, Black This is the latest MJ-808U model from MagicShine. This MJ-808U features the latest super bright CREE XM-L U2 LED. The new battery pack was made from a UL/CE/TUV/PSE certified supplier. It includes a small protection circuit board with over-charge, over-discharge and short-circuit protection function. All MagicShine lights come with 1 year limited warranty for lighthead and a 6 months limited warranty for the battery pack, charger and other accessories. MagicShine MJ-808U 1100 Lumen light head (105 grams, 3.7 oz.)offers two great new improvements: The 5 stage power meter and integrated control circuit to protect against overheating and separate them from the competition. As the battery depletes from 100% the backlit button will change colors from Green - Blue - Yellow - Red. High (100%) - Low (50%) - Off (hold 2 seconds) - Strobe (hold 4 seconds) Push and hold the switch for 2 seconds will turn off the light from any mode 5 Stage power meter: Green (75% - 100%), Blue (50% - 75%), Yellow (25%-50%), Red (10% - 25%), Flash red (less than 10%) Light Source: Cree XM-L U2 Luminous flux: Max 1100 Lumens (LED Emitter Rating.) LED lifespan: 50,000+ hours Shell material: 6061-T6 Aluminum alloy Surface treatment: Type III hard-anodized anti-abrasive finish Switch Type: Click switch Battery: 4 x 18650 Li-ion LCD battery (8.4V 4.4 AH) Runtime: 3.5 hours (100% brightness) Battery life: 500 times cycle Charging time: 3 - 3.5 hours.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uP8MAUP2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009GSLUR4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagicShine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 87.85}}
{"item_id": "B009H8BMEO", "title": "Coitac 4x32 Rangefinder Recticle CQB Tactical Fix Power Scope with Picatinny 1\" Ring", "description": "Most affordable high quality CoiTAC 4x32 Rangefinder tactical compact rifle scope. MAGNIFICATION: 4X OBJECTIVE DIA. MM: 32MM FINISH: BLACK LEN COATING: BLUE TUBE DIA. INCHES: 1\" LENGTH INCHES: 7.68\" WT. OUNCE: 1lbs EYE RELIEF INCHES: 3.15\"-2.75\" RETICLE Rangefinder Tacitcal 1\" Ring Included", "text": "Coitac 4x32 Rangefinder Recticle CQB Tactical Fix Power Scope with Picatinny 1\" Ring Most affordable high quality CoiTAC 4x32 Rangefinder tactical compact rifle scope. MAGNIFICATION: 4X OBJECTIVE DIA. MM: 32MM FINISH: BLACK LEN COATING: BLUE TUBE DIA. INCHES: 1\" LENGTH INCHES: 7.68\" WT. OUNCE: 1lbs EYE RELIEF INCHES: 3.15\"-2.75\" RETICLE Rangefinder Tacitcal 1\" Ring Included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BsmqSidzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009H8BMEO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B009HD0R86", "title": "SE Gun Cleaning Set - 3 Brushes, 2 Double Ended Picks", "description": "Brush all the grime and debris off your firearms with this 5 Pc Gun Cleaning Set. It includes 1 Double Ended Brass Brush, 1 Double Ended Copper Brush, 1 Double Ended Nylon Brush, and 2 Double Ended Picks. Great for Gun Cleaning as well as small jobs around the shop.", "text": "SE Gun Cleaning Set - 3 Brushes, 2 Double Ended Picks Brush all the grime and debris off your firearms with this 5 Pc Gun Cleaning Set. It includes 1 Double Ended Brass Brush, 1 Double Ended Copper Brush, 1 Double Ended Nylon Brush, and 2 Double Ended Picks. Great for Gun Cleaning as well as small jobs around the shop.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yGBd3lIrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009HD0R86.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sona", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 6.7}}
