{"item_id": "B009HVH9PW", "title": "UTAC .308 Winchester Caliber Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresighter", "description": "Calibrate your targeting to hair - splitting accuracy with a UTAC laser boresighter. SAVE BIG! Convenient, accurate and easy. Finding your targeting system isn't quite hitting the mark like it used to? Don't replace... re-calibrate! All you do is chamber the unit as though it were a round, and a red laser dot will show you exactly where your aim will land the shot. From there, you can adjust your scope or sights without ever wasting ammo! Save time, money and frustration with UTAC! Line it up: Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement; Easy to use; Improves accuracy; Reduces ammo waste; Compact, lightweight and durable; WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers..308 Winchester 7.62x51mm .243 7mm-08 Remington Caliber Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter BoresighterQuality grade Brass CasingPrecision Laser OpticsSits perfectly in the chamberQuick and easy sighting and zeroNo more wasting ammo", "text": "UTAC .308 Winchester Caliber Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresighter Calibrate your targeting to hair - splitting accuracy with a UTAC laser boresighter. SAVE BIG! Convenient, accurate and easy. Finding your targeting system isn't quite hitting the mark like it used to? Don't replace... re-calibrate! All you do is chamber the unit as though it were a round, and a red laser dot will show you exactly where your aim will land the shot. From there, you can adjust your scope or sights without ever wasting ammo! Save time, money and frustration with UTAC! Line it up: Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement; Easy to use; Improves accuracy; Reduces ammo waste; Compact, lightweight and durable; WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers..308 Winchester 7.62x51mm .243 7mm-08 Remington Caliber Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter BoresighterQuality grade Brass CasingPrecision Laser OpticsSits perfectly in the chamberQuick and easy sighting and zeroNo more wasting ammo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410V5Nh4K-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009HVH9PW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B009IDYBJ6", "title": "See All ® Open Sight Edge Glow Lit Reticle Sight Fits Rifles and Pistols 100% Made in USA No Batteries!", "description": "The See All Open Sight manufactured 100% in the USA is the first of its kind in true open sight shooting technology. By incorporating a patented optic, designed to maximize pin point accuracy, the see all open sight combined with an Edge Glow lit reticle gives shooters of all kinds multiple advantages over traditional open sights. The optic (A) brings into focus and magnifies crosshair reticle (B) creating a precision two point alignment system, The edge glow material (H) draws all available light to fill the optic with a florescent green, highlighting and illuminating crosshair reticle (B). Sighting (G) across the top of the optic (below) you place the crosshair reticle on the target and shoot. THERE IS NO FIELD OF VIEW THROUGH THE OPTIC!! The eye will do the work of instantly centering and placing the crosshair reticle in the proper location within the optic and on the target. The crosshair reticle is focused on the same plane as the target providing pin point accuracy. No batteries needed it uses a fiber block technology to enhance the reticle. Made of 6061 T6 Aluminum FITS ALL WEAVER AND PICATINNY RAILS. UTG RISER NOT INCLUDED !! We ran over it with a car and it still held zero and full Function!! 100% made in the USA 30 day money back guarentee !! Limited Lifetime Waranty !!!", "text": "See All ® Open Sight Edge Glow Lit Reticle Sight Fits Rifles and Pistols 100% Made in USA No Batteries! The See All Open Sight manufactured 100% in the USA is the first of its kind in true open sight shooting technology. By incorporating a patented optic, designed to maximize pin point accuracy, the see all open sight combined with an Edge Glow lit reticle gives shooters of all kinds multiple advantages over traditional open sights. The optic (A) brings into focus and magnifies crosshair reticle (B) creating a precision two point alignment system, The edge glow material (H) draws all available light to fill the optic with a florescent green, highlighting and illuminating crosshair reticle (B). Sighting (G) across the top of the optic (below) you place the crosshair reticle on the target and shoot. THERE IS NO FIELD OF VIEW THROUGH THE OPTIC!! The eye will do the work of instantly centering and placing the crosshair reticle in the proper location within the optic and on the target. The crosshair reticle is focused on the same plane as the target providing pin point accuracy. No batteries needed it uses a fiber block technology to enhance the reticle. Made of 6061 T6 Aluminum FITS ALL WEAVER AND PICATINNY RAILS. UTG RISER NOT INCLUDED !! We ran over it with a car and it still held zero and full Function!! 100% made in the USA 30 day money back guarentee !! Limited Lifetime Waranty !!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414GEuISX%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009IDYBJ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SeeAll", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 94.99}}
{"item_id": "B009IIJV3W", "title": "BlackBurn Road Mirror Bike Mirror", "description": "The Road Bike Mirror gives you a clear view of vehicles and other cyclists approaching from the rear. Convex reflective surface provides a wide field of vision. Designed to fit road bike handlebars and installs in seconds", "text": "BlackBurn Road Mirror Bike Mirror The Road Bike Mirror gives you a clear view of vehicles and other cyclists approaching from the rear. Convex reflective surface provides a wide field of vision. Designed to fit road bike handlebars and installs in seconds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ur-eVRLgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009IIJV3W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 19.27}}
{"item_id": "B009IPEID8", "title": "BudK Singapore Sling Throwing Axe Black With Sheath", "description": "Constructed from one solid piece of AUS-6 stainless steel, this lightning throwing axe is designed to slash through the air and nail the bulls eye with ease. Includes custom nylon sheath. 5 1/2\" bl, 11\" ov.", "text": "BudK Singapore Sling Throwing Axe Black With Sheath Constructed from one solid piece of AUS-6 stainless steel, this lightning throwing axe is designed to slash through the air and nail the bulls eye with ease. Includes custom nylon sheath. 5 1/2\" bl, 11\" ov.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31deC2PZdgL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009IPEID8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 13.0}}
