{"item_id": "B009KMH3M2", "title": "Rainier Arms Raptor", "description": "Rainier Arms RaptorTM ambidextrous charging handle by AXTS. The RaptorTM is truly revolutionary in design & function. From rapid palm \"blading\" or finger thumb charges of the weapon, the motion is fluid & fast from either strong or support side. Made in the USA from aircraft grade 7075 aluminum and milspec anodized. Raptor does not work with Sig Ar15s or Piston driven uppers", "text": "Rainier Arms Raptor Rainier Arms RaptorTM ambidextrous charging handle by AXTS. The RaptorTM is truly revolutionary in design & function. From rapid palm \"blading\" or finger thumb charges of the weapon, the motion is fluid & fast from either strong or support side. Made in the USA from aircraft grade 7075 aluminum and milspec anodized. Raptor does not work with Sig Ar15s or Piston driven uppers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31g-zm-A%2BjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009KMH3M2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rainier Arms", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 85.45}}
{"item_id": "B009KR4C9Y", "title": "Glock 19/23 Phantom Inside the Waistband Holster", "description": "The Phantom Inside-the-Waistband IWB for the Glock 19/23 is a great choice for concealed carry. The pistol is held tight to your body with a protective panel to prevent your shirt from interfering with the presentation of the fire arm. The Phantom IWB line of holsters is thin and streamlined reducing your weapons printing. Helping the gun and holster virtually disappear when you wear it. High quality molded holster at a affordable price.", "text": "Glock 19/23 Phantom Inside the Waistband Holster The Phantom Inside-the-Waistband IWB for the Glock 19/23 is a great choice for concealed carry. The pistol is held tight to your body with a protective panel to prevent your shirt from interfering with the presentation of the fire arm. The Phantom IWB line of holsters is thin and streamlined reducing your weapons printing. Helping the gun and holster virtually disappear when you wear it. High quality molded holster at a affordable price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MedtD37KL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009KR4C9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blade-Tech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 25.49}}
