{"item_id": "B009L2T0QI", "title": "UTG LE Rated Double Rail/13-Slot Angle Mount with Integral QD Lever Lock System, Black", "description": "UTG Fully Adjustable QD Lever Lock Picatinny Riser Angle Mount - Features See-thru 13 Slot Integral Double-rails for Most Versatile Applications, 140mm Base/Overall Length, 20mm Saddle Height, Aircraft Aluminum Construction w/Black Matte Finish. Bi-directional Design- Install & Mount Accessories with Most Flexibility & Offer Riser Function.", "text": "UTG LE Rated Double Rail/13-Slot Angle Mount with Integral QD Lever Lock System, Black UTG Fully Adjustable QD Lever Lock Picatinny Riser Angle Mount - Features See-thru 13 Slot Integral Double-rails for Most Versatile Applications, 140mm Base/Overall Length, 20mm Saddle Height, Aircraft Aluminum Construction w/Black Matte Finish. Bi-directional Design- Install & Mount Accessories with Most Flexibility & Offer Riser Function.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zG51y2eIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009L2T0QI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Tools & Accessories", "Mounts"]], "price": 28.75}}
