{"item_id": "B009LBVCIS", "title": "Highgear Alti-XT Altimeter Watch", "description": "Keep track of your progress on your next adventure with the HighGear Alti-XTss Altimeter Watch. Not only is the Alti-XT incredibly accurate, but it allows you to view graphic displays of your climb, so you can say to the folks at home, 'OK, the numbers probably don't mean much to youAAAbut just LOOK at it!'Product FeaturesHousing Material: plastic resinStrap Material: plastic resinAltimeter: yesAltimeter Max Height: 9000 mHeart Rate Monitor: noBarometer: yesThermometer: yesDigital Compass: yesDeclination Type:Adjustable Declination: yesChronograph: yesOdometer: noBacklight: yesFitness Test: noTraining Program: noTarget Heart Rate Zone: noRoute Elevation Profile: yesComputer Compatible: noWater-Resistant: yes, 50mAlarms: 3Alarm Type: advancedDate Indicator: yesWeekday Indicator: noBattery Type:Battery Life:Low Battery Indicator:Face Size:Weight:Recommended Use: climbing, trekking, touringManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "text": "Highgear Alti-XT Altimeter Watch Keep track of your progress on your next adventure with the HighGear Alti-XTss Altimeter Watch. Not only is the Alti-XT incredibly accurate, but it allows you to view graphic displays of your climb, so you can say to the folks at home, 'OK, the numbers probably don't mean much to youAAAbut just LOOK at it!'Product FeaturesHousing Material: plastic resinStrap Material: plastic resinAltimeter: yesAltimeter Max Height: 9000 mHeart Rate Monitor: noBarometer: yesThermometer: yesDigital Compass: yesDeclination Type:Adjustable Declination: yesChronograph: yesOdometer: noBacklight: yesFitness Test: noTraining Program: noTarget Heart Rate Zone: noRoute Elevation Profile: yesComputer Compatible: noWater-Resistant: yes, 50mAlarms: 3Alarm Type: advancedDate Indicator: yesWeekday Indicator: noBattery Type:Battery Life:Low Battery Indicator:Face Size:Weight:Recommended Use: climbing, trekking, touringManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510ajKKkVkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009LBVCIS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Altimeters"]], "price": 107.99}}
{"item_id": "B009LNOXF0", "title": "Ibera Bicycle Clip-on Quick-Release Panniers (Pair)", "description": "Panniers clip on securely in seconds - no straps required. Panniers can be used as a set or as a single unit. Hand-carry straps for off-road use, reflective strips for nighttime safety, durable ABS base and 1680 nylon. Built-in rain cover for all weather protection stores easily in its own hidden pocket.When used with Ibera PakRak Touring Carrier Plus+, other top-mounting PakRak bags can be mounted simultaneously (IB-BA1, IB-BA3).Compatibility: Ibera PakRak Carriers IB-RA2, IB-RA3, IB-RA4, IB-RA5, and most third-party touring carriers.Specifications (each pannier)Material:1680D NylonMount:PakRak Clip-On Quick-ReleaseRain Cover:YesCapacity:22 LDimensions:13.8 \" x 7\" x 13.8\"Weight:2.1 lbsLoad weight:Carries up to 19.8 lbs (9 kg)", "text": "Ibera Bicycle Clip-on Quick-Release Panniers (Pair) Panniers clip on securely in seconds - no straps required. Panniers can be used as a set or as a single unit. Hand-carry straps for off-road use, reflective strips for nighttime safety, durable ABS base and 1680 nylon. Built-in rain cover for all weather protection stores easily in its own hidden pocket.When used with Ibera PakRak Touring Carrier Plus+, other top-mounting PakRak bags can be mounted simultaneously (IB-BA1, IB-BA3).Compatibility: Ibera PakRak Carriers IB-RA2, IB-RA3, IB-RA4, IB-RA5, and most third-party touring carriers.Specifications (each pannier)Material:1680D NylonMount:PakRak Clip-On Quick-ReleaseRain Cover:YesCapacity:22 LDimensions:13.8 \" x 7\" x 13.8\"Weight:2.1 lbsLoad weight:Carries up to 19.8 lbs (9 kg)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Dzg5FqplL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009LNOXF0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 84.99}}
{"item_id": "B009LOSKLM", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pack Of 10 Inert 9mm 9x19mm Parabellum NATO Luger Safety Trainer Cartridge Dummy Ammunition Ammo Pistol Rounds", "description": "Pack of 10 - These Ultimate Arms Gear trainer 9mm Luger / 9x19mm / Parabellum / NATO cartridges are inert dummy rounds used for training and instructional activities. Developed for military and law enforcement use - They are made from a durable synthetic material and colored bright orange and have a different \"feel\" for instant positive identification to make sure these won't be confused for live rounds. Popular with many departments and agencies for use in Immediate Action training for just that reason. These do not duplicate weight and balance of loaded rounds or function-testing dummies. An affordable replacement for traditional metallic dummy cartridges. Ultimate Arms Gear Trainers will also cushion the firing pin when used as a snap cap.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pack Of 10 Inert 9mm 9x19mm Parabellum NATO Luger Safety Trainer Cartridge Dummy Ammunition Ammo Pistol Rounds Pack of 10 - These Ultimate Arms Gear trainer 9mm Luger / 9x19mm / Parabellum / NATO cartridges are inert dummy rounds used for training and instructional activities. Developed for military and law enforcement use - They are made from a durable synthetic material and colored bright orange and have a different \"feel\" for instant positive identification to make sure these won't be confused for live rounds. Popular with many departments and agencies for use in Immediate Action training for just that reason. These do not duplicate weight and balance of loaded rounds or function-testing dummies. An affordable replacement for traditional metallic dummy cartridges. Ultimate Arms Gear Trainers will also cushion the firing pin when used as a snap cap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QiFqGRNNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009LOSKLM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B009LPRHNS", "title": "Ak47/74 Quick Detach Side Mount with Dual Picatinny/weaver Rail", "description": "• AK Double Rail Side Mount Designed with Quick Detachable/Lock Lever • Fully Adjustable for Most Side Rail Variants • Precision Machined to Fit Most AKs and AK Variants • Machined from Aircraft Grade Aluminum for Extreme Strength • Double Picatinny Rails for Scope & Versatile Accessory Applications • STANAG Dimension and 12 Slots on Top Rail, 8 Slots on Side Rail • Optimal Clearance to Fit All Tactical Scopes Right on Top of Bore Centerline Material: Aluminum Weight: 7.3 oz Pieces: 1 Rail Type: Picatinny/Weaver No. of Rails: 2 Length: 5.5 inch Width: 1.7 inch Height: 3.3 inch", "text": "Ak47/74 Quick Detach Side Mount with Dual Picatinny/weaver Rail • AK Double Rail Side Mount Designed with Quick Detachable/Lock Lever • Fully Adjustable for Most Side Rail Variants • Precision Machined to Fit Most AKs and AK Variants • Machined from Aircraft Grade Aluminum for Extreme Strength • Double Picatinny Rails for Scope & Versatile Accessory Applications • STANAG Dimension and 12 Slots on Top Rail, 8 Slots on Side Rail • Optimal Clearance to Fit All Tactical Scopes Right on Top of Bore Centerline Material: Aluminum Weight: 7.3 oz Pieces: 1 Rail Type: Picatinny/Weaver No. of Rails: 2 Length: 5.5 inch Width: 1.7 inch Height: 3.3 inch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I7XAgJE3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009LPRHNS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SNIPER", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 19.89}}
{"item_id": "B009LQHOG2", "title": "ProSource Ultra Deluxe Revolutionary Sports Medicine Roller", "description": "Through simple techniques, you may control the amount of pressure \"the bumps\" apply to your body. \"The bumps\" are evenly spaced to one another, so several of them simultaneously contact your body during most exercises. However, with a slight shift of your body, you can reduce your area of contact with the ProSource Roller, which increases pressure and provides deeper, more penetrating relief.", "text": "ProSource Ultra Deluxe Revolutionary Sports Medicine Roller Through simple techniques, you may control the amount of pressure \"the bumps\" apply to your body. \"The bumps\" are evenly spaced to one another, so several of them simultaneously contact your body during most exercises. However, with a slight shift of your body, you can reduce your area of contact with the ProSource Roller, which increases pressure and provides deeper, more penetrating relief.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ti-iwT-dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009LQHOG2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProSource Discounts, Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B009M55QY4", "title": "TOAKS Titanium V-shaped tent peg (Pack of 6)", "description": "Titanium V-shaped tent peg provides excellent hold in ground. Titanium is light and strong. Hollow-carved design makes it beautiful and reduces the weight.", "text": "TOAKS Titanium V-shaped tent peg (Pack of 6) Titanium V-shaped tent peg provides excellent hold in ground. Titanium is light and strong. Hollow-carved design makes it beautiful and reduces the weight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QxTUYzaWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009M55QY4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]], "price": 17.95}}
