{"item_id": "B009MZY3RK", "title": "Conceal Mini- Right Handed, Black, Springfield XDS, .45 - Shepherd Leather IWB Holster", "description": "Made from top quality leather, and .093\" kydex and 2 spring steel clips to secure it to your waistband. Holster dimensions are 8\" long and 8.5\" high. We here at Sheperd Leather bring you affordable concealment", "text": "Conceal Mini- Right Handed, Black, Springfield XDS, .45 - Shepherd Leather IWB Holster Made from top quality leather, and .093\" kydex and 2 spring steel clips to secure it to your waistband. Holster dimensions are 8\" long and 8.5\" high. We here at Sheperd Leather bring you affordable concealment", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312g3ul80AL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009MZY3RK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 35.0}}
{"item_id": "B009N4ZJ00", "title": "Aurorae Yoga Mat Sport Bag/Multi Purpose Crossbody Sling Backpack, Great New Colors", "description": "Yoga Multi Purpose Sport Sling Bag by Aurorae is great for your trip to the studio, gym, the office, school, traveling, hiking, biking, and more! Mats sold separately and not included2nd Edition Model Made with Durable, Heavy-Duty Polyester.Specialized Mat-Locker System securely holds all Aurorae Yoga Mats and Most dense rubber mats effectively.2 Main Large Individual Compartments easily stores your yoga block, straps, towels, and clothes.Main compartment fits most 15.4 inch notebook computers.Wide, Easy Adjustable, Double Reinforced shoulder strap with Built-in cell phone pocket comfortably fits over your Right shoulder.Small front zippered pocket Securely holds Your Valuables.Front flap pocket has specialized wet liner to store your clothes after your workout.Built in side water bottle pocket to help you stay refreshed during your day.The Aurorae Yoga Sport Bag has a modern, stylish, and versatile design in five radiating colors! Green, Purple, Red, Blue, and Ebony.*** CUSTOMER SERVICE We at Aurorae are here to serve you as best as possible! We value 5 star service so if for any reason you are unsatisfied please contact us through Amazon. We are committed to do whatever possible to resolve any issues and guarantee your satisfaction.Remember \"It's Your Yoga\" Relax, Enjoy, and Namaste", "text": "Aurorae Yoga Mat Sport Bag/Multi Purpose Crossbody Sling Backpack, Great New Colors Yoga Multi Purpose Sport Sling Bag by Aurorae is great for your trip to the studio, gym, the office, school, traveling, hiking, biking, and more! Mats sold separately and not included2nd Edition Model Made with Durable, Heavy-Duty Polyester.Specialized Mat-Locker System securely holds all Aurorae Yoga Mats and Most dense rubber mats effectively.2 Main Large Individual Compartments easily stores your yoga block, straps, towels, and clothes.Main compartment fits most 15.4 inch notebook computers.Wide, Easy Adjustable, Double Reinforced shoulder strap with Built-in cell phone pocket comfortably fits over your Right shoulder.Small front zippered pocket Securely holds Your Valuables.Front flap pocket has specialized wet liner to store your clothes after your workout.Built in side water bottle pocket to help you stay refreshed during your day.The Aurorae Yoga Sport Bag has a modern, stylish, and versatile design in five radiating colors! Green, Purple, Red, Blue, and Ebony.*** CUSTOMER SERVICE We at Aurorae are here to serve you as best as possible! We value 5 star service so if for any reason you are unsatisfied please contact us through Amazon. We are committed to do whatever possible to resolve any issues and guarantee your satisfaction.Remember \"It's Your Yoga\" Relax, Enjoy, and Namaste", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FRJ%2BFb0KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009N4ZJ00.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mat Bags"]], "price": 35.0}}
{"item_id": "B009N5L016", "title": "UTAC 7.62 x 39 mm Laser Bore Sighter Boresighter", "description": "Calibrate your targeting to hair - splitting accuracy with a UTAC laser boresighter. SAVE BIG! Convenient, accurate and easy. Finding your targeting system isn't quite hitting the mark like it used to? Don't replace... re-calibrate! All you do is chamber the unit as though it were a round, and a red laser dot will show you exactly where your aim will land the shot. From there, you can adjust your scope or sights without ever wasting ammo! Save time, money and frustration with UTAC! Line it up: Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement; Easy to use; Improves accuracy; Reduces ammo waste; Compact, lightweight and durable; WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers.Quality grade Brass CasingPrecision Laser OpticsSits perfectly in the chamberQuick and easy sighting and zeroNo more wasting ammo", "text": "UTAC 7.62 x 39 mm Laser Bore Sighter Boresighter Calibrate your targeting to hair - splitting accuracy with a UTAC laser boresighter. SAVE BIG! Convenient, accurate and easy. Finding your targeting system isn't quite hitting the mark like it used to? Don't replace... re-calibrate! All you do is chamber the unit as though it were a round, and a red laser dot will show you exactly where your aim will land the shot. From there, you can adjust your scope or sights without ever wasting ammo! Save time, money and frustration with UTAC! Line it up: Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement; Easy to use; Improves accuracy; Reduces ammo waste; Compact, lightweight and durable; WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Lasers. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Lasers.Quality grade Brass CasingPrecision Laser OpticsSits perfectly in the chamberQuick and easy sighting and zeroNo more wasting ammo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313ffsdeL2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009N5L016.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009NHMDHO", "title": "TapouT Adult Special Edition Fang Mouth Guard", "description": "Get both protection and improved performance with the TapouT Mouth Guard. This mouth guard is constructed from patent pending Ever Mold advanced composite, which is designed to be re boiled and re molded multiple times. This is ideal for athletes who have braces or are undergoing orthodontic treatments and may need to re shape their mouth guard over time. Integrated channels in the guard are designed to remain open to allow maximum breathability and let you maintain ease of speech. Each package includes two mouth guards in your choice of colors and size, and two straps.", "text": "TapouT Adult Special Edition Fang Mouth Guard Get both protection and improved performance with the TapouT Mouth Guard. This mouth guard is constructed from patent pending Ever Mold advanced composite, which is designed to be re boiled and re molded multiple times. This is ideal for athletes who have braces or are undergoing orthodontic treatments and may need to re shape their mouth guard over time. Integrated channels in the guard are designed to remain open to allow maximum breathability and let you maintain ease of speech. Each package includes two mouth guards in your choice of colors and size, and two straps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UBXZVJoGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009NHMDHO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Mouthguards"]], "price": 16.15}}
{"item_id": "B009NJKXXS", "title": "Waterproof & Windproof Fleece Stadium Picnic Blanket", "description": "", "text": "Waterproof & Windproof Fleece Stadium Picnic Blanket", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cJzs10pAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009NJKXXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "fixfind", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Blankets"]], "price": 19.6}}
{"item_id": "B009NK85YG", "title": "Pellets LLC Stainless Steel Tumbling Media 5 Lb", "description": "Stainless Steel Tumbling Media is manufactured from high quality 300 series stainless steel. The pins have been sized to clean all calibers from 9 mm to 50 including the inside and primer pockets. Note that Stainless Steel Tumbling Media is designed for wet tumbling in a rotary tumbler. It should not be used in a vibratory tumbler.", "text": "Pellets LLC Stainless Steel Tumbling Media 5 Lb Stainless Steel Tumbling Media is manufactured from high quality 300 series stainless steel. The pins have been sized to clean all calibers from 9 mm to 50 including the inside and primer pockets. Note that Stainless Steel Tumbling Media is designed for wet tumbling in a rotary tumbler. It should not be used in a vibratory tumbler.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XXZLXkBWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009NK85YG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pellets LLC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 48.0}}
{"item_id": "B009NKJXFQ", "title": "Worlds Finest Trimmer 223 Rem", "description": "The WFT was developed as a precision tool built to last a lifetime (or more) and uses a source of power most people already own - a cordless or electric drill. Once adjusted to the user's preference, it's simply a matter of chucking it up in a drill and feeding cases in by hand - a pace of 10 cases per minute is pretty easy to maintain. The razor sharp high-speed cutters and the sealed ball bearing incorporated into the trimmer produce an extremely smooth cut. In most cases it will only be necessary to slightly chamfer the inner edge of the case mouth. Unlike other case trimmers the W.F.T. does not use pilots, the case is supported by the shoulder and body of the case.", "text": "Worlds Finest Trimmer 223 Rem The WFT was developed as a precision tool built to last a lifetime (or more) and uses a source of power most people already own - a cordless or electric drill. Once adjusted to the user's preference, it's simply a matter of chucking it up in a drill and feeding cases in by hand - a pace of 10 cases per minute is pretty easy to maintain. The razor sharp high-speed cutters and the sealed ball bearing incorporated into the trimmer produce an extremely smooth cut. In most cases it will only be necessary to slightly chamfer the inner edge of the case mouth. Unlike other case trimmers the W.F.T. does not use pilots, the case is supported by the shoulder and body of the case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KyzpSSY7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009NKJXFQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 75.95}}
