{"item_id": "B009NN2KDK", "title": "FuelBelt Ironman Collection Super Stretch Race Waistpack", "description": "Just don’t call it a fanny pack Our low profile adjustable waist packs are an easy solution for carrying keys, a wallet or cell phone. Use it for training, racing or even just a long walk.", "text": "FuelBelt Ironman Collection Super Stretch Race Waistpack Just don’t call it a fanny pack Our low profile adjustable waist packs are an easy solution for carrying keys, a wallet or cell phone. Use it for training, racing or even just a long walk.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yMyt8IHrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009NN2KDK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FuelBelt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 15.69}}
{"item_id": "B009NN35ZM", "title": "Zoic Men's Specific Chamois Pad with RPL Essential Liner, Black, Medium", "description": "Padded performance to attack your ride. Wear-tested for 2000 miles of riding over 46 days throughout India. Glowing reviews. Yeah, this should be fine for your daily loop. Machine wash cold with mild detergent, line dry. For almost 20 years ZOIC has been making quality, comfortable cycling apparel for people who enjoy riding bikes. We utilize the finest fabrics, the best factories, and our product is always guaranteed. ZOIC means pertaining to animal life or action, ZOIC is clothing for an active life, ZOIC is the style of cycling. Ride more, dress well.", "text": "Zoic Men's Specific Chamois Pad with RPL Essential Liner, Black, Medium Padded performance to attack your ride. Wear-tested for 2000 miles of riding over 46 days throughout India. Glowing reviews. Yeah, this should be fine for your daily loop. Machine wash cold with mild detergent, line dry. For almost 20 years ZOIC has been making quality, comfortable cycling apparel for people who enjoy riding bikes. We utilize the finest fabrics, the best factories, and our product is always guaranteed. ZOIC means pertaining to animal life or action, ZOIC is clothing for an active life, ZOIC is the style of cycling. Ride more, dress well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HpAkJxWXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009NN35ZM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
