{"item_id": "B009NN5T06", "title": "FuelBelt Ironman Collection Gel Ready Race Number Belt", "description": "FUEL BELT® IRONMAN GEL READY RACE NUMBER BELT :: Meet two of your key racing needs with one killer belt when you gear up with the Fuel Belt® Ironman Gel Ready Race Number Belt. Secure your bib number, no sweat, while locking in easy access to loads of gels with the multiple gel loops. Keep it light thanks to the super lightweight elastic webbing of this running belt, and race ahead in low-light conditions, staying visible and safe from the high reflective swatches.", "text": "FuelBelt Ironman Collection Gel Ready Race Number Belt FUEL BELT® IRONMAN GEL READY RACE NUMBER BELT :: Meet two of your key racing needs with one killer belt when you gear up with the Fuel Belt® Ironman Gel Ready Race Number Belt. Secure your bib number, no sweat, while locking in easy access to loads of gels with the multiple gel loops. Keep it light thanks to the super lightweight elastic webbing of this running belt, and race ahead in low-light conditions, staying visible and safe from the high reflective swatches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Wc-kzDTPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009NN5T06.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FuelBelt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 9.68}}
