{"item_id": "B009NX5D66", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Sneak Universal Holster Insert with Mag Retention", "description": "Product Details Adjustable to most popular pistol sizes, the Sneak Universal Holster Insert with mag Retention has a loop interior to protect your pistol from scratching and an elastic grip for an extra magazine. All backed by a stiffened spine with hook finish for a stable connection that allows for an easy draw. Product Feature Overall size: 6 in (L) x 2 in (H) wide x 2 in (W) Adjusts to fit most popular pistol sizes Non-directional attachment for versatility Stiffened spine for added stability Loop interior protects pistol finish Can hold other items such as tools, laptop power supply, etc.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Sneak Universal Holster Insert with Mag Retention Product Details Adjustable to most popular pistol sizes, the Sneak Universal Holster Insert with mag Retention has a loop interior to protect your pistol from scratching and an elastic grip for an extra magazine. All backed by a stiffened spine with hook finish for a stable connection that allows for an easy draw. Product Feature Overall size: 6 in (L) x 2 in (H) wide x 2 in (W) Adjusts to fit most popular pistol sizes Non-directional attachment for versatility Stiffened spine for added stability Loop interior protects pistol finish Can hold other items such as tools, laptop power supply, etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t9iI8ES3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009NX5D66.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B009NZVQ7O", "title": "Serfas Thunderbolt USB Headlight", "description": "If you're riding at night, let Serfas guide the way with the Thunderbolt Headlight. The 15-micro (double strength) LED strip puts out 90 lumens, giving you plenty of light to safely arrive at your destination. What's your mounting pleasure? The USB-rechargeable Thunderbolt can be mounted virtually anywhere on the front of your bike—from the handlebars to the fork. Since the Thunderbolt is rechargeable, you can say goodbye buying batteries and say hello to saving the earth and your hard earned money. It's your ride, your call. Charge up, light up and get riding safely at night with the Thunderbolt.", "text": "Serfas Thunderbolt USB Headlight If you're riding at night, let Serfas guide the way with the Thunderbolt Headlight. The 15-micro (double strength) LED strip puts out 90 lumens, giving you plenty of light to safely arrive at your destination. What's your mounting pleasure? The USB-rechargeable Thunderbolt can be mounted virtually anywhere on the front of your bike—from the handlebars to the fork. Since the Thunderbolt is rechargeable, you can say goodbye buying batteries and say hello to saving the earth and your hard earned money. It's your ride, your call. Charge up, light up and get riding safely at night with the Thunderbolt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rw-pJbumL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009NZVQ7O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 40.0}}
{"item_id": "B009NZVZ3E", "title": "Morakniv Companion Heavy Duty Knife with Sandvik Carbon Steel Blade, 0.125/4.1-Inch", "description": "The Mora Companion Heavy Duty is a powerful tool for bushcrafters, hunters and outdoor enthusiasts. Suitable for batoning, the Companion Heavy Duty features a thick, 1/8-inch (3.2mm) carbon steel blade with a slightly blunter 27 Degree edge angle for high load capacity and maximum sharpness resistance. The Companion HD has an extra large ergonomic handle with a soft high-friction grip. The classic scandi grind combined with high quality carbon steel makes the knife easy to resharpen. Mora knives made from high carbon steel achieve high hardness, sharpen easily and are exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Mora Knives are made from high-quality Sandvik steel. Sandvik knife steels are characterized by ultra-fine carbides that result in superb forging and hardening properties. The absence of large carbide deposits promotes excellent edge sharpness for optimum cutting performance. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended.", "text": "Morakniv Companion Heavy Duty Knife with Sandvik Carbon Steel Blade, 0.125/4.1-Inch The Mora Companion Heavy Duty is a powerful tool for bushcrafters, hunters and outdoor enthusiasts. Suitable for batoning, the Companion Heavy Duty features a thick, 1/8-inch (3.2mm) carbon steel blade with a slightly blunter 27 Degree edge angle for high load capacity and maximum sharpness resistance. The Companion HD has an extra large ergonomic handle with a soft high-friction grip. The classic scandi grind combined with high quality carbon steel makes the knife easy to resharpen. Mora knives made from high carbon steel achieve high hardness, sharpen easily and are exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Mora Knives are made from high-quality Sandvik steel. Sandvik knife steels are characterized by ultra-fine carbides that result in superb forging and hardening properties. The absence of large carbide deposits promotes excellent edge sharpness for optimum cutting performance. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414BHMqzccL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009NZVZ3E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morakniv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 15.87}}
