{"item_id": "B009PA1KJG", "title": "Gold's Gym XRS 20 Olympic Bench", "description": "Top Features • Olympic Multi-Position Bench • Power Catch™ Uprights • Squat Center Detachable Olympic Multi-Position Bench Choose an incline, decline or flat surface on this multi-position bench, which can be separated from the uprights for the ultimate in core, ab, bicep and leg workouts. Power Catch™ Uprights Strong and sturdy, these Olympic-width, Power Catch™ uprights are built to withstand the toughest workouts. Squat Center Safely perform squats with the Squat Center that incorporates strong uprights with Power Catch™ technology and extra-long safety spotters.", "text": "Gold's Gym XRS 20 Olympic Bench Top Features • Olympic Multi-Position Bench • Power Catch™ Uprights • Squat Center Detachable Olympic Multi-Position Bench Choose an incline, decline or flat surface on this multi-position bench, which can be separated from the uprights for the ultimate in core, ab, bicep and leg workouts. Power Catch™ Uprights Strong and sturdy, these Olympic-width, Power Catch™ uprights are built to withstand the toughest workouts. Squat Center Safely perform squats with the Squat Center that incorporates strong uprights with Power Catch™ technology and extra-long safety spotters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WrFb3echL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009PA1KJG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Benches"]], "price": 236.36}}
{"item_id": "B009PA6PLY", "title": "PANTHER XP2 Tactical 180lumen 3Watt AAA Strobe LED Flashlight Weaponlight w Gun Mount Wire Cord Switch", "description": "A pocket size light weight tactical flashlight built with high intensity 3Watt 180lumen high intensity LED bulb and using cost effective AAA batteries.- Anodized aluminum alloy body- 1\" straight main body works with standard 1\" scope rings- Dual mode tail cap switch: Continuous ON & Strobing- Comes with a gun mounting kit which includes a 1inch mounting ring and a long remote coil wire switch with pressure pad- Uses inexpensive and easy to find 3x AAA batteries (one set included)- Nylon carry pouch and wrist strap included- Very compact and lightweight: 3.4oz (including batteries); 4 1/2inch overall length", "text": "PANTHER XP2 Tactical 180lumen 3Watt AAA Strobe LED Flashlight Weaponlight w Gun Mount Wire Cord Switch A pocket size light weight tactical flashlight built with high intensity 3Watt 180lumen high intensity LED bulb and using cost effective AAA batteries.- Anodized aluminum alloy body- 1\" straight main body works with standard 1\" scope rings- Dual mode tail cap switch: Continuous ON & Strobing- Comes with a gun mounting kit which includes a 1inch mounting ring and a long remote coil wire switch with pressure pad- Uses inexpensive and easy to find 3x AAA batteries (one set included)- Nylon carry pouch and wrist strap included- Very compact and lightweight: 3.4oz (including batteries); 4 1/2inch overall length", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51X3Cyw5yhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009PA6PLY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 24.9}}
