{"item_id": "B009PLOBQE", "title": "Tate Labs Bar Fly TT - Men's", "description": "If you're not training and racing with a cycling computer, well, you're doing it wrong. However, if you're competing in the 21st century, then you've surely encountered the problematic scenario of placing your computer on your time trial rig. Lucky for you, though, the Tate Labs Bar Fly TT mount has removed both the frustration and jimmy-rigging that used to plague this process. Instead, the Dorin-constructed mount is able to be easily placed along either the aero extensions and some aero bars. This is made possible by a removable 3mm back bolt that gently fits around your bar of choice. Additionally, due to Tate Lab's patent-pending 1/8th Turn Technology, the CPU head unit is adjustable in 90 degree movements. So, your screen position will always be perfectly straight and aesthetically pleasing, regardless of the mount's location. Even better, 1/8th Turn Technology provides a secure, positive engagement system that allows a complete compatibility with Garmin Edge 200, 500, and 800 computers and Garmin Forerunner 910XT and 310XT watches. The Tate Labs Bar Fly TT is compatible with the aforementioned computers and watches and is available in the color Black. Please note that the mount is only compatible with 22. 0 - 22. 5mm diameter bars or extensions.", "text": "Tate Labs Bar Fly TT - Men's If you're not training and racing with a cycling computer, well, you're doing it wrong. However, if you're competing in the 21st century, then you've surely encountered the problematic scenario of placing your computer on your time trial rig. Lucky for you, though, the Tate Labs Bar Fly TT mount has removed both the frustration and jimmy-rigging that used to plague this process. Instead, the Dorin-constructed mount is able to be easily placed along either the aero extensions and some aero bars. This is made possible by a removable 3mm back bolt that gently fits around your bar of choice. Additionally, due to Tate Lab's patent-pending 1/8th Turn Technology, the CPU head unit is adjustable in 90 degree movements. So, your screen position will always be perfectly straight and aesthetically pleasing, regardless of the mount's location. Even better, 1/8th Turn Technology provides a secure, positive engagement system that allows a complete compatibility with Garmin Edge 200, 500, and 800 computers and Garmin Forerunner 910XT and 310XT watches. The Tate Labs Bar Fly TT is compatible with the aforementioned computers and watches and is available in the color Black. Please note that the mount is only compatible with 22. 0 - 22. 5mm diameter bars or extensions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416y7JB49eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009PLOBQE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bar Fly", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets"]], "price": 32.77}}
{"item_id": "B009PO6498", "title": "Giro Women's Tessa Gloves", "description": "A classic style, tailored for great fit, comfort and value. The Tessa is a gel-padded women's glove that delivers the comfort and feel Giro's Super Fit ergonomic design and high-quality construction at an affordable price. It's a great choice for recreational riders, or riders who prefer the feel of a more traditionally padded glove.", "text": "Giro Women's Tessa Gloves A classic style, tailored for great fit, comfort and value. The Tessa is a gel-padded women's glove that delivers the comfort and feel Giro's Super Fit ergonomic design and high-quality construction at an affordable price. It's a great choice for recreational riders, or riders who prefer the feel of a more traditionally padded glove.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VOgaHFuCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009PO6498.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009PP6WAS", "title": "Mini Red Laser Sight - By OTG", "description": "Mini Red Laser Sight - By Online Tactical Gear is an instantly activated universal laser sight for Picatinny or Weaver rail equipped pistols and rifles, with ambidextrous activation. Universal fit laser sight and built with the industry leading quality, ergonomics, and fit.This Laser sight is small and accurate. Will be a great additional to your firearm while not being invasive to ergonomics and profile of your weapon. The activation switches are resilient to mistaken activation and in some cases can also be used with existing soft holsters; allowing for use with your existing soft/padded holster due to its small profile.Batteries are inserted with + side facing up.There has been a lot of mixed reviews around this product. All feedback has been taken into account and forwarded to the manufacturer. OTG does not manufacturer these. This product is a replica and made in China. We do not wish to take away from valued names made in the USA and we urge you to support those brands. This model is made and priced for a different tier in the market. A good fit for lower cost markets including airsoft. Please be assured OTG stands behind the selling of these and 100% Refunds and shipping cost are provided if you are not satisfied. We are working with the manufacturer to fix future batches from malfunctions.FeaturesFits M1913/Picatinny Rails and Weaver RailAdjustable Rail LaserInstant Activation - Tap On, Tap Off with auto shut off - ambidextrousBattery Life & Type: Approx Four Hour constant activation / 1/3 N 3V Lithium BatteryAdjustable Windage and ElevationWaterproof, Rainproof, Shock proofCome with interchangeable inserts for more custom fittingExclusively Sold by Online Tactical Gear. Sellers other than Online Tactical Gear will not have the same product as listed.", "text": "Mini Red Laser Sight - By OTG Mini Red Laser Sight - By Online Tactical Gear is an instantly activated universal laser sight for Picatinny or Weaver rail equipped pistols and rifles, with ambidextrous activation. Universal fit laser sight and built with the industry leading quality, ergonomics, and fit.This Laser sight is small and accurate. Will be a great additional to your firearm while not being invasive to ergonomics and profile of your weapon. The activation switches are resilient to mistaken activation and in some cases can also be used with existing soft holsters; allowing for use with your existing soft/padded holster due to its small profile.Batteries are inserted with + side facing up.There has been a lot of mixed reviews around this product. All feedback has been taken into account and forwarded to the manufacturer. OTG does not manufacturer these. This product is a replica and made in China. We do not wish to take away from valued names made in the USA and we urge you to support those brands. This model is made and priced for a different tier in the market. A good fit for lower cost markets including airsoft. Please be assured OTG stands behind the selling of these and 100% Refunds and shipping cost are provided if you are not satisfied. We are working with the manufacturer to fix future batches from malfunctions.FeaturesFits M1913/Picatinny Rails and Weaver RailAdjustable Rail LaserInstant Activation - Tap On, Tap Off with auto shut off - ambidextrousBattery Life & Type: Approx Four Hour constant activation / 1/3 N 3V Lithium BatteryAdjustable Windage and ElevationWaterproof, Rainproof, Shock proofCome with interchangeable inserts for more custom fittingExclusively Sold by Online Tactical Gear. Sellers other than Online Tactical Gear will not have the same product as listed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ki2-Eu-EL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009PP6WAS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B009PPLNHK", "title": "Tactical Weaver Grip & Bipod - By OTG", "description": "Push Button Bipod is spring loaded and made out of military grade plastic. Awesome upgrade for the Sniper. Push a button and the legs extend out 3-1/2\". Also is a grip for your paintball/Airsoft gun, length of grip is 5\". Total length is 8-1/2\". This Bipod will fit any paintball gun or airsoft that has weaver rails.FeaturesTactical Grip w/ BipodPress Button pop out Bi-PodEasy mount on & offFits All R.I.S. SystemFlat surface for pressure switch mountingDurable Material, Weather ResistantExclusively Sold by Online Tactical Gear. Sellers other than Online Tactical Gear will not have the same product as listed.", "text": "Tactical Weaver Grip & Bipod - By OTG Push Button Bipod is spring loaded and made out of military grade plastic. Awesome upgrade for the Sniper. Push a button and the legs extend out 3-1/2\". Also is a grip for your paintball/Airsoft gun, length of grip is 5\". Total length is 8-1/2\". This Bipod will fit any paintball gun or airsoft that has weaver rails.FeaturesTactical Grip w/ BipodPress Button pop out Bi-PodEasy mount on & offFits All R.I.S. SystemFlat surface for pressure switch mountingDurable Material, Weather ResistantExclusively Sold by Online Tactical Gear. Sellers other than Online Tactical Gear will not have the same product as listed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j9SgPA8WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009PPLNHK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Online Tactical Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.4}}
{"item_id": "B009PSZJ8Q", "title": "AR15/M4/M16 Muzzle Cover (Black) 5-Pack", "description": "Slip-on muzzle covers for your AR15 / M16 / M4 / SOPMOD rifle. Semi-rigid end cap with less rigid cylinder. Can safely be shot off the rifle if you forget to remove it. Great for in the field to keep dirt/mud/water out of your bore. Snug fit for most flash hiders / breaks. We have tested on A2, Panther and Yankee Hill flash hiders although it probably fits many more. Does not fit the Cav-comp.", "text": "AR15/M4/M16 Muzzle Cover (Black) 5-Pack Slip-on muzzle covers for your AR15 / M16 / M4 / SOPMOD rifle. Semi-rigid end cap with less rigid cylinder. Can safely be shot off the rifle if you forget to remove it. Great for in the field to keep dirt/mud/water out of your bore. Snug fit for most flash hiders / breaks. We have tested on A2, Panther and Yankee Hill flash hiders although it probably fits many more. Does not fit the Cav-comp.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TjfTnJ0LL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009PSZJ8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 3.75}}
{"item_id": "B009PWE6RW", "title": "NEW 3800lm 3x Cree Xm-l T6 Led Outdoor Headlight Headlamp Bicycle / Bike Light", "description": "Description:Function: 3X CREE XM-L T6 3800Lm LED Bicycle Light and Headlamp.2 in 1 functions: It can be used both as a Bicycle light and Head LightBrand: WIndFireType of LED: 3X CREE XM-L T6 LED.Material:- Aluminum alloy casing, avoid high temperature, anti fall-off.- Aluminum alloy reflector.- Coated Glass Lens.Switch Modes: Normal / High / Low / Strobe.Brightness: Output brightness can come to 3800 lumens (Maximum).Runtime: Up to 2 hours run-time at 100% brightness (manufacturer rated).Power Source: 1 x 8.4v 6400mAh rechargeable Battery Pack.Input: 100V-240V, 50/60Hz.Output:- Voltage: DC 8.4V.- Current: 1A.Package include:1 x WindFire 3X CREE XM-L T6 3800Lm LED Bicycle Lamp Headlightt.1 x Adjustable headband.2 x Rubber ring for installation.1 x 6400mAh Battery Pack.1 x AC charger (100-240V).1 x Plug Adaptor (if need).WindFire After Sale Service: 30 days money back, one year warranty.", "text": "NEW 3800lm 3x Cree Xm-l T6 Led Outdoor Headlight Headlamp Bicycle / Bike Light Description:Function: 3X CREE XM-L T6 3800Lm LED Bicycle Light and Headlamp.2 in 1 functions: It can be used both as a Bicycle light and Head LightBrand: WIndFireType of LED: 3X CREE XM-L T6 LED.Material:- Aluminum alloy casing, avoid high temperature, anti fall-off.- Aluminum alloy reflector.- Coated Glass Lens.Switch Modes: Normal / High / Low / Strobe.Brightness: Output brightness can come to 3800 lumens (Maximum).Runtime: Up to 2 hours run-time at 100% brightness (manufacturer rated).Power Source: 1 x 8.4v 6400mAh rechargeable Battery Pack.Input: 100V-240V, 50/60Hz.Output:- Voltage: DC 8.4V.- Current: 1A.Package include:1 x WindFire 3X CREE XM-L T6 3800Lm LED Bicycle Lamp Headlightt.1 x Adjustable headband.2 x Rubber ring for installation.1 x 6400mAh Battery Pack.1 x AC charger (100-240V).1 x Plug Adaptor (if need).WindFire After Sale Service: 30 days money back, one year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EcH9acXRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009PWE6RW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WindFire&reg;", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 23.8}}
{"item_id": "B009QM7DSK", "title": "TOAKS Titanium 1600ml Pot with Pan", "description": "Ultralight titanium is corrosion-resistant and lasts for years. Rounded bottom edges make cleaning easy and improves heating efficiency. Handles fold away for compact storage. Titanium leaves no metallic smell or taste. The 1\" deep pan doubles as a lid or a sauce pan.", "text": "TOAKS Titanium 1600ml Pot with Pan Ultralight titanium is corrosion-resistant and lasts for years. Rounded bottom edges make cleaning easy and improves heating efficiency. Handles fold away for compact storage. Titanium leaves no metallic smell or taste. The 1\" deep pan doubles as a lid or a sauce pan.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PTFLKqCfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009QM7DSK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B009QNC7XU", "title": "Explorer Duffel Bag", "description": "This 13\" duffel bag was built with water resistant 600D polyester material with a D shape main compartment opening with 2 side pockets, 1 big long pocket in front. PE Board inside, heavy duty webbing, long shoulder strap, 4 rubber stubs at bottom and 2 mesh front pockets for small tools.", "text": "Explorer Duffel Bag This 13\" duffel bag was built with water resistant 600D polyester material with a D shape main compartment opening with 2 side pockets, 1 big long pocket in front. PE Board inside, heavy duty webbing, long shoulder strap, 4 rubber stubs at bottom and 2 mesh front pockets for small tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51u6r8njLmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009QNC7XU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009QX8B2Q", "title": "SecurityIng® 3X CREE XM-L T6 LED 3800Lm LED Headlight Headlamp and Bicycle Light (Generic Packaging)", "description": "Function:3X CREE XM-L T6 3800Lm LED Headlamp.Model of LED: 3X CREE XM-L T6 LED.Luminous Flux: Output brightness can come to 3800 lumens (Maximum).Material:- Aluminum alloy casing, avoid high temperature, anti fall-off.- Aluminum alloy reflector.- Coated Glass Lens.Support Waterproof.Switch Modes: Normal / High / Low / Strobe.Power Source: 1 x 8.4v 4400mAh rechargeable Battery Pack.Charge Method:- 100V ~ 240V battery charger.- LED Indication: Power ON / Charging / Full Charge.With 2 \"O\" type rubber sealing rings for installation:- The lamp support fixing on the bicycle with the rubber ring, working as a bicycle lamp.- Besides, comes with elastic rubber band sealing ring with the lamp, it can also working as a headlamp.Input: 100V-240V, 50/60Hz.Output:- Voltage: DC 8.4V.- Current: 1A.What's In The Box:1 x 3X CREE XM-L T6 LED 3800Lm LED Headlight Headlamp and Bicycle Light.2 x Rubber Rings.1 x 8.4V 4400mAh Battery Pack.1 x Power Adapter(100V-240V).1 x Head Strap.ePathDirect After Service: 30 Days Money Back Guarantee, 12 Months Warranty!Pls note:ePathDirect is the owner of trademark SecurityIng, only purchasing from ePathDirect that you can get 100%quality guarantee,and you can receive it just within 3-5 working days.", "text": "SecurityIng® 3X CREE XM-L T6 LED 3800Lm LED Headlight Headlamp and Bicycle Light (Generic Packaging) Function:3X CREE XM-L T6 3800Lm LED Headlamp.Model of LED: 3X CREE XM-L T6 LED.Luminous Flux: Output brightness can come to 3800 lumens (Maximum).Material:- Aluminum alloy casing, avoid high temperature, anti fall-off.- Aluminum alloy reflector.- Coated Glass Lens.Support Waterproof.Switch Modes: Normal / High / Low / Strobe.Power Source: 1 x 8.4v 4400mAh rechargeable Battery Pack.Charge Method:- 100V ~ 240V battery charger.- LED Indication: Power ON / Charging / Full Charge.With 2 \"O\" type rubber sealing rings for installation:- The lamp support fixing on the bicycle with the rubber ring, working as a bicycle lamp.- Besides, comes with elastic rubber band sealing ring with the lamp, it can also working as a headlamp.Input: 100V-240V, 50/60Hz.Output:- Voltage: DC 8.4V.- Current: 1A.What's In The Box:1 x 3X CREE XM-L T6 LED 3800Lm LED Headlight Headlamp and Bicycle Light.2 x Rubber Rings.1 x 8.4V 4400mAh Battery Pack.1 x Power Adapter(100V-240V).1 x Head Strap.ePathDirect After Service: 30 Days Money Back Guarantee, 12 Months Warranty!Pls note:ePathDirect is the owner of trademark SecurityIng, only purchasing from ePathDirect that you can get 100%quality guarantee,and you can receive it just within 3-5 working days.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EcH9acXRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009QX8B2Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SecurityIng", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 25.97}}
{"item_id": "B009R6B2ZA", "title": "Kelty Redwing 50-Liter Backpack", "description": "The best-selling pack in the Kelty lineup is also the best-selling pack in the outdoor industry. For good reason. Highly utilitarian, the Redwing has all the features and organization needed for simplified travel or an overnight on the trail. With a full-access U-zipper, the Redwing works both as top loader and a panel loader, depending on whether you have the top compression straps clipped or not, adding convenience to any adventure. Organization is the name of the game for the Redwing with zippered side pockets, zippered stash pocket, large front pocket with organization for small items, and the large pocket on the top of the pack. You'll also stay hydrated for any adventure with the hydration compatible design and the water bottle pockets on the side. When you are on the go, the carry handle makes it easy to grab your pack out of where you've stowed it for your trip. Finally, the Redwing suspension is designed for all day carry comfort. The load is kept off your shoulders and support is provided with the Light Beam(tm) single aluminum stay and HDPE frame sheet. The dynamic Airflow back panel and Air Mesh on the shoulder straps, dual density foam waist belt, and lumbar pad will keep you cool when you are working hard. Finally, the load lifters/stabilizers, hip belt stabilizer straps, sternum straps, and Scherer Cinch(tm) waist buckle will help customize the fit and keep the load close to your center of gravity.. Body Fabric: 420D Polyester Ball Shadow. Reinforcement Fabric: 450D Polyester Oxford. Suspension: Light beam(tm) Fixed Suspension System .", "text": "Kelty Redwing 50-Liter Backpack The best-selling pack in the Kelty lineup is also the best-selling pack in the outdoor industry. For good reason. Highly utilitarian, the Redwing has all the features and organization needed for simplified travel or an overnight on the trail. With a full-access U-zipper, the Redwing works both as top loader and a panel loader, depending on whether you have the top compression straps clipped or not, adding convenience to any adventure. Organization is the name of the game for the Redwing with zippered side pockets, zippered stash pocket, large front pocket with organization for small items, and the large pocket on the top of the pack. You'll also stay hydrated for any adventure with the hydration compatible design and the water bottle pockets on the side. When you are on the go, the carry handle makes it easy to grab your pack out of where you've stowed it for your trip. Finally, the Redwing suspension is designed for all day carry comfort. The load is kept off your shoulders and support is provided with the Light Beam(tm) single aluminum stay and HDPE frame sheet. The dynamic Airflow back panel and Air Mesh on the shoulder straps, dual density foam waist belt, and lumbar pad will keep you cool when you are working hard. Finally, the load lifters/stabilizers, hip belt stabilizer straps, sternum straps, and Scherer Cinch(tm) waist buckle will help customize the fit and keep the load close to your center of gravity.. Body Fabric: 420D Polyester Ball Shadow. Reinforcement Fabric: 450D Polyester Oxford. Suspension: Light beam(tm) Fixed Suspension System .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41avt9k%2ButL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009R6B2ZA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009R6B4G2", "title": "Kelty Redwing 44-Liter Backpack", "description": "The best-selling pack in the Kelty lineup is also the best-selling pack in the outdoor industry. For good reason. Highly utilitarian, the Redwing has all the features and organization needed for simplified travel or an overnight on the trail. With a full-access U-zipper, the Redwing works both as top loader and a panel loader, depending on whether you have the top compression straps clipped or not, adding convenience to any adventure. Organization is the name of the game for the Redwing with zippered side pockets, zippered stash pocket, large front pocket with organization for small items, and the large pocket on the top of the pack. You'll also stay hydrated for any adventure with the hydration compatible design and the water bottle pockets on the side. When you are on the go, the carry handle makes it easy to grab your pack out of where you've stowed it for your trip. Finally, the Redwing suspension is designed for all day carry comfort. The load is kept off your shoulders and support is provided with the Light Beam(tm) single aluminum stay and HDPE frame sheet. The dynamic Airflow back panel and Air Mesh on the shoulder straps, dual density foam waist belt, and lumbar pad will keep you cool when you are working hard. Finally, the load lifters/stabilizers, hip belt stabilizer straps, sternum straps, and Scherer Cinch(tm) waist buckle will help customize the fit and keep the load close to your center of gravity.. Body Fabric: 420D Polyester Ball Shadow. Reinforcement Fabric: 450D Polyester Oxford. Suspension: Light beam(tm) Fixed Suspension System .", "text": "Kelty Redwing 44-Liter Backpack The best-selling pack in the Kelty lineup is also the best-selling pack in the outdoor industry. For good reason. Highly utilitarian, the Redwing has all the features and organization needed for simplified travel or an overnight on the trail. With a full-access U-zipper, the Redwing works both