{"item_id": "B009R6J8RY", "title": "100+ Pack of Random Polyhedral Dice in Multiple Colors Plus Free Pouch Set by Wiz Dice", "description": "If you are a hard-core gamer, collect dice, need dice for a school project, fundraiser or other event, this 100 pack of random polyhedral dice is the perfect solution. Your dice will be selected from a bin of randomly allocated 4, 6, 8, 10, 12 and 20-sided dice. Each set of dice will include at least 100 random dice, in which we guarantee multiples of 4, 6, 8, 10, 12 and 20-sided dice. You will receive at least six different colors in this lot, including both translucent and opaque colors. The dice in this set are factory firsts and are brand-new in mint condition. With sharp edges for great random game play, these dice are perfect for math students, teachers, gamers and more. Each die has large numbers to ensure easy reading. The 6 and 9 on each die are clearly marked with an underscore for easy recognition. There are 6.07990119e+35 possible combinations with this set, so you will never receive the same dice combination twice. Each set also comes with a free Wiz Dice seven-pack polyhedral dice set in a velvet pouch. The pack will contain one 4 sided die, one 6-sided die, one 8-sided die, two 10-sided die (one with 0-9 and another with 00-90), one 12-sided die and one 20-sided die. All the dice in free set will be the same color, although the color of each pack may vary.", "text": "100+ Pack of Random Polyhedral Dice in Multiple Colors Plus Free Pouch Set by Wiz Dice If you are a hard-core gamer, collect dice, need dice for a school project, fundraiser or other event, this 100 pack of random polyhedral dice is the perfect solution. Your dice will be selected from a bin of randomly allocated 4, 6, 8, 10, 12 and 20-sided dice. Each set of dice will include at least 100 random dice, in which we guarantee multiples of 4, 6, 8, 10, 12 and 20-sided dice. You will receive at least six different colors in this lot, including both translucent and opaque colors. The dice in this set are factory firsts and are brand-new in mint condition. With sharp edges for great random game play, these dice are perfect for math students, teachers, gamers and more. Each die has large numbers to ensure easy reading. The 6 and 9 on each die are clearly marked with an underscore for easy recognition. There are 6.07990119e+35 possible combinations with this set, so you will never receive the same dice combination twice. Each set also comes with a free Wiz Dice seven-pack polyhedral dice set in a velvet pouch. The pack will contain one 4 sided die, one 6-sided die, one 8-sided die, two 10-sided die (one with 0-9 and another with 00-90), one 12-sided die and one 20-sided die. All the dice in free set will be the same color, although the color of each pack may vary.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517E5LB2aCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009R6J8RY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Casino Equipment", "Dice"]], "price": 19.99}}
