{"item_id": "B009R9FTW4", "title": "Kelty Noah's Tarp Shelter", "description": "The Noah’s Tarp is instant shade. This ultra light, affordable shelter is handy to have aboard when you want weather protection in a hurry, whether you are traveling over land or water. Handy for boating, camping, backpacking and sporting events and festivals.", "text": "Kelty Noah's Tarp Shelter The Noah’s Tarp is instant shade. This ultra light, affordable shelter is handy to have aboard when you want weather protection in a hurry, whether you are traveling over land or water. Handy for boating, camping, backpacking and sporting events and festivals.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Gs56i1UTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009R9FTW4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Tarps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009RA6C1K", "title": "Gymnastic Rings - Premium Heavy Duty Crossfit, Gymnastics, Fitness, Exercise Rings - Gymnastics Training, Equipment- Exercise, Fitness, Bands, Straps, Rings - Home Gym Equipment - #1 Strength & Core Training Equipment- Easy to Set Up, Use, & Adjust - 60 Day Risk Free Guarantee", "description": "The Secret Weapon Gymnasts and Cross fitters Use To Get Ridiculously Muscular and Ripped !★ Premium High Quality Materials.★ #1 Rated Gym Rings on the market: Includes 2 Gymnastic Rings with straps and adjusting buckles★ Supports body-weight exercises such as pull-ups, pushups, dips, muscle ups etc.★ Unlimited body-weight exercises that engage your muscles and core★ Easy to set up, use and adjust. Cross fit Rings are one of the best ways to build lean, strong muscle!★ You will be able to lift heavier weights without wrecking havoc on your wrists nor getting blistering calluses.★ The Rings are made of PC Plastic- supports up to 2,000 lbs.Backed by a Lifetime Free Replacement GuaranteeIMPORTANTBecause of the extremely HIGH DEMAND for this product, we frequently run out of stock.CLICKtheAdd to CartbuttonNOW !to ensure you receive your gym rings within days", "text": "Gymnastic Rings - Premium Heavy Duty Crossfit, Gymnastics, Fitness, Exercise Rings - Gymnastics Training, Equipment- Exercise, Fitness, Bands, Straps, Rings - Home Gym Equipment - #1 Strength & Core Training Equipment- Easy to Set Up, Use, & Adjust - 60 Day Risk Free Guarantee The Secret Weapon Gymnasts and Cross fitters Use To Get Ridiculously Muscular and Ripped !★ Premium High Quality Materials.★ #1 Rated Gym Rings on the market: Includes 2 Gymnastic Rings with straps and adjusting buckles★ Supports body-weight exercises such as pull-ups, pushups, dips, muscle ups etc.★ Unlimited body-weight exercises that engage your muscles and core★ Easy to set up, use and adjust. Cross fit Rings are one of the best ways to build lean, strong muscle!★ You will be able to lift heavier weights without wrecking havoc on your wrists nor getting blistering calluses.★ The Rings are made of PC Plastic- supports up to 2,000 lbs.Backed by a Lifetime Free Replacement GuaranteeIMPORTANTBecause of the extremely HIGH DEMAND for this product, we frequently run out of stock.CLICKtheAdd to CartbuttonNOW !to ensure you receive your gym rings within days", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4117sVBQHHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009RA6C1K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Gymnastics", "Gym & Competition Equipment", "Rings"]], "price": 39.47}}
