{"item_id": "B009RHCQXG", "title": "Rhoads Claw Bicycle Helmet", "description": "The Rhoads S-29 Claw is a rugged, light-weight, high-performance helmet. The Claw's low-profile silhouette, in-molded PC shell and aerodynamic vent configuration make it a great choice for cyclists. Other features include a high impact EPS liner, Ryafoam comfort padding system, quick release adjustments, detachable visor, and a dial adjustable uni-fit sizing system tailored to fit most adult heads.", "text": "Rhoads Claw Bicycle Helmet The Rhoads S-29 Claw is a rugged, light-weight, high-performance helmet. The Claw's low-profile silhouette, in-molded PC shell and aerodynamic vent configuration make it a great choice for cyclists. Other features include a high impact EPS liner, Ryafoam comfort padding system, quick release adjustments, detachable visor, and a dial adjustable uni-fit sizing system tailored to fit most adult heads.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BvSF6sxqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009RHCQXG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 43.35}}
