{"item_id": "B009S2KBPU", "title": "Trademark Innovations High Step Work Out Training Device", "description": "Add High Step to your workout to build lower body strength and get more muscles involved in routine exercises. Aerobic exercise will also improve lower body strength. High Steps can be used for a multitude of different exercises. Product takes almost zero space and can be stored away with great ease unlike so much other exercise equipment out there.", "text": "Trademark Innovations High Step Work Out Training Device Add High Step to your workout to build lower body strength and get more muscles involved in routine exercises. Aerobic exercise will also improve lower body strength. High Steps can be used for a multitude of different exercises. Product takes almost zero space and can be stored away with great ease unlike so much other exercise equipment out there.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MtwLTGSuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009S2KBPU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trademark Innovations", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Step Platforms"]], "price": 35.99}}
