{"item_id": "B009SF7QBE", "title": "MTECH USA Mt-588 Series Neck Knife 4.25-Inch Closed", "description": "A useful survival knife, the fixed MTech MT-588BK is small yet effective tool. It measures 4.25\" in overall length with a black finished stainless steel edge blade. A large thumbhole is also included within the full tang blade for easy gripping. The stainless steel handle is a short and simple black grenade design with a lanyard hole. For protection of both knife and wielder, the item includes a black neck sheath with metal clip and beaded neck chain.", "text": "MTECH USA Mt-588 Series Neck Knife 4.25-Inch Closed A useful survival knife, the fixed MTech MT-588BK is small yet effective tool. It measures 4.25\" in overall length with a black finished stainless steel edge blade. A large thumbhole is also included within the full tang blade for easy gripping. The stainless steel handle is a short and simple black grenade design with a lanyard hole. For protection of both knife and wielder, the item includes a black neck sheath with metal clip and beaded neck chain.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bqOflTYNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009SF7QBE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mtech USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 10.19}}
