{"item_id": "B009SQGRRW", "title": "Condor MOLLE Triple Kangaroo AK Mag Pouch", "description": "Genuine Crye Precision Multicam material, sewn in foreign country - Three AK mag pouch with adjustable Hook & Loop flap, will fit 30rd AK mags - Three pistol mag pouch in the front with adjustable Hook & Loop flap, will fit most pistol mags - MOLLE compatible, two 6\" mod strap is included - Imported", "text": "Condor MOLLE Triple Kangaroo AK Mag Pouch Genuine Crye Precision Multicam material, sewn in foreign country - Three AK mag pouch with adjustable Hook & Loop flap, will fit 30rd AK mags - Three pistol mag pouch in the front with adjustable Hook & Loop flap, will fit most pistol mags - MOLLE compatible, two 6\" mod strap is included - Imported", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ErvQotOkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009SQGRRW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009T6T7Q4", "title": "IPSC & USPSA and 3 Gun Shooting Competition High Speed Belt", "description": "Black Scorpion Competition Belt Systems with Inner and Outer High Torque High Speed Belts. Consistent 1 1/2\" width for easy use with Black Scorpion High Speed Magazine Pouches and other accessories. Availability: Available \"Standard\" with all the new features & in various trim colors at no additional charge. Black Belt with Black or Red Trim. Sizes and Suggestions Shooting Belts are held in place in such way that one end overlaps with the other, so this has to be taken into account when selecting the correct size. Also as the holsters and mag pouches are placed on the belt, the total available length is reduced. Black Scorpion Belts are presented in sizes of S, M, L, XL and XXL the Suggested waist size per belt size is as follows: Belt Size (Small) 38\"S: Waist Sizes 26\" to 28\" Belt Size (Medium) 43\"M: Waist Sizes 30\" to 33\" Belt Size (Large) 47\"L: Waist Sizes 34\" to 36\" Belt Size (Xtra Large) 51\"XL: Waist Sizes 38\" to 40\" Belt Size (Double Xtra Large) 55\"XXL: Waist Sizes 42\" to 44\" Belt Size (Triple Xtra Large) 59\"XXXL: Waist Sizes 46\" to 48\"", "text": "IPSC & USPSA and 3 Gun Shooting Competition High Speed Belt Black Scorpion Competition Belt Systems with Inner and Outer High Torque High Speed Belts. Consistent 1 1/2\" width for easy use with Black Scorpion High Speed Magazine Pouches and other accessories. Availability: Available \"Standard\" with all the new features & in various trim colors at no additional charge. Black Belt with Black or Red Trim. Sizes and Suggestions Shooting Belts are held in place in such way that one end overlaps with the other, so this has to be taken into account when selecting the correct size. Also as the holsters and mag pouches are placed on the belt, the total available length is reduced. Black Scorpion Belts are presented in sizes of S, M, L, XL and XXL the Suggested waist size per belt size is as follows: Belt Size (Small) 38\"S: Waist Sizes 26\" to 28\" Belt Size (Medium) 43\"M: Waist Sizes 30\" to 33\" Belt Size (Large) 47\"L: Waist Sizes 34\" to 36\" Belt Size (Xtra Large) 51\"XL: Waist Sizes 38\" to 40\" Belt Size (Double Xtra Large) 55\"XXL: Waist Sizes 42\" to 44\" Belt Size (Triple Xtra Large) 59\"XXXL: Waist Sizes 46\" to 48\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GosaEbKuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009T6T7Q4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 36.45}}
