{"item_id": "B009TAO0NA", "title": "Minotaur MTAC Holster - Black Leather Backing - 1.50 Black C Clips", "description": "Behind-the-hip (4 o'clock position), Tuckable, Adjustable Cant, Slim Profile, Adjustable Ride Depth, Interchangeable Spare Bodies The Minotaur MTAC is the ultimate level of deep concealment on the market today. This \"hybrid\" holster combines cowhide leather backing with a Kydex half-shell mounted on the leather. The leather backing provides the desired comfort achieved by leather holsters. The Kydex half-shell provides the reliable, consistent draw and re-holstering capabilities that make Kydex holsters so popular. Interchangeable Spare Bodies - One holster for all your guns! The Kydex half-shell (also called \"Spare Body\") on this model is interchangeable and can be swapped out for different handguns. Adjustable Cant and Ride Depth The clips on the MTAC can be re-positioned to ride higher or lower on the holster. This allows the cant (angle) to be adjusted more or less depending on user preference. The ride depth can also be adjusted in the same manner. Interchangeable Clips The clips can be swapped out for different styles, colors, and belt widths. Leather Backing Notice Leather is a natural material and shades may vary from hide to hide. We do fit check EVERY holster with the actual pistol. Due to this fit process, there may be small scuffs on the inside of the holster. This is normal and caused by the fit process.", "text": "Minotaur MTAC Holster - Black Leather Backing - 1.50 Black C Clips Behind-the-hip (4 o'clock position), Tuckable, Adjustable Cant, Slim Profile, Adjustable Ride Depth, Interchangeable Spare Bodies The Minotaur MTAC is the ultimate level of deep concealment on the market today. This \"hybrid\" holster combines cowhide leather backing with a Kydex half-shell mounted on the leather. The leather backing provides the desired comfort achieved by leather holsters. The Kydex half-shell provides the reliable, consistent draw and re-holstering capabilities that make Kydex holsters so popular. Interchangeable Spare Bodies - One holster for all your guns! The Kydex half-shell (also called \"Spare Body\") on this model is interchangeable and can be swapped out for different handguns. Adjustable Cant and Ride Depth The clips on the MTAC can be re-positioned to ride higher or lower on the holster. This allows the cant (angle) to be adjusted more or less depending on user preference. The ride depth can also be adjusted in the same manner. Interchangeable Clips The clips can be swapped out for different styles, colors, and belt widths. Leather Backing Notice Leather is a natural material and shades may vary from hide to hide. We do fit check EVERY holster with the actual pistol. Due to this fit process, there may be small scuffs on the inside of the holster. This is normal and caused by the fit process.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ginHuWPDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009TAO0NA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 90.0}}
{"item_id": "B009TBERKA", "title": "Leupold 115370 Mark AR MOD 1 Rifle", "description": "NEW Leupold Mark AR MOD 1 3-9x40mm P5 Dial Riflescope, Matte Black, FireDot TMR Reticle 115370", "text": "Leupold 115370 Mark AR MOD 1 Rifle NEW Leupold Mark AR MOD 1 3-9x40mm P5 Dial Riflescope, Matte Black, FireDot TMR Reticle 115370", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xuYsifnwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009TBERKA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leupold", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 439.99}}
{"item_id": "B009TBESRW", "title": "LaserLyte TLB-RT Reaction Tyme Laser Target", "description": "LaserLyte, innovators in firearms laser technologies, have developed a new interactive target system with dual modes for reaction and training; the Reaction Tyme Target, TLB-RT. This new laser training system comes with two (2) targets for more realistic training scenarios. Each target works independently of each other providing the user a variety of scenarios from near-to-far or left-to-right shooting. The interactive system works in two modes; reaction and training. The reaction mode features random LED signals in intervals of three to seven seconds that can be shot with any of the LaserLyte Trainers. When a hit is made the target celebrates with two beeps and a LED flash. The training mode allows the user to practice trigger control and accuracy with an always-on and ready-to-be-shot mode. When a hit is made, the target sounds two beeps and the LED flash. The LaserLyte Reaction Tyme Target allow for new and experienced shooters to gain increased levels of confidence and skills in the comfort of their own home while saving money on ammunition. The twin targets provide an active training session that can be set-up in a variety of ways. Any of the LaserLyte Trainers work with the TLB-RT including the LT-PRO, LT-1 and the LaserLyte Trainer Cartridges in .223, .380, 9mm, .40 S and W and .45 ACP.", "text": "LaserLyte TLB-RT Reaction Tyme Laser Target LaserLyte, innovators in firearms laser technologies, have developed a new interactive target system with dual modes for reaction and training; the Reaction Tyme Target, TLB-RT. This new laser training system comes with two (2) targets for more realistic training scenarios. Each target works independently of each other providing the user a variety of scenarios from near-to-far or left-to-right shooting. The interactive system works in two modes; reaction and training. The reaction mode features random LED signals in intervals of three to seven seconds that can be shot with any of the LaserLyte Trainers. When a hit is made the target celebrates with two beeps and a LED flash. The training mode allows the user to practice trigger control and accuracy with an always-on and ready-to-be-shot mode. When a hit is made, the target sounds two beeps and the LED flash. The LaserLyte Reaction Tyme Target allow for new and experienced shooters to gain increased levels of confidence and skills in the comfort of their own home while saving money on ammunition. The twin targets provide an active training session that can be set-up in a variety of ways. Any of the LaserLyte Trainers work with the TLB-RT including the LT-PRO, LT-1 and the LaserLyte Trainer Cartridges in .223, .380, 9mm, .40 S and W and .45 ACP.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516ExE5WTgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009TBESRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 104.93}}
{"item_id": "B009TOTIII", "title": "Intsun®Q5 CREE 240 Lumen LED Bike Bicycle Headlight Torch and Bike Holder Super BRIGHT!!!!", "description": "CREE Q5 LED Flashlight w/ Holster (3 modes 240lum)Package includes: One Flash Light and Holster.The flashlight is made with metal and magnesium alloy material.Thickness, hardness and texture are considered excellent.The 240 lumen CREE LED Q5 head has high brightness, high beam stability and light color close to natural light, which will help to identify the true color of an object.Blinking function can be served as a warning. Uses 3 AAA batteries (not inlcuded);it is best to use alkaline batteries that makes power more robust and last longer.Ideal for mountain climbing, biking, camping, hiking and other outdoor sports;usually at home can also be used for reading, repairing, responding power failures and so on.It is a multi-purpose must have tool. Overall end-to-end length: 103mm (~4 inches) when zoom in 114mm (~4.5 inches) when zoom out", "text": "Intsun®Q5 CREE 240 Lumen LED Bike Bicycle Headlight Torch and Bike Holder Super BRIGHT!!!! CREE Q5 LED Flashlight w/ Holster (3 modes 240lum)Package includes: One Flash Light and Holster.The flashlight is made with metal and magnesium alloy material.Thickness, hardness and texture are considered excellent.The 240 lumen CREE LED Q5 head has high brightness, high beam stability and light color close to natural light, which will help to identify the true color of an object.Blinking function can be served as a warning. Uses 3 AAA batteries (not inlcuded);it is best to use alkaline batteries that makes power more robust and last longer.Ideal for mountain climbing, biking, camping, hiking and other outdoor sports;usually at home can also be used for reading, repairing, responding power failures and so on.It is a multi-purpose must have tool. Overall end-to-end length: 103mm (~4 inches) when zoom in 114mm (~4.5 inches) when zoom out", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410CaNq6umL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009TOTIII.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intsun", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 7.05}}
{"item_id": "B009TUEKAS", "title": "Custom \"Dragon Scales\" High-Impact Polymer 1911 Grips in Black", "description": "These grips are made from high-strength polymer. The grips have the aggressive \"DRAGON SCALES\" checkering/texture. Since these are polymer, they are SUPER DURABLE for the field & everyday carry. They are virtually indestructible! ...AND they give a touch of class to your firearm! You will not be disappointed! These grips are cast & molded from a hand-carved wood prototype set which gives the imperfections some character in the pattern/texture design.", "text": "Custom \"Dragon Scales\" High-Impact Polymer 1911 Grips in Black These grips are made from high-strength polymer. The grips have the aggressive \"DRAGON SCALES\" checkering/texture. Since these are polymer, they are SUPER DURABLE for the field & everyday carry. They are virtually indestructible! ...AND they give a touch of class to your firearm! You will not be disappointed! These grips are cast & molded from a hand-carved wood prototype set which gives the imperfections some character in the pattern/texture design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GBj19xcNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009TUEKAS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 50.0}}
{"item_id": "B009UC76VA", "title": "American Trails Ozzie and Harriet Double 2 Person Giant Sleeping Bag, 80-Inch x 66-Inch", "description": "Zips together for one Giant bag and can also be used as two separate bags. The two bags zipped together makes the dimensions 66\" x 80\".", "text": "American Trails Ozzie and Harriet Double 2 Person Giant Sleeping Bag, 80-Inch x 66-Inch Zips together for one Giant bag and can also be used as two separate bags. The two bags zipped together makes the dimensions 66\" x 80\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yAPMEP-mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009UC76VA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "American Trails", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B009UF8NEQ", "title": "K-Edge PRO Braze-On Chain Catcher", "description": "While modern drivetrains have made respectable efforts to prevent dropped chains, it can -- and will -- still happen. And if it happens on a new carbon frame, you're going to have a bad time. For added insurance against a gouges and scratches, install the K-Edge PRO Braze-On Chain Catcher. Not only is the K-Edge a frame safeguard, it also ensures you don't miss a big ring to inner ring shift when you need it the most -- right before a harrowing climb. Its lightweight aluminum construction simply attaches to frames with braze-on front derailleurs mounts with the included hardware. Made from CNC-machined 6061 T6 aluminum in Boise, ID., it weighs 10g and is available in six colors -- Black, Blue, Gunmetal, Gold, Red, and White. It comes with 2 mounting bolts -- 20mm for Shimano or Campagnolo (except Campy EPS), and a 25mm for SRAM.", "text": "K-Edge PRO Braze-On Chain Catcher While modern drivetrains have made respectable efforts to prevent dropped chains, it can -- and will -- still happen. And if it happens on a new carbon frame, you're going to have a bad time. For added insurance against a gouges and scratches, install the K-Edge PRO Braze-On Chain Catcher. Not only is the K-Edge a frame safeguard, it also ensures you don't miss a big ring to inner ring shift when you need it the most -- right before a harrowing climb. Its lightweight aluminum construction simply attaches to frames with braze-on front derailleurs mounts with the included hardware. Made from CNC-machined 6061 T6 aluminum in Boise, ID., it weighs 10g and is available in six colors -- Black, Blue, Gunmetal, Gold, Red, and White. It comes with 2 mounting bolts -- 20mm for Shimano or Campagnolo (except Campy EPS), and a 25mm for SRAM.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GGpQ7ZqWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009UF8NEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "K-Edge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Chain Deflectors"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B009UFC7I4", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Ferox Folding Knife", "description": "Product Details Introducing the Maxpedition FEROX Folding Knife in plain edge. Primed for everyday use, this durable cutting tool is a perfect addition to every Maxpedition bag. At Maxpedition, we believe that the best knife is the knife you have on you. Maxpedition founder Tim Tang draws on his passion for tactical knives and a decade of collaborations with the industry's top custom knife makers to debut his own folder design. Engineered for utility and accessibility, the FEROX Folding Knife features a sleek jet-black blade with optimal point and edge geometries to provide a high degree of control during precise cutting tasks. Combine an ergonomic fiber-reinforced nylon handle with a fast-action opening flipper and you have a trusted quality tool that will perform in any situation or environment. You'll want to pack a FEROX in every one of your Maxpedition bags. The FEROX Folding Knife is available in two edge types: General purpose plain edge (#FEROXP) to maximize cutting edge for practical every day use. Field-maintainable serrated edge (#FEROXS) for tackling tough or fibrous materials.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Ferox Folding Knife Product Details Introducing the Maxpedition FEROX Folding Knife in plain edge. Primed for everyday use, this durable cutting tool is a perfect addition to every Maxpedition bag. At Maxpedition, we believe that the best knife is the knife you have on you. Maxpedition founder Tim Tang draws on his passion for tactical knives and a decade of collaborations with the industry's top custom knife makers to debut his own folder design. Engineered for utility and accessibility, the FEROX Folding Knife features a sleek jet-black blade with optimal point and edge geometries to provide a high degree of control during precise cutting tasks. Combine an ergonomic fiber-reinforced nylon handle with a fast-action opening flipper and you have a trusted quality tool that will perform in any situation or environment. You'll want to pack a FEROX in every one of your Maxpedition bags. The FEROX Folding Knife is available in two edge types: General purpose plain edge (#FEROXP) to maximize cutting edge for practical every day use. Field-maintainable serrated edge (#FEROXS) for tackling tough or fibrous materials.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411K7nRZXQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009UFC7I4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]], "price": 21.44}}
{"item_id": "B009UVF9U6", "title": "High Performance and Very Popular Outdoor SRM Sanrenmu GB-763 Folding Knife Pocket Knife (Bottle opener)", "description": "mechnism:axis lockBlade style&opener;: drop point blade, ambidextrous thumb-studsBlade steel: 8Cr13MoV stainless steel (56-58HRC)Handle spec:G10 Handle Scales, Reversible Tip-Up Pocket Clip, Lanyard HoleBlade length: 65mmOpen:156mmClose: 93mm", "text": "High Performance and Very Popular Outdoor SRM Sanrenmu GB-763 Folding Knife Pocket Knife (Bottle opener) mechnism:axis lockBlade style&opener;: drop point blade, ambidextrous thumb-studsBlade steel: 8Cr13MoV stainless steel (56-58HRC)Handle spec:G10 Handle Scales, Reversible Tip-Up Pocket Clip, Lanyard HoleBlade length: 65mmOpen:156mmClose: 93mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HAztvE8EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009UVF9U6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009UW2VJW", "title": "Alite Designs Mantis Chair", "description": "The Mantis Chair makes lounging effortless, so consider relocating your living room to the back yard. With a base that’s as strong as it is streamlined, you can sit to your heart’s content. And your backside will be straight-chilling’ in our body-hugging sling.", "text": "Alite Designs Mantis Chair The Mantis Chair makes lounging effortless, so consider relocating your living room to the back yard. With a base that’s as strong as it is streamlined, you can sit to your heart’s content. And your backside will be straight-chilling’ in our body-hugging sling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gXiae62%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009UW2VJW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Alite Designs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 102.95}}
{"item_id": "B009UW31MS", "title": "Alite Designs Mayfly Chair", "description": "The Mayfly Chair will revolutionize the way you lounge and enjoy the great indoors/outdoors. With the optional front leg, cherish the chair at its most superlight weight, a mere 1.15 lbs. and rock away.", "text": "Alite Designs Mayfly Chair The Mayfly Chair will revolutionize the way you lounge and enjoy the great indoors/outdoors. With the optional front leg, cherish the chair at its most superlight weight, a mere 1.15 lbs. and rock away.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dYvChtWvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009UW31MS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Alite Designs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 83.7}}
{"item_id": "B009V5HXGO", "title": "Modern Warrior Tactical Vest with Holster and Pouches - In Camouflage, ACU, Black, Desert, and Teen Sizes", "description": "This black premium tactical vest by Modern Warrior is the perfect outdoors or hunting vest. Numerous pocket gives you great storage capacity. Adjustable torso allows for size to fit all comfortably. Has straps on side/torso area and around waist for maximum comfort in fit. Padding on right shoulder for recoil, rifle and handgun magazine pockets, shotgun shell holders, handgun holster and much more. Great for outdoors camping, hunting, airsoft, and much more. Strong, large, durable zippers and mesh make this item strong and sure to last many years. Manufactured by Modern Warrior.", "text": "Modern Warrior Tactical Vest with Holster and Pouches - In Camouflage, ACU, Black, Desert, and Teen Sizes This black premium tactical vest by Modern Warrior is the perfect outdoors or hunting vest. Numerous pocket gives you great storage capacity. Adjustable torso allows for size to fit all comfortably. Has straps on side/torso area and around waist for maximum comfort in fit. Padding on right shoulder for recoil, rifle and handgun magazine pockets, shotgun shell holders, handgun holster and much more. Great for outdoors camping, hunting, airsoft, and much more. Strong, large, durable zippers and mesh make this item strong and sure to last many years. Manufactured by Modern Warrior.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517sxQYcu%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009V5HXGO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Modern Warrior", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tactical Vests"]], "price": 33.3}}
{"item_id": "B009V5Z88E", "title": "Modern Warrior Camouflage Hunting and Tactical Net, 12.5-Feet x 5-Feet", "description": "This Modern Warrior tactical came netting is perfect for hiding items in the outdoors or as a cool household item for any outdoors-loving person. Item is fire-retardant and waterproof. Measures 12 2/3 foot x 5 foot. Manufactured by Modern Warrior.", "text": "Modern Warrior Camouflage Hunting and Tactical Net, 12.5-Feet x 5-Feet This Modern Warrior tactical came netting is perfect for hiding items in the outdoors or as a cool household item for any outdoors-loving person. Item is fire-retardant and waterproof. Measures 12 2/3 foot x 5 foot. Manufactured by Modern Warrior.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514y3NEOivL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009V5Z88E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Modern Warrior", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 27.99}}
