{"item_id": "B009WGFYRC", "title": "Serfas Thunderbolt USB Taillight", "description": "Serfas' Thunderbolt Taillight gives you style and safety in one high-powered and affordable package. Being seen on your bike at night never looked so good until Serfas' Thunderbolt Taillight hit the scene. This USB rechargeable gem comes with 35 lumens of firepower while giving riders' several different rear facing mounting options. The 30 micro-LED strip will let your presence be known to cars and bikes alike. The rechargeable Lithium Polymer battery will have you saying good bye to buying additional batteries and hello to saving the earth and all your hard earned money. Charge up, light up and get riding safely with the Thunderbolt.", "text": "Serfas Thunderbolt USB Taillight Serfas' Thunderbolt Taillight gives you style and safety in one high-powered and affordable package. Being seen on your bike at night never looked so good until Serfas' Thunderbolt Taillight hit the scene. This USB rechargeable gem comes with 35 lumens of firepower while giving riders' several different rear facing mounting options. The 30 micro-LED strip will let your presence be known to cars and bikes alike. The rechargeable Lithium Polymer battery will have you saying good bye to buying additional batteries and hello to saving the earth and all your hard earned money. Charge up, light up and get riding safely with the Thunderbolt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31N3RxvyboL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009WGFYRC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009WO1UT0", "title": "Bulldog Cases Economy Tactical Case with Zombie Details, Black, 38-Inch", "description": "Economy - Black 38\" Tactical Case with Zombie Details INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 36\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for zipper** Unique coffin shape and plush red interior Zombie green logo, trim and zipper Full-length zipper with pull Heavy duty double stitching Three magazine pockets Removable, adjustable shoulder strap with swivels New, improved shape accommodates scoped and non-scoped rifles.", "text": "Bulldog Cases Economy Tactical Case with Zombie Details, Black, 38-Inch Economy - Black 38\" Tactical Case with Zombie Details INSIDE MEASUREMENT: [Fits guns up to 36\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for zipper** Unique coffin shape and plush red interior Zombie green logo, trim and zipper Full-length zipper with pull Heavy duty double stitching Three magazine pockets Removable, adjustable shoulder strap with swivels New, improved shape accommodates scoped and non-scoped rifles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WuMlM6AiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009WO1UT0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 39.4}}
