{"item_id": "B009X0HU0G", "title": "Red-Green 4 Reticle Red Dot Open Reflex Sight - By OTG", "description": "Acquire your target more quickly, fire a more accurate shot, and add a rugged tactical look to your firearm with this red dot sight. In addition to windage and elevation adjustments, there are four different reticle patterns and three brightness settings to choose from with red and green options. Durable anodized aluminum is water- and shock-proof, and the unit mounts easily with a standard weaver rail base.Features1X magnification33-millimeter objective aperture24 x 34 objective diameterThree-inch length4.2-ounce weight4 Separate Reticle Patterns In Both Red and Green6 Different Brightness Settings (3-Red 3-Green)Integral Weaver-Picatinny Rail BaseOpen red dot sight with windage and elevation adjustmentsExclusively Sold by Online Tactical Gear. Sellers other than Online Tactical Gear will not have the same product as listed.", "text": "Red-Green 4 Reticle Red Dot Open Reflex Sight - By OTG Acquire your target more quickly, fire a more accurate shot, and add a rugged tactical look to your firearm with this red dot sight. In addition to windage and elevation adjustments, there are four different reticle patterns and three brightness settings to choose from with red and green options. Durable anodized aluminum is water- and shock-proof, and the unit mounts easily with a standard weaver rail base.Features1X magnification33-millimeter objective aperture24 x 34 objective diameterThree-inch length4.2-ounce weight4 Separate Reticle Patterns In Both Red and Green6 Different Brightness Settings (3-Red 3-Green)Integral Weaver-Picatinny Rail BaseOpen red dot sight with windage and elevation adjustmentsExclusively Sold by Online Tactical Gear. Sellers other than Online Tactical Gear will not have the same product as listed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-atAmv5OL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009X0HU0G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Online Tactical Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 27.58}}
