{"item_id": "B009XN20G2", "title": "Ka-Bar Heavy Bowie Knife, Large", "description": "Extra-thick blade makes this knife almost as rugged as pry bars. The Large Heavy Bowie will perform well at chopping, digging, cutting, and in other tough applications.", "text": "Ka-Bar Heavy Bowie Knife, Large Extra-thick blade makes this knife almost as rugged as pry bars. The Large Heavy Bowie will perform well at chopping, digging, cutting, and in other tough applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ho6kLltXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009XN20G2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 51.01}}
{"item_id": "B009XXJV3M", "title": "Light and Dark Throwing Knife 12 Piece Set", "description": "This pack of throwing knives gives you the highest quality for an affordable price. This set includes six silver knives and six black knives, all dagger blades, all well balance for throwing. Each features cord-wrapped handles for a great grip, lanyard holes, and short guards. This set includes a nylon sheath that holds all six. Knives measure 6' overall.", "text": "Light and Dark Throwing Knife 12 Piece Set This pack of throwing knives gives you the highest quality for an affordable price. This set includes six silver knives and six black knives, all dagger blades, all well balance for throwing. Each features cord-wrapped handles for a great grip, lanyard holes, and short guards. This set includes a nylon sheath that holds all six. Knives measure 6' overall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dtRiQXqnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009XXJV3M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009XXKALO", "title": "The Hunted Forest Tracker T-3 Hunting Bowie Knife", "description": "The wide Tracker replica knife is a thick and functional unit originally designed for intense labor purposes. Two cutting edges are featured for reliability and flexibility. Stainless steel is used for a high quality material. This tracker knife has a serrated upper spine. The full tang is a single piece that spans through the handle. Natural wooden grips are stained black and feel remarkably natural when held. This knife type has so many functions it meets criteria for a machete, hatchet, wedge, knife, saw, and striker. The Hunted Tracker T-3 comes with a stiff nylon sheath and can be fixed to the belt.", "text": "The Hunted Forest Tracker T-3 Hunting Bowie Knife The wide Tracker replica knife is a thick and functional unit originally designed for intense labor purposes. Two cutting edges are featured for reliability and flexibility. Stainless steel is used for a high quality material. This tracker knife has a serrated upper spine. The full tang is a single piece that spans through the handle. Natural wooden grips are stained black and feel remarkably natural when held. This knife type has so many functions it meets criteria for a machete, hatchet, wedge, knife, saw, and striker. The Hunted Tracker T-3 comes with a stiff nylon sheath and can be fixed to the belt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BXYrO6TsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009XXKALO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Armory Replicas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B009YCWQES", "title": "WeiHeng® Force Ball Power Gyro Wrist Ball", "description": "Our registered brand to USPTO: WeihengPackage:WeiHeng special package and WeiHeng LOGO stickered, please report to amazon if you receive a counterfeit copy.The best and easy way to improve your hand strength,Prevent injury, sore wrist and tennis elbow ( Lateral Epicondyle) or even get rid of it.Power up your finger, wrist, forearm, bicep etc. & Take your games into next level.It's a very nice gift for sport lovers too Easy to start with the starting rope, thumb or even just using one hand,Max spins over 16,000 RPM (World record is already over 16,000 RPM) Intergrated computer balanced stainless steel rotor (Cheaper models only can reach 6,000 ~ 8,000 RPM, because unbalanced rotor causes too much vibration, so don't let the lower price fool you.)Package IncludesWrist ball x 1Starting rope x 1Wrist rope x 1English Instruction x 1", "text": "WeiHeng® Force Ball Power Gyro Wrist Ball Our registered brand to USPTO: WeihengPackage:WeiHeng special package and WeiHeng LOGO stickered, please report to amazon if you receive a counterfeit copy.The best and easy way to improve your hand strength,Prevent injury, sore wrist and tennis elbow ( Lateral Epicondyle) or even get rid of it.Power up your finger, wrist, forearm, bicep etc. & Take your games into next level.It's a very nice gift for sport lovers too Easy to start with the starting rope, thumb or even just using one hand,Max spins over 16,000 RPM (World record is already over 16,000 RPM) Intergrated computer balanced stainless steel rotor (Cheaper models only can reach 6,000 ~ 8,000 RPM, because unbalanced rotor causes too much vibration, so don't let the lower price fool you.)Package IncludesWrist ball x 1Starting rope x 1Wrist rope x 1English Instruction x 1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BAfXJv6dL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009YCWQES.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]]}}
