{"item_id": "B009YZT2UQ", "title": "Empire Paintball 2013 Grind Pro THT Chest Protectors (click-a-Size)", "description": "The Empire Grind THT Chest Protector is a fully padded paintball undershirt that keeps you cool with moisture-wicking properties. Stay safe from those painful impacts with plenty of chest, shoulder, and upper arm padding while staying cool, especially under a high-performance Empire Paintball jersey!", "text": "Empire Paintball 2013 Grind Pro THT Chest Protectors (click-a-Size) The Empire Grind THT Chest Protector is a fully padded paintball undershirt that keeps you cool with moisture-wicking properties. Stay safe from those painful impacts with plenty of chest, shoulder, and upper arm padding while staying cool, especially under a high-performance Empire Paintball jersey!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51V0t93A63L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009YZT2UQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Empire Paintball", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Chest Protectors"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B009ZCADGU", "title": "Centerpoint Enclose Reflex Sight Single Dot 30 mmTube with Picatinny Mount, Red/Green", "description": "Quick target acquisition with a single red dot, integrated rings and flip covers. Wide FOV, unlimited eye relief, fits Picatinny mounts, phase coated optics.", "text": "Centerpoint Enclose Reflex Sight Single Dot 30 mmTube with Picatinny Mount, Red/Green Quick target acquisition with a single red dot, integrated rings and flip covers. Wide FOV, unlimited eye relief, fits Picatinny mounts, phase coated optics.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vXkVJpcbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ZCADGU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CenterPoint", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B009ZILIJA", "title": "Brass Stacker TPT22ML Magazine Loader for Taurus PT22 Pistols, Black", "description": "CNC machined from non-marring DuPont Delrin a high performance acetal thermoplastic that is tough, stiff, impact and abrasion resistant. Easy to use ergonomic design for use with your .22 caliber pistol. Includes a detachable lanyard. Made in America with a 100% Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "Brass Stacker TPT22ML Magazine Loader for Taurus PT22 Pistols, Black CNC machined from non-marring DuPont Delrin a high performance acetal thermoplastic that is tough, stiff, impact and abrasion resistant. Easy to use ergonomic design for use with your .22 caliber pistol. Includes a detachable lanyard. Made in America with a 100% Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IaRHPL0BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ZILIJA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 17.0}}
{"item_id": "B009ZJ5L92", "title": "Gorilla Paracord® Nylon 550lb Type III 7 Strand Paracord Made in the U.S.A.", "description": "Our 550 Commercial Type III Parachute Cord is tough! Made with 100% raw nylon materials combined with a minimum of 550lb breaking strength this Paracord is the \"Real\" 550 cord. Paracord has literally 100's of survival applications as well as many apparel applications. Whether you carrying it around in your pack or wearing it on your wrist, Paracord is the one thing you do not want to be without. It is available in many different colors, and patterns and also in several different hank sizes.", "text": "Gorilla Paracord® Nylon 550lb Type III 7 Strand Paracord Made in the U.S.A. Our 550 Commercial Type III Parachute Cord is tough! Made with 100% raw nylon materials combined with a minimum of 550lb breaking strength this Paracord is the \"Real\" 550 cord. Paracord has literally 100's of survival applications as well as many apparel applications. Whether you carrying it around in your pack or wearing it on your wrist, Paracord is the one thing you do not want to be without. It is available in many different colors, and patterns and also in several different hank sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bQPzJJW9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ZJ5L92.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B009ZKHD3S", "title": "Hammers .22 Crossbow Airgun Scope Rail Adapter Riser 3/8inch 11mm Dovetail to Weaver w/ Stop Pin", "description": "- Great for use on .22 rifles, airguns and crossbows with dovetail rails- Converts dovetail base to Weaver/Picatinny tactical rail- Made from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy with matte black finish- Built in pointed stop pin and 3 clamping screws for extra holding power on spring airguns (needs to have predrilled receiver to apply)- Machined aluminum alloy in flat black finish- Weight: 2.3 ounces- Rail Type: Picatinny/Weaver- Length: 3.9 inches (100mm)", "text": "Hammers .22 Crossbow Airgun Scope Rail Adapter Riser 3/8inch 11mm Dovetail to Weaver w/ Stop Pin - Great for use on .22 rifles, airguns and crossbows with dovetail rails- Converts dovetail base to Weaver/Picatinny tactical rail- Made from aircraft-grade aluminum alloy with matte black finish- Built in pointed stop pin and 3 clamping screws for extra holding power on spring airguns (needs to have predrilled receiver to apply)- Machined aluminum alloy in flat black finish- Weight: 2.3 ounces- Rail Type: Picatinny/Weaver- Length: 3.9 inches (100mm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bdJ7NiQ-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ZKHD3S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hammers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Tools & Accessories", "Mounts"]], "price": 12.8}}
{"item_id": "B009ZLBHDO", "title": "TMS AR15 M4 One Piece Offset 1inch Scope Mount w/ Accessory Rails Picatinny Weaver Base", "description": "An one piece offset scope mount to install magnified long riflescope of 1inch tube for easier eye relief setup. Very helpful when mounting a scope with longer eyepiece tube. Integral rings have accessory rail built in on top and on the sides for mounting additional accessories such as laser sight, flashlight or backup sight.Integral Ring Size: 1inchCenterline Height - 31mmMachined from extruded aluminum alloy 6061Anodized black matte finishClamp attachment - two hex nutsSaddle Height (from top of base rail to bottom of ring cradle): 18mmOverall height 2.13\"Overall length 5.33\"Offset length: 1.10\"(28mm)Inner space between the rings 54mm (2.14inch)Ring width: 1.02inchRecoil lug: cross-slot screw shaftMount weight: 6.2oz.", "text": "TMS AR15 M4 One Piece Offset 1inch Scope Mount w/ Accessory Rails Picatinny Weaver Base An one piece offset scope mount to install magnified long riflescope of 1inch tube for easier eye relief setup. Very helpful when mounting a scope with longer eyepiece tube. Integral rings have accessory rail built in on top and on the sides for mounting additional accessories such as laser sight, flashlight or backup sight.Integral Ring Size: 1inchCenterline Height - 31mmMachined from extruded aluminum alloy 6061Anodized black matte finishClamp attachment - two hex nutsSaddle Height (from top of base rail to bottom of ring cradle): 18mmOverall height 2.13\"Overall length 5.33\"Offset length: 1.10\"(28mm)Inner space between the rings 54mm (2.14inch)Ring width: 1.02inchRecoil lug: cross-slot screw shaftMount weight: 6.2oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JkbNqRljL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ZLBHDO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TMS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 27.19}}
{"item_id": "B009ZM11XO", "title": "SKLZ ProStance Inflatable Balance Trainer", "description": "The ProStance balance trainer develops improved balance throughout the entire swing. It also promotes a more athletic stance and ideal posture by quickly detecting balance and weight distribution issues for any type of shot.", "text": "SKLZ ProStance Inflatable Balance Trainer The ProStance balance trainer develops improved balance throughout the entire swing. It also promotes a more athletic stance and ideal posture by quickly detecting balance and weight distribution issues for any type of shot.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21WBKKDMUaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ZM11XO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Swing Trainers"]], "price": 58.84}}
{"item_id": "B009ZMZDYM", "title": "Tate Labs Bar Fly 1.1 - Men's", "description": "Tate Labs designed the original Bar Fly as an out-in-front Garmin cycling computer mount to replace the more sensitive stock version. The Bar Fly 1. 1 is the updated version of the original Bar Fly, complete with a redesigned engagement system and even lower price. At the heart of the Bar Fly 1. 1 is its new 1/8th turn technology. This positive engagement system enables cross compatibility with all Garmin Edge series cycling computers and the Garmin Forerunner 910 XT and 310 XT watches. Simply lock your Garmin in with a 1/8th turn and you're all set. The Bar Fly 1. 1 is manufactured in the USA out of Delrin, which is a stiff thermoplastic used in applications where durability is a must. With no screws to lose, and 'zero-risk of over-clamping and crushing lightweight carbon bars,' the Bar Fly 1. 1 positions all of your Garmin devices directly in the center of the handlebar for a safe viewing position. Give yourself some peace of mind knowing that your valuable cycling computer is locked in place and guarded from the roads, trails, and bumps below. The Tate Labs Bar Fly 1. 1 is available in Black and is only compatible with 31. 8mm diameter handlebars.", "text": "Tate Labs Bar Fly 1.1 - Men's Tate Labs designed the original Bar Fly as an out-in-front Garmin cycling computer mount to replace the more sensitive stock version. The Bar Fly 1. 1 is the updated version of the original Bar Fly, complete with a redesigned engagement system and even lower price. At the heart of the Bar Fly 1. 1 is its new 1/8th turn technology. This positive engagement system enables cross compatibility with all Garmin Edge series cycling computers and the Garmin Forerunner 910 XT and 310 XT watches. Simply lock your Garmin in with a 1/8th turn and you're all set. The Bar Fly 1. 1 is manufactured in the USA out of Delrin, which is a stiff thermoplastic used in applications where durability is a must. With no screws to lose, and 'zero-risk of over-clamping and crushing lightweight carbon bars,' the Bar Fly 1. 1 positions all of your Garmin devices directly in the center of the handlebar for a safe viewing position. Give yourself some peace of mind knowing that your valuable cycling computer is locked in place and guarded from the roads, trails, and bumps below. The Tate Labs Bar Fly 1. 1 is available in Black and is only compatible with 31. 8mm diameter handlebars.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312ec1wT79L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ZMZDYM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bar Fly", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B009ZN3BXQ", "title": "Halo Anti-freeze Skull Cap", "description": "The Halo Antifreeze Skull Cap is Halo's answer to cold weather, outdoor exercise. A full coverage skull cap made with top quality Driline fabric with sides that completely cover the ears with wind resistant, double layer Driline. This antimicrobial fabric is embedded with silver ions to inhibit the growth of bacteria and reduce bad odors. Halo's patented SweatBlock Seal forms a water tight seal that channels sweat back and away from the eyes and face. Flat-lock stitching provides a smooth comfortable fit. Works great under helmets or worn alone. Hand wash, hang dry. One year warranty against manufacturer defects. Made in USA. One Size fits most.", "text": "Halo Anti-freeze Skull Cap The Halo Antifreeze Skull Cap is Halo's answer to cold weather, outdoor exercise. A full coverage skull cap made with top quality Driline fabric with sides that completely cover the ears with wind resistant, double layer Driline. This antimicrobial fabric is embedded with silver ions to inhibit the growth of bacteria and reduce bad odors. Halo's patented SweatBlock Seal forms a water tight seal that channels sweat back and away from the eyes and face. Flat-lock stitching provides a smooth comfortable fit. Works great under helmets or worn alone. Hand wash, hang dry. One year warranty against manufacturer defects. Made in USA. One Size fits most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bxWW-%2B4JL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ZN3BXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Halo Headbands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing"]], "price": 12.25}}
{"item_id": "B009ZN63TA", "title": "Topeak Smartphone Dry Bag for 4-5-Inch Screen Phones", "description": "Waterproof Smartphone carrier allows mounting your phone to handlebars or stem. The Dry Bag is great for riders who utilize GPS, riding apps, or music while riding.", "text": "Topeak Smartphone Dry Bag for 4-5-Inch Screen Phones Waterproof Smartphone carrier allows mounting your phone to handlebars or stem. The Dry Bag is great for riders who utilize GPS, riding apps, or music while riding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nC-PszF9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ZN63TA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Indoor Bike Storage"]], "price": 33.99}}
{"item_id": "B009ZN684K", "title": "Sigma Sport BC8.12 8 Function Bicycle Computer", "description": "Sigma Sport products are synonymous with quality, value and outstanding customer service. Sigma products are hand tested and packaged in the Chicago suburbs, guaranteeing reliable performance. The SIGMA BC 8.12 provides the essential cycling functions as well as average speed, max speed and total ride time. It features straightforward single button operation and a large, easy to read, full text display.", "text": "Sigma Sport BC8.12 8 Function Bicycle Computer Sigma Sport products are synonymous with quality, value and outstanding customer service. Sigma products are hand tested and packaged in the Chicago suburbs, guaranteeing reliable performance. The SIGMA BC 8.12 provides the essential cycling functions as well as average speed, max speed and total ride time. It features straightforward single button operation and a large, easy to read, full text display.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OEzU4K%2BZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ZN684K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sigma Sport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B009ZXGUA2", "title": "Brass Stacker SAXDM4.5/5.25TCGRB Rachis Recoil System for Springfield Armory XDM Pistols, Black", "description": "The Rachis [rey-kis] Recoil System \"Competition\" Model for Springfield Armory XDM 4.5\" or 5.25\" full frame pistols is designed for reliable performance. It utilizes a same hollow guide rod casing permanently bonded with a (WC) Tungsten Carbide Core. With an approximate 400% increase over the weight of the factory RSA (recoil spring assembly), these high density guide rods provide additional non-reciprocating mass improving recovery times and yielding faster target acquisition of follow up shots. The precision CNC machined high strength guide rod is hardened to resist spring wear and corrosion using a patented proprietary heat treatment process. Recoil springs are produced exclusively for this system by ISMI and are heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved after winding. Unit includes guide rod and a 18lb factory weight recoil spring. All components are Made in America. Guide rod and bushing have a 100% Lifetime Warranty. Recoil spring has a 12 month replacement warranty. Will NOT Springfield Armory XD or XDS series pistols.", "text": "Brass Stacker SAXDM4.5/5.25TCGRB Rachis Recoil System for Springfield Armory XDM Pistols, Black The Rachis [rey-kis] Recoil System \"Competition\" Model for Springfield Armory XDM 4.5\" or 5.25\" full frame pistols is designed for reliable performance. It utilizes a same hollow guide rod casing permanently bonded with a (WC) Tungsten Carbide Core. With an approximate 400% increase over the weight of the factory RSA (recoil spring assembly), these high density guide rods provide additional non-reciprocating mass improving recovery times and yielding faster target acquisition of follow up shots. The precision CNC machined high strength guide rod is hardened to resist spring wear and corrosion using a patented proprietary heat treatment process. Recoil springs are produced exclusively for this system by ISMI and are heat treated, shot peened and stress relieved after winding. Unit includes guide rod and a 18lb factory weight recoil spring. All components are Made in America. Guide rod and bushing have a 100% Lifetime Warranty. Recoil spring has a 12 month replacement warranty. Will NOT Springfield Armory XD or XDS series pistols.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61MQ2jSoLnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B009ZXGUA2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Souvenirs", "Trading Cards"]]}}
