{"item_id": "B00A2FDJS8", "title": "Full-Size Bipod with Weaver Style Mount, Black - By OTG", "description": "OTG full length Bipod measures 14 inches full extended leg. Roughly 15-16 inches from mounting point on rifle. This Bipod is sleek and stealthy for deployment. Provide a stable platform for those demanding shots. Priced economically, it is a valuable accessories to your shooting platform. Thanks, from OTG!FeaturesBipod attaches to virtually any Picatinny or Weaver Style Rail.Durability and DependabilityEach Bipod Leg folds individually in seconds, and locks in place creating a Positive Rest for your rifle.Spring Loaded Legs Deploy in a snap by using the Knurled Retention RingsRubber Pod Feet provide Extra Stability against slipping on just about any surfaceExclusively Sold by Online Tactical Gear. Sellers other than Online Tactical Gear will not have the same product as listed.", "text": "Full-Size Bipod with Weaver Style Mount, Black - By OTG OTG full length Bipod measures 14 inches full extended leg. Roughly 15-16 inches from mounting point on rifle. This Bipod is sleek and stealthy for deployment. Provide a stable platform for those demanding shots. Priced economically, it is a valuable accessories to your shooting platform. Thanks, from OTG!FeaturesBipod attaches to virtually any Picatinny or Weaver Style Rail.Durability and DependabilityEach Bipod Leg folds individually in seconds, and locks in place creating a Positive Rest for your rifle.Spring Loaded Legs Deploy in a snap by using the Knurled Retention RingsRubber Pod Feet provide Extra Stability against slipping on just about any surfaceExclusively Sold by Online Tactical Gear. Sellers other than Online Tactical Gear will not have the same product as listed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-boIq3aXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A2FDJS8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00A2FVMA0", "title": "Nite Ize Light Ride Gear Tie Flashlight Mount", "description": "Durable, lightweight, and versatile, the Nite Ize Lite Ride GT instantly turns nearly any handheld flashlight into a bright, powerful bike light - no tools required. Simply slide your barrel-shaped handheld flashlight into its grooved, thermoplastic rubber base, adjust the two bendable 9\" Gear Ties for a secure fit, and twist their ends tightly around any bicycle handlebar - voila. Instant bright, directed light that not only alerts others to your presence, but also illuminates the path ahead for a doubly safe ride in the dark. Constructed with strong internal wires, the Gear Ties hold their shape wherever you twist them. Their soft, durable external rubber won't scratch or mark surfaces, and they can be twisted and untwisted hundreds of times, so you can move the Lite Ride GT to other bikes, wrap it any other bars, poles, or straps to hang or create directed light where you need it. You can even shape the Gear Tie ends into feet and create a free-standing table for steady, focused light while making roadside repairs.", "text": "Nite Ize Light Ride Gear Tie Flashlight Mount Durable, lightweight, and versatile, the Nite Ize Lite Ride GT instantly turns nearly any handheld flashlight into a bright, powerful bike light - no tools required. Simply slide your barrel-shaped handheld flashlight into its grooved, thermoplastic rubber base, adjust the two bendable 9\" Gear Ties for a secure fit, and twist their ends tightly around any bicycle handlebar - voila. Instant bright, directed light that not only alerts others to your presence, but also illuminates the path ahead for a doubly safe ride in the dark. Constructed with strong internal wires, the Gear Ties hold their shape wherever you twist them. Their soft, durable external rubber won't scratch or mark surfaces, and they can be twisted and untwisted hundreds of times, so you can move the Lite Ride GT to other bikes, wrap it any other bars, poles, or straps to hang or create directed light where you need it. You can even shape the Gear Tie ends into feet and create a free-standing table for steady, focused light while making roadside repairs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-ll%2BkznwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A2FVMA0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 7.43}}
