{"item_id": "B00A2OAP6I", "title": "LUCID 2-5x Variable Magnifier for Red Dot Sight, Black", "description": "LUCID is proud to offer the worlds' first variable magnifier for red dot sights. Now the operator is able to transition quickly between a CQB operation to a designated marksman capability in an instant with the same weapons platform, all the while maintaining quality target identification and precision shot placement. LUCID's 2x-5x Variable Magnifier mounts behind any red dot sight (with the right mount). This high quality optic offers crystal clear optical performance and maintains an expansive field of view with a comfortable eye relief through the entire magnification range. NOTE: The 2x-5x Variable Magnifier from LUCID has been updated to offer an ocular focus ability.", "text": "LUCID 2-5x Variable Magnifier for Red Dot Sight, Black LUCID is proud to offer the worlds' first variable magnifier for red dot sights. Now the operator is able to transition quickly between a CQB operation to a designated marksman capability in an instant with the same weapons platform, all the while maintaining quality target identification and precision shot placement. LUCID's 2x-5x Variable Magnifier mounts behind any red dot sight (with the right mount). This high quality optic offers crystal clear optical performance and maintains an expansive field of view with a comfortable eye relief through the entire magnification range. NOTE: The 2x-5x Variable Magnifier from LUCID has been updated to offer an ocular focus ability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JCv%2B%2BWO%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A2OAP6I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lucid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 176.03}}
{"item_id": "B00A2OD07Y", "title": "Blackhawk Black Sportster Titan FXS Adjustable Rest - BH71RR00BK", "description": "Featuring a strong industrial design, the Sportster Titan FXS gives shooters a solid shooting platform, holding the gun firmly on target. It allows for quick elevation and windage adjustment to accommodate a variety of rifle configurations.", "text": "Blackhawk Black Sportster Titan FXS Adjustable Rest - BH71RR00BK Featuring a strong industrial design, the Sportster Titan FXS gives shooters a solid shooting platform, holding the gun firmly on target. It allows for quick elevation and windage adjustment to accommodate a variety of rifle configurations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cebLTkLUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A2OD07Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 138.49}}
{"item_id": "B00A2SMVAC", "title": "ZCORR Anti Corrosion Velcro Shotgun/ Rifle Bag", "description": "The ZCORR Tactical Weapon Bag was designed to protect modern rifles or other firearms with large attachments from rust and general contamination. Depending on a firearm's overall height, optics and magazines may remain mounted and are unaffected by VCI molecules. As always, optics should be stored with caps on. The Tactical Weapon Bags are the most convenient storage and preservation solution for firearms ranging from AR15's, MKA1919, AK47's, or the Saiga 12. Velcro Series firearm storage bags are ideal when there are firearms that are rarely to frequently used due to the easy closure system. Depending on use, firearms can be stored rust free for 5+ years. To use a Velcro Series firearm bag effectively: 1. Clean your firearm as recommended by the manufacturer and slide it into the bag. 2. Press the heavy duty Velcro closure shut. To remove the firearm simply: 1. Open the Velcro closure and remove your firearm. 2. VCI technology leaves be hind no residues so firearms are ready to be used right out of the bag... unlike messy oils & greases. We advise against placing firearms inside gun socks before placing them in ZCORR Collector Series Storage Bags as they may inhibit the effectiveness of the VCI chemistry. Sold Individually.", "text": "ZCORR Anti Corrosion Velcro Shotgun/ Rifle Bag The ZCORR Tactical Weapon Bag was designed to protect modern rifles or other firearms with large attachments from rust and general contamination. Depending on a firearm's overall height, optics and magazines may remain mounted and are unaffected by VCI molecules. As always, optics should be stored with caps on. The Tactical Weapon Bags are the most convenient storage and preservation solution for firearms ranging from AR15's, MKA1919, AK47's, or the Saiga 12. Velcro Series firearm storage bags are ideal when there are firearms that are rarely to frequently used due to the easy closure system. Depending on use, firearms can be stored rust free for 5+ years. To use a Velcro Series firearm bag effectively: 1. Clean your firearm as recommended by the manufacturer and slide it into the bag. 2. Press the heavy duty Velcro closure shut. To remove the firearm simply: 1. Open the Velcro closure and remove your firearm. 2. VCI technology leaves be hind no residues so firearms are ready to be used right out of the bag... unlike messy oils & greases. We advise against placing firearms inside gun socks before placing them in ZCORR Collector Series Storage Bags as they may inhibit the effectiveness of the VCI chemistry. Sold Individually.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518p3XzM4vL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A2SMVAC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A2UKM9W", "title": "AP 4X4 Shotgun Shell Carrier", "description": "The AP 4X4 Shell Carrier is a double-stack shell carrier capable of holding eight rounds of 12 ga. 2 3/4 shells. Our 4X4 Carriers double your shell capacity in the same amount of space as traditional carriers!", "text": "AP 4X4 Shotgun Shell Carrier The AP 4X4 Shell Carrier is a double-stack shell carrier capable of holding eight rounds of 12 ga. 2 3/4 shells. Our 4X4 Carriers double your shell capacity in the same amount of space as traditional carriers!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PEsYWiaQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A2UKM9W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B00A2VHERY", "title": "ZCORR Anti Corrosion 50 Cal Ammo Can Liner", "description": "Ammo Can Not Included. The ZCORR Ammo Can Liner is specifically designed to fit the Mil Spec Ammo Can - 50 Cal M2A1 and does so with a flat gusseted bottom to maximize storage capacity. The air tight water proof zipper adds additional protection in case the ammo can gasket fails. The ZCORR Ammo Can Liner is perfect for all sorts of ammunition raging from .22,9mm, 556/ 223, and various other rifle shotgun, or handgun rounds. Since VCI technology leaves no residues behind ammunition powder and primers are safe inside the ZCORR Ammo Can Liner. Also store firearm parts such as extra handgun barrels, magazines, and slides.", "text": "ZCORR Anti Corrosion 50 Cal Ammo Can Liner Ammo Can Not Included. The ZCORR Ammo Can Liner is specifically designed to fit the Mil Spec Ammo Can - 50 Cal M2A1 and does so with a flat gusseted bottom to maximize storage capacity. The air tight water proof zipper adds additional protection in case the ammo can gasket fails. The ZCORR Ammo Can Liner is perfect for all sorts of ammunition raging from .22,9mm, 556/ 223, and various other rifle shotgun, or handgun rounds. Since VCI technology leaves no residues behind ammunition powder and primers are safe inside the ZCORR Ammo Can Liner. Also store firearm parts such as extra handgun barrels, magazines, and slides.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eyhkYEwCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A2VHERY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 7.49}}
{"item_id": "B00A2WZOK2", "title": "RAND CLP Nano Infused All In One CLP, Cleans Lubricates Protects", "description": "Unlike other conventional firearm lubricants, RAND CLP is infused with our unique combination of nano-particles. These particles are so super small, they work their way into the asperities of the metal creating a super slick surface. Our nano-particles adhere and form a permanent teancious bond, thus outlasting silicon and PTFE based products. RAND CLP can be used in all temperatures. From extreme heat to extreme cold, our nano-particles will last longer and outperform other lubricants. NOTE: With RAND CLP's extreme friction modification properties, it DOES NOT REQUIRE large amounts of lubricant to be effective.", "text": "RAND CLP Nano Infused All In One CLP, Cleans Lubricates Protects Unlike other conventional firearm lubricants, RAND CLP is infused with our unique combination of nano-particles. These particles are so super small, they work their way into the asperities of the metal creating a super slick surface. Our nano-particles adhere and form a permanent teancious bond, thus outlasting silicon and PTFE based products. RAND CLP can be used in all temperatures. From extreme heat to extreme cold, our nano-particles will last longer and outperform other lubricants. NOTE: With RAND CLP's extreme friction modification properties, it DOES NOT REQUIRE large amounts of lubricant to be effective.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417nMNR3qmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A2WZOK2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00A30BEJS", "title": "RatPad - NEW! RatPad, the Original YOGA PAD. Eco-foam cushion complements your yoga mat. Get more comfort in your practice. 1\" thick", "description": "Experience true \"knee-vana\" with RatPad™, the original yoga pad, only by YogaRat!Small, featherweight, and made from nontoxic, moisture-proof foam material that's both recyclable and photodegradable, the RatPad™ is the perfect companion to your mat--for when your knees, elbows, or head could use a little extra comfort!•11.75\" x 7.5\" x 1\" and just 2.2 ouncesPleasecheck out our other Amazon listingsif you're in need of a new yoga mat or towel, accessories, or towels for other active pursuits.", "text": "RatPad - NEW! RatPad, the Original YOGA PAD. Eco-foam cushion complements your yoga mat. Get more comfort in your practice. 1\" thick Experience true \"knee-vana\" with RatPad™, the original yoga pad, only by YogaRat!Small, featherweight, and made from nontoxic, moisture-proof foam material that's both recyclable and photodegradable, the RatPad™ is the perfect companion to your mat--for when your knees, elbows, or head could use a little extra comfort!•11.75\" x 7.5\" x 1\" and just 2.2 ouncesPleasecheck out our other Amazon listingsif you're in need of a new yoga mat or towel, accessories, or towels for other active pursuits.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-8MyJDoqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A30BEJS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A338EB6", "title": "Browning BTC 2 Trail Force Recon Camera, Camo", "description": "Introducing the new Force Recon series of Browning trail cameras. The Force Recon trail camera is loaded with features to help you when scouting your favoring hunting spot. Powered by 8 AA batteries, this 8MP trail camera features incredible battery life, HD video with sound, while providing time, date, temperature and moon phase on every image. The camera also includes the Buck Watch Time-lapse software to assist when viewing images from the camera's time-lapse mode. With a 65 flash and the silent rapid fire feature (4 pictures in 2 seconds), the Force Recon camera shoots HD Video with sound.", "text": "Browning BTC 2 Trail Force Recon Camera, Camo Introducing the new Force Recon series of Browning trail cameras. The Force Recon trail camera is loaded with features to help you when scouting your favoring hunting spot. Powered by 8 AA batteries, this 8MP trail camera features incredible battery life, HD video with sound, while providing time, date, temperature and moon phase on every image. The camera also includes the Buck Watch Time-lapse software to assist when viewing images from the camera's time-lapse mode. With a 65 flash and the silent rapid fire feature (4 pictures in 2 seconds), the Force Recon camera shoots HD Video with sound.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dikLqAU3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A338EB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Browning", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 109.99}}
