{"item_id": "B00A36SKYO", "title": "Gear Keeper RT5-5901 Micro Scuba Retractor Snap Clip Mount with Q/C Split Ring Accessory", "description": "It is Ideal for small Items like Lobster gauges, knives, slate pencils, and safety whistles. Specially constructed Spectra/Nylon line provides for a 40-lb. break strength unit in a compact Micro package with a strong and secure stainless steel threaded stud mount along with the standard Gear Keeper \"built to last\" features of Stainless Spring and hardware, saltwater proof and high break strength. Made in USA.", "text": "Gear Keeper RT5-5901 Micro Scuba Retractor Snap Clip Mount with Q/C Split Ring Accessory It is Ideal for small Items like Lobster gauges, knives, slate pencils, and safety whistles. Specially constructed Spectra/Nylon line provides for a 40-lb. break strength unit in a compact Micro package with a strong and secure stainless steel threaded stud mount along with the standard Gear Keeper \"built to last\" features of Stainless Spring and hardware, saltwater proof and high break strength. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CrH6IVlYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A36SKYO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Fly Tying Tools & Materials"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A3B7ZE0", "title": "The Hunted Sweeper Tracker T-3 Hunting Bowie Knife Black", "description": "The wide Tracker replica knife is a thick and functional unit originally designed for intense labor purposes. Two cutting edges are featured for reliability and flexibility. Stainless steel is used for a high quality material. This tracker knife has a serrated upper spine. The full tang is a single piece that spans through the handle. Natural wooden grips are stained black and feel remarkably natural when held. This knife type has so many functions it meets criteria for a machete, hatchet, wedge, knife, saw, and striker. The Hunted Tracker T-3 comes with a stiff nylon sheath and can be fixed to the belt.", "text": "The Hunted Sweeper Tracker T-3 Hunting Bowie Knife Black The wide Tracker replica knife is a thick and functional unit originally designed for intense labor purposes. Two cutting edges are featured for reliability and flexibility. Stainless steel is used for a high quality material. This tracker knife has a serrated upper spine. The full tang is a single piece that spans through the handle. Natural wooden grips are stained black and feel remarkably natural when held. This knife type has so many functions it meets criteria for a machete, hatchet, wedge, knife, saw, and striker. The Hunted Tracker T-3 comes with a stiff nylon sheath and can be fixed to the belt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UOfdPuTxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A3B7ZE0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A3F10A6", "title": "Elite Force 1911 TAC Full Metal Blowback Airsoft Pistol", "description": "Full metal body. Combat sights. Integrated accessory rail. Serrated, CNC-machined Shoots up to 360 FPS. 14mm counterclockwise threading for mock suppressor. Skeleton hammer and trigger. Dual safety mechanism. Tan frame with black finish.", "text": "Elite Force 1911 TAC Full Metal Blowback Airsoft Pistol Full metal body. Combat sights. Integrated accessory rail. Serrated, CNC-machined Shoots up to 360 FPS. 14mm counterclockwise threading for mock suppressor. Skeleton hammer and trigger. Dual safety mechanism. Tan frame with black finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fiu0SWjiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A3F10A6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elite Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 119.95}}
{"item_id": "B00A3FPGVK", "title": "NcStar AR Handguard Removal Tool", "description": "The NcStar AR Hand Guard Removal Tool is a necessity for any carbine style rifle shooter or agency armorer. It eases the removal of the hand guards on both carbines and full sized rifles. All areas that contact the rifle are protected to prevent damage to the finish of the rifle.", "text": "NcStar AR Handguard Removal Tool The NcStar AR Hand Guard Removal Tool is a necessity for any carbine style rifle shooter or agency armorer. It eases the removal of the hand guards on both carbines and full sized rifles. All areas that contact the rifle are protected to prevent damage to the finish of the rifle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31C%2Bezfdw6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A3FPGVK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B00A3OC00G", "title": "Nsstar 12 LED Portable Super Bright Deluxe Camping Camp Lantern Light Lamp", "description": "Product Description:This waterproof solar lantern is a handy product for family outings, and outdoor activities.Adjustable brightness help you to light up from 5-15 hours using different number of LED lights.This way, it could be used as a night-light, or a serious camping lantern for your next outdoor activities.No maintenance needed, no bulb and battery replacement ever. Eco-friendly product using free solar energy.When there is no sun, it's always good to have its dynamic powering option by hand-crank.Product Features:•Product size: 8.5 inches tall * 6.5 dia inches.•Solar panel: 6V 70mA. Built-in rechargable battery: 3.6V/500mAh. 10 hours of sunlight to charge the battery full.•12 LED. No bulb burn out, and replacement.•Adjustable brightness switches as easy as thumb pressing.•Less brightness for longer lighting time. Using 4 LEDs it lights up for 15 hours; 8 LEDs for 10 hours, and 12 LEDs for 5 hours.Package Details:Weight: 566gSize: 16.5*16.5*22.5 cmPackage Includes:1 x solar lantern", "text": "Nsstar 12 LED Portable Super Bright Deluxe Camping Camp Lantern Light Lamp Product Description:This waterproof solar lantern is a handy product for family outings, and outdoor activities.Adjustable brightness help you to light up from 5-15 hours using different number of LED lights.This way, it could be used as a night-light, or a serious camping lantern for your next outdoor activities.No maintenance needed, no bulb and battery replacement ever. Eco-friendly product using free solar energy.When there is no sun, it's always good to have its dynamic powering option by hand-crank.Product Features:•Product size: 8.5 inches tall * 6.5 dia inches.•Solar panel: 6V 70mA. Built-in rechargable battery: 3.6V/500mAh. 10 hours of sunlight to charge the battery full.•12 LED. No bulb burn out, and replacement.•Adjustable brightness switches as easy as thumb pressing.•Less brightness for longer lighting time. Using 4 LEDs it lights up for 15 hours; 8 LEDs for 10 hours, and 12 LEDs for 5 hours.Package Details:Weight: 566gSize: 16.5*16.5*22.5 cmPackage Includes:1 x solar lantern", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XfAfVkbsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A3OC00G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Housweety", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 5.19}}
{"item_id": "B00A3W8EG2", "title": "BV Bicycle Strap-On Saddle Bag / Seat Bag", "description": "Strap-on Saddle bag with 3M ScotchliteTM reflective trimming, enhancing visibility and safety in low light and at night.Velcro straps quickly attach to the seat and seat post. Perfect for wallets, keys, tools, tire levers, patch kits and other small items.Medium and Large saddle bags are expandable for added capacityTaillight hangers for additional safety lights and attaching larger tools (ex. pumps)SmallDimensions: 6\" x 3.5\" x 3\"Capacity: 0.4 LWeight: 3 ozMedium - ExpandableDimensions:7\" x 3.5\" x 4\"Capacity: 0.7 - 1.0 LWeight: 3.8 ozLarge - ExpandableDimensions: 8\" x 4.3\" x 4.5\"Capacity: 1.1 - 1.5 LWeight: 4.8 oz", "text": "BV Bicycle Strap-On Saddle Bag / Seat Bag Strap-on Saddle bag with 3M ScotchliteTM reflective trimming, enhancing visibility and safety in low light and at night.Velcro straps quickly attach to the seat and seat post. Perfect for wallets, keys, tools, tire levers, patch kits and other small items.Medium and Large saddle bags are expandable for added capacityTaillight hangers for additional safety lights and attaching larger tools (ex. pumps)SmallDimensions: 6\" x 3.5\" x 3\"Capacity: 0.4 LWeight: 3 ozMedium - ExpandableDimensions:7\" x 3.5\" x 4\"Capacity: 0.7 - 1.0 LWeight: 3.8 ozLarge - ExpandableDimensions: 8\" x 4.3\" x 4.5\"Capacity: 1.1 - 1.5 LWeight: 4.8 oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KGjvnVMSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A3W8EG2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00A3X1MYM", "title": "Duracoat Shake N' Spray 4oz Kit", "description": "Now you can refinish your firearm as easy as 1-2-3 with the Exclusive Prep N' Spray System. All you need to do is degrease with the enclosed TruStrip and scrubbing pad, and spray! The new Shake N' Spray DuraCoat Finishing Kit includes 4oz of DuraCoat, LCW TruStrip, Cleaner/Degreaser and a Preval Aerosol Sprayer. The kit allows you to use DuraCoat like an aerosol.", "text": "Duracoat Shake N' Spray 4oz Kit Now you can refinish your firearm as easy as 1-2-3 with the Exclusive Prep N' Spray System. All you need to do is degrease with the enclosed TruStrip and scrubbing pad, and spray! The new Shake N' Spray DuraCoat Finishing Kit includes 4oz of DuraCoat, LCW TruStrip, Cleaner/Degreaser and a Preval Aerosol Sprayer. The kit allows you to use DuraCoat like an aerosol.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vZSrP5JLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A3X1MYM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 41.95}}
{"item_id": "B00A4450KM", "title": "SwissStop FlashPro BXP Brake Pads - Set of 4", "description": "'Nice ride -- How fast does it stop?' This question is asked far more often of sport cars than road bikes, which really doesn't make sense to us. After all, in the world of human-powered road racing, braking power and feel is every bit as critical. The simple story of SwissStop's new FlashPro Blue Extreme Performance (BXP) Brake Pads for alloy surfaces is that they deliver more power with less required lever force, in both wet and dry conditions. But, we'd be remiss as to not expound further. You may be familiar with SwissStop's Green High Performance II (GHP II) pads, respected for their superior combination of power, modulation, durability, and value. Assuredly, SwissStop could have rested on the reputation of the GHP II compound, but that wouldn't be consistent with its tradition of innovation. SwissStop's parent company, Rex Articoli, is a specialist in technical rubber compounds. And in 2010, it invested in new machinery and materials in order to further develop and refine the BXP compound for alloy surfaces. The goal was simple: Provide greater power and modulation, while maintaining durability and limiting brake squeal. Now, a few years later, the proof is in the testing. To go from 60 to 0 km/h in dry conditions, BXP Pads required only 35 meters. That's eight fewer than GHP II Pads, and much fewer than the competition. When 180 Newtons (N) of force were exerted on the brake lever, BXP Pads produced 800N of braking force -- a 200N improvement over GHP II. Additionally, the response of BXP is more linear, meaning that there's no sudden grabbing. From pad engagement to wheel lockout, the harder you squeeze, the more you slow. The SwissStop FlashPro BXP Brake Pads come in a complete set of four pads, and are designed to be used with Shimano and SRAM brakes. For Campagnolo, choose the RacePro BXP Pads.", "text": "SwissStop FlashPro BXP Brake Pads - Set of 4 'Nice ride -- How fast does it stop?' This question is asked far more often of sport cars than road bikes, which really doesn't make sense to us. After all, in the world of human-powered road racing, braking power and feel is every bit as critical. The simple story of SwissStop's new FlashPro Blue Extreme Performance (BXP) Brake Pads for alloy surfaces is that they deliver more power with less required lever force, in both wet and dry conditions. But, we'd be remiss as to not expound further. You may be familiar with SwissStop's Green High Performance II (GHP II) pads, respected for their superior combination of power, modulation, durability, and value. Assuredly, SwissStop could have rested on the reputation of the GHP II compound, but that wouldn't be consistent with its tradition of innovation. SwissStop's parent company, Rex Articoli, is a specialist in technical rubber compounds. And in 2010, it invested in new machinery and materials in order to further develop and refine the BXP compound for alloy surfaces. The goal was simple: Provide greater power and modulation, while maintaining durability and limiting brake squeal. Now, a few years later, the proof is in the testing. To go from 60 to 0 km/h in dry conditions, BXP Pads required only 35 meters. That's eight fewer than GHP II Pads, and much fewer than the competition. When 180 Newtons (N) of force were exerted on the brake lever, BXP Pads produced 800N of braking force -- a 200N improvement over GHP II. Additionally, the response of BXP is more linear, meaning that there's no sudden grabbing. From pad engagement to wheel lockout, the harder you squeeze, the more you slow. The SwissStop FlashPro BXP Brake Pads come in a complete set of four pads, and are designed to be used with Shimano and SRAM brakes. For Campagnolo, choose the RacePro BXP Pads.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bkfZ-z0KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A4450KM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Swiss Stop", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads", "Pads Inserts"]], "price": 23.49}}
{"item_id": "B00A45MZN6", "title": "Japanese Peacock Regular Size Platinum Catalyst Metal Hand Warmer - Made in Japan", "description": "This is a regular size Peacock hand warmer. It is the World's most famous hand warmer and the inventor of this type of hand warmer since WWII. Gives comfortable continuous heat for up to 24 hours on a single filling. These heat generating pocket sized warmer are great for anybody who spends time in the cold. Platinum catalyst flameless technology ensures easy lighting and stable temperature from beginning to the end. Made of polished chrome plated copper, which does not rust like steel. It includes a carrying case. Buy one for each pocket or coat and never be chilled in the cold again. The Peacock hand warmer is the ideal gift for the hunter and fisherman, and anyone that enjoys the outdoors in the winter. The hand warmer can also be used in the event of an emergency and should be part of every winter survival kit. This is probably the best hand warmer in the world. The other types of hand warmer are disposable (expensive, relatively short heating time, too small to keep warm for a large hand) and the reusable type (hot to cold in only 1 hour, need to wrap it in towel to boil in water for 15 minutes to recharge). This is the best and most elegant type of hand warmer. Heating Duration: regular Size - 24 hours at 160F Dimensions: Regular Size- 4\"x2.6\"x0.5\" Heating Element - Platinum Catalyst technology, 5000 hours heating life. Peacock has the best heating element. Useful for: (a) People who live in cold weather (b) Special workers such as miners, oil field workers working in cold weather (c) Elderly people, children, or other weaker people, (d) Fishing, hunting, skiing, and outdoor activities in cold weather (e) Football, baseball and outdoor sports in cold winter. Type of Fuel to Use: Ronsonol or Zippo lighter fluid only. Package Includes: Hand warmer, carrying case.", "text": "Japanese Peacock Regular Size Platinum Catalyst Metal Hand Warmer - Made in Japan This is a regular size Peacock hand warmer. It is the World's most famous hand warmer and the inventor of this type of hand warmer since WWII. Gives comfortable continuous heat for up to 24 hours on a single filling. These heat generating pocket sized warmer are great for anybody who spends time in the cold. Platinum catalyst flameless technology ensures easy lighting and stable temperature from beginning to the end. Made of polished chrome plated copper, which does not rust like steel. It includes a carrying case. Buy one for each pocket or coat and never be chilled in the cold again. The Peacock hand warmer is the ideal gift for the hunter and fisherman, and anyone that enjoys the outdoors in the winter. The hand warmer can also be used in the event of an emergency and should be part of every winter survival kit. This is probably the best hand warmer in the world. The other types of hand warmer are disposable (expensive, relatively short heating time, too small to keep warm for a large hand) and the reusable type (hot to cold in only 1 hour, need to wrap it in towel to boil in water for 15 minutes to recharge). This is the best and most elegant type of hand warmer. Heating Duration: regular Size - 24 hours at 160F Dimensions: Regular Size- 4\"x2.6\"x0.5\" Heating Element - Platinum Catalyst technology, 5000 hours heating life. Peacock has the best heating element. Useful for: (a) People who live in cold weather (b) Special workers such as miners, oil field workers working in cold weather (c) Elderly people, children, or other weaker people, (d) Fishing, hunting, skiing, and outdoor activities in cold weather (e) Football, baseball and outdoor sports in cold winter. Type of Fuel to Use: Ronsonol or Zippo lighter fluid only. Package Includes: Hand warmer, carrying case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TKECYKhnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A45MZN6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hand & Foot Warmers"]], "price": 35.95}}
{"item_id": "B00A46W77Y", "title": "Universal Adjustable Bike Bicycle Mount for LED Flashlights Torch(2cm~4cm Diameter)", "description": "Dimension: 1.57 in x 1.14 in x 0.94 in (4.00 cm x 3.00 cm x 2.39 cm) Weight: 19.00 g", "text": "Universal Adjustable Bike Bicycle Mount for LED Flashlights Torch(2cm~4cm Diameter) Dimension: 1.57 in x 1.14 in x 0.94 in (4.00 cm x 3.00 cm x 2.39 cm) Weight: 19.00 g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cAvS2irRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A46W77Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LightsCastle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 1.98}}
{"item_id": "B00A470DQA", "title": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Lubricant Cleaner Protectant Combo Pack #2", "description": "Ballistol was developed for the German Army who requested an oil that would lubricate, clean, protect and preserve firearms and gun stocks as well as preserve leather gear. It is unmatched for cleaning firearms and minimizes the need for brushing and scraping barrels and chambers. It forms a protective film on the surface of metals and is capable of creeping into the finest cracks and fissures making Ballistol and excellent \"penetrant\" to help loosen frozen nuts and bolts. It will even protect wet surfaces! Unlike most lubricants, Ballistol emulsifies with water; when the water evaporates, Ballistol stays behind to protect the metal, plastic, wood or leather. Ballistol will keep all smooth leathers soft and moisturized (do not use on suede). It is also non-toxic and biodegradable; neither its use, disposal or decomposition will produce any byproducts that are harmful to the environment. Coca Cola and many of Germany's famous breweries use Ballistol as does Bizerba, one of the largest precision scale manufacturers, who specifies Ballistol because it never gets sticky or increases friction over time. It's also a great silver and brass polish. Human sweat and skin oils are slightly acidic; their effect is similar to the etching process. Ballistol is slightly alkaline and neutralizes this effect. Of course Ballistol is also perfect for all the household chores any normal oil will do, but why settle for a \"normal\" oil when you can have one product that does so much more.", "text": "Ballistol Multi-Purpose Lubricant Cleaner Protectant Combo Pack #2 Ballistol was developed for the German Army who requested an oil that would lubricate, clean, protect and preserve firearms and gun stocks as well as preserve leather gear. It is unmatched for cleaning firearms and minimizes the need for brushing and scraping barrels and chambers. It forms a protective film on the surface of metals and is capable of creeping into the finest cracks and fissures making Ballistol and excellent \"penetrant\" to help loosen frozen nuts and bolts. It will even protect wet surfaces! Unlike most lubricants, Ballistol emulsifies with water; when the water evaporates, Ballistol stays behind to protect the metal, plastic, wood or leather. Ballistol will keep all smooth leathers soft and moisturized (do not use on suede). It is also non-toxic and biodegradable; neither its use, disposal or decomposition will produce any byproducts that are harmful to the environment. Coca Cola and many of Germany's famous breweries use Ballistol as does Bizerba, one of the largest precision scale manufacturers, who specifies Ballistol because it never gets sticky or increases friction over time. It's also a great silver and brass polish. Human sweat and skin oils are slightly acidic; their effect is similar to the etching process. Ballistol is slightly alkaline and neutralizes this effect. Of course Ballistol is also perfect for all the household chores any normal oil will do, but why settle for a \"normal\" oil when you can have one product that does so much more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pGWd%2BDziL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A470DQA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ballistol", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 21.5}}
