{"item_id": "B00A6HLQYQ", "title": "LED High Visibility Flashing Safety Armband Cycling Jogging Walking Reflective LED Armband - WalGap(TM)", "description": "The product has passed CE, ROHS, EN471 certification, water, cleaning removable electronic parts. The product is suitable for walking the dog at night or dark environment, outdoor and pet movement, through the ultra-bright fiber optic light, from a warning, while expression of individuality and fashion.Material: nylon webbing ,Fluorescence webbing ,super bright LED,Optic Lighten FiberFlashing Mode:Quickly Flashing / Slowly Flashing / Lighten up (controled by the button)2PCS CR2032 button battery60-80 hours, normal 4-5 months; battery can be replaced.", "text": "LED High Visibility Flashing Safety Armband Cycling Jogging Walking Reflective LED Armband - WalGap(TM) The product has passed CE, ROHS, EN471 certification, water, cleaning removable electronic parts. The product is suitable for walking the dog at night or dark environment, outdoor and pet movement, through the ultra-bright fiber optic light, from a warning, while expression of individuality and fashion.Material: nylon webbing ,Fluorescence webbing ,super bright LED,Optic Lighten FiberFlashing Mode:Quickly Flashing / Slowly Flashing / Lighten up (controled by the button)2PCS CR2032 button battery60-80 hours, normal 4-5 months; battery can be replaced.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pmakHyADL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A6HLQYQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Reflective Gear"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A6SZA1K", "title": "Lancer Tactical Airsoft Safety Goggles, Vented, Black Frame, Clear Lens", "description": "Lancer Tactical Airsoft Safety Goggles, Mask Vented, Tan Frame, Clear Lens - CA-221T is angle vented to maximize air flow while keeping small items from getting in. The Ultra-Vent system keeps you cool and provides maximum protection from fogging lens. You will have full seal protection around your eyes with a comfortable foam padding liner. Your eyes will be protected by a tough polycarbonate lens of Lancer Tactical airsoft goggle. Do not use any airsoft product without eye protection to prevent serious and/or permanent damage. A soft bag is included to transport your airsoft goggles without scratching the lenses, to use as a cleaning cloth, and to keep dust of when not in use.", "text": "Lancer Tactical Airsoft Safety Goggles, Vented, Black Frame, Clear Lens Lancer Tactical Airsoft Safety Goggles, Mask Vented, Tan Frame, Clear Lens - CA-221T is angle vented to maximize air flow while keeping small items from getting in. The Ultra-Vent system keeps you cool and provides maximum protection from fogging lens. You will have full seal protection around your eyes with a comfortable foam padding liner. Your eyes will be protected by a tough polycarbonate lens of Lancer Tactical airsoft goggle. Do not use any airsoft product without eye protection to prevent serious and/or permanent damage. A soft bag is included to transport your airsoft goggles without scratching the lenses, to use as a cleaning cloth, and to keep dust of when not in use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cmFxxLZ8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A6SZA1K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lancer Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A6TBITM", "title": "BV Bicycle Light Set, Super Bright 5 LED Headlight and 3 LED Taillight, Quick-Release, 80 Hours", "description": "From the Manufacturer The LED light set mounts quickly onto bicycle handlebars and seat posts. Great for cycling at night or in places where visibility and safety are a concern. Visible to motorists over 1500 feet away. The headlight has 5 LEDs that can light up roads for over 40 feet and features a toolless handlebar mount. Once mounted it has a quick-release system for removing the headlight from its mount. Cut-away design allows light through the sides for more visibility. The taillight is angle adjustable and removable from its seat post mount with a clip-on quick-release system. Fits most handlebars and seat posts (rubber sizing shims included). Up to 80 hours! (Batteries not included). Note: Headlight batteries, body and cover must be aligned correctly in order to work. Align the power button on the battery holder with the power button on the headlight body. Align the arrow (on the clear plastic portion of the cover) with the open/close marks on the body) Product Description The LED light set mounts quickly onto bicycle handlebars and seat posts. Great for cycling at night or in places where visibility and safety are a concern. Visible to motorists over 1500 feet away. The headlight has 5 LEDs that can light up roads for over 40 feet and features a toolless handlebar mount. Once mounted it has a quick-release system for removing the headlight from its mount. Cut-away design allows light through the sides for more visibility. The taillight is angle adjustable and removable from its seat post mount with a clip-on quick-release system. Fits most handlebars and seat posts (rubber sizing shims included). Up to 80 hours! (Batteries not included). Note: Headlight batteries, body and cover must be aligned correctly in order to work. Align the power button on the battery holder with the power button on the headlight body. Align the arrow (on the clear plastic portion of the cover) with the open/close marks on the body)", "text": "BV Bicycle Light Set, Super Bright 5 LED Headlight and 3 LED Taillight, Quick-Release, 80 Hours From the Manufacturer The LED light set mounts quickly onto bicycle handlebars and seat posts. Great for cycling at night or in places where visibility and safety are a concern. Visible to motorists over 1500 feet away. The headlight has 5 LEDs that can light up roads for over 40 feet and features a toolless handlebar mount. Once mounted it has a quick-release system for removing the headlight from its mount. Cut-away design allows light through the sides for more visibility. The taillight is angle adjustable and removable from its seat post mount with a clip-on quick-release system. Fits most handlebars and seat posts (rubber sizing shims included). Up to 80 hours! (Batteries not included). Note: Headlight batteries, body and cover must be aligned correctly in order to work. Align the power button on the battery holder with the power button on the headlight body. Align the arrow (on the clear plastic portion of the cover) with the open/close marks on the body) Product Description The LED light set mounts quickly onto bicycle handlebars and seat posts. Great for cycling at night or in places where visibility and safety are a concern. Visible to motorists over 1500 feet away. The headlight has 5 LEDs that can light up roads for over 40 feet and features a toolless handlebar mount. Once mounted it has a quick-release system for removing the headlight from its mount. Cut-away design allows light through the sides for more visibility. The taillight is angle adjustable and removable from its seat post mount with a clip-on quick-release system. Fits most handlebars and seat posts (rubber sizing shims included). Up to 80 hours! (Batteries not included). Note: Headlight batteries, body and cover must be aligned correctly in order to work. Align the power button on the battery holder with the power button on the headlight body. Align the arrow (on the clear plastic portion of the cover) with the open/close marks on the body)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4179p4AQbnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A6TBITM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BikepakUSA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 3.65}}
{"item_id": "B00A6TGZC2", "title": "BV Bicycle Light Set, Super Bright 5 LED Headlight and 3 LED Taillight, Quick-Release", "description": "The LED light set mounts quickly onto bicycle handlebars and seat posts. Great for cycling at night or in places where visibility and safety are a concern. Visible to motorists over 1500 feet away. The headlight has 5 LEDs that can light up roads for over 40 feet and features a toolless handlebar mount. The handlebar strap ratchets to a smaller diameter and can be released to increase the diameter. Once mounted it has a quick-release system for removing the headlight from its mount. Cut-away design allows light through the sides for more visibility. The taillight is angle adjustable and removable from its seat post mount with a clip-on quick-release system. Fits most handlebars and seat posts (rubber sizing shims included). Up to 80 hours! (Batteries not included).", "text": "BV Bicycle Light Set, Super Bright 5 LED Headlight and 3 LED Taillight, Quick-Release The LED light set mounts quickly onto bicycle handlebars and seat posts. Great for cycling at night or in places where visibility and safety are a concern. Visible to motorists over 1500 feet away. The headlight has 5 LEDs that can light up roads for over 40 feet and features a toolless handlebar mount. The handlebar strap ratchets to a smaller diameter and can be released to increase the diameter. Once mounted it has a quick-release system for removing the headlight from its mount. Cut-away design allows light through the sides for more visibility. The taillight is angle adjustable and removable from its seat post mount with a clip-on quick-release system. Fits most handlebars and seat posts (rubber sizing shims included). Up to 80 hours! (Batteries not included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t89UZWhWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A6TGZC2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 8.99}}
