{"item_id": "B00A6U7N1S", "title": "FrogLube 1FL OZ (29.5ml) Solvent (2-pack)", "description": "Clean your weapons like never before with FrogLube's solvent spray; and watch carbon just fall out of your weapon. FrogLube Solvent is designed to quickly attack surface fouling, baked on or filmed residues and other metallic fouling such as lead and copper, while protecting firearms coatings, paints, wood and other materials from the corrosive effects of petroleum-based, flammable and toxic weapons care products. Frequent use will keep firearms running at optimal performance and not harm the FrogLube coating. A great cleaner to remove all the petroleum products and junk before a FrogLube treatment. This product was worth the wait! Note: FrogLube products will not harm the environment. They can be disposed of without the need for prohibitive HAZMAT controls. Users will be protected from the affects of working in and around toxic chemicals.", "text": "FrogLube 1FL OZ (29.5ml) Solvent (2-pack) Clean your weapons like never before with FrogLube's solvent spray; and watch carbon just fall out of your weapon. FrogLube Solvent is designed to quickly attack surface fouling, baked on or filmed residues and other metallic fouling such as lead and copper, while protecting firearms coatings, paints, wood and other materials from the corrosive effects of petroleum-based, flammable and toxic weapons care products. Frequent use will keep firearms running at optimal performance and not harm the FrogLube coating. A great cleaner to remove all the petroleum products and junk before a FrogLube treatment. This product was worth the wait! Note: FrogLube products will not harm the environment. They can be disposed of without the need for prohibitive HAZMAT controls. Users will be protected from the affects of working in and around toxic chemicals.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h44VXBC1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A6U7N1S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00A6UPUFE", "title": "Barrel Nut by Tactical Intent", "description": "Standard AR15 Barrel Nut. High strength steel. Teeth will not deform when properly assembled with correct barrel nut wrench (sold separately). NO instructions included. We reccommend installation by qualified armorer.", "text": "Barrel Nut by Tactical Intent Standard AR15 Barrel Nut. High strength steel. Teeth will not deform when properly assembled with correct barrel nut wrench (sold separately). NO instructions included. We reccommend installation by qualified armorer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PqQ3EY4XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A6UPUFE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tactical Intent", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 10.92}}
