{"item_id": "B00A7EP4ZA", "title": "UnderTech Undercover Concealment Womens Tank Shirt in Black, White or Nude T0801", "description": "UnderTech brings you the ultimate in comfortable concealment with this women's Polyester Tank Compression Concealment Shirt! Worn by FBI, TSA and the Secret Service, this undershirt is the most comfortable concealed carry option available. It securely holds all self-defense handguns, while the breathable all weather X-Dry compression fabric cools the body and keeps it dry. This V-Neck shirt allows for immediate access to the handgun with button front shirts. Features include two holster pockets, one under each arm with two additional pockets for extra storage, perfect for storing your phone or wallet. Attached retention strap is included to keep firearm securely fastened, but is not necessary to the function of the shirt. Wear this concealment shirt under your clothing for the most comfortable and reliable way to be prepared in a dangerous situation. Made in the USA. Available in women's sizes Medium & Large.", "text": "UnderTech Undercover Concealment Womens Tank Shirt in Black, White or Nude T0801 UnderTech brings you the ultimate in comfortable concealment with this women's Polyester Tank Compression Concealment Shirt! Worn by FBI, TSA and the Secret Service, this undershirt is the most comfortable concealed carry option available. It securely holds all self-defense handguns, while the breathable all weather X-Dry compression fabric cools the body and keeps it dry. This V-Neck shirt allows for immediate access to the handgun with button front shirts. Features include two holster pockets, one under each arm with two additional pockets for extra storage, perfect for storing your phone or wallet. Attached retention strap is included to keep firearm securely fastened, but is not necessary to the function of the shirt. Wear this concealment shirt under your clothing for the most comfortable and reliable way to be prepared in a dangerous situation. Made in the USA. Available in women's sizes Medium & Large.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414Q0CrnNvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A7EP4ZA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00A7EXF4C", "title": "Intex Explorer K2 Kayak, Yellow", "description": "The Intex Explorer K2 Kayak is the newest model in our outstanding Sport Series of inflatable watercraft. Featuring 30 gauge rugged vinyl and a sturdy I-beam floor, the Explorer K2 is the optimal choice for comfort and ease on lakes or mild rivers.", "text": "Intex Explorer K2 Kayak, Yellow The Intex Explorer K2 Kayak is the newest model in our outstanding Sport Series of inflatable watercraft. Featuring 30 gauge rugged vinyl and a sturdy I-beam floor, the Explorer K2 is the optimal choice for comfort and ease on lakes or mild rivers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41n%2BpYObssL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A7EXF4C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Kayaks", "Fishing Kayaks"]], "price": 189.0}}
{"item_id": "B00A7F0EKO", "title": "UnderTech Undercover Mens Concealment V-Neck Shirt Black or White T0420", "description": "UnderTech brings you the ultimate in comfortable concealment with the Polyester V-Neck Compression Concealment Shirt! Worn by FBI, TSA and the Secret Service, this undershirt is the most comfortable concealed carry option available. It securely holds all self-defense handguns, while the breathable all weather X-Dry compression fabric cools the body and keeps it dry. This V-Neck shirt allows for immediate access to the handgun with button front shirts. Features include two holster pockets, one under each arm with two additional pockets for extra storage, perfect for storing your phone or wallet. Attached retention strap is included to keep firearm securely fastened, but is not necessary to the function of the shirt. Wear this concealment shirt under your clothing for the most comfortable and reliable way to be prepared in a dangerous situation. Made in the USA. Available in men's sizes Large & XL.", "text": "UnderTech Undercover Mens Concealment V-Neck Shirt Black or White T0420 UnderTech brings you the ultimate in comfortable concealment with the Polyester V-Neck Compression Concealment Shirt! Worn by FBI, TSA and the Secret Service, this undershirt is the most comfortable concealed carry option available. It securely holds all self-defense handguns, while the breathable all weather X-Dry compression fabric cools the body and keeps it dry. This V-Neck shirt allows for immediate access to the handgun with button front shirts. Features include two holster pockets, one under each arm with two additional pockets for extra storage, perfect for storing your phone or wallet. Attached retention strap is included to keep firearm securely fastened, but is not necessary to the function of the shirt. Wear this concealment shirt under your clothing for the most comfortable and reliable way to be prepared in a dangerous situation. Made in the USA. Available in men's sizes Large & XL.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KwQXFfreL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A7F0EKO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
