{"item_id": "B00A7FQOUI", "title": "Valor Fitness Slam Ball", "description": "Add a bit of cardio to your strength workout while releasing stress or an excess amount of energy. Take the ball with both hands like you would grip a basketball, raise it above your head and slam it to the ground. Hence the name -Inch Slam Ball-Inch. Enjoy your energy releasing workout. Textured surface for better grip. Dense wall to prevent blow outs while slamming ball to the ground. Large easy to recognize weight value.", "text": "Valor Fitness Slam Ball Add a bit of cardio to your strength workout while releasing stress or an excess amount of energy. Take the ball with both hands like you would grip a basketball, raise it above your head and slam it to the ground. Hence the name -Inch Slam Ball-Inch. Enjoy your energy releasing workout. Textured surface for better grip. Dense wall to prevent blow outs while slamming ball to the ground. Large easy to recognize weight value.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UJS3N47PL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A7FQOUI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00A7IN74Q", "title": "United Cutlery UC2928 Orcrist Thorin Oakenshield Sword", "description": "In Third Age of Middle-earth, Thorin Oakenshield and his Company of Dwarves came upon a troll lair in Rhûdaur. There Thorin found an ancient Elven sword named Orcrist, forged by the high Elves of the West, in Gondolin. Thorin claimed Orcrist for his own and vowed to cleave Goblins with it once again. He wielded the sword through most of the Quest for Erebor, using it against the Goblins of the Misty Mountains. The Goblins called it Biter and hated and feared it. The blade of Orcrist features a curved leaf shape on one side, and a straight edge on the other, a fitting design for a blade meant to cleave Orcs and Goblins. Adorning the pommel is an emblem of the heraldry of Ecthelion of the Fountain. The hilt is shaped from the tooth of a dragon. It is unknown if the tooth was acquired prior to the fifth battle of the First Age, or added to the sword with the inscription in the millennia after the Fall of Gondolin, most likely by the Dwarves of the North. This authentically detailed replica is a reproduction of the actual filming prop built by Weta Workshop of New Zealand and used in the motion picture, THE HOBBIT: AN UNEXPECTED JOURNEY. United Cutlery, industry leader in fine movie reproductions, has meticulously recreated the prop using only the finest grade materials and craftsmanship. Close attention to detail was a top priority. The sword is 38 3/4-Inchlong and features a stainless steel blade with an etched runic inscription. The hilt is crafted with solid metal parts, simulated gem stones, and an acrylic resin grip cast from the original prop. It is presented with a wood wall display and includes a certificate of authenticity.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2928 Orcrist Thorin Oakenshield Sword In Third Age of Middle-earth, Thorin Oakenshield and his Company of Dwarves came upon a troll lair in Rhûdaur. There Thorin found an ancient Elven sword named Orcrist, forged by the high Elves of the West, in Gondolin. Thorin claimed Orcrist for his own and vowed to cleave Goblins with it once again. He wielded the sword through most of the Quest for Erebor, using it against the Goblins of the Misty Mountains. The Goblins called it Biter and hated and feared it. The blade of Orcrist features a curved leaf shape on one side, and a straight edge on the other, a fitting design for a blade meant to cleave Orcs and Goblins. Adorning the pommel is an emblem of the heraldry of Ecthelion of the Fountain. The hilt is shaped from the tooth of a dragon. It is unknown if the tooth was acquired prior to the fifth battle of the First Age, or added to the sword with the inscription in the millennia after the Fall of Gondolin, most likely by the Dwarves of the North. This authentically detailed replica is a reproduction of the actual filming prop built by Weta Workshop of New Zealand and used in the motion picture, THE HOBBIT: AN UNEXPECTED JOURNEY. United Cutlery, industry leader in fine movie reproductions, has meticulously recreated the prop using only the finest grade materials and craftsmanship. Close attention to detail was a top priority. The sword is 38 3/4-Inchlong and features a stainless steel blade with an etched runic inscription. The hilt is crafted with solid metal parts, simulated gem stones, and an acrylic resin grip cast from the original prop. It is presented with a wood wall display and includes a certificate of authenticity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312grEORwhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A7IN74Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 143.64}}
{"item_id": "B00A7L6ORK", "title": "UCO Cocoon Neoprene Cover for UCO Candlelier Lanterns", "description": "The UCO Cocoon is a neoprene case that protects a UCO Chandelier Candle Lantern from denting and scratching and prevents glass breakage. With no zipper it slides on and off easily.", "text": "UCO Cocoon Neoprene Cover for UCO Candlelier Lanterns The UCO Cocoon is a neoprene case that protects a UCO Chandelier Candle Lantern from denting and scratching and prevents glass breakage. With no zipper it slides on and off easily.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jOZuoPRrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A7L6ORK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 13.06}}
{"item_id": "B00A7UM9CK", "title": "VersaCarry ZeroBulk Ambidextrous Inside the Waistband Gun Holster for .38/.357 revolver/2-Inch Barrel", "description": "VersaCarry is a revolutionary new inside the waistband concealment holster unlike anything else you've ever seen. It uses a new patent pending design that carries the firearm by the inner barrel diameter. This design allows for unlimited carry possibilities, while remaining one of the smallest carry devices in the world. Its ambidextrous trigger guard features a self-locking design. A Versacarry holster is available for almost every semi-automatic handgun available and they work with most accessories (like under the barrel mounted lasers and flashlights). With its easy on/off design and 75% less holster bulk; the Versacarry is great for deep concealment. With the new Versacarry you have the option to choose any gun you wish to carry, in any accessory combination for sturdy, inside-the-waistband concealment. Versacarry is designed to be minimal, quick to use, and highly effective at accommodating a variety of firearm configurations.", "text": "VersaCarry ZeroBulk Ambidextrous Inside the Waistband Gun Holster for .38/.357 revolver/2-Inch Barrel VersaCarry is a revolutionary new inside the waistband concealment holster unlike anything else you've ever seen. It uses a new patent pending design that carries the firearm by the inner barrel diameter. This design allows for unlimited carry possibilities, while remaining one of the smallest carry devices in the world. Its ambidextrous trigger guard features a self-locking design. A Versacarry holster is available for almost every semi-automatic handgun available and they work with most accessories (like under the barrel mounted lasers and flashlights). With its easy on/off design and 75% less holster bulk; the Versacarry is great for deep concealment. With the new Versacarry you have the option to choose any gun you wish to carry, in any accessory combination for sturdy, inside-the-waistband concealment. Versacarry is designed to be minimal, quick to use, and highly effective at accommodating a variety of firearm configurations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31l2Nf8IUWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A7UM9CK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Versacarry", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 20.14}}
{"item_id": "B00A8058CW", "title": "OutBags OB-16SC Nylon OWB Belt Gun Holster with Mag Pouch for Glock 17 / 19 / 22 / 23 / 31 / 32 / 38, Ruger 22lr / P89 / P95 / SR40, Hi-Point 45 ACP, Walther P22 / P99, Beretta PX4 Storm, and More", "description": "The SC Style is a fully loaded holster for revolvers and automatics. Available for left and right handed users, the SC Style is the only holster that comes standard with a magazine pouch. While keeping your weapon secure, the Thumb break also eliminates delay when drawing the firearm. This holster also has a removable Belt Clip for mounting to waistband or belt. Additionally, the Belt Loop allows for a more permanent and secure mount to the belt. The Webbed Spine ensures a snug and personalized fit. Firearm not included. Recommended fit: Arcus 94, Armalite AR 24K-10, AR 24K-13, Armalite AR 24K, Beretta 92, Beretta Cougar 8000, Beretta Cougar 9000, Beretta PX4 Storm, Beretta Stoeger Cougar 8000F, Beretta Stoeger Cougar Compact, Browning 9mm, Browning PRO-9, BUL G.Cherokee Compact, CZ P-01, CZ-75 Compact, CZ-75 D PCR, EAA Witness 4.5\", FN FNP 45, Girsan MC 13 / 14 / 21 / MC27E, Glock 17, Glock 19, Glock 22, Glock 23, Glock 25, Glock 31, Glock 32, Glock 38, H&K; HK P30 / P30S 9mm, Hi-Point 45ACP, ISSC M22, Kahr TP9 / TP40 / TP45, Mauser M2, Ruger KSR40, Ruger P89 / P91 / P94 / P95 / P97 / KP345, Ruger SR40 3473, Ruger SR9 3312, S&W; 40, S&W; M&P; 40, S&W; M&P; 9, SAI XD 45ACP, Sig Sauer Mosquito 22LR, Sig Sauer P220 / P225 / P226 / P228 / P229 / P250, Sig Sauer PRO 2009 / 2340 / 2022, Sig Sauer SP2022, Sigma S&W; .40, Springfield XD 40, Springfield XD 45, Springfield XD 9, Tanfoglio FT7 / FT9, Taurus 24/7 / 840 / 845 / 909 / 917, Taurus PT909 / PT911, Walther P22, Walther P99 / PK380, Walther PPQ,", "text": "OutBags OB-16SC Nylon OWB Belt Gun Holster with Mag Pouch for Glock 17 / 19 / 22 / 23 / 31 / 32 / 38, Ruger 22lr / P89 / P95 / SR40, Hi-Point 45 ACP, Walther P22 / P99, Beretta PX4 Storm, and More The SC Style is a fully loaded holster for revolvers and automatics. Available for left and right handed users, the SC Style is the only holster that comes standard with a magazine pouch. While keeping your weapon secure, the Thumb break also eliminates delay when drawing the firearm. This holster also has a removable Belt Clip for mounting to waistband or belt. Additionally, the Belt Loop allows for a more permanent and secure mount to the belt. The Webbed Spine ensures a snug and personalized fit. Firearm not included. Recommended fit: Arcus 94, Armalite AR 24K-10, AR 24K-13, Armalite AR 24K, Beretta 92, Beretta Cougar 8000, Beretta Cougar 9000, Beretta PX4 Storm, Beretta Stoeger Cougar 8000F, Beretta Stoeger Cougar Compact, Browning 9mm, Browning PRO-9, BUL G.Cherokee Compact, CZ P-01, CZ-75 Compact, CZ-75 D PCR, EAA Witness 4.5\", FN FNP 45, Girsan MC 13 / 14 / 21 / MC27E, Glock 17, Glock 19, Glock 22, Glock 23, Glock 25, Glock 31, Glock 32, Glock 38, H&K; HK P30 / P30S 9mm, Hi-Point 45ACP, ISSC M22, Kahr TP9 / TP40 / TP45, Mauser M2, Ruger KSR40, Ruger P89 / P91 / P94 / P95 / P97 / KP345, Ruger SR40 3473, Ruger SR9 3312, S&W; 40, S&W; M&P; 40, S&W; M&P; 9, SAI XD 45ACP, Sig Sauer Mosquito 22LR, Sig Sauer P220 / P225 / P226 / P228 / P229 / P250, Sig Sauer PRO 2009 / 2340 / 2022, Sig Sauer SP2022, Sigma S&W; .40, Springfield XD 40, Springfield XD 45, Springfield XD 9, Tanfoglio FT7 / FT9, Taurus 24/7 / 840 / 845 / 909 / 917, Taurus PT909 / PT911, Walther P22, Walther P99 / PK380, Walther PPQ,", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-YJeJiDhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8058CW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A8926CS", "title": "XLAB Stealth Pocket 100 Frame Aerodynamic Bag", "description": "Non slip surfaces underneath and on front of bag grip top tube and back of stem. Extra long front straps allow bag to be attached to bikes with cables entering the top tube behind the headset.", "text": "XLAB Stealth Pocket 100 Frame Aerodynamic Bag Non slip surfaces underneath and on front of bag grip top tube and back of stem. Extra long front straps allow bag to be attached to bikes with cables entering the top tube behind the headset.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xjjRBNnlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8926CS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XLAB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B00A8C967S", "title": "Da Vinci Single Cotton Hammock, Choose from Several Designs", "description": "The Da Vinci single cotton hammocks are made of 100% cotton in bright tropical colors. The hammock is 119\" long by 40\" wide with a 78\" bed size and has a capacity of 240 pounds. The hammock can be hung using a hammock frame (sold separately) or between 2 trees or 2 sturdy stationary objects. Comes packed in a matching cotton carry bag for storage. Hammock stand shown is optional and is not included.", "text": "Da Vinci Single Cotton Hammock, Choose from Several Designs The Da Vinci single cotton hammocks are made of 100% cotton in bright tropical colors. The hammock is 119\" long by 40\" wide with a 78\" bed size and has a capacity of 240 pounds. The hammock can be hung using a hammock frame (sold separately) or between 2 trees or 2 sturdy stationary objects. Comes packed in a matching cotton carry bag for storage. Hammock stand shown is optional and is not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61biJHAkhIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8C967S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00A8DKTX2", "title": "SKLZ TRAINERroller Sport Performance Self Guided Foam Roller", "description": "Relieve soreness, improve circulation and increase muscle elasticity with the TRAINER roller for Sport Performance. The high-density foam construction efficiently massages muscle and connective tissue. The roller includes 12 essential exercises designed by professional trainers for elite athletes.", "text": "SKLZ TRAINERroller Sport Performance Self Guided Foam Roller Relieve soreness, improve circulation and increase muscle elasticity with the TRAINER roller for Sport Performance. The high-density foam construction efficiently massages muscle and connective tissue. The roller includes 12 essential exercises designed by professional trainers for elite athletes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zDjvKN2wL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8DKTX2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 35.43}}
{"item_id": "B00A8E2ZZQ", "title": "Wenzel Moose Sleeping Bag", "description": "The Moose from Wenzel is a great kid's sleeping bag for camping during the summer. It's made with quilt-through construction with a temperature rating of 40 degrees F and stuffed with 2.5 pounds of Insul-Therm fill to ensure that you stay warm on those cool summer nights. 26\" x 66\" with a fun moose print on the outside, this sleeping bag is made with 190T polyester on the outer fabric and liner. You can also unzip it all the way to make it into a blanket. Sleep tight.", "text": "Wenzel Moose Sleeping Bag The Moose from Wenzel is a great kid's sleeping bag for camping during the summer. It's made with quilt-through construction with a temperature rating of 40 degrees F and stuffed with 2.5 pounds of Insul-Therm fill to ensure that you stay warm on those cool summer nights. 26\" x 66\" with a fun moose print on the outside, this sleeping bag is made with 190T polyester on the outer fabric and liner. You can also unzip it all the way to make it into a blanket. Sleep tight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V9q1mXqjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8E2ZZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wenzel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A8EK5F8", "title": "Universal Hand Gun/HandGun Mag loader UpLULATM - 9mm to 45ACP Maglula Uplula Pistol Speed Magazine Loader. Loads all* 9mm Luger, 10mm, .357 Sig, 10mm, .40, and .45ACP cal", "description": "Brand New UpLULATM - 9mm to 45ACP Maglula Uplula Pistol Speed Magazine Loader. Loads all* 9mm Luger, 10mm, .357 Sig, 10mm, .40, and .45ACP cal. single and double stack magazines., including 1911 mags, of all manufacturers. The UpLULATM is a military-quality universal pistol magazine loader and unloader designed for loading and unloading virtually all* 9mm Luger up to .45ACP magazines, single and double stack, of all manufacturers. It does so easily, reliably, and painlessly! . Loads all* 9mm Luger, 10mm, .357 Sig, 10mm, .40, and .45ACP cal. single and double stack magazines., including 1911 mags, of all manufacturers. One size fits all. No inserts, spacers or adjustments at all ! (One SKU). Easy loading; the rounds just drop in with no fingers pushing or pressing them. No more pain ! Load hundreds of rounds painlessly. Protects your fingers and mags. Up to one round per sec. loading rate. 1/3 the time loading mags compared with thumb loading. Fits in hand and pocket, weighs only 66 grams (2.3 Ounce). Highly durable. Important! * Please note that my default shipping is standard flat rate shipping and it takes up to 14-21 business days to deliver. If you wish, you may request expedited shipping at an additional cost. Please turn to the shipping section of the listing for this option.", "text": "Universal Hand Gun/HandGun Mag loader UpLULATM - 9mm to 45ACP Maglula Uplula Pistol Speed Magazine Loader. Loads all* 9mm Luger, 10mm, .357 Sig, 10mm, .40, and .45ACP cal Brand New UpLULATM - 9mm to 45ACP Maglula Uplula Pistol Speed Magazine Loader. Loads all* 9mm Luger, 10mm, .357 Sig, 10mm, .40, and .45ACP cal. single and double stack magazines., including 1911 mags, of all manufacturers. The UpLULATM is a military-quality universal pistol magazine loader and unloader designed for loading and unloading virtually all* 9mm Luger up to .45ACP magazines, single and double stack, of all manufacturers. It does so easily, reliably, and painlessly! . Loads all* 9mm Luger, 10mm, .357 Sig, 10mm, .40, and .45ACP cal. single and double stack magazines., including 1911 mags, of all manufacturers. One size fits all. No inserts, spacers or adjustments at all ! (One SKU). Easy loading; the rounds just drop in with no fingers pushing or pressing them. No more pain ! Load hundreds of rounds painlessly. Protects your fingers and mags. Up to one round per sec. loading rate. 1/3 the time loading mags compared with thumb loading. Fits in hand and pocket, weighs only 66 grams (2.3 Ounce). Highly durable. Important! * Please note that my default shipping is standard flat rate shipping and it takes up to 14-21 business days to deliver. If you wish, you may request expedited shipping at an additional cost. Please turn to the shipping section of the listing for this option.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S73bLdzfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8EK5F8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagLula", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 37.0}}
