ally all* 9mm Luger up to .45ACP magazines, single and double stack, of all manufacturers. It does so easily, reliably, and painlessly! . Loads all* 9mm Luger, 10mm, .357 Sig, 10mm, .40, and .45ACP cal. single and double stack magazines., including 1911 mags, of all manufacturers. One size fits all. No inserts, spacers or adjustments at all ! (One SKU). Easy loading; the rounds just drop in with no fingers pushing or pressing them. No more pain ! Load hundreds of rounds painlessly. Protects your fingers and mags. Up to one round per sec. loading rate. 1/3 the time loading mags compared with thumb loading. Fits in hand and pocket, weighs only 66 grams (2.3 Ounce). Highly durable. Important! * Please note that my default shipping is standard flat rate shipping and it takes up to 14-21 business days to deliver. If you wish, you may request expedited shipping at an additional cost. Please turn to the shipping section of the listing for this option.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51n2%2BqJqdyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8EK5Z8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagLula", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 37.0}}
{"item_id": "B00A8EYYQY", "title": "2XU Men's Performance Compression Run Sock", "description": "The new 2XU Compression Performance Run Sock is our lightest, most breathable performance compression sock. By blending powerful Sport Lycra with Nylon yarns in a new proprietary, medically engineered circular knit construction, 2XU has created a revolutionary new fabric that is powerful, super lightweight, highly breathable, with unparalleled longevity and durability. The goal of any Performance Compression sock is to create a properly graduated compression fit to promote increased circulation while wrapping key muscles such as the calf and containing them in their proper firing position. Proper muscle containment more efficient performance plus a dramatic reduction in muscle vibration/oscillation leading to reduced muscle fatigue, damage plus reduced injuries such as shin splints. Because of 2XU's new knit structure and more powerful fabric, 2XU's designers can now achieve these key compression properties while introducing highly breathable panels for increased airflow and moisture management. The 2XU Performance Run Sock is Powerful, yet extremely lightweight and highly breathable. Other features include, Flexible Tongue Zone, with minimal fabric at the top of the ankle to provide a flexible juncture with the shoe tongue eliminating bunching and pressure points. Engineered Foot bed plus Heel, Optimal support for arch and Achilles with zoned padding for the heel, balls of the feet, and toe region for maximum comfort. Linked Toe Cage/Vented Toe Panel, Maximum toe plus foot bed breathability, comfort, and wear. The 2XU Compression Performance Run Sock can be worn during activity and post activity for enhanced recovery. It's perfect for any and all athletics and also a terrific travel companion for DVT protection while flying. Powerful, versatile, long lasting, lightweight plus highly breathable, The 2XU Compression Performance Run Sock will multiply your performance giving you more power with less fatigue and a more comfortable, enhanced recovery after.", "text": "2XU Men's Performance Compression Run Sock The new 2XU Compression Performance Run Sock is our lightest, most breathable performance compression sock. By blending powerful Sport Lycra with Nylon yarns in a new proprietary, medically engineered circular knit construction, 2XU has created a revolutionary new fabric that is powerful, super lightweight, highly breathable, with unparalleled longevity and durability. The goal of any Performance Compression sock is to create a properly graduated compression fit to promote increased circulation while wrapping key muscles such as the calf and containing them in their proper firing position. Proper muscle containment more efficient performance plus a dramatic reduction in muscle vibration/oscillation leading to reduced muscle fatigue, damage plus reduced injuries such as shin splints. Because of 2XU's new knit structure and more powerful fabric, 2XU's designers can now achieve these key compression properties while introducing highly breathable panels for increased airflow and moisture management. The 2XU Performance Run Sock is Powerful, yet extremely lightweight and highly breathable. Other features include, Flexible Tongue Zone, with minimal fabric at the top of the ankle to provide a flexible juncture with the shoe tongue eliminating bunching and pressure points. Engineered Foot bed plus Heel, Optimal support for arch and Achilles with zoned padding for the heel, balls of the feet, and toe region for maximum comfort. Linked Toe Cage/Vented Toe Panel, Maximum toe plus foot bed breathability, comfort, and wear. The 2XU Compression Performance Run Sock can be worn during activity and post activity for enhanced recovery. It's perfect for any and all athletics and also a terrific travel companion for DVT protection while flying. Powerful, versatile, long lasting, lightweight plus highly breathable, The 2XU Compression Performance Run Sock will multiply your performance giving you more power with less fatigue and a more comfortable, enhanced recovery after.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2Bn50XOcyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8EYYQY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00A8LOV5G", "title": "Aluminum Pro Mechanic Bike Repair Stand Foldable Bicycle Workstand Lightweight & Portable", "description": "This Conquer bike workstand is lightweight and ultra compact. The complete stand weighs only 10.5 lbs. and folds to only 40\" x 9\" x 7\" for storage.The head rotates 360° and locks in place enabling you to position your bike just so. The clamp is adjustable for clamping your seatube, saddle post, or top tube.Full Specs:Body: Anodized AluminumWeight:10.5 lbs.Folded Dims:40\" x 9\" x 7\"Height:Adjustable to 61\"Max Clamp Width:3 3/4\"Max Bike Weight:55 lbs.Extras:Tool Tray Included", "text": "Aluminum Pro Mechanic Bike Repair Stand Foldable Bicycle Workstand Lightweight & Portable This Conquer bike workstand is lightweight and ultra compact. The complete stand weighs only 10.5 lbs. and folds to only 40\" x 9\" x 7\" for storage.The head rotates 360° and locks in place enabling you to position your bike just so. The clamp is adjustable for clamping your seatube, saddle post, or top tube.Full Specs:Body: Anodized AluminumWeight:10.5 lbs.Folded Dims:40\" x 9\" x 7\"Height:Adjustable to 61\"Max Clamp Width:3 3/4\"Max Bike Weight:55 lbs.Extras:Tool Tray Included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Rj9XKvJQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8LOV5G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B00A8LXC5Q", "title": "Women's Concealment Shorts by UnderTech Undercover (Small, Black)", "description": "This is the perfect way for women to carry and conceal a handgun when they're wearing a skirt or slacks without a belt. Modeled off our extremely popular Compression T-Shirt, this Compression Concealment Shorts Holster is custom built on a pair of name brand compression shorts that are made specifically for a woman's body. It's extremely comfortable, secure and yet so concealed. It can be worn with just about everything you own, gym shorts, sweat pants, slacks, skirts, and suits. Because it works without a belt, it finally gives women a truly remarkable concealment option. Each pair of shorts features two identical holsters, one on each side, so if you're right handed you can carry a handgun on your right side and also carry spare magazines, documents, handcuffs on your left side. And, vise versa for left handed individuals. Truly one of the most comfortable holsters you'll ever wear. Extremely popular with female federal agents, undercover officers, and parole officers. Available in Black and White. Allows you to carry and conceal any self-defense handgun. Made in USA, MicroPoly/Lycra blend, machine washable. SIZE CHART XS, (0-2): 23\"-25\" WAIST, 33\"-35\" HIPS S, (4-6): 25.5\"-27.5\" WAIST, 35.5\"-37.5\" HIPS M, (8-10): 28\"-30\" WAIST, 38\"-40\" HIPS L, (12-14): 30.5\"-32.5\" WAIST, 40.5\"-42.5\" HIPS XL, (16): 33\"-35\" WAIST, 43\"-45\" HIPS XXL, (18): 36\"-38\" WAIST, 46\"-48\" HIPS Standard length shorts Inseam is 5\" DISCLAIMER: \"GLOCK\" is a federally registered trademark of Glock, Inc. and is one of many trademarks owned by Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. Glockstore.com is not affiliated with nor endorsed by Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H.", "text": "Women's Concealment Shorts by UnderTech Undercover (Small, Black) This is the perfect way for women to carry and conceal a handgun when they're wearing a skirt or slacks without a belt. Modeled off our extremely popular Compression T-Shirt, this Compression Concealment Shorts Holster is custom built on a pair of name brand compression shorts that are made specifically for a woman's body. It's extremely comfortable, secure and yet so concealed. It can be worn with just about everything you own, gym shorts, sweat pants, slacks, skirts, and suits. Because it works without a belt, it finally gives women a truly remarkable concealment option. Each pair of shorts features two identical holsters, one on each side, so if you're right handed you can carry a handgun on your right side and also carry spare magazines, documents, handcuffs on your left side. And, vise versa for left handed individuals. Truly one of the most comfortable holsters you'll ever wear. Extremely popular with female federal agents, undercover officers, and parole officers. Available in Black and White. Allows you to carry and conceal any self-defense handgun. Made in USA, MicroPoly/Lycra blend, machine washable. SIZE CHART XS, (0-2): 23\"-25\" WAIST, 33\"-35\" HIPS S, (4-6): 25.5\"-27.5\" WAIST, 35.5\"-37.5\" HIPS M, (8-10): 28\"-30\" WAIST, 38\"-40\" HIPS L, (12-14): 30.5\"-32.5\" WAIST, 40.5\"-42.5\" HIPS XL, (16): 33\"-35\" WAIST, 43\"-45\" HIPS XXL, (18): 36\"-38\" WAIST, 46\"-48\" HIPS Standard length shorts Inseam is 5\" DISCLAIMER: \"GLOCK\" is a federally registered trademark of Glock, Inc. and is one of many trademarks owned by Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. Glockstore.com is not affiliated with nor endorsed by Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yRcQIC25L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8LXC5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Girls", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A8NW65G", "title": "m1surplus Tactical Tan Color Cheek Rest w/ Detachable Mag Pouch For Howa 1500 Weatherby Vanguard Remington 700 770 M1 Garand M1A M14 Springfield 1903 Savage 10 12 110 Mauser k98 M24/47 M48 Mosin Nagant 91/30 M38 M44 1891 Ruger Gunsite Scout Rifle 10/22 Mini14 Mini30 Ranch Rifles Winchester 70 Lee Enfield Mossberg ATR MVP (Flex and predator models) Rifles", "description": "m1surplus presents this tactical ambidextrous lace-on cheekrest ----------------------------- Specification: Tan color, Made from heavy duty ballistic nylon, This is a universal design cheek rest will fit most any rifle that has a traditional rifle style stock. Provides a 7/8\" rise on top of your stock to allow for better scope to eye placement and more ergonomic shooting cheek position. Consistency in your cheek position is critical for good accuracy. Easy installation, this item just slides over your buttstock and the tightens down with heavy duty nylon cord. Nylon cord has a plastic keeper to prevent anything from coming loose. Includes a detachable rifle mag pouch which can be placed on either the right or left side of the cheek rest. Mag pouch is held firmly in place via velcro. The velcro on the side of the cheek rest is the soft side so as not to irritate your skin. Mag pouch is adjustable and will fit 5.56/223/7.62X39 magazines. The Mag pouch has an adjustable cord strap to adjust for different length magazines. Brand new with manufacture warranty against defects. Note that this listing is only for a TAN color cheek rest. Other colors may be available through other Amazon listings.", "text": "m1surplus Tactical Tan Color Cheek Rest w/ Detachable Mag Pouch For Howa 1500 Weatherby Vanguard Remington 700 770 M1 Garand M1A M14 Springfield 1903 Savage 10 12 110 Mauser k98 M24/47 M48 Mosin Nagant 91/30 M38 M44 1891 Ruger Gunsite Scout Rifle 10/22 Mini14 Mini30 Ranch Rifles Winchester 70 Lee Enfield Mossberg ATR MVP (Flex and predator models) Rifles m1surplus presents this tactical ambidextrous lace-on cheekrest ----------------------------- Specification: Tan color, Made from heavy duty ballistic nylon, This is a universal design cheek rest will fit most any rifle that has a traditional rifle style stock. Provides a 7/8\" rise on top of your stock to allow for better scope to eye placement and more ergonomic shooting cheek position. Consistency in your cheek position is critical for good accuracy. Easy installation, this item just slides over your buttstock and the tightens down with heavy duty nylon cord. Nylon cord has a plastic keeper to prevent anything from coming loose. Includes a detachable rifle mag pouch which can be placed on either the right or left side of the cheek rest. Mag pouch is held firmly in place via velcro. The velcro on the side of the cheek rest is the soft side so as not to irritate your skin. Mag pouch is adjustable and will fit 5.56/223/7.62X39 magazines. The Mag pouch has an adjustable cord strap to adjust for different length magazines. Brand new with manufacture warranty against defects. Note that this listing is only for a TAN color cheek rest. Other colors may be available through other Amazon listings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gOWlJ7yuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8NW65G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 23.95}}
{"item_id": "B00A8P55IY", "title": "WARNING: Baiting Deer Is Illegal - 11\" x 11\" Plastic Yellow Sign", "description": "\"WARNING: Baiting Deer Is Illegal; This Corn Pile Is Intended For Squirrels, Chipmunks And Other Such Animals; Any Deer Found Eating This Corn Will Be Shot!\" 11\" x 11\" plastic novelty sign. Perfect gag gift or decor for the hunting cabin. Weather-resistant plastic will last for years outdoors. Bright yellow", "text": "WARNING: Baiting Deer Is Illegal - 11\" x 11\" Plastic Yellow Sign \"WARNING: Baiting Deer Is Illegal; This Corn Pile Is Intended For Squirrels, Chipmunks And Other Such Animals; Any Deer Found Eating This Corn Will Be Shot!\" 11\" x 11\" plastic novelty sign. Perfect gag gift or decor for the hunting cabin. Weather-resistant plastic will last for years outdoors. Bright yellow", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61GrGkgviAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A8P55IY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Hunting Signs"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A95QWGM", "title": "Hornady 9th Edition Handbook of Cartridge Reloading", "description": "Reloaders will find the 9th Edition Hornady Handbook of Cartridge Reloading an invaluable resource for their bench. You'll find over 900 pages representing data of all the newest Hornady bullets like the NTX, GMX and FTX, plus longtime favorites like the V-MAX, SST, InterBond, Interlock, A-MAX, XTP and more. Each cartridge features applicable Hornady bullets along with velocity/powder charts for quick and easy reference. Cartridge additions include the 17 Hornet, 327 Federal, 356 Winchester, 5.56 NATO, 416 Barrett and 505 Gibbs. There is also expanded data on over 20 favorites like the 223 Rem, 300 Whisper, 308 Win 25-06 and many more. A variety of propellants such as Power Pro Varmint, AR Comp, CFE-223 among others have been added to many popular cartridges. In addition to the comprehensive reloading charts, this reference manual provides shooting enthusiasts with in-depth, easy-to-understand explanations of internal, external and terminal ballistics. Whether a novice or a seasoned reloader, these resources provide everything needed to successfully reload your favorite cartridges.", "text": "Hornady 9th Edition Handbook of Cartridge Reloading Reloaders will find the 9th Edition Hornady Handbook of Cartridge Reloading an invaluable resource for their bench. You'll find over 900 pages representing data of all the newest Hornady bullets like the NTX, GMX and FTX, plus longtime favorites like the V-MAX, SST, InterBond, Interlock, A-MAX, XTP and more. Each cartridge features applicable Hornady bullets along with velocity/powder charts for quick and easy reference. Cartridge additions include the 17 Hornet, 327 Federal, 356 Winchester, 5.56 NATO, 416 Barrett and 505 Gibbs. There is also expanded data on over 20 favorites like the 223 Rem, 300 Whisper, 308 Win 25-06 and many more. A variety of propellants such as Power Pro Varmint, AR Comp, CFE-223 among others have been added to many popular cartridges. In addition to the comprehensive reloading charts, this reference manual provides shooting enthusiasts with in-depth, easy-to-understand explanations of internal, external and terminal ballistics. Whether a novice or a seasoned reloader, these resources provide everything needed to successfully reload your favorite cartridges.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Be8qQRQxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A95QWGM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A9AL5Q4", "title": "Portable Quick-Wrap Hand Wrap Roller", "description": "Tired of rolling your wraps by hand? The quick-wrap roller is exactly what you need! Simply slide one end of your hand wrap through the guide opening and start rolling. This portable hand wrap roller from Meister MMA will fit easily in your gym bag so you can re-wrap your hand wraps in seconds at the gym or after you wash them. And, it fits all 2\" wide wraps, any length. Stop wasting your time and get this roller today!", "text": "Portable Quick-Wrap Hand Wrap Roller Tired of rolling your wraps by hand? The quick-wrap roller is exactly what you need! Simply slide one end of your hand wrap through the guide opening and start rolling. This portable hand wrap roller from Meister MMA will fit easily in your gym bag so you can re-wrap your hand wraps in seconds at the gym or after you wash them. And, it fits all 2\" wide wraps, any length. Stop wasting your time and get this roller today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h18nZ3iUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A9AL5Q4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Hand Wraps"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A9GG6EY", "title": "Hot Sale Polar Fleece Neck Warmer Snood Scarf Hat Thermal Ski Wear Mask Beanie Cs Hat", "description": "", "text": "Hot Sale Polar Fleece Neck Warmer Snood Scarf Hat Thermal Ski Wear Mask Beanie Cs Hat", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415W3bTO5oL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A9GG6EY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Generic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowboarding"]], "price": 6.0}}
{"item_id": "B00A9GX5Y8", "title": "Paracord Planet 550lb Type III Paracord Combo Crafting Kits with Buckles", "description": "Looking for a fun paracord project but don't want to spend the money all on just one color? Then the Paracord Planet Combo Sets are the item for you! The Combo Sets consist of anywhere from 30-200 ft of various colors of 550 Type III Commercial Grade paracord and all sets include buckles! Our paracord is 550lb. Type III Commercial Grade parachute cord (almost identical to the Mil-Spec without the higher prices). It has a core of seven inner strands surrounded by a nylon cover with a minimum breaking strength of 550lbs. Great for camping, hiking, military, survival or any outdoor adventure!", "text": "Paracord Planet 550lb Type III Paracord Combo Crafting Kits with Buckles Looking for a fun paracord project but don't want to spend the money all on just one color? Then the Paracord Planet Combo Sets are the item for you! The Combo Sets consist of anywhere from 30-200 ft of various colors of 550 Type III Commercial Grade paracord and all sets include buckles! Our paracord is 550lb. Type III Commercial Grade parachute cord (almost identical to the Mil-Spec without the higher prices). It has a core of seven inner strands surrounded by a nylon cover with a minimum breaking strength of 550lbs. Great for camping, hiking, military, survival or any outdoor adventure!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51yU1Wo0SCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A9GX5Y8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PARACORD PLANET", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A9HPP6S", "title": "Black Leather Military Style Sling M1 Garand M14 Springfield", "description": "Excellent quality current production of the classic and still very popular M1907 Military Leather Rifle Sling in Black Leather. 1 1/4 wide. This would be the correct issue sling for your M1 Garand, 1903 / 1903A3 Springfield, 1917 Enfield, M14, M1A , Black Rifles and many other classic Military Rifles. Exactly like the one used by U.S. Troops from WW2 to Vietnam except in Black. Still a favorite among target shooters and at the National Matches at Camp Perry. The perfect sling for your Black Rifle. Sewn keepers and copper rivets. I have taken several closeup pictures for you to see the quality put into this sling. This is a current production never used sling.", "text": "Black Leather Military Style Sling M1 Garand M14 Springfield Excellent quality current production of the classic and still very popular M1907 Military Leather Rifle Sling in Black Leather. 1 1/4 wide. This would be the correct issue sling for your M1 Garand, 1903 / 1903A3 Springfield, 1917 Enfield, M14, M1A , Black Rifles and many other classic Military Rifles. Exactly like the one used by U.S. Troops from WW2 to Vietnam except in Black. Still a favorite among target shooters and at the National Matches at Camp Perry. The perfect sling for your Black Rifle. Sewn keepers and copper rivets. I have taken several closeup pictures for you to see the quality put into this sling. This is a current production never used sling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ie9VrckoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A9HPP6S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B00A9L30M0", "title": "ILBE Assault Pack Generation 2 Marpat Previously Issued", "description": "Genuine USGI ILBE Marine Corps Generation 2 Assault Pack. The assault pack is the smaller pack that can be attached to the ILBE Main Pack. This pack can hold 1500 cubic inches of gear with a load capacity of up to 40 pounds. This pack also has an inner pocket designed to store a Hydration System which can hold 100 oz. of water (not included). The front and side panels have PALS (Pouch Accessory Ladder System) allowing attachment of additional MOLLE type pouches. Featuring quick release padded shoulder straps, built-in waist belt with buckle, padded back panel, removable plastic stiffener panel (included), two storage compartments, front and side MOLLE attachment points and is made out of 100% heavy duty nylon material. The pack measures approximately 22 inches length x 12 inches wide x 9 inches deep.", "text": "ILBE Assault Pack Generation 2 Marpat Previously Issued Genuine USGI ILBE Marine Corps Generation 2 Assault Pack. The assault pack is the smaller pack that can be attached to the ILBE Main Pack. This pack can hold 1500 cubic inches of gear with a load capacity of up to 40 pounds. This pack also has an inner pocket designed to store a Hydration System which can hold 100 oz. of water (not included). The front and side panels have PALS (Pouch Accessory Ladder System) allowing attachment of additional MOLLE type pouches. Featuring quick release padded shoulder straps, built-in waist belt with buckle, padded back panel, removable plastic stiffener panel (included), two storage compartments, front and side MOLLE attachment points and is made out of 100% heavy duty nylon material. The pack measures approximately 22 inches length x 12 inches wide x 9 inches deep.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YRLpptfkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A9L30M0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 70.49}}
{"item_id": "B00A9O7S2A", "title": "injinji Men's Performance Midweight Mini Crew Toe Socks (Small)", "description": "The Performance Series Mid weight Toe sock is designed as a padded interface for performance in any shoe, climate or terrain. The Performance Series is built with Injinji's patented AIS Technology and constructed with Cool Max, Lycra and Nylon fibers that help keep feet dry, cool and comfortable.", "text": "injinji Men's Performance Midweight Mini Crew Toe Socks (Small) The Performance Series Mid weight Toe sock is designed as a padded interface for performance in any shoe, climate or terrain. The Performance Series is built with Injinji's patented AIS Technology and constructed with Cool Max, Lycra and Nylon fibers that help keep feet dry, cool and comfortable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51x%2B1C74QxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A9O7S2A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Women", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00A9OVWMM", "title": "1QT MOLLE Canteen Pouch Woodland Camo", "description": "Grommet hole for drainage, quick release adjustable buckle, and 2 velcro-closure side pockets. Pouch can be used to hold a 1 Qt. Canteen, 1 stripped down MRE, 5 M16 or M4 magazines, or ANPVS 7 Goggles, or any number of other items.", "text": "1QT MOLLE Canteen Pouch Woodland Camo Grommet hole for drainage, quick release adjustable buckle, and 2 velcro-closure side pockets. Pouch can be used to hold a 1 Qt. Canteen, 1 stripped down MRE, 5 M16 or M4 magazines, or ANPVS 7 Goggles, or any number of other items.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qgKIBb7HL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A9OVWMM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "U.S. Military", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 14.98}}
{"item_id": "B00A9PWUOK", "title": "Sinland Multi-purpose Ultra Absorbent Microfiber Sports Towel", "description": "Made of 80/20 blend of polyester and polyamide. The super microfiber towel is thirsty,soft, hypoallergenic, anti-bacteria, lightweight, compact, self quick drying and easy be cleaned and durable. It will give you thoroughly perfect feeling. So keep one in home or your travel luggage, it will work quicker and be easier to store. NOTE: Towels in dark color( green and red for example) will fade more or less at the first washing, please wash separately.", "text": "Sinland Multi-purpose Ultra Absorbent Microfiber Sports Towel Made of 80/20 blend of polyester and polyamide. The super microfiber towel is thirsty,soft, hypoallergenic, anti-bacteria, lightweight, compact, self quick drying and easy be cleaned and durable. It will give you thoroughly perfect feeling. So keep one in home or your travel luggage, it will work quicker and be easier to store. NOTE: Towels in dark color( green and red for example) will fade more or less at the first washing, please wash separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51EFGeTixeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A9PWUOK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00A9UNNJG", "title": "Trophy Ridge 6 inch Static Stabilizer", "description": "Trophy Ridge 6\" Static Stabilizers helps steady your bow for accurate shots! The Static Stabilizer absorbs shock and adds weight up front to avoid unfortunate imbalance that might change the trajectory of your arrow: Ultra-lightweight design comes with 2 customizable weights for added balance; Ballistix copolymer system has the strength of aluminum, with 25% less weight, and boasts soft-touch coating for vibration reduction; Braided wrist sling included; Unique design allows wind to pass through, giving you a steadier shot. State Color. Order yours today! Trophy Ridge 6\" Static Stabilizer", "text": "Trophy Ridge 6 inch Static Stabilizer Trophy Ridge 6\" Static Stabilizers helps steady your bow for accurate shots! The Static Stabilizer absorbs shock and adds weight up front to avoid unfortunate imbalance that might change the trajectory of your arrow: Ultra-lightweight design comes with 2 customizable weights for added balance; Ballistix copolymer system has the strength of aluminum, with 25% less weight, and boasts soft-touch coating for vibration reduction; Braided wrist sling included; Unique design allows wind to pass through, giving you a steadier shot. State Color. Order yours today! Trophy Ridge 6\" Static Stabilizer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BYgnPDo0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A9UNNJG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trophy Ridge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Stabilizers"]], "price": 28.5}}
{"item_id": "B00A9XN9E2", "title": "Spyderco Southard Folder G-10 Plain Edge Knife, Brown", "description": "Brad Southard is an amazingly talented custom knife maker who specializes in high-performance folder designs. His first collaboration with Spiders features a \"flipper\"—a novel blade-opening device that was pioneered by custom knife maker Kit Carson. A flipper consists of a small lever that extends from the base of the Southard's CTS 204P hollow-ground blade and protrudes from the back of the knife's handle when closed. Pulling on it with your index finger creates a tension against the detent mechanism that holds the blade closed. When the detent is overcome, the blade rotates on a special captive ball-bearing pivot system and snaps authoritatively into the open position. The Southard Flipper features a stonewashed finish on the blade and the titanium scale that forms the foundation of the knife's Reeve Integral Lock (R.I.L.) mechanism. The opposite scale is machined from textured Earth-brown G-10 for a positive grip and the knife includes a pocket clip configured for right-side, tip-up carry to ensure swift, positive deployment.", "text": "Spyderco Southard Folder G-10 Plain Edge Knife, Brown Brad Southard is an amazingly talented custom knife maker who specializes in high-performance folder designs. His first collaboration with Spiders features a \"flipper\"—a novel blade-opening device that was pioneered by custom knife maker Kit Carson. A flipper consists of a small lever that extends from the base of the Southard's CTS 204P hollow-ground blade and protrudes from the back of the knife's handle when closed. Pulling on it with your index finger creates a tension against the detent mechanism that holds the blade closed. When the detent is overcome, the blade rotates on a special captive ball-bearing pivot system and snaps authoritatively into the open position. The Southard Flipper features a stonewashed finish on the blade and the titanium scale that forms the foundation of the knife's Reeve Integral Lock (R.I.L.) mechanism. The opposite scale is machined from textured Earth-brown G-10 for a positive grip and the knife includes a pocket clip configured for right-side, tip-up carry to ensure swift, positive deployment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lbWpJkMXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00A9XN9E2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 233.64}}
{"item_id": "B00AA0MXAU", "title": "Zing Air Huntress", "description": "The Air Huntress Z Curve Bow is the ultimate foam bow and arrow combo, load up with a whistling sonic soft foam arrow, pull back, then ready, aim, fire and watch as the arrow soars over 125'. Set up some cans for target practice or shoot against a wall for bounce back action.", "text": "Zing Air Huntress The Air Huntress Z Curve Bow is the ultimate foam bow and arrow combo, load up with a whistling sonic soft foam arrow, pull back, then ready, aim, fire and watch as the arrow soars over 125'. Set up some cans for target practice or shoot against a wall for bounce back action.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uluZotK%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AA0MXAU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bows", "Youth Bow Sets"]], "price": 16.5}}
{"item_id": "B00AAGLS8W", "title": "PTK Ergonomic Pointing Grip By Fab-Defense", "description": "The 'PTK'- Ergonomic Pointing Grip conceptualizes within its design a unique Special Forces combat proven instinctive shooting method incorporating natural pointing positioning which enhances accuracy, speed and overall tactical performance. • Provides Natural Grip Positioning for Point and Shoot Techniques • Innovative State of the Art Design • Allows Optimal Tactical Support Prevents Fatigue, Increases Long Term Accuracy • Maintains Natural Body Stance", "text": "PTK Ergonomic Pointing Grip By Fab-Defense The 'PTK'- Ergonomic Pointing Grip conceptualizes within its design a unique Special Forces combat proven instinctive shooting method incorporating natural pointing positioning which enhances accuracy, speed and overall tactical performance. • Provides Natural Grip Positioning for Point and Shoot Techniques • Innovative State of the Art Design • Allows Optimal Tactical Support Prevents Fatigue, Increases Long Term Accuracy • Maintains Natural Body Stance", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kBYhASbXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AAGLS8W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fab-Defense", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 31.06}}
{"item_id": "B00AAGMLL0", "title": "VTS Versatile Tactical Support (2 Pieces) Fab-Defense color FDE - Flat Dark Earth / Black / OD Green", "description": "The new 'VTS' Versatile Tactical Support- provides versatile solutions for various forward grip positioning enhancing comfort and increasing accuracy. This ergonomic support may be set to accommodate a wide variety of tactical locations for ideal operational superiority taking in mind ideal compact configuration.", "text": "VTS Versatile Tactical Support (2 Pieces) Fab-Defense color FDE - Flat Dark Earth / Black / OD Green The new 'VTS' Versatile Tactical Support- provides versatile solutions for various forward grip positioning enhancing comfort and increasing accuracy. This ergonomic support may be set to accommodate a wide variety of tactical locations for ideal operational superiority taking in mind ideal compact configuration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61SucQaLoEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AAGMLL0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fab-Defense", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 20.65}}
{"item_id": "B00AAJO9R6", "title": "Havalon Piranta Folding Knives", "description": "The Havalon brand offers surgical-edging technology to the sporting and industrial markets. If you have field dressing, skinning or caping work to do, Havalon is your best choice with their \"crazy-sharp blades,\" the sharpest knives for the job. Hunters, professional guides and wildlife officers rave about their lightweight field dressing and skinning knives with the surgically-sharp blades - blades that taxidermists have been using for over 25 years. This is Havalon's best selling knife for field dressing and skinning. The Piranta-Edge, in easy-to-find blaze orange, is light weight - less than three ounces. And no need to carry extra knives, heavy files, stones or other sharpeners. It's always sharp - just replace the blades and go!", "text": "Havalon Piranta Folding Knives The Havalon brand offers surgical-edging technology to the sporting and industrial markets. If you have field dressing, skinning or caping work to do, Havalon is your best choice with their \"crazy-sharp blades,\" the sharpest knives for the job. Hunters, professional guides and wildlife officers rave about their lightweight field dressing and skinning knives with the surgically-sharp blades - blades that taxidermists have been using for over 25 years. This is Havalon's best selling knife for field dressing and skinning. The Piranta-Edge, in easy-to-find blaze orange, is light weight - less than three ounces. And no need to carry extra knives, heavy files, stones or other sharpeners. It's always sharp - just replace the blades and go!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416qe7COk2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AAJO9R6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Havalon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 34.7}}
{"item_id": "B00AAORNFQ", "title": "100 pack - 7\" Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Multi Color - See Your Hits Instantly - Gun, Rifle & Airsoft Targets", "description": "GlowShot 7\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each ring is a different color so you can see your hit location easier. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 7\" Targets come in 40 and 100 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 7\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "text": "100 pack - 7\" Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Multi Color - See Your Hits Instantly - Gun, Rifle & Airsoft Targets GlowShot 7\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each ring is a different color so you can see your hit location easier. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 7\" Targets come in 40 and 100 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 7\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ir-zRvM1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AAORNFQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B00AAOW2WK", "title": "Outers Economy Universal Cleaning Kit in Wooden Case, 28-Piece", "description": "Outers is excited to offer a full line of attractive, wooden specialty kits to perform cleanings quickly and effectively. Each kit is specifically created to work on all calibers and gauges, as well as for all gun types, and boast an attractive full wood grain appearance for years of enjoyment.", "text": "Outers Economy Universal Cleaning Kit in Wooden Case, 28-Piece Outers is excited to offer a full line of attractive, wooden specialty kits to perform cleanings quickly and effectively. Each kit is specifically created to work on all calibers and gauges, as well as for all gun types, and boast an attractive full wood grain appearance for years of enjoyment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zQgA47I9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AAOW2WK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 33.06}}
{"item_id": "B00AAP4Y98", "title": "1 Pair Outdoor Sports Fingerless Military Tactical Airsoft Hunting Cycling Bike Gloves Green M/L/XL", "description": "Color: Green (As picture)Size: M/L/XLSIZE CENTIMETERS INCHESMedium 17.5cm-21cm 7\" to 8.5\"Large 21cm-23cm 8.5\" to 9\"X-Large 23cm-25cm 9\" to 10\"MEASURE AROUND HAND WITH THUMB EXTENDEDMEASURE HAND CIRCUMFERENCE?Colors may not appear exactly as seen on photo in real life due to variations between the computer monitors and naked eye color difference.?", "text": "1 Pair Outdoor Sports Fingerless Military Tactical Airsoft Hunting Cycling Bike Gloves Green M/L/XL Color: Green (As picture)Size: M/L/XLSIZE CENTIMETERS INCHESMedium 17.5cm-21cm 7\" to 8.5\"Large 21cm-23cm 8.5\" to 9\"X-Large 23cm-25cm 9\" to 10\"MEASURE AROUND HAND WITH THUMB EXTENDEDMEASURE HAND CIRCUMFERENCE?Colors may not appear exactly as seen on photo in real life due to variations between the computer monitors and naked eye color difference.?", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l9EASDroL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AAP4Y98.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00AAQ3S7G", "title": "WeiHeng ® Led Digital Electronic Portable Luggage Travel Express Fish Scale", "description": "Ultra-compact design & light weight,and easy to carry. Retractable steel handle Auto Off: 120 seconds Display: LCD with backup light Reading Hold: Automatic Power: AAA x 2 (Not included） Automatic reading hold Large LCD display with backup light Package Included: 1 x digital 50kg x 10g hanging scale", "text": "WeiHeng ® Led Digital Electronic Portable Luggage Travel Express Fish Scale Ultra-compact design & light weight,and easy to carry. Retractable steel handle Auto Off: 120 seconds Display: LCD with backup light Reading Hold: Automatic Power: AAA x 2 (Not included） Automatic reading hold Large LCD display with backup light Package Included: 1 x digital 50kg x 10g hanging scale", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ftAWEtN7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AAQ3S7G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weiheng", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Fish Scales"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AAQOV5E", "title": "Replacement 8.4V 6600mAh Rechargeable Battery Pack for Headlamp & Bicycle Light", "description": "Working Time:- Can work 3 ~ 4 hours (in the middle mode for 1X CREE XM-L T6 LED)- Can work 1.5 ~ 2 hours(in the middle mode for 3X CREE XM-L T6 LED)Weight: 280gDimension(L x W x D): 65mm x 56mm x 36mmWhat's In The Box:1 x 6600mAh Rechargeable Battery PackePathDirect After Service: 30 Days Money Back Guarantee, 12 Months Warranty!", "text": "Replacement 8.4V 6600mAh Rechargeable Battery Pack for Headlamp & Bicycle Light Working Time:- Can work 3 ~ 4 hours (in the middle mode for 1X CREE XM-L T6 LED)- Can work 1.5 ~ 2 hours(in the middle mode for 3X CREE XM-L T6 LED)Weight: 280gDimension(L x W x D): 65mm x 56mm x 36mmWhat's In The Box:1 x 6600mAh Rechargeable Battery PackePathDirect After Service: 30 Days Money Back Guarantee, 12 Months Warranty!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lMNHvIctL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AAQOV5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ePathDirect", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AAZ08ES", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits Ultralight & Watertight .5 First Aid Kit", "description": "The Ultralight / Watertight .5 is designed for adventure racers, multi-sport enthusiasts, and anyone looking for an ultralight kit with enough supplies for one person Up to 2 Days. Inner DryFlexTM waterproof liners and seam-sealed outer silnylon bags provide multiple layers of protection from the elements. Designed for one up to two days, this is the kit for adventures where exposure to the elements will be an issue. KIT INCLUDES: Bandages & Dressings 2 Bandage, Butterfly Closure 1 Tape, 1\" x 10 Yards 2 Bandage, Adhesive, Fabric, Knuckle 4 Bandage, Adhesive, Fabric, 1\" x 3\" 1 Bandage, Conforming Gauze, 2\" 2 Dressing, Gauze, Sterile, 3\" x 3\", Pkg./2 2 Dressing, Gauze, Sterile, 2\" x 2\", Pkg./2 1 Dressing, Non-Adherent, Sterile, 3\" x 4\" Medication 2 Ibuprofen (200 mg), Pkg./2 1 Aspirin (325 mg), Pkg./2 2 Antihistamine (Diphenhydramine 25 mg) 2 AfterBite Sting & Itch Relief Wipe Blister 11 Moleskin, Pre-Cut & Shaped 3 Alcohol Swab Instrument 1 Splinter Picker/Tick Remover Forceps 3 Safety Pins Cleaning & Topicals 3 After Cuts & Scrapes Antiseptic Wipe 2 Triple Antibiotic Ointment, Single Use 1 Tincture of Benzoin Topical Adhesive", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits Ultralight & Watertight .5 First Aid Kit The Ultralight / Watertight .5 is designed for adventure racers, multi-sport enthusiasts, and anyone looking for an ultralight kit with enough supplies for one person Up to 2 Days. Inner DryFlexTM waterproof liners and seam-sealed outer silnylon bags provide multiple layers of protection from the elements. Designed for one up to two days, this is the kit for adventures where exposure to the elements will be an issue. KIT INCLUDES: Bandages & Dressings 2 Bandage, Butterfly Closure 1 Tape, 1\" x 10 Yards 2 Bandage, Adhesive, Fabric, Knuckle 4 Bandage, Adhesive, Fabric, 1\" x 3\" 1 Bandage, Conforming Gauze, 2\" 2 Dressing, Gauze, Sterile, 3\" x 3\", Pkg./2 2 Dressing, Gauze, Sterile, 2\" x 2\", Pkg./2 1 Dressing, Non-Adherent, Sterile, 3\" x 4\" Medication 2 Ibuprofen (200 mg), Pkg./2 1 Aspirin (325 mg), Pkg./2 2 Antihistamine (Diphenhydramine 25 mg) 2 AfterBite Sting & Itch Relief Wipe Blister 11 Moleskin, Pre-Cut & Shaped 3 Alcohol Swab Instrument 1 Splinter Picker/Tick Remover Forceps 3 Safety Pins Cleaning & Topicals 3 After Cuts & Scrapes Antiseptic Wipe 2 Triple Antibiotic Ointment, Single Use 1 Tincture of Benzoin Topical Adhesive", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416dldYkFrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AAZ08ES.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00AB3Z718", "title": "Smith & Wesson 1911 Tactical Bag", "description": "Smith & Wesson 1911 Tactical Bag. A compact backpack-style carry for the range, hikes, the hunt, everywhere! Gear up, this 1911 Tactical Pack is ready. Rugged 600-denier nylon; Padded, adjustable shoulder straps; Hydration ready; Large water bottle pocket; Protected laptop compartment; Smooth operating zippers. 1 lb., 2 oz. State Color. Choose yours today! Smith & Wesson 1911 Tactical Bag", "text": "Smith & Wesson 1911 Tactical Bag Smith & Wesson 1911 Tactical Bag. A compact backpack-style carry for the range, hikes, the hunt, everywhere! Gear up, this 1911 Tactical Pack is ready. Rugged 600-denier nylon; Padded, adjustable shoulder straps; Hydration ready; Large water bottle pocket; Protected laptop compartment; Smooth operating zippers. 1 lb., 2 oz. State Color. Choose yours today! Smith & Wesson 1911 Tactical Bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51n8mGte6BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AB3Z718.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 50.27}}
{"item_id": "B00AB40QCW", "title": "Smith and Wesson M&P Tactical Rifle Case, Black, 42-Inch", "description": "Allen Company is proud to have co-developed the NEW Smith and Wesson product line to meet the needs of serious shooters and law enforcement. The designs are functional and the components are intended to withstand heavy use. Allen Company used 1200D Endure fabric for the gun cases and shooting bags and increased the specification of the 600D Endure fabric by 25% for the packs. As future products are developed, Allen Co will continue to consult serious users, military and police departments to make sure products the needs and expectations of hard-core users are being met.", "text": "Smith and Wesson M&P Tactical Rifle Case, Black, 42-Inch Allen Company is proud to have co-developed the NEW Smith and Wesson product line to meet the needs of serious shooters and law enforcement. The designs are functional and the components are intended to withstand heavy use. Allen Company used 1200D Endure fabric for the gun cases and shooting bags and increased the specification of the 600D Endure fabric by 25% for the packs. As future products are developed, Allen Co will continue to consult serious users, military and police departments to make sure products the needs and expectations of hard-core users are being met.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313349obdqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AB40QCW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 51.41}}
