{"item_id": "B00AB63708", "title": "MRE (Meals, Ready to Eat) - Two Course Fresh MREs with Heaters - 5 Year Shelf Life (Pack of 6)", "description": "MREs were designed by the US military to provide a hot nutritious meal to soldiers anywhere, anytime. Because the food is retort packaged, it staysfresh tasting without preservatives- MREs have up to a5 year shelf life!When in the field, soldiers 'field-strip' their 3 course MREs to get down to the basics: entrees and desserts. Field-strippinglightens the load and allows easy transport, all while supplying necessary energy and calories. The 2 course MRE was designed with this practice in mind: get thecalories you needwithout the extra weight.Our MREs are perfect for youremergency food supplyand field use. They were designed for 'Week 1' of any disaster or emergency: they're precooked, mobile, ultra durable, and ready to eat. These qualities make MREs highly suited to quick departures from your home (i.e. emergency evacuations) and storage in yourcar emergency kit, 72 hour kit, bug out bag, or other emergency food supply.Meal Kit Supply focuses exclusively on MREs and offers the best commercial MRE on the market. Each pack includes 6 menus: 2 breakfast meals and 4 lunch / dinner meals. Each 2 course MRE also contains a Flameless Ration Heater, 6\" spoon, and napkin.See the product images for current menu.", "text": "MRE (Meals, Ready to Eat) - Two Course Fresh MREs with Heaters - 5 Year Shelf Life (Pack of 6) MREs were designed by the US military to provide a hot nutritious meal to soldiers anywhere, anytime. Because the food is retort packaged, it staysfresh tasting without preservatives- MREs have up to a5 year shelf life!When in the field, soldiers 'field-strip' their 3 course MREs to get down to the basics: entrees and desserts. Field-strippinglightens the load and allows easy transport, all while supplying necessary energy and calories. The 2 course MRE was designed with this practice in mind: get thecalories you needwithout the extra weight.Our MREs are perfect for youremergency food supplyand field use. They were designed for 'Week 1' of any disaster or emergency: they're precooked, mobile, ultra durable, and ready to eat. These qualities make MREs highly suited to quick departures from your home (i.e. emergency evacuations) and storage in yourcar emergency kit, 72 hour kit, bug out bag, or other emergency food supply.Meal Kit Supply focuses exclusively on MREs and offers the best commercial MRE on the market. Each pack includes 6 menus: 2 breakfast meals and 4 lunch / dinner meals. Each 2 course MRE also contains a Flameless Ration Heater, 6\" spoon, and napkin.See the product images for current menu.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YAv5qQ-CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AB63708.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AB811MC", "title": "Professional New Mini Set Stove for Camping/hiking Cs-b02", "description": "Folding handle for the fire extinguish lid make it easy to pack, Put the spirit burner into the stand. Place the cookware on the top of the stand.Used for Alocs cookwarePlease put it on the plane ground.The holes on the stand increase the air ventilation. Put the extinguish lid on the burner to finish burning.List of items:1PC stove bracket,1 spirit stove.", "text": "Professional New Mini Set Stove for Camping/hiking Cs-b02 Folding handle for the fire extinguish lid make it easy to pack, Put the spirit burner into the stand. Place the cookware on the top of the stand.Used for Alocs cookwarePlease put it on the plane ground.The holes on the stand increase the air ventilation. Put the extinguish lid on the burner to finish burning.List of items:1PC stove bracket,1 spirit stove.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gFvGqzjXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AB811MC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FreeFisher", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 18.12}}
