{"item_id": "B00ABUSWM2", "title": "UST 30-Day Lantern", "description": "UST's remarkable new 30 Day Lantern runs for an amazing 30 days or more on the low setting at 29 lumens and 32 hours at up to 300 lumens. With a quick twist, the cover can be removed and the 30 Day Lantern can be used as a down light. In case of emergency, you can remove the cover, set the light to strobe, set it in an open area, and continue to handle your situation without worrying about holding the light. Operates on readily available D cell batteries, has a high, medium, low, and SOS flash setting.Compact size is easy to pack for camping, RV'ing or any other outdoor application, also great for emergency preparedness in the home.", "text": "UST 30-Day Lantern UST's remarkable new 30 Day Lantern runs for an amazing 30 days or more on the low setting at 29 lumens and 32 hours at up to 300 lumens. With a quick twist, the cover can be removed and the 30 Day Lantern can be used as a down light. In case of emergency, you can remove the cover, set the light to strobe, set it in an open area, and continue to handle your situation without worrying about holding the light. Operates on readily available D cell batteries, has a high, medium, low, and SOS flash setting.Compact size is easy to pack for camping, RV'ing or any other outdoor application, also great for emergency preparedness in the home.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pyPb7aRuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ABUSWM2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UST", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B00AC66HKY", "title": "12ga Forend Wrench", "description": "12ga Forend Wrench | (Remington 870) *Made of STEEL *Made in USA | This wrench is used for cleaning the pump action or changing your forend stocks on Remington 870 shotguns.", "text": "12ga Forend Wrench 12ga Forend Wrench | (Remington 870) *Made of STEEL *Made in USA | This wrench is used for cleaning the pump action or changing your forend stocks on Remington 870 shotguns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bI2KYqgIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AC66HKY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 13.2}}
{"item_id": "B00AC6Q8JY", "title": "Condor 26 Transporter Gun Bag, Black", "description": "The Condor Transporter's discreet design hides your AR-15 Carbine in plain sight. The 164 features a padded interior with a removable divider to separate the upper and lower receivers with a padded mesh back to maximize airflow. The exterior zipper compartment hold s your magazines, tools and other accessories. Also, fits AR and AK pistols as well as AK-47 under folders and other take-down guns.", "text": "Condor 26 Transporter Gun Bag, Black The Condor Transporter's discreet design hides your AR-15 Carbine in plain sight. The 164 features a padded interior with a removable divider to separate the upper and lower receivers with a padded mesh back to maximize airflow. The exterior zipper compartment hold s your magazines, tools and other accessories. Also, fits AR and AK pistols as well as AK-47 under folders and other take-down guns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BSN%2Bz-jOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AC6Q8JY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 48.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AC8G8C4", "title": "Paracord Planet Mil-Spec Commercial Grade 550lb Type III Nylon Paracord", "description": "An ideal all-around utility cord in the field, the type III commercial paracord is tough and long lasting. The cord is made of 550-pound test nylon and features a seven-strand core for maximum strength. Measuring 5/32 inches in diameter, the paracord is manufactured in the United States. This paracord is available in a variety of lengths and colors.", "text": "Paracord Planet Mil-Spec Commercial Grade 550lb Type III Nylon Paracord An ideal all-around utility cord in the field, the type III commercial paracord is tough and long lasting. The cord is made of 550-pound test nylon and features a seven-strand core for maximum strength. Measuring 5/32 inches in diameter, the paracord is manufactured in the United States. This paracord is available in a variety of lengths and colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61oEUwNtoVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AC8G8C4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00ACD91O6", "title": "Crazy Shopping Airsoft War Game Half Face Guard Mesh Mask Protector Olive Green", "description": "Specification:Material: environment-friendly paint and carbon steel wireColour: khaki, blackType: protective maskGender:UnisexSize:20cm*15cm/7.87\"x5.90\"inchWeight: 0.146 (kg)", "text": "Crazy Shopping Airsoft War Game Half Face Guard Mesh Mask Protector Olive Green Specification:Material: environment-friendly paint and carbon steel wireColour: khaki, blackType: protective maskGender:UnisexSize:20cm*15cm/7.87\"x5.90\"inchWeight: 0.146 (kg)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dZNiJ2WyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ACD91O6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Amico", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 6.18}}
{"item_id": "B00ACMPARE", "title": "Pocket Holster for Kimber Pepper Blaster II High Adhesion Very Sticky Fabric", "description": "This is a slim-line, soft sided holster constructed of a high adhesion fabric. It is designed for use inside the pocket of trousers or slacks, and will prevent the gun from \"imprinting\" on the outside of the pocket, while helping to hold the gun in an upright position. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun and its soft lined interior allows a rapid, unobstructed draw. It is also useful for positioning a gun inside a purse so it can be found quickly.", "text": "Pocket Holster for Kimber Pepper Blaster II High Adhesion Very Sticky Fabric This is a slim-line, soft sided holster constructed of a high adhesion fabric. It is designed for use inside the pocket of trousers or slacks, and will prevent the gun from \"imprinting\" on the outside of the pocket, while helping to hold the gun in an upright position. Its flexible design adds little bulk to the size of the gun and its soft lined interior allows a rapid, unobstructed draw. It is also useful for positioning a gun inside a purse so it can be found quickly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51q6X9XfJvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ACMPARE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 16.9}}
