{"item_id": "B00ADINL8W", "title": "SainStyle Road Racing Cycling Bicycle Bike Helmet with Visor for Adult, Red", "description": "Features: 1. Many channeled vents bring cool air in through the front, allowing it to pass over your head and then flushes warm air out of the rear ports 2. Adjustable and removable visor and visor plugs make this bike helmet perfect for on-road or off-road use 3. In-mold construction fuses the helmet's outer shell with the impact-absorbing line 4. Well-ventilated and comfortable, a labyrinth of optimized internal channels allow the bike helmet to breathe like no other 5. The strap is adjustable to most fit you 6. It is made of high quality material, you might even forget that you're wearing anything at all 7. Stay safe while cycling with the bike helmet 8. It's the perfect mix for riding roads, trails and everything in between 9. Lightweight cycling helmet that's ideal for casual or technical use 10. As a result, the riding helmet is the perfect choice for riding downtown, up a technical climb, and everything in between Material: PC + EPC Head Circumference: 56- 61 cm Package Include: 1 x BIKE HELMET", "text": "SainStyle Road Racing Cycling Bicycle Bike Helmet with Visor for Adult, Red Features: 1. Many channeled vents bring cool air in through the front, allowing it to pass over your head and then flushes warm air out of the rear ports 2. Adjustable and removable visor and visor plugs make this bike helmet perfect for on-road or off-road use 3. In-mold construction fuses the helmet's outer shell with the impact-absorbing line 4. Well-ventilated and comfortable, a labyrinth of optimized internal channels allow the bike helmet to breathe like no other 5. The strap is adjustable to most fit you 6. It is made of high quality material, you might even forget that you're wearing anything at all 7. Stay safe while cycling with the bike helmet 8. It's the perfect mix for riding roads, trails and everything in between 9. Lightweight cycling helmet that's ideal for casual or technical use 10. As a result, the riding helmet is the perfect choice for riding downtown, up a technical climb, and everything in between Material: PC + EPC Head Circumference: 56- 61 cm Package Include: 1 x BIKE HELMET", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BIALl6MIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ADINL8W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SainStyle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "BMX Equipment", "Helmets"]], "price": 31.41}}
{"item_id": "B00ADIZY4G", "title": "Castelli Elite Gel Glove - Women's", "description": "Castelli constructed the Women's Elite Gel Glove's palms from perforated Clarino with gel insert padding. This combination breathes extremely well and provides just the right amount of cushioning for choppy roads. The result is a palm material that allows you to adequately feel the road through the bars, while keeping your hands cool and dry. Silicone printed logos across the palm inserts provide texture for added grip, and microsuede panels along the backs of the thumbs allow you to comfortably remove sweat from your face. The back panels utilize lightweight printed Lycra with open mesh inserts, which keeps your hand dry and comfortable by forcing air to flow through the glove. The hook-and-loop wrist tab allows you to snug up the glove for a perfect fit.The Castelli Women's Elite Gel Gloves are available in five sizes from X-Small to X-Large and in the colors White/pink fluo/ocean, Aqua/black/silver, Cyclamen/white/pink fluo, ans Black/white/silver.", "text": "Castelli Elite Gel Glove - Women's Castelli constructed the Women's Elite Gel Glove's palms from perforated Clarino with gel insert padding. This combination breathes extremely well and provides just the right amount of cushioning for choppy roads. The result is a palm material that allows you to adequately feel the road through the bars, while keeping your hands cool and dry. Silicone printed logos across the palm inserts provide texture for added grip, and microsuede panels along the backs of the thumbs allow you to comfortably remove sweat from your face. The back panels utilize lightweight printed Lycra with open mesh inserts, which keeps your hand dry and comfortable by forcing air to flow through the glove. The hook-and-loop wrist tab allows you to snug up the glove for a perfect fit.The Castelli Women's Elite Gel Gloves are available in five sizes from X-Small to X-Large and in the colors White/pink fluo/ocean, Aqua/black/silver, Cyclamen/white/pink fluo, ans Black/white/silver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517O%2BTYSE7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ADIZY4G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00ADJC3VW", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Gloves", "description": "Comfort Bridge Gel–Foam Padding Relieves Pressure On Ulnar And Median Nerves For Riding Comfort Synthetic Leather Palm Is Soft And Durable Soft, Lo.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Select Gloves Comfort Bridge Gel–Foam Padding Relieves Pressure On Ulnar And Median Nerves For Riding Comfort Synthetic Leather Palm Is Soft And Durable Soft, Lo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IaxtU6kLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ADJC3VW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00ADQOYR6", "title": "75 pack - 7x11 Oval Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Multi Color - See Your Hits Instantly - Gun, Rifle & Airsoft Targets", "description": "GlowShot 7\" x 11\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each ring is a different color so you can see your hit location easier. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 7\"x11\" Oval Targets come in 30 and 75 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 7\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "text": "75 pack - 7x11 Oval Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Multi Color - See Your Hits Instantly - Gun, Rifle & Airsoft Targets GlowShot 7\" x 11\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each ring is a different color so you can see your hit location easier. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 7\"x11\" Oval Targets come in 30 and 75 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 7\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KoXMBsjsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ADQOYR6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B00ADQQMC6", "title": "40 pack - 7\" Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Multi Color - See Your Hits Instantly - Gun, Rifle & Airsoft Targets", "description": "GlowShot 7\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each ring is a different color so you can see your hit location easier. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 7\" Targets come in 40 and 100 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "text": "40 pack - 7\" Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Multi Color - See Your Hits Instantly - Gun, Rifle & Airsoft Targets GlowShot 7\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each ring is a different color so you can see your hit location easier. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 7\" Targets come in 40 and 100 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51s5xgX%2BfAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ADQQMC6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B00ADSI4U2", "title": "Bowie Survival Military Fix Blade Full Tang Knife Silver", "description": "Featuring a 440 Stainless Steel Satin Finish, our Military Bowie Combat ready knife is fit for our Military personnel worldwide. It offers a super-size 9.75 inch full tang blade with an extremely sharpened edge. The curvy finish to the blade offers an audible feedback when chopping or slicing. Its also great for outdoor survival uses when cutting branches or small trees. The unique feature on this Bowie Military knife is its forefinger ring hole which helps to secure your hands tightly when clutched over the wooden color pakkawood handle. The handle also sports a curve finger groove while the pommel sports two lanyard cords. This knife is full tang and ready for action. It comes complete with a black durable nylon sheath with belt loop and Velcro securing strap.", "text": "Bowie Survival Military Fix Blade Full Tang Knife Silver Featuring a 440 Stainless Steel Satin Finish, our Military Bowie Combat ready knife is fit for our Military personnel worldwide. It offers a super-size 9.75 inch full tang blade with an extremely sharpened edge. The curvy finish to the blade offers an audible feedback when chopping or slicing. Its also great for outdoor survival uses when cutting branches or small trees. The unique feature on this Bowie Military knife is its forefinger ring hole which helps to secure your hands tightly when clutched over the wooden color pakkawood handle. The handle also sports a curve finger groove while the pommel sports two lanyard cords. This knife is full tang and ready for action. It comes complete with a black durable nylon sheath with belt loop and Velcro securing strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BmL9gBrRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ADSI4U2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Armory Replicas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 19.5}}
{"item_id": "B00ADUJ40O", "title": "Redfield 117850 Counterstrike Red and Green Dot Sight with 4-MOA Aiming Point and (11) Brightness Levels, Black Matte Finish", "description": "The Redfield 117850 Counterstrike Red and Green Dot Sight combines an unmagnified dot sight and laser aiming device, making a versatile tool for close-range targets. A fully multicoated lens system and nitrogen-filled weather sealed housing equip the Counterstrike sight to perform in a variety of situations.", "text": "Redfield 117850 Counterstrike Red and Green Dot Sight with 4-MOA Aiming Point and (11) Brightness Levels, Black Matte Finish The Redfield 117850 Counterstrike Red and Green Dot Sight combines an unmagnified dot sight and laser aiming device, making a versatile tool for close-range targets. A fully multicoated lens system and nitrogen-filled weather sealed housing equip the Counterstrike sight to perform in a variety of situations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415%2B-e-XapL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ADUJ40O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Redfield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 174.8}}
{"item_id": "B00ADUYW9M", "title": "Emberlit Wood-burning Portable Stove", "description": "Emberlit Wood-burning Portable Stove. No more cold beans! The heat is on with this compact, flat-folding wood-burning Stove. Sticks or anything burnable go through side holes; Rugged stainless steel, no corrosion; Less than 12 ozs. Supports any pot; No need to carry fuel; Lifetime Limited Mfr.'s Warranty. Panels: 4 x 5 1/2 x 6\" h. (1/8\" h. folded). Ideal for preppers, survivalists and more. Order right now! Emberlit Wood-burning Portable Stove", "text": "Emberlit Wood-burning Portable Stove Emberlit Wood-burning Portable Stove. No more cold beans! The heat is on with this compact, flat-folding wood-burning Stove. Sticks or anything burnable go through side holes; Rugged stainless steel, no corrosion; Less than 12 ozs. Supports any pot; No need to carry fuel; Lifetime Limited Mfr.'s Warranty. Panels: 4 x 5 1/2 x 6\" h. (1/8\" h. folded). Ideal for preppers, survivalists and more. Order right now! Emberlit Wood-burning Portable Stove", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PPbwGo-LL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ADUYW9M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MERKWARES", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B00ADX6ZYY", "title": "Avid Disc Brake Bleed Kit, Elixir, Code, Juicy, USA", "description": "We offer a superior Avid bleed kit that will save you up to 70% over other online retailers. Not only do we save you money but you are getting superior products and customer service. Our Avid bleed kit is compatible with ALL Avid brakes including: Elixir, Code, Juicy, XX, X0.", "text": "Avid Disc Brake Bleed Kit, Elixir, Code, Juicy, USA We offer a superior Avid bleed kit that will save you up to 70% over other online retailers. Not only do we save you money but you are getting superior products and customer service. Our Avid bleed kit is compatible with ALL Avid brakes including: Elixir, Code, Juicy, XX, X0.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YNDI5qDYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ADX6ZYY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brakes"]], "price": 19.95}}
