{"item_id": "B00AE00Y84", "title": "Santic Cycling Shorts Biking Bicycle Bike Shorts Black COOLMAX Padded", "description": "A classic padded bike short from Aero Tech Designs. The Classic Short is the ideal short for the cyclist who wants excellent comfort and performance during your ride. Sewn from premium quality, four-way stretch tricot fabric, the Classic Short moves fluidly with the your body while in the cycling motion. This short has a smooth, two-panel construction and a seamless pad that reduces the opportunity for abrasion and saddle sores. The pad's surface is a smooth, coolmax microfiber that is laminated to foam and tricot. It is also antibacterial and stays dry longer to inhibit the growth of bacteria.", "text": "Santic Cycling Shorts Biking Bicycle Bike Shorts Black COOLMAX Padded A classic padded bike short from Aero Tech Designs. The Classic Short is the ideal short for the cyclist who wants excellent comfort and performance during your ride. Sewn from premium quality, four-way stretch tricot fabric, the Classic Short moves fluidly with the your body while in the cycling motion. This short has a smooth, two-panel construction and a seamless pad that reduces the opportunity for abrasion and saddle sores. The pad's surface is a smooth, coolmax microfiber that is laminated to foam and tricot. It is also antibacterial and stays dry longer to inhibit the growth of bacteria.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YsJrC4uzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AE00Y84.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
