{"item_id": "B00AE9YZLW", "title": "Aylio 2 Loop Bands for Power Users (X-Heavy, XX-Heavy)", "description": "Due to the popularity of our original loop band set, we decided to release two new bands designed for power users. These two loop bands are thicker and provide significantly more resistance than the original three Aylio loop bands.Set includes:1 Black X-Heavy Loop Band1 Orange XX-Heavy Loop Band", "text": "Aylio 2 Loop Bands for Power Users (X-Heavy, XX-Heavy) Due to the popularity of our original loop band set, we decided to release two new bands designed for power users. These two loop bands are thicker and provide significantly more resistance than the original three Aylio loop bands.Set includes:1 Black X-Heavy Loop Band1 Orange XX-Heavy Loop Band", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414CbkaVAML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AE9YZLW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AEA3MYW", "title": "Aylio 2 Exercise Bands (X-Heavy, XX-Heavy) and Door Anchor", "description": "These professional-grade stretch bands by Aylio were created from the highest quality latex rubber for heightened durability, elasticity, and preservation. They measure in at the standard length of 5 feet and are designed for men and strong women.Set includes:1 X-Heavy Black Band1 XX-Heavy Orange Band1 Door Anchor", "text": "Aylio 2 Exercise Bands (X-Heavy, XX-Heavy) and Door Anchor These professional-grade stretch bands by Aylio were created from the highest quality latex rubber for heightened durability, elasticity, and preservation. They measure in at the standard length of 5 feet and are designed for men and strong women.Set includes:1 X-Heavy Black Band1 XX-Heavy Orange Band1 Door Anchor", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h7wvJ6pML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AEA3MYW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 12.99}}
