{"item_id": "B00AFI7TL0", "title": "Duck Commander Braided Lanyard with Removable Clip", "description": "DC-NOV-CBK Features: -Lanyard.-Comes with two removable clips. Dimensions: -8.25'' H x 8.25'' W x 0.5'' D, 0.15 lb. Warranty: -Manufacturer provides 30 days limited warranty.", "text": "Duck Commander Braided Lanyard with Removable Clip DC-NOV-CBK Features: -Lanyard.-Comes with two removable clips. Dimensions: -8.25'' H x 8.25'' W x 0.5'' D, 0.15 lb. Warranty: -Manufacturer provides 30 days limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MSinvBOzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AFI7TL0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Duck Commander", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Lanyards, Pouches & Accessories"]], "price": 17.25}}
{"item_id": "B00AG8C4LO", "title": "Thermafreeze Reusable Ice Pack Sheets / Ice Packs -5 Extra Large Sheets - 10 x 15 inch sheets (4 x 6 cells = 24 large cells each, 120 cells total) - Reusable, Flexible, Non-Toxic - Lasts hours longer than ice!", "description": "Thermafreeze Ice Pack Sheets are reusable, flexible, and easy to use. They ship and store flat. Just soak them in water, freeze, and use. Each sheet contains 2.5 x 2.5 inch square cells that expand into mini frozen ice packs. Each cell contains biodegradable, expandable, non-toxic beads that absorb almost 25 times its weight in water. Unlike ordinary ice packs, ThermaFreeze ice sheets are flexible even when frozen - it can be cut or folded to fit around products or in containers, or around a body part that needs cold therapy relief. The ice sheets have a thin plastic backing on one side, and soft cloth on the other to provide comfort.You can cut the sheet to size, or fold them to fit your needs. Thermafreeze can be used in coolers or lunch bags, as a cold therapy or ice pack for pain relief, or even to store and ship cold or frozen items. 1 ounce of material (like our 4 x 6 cell, 10 x 15 inch sheet) converts to 1.5 pounds of frozen ice packs! Hydration takes only seconds per sheet and is done by soaking or spraying the cloth side of the pad with water. Once hydrated, it is ready to be placed in a freezer and will be fully frozen in approximately 2 hours. To use, take it out of the freezer and place it where you need an ice pack. The sheets will stay frozen outside of a cooler for up to 2 hours, way longer than ice, way longer than traditional gel packs. Meets your cooling needs without causing drips, leaks and wetness. They provide cooling without becoming wet (they stay moist but never wet) so you can keep them on as long as necessary. They also don't drip like ice so they don't mix with the food or soak the product needing refrigeration. ThermaFreeze lasts longer than ice, Cryopack, Flexi Freeze and Techni Ice. ThermaFreeze is made in the USA from 100% non-toxic material to provide you safe cooling whenever and wherever necessary. You can reuse the sheets by refreezing or rehydrating first. The packs may shrink over 10-15 days due to evaporation.", "text": "Thermafreeze Reusable Ice Pack Sheets / Ice Packs -5 Extra Large Sheets - 10 x 15 inch sheets (4 x 6 cells = 24 large cells each, 120 cells total) - Reusable, Flexible, Non-Toxic - Lasts hours longer than ice! Thermafreeze Ice Pack Sheets are reusable, flexible, and easy to use. They ship and store flat. Just soak them in water, freeze, and use. Each sheet contains 2.5 x 2.5 inch square cells that expand into mini frozen ice packs. Each cell contains biodegradable, expandable, non-toxic beads that absorb almost 25 times its weight in water. Unlike ordinary ice packs, ThermaFreeze ice sheets are flexible even when frozen - it can be cut or folded to fit around products or in containers, or around a body part that needs cold therapy relief. The ice sheets have a thin plastic backing on one side, and soft cloth on the other to provide comfort.You can cut the sheet to size, or fold them to fit your needs. Thermafreeze can be used in coolers or lunch bags, as a cold therapy or ice pack for pain relief, or even to store and ship cold or frozen items. 1 ounce of material (like our 4 x 6 cell, 10 x 15 inch sheet) converts to 1.5 pounds of frozen ice packs! Hydration takes only seconds per sheet and is done by soaking or spraying the cloth side of the pad with water. Once hydrated, it is ready to be placed in a freezer and will be fully frozen in approximately 2 hours. To use, take it out of the freezer and place it where you need an ice pack. The sheets will stay frozen outside of a cooler for up to 2 hours, way longer than ice, way longer than traditional gel packs. Meets your cooling needs without causing drips, leaks and wetness. They provide cooling without becoming wet (they stay moist but never wet) so you can keep them on as long as necessary. They also don't drip like ice so they don't mix with the food or soak the product needing refrigeration. ThermaFreeze lasts longer than ice, Cryopack, Flexi Freeze and Techni Ice. ThermaFreeze is made in the USA from 100% non-toxic material to provide you safe cooling whenever and wherever necessary. You can reuse the sheets by refreezing or rehydrating first. The packs may shrink over 10-15 days due to evaporation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TfXFOKNrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AG8C4LO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ThermaFreeze", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooler Accessories"]], "price": 13.99}}
