{"item_id": "B00AGB1JOO", "title": "SNIPER Compact Scope 4x32 Rangefingder reticle with Rings", "description": "Built on strong cardan joint platform to fulfill the most demanding requirements Rnagefingder estimating reticle for most optimal aiming and shooting performance Sapphire lenses coating One piece tube Regular lens caps Limited lifetime warranty With PT-25L2 ring Magnification: 4X Tube Diameter: 1 Inch Objective Diameter: 32mm Field of View @ 100 yards: 28' Eye Relief: 3.0\" Exit Pupil: 8mm Click Value @100 yards: 1/4\" Length: 190mm Weight: 10.8 oz Parallax Setting: 100 Yds", "text": "SNIPER Compact Scope 4x32 Rangefingder reticle with Rings Built on strong cardan joint platform to fulfill the most demanding requirements Rnagefingder estimating reticle for most optimal aiming and shooting performance Sapphire lenses coating One piece tube Regular lens caps Limited lifetime warranty With PT-25L2 ring Magnification: 4X Tube Diameter: 1 Inch Objective Diameter: 32mm Field of View @ 100 yards: 28' Eye Relief: 3.0\" Exit Pupil: 8mm Click Value @100 yards: 1/4\" Length: 190mm Weight: 10.8 oz Parallax Setting: 100 Yds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31s7WgbfbEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AGB1JOO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 23.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AGJ4ZJW", "title": "Outsunny 86\" x 59\" Two-Person Double Wide Sleeping Bag - Red / Gray", "description": "Designed from durable material and a cozy liner, this sleeping bag is great for climbing, backpacking trips, camping and other uses. Full length zipper with two zipper pulls makes for easy opening and closing of the bag. Temperature rated down to -5 degrees C / 23 degrees F. Includes a stuff sack!Specifications:- Shell material: 210T nylon- Filling Material: 300 g hollow fiber- Lining Material: T/R Gray- Red Stuff Sack: oxford nylon- Total Weight: 5.7 lbs- Size: 86.6\" long overall x 59\" wide- Pillow: 15.7\" x 11.8\"", "text": "Outsunny 86\" x 59\" Two-Person Double Wide Sleeping Bag - Red / Gray Designed from durable material and a cozy liner, this sleeping bag is great for climbing, backpacking trips, camping and other uses. Full length zipper with two zipper pulls makes for easy opening and closing of the bag. Temperature rated down to -5 degrees C / 23 degrees F. Includes a stuff sack!Specifications:- Shell material: 210T nylon- Filling Material: 300 g hollow fiber- Lining Material: T/R Gray- Red Stuff Sack: oxford nylon- Total Weight: 5.7 lbs- Size: 86.6\" long overall x 59\" wide- Pillow: 15.7\" x 11.8\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fDtplReAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AGJ4ZJW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories"]], "price": 35.97}}
{"item_id": "B00AGYZV40", "title": "Fortified Bicycle Alliance 50 Lumen LED Defender Bike Headlight", "description": "Meet the Defender bike light - the theft-proof, weather-proof, city-proof aluminum headlight that locks onto your handlebars for years of urban riding. Just attach it to the handlebars and forget about it. Dodging drivers, braving rides through the pouring rain and skillfully maneuvering around pedestrians, you do what it takes to reach your destination. You trust your bicycle to withstand your unforgiving daily commute and at night you need something equally as dependable to be seen. Headlight fits all handlebars sized 22mm - 32mm. Six LEDs provide 50 lumens of brightness with a 30 degree primary beam and 80 degree secondary angle. Included 3-AA batteries provide a runtime up to 50 hours on steady beam and up to 100 hours flashing. Weight: 232-grams; dimensions: 10 by 42 by 80-mm.", "text": "Fortified Bicycle Alliance 50 Lumen LED Defender Bike Headlight Meet the Defender bike light - the theft-proof, weather-proof, city-proof aluminum headlight that locks onto your handlebars for years of urban riding. Just attach it to the handlebars and forget about it. Dodging drivers, braving rides through the pouring rain and skillfully maneuvering around pedestrians, you do what it takes to reach your destination. You trust your bicycle to withstand your unforgiving daily commute and at night you need something equally as dependable to be seen. Headlight fits all handlebars sized 22mm - 32mm. Six LEDs provide 50 lumens of brightness with a 30 degree primary beam and 80 degree secondary angle. Included 3-AA batteries provide a runtime up to 50 hours on steady beam and up to 100 hours flashing. Weight: 232-grams; dimensions: 10 by 42 by 80-mm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zAml%2BUtUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AGYZV40.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fortified Bicycle Alliance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 59.0}}
{"item_id": "B00AGZGCA6", "title": "Ruger Mini 14/30 Accu-Strut LT 6\" in Blued Steel 2 Clamps", "description": "Barrel strut for Mini-14 and Mini-30 rifles. Provides mechanical rigidity for thin carbine barrel, reducing accuracy-killing vibrations. The 6-inch 2-clamp configuration gives your best opportunity for performance increases. Typical improvement is 50-75% reduction in group size for earlier straight-barrel rifles, and up to 33% on the new tapered barrels.", "text": "Ruger Mini 14/30 Accu-Strut LT 6\" in Blued Steel 2 Clamps Barrel strut for Mini-14 and Mini-30 rifles. Provides mechanical rigidity for thin carbine barrel, reducing accuracy-killing vibrations. The 6-inch 2-clamp configuration gives your best opportunity for performance increases. Typical improvement is 50-75% reduction in group size for earlier straight-barrel rifles, and up to 33% on the new tapered barrels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411PcnWrN%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AGZGCA6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 94.95}}
