{"item_id": "B00AH7WOGY", "title": "Cgecko Special Wicking Shockproof Mountain Reflex Gel Bike Half Finger Glove Tri-color Optional Outdoor Sports Gloves Cycling Short Glove", "description": "Palm width 8.5-9.5 SIZE MPalm width 9.5-10.5 SIZE LPalm width 10.5-11.5 SIZE XLPalm width 11.5-12.5 SIZE XXL-------------------------------------------*Measure around flat hand at knuckles, thumb excluded. Number of inches equals the glove size.M:8\"L:8.5\"XL:9\"-9.5\"XXL:10\"-10.5\"", "text": "Cgecko Special Wicking Shockproof Mountain Reflex Gel Bike Half Finger Glove Tri-color Optional Outdoor Sports Gloves Cycling Short Glove Palm width 8.5-9.5 SIZE MPalm width 9.5-10.5 SIZE LPalm width 10.5-11.5 SIZE XLPalm width 11.5-12.5 SIZE XXL-------------------------------------------*Measure around flat hand at knuckles, thumb excluded. Number of inches equals the glove size.M:8\"L:8.5\"XL:9\"-9.5\"XXL:10\"-10.5\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HCvse7HXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AH7WOGY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Boys", "Gloves"]], "price": 12.87}}
