{"item_id": "B00AHF6EIU", "title": "Spyderco Matriarch Spyder Edge Knife with Emerson Opener, Black", "description": "MATRIARCH2 EMERSON OPENER - The Matriarch2 combines the extraordinary cutting power of our Reverse \"S\" blade profile and SpyderEdge serrations with the blindingly fast deployment speed of the patented Emerson Opening feature. The result is an amazingly swift and potent cutting tool that is ready for anything. The original Matriarch was inspired by a request from Spyderco's South African distributor for a more economical version of our iconic Civilian. The standard Matriarch2 is an evolution of that concept, combining the Civilian's aggressive blade shape and Reverse \"S\" edge profile with the lightweight handle construction of the best-selling Endura4 to provide extreme cutting performance in a convenient, lightweight package. By adding an Emerson Opener—a small integral hook on the spine of the blade—the latest version of the Matriarch2 raises the bar even further by offering the ultimate in high-speed deployment. As the knife is drawn from tip-up carry, the Emerson Opener snags on the mouth of the pocket and automatically opens the blade as it clears the pocket. Originally developed by renowned knife maker Ernest Emerson, Spiders is licensed to incorporate this remarkable feature into selected Spiders designs. Offering completely ambidextrous operation, the Matriarch2 features a four-position clip, a sturdy back lock mechanism, skeletonized stainless steel liners and a Bi-Directional-Textured fiberglass-reinforced-nylon handle.", "text": "Spyderco Matriarch Spyder Edge Knife with Emerson Opener, Black MATRIARCH2 EMERSON OPENER - The Matriarch2 combines the extraordinary cutting power of our Reverse \"S\" blade profile and SpyderEdge serrations with the blindingly fast deployment speed of the patented Emerson Opening feature. The result is an amazingly swift and potent cutting tool that is ready for anything. The original Matriarch was inspired by a request from Spyderco's South African distributor for a more economical version of our iconic Civilian. The standard Matriarch2 is an evolution of that concept, combining the Civilian's aggressive blade shape and Reverse \"S\" edge profile with the lightweight handle construction of the best-selling Endura4 to provide extreme cutting performance in a convenient, lightweight package. By adding an Emerson Opener—a small integral hook on the spine of the blade—the latest version of the Matriarch2 raises the bar even further by offering the ultimate in high-speed deployment. As the knife is drawn from tip-up carry, the Emerson Opener snags on the mouth of the pocket and automatically opens the blade as it clears the pocket. Originally developed by renowned knife maker Ernest Emerson, Spiders is licensed to incorporate this remarkable feature into selected Spiders designs. Offering completely ambidextrous operation, the Matriarch2 features a four-position clip, a sturdy back lock mechanism, skeletonized stainless steel liners and a Bi-Directional-Textured fiberglass-reinforced-nylon handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418p0CcbznL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AHF6EIU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 81.0}}
{"item_id": "B00AHHKXZI", "title": "Darkfin Webbed Power Gloves", "description": "Seamless design, no straps or stitching to come out. Made from Natural Latex Rubber so lightweight and won't absorb water. Cotton flocking allows for amazing grip. Rear webbing provides 70% more surface area and power. The Contoured 3-D shape provides maximum comfort and dexterity. Perfect for surfers needing extra propulsion to catch every wave. Divers use them for micro-movements and surge control. Kayakers can use these to improve hand rolls. Swimmers and all water enthusiasts to help build shoulder and upper body strength. Free Divers can surface more quickly. Spearfishing? No problem, easily operate your equipment while wearing them. Perhaps the most important role Darkfin has played in the industry is with those with disabilities. To determine the best size measure your hand from the tip of your middle finger to the crease in your wrist closest to your palm. Then measure the width across above the thumb area. Compare to the sizes below: XXL- 8\"(20.3cm) x 4\" (10.2cm) XL- 8\"(20.3cm) x 3 3/4\"(9.5cm) L- 7 3/4\"(19.7cm) x 3 5/8\"(9.2cm) ML- 7 1/2\"(19.1cm) x 3 1/2\"(8.9cm) M- 7\"(17.5cm) x 3 3/8\"(8.3cm) WL- 7 1/8\"(18.1cm) x 3 1/4\"(8.3cm) WM- 6 7/8\"(17.5cm) x 3 1/8\"(7.9cm) WS- 6 3/4\"(17.1cm) x 3\"(7.6cm) YL- 6 3/8\"(16.2cm) x 3\"(7.6cm) YM- 6 1/4\"(15.9cm) x 2 7/8\"(7.3cm) YS- 6 1/8\"(15.5cm) x 2 3/4\"(7.0cm) Sizes from top are Men's, Women's and Youth. CM is children's medium and measurements are not readily available, however just slightly smaller than the Youth Large more for children in the 5-7 yr old range.", "text": "Darkfin Webbed Power Gloves Seamless design, no straps or stitching to come out. Made from Natural Latex Rubber so lightweight and won't absorb water. Cotton flocking allows for amazing grip. Rear webbing provides 70% more surface area and power. The Contoured 3-D shape provides maximum comfort and dexterity. Perfect for surfers needing extra propulsion to catch every wave. Divers use them for micro-movements and surge control. Kayakers can use these to improve hand rolls. Swimmers and all water enthusiasts to help build shoulder and upper body strength. Free Divers can surface more quickly. Spearfishing? No problem, easily operate your equipment while wearing them. Perhaps the most important role Darkfin has played in the industry is with those with disabilities. To determine the best size measure your hand from the tip of your middle finger to the crease in your wrist closest to your palm. Then measure the width across above the thumb area. Compare to the sizes below: XXL- 8\"(20.3cm) x 4\" (10.2cm) XL- 8\"(20.3cm) x 3 3/4\"(9.5cm) L- 7 3/4\"(19.7cm) x 3 5/8\"(9.2cm) ML- 7 1/2\"(19.1cm) x 3 1/2\"(8.9cm) M- 7\"(17.5cm) x 3 3/8\"(8.3cm) WL- 7 1/8\"(18.1cm) x 3 1/4\"(8.3cm) WM- 6 7/8\"(17.5cm) x 3 1/8\"(7.9cm) WS- 6 3/4\"(17.1cm) x 3\"(7.6cm) YL- 6 3/8\"(16.2cm) x 3\"(7.6cm) YM- 6 1/4\"(15.9cm) x 2 7/8\"(7.3cm) YS- 6 1/8\"(15.5cm) x 2 3/4\"(7.0cm) Sizes from top are Men's, Women's and Youth. CM is children's medium and measurements are not readily available, however just slightly smaller than the Youth Large more for children in the 5-7 yr old range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jrs3Xa5QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AHHKXZI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Gloves"]], "price": 25.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AHJPTS2", "title": "S&W 22A Clip Loader", "description": "Are you looking for something easy to operate and to save your aching thumbs? Try this new, affordable, and easy to use clip loader for the S&W; .22A Caliber Magazines, and with the included carabiner or lanyard, it will be easy to keep track of. This is about as simple as it gets. No moving parts, and one simple tool loads them all. Just slip the loader over the magazine, slide down the follower and load up. Save your aching thumbs, and put one in your shopping cart now! We'll ship it to you TODAY!", "text": "S&W 22A Clip Loader Are you looking for something easy to operate and to save your aching thumbs? Try this new, affordable, and easy to use clip loader for the S&W; .22A Caliber Magazines, and with the included carabiner or lanyard, it will be easy to keep track of. This is about as simple as it gets. No moving parts, and one simple tool loads them all. Just slip the loader over the magazine, slide down the follower and load up. Save your aching thumbs, and put one in your shopping cart now! We'll ship it to you TODAY!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mgcnWyNJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AHJPTS2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AHOGRCE", "title": "Type-III Flat Black Adjustable Stainless Steel Shackle For Paracord Bracelets (Ships From USA)", "description": "These heavy duty flat black stainless steel shackles are perfect for King Cobra paracord bracelets. The 5mm holes fit one strand of 550 cord. They measure 2\" long at their last hole and are slightly contoured to fit your wrist comfortably. The multiple holes allow for adjustable size bracelets. Available in 5 pack, 3 pack, or single.These are not break-away buckles, and are not recommended for pet collars.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "text": "Type-III Flat Black Adjustable Stainless Steel Shackle For Paracord Bracelets (Ships From USA) These heavy duty flat black stainless steel shackles are perfect for King Cobra paracord bracelets. The 5mm holes fit one strand of 550 cord. They measure 2\" long at their last hole and are slightly contoured to fit your wrist comfortably. The multiple holes allow for adjustable size bracelets. Available in 5 pack, 3 pack, or single.These are not break-away buckles, and are not recommended for pet collars.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41syijLSTcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AHOGRCE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00AHSVGYO", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Sr/22 Magazine Caps Dust Covers 4 Pack", "description": "Made in the USA Fits any high capacity magazine plus the factory rotary magazines made for the Ruger 10/22.Made from santoprene thermoplastic rubber, they are flexible and tough.", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Sr/22 Magazine Caps Dust Covers 4 Pack Made in the USA Fits any high capacity magazine plus the factory rotary magazines made for the Ruger 10/22.Made from santoprene thermoplastic rubber, they are flexible and tough.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z48LABj4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AHSVGYO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AHU76AK", "title": "Ultimate Survival Technologies Pico Lantern", "description": "This compact, super bright LED Lantern is perfect for backcountry or emergency use. Available in Silver, Green, Orange, Fuchsia and GLO, the impact and weather resistant rubberized ABS housing provides for a super tough little light. It will burn an amazing 91 hours on low providing 15 lumens of light, and 22 hours on high at 120 lumens. Takes three easy to find AA batteries, has a removable globe to convert to an area light, and features high, low and emergency SOS modes. At 9 oz, this lantern is the perfect balance between light weight and sturdy. Perfect for emergency preparedness, camping, power outages, or just around the house.", "text": "Ultimate Survival Technologies Pico Lantern This compact, super bright LED Lantern is perfect for backcountry or emergency use. Available in Silver, Green, Orange, Fuchsia and GLO, the impact and weather resistant rubberized ABS housing provides for a super tough little light. It will burn an amazing 91 hours on low providing 15 lumens of light, and 22 hours on high at 120 lumens. Takes three easy to find AA batteries, has a removable globe to convert to an area light, and features high, low and emergency SOS modes. At 9 oz, this lantern is the perfect balance between light weight and sturdy. Perfect for emergency preparedness, camping, power outages, or just around the house.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mfm%2BXmmcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AHU76AK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Survival Technologies", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 18.59}}
{"item_id": "B00AI7I57K", "title": "Ruger SR22 Clip Loader", "description": "Are you looking for something easy to operate and to save your aching thumbs? Try this new, affordable, and easy to use clip loader for the Ruger .22 Caliber Magazines, and with the included carabiner or lanyard, it will be easy to keep track of. This is about as simple as it gets. No moving parts, and one simple tool loads them all. Just slip the loader over the magazine, slide down the follower and load up. Save your aching thumbs, and put one in your shopping cart now! We'll ship it to you TODAY!", "text": "Ruger SR22 Clip Loader Are you looking for something easy to operate and to save your aching thumbs? Try this new, affordable, and easy to use clip loader for the Ruger .22 Caliber Magazines, and with the included carabiner or lanyard, it will be easy to keep track of. This is about as simple as it gets. No moving parts, and one simple tool loads them all. Just slip the loader over the magazine, slide down the follower and load up. Save your aching thumbs, and put one in your shopping cart now! We'll ship it to you TODAY!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313%2BmHo5d8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AI7I57K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AIBGYZG", "title": "Topoint 3 Blade Broadhead TP211 (6 Pack, 100 Grain)", "description": "3 blade broadheads that are 2.817 inches long, 1.035 inches wide, and made of Steel, Aluminum, and 420 stainless steel.", "text": "Topoint 3 Blade Broadhead TP211 (6 Pack, 100 Grain) 3 blade broadheads that are 2.817 inches long, 1.035 inches wide, and made of Steel, Aluminum, and 420 stainless steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MfKCZZ45L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AIBGYZG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dakota Sport &amp; Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]], "price": 11.5}}
{"item_id": "B00AIP813A", "title": "Boker Plus Nano 42 Folding Knives, Lime Green", "description": "The Boker Plus Nano is breaking new ground with its remarkable concept and design by David Curtiss. The Nano clearly shows that size and utility value are not always correlated. Due to its ingenious ergonomics, the Nano sits perfectly in the hand despite its compact size of just 4 3/4\", and can handle any cutting task with ease, while providing a superior grip. The structure of the Zytel scale enhances the slip resistance, and the bellied blade ensures comfortable handling with its large opening. An added bonus is the pocket clip - David Curtiss, who runs a company for water jet cutting systems, also supplies the same pocket clip for custom pieces. Blade length: 1 7/8'. Overall length: 4 3/4\". Weight: 2.9 oz.", "text": "Boker Plus Nano 42 Folding Knives, Lime Green The Boker Plus Nano is breaking new ground with its remarkable concept and design by David Curtiss. The Nano clearly shows that size and utility value are not always correlated. Due to its ingenious ergonomics, the Nano sits perfectly in the hand despite its compact size of just 4 3/4\", and can handle any cutting task with ease, while providing a superior grip. The structure of the Zytel scale enhances the slip resistance, and the bellied blade ensures comfortable handling with its large opening. An added bonus is the pocket clip - David Curtiss, who runs a company for water jet cutting systems, also supplies the same pocket clip for custom pieces. Blade length: 1 7/8'. Overall length: 4 3/4\". Weight: 2.9 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vlUn9r2nL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AIP813A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BOKER PLUS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 41.15}}
{"item_id": "B00AIT81PE", "title": "Packin Tee V-NECK Holster Shirt / Shoulder Holster-Deep Conceal-Concealed Gun Shirt, Cross Draw Holster, More Versitile Than a 5.11 Tactical S/S Holster Shirt", "description": "You Have Earned Your Concealed Weapon Permit, You chose your weapon of Choice, Now, How do You Carry It With All Day Comfort?We all know that feeling, you go to the mailbox, open the letter and BAM! You are now a US Citizen with the Ability to Exercise Your Right to Defend Yourself! There is no better feeling.But how do you plan to carry your weapon? There are so many choices out there, it is a hard decision. You have leather shoulder holsters, Spandex under shirts, Belt holsters, Pocket holsters, Crouch Holsters (Really?). But what if you wear a suite and sit at a desk you want to carry? Have more than one size gun? Want to carry an extra clip? You need a Holster that will adjust to your lifestyle, not adjust your lifestyle to your holster.You can now have your gun at your side without the restricting discomfort from other types of holsters used in carrying concealed weapons. No longer is there a need to wear jackets or other heavy outerwear to conceal your weapon; light weight shirts/clothing can be worn over the Packin' Tee the same as you would any other undershirt.The New Packin Tee Is The Most Comfortable and Versatile Concealed Carry Shirt Ever- Ultra Versatile-Switch from a Small Holster To a Large. Switch From a Left Hand to a Right Hand Holster. Add a Extra Clip Holder or Accessory Pouch for Extra Convenience.- Ultra comfortable 100% Breathable Pre-Shrunk Cotton for all Day Comfort with Re-enforced Shoulders and Back- Added Length to insure your packin Tee Stays Tucked InHolster Sizing:LARGE PISTOL HOLSTER POUCH FITS:Glock, Springfield XD, Taurus 24/7, All 1911 models, Sig Saur, Heckler & Koch HK, Hi Point, Taurus Millenium, all semi auto pistols 9mm or greater.SMALL PISTOL HOLSTER POUCH FITS:Most small frame pistols of 380, 32 & 25 cal. such as the Ruger LCP, Kel-Tec P-32", "text": "Packin Tee V-NECK Holster Shirt / Shoulder Holster-Deep Conceal-Concealed Gun Shirt, Cross Draw Holster, More Versitile Than a 5.11 Tactical S/S Holster Shirt You Have Earned Your Concealed Weapon Permit, You chose your weapon of Choice, Now, How do You Carry It With All Day Comfort?We all know that feeling, you go to the mailbox, open the letter and BAM! You are now a US Citizen with the Ability to Exercise Your Right to Defend Yourself! There is no better feeling.But how do you plan to carry your weapon? There are so many choices out there, it is a hard decision. You have leather shoulder holsters, Spandex under shirts, Belt holsters, Pocket holsters, Crouch Holsters (Really?). But what if you wear a suite and sit at a desk you want to carry? Have more than one size gun? Want to carry an extra clip? You need a Holster that will adjust to your lifestyle, not adjust your lifestyle to your holster.You can now have your gun at your side without the restricting discomfort from other types of holsters used in carrying concealed weapons. No longer is there a need to wear jackets or other heavy outerwear to conceal your weapon; light weight shirts/clothing can be worn over the Packin' Tee the same as you would any other undershirt.The New Packin Tee Is The Most Comfortable and Versatile Concealed Carry Shirt Ever- Ultra Versatile-Switch from a Small Holster To a Large. Switch From a Left Hand to a Right Hand Holster. Add a Extra Clip Holder or Accessory Pouch for Extra Convenience.- Ultra comfortable 100% Breathable Pre-Shrunk Cotton for all Day Comfort with Re-enforced Shoulders and Back- Added Length to insure your packin Tee Stays Tucked InHolster Sizing:LARGE PISTOL HOLSTER POUCH FITS:Glock, Springfield XD, Taurus 24/7, All 1911 models, Sig Saur, Heckler & Koch HK, Hi Point, Taurus Millenium, all semi auto pistols 9mm or greater.SMALL PISTOL HOLSTER POUCH FITS:Most small frame pistols of 380, 32 & 25 cal. such as the Ruger LCP, Kel-Tec P-32", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iPmV17WLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AIT81PE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00AJ212WY", "title": "ASICS Intensity Low Cut Socks (3-Pair)", "description": "Lightweight moisture management and arch support meet in this Hydrology yarn sock. Built-in mesh provides superior ventilation and lightweight moisture management, while seamless toe linking and dense cushioning in the heel and toe adds targeted comfort. Three per pack.", "text": "ASICS Intensity Low Cut Socks (3-Pair) Lightweight moisture management and arch support meet in this Hydrology yarn sock. Built-in mesh provides superior ventilation and lightweight moisture management, while seamless toe linking and dense cushioning in the heel and toe adds targeted comfort. Three per pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yiwsD7nWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AJ212WY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Women", "Socks"]]}}
