{"item_id": "B00AJPYMIC", "title": "WORK-SHIELD 16 X 54 Long Gun Cleaning Mat - Black", "description": "Work-ShieldTM gun cleaning mats are manufactured in the USA using an industrial grade PVC membrane which has been formulated to withstand even the harshest solvents, bore cleaners and oils. The Work-ShieldTM mat will not absorb any chemicals or liquids, therefore clean-up is as simple as wiping the mat off and rolling it up for the next use. The Work-ShieldTM patent pending flexible magnetic strip allows the user to easily place small parts and screws in a secure location until the job is done. Once finished just roll the mat up and the magnetic strips will keep your mat secure for easy storage.", "text": "WORK-SHIELD 16 X 54 Long Gun Cleaning Mat - Black Work-ShieldTM gun cleaning mats are manufactured in the USA using an industrial grade PVC membrane which has been formulated to withstand even the harshest solvents, bore cleaners and oils. The Work-ShieldTM mat will not absorb any chemicals or liquids, therefore clean-up is as simple as wiping the mat off and rolling it up for the next use. The Work-ShieldTM patent pending flexible magnetic strip allows the user to easily place small parts and screws in a secure location until the job is done. Once finished just roll the mat up and the magnetic strips will keep your mat secure for easy storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eRjsRvb%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AJPYMIC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 30.97}}
{"item_id": "B00AJT98OQ", "title": "Universal Brass Catcher", "description": "Simply place the brass catcher next to your firearm and begin shooting. The brass will be ejected into the high quality mon-rail net. Use it offhand, prone or from the bench. The Brass Catcher has a heavy duty steel frame, with a durable E-Coat finish. A generous net opening of 16\"x16\" ensures your brass is caught. Base size: 12\"x12\". Total height: 19\"", "text": "Universal Brass Catcher Simply place the brass catcher next to your firearm and begin shooting. The brass will be ejected into the high quality mon-rail net. Use it offhand, prone or from the bench. The Brass Catcher has a heavy duty steel frame, with a durable E-Coat finish. A generous net opening of 16\"x16\" ensures your brass is caught. Base size: 12\"x12\". Total height: 19\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ngxn%2BXm4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AJT98OQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CTK Precision", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AJWR6SI", "title": "Shooting Rest Attachment", "description": "Our Shooting Rest Attachment quickly converts our P3 Ultimate Gun Vise (sold separately) into a Shooting Rest. *See P3 Ultimate Gun Vise for more information.", "text": "Shooting Rest Attachment Our Shooting Rest Attachment quickly converts our P3 Ultimate Gun Vise (sold separately) into a Shooting Rest. *See P3 Ultimate Gun Vise for more information.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51w08uqmbzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AJWR6SI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SRA1", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 64.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AK8C1E0", "title": "Injinji Men's Run Lightweight Mini Crew Toesocks", "description": "The RUN Lightweight is an ultra-thin, next to skin fit for those want the benefit of minimal weight with maximum protection and performance. RUN LW is ideal for milder temperatures, shorter distances and minimal footwear.", "text": "Injinji Men's Run Lightweight Mini Crew Toesocks The RUN Lightweight is an ultra-thin, next to skin fit for those want the benefit of minimal weight with maximum protection and performance. RUN LW is ideal for milder temperatures, shorter distances and minimal footwear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KsB1Cu2gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AK8C1E0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"]]}}
