{"item_id": "B00ALAS6BE", "title": "Lancer Tactical Light Weight Hydration Backpack", "description": "The Lancer Tactical Light Weight Hydration Pack is deceiving by its economical price tag. At first glance you will not think that this hydration pack will be of such high quality because of its low pricing, but this Lancer Tactical Hydration Pack can be held up against other high end brands such as Camelbak. THE HYDRATION PACK WILL NOT BE COMPATIBLE WITH CAMELBAK BLADDERS, LANCER TACTICAL RESERVOIRS ARE REQUIRED. It is made up of high quality 600D Polyester which is a light weight material that is very rugged and durable so it will last many hiking trips, airsoft games or many other outdoor outings you may use this hydration pack for.", "text": "Lancer Tactical Light Weight Hydration Backpack The Lancer Tactical Light Weight Hydration Pack is deceiving by its economical price tag. At first glance you will not think that this hydration pack will be of such high quality because of its low pricing, but this Lancer Tactical Hydration Pack can be held up against other high end brands such as Camelbak. THE HYDRATION PACK WILL NOT BE COMPATIBLE WITH CAMELBAK BLADDERS, LANCER TACTICAL RESERVOIRS ARE REQUIRED. It is made up of high quality 600D Polyester which is a light weight material that is very rugged and durable so it will last many hiking trips, airsoft games or many other outdoor outings you may use this hydration pack for.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QHehOF8zL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ALAS6BE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lancer Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B00ALI4HMI", "title": "SHTF Gear Horizontal Magazine Carrier, Gen 2", "description": "Our second generation Horizontal Magazine Carrier (HMC) ensures that an extra magazine is within easy reach at all times. The HMC is specifically designed for concealed carry and mounts horizontally to your belt for superior comfort. Dual belt straps provide stability and keep the magazine tight against your body. The Velcro flap closure secures the magazine and provides 95% visual coverage of the magazine. The included depth adjustment screw ensures proper fit when using a compact magazine. Available in four different sizes to fit a wide variety of magazines and multi tools. Proudly made in the USA.", "text": "SHTF Gear Horizontal Magazine Carrier, Gen 2 Our second generation Horizontal Magazine Carrier (HMC) ensures that an extra magazine is within easy reach at all times. The HMC is specifically designed for concealed carry and mounts horizontally to your belt for superior comfort. Dual belt straps provide stability and keep the magazine tight against your body. The Velcro flap closure secures the magazine and provides 95% visual coverage of the magazine. The included depth adjustment screw ensures proper fit when using a compact magazine. Available in four different sizes to fit a wide variety of magazines and multi tools. Proudly made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Zcz2ZYVAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ALI4HMI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 15.95}}
