{"item_id": "B00AN8DQNM", "title": "FIREClean Anti-Fouling Gun Conditioing Oil 2 pack", "description": "Imagine finding a gun oil that works as advertised, and being able to clean your gun without scrubbing and scraping. FIREClean is a revolutionary way to keep your gun shooting cleaner, longer, and better. Complete, easy gun care in one bottle. Non-toxic and odorless, FIREClean dissolves fouling. It cleans deeply and powerfully, while offering extreme heat resistance and deep, powerful cleaning. See why some of the country's top 3-Gun shooters and well-known former members of the US Special Operations Command use FIREClean on their guns. Once a gun is conditioned with FIREClean, you can clean an AR-15 with paper towel and QTips, and not worry about reoiling every time that you go to the range. A semi-auto shotgun piston that used to be scraped and scrubbed? Now it just wipes off. Some shooters really appreciate the fact that FIREClean is odorless and doesn't fill up the kitchen or family room with noxious odors. It is NOT fatal if swallowed, and does not require HAZMAT disposal or ORM-D shipping. Whether you're shooting a Blunderbuss or a Minigun, FIREClean will make your gun cleaning regimen cheaper, faster, and better. Some customers even use it to lubricate bike chains, squeaky hinges, door tracks, etc. We invite you to view numerous video demos at youtube.com/firecleanusa such as this cleanoff of a 7.62 AR upper after 500 rounds http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4X6ysD9_bgc&list;=UUo4mTB0M40l8LL0qq6yNNEA&feature;=share", "text": "FIREClean Anti-Fouling Gun Conditioing Oil 2 pack Imagine finding a gun oil that works as advertised, and being able to clean your gun without scrubbing and scraping. FIREClean is a revolutionary way to keep your gun shooting cleaner, longer, and better. Complete, easy gun care in one bottle. Non-toxic and odorless, FIREClean dissolves fouling. It cleans deeply and powerfully, while offering extreme heat resistance and deep, powerful cleaning. See why some of the country's top 3-Gun shooters and well-known former members of the US Special Operations Command use FIREClean on their guns. Once a gun is conditioned with FIREClean, you can clean an AR-15 with paper towel and QTips, and not worry about reoiling every time that you go to the range. A semi-auto shotgun piston that used to be scraped and scrubbed? Now it just wipes off. Some shooters really appreciate the fact that FIREClean is odorless and doesn't fill up the kitchen or family room with noxious odors. It is NOT fatal if swallowed, and does not require HAZMAT disposal or ORM-D shipping. Whether you're shooting a Blunderbuss or a Minigun, FIREClean will make your gun cleaning regimen cheaper, faster, and better. Some customers even use it to lubricate bike chains, squeaky hinges, door tracks, etc. We invite you to view numerous video demos at youtube.com/firecleanusa such as this cleanoff of a 7.62 AR upper after 500 rounds http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4X6ysD9_bgc&list;=UUo4mTB0M40l8LL0qq6yNNEA&feature;=share", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41e5o0DccPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AN8DQNM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 29.9}}
{"item_id": "B00ANRW7DI", "title": "Klymit Insulated Static V Inflatable Sleeping Pad", "description": "The Klymit Insulated Static V Inflatable Sleeping Pad is a game changer, with its innovative V-chamber design, which limits air movement and heat loss with better support and comfort with a low overall cost and high end performance. Easy to inflate or deflate the Insulated Static V is filled with Primaloft eco m2 50% recycled fill which will keep you warmer than what the other guys offer. With its very light weight (under 2 lbs) and very small pack size the Insulated Static V will become your favorite cool weather sleeping pad. Includes a repair/patch kit for in the field repairs.V shaped baffles and Primaloft insulation keep you warm.Repair kit included and stuff sack included.Weight = 1 lb 9 oz.Inflated Dimensions 72\" x 23 \"x 2.5\".Pack Size = 8\"x5\".Insulation = Primaloft eco m2 50% recycled.R-Value = 4.5.", "text": "Klymit Insulated Static V Inflatable Sleeping Pad The Klymit Insulated Static V Inflatable Sleeping Pad is a game changer, with its innovative V-chamber design, which limits air movement and heat loss with better support and comfort with a low overall cost and high end performance. Easy to inflate or deflate the Insulated Static V is filled with Primaloft eco m2 50% recycled fill which will keep you warmer than what the other guys offer. With its very light weight (under 2 lbs) and very small pack size the Insulated Static V will become your favorite cool weather sleeping pad. Includes a repair/patch kit for in the field repairs.V shaped baffles and Primaloft insulation keep you warm.Repair kit included and stuff sack included.Weight = 1 lb 9 oz.Inflated Dimensions 72\" x 23 \"x 2.5\".Pack Size = 8\"x5\".Insulation = Primaloft eco m2 50% recycled.R-Value = 4.5.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PsufYvOtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ANRW7DI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klymit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Foam Pads"]], "price": 69.99}}
