{"item_id": "B00ANT2M0E", "title": "CREE LED 200 Lumen Tactical Rifle Gun Shotgun Flashlight, Rail Mount, Charger, Pressure Switch", "description": "As of March 2013 we have modified our pressure switches making them more durable.Super Strong Solid Aluminum Tactical Flashlight - LED CREE 200+ LumensSuper Bright CREE LED with STROBE FUNCTION.These flashlights are NOT plastic like other cheap ones you see on amazon. 100% solid Aluminum. Will not be disappointed with the qualityIncludes:1 CREE LED Flashlight 200+ Lumens1 Rechargeable Battery (18650) 2200MAH1 Picatinny / Weaver Rail Mount (Shotgun Mount can be purchased separately)1 Battery Charger1 Pressure switch & Cap1 on/off button cap1 Allen WrenchSpecifications:3 Light Modes: Bright, Dim, Strobe!!!Battery Type: 18650150 Lumen CREE LEDWater Resistant & ShockproofLength: 5 1/4 inchesWidth: 1 inchesOn/Off Switch AND pressure wire switch (On separate caps)Material: Aircraft-grade Aluminum T6160 Alloy Picatinny Rail Mountable.WE SELL SHOTGUN MOUNTS THAT CAN BE USED WITH THIS AND OUR OTHER FLASHLIGHTS.", "text": "CREE LED 200 Lumen Tactical Rifle Gun Shotgun Flashlight, Rail Mount, Charger, Pressure Switch As of March 2013 we have modified our pressure switches making them more durable.Super Strong Solid Aluminum Tactical Flashlight - LED CREE 200+ LumensSuper Bright CREE LED with STROBE FUNCTION.These flashlights are NOT plastic like other cheap ones you see on amazon. 100% solid Aluminum. Will not be disappointed with the qualityIncludes:1 CREE LED Flashlight 200+ Lumens1 Rechargeable Battery (18650) 2200MAH1 Picatinny / Weaver Rail Mount (Shotgun Mount can be purchased separately)1 Battery Charger1 Pressure switch & Cap1 on/off button cap1 Allen WrenchSpecifications:3 Light Modes: Bright, Dim, Strobe!!!Battery Type: 18650150 Lumen CREE LEDWater Resistant & ShockproofLength: 5 1/4 inchesWidth: 1 inchesOn/Off Switch AND pressure wire switch (On separate caps)Material: Aircraft-grade Aluminum T6160 Alloy Picatinny Rail Mountable.WE SELL SHOTGUN MOUNTS THAT CAN BE USED WITH THIS AND OUR OTHER FLASHLIGHTS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412UZPY5biL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ANT2M0E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 30.99}}
{"item_id": "B00ANX2M6E", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Marpat Woodland Digital Camo Camouflage Ambidextrous Molle Rifle Shotgun Scabbard Soft Protective Case", "description": "The Ultimate Arms Gear tactial assault rifle scabbard, is designed to transport various types and sizes of assault rifles and provide plenty of space for many weapon mounted optics. It has a removable retention strap with a quick-release buckle, and is adjustable to 4 positions for various barrel lengths. Versatile ambidextrous (either right or left handed) carry options: by hand via side carry handle, shoulder via adjustable & padded shoulder sling strap which can connect to 6 different D-Ring locations, or via MOLLE modular webbing panels. Both sides feature the MOLLE webbing as well as 4 (2 on each side) detachable PALS straps. Snap & zippered opening for pistol grip or magazine (including high capacity) ready weapons. Flexible semi-rigid insert for shape retention, and closed cell foam padding around the entire scabbard for secure and reliable protection of your rifle. Built in Durable and constructed to last - lifetime manufacturer's warranty included.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Marpat Woodland Digital Camo Camouflage Ambidextrous Molle Rifle Shotgun Scabbard Soft Protective Case The Ultimate Arms Gear tactial assault rifle scabbard, is designed to transport various types and sizes of assault rifles and provide plenty of space for many weapon mounted optics. It has a removable retention strap with a quick-release buckle, and is adjustable to 4 positions for various barrel lengths. Versatile ambidextrous (either right or left handed) carry options: by hand via side carry handle, shoulder via adjustable & padded shoulder sling strap which can connect to 6 different D-Ring locations, or via MOLLE modular webbing panels. Both sides feature the MOLLE webbing as well as 4 (2 on each side) detachable PALS straps. Snap & zippered opening for pistol grip or magazine (including high capacity) ready weapons. Flexible semi-rigid insert for shape retention, and closed cell foam padding around the entire scabbard for secure and reliable protection of your rifle. Built in Durable and constructed to last - lifetime manufacturer's warranty included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KTsTIWa8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ANX2M6E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00ANX2OMG", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Stealth Black Carrier Military Hunting Vest With MOLLE Web Modular System With Included 7 Modular Pouches", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation Modular MOLLE Web Carrier Vest (Black Color) + 7 Modular Pouches (* Armored Plates Not Included ). A true tactial vest made with high grade sturdy and weatherproof nylon loaded with features designed for military/law enforcement purposes. Completely breathable rear mesh ventilation system for enhanced comfort and heat release. Features a max strength rescue drag handle for field operations, Adjustable Shoulder & Waist Supports For Even Load Distribution and maximum comfort, Adjustable Padded Shoulders For Height And Comfortable fit, and of course the MOLLE System which allows you to place pouches exactly where you want and need it on the vest . Fully customizable to your exact needs - 100s of different combinations to fit everyones needs. One size fits most, fully adjustable in height and girth to fit from a small to X-Large adult. Great for hunters, military, and law enforecement. Constructed to last and covered by the Ultimate Arms Gear lifetime warranty.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Stealth Black Carrier Military Hunting Vest With MOLLE Web Modular System With Included 7 Modular Pouches Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation Modular MOLLE Web Carrier Vest (Black Color) + 7 Modular Pouches (* Armored Plates Not Included ). A true tactial vest made with high grade sturdy and weatherproof nylon loaded with features designed for military/law enforcement purposes. Completely breathable rear mesh ventilation system for enhanced comfort and heat release. Features a max strength rescue drag handle for field operations, Adjustable Shoulder & Waist Supports For Even Load Distribution and maximum comfort, Adjustable Padded Shoulders For Height And Comfortable fit, and of course the MOLLE System which allows you to place pouches exactly where you want and need it on the vest . Fully customizable to your exact needs - 100s of different combinations to fit everyones needs. One size fits most, fully adjustable in height and girth to fit from a small to X-Large adult. Great for hunters, military, and law enforecement. Constructed to last and covered by the Ultimate Arms Gear lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bzmT3l5ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ANX2OMG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B00ANZWCIK", "title": "Neewer® Durable AntiShock Trekking Retractable Outdoor Hiking Walking Stick Adjustable Pole", "description": "* Manganese steel tip with removable rubber ferrule, protect the hiking stick.* Made of lightweight aluminum metal, strong and light weighted.* Material: Aviation aluminum alloy rod, manganese steel tipPackage Contents:1 x Hiking stick", "text": "Neewer® Durable AntiShock Trekking Retractable Outdoor Hiking Walking Stick Adjustable Pole * Manganese steel tip with removable rubber ferrule, protect the hiking stick.* Made of lightweight aluminum metal, strong and light weighted.* Material: Aviation aluminum alloy rod, manganese steel tipPackage Contents:1 x Hiking stick", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RPEFXbYpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ANZWCIK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Neewer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 10.74}}
{"item_id": "B00AOCFPM2", "title": "Condor 241 Generation II Padded MOLLE Battle Belt", "description": "The Condor battle belt was designed to 1. provide extra real-estate for modular attache, 2. In conjunction with our 215 - H-Harness, work as light and easy load-out, or 3. provide addition options to distribute your modular attaches/weight from your load-bearing vest. The battle belt, must be used, and is compatible with any 1.5\" - 2\" web belt.", "text": "Condor 241 Generation II Padded MOLLE Battle Belt The Condor battle belt was designed to 1. provide extra real-estate for modular attache, 2. In conjunction with our 215 - H-Harness, work as light and easy load-out, or 3. provide addition options to distribute your modular attaches/weight from your load-bearing vest. The battle belt, must be used, and is compatible with any 1.5\" - 2\" web belt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WIfilhUeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AOCFPM2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00AOH8VWI", "title": "Peerless Handcuff Company Chain Link Handcuff", "description": "The classic design. The Model 700 incorporates spun rivet construction for increased strength and durability. Smooth single strand action allows for fast and efficient cuffing. The Model 700 has been approved by the National Institute of Justice. It comes with a lifetime warranty for manufacture defects. Updated design with new lock mechanism. Two keys supplied. Made in USA.", "text": "Peerless Handcuff Company Chain Link Handcuff The classic design. The Model 700 incorporates spun rivet construction for increased strength and durability. Smooth single strand action allows for fast and efficient cuffing. The Model 700 has been approved by the National Institute of Justice. It comes with a lifetime warranty for manufacture defects. Updated design with new lock mechanism. Two keys supplied. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31izyLSDhmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AOH8VWI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Peerless Handcuffs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Handcuffs & Restraints", "Handcuffs"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AONU6G6", "title": "Fizik Performance Bar Tape", "description": "Touch points are Fi'zi:k's area of expertise, so it's not surprising that the Italian brand has yet again put forth a new line of bar tape that keeps you supported and your ride looking sharp. For those looking for slightly more cushioning than what's provided by the famous stripped-down Superlight Tape, the Performance Bar Tape is the answer. Made with the tried-and-proven Microtex synthetic material, the Performance Bar Tape features 3mm of foam-cushioned support. Those familiar with Fi'zi:k's Dual Tape will see a resemblance in this version, as its stitched channel along the border provides an added shock-absorbing layer. The tacky Microtex material provides a sure grip with either gloved or bare hands, and its durable composition stands up to the abuse of sun, sweat, and countless hours of road time that undoubtedly awaits you this coming season. This perforated microfiber material also breathes exceptionally well, meaning that it'll stay drier and more comfortable than many other synthetic tapes out there. The Fi'zi:k Performance Bar Tape is available in the colors Apple Green, Black, Metal Blue, Orange, Pink, Red, Soft Touch - Black, Soft Touch - White, Tacky - Black, Tacky - White, White, and Yellow. Two rolls and two bar-end finishing plugs are included in each package.", "text": "Fizik Performance Bar Tape Touch points are Fi'zi:k's area of expertise, so it's not surprising that the Italian brand has yet again put forth a new line of bar tape that keeps you supported and your ride looking sharp. For those looking for slightly more cushioning than what's provided by the famous stripped-down Superlight Tape, the Performance Bar Tape is the answer. Made with the tried-and-proven Microtex synthetic material, the Performance Bar Tape features 3mm of foam-cushioned support. Those familiar with Fi'zi:k's Dual Tape will see a resemblance in this version, as its stitched channel along the border provides an added shock-absorbing layer. The tacky Microtex material provides a sure grip with either gloved or bare hands, and its durable composition stands up to the abuse of sun, sweat, and countless hours of road time that undoubtedly awaits you this coming season. This perforated microfiber material also breathes exceptionally well, meaning that it'll stay drier and more comfortable than many other synthetic tapes out there. The Fi'zi:k Performance Bar Tape is available in the colors Apple Green, Black, Metal Blue, Orange, Pink, Red, Soft Touch - Black, Soft Touch - White, Tacky - Black, Tacky - White, White, and Yellow. Two rolls and two bar-end finishing plugs are included in each package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JivfsZ27L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AONU6G6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fizik", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebar Tape"]], "price": 12.0}}
{"item_id": "B00AOZHW3O", "title": "MetroFlash Safety Zone Tail Light", "description": "Built with two powerful 0.5-watt Nichia LED bulbs in red, the Saftey Zone Taillight from Metro Flash defends you and your bike against rear collisions with three eye-catching modes that can be changed with a feather-light touch. Running with two AAA batteries, the Safety Zone offers runtimes of up to 124 hours depending on the mode. The Safety Zone is uniquely designed to be visible from all sides. The Safety Zone comes complete with a backpack clip as well as a seatpost and seatstay mount so that it is easy to secure to your bike or your person. Built to withstand all weather conditions, the Safety Zone carries a lifetime warranty against defects from Metro Flash .Specifications: Two Nichia brand 0.5 watt red LEDs Modes: Flashing/Constant/Chasing Runtime:124 hours seatpost and seatstay mounts Backpack clip Power: two AAA batteries (included) Weight: 60 grams What's in the Box? Safety Zone Taillight, two AAA batteries, seatpost and seatstay mounts Product Description SUPER bright double LED tail light for those who truly want to be seen. Two 1/2 watt LED's 3 unique light settings: Flashing/Constant/Chasing Batteries, Seatpost and Seatstay mounts all included Item Specifications Weight 60g Battery 2xAAA (included) Bulb LED Run Time 124 hours", "text": "MetroFlash Safety Zone Tail Light Built with two powerful 0.5-watt Nichia LED bulbs in red, the Saftey Zone Taillight from Metro Flash defends you and your bike against rear collisions with three eye-catching modes that can be changed with a feather-light touch. Running with two AAA batteries, the Safety Zone offers runtimes of up to 124 hours depending on the mode. The Safety Zone is uniquely designed to be visible from all sides. The Safety Zone comes complete with a backpack clip as well as a seatpost and seatstay mount so that it is easy to secure to your bike or your person. Built to withstand all weather conditions, the Safety Zone carries a lifetime warranty against defects from Metro Flash .Specifications: Two Nichia brand 0.5 watt red LEDs Modes: Flashing/Constant/Chasing Runtime:124 hours seatpost and seatstay mounts Backpack clip Power: two AAA batteries (included) Weight: 60 grams What's in the Box? Safety Zone Taillight, two AAA batteries, seatpost and seatstay mounts Product Description SUPER bright double LED tail light for those who truly want to be seen. Two 1/2 watt LED's 3 unique light settings: Flashing/Constant/Chasing Batteries, Seatpost and Seatstay mounts all included Item Specifications Weight 60g Battery 2xAAA (included) Bulb LED Run Time 124 hours", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TqIUrK3ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AOZHW3O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AP30RVE", "title": "Moultrie M-880 Low Glow Game Camera", "description": "The Game Spy Moultrie M-880 is a redesign of the best-selling M-80XT camera. It is an 8.0 megapixel Low-Glow infrared mini game camera with the serious hunter in mind. Low-Glow technology will not scare away the game, helping you get a true census. It has an outstanding 100' night range, and its Illumi-Night Sensor will make sure those images are bright & clear. You can choose from 1 of 4 operational modes on this Moultrie M-880 camera including: IR triggered plot game camera, Time-lapse plot camera, Plot camera by day/motion detect at night, and day & night HD 720 video. Plus, you can set it up for Multi-Shot, which allows your camera to take 1-10 pictures quickly in a row. The Moultrie M-880 Game Camera also features FastFire Continuous Shooting that can take 1-4 pictures per second, and Motion Freeze Technology that reduces night-time blur. The camera is capable of holding 9,500 images on 8 AA batteries (not included) and is compatible with SD cards up to 32 GB. Plus, with moon phase, temperature, time, date and camera ID stamp on each photo you'll have superior intelligence for your next hunt.", "text": "Moultrie M-880 Low Glow Game Camera The Game Spy Moultrie M-880 is a redesign of the best-selling M-80XT camera. It is an 8.0 megapixel Low-Glow infrared mini game camera with the serious hunter in mind. Low-Glow technology will not scare away the game, helping you get a true census. It has an outstanding 100' night range, and its Illumi-Night Sensor will make sure those images are bright & clear. You can choose from 1 of 4 operational modes on this Moultrie M-880 camera including: IR triggered plot game camera, Time-lapse plot camera, Plot camera by day/motion detect at night, and day & night HD 720 video. Plus, you can set it up for Multi-Shot, which allows your camera to take 1-10 pictures quickly in a row. The Moultrie M-880 Game Camera also features FastFire Continuous Shooting that can take 1-4 pictures per second, and Motion Freeze Technology that reduces night-time blur. The camera is capable of holding 9,500 images on 8 AA batteries (not included) and is compatible with SD cards up to 32 GB. Plus, with moon phase, temperature, time, date and camera ID stamp on each photo you'll have superior intelligence for your next hunt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511Rhix%2BvHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AP30RVE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moultrie", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 149.09}}
{"item_id": "B00AP311JQ", "title": "Moultrie A5 Low Glow Game Camera", "description": "This camera is scouting made easy. Moultrie's A-5 provides easy setup and great features at a price making it affordable to outfit your entire property. This is a 5.0 megapixel Low Glow infrared game camera. The night range spans to 50-ft, and the A-5 captures day and night video. This camera has a picture delay of 1/5/10 and 30 minutes, and includes a moon phase, time, date and camera ID stamp. There is an SD memory card slot (up to 32 GB; not included), and 8,000+ images can be supported on 4 C-cell batteries.", "text": "Moultrie A5 Low Glow Game Camera This camera is scouting made easy. Moultrie's A-5 provides easy setup and great features at a price making it affordable to outfit your entire property. This is a 5.0 megapixel Low Glow infrared game camera. The night range spans to 50-ft, and the A-5 captures day and night video. This camera has a picture delay of 1/5/10 and 30 minutes, and includes a moon phase, time, date and camera ID stamp. There is an SD memory card slot (up to 32 GB; not included), and 8,000+ images can be supported on 4 C-cell batteries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519gxZ9IRUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AP311JQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moultrie", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 59.0}}
{"item_id": "B00APBMNOK", "title": "Garmin Edge 510 GPS Bike Computer", "description": "Train on the EdgeThe touchscreen Edge 510 is designed for the competitive cyclist who seeks the most accurate and comprehensive ride data. It offers connected features¹ through your smartphone, including live tracking, weather and social media sharing. Whether you're training, racing or touring, Edge 510 tracks the details of your ride, and you can view it later on a map atGarmin Connect™. Compatible with GPS and GLONASS satellites for faster satellite acquisition and improved signal lock, the 510 is suited for the most challenging conditions, such as canyons.Track Every DetailThe 510 records your distance, speed metrics, ascent/descent, grade and more. Take your training farther with ANT+™-compatible sensors that measure your heart rate², speed/cadence² and power³. The activity profiles feature allows you to customize data fields and device settings based on cycling activity, such as training or racing. Switch profiles with a simple swipe of the touchscreen and your device will be set up to show the data you need for that ride. When you complete a ride, the 510 displays any new personal records you achieved, such as farthest distance, most ascent gained and more.Get ConnectedEdge 510 offers a suite of connected features when paired with your smartphone (Apple® or Android™) and theGarmin Connect™ Mobileapp. This allows you to gain comprehensive, accurate ride data from a dedicated device, while saving your phone battery. Edge tracks the data and sends it to your phone using a Bluetooth® connection. Stay connected and share all the details of your ride with friends, family and your social media contacts. You can post an update immediately after your ride or race with details from your completed activity. You'll create your posts via your smartphone, and the ride data's already there, thanks to the interface with Garmin Connect Mobile.Live TrackingThe live tracking feature allows your friends and family to follow your races and training activities in real time. Invite followers using email or social media, so they can view your live data on a Garmin Connect tracking page. Once they get your email invite, they can click to follow and see your stats and location on the map.WeatherGet real-time weather conditions, forecasts and alerts (in areas with coverage) directly on the Edge 510 when it's paired with your smartphone and Garmin Connect Mobile. This feature is useful for extended rides, and it lets you keep your smartphone safe and dry, while the weather data you need is at your fingertips.Wireless Data TransfersNow you can instantly store, share and analyze every detail of your ride. The Garmin Connect Mobile app allows for wireless uploads of completed activities from your device as soon as you finish recording an activity. You choose whether activities are automatically or manually uploaded. Once your ride has posted to Garmin Connect, your own \"connections\" can view them. You can also search your courses and workouts4stored at Garmin Connect, download to your smartphone, then send directly to your Edge 510 — wirelessly. Use the courses and Virtual Partner® features on your Edge to race your previous activities in real time.Purpose-Built Bike ComputerEdge 510 is rugged, waterproof and has up to a 20 hour battery life. The touchscreen is easy to operate, even with a gloved finger and when wet. Mounting options include a new out-front mount² for heads-up positioning and a standard quarter-turn mount. It also comes with a tether to ensure your device doesn't travel far in the event of a spill.¹When paired with your compatible Android or Apple device.²Included with some models, sold separately on others.³When paired with ANT+ power meter.4Future release of Garmin Connect Mobile will allow you to explore and download courses and workouts from other Garmin Connect users.What's in the Box:Edge 510Mounts (standard) - the OUT FRONT mount ONLY comes in the PERFORMANCE BUNDLE versionUSB cableAC chargerTetherManual", "text": "Garmin Edge 510 GPS Bike Computer Train on the EdgeThe touchscreen Edge 510 is designed for the competitive cyclist who seeks the most accurate and comprehensive ride data. It offers connected features¹ through your smartphone, including live tracking, weather and social media sharing. Whether you're training, racing or touring, Edge 510 tracks the details of your ride, and you can view it later on a map atGarmin Connect™. Compatible with GPS and GLONASS satellites for faster satellite acquisition and improved signal lock, the 510 is suited for the most challenging conditions, such as canyons.Track Every DetailThe 510 records your distance, speed metrics, ascent/descent, grade and more. Take your training farther with ANT+™-compatible sensors that measure your heart rate², speed/cadence² and power³. The activity profiles feature allows you to customize data fields and device settings based on cycling activity, such as training or racing. Switch profiles with a simple swipe of the touchscreen and your device will be set up to show the data you need for that ride. When you complete a ride, the 510 displays any new personal records you achieved, such as farthest distance, most ascent gained and more.Get ConnectedEdge 510 offers a suite of connected features when paired with your smartphone (Apple® or Android™) and theGarmin Connect™ Mobileapp. This allows you to gain comprehensive, accurate ride data from a dedicated device, while saving your phone battery. Edge tracks the data and sends it to your phone using a Bluetooth® connection. Stay connected and share all the details of your ride with friends, family and your social media contacts. You can post an update immediately after your ride or race with details from your completed activity. You'll create your posts via your smartphone, and the ride data's already there, thanks to the interface with Garmin Connect Mobile.Live TrackingThe live tracking feature allows your friends and family to follow your races and training activities in real time. Invite followers using email or social media, so they can view your live data on a Garmin Connect tracking page. Once they get your email invite, they can click to follow and see your stats and location on the map.WeatherGet real-time weather conditions, forecasts and alerts (in areas with coverage) directly on the Edge 510 when it's paired with your smartphone and Garmin Connect Mobile. This feature is useful for extended rides, and it lets you keep your smartphone safe and dry, while the weather data you need is at your fingertips.Wireless Data TransfersNow you can instantly store, share and analyze every detail of your ride. The Garmin Connect Mobile app allows for wireless uploads of completed activities from your device as soon as you finish recording an activity. You choose whether activities are automatically or manually uploaded. Once your ride has posted to Garmin Connect, your own \"connections\" can view them. You can also search your courses and workouts4stored at Garmin Connect, download to your smartphone, then send directly to your Edge 510 — wirelessly. Use the courses and Virtual Partner® features on your Edge to race your previous activities in real time.Purpose-Built Bike ComputerEdge 510 is rugged, waterproof and has up to a 20 hour battery life. The touchscreen is easy to operate, even with a gloved finger and when wet. Mounting options include a new out-front mount² for heads-up positioning and a standard quarter-turn mount. It also comes with a tether to ensure your device doesn't travel far in the event of a spill.¹When paired with your compatible Android or Apple device.²Included with some models, sold separately on others.³When paired with ANT+ power meter.4Future release of Garmin Connect Mobile will allow you to explore and download courses and workouts from other Garmin Connect users.What's in the Box:Edge 510Mounts (standard) - the OUT FRONT mount ONLY comes in the PERFORMANCE BUNDLE versionUSB cableAC chargerTetherManual", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mzroUFBJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00APBMNOK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Garmin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 329.99}}
