{"item_id": "B00APP5AUU", "title": "36 Aluminum Pistol Crossbow Arrows 50 - 80 Lb", "description": "You receive 36 new arrows (3 packs with 12 arrows in each pack). These arrows will work on most 50 and 80lb crossbows. They are made of an aluminum shaft with a metal tip. These Durable Aluminum Bolts Are Tough Enough To Stand Up To Repeated Use. Arrow Length Is Just Over 6.25\" Makes For A Great Gift For The Crossbow Enthusiast In Your Life", "text": "36 Aluminum Pistol Crossbow Arrows 50 - 80 Lb You receive 36 new arrows (3 packs with 12 arrows in each pack). These arrows will work on most 50 and 80lb crossbows. They are made of an aluminum shaft with a metal tip. These Durable Aluminum Bolts Are Tough Enough To Stand Up To Repeated Use. Arrow Length Is Just Over 6.25\" Makes For A Great Gift For The Crossbow Enthusiast In Your Life", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61LrTx8lS1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00APP5AUU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ACE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 11.45}}
{"item_id": "B00AQ0ZGP8", "title": "Shock And Awe Zombie Killer Knife", "description": "A fusion of two ancient tools, our Zombie Killer Primal Fear Knife combines the functionality of a kitchen cleaver with the unique look and extreme utility of the Inuit ulu knife. A versatile tool well suited for heavy-duty tasks but most ideal for hunting, the thick and heavy blade features a fully curved razor-sharp skinning edge, a gut hook and serrated reverse edge along with a strong handle that allows it to withstand heavy chopping as a cleaver. Made of high quality 3CR13 surgical stainless steel for maximum toughness the highly durable blade is black powder coated to resist corrosion while the tough ABS handle is ergonomic and provides a secure grip in all conditions. Befitting the \"Zombie Killer\" name, the bright green handle provides a unique look with a biohazard emblem printed on both sides and the distinctive green Zombie Killer logo stamped on the blade. Includes a FREE ABS holster with a sturdy belt clip to hold the knife secure by your side.", "text": "Shock And Awe Zombie Killer Knife A fusion of two ancient tools, our Zombie Killer Primal Fear Knife combines the functionality of a kitchen cleaver with the unique look and extreme utility of the Inuit ulu knife. A versatile tool well suited for heavy-duty tasks but most ideal for hunting, the thick and heavy blade features a fully curved razor-sharp skinning edge, a gut hook and serrated reverse edge along with a strong handle that allows it to withstand heavy chopping as a cleaver. Made of high quality 3CR13 surgical stainless steel for maximum toughness the highly durable blade is black powder coated to resist corrosion while the tough ABS handle is ergonomic and provides a secure grip in all conditions. Befitting the \"Zombie Killer\" name, the bright green handle provides a unique look with a biohazard emblem printed on both sides and the distinctive green Zombie Killer logo stamped on the blade. Includes a FREE ABS holster with a sturdy belt clip to hold the knife secure by your side.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ejw9Qab0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AQ0ZGP8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Armory Replicas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 10.47}}
{"item_id": "B00AQ4F19K", "title": "Bosu Standard Balance Trainer", "description": "From the elite athlete to weekend warriors trying to stay in shape, this Bosu Balance Trainer helps to strengthen and coordinate your body (including the muscles that you don't see). The trainer targets the core muscles of your body--those muscles around your abdominal and back area--helping you to not only gain strength, trim, and tone, but to help coordinate your entire body. This set includes a blue Bosu balance trainer, a workout DVD, a pump, and an exercise manual that will help get you started.About Bosu TrainingThe BOSU acronym stands for \"Both Sides Utilized\" and has evolved beyond the original BOSU Balance Trainer product. It now represents an approach to exercise that is more mindful than traditional training. At its essence, BOSU Training is about expanding movement capabilities while reshaping the body and strengthening the mind. It is comprised of thoughtful movement that requires the participant to not only be physically involved, but also \"here and present\" with the mind fully engaged. BOSU Training can be physically demanding, but when properly taught, it is appropriate to a variety of fitness levels and physical capabilities. Use BOSU Training to help enhance performance across a wide continuum of activities including sport, recreation, and daily tasks.", "text": "Bosu Standard Balance Trainer From the elite athlete to weekend warriors trying to stay in shape, this Bosu Balance Trainer helps to strengthen and coordinate your body (including the muscles that you don't see). The trainer targets the core muscles of your body--those muscles around your abdominal and back area--helping you to not only gain strength, trim, and tone, but to help coordinate your entire body. This set includes a blue Bosu balance trainer, a workout DVD, a pump, and an exercise manual that will help get you started.About Bosu TrainingThe BOSU acronym stands for \"Both Sides Utilized\" and has evolved beyond the original BOSU Balance Trainer product. It now represents an approach to exercise that is more mindful than traditional training. At its essence, BOSU Training is about expanding movement capabilities while reshaping the body and strengthening the mind. It is comprised of thoughtful movement that requires the participant to not only be physically involved, but also \"here and present\" with the mind fully engaged. BOSU Training can be physically demanding, but when properly taught, it is appropriate to a variety of fitness levels and physical capabilities. Use BOSU Training to help enhance performance across a wide continuum of activities including sport, recreation, and daily tasks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312LYPLeHfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AQ4F19K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bosu", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 104.0}}
{"item_id": "B00AQ6952M", "title": "Marbles G.I. Utility Knife.", "description": "Marbles G.I. Utility Knife. 3 5/8\" closed. Stainless spear blade, can opener, bottle opener with screwdriver tip, and punch. Stainless handles printed U S. Bail.", "text": "Marbles G.I. Utility Knife. Marbles G.I. Utility Knife. 3 5/8\" closed. Stainless spear blade, can opener, bottle opener with screwdriver tip, and punch. Stainless handles printed U S. Bail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TwizgRInL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AQ6952M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Marbles", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 15.5}}
{"item_id": "B00AQ6E5XQ", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Beefy Pocket Organizer", "description": "Product Details Maxpedition beefed up the #0261 FATTY POCKET ORGANIZER for increased capacity. The Beefy Pocket Organizer is the largest of its kind with optimum interior space for standard flashlights, hand tools, large knives, 16OZ bottles, heavy cables and other fuller-sized gear. A full clamshell opening reveals a hefty main compartment, containing 15 elastic dividers and 2 large slip and zippered pockets. This portable utility carry is perfect for big jobs and can be dropped into your Maxpedition bag or attached to its exterior PALS webbing for extended travels. Product Features Overall size: 6.25-Inch (L) x 8.75-Inch (H) x 2.5-Inch (W) Main compartment: 6-Inch (L) x 8-Inch (H) x 2-Inch (W) Exterior front: One (1) 5.75-Inch (L) x 5.25-Inch (H) mesh pocket and loop field for ID patch Exterior rear: 3 rows x 4 channels PALS webbing with over-sized grab handle made from 1-Inch webbing Integrate using 3-Inch TacTie Attachment Straps Full clamshell opening with dual YKK zippers Interior left: One (1) 6-Inch (L) x 6.5-Inch (H) slip pocket with 9 horizontal elastic channels Interior right: One (1) 8-Inch (L) x 5-Inch (H) zippered pocket and 6 vertical elastic channels Center spine: 1 elastic retention loop Internal D-Ring attachment point.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Beefy Pocket Organizer Product Details Maxpedition beefed up the #0261 FATTY POCKET ORGANIZER for increased capacity. The Beefy Pocket Organizer is the largest of its kind with optimum interior space for standard flashlights, hand tools, large knives, 16OZ bottles, heavy cables and other fuller-sized gear. A full clamshell opening reveals a hefty main compartment, containing 15 elastic dividers and 2 large slip and zippered pockets. This portable utility carry is perfect for big jobs and can be dropped into your Maxpedition bag or attached to its exterior PALS webbing for extended travels. Product Features Overall size: 6.25-Inch (L) x 8.75-Inch (H) x 2.5-Inch (W) Main compartment: 6-Inch (L) x 8-Inch (H) x 2-Inch (W) Exterior front: One (1) 5.75-Inch (L) x 5.25-Inch (H) mesh pocket and loop field for ID patch Exterior rear: 3 rows x 4 channels PALS webbing with over-sized grab handle made from 1-Inch webbing Integrate using 3-Inch TacTie Attachment Straps Full clamshell opening with dual YKK zippers Interior left: One (1) 6-Inch (L) x 6.5-Inch (H) slip pocket with 9 horizontal elastic channels Interior right: One (1) 8-Inch (L) x 5-Inch (H) zippered pocket and 6 vertical elastic channels Center spine: 1 elastic retention loop Internal D-Ring attachment point.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51b0UuSm5fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AQ6E5XQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AQ6X9GU", "title": "ProSource Speed Cable Jump Rope, Super Fast, 10' feet Fully Adjustable", "description": "ProSource super fast, speed, cable rope is a must have for everyone. This rope will make crossing moves, double under and even triple under easier and fun. Perfect for beginners as well as advanced jumpers. ProSource cable jump rope is a one size fits all. Simply measure rope by standing on the middle of the cord and the end of the handles come up to the top of the jumper's shoulders. Will fit anyone up to up to 6' 6\" tall. Simply adjust the length with an easy screw/lock using fingers or a screw driver (recommended). Make sure it is clamped tight before jumping. As an option you can cut off the extra cable.", "text": "ProSource Speed Cable Jump Rope, Super Fast, 10' feet Fully Adjustable ProSource super fast, speed, cable rope is a must have for everyone. This rope will make crossing moves, double under and even triple under easier and fun. Perfect for beginners as well as advanced jumpers. ProSource cable jump rope is a one size fits all. Simply measure rope by standing on the middle of the cord and the end of the handles come up to the top of the jumper's shoulders. Will fit anyone up to up to 6' 6\" tall. Simply adjust the length with an easy screw/lock using fingers or a screw driver (recommended). Make sure it is clamped tight before jumping. As an option you can cut off the extra cable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o3YjesnfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AQ6X9GU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProSource Discounts, Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AQA6G6G", "title": "CVLIFE Tactical Optics Scopes 3-9x40 E Mil-Dot Blue illuminated Rifle Scope With Spirit Level Gauge", "description": "Features：● Blue mil-dot illuminated● Wide Field of View with Mil-Dot reticle● Illuminated blue reticle with 5 level brightness control● Scope with the level can keep balance of the gun● Protective lens covers included● Only offer 20mm rail mountsPackage include:1x 3-9x40mm scope with lens covers1 pair 20mm rail mounts", "text": "CVLIFE Tactical Optics Scopes 3-9x40 E Mil-Dot Blue illuminated Rifle Scope With Spirit Level Gauge Features：● Blue mil-dot illuminated● Wide Field of View with Mil-Dot reticle● Illuminated blue reticle with 5 level brightness control● Scope with the level can keep balance of the gun● Protective lens covers included● Only offer 20mm rail mountsPackage include:1x 3-9x40mm scope with lens covers1 pair 20mm rail mounts", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NO-1wKdKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AQA6G6G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00AQH2M44", "title": "UTG Super Duty OP Bi-Pod with QD Lever Lock, Black", "description": "UTG Super Duty Tactical Op Bi-pod w/QD Lever Lock–Fits Swivel Stud & Picatinny/Weaver Rail, Foldable Arms w/Robust Spring Tension Control, Slotted Posi-lock & Lockable Thumb Wheel for Full Adjustments & Max. Security, Center Ht:6.0\"-8.5\" Leg Leng:5.5\"-8.0\".", "text": "UTG Super Duty OP Bi-Pod with QD Lever Lock, Black UTG Super Duty Tactical Op Bi-pod w/QD Lever Lock–Fits Swivel Stud & Picatinny/Weaver Rail, Foldable Arms w/Robust Spring Tension Control, Slotted Posi-lock & Lockable Thumb Wheel for Full Adjustments & Max. Security, Center Ht:6.0\"-8.5\" Leg Leng:5.5\"-8.0\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EY372w9bL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AQH2M44.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 50.38}}
{"item_id": "B00AQLN0FA", "title": "5.5mm 22 Caliber Air Pistol Pellet Gun Real Wood", "description": "Air Pistol 5.5mm Rifling-12 Barrel Length-180mm Overall Length-329mm Weight-1.1-1.3kg For General Shooting Hobby Shooting Training Easy To Use Heavy Duty Pistol Wood Finish Handle Adjustable Aim Sight Black Color Barrel Come With Instruction Manual Nicely Packed", "text": "5.5mm 22 Caliber Air Pistol Pellet Gun Real Wood Air Pistol 5.5mm Rifling-12 Barrel Length-180mm Overall Length-329mm Weight-1.1-1.3kg For General Shooting Hobby Shooting Training Easy To Use Heavy Duty Pistol Wood Finish Handle Adjustable Aim Sight Black Color Barrel Come With Instruction Manual Nicely Packed", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317bbr7wPRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AQLN0FA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lastworld", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 44.7}}
{"item_id": "B00AQOBYKA", "title": "Gamo Whisper Fusion .177 Caliber 1300 FPS Air Rifle", "description": "The Whisper Fusion offers all-weather durability combined with maximum performance. Light weight synthetic stock, match grade fluted barrel and 1300 fps with PBA make the Whisper Fusion perfect for small game hunting, targets and pest control. The IGT (Inert Gas Technology) is a new advanced technology from Gamo for Adult Break-Barrel Air Rifles. This innovative technology allows shooting pellet ammunition by use of a pneumatic inert gas cylinder instead of conventional spring technology. Fluted Polymer Jacketed Steel Barrel with WHISPER FUSION Double Integrated Noise Dampening Technology. MECHANISM -Velocity: 1300 feet per second (fps) with PBA Platinum -Single Shot -Inert Gas Technology (IGT) -Break Barrel: Single Cocking System -Automatic Cocking Safety system -Barrel: Fluted Polymer Jacketed Steel with WHISPER FUSION Technology -Cocking Effort: 32 lbs. -Trigger: Two stage adjustable SAT (Smooth Action Trigger) -Manual Safety STOCK -Stock: Tough All Weather molded Synthetic -Butt Plate: SWA (Shock Wave Absorber) Recoil pad with up to 74% recoil absorption -Cheekpiece: Adjustable cheek piece molded for both Right hand and Left hand shooters -Checkering: Non-Slip texture design on grip and forearm OPTICS -Scope Ramp: Raised Rail -Scope: 3-9x40 air rifle scope with rings. SPECIFICATIONS -Weight: 8.00 lbs. -Length: 43'' -Ammunition: Any.177 Pellet -Caliber:.177 -Trigger Pull: 3.74 lbs. -Barrel Length: 18 in.", "text": "Gamo Whisper Fusion .177 Caliber 1300 FPS Air Rifle The Whisper Fusion offers all-weather durability combined with maximum performance. Light weight synthetic stock, match grade fluted barrel and 1300 fps with PBA make the Whisper Fusion perfect for small game hunting, targets and pest control. The IGT (Inert Gas Technology) is a new advanced technology from Gamo for Adult Break-Barrel Air Rifles. This innovative technology allows shooting pellet ammunition by use of a pneumatic inert gas cylinder instead of conventional spring technology. Fluted Polymer Jacketed Steel Barrel with WHISPER FUSION Double Integrated Noise Dampening Technology. MECHANISM -Velocity: 1300 feet per second (fps) with PBA Platinum -Single Shot -Inert Gas Technology (IGT) -Break Barrel: Single Cocking System -Automatic Cocking Safety system -Barrel: Fluted Polymer Jacketed Steel with WHISPER FUSION Technology -Cocking Effort: 32 lbs. -Trigger: Two stage adjustable SAT (Smooth Action Trigger) -Manual Safety STOCK -Stock: Tough All Weather molded Synthetic -Butt Plate: SWA (Shock Wave Absorber) Recoil pad with up to 74% recoil absorption -Cheekpiece: Adjustable cheek piece molded for both Right hand and Left hand shooters -Checkering: Non-Slip texture design on grip and forearm OPTICS -Scope Ramp: Raised Rail -Scope: 3-9x40 air rifle scope with rings. SPECIFICATIONS -Weight: 8.00 lbs. -Length: 43'' -Ammunition: Any.177 Pellet -Caliber:.177 -Trigger Pull: 3.74 lbs. -Barrel Length: 18 in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QGTG-iwHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AQOBYKA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 240.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AQPJ1P4", "title": "Fishing Hook - Spring Loaded Speedhook - Easy Action Snare for Pan or Ice Fishing, Survival and Trapping (3 Piece Pack)", "description": "Speedhook Fishing Hook - When You Need To Catch a Fish, Trust Speedhook.Speedhook, which has a patented design trusted by the US Military in their survival kits, is the best tool to catch fish. Utilizing a spring loaded snare, the Speedhook is world renowned for setting a hook perfectly in a fish's mouth. That makes it a fantastic hook for pan fishing, ice fishing, and any other way you might need to catch fish! Speedhook is great for catch and release because of it's ability to set in a fish's mouth without extra damage. Because of the quick action release, Speedhook is incredibly effective - in one fishing contest the Speedhook creator defeated a fishing show host 84 to 4!Want to impress your friends? Look no further than the Speedhook and you too could be catching 80 fish in one day. Speedhook is so effective at catching fish that it is outlawed in some areas for use in non-survival circumstances (always check your local game laws before use). The US Department of Defense trusts Speedhook and has included it in Air Force Survival kits and has been sold to all branches of the military. For survival kits, why not trust what the military uses? Speedhook can be used on fish or small game, with or without a fishing pole. Small and compact, this is the one hook you need for your survival kit.When you just need to catch a fish or you want to impress your friend's with your fishing prowess, trust the hook so effective that some states have made it illegal: Speedhook. Nothing catches better.", "text": "Fishing Hook - Spring Loaded Speedhook - Easy Action Snare for Pan or Ice Fishing, Survival and Trapping (3 Piece Pack) Speedhook Fishing Hook - When You Need To Catch a Fish, Trust Speedhook.Speedhook, which has a patented design trusted by the US Military in their survival kits, is the best tool to catch fish. Utilizing a spring loaded snare, the Speedhook is world renowned for setting a hook perfectly in a fish's mouth. That makes it a fantastic hook for pan fishing, ice fishing, and any other way you might need to catch fish! Speedhook is great for catch and release because of it's ability to set in a fish's mouth without extra damage. Because of the quick action release, Speedhook is incredibly effective - in one fishing contest the Speedhook creator defeated a fishing show host 84 to 4!Want to impress your friends? Look no further than the Speedhook and you too could be catching 80 fish in one day. Speedhook is so effective at catching fish that it is outlawed in some areas for use in non-survival circumstances (always check your local game laws before use). The US Department of Defense trusts Speedhook and has included it in Air Force Survival kits and has been sold to all branches of the military. For survival kits, why not trust what the military uses? Speedhook can be used on fish or small game, with or without a fishing pole. Small and compact, this is the one hook you need for your survival kit.When you just need to catch a fish or you want to impress your friend's with your fishing prowess, trust the hook so effective that some states have made it illegal: Speedhook. Nothing catches better.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AnJKolMLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AQPJ1P4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedhook", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Terminal Tackle", "Hooks"]], "price": 11.15}}
