{"item_id": "B00ARB8QRQ", "title": "Three-leg Transfer Head Adaptor Nozzle Gas Bottle Screwgate Camping Stove Gear", "description": "Made of metal and plastic material, features three-leg head, 11mm thread dia, fit 43mm dia Nozzle Gas Bottle. Great accessory for outdoor camping, picnic, etc. It is a stove gear for your daily life, compact size design, it is portable for you to carry about.The Nozzle Gas Bottle is not included here.", "text": "Three-leg Transfer Head Adaptor Nozzle Gas Bottle Screwgate Camping Stove Gear Made of metal and plastic material, features three-leg head, 11mm thread dia, fit 43mm dia Nozzle Gas Bottle. Great accessory for outdoor camping, picnic, etc. It is a stove gear for your daily life, compact size design, it is portable for you to carry about.The Nozzle Gas Bottle is not included here.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uSJeEveqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ARB8QRQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Como", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 4.0}}
{"item_id": "B00AREJIBQ", "title": "Guard Dog Diablo II 320 Lumen Tactical Flashlight and Stun Gun", "description": "The most versatile and practical stun gun flashlight in the world is here: The Guard Dog Diablo II. Previously used by law enforcement, and now released to the general public, this multi-functional self defense device embodies all the necessary features of personal security combined with a daily flashlight- all without being a visible stun gun. Built on its popularity, the Diablo II boasts the patented concealed inner stun technology which has become the most envied feature in the stun gun industry. Once activated, this 5,000,000 concealed stun gun rips a thunderous and intimidating spark completely inconspicuously around the top layer. As an everyday flashlight, the Diablo II shines an astounding 320 lumen light capable of being seen over 500 yards away, while blinding any unwelcome assailants. Ensure you are charged for any occasion, expected or unexpected, with the included AC vehicle charger and home charger. Enclosed within a type III aluminum aircraft grade body, the Diablo II has a shockproof body with an emergency glass breaker bezel. Take this accomplice with you where ever you go in the included premium leather holster. The search for your daily necessity is over- the ideal flashlight with a concealed volt-thrashing stun gun, The Guard Dog Diablo II. A one-sided spark when test firing is normal. Both probes will spark upon contact. To test, place a sheet of paper across both probes to see both jumping simultaneously", "text": "Guard Dog Diablo II 320 Lumen Tactical Flashlight and Stun Gun The most versatile and practical stun gun flashlight in the world is here: The Guard Dog Diablo II. Previously used by law enforcement, and now released to the general public, this multi-functional self defense device embodies all the necessary features of personal security combined with a daily flashlight- all without being a visible stun gun. Built on its popularity, the Diablo II boasts the patented concealed inner stun technology which has become the most envied feature in the stun gun industry. Once activated, this 5,000,000 concealed stun gun rips a thunderous and intimidating spark completely inconspicuously around the top layer. As an everyday flashlight, the Diablo II shines an astounding 320 lumen light capable of being seen over 500 yards away, while blinding any unwelcome assailants. Ensure you are charged for any occasion, expected or unexpected, with the included AC vehicle charger and home charger. Enclosed within a type III aluminum aircraft grade body, the Diablo II has a shockproof body with an emergency glass breaker bezel. Take this accomplice with you where ever you go in the included premium leather holster. The search for your daily necessity is over- the ideal flashlight with a concealed volt-thrashing stun gun, The Guard Dog Diablo II. A one-sided spark when test firing is normal. Both probes will spark upon contact. To test, place a sheet of paper across both probes to see both jumping simultaneously", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iHzMLJcLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AREJIBQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Guard Dog Security", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 47.19}}
{"item_id": "B00ARJR796", "title": "Black High Density Foam Roller", "description": "This foam roller will aid in stretching muscles. Use your own body weight to help increase blood flow and circulation to the soft tissues. Improve springiness and range of motion, and shrink pain and soreness. Use it to help heal aching muscles or as a tool for multiple exercises.The foam roller is made from high quality grade Expanded Polyethylene foam with 1.9 pound density. It will not loose its form, but also is the perfect firmness. Other foam rollers are made with inferior EVA or EPP foam which has a much lower density. Use it to help heal aching muscles or as a tool for multiple exercises.", "text": "Black High Density Foam Roller This foam roller will aid in stretching muscles. Use your own body weight to help increase blood flow and circulation to the soft tissues. Improve springiness and range of motion, and shrink pain and soreness. Use it to help heal aching muscles or as a tool for multiple exercises.The foam roller is made from high quality grade Expanded Polyethylene foam with 1.9 pound density. It will not loose its form, but also is the perfect firmness. Other foam rollers are made with inferior EVA or EPP foam which has a much lower density. Use it to help heal aching muscles or as a tool for multiple exercises.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41udj4CevTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ARJR796.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 18.75}}
{"item_id": "B00ARM39M2", "title": "Global Sportsman Tactical Combat Military Four 4 Separate Reticle 7 Brightness Settings Red Dot Tubeless Open Reflex Design Sight with Weaver-Picatinny Rail Base Mount", "description": "Official Product of Global Sportsman Tactical Gear. Combat Military Four 4 Separate Reticle 7 Brightness Settings Red Dot Tubeless Open Reflex Design Sight with Weaver-Picatinny Rail Base Mount. 4 Different Reticle Designs for every Tactical Solution. 7 Brightness Settings. Tubeless Design. 1x Magnification. Objective (mm)-24x34. Unlimited Eye Relief. Multi-Coated Lens. Black Finish. Windage & Elevation Adjustments. Weight-4.2oz. Length-3.25\". Wide Sharp Field of View. Weaver-Picatinny Rail BAse-Great For Rifles-Shotguns or Any Weapon with A Weaver-Picatinny Rail. Thermoplastic Lens Cover Included. Battery Included", "text": "Global Sportsman Tactical Combat Military Four 4 Separate Reticle 7 Brightness Settings Red Dot Tubeless Open Reflex Design Sight with Weaver-Picatinny Rail Base Mount Official Product of Global Sportsman Tactical Gear. Combat Military Four 4 Separate Reticle 7 Brightness Settings Red Dot Tubeless Open Reflex Design Sight with Weaver-Picatinny Rail Base Mount. 4 Different Reticle Designs for every Tactical Solution. 7 Brightness Settings. Tubeless Design. 1x Magnification. Objective (mm)-24x34. Unlimited Eye Relief. Multi-Coated Lens. Black Finish. Windage & Elevation Adjustments. Weight-4.2oz. Length-3.25\". Wide Sharp Field of View. Weaver-Picatinny Rail BAse-Great For Rifles-Shotguns or Any Weapon with A Weaver-Picatinny Rail. Thermoplastic Lens Cover Included. Battery Included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418gaGvUteL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ARM39M2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GS-Global Sportsman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B00ARWLKXC", "title": "Medium Arrow Rest Right and Left Hand - Black", "description": "Holds your arrow safely and securely, Light and Compact, Composite-encased biscuit, Reference marks for adjustment, Designed to use with left and right hand bows", "text": "Medium Arrow Rest Right and Left Hand - Black Holds your arrow safely and securely, Light and Compact, Composite-encased biscuit, Reference marks for adjustment, Designed to use with left and right hand bows", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QRTzV2yDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ARWLKXC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Rests"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AS3QNQO", "title": "MTECH USA XTREME Mx-8062Bk Fixed Blade Knife 12-Inch Overall", "description": "This MTech Extreme tactical knife measures a solid 12\" overall. The tanto style black 440 stainless steel reverse saw back blade was designed with strength and durability in mind. The black ABS molded handle offers an excellent grip and has a lanyard hole allowing you to be able to hang it from your neck. This very useful and versatile tactical knife is a great knife for anyone who spends time in the outdoors. This knife comes with a nylon sheath for easy transport.", "text": "MTECH USA XTREME Mx-8062Bk Fixed Blade Knife 12-Inch Overall This MTech Extreme tactical knife measures a solid 12\" overall. The tanto style black 440 stainless steel reverse saw back blade was designed with strength and durability in mind. The black ABS molded handle offers an excellent grip and has a lanyard hole allowing you to be able to hang it from your neck. This very useful and versatile tactical knife is a great knife for anyone who spends time in the outdoors. This knife comes with a nylon sheath for easy transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pcXcbi1sL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AS3QNQO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTECH USA XTREME", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AS47A92", "title": "1911 Pistol Grips .25\" Thickness - Honeycomb Punisher", "description": "Designed to frame the 1911, this simple grip will highlight the look of the 1911 instead of taking attention away from it. Grips feature Ambi and bottom pin cutouts as well as thumb grooving for added comfort. Specifications (Based on the JIS K6911 standard) - Thickness: 0.25\" (0.635cm) - Density: 1.42 - Water Absorption: 0.3% - Molded Shrinkage: 0.7%-1.25% - Heat Resistance:(2hr/'C): 200'C - Impact Strength: 3.0-3.5 Kgf-cm/cm2 - Flexible Strength: 9.5 Kgf/mm2 - Tensile Strength: 5.6 Kgf/mm2 - Compressive Strength: 22.0 Kgf/mm2 - Isolation Resistance: 1x5^(8-9)Ω (ohm) - Breakdown Voltage: 11.0Kv/mm", "text": "1911 Pistol Grips .25\" Thickness - Honeycomb Punisher Designed to frame the 1911, this simple grip will highlight the look of the 1911 instead of taking attention away from it. Grips feature Ambi and bottom pin cutouts as well as thumb grooving for added comfort. Specifications (Based on the JIS K6911 standard) - Thickness: 0.25\" (0.635cm) - Density: 1.42 - Water Absorption: 0.3% - Molded Shrinkage: 0.7%-1.25% - Heat Resistance:(2hr/'C): 200'C - Impact Strength: 3.0-3.5 Kgf-cm/cm2 - Flexible Strength: 9.5 Kgf/mm2 - Tensile Strength: 5.6 Kgf/mm2 - Compressive Strength: 22.0 Kgf/mm2 - Isolation Resistance: 1x5^(8-9)Ω (ohm) - Breakdown Voltage: 11.0Kv/mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41INvqePe9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AS47A92.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 36.99}}
