{"item_id": "B00AU67HZ0", "title": "Birchwood Casey Super Bright Pen Kit, Green/Red/White", "description": "Shoot better in any light. These pens provide a fast and easy way to touch-up chipped, dull or scratched sights. Super Bright Pens contain a fast-drying, lead-free paint with superior adhesion and durability. Use on front and/or rear sights for better sight visibility. Apply two layers of white undercoat, then neon green or red to make color even brighter. Brighter sights help to obtain a quicker sight picture. Great for rifles, pistols, shotguns and archery pins. Use like a parking pen with no mess - simply rub on with \"chisel point\" felt tip.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Super Bright Pen Kit, Green/Red/White Shoot better in any light. These pens provide a fast and easy way to touch-up chipped, dull or scratched sights. Super Bright Pens contain a fast-drying, lead-free paint with superior adhesion and durability. Use on front and/or rear sights for better sight visibility. Apply two layers of white undercoat, then neon green or red to make color even brighter. Brighter sights help to obtain a quicker sight picture. Great for rifles, pistols, shotguns and archery pins. Use like a parking pen with no mess - simply rub on with \"chisel point\" felt tip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LXOtUO4JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU67HZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 15.53}}
{"item_id": "B00AU67NEA", "title": "Bulldog Cases Tactical Shotgun Case, Black, 42-Inch", "description": "42\" Tactical Shotgun Case – Black INSIDE MEASUREMENT [Fits Guns Up to 40\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 8\" 1 3/4\" total soft padding Full-length, heavy-duty zipper with pull Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon, water-resistant outer shell Brushed Tricot, soft, scratch-resistant inner lining Two external pockets with elastic loops hold 12 extra shells.", "text": "Bulldog Cases Tactical Shotgun Case, Black, 42-Inch 42\" Tactical Shotgun Case – Black INSIDE MEASUREMENT [Fits Guns Up to 40\"] **We deduct 2\" to give room for the zipper** Height: 8\" 1 3/4\" total soft padding Full-length, heavy-duty zipper with pull Durable, extra heavy-duty Nylon, water-resistant outer shell Brushed Tricot, soft, scratch-resistant inner lining Two external pockets with elastic loops hold 12 extra shells.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21eBdZC5EXL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU67NEA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 16.74}}
