{"item_id": "B00AU699SI", "title": "Field Logic Youth Block GenZ Open Target", "description": "The BLOCK GenZ was designed specifically with the young archer in mind. It is intended for bows of 40 pounds of draw weight or less. The GenZ features the legendary open layered technology which allows easy arrow removal and longer target life no matter what kind of arrow tip the GenZ shooter is using. High contrast white-on-black aiming points offer great visibility, so your child can move from the larger aiming points to the smaller spots for a greater degree of difficulty and superior accuracy.", "text": "Field Logic Youth Block GenZ Open Target The BLOCK GenZ was designed specifically with the young archer in mind. It is intended for bows of 40 pounds of draw weight or less. The GenZ features the legendary open layered technology which allows easy arrow removal and longer target life no matter what kind of arrow tip the GenZ shooter is using. High contrast white-on-black aiming points offer great visibility, so your child can move from the larger aiming points to the smaller spots for a greater degree of difficulty and superior accuracy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XKXxMUXSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU699SI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Field Logic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6A3JW", "title": "Bulldog Cases \"Vertical\" Cell Phone Holster with Belt Loop and Clip fits Sub-Compact Sig Sauer P238, Black Nylon", "description": "Nylon Black Vertical Cell Phone Holster with Belt Loop & Clip Vinyl or heavy-duty Nylon outer shell Magnetic latches for easy open and close Belt loop and metal clip for easy carrying Conceals the weapon 100% 6\" x 4.75\" x 1\" Fits sub-compact \"vertical\".380 auto's (Sig P238).", "text": "Bulldog Cases \"Vertical\" Cell Phone Holster with Belt Loop and Clip fits Sub-Compact Sig Sauer P238, Black Nylon Nylon Black Vertical Cell Phone Holster with Belt Loop & Clip Vinyl or heavy-duty Nylon outer shell Magnetic latches for easy open and close Belt loop and metal clip for easy carrying Conceals the weapon 100% 6\" x 4.75\" x 1\" Fits sub-compact \"vertical\".380 auto's (Sig P238).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41k7lAiiRSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6A3JW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bulldog Cases", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 21.81}}
