{"item_id": "B00AU6ADRY", "title": "Benjamin 750-Count .177-Caliber Hollow Point Pellets", "description": "This is the perfect pellet for small game hunting. Enjoy greater impact and a consistent accuracy with these expanding pellets.", "text": "Benjamin 750-Count .177-Caliber Hollow Point Pellets This is the perfect pellet for small game hunting. Enjoy greater impact and a consistent accuracy with these expanding pellets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fWmXt5HGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6ADRY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6AIKG", "title": "Smith and Wesson M&P Sporter Range Bag, Black", "description": "Allen Company is proud to have co-developed the NEW Smith and Wesson product line to meet the needs of serious shooters and law enforcement. The designs are functional and the components are intended to withstand heavy use. Allen Company used 1200D Endure fabric for the gun cases and shooting bags and increased the specification of the 600D Endure fabric by 25% for the packs. As future products are developed, Allen Co will continue to consult serious users, military and police departments to make sure products the needs and expectations of hard-core users are being met.", "text": "Smith and Wesson M&P Sporter Range Bag, Black Allen Company is proud to have co-developed the NEW Smith and Wesson product line to meet the needs of serious shooters and law enforcement. The designs are functional and the components are intended to withstand heavy use. Allen Company used 1200D Endure fabric for the gun cases and shooting bags and increased the specification of the 600D Endure fabric by 25% for the packs. As future products are developed, Allen Co will continue to consult serious users, military and police departments to make sure products the needs and expectations of hard-core users are being met.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Umlkron8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6AIKG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 23.09}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6APV8", "title": "Ka-Bar 0-4062ZG-7 Dozier Folding", "description": "Bob Dozier has been hand-crafting knives for more than 50 years. The clean lines of his designs add aesthetic appeal to some very utilitarian cutting tools. In 2001 Bob teamed up with KA-BAR and his factory-made pieces have been a staple to the line ever since. The Kabar Dozier Folding Hunter Knife (in Zombie Green) is the perfect knife for any situation. Award-winning lock back designed by Bob Dozier is an affordable, practical all-purpose knife appropriate for daily tasks.", "text": "Ka-Bar 0-4062ZG-7 Dozier Folding Bob Dozier has been hand-crafting knives for more than 50 years. The clean lines of his designs add aesthetic appeal to some very utilitarian cutting tools. In 2001 Bob teamed up with KA-BAR and his factory-made pieces have been a staple to the line ever since. The Kabar Dozier Folding Hunter Knife (in Zombie Green) is the perfect knife for any situation. Award-winning lock back designed by Bob Dozier is an affordable, practical all-purpose knife appropriate for daily tasks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BIvQiSEBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6APV8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.98}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6AXN8", "title": "Spitfire Knife", "description": "Perfect for everyday use, the Spitfire Serrated knife from Buck Knives features easy one-hand opening and a lockback construction. While the 420HC blade offers excellent control and precision, you'll appreciate the sleek styling of the orange anodized aluminum handle. PRODUCT FEATURES: Blade Length: 3 1/4\" (8.3 cm) Blade Material: 420HC Carry System: Pocket Length Closed: 4 1/4\" (10.8 cm) Locking: Yes Weight: 3.2 oz. (91.1 g) 0722ORS1-B , buck knives Spitfire Knife , buck knives spirtfire knife , buck knives spit fire , Spitfire knife buck knives , Spitfire Knife buck knives , knives , knifes , knife , flip knives , flip knifes , serrated knives , serrated knifes , blades , cutting , pocket knifes , pocket knives , everyday knives , everyday knifes , every day knives , camping , hiking , fishing , backpacking , back packing , trekking", "text": "Spitfire Knife Perfect for everyday use, the Spitfire Serrated knife from Buck Knives features easy one-hand opening and a lockback construction. While the 420HC blade offers excellent control and precision, you'll appreciate the sleek styling of the orange anodized aluminum handle. PRODUCT FEATURES: Blade Length: 3 1/4\" (8.3 cm) Blade Material: 420HC Carry System: Pocket Length Closed: 4 1/4\" (10.8 cm) Locking: Yes Weight: 3.2 oz. (91.1 g) 0722ORS1-B , buck knives Spitfire Knife , buck knives spirtfire knife , buck knives spit fire , Spitfire knife buck knives , Spitfire Knife buck knives , knives , knifes , knife , flip knives , flip knifes , serrated knives , serrated knifes , blades , cutting , pocket knifes , pocket knives , everyday knives , everyday knifes , every day knives , camping , hiking , fishing , backpacking , back packing , trekking", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mG%2BnXGzpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6AXN8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 32.66}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6C7MI", "title": "Lyman Products E-ZEE Trim Hand Case Trimmer Rifle Set", "description": "The industry leader in trimming and case prep innovation, Lyman introduces a new case trimming system for the reloader interested in economy or preferring to have an individual precision hand system for each caliber. The E-ZEE TRIM case trimming system allows the user to trim cases by hand or with a power attachment (included) to precise pre-set length - no adjustment of measuring needed. The trimmer comes with a case locking device, cutter, trim-to-length pilot, cutter head and both hand and power trimming adapters. The trimmer works with any standard shell holder including Lyman, Redding, RCBS, Hornady & Lee Precision. Assembles in seconds and you are ready to trim cases. The E-ZEE TRIM system comes in three practical variations.", "text": "Lyman Products E-ZEE Trim Hand Case Trimmer Rifle Set The industry leader in trimming and case prep innovation, Lyman introduces a new case trimming system for the reloader interested in economy or preferring to have an individual precision hand system for each caliber. The E-ZEE TRIM case trimming system allows the user to trim cases by hand or with a power attachment (included) to precise pre-set length - no adjustment of measuring needed. The trimmer comes with a case locking device, cutter, trim-to-length pilot, cutter head and both hand and power trimming adapters. The trimmer works with any standard shell holder including Lyman, Redding, RCBS, Hornady & Lee Precision. Assembles in seconds and you are ready to trim cases. The E-ZEE TRIM system comes in three practical variations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZTrsWKy5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6C7MI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 23.36}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6C9JE", "title": "Lyman E-Zee Trim Hand Case Trimmer, Handgun Set 7821892", "description": "Lyman E-Zee Trim Hand Case Trimmer, Handgun Set 7821892", "text": "Lyman E-Zee Trim Hand Case Trimmer, Handgun Set 7821892 Lyman E-Zee Trim Hand Case Trimmer, Handgun Set 7821892", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31B95cnq3BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6C9JE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 27.34}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6CK20", "title": "Hornady Lock N Load Hot Tub for Sonic Cleaners", "description": "The Hornady Hot Tub takes sonic cleaning to a whole new level. Featuring a 9 liter capacity, the Hot Tub is long enough to accommodate and clean a 16 inch AR-15 upper. In addition to having 4 transducers there is also a heating element that enhances cleaning action, which is especially useful when cleaning gun parts. Combined with One Shot Sonic Clean solution, the microjet action of the Hornady Hot Tub removes carbon residue and other debris from cartridge cases, gun part and other metal equipment. Unlike traditional tumblers, sonic cleaners can clean internal and external surfaces of cartridge cases and primer pockets. One 1.7 quart inner tank comes with the unit and can be used in the main tank for cleaning smaller batches or to use separate solutions at the same time. Additional inner tanks can be purchases separately. Hanging cords have been integrated into the design to allow large objects to take full advantage of the ultrasonic energy. Additionally, the Hot Tub features integrated drain pans in the lids, a small parts basket, a degas function and 5 temperature settings from 100-140 degrees F.", "text": "Hornady Lock N Load Hot Tub for Sonic Cleaners The Hornady Hot Tub takes sonic cleaning to a whole new level. Featuring a 9 liter capacity, the Hot Tub is long enough to accommodate and clean a 16 inch AR-15 upper. In addition to having 4 transducers there is also a heating element that enhances cleaning action, which is especially useful when cleaning gun parts. Combined with One Shot Sonic Clean solution, the microjet action of the Hornady Hot Tub removes carbon residue and other debris from cartridge cases, gun part and other metal equipment. Unlike traditional tumblers, sonic cleaners can clean internal and external surfaces of cartridge cases and primer pockets. One 1.7 quart inner tank comes with the unit and can be used in the main tank for cleaning smaller batches or to use separate solutions at the same time. Additional inner tanks can be purchases separately. Hanging cords have been integrated into the design to allow large objects to take full advantage of the ultrasonic energy. Additionally, the Hot Tub features integrated drain pans in the lids, a small parts basket, a degas function and 5 temperature settings from 100-140 degrees F.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2Bk1LXyMoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6CK20.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornady", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 419.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6DAFG", "title": "Umarex 2254855 Steel Force .177-Caliber BB Air Pistol, Black Matte Finish", "description": "The Umarex 2254855 Steel Force .177-Caliber BB Air Pistol is a M4-stye BB machine perfect for recreational users. Designing, developing and marketing sport shooting products under the RWS, Walther, Hämmerli, Beretta, Colt, Smith & Wesson, HK, Ruger, Browning, Makarov, Tactical Force, Magnum Research, and Combat Zone brands. Umarex USA offers world-class products for multiple product categories including adult airguns and air rifles, BB and pellet pistols, air soft guns, specialized airgun optics, performance airgun ammunition, airgun accessories and tactical training paintball guns.", "text": "Umarex 2254855 Steel Force .177-Caliber BB Air Pistol, Black Matte Finish The Umarex 2254855 Steel Force .177-Caliber BB Air Pistol is a M4-stye BB machine perfect for recreational users. Designing, developing and marketing sport shooting products under the RWS, Walther, Hämmerli, Beretta, Colt, Smith & Wesson, HK, Ruger, Browning, Makarov, Tactical Force, Magnum Research, and Combat Zone brands. Umarex USA offers world-class products for multiple product categories including adult airguns and air rifles, BB and pellet pistols, air soft guns, specialized airgun optics, performance airgun ammunition, airgun accessories and tactical training paintball guns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Mbh9kB6XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6DAFG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Umarex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 108.97}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6DEB6", "title": "Rage Hypodermic Standard Broadhead, 100-Grain (Pack of 3)", "description": "Rage Hypodermic- More Information: Rage is changing the game again. Brand new for 2013, is the much anticipated Hypodermic. This aerodynamic, compact design is extremely tough and offers more penetration than any Rage broad head to date. The solid steel ferrule sports a brand new hybrid tip design, allowing the Hypodermic to have the aerodynamics and accuracy of a leading edge blade, coupled with the bone crushing performance of our chisel tip. Exclusive hybrid tip, Aerodynamic one-piece steel ferrule, Tough, Razor Sharp.035-Inch Stainless Steel Blades, Increased Penetration, Available in Standard and Deep Six models, Shock Collar ensures proper blade retention, Includes free practice head. 2 blade. 100 grain. 3/pack. Model 39100.", "text": "Rage Hypodermic Standard Broadhead, 100-Grain (Pack of 3) Rage Hypodermic- More Information: Rage is changing the game again. Brand new for 2013, is the much anticipated Hypodermic. This aerodynamic, compact design is extremely tough and offers more penetration than any Rage broad head to date. The solid steel ferrule sports a brand new hybrid tip design, allowing the Hypodermic to have the aerodynamics and accuracy of a leading edge blade, coupled with the bone crushing performance of our chisel tip. Exclusive hybrid tip, Aerodynamic one-piece steel ferrule, Tough, Razor Sharp.035-Inch Stainless Steel Blades, Increased Penetration, Available in Standard and Deep Six models, Shock Collar ensures proper blade retention, Includes free practice head. 2 blade. 100 grain. 3/pack. Model 39100.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HYHF09FyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6DEB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rage", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]], "price": 36.69}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6DJ7A", "title": "SOG MC04-N Machete Tanto 10 Inch Knife", "description": "The SOGfari 10'' machete is perfectly balanced in size and weight, for use in a variety of applications using the tanto blade or saw back. SOG's machetes are exciting additions to the SOG family. Its not should I have a machete but which size will work for me. Machetes are one of the more useful edged tools in the world. They have cleared brush and blazed trails, have chopped wood, made shelters, harvested crops, prepared meals, hunted and protected. Careful attention has been given to the SOGfari to make sure that the SOGight was right and the handles SOGre comfortable for extended use. Whip them through the air and hear them sing. SOG've added a real working saw on the back of the blades with teeth that cut deep. Extended out of the back of the handle is a spiked tang for pounding and scraping. There are even holes in the handle to mount lanyards. SOGfari. . . the go to tool for survival, exploration and adventure. Specifications: Product Type: Fixed Blade Finish: Hardcase Black Blade Shape Tanto Edge Type: Straight Blade Steel Type: 3Cr13 Hardness: Rc. 44-50 Overall Length: 16'' Product SOGight: 13. 50 oz Blade Length: 10'' Blade Thickness: 0. 08''.", "text": "SOG MC04-N Machete Tanto 10 Inch Knife The SOGfari 10'' machete is perfectly balanced in size and weight, for use in a variety of applications using the tanto blade or saw back. SOG's machetes are exciting additions to the SOG family. Its not should I have a machete but which size will work for me. Machetes are one of the more useful edged tools in the world. They have cleared brush and blazed trails, have chopped wood, made shelters, harvested crops, prepared meals, hunted and protected. Careful attention has been given to the SOGfari to make sure that the SOGight was right and the handles SOGre comfortable for extended use. Whip them through the air and hear them sing. SOG've added a real working saw on the back of the blades with teeth that cut deep. Extended out of the back of the handle is a spiked tang for pounding and scraping. There are even holes in the handle to mount lanyards. SOGfari. . . the go to tool for survival, exploration and adventure. Specifications: Product Type: Fixed Blade Finish: Hardcase Black Blade Shape Tanto Edge Type: Straight Blade Steel Type: 3Cr13 Hardness: Rc. 44-50 Overall Length: 16'' Product SOGight: 13. 50 oz Blade Length: 10'' Blade Thickness: 0. 08''.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318k4MKbr7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6DJ7A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 24.47}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6DQTQ", "title": "Moultrie D-444 Low Glow Game Camera", "description": "This 8.0MP camera delivers high-quality pictures and video, day or night. Invisible infrared flash captures footage of game up to 60 feet out without the risk of scaring off the animal. Time-lapse mode gives you the option to capture pictures at 15- and 30-second or one- to 60-second delays. FastFire shooting feature captures four pictures per second with a trigger speed of less than one second. The D-444 has 16:9 widescreen images and video. The barometric pressure, moon phase, temperature, time, date and camera ID can be stamped on every photo for added accuracy. Password protected for peace of mind. SD memory-card slot accepts up to 32GB card (not included). Runs on six C batteries (not included). Camo casing. This camera does not have motion freeze, like many other Moultrie cameras.", "text": "Moultrie D-444 Low Glow Game Camera This 8.0MP camera delivers high-quality pictures and video, day or night. Invisible infrared flash captures footage of game up to 60 feet out without the risk of scaring off the animal. Time-lapse mode gives you the option to capture pictures at 15- and 30-second or one- to 60-second delays. FastFire shooting feature captures four pictures per second with a trigger speed of less than one second. The D-444 has 16:9 widescreen images and video. The barometric pressure, moon phase, temperature, time, date and camera ID can be stamped on every photo for added accuracy. Password protected for peace of mind. SD memory-card slot accepts up to 32GB card (not included). Runs on six C batteries (not included). Camo casing. This camera does not have motion freeze, like many other Moultrie cameras.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51cBHLNQQTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6DQTQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moultrie", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6DV0K", "title": "Bushnell Team Primos The Truth ARC 4 x 20mm Bow Mode Laser Rangefinder", "description": "", "text": "Bushnell Team Primos The Truth ARC 4 x 20mm Bow Mode Laser Rangefinder", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51autsR1WXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6DV0K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 194.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6DY2A", "title": "Crimson Trace Defender Series DS-121 Accu-Guard", "description": "The DS-121 Defender Series Accu-Guard Laser Sight by Crimson Trace fits GLOCK Full-Size and Compact pistols. The Defender Series sets a new standard in laser sighting systems by providing cutting edge design, superior technology, and an affordable price tag. The DS-121 features Beam Lock Adjustments so that the user can easily adjust laser sighting for both windage and elevation, and the unit is pre-sighted at the factory at 50 ft. The Dual Side N-Gage Activation Buttons provide a large, easy-to-find, bright red activation button, which emits a powerful (5mW peak, 620-670nm, Class 3R) red aiming laser.FeaturesMaterial: Polymer. Attachment: Trigger Guard Attachment. Activation Location: Dual Side N-Gage Activation. Sighting: Factory Sighted at 50'. Battery Type: One 1/3N Lithium or Two 357 Silver Oxide Batteries. Laser Battery Life: Approx. Two Hours. Laser Output: 5mW Red Laser. Activation Mode: Switch Activated. Laser Visibility: Approx . 5 Inch Diameter at 50 Feet. Wrench Size: 0. 05. User Adjustable: Windage and Elevation. Installation: User Installed. Warranty: One Year Limited Warranty. Color: Black w/Red Activation Buttons. Dot Size: Approx. 0. 50\" at 50'.", "text": "Crimson Trace Defender Series DS-121 Accu-Guard The DS-121 Defender Series Accu-Guard Laser Sight by Crimson Trace fits GLOCK Full-Size and Compact pistols. The Defender Series sets a new standard in laser sighting systems by providing cutting edge design, superior technology, and an affordable price tag. The DS-121 features Beam Lock Adjustments so that the user can easily adjust laser sighting for both windage and elevation, and the unit is pre-sighted at the factory at 50 ft. The Dual Side N-Gage Activation Buttons provide a large, easy-to-find, bright red activation button, which emits a powerful (5mW peak, 620-670nm, Class 3R) red aiming laser.FeaturesMaterial: Polymer. Attachment: Trigger Guard Attachment. Activation Location: Dual Side N-Gage Activation. Sighting: Factory Sighted at 50'. Battery Type: One 1/3N Lithium or Two 357 Silver Oxide Batteries. Laser Battery Life: Approx. Two Hours. Laser Output: 5mW Red Laser. Activation Mode: Switch Activated. Laser Visibility: Approx . 5 Inch Diameter at 50 Feet. Wrench Size: 0. 05. User Adjustable: Windage and Elevation. Installation: User Installed. Warranty: One Year Limited Warranty. Color: Black w/Red Activation Buttons. Dot Size: Approx. 0. 50\" at 50'.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FyLNOAcvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6DY2A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6DY98", "title": "Moultrie M-990i No Glow Game Camera", "description": "This Game Spy Moultrie M-990i is a feature-rich game camera that includes No Glow technology that's undetectable to the eye to help get a true census without compromising image quality. It has a 70' night range, and its Motion Freeze technology will help reduce night-time blur. This Moultrie M-990i offers 4 operational modes, including: an IR triggered plot game camera, a time-lapse plot camera, plot camera by day/motion detect at night and day & night HD 720p video.", "text": "Moultrie M-990i No Glow Game Camera This Game Spy Moultrie M-990i is a feature-rich game camera that includes No Glow technology that's undetectable to the eye to help get a true census without compromising image quality. It has a 70' night range, and its Motion Freeze technology will help reduce night-time blur. This Moultrie M-990i offers 4 operational modes, including: an IR triggered plot game camera, a time-lapse plot camera, plot camera by day/motion detect at night and day & night HD 720p video.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51plxwMjLXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6DY98.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moultrie", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 154.48}}
