{"item_id": "B00AU6E6RC", "title": "Bushnell AR Optics First Strike HiRise Red Dot Riflescope with Riser Block", "description": "For handguns, shotguns or rifles, this compact model comes fully waterproof and shockproof, with self-regulating brightness. The pinnacle of red dot aiming solutions, with blazing fast target acquisition, peak accuracy and bright enough to hunt even the thickest woods. It's the most rugged, reliable partner you'll find when speed and accuracy are needed in a sight for your tactical firearm. The 5 MOA Red Dot features multi-coated optics to deliver the ultimate confidence boost in low light and it conserves battery life by self regulating brightness based on available light and power down when the protective storage hood is attached. Lightweight at only 2.1 ounces, the super-low-profile First Strike HiRise travels light on any tactical firearm, with an integral mount and riser block to position the sight at optimum height and attach easily to your AR-15 flat top.", "text": "Bushnell AR Optics First Strike HiRise Red Dot Riflescope with Riser Block For handguns, shotguns or rifles, this compact model comes fully waterproof and shockproof, with self-regulating brightness. The pinnacle of red dot aiming solutions, with blazing fast target acquisition, peak accuracy and bright enough to hunt even the thickest woods. It's the most rugged, reliable partner you'll find when speed and accuracy are needed in a sight for your tactical firearm. The 5 MOA Red Dot features multi-coated optics to deliver the ultimate confidence boost in low light and it conserves battery life by self regulating brightness based on available light and power down when the protective storage hood is attached. Lightweight at only 2.1 ounces, the super-low-profile First Strike HiRise travels light on any tactical firearm, with an integral mount and riser block to position the sight at optimum height and attach easily to your AR-15 flat top.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZyXHaToNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6E6RC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 94.0}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6E9HO", "title": "Viridian C5L-R Universal Sub-Compact Red Dot Laser Sight with Tactical Light, Black", "description": "The dim red dots of ordinary lasers can leave you vulnerable. The new Viridian C5L-R produces a red hue intensity no conventional laser can achieve, for explosively sharp, clear indoor and low light targeting no standard laser can match. Partnered with ECR instant activation, Radiance illumination, multiple modes, extended run time, precision fit and tight, lean profile, Elite Red technology raises red lasers to a whole new level.", "text": "Viridian C5L-R Universal Sub-Compact Red Dot Laser Sight with Tactical Light, Black The dim red dots of ordinary lasers can leave you vulnerable. The new Viridian C5L-R produces a red hue intensity no conventional laser can achieve, for explosively sharp, clear indoor and low light targeting no standard laser can match. Partnered with ECR instant activation, Radiance illumination, multiple modes, extended run time, precision fit and tight, lean profile, Elite Red technology raises red lasers to a whole new level.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AyvslClgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6E9HO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Viridian Green Laser Sights", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 147.02}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6EAWS", "title": "Wildlife Research Scent Killer Gold Spray Combo Pack, 44-Ounce", "description": "Wildlife Research Scent Killer Gold Spray with Hunt Dry Technology. Apply it, Dry it and Go Hunt. -Formulated for maximum performance after it dries so you don't have to hunt with wet clothing. With Hunt Dry technology you can spray it onto your clothing - hours, days, or weeks before you hunt.", "text": "Wildlife Research Scent Killer Gold Spray Combo Pack, 44-Ounce Wildlife Research Scent Killer Gold Spray with Hunt Dry Technology. Apply it, Dry it and Go Hunt. -Formulated for maximum performance after it dries so you don't have to hunt with wet clothing. With Hunt Dry technology you can spray it onto your clothing - hours, days, or weeks before you hunt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XIGNovSkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6EAWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wildlife Research", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Scents & Scent Eliminators", "Scent Eliminators"]], "price": 14.88}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6EB04", "title": "Bushnell AR Optics Zombie Assault 1x MP Red/Green T-Dot Reticle Riflescope", "description": "Bushnell AR Optics 1x MP Red/Green T-Dot Riflescope with Zombie Graphics features 5 brightness settings and brilliant, multi-coated optics to deliver the ultimate confidence boost in low light. The pinnacle of red dot aiming solutions and the most rugged, reliable partner you'll find when speed and accuracy are needed in a sight for your tactical firearm.", "text": "Bushnell AR Optics Zombie Assault 1x MP Red/Green T-Dot Reticle Riflescope Bushnell AR Optics 1x MP Red/Green T-Dot Riflescope with Zombie Graphics features 5 brightness settings and brilliant, multi-coated optics to deliver the ultimate confidence boost in low light. The pinnacle of red dot aiming solutions and the most rugged, reliable partner you'll find when speed and accuracy are needed in a sight for your tactical firearm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KL76zL9tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6EB04.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 178.52}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6ED8Y", "title": "Umarex Octane Air Rifle Combo, Gas Piston air rifle", "description": "Umarex Octane air rifle ReAxis gas-piston Breakbarrel Single-shot Rifled steel barrel with SilencAIR integral silencer 2-stage adj. trigger 3.50 lbs. trigger-pull Fiber-optic sights (fully adj. rear) Picatinny optics rail Automatic safety Ambi synthetic thumbhole stock 14.25 length of pull Rubber recoil pad Grooved (ribbed) grip 42 lbs. cocking effort 3-year warranty 9.50 lbs. Includes 3-9x40 AO scope (10 yds to infinity parallax adjustment, duplex reticle) and mount (scope is not mounted) Here are the benefits of the Umarex ReAxis gas-piston: Smoother cocking Smoother shooting No spring torque No spring fatigue, even if you leave it cocked for hours Functions perfectly in cold weather Lasts longer than a metal spring ... ...", "text": "Umarex Octane Air Rifle Combo, Gas Piston air rifle Umarex Octane air rifle ReAxis gas-piston Breakbarrel Single-shot Rifled steel barrel with SilencAIR integral silencer 2-stage adj. trigger 3.50 lbs. trigger-pull Fiber-optic sights (fully adj. rear) Picatinny optics rail Automatic safety Ambi synthetic thumbhole stock 14.25 length of pull Rubber recoil pad Grooved (ribbed) grip 42 lbs. cocking effort 3-year warranty 9.50 lbs. Includes 3-9x40 AO scope (10 yds to infinity parallax adjustment, duplex reticle) and mount (scope is not mounted) Here are the benefits of the Umarex ReAxis gas-piston: Smoother cocking Smoother shooting No spring torque No spring fatigue, even if you leave it cocked for hours Functions perfectly in cold weather Lasts longer than a metal spring ... ...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dqhn2wK0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6ED8Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6EEVU", "title": "Gamo 611009754 Whspr Fsn Pro Air", "description": "The Whisper Fusion Pro offers all-weather durability combined with maximum performance. Light weight synthetic stock, match grade fluted barrel and 1400 fps with PBA make the Whisper Fusion Pro perfect for small game hunting, targets and pest control. Fluted Polymer Jacketed Steel Barrel with WHISPER FUSION Double Integrated Noise Dampening Technology and 3-9x40 with adjustable objective scope. MECHANISM -Velocity: 1400 feet per second (fps) with PBA Platinum -33mm cylinder, high power plant -Single Shot -Break Barrel: Single Cocking System -Automatic Cocking Safety system -Barrel: Fluted Polymer Jacketed Steel with WHISPER FUSION Technology -Cocking Effort: 41 lbs. -Trigger: Two stage adjustable SAT (Smooth Action Trigger) -Manual Safety STOCK -Stock: Tough All Weather molded Synthetic -Butt Plate: SWA (Shock Wave Absorber) Recoil pad with up to 74% recoil absorption -Cheekpiece: Thin cheekpad molded on each side for both Right hand and Left hand shooters -Checkering: Non-Slip texture design on grip and forearm OPTICS -Scope Ramp: Raised Rail -Scope: 3-9x40 air rifle scope with adjustable objective. SPECIFICATIONS -Weight: 8.00 lbs. -Length: 43'' -Ammunition: Any.177 Pellet -Caliber:.177 -Trigger Pull: 3.74 lbs. -Barrel Length: 18 in.", "text": "Gamo 611009754 Whspr Fsn Pro Air The Whisper Fusion Pro offers all-weather durability combined with maximum performance. Light weight synthetic stock, match grade fluted barrel and 1400 fps with PBA make the Whisper Fusion Pro perfect for small game hunting, targets and pest control. Fluted Polymer Jacketed Steel Barrel with WHISPER FUSION Double Integrated Noise Dampening Technology and 3-9x40 with adjustable objective scope. MECHANISM -Velocity: 1400 feet per second (fps) with PBA Platinum -33mm cylinder, high power plant -Single Shot -Break Barrel: Single Cocking System -Automatic Cocking Safety system -Barrel: Fluted Polymer Jacketed Steel with WHISPER FUSION Technology -Cocking Effort: 41 lbs. -Trigger: Two stage adjustable SAT (Smooth Action Trigger) -Manual Safety STOCK -Stock: Tough All Weather molded Synthetic -Butt Plate: SWA (Shock Wave Absorber) Recoil pad with up to 74% recoil absorption -Cheekpiece: Thin cheekpad molded on each side for both Right hand and Left hand shooters -Checkering: Non-Slip texture design on grip and forearm OPTICS -Scope Ramp: Raised Rail -Scope: 3-9x40 air rifle scope with adjustable objective. SPECIFICATIONS -Weight: 8.00 lbs. -Length: 43'' -Ammunition: Any.177 Pellet -Caliber:.177 -Trigger Pull: 3.74 lbs. -Barrel Length: 18 in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jDIpKCWlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6EEVU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 260.95}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6EICA", "title": "Benjamin Marauder PCP Air Rifle, Synthetic Stock air rifle", "description": "Benjamin Marauder air rifle 10-shot repeater with auto-indexing feature (.25 cal is an 8-shot repeater) Uses compressed air: 2,000 to 3,000 psi (make adjustments as shown in the owner's manual) Can be adjusted for different velocities Internal shroud makes this a VERY quiet gun Choked barrel delivers superior accuracy 2-stage adjustable match trigger...and the trigger is metal! Raised aluminum breech for easier loading of circular magazine 11mm dovetail (does not come with sights) Ambidextrous synthetic stock with vertically adjustable comb (almost a full pound lighter than the wood-stocked rifle!) Built-in air pressure gauge (manometer) 215cc air reservoir 7.30 lbs. 42.8 long Air reservoir ends with a male quick-disconnect Foster fitting for fast refills (requires a female Foster quick-disconnect adapter to fill from a scuba tank or hand pump) Includes one magazine, sling swivel studs & degassing toolUpgrades from the original version of the gun: Factory-installed depinger changes the sharp ping to a dull thud. Improved valve (increases the number of shots: .177/.22=32 shots, .25=16 shots). Trigger moved back for better hand position. Optional reversible bolt for left- or right-handed shooters. Simplified the breech design for assembly, service and to provide a more stable platform for larger scopes.As the caliber increases, the gun becomes somewhat louder.... ...", "text": "Benjamin Marauder PCP Air Rifle, Synthetic Stock air rifle Benjamin Marauder air rifle 10-shot repeater with auto-indexing feature (.25 cal is an 8-shot repeater) Uses compressed air: 2,000 to 3,000 psi (make adjustments as shown in the owner's manual) Can be adjusted for different velocities Internal shroud makes this a VERY quiet gun Choked barrel delivers superior accuracy 2-stage adjustable match trigger...and the trigger is metal! Raised aluminum breech for easier loading of circular magazine 11mm dovetail (does not come with sights) Ambidextrous synthetic stock with vertically adjustable comb (almost a full pound lighter than the wood-stocked rifle!) Built-in air pressure gauge (manometer) 215cc air reservoir 7.30 lbs. 42.8 long Air reservoir ends with a male quick-disconnect Foster fitting for fast refills (requires a female Foster quick-disconnect adapter to fill from a scuba tank or hand pump) Includes one magazine, sling swivel studs & degassing toolUpgrades from the original version of the gun: Factory-installed depinger changes the sharp ping to a dull thud. Improved valve (increases the number of shots: .177/.22=32 shots, .25=16 shots). Trigger moved back for better hand position. Optional reversible bolt for left- or right-handed shooters. Simplified the breech design for assembly, service and to provide a more stable platform for larger scopes.As the caliber increases, the gun becomes somewhat louder.... ...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31szStR7kQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6EICA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6EIIY", "title": "Bushnell AR Optics FFP Illuminated BTR-1 BDC Reticle AR-223 Riflescope with Target Turrets and Throw Down PCL, 1-4x 24mm", "description": "", "text": "Bushnell AR Optics FFP Illuminated BTR-1 BDC Reticle AR-223 Riflescope with Target Turrets and Throw Down PCL, 1-4x 24mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JI98mz6rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6EIIY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 266.63}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6EILQ", "title": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Gloves for S&W Shield", "description": "Tactical Grip Glove for Smith & Wesson M& P Shield - \"Stretch to Fit \" Grip Gloves custom molded for each pistol. Delivers proven recoil reduction and enhanced control. They have the right shape and flexibility to make installation \"a snap\" - no trimming, tearing or hard work, just a perfect fit. Ventilated side panels and finger grooves provide more instinctive gun orientation, enhanced control and look more professional than older models.", "text": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Gloves for S&W Shield Tactical Grip Glove for Smith & Wesson M& P Shield - \"Stretch to Fit \" Grip Gloves custom molded for each pistol. Delivers proven recoil reduction and enhanced control. They have the right shape and flexibility to make installation \"a snap\" - no trimming, tearing or hard work, just a perfect fit. Ventilated side panels and finger grooves provide more instinctive gun orientation, enhanced control and look more professional than older models.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rfWy3kFeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6EILQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 12.11}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6EPQO", "title": "LimbSaver Magpul Precision Fit Recoil Pad", "description": "Controls Muzzle Jump-Reduces Felt Recoil-Improves Accuracy. New Dynamic precision fit Recoil pad for MagPul AR-15/Carbines. LimbSaver recoil pads are referred to as the best and are widely used by military personnel, law enforcement agencies and a variety of sportsmen. Reduces up to 70% of felt recoil and maintains target acquisition by reducing muzzle jump while supporting a solid shooting platform. Benefits: Easy Installation, Snag-Proof Design, Provides Quick Acquisition, Reduces up to 70% of Felt Recoil, Incorporates Anti-Muzzle Jump Technology, Provides Stable Shooting Platform. Black. 10025.", "text": "LimbSaver Magpul Precision Fit Recoil Pad Controls Muzzle Jump-Reduces Felt Recoil-Improves Accuracy. New Dynamic precision fit Recoil pad for MagPul AR-15/Carbines. LimbSaver recoil pads are referred to as the best and are widely used by military personnel, law enforcement agencies and a variety of sportsmen. Reduces up to 70% of felt recoil and maintains target acquisition by reducing muzzle jump while supporting a solid shooting platform. Benefits: Easy Installation, Snag-Proof Design, Provides Quick Acquisition, Reduces up to 70% of Felt Recoil, Incorporates Anti-Muzzle Jump Technology, Provides Stable Shooting Platform. Black. 10025.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pEV91lRQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6EPQO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Limbsaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 26.89}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6GG2U", "title": "Coleman Triton 2 Burner Propane Stove", "description": "The durable Tritan 2 Burner Stove by Coleman has powerful burners for great cooking performance and boils water very quickly allowing you to adjust the temp from a simmer to a boil. The large cooking area fits one 10-in. (25.4 cm) pan and one 12-in. (30.48 cm) pan and PerfectHeat™ Technology gets the temperatures just right. The WindBlock™ Shields keep the wind from blowing the flames and PerfectFlow™ Pressure Control System keeps the heat steady on each of the high-performance 11,000-BTU burners. The Tritan is also efficient, with a 1-hr. runtime on high using a single 16.4-oz. propane cylinder(sold separately). The Tritan performance stove features a slim, portable design and when the fun is done, removable heavy-duty, nickel-chrome grates make cleaning easy, and the built-in handle will have you carrying this lightweight stove effortlessly. Perfect for camping, hunting, tailgating and during emergencies.Independent, easily-adjustable controls range from simmer to boil.Durable steel construction withstands rugged cooking conditions.PerfectHeat™ Technology gets the temperatures just right.WindBlock™ Shields prevent the wind from blowing the flames around.PerfectFlow™ Pressure Control System keeps steady heat on each high-performance burner.1-hr. runtime on high using a single 16.4-oz. propane cylinder.Easy-to-clean removable heavy-duty, nickel-chrome grates.Built-in handle for easy, lightweight carrying.Optional griddle accessory packs away inside stove (sold separately).Folded dimensions: 21in x 13.5in x 4.25in.", "text": "Coleman Triton 2 Burner Propane Stove The durable Tritan 2 Burner Stove by Coleman has powerful burners for great cooking performance and boils water very quickly allowing you to adjust the temp from a simmer to a boil. The large cooking area fits one 10-in. (25.4 cm) pan and one 12-in. (30.48 cm) pan and PerfectHeat™ Technology gets the temperatures just right. The WindBlock™ Shields keep the wind from blowing the flames and PerfectFlow™ Pressure Control System keeps the heat steady on each of the high-performance 11,000-BTU burners. The Tritan is also efficient, with a 1-hr. runtime on high using a single 16.4-oz. propane cylinder(sold separately). The Tritan performance stove features a slim, portable design and when the fun is done, removable heavy-duty, nickel-chrome grates make cleaning easy, and the built-in handle will have you carrying this lightweight stove effortlessly. Perfect for camping, hunting, tailgating and during emergencies.Independent, easily-adjustable controls range from simmer to boil.Durable steel construction withstands rugged cooking conditions.PerfectHeat™ Technology gets the temperatures just right.WindBlock™ Shields prevent the wind from blowing the flames around.PerfectFlow™ Pressure Control System keeps steady heat on each high-performance burner.1-hr. runtime on high using a single 16.4-oz. propane cylinder.Easy-to-clean removable heavy-duty, nickel-chrome grates.Built-in handle for easy, lightweight carrying.Optional griddle accessory packs away inside stove (sold separately).Folded dimensions: 21in x 13.5in x 4.25in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41szvWj3LML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6GG2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 69.5}}
{"item_id": "B00AU6GHCY", "title": "Coleman 2000012034 InstaStart Triton Stove", "description": "Coleman, Insta-Start Triton Stove, 22,000 BTU, Fully Adjustable Burners With Instastart Matchless Lighting, Built In Handle On Underside For Increased Portability, Removable Grate Along With Aluminized Cook Top Allows For Quick & Easy Clean Up, Can Accommodate Up To One 12\" Pan & One 10\" Pan At The Same Time, Can Stow A Full Size Griddle, Not Included, Accessory Inside The Stove, Includes Windlock System & Stainless Steel Rust Resistant Burners.", "text": "Coleman 2000012034 InstaStart Triton Stove Coleman, Insta-Start Triton Stove, 22,000 BTU, Fully Adjustable Burners With Instastart Matchless Lighting, Built In Handle On Underside For Increased Portability, Removable Grate Along With Aluminized Cook Top Allows For Quick & Easy Clean Up, Can Accommodate Up To One 12\" Pan & One 10\" Pan At The Same Time, Can Stow A Full Size Griddle, Not Included, Accessory Inside The Stove, Includes Windlock System & Stainless Steel Rust Resistant Burners.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nTmYCvdNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AU6GHCY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 74.99}}
