{"item_id": "B00AV1ZS00", "title": "Signstek Wired Bicycle Computer With Speed, Distance, Temperature And Time Readings Display", "description": "Product FeaturesWired bicycle computer ideal for cyclists in trainingEasy to install - no tools requiredEasy-to-read, backlit LCD displayWeather-resistantVersatile 30 function bicycle computer, includes all vital bicycle function for novices and pros alikeCurrent speed, average speed, max speed, miles and kilometers per hour, speed and distanceOdometer, trip distance, trip timer, 12- and 24-hour clock, scanBacklight, temperature displaySelf-explanatory menu navigation with 3 language settings (DE/GB/FR)Suitable for child and adult bicycles from 12.5\" to 37.5\"Screen: LCDScreen Backlight: YesOdometer Recorded: YesCalorie Recorded: YesPackage Includes1 x Wired Bicycle Computer (1*3V battery CR2032 included)", "text": "Signstek Wired Bicycle Computer With Speed, Distance, Temperature And Time Readings Display Product FeaturesWired bicycle computer ideal for cyclists in trainingEasy to install - no tools requiredEasy-to-read, backlit LCD displayWeather-resistantVersatile 30 function bicycle computer, includes all vital bicycle function for novices and pros alikeCurrent speed, average speed, max speed, miles and kilometers per hour, speed and distanceOdometer, trip distance, trip timer, 12- and 24-hour clock, scanBacklight, temperature displaySelf-explanatory menu navigation with 3 language settings (DE/GB/FR)Suitable for child and adult bicycles from 12.5\" to 37.5\"Screen: LCDScreen Backlight: YesOdometer Recorded: YesCalorie Recorded: YesPackage Includes1 x Wired Bicycle Computer (1*3V battery CR2032 included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Wjmmcxb6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AV1ZS00.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 9.9}}
