{"item_id": "B00AVUH2Z0", "title": "Panteao Productions Make Ready with Paul Howe Combat Mindset Tactical DVD", "description": "Make Ready with Paul Howe: Combat Mindset is all about teaching you how defend yourself and others with the correct mental perspective. This is a must see video from Paul Howe who is a high-risk training instructor that served 20 years in the US Army.", "text": "Panteao Productions Make Ready with Paul Howe Combat Mindset Tactical DVD Make Ready with Paul Howe: Combat Mindset is all about teaching you how defend yourself and others with the correct mental perspective. This is a must see video from Paul Howe who is a high-risk training instructor that served 20 years in the US Army.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fk-tYJrPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AVUH2Z0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Panteao Productions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AVUJ0UU", "title": "Caldwell Bipod Pivot Lock", "description": "The Cadlwell Bipod Pivot Lock works on all XLA Pivot model bipods. It also fits most other brand bipods and includes a #10-32 threaded adapter for SAE threaded pivot model bipods. Easily adjust the tension of your pivot mount without tools.", "text": "Caldwell Bipod Pivot Lock The Cadlwell Bipod Pivot Lock works on all XLA Pivot model bipods. It also fits most other brand bipods and includes a #10-32 threaded adapter for SAE threaded pivot model bipods. Easily adjust the tension of your pivot mount without tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414CMTsuLjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AVUJ0UU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 12.19}}
{"item_id": "B00AVUJ26C", "title": "Frankford Arsenal Powder Trickler", "description": "The Frankford Arsenal Powder Trickler allows very small amounts of powder to be dispensed to achieve precise load weights. Dust/moisture covers protect powder while in the trickler. The Frankford Arsenal Powder Trickler is designed to work for all powder types, scales and supporting reloading equipment.", "text": "Frankford Arsenal Powder Trickler The Frankford Arsenal Powder Trickler allows very small amounts of powder to be dispensed to achieve precise load weights. Dust/moisture covers protect powder while in the trickler. The Frankford Arsenal Powder Trickler is designed to work for all powder types, scales and supporting reloading equipment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BJuu9eNNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AVUJ26C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford Arsenal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 24.73}}
