{"item_id": "B00AW5YFOK", "title": "Walkers EXT Range Shooting Folding Muff", "description": "January, 2013…Walker’s® Game Ear®, the shooting and hunting industry pioneer in hearing protection, introduces the new EXT Folding Range Shooting Muff with 34dB NRR and ANSI S3.19 Rated for extra hearing protection. Features padded headband and soft PVC Ear pads for comfortable fit. Ultra-light weight and compact folding design.", "text": "Walkers EXT Range Shooting Folding Muff January, 2013…Walker’s® Game Ear®, the shooting and hunting industry pioneer in hearing protection, introduces the new EXT Folding Range Shooting Muff with 34dB NRR and ANSI S3.19 Rated for extra hearing protection. Features padded headband and soft PVC Ear pads for comfortable fit. Ultra-light weight and compact folding design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413ZqTNETML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AW5YFOK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Walker&#39;s Game Ear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 17.92}}
