{"item_id": "B00AWHLTYM", "title": "USA GunClub Easy Use Gun Hanger Pack of 4 Original Handgun Hangers", "description": "This is a brand new handgun hanger. This Handgun Hangers enable suspension of handguns by their barrels beneath 5/8 to 1-inch-thick shelves in gun safes, kitchen cabinets, closets and bed frames, freeing up space atop. Normally handgun length must not exceed 10 inches, otherwise the door might not shut. They are suitable for .22-cal. and larger bore diameters, the vinyl coated rod ensure a tighten grip for mounting.", "text": "USA GunClub Easy Use Gun Hanger Pack of 4 Original Handgun Hangers This is a brand new handgun hanger. This Handgun Hangers enable suspension of handguns by their barrels beneath 5/8 to 1-inch-thick shelves in gun safes, kitchen cabinets, closets and bed frames, freeing up space atop. Normally handgun length must not exceed 10 inches, otherwise the door might not shut. They are suitable for .22-cal. and larger bore diameters, the vinyl coated rod ensure a tighten grip for mounting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5124zLegOyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AWHLTYM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AWRSMRE", "title": "Franklin Sports Deluxe Ball Maintenance Kit: Pump, Needles, and Pressure Gauge", "description": "The Ball Maintenance Kit from Franklin Sports offers everything you need to inflate your sport balls. This kit includes a 7.5\" inflating pump, flexible extension hose, 6 metal needles, pressure gauge and plastic carry case. Perfect addition to your game gear bag.", "text": "Franklin Sports Deluxe Ball Maintenance Kit: Pump, Needles, and Pressure Gauge The Ball Maintenance Kit from Franklin Sports offers everything you need to inflate your sport balls. This kit includes a 7.5\" inflating pump, flexible extension hose, 6 metal needles, pressure gauge and plastic carry case. Perfect addition to your game gear bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41R8XB7bVhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AWRSMRE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Inflation Devices & Accessories"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AWTD7HM", "title": "Tri-Fold Entrenching Tool (E-Tool), Genuine Military Issue, with Shovel Cover", "description": "Steel Blade with Aluminum Handle Genuine US Military Issue Black Powder-Coat Finish Tri-Fold Design Collapses for Easy Carry/Storage Sharpened Axe Edge, Serrated Saw Edge, comes with ODG Vinyl Cover", "text": "Tri-Fold Entrenching Tool (E-Tool), Genuine Military Issue, with Shovel Cover Steel Blade with Aluminum Handle Genuine US Military Issue Black Powder-Coat Finish Tri-Fold Design Collapses for Easy Carry/Storage Sharpened Axe Edge, Serrated Saw Edge, comes with ODG Vinyl Cover", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41seBAxfLXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AWTD7HM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Military issue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 48.99}}
{"item_id": "B00AWZI942", "title": "ArmaLaser TR10 SCCY CPX-Series Laser Sight, Black", "description": "The new TR10 for SCCY CPX-Series is the first and only laser available for this exciting and capable pistol.", "text": "ArmaLaser TR10 SCCY CPX-Series Laser Sight, Black The new TR10 for SCCY CPX-Series is the first and only laser available for this exciting and capable pistol.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51P-bW3%2B8lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AWZI942.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ArmaLaser", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 97.0}}
{"item_id": "B00AX2CV0C", "title": "Magblock 10 Round Limiter for Pmag 30 MOE Gen M2 (3 Pack)", "description": "The original Magblock 10/30 MCL (Magazine Capacity Limiter) for Magpul 30 round Pmags in .223/5.56mm. This block will replace the lower spring attachment point or locking plate and convert a 30 round magazine to hold only 10 rounds. The Pmag dust covers will still fit when loaded and magazines can be loaded with the bolt closed in most rifles. Does not affect reliability or magazine function. No increase in spring pressure which would reduce spring life. Compatible with original Pmags, Gen M2 Pmags, Magpul HK G36, and Magpul Emags. Can be adapted to fit other magazines. ***These will not work in Gen M3 Pmags.***", "text": "Magblock 10 Round Limiter for Pmag 30 MOE Gen M2 (3 Pack) The original Magblock 10/30 MCL (Magazine Capacity Limiter) for Magpul 30 round Pmags in .223/5.56mm. This block will replace the lower spring attachment point or locking plate and convert a 30 round magazine to hold only 10 rounds. The Pmag dust covers will still fit when loaded and magazines can be loaded with the bolt closed in most rifles. Does not affect reliability or magazine function. No increase in spring pressure which would reduce spring life. Compatible with original Pmags, Gen M2 Pmags, Magpul HK G36, and Magpul Emags. Can be adapted to fit other magazines. ***These will not work in Gen M3 Pmags.***", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LTtK6jOHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AX2CV0C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagazineBlocks.com", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 11.17}}
