{"item_id": "B00AZ7XVHM", "title": "TaylorMade Men's Rocketballz Stage 2 Rescue", "description": "The Taylor made rocketballz ribs stage 2 rescue features a new ultra-high strength rocket steel material which creates a thinner and faster flexing face. the improved speed pocket design allows for faster flexing to promote faster ball speed and more distance. the lower and more forward cg promotes faster ball speed, high launch and low spin. faster and longer than original rocketballz rescues ultra-high strength tailor-made rocket steel supplied by carpenter creates a thinner and faster-flexing face. improved speed pocket design flexes faster to promote faster ball speed and more distance. lower and more-forward cg location promotes faster ball speed, high launch and low spin. black clubface, non-glare white crown and new crown graphic all promote easy alignment. lightweight 65-gram graphite shaft promotes fast swing speed.", "text": "TaylorMade Men's Rocketballz Stage 2 Rescue The Taylor made rocketballz ribs stage 2 rescue features a new ultra-high strength rocket steel material which creates a thinner and faster flexing face. the improved speed pocket design allows for faster flexing to promote faster ball speed and more distance. the lower and more forward cg promotes faster ball speed, high launch and low spin. faster and longer than original rocketballz rescues ultra-high strength tailor-made rocket steel supplied by carpenter creates a thinner and faster-flexing face. improved speed pocket design flexes faster to promote faster ball speed and more distance. lower and more-forward cg location promotes faster ball speed, high launch and low spin. black clubface, non-glare white crown and new crown graphic all promote easy alignment. lightweight 65-gram graphite shaft promotes fast swing speed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kTMcYLbYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AZ7XVHM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TaylorMade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Clubs", "Hybrid Clubs"]], "price": 99.98}}
{"item_id": "B00AZ9ZECA", "title": "MIR Weight Lifting Dip Belt with chain", "description": "MIR Weight Lifting DIP Belt is made to work out every muscle in your upper body. This includes triceps, biceps, and your chest. Use this dip belt for dips, chin ups, and pull ups. Attach any weight desired to your dips .The dip belt is designed to hold up to 500lbs. Its sleek design helps the dip belt contour to your body while widening in the back to offer back support. The dip belt is designed like this to make sure you have full control of the weights, eliminating any chances of discomfort or swaying of the weights when in use. The metal chain and safety clip hook offers maximum security when weights are loaded and will not snap or break. This dip belt is a great alternative from our MIR Champion Weight belt. Get the work out you need with the quality you can trust with MIR.", "text": "MIR Weight Lifting Dip Belt with chain MIR Weight Lifting DIP Belt is made to work out every muscle in your upper body. This includes triceps, biceps, and your chest. Use this dip belt for dips, chin ups, and pull ups. Attach any weight desired to your dips .The dip belt is designed to hold up to 500lbs. Its sleek design helps the dip belt contour to your body while widening in the back to offer back support. The dip belt is designed like this to make sure you have full control of the weights, eliminating any chances of discomfort or swaying of the weights when in use. The metal chain and safety clip hook offers maximum security when weights are loaded and will not snap or break. This dip belt is a great alternative from our MIR Champion Weight belt. Get the work out you need with the quality you can trust with MIR.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Nx%2BL1f9DL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AZ9ZECA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dip Stands"]], "price": 19.95}}
