{"item_id": "B00AZPWV7K", "title": "ProSource Abdominal Ab Exercise Mat Core Trainer - High Density", "description": "ProSource abs mat is specifically designed to give you the ultimate and most effective abdominal workout. You will be able to target and isolate upper abs, lower abs, oblique's and even the lower back muscles. One size fits all. No matter if you are a beginner or pro, you can use ProSource Abs Mat. Lightweight, just over one pound, makes it easy to store or travel with. Perfect for Home, Office, Gym, Crossfit, MMA, Boxing and for other types of training that requires a stronger abdominal core.", "text": "ProSource Abdominal Ab Exercise Mat Core Trainer - High Density ProSource abs mat is specifically designed to give you the ultimate and most effective abdominal workout. You will be able to target and isolate upper abs, lower abs, oblique's and even the lower back muscles. One size fits all. No matter if you are a beginner or pro, you can use ProSource Abs Mat. Lightweight, just over one pound, makes it easy to store or travel with. Perfect for Home, Office, Gym, Crossfit, MMA, Boxing and for other types of training that requires a stronger abdominal core.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GW%2Br%2B4OhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AZPWV7K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProSource Discounts, Inc.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 15.58}}
{"item_id": "B00AZVMS2C", "title": "MSR Piezo Igniter", "description": "MSR's Piezo Igniter reliably lights most canister stoves with push-button convenience. The Piezo Ignitor's element is housed in a protective metal tube that also collects fuel vapor for more reliable ignition. Works with most canister stoves except MSR's Reactor Stove systems or other radient burners. Wt. .5 oz.", "text": "MSR Piezo Igniter MSR's Piezo Igniter reliably lights most canister stoves with push-button convenience. The Piezo Ignitor's element is housed in a protective metal tube that also collects fuel vapor for more reliable ignition. Works with most canister stoves except MSR's Reactor Stove systems or other radient burners. Wt. .5 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PDMEudqwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00AZVMS2C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B00B04CCU6", "title": "Custom Slide Cover Plates for Glock pistols - many designs to choose", "description": "Make a statement on your Glock with our Custom Slide Cover Plates for Glock. Machined in the USA from aircraft-grade aluminum bar stock and much stronger than the original plastic. Select your favorite from the drop-down menu above. $19.99 each.", "text": "Custom Slide Cover Plates for Glock pistols - many designs to choose Make a statement on your Glock with our Custom Slide Cover Plates for Glock. Machined in the USA from aircraft-grade aluminum bar stock and much stronger than the original plastic. Select your favorite from the drop-down menu above. $19.99 each.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dHS1paeWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B04CCU6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B07MU7S", "title": "TSSS® Patented Product,Waterproof bicycle taillights rearlight-Blue,2 Years Warranty", "description": "All products from TSSS are manufactured following the same quality standard as the original manufacturer. Every piece is tested to ensure high reliability and performance. TSSS stands behind every product to provide excellent customer service.As to the city roads become more and more complex,along with the bicycle enthusiasts quantity is daily up, safely riding is concerned by the peole who are busy working during the day and riding at night. So our low carbon,pro-environment, rechargeale and water-proof tail light which just like a diamond is born.With more promotion on the design and practicability,it inproves the dim field of vision.There are not only 8 high brightness LED lights to complete 3 shining ways,but also 2 laser lights at a 120 degree angle project two parallel lanes to increase the safety in rain and fog weather.And it has isolated charger and natual reflective lampshade,longer continuous working hours,these can double insure you riding safely.Variety:bicycle laser taillights;super bright;super amazing;realiable qualityShell color:red,blue,green,white,other colors can be customizedPower Supply:Input 100-240VAC 50/60Hz 0.15A Output 4.2VDC-500mABattery:14500 rechargeable battery capativy 1200mAh,voltage of 3.7VWorking time:6 hours of continuous workLaser color:6585nm(red)Laser power:5mwDimensions:L83*W68*H45mmWeight:0.06kgEnjoy your time with TSSS.Want a reliable bicycle light? see:http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0084BRQ36", "text": "TSSS® Patented Product,Waterproof bicycle taillights rearlight-Blue,2 Years Warranty All products from TSSS are manufactured following the same quality standard as the original manufacturer. Every piece is tested to ensure high reliability and performance. TSSS stands behind every product to provide excellent customer service.As to the city roads become more and more complex,along with the bicycle enthusiasts quantity is daily up, safely riding is concerned by the peole who are busy working during the day and riding at night. So our low carbon,pro-environment, rechargeale and water-proof tail light which just like a diamond is born.With more promotion on the design and practicability,it inproves the dim field of vision.There are not only 8 high brightness LED lights to complete 3 shining ways,but also 2 laser lights at a 120 degree angle project two parallel lanes to increase the safety in rain and fog weather.And it has isolated charger and natual reflective lampshade,longer continuous working hours,these can double insure you riding safely.Variety:bicycle laser taillights;super bright;super amazing;realiable qualityShell color:red,blue,green,white,other colors can be customizedPower Supply:Input 100-240VAC 50/60Hz 0.15A Output 4.2VDC-500mABattery:14500 rechargeable battery capativy 1200mAh,voltage of 3.7VWorking time:6 hours of continuous workLaser color:6585nm(red)Laser power:5mwDimensions:L83*W68*H45mmWeight:0.06kgEnjoy your time with TSSS.Want a reliable bicycle light? see:http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0084BRQ36", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xTLIo60yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B07MU7S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00B0AMFA2", "title": "ZITRADES 3pcs Emergency Hiking Camping Survival Aluminum Whistle Key Chain With Red/Green/Blue Color BY ZITRADES", "description": "Features:1.Assorted colors available2.Loud whistle, great for sporting events, camping & hiking,boating.3.Length:6cm 2.36\"4.Material:AluminumDescription:1.Loud whistle can be heard for far distance2.Looks like little item,but potentially important one, this Emergency Whistle & Keychain could be a life-saver.3.This tool is ideal for camping, boating, fishing, hiking and other outdoor activities4.Brightly colored easy to find it when you need it.5.Key ring for attachment to a lanyard or keys.Note: Colors send random!Package content:3 x Aluminum Whistle（Colors send random!）", "text": "ZITRADES 3pcs Emergency Hiking Camping Survival Aluminum Whistle Key Chain With Red/Green/Blue Color BY ZITRADES Features:1.Assorted colors available2.Loud whistle, great for sporting events, camping & hiking,boating.3.Length:6cm 2.36\"4.Material:AluminumDescription:1.Loud whistle can be heard for far distance2.Looks like little item,but potentially important one, this Emergency Whistle & Keychain could be a life-saver.3.This tool is ideal for camping, boating, fishing, hiking and other outdoor activities4.Brightly colored easy to find it when you need it.5.Key ring for attachment to a lanyard or keys.Note: Colors send random!Package content:3 x Aluminum Whistle（Colors send random!）", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2Bfs7mrmWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0AMFA2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 8.0}}
{"item_id": "B00B0BD3W0", "title": "Gerber 31-001880 Impromptu Tactical Pen, Black", "description": "Danger has a way of presenting itself when you least expect it. That’s why Gerber, in collaboration with law enforcement professionals, developed the Impromptu Tactical Pen. Sure, it’s a pen and it’ll serve to take notes like a good pen should, but it’s not your average writing implement. Made from machined steel with a tempered window-shattering tip design, the Impromptu Tactical Pen can be used to break a windshield or defend yourself from an unexpected attack.", "text": "Gerber 31-001880 Impromptu Tactical Pen, Black Danger has a way of presenting itself when you least expect it. That’s why Gerber, in collaboration with law enforcement professionals, developed the Impromptu Tactical Pen. Sure, it’s a pen and it’ll serve to take notes like a good pen should, but it’s not your average writing implement. Made from machined steel with a tempered window-shattering tip design, the Impromptu Tactical Pen can be used to break a windshield or defend yourself from an unexpected attack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21xJVCMVZIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0BD3W0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 41.95}}
{"item_id": "B00B0E1MB6", "title": "Benchmade Bushcrafter Knife", "description": "For two decades Benchmade has been committed to designing and manufacturing world-class sports cutlery and edged tools. We continually strive to manufacture high quality products that will deliver superior performance and provide great value for our customers. Whether you are using a Griptilian as a basic cutting tool or one of our professional grade rescue hooks to perform a quick cut in an emergency situation, you can count on your Benchmade to get the job done.", "text": "Benchmade Bushcrafter Knife For two decades Benchmade has been committed to designing and manufacturing world-class sports cutlery and edged tools. We continually strive to manufacture high quality products that will deliver superior performance and provide great value for our customers. Whether you are using a Griptilian as a basic cutting tool or one of our professional grade rescue hooks to perform a quick cut in an emergency situation, you can count on your Benchmade to get the job done.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4162zO5yKJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0E1MB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Benchmade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 154.71}}
