{"item_id": "B00B0GCZ3I", "title": "PK80 - 80cc 2-Cycle Bike Engine Motor Kit with Angle Fire Slant Head for High Performance Bicycle", "description": "This bicycle motor engine kit comes with everything that you'll need except gas and oil! You will be able to stop or start the engine as you ride. There is no rope pulling needed and it gives more speed and gets around 150 miles on a gallon of gas. We cannot ship any 2-stroke Bicycle Motors or Bike Engine Kits to California due to CARB regulations.", "text": "PK80 - 80cc 2-Cycle Bike Engine Motor Kit with Angle Fire Slant Head for High Performance Bicycle This bicycle motor engine kit comes with everything that you'll need except gas and oil! You will be able to stop or start the engine as you ride. There is no rope pulling needed and it gives more speed and gets around 150 miles on a gallon of gas. We cannot ship any 2-stroke Bicycle Motors or Bike Engine Kits to California due to CARB regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51irmZLfOtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0GCZ3I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unknown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 171.98}}
{"item_id": "B00B0HHG8Q", "title": "Outbags OB-02SC Nylon OWB Belt Gun Holster with Mag Pouch for Ruger LC9, Bersa Thunder 380, Beretta 81 / 84 / 85F, Kahr CW9, Walther P22 Compact, Kel-Tec PF-9, Makarov FEG PA-63, Diamondback DB9, CZ-USA CZ 83 and More", "description": "The SC Style holster is a fully loaded holster for revolvers and automatics. Available for left and right handed users, the SC Style is the only holster in the Outbags line that comes standard with a magazine pouch. While keeping your weapon secure, the Thumb Break also eliminates delay when drawing the firearm. This holster also has a removable Belt Clip for mounting to waistband or belt. Additionally, the Belt Loop allows for a more permanent and secure mount to the belt. The Webbed Spine ensures a snug and personalized fit. Firearm not included. Recommended fit for: American Arms PK22 / EP380, Beretta 81 / 82 / 84 / 85 / 87, Bersa Thunder 22LR, Bersa Thunder 380, Bersa Thunder 83, Bersa Thunder 85, Browning 1910 / BDA 380, Colt Mk IV, CZ-U CZ75 / CZ83, E18 Diamondback DB9, Jiminez JA-22, Kahr CM9 / CM40 / SW9, Kahr MK9 / MK40 / MK45, Kahr PM9 / PM40 / PM45, Kel-Tec P3AT 380 / PF9 / P11, Kimber ULT Carry II 3\", Makarov FEG PA63 / PA64 / R61 / 9x18 / 380, Pheonix Arms HP22 3\", Polish P-64, Ruger LC9 / LC380, Sig Sauer 230, 232,", "text": "Outbags OB-02SC Nylon OWB Belt Gun Holster with Mag Pouch for Ruger LC9, Bersa Thunder 380, Beretta 81 / 84 / 85F, Kahr CW9, Walther P22 Compact, Kel-Tec PF-9, Makarov FEG PA-63, Diamondback DB9, CZ-USA CZ 83 and More The SC Style holster is a fully loaded holster for revolvers and automatics. Available for left and right handed users, the SC Style is the only holster in the Outbags line that comes standard with a magazine pouch. While keeping your weapon secure, the Thumb Break also eliminates delay when drawing the firearm. This holster also has a removable Belt Clip for mounting to waistband or belt. Additionally, the Belt Loop allows for a more permanent and secure mount to the belt. The Webbed Spine ensures a snug and personalized fit. Firearm not included. Recommended fit for: American Arms PK22 / EP380, Beretta 81 / 82 / 84 / 85 / 87, Bersa Thunder 22LR, Bersa Thunder 380, Bersa Thunder 83, Bersa Thunder 85, Browning 1910 / BDA 380, Colt Mk IV, CZ-U CZ75 / CZ83, E18 Diamondback DB9, Jiminez JA-22, Kahr CM9 / CM40 / SW9, Kahr MK9 / MK40 / MK45, Kahr PM9 / PM40 / PM45, Kel-Tec P3AT 380 / PF9 / P11, Kimber ULT Carry II 3\", Makarov FEG PA63 / PA64 / R61 / 9x18 / 380, Pheonix Arms HP22 3\", Polish P-64, Ruger LC9 / LC380, Sig Sauer 230, 232,", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418zlhd7oDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0HHG8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B0I2DBK", "title": "Gerber 31-002070 Bear Grylls Survival Hatchet with Nylon Sheath", "description": "Making a fire or building a shelter can be life saving parts of a survival experience. With a slim profile and full tang construction, the Survival Hatchet is just the right size for survival situations. The grippy rubber handle ensures it won’t slip, even when wet. Includes a durable nylon sheath to keep the razor sharp blade safe when not in use.", "text": "Gerber 31-002070 Bear Grylls Survival Hatchet with Nylon Sheath Making a fire or building a shelter can be life saving parts of a survival experience. With a slim profile and full tang construction, the Survival Hatchet is just the right size for survival situations. The grippy rubber handle ensures it won’t slip, even when wet. Includes a durable nylon sheath to keep the razor sharp blade safe when not in use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oH6EfPrjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0I2DBK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Axes"]], "price": 32.18}}
{"item_id": "B00B0I2W20", "title": "Gerber 31-001777 Bear Grylls Compact Compass", "description": "You won’t always know where you’re at, but with the Compact Compass you can know what direction you’re heading. Small and lightweight, this compass comes in a durable housing with an attached lanyard that makes it easy to take it with you wherever you go.", "text": "Gerber 31-001777 Bear Grylls Compact Compass You won’t always know where you’re at, but with the Compact Compass you can know what direction you’re heading. Small and lightweight, this compass comes in a durable housing with an attached lanyard that makes it easy to take it with you wherever you go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bk0B2KwHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0I2W20.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Compasses"]], "price": 12.49}}
{"item_id": "B00B0I7T00", "title": "Gerber 31-001790 Bear Grylls Survival Poncho", "description": "A key element to surviving in the wild is to stay dry; the new Survival Poncho does just that. Bright orange with a large hood and BG logo on the chest, this lightweight, one size fits all poncho is a key component of any outdoors adventure. Comes with a reusable pouch that can be used as a water capturing device if necessary.", "text": "Gerber 31-001790 Bear Grylls Survival Poncho A key element to surviving in the wild is to stay dry; the new Survival Poncho does just that. Bright orange with a large hood and BG logo on the chest, this lightweight, one size fits all poncho is a key component of any outdoors adventure. Comes with a reusable pouch that can be used as a water capturing device if necessary.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DuaEWNO%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0I7T00.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Souvenirs", "Hard Hats"]], "price": 5.9}}
{"item_id": "B00B0I8WEC", "title": "Gerber Propel AO Knife - Serrated Edge - Black G-10", "description": "An all-purpose tactical knife needs to feel familiar and capable, like a well-worn tool, yet still offer quick action and hold up to long-term use. Drawing on critical feedback from military and law enforcement personnel plus its decades of knife design experience, Gerber set out to design a full-size, assisted-opening knife that�s as easy to handle and carry as it is durable and capable. The Gerber Propel AO knife is this knife. It�s a full-size tactical knife with a slim handle profile that fits comfortably in your pocket and hand.", "text": "Gerber Propel AO Knife - Serrated Edge - Black G-10 An all-purpose tactical knife needs to feel familiar and capable, like a well-worn tool, yet still offer quick action and hold up to long-term use. Drawing on critical feedback from military and law enforcement personnel plus its decades of knife design experience, Gerber set out to design a full-size, assisted-opening knife that�s as easy to handle and carry as it is durable and capable. The Gerber Propel AO knife is this knife. It�s a full-size tactical knife with a slim handle profile that fits comfortably in your pocket and hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uXkiqEEBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0I8WEC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tactical Vests"]], "price": 74.25}}
