{"item_id": "B00B0MX3J2", "title": "SE - Compression Sack - TP111CB", "description": "Whether you need a Gear sack for your sleeping bag or for storing other items in your pack, the high quality Outdoor Compression Sleeping Bag Gear Sack will perform to the highest standards, time and time again, on all your treks. Each comes equipped with a ? 3pc Buckle Straps? Dust Flap? End Carrying Strap? Grey Color? Color Sleeve ? Nylon Material ? Dimensions: 23 x 18-3/4 Dia.", "text": "SE - Compression Sack - TP111CB Whether you need a Gear sack for your sleeping bag or for storing other items in your pack, the high quality Outdoor Compression Sleeping Bag Gear Sack will perform to the highest standards, time and time again, on all your treks. Each comes equipped with a ? 3pc Buckle Straps? Dust Flap? End Carrying Strap? Grey Color? Color Sleeve ? Nylon Material ? Dimensions: 23 x 18-3/4 Dia.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mE-2QlApL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0MX3J2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Compression Sacks"]]}}
