{"item_id": "B00B0SVFNC", "title": "Enjoydeal 12 Gauge Red Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresight", "description": "Features:100% Brand New and High QualityThe Product is precisely engineered to fit into the chamber, ensuring exact and consistent laser alignment with the bore. Save time, money and frustration.Convenient, accurate and easy.Perfect for hunters, competitive/recreational shooters and law enforcement.Easy to use.Improves accuracy.Reduces ammo waste.Compact, lightweight and durable.How to use:Turn on the bore sight by turning bottom of bore sighter clockwise.Load the laser into the chamber as if it was a normal round.Place the dot on a target downrange.Align your sights cross hairs or dot with the projected spot. From there, you can adjust your scope or sights without ever wasting ammo!Turn off bore sighter by turning bottom of unit counter clockwise until dot no longer appears, or take out batteries completely for longest battery life.Specifications:Color: RedWave Length: 635-655nmBattery: 3x AG13 Button cell batteries(or equivalent)(Included )Battery Life: 1 hour maximumRange for Sighting: 15-100 yardsBest Range for Sighting: 20-30 yardsOperation: On/Off End CapConstruction: BrassPower: Less than 5mWItem Size:6.1 x 1.9cm(L x D)Weight :32gItem Included:1x 12 Gauge Red Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter", "text": "Enjoydeal 12 Gauge Red Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresight Features:100% Brand New and High QualityThe Product is precisely engineered to fit into the chamber, ensuring exact and consistent laser alignment with the bore. Save time, money and frustration.Convenient, accurate and easy.Perfect for hunters, competitive/recreational shooters and law enforcement.Easy to use.Improves accuracy.Reduces ammo waste.Compact, lightweight and durable.How to use:Turn on the bore sight by turning bottom of bore sighter clockwise.Load the laser into the chamber as if it was a normal round.Place the dot on a target downrange.Align your sights cross hairs or dot with the projected spot. From there, you can adjust your scope or sights without ever wasting ammo!Turn off bore sighter by turning bottom of unit counter clockwise until dot no longer appears, or take out batteries completely for longest battery life.Specifications:Color: RedWave Length: 635-655nmBattery: 3x AG13 Button cell batteries(or equivalent)(Included )Battery Life: 1 hour maximumRange for Sighting: 15-100 yardsBest Range for Sighting: 20-30 yardsOperation: On/Off End CapConstruction: BrassPower: Less than 5mWItem Size:6.1 x 1.9cm(L x D)Weight :32gItem Included:1x 12 Gauge Red Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OcADLF6WL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0SVFNC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Enjoydeal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 10.92}}
{"item_id": "B00B0Y7D6O", "title": "5 LED Safety Bicycle Rear Tail Light 7 Flashing Models", "description": "The rear 5-LED flashing safety light will alert motorists of your presence on the roadSuper bright red LED's and light weight7 different modes for you to chooseMount clip includedPowered by 2AAA batteries1.Brand New 5 LED 7 Mode Bicycle Safety Rear Light 2.Increase more safety in the morning or evening, even in cloudy or raining day 3.Suitable for fixing on the bicycle to assure safety 4.Light bracket is available to clip on your bicycle 5.Quick release bracket is available to clip on your bicycle 6.With belt clip at the back for joggers", "text": "5 LED Safety Bicycle Rear Tail Light 7 Flashing Models The rear 5-LED flashing safety light will alert motorists of your presence on the roadSuper bright red LED's and light weight7 different modes for you to chooseMount clip includedPowered by 2AAA batteries1.Brand New 5 LED 7 Mode Bicycle Safety Rear Light 2.Increase more safety in the morning or evening, even in cloudy or raining day 3.Suitable for fixing on the bicycle to assure safety 4.Light bracket is available to clip on your bicycle 5.Quick release bracket is available to clip on your bicycle 6.With belt clip at the back for joggers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iRpCsedKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B0Y7D6O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AAA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 1.89}}
{"item_id": "B00B110UKM", "title": "Coleman Standard Tie Mantles Pack of 2 - 4 pack mantles (Total 8 mantles)", "description": "Keep your lantern burning brightly with the Coleman Standard Tie Mantle.", "text": "Coleman Standard Tie Mantles Pack of 2 - 4 pack mantles (Total 8 mantles) Keep your lantern burning brightly with the Coleman Standard Tie Mantle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519MMskL0mL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B110UKM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 11.75}}
{"item_id": "B00B11MTM4", "title": "Aqua Sphere K180 Micro Swim Goggle", "description": "The new K180 swimming goggle from Aqua Sphere is a fantastic training goggle with a hydrodynamic shape, asymmetric lens with 180 degree wider field of vision and interchangeable nose bridges to achieve a perfect fit. This swim training goggles has an ultra-soft gasket for comfort and is a stable swim goggle for performance swimming.", "text": "Aqua Sphere K180 Micro Swim Goggle The new K180 swimming goggle from Aqua Sphere is a fantastic training goggle with a hydrodynamic shape, asymmetric lens with 180 degree wider field of vision and interchangeable nose bridges to achieve a perfect fit. This swim training goggles has an ultra-soft gasket for comfort and is a stable swim goggle for performance swimming.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kb8SQvkOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B11MTM4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B13A1Y0", "title": "Topeak RedLite Aura Tail Light", "description": "This tail light features 3 super bright red LEDs (1 High Flux Piranha). Mounts to Topeak racks or seatpost. Light include 2 CR2032 batteries. Two modes constant or blinking. Burn time approx. 60/120 hours. Weight 32 grams.", "text": "Topeak RedLite Aura Tail Light This tail light features 3 super bright red LEDs (1 High Flux Piranha). Mounts to Topeak racks or seatpost. Light include 2 CR2032 batteries. Two modes constant or blinking. Burn time approx. 60/120 hours. Weight 32 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51K5BopDoyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B13A1Y0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00B13A5RS", "title": "Topeak PanoBike Blue Tooth Speed/Cadence Sensor", "description": "With the Topeak PanoBike Blue Tooth Speed/Cadence Sensor, you can turn a smartphone, tablet, or any Bluetooth Smart (BLE 4. 0) device into a personal training and health management device. All you have to do is chose an app (Strava, MapMyRide, Runtastic, Endomondo, ext.) of your liking and sync it with the Blue Tooth Speed/Cadence Sensor. The Bluetooth smart algorithm extends the included CR2032 battery's life to an incredible 1800 hours (approximately five years with an hour a day use). The transmitter is water resistant so light precipitation will not ruin the device. And, it has a transmission range of 33 feet so you can use laptops/desktops/tablets when training indoors, or a handlebar/pocket location while on the bike. The Topeak PanoBike Blue Tooth Speed/Cadence Sensor uses a rubber-band style mount with zip ties to allow quick and easy mounting on chainstays or seatstays without harming the frame.", "text": "Topeak PanoBike Blue Tooth Speed/Cadence Sensor With the Topeak PanoBike Blue Tooth Speed/Cadence Sensor, you can turn a smartphone, tablet, or any Bluetooth Smart (BLE 4. 0) device into a personal training and health management device. All you have to do is chose an app (Strava, MapMyRide, Runtastic, Endomondo, ext.) of your liking and sync it with the Blue Tooth Speed/Cadence Sensor. The Bluetooth smart algorithm extends the included CR2032 battery's life to an incredible 1800 hours (approximately five years with an hour a day use). The transmitter is water resistant so light precipitation will not ruin the device. And, it has a transmission range of 33 feet so you can use laptops/desktops/tablets when training indoors, or a handlebar/pocket location while on the bike. The Topeak PanoBike Blue Tooth Speed/Cadence Sensor uses a rubber-band style mount with zip ties to allow quick and easy mounting on chainstays or seatstays without harming the frame.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yc0HSspFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B13A5RS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 42.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B1GGMV8", "title": "Police Force 8 Million* Rechargeable Tactical Stun Gun Flashlight w/ 200 Lumen Bright Light & Holster", "description": "•Police Strength Protection Engineered to meet the demands of Police, Military, and Security People worldwide but also available to civilians •Triple Stun Technology: Streetwise Security Products continues to innovate and improve the designs of their stun guns. This is the first model to incorpate Triple Stun Technology allowing the electrical charge to jump between both edges and the middle of the prongs which creates a loud and bright electrical burst. •Shock Proof Exterior: Military Grade aluminum alloy protects the Police Force from damage. •Blinding Light: Not only will the flashlight safely illuminate the entire area at night, but it can help to protect you. When shined in the eyes of an attacker causing a temporary blinding effect. •Auto Emergency Tool: When stored in your automobile the unique design of the top edge can be used to shatter a window if you are trapped in your vehicle after an accident. •Economically & Environmentally Friendly: The stun gun and flashlight are fully rechargeable and the light bulb has a life of up to 100,000 hours. •Safety Switch: To prevent accidental discharge, the safety must be in the \"stun\" position and trigger pressed before the stun will operate. •Fast Action: The safety switch and trigger buttons are strategically located on opposite sides of the unit allowing the safety to be turned off and the trigger pressed in less than one second. •Rechargeable: Recharge cord (included) plugs into a standard wall outlet. •Lifetime Warranty: The Police Force is made of the highest quality components and comes with a lifetime warranty. Please be advised that there are legal restrictions where stun guns cannot be sold to any of the following states: Connecticut, Illinois, Hawaii, New York, New Jersey, Massachusetts, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, or Michigan or the cities of Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Baltimore County, MD, Chicago, IL, Denison/Crawford County, District of Columbia and Philadelphia, PA.", "text": "Police Force 8 Million* Rechargeable Tactical Stun Gun Flashlight w/ 200 Lumen Bright Light & Holster •Police Strength Protection Engineered to meet the demands of Police, Military, and Security People worldwide but also available to civilians •Triple Stun Technology: Streetwise Security Products continues to innovate and improve the designs of their stun guns. This is the first model to incorpate Triple Stun Technology allowing the electrical charge to jump between both edges and the middle of the prongs which creates a loud and bright electrical burst. •Shock Proof Exterior: Military Grade aluminum alloy protects the Police Force from damage. •Blinding Light: Not only will the flashlight safely illuminate the entire area at night, but it can help to protect you. When shined in the eyes of an attacker causing a temporary blinding effect. •Auto Emergency Tool: When stored in your automobile the unique design of the top edge can be used to shatter a window if you are trapped in your vehicle after an accident. •Economically & Environmentally Friendly: The stun gun and flashlight are fully rechargeable and the light bulb has a life of up to 100,000 hours. •Safety Switch: To prevent accidental discharge, the safety must be in the \"stun\" position and trigger pressed before the stun will operate. •Fast Action: The safety switch and trigger buttons are strategically located on opposite sides of the unit allowing the safety to be turned off and the trigger pressed in less than one second. •Rechargeable: Recharge cord (included) plugs into a standard wall outlet. •Lifetime Warranty: The Police Force is made of the highest quality components and comes with a lifetime warranty. Please be advised that there are legal restrictions where stun guns cannot be sold to any of the following states: Connecticut, Illinois, Hawaii, New York, New Jersey, Massachusetts, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, or Michigan or the cities of Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Baltimore County, MD, Chicago, IL, Denison/Crawford County, District of Columbia and Philadelphia, PA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41plDjNcz7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B1GGMV8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StreetWise", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 27.85}}
{"item_id": "B00B1MPTRA", "title": "Mako Forward Point Shooting Foregrip", "description": "The 'PTK'- Ergonomic Pointing Grip conceptualizes within its design a unique Special Forces combat proven instinctive shooting method incorporating natural pointing positioning which enhances accuracy, speed and overall tactical performance. Provides an Additional Compartment for Cleaning Kit or Spare Battery. May be used alongside the VTS for optimal support. Comes in 3 Colors. Weight 2.1 ounces (60 gr) Width 1.3\" (34 mm) Height 2.4\" (61 mm) Length 5.1\" (130 mm)", "text": "Mako Forward Point Shooting Foregrip The 'PTK'- Ergonomic Pointing Grip conceptualizes within its design a unique Special Forces combat proven instinctive shooting method incorporating natural pointing positioning which enhances accuracy, speed and overall tactical performance. Provides an Additional Compartment for Cleaning Kit or Spare Battery. May be used alongside the VTS for optimal support. Comes in 3 Colors. Weight 2.1 ounces (60 gr) Width 1.3\" (34 mm) Height 2.4\" (61 mm) Length 5.1\" (130 mm)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-Y9yYblhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B1MPTRA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mako Group", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 31.95}}
{"item_id": "B00B1MY318", "title": "Padded Ventilated Bike Bicycle Cycling Mountain Road Half Gel Silicone Antiskid Finger Gloves/ Half Finger Gloves / Sport Gloves Mitten/ Fingerless Cycle mitts, Soft durable microfiber Material with Velcro Strap -Black with Blue -XL", "description": "1. This mitts feature breathable mesh panels on the top, combined with lycra panels to ensure comfort and flexibility.2. The palm has a grip enhanced print, along with friction pads give you the smoothest and most controlled ride possible. It fits perfectly for your grip all in one extremely wear-resistant, compact package.3. A velcro closure allow you to slip them on and off with ease, whilst ensuring a nice close fit when done up.4. Half-finger design makes it easy for hands to breath naturally, and keeps you cool.5. Soft durable material increases comfort and grip, and reduces hand discomfort and callusesSize:M: Suitable for palm width from 8.5cm - 9.5cm(3.3\"--3.7\")L: Suitable for palm width from 9.5cm - 10.5cm(3.7\"--4.13\")XL:Suitable for palm width more than 10.5cm (over 4.13\")color:blue + black", "text": "Padded Ventilated Bike Bicycle Cycling Mountain Road Half Gel Silicone Antiskid Finger Gloves/ Half Finger Gloves / Sport Gloves Mitten/ Fingerless Cycle mitts, Soft durable microfiber Material with Velcro Strap -Black with Blue -XL 1. This mitts feature breathable mesh panels on the top, combined with lycra panels to ensure comfort and flexibility.2. The palm has a grip enhanced print, along with friction pads give you the smoothest and most controlled ride possible. It fits perfectly for your grip all in one extremely wear-resistant, compact package.3. A velcro closure allow you to slip them on and off with ease, whilst ensuring a nice close fit when done up.4. Half-finger design makes it easy for hands to breath naturally, and keeps you cool.5. Soft durable material increases comfort and grip, and reduces hand discomfort and callusesSize:M: Suitable for palm width from 8.5cm - 9.5cm(3.3\"--3.7\")L: Suitable for palm width from 9.5cm - 10.5cm(3.7\"--4.13\")XL:Suitable for palm width more than 10.5cm (over 4.13\")color:blue + black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5113coSqDZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B1MY318.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00B1MZ22C", "title": "Srixon Men's Q-Star Golf Balls (1-Dozen)", "description": "Designed for players who are looking for an all-ability ball with STAR performance. The process of precisely tuning the ball's STAR performance (Spin, Trajectory, Acceleration and Responsiveness) during development enhances total playability on every shot, allowing you to shoot lower scores.", "text": "Srixon Men's Q-Star Golf Balls (1-Dozen) Designed for players who are looking for an all-ability ball with STAR performance. The process of precisely tuning the ball's STAR performance (Spin, Trajectory, Acceleration and Responsiveness) during development enhances total playability on every shot, allowing you to shoot lower scores.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Lp7nddt7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B1MZ22C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Srixon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Standard Balls"]], "price": 21.0}}
{"item_id": "B00B1N0R6C", "title": "Perfect Fitness Ab Carver Pro", "description": "The Perfect Ab-Carver will carve your core and help you get ripped abs and sculpted arms. The kinetic \"engine\" uses a carbon steel spring to turbocharge your abdominal and arm workouts. It provides resistance as you roll out and assistance when you roll back. The ultra-wide tread provides maximum stability when carving left, right and center. Ergonomic hand grips are angled to help activate arm and core muscles.", "text": "Perfect Fitness Ab Carver Pro The Perfect Ab-Carver will carve your core and help you get ripped abs and sculpted arms. The kinetic \"engine\" uses a carbon steel spring to turbocharge your abdominal and arm workouts. It provides resistance as you roll out and assistance when you roll back. The ultra-wide tread provides maximum stability when carving left, right and center. Ergonomic hand grips are angled to help activate arm and core muscles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41slmbNR5mL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B1N0R6C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Perfect Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B1OBN7I", "title": "Wellgo Kc001 MTB Bike Pedal, Aluminum Alloy Super Light WITH FREE BAND AND ANTI-LOOSE WASHER", "description": "There's free gift in the package,please see the picuturs1.One piece elastic strap band with 4Ucycling logo,it can fasten your pants when you wear a looser pants.2.A pair of anti-loose washer,you can add it on the pedal's AXLE to prevent loose from crank.Wellgo KC001 Ultra-light Bearing Pedal (2012 Tour of China Version)Ultra-light bearing weighs only 273g. The pedal revals MG1.The shaft is made of chromium molybdenum steel; the body is made of aluminum alloy; there're some stubs on the surface.Details:Brand: wellgoOrigin: TaiwanModel: KC001Color: Red, black, white, gray, silverSize: 80X70mm (actual area that contacts), 80X76mm(area that seems to be), suitable for commuter BMX, folding bike and road bikeWeight: 270g (there might be slight differences due to the paintings of different colors), ultra-lightMaterial: 6061 Aluminum alloy, precisely processed by CNCShaft: Made of chromium molybdenum steel and precisely processed by CNC.Bearing: DU / sealed bearingIllustration: The stubs are hexagonal which do not hurt the soles.Get these fittings ready:A pair of KC001 pedal;A pair of locking gasket;A 15mm open-end wrench;Some superior butter (unnecessary)Installation:First, the pedals are dinstinguished as L for left and R for right.Drop some butter at the screw threads and put the locking gasket between the pedal and the brace (the smoother side faces outside).Use the wrench to wrench the pedal tightly. (The left foot is reverse threaded).", "text": "Wellgo Kc001 MTB Bike Pedal, Aluminum Alloy Super Light WITH FREE BAND AND ANTI-LOOSE WASHER There's free gift in the package,please see the picuturs1.One piece elastic strap band with 4Ucycling logo,it can fasten your pants when you wear a looser pants.2.A pair of anti-loose washer,you can add it on the pedal's AXLE to prevent loose from crank.Wellgo KC001 Ultra-light Bearing Pedal (2012 Tour of China Version)Ultra-light bearing weighs only 273g. The pedal revals MG1.The shaft is made of chromium molybdenum steel; the body is made of aluminum alloy; there're some stubs on the surface.Details:Brand: wellgoOrigin: TaiwanModel: KC001Color: Red, black, white, gray, silverSize: 80X70mm (actual area that contacts), 80X76mm(area that seems to be), suitable for commuter BMX, folding bike and road bikeWeight: 270g (there might be slight differences due to the paintings of different colors), ultra-lightMaterial: 6061 Aluminum alloy, precisely processed by CNCShaft: Made of chromium molybdenum steel and precisely processed by CNC.Bearing: DU / sealed bearingIllustration: The stubs are hexagonal which do not hurt the soles.Get these fittings ready:A pair of KC001 pedal;A pair of locking gasket;A 15mm open-end wrench;Some superior butter (unnecessary)Installation:First, the pedals are dinstinguished as L for left and R for right.Drop some butter at the screw threads and put the locking gasket between the pedal and the brace (the smoother side faces outside).Use the wrench to wrench the pedal tightly. (The left foot is reverse threaded).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412hOVMyfdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B1OBN7I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wellgo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 24.07}}
{"item_id": "B00B1PDOH4", "title": "Fusion Contigua Straight Non-Locking Gate Carabiner", "description": "Mini-aluminum, ultra lightweight. Great for female climbers and youth climbers. Easy to clip in due to soft gate action. When you need strength from a carabiner but need to move fast and light. Also the perfect emergency use carabiner to keep on your keychain.", "text": "Fusion Contigua Straight Non-Locking Gate Carabiner Mini-aluminum, ultra lightweight. Great for female climbers and youth climbers. Easy to clip in due to soft gate action. When you need strength from a carabiner but need to move fast and light. Also the perfect emergency use carabiner to keep on your keychain.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415cFZXSuFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B1PDOH4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Nonlocking"]], "price": 6.35}}
{"item_id": "B00B1SI03Y", "title": "SportRack SR2901LR 2-Bike Lock and Tilt Platform Hitch Rack, Black", "description": "", "text": "SportRack SR2901LR 2-Bike Lock and Tilt Platform Hitch Rack, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31j0atntapL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B1SI03Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SportRack", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 199.96}}
{"item_id": "B00B1VDNQA", "title": "DeskCycle Desk Exercise Bike Pedal Exerciser, White", "description": "If you want to burn calories, improve your health, mood and productivity while typing at your desk, then the DeskCycle is the bike for you. The DeskCycle was specifically designed to be used in the work environment. It has the same patented magnetic resistance mechanism as in the MagneTrainer. This insures smooth and quiet operation. Smooth pedal motion is healthy for your joints and won't distract you from your work. Quiet operation insures that you won't disturb your coworkers. Other bikes use friction resistance which is not smooth and can be noisy. The DeskCycle has a lower profile than the MagneTrainer. The pedals are 5 inches lower than the MagneTrainer so that it will fit under desks better. It could be used at a 27 inch desk by a person as tall as 5'7\". At this height you will need to push the cycle further under your desk and extend your legs. You may also need to lower your chair. If you are taller, you will need a taller desk. The highest resistance level is twice as high as the highest resistance setting of the Magneciser, and MagneCycle. At the lowest level it takes no effort to pedal it. The pedal motion is bidirectional, which means you can pedal it forward as well as in reverse. This lets you work opposite muscle groups. It comes with the Large pedals with adjustable Velcro straps. It has 8 calibrated resistance levels. We also provide an online calorie calculator on the desk-cycle website.", "text": "DeskCycle Desk Exercise Bike Pedal Exerciser, White If you want to burn calories, improve your health, mood and productivity while typing at your desk, then the DeskCycle is the bike for you. The DeskCycle was specifically designed to be used in the work environment. It has the same patented magnetic resistance mechanism as in the MagneTrainer. This insures smooth and quiet operation. Smooth pedal motion is healthy for your joints and won't distract you from your work. Quiet operation insures that you won't disturb your coworkers. Other bikes use friction resistance which is not smooth and can be noisy. The DeskCycle has a lower profile than the MagneTrainer. The pedals are 5 inches lower than the MagneTrainer so that it will fit under desks better. It could be used at a 27 inch desk by a person as tall as 5'7\". At this height you will need to push the cycle further under your desk and extend your legs. You may also need to lower your chair. If you are taller, you will need a taller desk. The highest resistance level is twice as high as the highest resistance setting of the Magneciser, and MagneCycle. At the lowest level it takes no effort to pedal it. The pedal motion is bidirectional, which means you can pedal it forward as well as in reverse. This lets you work opposite muscle groups. It comes with the Large pedals with adjustable Velcro straps. It has 8 calibrated resistance levels. We also provide an online calorie calculator on the desk-cycle website.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GQ3verykL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B1VDNQA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 159.0}}
{"item_id": "B00B1YEH5I", "title": "LifeTrak C200 Core", "description": "Lifetrak C200", "text": "LifeTrak C200 Core Lifetrak C200", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31peuriTPhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B1YEH5I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LifeTrak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]], "price": 60.75}}
{"item_id": "B00B2ANNJM", "title": "Pair of PaceMaker \"Journey\" Antishock Trekking Poles with Attachments and Extended Life Vulcanized Rubber Feet. (Purple)", "description": "Suitable for people of all sizes. Three sections telescope from 24.5 to 54 inches long. At only 9.5 ounces/pole these poles are among the lightest available. Superior ultralight 7075 aluminum, sweat absorbing and durable cork grips, tungsten tips, and vulcanized \"extra life\" rubber feet are some of the features that other sticks on the market do not match for the price. Antishock can be turned off and on according to preference. These sticks compare favorably with other, more expensive brands.", "text": "Pair of PaceMaker \"Journey\" Antishock Trekking Poles with Attachments and Extended Life Vulcanized Rubber Feet. (Purple) Suitable for people of all sizes. Three sections telescope from 24.5 to 54 inches long. At only 9.5 ounces/pole these poles are among the lightest available. Superior ultralight 7075 aluminum, sweat absorbing and durable cork grips, tungsten tips, and vulcanized \"extra life\" rubber feet are some of the features that other sticks on the market do not match for the price. Antishock can be turned off and on according to preference. These sticks compare favorably with other, more expensive brands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bUyIfWL6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B2ANNJM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00B2H9SU8", "title": "Water Bobble Water Bottle, 24-Ounce, Blue", "description": "Water bottle with replaceable filter removes organic contaminates from regular municipal tap water and meets or exceeds International Standard 42 for chlorine, taste and odor reduction.", "text": "Water Bobble Water Bottle, 24-Ounce, Blue Water bottle with replaceable filter removes organic contaminates from regular municipal tap water and meets or exceeds International Standard 42 for chlorine, taste and odor reduction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314vGOLuIML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B2H9SU8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Water Bobble", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B2HZQN6", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 9110KC Eat N' Tool Black Multi Tool, X-Large", "description": "Sometimes Bigger Really Is Better. The Same Great Tool—Now Goes BIG. If you are a current fan of the original Eat'N Tool, designed by revolutionary designer Liong Mah, you may have been one of the many who were wishing for a slightly bigger version. And, here it is. The Eat'N Tool XL offers a larger spoon and longer handle surface to grab hold of. Use it as a spoon, or fork, to prepare and/or eat your favorite \"on the trail\" meal. Other handy tools include a box wrench, driver/pry tool, can opener and bottle opener. It also comes with a carabiner* to make carry simple and accessible. Available in bead blast grey or black powder coat finish. For the trail, camper or cabin, the Eat'N Tool XL makes eating easy and maybe even just a little bit fun.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 9110KC Eat N' Tool Black Multi Tool, X-Large Sometimes Bigger Really Is Better. The Same Great Tool—Now Goes BIG. If you are a current fan of the original Eat'N Tool, designed by revolutionary designer Liong Mah, you may have been one of the many who were wishing for a slightly bigger version. And, here it is. The Eat'N Tool XL offers a larger spoon and longer handle surface to grab hold of. Use it as a spoon, or fork, to prepare and/or eat your favorite \"on the trail\" meal. Other handy tools include a box wrench, driver/pry tool, can opener and bottle opener. It also comes with a carabiner* to make carry simple and accessible. Available in bead blast grey or black powder coat finish. For the trail, camper or cabin, the Eat'N Tool XL makes eating easy and maybe even just a little bit fun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31u0Y%2BtZuHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B2HZQN6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 10.74}}
{"item_id": "B00B2I8NQC", "title": "GERBER 30-000690 Outrigger XL Assisted Opening Knife with Serrated Blade", "description": "Hello, Big Daddy. The Outrigger XL is the macho-sized member of the outrigger clan, with an impressive 3.4\" blade and a beefy 4.5” handle. It’s not all about the size, though: like its Outrigger kin, the XL features Assisted Opening 2.0 technology, an open frame design and over molded rubberized handles.", "text": "GERBER 30-000690 Outrigger XL Assisted Opening Knife with Serrated Blade Hello, Big Daddy. The Outrigger XL is the macho-sized member of the outrigger clan, with an impressive 3.4\" blade and a beefy 4.5” handle. It’s not all about the size, though: like its Outrigger kin, the XL features Assisted Opening 2.0 technology, an open frame design and over molded rubberized handles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-pCLyH9HL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B2I8NQC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 37.95}}
{"item_id": "B00B2OS85W", "title": "Bushwhacker Ketchum Black - Bicycle Frame Bag Cycling Triangle Pack Bike Under Seat Top Tube Bag - w/ Reflective Trim", "description": "", "text": "Bushwhacker Ketchum Black - Bicycle Frame Bag Cycling Triangle Pack Bike Under Seat Top Tube Bag - w/ Reflective Trim", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417kAyuuIZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B2OS85W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B00B2PT7WY", "title": "CatEye Strada Digital Cadence Wireless Computer - Men's", "description": "Guess what? The days of spending over $200 on cycling computers with wireless technology and heart rate readings are over. With the new CatEye Strada Digital Cadence Wireless Computer, you gain access to all of the crucial cycling metrics, as well as cadence and heart rate. It's time to take your training to the next level. CatEye designed the Strada Digital with its ease-of-use at the forefront of design. Accordingly, its ClickTec design provides a simple-to-use, single button operation system. So, you can easily navigate through metrics like current speed, trip distance, elapsed time, average speed, maximum speed, heart rate, and cadence. That's right, for under $100 you get access to cadence readings. This is made possible by CatEye's ISCTec sensor. It mounts to the chainstay of your frame and is responsible for both speed and cadence readings. And as a technology update to problems that we've experience from CatEye in the past, the Strada's wireless communications are now transmitted through 30 different ID codes. This way, there's no confusion or intermixing of your readings while you're riding in the peloton, or on secondary bikes. Don't think that we've neglected the importance of the Strada heart rate monitor. With the Cateye HRM chest strap (sold separately) you can maximize your training and racing by learning your sustainable output within your heart rate zones. And to support this training method, the Strada is capable of computing readings ranging from 0 to 199 bpm. Now, you have the metrics to tell you if jumping off of the front is possible on a sustained climb. Another couple of key features are the Strada's minimal size and weight. The CPU measures out to 46. 5 x 31 x 16mm, and it only weighs around 20 grams. Additionally, the CPU setup is a simple affair, as is its mounting setup. In fact, CatEye includes its tool-free FlexTight bracket that mounts to either your stem or bars. The CatEye Strada Digital Cadence Wireless Computer is available...", "text": "CatEye Strada Digital Cadence Wireless Computer - Men's Guess what? The days of spending over $200 on cycling computers with wireless technology and heart rate readings are over. With the new CatEye Strada Digital Cadence Wireless Computer, you gain access to all of the crucial cycling metrics, as well as cadence and heart rate. It's time to take your training to the next level. CatEye designed the Strada Digital with its ease-of-use at the forefront of design. Accordingly, its ClickTec design provides a simple-to-use, single button operation system. So, you can easily navigate through metrics like current speed, trip distance, elapsed time, average speed, maximum speed, heart rate, and cadence. That's right, for under $100 you get access to cadence readings. This is made possible by CatEye's ISCTec sensor. It mounts to the chainstay of your frame and is responsible for both speed and cadence readings. And as a technology update to problems that we've experience from CatEye in the past, the Strada's wireless communications are now transmitted through 30 different ID codes. This way, there's no confusion or intermixing of your readings while you're riding in the peloton, or on secondary bikes. Don't think that we've neglected the importance of the Strada heart rate monitor. With the Cateye HRM chest strap (sold separately) you can maximize your training and racing by learning your sustainable output within your heart rate zones. And to support this training method, the Strada is capable of computing readings ranging from 0 to 199 bpm. Now, you have the metrics to tell you if jumping off of the front is possible on a sustained climb. Another couple of key features are the Strada's minimal size and weight. The CPU measures out to 46. 5 x 31 x 16mm, and it only weighs around 20 grams. Additionally, the CPU setup is a simple affair, as is its mounting setup. In fact, CatEye includes its tool-free FlexTight bracket that mounts to either your stem or bars. The CatEye Strada Digital Cadence Wireless Computer is available...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A19r1MjaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B2PT7WY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 87.95}}
{"item_id": "B00B2SNAS8", "title": "Tipton 1911 Mag Well Vise Block", "description": "The Tipton 1911 Mag Well Vise Block is quite possibly the handiest tool a 1911 owner could ask for. Designed for use with the Tipton Best Gun ViseTM, this center support slides into the magazine well and provides a steady base for cleaning or light gunsmithing on your 1911. Users without a Best Gun Vise can mount the Mag Well Vise Block directly to their bench top with the included fasteners. Loaded with handy features, this tool is a must have for anyone with a 1911.", "text": "Tipton 1911 Mag Well Vise Block The Tipton 1911 Mag Well Vise Block is quite possibly the handiest tool a 1911 owner could ask for. Designed for use with the Tipton Best Gun ViseTM, this center support slides into the magazine well and provides a steady base for cleaning or light gunsmithing on your 1911. Users without a Best Gun Vise can mount the Mag Well Vise Block directly to their bench top with the included fasteners. Loaded with handy features, this tool is a must have for anyone with a 1911.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31F-YMOoS1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B2SNAS8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tipton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 19.24}}
{"item_id": "B00B3OQ3JY", "title": "SKLZ Stik-Grip Custom Personalized Shrink-Fit Sports Grip", "description": "Protect your hands and improve your game with SKLZ Stik-Grip personalized shrink-fit sport grip. The slide and shrink-to-fit process allows for easy application to baseball and softball bats, hockey and lacrosse sticks, and tennis racquets. Customize your grip quickly and have it be available to use in under 12 hours. Visit Stik-Grip.com for premade custom templates or upload your own design.", "text": "SKLZ Stik-Grip Custom Personalized Shrink-Fit Sports Grip Protect your hands and improve your game with SKLZ Stik-Grip personalized shrink-fit sport grip. The slide and shrink-to-fit process allows for easy application to baseball and softball bats, hockey and lacrosse sticks, and tennis racquets. Customize your grip quickly and have it be available to use in under 12 hours. Visit Stik-Grip.com for premade custom templates or upload your own design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ORuwRifWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B3OQ3JY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Accessories", "Bat Accessories", "Grips & Grip Tape"]]}}
