{"item_id": "B00B49VUVO", "title": "Light My Fire 8-Piece BPA-Free Meal Kit 2.0 with Plate, Bowl, Cup, Cutting Board, Spork and More", "description": "Designed especially for Light My Fire by Scandinavian designer Joachim Nordwall, the Meal Kit has become a modern classic. The colorful Meal Kit 2.0 has been updated and expanded to include 8 utilitarian pieces: 1 lid/plate, 1 plate/bowl, 1 SnapBox Original with lid (170 ml), 1 SnapBox Oval with lid (320 ml), 1 Pack-Up Cup (260 ml), 1 strainer/cutting board, 1 Original Spork and a carry harness. All feature environmentally-friendly materials and are dishwasher and microwave safe. The Meal Kit 2.0 packs up into its own container and even floats. Ideal for use outdoors, on the road, in the office, or on the go.", "text": "Light My Fire 8-Piece BPA-Free Meal Kit 2.0 with Plate, Bowl, Cup, Cutting Board, Spork and More Designed especially for Light My Fire by Scandinavian designer Joachim Nordwall, the Meal Kit has become a modern classic. The colorful Meal Kit 2.0 has been updated and expanded to include 8 utilitarian pieces: 1 lid/plate, 1 plate/bowl, 1 SnapBox Original with lid (170 ml), 1 SnapBox Oval with lid (320 ml), 1 Pack-Up Cup (260 ml), 1 strainer/cutting board, 1 Original Spork and a carry harness. All feature environmentally-friendly materials and are dishwasher and microwave safe. The Meal Kit 2.0 packs up into its own container and even floats. Ideal for use outdoors, on the road, in the office, or on the go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Eq5KpK4wL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B49VUVO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Light my Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 26.95}}
