{"item_id": "B00B4FY8YO", "title": "Etekcity® Portable Outdoor Picnic Backpacking Stainless Steel Canister Camp Stove with Carry Case, Piezo Ignition 4.8oz", "description": "The Etekcity Mini Camp Stove is an amazing stove! Any shortcomings are owing to intentional and necessary design compromises aimed at keeping the stove as tiny as possible. The materials used are not the surgical quality metals we are use to seeing in high-end stoves but this takes nothing from the functionality of the stove. It may however, limit the functional life of the stove. But this must be taken in context: this stove does not claim to be a material equivalent or substitute for stoves that are 4 or 5 times the price. This stove will do a fine job for the minimalist or 3 season overnight/short trip solo-trecker. It's small enough to throw in the pack for day trips or in a fly fishing vest; truck box or car trunk, or even a lunch bucket---semper paratus!Features:Brand new and high quality.This Mini Stove is made of aluminum alloy and stainless steel which can stand the high temperature and weight.High-energy ceramic piezoelectric ignition system make it very convenience in outdoor. Folding design makes it smaller to put in the pot.Hold up to 18cm diameter pot.Strong fire power, High thermal efficiency.Used with circinal screw gas holder - Light weight and collect in a plastic box.Good companion for outdoor camping picnic.Stove Base Material: Stainless Steel.Support Material: Aluminum Alloy.Output: 1.680 kilocalories / 1.94kW / 6.666BTU.Ignition: Automatically strike fire.Dimension:80 x 60 x 46mmPackage Included:1 x Etekcity Mini Camp Stove1 x Carry Case", "text": "Etekcity® Portable Outdoor Picnic Backpacking Stainless Steel Canister Camp Stove with Carry Case, Piezo Ignition 4.8oz The Etekcity Mini Camp Stove is an amazing stove! Any shortcomings are owing to intentional and necessary design compromises aimed at keeping the stove as tiny as possible. The materials used are not the surgical quality metals we are use to seeing in high-end stoves but this takes nothing from the functionality of the stove. It may however, limit the functional life of the stove. But this must be taken in context: this stove does not claim to be a material equivalent or substitute for stoves that are 4 or 5 times the price. This stove will do a fine job for the minimalist or 3 season overnight/short trip solo-trecker. It's small enough to throw in the pack for day trips or in a fly fishing vest; truck box or car trunk, or even a lunch bucket---semper paratus!Features:Brand new and high quality.This Mini Stove is made of aluminum alloy and stainless steel which can stand the high temperature and weight.High-energy ceramic piezoelectric ignition system make it very convenience in outdoor. Folding design makes it smaller to put in the pot.Hold up to 18cm diameter pot.Strong fire power, High thermal efficiency.Used with circinal screw gas holder - Light weight and collect in a plastic box.Good companion for outdoor camping picnic.Stove Base Material: Stainless Steel.Support Material: Aluminum Alloy.Output: 1.680 kilocalories / 1.94kW / 6.666BTU.Ignition: Automatically strike fire.Dimension:80 x 60 x 46mmPackage Included:1 x Etekcity Mini Camp Stove1 x Carry Case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4148eFweVPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B4FY8YO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B4MC9CK", "title": "CVLIFE Hunting Riflescope M1 3.5-10x40 R&G Long Range Illuminated Mil-dot Optics Rifle Gun Scope", "description": "Features：Length:35cmWeight:1035gClick Value:1/4 ft @ 100 yardsMaterial:Aircraft-Grade Aluminum AlloyExit pupil:4.4mm-13.3mmDustproof, shockproof, fogproofPrecise Windage & Elevation AdjustmentOnly offer 20mm rail mountsPackage Content:1x Rifle scope1 pair 20mm rail mounts1 pair lens covers", "text": "CVLIFE Hunting Riflescope M1 3.5-10x40 R&G Long Range Illuminated Mil-dot Optics Rifle Gun Scope Features：Length:35cmWeight:1035gClick Value:1/4 ft @ 100 yardsMaterial:Aircraft-Grade Aluminum AlloyExit pupil:4.4mm-13.3mmDustproof, shockproof, fogproofPrecise Windage & Elevation AdjustmentOnly offer 20mm rail mountsPackage Content:1x Rifle scope1 pair 20mm rail mounts1 pair lens covers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51M22TQueKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B4MC9CK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00B4MTZ1I", "title": "Tetra Gun Grease - 1 oz", "description": "The major advance in firearms lubrication. Won't migrate Excellent for use on rifle bolts, sears, locking lugs and semi-auto slide/rails. Apply light coating to metal surface. Buff dry for a debris-repelling, \"glass-smooth\" surface.", "text": "Tetra Gun Grease - 1 oz The major advance in firearms lubrication. Won't migrate Excellent for use on rifle bolts, sears, locking lugs and semi-auto slide/rails. Apply light coating to metal surface. Buff dry for a debris-repelling, \"glass-smooth\" surface.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41koNQ1C9uL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B4MTZ1I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Solvents"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00B4O0FNS", "title": "Glock Slide Back Plate by Bastion LLC - Psalm 144:1", "description": "Bastion slide back plates are made of T6 aluminum, hard coat anodized. Great replacement for a plastic factory part. All designs are laser engraved. You will love the quality of BASTION products.", "text": "Glock Slide Back Plate by Bastion LLC - Psalm 144:1 Bastion slide back plates are made of T6 aluminum, hard coat anodized. Great replacement for a plastic factory part. All designs are laser engraved. You will love the quality of BASTION products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f0GwePLUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B4O0FNS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 18.5}}
{"item_id": "B00B4XYISM", "title": "Outbags OB-15SC Nylon OWB Belt Gun Holster for Taurus 405 / 441 / 451 / 605 / 851 / M850 / 85 Protector Polymer, Ladysmith Airweight, Diamondback DB9, and More", "description": "The SC Style is a fully loaded holster for revolvers and automatics. Available for left and right handed users, our SC Style is the line of holsters that comes standard with a magazine pouch. While keeping your weapon secure, the Thumb break also eliminates delay when drawing the firearm. This holster also has a removable Belt Clip for mounting to waistband or belt. Additionally, the Belt Loop allows for a more permanent and secure mount to the belt. The Webbed Spine ensures a snug and personalized fit. Firearm not included. Recommended fit: Charter Arms 2.5\" Small Frame, Colt Detective Special 2\" Small Frame, Colt SD2020 2.5\", H&R; 622 2.5\" Small Frame, Rossi 357 Magnum 2.5\" Small Frame, Ruger LCR with Crimson Trace Laser, Ruger SP101 2.5\" Small Frame, S&W; 36 / 43 / 637 / 642 / 2.5\" Small Frame, S&W; 37 / 686 Lady Smith 2.5\" Small Frame, S&W; 442 / 638 2.5\" Small Frame, Taurus 444 2\" Small Frame, Taurus CIA 895 / 405 / 451 / 605 2\",", "text": "Outbags OB-15SC Nylon OWB Belt Gun Holster for Taurus 405 / 441 / 451 / 605 / 851 / M850 / 85 Protector Polymer, Ladysmith Airweight, Diamondback DB9, and More The SC Style is a fully loaded holster for revolvers and automatics. Available for left and right handed users, our SC Style is the line of holsters that comes standard with a magazine pouch. While keeping your weapon secure, the Thumb break also eliminates delay when drawing the firearm. This holster also has a removable Belt Clip for mounting to waistband or belt. Additionally, the Belt Loop allows for a more permanent and secure mount to the belt. The Webbed Spine ensures a snug and personalized fit. Firearm not included. Recommended fit: Charter Arms 2.5\" Small Frame, Colt Detective Special 2\" Small Frame, Colt SD2020 2.5\", H&R; 622 2.5\" Small Frame, Rossi 357 Magnum 2.5\" Small Frame, Ruger LCR with Crimson Trace Laser, Ruger SP101 2.5\" Small Frame, S&W; 36 / 43 / 637 / 642 / 2.5\" Small Frame, S&W; 37 / 686 Lady Smith 2.5\" Small Frame, S&W; 442 / 638 2.5\" Small Frame, Taurus 444 2\" Small Frame, Taurus CIA 895 / 405 / 451 / 605 2\",", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f2U9Spl-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B4XYISM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 14.99}}
