0 ACP, I.O Hellcat Semi Auto 380 ACP, Kahr CW380 / P380 Kel-Tec 32 / 380 / P-3AT, Kimber Solo Carry, Phoenix Arms HP22, HP25, Ruger LCP, S&W; Bodyguard 380, Sig Sauer P238 / P290 / P938, Taurus 22LR 2.75\" / TCP PT 380, Walther PPK / PPK-S / TPH,", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517hdw-GfrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B4XZ5SE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B4ZKZK0", "title": "Bushwhacker Omaha - Bicycle Grocery Pannier Cycling Rack Basket Bike Rear Bag - Sold as Pair", "description": "The Omaha grocery panniers are perfect for a quick trip to the market. They secure to the rack of your bike with a three-point mounting system. Each pannier will accommodate one full sized grocery bag, and when done folds flat for storage. Dimensions: 14\" Length x 9\" width x 11.5\" height", "text": "Bushwhacker Omaha - Bicycle Grocery Pannier Cycling Rack Basket Bike Rear Bag - Sold as Pair The Omaha grocery panniers are perfect for a quick trip to the market. They secure to the rack of your bike with a three-point mounting system. Each pannier will accommodate one full sized grocery bag, and when done folds flat for storage. Dimensions: 14\" Length x 9\" width x 11.5\" height", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51oVh7aP4oL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B4ZKZK0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 49.95}}
