{"item_id": "B00B5E9YLQ", "title": "Camelbak HAWG 100-Ounce/3-Liter Mil Spec Antidote Long 621 Hydration Pack", "description": "Features: Hydration Capacity: 100 oz./3 L Total Capacity: 1403 cu. In/23 L Weight: 2.75 lbs./1.25 kg Fabric: 500D Cordura Fabric Front panel gussets and shoulder harness front side &get; 420D High Density Nylon on shoulder harness back side and raised pod panels &get; 10 mm EVA foam shoulder harness &get; 210D Nylon lining &get; 5 mm Closed Cell foam &get; Nylon webbing.", "text": "Camelbak HAWG 100-Ounce/3-Liter Mil Spec Antidote Long 621 Hydration Pack Features: Hydration Capacity: 100 oz./3 L Total Capacity: 1403 cu. In/23 L Weight: 2.75 lbs./1.25 kg Fabric: 500D Cordura Fabric Front panel gussets and shoulder harness front side &get; 420D High Density Nylon on shoulder harness back side and raised pod panels &get; 10 mm EVA foam shoulder harness &get; 210D Nylon lining &get; 5 mm Closed Cell foam &get; Nylon webbing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HNQ7m8FQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B5E9YLQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 137.6}}
{"item_id": "B00B5EDG74", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Aftermath Compact Toiletries Bag", "description": "Product Details Expandable and attachable multi-functional toiletry bag The #1817 AFTERMATH COMPACT TOILETRIES BAG is a great travel essential for carrying shampoo bottles, tooth brush and toothpaste, other personal items in a compartmentalized fashion. The fold away hook makes it possible to hang the Aftermath in the shower and an internal zippered clear window compartment allows for an optional mirror (not included). Overall size Approx. 10-Inch (L) x 8-Inch (H) x 4.5-Inch (W) Main compartment approx. 9-Inch (L) x 6.5-Inch (H) x 4-Inch (W).", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Aftermath Compact Toiletries Bag Product Details Expandable and attachable multi-functional toiletry bag The #1817 AFTERMATH COMPACT TOILETRIES BAG is a great travel essential for carrying shampoo bottles, tooth brush and toothpaste, other personal items in a compartmentalized fashion. The fold away hook makes it possible to hang the Aftermath in the shower and an internal zippered clear window compartment allows for an optional mirror (not included). Overall size Approx. 10-Inch (L) x 8-Inch (H) x 4.5-Inch (W) Main compartment approx. 9-Inch (L) x 6.5-Inch (H) x 4-Inch (W).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515q0FT47BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B5EDG74.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]], "price": 46.79}}
{"item_id": "B00B5F02ZW", "title": "Nikon P-Series Mount", "description": "The 2-piece design of the P-Series Mount allows proper mounting height and proper fore-aft positioning for proper shooting technique with comfortable eye relief.", "text": "Nikon P-Series Mount The 2-piece design of the P-Series Mount allows proper mounting height and proper fore-aft positioning for proper shooting technique with comfortable eye relief.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dftpVwYKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B5F02ZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 31.85}}
{"item_id": "B00B5H92LA", "title": "LaserLyte LT-223 Laser Trainer Cartridge", "description": "LaserLyte, innovators in firearms laser technologies, are proud to announce the most highly anticipated addition to the LaserLyte family of laser training cartridges; the LT-223, .223 Caliber Training Cartridge. The in-the-chamber design of the LT-223 allows the user to realistically train anywhere and practice tap, rack, bang or malfunction drills in the comfort of one's own home.", "text": "LaserLyte LT-223 Laser Trainer Cartridge LaserLyte, innovators in firearms laser technologies, are proud to announce the most highly anticipated addition to the LaserLyte family of laser training cartridges; the LT-223, .223 Caliber Training Cartridge. The in-the-chamber design of the LT-223 allows the user to realistically train anywhere and practice tap, rack, bang or malfunction drills in the comfort of one's own home.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415FiA4BBxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B5H92LA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B5HP28M", "title": "Strike Industries 1911 Torx Grip Screws With Stainless Steel x 4", "description": "Strike Industries has released the classic Stainless Steel version of its 1911 Torx screws. A staple to any 1911 gunsmith's collection the Strike Industries 1911 Torx Pistol Grip Screws and Bushing hardware not only provides a secure fasten for your 1911 grip, it also provides a finishing touch to the user's 1911 platform. Simple, classic, and clean is the best way to describe the SI Stainless Steel Torx Screws and Bushings.These screws and bushings come in two versions: standard and slimline and are made of 100% stainless steel. Both items are fitted with Torx heads to not only ensure a secure fasten but also add a cosmetic dimension to the pistol. The SI 1911 screws and bushings are available in several finishes; Stainless Steel, BLUE finish, Zinc, Chrome, and Gold-plated.", "text": "Strike Industries 1911 Torx Grip Screws With Stainless Steel x 4 Strike Industries has released the classic Stainless Steel version of its 1911 Torx screws. A staple to any 1911 gunsmith's collection the Strike Industries 1911 Torx Pistol Grip Screws and Bushing hardware not only provides a secure fasten for your 1911 grip, it also provides a finishing touch to the user's 1911 platform. Simple, classic, and clean is the best way to describe the SI Stainless Steel Torx Screws and Bushings.These screws and bushings come in two versions: standard and slimline and are made of 100% stainless steel. Both items are fitted with Torx heads to not only ensure a secure fasten but also add a cosmetic dimension to the pistol. The SI 1911 screws and bushings are available in several finishes; Stainless Steel, BLUE finish, Zinc, Chrome, and Gold-plated.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FpO%2Bq0auL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B5HP28M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B5J8854", "title": "Darn Tough Vermont Men's Merino Wool No-Show Ultra-Light Cushion Athletic Socks", "description": "Made in Vermont - We live and work in Vermont. Our backyard is the perfect testing ground to make the finest Premium All Weather Performance Socks. We ski, snowboard, hike, bike and run in the most unforgiving climate in the lower 48. It is under these conditions that we design, test and manufacture our socks.", "text": "Darn Tough Vermont Men's Merino Wool No-Show Ultra-Light Cushion Athletic Socks Made in Vermont - We live and work in Vermont. Our backyard is the perfect testing ground to make the finest Premium All Weather Performance Socks. We ski, snowboard, hike, bike and run in the most unforgiving climate in the lower 48. It is under these conditions that we design, test and manufacture our socks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4104pxIcuZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B5J8854.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00B5JP6H2", "title": "BBTac CM022 AK47 Airsoft Gun High Capacity Magazine 200 Round by BBTac®", "description": "BBTac / Cyma CM 022 AK47 Airsoft Gun High Capacity Magazine Great Spare magazine for long lasting game.", "text": "BBTac CM022 AK47 Airsoft Gun High Capacity Magazine 200 Round by BBTac® BBTac / Cyma CM 022 AK47 Airsoft Gun High Capacity Magazine Great Spare magazine for long lasting game.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jRI2DxbfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B5JP6H2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BBTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B5JZH4O", "title": "Virtue Spire Paintball Loaders", "description": "Tool-less Disassembly: Slide Lock Quick Release Button for easy, tool-less disassembly. - Flex Cycle Paddle: Rubber Flex Cycle allows the Spire to feed even the most brittle paint. - Spring Loaded Anti-jam Drive: Slides underneath and pushes jams out of the way before they occur. - Shot Activated Sensor: Intelligent G-Force Sensor isolates and detects acceleration from each shot. - Aggressive Low Profile Styling: Adds approx. 4.4\" of height to the gun as a result of spacing saving with the vertically stacked gearbox. - Single Tray Internal Construction: All of the Spire internals are attached to a single tray for easy removal. - Transparent Back Shell: View paint levels in a single glance without showing everyone else. - True 260TM Capacity: High ball capacity holds 260 paintballs. - Self-Optimizing Motor: Monitors motor torque and the G-force sensor to optimize performance. - Quick Change Speedfeed: Optional Crown2 changes back and forth from Speed Feed to Lid in seconds. - Wide Mouth Lid: Huge lid opening for easy reloading. - Extremely Tough Shells: Front, Bottom & Back Shells made from reinforced, impact modified materials. - Internally Sorting Spire Drive: Spire shaped drive funnels and feeds paint. - Reball Ready: Works with most ReballsTM and other branded reusable paintballs. - Electronic Force Feed Button: Press the LED cover to manually force the Spire to spin. - Adjustable Settings: Speaker, LED control, Standby, Sensitivity, and Factory Reset. - Water Resistant Electronics: Conformal coated electronics protect the circuitry from moisture and paint. - Audible, Instant-on: Push button on/off with audible speaker feedback. - Long Battery Life: Ultra long battery life from 3 AA batteries.", "text": "Virtue Spire Paintball Loaders Tool-less Disassembly: Slide Lock Quick Release Button for easy, tool-less disassembly. - Flex Cycle Paddle: Rubber Flex Cycle allows the Spire to feed even the most brittle paint. - Spring Loaded Anti-jam Drive: Slides underneath and pushes jams out of the way before they occur. - Shot Activated Sensor: Intelligent G-Force Sensor isolates and detects acceleration from each shot. - Aggressive Low Profile Styling: Adds approx. 4.4\" of height to the gun as a result of spacing saving with the vertically stacked gearbox. - Single Tray Internal Construction: All of the Spire internals are attached to a single tray for easy removal. - Transparent Back Shell: View paint levels in a single glance without showing everyone else. - True 260TM Capacity: High ball capacity holds 260 paintballs. - Self-Optimizing Motor: Monitors motor torque and the G-force sensor to optimize performance. - Quick Change Speedfeed: Optional Crown2 changes back and forth from Speed Feed to Lid in seconds. - Wide Mouth Lid: Huge lid opening for easy reloading. - Extremely Tough Shells: Front, Bottom & Back Shells made from reinforced, impact modified materials. - Internally Sorting Spire Drive: Spire shaped drive funnels and feeds paint. - Reball Ready: Works with most ReballsTM and other branded reusable paintballs. - Electronic Force Feed Button: Press the LED cover to manually force the Spire to spin. - Adjustable Settings: Speaker, LED control, Standby, Sensitivity, and Factory Reset. - Water Resistant Electronics: Conformal coated electronics protect the circuitry from moisture and paint. - Audible, Instant-on: Push button on/off with audible speaker feedback. - Long Battery Life: Ultra long battery life from 3 AA batteries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cQ%2B-MJ1dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B5JZH4O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Loaders & Accessories", "Loaders"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00B5LIE4C", "title": "Shaun T's Rockin' Body DVD Workout", "description": "Dance with Shaun T and lose weight the easy way. With Rockin' Body, you can burn up to 1,500 calories a day.What's In The Package?7 workouts (including 2 bonus workouts) on 2 DVDs, My Quickstart Guide, Never \"Diet\" Again Guide, 3-Day SlimDown Plan, and a Party GuideGet Rockin’ Results with 5 Hot WorkoutsMark, Move & Groove:Even if you don't think you can dance, Shaun T will have you dancing and sweating with his breakthroughMark It and Move Ittechnique. You'll be grooving like the pros in no time. (15 minutes)Party Express:Give Shaun 25 minutes and he guarantees a workout—without sacrificing results. Perfect when you're short on time so now you never have to miss a workout. (25 minutes)Rock It Out:This rock-and-roll strength routine will shape, sculpt, and tone your new lean body from head to toe while sending your metabolism soaring. (45 minutes)Disco Groove:Hit the dance floor and shake your groove thing in this off-the-hook workout guaranteed to burn some serious calories. (35 minutes)Shaun T’s Dance Party:It's a calorie-burning dance party in your living room with tunes like \"Holiday\" and \"Don't Stop 'Til You Get Enough.\"(45 minutes)4 FREE Gifts With Your Purchase of Rockin' BodyHard-Core Abs (BONUS WORKOUT):Learn how Shaun T got his hard-core abs—and you won't have to do a sit-up or crunch. Give Shaun 10 minutes, and you're on your way to the rock-hard abs of your dreams. (10 minutes)Booty Time (BONUS WORKOUT):Get ready for crazy moves to lift your buns, slim your hips, and tighten your abs. You'll be turning heads in your skinny jeans in no time. (30 minutes)3-Day SlimDown:See visible results in just 3 days—guaranteed. Follow this simple and healthy plan to jump-start your weight loss for great results right away.Party Guide:Learn what to eat and drink at any party without breaking the calorie bank. Shaun's handy pocket-sized guide takes the guesswork out.Easy-to-use Tools to Maximize Your ResultsMy Quickstart Guide:Getting started is easy. Just follow this simple workout calendar, and you'll be on your way to your very own Rockin' Body.Never “Diet” Again Guide:Say goodbye to all those fad diets. This easy-to-follow plan works because it's not a diet—it's a plan you can stick with forever. The guide is filled with Shaun's favorite meals and recipes and shows you how simple it is to eat healthy.", "text": "Shaun T's Rockin' Body DVD Workout Dance with Shaun T and lose weight the easy way. With Rockin' Body, you can burn up to 1,500 calories a day.What's In The Package?7 workouts (including 2 bonus workouts) on 2 DVDs, My Quickstart Guide, Never \"Diet\" Again Guide, 3-Day SlimDown Plan, and a Party GuideGet Rockin’ Results with 5 Hot WorkoutsMark, Move & Groove:Even if you don't think you can dance, Shaun T will have you dancing and sweating with his breakthroughMark It and Move Ittechnique. You'll be grooving like the pros in no time. (15 minutes)Party Express:Give Shaun 25 minutes and he guarantees a workout—without sacrificing results. Perfect when you're short on time so now you never have to miss a workout. (25 minutes)Rock It Out:This rock-and-roll strength routine will shape, sculpt, and tone your new lean body from head to toe while sending your metabolism soaring. (45 minutes)Disco Groove:Hit the dance floor and shake your groove thing in this off-the-hook workout guaranteed to burn some serious calories. (35 minutes)Shaun T’s Dance Party:It's a calorie-burning dance party in your living room with tunes like \"Holiday\" and \"Don't Stop 'Til You Get Enough.\"(45 minutes)4 FREE Gifts With Your Purchase of Rockin' BodyHard-Core Abs (BONUS WORKOUT):Learn how Shaun T got his hard-core abs—and you won't have to do a sit-up or crunch. Give Shaun 10 minutes, and you're on your way to the rock-hard abs of your dreams. (10 minutes)Booty Time (BONUS WORKOUT):Get ready for crazy moves to lift your buns, slim your hips, and tighten your abs. You'll be turning heads in your skinny jeans in no time. (30 minutes)3-Day SlimDown:See visible results in just 3 days—guaranteed. Follow this simple and healthy plan to jump-start your weight loss for great results right away.Party Guide:Learn what to eat and drink at any party without breaking the calorie bank. Shaun's handy pocket-sized guide takes the guesswork out.Easy-to-use Tools to Maximize Your ResultsMy Quickstart Guide:Getting started is easy. Just follow this simple workout calendar, and you'll be on your way to your very own Rockin' Body.Never “Diet” Again Guide:Say goodbye to all those fad diets. This easy-to-follow plan works because it's not a diet—it's a plan you can stick with forever. The guide is filled with Shaun's favorite meals and recipes and shows you how simple it is to eat healthy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qgKYlUi%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B5LIE4C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Videos"]], "price": 27.94}}
{"item_id": "B00B5VY8UG", "title": "Mauser Stripper Clips 40CT 6.5x55mm 38,94,96 & 30-06, 1903, 1917", "description": "40x 6.5x55 mm stripper clips in a unopened box These are new stripper clips that will work on many firearms including the Swedish Mauser 38,94,96,1903 springfield,1917 Enfield and i have been told 6.5mm Arisaka rifles You will receive 40 new stripper clips with each order", "text": "Mauser Stripper Clips 40CT 6.5x55mm 38,94,96 & 30-06, 1903, 1917 40x 6.5x55 mm stripper clips in a unopened box These are new stripper clips that will work on many firearms including the Swedish Mauser 38,94,96,1903 springfield,1917 Enfield and i have been told 6.5mm Arisaka rifles You will receive 40 new stripper clips with each order", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MytbzJpbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B5VY8UG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Numrich", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 24.86}}
