{"item_id": "B00B6CONRM", "title": "Buck Commander Willie's Day Pack", "description": "As the ideal blend of mid-size pack and maximum storage, the new Willie's Day Pack is a straightforward approach to carrying gear into the field. The large cargo compartment accommodates bulky items while the accessory pocket is designed for easy access to smaller gear items. Padded shoulder straps with quick release strap allow for quick removal during fast hunting action.", "text": "Buck Commander Willie's Day Pack As the ideal blend of mid-size pack and maximum storage, the new Willie's Day Pack is a straightforward approach to carrying gear into the field. The large cargo compartment accommodates bulky items while the accessory pocket is designed for easy access to smaller gear items. Padded shoulder straps with quick release strap allow for quick removal during fast hunting action.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514YJ8sYWeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B6CONRM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00B6DVKO0", "title": "SigTac Compact Prismatic Rifle Scope", "description": "The Prismatic Scope is a lightweight solution for fast target acquisition. This rugged and reliable scope provides assured accuracy from a 3X fixed magnification reticle, graduated to 600 meters. It features three reticle modes – non-illuminated black, illuminated green and illuminated red, with each illuminated mode offering 5 brightness settings. Anodized aluminum construction ensures optimal performance in the most extreme conditions. Features:- 3 reticle modes – non-illuminated black, illuminated green and red- 5 brightness settings for each illuminated mode (green and red)- 3X fixed magnification ranging reticle- Windage & elevation adjustments- Anti-reflex & multilayer band pass optical coating- M1913/Weaver rail mount.", "text": "SigTac Compact Prismatic Rifle Scope The Prismatic Scope is a lightweight solution for fast target acquisition. This rugged and reliable scope provides assured accuracy from a 3X fixed magnification reticle, graduated to 600 meters. It features three reticle modes – non-illuminated black, illuminated green and illuminated red, with each illuminated mode offering 5 brightness settings. Anodized aluminum construction ensures optimal performance in the most extreme conditions. Features:- 3 reticle modes – non-illuminated black, illuminated green and red- 5 brightness settings for each illuminated mode (green and red)- 3X fixed magnification ranging reticle- Windage & elevation adjustments- Anti-reflex & multilayer band pass optical coating- M1913/Weaver rail mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xsHmO8nmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B6DVKO0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SigTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 149.0}}
