{"item_id": "B00B79NZNM", "title": "Blade-Tech Competition Gun Belt", "description": "Blade-Tech Competition Speed Belt This two-piece competition belt is designed for easy on, easy off operation with a rigid design to hold all of your Blade-Tech shooting gear. Great for USPSA and 3Gun matches. Measure your waist. Take that number and go to the next size. If your waist measures 38-Inch, Order a 40-Inch. If it measures 37-Inch, order a 40-Inch. The extra 2-Inch is for the extra space from the inner belt, pouches and holster. If you follow this guideline it will not fail. DO NOT use your pant size.", "text": "Blade-Tech Competition Gun Belt Blade-Tech Competition Speed Belt This two-piece competition belt is designed for easy on, easy off operation with a rigid design to hold all of your Blade-Tech shooting gear. Great for USPSA and 3Gun matches. Measure your waist. Take that number and go to the next size. If your waist measures 38-Inch, Order a 40-Inch. If it measures 37-Inch, order a 40-Inch. The extra 2-Inch is for the extra space from the inner belt, pouches and holster. If you follow this guideline it will not fail. DO NOT use your pant size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XYf3VzEeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B79NZNM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Belts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00B7B0FIS", "title": "NEW Self Cocking 80lb Draw Crossbow Pistol", "description": "This 80 lb draw weight, self-cocking crossbow makes cocking much more easy and safe. Manufactured with a strong plastic body and compressed molded fiberglass bow, this crossbow pistol is very durable and perfect for both hunting and target practice. Each crossbow includes 3 aluminum arrows with metal tips and adjustable tactical sight. With a firing speed of 165 fps, the 80 lb cross bow is great for hunting small game.", "text": "NEW Self Cocking 80lb Draw Crossbow Pistol This 80 lb draw weight, self-cocking crossbow makes cocking much more easy and safe. Manufactured with a strong plastic body and compressed molded fiberglass bow, this crossbow pistol is very durable and perfect for both hunting and target practice. Each crossbow includes 3 aluminum arrows with metal tips and adjustable tactical sight. With a firing speed of 165 fps, the 80 lb cross bow is great for hunting small game.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S5CYEh3-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B7B0FIS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 30.73}}
{"item_id": "B00B7RWNTG", "title": "PlugsSafety PSRP1-PPMD PermaPlug Thermoplastic Elastomer Metal Detectable Earplugs (1 Pair)", "description": "PlugsSafety two piece co-molded design uses two different durometers to achieve an ultra comfortable fit with a stiff core for ease of insertion. Triple flange design insures proper fit. Very competively priced. TPU insert provides easy attachment to all PlugsSafety products. Extremely durable TPE allows for extended life of the earplug. NRR 25/SLC80 18, Class 3/SNR 29.", "text": "PlugsSafety PSRP1-PPMD PermaPlug Thermoplastic Elastomer Metal Detectable Earplugs (1 Pair) PlugsSafety two piece co-molded design uses two different durometers to achieve an ultra comfortable fit with a stiff core for ease of insertion. Triple flange design insures proper fit. Very competively priced. TPU insert provides easy attachment to all PlugsSafety products. Extremely durable TPE allows for extended life of the earplug. NRR 25/SLC80 18, Class 3/SNR 29.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vPmOkGc8L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B7RWNTG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earplugs"]], "price": 2.17}}
