{"item_id": "B00B8XCVT6", "title": "5.56 223 Stripper Clips Repack Kit/ 7 Pocket Bandolier", "description": "NEW 2013 production stripper clips Factory new stripper clips. MADE IN THE USA BY A MAJOR CONTRACTOR TO THE US GOVERMENT STRIPPER CLIPS G.G.G./I.O.T. LOADERS VARIE BETWEEN K.S.W.,IOT AND G.G.G. LOADERS BANDOLIERS ARE VIETNAM ERA 7 POCKETS, STAMPED WITH DATES FROM 1970-1988 These are a 100% new repack kits Picture on listing shows old used bandoliers. Current bandoliers are new", "text": "5.56 223 Stripper Clips Repack Kit/ 7 Pocket Bandolier NEW 2013 production stripper clips Factory new stripper clips. MADE IN THE USA BY A MAJOR CONTRACTOR TO THE US GOVERMENT STRIPPER CLIPS G.G.G./I.O.T. LOADERS VARIE BETWEEN K.S.W.,IOT AND G.G.G. LOADERS BANDOLIERS ARE VIETNAM ERA 7 POCKETS, STAMPED WITH DATES FROM 1970-1988 These are a 100% new repack kits Picture on listing shows old used bandoliers. Current bandoliers are new", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ik5hvc96L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B8XCVT6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 17.22}}
{"item_id": "B00B8YRHH6", "title": "Tactical Crusader ProA1 Propane Adapter", "description": "The Tactical Crusader PROA1 Propane Adapter is made of Metal and is designed for easy filling of gas gun magazines. Simply add silicon lubricant, attach to the top of a standard propane can and fill the same way as you would if you were using a green gas canister. This allows the user to cut down on their spending without worrying about sacrificing performance, which means more money to spend on more guns and accessories. It is important, however, to always remember to add the needed silicon lubricant when using propane instead of green gas.", "text": "Tactical Crusader ProA1 Propane Adapter The Tactical Crusader PROA1 Propane Adapter is made of Metal and is designed for easy filling of gas gun magazines. Simply add silicon lubricant, attach to the top of a standard propane can and fill the same way as you would if you were using a green gas canister. This allows the user to cut down on their spending without worrying about sacrificing performance, which means more money to spend on more guns and accessories. It is important, however, to always remember to add the needed silicon lubricant when using propane instead of green gas.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416laEevVYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B8YRHH6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tactical Crusader", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 16.24}}
{"item_id": "B00B90H1T8", "title": "Morakniv Bushcraft Fixed Blade Knife with Sandvik Stainless Steel Blade, Orange, 0.125/4.3-Inch", "description": "The Mora Bushcraft Orange boasts a razor-sharp, burly, 1/8-inch (3.2 mm) thick stainless steel blade and is one of the most sturdy knives made by Mora. The spine of the blade is ridge ground so that it can be used with a fire starter. Mora Stainless steel options are ideally suited for outdoor applications where knives see hard use and are commonly exposed to dirt and moisture. The chromium content makes the Bushcraft extremely tolerant against wear and has considerable cutting strength, giving it a longer life overall. Mora Knives are made from high-quality Sandvik steel. Sandvik knife steels are characterized by ultra-fine carbides that result in superb forging and hardening properties. The absence of large carbide deposits promotes excellent edge sharpness for optimum cutting performance. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives.", "text": "Morakniv Bushcraft Fixed Blade Knife with Sandvik Stainless Steel Blade, Orange, 0.125/4.3-Inch The Mora Bushcraft Orange boasts a razor-sharp, burly, 1/8-inch (3.2 mm) thick stainless steel blade and is one of the most sturdy knives made by Mora. The spine of the blade is ridge ground so that it can be used with a fire starter. Mora Stainless steel options are ideally suited for outdoor applications where knives see hard use and are commonly exposed to dirt and moisture. The chromium content makes the Bushcraft extremely tolerant against wear and has considerable cutting strength, giving it a longer life overall. Mora Knives are made from high-quality Sandvik steel. Sandvik knife steels are characterized by ultra-fine carbides that result in superb forging and hardening properties. The absence of large carbide deposits promotes excellent edge sharpness for optimum cutting performance. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318KDQ0UPbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B90H1T8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morakniv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 25.99}}
{"item_id": "B00B99BAP0", "title": "Roswheel 4.2 Inch Cycling Bike Bicycle Frame Pannier Front Tube Bag Waterproof with Headphone Jack for Cell Phone Green", "description": "Features:Clear PVC window pouch designed for 4.2 inch mobile phonePE cotton filling of the main bag bodyBoth sides have the reflective strip for safe riding in nightSuitable for all type bikeImage - is a registered trademark protected by the US Trademark Law. Image products are sold by authorized sellers only", "text": "Roswheel 4.2 Inch Cycling Bike Bicycle Frame Pannier Front Tube Bag Waterproof with Headphone Jack for Cell Phone Green Features:Clear PVC window pouch designed for 4.2 inch mobile phonePE cotton filling of the main bag bodyBoth sides have the reflective strip for safe riding in nightSuitable for all type bikeImage - is a registered trademark protected by the US Trademark Law. Image products are sold by authorized sellers only", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vI9J2ojcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B99BAP0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Roswheel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 5.76}}
{"item_id": "B00B9AD8XG", "title": "Bridgestone Golf 2013 e6 Golf Balls (Pack of 12)", "description": "New 2013 e6 3-piece multi-layer golf ball designed to minimize spin for straighter, longer shots. The 2013 e6 is the softest multi-layer ball on the market. The e6 is available in White, Optic Yellow and Optic Orange.", "text": "Bridgestone Golf 2013 e6 Golf Balls (Pack of 12) New 2013 e6 3-piece multi-layer golf ball designed to minimize spin for straighter, longer shots. The 2013 e6 is the softest multi-layer ball on the market. The e6 is available in White, Optic Yellow and Optic Orange.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uV54ijx7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B9AD8XG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bridgestone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Standard Balls"]], "price": 24.9}}
{"item_id": "B00B9HZPBW", "title": "Strike Industries 2 Packs Shock Buffer for Glock 17, 17l, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 24c, 31, 32, 37 (Not Compatible with Gen 4) **** FREE shipping when checkout *****", "description": "The SI GSB is a polyester based thermoplastic polyurethane barrier that is uniquely designed to absorb recoil. The GSB was designed to increase durability between the areas of the metal slide and polymer frame while also decrease the amount of overall wear. The GSB is compatible with several models of GlockTM and comes in two degrees of hardness for the user's desire comfort level of recoil relief. The relief gained will also decrease the shock to your hands which prevents muscle fatigue and allows for more control for the next shot. It is engineered with a retaining design to ensure buffer will be secured on the slide and has added extra cushion knobs for extra buffer.Note:For Glock 17, 17L, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 24C, 31, 32, 37. Not for Gen4Package include:1 x Smoke Shock 95 degree buffer1 x Red Shock 115 degree bufferProduct Spec:Length: \"Weight: 0.1ozMaterials:polyester based thermoplastic polyurethaneColor: Smoke, RedGlockTM is the trademark owned by GlockTM Inc.", "text": "Strike Industries 2 Packs Shock Buffer for Glock 17, 17l, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 24c, 31, 32, 37 (Not Compatible with Gen 4) **** FREE shipping when checkout ***** The SI GSB is a polyester based thermoplastic polyurethane barrier that is uniquely designed to absorb recoil. The GSB was designed to increase durability between the areas of the metal slide and polymer frame while also decrease the amount of overall wear. The GSB is compatible with several models of GlockTM and comes in two degrees of hardness for the user's desire comfort level of recoil relief. The relief gained will also decrease the shock to your hands which prevents muscle fatigue and allows for more control for the next shot. It is engineered with a retaining design to ensure buffer will be secured on the slide and has added extra cushion knobs for extra buffer.Note:For Glock 17, 17L, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 24C, 31, 32, 37. Not for Gen4Package include:1 x Smoke Shock 95 degree buffer1 x Red Shock 115 degree bufferProduct Spec:Length: \"Weight: 0.1ozMaterials:polyester based thermoplastic polyurethaneColor: Smoke, RedGlockTM is the trademark owned by GlockTM Inc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413b-6spjqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B9HZPBW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Strike Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 9.95}}
