{"item_id": "B00B9XD6IA", "title": "SNIPER Tactical Smart Polymer Picatinny/weaver Front And Rear Combo Set Flip Up Backup AR15 AR-15 M16 M4 M-4 Flattop A1 A2 Post Back Up Sight", "description": "Tactical Combo Of Front And Rear Polymer Iron Sights. • Quick Detachable Front Sight with Adjustable A2 Square Post Assembly to Fit All Picatinny/Weaver Style Rails • Equipped with Locking Retention Allen Wrench and Clever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Condition • Precision Elevation Adjustments to Enhance Shooting Accuracy • Profile Designed for Installation on Gas Block • Integral Picatinny Mounting Deck to Fit All Flat Tops • Dual Aiming Apertures for All Shooting Requirements • Precision Windage Adjustments • Clever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Conditions • User Friendly Locking With allen Wrench for Easy Installation", "text": "SNIPER Tactical Smart Polymer Picatinny/weaver Front And Rear Combo Set Flip Up Backup AR15 AR-15 M16 M4 M-4 Flattop A1 A2 Post Back Up Sight Tactical Combo Of Front And Rear Polymer Iron Sights. • Quick Detachable Front Sight with Adjustable A2 Square Post Assembly to Fit All Picatinny/Weaver Style Rails • Equipped with Locking Retention Allen Wrench and Clever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Condition • Precision Elevation Adjustments to Enhance Shooting Accuracy • Profile Designed for Installation on Gas Block • Integral Picatinny Mounting Deck to Fit All Flat Tops • Dual Aiming Apertures for All Shooting Requirements • Precision Windage Adjustments • Clever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Conditions • User Friendly Locking With allen Wrench for Easy Installation", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mjal1503L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00B9XD6IA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 20.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BAHMHQW", "title": "Nikon P-223 BDC 600 Riflescope with Rapid Action Turret, Black, 4-12x40", "description": "Nikon has expanded its line of precision optics for MSR platform rifles by adding a new magnification to the popular P-223 riflescope. Now available in 4-12x40 with BDC 600 reticle, the new P-223 makes any AR rifle more effective at longer ranges. The P-223 4-12x40 comes in matte finish and is built with Fully Multicoated lenses. For the first time, one riflescope provides a choice between two different methods of bullet drop compensation. One way to compensate for bullet drop at long ranges is by using the BDC 600 reticle with open circle aiming points and hash marks from 100 to 600 yards. The BDC 600 reticle was developed specifically for the trajectory of the.223 Rem./5.56 NATO round with 55-grain polymer tip bullet and is most effective when used with Spot On Ballistic Match Technology. The other way to compensate for bullet drop is by using Nikon's Rapid Action Turret system that allows shooters to dial in their distances and hold the BDC reticle's horizontal crosshair directly on the target. Distances as far as 100 to 600 yards can be dialed in, making the Rapid Action Turret system a quick and easy option for long range shooting.", "text": "Nikon P-223 BDC 600 Riflescope with Rapid Action Turret, Black, 4-12x40 Nikon has expanded its line of precision optics for MSR platform rifles by adding a new magnification to the popular P-223 riflescope. Now available in 4-12x40 with BDC 600 reticle, the new P-223 makes any AR rifle more effective at longer ranges. The P-223 4-12x40 comes in matte finish and is built with Fully Multicoated lenses. For the first time, one riflescope provides a choice between two different methods of bullet drop compensation. One way to compensate for bullet drop at long ranges is by using the BDC 600 reticle with open circle aiming points and hash marks from 100 to 600 yards. The BDC 600 reticle was developed specifically for the trajectory of the.223 Rem./5.56 NATO round with 55-grain polymer tip bullet and is most effective when used with Spot On Ballistic Match Technology. The other way to compensate for bullet drop is by using Nikon's Rapid Action Turret system that allows shooters to dial in their distances and hold the BDC reticle's horizontal crosshair directly on the target. Distances as far as 100 to 600 yards can be dialed in, making the Rapid Action Turret system a quick and easy option for long range shooting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WDDy2HJ8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BAHMHQW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 196.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BAKVXWI", "title": "AGPtek® Green Bigger Size Roswheel Waterproof Bicycle Cycling Frame Pannier Front Tube Bag (Including Headphone Jack and Clear PVC Window Pouch for 4.2 inch Cell Phone, Reflective Strips for Safe Night Riding)", "description": "Specifications:Color: Green BlackMaterial: 600D+PU+PVCDimensions: 17.5 * 8 * 9cmWeight: 129gPacking Include:1 * Bike bagTrademark AGPtek products are marketed exclusively by Brainydeal, any misuse of AGPtek without prior approval from AGPtek will take legal action.", "text": "AGPtek® Green Bigger Size Roswheel Waterproof Bicycle Cycling Frame Pannier Front Tube Bag (Including Headphone Jack and Clear PVC Window Pouch for 4.2 inch Cell Phone, Reflective Strips for Safe Night Riding) Specifications:Color: Green BlackMaterial: 600D+PU+PVCDimensions: 17.5 * 8 * 9cmWeight: 129gPacking Include:1 * Bike bagTrademark AGPtek products are marketed exclusively by Brainydeal, any misuse of AGPtek without prior approval from AGPtek will take legal action.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gwtN2CNQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BAKVXWI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AGPtek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]], "price": 7.99}}
