{"item_id": "B00BBJI9PW", "title": "KA-BAR BK-10 BECKER CREWMAN FIXED BLADE SURVIVAL KNIFE w/ FRONT POCKET SHEATH", "description": "Ethan Becker founded Becker Knife & Tool in the early 1980's and set about designing, manufacturing and selling the industrial-strength tactical and survival knives that he had always wanted for himself. His products, the BK&T; line, have gone a long way to making these now popular all-black knives in demand. The Kabar Becker Crewman knife is no different. It is made of.188\" thick 1095 Cro-Van Steel and offers a 5 1/2\" straight edge blade. It has a black zytel handle and includes a heavy-duty polyester sheath with front pocket. The KA-BAR Becker BK10 is sure to be a hit with salty Beckerheads and those just learning about the brand.", "text": "KA-BAR BK-10 BECKER CREWMAN FIXED BLADE SURVIVAL KNIFE w/ FRONT POCKET SHEATH Ethan Becker founded Becker Knife & Tool in the early 1980's and set about designing, manufacturing and selling the industrial-strength tactical and survival knives that he had always wanted for himself. His products, the BK&T; line, have gone a long way to making these now popular all-black knives in demand. The Kabar Becker Crewman knife is no different. It is made of.188\" thick 1095 Cro-Van Steel and offers a 5 1/2\" straight edge blade. It has a black zytel handle and includes a heavy-duty polyester sheath with front pocket. The KA-BAR Becker BK10 is sure to be a hit with salty Beckerheads and those just learning about the brand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IRNEM7N7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBJI9PW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 77.75}}
{"item_id": "B00BBJIAZQ", "title": "Ka-Bar BK24 D'Eskabar Fixed Blade Hunting Knife", "description": "Ethan Becker founded Becker Knife & Tool in the early 1980's and set about designing, manufacturing and selling the industrial-strength tactical and survival knives that he had always wanted for himself. The Becker D'Eskabar is made with high quality D2 steel with a stonewashed finish. It features the Becker Necker blade shape and the ESEE Izulu handle shape for the best end product. Sold with hard plastic sheath. Cord included.", "text": "Ka-Bar BK24 D'Eskabar Fixed Blade Hunting Knife Ethan Becker founded Becker Knife & Tool in the early 1980's and set about designing, manufacturing and selling the industrial-strength tactical and survival knives that he had always wanted for himself. The Becker D'Eskabar is made with high quality D2 steel with a stonewashed finish. It features the Becker Necker blade shape and the ESEE Izulu handle shape for the best end product. Sold with hard plastic sheath. Cord included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Xqd8Ji1SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBJIAZQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 51.98}}
{"item_id": "B00BBJQYEA", "title": "Gerber 30-000792 Downrange Tomahawk with Molle Compatible Sheath", "description": "The Downrange Tomahawk is a modern take on an ancient instrument of war - specifically designed to accomplish three breaching tasks. The axe head cuts through walls and rope while the hammer head is the perfect size for smashing through obstacles like hinges, door knobs and locking devices. A hefty pry at the end of the tool can be employed confidently with a cutaway handle in the axe head - this allows the user to maximize leverage during the breach. Desert Tan G-10 scales mount the 420HC steel with KG gun cote to provide maximum grip regardless of environment. The Downrange Tomahawk is an indestructible instrument of destruction.", "text": "Gerber 30-000792 Downrange Tomahawk with Molle Compatible Sheath The Downrange Tomahawk is a modern take on an ancient instrument of war - specifically designed to accomplish three breaching tasks. The axe head cuts through walls and rope while the hammer head is the perfect size for smashing through obstacles like hinges, door knobs and locking devices. A hefty pry at the end of the tool can be employed confidently with a cutaway handle in the axe head - this allows the user to maximize leverage during the breach. Desert Tan G-10 scales mount the 420HC steel with KG gun cote to provide maximum grip regardless of environment. The Downrange Tomahawk is an indestructible instrument of destruction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FRgPJk4VL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBJQYEA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Axes"]], "price": 165.7}}
{"item_id": "B00BBJS43E", "title": "13 Diamond Infinite Edge Bow Pkg Black OPS RH 13-30\" 5-70", "description": "For maximum adjustability and unlimited value, Diamond Archery has released the Infinite Edge. Pushing the limits of performance, the Infinite Edge is so versatile that it will be the last bow you will ever have to buy. It features an incredible draw length range of 13 to 30 inches and draw weight range from 5 to 70 pounds to provide dependability for any archer as they develop. The Infinite Edge also comes with an infinite draw setting for training programs, first time shooters, or bowfishers.", "text": "13 Diamond Infinite Edge Bow Pkg Black OPS RH 13-30\" 5-70 For maximum adjustability and unlimited value, Diamond Archery has released the Infinite Edge. Pushing the limits of performance, the Infinite Edge is so versatile that it will be the last bow you will ever have to buy. It features an incredible draw length range of 13 to 30 inches and draw weight range from 5 to 70 pounds to provide dependability for any archer as they develop. The Infinite Edge also comes with an infinite draw setting for training programs, first time shooters, or bowfishers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MEipG9yjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBJS43E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Diamond Archery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Air Decompression Limit Monitors"]], "price": 330.58}}
{"item_id": "B00BBJTG40", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's 1105K Endorser Razor Edge Knife", "description": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's Endorser is one of those knives that is real tough to pass up, thanks to a solid \"no nonsense\" design. Need a new knife to call your \"ol' reliable\"? This straight forward folding knife is both fundamentally sound and physically fit for today's knife enthusiasts. We put the utility driven, drop-point blade shape into a progressively functional handle design complete with finger grooves and slight palm swell. Handles are G10 with blackened stainless steel liners. The blade is available in both satin finish and black oxide coated. The patented Fire Safe thumb-stud opener secures the blade at the ready for when it's needed, and our patented OutBurst assisted opening system makes blade opening quick. The Endorser employs a locking-liner for effective lock up and it's also easy to close when needed. Some knives don't need any hard sell to stand out-they endorse themselves.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's 1105K Endorser Razor Edge Knife Columbia River Knife and Tool's Endorser is one of those knives that is real tough to pass up, thanks to a solid \"no nonsense\" design. Need a new knife to call your \"ol' reliable\"? This straight forward folding knife is both fundamentally sound and physically fit for today's knife enthusiasts. We put the utility driven, drop-point blade shape into a progressively functional handle design complete with finger grooves and slight palm swell. Handles are G10 with blackened stainless steel liners. The blade is available in both satin finish and black oxide coated. The patented Fire Safe thumb-stud opener secures the blade at the ready for when it's needed, and our patented OutBurst assisted opening system makes blade opening quick. The Endorser employs a locking-liner for effective lock up and it's also easy to close when needed. Some knives don't need any hard sell to stand out-they endorse themselves.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ILpHgc4GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBJTG40.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 34.15}}
{"item_id": "B00BBO7TXU", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's K240XXP Ken Onion Swindle Razor Edge Knife, Flat Handle", "description": "Who better to \"cheat\" the rules of typical folding pocket knife design other than world renowned Knife Designer Ken Onion, whose new Swindle design flows from tip to tail with the slightest of uphill curve. It innocently tricks the eye at first sight, but once in the hand the functional subtleties become apparent. The frame lock mechanics and flipper style opener are neatly tucked into the handle, and the hollow ground, modified wharncliffe blade moves with ease thanks to the smooth IKBS pivot system. The IKBS innovation is arguably the strongest, smoothest pivot system on the market. The Swindle comes in two versions, both with Razor Sharp Cutting Edges with two distinguished handles. The K240XXP in a flat, smooth handled version and the K241XXP in a distinctive grooved handle. Both excellent selections for the refined knife enthusiast. For carry, Ken went the extra mile with a clip design flowing from the tail end, back over the spine. The tension lever securely clips into the pocket and \"nests\" the knife for comfort. If you are seeking a classy, slim everyday carry knife that \"bends\" the rules in your favor, the Swindle is a good bet.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's K240XXP Ken Onion Swindle Razor Edge Knife, Flat Handle Who better to \"cheat\" the rules of typical folding pocket knife design other than world renowned Knife Designer Ken Onion, whose new Swindle design flows from tip to tail with the slightest of uphill curve. It innocently tricks the eye at first sight, but once in the hand the functional subtleties become apparent. The frame lock mechanics and flipper style opener are neatly tucked into the handle, and the hollow ground, modified wharncliffe blade moves with ease thanks to the smooth IKBS pivot system. The IKBS innovation is arguably the strongest, smoothest pivot system on the market. The Swindle comes in two versions, both with Razor Sharp Cutting Edges with two distinguished handles. The K240XXP in a flat, smooth handled version and the K241XXP in a distinctive grooved handle. Both excellent selections for the refined knife enthusiast. For carry, Ken went the extra mile with a clip design flowing from the tail end, back over the spine. The tension lever securely clips into the pocket and \"nests\" the knife for comfort. If you are seeking a classy, slim everyday carry knife that \"bends\" the rules in your favor, the Swindle is a good bet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IjVASnsgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBO7TXU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 35.24}}
{"item_id": "B00BBOBEEU", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's 2906 Otanashi noh Ken Tactical Folding Knife by James Williams", "description": "As a veteran and current martial arts practitioner/instructor, James Williams knows cutlery-especially the tactical variety. So, it's no surprise that his Hissatsu knife designs have quickly become mainstays within the military Special Forces and tactical Law Enforcement communities across the globe. Whether a folding or fixed blade knife variation, these are focused, single-purpose knives, for use in close quarters battle (CQB) environments, either as a primary or a secondary weapon to augment the handgun in the hands of well-trained professionals. The Otanashi noh Ken was designed by James Williams per a request from SOCOM for a larger, thinner, folding combat knife that was easy to carry and conceal. The Osoraku style blade, made famous by the 16th century Samurai warlord Takeda Shingen, is efficient and effective. This knife has a longer blade than the Hissatsu Folder and yet is slimmer to carry than the popular Heiho folding knife. The Otanashi noh Ken and Hissatsu knife designs were developed for exceptional penetrating ability in tactical use situations. The clip allows deep, inconspicuous, carry and the frame lock design is for strength and simplicity in operations. James Williams' work with worldwide military Special Operations and his extensive classical Samurai training means that this knife is designed to perform at the highest level, when you need it most.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool's 2906 Otanashi noh Ken Tactical Folding Knife by James Williams As a veteran and current martial arts practitioner/instructor, James Williams knows cutlery-especially the tactical variety. So, it's no surprise that his Hissatsu knife designs have quickly become mainstays within the military Special Forces and tactical Law Enforcement communities across the globe. Whether a folding or fixed blade knife variation, these are focused, single-purpose knives, for use in close quarters battle (CQB) environments, either as a primary or a secondary weapon to augment the handgun in the hands of well-trained professionals. The Otanashi noh Ken was designed by James Williams per a request from SOCOM for a larger, thinner, folding combat knife that was easy to carry and conceal. The Osoraku style blade, made famous by the 16th century Samurai warlord Takeda Shingen, is efficient and effective. This knife has a longer blade than the Hissatsu Folder and yet is slimmer to carry than the popular Heiho folding knife. The Otanashi noh Ken and Hissatsu knife designs were developed for exceptional penetrating ability in tactical use situations. The clip allows deep, inconspicuous, carry and the frame lock design is for strength and simplicity in operations. James Williams' work with worldwide military Special Operations and his extensive classical Samurai training means that this knife is designed to perform at the highest level, when you need it most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AkqoFJf8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBOBEEU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 89.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BBPAHJ2", "title": "SigTac Retention Roto Paddle Holster (Right)", "description": "Made of durable, high-tech, black polymer, these right-handed holsters use a unique patented retention system with a zero time to disengage feature. Simply depressing the lever allows for instant removal of the firearm. Features: - Comfortable, contoured fit holster is positioned to where your trigger finger normally rests at \"The Ready\". - Fully adjustable for cant. - Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.) - Adjusts with simple Allen key. - Protective sight channel. - Right hand models only. Fits: Baby Eagle 9mm/40.", "text": "SigTac Retention Roto Paddle Holster (Right) Made of durable, high-tech, black polymer, these right-handed holsters use a unique patented retention system with a zero time to disengage feature. Simply depressing the lever allows for instant removal of the firearm. Features: - Comfortable, contoured fit holster is positioned to where your trigger finger normally rests at \"The Ready\". - Fully adjustable for cant. - Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.) - Adjusts with simple Allen key. - Protective sight channel. - Right hand models only. Fits: Baby Eagle 9mm/40.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XgIz85UKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBPAHJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BBPANFA", "title": "Ontario Knives 8861 Folding Knife, Black", "description": "The Model 2 features the same 4-way clip position, heavy-duty open post construction, razor-sharp AUS-8 blade, full flat grind, reversible thumb stud, precision pivot screw, lanyard hole and ergonomic handles as it's larger brother the Model 1 but is 20% smaller. Features:- Hardened stainless steel liners- Dual thumb studs- 4-position pocket clip- Lanyard hole Specifications:- Blade Length: 3\"- Overall Length: 7\"- Closed Length: 4\"- Steel: AUS 8 Stainless Steel, Black- Handle Material: Black FRN- Hardness: 57-59 RC- Weight: 2.7 oz.", "text": "Ontario Knives 8861 Folding Knife, Black The Model 2 features the same 4-way clip position, heavy-duty open post construction, razor-sharp AUS-8 blade, full flat grind, reversible thumb stud, precision pivot screw, lanyard hole and ergonomic handles as it's larger brother the Model 1 but is 20% smaller. Features:- Hardened stainless steel liners- Dual thumb studs- 4-position pocket clip- Lanyard hole Specifications:- Blade Length: 3\"- Overall Length: 7\"- Closed Length: 4\"- Steel: AUS 8 Stainless Steel, Black- Handle Material: Black FRN- Hardness: 57-59 RC- Weight: 2.7 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416aUojREUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBPANFA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 27.47}}
{"item_id": "B00BBPAOCW", "title": "Ontario Knives Model II Folding Knife, Black", "description": "If you like the Ontario RAT Model 1, but want something a little less bulky, then you'll love the Model 2. The RAT Model II is based on the popular Model I, it's smaller, but retains the same great shape and performance of the original. This knife is designed for comfort and performance with an index finger groove on the handle to keep your hand where it should be and jimping on the spine of the blade for controlled cutting. The handle features textured black nylon 6 scales with an open-built steel linerlock frame. The AUS-8 stainless steel drop point blade has a satin finish and a plain cutting edge. The RAT Model 2 is fully ambidextrous with dual thumb studs and a 4-way reversible pocket clip. Specifications: - Overall Length: 7.00\" - Blade Length: 3.00\" - Cutting Edge: 2.75\", Plain - Blade Thickness: 0.093\" - Blade Steel: AUS-8, RC 58-60 - Blade Color: Satin - Handle Material: Nylon 6 Handle Color: Black - Closed Length: 4.00\" - Handle Thickness: 0.43\" - Weight: 2.8 oz.", "text": "Ontario Knives Model II Folding Knife, Black If you like the Ontario RAT Model 1, but want something a little less bulky, then you'll love the Model 2. The RAT Model II is based on the popular Model I, it's smaller, but retains the same great shape and performance of the original. This knife is designed for comfort and performance with an index finger groove on the handle to keep your hand where it should be and jimping on the spine of the blade for controlled cutting. The handle features textured black nylon 6 scales with an open-built steel linerlock frame. The AUS-8 stainless steel drop point blade has a satin finish and a plain cutting edge. The RAT Model 2 is fully ambidextrous with dual thumb studs and a 4-way reversible pocket clip. Specifications: - Overall Length: 7.00\" - Blade Length: 3.00\" - Cutting Edge: 2.75\", Plain - Blade Thickness: 0.093\" - Blade Steel: AUS-8, RC 58-60 - Blade Color: Satin - Handle Material: Nylon 6 Handle Color: Black - Closed Length: 4.00\" - Handle Thickness: 0.43\" - Weight: 2.8 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MnRT0aV-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBPAOCW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 27.54}}
{"item_id": "B00BBPAOYU", "title": "Ontario Knives 8862 Folding Knife, Pink", "description": "The Model 2 features the same 4-way clip position, heavy-duty open post construction, razor-sharp AUS-8 blade, full flat grind, reversible thumb stud, precision pivot screw, lanyard hole and ergonomic handles as it's larger brother the Model 1 but is 20% smaller. Features:- Hardened stainless steel liners- Dual thumb studs- 4-position pocket clip- Lanyard hole Specifications:- Blade Length: 3\"- Overall Length: 7\"- Closed Length: 4\"- Steel: AUS 8 Stainless Steel- Handle Material: Black FRN- Hardness: 57-59 RC- Weight: 2.7 oz.", "text": "Ontario Knives 8862 Folding Knife, Pink The Model 2 features the same 4-way clip position, heavy-duty open post construction, razor-sharp AUS-8 blade, full flat grind, reversible thumb stud, precision pivot screw, lanyard hole and ergonomic handles as it's larger brother the Model 1 but is 20% smaller. Features:- Hardened stainless steel liners- Dual thumb studs- 4-position pocket clip- Lanyard hole Specifications:- Blade Length: 3\"- Overall Length: 7\"- Closed Length: 4\"- Steel: AUS 8 Stainless Steel- Handle Material: Black FRN- Hardness: 57-59 RC- Weight: 2.7 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ROfTXEPKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBPAOYU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 26.5}}
{"item_id": "B00BBQQ3AI", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools JB01K-CP Brous Series Snarl Knife with Straight Edge 2.3-Inch Steel Blade and Black Molded Nylon Sheath, Satin Finish", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools JB01K-CP Brous Series Snarl Knife with Straight Edge 2.3-Inch Steel Blade and Black Molded Nylon Sheath, Satin Finish", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314iplOP7LL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBQQ3AI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 30.59}}
{"item_id": "B00BBZPE3Q", "title": "Hard Rubber Training Gun", "description": "New, Improved! Constructed of dense synthetic silicone with the exact size and design of the popular automatic pistol. Ideal for safely practicing disarming techniques against firearms. Very popular for law enforcement agencies. These high quality training aids are now available to all qualified instructors! Available in 'safety' colors only so they cannot be mistaken for a real firearm, and to comply with 'Limitation Gun' laws. New improved material is not as stiff as previous models for safer, more realistic training! 8.5 inch long, 5.5 inch tall. Approx. 18.6 oz.", "text": "Hard Rubber Training Gun New, Improved! Constructed of dense synthetic silicone with the exact size and design of the popular automatic pistol. Ideal for safely practicing disarming techniques against firearms. Very popular for law enforcement agencies. These high quality training aids are now available to all qualified instructors! Available in 'safety' colors only so they cannot be mistaken for a real firearm, and to comply with 'Limitation Gun' laws. New improved material is not as stiff as previous models for safer, more realistic training! 8.5 inch long, 5.5 inch tall. Approx. 18.6 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41We9FjbC%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BBZPE3Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BladesUSA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BC1ZVP0", "title": "AR15 M4 FLAT TOP 1 INCH COMPACT RISER MOUNT PICATINNY RAIL 8 RING SLOT", "description": "One piece skeleton body design with unique stylingAttaches to flat top Picatinny rails to raise line of sight by 1\"Locks firmly in place with two large thumb screwsInstalls in secondsMultiple ring slots (8) to adjust for proper sight positionMade of heavy duty quality aluminum alloy 6061Anodized matte black finishTakes standard PICATINNY OR Weaver ringsMount overall length: 3.5\"(85mm)Weight: 3.5OZ", "text": "AR15 M4 FLAT TOP 1 INCH COMPACT RISER MOUNT PICATINNY RAIL 8 RING SLOT One piece skeleton body design with unique stylingAttaches to flat top Picatinny rails to raise line of sight by 1\"Locks firmly in place with two large thumb screwsInstalls in secondsMultiple ring slots (8) to adjust for proper sight positionMade of heavy duty quality aluminum alloy 6061Anodized matte black finishTakes standard PICATINNY OR Weaver ringsMount overall length: 3.5\"(85mm)Weight: 3.5OZ", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HAjzPAziL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BC1ZVP0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 18.75}}
{"item_id": "B00BC56IB2", "title": "1 inch Picatinni Picatinny Offset Flashlight Ring Mount with QD Cam Lock", "description": "A 1inch OFFSET ring mount with QD cam lock for use with 1inch tactical flashlights or red dot sight with 1inch main tube* Made of solid aluminum alloy to withstand shock and recoil* Fits 7/8\" Weaver or Picatinny rails and bases as commonly found on ARs and handguns with accessory rails*Installs and uninstalls in seconds using quick detach cam lock* Offset design allows easier access to flashlight tail cap button switch* Accepts flashlights and red dot sights with 1 inch main tube* 4 screws (two on each side) hold flashlight firmly in place.* Anodized matte black finish* Mount width: 1.20inch* Weight: 2.6oz.", "text": "1 inch Picatinni Picatinny Offset Flashlight Ring Mount with QD Cam Lock A 1inch OFFSET ring mount with QD cam lock for use with 1inch tactical flashlights or red dot sight with 1inch main tube* Made of solid aluminum alloy to withstand shock and recoil* Fits 7/8\" Weaver or Picatinny rails and bases as commonly found on ARs and handguns with accessory rails*Installs and uninstalls in seconds using quick detach cam lock* Offset design allows easier access to flashlight tail cap button switch* Accepts flashlights and red dot sights with 1 inch main tube* 4 screws (two on each side) hold flashlight firmly in place.* Anodized matte black finish* Mount width: 1.20inch* Weight: 2.6oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EWK7HH8LL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BC56IB2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BC6036C", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pro Series Forged Front Sight 3/16 Hex Nut DriverTool For All Glock Models Pistol Gun Handgun", "description": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pro Series tool for ealily removing & installing Glock front sights. Forged to fits the small, hex head screw that holds Glock aftermarket sights in place. It will make installing replacement sights or removing sights for maintenance much easier and more secure with significantly less chance of damage to your firearm. Also fits Walther P99, Smith &Wesson; SW99, and other pistols with sights that use 3 / 16\" hex head screws.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pro Series Forged Front Sight 3/16 Hex Nut DriverTool For All Glock Models Pistol Gun Handgun Ultimate Arms Gear Pro Series tool for ealily removing & installing Glock front sights. Forged to fits the small, hex head screw that holds Glock aftermarket sights in place. It will make installing replacement sights or removing sights for maintenance much easier and more secure with significantly less chance of damage to your firearm. Also fits Walther P99, Smith &Wesson; SW99, and other pistols with sights that use 3 / 16\" hex head screws.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mCE0I34dL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BC6036C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BCAYO2M", "title": "Princeton Tec Vizz Headlamp", "description": "FEATURES of the Princeton Tec Vizz Headlamp 2 Ultrabright LEDs: The highest quality LED available, the Ultrabright LED is bright and efficient. The smooth, white, wide-beam light emitted by Ultrabright LEDs is ideal for close to mid-range tasks 3 AAA Alkaline batteries (Included) Dimmable LED: This advanced circuitry allows selection of whichever power level suits user requirements Heatsink Technology: Princeton Tec has developed proprietary ultralight heatsinks to protect LED products from overheating. Even though LEDs operate at much lower temperatures than traditional incandescent bulbs, they still generate heat. If this heat is not dissipated, the LED will suffer irreversible damage. By using heatsinks, Princeton Tec lights can burn at extreme brightness levels for long periods of time. The heatsink may be incorporated internally or externally depending on the product and its application Focused Narrow Beams: This pattern creates a long, powerful beam of light excellent for illuminating distant areas. The resulting long-throw spotlight is especially well-suited for night hiking and search and rescue Lumen 150: The light output of Princeton Tec lights is measured in lumens. A lumen is unit derived by the International System of Units (SI) for measuring light output Maxbright LED: The highest quality LED available from Lumileds, Princeton Tec's Maxbright LED is extremely bright and efficient. This single LED emits a smooth, powerful, white light useful for a wide range of tasks. Princeton Tec uses collimators or reflectors with the Maxbright LED depending upon the application Multiple Modes: Multiple settings on many of our products give you the flexibility to adjust your light's brightness and/or beam width to illuminate greater distances or to conserve battery power, depending on your needs Regulated LED / Constant Brightness: Princeton Tec lights that feature regulated LEDs have a sophisticated regulating circuit that maintains initial brightness as long as the", "text": "Princeton Tec Vizz Headlamp FEATURES of the Princeton Tec Vizz Headlamp 2 Ultrabright LEDs: The highest quality LED available, the Ultrabright LED is bright and efficient. The smooth, white, wide-beam light emitted by Ultrabright LEDs is ideal for close to mid-range tasks 3 AAA Alkaline batteries (Included) Dimmable LED: This advanced circuitry allows selection of whichever power level suits user requirements Heatsink Technology: Princeton Tec has developed proprietary ultralight heatsinks to protect LED products from overheating. Even though LEDs operate at much lower temperatures than traditional incandescent bulbs, they still generate heat. If this heat is not dissipated, the LED will suffer irreversible damage. By using heatsinks, Princeton Tec lights can burn at extreme brightness levels for long periods of time. The heatsink may be incorporated internally or externally depending on the product and its application Focused Narrow Beams: This pattern creates a long, powerful beam of light excellent for illuminating distant areas. The resulting long-throw spotlight is especially well-suited for night hiking and search and rescue Lumen 150: The light output of Princeton Tec lights is measured in lumens. A lumen is unit derived by the International System of Units (SI) for measuring light output Maxbright LED: The highest quality LED available from Lumileds, Princeton Tec's Maxbright LED is extremely bright and efficient. This single LED emits a smooth, powerful, white light useful for a wide range of tasks. Princeton Tec uses collimators or reflectors with the Maxbright LED depending upon the application Multiple Modes: Multiple settings on many of our products give you the flexibility to adjust your light's brightness and/or beam width to illuminate greater distances or to conserve battery power, depending on your needs Regulated LED / Constant Brightness: Princeton Tec lights that feature regulated LEDs have a sophisticated regulating circuit that maintains initial brightness as long as the", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314P5TUpRZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BCAYO2M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Princeton Tec", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 40.23}}
{"item_id": "B00BCFQ970", "title": "BOKER PLUS Cera-Neck Fixed Blade Knife, Black", "description": "This neck knife, made completely of ceramic, is not only corrosion resistant but also provides outstanding edge holding ability. The paracord wrapped handle and Kydex sheath make it comfortable and easy to carry. Blade length: 1 5/8\". Overall length: 4 1/4\". Weight: 1.3 oz.", "text": "BOKER PLUS Cera-Neck Fixed Blade Knife, Black This neck knife, made completely of ceramic, is not only corrosion resistant but also provides outstanding edge holding ability. The paracord wrapped handle and Kydex sheath make it comfortable and easy to carry. Blade length: 1 5/8\". Overall length: 4 1/4\". Weight: 1.3 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ybxYqbTLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BCFQ970.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BOKER PLUS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 30.55}}
{"item_id": "B00BCKOKD0", "title": "Otis B.O.N.E. Tool", "description": "Effectively cleans the bolt carrier assembly area including the bolt, bolt carrier and firing pin. Designed for .223/5.56mm Rifles.", "text": "Otis B.O.N.E. Tool Effectively cleans the bolt carrier assembly area including the bolt, bolt carrier and firing pin. Designed for .223/5.56mm Rifles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31B9GAdOPxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BCKOKD0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 20.5}}
