{"item_id": "B00BERBWQY", "title": "Da Vinci Pair of Neoprene Dumbbells with Non-Slip Grip, Choose Your Dumbbell Weight", "description": "Da Vinci Dumbbells are made of cast iron and are coated with Neoprene for durability, comfort, and to help protect you, the floor, and other fitness facility and equipment in case of drops. The Neoprene surface provides for a comfortable and sure grip that won't slip due to sweaty hands. These dumbbells are the ideal athlete companion to help tone arms, shoulder and back, and the hexagonal shape prevents the dumbbells from rolling when put away. Choose from a variety of sizes and colors. Sold in pairs so you will receive 2 dumbells in one package.", "text": "Da Vinci Pair of Neoprene Dumbbells with Non-Slip Grip, Choose Your Dumbbell Weight Da Vinci Dumbbells are made of cast iron and are coated with Neoprene for durability, comfort, and to help protect you, the floor, and other fitness facility and equipment in case of drops. The Neoprene surface provides for a comfortable and sure grip that won't slip due to sweaty hands. These dumbbells are the ideal athlete companion to help tone arms, shoulder and back, and the hexagonal shape prevents the dumbbells from rolling when put away. Choose from a variety of sizes and colors. Sold in pairs so you will receive 2 dumbells in one package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Nxq-3WhdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BERBWQY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Dumbbells"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BF0J2MG", "title": "Worlds Finest Trimmer 300 AAC Blackout", "description": "The WFT was developed as a precision tool built to last a lifetime (or more) and uses a source of power most people already own - a cordless or electric drill. Once adjusted to the user's preference, it's simply a matter of chucking it up in a drill and feeding cases in by hand - a pace of 10 cases per minute is pretty easy to maintain. The razor sharp high-speed cutters and the sealed ball bearing incorporated into the trimmer produce an extremely smooth cut. In most cases it will only be necessary to slightly chamfer the inner edge of the case mouth. Unlike other case trimmers the W.F.T. does not use pilots, the case is supported by the shoulder and body of the case.", "text": "Worlds Finest Trimmer 300 AAC Blackout The WFT was developed as a precision tool built to last a lifetime (or more) and uses a source of power most people already own - a cordless or electric drill. Once adjusted to the user's preference, it's simply a matter of chucking it up in a drill and feeding cases in by hand - a pace of 10 cases per minute is pretty easy to maintain. The razor sharp high-speed cutters and the sealed ball bearing incorporated into the trimmer produce an extremely smooth cut. In most cases it will only be necessary to slightly chamfer the inner edge of the case mouth. Unlike other case trimmers the W.F.T. does not use pilots, the case is supported by the shoulder and body of the case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hJWc3ZbjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BF0J2MG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BF0U35G", "title": "Nite Ize Gear Tie - Assorted 16 Pack", "description": "The Nite Ize Gear Tie Assorted 16 Pack can be used to organize your desk, kitchen, garage, vehicle, boat, and more. Each gear tie is reusable, long lasting, and good for both indoor and outdoor use. They are designed to organize items that are too small to be managed by bungee cords and tie-down straps.", "text": "Nite Ize Gear Tie - Assorted 16 Pack The Nite Ize Gear Tie Assorted 16 Pack can be used to organize your desk, kitchen, garage, vehicle, boat, and more. Each gear tie is reusable, long lasting, and good for both indoor and outdoor use. They are designed to organize items that are too small to be managed by bungee cords and tie-down straps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AUkUDNlOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BF0U35G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpack Accessories", "Pack Pockets"]], "price": 24.88}}
{"item_id": "B00BF14XXS", "title": "First Gear - Cliff Hanger - Solo Tent", "description": "The Texsport FirstGear tent is a very lightweight solo tent with a full coverage fly to keep you out of the elements. It has a full no-see-um mesh body for lightweight carrying and great ventilation as well as keeping those small biting things out too. You can stargaze at night if the weather cooperates. It comes with shock-corded fiberglass poles that set up fast and easy with the all clip set up. It even has a small vestibule to store extra or wet stuff. Great for biking, backpacking or even the backyard.No-See-Um Mesh body keeps bugs out and ventilates well.Lightweight - 3.5 lbs.Easy to use Zippered Carry Bag.2 Fly vents add ventilation.All carry bags and stakes included.Flame Retardant.Import.", "text": "First Gear - Cliff Hanger - Solo Tent The Texsport FirstGear tent is a very lightweight solo tent with a full coverage fly to keep you out of the elements. It has a full no-see-um mesh body for lightweight carrying and great ventilation as well as keeping those small biting things out too. You can stargaze at night if the weather cooperates. It comes with shock-corded fiberglass poles that set up fast and easy with the all clip set up. It even has a small vestibule to store extra or wet stuff. Great for biking, backpacking or even the backyard.No-See-Um Mesh body keeps bugs out and ventilates well.Lightweight - 3.5 lbs.Easy to use Zippered Carry Bag.2 Fly vents add ventilation.All carry bags and stakes included.Flame Retardant.Import.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mW5qMm0OL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BF14XXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Texsport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Backpacking Tents"]], "price": 50.0}}
