{"item_id": "B00BFCWA1E", "title": "Perfect Fitness Pullup Assist Exercise Equipment, Red", "description": "Get the V-cut look with broad shoulders and a narrow waist while perfecting your pull-up form. Perfect Pull-up Assist helps you get stronger and maximizes your workout by providing assistance when you do a pull-up. Traditional pull-ups are hard, but the Pull-up Assist helps offset your weight so you can focus on technique and good form. Increases the number of pull-up sets and helps you work up to performing more unassisted pull-ups and chin-ups. Heavy-duty nylon strap with steel cam buckle to adjust length. Adjustable assistance with 3 band system provides up to approximately 50 lb. of assistance.", "text": "Perfect Fitness Pullup Assist Exercise Equipment, Red Get the V-cut look with broad shoulders and a narrow waist while perfecting your pull-up form. Perfect Pull-up Assist helps you get stronger and maximizes your workout by providing assistance when you do a pull-up. Traditional pull-ups are hard, but the Pull-up Assist helps offset your weight so you can focus on technique and good form. Increases the number of pull-up sets and helps you work up to performing more unassisted pull-ups and chin-ups. Heavy-duty nylon strap with steel cam buckle to adjust length. Adjustable assistance with 3 band system provides up to approximately 50 lb. of assistance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415ktfUrSUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFCWA1E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Perfect Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BFD0I7Q", "title": "Perfect Fitness Multi-Gym Pro, White", "description": "", "text": "Perfect Fitness Multi-Gym Pro, White", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31V2TWgqOhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFD0I7Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Perfect Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 39.98}}
{"item_id": "B00BFI8TOA", "title": "Morakniv Bushcraft Carbon Steel Survival Knife with Fire Starter and Sheath, Black", "description": "The Mora Bushcraft Survival Knife is an indispensable tool for a variety of outdoor, hunting, emergency or tactical applications. At the core is a Bushcraft Black Carbon Knife with a razor-sharp, burly 1/8-inch (3.2 mm) thick carbon steel blade treated with a tungsten DLC anti-corrosive black coating. The Mora Bushcraft Carbon Black will be one of the strongest and most dependable knives you will own. The spine of the blade is ridge ground so that it can be used with a fire starter. The Bushcraft Survival version comes with a black plastic sheath that holds a Mora Fire Starter (included) and features an integrated diamond sharpener. Mora Fire Starters will yield 7,000 strikes that can produce a 3,000 Degree spark, even in wet conditions. Mora knives made from high carbon steel achieve high hardness, sharpen easily and are exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Mora Knives are made from high-quality Sandvik steel. Sandvik knife steels are characterized by ultra-fine carbides that result in superb forging and hardening properties. The absence of large carbide deposits promotes excellent edge sharpness for optimum cutting performance. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891.", "text": "Morakniv Bushcraft Carbon Steel Survival Knife with Fire Starter and Sheath, Black The Mora Bushcraft Survival Knife is an indispensable tool for a variety of outdoor, hunting, emergency or tactical applications. At the core is a Bushcraft Black Carbon Knife with a razor-sharp, burly 1/8-inch (3.2 mm) thick carbon steel blade treated with a tungsten DLC anti-corrosive black coating. The Mora Bushcraft Carbon Black will be one of the strongest and most dependable knives you will own. The spine of the blade is ridge ground so that it can be used with a fire starter. The Bushcraft Survival version comes with a black plastic sheath that holds a Mora Fire Starter (included) and features an integrated diamond sharpener. Mora Fire Starters will yield 7,000 strikes that can produce a 3,000 Degree spark, even in wet conditions. Mora knives made from high carbon steel achieve high hardness, sharpen easily and are exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Mora Knives are made from high-quality Sandvik steel. Sandvik knife steels are characterized by ultra-fine carbides that result in superb forging and hardening properties. The absence of large carbide deposits promotes excellent edge sharpness for optimum cutting performance. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417kpXyfQhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFI8TOA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morakniv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 54.57}}
{"item_id": "B00BFL22WM", "title": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod Assembly for Ruger SR22 pistols by Galloway Precision", "description": "These are direct drop in replacement guide rods, Stainless steel and CAPTURED with a new recoil spring, you'll never need to fight with your stock spring and guide rod again with our new guide rod and spring setup.", "text": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod Assembly for Ruger SR22 pistols by Galloway Precision These are direct drop in replacement guide rods, Stainless steel and CAPTURED with a new recoil spring, you'll never need to fight with your stock spring and guide rod again with our new guide rod and spring setup.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jV0oQuNJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFL22WM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 24.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BFL2ERA", "title": "Assembled Guide Rods for Ruger SR9c and SR40c pistols with a stainless or black retainer and 14, 16, 18, 20lb available spring rates by Galloway Precision", "description": "Galloway Precision is now offering our GEN 2 BOMB PROOF Ruger SR9c and SR40c guiderods for sale. Choose from a stainless retainer or black retainer. Both guide rods use the stock 16lb spring rate like factory, or choose from 14, 18, or 20 as an option to help control felt recoil or dial in for hand loads. ***These are our new design BOMB PROOF thick head guide rods, we have tripled the head thickness to prevent the scaring and rare bending on the locking lug side seen on some of the 40 S/W guns, these will work on the 9mm model as well. Made of non magnetic stainless steel or blacked tool steel, they are drop in and you can disassemble them to change spring rates if need be or desired. The compacts both come factory with 16lb, we recommend the 14lb only for light handloads only, 18lb is the high in for 9mm, and the 20lb is for 40.", "text": "Assembled Guide Rods for Ruger SR9c and SR40c pistols with a stainless or black retainer and 14, 16, 18, 20lb available spring rates by Galloway Precision Galloway Precision is now offering our GEN 2 BOMB PROOF Ruger SR9c and SR40c guiderods for sale. Choose from a stainless retainer or black retainer. Both guide rods use the stock 16lb spring rate like factory, or choose from 14, 18, or 20 as an option to help control felt recoil or dial in for hand loads. ***These are our new design BOMB PROOF thick head guide rods, we have tripled the head thickness to prevent the scaring and rare bending on the locking lug side seen on some of the 40 S/W guns, these will work on the 9mm model as well. Made of non magnetic stainless steel or blacked tool steel, they are drop in and you can disassemble them to change spring rates if need be or desired. The compacts both come factory with 16lb, we recommend the 14lb only for light handloads only, 18lb is the high in for 9mm, and the 20lb is for 40.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Fw-MTZ3pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFL2ERA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 45.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BFLP52Q", "title": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod for Ruger LC9/LC380 pistols by Galloway Precision", "description": "This Galloway Precision stainless steel guide rod is a drop in replacement for the factory plastic unit. Comes fully polished and ready to swap in. Adds some nice contrast for those looking for that, gets rid of the plastic some dislike, and adds a little weight to the muzzle end.", "text": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod for Ruger LC9/LC380 pistols by Galloway Precision This Galloway Precision stainless steel guide rod is a drop in replacement for the factory plastic unit. Comes fully polished and ready to swap in. Adds some nice contrast for those looking for that, gets rid of the plastic some dislike, and adds a little weight to the muzzle end.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31F1clTAmJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFLP52Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BFLP5LW", "title": "Recoil Springs for Ruger LC9 pistols by Galloway Precision", "description": "Tame your LC9 with our heavy duty spring rate for the recoil spring. These work with our Galloway Precision stainless guide rods and the plastic factory guide rods. Factory spring rate is 16 lbs we offer a 20lb unit for max control. Will help tame recoil and muzzle flip and handle high powered defense load.", "text": "Recoil Springs for Ruger LC9 pistols by Galloway Precision Tame your LC9 with our heavy duty spring rate for the recoil spring. These work with our Galloway Precision stainless guide rods and the plastic factory guide rods. Factory spring rate is 16 lbs we offer a 20lb unit for max control. Will help tame recoil and muzzle flip and handle high powered defense load.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4130U9zvnzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFLP5LW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 20.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BFLP5YY", "title": "Assembled Guide Rods for Ruger SR9 and SR40 pistols by Galloway Precision", "description": "These stainless steel guide rods add weight to reduce muzzle flip and decrease follow up shot time. Also allows use of different spring rates to tune the pistol to your needs and handloads. Adds a little bling for those folks looking for that. These are polished and assembled with loctite to your needs. Choose your desired spring rate and retainer color (polished stainless or blacked tool steel) and we'll put it together as requested. SR9 and SR45 factory spring is 18lb and the SR40 factory spring is 22lb till December 2010, Dec 2010. We offer fully assembled units captured like factory in 15lb, 18lb, 20lb, 22lb, 24lb.", "text": "Assembled Guide Rods for Ruger SR9 and SR40 pistols by Galloway Precision These stainless steel guide rods add weight to reduce muzzle flip and decrease follow up shot time. Also allows use of different spring rates to tune the pistol to your needs and handloads. Adds a little bling for those folks looking for that. These are polished and assembled with loctite to your needs. Choose your desired spring rate and retainer color (polished stainless or blacked tool steel) and we'll put it together as requested. SR9 and SR45 factory spring is 18lb and the SR40 factory spring is 22lb till December 2010, Dec 2010. We offer fully assembled units captured like factory in 15lb, 18lb, 20lb, 22lb, 24lb.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GCr2oJGVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFLP5YY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 30.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BFLPAL2", "title": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod for Ruger LCP pistols by Galloway Precision", "description": "This Galloway Precision stainless steel guide rod is a direct replacement for your factory guide rod in your Ruger LCP pistol. It is produced out of stainless 316 steel. Polished and ready to go.", "text": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod for Ruger LCP pistols by Galloway Precision This Galloway Precision stainless steel guide rod is a direct replacement for your factory guide rod in your Ruger LCP pistol. It is produced out of stainless 316 steel. Polished and ready to go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fobssUnDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFLPAL2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BFLPAXA", "title": "13 lb Recoil Spring Set Ruger LCP pistols by Galloway Precision", "description": "These Galloway Precision 13lb Recoil Springs are the aftermarket increased recoil springs you have been asking for. Direct replacement for the stock 9lb unit from the factory. Will fully cycle full power ammo and help reduce felt recoil and muzzle flip.", "text": "13 lb Recoil Spring Set Ruger LCP pistols by Galloway Precision These Galloway Precision 13lb Recoil Springs are the aftermarket increased recoil springs you have been asking for. Direct replacement for the stock 9lb unit from the factory. Will fully cycle full power ammo and help reduce felt recoil and muzzle flip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UZC1MTGYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFLPAXA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 18.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BFLTAS6", "title": "PF9/P11 Stainless Steel Guide Rod for Kel-Tec PF9/P11 pistols by Galloway Precision", "description": "This a direct replacement for your factory guide rod but, produced by Galloway Precision out of stainless 316 steel. Polished and ready to go.", "text": "PF9/P11 Stainless Steel Guide Rod for Kel-Tec PF9/P11 pistols by Galloway Precision This a direct replacement for your factory guide rod but, produced by Galloway Precision out of stainless 316 steel. Polished and ready to go.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31r7MT2qDYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFLTAS6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BFWKGI8", "title": "ReDo Reusable Hand Wamer 2 Pack, Emergency Zone Brand", "description": "Perfect to slip into your pocket to keep your hands warm on those cold winter days or keep in your emergency kit just in case. Flexing a catalyst disc in the warmer causes the liquid in the pouch to crystalize, generating heat. To recharge, simply place in boiling water to melt the crystals back into a stable liquid. Directions are printed right on the warmer.", "text": "ReDo Reusable Hand Wamer 2 Pack, Emergency Zone Brand Perfect to slip into your pocket to keep your hands warm on those cold winter days or keep in your emergency kit just in case. Flexing a catalyst disc in the warmer causes the liquid in the pouch to crystalize, generating heat. To recharge, simply place in boiling water to melt the crystals back into a stable liquid. Directions are printed right on the warmer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512XY%2BWk0PL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFWKGI8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hand & Foot Warmers"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BFXAIEY", "title": "Acid Tactical® MP5 G3 GSG5 GSG-5 A5 Claw Rail Scope & Sight Mount 100% Aluminum Picatinny", "description": "FREE ACID TACTICAL DECAL WITH EVERY ORDER!!Includes:1 MP5 GSG5 Claw Mount1 Allen WrenchSpecifications:Total Length: 3.5\"Picatinny RailFor Nato Picatinny AccessoriesColor: Matte BlackClean Anodized Finish on all surfaces.Fits GSG5 G3 & MP5 (also many Airsoft MP5 Mocks)NOTE!Acid Tacticalis the UPC owner of this item. Any other seller claiming to sell this items under the same UPC is not selling the same product. Quality, quantity, and description may not apply to any other seller under this listing. Be AwareNOTE!* It is the buyers responsibility to know their state and local gun laws. Some accessories may not be legally added to a firearm in particular states or in combination with other accessories. Please be aware of your local laws before adding any accessory to a firearm.", "text": "Acid Tactical® MP5 G3 GSG5 GSG-5 A5 Claw Rail Scope & Sight Mount 100% Aluminum Picatinny FREE ACID TACTICAL DECAL WITH EVERY ORDER!!Includes:1 MP5 GSG5 Claw Mount1 Allen WrenchSpecifications:Total Length: 3.5\"Picatinny RailFor Nato Picatinny AccessoriesColor: Matte BlackClean Anodized Finish on all surfaces.Fits GSG5 G3 & MP5 (also many Airsoft MP5 Mocks)NOTE!Acid Tacticalis the UPC owner of this item. Any other seller claiming to sell this items under the same UPC is not selling the same product. Quality, quantity, and description may not apply to any other seller under this listing. Be AwareNOTE!* It is the buyers responsibility to know their state and local gun laws. Some accessories may not be legally added to a firearm in particular states or in combination with other accessories. Please be aware of your local laws before adding any accessory to a firearm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EeNTo1mUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFXAIEY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BFXPJWU", "title": "Premium Gun Grips 1911 Acrylic Pearl White Gun Grips, Will Fit All Government Issue Full Size 1911's and Most Clones", "description": "Pair of acrylic pearl 1911 grips. These will fit all full size Government Issue 1911 and most clones.", "text": "Premium Gun Grips 1911 Acrylic Pearl White Gun Grips, Will Fit All Government Issue Full Size 1911's and Most Clones Pair of acrylic pearl 1911 grips. These will fit all full size Government Issue 1911 and most clones.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4126v3igV1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BFXPJWU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 35.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BGDI2XC", "title": "Havalon Bolt Knife with 12 60A Blades", "description": "Stronger, thicker 60A blades and a larger handle for improved grip, features 12 additional stainless steel blades (2-3/4 Inch), rugged ABS shock green handle with a black rubber grip insert, ambidextrous thumb studs, removable pocket clip, overall length: 7-3/8 in., includes a black nylon belt holster.", "text": "Havalon Bolt Knife with 12 60A Blades Stronger, thicker 60A blades and a larger handle for improved grip, features 12 additional stainless steel blades (2-3/4 Inch), rugged ABS shock green handle with a black rubber grip insert, ambidextrous thumb studs, removable pocket clip, overall length: 7-3/8 in., includes a black nylon belt holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XoEcGWtML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BGDI2XC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Piranta Bolt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 35.19}}
{"item_id": "B00BGDTCMC", "title": "Rail Mounted Push Button Qd Quick Release 1.25\" Sling Swivel with Base Mount By Ade Advanced Optics®", "description": "The set includes one push-button style sling swivel pin and one base for Picatinny rails Simply push button to detach and attach swivel Fit on 20mm weaver rails. Swivel pin rotates freely after plugged in For use with 1 1/4inch wide slings Great for use on Quad Rail forends or other Picatinny accessory rails. Quick- detach feature provides emergency weapon install and release Accepts QD Push Button Style Stud Swivels Heavy duty alloy construction. Allen wrench included Base length: 1inch Swivel set weight: 2 oz. About Ade Advanced Optics: Ade Advanced Optics first made its appearance in the firearms accessory industry by doing private label production for several major manufacturers and retailers. During this period, Ade Advanced Optics began receiving requests from numerous customers for access to the affordable, high quality products that Ade Advanced Optics was capable of producing. By soliciting feedback from both clients and end users, Ade Advanced Optics was able to overcome the challenges a new company often faces when entering a global market and industry, especially one as competitive as the shooting, hunting, and outdoors industry.", "text": "Rail Mounted Push Button Qd Quick Release 1.25\" Sling Swivel with Base Mount By Ade Advanced Optics® The set includes one push-button style sling swivel pin and one base for Picatinny rails Simply push button to detach and attach swivel Fit on 20mm weaver rails. Swivel pin rotates freely after plugged in For use with 1 1/4inch wide slings Great for use on Quad Rail forends or other Picatinny accessory rails. Quick- detach feature provides emergency weapon install and release Accepts QD Push Button Style Stud Swivels Heavy duty alloy construction. Allen wrench included Base length: 1inch Swivel set weight: 2 oz. About Ade Advanced Optics: Ade Advanced Optics first made its appearance in the firearms accessory industry by doing private label production for several major manufacturers and retailers. During this period, Ade Advanced Optics began receiving requests from numerous customers for access to the affordable, high quality products that Ade Advanced Optics was capable of producing. By soliciting feedback from both clients and end users, Ade Advanced Optics was able to overcome the challenges a new company often faces when entering a global market and industry, especially one as competitive as the shooting, hunting, and outdoors industry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21X653gt77L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BGDTCMC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BGE59BO", "title": "36 Crossbow Arrows Aluminum 50-80 lb High Impact Bolts", "description": "Save 15%! These are the same bolts that are being sold for $5.50+ on other listings, except with lower bulk price - that is, pay less for purchasing 3x items together. High impact Aluminum with metal point head for all your hunting and archery needs. Each item quantity ordered comes with 36 (3 packs of 12). Compatible with both 50 and 80lb crossbows. The aluminum shaft and metal tip provide front-end weight distribution, allowing the bolt to maintain a straighter course. Tough enough to withstand repeated use. Each bolt length is just over 6.25\".", "text": "36 Crossbow Arrows Aluminum 50-80 lb High Impact Bolts Save 15%! These are the same bolts that are being sold for $5.50+ on other listings, except with lower bulk price - that is, pay less for purchasing 3x items together. High impact Aluminum with metal point head for all your hunting and archery needs. Each item quantity ordered comes with 36 (3 packs of 12). Compatible with both 50 and 80lb crossbows. The aluminum shaft and metal tip provide front-end weight distribution, allowing the bolt to maintain a straighter course. Tough enough to withstand repeated use. Each bolt length is just over 6.25\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51V4IBhSNFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BGE59BO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Crossbow Bolts"]], "price": 10.84}}
{"item_id": "B00BGEXP9W", "title": "Assembled Stainless Steel Guide Rods for Smith & Wesson Sigma/SD-VE pistols by Galloway Precision", "description": "Custom made for the Smith and Wesson SD-VE and Sigma VE pistols these Galloway Precision guide rods are made of Stainless and come pre-assembled to your selection. Factory spring rates are 17lb for both the 9mm and 40 models. We offer several rates as well as options on the retainer finish, black or polished stainless. We recommend the 20 or 22 for 40s/w pistols and 20 for the 9mm as upper limits. The 15 for light handloads only.", "text": "Assembled Stainless Steel Guide Rods for Smith & Wesson Sigma/SD-VE pistols by Galloway Precision Custom made for the Smith and Wesson SD-VE and Sigma VE pistols these Galloway Precision guide rods are made of Stainless and come pre-assembled to your selection. Factory spring rates are 17lb for both the 9mm and 40 models. We offer several rates as well as options on the retainer finish, black or polished stainless. We recommend the 20 or 22 for 40s/w pistols and 20 for the 9mm as upper limits. The 15 for light handloads only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GCr2oJGVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BGEXP9W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 35.0}}
