{"item_id": "B00BGRG9RO", "title": "Duck Commander Uncle Si Duck Call", "description": "Duck Commander Uncle Si Duck Call will get 'em right into the decoys, Jack. Designed to be raspy and easy to blow, the Uncle Si is nothing short of ducky. This is a great Call for a beginner - but will ring for a seasoned caller. This single-reed classic is made of durable polycarbonate for seasons of reliable use. Order yours today. Duck Commander Uncle Si Duck Call.", "text": "Duck Commander Uncle Si Duck Call Duck Commander Uncle Si Duck Call will get 'em right into the decoys, Jack. Designed to be raspy and easy to blow, the Uncle Si is nothing short of ducky. This is a great Call for a beginner - but will ring for a seasoned caller. This single-reed classic is made of durable polycarbonate for seasons of reliable use. Order yours today. Duck Commander Uncle Si Duck Call.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tF1SzmAcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BGRG9RO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Commander", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Duck"]], "price": 17.49}}
{"item_id": "B00BGZ2CMC", "title": "Sanrenmu Gb-704 Folding Pocket Knife with 8cr13mov Stainless Steel Blade", "description": "Package DetailsWeight 85.60 gSize 14.5*6.5*1.8 cmPackage Includes1 Foldable Knife", "text": "Sanrenmu Gb-704 Folding Pocket Knife with 8cr13mov Stainless Steel Blade Package DetailsWeight 85.60 gSize 14.5*6.5*1.8 cmPackage Includes1 Foldable Knife", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CqXSCWpYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BGZ2CMC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BGZCPEM", "title": "Enlan Folding Knife Micarta Handle Stainless Steel 8cr13mov Blade", "description": "This is a beautifully crafted knife. The contoured micarta handle scales are very well finished and look and feel great. The satin finished blade looks very sleek. Overall, the knife feels very heavy duty for a folding blade. The handle scales are thicker than other small EDC knives. This makes the EL04MCT a bit bulkier when carried in your pocket, but the more robust handles do provide greater comfort when handling the knife. Overall, the EL04MCT is a well made heavier duty larger pocket folding knife.", "text": "Enlan Folding Knife Micarta Handle Stainless Steel 8cr13mov Blade This is a beautifully crafted knife. The contoured micarta handle scales are very well finished and look and feel great. The satin finished blade looks very sleek. Overall, the knife feels very heavy duty for a folding blade. The handle scales are thicker than other small EDC knives. This makes the EL04MCT a bit bulkier when carried in your pocket, but the more robust handles do provide greater comfort when handling the knife. Overall, the EL04MCT is a well made heavier duty larger pocket folding knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QgxS6pUfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BGZCPEM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BHB63H0", "title": "WorthTrust CREE XML T6 LED Headlight Headlamp Torch Flashlight 1600lm + 2 x Rechargeable 18650 Battery, Waterproof Design", "description": "CREE XML XM-L T6 LED 1600 Lumens headlamp 1. LED Type: CREE XM-L T6 2. Brightness is 1600 Lumens lm, Irradiation distance Up to 500 meters 3. Improved deep smooth shaped reflecting cup, increase concentrating effect, aluminum vacuum coating 4. Water-Resistance Design 5. 3 Switch Modes: Strong Brightness / Normal Brightness / Flashing 6. 90 Degree Adjustable Headlight, very convenient 7. Back of battery box with rubber cover, your head won't feel uncomfortable even long time use 8. Powered by: 2x UltraFire 18650 2400mAh 3.7V High Capacity Rechargeable batteries 9. 100V-240V 50/60Hz Battery Charger With LED indication for Power on / Charging / Full charge, Can Supply Power for the Headlight Directly (Cord Length: Approx.710mm) 10. Ideal for Daily life, Cycling, Climbing, Camping, Hiking, Hunting, Caves Exploring etc. Package Include: 1 x CREE XM-L T6 LED Rechargeable Headlight 2 x 3.7v 2400mAh 18650 Rechargeable Batteries 1 x Battery Charger (100v - 240v) 1 x Plug Adaptor UK Quantity:1 Set Shipping 10-16 businessdays", "text": "WorthTrust CREE XML T6 LED Headlight Headlamp Torch Flashlight 1600lm + 2 x Rechargeable 18650 Battery, Waterproof Design CREE XML XM-L T6 LED 1600 Lumens headlamp 1. LED Type: CREE XM-L T6 2. Brightness is 1600 Lumens lm, Irradiation distance Up to 500 meters 3. Improved deep smooth shaped reflecting cup, increase concentrating effect, aluminum vacuum coating 4. Water-Resistance Design 5. 3 Switch Modes: Strong Brightness / Normal Brightness / Flashing 6. 90 Degree Adjustable Headlight, very convenient 7. Back of battery box with rubber cover, your head won't feel uncomfortable even long time use 8. Powered by: 2x UltraFire 18650 2400mAh 3.7V High Capacity Rechargeable batteries 9. 100V-240V 50/60Hz Battery Charger With LED indication for Power on / Charging / Full charge, Can Supply Power for the Headlight Directly (Cord Length: Approx.710mm) 10. Ideal for Daily life, Cycling, Climbing, Camping, Hiking, Hunting, Caves Exploring etc. Package Include: 1 x CREE XM-L T6 LED Rechargeable Headlight 2 x 3.7v 2400mAh 18650 Rechargeable Batteries 1 x Battery Charger (100v - 240v) 1 x Plug Adaptor UK Quantity:1 Set Shipping 10-16 businessdays", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nCq00XfFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BHB63H0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "eBoTrade-Tech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Headlamps"]], "price": 11.6}}
