{"item_id": "B00BHST9EM", "title": "Modular Battery Case from The Tactical Medic", "description": "Injection Molded here in the USA from durable non-conductive plastic. These cases will keep your batteries organized and most importantly will keep them from accidentally shorting out against each other or lose objects in your pack. - Each set holds up to (8) AA Batteries, or (12) AAA Batteries, or (8) CR2, or (8) CR123 batteries. - Lightweight, two tone cases slide apart to separate your spent or (dead) batteries on one side, (live) batteries on the other side. - Made in USA - Size : 4.5 x 2.73 - Color :Brown/Tan", "text": "Modular Battery Case from The Tactical Medic Injection Molded here in the USA from durable non-conductive plastic. These cases will keep your batteries organized and most importantly will keep them from accidentally shorting out against each other or lose objects in your pack. - Each set holds up to (8) AA Batteries, or (12) AAA Batteries, or (8) CR2, or (8) CR123 batteries. - Lightweight, two tone cases slide apart to separate your spent or (dead) batteries on one side, (live) batteries on the other side. - Made in USA - Size : 4.5 x 2.73 - Color :Brown/Tan", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gOppUE0RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BHST9EM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 11.94}}
