{"item_id": "B00BI0DZ7G", "title": "Guide Gear 8 1/2x8 1/2' Tarp Green", "description": "Guide Gear Tarp. Portable shelter goes anywhere. Use it to cover stored gear. Great makeshift tent/shelter you can customize in a pinch when sudden storms hit. Cover your firewood, ATV, boat and more instantly. The user list goes on and on. Keep 'em on hand for easy access. This special make-up means no middleman markup. Just a great discount deal! Performance details: Constructed of tough 190T nylon; 1,000mm polyurethane water coating; Factory-taped seams ensure waterproof protection; Multiple guy-out points; Guy lines included. Order yours today at our money-saving LOW price! Guide Gear 8 1/2x8 1/2' Tarp, Green", "text": "Guide Gear 8 1/2x8 1/2' Tarp Green Guide Gear Tarp. Portable shelter goes anywhere. Use it to cover stored gear. Great makeshift tent/shelter you can customize in a pinch when sudden storms hit. Cover your firewood, ATV, boat and more instantly. The user list goes on and on. Keep 'em on hand for easy access. This special make-up means no middleman markup. Just a great discount deal! Performance details: Constructed of tough 190T nylon; 1,000mm polyurethane water coating; Factory-taped seams ensure waterproof protection; Multiple guy-out points; Guy lines included. Order yours today at our money-saving LOW price! Guide Gear 8 1/2x8 1/2' Tarp, Green", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512SuTkrjLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BI0DZ7G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Tarps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BI1H4CM", "title": "Boomstick Gun Accessories Shotgun Shell Sling Bandolier", "description": "This brand new and rugged, nylon belt adjusts to 59-inch and will hold up to 15 shotgun shells. This is a light in weight but heavy duty, high quality product. The ammo pictured is not included.", "text": "Boomstick Gun Accessories Shotgun Shell Sling Bandolier This brand new and rugged, nylon belt adjusts to 59-inch and will hold up to 15 shotgun shells. This is a light in weight but heavy duty, high quality product. The ammo pictured is not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41feYt6bJBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BI1H4CM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 14.75}}
{"item_id": "B00BI4DOI2", "title": "Pellet Pins Stainless Steel Tumbling Media Ultra 47's - 5 Lbs with Lemi Shine", "description": "Stainless Steel Pin Media is designed to clean brass cases inside and out to give a \"like new\" look. Unlike conventional corn cob or walnut media, stainless media does not create dust and also cleans the inside of the cases, primer pockets and flash holes. Stainless media will not damage brass and does not require replacement after multiple uses. This media is designed to be used in a water tight rotary tumbler along with water and cleaning solution. See \"Bullseye Reloading Pellet Pins\" videos on Youtube for use information.", "text": "Pellet Pins Stainless Steel Tumbling Media Ultra 47's - 5 Lbs with Lemi Shine Stainless Steel Pin Media is designed to clean brass cases inside and out to give a \"like new\" look. Unlike conventional corn cob or walnut media, stainless media does not create dust and also cleans the inside of the cases, primer pockets and flash holes. Stainless media will not damage brass and does not require replacement after multiple uses. This media is designed to be used in a water tight rotary tumbler along with water and cleaning solution. See \"Bullseye Reloading Pellet Pins\" videos on Youtube for use information.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51h9PvNFA%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BI4DOI2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 49.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BI9AM14", "title": "Vapur Eclipse Water Bottle", "description": "This water bottle can be folded, rolled or flattened. It stands when full. Light weight, BPA free and holds .7L. Easy to put ice cubes in the wide mouth top. Includes tough, easy to use Super Cap.", "text": "Vapur Eclipse Water Bottle This water bottle can be folded, rolled or flattened. It stands when full. Light weight, BPA free and holds .7L. Easy to put ice cubes in the wide mouth top. Includes tough, easy to use Super Cap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Tx1Rap5jL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BI9AM14.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BIMNFYM", "title": "Wide body take down plate for Smith & Wesson SD-VE and Sigma VE pistols by Galloway Precision", "description": "Direct replacement to your stock narrow take down plate, wider at the bottom and steps in towards to top to reduce drag but increase traction for take down. Fits Smith & Wesson Sigma VE and SD-VE pistols.", "text": "Wide body take down plate for Smith & Wesson SD-VE and Sigma VE pistols by Galloway Precision Direct replacement to your stock narrow take down plate, wider at the bottom and steps in towards to top to reduce drag but increase traction for take down. Fits Smith & Wesson Sigma VE and SD-VE pistols.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nfO15bpHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BIMNFYM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 15.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BIPRF18", "title": "UTG 5-Slot Universal QD Lever Lock Adaptor and Riser, Black", "description": "UTG Universal QD Lever Lock Adaptor & Riser Mount,15mm Saddle Ht., 60mm Long 5-Slot Picatinny Rail, Most Versatile for Use as QD Riser & for Immediate Converting Any Non-QD Mount Accessories w//QD Deployment, Made from Aircraft Aluminum w/Matte Anodizing.", "text": "UTG 5-Slot Universal QD Lever Lock Adaptor and Riser, Black UTG Universal QD Lever Lock Adaptor & Riser Mount,15mm Saddle Ht., 60mm Long 5-Slot Picatinny Rail, Most Versatile for Use as QD Riser & for Immediate Converting Any Non-QD Mount Accessories w//QD Deployment, Made from Aircraft Aluminum w/Matte Anodizing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31u9DZCMBYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BIPRF18.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 17.88}}
{"item_id": "B00BIRN39Y", "title": "Coleman Personal Survival First Aid Kit 74-Piece, Metal Tinplate", "description": "Campers, hikers, hunters, bikers, boaters, and other outdoor enthusiasts can rest easier with six first aid kit options available under the Coleman brand - the most trusted name in outdoor equipment. Each kit contains components that are most used and useful when you or your family needs medical attention away from home. Coleman’s Personal Survival First Aid Tin Kit contains: 6 - Bandages 1\" x 3\", 6 - Small Bandages, 4 - Butterfly Bandages, 2 - Spot Bandages, 2 - Knuckle Bandages, 5 - Antiseptic Wipes, 3 - Sting Relief Wipes, 1 - 2\" Large Safety Pin, 1 - 1\" Small Safety Pin, 2 - Antibiotic Ointments, 40 - Waterproof Matches, 1 - Razor Blade, 1 - Reusable Tin.", "text": "Coleman Personal Survival First Aid Kit 74-Piece, Metal Tinplate Campers, hikers, hunters, bikers, boaters, and other outdoor enthusiasts can rest easier with six first aid kit options available under the Coleman brand - the most trusted name in outdoor equipment. Each kit contains components that are most used and useful when you or your family needs medical attention away from home. Coleman’s Personal Survival First Aid Tin Kit contains: 6 - Bandages 1\" x 3\", 6 - Small Bandages, 4 - Butterfly Bandages, 2 - Spot Bandages, 2 - Knuckle Bandages, 5 - Antiseptic Wipes, 3 - Sting Relief Wipes, 1 - 2\" Large Safety Pin, 1 - 1\" Small Safety Pin, 2 - Antibiotic Ointments, 40 - Waterproof Matches, 1 - Razor Blade, 1 - Reusable Tin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QWX1jk-pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BIRN39Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BIUB8KM", "title": "Klean Kanteen Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Tumbler and Cup", "description": "Klean Kanteen's Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Tumbler and Cup is a prime example of their quest to make high performance multi use products. This tumbler out performs plastic and paper and is not only more durable but it actually does more. Anything a single-use paper or plastic cup can do, the stainless steel vacuum tumbler can do much better, insulating hot and cold beverages. Iced tea, IPA or Caramel Latte; Vacuum insulation and electropolished stainless steel combine to protect the taste and temperature of whatever you put inside. A quick rinse or wash is all it takes to go from your morning pick-me-up to staying hydrated at work to a smoothie at the gym to whatever you drink in your daily life.Electropolished interior.Laser-etched exterior.Doesn't retain or impart flavors.Mouth Opening: 3.08\" (78mm).Size: 6.3\" H x 3.5\" W (161mm x 90mm).Weight: 9.25 ounces (262g).Capacity: 16 fluid oz (473 ml).", "text": "Klean Kanteen Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Tumbler and Cup Klean Kanteen's Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Tumbler and Cup is a prime example of their quest to make high performance multi use products. This tumbler out performs plastic and paper and is not only more durable but it actually does more. Anything a single-use paper or plastic cup can do, the stainless steel vacuum tumbler can do much better, insulating hot and cold beverages. Iced tea, IPA or Caramel Latte; Vacuum insulation and electropolished stainless steel combine to protect the taste and temperature of whatever you put inside. A quick rinse or wash is all it takes to go from your morning pick-me-up to staying hydrated at work to a smoothie at the gym to whatever you drink in your daily life.Electropolished interior.Laser-etched exterior.Doesn't retain or impart flavors.Mouth Opening: 3.08\" (78mm).Size: 6.3\" H x 3.5\" W (161mm x 90mm).Weight: 9.25 ounces (262g).Capacity: 16 fluid oz (473 ml).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iVhIOD5CL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BIUB8KM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 21.75}}
{"item_id": "B00BJ4EH5K", "title": "Military Army USMC MOLLE Ammo Utility Side Pouch Pocket Coyote Brown Lot of 2", "description": "Official US Military side plate pocket. Lot of 2 included. Heavy duty nylon material with Velcro closure. Outside of pouch has Molle webbing. Can be attached to the Molle system. NSN:8470-01-562-7916. Approximate Size: 8.5\" Height x 9\" Width. Great use as ammo pouch, utility pouch and more. Government manufacturer: Eagle Industries", "text": "Military Army USMC MOLLE Ammo Utility Side Pouch Pocket Coyote Brown Lot of 2 Official US Military side plate pocket. Lot of 2 included. Heavy duty nylon material with Velcro closure. Outside of pouch has Molle webbing. Can be attached to the Molle system. NSN:8470-01-562-7916. Approximate Size: 8.5\" Height x 9\" Width. Great use as ammo pouch, utility pouch and more. Government manufacturer: Eagle Industries", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FrQ2rZ59L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BJ4EH5K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Eagle Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 2.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BJ9BL7W", "title": "Mini Japanese Tanto Blade", "description": "This Blade is handmade by forging 1095 & 15N20 high & low carbon steels folded over each other forming over 200 layers, resulting in a stunning blade pattern. Damascus steel knives are renowned for their tough blade and long endurance of their edges. FEATURES & SPECIFICATIONS: Overall Length: 6.00 Inches (approx) Blade Length: 3.00 Inches (approx) Handle Material: Buffalo Horn (black/blonde color) Options: Quality Leather Sheath +$5.00 File Work: Excellent File Work Sharpness: Very Sharp Rockwell Hardness: 58 to 60 HRC Number of layers: 200+", "text": "Mini Japanese Tanto Blade This Blade is handmade by forging 1095 & 15N20 high & low carbon steels folded over each other forming over 200 layers, resulting in a stunning blade pattern. Damascus steel knives are renowned for their tough blade and long endurance of their edges. FEATURES & SPECIFICATIONS: Overall Length: 6.00 Inches (approx) Blade Length: 3.00 Inches (approx) Handle Material: Buffalo Horn (black/blonde color) Options: Quality Leather Sheath +$5.00 File Work: Excellent File Work Sharpness: Very Sharp Rockwell Hardness: 58 to 60 HRC Number of layers: 200+", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NvxH9dPRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BJ9BL7W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BJD8LTO", "title": "Mr. Paracord ™ Reflective 550 Paracord Type III 7 Strand Parachute Cord 25FT, 50FT, 100FT", "description": "Wait? Did you know we have over 300 different paracord colors?Click“Mr. Paracord”above to see all of our great products.We have Basic Colors, Neon Colors, Camo Colors, Reflective Colors and even Glow in the Dark Paracord.About this product:This is top quality paracord. Better known as \"THE GOOD STUFF\".Get it wet! It will dry quickly and won't rot or mildew.This is reflective paracord.When light hits this cord it reflects off so that it can be seen at night. Very cool!It’s made from Heavy Duty Polyester and 7 Inner Nylon strands. It can withstand up to 550 lbs of load.The diameter of this paracord is 5/32”.This is 550 Type III Commercial Paracord – 7 Inner 2-ply Nylon Strands.Select your color and size above receive it within a few days and enjoy!We are thelargest paracord supplierin terms of color selection, so we have exactly what you're looking for.This paracord will work great for bracelets, landyards, dog collars and all outdoors products.", "text": "Mr. Paracord ™ Reflective 550 Paracord Type III 7 Strand Parachute Cord 25FT, 50FT, 100FT Wait? Did you know we have over 300 different paracord colors?Click“Mr. Paracord”above to see all of our great products.We have Basic Colors, Neon Colors, Camo Colors, Reflective Colors and even Glow in the Dark Paracord.About this product:This is top quality paracord. Better known as \"THE GOOD STUFF\".Get it wet! It will dry quickly and won't rot or mildew.This is reflective paracord.When light hits this cord it reflects off so that it can be seen at night. Very cool!It’s made from Heavy Duty Polyester and 7 Inner Nylon strands. It can withstand up to 550 lbs of load.The diameter of this paracord is 5/32”.This is 550 Type III Commercial Paracord – 7 Inner 2-ply Nylon Strands.Select your color and size above receive it within a few days and enjoy!We are thelargest paracord supplierin terms of color selection, so we have exactly what you're looking for.This paracord will work great for bracelets, landyards, dog collars and all outdoors products.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61GFeBH6RJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BJD8LTO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
