{"item_id": "B00BJFAYJ2", "title": "Vanguard Endeavor HD Angled Eyepiece Spotting Scope", "description": "Endeavor HD Spotting Scope is the most advanced piece of optical equipment Vanguard has ever produced. The optical system employs extra-low dispersion glass (ED) to ensure accurate color rendition and virtually eliminate color fringing. The lenses are all fully multi-coated to ensure optimum light transmission and feature a phase-coated BAK4 roof prism. Endeavor 82A comes with an 82mm objective lens and angled eyepiece with 20-60x zoom magnification. It features an extendable rubber covered eyecup and boasts impressive eye relief even at the highest zoom settings. It also provides a very impressive field of view. A built-in sunshield is included to eliminate glare in direct sunlight and it includes a padded raincoat with sling for carry and protection. Endeavor HD is also equipped with fine and coarse focusing wheels for quick and precision fine tuning adjustments. The Endeavor HD mounts directly to Vanguard tripod heads (and others) that are equipped with the universal mounting plate without the use of a quick shoe.", "text": "Vanguard Endeavor HD Angled Eyepiece Spotting Scope Endeavor HD Spotting Scope is the most advanced piece of optical equipment Vanguard has ever produced. The optical system employs extra-low dispersion glass (ED) to ensure accurate color rendition and virtually eliminate color fringing. The lenses are all fully multi-coated to ensure optimum light transmission and feature a phase-coated BAK4 roof prism. Endeavor 82A comes with an 82mm objective lens and angled eyepiece with 20-60x zoom magnification. It features an extendable rubber covered eyecup and boasts impressive eye relief even at the highest zoom settings. It also provides a very impressive field of view. A built-in sunshield is included to eliminate glare in direct sunlight and it includes a padded raincoat with sling for carry and protection. Endeavor HD is also equipped with fine and coarse focusing wheels for quick and precision fine tuning adjustments. The Endeavor HD mounts directly to Vanguard tripod heads (and others) that are equipped with the universal mounting plate without the use of a quick shoe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417yb4p3mEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BJFAYJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BJFAYJC", "title": "Vanguard Endeavor XF Angled Eyepiece Spotting Scope", "description": "The Endeavor XF spotting scope boasts excellent optical viewing for nature enthusiasts and hunters. It features a rubber armored magnesium body and is waterproof submersible, nitrogen filled and fog proof. The lenses are all fully multi-coated to ensure optimum light transmission and feature a phase-coated BAK4 roof prism. The Endeavor XF 80A comes with a 80mm objective lens and angled eyepiece with 20-60x zoom magnification. It features an extendable rubber covered eyecup and boasts impressive eye relief even at the highest zoom settings. It also provides a very impressive field of view. A built-in sunshield is included to eliminate glare in direct sunlight and it includes a padded raincoat with sling for carry and protection. Endeavor XF is equipped with a large smooth focusing wheel for quick focusing adjustments. The Endeavor XF mounts directly to Vanguard tripod heads (and others) that are equipped with the universal mounting plate without the use of a quick shoe. The tripod mount on the angled scope rotates to give optimum viewing angles in a variety of situations such as bench shooting and use with a window mount.", "text": "Vanguard Endeavor XF Angled Eyepiece Spotting Scope The Endeavor XF spotting scope boasts excellent optical viewing for nature enthusiasts and hunters. It features a rubber armored magnesium body and is waterproof submersible, nitrogen filled and fog proof. The lenses are all fully multi-coated to ensure optimum light transmission and feature a phase-coated BAK4 roof prism. The Endeavor XF 80A comes with a 80mm objective lens and angled eyepiece with 20-60x zoom magnification. It features an extendable rubber covered eyecup and boasts impressive eye relief even at the highest zoom settings. It also provides a very impressive field of view. A built-in sunshield is included to eliminate glare in direct sunlight and it includes a padded raincoat with sling for carry and protection. Endeavor XF is equipped with a large smooth focusing wheel for quick focusing adjustments. The Endeavor XF mounts directly to Vanguard tripod heads (and others) that are equipped with the universal mounting plate without the use of a quick shoe. The tripod mount on the angled scope rotates to give optimum viewing angles in a variety of situations such as bench shooting and use with a window mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DPXqolyTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BJFAYJC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BJLXPSI", "title": "Blade-Tech Tek-Lok with Hardware", "description": "Universal Belt Clip Introducing Blade-Tech's newly remodeled Tek-Lok; a secure, innovative and versatile latching attachment system. The engineers and product developers at Blade-Tech took the original Tek-Lok and reworked its functional ability to add more utility and ease of use. The Tek-Lok has also been contoured to better fit the profile of the body and to eliminate hot spots. The new Tek-Lok is held in place by two robust retaining tabs. A user friendly, integrated secondary locking system was also built into the newly redesigned Tek-Lok. With the simple motion of a thumb or finger, the redundant lock rotates out of the way to allow the user to pinch the retaining tabs and conveniently remove the Tek-Lok from the belt. It is readily adjustable to accommodate belts from 2.25\" down to 1.25\". Hardware included in this set are as follows; (3) posts, (3) screws and (3) 1/8\" Spacers.", "text": "Blade-Tech Tek-Lok with Hardware Universal Belt Clip Introducing Blade-Tech's newly remodeled Tek-Lok; a secure, innovative and versatile latching attachment system. The engineers and product developers at Blade-Tech took the original Tek-Lok and reworked its functional ability to add more utility and ease of use. The Tek-Lok has also been contoured to better fit the profile of the body and to eliminate hot spots. The new Tek-Lok is held in place by two robust retaining tabs. A user friendly, integrated secondary locking system was also built into the newly redesigned Tek-Lok. With the simple motion of a thumb or finger, the redundant lock rotates out of the way to allow the user to pinch the retaining tabs and conveniently remove the Tek-Lok from the belt. It is readily adjustable to accommodate belts from 2.25\" down to 1.25\". Hardware included in this set are as follows; (3) posts, (3) screws and (3) 1/8\" Spacers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iv56ShH2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BJLXPSI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BJRFT72", "title": "Y&W Russian/Aviator Soft Nylon Winter Hat (One Size)", "description": "", "text": "Y&W Russian/Aviator Soft Nylon Winter Hat (One Size)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415OQkKh08L._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BJRFT72.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Clothing", "Men", "Hats"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BJXM0KK", "title": "Hi-Lux Optics Long Eye Relief Series 2-7x42mm Riflescope with Duplex Reticle, Matte Black", "description": "Scout rifle shooters looking to fully tap that capability are turning to low magnification scopes mounted forward of the receiver. One of the best scopes available today for rifles of this type is the Hi-Lux Optics 2-7x32mm LER Scout. This scope has been specifically designed for being mounted in just this fashion. Depending on the magnification setting, the workable eye relief of this scope is approximately 8 to 13 Inch, which puts it mounted in front of the receiver. With the LER Scout magnification turned down to the lowest 2x setting, a hunter following wounded game can hold the rifle in the ready position and when the target suddenly appears at close range, just snapping the rifle up to the shoulder will generally put the reticle on the target. A rifle in a popular caliber such as.308 WInchester can still deliver the accuracy and performance needed for shots out to and past 200 yards - and the LER Scout offers the higher magnification often needed to precisely place those longer range shots. The LER Scout is ideal for whenever a scope must be mounted forward - whether the shooter is assembling his own Scout Rifle. Or perhaps when mounted on a top-ejection lever action rifle, or even to set clear of the hammer on a traditionally styled muzzleloading big game rifle. This scope is built with a high tensile strength one-piece aluminum tube and the lenses have been fully multi-coated to insure a clear, bright and sharp sight picture.", "text": "Hi-Lux Optics Long Eye Relief Series 2-7x42mm Riflescope with Duplex Reticle, Matte Black Scout rifle shooters looking to fully tap that capability are turning to low magnification scopes mounted forward of the receiver. One of the best scopes available today for rifles of this type is the Hi-Lux Optics 2-7x32mm LER Scout. This scope has been specifically designed for being mounted in just this fashion. Depending on the magnification setting, the workable eye relief of this scope is approximately 8 to 13 Inch, which puts it mounted in front of the receiver. With the LER Scout magnification turned down to the lowest 2x setting, a hunter following wounded game can hold the rifle in the ready position and when the target suddenly appears at close range, just snapping the rifle up to the shoulder will generally put the reticle on the target. A rifle in a popular caliber such as.308 WInchester can still deliver the accuracy and performance needed for shots out to and past 200 yards - and the LER Scout offers the higher magnification often needed to precisely place those longer range shots. The LER Scout is ideal for whenever a scope must be mounted forward - whether the shooter is assembling his own Scout Rifle. Or perhaps when mounted on a top-ejection lever action rifle, or even to set clear of the hammer on a traditionally styled muzzleloading big game rifle. This scope is built with a high tensile strength one-piece aluminum tube and the lenses have been fully multi-coated to insure a clear, bright and sharp sight picture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BTzfnwqxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BJXM0KK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hi-Lux Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 139.79}}
{"item_id": "B00BK4ISWC", "title": "Nikon M-223 Mount", "description": "Developed specifically for the M-223 series of scopes, this special mount fits Picatinny rails found atop most flattop ARs.", "text": "Nikon M-223 Mount Developed specifically for the M-223 series of scopes, this special mount fits Picatinny rails found atop most flattop ARs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bmS14tLDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BK4ISWC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 56.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BK8T5YI", "title": "XGRIP - Magazine Sleeve Provides Better Grip", "description": "WE ARE CLOSED WEEKENDS - OPEN WEEKDAYS 9-5 The Softer, Gentler Magazine Sleeve The Magazine Sleeve is a simple yet extremely effective method of providing a better grip on smaller framed handguns. It simply slides over the top of a longer magazine and fills in the gap where the magazine sticks out of the frame. XGRIP is made of an elasticized polymer, which means that it is soft to the touch.....it feels great in your hands. It's definitely different from the original Magazine Sleeve, item #T0364, in the way it feels....however, the concept is the same.", "text": "XGRIP - Magazine Sleeve Provides Better Grip WE ARE CLOSED WEEKENDS - OPEN WEEKDAYS 9-5 The Softer, Gentler Magazine Sleeve The Magazine Sleeve is a simple yet extremely effective method of providing a better grip on smaller framed handguns. It simply slides over the top of a longer magazine and fills in the gap where the magazine sticks out of the frame. XGRIP is made of an elasticized polymer, which means that it is soft to the touch.....it feels great in your hands. It's definitely different from the original Magazine Sleeve, item #T0364, in the way it feels....however, the concept is the same.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bmXP0J7rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BK8T5YI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BKFY3E8", "title": "VERY100 Tactical Red Laser Dot Sight Scope with Mount For Gun Rifle Pistol", "description": "Features: Laser Wavelength::625-660mm Length: Approx 56-57mm Laser Range: 50-100 meters Metal Housing Tube Size: 54mm x 16mm Tube Diameter: 16mm Mount Size: 26mm x 25mm x 30mm Packing: Blister Card Wrench Diameter: Approx 2.4mm", "text": "VERY100 Tactical Red Laser Dot Sight Scope with Mount For Gun Rifle Pistol Features: Laser Wavelength::625-660mm Length: Approx 56-57mm Laser Range: 50-100 meters Metal Housing Tube Size: 54mm x 16mm Tube Diameter: 16mm Mount Size: 26mm x 25mm x 30mm Packing: Blister Card Wrench Diameter: Approx 2.4mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aNNbcuasL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BKFY3E8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VERY100", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 11.98}}
