{"item_id": "B00BLPBSXG", "title": "Pro Bike Adjustable 41\" to 75\" Repair Stand w/ Telescopic Arm Cycle Bicycle Rack", "description": "This repair stand, which can holdup to 66 lbs, is a great comfortable way for DIYers to work on their bikes. Its heavy duty clamp protects your bike's finish from scratches while allowing you to work worry free. Features a fastener that can be rotated 360 and an adjustable handlebar which holds the front wheel making your work easier. It's lightweight and has a wide base for greater stability.FEATURES: Heavy duty construction and durable material; Quick release clamp locks bike in place; Telescoping stand; Clamp rotates 360 with big gears; Tool tray w/ built-in magnetic compartment; Adjustable handlebar rod; Assembles in minutes; instructions, tools and hardware requiredSPECIFICATIONS: 66lbs maximum capacity; Clamps fit all standard frames from 1\" to 2.5\"; Telescoping stand adjusts height from 41\" to 68 1/4\"", "text": "Pro Bike Adjustable 41\" to 75\" Repair Stand w/ Telescopic Arm Cycle Bicycle Rack This repair stand, which can holdup to 66 lbs, is a great comfortable way for DIYers to work on their bikes. Its heavy duty clamp protects your bike's finish from scratches while allowing you to work worry free. Features a fastener that can be rotated 360 and an adjustable handlebar which holds the front wheel making your work easier. It's lightweight and has a wide base for greater stability.FEATURES: Heavy duty construction and durable material; Quick release clamp locks bike in place; Telescoping stand; Clamp rotates 360 with big gears; Tool tray w/ built-in magnetic compartment; Adjustable handlebar rod; Assembles in minutes; instructions, tools and hardware requiredSPECIFICATIONS: 66lbs maximum capacity; Clamps fit all standard frames from 1\" to 2.5\"; Telescoping stand adjusts height from 41\" to 68 1/4\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Tx3bdsXZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BLPBSXG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 54.95}}
