{"item_id": "B00BM8FNL0", "title": "Schrade SCH303 Titanium Coated Partially Serrated Drop-Point Blade Folding Knife", "description": "This ambidextrous folding knife features dual thumb studs and a frame lock for easy single handed opening and closing. The blade has a durable bead-blasted finish and the G10 handle slabs are comfortable and durable as well.", "text": "Schrade SCH303 Titanium Coated Partially Serrated Drop-Point Blade Folding Knife This ambidextrous folding knife features dual thumb studs and a frame lock for easy single handed opening and closing. The blade has a durable bead-blasted finish and the G10 handle slabs are comfortable and durable as well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21LNQLzWnWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BM8FNL0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 20.19}}
