{"item_id": "B00BMAPESA", "title": "Barska Mossberg 500A Forearm", "description": "The Mossberg 500 A Forearm features a lower accessory rail system for the Mossberg 500 A. It is used to attach accessories such as a bipod, flashlight, fore grip or laser to your firearm. Two additional side rails allow you to attach more accessories. Specifications: Rail Length: 9 Inches x 2 Inches x 2.4 Inches; Rail Type: Weaver/Picatinny; Material: Aluminum; Applicable Firearm: Mossberg 500 A and similar firearms; Warranty: 1 Year Limited.", "text": "Barska Mossberg 500A Forearm The Mossberg 500 A Forearm features a lower accessory rail system for the Mossberg 500 A. It is used to attach accessories such as a bipod, flashlight, fore grip or laser to your firearm. Two additional side rails allow you to attach more accessories. Specifications: Rail Length: 9 Inches x 2 Inches x 2.4 Inches; Rail Type: Weaver/Picatinny; Material: Aluminum; Applicable Firearm: Mossberg 500 A and similar firearms; Warranty: 1 Year Limited.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nCrKXzNUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BMAPESA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 46.39}}
{"item_id": "B00BMDMF5C", "title": "MTECH USA MT-20-08L Machete Knife 25-Inch Overall", "description": "If you're looking for a reliable machete that looks and works great, then this is for you. The MT-20-08L machete is designed to fill all your cutting, chopping, carving and clearing needs. It measures to 20\" Inch overall with a rubber handle and compass. It has a 3mm thick black stainless steel blade. Don't be caught out in the wilderness without it. .", "text": "MTECH USA MT-20-08L Machete Knife 25-Inch Overall If you're looking for a reliable machete that looks and works great, then this is for you. The MT-20-08L machete is designed to fill all your cutting, chopping, carving and clearing needs. It measures to 20\" Inch overall with a rubber handle and compass. It has a 3mm thick black stainless steel blade. Don't be caught out in the wilderness without it. .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XyAfcOELL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BMDMF5C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BMKIWXY", "title": "Cold Steel 92R80NT Rubber Tanto Trainer Trench Knife", "description": "Modeled after the original Cold Steel Tanto Trench Knife, this trainer will give you the look, feel and weight you need to properly train with this item. Made from durable santoprene, it will hold up for hundreds, even thousands of hours of rigorous training. Eye protection should be worn while using and care should be taken to injure yourself or training partner. Blade Length- 7 1/2\". Overall Length- 13 1/2\". Material: Santoprene. Weight- 6 oz. Handle- 6\".", "text": "Cold Steel 92R80NT Rubber Tanto Trainer Trench Knife Modeled after the original Cold Steel Tanto Trench Knife, this trainer will give you the look, feel and weight you need to properly train with this item. Made from durable santoprene, it will hold up for hundreds, even thousands of hours of rigorous training. Eye protection should be worn while using and care should be taken to injure yourself or training partner. Blade Length- 7 1/2\". Overall Length- 13 1/2\". Material: Santoprene. Weight- 6 oz. Handle- 6\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YyvvqAoDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BMKIWXY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Tools & Accessories", "Tools"]], "price": 11.34}}
{"item_id": "B00BMKKQBA", "title": "Cold Steel 92BKPTH Trench Hawk Trainer Axe", "description": "Modeled after the original Cold Steel Trench Hawk, this trainer will give you the look, feel and weight you need to properly train with this item. Made from durable santoprene, it will hold up for hundreds, even thousands of hours of rigorous training. Eye protection should be worn while using and care should be taken to injure yourself or training partner. 19 3/4\" long, weighs 15.9 oz.", "text": "Cold Steel 92BKPTH Trench Hawk Trainer Axe Modeled after the original Cold Steel Trench Hawk, this trainer will give you the look, feel and weight you need to properly train with this item. Made from durable santoprene, it will hold up for hundreds, even thousands of hours of rigorous training. Eye protection should be worn while using and care should be taken to injure yourself or training partner. 19 3/4\" long, weighs 15.9 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Zr71-pPEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BMKKQBA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles"]], "price": 16.81}}
{"item_id": "B00BMOTEPA", "title": "VR TT Adjustable Multi-Position Armrest Triathlon Handlebar Aero Bar with 8 Backup Rings and 2 Elbow Pads", "description": "About VR Bicycle:VR Bicycle dedicates to sell components and accessories of bike by offering the best purchasing experience.Specifications:Fits for 20-31.8mm diameterBody diameter 2cmWeight 556g(pair)", "text": "VR TT Adjustable Multi-Position Armrest Triathlon Handlebar Aero Bar with 8 Backup Rings and 2 Elbow Pads About VR Bicycle:VR Bicycle dedicates to sell components and accessories of bike by offering the best purchasing experience.Specifications:Fits for 20-31.8mm diameterBody diameter 2cmWeight 556g(pair)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51r-V1DaYsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BMOTEPA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 29.45}}
{"item_id": "B00BMSGU1W", "title": "Jaws Quick Spit Antifog Spray (Pack of 3), 1-Ounce", "description": "Now the worlds most recognized antifog comes in a spray. Quick spit spray works on anything that fogs, including dive masks, swim goggles, paintball masks, sport goggles, safety goggles, ski goggles, eye wear, windows, binoculars, scopes and more. Apply wet or dry - Quick spit is made with the same ingredients as spit gel, giving the high performance of a gel in a convenient spray formula. Over 200 pumps per bottle. Quick spit. the most recognized name in antifog. the spray that works. .", "text": "Jaws Quick Spit Antifog Spray (Pack of 3), 1-Ounce Now the worlds most recognized antifog comes in a spray. Quick spit spray works on anything that fogs, including dive masks, swim goggles, paintball masks, sport goggles, safety goggles, ski goggles, eye wear, windows, binoculars, scopes and more. Apply wet or dry - Quick spit is made with the same ingredients as spit gel, giving the high performance of a gel in a convenient spray formula. Over 200 pumps per bottle. Quick spit. the most recognized name in antifog. the spray that works. .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5184ZSnsxEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BMSGU1W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Just Add Water", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Mask Defoggers"]], "price": 14.25}}
