{"item_id": "B00BMVQSH0", "title": "Canari Men's Cyclewear Core Tank Top", "description": "The CORE Tank has all the same great features as the CORE Jersey but comes in this great tank version, the super fast wicking DriPRO fabric helps keep you dry but also regulates your body temperature keeping you cool as well.", "text": "Canari Men's Cyclewear Core Tank Top The CORE Tank has all the same great features as the CORE Jersey but comes in this great tank version, the super fast wicking DriPRO fabric helps keep you dry but also regulates your body temperature keeping you cool as well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61VsAZ1jKhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BMVQSH0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BN0M3HY", "title": "Buck Knives S30V Steel Blade 0277RWS1 Folding Alpha Hunter Knife", "description": "A rugged folding hunting knife with a modern look. The blade shape is ideal for field dressing as well as handling a wide range of camp tasks. Attractive styling is both functional and ergonomic. This tough, sturdy knife encompasses functionality with a modern feel. The folding hunter from Buck is the first with patented \"Zipper\" gut hook.", "text": "Buck Knives S30V Steel Blade 0277RWS1 Folding Alpha Hunter Knife A rugged folding hunting knife with a modern look. The blade shape is ideal for field dressing as well as handling a wide range of camp tasks. Attractive styling is both functional and ergonomic. This tough, sturdy knife encompasses functionality with a modern feel. The folding hunter from Buck is the first with patented \"Zipper\" gut hook.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318EgmMju2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BN0M3HY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 70.87}}
{"item_id": "B00BN37W7W", "title": "Lee Fisher Black and Tarred Braided Nylon Twine (1-Pound), 450-Feet", "description": "Trot line fishing is a proven, time-tested tactic and about the only equipment required to be successful is good, high-quality Braided Nylon Twine. This Braided Nylon Twine is perfect for running trot lines because its outstanding strength and long lasting durability. The heavier sizes of Twine is typically used for the main line and the lighter sizes are great for the drop lines. Lee Fisher Black Braided Nylon Twine is 100% nylon industrial grade filament materials, constructed 8 carrier round type twine for excellent strength. Tarred coating for weather resistance. Use for trotlines, jug lines, limb lines, chalk lines, fishing line, plumb line, seine line twine, mason twine net repair, craft, duck decoy, staging twine and gardening.", "text": "Lee Fisher Black and Tarred Braided Nylon Twine (1-Pound), 450-Feet Trot line fishing is a proven, time-tested tactic and about the only equipment required to be successful is good, high-quality Braided Nylon Twine. This Braided Nylon Twine is perfect for running trot lines because its outstanding strength and long lasting durability. The heavier sizes of Twine is typically used for the main line and the lighter sizes are great for the drop lines. Lee Fisher Black Braided Nylon Twine is 100% nylon industrial grade filament materials, constructed 8 carrier round type twine for excellent strength. Tarred coating for weather resistance. Use for trotlines, jug lines, limb lines, chalk lines, fishing line, plumb line, seine line twine, mason twine net repair, craft, duck decoy, staging twine and gardening.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41k9BV%2BtGEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BN37W7W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee Fisher", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Line", "Braided Line"]], "price": 13.07}}
{"item_id": "B00BNFDQMU", "title": "Orion H40-W 500 Lumen LED Tactical Flashlight with Pressure Switch and Rifle Mount", "description": "Designed for peak performance in the harshest environments, Orion H40-W Tactical Lights are compact, recoil-proof due to their virtually indestructible LED emitter. Comes with both constant-on clicky switch and momentary-on pressure switch, it is ready to be mounted on any rifle with standard picatinny rails. Redesigned in 2013 with the newest CREE XM-L U2 LED, the Orion H40-W emits a powerful 500 lumens white beam, ideal for identifying threats and overwhelming the sight of adversaries.Specification* LED type: Cree XM-L U2 (Cool White)* Output and Runtime:* * LED lumen: 640* * ANSI FL-1 lumen: 500* * Runtime: 75 min* Lens: Waterwhite glass lens w/ harden treatment* Reflector: Smooth aluminum reflector* Beam Profile:* * Center lux: 6400* * Center spot angle: 9.6* * Spill light angle: 58* * Beam distance: 175 yards / 160 meters* Battery: 2 x CR123A (included) or 1 x 18650* Dimensions: 5.2\" (L) x 1\" (D)* Weight: 3.4 oz (without battery)* Material: High-strength aerospace aluminum body, hard-anodized for extreme durability* Waterproof: IPX-7 standardPackage includes* 1x Orion H40-W Tactical Light (with regular tail cap switch)* 2x CR123A Batteries* 1x Pressure switch* 1x 1\" Picatinny / Weaver rail mount* 1x Instruction SheetImportant Notice: Only purchase from US vendors to ensure you get the authentic product and warranty service.", "text": "Orion H40-W 500 Lumen LED Tactical Flashlight with Pressure Switch and Rifle Mount Designed for peak performance in the harshest environments, Orion H40-W Tactical Lights are compact, recoil-proof due to their virtually indestructible LED emitter. Comes with both constant-on clicky switch and momentary-on pressure switch, it is ready to be mounted on any rifle with standard picatinny rails. Redesigned in 2013 with the newest CREE XM-L U2 LED, the Orion H40-W emits a powerful 500 lumens white beam, ideal for identifying threats and overwhelming the sight of adversaries.Specification* LED type: Cree XM-L U2 (Cool White)* Output and Runtime:* * LED lumen: 640* * ANSI FL-1 lumen: 500* * Runtime: 75 min* Lens: Waterwhite glass lens w/ harden treatment* Reflector: Smooth aluminum reflector* Beam Profile:* * Center lux: 6400* * Center spot angle: 9.6* * Spill light angle: 58* * Beam distance: 175 yards / 160 meters* Battery: 2 x CR123A (included) or 1 x 18650* Dimensions: 5.2\" (L) x 1\" (D)* Weight: 3.4 oz (without battery)* Material: High-strength aerospace aluminum body, hard-anodized for extreme durability* Waterproof: IPX-7 standardPackage includes* 1x Orion H40-W Tactical Light (with regular tail cap switch)* 2x CR123A Batteries* 1x Pressure switch* 1x 1\" Picatinny / Weaver rail mount* 1x Instruction SheetImportant Notice: Only purchase from US vendors to ensure you get the authentic product and warranty service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31x9MDbLpUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BNFDQMU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BNFVWL2", "title": "Stainless Steel Vacuum Water Bottle - 500ml (17 Oz.)", "description": "Rugged Stainless Steel bottles! The perfect bottle for any occasion!. Unlike bulky canteens, this stylish and elegant bottle looks great and works even better. All this while saving the planet from plastic waste Double walled, insulated construction allows beverages to stay cold for 24 hours or hot for 12. Constructed of the highest quality, 18/8 food grade stainless steel, these bottles are non leaching, toxin free, virtually unbreakable. Extremely lightweight with a wide mouth to allow for easy cleaning and adding ice cubes. * Dishwasher safe * 2 Year warranty * 30 day money back guarantee * Non leaching, toxin and BPA free", "text": "Stainless Steel Vacuum Water Bottle - 500ml (17 Oz.) Rugged Stainless Steel bottles! The perfect bottle for any occasion!. Unlike bulky canteens, this stylish and elegant bottle looks great and works even better. All this while saving the planet from plastic waste Double walled, insulated construction allows beverages to stay cold for 24 hours or hot for 12. Constructed of the highest quality, 18/8 food grade stainless steel, these bottles are non leaching, toxin free, virtually unbreakable. Extremely lightweight with a wide mouth to allow for easy cleaning and adding ice cubes. * Dishwasher safe * 2 Year warranty * 30 day money back guarantee * Non leaching, toxin and BPA free", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pb1wcqd6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BNFVWL2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BNPUX94", "title": "Kershaw 3880 Thermite Folding Knife", "description": "A thermite is a mixture that, when ignited, produces a huge amount of heat. And we think you'll agree, the Thermite is hot. With tactical styling and practical performance, the Thermite, designed by Rick Hinderer, has a great look and great features. The Thermite offers Rick's no-nonsense functionality, but with enough style that co-workers will look on with a satisfying touch of envy when you take the Thermite out of your pocket. The 3 1/2-inch stonewashed blade is hollow-ground for excellent slicing capabilities with a flat-ground \"spanto\" tip for strong piercing. A machined G-10 front scale and a heavily textured back spacer add to the Thermite's good looks. On the practical side, the back handle is stainless steel with a frame lock and lock bar stabilizer. For easy opening, the Thermite is Speed Safe-equipped and can be accessed with the ambidextrous flipper or thumb stud. Flipper: May be used on either manual or assisted opening knives. The \"flipper\" is a protrusion on the back of the blade that the user can pull back on, or flip, in order to move the blade easily out of the handle. Speed Safe: Assists you to open any Speed Safe knife quickly and easily with a manual push on the thumb stud or pull back on the flipper. Frame Lock: A portion of the handle (the knife frame) moves behind the blade to lock it into position during use. This is a safety feature of the knife. Quad-carry: The user may position the pocket clip for tip-up or tip-down, left- or right-handed carry.", "text": "Kershaw 3880 Thermite Folding Knife A thermite is a mixture that, when ignited, produces a huge amount of heat. And we think you'll agree, the Thermite is hot. With tactical styling and practical performance, the Thermite, designed by Rick Hinderer, has a great look and great features. The Thermite offers Rick's no-nonsense functionality, but with enough style that co-workers will look on with a satisfying touch of envy when you take the Thermite out of your pocket. The 3 1/2-inch stonewashed blade is hollow-ground for excellent slicing capabilities with a flat-ground \"spanto\" tip for strong piercing. A machined G-10 front scale and a heavily textured back spacer add to the Thermite's good looks. On the practical side, the back handle is stainless steel with a frame lock and lock bar stabilizer. For easy opening, the Thermite is Speed Safe-equipped and can be accessed with the ambidextrous flipper or thumb stud. Flipper: May be used on either manual or assisted opening knives. The \"flipper\" is a protrusion on the back of the blade that the user can pull back on, or flip, in order to move the blade easily out of the handle. Speed Safe: Assists you to open any Speed Safe knife quickly and easily with a manual push on the thumb stud or pull back on the flipper. Frame Lock: A portion of the handle (the knife frame) moves behind the blade to lock it into position during use. This is a safety feature of the knife. Quad-carry: The user may position the pocket clip for tip-up or tip-down, left- or right-handed carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DGLwiUwcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BNPUX94.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 18.44}}
{"item_id": "B00BNPV1O0", "title": "Kershaw 1074 Camp Knife, 18-Inch", "description": "The Camp 18 is the biggest zombie whacker in the Kershaw stable. On the other hand, we think it makes a pretty darn successful camp knife, too. With it's big 18-inch blade, it takes on campsite and other outdoor chores with ease. From clearing brush to making kindling, the Camp 18 is the ideal outdoor and survival tool. Cut, chop, slash, hack, split, scrape—just about any task you ask of it, the Camp 18 can handle. The full-tang Camp 18 is made of carbon tool steel for toughness and wear resistance. A basic black powder coat protects the steel and makes maintenance easier. You'll like the secure, contoured grip of the Camp 18, too. The handle has a built-in hand guard and is drilled in both front and rear so you can attach a lanyard either place—or both—for carrying versatility. Like the other knives in our Camp series, the Camp 18 comes with its own molded sheath with sturdy nylon straps. Whether you're whacking zombies or underbrush, the Camp 18 is the tool of choice. Technical Specifications: Fixed Blade: The knife does not fold closed; usually stored in a sheath or blade protector.", "text": "Kershaw 1074 Camp Knife, 18-Inch The Camp 18 is the biggest zombie whacker in the Kershaw stable. On the other hand, we think it makes a pretty darn successful camp knife, too. With it's big 18-inch blade, it takes on campsite and other outdoor chores with ease. From clearing brush to making kindling, the Camp 18 is the ideal outdoor and survival tool. Cut, chop, slash, hack, split, scrape—just about any task you ask of it, the Camp 18 can handle. The full-tang Camp 18 is made of carbon tool steel for toughness and wear resistance. A basic black powder coat protects the steel and makes maintenance easier. You'll like the secure, contoured grip of the Camp 18, too. The handle has a built-in hand guard and is drilled in both front and rear so you can attach a lanyard either place—or both—for carrying versatility. Like the other knives in our Camp series, the Camp 18 comes with its own molded sheath with sturdy nylon straps. Whether you're whacking zombies or underbrush, the Camp 18 is the tool of choice. Technical Specifications: Fixed Blade: The knife does not fold closed; usually stored in a sheath or blade protector.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21lAnm3p6vL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BNPV1O0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 37.26}}
{"item_id": "B00BNPV1RW", "title": "Kershaw 1076 Camp Knife, 14-Inch", "description": "Sometimes, bigger is better. It all depends on the job. That's why we make our Camp series knives in three sizes. This one is the Camp 14. It's 14 Inch of pretty awesome camp knife that does a great job of whacking campsite and other outdoor chores down to size in very short order. From clearing brush to making kindling, the Camp 14 is the ideal outdoor and survival tool. Cut, chop, slash, hack, split, scrape—just about any task you ask of it, the Camp 14 can handle. The full-tang Camp 14 is made of carbon tool steel for toughness and wear resistance. A basic black powder coat protects the steel and makes maintenance easier. You'll like the secure, contoured grip of the Camp 14, too. The handle has a built-in hand guard and is drilled in both front and rear so you can attach a lanyard either place—or both—for carrying versatility. The Camp 14, like the other knives in our Camp series comes with its own molded sheath with sturdy nylon straps. Technical Specifications: Fixed Blade: The knife does not fold closed; usually stored in a sheath or blade protector.", "text": "Kershaw 1076 Camp Knife, 14-Inch Sometimes, bigger is better. It all depends on the job. That's why we make our Camp series knives in three sizes. This one is the Camp 14. It's 14 Inch of pretty awesome camp knife that does a great job of whacking campsite and other outdoor chores down to size in very short order. From clearing brush to making kindling, the Camp 14 is the ideal outdoor and survival tool. Cut, chop, slash, hack, split, scrape—just about any task you ask of it, the Camp 14 can handle. The full-tang Camp 14 is made of carbon tool steel for toughness and wear resistance. A basic black powder coat protects the steel and makes maintenance easier. You'll like the secure, contoured grip of the Camp 14, too. The handle has a built-in hand guard and is drilled in both front and rear so you can attach a lanyard either place—or both—for carrying versatility. The Camp 14, like the other knives in our Camp series comes with its own molded sheath with sturdy nylon straps. Technical Specifications: Fixed Blade: The knife does not fold closed; usually stored in a sheath or blade protector.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AU47TvH7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BNPV1RW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 42.72}}
{"item_id": "B00BNWV89Q", "title": "Casio Men's PRG260-1 Black Pro-Trek Watch", "description": "", "text": "Casio Men's PRG260-1 Black Pro-Trek Watch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YlICs5DiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BNWV89Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Casio", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "New Arrivals"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men's Athletic Watches"]], "price": 114.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BO2ERG6", "title": "Smith and Wesson SWTK10CP Throwing Knives, 10-Inch, 3-Pack", "description": "These perfectly balanced 10-inch throwing knives feature razor sharp edges and tip. This package includes a sheath, nicely accommodating all three knives.", "text": "Smith and Wesson SWTK10CP Throwing Knives, 10-Inch, 3-Pack These perfectly balanced 10-inch throwing knives feature razor sharp edges and tip. This package includes a sheath, nicely accommodating all three knives.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Vvm2ubq3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BO2ERG6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 28.16}}
{"item_id": "B00BO2EXXI", "title": "Schrade SCPEN4BK Survival Tactical Pen with Ferro Fire-Starting Rod and Whistle, Black", "description": "As comfortable in the office as it is in the field, this survival pen can be used as a window breaker, an emergency whistle and includes a fire starter. The durable aluminum body means it can take abuse of every-day carry. This pen DOES NOT include or conceal a knife blade.", "text": "Schrade SCPEN4BK Survival Tactical Pen with Ferro Fire-Starting Rod and Whistle, Black As comfortable in the office as it is in the field, this survival pen can be used as a window breaker, an emergency whistle and includes a fire starter. The durable aluminum body means it can take abuse of every-day carry. This pen DOES NOT include or conceal a knife blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31B-Hi3yYwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BO2EXXI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 24.75}}
{"item_id": "B00BO4U7VS", "title": "Sigma Sport BC16.12 16 Function Bicycle Computer", "description": "Sigma Sport products are synonymous with quality, value and outstanding customer service. Sigma products are hand tested and packaged in the Chicago suburbs, guaranteeing reliable performance. The BC 16.12 is the training computer in SIGMA's Topline12 product range offering cyclists the ability to measure cadence to increase performance. It delivers all of the essential ride data on a large, easy to read, full text display. Additional features like the countdown timer, stopwatch and the Smart Backlight will help you achieve your training goals. Includes a low battery indicator and an integrated storage chip that maintains settings and total values while changing the battery. 16 Functions: Speed, Distance, Average speed, Maximum speed, Comparison of current speed to average speed, Clock, Ride time, Temperature, Cadence, Average cadence, 2 bike Programmable, Stopwatch, Backlight.", "text": "Sigma Sport BC16.12 16 Function Bicycle Computer Sigma Sport products are synonymous with quality, value and outstanding customer service. Sigma products are hand tested and packaged in the Chicago suburbs, guaranteeing reliable performance. The BC 16.12 is the training computer in SIGMA's Topline12 product range offering cyclists the ability to measure cadence to increase performance. It delivers all of the essential ride data on a large, easy to read, full text display. Additional features like the countdown timer, stopwatch and the Smart Backlight will help you achieve your training goals. Includes a low battery indicator and an integrated storage chip that maintains settings and total values while changing the battery. 16 Functions: Speed, Distance, Average speed, Maximum speed, Comparison of current speed to average speed, Clock, Ride time, Temperature, Cadence, Average cadence, 2 bike Programmable, Stopwatch, Backlight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MciispZmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BO4U7VS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sigma Sport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 33.98}}
{"item_id": "B00BOEEU70", "title": "Meister Gel-Padded ProWrap Hand Wrap Gloves (Pair)", "description": "Protect your hands and wrists with Meister's ProWraps. These premium inner wrap gloves are the perfect protection to wear under your MMA, Boxing or Bag Gloves. The integrated Gel Padding gives these wraps extra thickness and protection around the knuckles and back of hand. With 26\" of premium lycra straps you can wrap your wrists to give yourself maximum stability. Get yours today!", "text": "Meister Gel-Padded ProWrap Hand Wrap Gloves (Pair) Protect your hands and wrists with Meister's ProWraps. These premium inner wrap gloves are the perfect protection to wear under your MMA, Boxing or Bag Gloves. The integrated Gel Padding gives these wraps extra thickness and protection around the knuckles and back of hand. With 26\" of premium lycra straps you can wrap your wrists to give yourself maximum stability. Get yours today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mjPNtNSwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BOEEU70.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Hand Wraps"]], "price": 9.99}}
