{"item_id": "B00BOK39T4", "title": "AVID MTB BB7 Mechanical Disc Brake Front and Rear 160mm", "description": "Product Details:Condition: Brand NewProduct Location: USAColor: BlackMaterial: Stainless steel & Aluminum AllyFeatures:Mechanical Cable Pull Type16 bolts & 2 stainless steel G2 160 mm rotors2 aluminum ally calipersAvid original brake pads", "text": "AVID MTB BB7 Mechanical Disc Brake Front and Rear 160mm Product Details:Condition: Brand NewProduct Location: USAColor: BlackMaterial: Stainless steel & Aluminum AllyFeatures:Mechanical Cable Pull Type16 bolts & 2 stainless steel G2 160 mm rotors2 aluminum ally calipersAvid original brake pads", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51a4gNtZSSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BOK39T4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brakes"]], "price": 65.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BOVWP1Q", "title": "Black Mountain Products 1200lbs Rated Multi-Use Exercise Gymnastics Rings", "description": "Brand New set of Black Mountain Products Multi-Use Exercise Gymnastic Rings. B.M.P. Rings are capable of holding up to 1200lbs and come with a 15ft strap for greater adjustment lengths. Gymnastics rings are lightweight and portable for use anywhere. Black Mountain products Gym Rings are professional grade and are perfect for any fitness level. B.M.P. gym rings are a great way to exercise your upper body, core and agility. Great for cross fit training, body rows, push-ups, pull-ups, dips, any many other exercises. Rings can easily installed and taken down. Each set of Black Mountain Products Gymnastics Rings comes with a lifetime warranty.", "text": "Black Mountain Products 1200lbs Rated Multi-Use Exercise Gymnastics Rings Brand New set of Black Mountain Products Multi-Use Exercise Gymnastic Rings. B.M.P. Rings are capable of holding up to 1200lbs and come with a 15ft strap for greater adjustment lengths. Gymnastics rings are lightweight and portable for use anywhere. Black Mountain products Gym Rings are professional grade and are perfect for any fitness level. B.M.P. gym rings are a great way to exercise your upper body, core and agility. Great for cross fit training, body rows, push-ups, pull-ups, dips, any many other exercises. Rings can easily installed and taken down. Each set of Black Mountain Products Gymnastics Rings comes with a lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gmAe6GdLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BOVWP1Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Mountain", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Gymnastics", "Gym & Competition Equipment", "Rings"]], "price": 32.99}}
