{"item_id": "B00BP2XL6C", "title": "Cornhole Bags (Set of 4) By SC Cornhole:: Choose Your Colors", "description": "SC Cornhole is one of the leading producers of cornhole bags in the United States. Developed in 2006, the weather resistant cornhole bags were designed to combat several problems with traditoinal cornhole bags. While the size and canvas remain the same, they are filled with recycled plastic. The advantage to this is that the bag does not lose volume as you continue to play, it will not attract critters, and it will not get moldy if they are left in the rain. Whether you are a casual player or a tournament organizer, SC Cornhole Bags are the right choose.", "text": "Cornhole Bags (Set of 4) By SC Cornhole:: Choose Your Colors SC Cornhole is one of the leading producers of cornhole bags in the United States. Developed in 2006, the weather resistant cornhole bags were designed to combat several problems with traditoinal cornhole bags. While the size and canvas remain the same, they are filled with recycled plastic. The advantage to this is that the bag does not lose volume as you continue to play, it will not attract critters, and it will not get moldy if they are left in the rain. Whether you are a casual player or a tournament organizer, SC Cornhole Bags are the right choose.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AY738ee5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BP2XL6C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Toss Games", "Cornhole", "Cornhole Bags"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BP70H8W", "title": "Glo-Toob AAA Waterproof Emergency Dive Light, Green", "description": "The Glo-toob AAA is a three function, waterproof, reusable light with hundreds of applications. The AAA Glo-toob are virtually indestructible and can take knocks and bumps in almost any environment. Glo-toob are perfect for diving, camping, road side emergencies, action sports or any extreme situation including covert Military operations. Its compact design allows you to easily carry it in your pocket, on your belt, or in a glove compartment.", "text": "Glo-Toob AAA Waterproof Emergency Dive Light, Green The Glo-toob AAA is a three function, waterproof, reusable light with hundreds of applications. The AAA Glo-toob are virtually indestructible and can take knocks and bumps in almost any environment. Glo-toob are perfect for diving, camping, road side emergencies, action sports or any extreme situation including covert Military operations. Its compact design allows you to easily carry it in your pocket, on your belt, or in a glove compartment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a0d-QIUyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BP70H8W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glo-Toob", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Lights"]], "price": 17.47}}
{"item_id": "B00BPHNIZG", "title": "Monstrum F22B Tactical LED Flashlight, Black Matte, includes Remote Pressure Switch, Colored Lens Filters, and Rail Mount", "description": "Whether for hunting or for tactical use, the rugged and dependable Monstrum F22B Tactical Flashlight is a welcome complement to any AR-15 or similar rifle. Powered by a long-lasting 200 Lumens Cree XR-E LED, the F22B has both high and low beam settings, and can even function as a blinding strobe. This package includes a detachable remote pressure switch for convenient operation without removing hand from gun, a detachable lens filter with red, green, and blue lenses, and a 1\" ring mount for mounting on Picatinny or Weaver rail equipped AR-15 or similar rifles. Please note that the low beam and strobe functions cannot be activated with the remote pressure switch. Two CR123A batteries are included with purchase.", "text": "Monstrum F22B Tactical LED Flashlight, Black Matte, includes Remote Pressure Switch, Colored Lens Filters, and Rail Mount Whether for hunting or for tactical use, the rugged and dependable Monstrum F22B Tactical Flashlight is a welcome complement to any AR-15 or similar rifle. Powered by a long-lasting 200 Lumens Cree XR-E LED, the F22B has both high and low beam settings, and can even function as a blinding strobe. This package includes a detachable remote pressure switch for convenient operation without removing hand from gun, a detachable lens filter with red, green, and blue lenses, and a 1\" ring mount for mounting on Picatinny or Weaver rail equipped AR-15 or similar rifles. Please note that the low beam and strobe functions cannot be activated with the remote pressure switch. Two CR123A batteries are included with purchase.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jEB9uUYJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BPHNIZG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 40.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BPHUKB6", "title": "Monstrum F22MC Tactical LED Flashlight, Military Copper Finish, includes Remote Pressure Switch, Colored Lens Filters, and Rail Mount", "description": "Whether for hunting or for tactical use, the rugged and dependable Monstrum F22MC Tactical Flashlight is a welcome complement to any rifle or shotgun. Powered by a long-lasting 200 Lumens Cree XR-E LED, the F22MC has both high and low beam settings, and can even function as a blinding strobe. This package includes a detachable remote pressure switch for convenient operation without removing hand from gun, a detachable lens filter with red, green, and blue lenses, and a 1\" ring mount for mounting on Picatinny or Weaver rail equipped AR-15 or similar rifle. Please note that the low beam and strobe functions cannot be activated with the remote pressure switch. Two CR123A batteries are included with purchase.", "text": "Monstrum F22MC Tactical LED Flashlight, Military Copper Finish, includes Remote Pressure Switch, Colored Lens Filters, and Rail Mount Whether for hunting or for tactical use, the rugged and dependable Monstrum F22MC Tactical Flashlight is a welcome complement to any rifle or shotgun. Powered by a long-lasting 200 Lumens Cree XR-E LED, the F22MC has both high and low beam settings, and can even function as a blinding strobe. This package includes a detachable remote pressure switch for convenient operation without removing hand from gun, a detachable lens filter with red, green, and blue lenses, and a 1\" ring mount for mounting on Picatinny or Weaver rail equipped AR-15 or similar rifle. Please note that the low beam and strobe functions cannot be activated with the remote pressure switch. Two CR123A batteries are included with purchase.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417Tio1FW1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BPHUKB6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 38.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BPI3BP2", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Diversion Carry Bag", "description": "BLACKHAWK! Diversion Carry Bag keeps up to 2 firearms secure and out of sight. Mimics a tennis racquet case, but the only thing this Carry Bag serves up is protection and concealment! Now you can transport firearms conveniently, without drawing attention. To keep your cargo even more \"undercover,\" the Bag comes in 3 common, athletic-inspired color schemes. For safety, zipper slides allow for locking. In your court: Padded walls with inner shells protect firearms, hide their outlines; Easy-access hidden compartments; Internal divider carries up to 2 firearms, or separated upper / lower AR-15 receivers (up to 29\" long); Lock-compatible zipper sliders. State Color. Order Now! BLACKHAWK! Diversion Carry Bag", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Diversion Carry Bag BLACKHAWK! Diversion Carry Bag keeps up to 2 firearms secure and out of sight. Mimics a tennis racquet case, but the only thing this Carry Bag serves up is protection and concealment! Now you can transport firearms conveniently, without drawing attention. To keep your cargo even more \"undercover,\" the Bag comes in 3 common, athletic-inspired color schemes. For safety, zipper slides allow for locking. In your court: Padded walls with inner shells protect firearms, hide their outlines; Easy-access hidden compartments; Internal divider carries up to 2 firearms, or separated upper / lower AR-15 receivers (up to 29\" long); Lock-compatible zipper sliders. State Color. Order Now! BLACKHAWK! Diversion Carry Bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pDDy8nnnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BPI3BP2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Racquets"]], "price": 61.91}}
