{"item_id": "B00BPIPNIU", "title": "Cold Steel 21TTXL Talwar Plain Edge Knife, 5 1/2-Inch", "description": "Designed by celebrated custom knife-maker Andrew Demko and Cold Steel President Lynn C Thompson, the largest of our diverse new Talwar series boasts the widest blade available (measuring a full 2\" wide!). Flat ground, with a continuously curved cutting edge from choil to upswept point it offers cutting and piercing power hitherto unavailable in a folding knife. To compliment the Talwar's razor edge and lethal point we developed a truly exceptional handle. Made from American G-10, it's textured and contoured pistol grip handle features strategically placed finger grooves for comfort and safety and to further protect your precious fingers from this formidable blade, we have equipped the Talwar with our industry-leading Tri-Ad lock. Tried and tested, this super safe locking mechanism has proven to be unequalled by any folding knife lock in the industry - at any price! Faster on the draw than any switchblade, our Talwar comes equipped with Andrew Demko's revolutionary ambidextrous thumb plate. By draw-snagging the knife on a pocket the awesome power of the Talwar can be in your hand at the speed of lightning! Specifications: Blade length 5-1/2\"; Blade thickness 4 mm; Overall length 12-3/4\"; Weight 8.4 oz.; Steel: Japanese AUS 8A Stainless; Handle: G-10; Pocket clip: Stainless Pocket/(more.).", "text": "Cold Steel 21TTXL Talwar Plain Edge Knife, 5 1/2-Inch Designed by celebrated custom knife-maker Andrew Demko and Cold Steel President Lynn C Thompson, the largest of our diverse new Talwar series boasts the widest blade available (measuring a full 2\" wide!). Flat ground, with a continuously curved cutting edge from choil to upswept point it offers cutting and piercing power hitherto unavailable in a folding knife. To compliment the Talwar's razor edge and lethal point we developed a truly exceptional handle. Made from American G-10, it's textured and contoured pistol grip handle features strategically placed finger grooves for comfort and safety and to further protect your precious fingers from this formidable blade, we have equipped the Talwar with our industry-leading Tri-Ad lock. Tried and tested, this super safe locking mechanism has proven to be unequalled by any folding knife lock in the industry - at any price! Faster on the draw than any switchblade, our Talwar comes equipped with Andrew Demko's revolutionary ambidextrous thumb plate. By draw-snagging the knife on a pocket the awesome power of the Talwar can be in your hand at the speed of lightning! Specifications: Blade length 5-1/2\"; Blade thickness 4 mm; Overall length 12-3/4\"; Weight 8.4 oz.; Steel: Japanese AUS 8A Stainless; Handle: G-10; Pocket clip: Stainless Pocket/(more.).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bqluE23lL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BPIPNIU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 95.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BPITNWM", "title": "Magpul PTS MBUS Front & Rear Back-UP Sight Set Black", "description": "The Magpul PTS Back-up sights are not any ordinary sights, they really are handsome-looking things. There's something quite muscular and \"beefy\" about the shape of this that give it a futuristic, cutting-edge look. ***Product Details: - A Sight Designed As A Low-Cost. Folding Back-Up Sight - Spring Loaded Flip-Up system, release lever can be reached on left, right & top position - Solid click sound when sights are locked into position - No need to release lock to fold - Standard Adjustable M16 Style Sight Post - Rear sight comes with Dual Apertures and Adjustable Windage - The MBUS Fits All 20mm Rail Equipped Weapons - Constructed of same DuPont Polyer material as the Famous PMAG.*** ===---MAGPUL PTS PRODUCT FAQ: 1. What is the difference between Magpul PTS and Magpul Industries? - Magpul PTS (Professional Training and Simulation) is a division of Magpul Industries USA that is specifically creates products for the sport of airsoft/simuation. 2. Can I use Magpul PTS on my real steel AR/Rifle? - We highly advise against it. 3. Why are Magpul PTS prices so much lower than Magpul USA products? - Because many airsoft rifles are built with a less expensive material (aka polymer vs. steel), Magpul PTS products also uses inexpensive but high quality materials vs. Magpul USA. 4. Will this item fit my (insert brand/make/model/type) AEG or GBB airsoft rifle? - Magpul products are designed to fit 95% of all M4/M16 type rifles and styles. However, due to literally dozens of different airsoft manufacturers, we cannot 100% guarantee fitment. We recommend doing research at airsoft forums and websites if you have any doubts.---===", "text": "Magpul PTS MBUS Front & Rear Back-UP Sight Set Black The Magpul PTS Back-up sights are not any ordinary sights, they really are handsome-looking things. There's something quite muscular and \"beefy\" about the shape of this that give it a futuristic, cutting-edge look. ***Product Details: - A Sight Designed As A Low-Cost. Folding Back-Up Sight - Spring Loaded Flip-Up system, release lever can be reached on left, right & top position - Solid click sound when sights are locked into position - No need to release lock to fold - Standard Adjustable M16 Style Sight Post - Rear sight comes with Dual Apertures and Adjustable Windage - The MBUS Fits All 20mm Rail Equipped Weapons - Constructed of same DuPont Polyer material as the Famous PMAG.*** ===---MAGPUL PTS PRODUCT FAQ: 1. What is the difference between Magpul PTS and Magpul Industries? - Magpul PTS (Professional Training and Simulation) is a division of Magpul Industries USA that is specifically creates products for the sport of airsoft/simuation. 2. Can I use Magpul PTS on my real steel AR/Rifle? - We highly advise against it. 3. Why are Magpul PTS prices so much lower than Magpul USA products? - Because many airsoft rifles are built with a less expensive material (aka polymer vs. steel), Magpul PTS products also uses inexpensive but high quality materials vs. Magpul USA. 4. Will this item fit my (insert brand/make/model/type) AEG or GBB airsoft rifle? - Magpul products are designed to fit 95% of all M4/M16 type rifles and styles. However, due to literally dozens of different airsoft manufacturers, we cannot 100% guarantee fitment. We recommend doing research at airsoft forums and websites if you have any doubts.---===", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317Q0qewt%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BPITNWM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BPRM2O4", "title": "Large Exercise Mat. 72\" Wide x 72\" Long, Durable Rubber Fitness Mat. Designed For Home-Based Fitness and CARDIO Workouts Like Insanity, P90X, Shaun T's Rockin' Body, T25, X-TrainFit, Jillian Michaels 30 Day Shred, etc. Large Workout Mat With A Unique Fabric Finish That Provides Excellent Traction And Floor Protection. Can Be Used In Conjunction With The Square36 YOGA Mat. The Square36 CARDIO Mat - The BIG Exercise Mat- Step Into the Square.", "description": "*Square36 CARDIO Exercise Mat**Made with durable rubber. Rubber provides excellent floor protection and traction.*Large Size: 6 Feet x 6 Feet (72\"x72\")*The Cardio Mat has an initial rubber odour. Please leave the mat unrolled and the smell will dissipate. Thank you for your patience:)*As Of March 1st 2014 our mats are made with a new rubber blend that has less of an initial rubber odour*The 40 Lb weight of the mat limits shifting and bunching on most surfacesCUSTOMER SERVICE: We are a small, family run company and our customers are extremely important to us. If you are unsatisfied with our product for any reason, please contact us directly through Amazon before leaving a review. We will do anything we can to accommodate you:)*3mm thick, made of dense rubber with no fillers (no pvc, plastic, foam etc). The Cardio mat is not squishy, but the high density of rubber helps with absorption for joints.*For additional cushioning and absorption on hard surfaces (tile, cement, hardwood) we recommend using the Square36 Yoga 3.0 mat as an underlay. Used together, the Square36 Cardio and the Square Yoga 3.0 provide 9mm of cushioning. The Yoga 3.0 is also excellent for cool down or floor work.*Store the mat laying flat or in the rolled position, NOT folded. Folding the mat can cause crease damage.*To clean use a cloth or mop & water mixed with a few drops of mild dish soap. For a quick clean use a vacuum or broom.*Check Out Our Other Sizes:*6' x 4' (6mm Thick-Twice as thick as our S36 Cardio Mat) BARRACUDA BLACK Exercise Mat*8' x 6' Cardio MAX Exercise Mat*For The BEST warm up and cool down check out our Barracuda Cork Massage Roller.", "text": "Large Exercise Mat. 72\" Wide x 72\" Long, Durable Rubber Fitness Mat. Designed For Home-Based Fitness and CARDIO Workouts Like Insanity, P90X, Shaun T's Rockin' Body, T25, X-TrainFit, Jillian Michaels 30 Day Shred, etc. Large Workout Mat With A Unique Fabric Finish That Provides Excellent Traction And Floor Protection. Can Be Used In Conjunction With The Square36 YOGA Mat. The Square36 CARDIO Mat - The BIG Exercise Mat- Step Into the Square. *Square36 CARDIO Exercise Mat**Made with durable rubber. Rubber provides excellent floor protection and traction.*Large Size: 6 Feet x 6 Feet (72\"x72\")*The Cardio Mat has an initial rubber odour. Please leave the mat unrolled and the smell will dissipate. Thank you for your patience:)*As Of March 1st 2014 our mats are made with a new rubber blend that has less of an initial rubber odour*The 40 Lb weight of the mat limits shifting and bunching on most surfacesCUSTOMER SERVICE: We are a small, family run company and our customers are extremely important to us. If you are unsatisfied with our product for any reason, please contact us directly through Amazon before leaving a review. We will do anything we can to accommodate you:)*3mm thick, made of dense rubber with no fillers (no pvc, plastic, foam etc). The Cardio mat is not squishy, but the high density of rubber helps with absorption for joints.*For additional cushioning and absorption on hard surfaces (tile, cement, hardwood) we recommend using the Square36 Yoga 3.0 mat as an underlay. Used together, the Square36 Cardio and the Square Yoga 3.0 provide 9mm of cushioning. The Yoga 3.0 is also excellent for cool down or floor work.*Store the mat laying flat or in the rolled position, NOT folded. Folding the mat can cause crease damage.*To clean use a cloth or mop & water mixed with a few drops of mild dish soap. For a quick clean use a vacuum or broom.*Check Out Our Other Sizes:*6' x 4' (6mm Thick-Twice as thick as our S36 Cardio Mat) BARRACUDA BLACK Exercise Mat*8' x 6' Cardio MAX Exercise Mat*For The BEST warm up and cool down check out our Barracuda Cork Massage Roller.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xjBTrUaUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BPRM2O4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Protective Flooring"]], "price": 159.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BPUPEAK", "title": "Mora Hi-Vis Orange Swedish Survival Knife - Stainless", "description": "Mora Outdoor 2000 Orange. 8 3/4 overall. 4 stainless blade. Black composition handle with blaze orange trim. Blaze orange composition belt sheath with water drain holes. Bulk packed.", "text": "Mora Hi-Vis Orange Swedish Survival Knife - Stainless Mora Outdoor 2000 Orange. 8 3/4 overall. 4 stainless blade. Black composition handle with blaze orange trim. Blaze orange composition belt sheath with water drain holes. Bulk packed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4140Q1l9u1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BPUPEAK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mora", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 31.73}}
