{"item_id": "B00BPZBR5G", "title": "Schrade SCHBOLO Bolo Stainless Steel Machete", "description": "The Schrade BOLO Machete is strong and durable with a High Carbon Steel blade, with full tang-through-handle design. The Titanium Nitride Coating helps ensure a longer lasting edge and smooth cutting. The included sheath has a removable strap and houses the included sharpener and fire-starting flint.", "text": "Schrade SCHBOLO Bolo Stainless Steel Machete The Schrade BOLO Machete is strong and durable with a High Carbon Steel blade, with full tang-through-handle design. The Titanium Nitride Coating helps ensure a longer lasting edge and smooth cutting. The included sheath has a removable strap and houses the included sharpener and fire-starting flint.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21s9sCsQqyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BPZBR5G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 43.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BQ0CY0M", "title": "Kershaw Knives 1555BLK Kershaw Cryo Hinderer Assisted Opening Framelock with Black DLC Finish Standard Edge Blade", "description": "Kershaw Cryo Hinderer Assisted Opening Framelock. 3 3/4\" closed. 2 3/4\" 8Cr13MoV stainless blade with dual thumb studs and flipper. Stainless handles with Hinderer lockbar stabilizer. Oversized lanyard hole. Four-way reversible stainless pocket clip. Rick Hinderer design.Black DLC finish standard edge blade. Black DLC finish handles.", "text": "Kershaw Knives 1555BLK Kershaw Cryo Hinderer Assisted Opening Framelock with Black DLC Finish Standard Edge Blade Kershaw Cryo Hinderer Assisted Opening Framelock. 3 3/4\" closed. 2 3/4\" 8Cr13MoV stainless blade with dual thumb studs and flipper. Stainless handles with Hinderer lockbar stabilizer. Oversized lanyard hole. Four-way reversible stainless pocket clip. Rick Hinderer design.Black DLC finish standard edge blade. Black DLC finish handles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XvLokRE%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQ0CY0M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 32.87}}
{"item_id": "B00BQ0MVEQ", "title": "Schrade SCH104L Honed Drop-Point Frame-Lock Folding Knife", "description": "This ambidextrous folding knife features dual thumb studs and a frame lock for easy single handed opening and closing. The blade has a durable bead-blasted finish and the G10 handle slabs are comfortable and durable as well.", "text": "Schrade SCH104L Honed Drop-Point Frame-Lock Folding Knife This ambidextrous folding knife features dual thumb studs and a frame lock for easy single handed opening and closing. The blade has a durable bead-blasted finish and the G10 handle slabs are comfortable and durable as well.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DsLuaQuNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQ0MVEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 24.11}}
{"item_id": "B00BQ0OIUG", "title": "Pachmayr 05178 Tactical Grip Glove Springfield Xd(S)", "description": "Tactical Grip Glove for Springfield XD (S) Model - \"Stretch to Fit \" Grip Gloves custom molded for each pistol. Delivers proven recoil reduction and enhanced control. They have the right shape and flexibility to make installation \"a snap\" - no trimming, tearing or hard work, just a perfect fit. Ventilated side panels and finger grooves provide more instinctive gun orientation, enhanced control and look more professional than older models. Ask Joe How To Install the XD(S) Grip Glove.", "text": "Pachmayr 05178 Tactical Grip Glove Springfield Xd(S) Tactical Grip Glove for Springfield XD (S) Model - \"Stretch to Fit \" Grip Gloves custom molded for each pistol. Delivers proven recoil reduction and enhanced control. They have the right shape and flexibility to make installation \"a snap\" - no trimming, tearing or hard work, just a perfect fit. Ventilated side panels and finger grooves provide more instinctive gun orientation, enhanced control and look more professional than older models. Ask Joe How To Install the XD(S) Grip Glove.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OdjlJ%2B2wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQ0OIUG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BQ0QBME", "title": "United Cutlery UC2979 M48 Kommando Tactical Survival Shovel with Sheath", "description": "The ultimate tactical shovel that also doubles as a defensive weapon. Features virtually indestructible, injection-molded nylon handle with 30-Percent fiberglass & nylon reinforcement. The shovel head is made of tempered 2Cr13 stainless tool steel with a hard, black oxide coating. The shovel point edge is sharpened, with a partially serrated edge on one side and a concave chopping edge on the other. Perfect for camping and outdoors use, light chopping, or for use as a defensive weapon in an emergency situation. Includes a reinforced nylon belt pouch.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2979 M48 Kommando Tactical Survival Shovel with Sheath The ultimate tactical shovel that also doubles as a defensive weapon. Features virtually indestructible, injection-molded nylon handle with 30-Percent fiberglass & nylon reinforcement. The shovel head is made of tempered 2Cr13 stainless tool steel with a hard, black oxide coating. The shovel point edge is sharpened, with a partially serrated edge on one side and a concave chopping edge on the other. Perfect for camping and outdoors use, light chopping, or for use as a defensive weapon in an emergency situation. Includes a reinforced nylon belt pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DuJohQohL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQ0QBME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]], "price": 34.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BQ0Z7ME", "title": "Kershaw Knives 1555BLKST Kershaw Cryo Hinderer Assisted Opening Framelock with Black DLC Finish Partially Serrated Blade", "description": "Kershaw Cryo Hinderer Assisted Opening Framelock. 3 3/4\" closed. 2 3/4\" 8Cr13MoV stainless blade with dual thumb studs and flipper. Stainless handles with Hinderer lockbar stabilizer. Oversized lanyard hole. Four-way reversible stainless pocket clip. Rick Hinderer design.Black DLC finish partially serrated blade. Black DLC finish handles.", "text": "Kershaw Knives 1555BLKST Kershaw Cryo Hinderer Assisted Opening Framelock with Black DLC Finish Partially Serrated Blade Kershaw Cryo Hinderer Assisted Opening Framelock. 3 3/4\" closed. 2 3/4\" 8Cr13MoV stainless blade with dual thumb studs and flipper. Stainless handles with Hinderer lockbar stabilizer. Oversized lanyard hole. Four-way reversible stainless pocket clip. Rick Hinderer design.Black DLC finish partially serrated blade. Black DLC finish handles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JDrpJtqqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQ0Z7ME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 32.87}}
{"item_id": "B00BQ6A3Y0", "title": "Frankford Arsenal Vibra Prime Automatic Primer Tube Filler", "description": "Who spends the money on a progressive press to sit there and slowly load primer tubes one primer at a time? Progressive presses are designed to load lots of ammunition quickly. That's why Frankford Arsenal designed the Vibra Prime Automatic Primer Tube Filler. To save time. The Vibra Prime can load 100 primers into a primer tube in a matter of seconds with its unique motorized agitation mechanism. Filled tubes are then easily transferred into any model progressive press tube. A set of simple universal tube adapters and the drop pin ensure efficient transfers. Runs on 2 AA batteries (not included). .", "text": "Frankford Arsenal Vibra Prime Automatic Primer Tube Filler Who spends the money on a progressive press to sit there and slowly load primer tubes one primer at a time? Progressive presses are designed to load lots of ammunition quickly. That's why Frankford Arsenal designed the Vibra Prime Automatic Primer Tube Filler. To save time. The Vibra Prime can load 100 primers into a primer tube in a matter of seconds with its unique motorized agitation mechanism. Filled tubes are then easily transferred into any model progressive press tube. A set of simple universal tube adapters and the drop pin ensure efficient transfers. Runs on 2 AA batteries (not included). .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gyutmO3cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQ6A3Y0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford Arsenal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 49.19}}
{"item_id": "B00BQ9Y1TK", "title": "Nikon P-300 BDC SuperSub Reticle Riflescope, Black, 2-7x32", "description": "The P-300 BLK comes in 2-7x32 magnification with an all-new BDC SuperSub reticle that is calibrated for use with both supersonic and subsonic ammunition and is fully compatible with Spot On Ballistic Match Technology. The BDC SuperSub reticle offers shooters unique, open circle aiming points out to 600 yards, in 100-yard increments, with additional hash-marks at 50-yard distances. It is built with Nikon's Fully Multicoated optical system with up to 98% light transmission, which offers bright, high-resolution viewing, even in low light situations. Making adjustments in the field is now incredibly easy with Nikon's spring-loaded instant zero-reset turrets. Just sight in at 100 yards, then lift the adjustment knob, rotate to your \"zero,\" and re-engage. Hand-turn reticle adjustments are made in ¼-inch click-stop moves that can be felt and heard. The P-300 BLK is waterproof, fog proof and backed by Nikon's full lifetime warranty.", "text": "Nikon P-300 BDC SuperSub Reticle Riflescope, Black, 2-7x32 The P-300 BLK comes in 2-7x32 magnification with an all-new BDC SuperSub reticle that is calibrated for use with both supersonic and subsonic ammunition and is fully compatible with Spot On Ballistic Match Technology. The BDC SuperSub reticle offers shooters unique, open circle aiming points out to 600 yards, in 100-yard increments, with additional hash-marks at 50-yard distances. It is built with Nikon's Fully Multicoated optical system with up to 98% light transmission, which offers bright, high-resolution viewing, even in low light situations. Making adjustments in the field is now incredibly easy with Nikon's spring-loaded instant zero-reset turrets. Just sight in at 100 yards, then lift the adjustment knob, rotate to your \"zero,\" and re-engage. Hand-turn reticle adjustments are made in ¼-inch click-stop moves that can be felt and heard. The P-300 BLK is waterproof, fog proof and backed by Nikon's full lifetime warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MSuy2uVhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQ9Y1TK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BQHET9O", "title": "BioLite Wood Burning Campstove", "description": "The BioLite Wood Burning CampStove combines the benefits of a lightweight backpacking stove and an off-grid power charger so you can cook a meal while charging your gadgets. The Campstove is the perfect solution for both the backcountry campsite and also Emergency Preparedness Kits.No Fuel to Buy or Carry: Our stoves cook your meals with nothing but the twigs you collect on your journey or in your backyard, eliminating the need for heavy, expensive, polluting petroleum gas. Quick to light, fast to boil and easy to use.Charge your Gadgets: By converting heat from the fire into usable electricity, our stoves will recharge your phones, lights and other gadgets while you cook dinner. Unlike solar, BioLite CampStove is a true on-demand source.Stay Green: By using renewable resources for fuel instead of petroleum, you're reducing your carbon footprint. You'll also keep fuel canisters out of the landfill.Be Prepared: The CampStove isn't just for camping; it's great to have when the power goes out in a storm or other natural disaster. You'll be able to cook and keep electronics charged while power lines are down. No need to worry about your local store being sold out of propane, the CampStove is designed to run on any biomass.Support a Better World: We're using the same technology inside the CampStove to bring clean, safe energy to families across the developing world.Have Fun: Like a campfire, you can sit around the CampStove and watch the flames dance as you roast marshmallows and tell stories with friends.How it Works: Using BioLite's patented thermoelectric technology, the BioLite CampStove converts heat to electricity that powers a fan to make the fire ultra-efficient. Extra electricity can be used to charge small electronics like mobile phones and LED lights.", "text": "BioLite Wood Burning Campstove The BioLite Wood Burning CampStove combines the benefits of a lightweight backpacking stove and an off-grid power charger so you can cook a meal while charging your gadgets. The Campstove is the perfect solution for both the backcountry campsite and also Emergency Preparedness Kits.No Fuel to Buy or Carry: Our stoves cook your meals with nothing but the twigs you collect on your journey or in your backyard, eliminating the need for heavy, expensive, polluting petroleum gas. Quick to light, fast to boil and easy to use.Charge your Gadgets: By converting heat from the fire into usable electricity, our stoves will recharge your phones, lights and other gadgets while you cook dinner. Unlike solar, BioLite CampStove is a true on-demand source.Stay Green: By using renewable resources for fuel instead of petroleum, you're reducing your carbon footprint. You'll also keep fuel canisters out of the landfill.Be Prepared: The CampStove isn't just for camping; it's great to have when the power goes out in a storm or other natural disaster. You'll be able to cook and keep electronics charged while power lines are down. No need to worry about your local store being sold out of propane, the CampStove is designed to run on any biomass.Support a Better World: We're using the same technology inside the CampStove to bring clean, safe energy to families across the developing world.Have Fun: Like a campfire, you can sit around the CampStove and watch the flames dance as you roast marshmallows and tell stories with friends.How it Works: Using BioLite's patented thermoelectric technology, the BioLite CampStove converts heat to electricity that powers a fan to make the fire ultra-efficient. Extra electricity can be used to charge small electronics like mobile phones and LED lights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xPb7aJkzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQHET9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BioLite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 179.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BQHKXNK", "title": "Little Crow Gunworks AR-15 Trigger Guard Roll Pin Pusher", "description": "The Little Crow Gunworks AR-15 Trigger Guard Roll Pin Pusher (RPP) is an ingenious device that makes swapping or installing a new trigger guard a quick and easy process. Since the tool slowly pushes the trigger guard roll pin in and out of its channel, there is no more fear of breaking off a lower receiver \"ear\" due to insufficient support while hammering in a roll pin. The durable tool is constructed of anodized aluminum and steel, with a 1/5/8\" thermoplastic ball handle. Made in the USA.", "text": "Little Crow Gunworks AR-15 Trigger Guard Roll Pin Pusher The Little Crow Gunworks AR-15 Trigger Guard Roll Pin Pusher (RPP) is an ingenious device that makes swapping or installing a new trigger guard a quick and easy process. Since the tool slowly pushes the trigger guard roll pin in and out of its channel, there is no more fear of breaking off a lower receiver \"ear\" due to insufficient support while hammering in a roll pin. The durable tool is constructed of anodized aluminum and steel, with a 1/5/8\" thermoplastic ball handle. Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z2APrH5CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQHKXNK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 45.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BQS5B7W", "title": "", "description": "In nearly three decades, Skinny Puppy has established itself as a groundbreaking, innovative voice in the world of electronic music. The band is always fearless in both its musical experimentation and voicing a stance on the issues of our times, and the new album Weapon is no exception.This stunning new album stands as a commentary on that which it is named after, or more specifically, to the concurrent glorification of the gun culture and simultaneous horror at the devastation the gun can cause. Given this view, the pop undertones of the album s opening wornin and the compelling counterpoint of the vocals and lyrics seem to reflect our mass media homogenization of an instrument of death into an entertainment centerpiece. illisiT focuses on the authoritarian control applied to us under the guise of protecting us from the criminal element. Perhaps the classic Skinny Puppy sounds evident in the song solvent are a nod to not only the past, but to a bleak Orwellian future. Are we facing a 1984 dystopia filtered through a Kafkaesque lens? A world where the illusion of power given to the private citizen afforded ownership of a weapon distracts them from the Big Brother drones that watch overhead?", "text": "In nearly three decades, Skinny Puppy has established itself as a groundbreaking, innovative voice in the world of electronic music. The band is always fearless in both its musical experimentation and voicing a stance on the issues of our times, and the new album Weapon is no exception.This stunning new album stands as a commentary on that which it is named after, or more specifically, to the concurrent glorification of the gun culture and simultaneous horror at the devastation the gun can cause. Given this view, the pop undertones of the album s opening wornin and the compelling counterpoint of the vocals and lyrics seem to reflect our mass media homogenization of an instrument of death into an entertainment centerpiece. illisiT focuses on the authoritarian control applied to us under the guise of protecting us from the criminal element. Perhaps the classic Skinny Puppy sounds evident in the song solvent are a nod to not only the past, but to a bleak Orwellian future. Are we facing a 1984 dystopia filtered through a Kafkaesque lens? A world where the illusion of power given to the private citizen afforded ownership of a weapon distracts them from the Big Brother drones that watch overhead?", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510RbJelPQL._SY300__PJautoripBadge,BottomRight,4,-40_OU11__.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQS5B7W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["CDs & Vinyl", "Dance & Electronic", "Electronica"], ["CDs & Vinyl", "Pop"], ["CDs & Vinyl", "Rock"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Softball", "Player Equipment", "Bats", "Slow-Pitch Softball Bats"]], "price": 29.76}}
{"item_id": "B00BQT69PO", "title": "AVEX Brazos Water Bottle, Stainless Steel, 24-Ounce", "description": "Whether you're or hiking a desert trail or scaling a mountain, the 24 oz. Brazos AUTOSEAL Stainless Water Bottle is a great fit for the task at hand. This vacuum-insulated water bottle is engineered to keep drinks cold for 20 hours without sweating for improved grip. This water bottle features a one-touch AUTOSEAL lid that automatically seals between sips to eliminate spills and leaks. This BPA-free water bottle also has a spout shield to protect against dirt and an ergonomic clip-on handle that attaches to backpacks and other gear. Don't let the looks fool you; this water bottle is rugged.", "text": "AVEX Brazos Water Bottle, Stainless Steel, 24-Ounce Whether you're or hiking a desert trail or scaling a mountain, the 24 oz. Brazos AUTOSEAL Stainless Water Bottle is a great fit for the task at hand. This vacuum-insulated water bottle is engineered to keep drinks cold for 20 hours without sweating for improved grip. This water bottle features a one-touch AUTOSEAL lid that automatically seals between sips to eliminate spills and leaks. This BPA-free water bottle also has a spout shield to protect against dirt and an ergonomic clip-on handle that attaches to backpacks and other gear. Don't let the looks fool you; this water bottle is rugged.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318nPALqDDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQT69PO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 28.79}}
