{"item_id": "B00BQWTC14", "title": "Vortex VMX-3T Magnifier with Flip Mount", "description": "Vortex VMX - 3T Magnifier with Flip Mount. Simple. Fast. Effective. The push-button design of the VMX-3T engages and disengages the flip-mount, allowing the magnifier to lock in place. The result? 3X magnified or unmagnified views on demand. Optics are fully multi-coated for optimal light transmission. Lightweight and tough... hard-coat-anodized, machined-aluminum construction ensures durability. Internally nitrogen purged for reliable waterproof / fogproof performance. Ultimate magnified versatility for virtually any AR-height red dot sight. Allows for lower 1/3 or absolute co-witness mounting heights and is ideal for shooters who want to increase the effective range of their red dot sight. Fully multi-coated lenses increase light transmission with multiple anti-reflective coatings on all air-to-glass surfaces; Waterproof O-ring seals prevent moisture, dust, and debris from getting inside the tube for reliable performance in all environments; Fogproof barrels are filled with nitrogen gas to inhibit internal fogging; Matte black finish hard-coat anodized for durability; 1-3X magnification; 3 1/4\" eye relief; F.O.V. is 38.2' @ 100 yards; 30mm tube size; 4.3\"l.; 11.9 ozs. Order yours today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. Vortex VMX-3T Magnifier with Flip Mount", "text": "Vortex VMX-3T Magnifier with Flip Mount Vortex VMX - 3T Magnifier with Flip Mount. Simple. Fast. Effective. The push-button design of the VMX-3T engages and disengages the flip-mount, allowing the magnifier to lock in place. The result? 3X magnified or unmagnified views on demand. Optics are fully multi-coated for optimal light transmission. Lightweight and tough... hard-coat-anodized, machined-aluminum construction ensures durability. Internally nitrogen purged for reliable waterproof / fogproof performance. Ultimate magnified versatility for virtually any AR-height red dot sight. Allows for lower 1/3 or absolute co-witness mounting heights and is ideal for shooters who want to increase the effective range of their red dot sight. Fully multi-coated lenses increase light transmission with multiple anti-reflective coatings on all air-to-glass surfaces; Waterproof O-ring seals prevent moisture, dust, and debris from getting inside the tube for reliable performance in all environments; Fogproof barrels are filled with nitrogen gas to inhibit internal fogging; Matte black finish hard-coat anodized for durability; 1-3X magnification; 3 1/4\" eye relief; F.O.V. is 38.2' @ 100 yards; 30mm tube size; 4.3\"l.; 11.9 ozs. Order yours today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. Vortex VMX-3T Magnifier with Flip Mount", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aWkik2YXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQWTC14.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vortex Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 209.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BQXPP2I", "title": "Allen Company Broadhead Case, Carbon Fibre", "description": "This slick case with a carbon fiber look will safely carry, secure and protect your broad heads. It will hold a multitude of broad head styles including 3-blade, 4-blade and mechanicals.", "text": "Allen Company Broadhead Case, Carbon Fibre This slick case with a carbon fiber look will safely carry, secure and protect your broad heads. It will hold a multitude of broad head styles including 3-blade, 4-blade and mechanicals.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kdqfJfFvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQXPP2I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Broadheads"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BQYLZ9Y", "title": "Callaway Putting Mat Gift Set, 6-Feet", "description": "The Callaway Putting Mat Gift Set includes a 6' Black Hole putting mat and a 2-pack of Callaway Warbird golf balls. The true-turf putting surface simulates a real green and the black scrape backing on the putting mat minimizes creasing and promotes a smoother roll. A great gift for the avid golfer in your life and for fine-tuning your putting stroke at home or office. Boxed retail packaging easy-to-wrap.", "text": "Callaway Putting Mat Gift Set, 6-Feet The Callaway Putting Mat Gift Set includes a 6' Black Hole putting mat and a 2-pack of Callaway Warbird golf balls. The true-turf putting surface simulates a real green and the black scrape backing on the putting mat minimizes creasing and promotes a smoother roll. A great gift for the avid golfer in your life and for fine-tuning your putting stroke at home or office. Boxed retail packaging easy-to-wrap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EtTHv7c4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BQYLZ9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Callaway", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Putting Mats"]], "price": 21.95}}
