{"item_id": "B00BRBKRCC", "title": "Ka-Bar BK16HNDL Becker Micarta Handles for Short Becker Knife, Green", "description": "These attractive green Micarta handles will fit any of the Short Becker Knives. Made in the USA, knives sold separately. Becker handle kit for short Becker knives.", "text": "Ka-Bar BK16HNDL Becker Micarta Handles for Short Becker Knife, Green These attractive green Micarta handles will fit any of the Short Becker Knives. Made in the USA, knives sold separately. Becker handle kit for short Becker knives.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oxHHh9tCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BRBKRCC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 36.25}}
{"item_id": "B00BRC71XY", "title": "GSI Outdoors Destination Kitchen Set (24-Piece)", "description": "GSI Outdoors Destination Kitchen Set 24 is All-in-one 24pc kitchen set includes all utensils needed for any gourmet expedition. Pivoting tools rotate from stored to working position. Waterproof shaker modules screw together to keep spices dry and flavorful. Attractive ballistic nylon outer case keeps everything organized. Also includes 4 sets of cutlery.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Destination Kitchen Set (24-Piece) GSI Outdoors Destination Kitchen Set 24 is All-in-one 24pc kitchen set includes all utensils needed for any gourmet expedition. Pivoting tools rotate from stored to working position. Waterproof shaker modules screw together to keep spices dry and flavorful. Attractive ballistic nylon outer case keeps everything organized. Also includes 4 sets of cutlery.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qn0OYO1xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BRC71XY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 45.61}}
{"item_id": "B00BRS42T4", "title": "Mojo Decoys Super Critter Decoy", "description": "Predator decoy has the same tantalizing motion as the Critter but more advanced decoy. Has a magnetically connected Critter topper and disappearing tri-pod legs has 1/4\" camera thread gives multiple mounting options.", "text": "Mojo Decoys Super Critter Decoy Predator decoy has the same tantalizing motion as the Critter but more advanced decoy. Has a magnetically connected Critter topper and disappearing tri-pod legs has 1/4\" camera thread gives multiple mounting options.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vc8GwBbLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BRS42T4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mojo Decoys", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 49.49}}
{"item_id": "B00BS2NTVQ", "title": "Harbinger 1340 BioFlex Wristwrap Lifting Gloves - Blue/Black", "description": "Dynamic Support: Precurved extended length positions and protects fingersSpidergrip Control: Exclusive tactified leather palm grabs bar for ultimate grip control and powerClose contact: BioFlex - All leather, maximum grip on bar. Patent-pending moving palm is next generation glove technologyFitlock Wristwrap: Fully adjustable wrist support and smooth palm systemPeak Performance: BioFlex - Patent-pending layered palm design eliminates bulk and enhances comfort. Acts like a second skin, moving with grip so you can lift stronger, better, longer", "text": "Harbinger 1340 BioFlex Wristwrap Lifting Gloves - Blue/Black Dynamic Support: Precurved extended length positions and protects fingersSpidergrip Control: Exclusive tactified leather palm grabs bar for ultimate grip control and powerClose contact: BioFlex - All leather, maximum grip on bar. Patent-pending moving palm is next generation glove technologyFitlock Wristwrap: Fully adjustable wrist support and smooth palm systemPeak Performance: BioFlex - Patent-pending layered palm design eliminates bulk and enhances comfort. Acts like a second skin, moving with grip so you can lift stronger, better, longer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PQQzWm%2BEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BS2NTVQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BS2O39I", "title": "HumanX Wrist Stabilizers, One Size, Black", "description": "Extra wide 2inch stabilizing strap provides maximum wrist support while lifting. Full 6mm neoprene wrist cuff cushions wrist during lifts. Non-stretch design maintains strong wrist positioning. Steel tensioning buckle secures fit. One size, fully adjustable for customized fit. Hand wash cold; lay flat to dry.", "text": "HumanX Wrist Stabilizers, One Size, Black Extra wide 2inch stabilizing strap provides maximum wrist support while lifting. Full 6mm neoprene wrist cuff cushions wrist during lifts. Non-stretch design maintains strong wrist positioning. Steel tensioning buckle secures fit. One size, fully adjustable for customized fit. Hand wash cold; lay flat to dry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zM72V9RRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BS2O39I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HumanX", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Wraps"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BS46LGO", "title": "SureFire E2D Defender Ultra Dual Output LED Flashlight", "description": "The E2DL Ultra is a Pocket Protector with more than double the output of it's predecessor now at 500 lumens on high courtesy of it's new, slightly larger LED and TIR lens. It still has hard anodized aluminum teeth, aka Strike Bezel, which can be used for self defense should a blast of blinding white light not be enough to repel an aggressor. This Defender model also puts out five useful lumens of light on low and is armored in a Mil-Spec hard anodized aluminum body that features a steel two way pocket clip.", "text": "SureFire E2D Defender Ultra Dual Output LED Flashlight The E2DL Ultra is a Pocket Protector with more than double the output of it's predecessor now at 500 lumens on high courtesy of it's new, slightly larger LED and TIR lens. It still has hard anodized aluminum teeth, aka Strike Bezel, which can be used for self defense should a blast of blinding white light not be enough to repel an aggressor. This Defender model also puts out five useful lumens of light on low and is armored in a Mil-Spec hard anodized aluminum body that features a steel two way pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A9vps7QvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BS46LGO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SureFire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 159.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BS4RP7S", "title": "GasOne GS-3000 Portable Gas Stove with Color Box, Black", "description": "Original Gasone stove from the manufacturer. Unlike gas stoves from other manufacturers, GS-3000 is CSA approved for safety and uses quality materials to meet higher standards. This stove uses standard 8oz butane canisters (sold separately) and is perfect for any outdoor occasion. With the included black carrying case and color box packaging, it also makes a great gift idea. For optimal results, use with Gasone butane canisters. Dimensions: 13.5 in x 11.2 in x 4.4 in Weight: 3.1 lbs. Safety features: Safety shut-off device, Safety joint, Safety cartridge setting device, Drip pan reversal prevention mechanism.", "text": "GasOne GS-3000 Portable Gas Stove with Color Box, Black Original Gasone stove from the manufacturer. Unlike gas stoves from other manufacturers, GS-3000 is CSA approved for safety and uses quality materials to meet higher standards. This stove uses standard 8oz butane canisters (sold separately) and is perfect for any outdoor occasion. With the included black carrying case and color box packaging, it also makes a great gift idea. For optimal results, use with Gasone butane canisters. Dimensions: 13.5 in x 11.2 in x 4.4 in Weight: 3.1 lbs. Safety features: Safety shut-off device, Safety joint, Safety cartridge setting device, Drip pan reversal prevention mechanism.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51e4QVSruOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BS4RP7S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GasOne", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BSENUZ4", "title": "Universal Fit Tri-Rail Barrel Mount For 12 Gauge Mossberg 500 590 Remington 870 Shotguns with QD Sling Swivel", "description": "For 12 Gauge Mossberg 500 590 Remington 870 Shotguns -- Fits Most 12 20 Gauge ShotGuns and Barrels and PaintBall - - This is the perfect for ShotGun light laser barrel mount - you can use all 3 Rails at the same time - BOTH SIDE HAVE HOLE FOR A QD SLING RING. (COME WTH ONE QD RING) 3 Tactical Picatinny/Weaver Rails - Made of Light weight Aircraft Aluminum - Easy to Install - Comes ready to mount, Hex wrench tool & QD RING included..", "text": "Universal Fit Tri-Rail Barrel Mount For 12 Gauge Mossberg 500 590 Remington 870 Shotguns with QD Sling Swivel For 12 Gauge Mossberg 500 590 Remington 870 Shotguns -- Fits Most 12 20 Gauge ShotGuns and Barrels and PaintBall - - This is the perfect for ShotGun light laser barrel mount - you can use all 3 Rails at the same time - BOTH SIDE HAVE HOLE FOR A QD SLING RING. (COME WTH ONE QD RING) 3 Tactical Picatinny/Weaver Rails - Made of Light weight Aircraft Aluminum - Easy to Install - Comes ready to mount, Hex wrench tool & QD RING included..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NmmkaiX2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BSENUZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Scents & Scent Eliminators", "Scent Accessories"]], "price": 18.46}}
