{"item_id": "B00BT49UVG", "title": "KA-BAR BK-22 Campanion Fixed Blade Knife with HD Polyester Front Pocket Sheath", "description": "KA-BAR/Becker 22 \"Companion\" Fixed Blade Camp/Hunting Knife with HD Sheath. The \"Companion\" is a full tang heavy duty field utility knife suited for a number of camping, hunting and in the field chores. The knife features an overall length of 10 1/2\" with a straight edge 5.25\" blade constructed of 1095 Cro-Van steel, flat ground providing a sharp edge and better edge retention. The thick blade has a HRC hardness rating of 56-58 allows for prying, splitting kindling, or slicing. The unique drop point blade is also handy when field dressing or skinning wild game. The handle which is constructed of Grivory (a Swiss made glass reinforced nylon) is designed for comfort as well as control during use and has a wrist lanyard hole. The Companion 2nd generation features the extended pommel which can be used to pound with such items such as tent pegs, shatter glass, or to be used in a self-defense mode. This knife is made exclusively in Olean, New York U.S.A. and proudly etched with the BKT/KA-BAR brand name. The knife comes with the new BK-22S sheath constructed of heavy-duty Polyester with front cargo pocket with Velcro closure and riveted leg lashing holes. Overall length: 10.5\" Weight: 14.6 oz. Blade Length: 5.25\" Blade Shape: Drop Point Blade Etched: BKT/KA-BAR Grind: Flat Steel: 1095 Carbon Handle: Grivory Blade Thickness:.250\"/Black Epoxy Powder Coat Made In Olean, New York USA Knife comes with a Heavy-Duty Polyester sheath with front pocket.", "text": "KA-BAR BK-22 Campanion Fixed Blade Knife with HD Polyester Front Pocket Sheath KA-BAR/Becker 22 \"Companion\" Fixed Blade Camp/Hunting Knife with HD Sheath. The \"Companion\" is a full tang heavy duty field utility knife suited for a number of camping, hunting and in the field chores. The knife features an overall length of 10 1/2\" with a straight edge 5.25\" blade constructed of 1095 Cro-Van steel, flat ground providing a sharp edge and better edge retention. The thick blade has a HRC hardness rating of 56-58 allows for prying, splitting kindling, or slicing. The unique drop point blade is also handy when field dressing or skinning wild game. The handle which is constructed of Grivory (a Swiss made glass reinforced nylon) is designed for comfort as well as control during use and has a wrist lanyard hole. The Companion 2nd generation features the extended pommel which can be used to pound with such items such as tent pegs, shatter glass, or to be used in a self-defense mode. This knife is made exclusively in Olean, New York U.S.A. and proudly etched with the BKT/KA-BAR brand name. The knife comes with the new BK-22S sheath constructed of heavy-duty Polyester with front cargo pocket with Velcro closure and riveted leg lashing holes. Overall length: 10.5\" Weight: 14.6 oz. Blade Length: 5.25\" Blade Shape: Drop Point Blade Etched: BKT/KA-BAR Grind: Flat Steel: 1095 Carbon Handle: Grivory Blade Thickness:.250\"/Black Epoxy Powder Coat Made In Olean, New York USA Knife comes with a Heavy-Duty Polyester sheath with front pocket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31cAGuIRnhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BT49UVG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 72.74}}
