{"item_id": "B00BU95T92", "title": "H8O® Polycarbonate 3 Gallon Stubby Water Bottle with 48mm Cap", "description": "This commercial safe and durable 3 gallon bottle is perfect for water storage. More durable than most other plastic containers currently out in the market. Includes a 48mm screw cap and handle for easy carrying. Can be used everywhere and is compatible with standard water coolers. Made with FDA approved polycarbonate plastic.", "text": "H8O® Polycarbonate 3 Gallon Stubby Water Bottle with 48mm Cap This commercial safe and durable 3 gallon bottle is perfect for water storage. More durable than most other plastic containers currently out in the market. Includes a 48mm screw cap and handle for easy carrying. Can be used everywhere and is compatible with standard water coolers. Made with FDA approved polycarbonate plastic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t4BtNQ5vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BU95T92.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottle Accessories"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BUMDTUA", "title": "U.S. Divers Junior Lanai LX Mask and Paradise Dry Snorkel", "description": "Mask Features: Junior face skirt designed to fit smaller, narrower faces, ages 6+; Hypoallergenic silicone face skirt for ultimate comfort; 3-way adjust Pro-Glide buckles for easy adjustments. Snorkel Features: Submersible, dry top snorkel with Pivot Dry Technology - Designed to keep water out of the breathing tube above and below the surface of the water; Ergonomically shaped mouthpiece for great comfort; One way purge valve for easy clearing. Snorkel placement - Place snorkel on left side of face attaching snorkel keeper clip to mask strap.", "text": "U.S. Divers Junior Lanai LX Mask and Paradise Dry Snorkel Mask Features: Junior face skirt designed to fit smaller, narrower faces, ages 6+; Hypoallergenic silicone face skirt for ultimate comfort; 3-way adjust Pro-Glide buckles for easy adjustments. Snorkel Features: Submersible, dry top snorkel with Pivot Dry Technology - Designed to keep water out of the breathing tube above and below the surface of the water; Ergonomically shaped mouthpiece for great comfort; One way purge valve for easy clearing. Snorkel placement - Place snorkel on left side of face attaching snorkel keeper clip to mask strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GX3RYaNWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BUMDTUA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "U.S. Divers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]], "price": 32.02}}
