{"item_id": "B00BUS12OE", "title": "Condor Tactical Hydro Harness 2.5 L Coyote Tan", "description": "Condor Hydro Harness is designed to be used stand alone as a Hydration System with 2.5 L bladder included or can be integrated with Condor MCR4, MCR5, MCR6 AND MCR7 tactical chest rigs to become 1 complete rig with tactical chest rig and hydration system. This Hydro Harness has contoured, padded shoulder straps with webbing and D-rings. Padded with mesh for comfort and airflow. Item has a drag handle and accepts Condor 2.5 L bladder (Not included)", "text": "Condor Tactical Hydro Harness 2.5 L Coyote Tan Condor Hydro Harness is designed to be used stand alone as a Hydration System with 2.5 L bladder included or can be integrated with Condor MCR4, MCR5, MCR6 AND MCR7 tactical chest rigs to become 1 complete rig with tactical chest rig and hydration system. This Hydro Harness has contoured, padded shoulder straps with webbing and D-rings. Padded with mesh for comfort and airflow. Item has a drag handle and accepts Condor 2.5 L bladder (Not included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419TAEWLWjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BUS12OE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BUT3E0I", "title": "KastKing SuperPower Saltwater Blue Braided Fishing Line 500M(547 Yds) /1000M(1100Yds) Dyneema Fiber", "description": "Cast a mile...The SuperPower Braided Fishing Line is coated with a proprietary treatment that reduces friction by rounding and smoothing the surface of the line. This treatment results in longer casts with fewer backlashes. It also enhances UV and abrasion resistance, and also slows water absorption.Serious \"fishability\"...This line has little spool memory and resists the coils and twists that commonly occur with spinning reels. Don't lose any more fish because of poor hook sets.SuperPower line has almost zero stretch, so your hooks sets are strong, clean and positive.Visibility is a concern for many anglers using braided line, so we provide a large variety of colors to match the conditions at your favorite fishing hole.The pursuit of catching fish no longer means you need to empty your wallet. We are dedicated to manufacturing high quality fishing equipment using state-of-the-art techniques. Our top priority is providing high quality fishing equipment at affordable prices.", "text": "KastKing SuperPower Saltwater Blue Braided Fishing Line 500M(547 Yds) /1000M(1100Yds) Dyneema Fiber Cast a mile...The SuperPower Braided Fishing Line is coated with a proprietary treatment that reduces friction by rounding and smoothing the surface of the line. This treatment results in longer casts with fewer backlashes. It also enhances UV and abrasion resistance, and also slows water absorption.Serious \"fishability\"...This line has little spool memory and resists the coils and twists that commonly occur with spinning reels. Don't lose any more fish because of poor hook sets.SuperPower line has almost zero stretch, so your hooks sets are strong, clean and positive.Visibility is a concern for many anglers using braided line, so we provide a large variety of colors to match the conditions at your favorite fishing hole.The pursuit of catching fish no longer means you need to empty your wallet. We are dedicated to manufacturing high quality fishing equipment using state-of-the-art techniques. Our top priority is providing high quality fishing equipment at affordable prices.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Zr4rqgEHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BUT3E0I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Line", "Braided Line"]], "price": 33.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BUVLZES", "title": "UTG 3-Slot Universal QD Lever Lock Adaptor and Riser, Black", "description": "UTG Universal QD Lever Lock Adaptor & Riser Mount,15mm Saddle Ht., 40mm Long 3-Slot Picatinny Rail, Most Versatile for Use as QD Riser & for Immediate Converting Any Non-QD Mount Accessories w//QD Deployment, Made from Aircraft Aluminum w/Matte Anodizing.", "text": "UTG 3-Slot Universal QD Lever Lock Adaptor and Riser, Black UTG Universal QD Lever Lock Adaptor & Riser Mount,15mm Saddle Ht., 40mm Long 3-Slot Picatinny Rail, Most Versatile for Use as QD Riser & for Immediate Converting Any Non-QD Mount Accessories w//QD Deployment, Made from Aircraft Aluminum w/Matte Anodizing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bTZKGoSzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BUVLZES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 15.96}}
