{"item_id": "B00BWWJPAQ", "title": "Crosman Vigilante 357 Co2 Air Pistol Kit with Free holster and 3- pack of magazines!", "description": "Includes Holster & 3 Extra Magazines Free- $15.00 Value New Updated Design With Tactical Weaver Rails! This full-sized pistol is constructed with both cast metal and plastic. Gun barrel is 6\" rifled steel and grip is synthetic. The front of the pistol is plastic, while the main part is metal. Crosman 357 Vigilante delivers a realistic shooting experience and shoots up to 435 feet per second (FPS). It is powered by a CO2 cartridge that can be found in the gun's handle. Caliber: .177 Velocity: 435 FPS Airgun Mechanism: CO2 Ammo Type: Pellets or BBs Warranty: 1 Year Limited IMPORTANT: The sale of airguns is prohibited in New Jersey, New York City and its Burroughs. Please check with your local law enforcement agencies with any questions on local and state laws.", "text": "Crosman Vigilante 357 Co2 Air Pistol Kit with Free holster and 3- pack of magazines! Includes Holster & 3 Extra Magazines Free- $15.00 Value New Updated Design With Tactical Weaver Rails! This full-sized pistol is constructed with both cast metal and plastic. Gun barrel is 6\" rifled steel and grip is synthetic. The front of the pistol is plastic, while the main part is metal. Crosman 357 Vigilante delivers a realistic shooting experience and shoots up to 435 feet per second (FPS). It is powered by a CO2 cartridge that can be found in the gun's handle. Caliber: .177 Velocity: 435 FPS Airgun Mechanism: CO2 Ammo Type: Pellets or BBs Warranty: 1 Year Limited IMPORTANT: The sale of airguns is prohibited in New Jersey, New York City and its Burroughs. Please check with your local law enforcement agencies with any questions on local and state laws.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gC4Dc%2Be4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BWWJPAQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 71.99}}
{"item_id": "B00BX32TTS", "title": "Strike Industries Frame Shock Buffer for SPRINGFIELDTM XD/XDM .40 (Not for all Model))", "description": "The SI Frame Shock Buffer for the Springfield XD(M) is a polyester based thermoplastic polyurethane barrier that is uniquely designed to absorb recoil. The XD(M) FSB was designed to increase durability between the areas of the metal slide and polymer frame while also decrease the amount of overall wear. The relief gained will also decrease the shock to your hands which prevents muscle fatigue and allows for more control for the next shot. You'll get a smoother and cleaner shot with a simple yet effective upgrade in the Strike Industries Frame Shock Buffers for the XD(M).Fit Caliber Size 9x19mm / .40Package includeFSB-XD(M) X1Note:Due to so many different types and models, we could not be able to test-fit on every pistol model. We have included a dimention illustration for customers to determine if the buffer fits or not.For more product info, please visit at www.strikeindustries.com", "text": "Strike Industries Frame Shock Buffer for SPRINGFIELDTM XD/XDM .40 (Not for all Model)) The SI Frame Shock Buffer for the Springfield XD(M) is a polyester based thermoplastic polyurethane barrier that is uniquely designed to absorb recoil. The XD(M) FSB was designed to increase durability between the areas of the metal slide and polymer frame while also decrease the amount of overall wear. The relief gained will also decrease the shock to your hands which prevents muscle fatigue and allows for more control for the next shot. You'll get a smoother and cleaner shot with a simple yet effective upgrade in the Strike Industries Frame Shock Buffers for the XD(M).Fit Caliber Size 9x19mm / .40Package includeFSB-XD(M) X1Note:Due to so many different types and models, we could not be able to test-fit on every pistol model. We have included a dimention illustration for customers to determine if the buffer fits or not.For more product info, please visit at www.strikeindustries.com", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31W48pOuwJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BX32TTS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 7.0}}
{"item_id": "B00BXPLD0W", "title": "Monstrum Tactical Rifle Scope with Illuminated Mil-Dot Reticle and Integrated Red Laser Sight", "description": "The Monstrum S3940-M Tactical Rifle Scope is a compact scope designed for close to mid range shooting, with high optical clarity at between 3 to 9 times magnification and a 40mm objective diameter. It features a clean yet functionally designed illuminated glass mil-dot reticle, allowing for on-the-fly range estimation and long distance targeting, which can be viewed in red or green illumination and in multiple brightness intensities, or without illumination, for a suitable sight picture regardless of lighting or environment. The scope is also equipped with an integrated, independently operated, red laser sight for fast and flexible acquisition of close quarter targets. The scope has an integrated mount that secures quickly to any Weaver or Picatinny 1913 rail equipped flat top rifle. Crafted from aircraft grade aluminum, the scope is both lightweight and sturdy, with a sealed, weatherproof design. It is 8.5 Inch in length, 3 Inch in width, 2.5 Inch in height and 1.2 pounds in weight. It has a Field of View at 100 yards of 37.5(at 3x)-12.4(at 9x) feet, an eye relief of 3 Inch, an exit pupil of 13.3mm(at 3x)-4.4mm(at 9x) and a click value of 1/4 MOA. It comes with lens covers, one 3V CR2032 battery and two 1.5V LR44 batteries.", "text": "Monstrum Tactical Rifle Scope with Illuminated Mil-Dot Reticle and Integrated Red Laser Sight The Monstrum S3940-M Tactical Rifle Scope is a compact scope designed for close to mid range shooting, with high optical clarity at between 3 to 9 times magnification and a 40mm objective diameter. It features a clean yet functionally designed illuminated glass mil-dot reticle, allowing for on-the-fly range estimation and long distance targeting, which can be viewed in red or green illumination and in multiple brightness intensities, or without illumination, for a suitable sight picture regardless of lighting or environment. The scope is also equipped with an integrated, independently operated, red laser sight for fast and flexible acquisition of close quarter targets. The scope has an integrated mount that secures quickly to any Weaver or Picatinny 1913 rail equipped flat top rifle. Crafted from aircraft grade aluminum, the scope is both lightweight and sturdy, with a sealed, weatherproof design. It is 8.5 Inch in length, 3 Inch in width, 2.5 Inch in height and 1.2 pounds in weight. It has a Field of View at 100 yards of 37.5(at 3x)-12.4(at 9x) feet, an eye relief of 3 Inch, an exit pupil of 13.3mm(at 3x)-4.4mm(at 9x) and a click value of 1/4 MOA. It comes with lens covers, one 3V CR2032 battery and two 1.5V LR44 batteries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318dpZl3s7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BXPLD0W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 76.95}}
{"item_id": "B00BXU24NM", "title": "EasyAcc® Cycling Headlight Head light Bicycle Lights Bike Headlamps Flashlight with USB Cable 3 Mode 1200 lumens [CREE XML-T6 LED;1.5 M long]", "description": "Multi-Function-Cycling Light+Head Light-Flashlight in Camping Outdoor conditionPowered by External Battery simultaneously,Can not used aloneSpecification:-Colour : Black-Using CREE XML-T6 LED Light-Brightness: 1200 lumens maximum brightness (manufacturer rated)-Voltage Output: 8.4 V max-Mode:3 High > Weak > Fast Strobe-Switch Type: Clicky (Clickie)-Switch Location: Tailcap (Tail-cap)-Shell: aviation aluminum alloy,CNC machining,anodizing surface treatment-With USB Cable,USB Cable Length: 1.5 MeterRuntime:this cycling light should be powered by external battery simultaneously,Can not used alone,the Runtime depend on the external battery capacity.we highly recommendExcellent EasyAcc External Battery(also could charge Mobile Devices):Runtime of High brightness Mode:EasyAcc 12000mAh- Approx 4.5 hoursEasyAcc 10000mAh-Approx 3.5 hoursEasyAcc 15000mAh-Approx 5.5 hoursplease note: we highly recommend you use 5V 2A output portcaution, High temperature will be caused by long-time useRecommend Continuous Run Time:High Mode: < or = 5 HoursWeak&Fast; Strobe Mode: < or = 10 HoursPackage Included:- 1 * EasyAcc Cycling Light- 2 * O type Rubber Ring- 1 * Adjustable headbandAttention: External Battery not included", "text": "EasyAcc® Cycling Headlight Head light Bicycle Lights Bike Headlamps Flashlight with USB Cable 3 Mode 1200 lumens [CREE XML-T6 LED;1.5 M long] Multi-Function-Cycling Light+Head Light-Flashlight in Camping Outdoor conditionPowered by External Battery simultaneously,Can not used aloneSpecification:-Colour : Black-Using CREE XML-T6 LED Light-Brightness: 1200 lumens maximum brightness (manufacturer rated)-Voltage Output: 8.4 V max-Mode:3 High > Weak > Fast Strobe-Switch Type: Clicky (Clickie)-Switch Location: Tailcap (Tail-cap)-Shell: aviation aluminum alloy,CNC machining,anodizing surface treatment-With USB Cable,USB Cable Length: 1.5 MeterRuntime:this cycling light should be powered by external battery simultaneously,Can not used alone,the Runtime depend on the external battery capacity.we highly recommendExcellent EasyAcc External Battery(also could charge Mobile Devices):Runtime of High brightness Mode:EasyAcc 12000mAh- Approx 4.5 hoursEasyAcc 10000mAh-Approx 3.5 hoursEasyAcc 15000mAh-Approx 5.5 hoursplease note: we highly recommend you use 5V 2A output portcaution, High temperature will be caused by long-time useRecommend Continuous Run Time:High Mode: < or = 5 HoursWeak&Fast; Strobe Mode: < or = 10 HoursPackage Included:- 1 * EasyAcc Cycling Light- 2 * O type Rubber Ring- 1 * Adjustable headbandAttention: External Battery not included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kC3FLebYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BXU24NM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00BY2CS26", "title": "E LV iPod Touch 5 Two Tone Hard and Soft Hybrid Armor Sports Combo Case for Apple iPod Touch 5 5th Generation with 1 Screen Protector, 1 Black Stylus, 1 Water Resistant Bag and 1 E LV Microfiber Digital Cleaner", "description": "Especially Designed for Apple iPod Touch 5 5th GenerationThis case is specially designed for your iPod. Stylish, slim, light weight, and provides full protection. Precise cutouts allow you to maximize the functionality of your device.How to apply screen protector to your device:1. Use E LV Digital Cleaner/any cleaning cloth to wipe out any dust, dirt, fingerprints or smudges before applying the screen protector.2. Remove the \"back\" layer first. Then carefully align the top corners and gently smooth the protector down onto the screen.3. After successfully applying the screen protector to your phone, you can remove the \"front\" layer.E LV Microfiber Sticker Digital Cleaner:The front side is made of premium microfiber. The back side was developed using a special non-adhesive, highly sticky silicone gel that easily sticks to your electronics without leaving any marks. Removes germs, oils, makeup and fingerprints from screens safely. Washable, removable and durable.E LV® is a registered trademark protected by the US Trademark Law.", "text": "E LV iPod Touch 5 Two Tone Hard and Soft Hybrid Armor Sports Combo Case for Apple iPod Touch 5 5th Generation with 1 Screen Protector, 1 Black Stylus, 1 Water Resistant Bag and 1 E LV Microfiber Digital Cleaner Especially Designed for Apple iPod Touch 5 5th GenerationThis case is specially designed for your iPod. Stylish, slim, light weight, and provides full protection. Precise cutouts allow you to maximize the functionality of your device.How to apply screen protector to your device:1. Use E LV Digital Cleaner/any cleaning cloth to wipe out any dust, dirt, fingerprints or smudges before applying the screen protector.2. Remove the \"back\" layer first. Then carefully align the top corners and gently smooth the protector down onto the screen.3. After successfully applying the screen protector to your phone, you can remove the \"front\" layer.E LV Microfiber Sticker Digital Cleaner:The front side is made of premium microfiber. The back side was developed using a special non-adhesive, highly sticky silicone gel that easily sticks to your electronics without leaving any marks. Removes germs, oils, makeup and fingerprints from screens safely. Washable, removable and durable.E LV® is a registered trademark protected by the US Trademark Law.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2B5GsVt%2BSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BY2CS26.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 8.99}}
