{"item_id": "B00BYNAVFQ", "title": "Runtastic Bike Case for Android Smartphones (White)", "description": "Don't fumble around for your smartphone while riding your bike. The Runtastic Bike Case attaches to your handlebars or stem in minutes without tools. Mount it in portrait or landscape position to best view your phone. Use the popular Runtastic Road Bike or Mountain Bike apps and the Runtastic Speed and Cadence Sensor and the Runtastic Bluetooth Combo Heart Rate Monitor to turn your smartphone into a complete cycling computer for training. A shockproof hard shelled case on the outside and foam cushioning on the inside protect your smartphone against bumps. The plastic screen cover keeps splashed mud and water off your phone's display while offering excellent touchscreen operation. Foam inserts create help to brace any smartphone that is fits into the 5.4 x 2.8 x 0.5 inch case.", "text": "Runtastic Bike Case for Android Smartphones (White) Don't fumble around for your smartphone while riding your bike. The Runtastic Bike Case attaches to your handlebars or stem in minutes without tools. Mount it in portrait or landscape position to best view your phone. Use the popular Runtastic Road Bike or Mountain Bike apps and the Runtastic Speed and Cadence Sensor and the Runtastic Bluetooth Combo Heart Rate Monitor to turn your smartphone into a complete cycling computer for training. A shockproof hard shelled case on the outside and foam cushioning on the inside protect your smartphone against bumps. The plastic screen cover keeps splashed mud and water off your phone's display while offering excellent touchscreen operation. Foam inserts create help to brace any smartphone that is fits into the 5.4 x 2.8 x 0.5 inch case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318-twT20GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BYNAVFQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets"]]}}
