{"item_id": "B00BZ5M0BG", "title": "22/45 Plus1 PRO Bumper", "description": "All TANDEMKROSS branded products come with a lifetime guarantee! Don't load less ammo, load more with the TANDEMKROSS Plus1 bumper! This finely made bumper is designed to enable your factory mags to load one extra round saving you time at the range and giving you that extra edge while trying to one up your buddies. All the while your mags will seat better and give you that extra material to \"bump\" them into a locked state. Simple installation, only takes minutes to do. Warning: Cannot ship to California or New York *Note: Tweaking or break in period may be required in older or non factory magazines.", "text": "22/45 Plus1 PRO Bumper All TANDEMKROSS branded products come with a lifetime guarantee! Don't load less ammo, load more with the TANDEMKROSS Plus1 bumper! This finely made bumper is designed to enable your factory mags to load one extra round saving you time at the range and giving you that extra edge while trying to one up your buddies. All the while your mags will seat better and give you that extra material to \"bump\" them into a locked state. Simple installation, only takes minutes to do. Warning: Cannot ship to California or New York *Note: Tweaking or break in period may be required in older or non factory magazines.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HvEhALT%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00BZ5M0BG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B00C0V5TYO", "title": "United Cutlery UC2971 M48 Hawk Harpoon with Sheath", "description": "This M48 Hawk Harpoon knife features a razor-sharp blade that will slice through anything like butter and a tip that will penetrate practically any target effortlessly. The wicked curve of this powerful blade allows it to be used for a variety of purposes. Lashing holes allow you to attach this harpoon knife to a wooden rod or stick, making an excellent harpoon or spear that can be used for hunting, fishing and much more. Crafted of one solid piece of rock-hard AUS-6 stainless steel with a black oxide coating, this harpoon knife won't bend or break and will stand up to tough, repeated use. The rubberized sheath will house this harpoon knife securely and protect you from its razor-sharp blade when not in use.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2971 M48 Hawk Harpoon with Sheath This M48 Hawk Harpoon knife features a razor-sharp blade that will slice through anything like butter and a tip that will penetrate practically any target effortlessly. The wicked curve of this powerful blade allows it to be used for a variety of purposes. Lashing holes allow you to attach this harpoon knife to a wooden rod or stick, making an excellent harpoon or spear that can be used for hunting, fishing and much more. Crafted of one solid piece of rock-hard AUS-6 stainless steel with a black oxide coating, this harpoon knife won't bend or break and will stand up to tough, repeated use. The rubberized sheath will house this harpoon knife securely and protect you from its razor-sharp blade when not in use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416BwmHbFKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C0V5TYO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 23.99}}
{"item_id": "B00C11GPMS", "title": "Helotex G2 Tactical Flashlight", "description": "The Helotex G2 flashlight from Gun Shack features dual power capability to run either on a single AA or CR123 battery. The unit features a CREE XR-E Q4 LED for an incredible output of 130 Lumen. The flashlight features a tactile click on/off button on the rear of the flashlight. Once turned on, the user can toggle between high, low, and strobe functions with a quick tap of the on/off button. After turning the light off for 1 second, it will revert back to high the next time it is turned on, regardless what the previous mode was. The flashlight is constructed of anodized 6063-T6 Aircraft Aluminum and features o-ring seals on all parts for optimum weather resistance. The new design maintains the same ultra bright light output on high but now offers the flexibility of a true low output setting suitable for close up work. Output: 120 Lumen (AA) or 130 Lumen (CR123) LED: CREE XR-E Q4-BIN LED Life: 50,000 hours Battery Life: 1 hr (AA) or 2 hr (CR123) Modes: 3 (High, Low, Strobe) Length: 4.2\" (AA) or 3.6\" (CR123)", "text": "Helotex G2 Tactical Flashlight The Helotex G2 flashlight from Gun Shack features dual power capability to run either on a single AA or CR123 battery. The unit features a CREE XR-E Q4 LED for an incredible output of 130 Lumen. The flashlight features a tactile click on/off button on the rear of the flashlight. Once turned on, the user can toggle between high, low, and strobe functions with a quick tap of the on/off button. After turning the light off for 1 second, it will revert back to high the next time it is turned on, regardless what the previous mode was. The flashlight is constructed of anodized 6063-T6 Aircraft Aluminum and features o-ring seals on all parts for optimum weather resistance. The new design maintains the same ultra bright light output on high but now offers the flexibility of a true low output setting suitable for close up work. Output: 120 Lumen (AA) or 130 Lumen (CR123) LED: CREE XR-E Q4-BIN LED Life: 50,000 hours Battery Life: 1 hr (AA) or 2 hr (CR123) Modes: 3 (High, Low, Strobe) Length: 4.2\" (AA) or 3.6\" (CR123)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qqnpL4m2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C11GPMS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B00C185G4O", "title": "Lancer Tactical Rubber Combat Bayonet Knife with Scabbard/Sheath", "description": "The perfect final touch to complete any arsenal whether you're going in for a deadly and silent knife kill or if you want to give your rifle a cutting edge, this Lancer Tactical rubber dummy knife and bayonet is for you. A 1:1 scaled detailed replica of the USMC type combat knives, from the tactile grit texture of the handle to the stiletto blade design, to even a matte black finish as seen in today's armies. At the bottom of the knife's grib are locking lugs to clamp onto gas blocks of classic M4A1 carbine rifles allowing you to attach the knife through your gun's barrel for a bayonet weapon when the going gets though. Included is its plastic sheath that includes straps to attach to your belt, MOLLE vest, or any rig it could fit. Made out of tough rubber and plastic construction, it's a safer, lighter, and economic alternative for players.", "text": "Lancer Tactical Rubber Combat Bayonet Knife with Scabbard/Sheath The perfect final touch to complete any arsenal whether you're going in for a deadly and silent knife kill or if you want to give your rifle a cutting edge, this Lancer Tactical rubber dummy knife and bayonet is for you. A 1:1 scaled detailed replica of the USMC type combat knives, from the tactile grit texture of the handle to the stiletto blade design, to even a matte black finish as seen in today's armies. At the bottom of the knife's grib are locking lugs to clamp onto gas blocks of classic M4A1 carbine rifles allowing you to attach the knife through your gun's barrel for a bayonet weapon when the going gets though. Included is its plastic sheath that includes straps to attach to your belt, MOLLE vest, or any rig it could fit. Made out of tough rubber and plastic construction, it's a safer, lighter, and economic alternative for players.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311lrDN9i-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C185G4O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lancer Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tools"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B00C185HS4", "title": "BBTac ZM02 Airsoft Spring Pistol Metal Body and Slide Sub-Compact Pocket Pistol 220 FPS Spring Concealable Airsoft Gun by BBTac®", "description": "Introducing the Spring BBTac ZM02 Pistol Airsoft Gun! This Airsoft gun is the perfect gun for anyone just getting their start in the world of Airsoft. With a impressive full metal body and slide construction and stylish design, this is great for those secret missions! With fire power of 260 FPS and a 12 round magazine this spring pistol is the perfect secondary or weapon on the battle field. With it's small size it is perfect for fooling around with your friends or taking it out to the field of battle and using it as a secondary weapon. So what are you waiting for? Pick up this BB Tac Pistol Airsoft Gun today and have a have a blast with your friends!", "text": "BBTac ZM02 Airsoft Spring Pistol Metal Body and Slide Sub-Compact Pocket Pistol 220 FPS Spring Concealable Airsoft Gun by BBTac® Introducing the Spring BBTac ZM02 Pistol Airsoft Gun! This Airsoft gun is the perfect gun for anyone just getting their start in the world of Airsoft. With a impressive full metal body and slide construction and stylish design, this is great for those secret missions! With fire power of 260 FPS and a 12 round magazine this spring pistol is the perfect secondary or weapon on the battle field. With it's small size it is perfect for fooling around with your friends or taking it out to the field of battle and using it as a secondary weapon. So what are you waiting for? Pick up this BB Tac Pistol Airsoft Gun today and have a have a blast with your friends!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q6SjGgmCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C185HS4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B00C1QHVDA", "title": "AR-15 Cleaning Link gunsmith armorers tool for rear takedown pin", "description": "This high quality armorers tool is made from durable, non marring, stress relieved HDPE to protect the finish of your upper receiver. Simply insert this link between your upper and lower receiver and secure it with your rear takedown pin and the provided hitch pin. Cleaning your barrel and receiver will be much easier without having to wrestle with your upper receiver while it rolls around on your work bench. High density polyethylene will resist all solvents and lubricants that a receiver might be subjected to, it will not soften or swell and can be easily cleaned for a long life.", "text": "AR-15 Cleaning Link gunsmith armorers tool for rear takedown pin This high quality armorers tool is made from durable, non marring, stress relieved HDPE to protect the finish of your upper receiver. Simply insert this link between your upper and lower receiver and secure it with your rear takedown pin and the provided hitch pin. Cleaning your barrel and receiver will be much easier without having to wrestle with your upper receiver while it rolls around on your work bench. High density polyethylene will resist all solvents and lubricants that a receiver might be subjected to, it will not soften or swell and can be easily cleaned for a long life.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GvpBd%2BaBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C1QHVDA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B00C1SDT98", "title": "AR-15 Trigger Test Fixture Block attaches to front pivot pin", "description": "This high quality armorer tool is made from durable, non marring, stress relieved HDPE to protect the finish of your receiver and hammer. It is designed to last, and is machined to high tolerances with state of the art CNC machinery. Every part is carefully inspected before it goes out to a customer, and each piece is skillfully packaged to assure that it reaches you in perfect condition. This purchase includes a trigger test block that is secured to your receiver with the front takedown / pivot pin. Now you can easily and safely test your trigger without risking damage to your receiver by dry firing. You can use the trigger test block and the lower receiver block (find it in our other items for sale) at the same time when you are inserting the lower block through the bottom of the magwell.", "text": "AR-15 Trigger Test Fixture Block attaches to front pivot pin This high quality armorer tool is made from durable, non marring, stress relieved HDPE to protect the finish of your receiver and hammer. It is designed to last, and is machined to high tolerances with state of the art CNC machinery. Every part is carefully inspected before it goes out to a customer, and each piece is skillfully packaged to assure that it reaches you in perfect condition. This purchase includes a trigger test block that is secured to your receiver with the front takedown / pivot pin. Now you can easily and safely test your trigger without risking damage to your receiver by dry firing. You can use the trigger test block and the lower receiver block (find it in our other items for sale) at the same time when you are inserting the lower block through the bottom of the magwell.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Lng3zrVJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C1SDT98.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B00C1TY1FS", "title": "Premier Kayak Bungee Paddle Leash / Accessory leash", "description": "Premier Kayak bungee paddle leash with new cinch lock strap is a great addition to your kayak gear. Generous 4 feet of 5 mm shock cord is great for all paddling styles. USA made fasteners and bungee are made for outdoor use and won't fade, corrode or lock up. Awesome security solution for fishing rods, electronics, sports cameras, hi def outdoor cameras, etc. Easily attaches and removes for ease of use. For recreational use only. Not a safety device. Made in USA.", "text": "Premier Kayak Bungee Paddle Leash / Accessory leash Premier Kayak bungee paddle leash with new cinch lock strap is a great addition to your kayak gear. Generous 4 feet of 5 mm shock cord is great for all paddling styles. USA made fasteners and bungee are made for outdoor use and won't fade, corrode or lock up. Awesome security solution for fishing rods, electronics, sports cameras, hi def outdoor cameras, etc. Easily attaches and removes for ease of use. For recreational use only. Not a safety device. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kiw1r6CLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C1TY1FS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Paddle Accessories"]], "price": 8.5}}
{"item_id": "B00C20NF7G", "title": "Clay Clips - Sporting Clay Target Holder (10 Pack)", "description": "Clay Clips are a stainless steel spring tension wire form that holds Sporting Clays (pigeon) and allows you to punch them into cardboard target backer board. They are very low profile, reusable and are wind resistant (pigeons won't come off). You can arrange pigeons in any configuration you'd like, and if you shoot a top clay, the pieces that fall don't knock down the pigeon below. Long range rifle shooters, no longer need spotting scopes to see a hit. Pistol shooters get a nice inexpensive reactive target. Archers have been know to hang clays on their bales of hay with Clay Clips. Kids are shooting clays in their backyards with clay Clips.", "text": "Clay Clips - Sporting Clay Target Holder (10 Pack) Clay Clips are a stainless steel spring tension wire form that holds Sporting Clays (pigeon) and allows you to punch them into cardboard target backer board. They are very low profile, reusable and are wind resistant (pigeons won't come off). You can arrange pigeons in any configuration you'd like, and if you shoot a top clay, the pieces that fall don't knock down the pigeon below. Long range rifle shooters, no longer need spotting scopes to see a hit. Pistol shooters get a nice inexpensive reactive target. Archers have been know to hang clays on their bales of hay with Clay Clips. Kids are shooting clays in their backyards with clay Clips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qmKbrwDtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C20NF7G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B00C27EQHM", "title": "Browning Black Label Black Lash Dagger", "description": "Browning Black Label Black Lash Dagger. SAVE BIG! Compact design, powerful response! A fixed-blade Dagger to give you an instant edge whenever you need it. A proud member of Browning's Black Label line of top-quality designer Knives, this Black Lash is ready for anything in a dangerous world. Now offered here for BIG BUCKS OFF! Practical tactical: 440 titanium coated 5 1/2\"l. double-edge stainless steel blade; CNC machined black G-10 handle for a secure grip; Stainless steel guard and pommel; Blade-Tech sheath with Tek-Lok belt clip for easy carry. 10\"l. overall. 8 ozs. State Color. Order Now! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. Browning Black Label Black Lash Dagger", "text": "Browning Black Label Black Lash Dagger Browning Black Label Black Lash Dagger. SAVE BIG! Compact design, powerful response! A fixed-blade Dagger to give you an instant edge whenever you need it. A proud member of Browning's Black Label line of top-quality designer Knives, this Black Lash is ready for anything in a dangerous world. Now offered here for BIG BUCKS OFF! Practical tactical: 440 titanium coated 5 1/2\"l. double-edge stainless steel blade; CNC machined black G-10 handle for a secure grip; Stainless steel guard and pommel; Blade-Tech sheath with Tek-Lok belt clip for easy carry. 10\"l. overall. 8 ozs. State Color. Order Now! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. Browning Black Label Black Lash Dagger", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IcgWFrl5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C27EQHM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BROWNING BLACK LABEL", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 42.72}}
{"item_id": "B00C2C3FO2", "title": "Ibera Bicycle Strap-On Reflective SeatPak", "description": "This small or medium sized saddle bag is lightweight perfect for road or mountain bikes. With a narrow, streamlined design that fits under most saddles with minimal wind resistance. Reflective trim enhances low-light visibility, while taillight hanger allows for additional nighttime safety gear. Bag conveniently front-loads and attaches quickly and easily with Velcro straps. Fits most saddlesNote:Also available in size small (IB-SB11).Specifications for small bag:Material:1680D NylonMount:Velcro StrapCapacity:0.6 LDimensions:6.5\" x 3.5\" x 2.5\"Weight:0.19 lbs (90g)Item No.:IB-SB11-SSpecifications for medium bag:Material:1680D NylonMount:Velcro StrapCapacity:1.8 LDimensions:6.25-7\" x 3-4\" x 2-4\"Weight:0.32 lbs (5.1oz)Item No.:IB-SB11-M", "text": "Ibera Bicycle Strap-On Reflective SeatPak This small or medium sized saddle bag is lightweight perfect for road or mountain bikes. With a narrow, streamlined design that fits under most saddles with minimal wind resistance. Reflective trim enhances low-light visibility, while taillight hanger allows for additional nighttime safety gear. Bag conveniently front-loads and attaches quickly and easily with Velcro straps. Fits most saddlesNote:Also available in size small (IB-SB11).Specifications for small bag:Material:1680D NylonMount:Velcro StrapCapacity:0.6 LDimensions:6.5\" x 3.5\" x 2.5\"Weight:0.19 lbs (90g)Item No.:IB-SB11-SSpecifications for medium bag:Material:1680D NylonMount:Velcro StrapCapacity:1.8 LDimensions:6.25-7\" x 3-4\" x 2-4\"Weight:0.32 lbs (5.1oz)Item No.:IB-SB11-M", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LPM%2B572eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C2C3FO2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00C2G58U2", "title": "Umarex 2254804 XBG Multi-Shot CO2 Power .177-Caliber Air Pistol, Black Matte Finish", "description": "The Umarex 2254804 XBG Multi-Shot CO2 Power .177-Caliber Air Pistol is compact, lightweight and has a 19-shot drop-free metal magazine for quick reloading. Designing, developing and marketing sport shooting products under the RWS, Walther, Hämmerli, Beretta, Colt, Smith & Wesson, HK, Ruger, Browning, Makarov, Tactical Force, Magnum Research, and Combat Zone brands. Umarex USA offers world-class products for multiple product categories including adult airguns and air rifles, BB and pellet pistols, air soft guns, specialized airgun optics, performance airgun ammunition, airgun accessories and tactical training paintball guns.", "text": "Umarex 2254804 XBG Multi-Shot CO2 Power .177-Caliber Air Pistol, Black Matte Finish The Umarex 2254804 XBG Multi-Shot CO2 Power .177-Caliber Air Pistol is compact, lightweight and has a 19-shot drop-free metal magazine for quick reloading. Designing, developing and marketing sport shooting products under the RWS, Walther, Hämmerli, Beretta, Colt, Smith & Wesson, HK, Ruger, Browning, Makarov, Tactical Force, Magnum Research, and Combat Zone brands. Umarex USA offers world-class products for multiple product categories including adult airguns and air rifles, BB and pellet pistols, air soft guns, specialized airgun optics, performance airgun ammunition, airgun accessories and tactical training paintball guns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31s5RWDe1BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C2G58U2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Umarex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B00C2L4F3S", "title": "Wildgame Innovations Halo X Ray 600 Laser Range Finder", "description": "The Halo Ballistix 600 Laser Range Finder provides a maximum range of 600 yards to a reflective target with AI slope accounting technology. With 6x magnification and scan mode that allows for constant ranging precise to +/- 1 yard. It is water resistant, comes with nylon pouch and one year warranty. The unit uses a CR2 lithium battery (not included).", "text": "Wildgame Innovations Halo X Ray 600 Laser Range Finder The Halo Ballistix 600 Laser Range Finder provides a maximum range of 600 yards to a reflective target with AI slope accounting technology. With 6x magnification and scan mode that allows for constant ranging precise to +/- 1 yard. It is water resistant, comes with nylon pouch and one year warranty. The unit uses a CR2 lithium battery (not included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hAgVyxPPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C2L4F3S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wild Game Innovations", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 111.27}}
{"item_id": "B00C2MHNJK", "title": "SecurityIng® 4 Modes Waterproof 2800 Lumens Cree XM-L U2 LED Bicycle Light & 6400mAh Battery Pack & Charger, Cree LED Bike Lmap Light Super Bright Lighting Lamp for Outdoor Sports Like Cmaping, Hiking, etc..", "description": "Specifications:Function: Super bright CREE XM-L U2 LED bicycle light.Brand: Securitylng.LED:- LED Type: CREE XM-L U2 LED.- Quantity: 2 pcs.- LED Life: 50,000 hours.- Feature: More condensed light, long exposure distance.4 Switch Modes: Weak, Middle, Strong, Strobe.Switch Type: Blue Button.Runtime: About 3 hours.Switch Type: push.Switch Location: Tail-cap.High-performance electronic switch:- Slightly click the switch to turn ON/OFF the light.- Slightly click the switch to change the brightness modes, LOW - MID - HIGH.- Long press the switch for more than one second to access to Strobe mode.Battery indicator(beside the blue button):- Three lights lit on(power≥80%).- Two lights lit on(50%≤power≤80%).- One light will lit on and will flash three(runtime≤30minutes).Power Source: 1x8.4v 6400mAh Battery Pack.The connector of battery pack is specially matched with the connector of the bike lamp, the other kind of battery may not be compatible with the bike lamp.Battery Charger(include):- Voltage: 100v - 240v.- LED indication for Power On / Charging / Full charge.Color: black.Weight: 486g.Note:- 1. Remove batteries for long times of inactivity or during transportation.- 2. Do not use petroleum-based lubricant on the waterproof O-rings, it may cause damages to the O-ring.- 3. IPX-7 waterproof rating, not for diving.Including: 1 x SecurityIng 1200 Lumens Cree XM-L U2 LED Bicycle Light.1 x 8.4 V 6400 mAh battery pack.1 x charger for this battery pack.2 x Spare O-ring.ePathDirect After Service: 30 Days Money Back Guarantee, 12 Months Warranty!", "text": "SecurityIng® 4 Modes Waterproof 2800 Lumens Cree XM-L U2 LED Bicycle Light & 6400mAh Battery Pack & Charger, Cree LED Bike Lmap Light Super Bright Lighting Lamp for Outdoor Sports Like Cmaping, Hiking, etc.. Specifications:Function: Super bright CREE XM-L U2 LED bicycle light.Brand: Securitylng.LED:- LED Type: CREE XM-L U2 LED.- Quantity: 2 pcs.- LED Life: 50,000 hours.- Feature: More condensed light, long exposure distance.4 Switch Modes: Weak, Middle, Strong, Strobe.Switch Type: Blue Button.Runtime: About 3 hours.Switch Type: push.Switch Location: Tail-cap.High-performance electronic switch:- Slightly click the switch to turn ON/OFF the light.- Slightly click the switch to change the brightness modes, LOW - MID - HIGH.- Long press the switch for more than one second to access to Strobe mode.Battery indicator(beside the blue button):- Three lights lit on(power≥80%).- Two lights lit on(50%≤power≤80%).- One light will lit on and will flash three(runtime≤30minutes).Power Source: 1x8.4v 6400mAh Battery Pack.The connector of battery pack is specially matched with the connector of the bike lamp, the other kind of battery may not be compatible with the bike lamp.Battery Charger(include):- Voltage: 100v - 240v.- LED indication for Power On / Charging / Full charge.Color: black.Weight: 486g.Note:- 1. Remove batteries for long times of inactivity or during transportation.- 2. Do not use petroleum-based lubricant on the waterproof O-rings, it may cause damages to the O-ring.- 3. IPX-7 waterproof rating, not for diving.Including: 1 x SecurityIng 1200 Lumens Cree XM-L U2 LED Bicycle Light.1 x 8.4 V 6400 mAh battery pack.1 x charger for this battery pack.2 x Spare O-ring.ePathDirect After Service: 30 Days Money Back Guarantee, 12 Months Warranty!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NofdXiKRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C2MHNJK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 30.99}}
{"item_id": "B00C2NQ6XS", "title": "VERY100 Holographic Red and Green Dot Sight Tactical Reflex 4 Different Reticles", "description": "Specification:Power: 1XObj.aperture: 1.3''Field o.V.: 15.8m@100mOutput: 1mwBattery: 1xCR2032Housing Size: about 3.2'' x 2.1''X 2''Reticle seletorTube diameter: 1.3''Switch & Stepless Intensity controlRed Laser: Wavelength: 650nmMaterial: aircraft grade aluminum alloy", "text": "VERY100 Holographic Red and Green Dot Sight Tactical Reflex 4 Different Reticles Specification:Power: 1XObj.aperture: 1.3''Field o.V.: 15.8m@100mOutput: 1mwBattery: 1xCR2032Housing Size: about 3.2'' x 2.1''X 2''Reticle seletorTube diameter: 1.3''Switch & Stepless Intensity controlRed Laser: Wavelength: 650nmMaterial: aircraft grade aluminum alloy", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BXWdHQj2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C2NQ6XS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VERY100", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B00C2SGGD8", "title": "Gamo MRA Showstopper Shawn Michaels 1400 FPS Air Rifle", "description": "The Gamo MRA Showstopper Shawn Michaels is a spring piston break Barrel action air rifle with a velocity of 1,400 FPS. This air rifle comes with an SAT 2-Stage adjustable trigger and SWA recoil pads with 74% absorption. The stock is made of all-weather black stock synthetic Twin Cheek Pads for ambidextrous shooting. MECHANISM -Velocity: 1400 feet per second (fps) with PBA -Single Shot -Break Barrel: Single Cocking System -Automatic Cocking Safety system -Manual trigger safety -Barrel: Fluted Polymer Jacketed Steel -Trigger: SAT Second Stage adjustable STOCK -Stock: Tough All Weather black stock synthetic -Cheekpiece: Twin cheek pads (comfortable for ambidextrous shooting) OPTICS -Scope: 4x32 Air Rifle Scope SPECIFICATIONS -Weight: 6.1 lbs. -Length: 45'' -Caliber:.177 -Trigger Pull: 3.74 lbs. -Cocking Effort: 30 lbs. -Barrel Length: 18 in.", "text": "Gamo MRA Showstopper Shawn Michaels 1400 FPS Air Rifle The Gamo MRA Showstopper Shawn Michaels is a spring piston break Barrel action air rifle with a velocity of 1,400 FPS. This air rifle comes with an SAT 2-Stage adjustable trigger and SWA recoil pads with 74% absorption. The stock is made of all-weather black stock synthetic Twin Cheek Pads for ambidextrous shooting. MECHANISM -Velocity: 1400 feet per second (fps) with PBA -Single Shot -Break Barrel: Single Cocking System -Automatic Cocking Safety system -Manual trigger safety -Barrel: Fluted Polymer Jacketed Steel -Trigger: SAT Second Stage adjustable STOCK -Stock: Tough All Weather black stock synthetic -Cheekpiece: Twin cheek pads (comfortable for ambidextrous shooting) OPTICS -Scope: 4x32 Air Rifle Scope SPECIFICATIONS -Weight: 6.1 lbs. -Length: 45'' -Caliber:.177 -Trigger Pull: 3.74 lbs. -Cocking Effort: 30 lbs. -Barrel Length: 18 in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZHwM1W2cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C2SGGD8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 179.99}}
