{"item_id": "B00C33FZS4", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pro Series Side Saddle 6 Round 12 Gauge Shotshell Shot Shell No Gunsmithing Carrier Mount For The Mossberg 500 & 590 Shotgun", "description": "Ultimate Arms Gear Side Saddle Shell Carrier Mount for the Mossberg 500 & 590 12 gauge shotguns. Lightweight, molded-nylon shell 6 round carrier puts additional fire power quickly within your reach. Aluminum mounting plate attaches to the side of the receiver using the existing pin/screw holes-no permanent alterations or gunsmithing required. Length : 7\" , Width: 2.5\" , Net Weight: 5 oz", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Pro Series Side Saddle 6 Round 12 Gauge Shotshell Shot Shell No Gunsmithing Carrier Mount For The Mossberg 500 & 590 Shotgun Ultimate Arms Gear Side Saddle Shell Carrier Mount for the Mossberg 500 & 590 12 gauge shotguns. Lightweight, molded-nylon shell 6 round carrier puts additional fire power quickly within your reach. Aluminum mounting plate attaches to the side of the receiver using the existing pin/screw holes-no permanent alterations or gunsmithing required. Length : 7\" , Width: 2.5\" , Net Weight: 5 oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kkuMGZMaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C33FZS4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 20.99}}
