{"item_id": "B00C498LBA", "title": "VERY100 Red Laser with 200 Lumen Tactical Flashlight", "description": "100% Brand New A compact flashlight and laser sight combo Wavelength: 650nm Power: <5mw 3 Hours Continous Burn Time on 1 set of batteries Black color polymer body Quick release mounting latch mounts the flashlight securely and allows speedy installation and removal of the flashlight. Mode selector set various operation mode such as flashlight only, laser sight only and flashlight/laser sight the same time. Mode selector also works as a safety switch. Dual Switches: Button switch turns on continuous beam of the flashlight or/and laser sight. Included cord remote switch turns flashlight or/and laser sight momentarily. 650nm red laser sight is fully adjustable for Windage and Elevation with included Allen wrench. 2x CR123A 3Volt lithium batteries (Not included) Note: The flashlight fits onto Picatinny rails including RAS/RIS. It also fit's any standard 20mm weaver style rail.", "text": "VERY100 Red Laser with 200 Lumen Tactical Flashlight 100% Brand New A compact flashlight and laser sight combo Wavelength: 650nm Power: <5mw 3 Hours Continous Burn Time on 1 set of batteries Black color polymer body Quick release mounting latch mounts the flashlight securely and allows speedy installation and removal of the flashlight. Mode selector set various operation mode such as flashlight only, laser sight only and flashlight/laser sight the same time. Mode selector also works as a safety switch. Dual Switches: Button switch turns on continuous beam of the flashlight or/and laser sight. Included cord remote switch turns flashlight or/and laser sight momentarily. 650nm red laser sight is fully adjustable for Windage and Elevation with included Allen wrench. 2x CR123A 3Volt lithium batteries (Not included) Note: The flashlight fits onto Picatinny rails including RAS/RIS. It also fit's any standard 20mm weaver style rail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gPeqMtyqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C498LBA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VERY100", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 28.42}}
