{"item_id": "B00C4TMRKQ", "title": "HDE® Tactical Red Dot Laser Sight for Pistol/Handgun Picatinny Rail Mount (Perfect for Hunting)", "description": "Powerful and long range beam with pinpoint accuracy Precise and wide range windage/elevation adjustments Hard anodized finish for wear resistance Excellent water resistance", "text": "HDE® Tactical Red Dot Laser Sight for Pistol/Handgun Picatinny Rail Mount (Perfect for Hunting) Powerful and long range beam with pinpoint accuracy Precise and wide range windage/elevation adjustments Hard anodized finish for wear resistance Excellent water resistance", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ew0q3rjuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C4TMRKQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UNKONW", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 10.98}}
{"item_id": "B00C54GWYW", "title": "Rainier Arms Raptor Ambidextrous Charging Handle - .223 / 5.56mm", "description": "Rainier Arms Raptor ambidextrous charging handle by AXTS. The Raptor is truly revolutionary in design & function. From rapid palm \"blading\" or finger thumb charges of the weapon, the motion is fluid & fast from either strong or support side. Made in the USA from aircraft grade 7075 aluminum and milspec anodized. Designed for AR15-556 *** May not fit on some SIG AR's, specifically the 516 Model", "text": "Rainier Arms Raptor Ambidextrous Charging Handle - .223 / 5.56mm Rainier Arms Raptor ambidextrous charging handle by AXTS. The Raptor is truly revolutionary in design & function. From rapid palm \"blading\" or finger thumb charges of the weapon, the motion is fluid & fast from either strong or support side. Made in the USA from aircraft grade 7075 aluminum and milspec anodized. Designed for AR15-556 *** May not fit on some SIG AR's, specifically the 516 Model", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rybteAC9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C54GWYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rainier Arms by AXTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 85.45}}
{"item_id": "B00C586H3E", "title": "Sinland Microfiber Ultra Compact & Fast Drying Travel Towels", "description": "This Super Compact Microfiber Towel is made of microfibers,it is lightweight and compact,is a must for travelers, backpackers, hikers, etc. Can absorb tons of water, and promote rapid evaporation. Just let the cloth erase water slowly and lightly or Only need to cover , not back and forth, and there will be a good effect. When your first use,please wash in water after 10 seconds. Machine wash warm and separately,Tumble dry low or air dry,No fabric softener,No bleach.", "text": "Sinland Microfiber Ultra Compact & Fast Drying Travel Towels This Super Compact Microfiber Towel is made of microfibers,it is lightweight and compact,is a must for travelers, backpackers, hikers, etc. Can absorb tons of water, and promote rapid evaporation. Just let the cloth erase water slowly and lightly or Only need to cover , not back and forth, and there will be a good effect. When your first use,please wash in water after 10 seconds. Machine wash warm and separately,Tumble dry low or air dry,No fabric softener,No bleach.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qU1ApB4ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C586H3E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00C5RK6TG", "title": "PHANTOM POLYMER TACTICAL CQB RETICLE RED DOT REFLEX SIGHT WITH PICATINNY MOUNT", "description": "A super lightweight aiming solution for most rifles, shotguns, airguns and crossbows. High strength polymer housing is soft coated in flat black color. This red dot sight provides optimum performance under most everyday sport shooting conditions. Intensity of the CQB reticle dot has 5 level adjustment settings for proper contrast against full range of background light. Windage and elevation is adjustable with 1moa click value. Built-in rail mount works on both Weaver and Picatinny type of rails.Magnification: parallax free 1XEye relief: UnlimitedDot size: 3MOA center dot and 20MOA circleObjective lens size: 30mmRail type: Fits onto Weaver and M1913 Picatinny bases.Center height: 28mmOverall length: 142mm ( 6inch)Weight: 6.8oz.Power source: One CR1620 Lithium cell (included)Battery life: 200hours (with light intensity set at 3)", "text": "PHANTOM POLYMER TACTICAL CQB RETICLE RED DOT REFLEX SIGHT WITH PICATINNY MOUNT A super lightweight aiming solution for most rifles, shotguns, airguns and crossbows. High strength polymer housing is soft coated in flat black color. This red dot sight provides optimum performance under most everyday sport shooting conditions. Intensity of the CQB reticle dot has 5 level adjustment settings for proper contrast against full range of background light. Windage and elevation is adjustable with 1moa click value. Built-in rail mount works on both Weaver and Picatinny type of rails.Magnification: parallax free 1XEye relief: UnlimitedDot size: 3MOA center dot and 20MOA circleObjective lens size: 30mmRail type: Fits onto Weaver and M1913 Picatinny bases.Center height: 28mmOverall length: 142mm ( 6inch)Weight: 6.8oz.Power source: One CR1620 Lithium cell (included)Battery life: 200hours (with light intensity set at 3)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rBzAxVE6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C5RK6TG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 38.8}}
{"item_id": "B00C5RO28M", "title": "PHANTOM POLYMER TACTICAL CQB RETICLE MINI RED DOT REFLEX SIGHT RDA20 BLACK WITH PICATINNY MOUNT", "description": "A super lightweight aiming solution for most rifles, shotguns, airguns and crossbows. High strength polymer housing is soft coated in flat black color. This red dot sight provides optimum performance under most everyday sport shooting conditions. Intensity of the CQB reticle dot has 5 level adjustment settings for proper contrast against full range of background light. Windage and elevation is adjustable with 1moa click value. Built-in rail mount works on both Weaver and Picatinny type of rails.Magnification: parallax free 1XEye relief: UnlimitedDot size: 3MOA center dot and 20MOA circleObjective lens size: 24mmRail type: Fits onto Weaver and M1913 Picatinny bases.Center height: 25mmOverall length: 78.5mm ( 3inch)Weight: 4.4oz.Power source: One CR1620 Lithium cell (included)Battery life: 200hours (with light intensity set at 3)", "text": "PHANTOM POLYMER TACTICAL CQB RETICLE MINI RED DOT REFLEX SIGHT RDA20 BLACK WITH PICATINNY MOUNT A super lightweight aiming solution for most rifles, shotguns, airguns and crossbows. High strength polymer housing is soft coated in flat black color. This red dot sight provides optimum performance under most everyday sport shooting conditions. Intensity of the CQB reticle dot has 5 level adjustment settings for proper contrast against full range of background light. Windage and elevation is adjustable with 1moa click value. Built-in rail mount works on both Weaver and Picatinny type of rails.Magnification: parallax free 1XEye relief: UnlimitedDot size: 3MOA center dot and 20MOA circleObjective lens size: 24mmRail type: Fits onto Weaver and M1913 Picatinny bases.Center height: 25mmOverall length: 78.5mm ( 3inch)Weight: 4.4oz.Power source: One CR1620 Lithium cell (included)Battery life: 200hours (with light intensity set at 3)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Jatfen8NL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C5RO28M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 29.9}}
{"item_id": "B00C5TQ1PW", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Extended Magazine Release (Stainless)", "description": "Trick out your Ruger 10/22 with a magazine release that looks like it belongs on your gun. Improve the function and look of your 10/22. Made from aircraft aluminum anodized in either black or clear to match up to your gun. Simple to operate by applying pressure in the forward direction, the magazine will drop free from the receiver. This extended magazine release is a great low cost upgrade to your favorite Ruger 10/22. Loads of Fun! Upgrade today!", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Extended Magazine Release (Stainless) Trick out your Ruger 10/22 with a magazine release that looks like it belongs on your gun. Improve the function and look of your 10/22. Made from aircraft aluminum anodized in either black or clear to match up to your gun. Simple to operate by applying pressure in the forward direction, the magazine will drop free from the receiver. This extended magazine release is a great low cost upgrade to your favorite Ruger 10/22. Loads of Fun! Upgrade today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eSsGOQ9vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C5TQ1PW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B00C65NA8Q", "title": "Ruger 90417 10/22 Laser Max Laser", "description": "Ruger 10/22 Laser Sight for precision aiming! This LaserMax Laser is designed to work with your Ruger 10/22 and put you on your target quickly and easily. The bright red 635nm continuous-wave laser is easily visible all the way out to 100 yds. This Laser Sight is pre-aligned at 25 yds., but can easily be adjusted for windage and elevation. The two integrated Picatinny rails on this Sight are perfect for adding additional accessories like a tactical light or infrared laser. It's built to last, too, thanks to its rugged yet lightweight Fiberglass Reinforced Nylon construction. Requires one 1/3N Lithium cell battery (included) for 2 hours of continuous runtime. Set your sights on saving when you order now! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. Ruger 10/22 Laser Sight", "text": "Ruger 90417 10/22 Laser Max Laser Ruger 10/22 Laser Sight for precision aiming! This LaserMax Laser is designed to work with your Ruger 10/22 and put you on your target quickly and easily. The bright red 635nm continuous-wave laser is easily visible all the way out to 100 yds. This Laser Sight is pre-aligned at 25 yds., but can easily be adjusted for windage and elevation. The two integrated Picatinny rails on this Sight are perfect for adding additional accessories like a tactical light or infrared laser. It's built to last, too, thanks to its rugged yet lightweight Fiberglass Reinforced Nylon construction. Requires one 1/3N Lithium cell battery (included) for 2 hours of continuous runtime. Set your sights on saving when you order now! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. Ruger 10/22 Laser Sight", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EvrJMjSkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C65NA8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ruger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 62.37}}
{"item_id": "B00C6IYGMC", "title": "10/22 Bolt Handle By Kidd - Black with Black Viton", "description": "This great upgrade kit for your 10-22 will give you a precision bolt handle along with the ultimate 10-22 guide rod and our popular tuning springs. The cocking handle is offered in two colors black or silver. The black weighs .4oz, length 1 3/4 and is made from 7075 aluminum. The silver is made from stainless steel with a weight of .6oz, length 1 3/4. Both 10-22 cocking handles are 1/4 inch longer than the OEM Ruger and have the signature Viton cushion for comfort. The KIDD Precision Ground Guide Rod is an upgraded part for your 10-22 and is made from hardened tool steel and held to 2/10,000\" tolerance throughout its entire length. The rod is nitride treated which gives its surface a 70C rockwell (harder than a file) surface hardness. Guaranteed the smoothest and slickest 10-22 guide rod in the industry. The three springs come in varying tensions for standard 22LR ammo, subsonic ammo, or high velocity up to 17 Mach 2 ammo. (Note that increased weight is needed on the bolt to compensate for the 17 Mach 2 ammo). Our cocking assembly is made to work with Ruger 10-22 or any after market products that are also interchangeable with the OEM Ruger model. Packaging Includes: bolt handle guide rod 3 tuning springs Installation instructions: After removing the 10-22 stock from the barreled action, remove the trigger and bolt stop. This will allow the needed clearance for the 10-22 bolt to be removed along with the cocking assembly. The video below offers some of the finer installation points. But essentially after choosing your proper spring tension slip the cocking assembly in from the ejection port, placing the cone end into the containment detent. Then fully compress the cocking assembly and place the bolt on it. Let up on the containment allowing the bolt to go forward. Re-install the Ruger bolt stop or aftermarket KIDD bolt buffer, then the trigger and stock.", "text": "10/22 Bolt Handle By Kidd - Black with Black Viton This great upgrade kit for your 10-22 will give you a precision bolt handle along with the ultimate 10-22 guide rod and our popular tuning springs. The cocking handle is offered in two colors black or silver. The black weighs .4oz, length 1 3/4 and is made from 7075 aluminum. The silver is made from stainless steel with a weight of .6oz, length 1 3/4. Both 10-22 cocking handles are 1/4 inch longer than the OEM Ruger and have the signature Viton cushion for comfort. The KIDD Precision Ground Guide Rod is an upgraded part for your 10-22 and is made from hardened tool steel and held to 2/10,000\" tolerance throughout its entire length. The rod is nitride treated which gives its surface a 70C rockwell (harder than a file) surface hardness. Guaranteed the smoothest and slickest 10-22 guide rod in the industry. The three springs come in varying tensions for standard 22LR ammo, subsonic ammo, or high velocity up to 17 Mach 2 ammo. (Note that increased weight is needed on the bolt to compensate for the 17 Mach 2 ammo). Our cocking assembly is made to work with Ruger 10-22 or any after market products that are also interchangeable with the OEM Ruger model. Packaging Includes: bolt handle guide rod 3 tuning springs Installation instructions: After removing the 10-22 stock from the barreled action, remove the trigger and bolt stop. This will allow the needed clearance for the 10-22 bolt to be removed along with the cocking assembly. The video below offers some of the finer installation points. But essentially after choosing your proper spring tension slip the cocking assembly in from the ejection port, placing the cone end into the containment detent. Then fully compress the cocking assembly and place the bolt on it. Let up on the containment allowing the bolt to go forward. Re-install the Ruger bolt stop or aftermarket KIDD bolt buffer, then the trigger and stock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51t4JY6nqKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C6IYGMC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 38.95}}
{"item_id": "B00C6KVAR4", "title": "10/22 Kidd Auto Bolt Release", "description": "The KIDD Auto Bolt Release is an 10-22 Accessory for the Ruger 10-22 rifle. This drop-in part works with the standard single stage geometry triggers for the 22 auto loader. This 10-22 accessory will allow the shooter to simply pull back on the bolt handle when the bolt is locked back to allow the bolt to go forward. No more fiddling with the Ruger bolt hold open to allow the bolt to go forward. The KIDD 10 22 Auto Bolt Release is a standard feature in our KIDD single stage trigger, KIDD two stage trigger, and Complete Ruger 10-22 Polymer Guard trigger units but this product can also upgrade your current Ruger single stage trigger. The material is 304 stainless steel. Replacement instructions: Remove the ejector pin and from the side of the bolt hold open push the pin 1/3 of the way in. Pull out the current bolt hold open then slide in the KIDD Auto Bolt release. Push the pin back through the KIDD Auto bolt release and re-install the ejector pin.", "text": "10/22 Kidd Auto Bolt Release The KIDD Auto Bolt Release is an 10-22 Accessory for the Ruger 10-22 rifle. This drop-in part works with the standard single stage geometry triggers for the 22 auto loader. This 10-22 accessory will allow the shooter to simply pull back on the bolt handle when the bolt is locked back to allow the bolt to go forward. No more fiddling with the Ruger bolt hold open to allow the bolt to go forward. The KIDD 10 22 Auto Bolt Release is a standard feature in our KIDD single stage trigger, KIDD two stage trigger, and Complete Ruger 10-22 Polymer Guard trigger units but this product can also upgrade your current Ruger single stage trigger. The material is 304 stainless steel. Replacement instructions: Remove the ejector pin and from the side of the bolt hold open push the pin 1/3 of the way in. Pull out the current bolt hold open then slide in the KIDD Auto Bolt release. Push the pin back through the KIDD Auto bolt release and re-install the ejector pin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-WWa6Pl0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C6KVAR4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 13.95}}
