{"item_id": "B00C6PXGYE", "title": "Type-III Universal Gun Cleaning Kit w/ 100pc 6 Inch American Made Tapered/Regular Tip Cotton Swabs and Black Double Sided Nylon Brush", "description": "These swabs are made by a Certified US Government Contractor and are identical to the ones used by the service men and women of our United States Armed Forces. This set will help purge your firearm of performance robbing gunk and carbon build up. Defend your nation with a well maintained weapon!Swabs are made in USA. The brush is imported.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "text": "Type-III Universal Gun Cleaning Kit w/ 100pc 6 Inch American Made Tapered/Regular Tip Cotton Swabs and Black Double Sided Nylon Brush These swabs are made by a Certified US Government Contractor and are identical to the ones used by the service men and women of our United States Armed Forces. This set will help purge your firearm of performance robbing gunk and carbon build up. Defend your nation with a well maintained weapon!Swabs are made in USA. The brush is imported.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TEEyJdk4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C6PXGYE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 6.95}}
{"item_id": "B00C6SQQFM", "title": "Type-III 7\" Black Double Sided Nylon Gun Cleaning Brush Set", "description": "This 7\" dual sided brush is excellent for all around firearm maintenance. Keep your weapon clean and functioning properly by removing even the tiniest pieces of gunk, grime, dirt, and debris. The thick toothbrush like end is able to brush away performance robbing carbon build-up, while the petite end squeezes in those hard to reach places.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "text": "Type-III 7\" Black Double Sided Nylon Gun Cleaning Brush Set This 7\" dual sided brush is excellent for all around firearm maintenance. Keep your weapon clean and functioning properly by removing even the tiniest pieces of gunk, grime, dirt, and debris. The thick toothbrush like end is able to brush away performance robbing carbon build-up, while the petite end squeezes in those hard to reach places.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411vHxCkZ3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C6SQQFM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00C6XH8FO", "title": "AGR - 47 Rubberized Pistol Grip For AK - Fab-defense color FDE - Flat Dark Earth / Black / OD Green", "description": "The latest addition to the line of Pistol Grips featuring State-of-the Art Multi-Textured Rubber, enhancing your grip experience. Incorporated into its design, is the superior contour of its predecessor, adding even more comfort and proper ventilation needed in extreme heat and moist environments, giving you the edge you need in the field or at the range.", "text": "AGR - 47 Rubberized Pistol Grip For AK - Fab-defense color FDE - Flat Dark Earth / Black / OD Green The latest addition to the line of Pistol Grips featuring State-of-the Art Multi-Textured Rubber, enhancing your grip experience. Incorporated into its design, is the superior contour of its predecessor, adding even more comfort and proper ventilation needed in extreme heat and moist environments, giving you the edge you need in the field or at the range.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Vih-NGZ-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C6XH8FO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fab-Defense", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 30.25}}
{"item_id": "B00C7499UY", "title": "Sox Sport Plantar Fasciitis Arch Support Ped Compression Socks, Pairs", "description": "Why do you need these socks? Major foot arteries are the farthest away from the heart, causing feet and arch issues to heal very slow, by increasing the circulation it helps bring fresh blood to the damaged areas and tissue. The mid foot plantar fasciitis support zone, Gently lifts the Plantar Ligaments without Pressure for gradual Improvements in the mid foot plantar fasciitis support zone. It is not a quick fix or overnight solution, circulation and support can be the shortest route to recovery. Made in Italy with our exclusive wicking and Silver DryStat fibers to prevent bacteria and fungus from growing in your socks. This quick dry sock also helps prevent blisters and provides great padding for your feet. Over the calf compression is still the best for your leg health, a great sock to wear with shorts or on light workout days. Sox come in 4 different styles, The best compression is always going to be our Over The Calf Graduated Compression Socks The SS1211, the Crew SS3011, the Ped SS4011 and the NEW No Show Ghost SS6011. Made in our Italy factory never outsourced to the lowest bidder, always in style and quality you would expect. The best socks your feet will ever wear. Arcos manufacturers socks under the names Vitalsox, Travelsox, Sox, Worksox, Caresox, Arcos, and Eurosock.", "text": "Sox Sport Plantar Fasciitis Arch Support Ped Compression Socks, Pairs Why do you need these socks? Major foot arteries are the farthest away from the heart, causing feet and arch issues to heal very slow, by increasing the circulation it helps bring fresh blood to the damaged areas and tissue. The mid foot plantar fasciitis support zone, Gently lifts the Plantar Ligaments without Pressure for gradual Improvements in the mid foot plantar fasciitis support zone. It is not a quick fix or overnight solution, circulation and support can be the shortest route to recovery. Made in Italy with our exclusive wicking and Silver DryStat fibers to prevent bacteria and fungus from growing in your socks. This quick dry sock also helps prevent blisters and provides great padding for your feet. Over the calf compression is still the best for your leg health, a great sock to wear with shorts or on light workout days. Sox come in 4 different styles, The best compression is always going to be our Over The Calf Graduated Compression Socks The SS1211, the Crew SS3011, the Ped SS4011 and the NEW No Show Ghost SS6011. Made in our Italy factory never outsourced to the lowest bidder, always in style and quality you would expect. The best socks your feet will ever wear. Arcos manufacturers socks under the names Vitalsox, Travelsox, Sox, Worksox, Caresox, Arcos, and Eurosock.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lbgrgEC4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C7499UY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00C7APFG0", "title": "Carrom Balance Board", "description": "The Balance Board is a valuable conditioning tool for every athlete or exercise junky, especially for the skiing or skateboarding enthusiast. Not an athlete or exercise junky? Your kids will enjoy watching you try to stay on this thing. You will enjoy watching your kids learn balance and coordination they didn't inherit from you. It can be used in a standing, kneeling or sitting position. Fine tune your balance and coordination all while having quality family fun. Consumers Reports thinks it's pretty cool.", "text": "Carrom Balance Board The Balance Board is a valuable conditioning tool for every athlete or exercise junky, especially for the skiing or skateboarding enthusiast. Not an athlete or exercise junky? Your kids will enjoy watching you try to stay on this thing. You will enjoy watching your kids learn balance and coordination they didn't inherit from you. It can be used in a standing, kneeling or sitting position. Fine tune your balance and coordination all while having quality family fun. Consumers Reports thinks it's pretty cool.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vGimDE2yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C7APFG0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Carrom", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Balance Boards"]], "price": 52.14}}
{"item_id": "B00C7HKS2E", "title": "Zing Air Storm Z Bow, Orange", "description": "The Air Storm Z-Bow is the bow and arrow, one set includes 1 Z Bow, 1 Zartz Arrow and 1 Zonic Whistle Arrow. The Air Storm Z Bow is designed for the aged 8 years old and up and for whether your young shooter is left or right-handed. Load your Air Storm Z-Bow up with a whistling Zonic soft foam arrow, pull back then aim and fire. Watch as the arrow soars over 95 feet. You also can launch the Zart suction cup arrow with the Z Bow, the Zartz suction cup arrow is made with softek foam, a top secret formula what makes Zartz fun anywhere you will be amazed with where your Zartz will stick.", "text": "Zing Air Storm Z Bow, Orange The Air Storm Z-Bow is the bow and arrow, one set includes 1 Z Bow, 1 Zartz Arrow and 1 Zonic Whistle Arrow. The Air Storm Z Bow is designed for the aged 8 years old and up and for whether your young shooter is left or right-handed. Load your Air Storm Z-Bow up with a whistling Zonic soft foam arrow, pull back then aim and fire. Watch as the arrow soars over 95 feet. You also can launch the Zart suction cup arrow with the Z Bow, the Zartz suction cup arrow is made with softek foam, a top secret formula what makes Zartz fun anywhere you will be amazed with where your Zartz will stick.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31InOsVx3cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C7HKS2E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zing", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Targeting Arrows"]], "price": 17.0}}
{"item_id": "B00C7SZPT4", "title": "Jetson Electric Bike, 41-Inch", "description": "", "text": "Jetson Electric Bike, 41-Inch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417lvnDgfjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C7SZPT4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Scooters & Equipment", "Scooters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00C7WXTJS", "title": "6-Pack GT-5000 Grip Tape for Your Pistol * Use on handguns and rifles * Not gritty like sandpaper or skateboard tape. * Does not scuff clothing, holsters, furniture or car seats like those sandy tapes. * Makes chambering a round easier for arthritis sufferers or anyone with less strength in their hands. * Easy to cut and apply. Follows contours better than other tapes. * Improves wet and dry grip. * Improves accuracy at the range or in an emergency. * Quicker more positive acquisition from holster, waistband, glove box or purse. * Perfect match to Glock texturing. * Durable synthetic rubber. Use on grips and slides. * Removes cleanly with no sticky residue.", "description": "Includes 6 pieces 2\"x 8 1/2\" that's over 2 feet of GT5000! Enough for 2-4 handguns. Now you can customize the look and feel of your handgun or rifle to get that positive grip that you have been looking for. It is not a pre-cut template, put it exactly where you need it. It does not add significant thickness. Glock Grip Tape is not rough and gritty like skateboard tape. It is a tough resilient synthetic rubber that provides a solid grip without feeling like sandpaper. Does not scuff clothing, holsters or car seats like those sandy tapes. Makes racking the slide on sub-compact Glocks a breeze even with a full magazine. You will notice an immediate improvement at the range with a more positive and firm grip on your handgun.", "text": "6-Pack GT-5000 Grip Tape for Your Pistol * Use on handguns and rifles * Not gritty like sandpaper or skateboard tape. * Does not scuff clothing, holsters, furniture or car seats like those sandy tapes. * Makes chambering a round easier for arthritis sufferers or anyone with less strength in their hands. * Easy to cut and apply. Follows contours better than other tapes. * Improves wet and dry grip. * Improves accuracy at the range or in an emergency. * Quicker more positive acquisition from holster, waistband, glove box or purse. * Perfect match to Glock texturing. * Durable synthetic rubber. Use on grips and slides. * Removes cleanly with no sticky residue. Includes 6 pieces 2\"x 8 1/2\" that's over 2 feet of GT5000! Enough for 2-4 handguns. Now you can customize the look and feel of your handgun or rifle to get that positive grip that you have been looking for. It is not a pre-cut template, put it exactly where you need it. It does not add significant thickness. Glock Grip Tape is not rough and gritty like skateboard tape. It is a tough resilient synthetic rubber that provides a solid grip without feeling like sandpaper. Does not scuff clothing, holsters or car seats like those sandy tapes. Makes racking the slide on sub-compact Glocks a breeze even with a full magazine. You will notice an immediate improvement at the range with a more positive and firm grip on your handgun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61lFoYgikgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C7WXTJS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B00C815RFC", "title": "New 2 Pack of GSLC 5 LED 6 Modes Bicycle Rear Tail Red Bike warning lamp safety Light", "description": "The rear 5-LED flashing safety light will alert motorists of your presence on the roadSuper bright red LED's and light weight6 different modes for you to choose1.Brand New 5 LED 6 Mode Bicycle Safety Rear Light 2.Increase more safety in the morning or evening, even in cloudy or raining day 3.Suitable for fixing on the bicycle to assure safety", "text": "New 2 Pack of GSLC 5 LED 6 Modes Bicycle Rear Tail Red Bike warning lamp safety Light The rear 5-LED flashing safety light will alert motorists of your presence on the roadSuper bright red LED's and light weight6 different modes for you to choose1.Brand New 5 LED 6 Mode Bicycle Safety Rear Light 2.Increase more safety in the morning or evening, even in cloudy or raining day 3.Suitable for fixing on the bicycle to assure safety", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YFFRdFH8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C815RFC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BikeGearz(tm)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 3.05}}
