{"item_id": "B00C87ZRRY", "title": "WarTech USA Batman Knife with Dual Assist Open Blades", "description": "Two blades for twice the cutting power. Both blades are assist-open and feature liner locks. Blades are stainless steel. Each blade has three inches of cutting edge. Pocket clip for easy carry. 11 1/4 Inch with both blades open. 8 1/2 Inch with one blade open. 5 3/4 Inch closed.", "text": "WarTech USA Batman Knife with Dual Assist Open Blades Two blades for twice the cutting power. Both blades are assist-open and feature liner locks. Blades are stainless steel. Each blade has three inches of cutting edge. Pocket clip for easy carry. 11 1/4 Inch with both blades open. 8 1/2 Inch with one blade open. 5 3/4 Inch closed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EHTHvjTHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C87ZRRY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WarTech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 15.5}}
{"item_id": "B00C88DTW8", "title": "100 Pack - 8\" Bullseye Splatter Target - Instantly See Your Shots Burst Bright Florescent Yellow Upon Impact!", "description": "See your shots instantly with Splatterburst Targets! Impact holes burst bright florescent yellow providing instant feedback. Whether shooting inside or outside, these high visibility targets make it easy to see your shots without walking downrange. The bright yellow bullet holes are visible in all light conditions without the aid of binoculars or spotting scopes, great for people with reduced vision. Made of heavy duty non-adhesive tag board, they withstand shot after shot. Excellent for all firearms, including: rifles, pistols, shotguns, bb, and pellet guns. Try a Splatterburst Target and you will see the difference! - Search \"Splatterburst Targets\" to view all our targets and packs.", "text": "100 Pack - 8\" Bullseye Splatter Target - Instantly See Your Shots Burst Bright Florescent Yellow Upon Impact! See your shots instantly with Splatterburst Targets! Impact holes burst bright florescent yellow providing instant feedback. Whether shooting inside or outside, these high visibility targets make it easy to see your shots without walking downrange. The bright yellow bullet holes are visible in all light conditions without the aid of binoculars or spotting scopes, great for people with reduced vision. Made of heavy duty non-adhesive tag board, they withstand shot after shot. Excellent for all firearms, including: rifles, pistols, shotguns, bb, and pellet guns. Try a Splatterburst Target and you will see the difference! - Search \"Splatterburst Targets\" to view all our targets and packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514iU1UnkOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C88DTW8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]]}}
