{"item_id": "B00C8SR0FK", "title": "Black Slide Cover Plate for Glock, Tactical Skull design, by Fixxxer LLC, fits most Glock models.", "description": "Justice Skull DesignFixxxer slide back plates are made of T6 aluminum, hard coat anodized. Great replacement for a plastic factory part. All designs are laser engraved.Black anodized and permanent laser engraved slide cover plates are made from durable aluminum. Slide cover plates fit all Glock models and are easily installed.You will love the quality of FIXXXER products.Fits all Generation Glocks 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 26, 27, 30, 31, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38, 39Fixxxer LLCis proud to be an American Company. We stand behind our products, period.Disclaimer - \"GLOCK\" is a federally registered trademark of Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. Fixxxer LLC has NO affiliation in any manner with, or otherwise endorsed by, Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. The use of the word \"GLOCK \" on this page is merely to identify which firearm these parts or components are compatible with.", "text": "Black Slide Cover Plate for Glock, Tactical Skull design, by Fixxxer LLC, fits most Glock models. Justice Skull DesignFixxxer slide back plates are made of T6 aluminum, hard coat anodized. Great replacement for a plastic factory part. All designs are laser engraved.Black anodized and permanent laser engraved slide cover plates are made from durable aluminum. Slide cover plates fit all Glock models and are easily installed.You will love the quality of FIXXXER products.Fits all Generation Glocks 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 26, 27, 30, 31, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38, 39Fixxxer LLCis proud to be an American Company. We stand behind our products, period.Disclaimer - \"GLOCK\" is a federally registered trademark of Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. Fixxxer LLC has NO affiliation in any manner with, or otherwise endorsed by, Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. The use of the word \"GLOCK \" on this page is merely to identify which firearm these parts or components are compatible with.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41krMWHKNgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C8SR0FK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fixxxer LLC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B00C8VJDUM", "title": "Pump Me Up! Mini Bike Pump - Compact & Portable Micro Bike Pump - Road, Mountain Or BMX Bike Tire Pump - Presta & Schrader Compatible - Premium CNC Aluminum - Lightweight & Compact - Lifetime Warranty - The Last Bike Pump You'll Ever Need", "description": "Premium Professional Bike Pump With Risk Free Lifetime Warranty!Are you looking for a dependable and compact bike pump you can easily take with you so you don't get stuck with a flat tire far from home?Are you concerned about dependability and proper fit in a mini bike pump?The Pump Me Up! Mini Bike Pump by Geared2U is designed specifically to be the lightest, compact and most durable pump on the market.You'll find this to be one of the best bike accessory purchases you'll make. Here's why:- We use only high quality aluminum alloy so you get the most durable construction but lightest bike pump (incredibly only 3.28 oz)- It's portable size (7.7 inches long, .78 inch diameter) and mounting kit means it can fit perfectly on your bike frame under your bottle cage without any interference or it can be easily carried in a bike bag.- It's specifically designed to optimize air flow with every pump which means minimum resistance when pumping up a tire - it's much easier than using other mini bike pumps.- Perfect fit for your tire valve - easily compatible with Presta and Schrader Valves - quickly re-configure the pump head so there's no need to carry two pumps or additional adapters.- Unlike many other manufacturers, our process is automated and computer controlled (CNC) for perfect precision. You get a pump that is easy to use, extremely efficient and a perfect fit on your tires.Designing for portability means you can take it anywhere without effort in case you need to perform an emergency repair, or just put more pressure in your tire and it comes with a needle valve for inflating sports balls as well!With The Pump Me Up! Mini Bike Pump, you'll always feel confident knowing that you're covered for any situation. And you just won't find a higher quality bike pump. Period.Click The \"Add To Cart Button\" NOW - Lifetime Warranty!", "text": "Pump Me Up! Mini Bike Pump - Compact & Portable Micro Bike Pump - Road, Mountain Or BMX Bike Tire Pump - Presta & Schrader Compatible - Premium CNC Aluminum - Lightweight & Compact - Lifetime Warranty - The Last Bike Pump You'll Ever Need Premium Professional Bike Pump With Risk Free Lifetime Warranty!Are you looking for a dependable and compact bike pump you can easily take with you so you don't get stuck with a flat tire far from home?Are you concerned about dependability and proper fit in a mini bike pump?The Pump Me Up! Mini Bike Pump by Geared2U is designed specifically to be the lightest, compact and most durable pump on the market.You'll find this to be one of the best bike accessory purchases you'll make. Here's why:- We use only high quality aluminum alloy so you get the most durable construction but lightest bike pump (incredibly only 3.28 oz)- It's portable size (7.7 inches long, .78 inch diameter) and mounting kit means it can fit perfectly on your bike frame under your bottle cage without any interference or it can be easily carried in a bike bag.- It's specifically designed to optimize air flow with every pump which means minimum resistance when pumping up a tire - it's much easier than using other mini bike pumps.- Perfect fit for your tire valve - easily compatible with Presta and Schrader Valves - quickly re-configure the pump head so there's no need to carry two pumps or additional adapters.- Unlike many other manufacturers, our process is automated and computer controlled (CNC) for perfect precision. You get a pump that is easy to use, extremely efficient and a perfect fit on your tires.Designing for portability means you can take it anywhere without effort in case you need to perform an emergency repair, or just put more pressure in your tire and it comes with a needle valve for inflating sports balls as well!With The Pump Me Up! Mini Bike Pump, you'll always feel confident knowing that you're covered for any situation. And you just won't find a higher quality bike pump. Period.Click The \"Add To Cart Button\" NOW - Lifetime Warranty!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411vUm-0CML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C8VJDUM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 16.49}}
{"item_id": "B00C8YXGB6", "title": "", "description": "“FRED” Flashing Roadside Emergency Disc LED Flare offers 10 different LED lighting modes to make sure it attracts attention whenever it is in use. Perfect for emergency use, camping/outdoors, road flares, marine applications, etc. Plus it is shatterproof, rainproof (IP55) and it can float so you can take it anywhere. 10 different LED lighting modes include spotlight (6 hours), double blink (9 hours), double pulse (9 hours), single blink (38 hours), rotate (9 hours), SOS rescue morse code (15 hours), alternate (9 hours), solid on high (5 hours), solid on low (28 hours) and 2 LED flashlight (9 hours). Easy to use: Just press the button and hold to turn on and cycle through the different lighting options. Requires 3 AAA batteries (included). Superior visibility: Super bright LED array can be seen up to 1 mile at night and can also provide additional protection during the day as well. Lateral illumination: 360 degree coverage is provided (a common weakness of other emergency lights). Attachable: Strong magnetic backing allows flare to adhere to your vehicle’s hood and other metal surfaces. Plus the extendable hook can be used to fasten to backpacks. Compact: The size is similar to a hockey puck, and they can be mounted or stored just about anywhere on your bike. Versatile: FRED Light units can be used for traffic control, as a warning light, as a rescue beacon, and for any other emergencies. They can also be used for recreational activities such as camping and hiking. Durable: can withstand weight of 10,000 pounds vehicle. Watertight: Used on rainy weather and marine applications. Non-reactive: Flares can be used in places where old fashioned flares would be dangerous, such as in dry brush or in the presence of gasoline.", "text": "“FRED” Flashing Roadside Emergency Disc LED Flare offers 10 different LED lighting modes to make sure it attracts attention whenever it is in use. Perfect for emergency use, camping/outdoors, road flares, marine applications, etc. Plus it is shatterproof, rainproof (IP55) and it can float so you can take it anywhere. 10 different LED lighting modes include spotlight (6 hours), double blink (9 hours), double pulse (9 hours), single blink (38 hours), rotate (9 hours), SOS rescue morse code (15 hours), alternate (9 hours), solid on high (5 hours), solid on low (28 hours) and 2 LED flashlight (9 hours). Easy to use: Just press the button and hold to turn on and cycle through the different lighting options. Requires 3 AAA batteries (included). Superior visibility: Super bright LED array can be seen up to 1 mile at night and can also provide additional protection during the day as well. Lateral illumination: 360 degree coverage is provided (a common weakness of other emergency lights). Attachable: Strong magnetic backing allows flare to adhere to your vehicle’s hood and other metal surfaces. Plus the extendable hook can be used to fasten to backpacks. Compact: The size is similar to a hockey puck, and they can be mounted or stored just about anywhere on your bike. Versatile: FRED Light units can be used for traffic control, as a warning light, as a rescue beacon, and for any other emergencies. They can also be used for recreational activities such as camping and hiking. Durable: can withstand weight of 10,000 pounds vehicle. Watertight: Used on rainy weather and marine applications. Non-reactive: Flares can be used in places where old fashioned flares would be dangerous, such as in dry brush or in the presence of gasoline.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mLDP1K2-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C8YXGB6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B00C9QGXAY", "title": "Liberty DuraPlug Uncorded Disposable Foam Earplug with 32 dB NRR, Orange (Case of 200 Pairs)", "description": "Liberty DuraPlug uncorded disposable foam earplug. Super-soft, slow-recovery tapered shape foam for easy insertion and removal. High visibility color plus bright color cord make compliance checks quick and easy. Low pressure, self-adjusting foam offers long wearing comfort and quick recovery time. Noise reduction rating (NRR): 32dB. Comply to ANSI S3.19. Orange color.", "text": "Liberty DuraPlug Uncorded Disposable Foam Earplug with 32 dB NRR, Orange (Case of 200 Pairs) Liberty DuraPlug uncorded disposable foam earplug. Super-soft, slow-recovery tapered shape foam for easy insertion and removal. High visibility color plus bright color cord make compliance checks quick and easy. Low pressure, self-adjusting foam offers long wearing comfort and quick recovery time. Noise reduction rating (NRR): 32dB. Comply to ANSI S3.19. Orange color.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dPeBM2ZzL._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00C9QGXAY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earplugs"]], "price": 18.77}}
