{"item_id": "B00CAV5ZG6", "title": "Fieldline Alpha OPS Daypack", "description": "From the Fieldline Tactical collection, take a look at the versatile Fieldline Alpha OPS Daypack. It features a large main compartment with zip mesh pockets, plus other compartments and pockets to help you organize your gear. This solid pack is a great choice for day hikes and is hydration-compatible.Velcro fastener closure name-tape and patch holders..Heavy duty padded handle..Fleece-lined sunglasses and digital media pouch with headphone port..Yoked shoulder strap system with adjustable sternum slider..Side compression straps to stabilize your gear..Dual grommeted bottom drain holes..Additional left and right side MOLLE attachment points..Size: 17.25\"H x 12.5\"W x 6.5\"D..Capacity: 1,400 cu. in..600 x 300 Denier polyester..Import..", "text": "Fieldline Alpha OPS Daypack From the Fieldline Tactical collection, take a look at the versatile Fieldline Alpha OPS Daypack. It features a large main compartment with zip mesh pockets, plus other compartments and pockets to help you organize your gear. This solid pack is a great choice for day hikes and is hydration-compatible.Velcro fastener closure name-tape and patch holders..Heavy duty padded handle..Fleece-lined sunglasses and digital media pouch with headphone port..Yoked shoulder strap system with adjustable sternum slider..Side compression straps to stabilize your gear..Dual grommeted bottom drain holes..Additional left and right side MOLLE attachment points..Size: 17.25\"H x 12.5\"W x 6.5\"D..Capacity: 1,400 cu. in..600 x 300 Denier polyester..Import..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41utkZPGLZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CAV5ZG6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fieldline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B00CB26NUQ", "title": "Emberlit- Ultra Light Titanium with Cross Bars", "description": "The EmberLit-UL (Ultralite) Stove. Weighing in at less than 5.45 oz, the Emberlit-UL stove caters to those who pay special attention to the weight of their gear. Made of pure titanium, the Emberlit-UL is just as strong and impervious to corrosion as it's stainless steel brother, but at half the weight. With use the individual panels that make up the EmberLit-UL may take on a slight warp. This is normal and doesn't affect the assembly or durability of the stove. Likewise it comes with a lifetime guarantee... you'll never wear this one out either. Despite the extra difficulty and expense of working with titanium this stove is PROUDLY Made in the USA! Material: Titanium. Weight: 5.45 oz (136 g). Panels: 4x5.5 Inches. Stove Height: 6 inches. Top of stove: 3.5x3.5 Inches. Packs flat: 1/8th of an inch. Fuel: Does not require you to carry any fuel. Includes: Cross Bars. Manufactuer: Merkwares. Warranty: Lifetime.", "text": "Emberlit- Ultra Light Titanium with Cross Bars The EmberLit-UL (Ultralite) Stove. Weighing in at less than 5.45 oz, the Emberlit-UL stove caters to those who pay special attention to the weight of their gear. Made of pure titanium, the Emberlit-UL is just as strong and impervious to corrosion as it's stainless steel brother, but at half the weight. With use the individual panels that make up the EmberLit-UL may take on a slight warp. This is normal and doesn't affect the assembly or durability of the stove. Likewise it comes with a lifetime guarantee... you'll never wear this one out either. Despite the extra difficulty and expense of working with titanium this stove is PROUDLY Made in the USA! Material: Titanium. Weight: 5.45 oz (136 g). Panels: 4x5.5 Inches. Stove Height: 6 inches. Top of stove: 3.5x3.5 Inches. Packs flat: 1/8th of an inch. Fuel: Does not require you to carry any fuel. Includes: Cross Bars. Manufactuer: Merkwares. Warranty: Lifetime.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G3CSRh6iL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CB26NUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emberlit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 84.75}}
{"item_id": "B00CB4UCW4", "title": "Tactical LED Flashlight: #1 Best Value, High-Lumen, ZOOM, Waterproof, Lifetime Warranty, Industrial Grade, FREE LAMP DIFFUSER & HOLSTER, 100,000 Hour CREE LED Torch, Strobe, 5-Mode with Memory, Compare to Others, Most Versatile Light Available!", "description": "After you buy the VZ230 here's what happens. First we email you a full-color user guide that details usage. After receiving theproduct, pop batteries in it and prepare to be amazed by its powerful beam. You'll wonder how so much power can be crammed into such a compact package. Then admire how the flashlight feels in your hand. Attach the diffuser and note how the focusedbeam now scatters about the room like a lantern. Experiment with the 5 modes and memory feature that remembers the last mode.Slide the light into the included holster and think how you'll use it to store or carry the light.What sets the VZ230 apart from competition, besides its enviable quality, is that it has zoom focusing, yet is still IPX7 waterproof.Most truly waterproof lights have a fixed focal length where one beam is forced to fit all applications. Would you buy a camera withoutzoom and expect it to take the best pictures in all situations?Because of the VZ230's brightness, quality, and features we can make a guarantee that's better than anything you've seen forflashlights. It's called our \"Better than Money Back Guarantee.\" The way it works is that you just try our flashlight for 60 days. Ifanywhere in that time you don't absolutely love the light, just let us know and we will refund your full payment. We are so confidentthat you will love the light like our other 5-star review customers.Also, don't forget that there's a Lifetime Warranty. Should anything ever go wrong, just contact us for a new one! You will be evenmore amazed at the customer service we provide after the sale! You have nothing to lose so ORDER NOW and consider buying anextra unit or two for your loved ones. There's a discount when you buy more than one.", "text": "Tactical LED Flashlight: #1 Best Value, High-Lumen, ZOOM, Waterproof, Lifetime Warranty, Industrial Grade, FREE LAMP DIFFUSER & HOLSTER, 100,000 Hour CREE LED Torch, Strobe, 5-Mode with Memory, Compare to Others, Most Versatile Light Available! After you buy the VZ230 here's what happens. First we email you a full-color user guide that details usage. After receiving theproduct, pop batteries in it and prepare to be amazed by its powerful beam. You'll wonder how so much power can be crammed into such a compact package. Then admire how the flashlight feels in your hand. Attach the diffuser and note how the focusedbeam now scatters about the room like a lantern. Experiment with the 5 modes and memory feature that remembers the last mode.Slide the light into the included holster and think how you'll use it to store or carry the light.What sets the VZ230 apart from competition, besides its enviable quality, is that it has zoom focusing, yet is still IPX7 waterproof.Most truly waterproof lights have a fixed focal length where one beam is forced to fit all applications. Would you buy a camera withoutzoom and expect it to take the best pictures in all situations?Because of the VZ230's brightness, quality, and features we can make a guarantee that's better than anything you've seen forflashlights. It's called our \"Better than Money Back Guarantee.\" The way it works is that you just try our flashlight for 60 days. Ifanywhere in that time you don't absolutely love the light, just let us know and we will refund your full payment. We are so confidentthat you will love the light like our other 5-star review customers.Also, don't forget that there's a Lifetime Warranty. Should anything ever go wrong, just contact us for a new one! You will be evenmore amazed at the customer service we provide after the sale! You have nothing to lose so ORDER NOW and consider buying anextra unit or two for your loved ones. There's a discount when you buy more than one.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5188TbCMDcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CB4UCW4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 39.97}}
