{"item_id": "B00CBM5FAA", "title": "Brass Stacker RSR22GRA Guide Rod Recoil Spring Assembly for Ruger SR22 Pistols, Black", "description": "Quality aftermarket CNC machined solid stainless steel single stage guide rod recoil spring assembly (RSA) for Ruger SR 22 pistols. The completely assembled \"Drop In\" unit includes round wire recoil spring (at factory spring weight) with a black anodized aluminum button head cap screw and brass washer. Guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the recoil spring has a one year replacement warranty. Both are made in America.", "text": "Brass Stacker RSR22GRA Guide Rod Recoil Spring Assembly for Ruger SR22 Pistols, Black Quality aftermarket CNC machined solid stainless steel single stage guide rod recoil spring assembly (RSA) for Ruger SR 22 pistols. The completely assembled \"Drop In\" unit includes round wire recoil spring (at factory spring weight) with a black anodized aluminum button head cap screw and brass washer. Guide rod has a 100% lifetime warranty and the recoil spring has a one year replacement warranty. Both are made in America.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GlHp77G8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CBM5FAA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B00CBN11AM", "title": "5 Position Shotgun Barrel Mount", "description": "This multi position shotgun barrel mount measures 1\" in diameter/25mm. It has 5 different picatinny attachments, one on the left, right, top, and 45* to the left and 45* to the right.", "text": "5 Position Shotgun Barrel Mount This multi position shotgun barrel mount measures 1\" in diameter/25mm. It has 5 different picatinny attachments, one on the left, right, top, and 45* to the left and 45* to the right.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417Ir6WpFpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CBN11AM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Field Sport Inc", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 14.75}}
