{"item_id": "B00CBRV5JA", "title": "MTECH USA MT-673 Fixed Stainless Steel Blade", "description": "Don't miss out this G-10 handle neck knife. It features stone wash finish and raised palm support provides extra comfort. It is easy to carry around. 5\" overall in length and includes kydex sheath.", "text": "MTECH USA MT-673 Fixed Stainless Steel Blade Don't miss out this G-10 handle neck knife. It features stone wash finish and raised palm support provides extra comfort. It is easy to carry around. 5\" overall in length and includes kydex sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KGkoBsHRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CBRV5JA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mtech USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00CBT17IW", "title": "Gorilla Fitness Push up bar - Best metal pushup stands on the market. Comfortable grips on the handles allow a full range of motion. These sturdy, well built steel push up bars are a solid piece of equipment superior to pvc or plastic.", "description": "They laughed when I did push ups at the office, until we went to the beach!Are you looking for a great workout that you can do anywhere? Push ups have always been a favorite core exercise for fitness buffs. Unfortunately, a regular push up only allows a limited range of motion and the stress that is placed on your wrists can keep you from using push ups in your workout.With Gorilla Fitness Push Up Bars, the stress is relieved from your wrists because you are holding the bars with your wrists in line with your arms. They also offer a much more challenging workout because of the greater range of motion that they provide. These bars are made of high strength steel and have non-slip feet. The hand grips are lined with highly durable foam and the frames collapse for convenience.Here's some of the benefits:-a compact light weight push up bar that travels with you wherever you go-a safe and sturdy pushup platform-a challenging workout that you can do anywhere without having to go to the gym-relieves stress on your wrists-won't slip on non-carpeted surfaces-easily stored out of the way when not in useOur stands are fabricated to the highest standards and inspected for defects before they are packaged to ensure that you have the highest quality push up bar now and for years to come. When you buy a set of Gorilla Fitness Push Up Bars today, you get a rock solid pair of push up stands backed with aone year customer satisfaction guarantee.That's right, you have one whole year to decide if you like these bars and if not, we will refund your money, no questions asked!To get your set of Gorilla Fitness Push Up Bars, go to the top of the screen and Click on the yellow \"add to cart\" button right 