{"item_id": "B00CBTIRWQ", "title": "Resistance Band Set, Door Anchor, Ankle Strap, Multiple Handles - Legs, Abs, Crossfit, Weight loss or even Hard Core Body Building - Perfect for Home or Travel Gym - Lifetime Guarantee from Wailea Fitness", "description": "Look at yourself - look at your co-workers, your spouse, your kids, your neighbors.Do you have the body you want to have - are you in the physical condition you want to be in? Summer is around the corner, they can't hide under bulky sweaters and winter coats any more, nor can you.The time for changing your life, your marriage, your career is slipping away everyday you wait.You are not the only one - the reasons for letting fitness slip in our lives is simple. I know I did not want to join an expensive gym, spend more time commuting there then I could even workout, and then exercise with the others who started before me.If you are ready to make a difference in your life and invest the 15 minutes to do the workouts then the Wailea Fitness(TM) Resistance Band set can get you there safely, privately and without destroying your pocketbook.Our resistance band technology replicates the forces of gravity on the heavy iron weights, and allows you to perform over 100 exercises from professional gym machines, as well as all the exercises you can perform with free weights. However our resistance bands have no mass and no momentum. It is these forces that create the physical injuries that occur and often derail most people starting a fitness regime.Imagine being able replicate every machine in the gym, plus crossfit, P90X(tm), ab ripper, any aerobic and anaerobic workout in the privacy and convenient location of your choice.What's in the box?*Two Cushioned foam handles *Door anchor *Carrying bag *Two Ankle strap *Starter guide *Five bands of varying resistance: Yellow = 2-to-4 pounds Blue = 4-to-6 pounds Green = 10-to-12 pounds Black = 15-to-20 pounds Red = 25-to-30 pounds *Body Fat Tester to track your SuccessAfter you order and you put in the 15 minutes a day - we can guarantee you will see results in 6 weeks.", "text": "Resistance Band Set, Door Anchor, Ankle Strap, Multiple Handles - Legs, Abs, Crossfit, Weight loss or even Hard Core Body Building - Perfect for Home or Travel Gym - Lifetime Guarantee from Wailea Fitness Look at yourself - look at your co-workers, your spouse, your kids, your neighbors.Do you have the body you want to have - are you in the physical condition you want to be in? Summer is around the corner, they can't hide under bulky sweaters and winter coats any more, nor can you.The time for changing your life, your marriage, your career is slipping away everyday you wait.You are not the only one - the reasons for letting fitness slip in our lives is simple. I know I did not want to join an expensive gym, spend more time commuting there then I could even workout, and then exercise with the others who started before me.If you are ready to make a difference in your life and invest the 15 minutes to do the workouts then the Wailea Fitness(TM) Resistance Band set can get you there safely, privately and without destroying your pocketbook.Our resistance band technology replicates the forces of gravity on the heavy iron weights, and allows you to perform over 100 exercises from professional gym machines, as well as all the exercises you can perform with free weights. However our resistance bands have no mass and no momentum. It is these forces that create the physical injuries that occur and often derail most people starting a fitness regime.Imagine being able replicate every machine in the gym, plus crossfit, P90X(tm), ab ripper, any aerobic and anaerobic workout in the privacy and convenient location of your choice.What's in the box?*Two Cushioned foam handles *Door anchor *Carrying bag *Two Ankle strap *Starter guide *Five bands of varying resistance: Yellow = 2-to-4 pounds Blue = 4-to-6 pounds Green = 10-to-12 pounds Black = 15-to-20 pounds Red = 25-to-30 pounds *Body Fat Tester to track your SuccessAfter you order and you put in the 15 minutes a day - we can guarantee you will see results in 6 weeks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51s2sbRA3AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CBTIRWQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B00CBTRMZ4", "title": "NOCO Genius GENM2 8 Amp 2-Bank Waterproof Smart On-Board Battery Charger", "description": "GEN Mini On-Board Smart Battery Chargers are rugged and compact waterproof chargers for 12 volts lead-acid batteries. They can be mounted onto virtually any vehicle, like a boat, car, tractor, or RV. Safe to leave connected indefinitely, the GEN Mini interactively diagnoses, recovers, and charges wet, gel, MF and AGM batteries from 20-120 ampere hour and maintains all battery sizes. The GEN Mini is a smart battery charging solution for rugged environments, and includes multiple innovative features, such as 100 percent waterproof design, automatically recovers sulfated batteries, charges multiple battery chemistries, designed for user safety, protects against abnormal conditions, small, compact design, optimizes a battery's specific gravity, charges 2X faster than traditional chargers, works with varying AV voltages, and ignition protected. GEN Mini On-Board Smart Battery Chargers are rated at IP68, ETL approved for United States and Canada, and comes with a 5 year limited warranty.", "text": "NOCO Genius GENM2 8 Amp 2-Bank Waterproof Smart On-Board Battery Charger GEN Mini On-Board Smart Battery Chargers are rugged and compact waterproof chargers for 12 volts lead-acid batteries. They can be mounted onto virtually any vehicle, like a boat, car, tractor, or RV. Safe to leave connected indefinitely, the GEN Mini interactively diagnoses, recovers, and charges wet, gel, MF and AGM batteries from 20-120 ampere hour and maintains all battery sizes. The GEN Mini is a smart battery charging solution for rugged environments, and includes multiple innovative features, such as 100 percent waterproof design, automatically recovers sulfated batteries, charges multiple battery chemistries, designed for user safety, protects against abnormal conditions, small, compact design, optimizes a battery's specific gravity, charges 2X faster than traditional chargers, works with varying AV voltages, and ignition protected. GEN Mini On-Board Smart Battery Chargers are rated at IP68, ETL approved for United States and Canada, and comes with a 5 year limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UilgS2ToL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CBTRMZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NOCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Electrical Equipment", "Battery Chargers"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B00CBUHFNW", "title": "Outdoor Pocket Micro Stove EDCBox", "description": "The world's smallest hobo stove - fits in a wallet! Super small - pack size 4,7 x 6,5 cm, only 77 grams, still a fully functional hobo stove. Can be used with wood, other organic material, Esbit, alcohol burner or a tea candle. A perfect gift for real men (and women!). Has been used by our customers as EDC emergency stove, penholder, stylish teapot warmer and atmospheric Bushcraft tea candle lamp. Each part has a hole for a carabiner. Made in Germany from 100% stainless steel.", "text": "Outdoor Pocket Micro Stove EDCBox The world's smallest hobo stove - fits in a wallet! Super small - pack size 4,7 x 6,5 cm, only 77 grams, still a fully functional hobo stove. Can be used with wood, other organic material, Esbit, alcohol burner or a tea candle. A perfect gift for real men (and women!). Has been used by our customers as EDC emergency stove, penholder, stylish teapot warmer and atmospheric Bushcraft tea candle lamp. Each part has a hole for a carabiner. Made in Germany from 100% stainless steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GD40arcgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CBUHFNW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushcraft Essentials", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 19.9}}
