{"item_id": "B00CCDDVQI", "title": "Calf Compression Sleeve (1 Pair) - Best to Guard Against Shin Splints - Men's and Women's Black Compression Leg Sleeves for Running, Jogging, Walking, Marathon and Fitness Athletes - Comfortable, Breathable, Good Circulation for Travel - Great Reviews", "description": "Looking for comfortable, fitting, and breathable Calf Compression Sleeves?Tired of suffering from shin splints?- Complete your runs or workouts without injury- Snug fit and won't slip from your calves- Promotes blood circulationHow Else Does CompressionZ Calf Sleeves Help You- Faster and easier recovery after your workout, as increase in oxygen helps remove lactic acid- More effective warm up as your muscles get warmed faster due to increasing blood flow to your calves- Improve your performance with better muscle support and muscle efficiency- Breathable and comfortable as we use anti itch material- Promotes blood circulation for travel, and helps to reduce swelling of calf and ankles- Retains shape even after multiple washes- Anti bacterial material to reduce odorWho Is This Suitable For- Runners- Joggers- Walkers- Athletes- Cyclists- Triathletes- Field Sports- Office workers- Travelers on plane / long distance travelComes in a Pair (2 individual sleeves)Order Now as price will increase once the initial stock runs out!", "text": "Calf Compression Sleeve (1 Pair) - Best to Guard Against Shin Splints - Men's and Women's Black Compression Leg Sleeves for Running, Jogging, Walking, Marathon and Fitness Athletes - Comfortable, Breathable, Good Circulation for Travel - Great Reviews Looking for comfortable, fitting, and breathable Calf Compression Sleeves?Tired of suffering from shin splints?- Complete your runs or workouts without injury- Snug fit and won't slip from your calves- Promotes blood circulationHow Else Does CompressionZ Calf Sleeves Help You- Faster and easier recovery after your workout, as increase in oxygen helps remove lactic acid- More effective warm up as your muscles get warmed faster due to increasing blood flow to your calves- Improve your performance with better muscle support and muscle efficiency- Breathable and comfortable as we use anti itch material- Promotes blood circulation for travel, and helps to reduce swelling of calf and ankles- Retains shape even after multiple washes- Anti bacterial material to reduce odorWho Is This Suitable For- Runners- Joggers- Walkers- Athletes- Cyclists- Triathletes- Field Sports- Office workers- Travelers on plane / long distance travelComes in a Pair (2 individual sleeves)Order Now as price will increase once the initial stock runs out!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XExXoa1FL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CCDDVQI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Girls", "Tights & Leggings"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00CCR7A7U", "title": "Military Ammo Cans - Made to store 5.56mm & 50cal Ammo - 11\"L x 5.5\"W x 7\"D", "description": "These genuine military surplus 50cal cans are great for storage. They have a rubber seal on the lid that makes them virtually air tight and highly water resistant. Ammo cans make great tool boxes or use them for their original use, storing ammo! 50 cal. cans measure 11\"L x 5 1/2\"W x 7\"D on the inside. Cans are olive drab green. USED AMMO CANS.", "text": "Military Ammo Cans - Made to store 5.56mm & 50cal Ammo - 11\"L x 5.5\"W x 7\"D These genuine military surplus 50cal cans are great for storage. They have a rubber seal on the lid that makes them virtually air tight and highly water resistant. Ammo cans make great tool boxes or use them for their original use, storing ammo! 50 cal. cans measure 11\"L x 5 1/2\"W x 7\"D on the inside. Cans are olive drab green. USED AMMO CANS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FN1cUVYeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CCR7A7U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 28.88}}
