{"item_id": "B00CDWBRLO", "title": "Outbags OB-10TAC Nylon Tactical Drop Leg Holster for Colt Python 6\", Colt Trooper 6\", Dan Wesson 357 6\", Ruger 357 6\", Ruger Blackhawk 6\", Ruger GP100 6\", Ruger Security Six 6\", S&W 357 6\", S&W 66 6\", S&W 686 6\", Taurus 357 6\", Taurus 44 6\", Taurus 608 6\", Taurus 66 6\", Taurus Tracker 992 6.5\",", "description": "The OutBags Tactical Leg Holster is designed and manufactured to fit an active lifestyle and application. The Tactical Leg Holster comes standard with a rugged belt strap and double thigh straps. The thigh straps have been specialized with neoprene additions to decrease the risk of the holster twisting on the user's leg. The OutBags Tactical Leg Holster is unlike any other; it features a secondary safety harness which ensures your firearm is with you at all times- no matter how hard you run, jump, etc. Recommended fit: Colt Python 6\", Colt Trooper 6\", Dan Wesson 357 6\", Ruger 357 6\", Ruger Blackhawk 6\", Ruger GP100 6\", Ruger Security Six 6\", S&W; 357 6\", S&W; 66 6\", S&W; 686 6\", Taurus 357 6\", Taurus 44 6\", Taurus 608 6\", Taurus 66 6\", Taurus Tracker 992 6.5\",", "text": "Outbags OB-10TAC Nylon Tactical Drop Leg Holster for Colt Python 6\", Colt Trooper 6\", Dan Wesson 357 6\", Ruger 357 6\", Ruger Blackhawk 6\", Ruger GP100 6\", Ruger Security Six 6\", S&W 357 6\", S&W 66 6\", S&W 686 6\", Taurus 357 6\", Taurus 44 6\", Taurus 608 6\", Taurus 66 6\", Taurus Tracker 992 6.5\", The OutBags Tactical Leg Holster is designed and manufactured to fit an active lifestyle and application. The Tactical Leg Holster comes standard with a rugged belt strap and double thigh straps. The thigh straps have been specialized with neoprene additions to decrease the risk of the holster twisting on the user's leg. The OutBags Tactical Leg Holster is unlike any other; it features a secondary safety harness which ensures your firearm is with you at all times- no matter how hard you run, jump, etc. Recommended fit: Colt Python 6\", Colt Trooper 6\", Dan Wesson 357 6\", Ruger 357 6\", Ruger Blackhawk 6\", Ruger GP100 6\", Ruger Security Six 6\", S&W; 357 6\", S&W; 66 6\", S&W; 686 6\", Taurus 357 6\", Taurus 44 6\", Taurus 608 6\", Taurus 66 6\", Taurus Tracker 992 6.5\",", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lbfddR5rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CDWBRLO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B00CDZWU1C", "title": "Personal Water Filter Straw Includes FREE Re-Sealable Emergency Canteen and Carry Case - Portable for Wilderness Camping & Survival Equipment Packs - Best Emergency Tool Disaster Kit - Camping Water Filters - Water Filter for Purification of Water & Filtration of Water Treatment System for drinking water - No Hassle Guarantee - FREE SHIPPING WITH TWO OR MORE FILTER STRAWS", "description": "In an Emergency, Drink From Any Kind of Bad Water & Stay Safe.Filters or Kills Water Contaminants!When you least expect it you can be stuck without access to clean water & you will be glad you were prepared.Features & Benefits* NEW - Includes Re-Sealable Emergency Water Canteen - 1L/1Qt Capacity* Ultra Light Weight 1.6 Oz & Easy to Carry* Advanced 6 Stage Filter Technology* Easy Back-Flush Cleaning to Extend Filter Life* FREE Waterproof Carry Case - a $5.49 Value* Product is sealed in package for your protection* Perfect for Camping, Hiking, Backpacking, Emergency, Prepping, Survival, BOB, Mission Trips or simply on Vacation!Our powerful advantage is the use of Iodinated Resin to purify your water. The Proprietary Technology protects your family from water borne illnesses and doesn't rely on just the filtering alone, the Iodinated Resin actually Kills the Bacteria. Then the iodine is also removed in the 2nd stage of the filter.The Back-Flush Kit cleans out the micro sized pores to allow the filter to continue working long after other filter straws would clog.Additional Features* Removes Chlorine, Iodine, Heavy Metals, VOC, Industrial Pollutants, Agricultural Runoff, Chemicals & Trace Pharmaceuticals* EPA Approved Iodinated Resin (Proprietary Technology) Kills Bacteria & Virus (Giardia & Cryptosporidium)* 6 Stages of Filtering Including Ionic Absorption of particles to 2 Microns* Straw Life: 200+ gals when filtering Inorganic & Organic particles in clear water, 25+ gals in Turbid or Stagnant Water* FDA Food Grade BPA Free Plastic* Made in USA to ISO StandardsYour Quality Guarantee -The ONLY Filter Straw Backed by a No-Hassle Guarantee!Click the \"Add To Cart Button\" Now to protect you & your loved ones NOW!", "text": "Personal Water Filter Straw Includes FREE Re-Sealable Emergency Canteen and Carry Case - Portable for Wilderness Camping & Survival Equipment Packs - Best Emergency Tool Disaster Kit - Camping Water Filters - Water Filter for Purification of Water & Filtration of Water Treatment System for drinking water - No Hassle Guarantee - FREE SHIPPING WITH TWO OR MORE FILTER STRAWS In an Emergency, Drink From Any Kind of Bad Water & Stay Safe.Filters or Kills Water Contaminants!When you least expect it you can be stuck without access to clean water & you will be glad you were prepared.Features & Benefits* NEW - Includes Re-Sealable Emergency Water Canteen - 1L/1Qt Capacity* Ultra Light Weight 1.6 Oz & Easy to Carry* Advanced 6 Stage Filter Technology* Easy Back-Flush Cleaning to Extend Filter Life* FREE Waterproof Carry Case - a $5.49 Value* Product is sealed in package for your protection* Perfect for Camping, Hiking, Backpacking, Emergency, Prepping, Survival, BOB, Mission Trips or simply on Vacation!Our powerful advantage is the use of Iodinated Resin to purify your water. The Proprietary Technology protects your family from water borne illnesses and doesn't rely on just the filtering alone, the Iodinated Resin actually Kills the Bacteria. Then the iodine is also removed in the 2nd stage of the filter.The Back-Flush Kit cleans out the micro sized pores to allow the filter to continue working long after other filter straws would clog.Additional Features* Removes Chlorine, Iodine, Heavy Metals, VOC, Industrial Pollutants, Agricultural Runoff, Chemicals & Trace Pharmaceuticals* EPA Approved Iodinated Resin (Proprietary Technology) Kills Bacteria & Virus (Giardia & Cryptosporidium)* 6 Stages of Filtering Including Ionic Absorption of particles to 2 Microns* Straw Life: 200+ gals when filtering Inorganic & Organic particles in clear water, 25+ gals in Turbid or Stagnant Water* FDA Food Grade BPA Free Plastic* Made in USA to ISO StandardsYour Quality Guarantee -The ONLY Filter Straw Backed by a No-Hassle Guarantee!Click the \"Add To Cart Button\" Now to protect you & your loved ones NOW!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51twNk-vgKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CDZWU1C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 19.49}}
{"item_id": "B00CEFY8YS", "title": "10/22 Kidd Bolt Buffer (2)", "description": "This 10-22 accessory is a must have! This inexpensive upgrade is a great addition to your Ruger 10-22 rifle. The Viton tubing covering the steel dowel pin: Eliminates \"Bolt-Battering\" of the receiver Dampens cycling vibrations Installation instructions: To install the buffer into a receiver after the cocking handle and bolt are installed. First install the Viton tubing beginning from the center and guiding it through the right and left side. Then thread/push the dowel pin through the center of the tubing. Packaging includes 2 buffers", "text": "10/22 Kidd Bolt Buffer (2) This 10-22 accessory is a must have! This inexpensive upgrade is a great addition to your Ruger 10-22 rifle. The Viton tubing covering the steel dowel pin: Eliminates \"Bolt-Battering\" of the receiver Dampens cycling vibrations Installation instructions: To install the buffer into a receiver after the cocking handle and bolt are installed. First install the Viton tubing beginning from the center and guiding it through the right and left side. Then thread/push the dowel pin through the center of the tubing. Packaging includes 2 buffers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kvEgMlvQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CEFY8YS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 13.0}}
