{"item_id": "B00CF1AIM2", "title": "Bencore COYOTE Ventec Tactical Goggle - Life-Time Warranty", "description": "These Bencore Tactical goggles are the only Goggles Guaranteed to last a life time without shattering. The Lenses are Specially Designed Poly Carbonate Lenses. Not All Poly Carbonate lenses are shatterproof, Which is why Bencore Quality Control Team had these Goggles tested by the US Dept. of Food Drug and Cosmetics Assuring the product is both Shatter Proof and to full standards of UV 400. The product also features a Padded Frame so it wont hurt your eyes or face from excessive use or shock. The goggles also feature a 1\" Adjustable & Stretchable strap to ensure a proper fit at all times that will not slide or slip. The lenses are Smoke Grey, Polycarbon Lightweight Heavy Duty lenses, They are coated with anti Scratch so as not to harm vision even after repeated strikes by paintballs or other airsoft weapons. This product also features a unique Anti-Fog Lens, to ensure 100% visibility in almost any Climate", "text": "Bencore COYOTE Ventec Tactical Goggle - Life-Time Warranty These Bencore Tactical goggles are the only Goggles Guaranteed to last a life time without shattering. The Lenses are Specially Designed Poly Carbonate Lenses. Not All Poly Carbonate lenses are shatterproof, Which is why Bencore Quality Control Team had these Goggles tested by the US Dept. of Food Drug and Cosmetics Assuring the product is both Shatter Proof and to full standards of UV 400. The product also features a Padded Frame so it wont hurt your eyes or face from excessive use or shock. The goggles also feature a 1\" Adjustable & Stretchable strap to ensure a proper fit at all times that will not slide or slip. The lenses are Smoke Grey, Polycarbon Lightweight Heavy Duty lenses, They are coated with anti Scratch so as not to harm vision even after repeated strikes by paintballs or other airsoft weapons. This product also features a unique Anti-Fog Lens, to ensure 100% visibility in almost any Climate", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31OrdgtlILL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CF1AIM2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B00CF3GUE0", "title": "10/22 Kidd Magazine Lever Interchangeable for Ruger 1022 Black", "description": "The KIDD Interchangeable Magazine Release system for the Ruger geometry trigger is a three part set. It includes the magazine release, the speed lever, and the extended lever. This replacement for the standard factory magazine release allows you to go quickly from the extended release lever to the long and sleek speed lever with a turn of a set screw in your 10/22 rifle. Allowing a shooter to easily adapt the rifle from varmint hunting to competitive shooting without taking it apart. Made from 6061 T6 aluminum all pieces are sculpted from billet and then anodized with a protective coating.", "text": "10/22 Kidd Magazine Lever Interchangeable for Ruger 1022 Black The KIDD Interchangeable Magazine Release system for the Ruger geometry trigger is a three part set. It includes the magazine release, the speed lever, and the extended lever. This replacement for the standard factory magazine release allows you to go quickly from the extended release lever to the long and sleek speed lever with a turn of a set screw in your 10/22 rifle. Allowing a shooter to easily adapt the rifle from varmint hunting to competitive shooting without taking it apart. Made from 6061 T6 aluminum all pieces are sculpted from billet and then anodized with a protective coating.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417iW8WaXcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CF3GUE0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 37.95}}
{"item_id": "B00CF40J6E", "title": "Resistance Bands - Exercise Bands for Ankles, Legs, Arms, Shoulders and Core Exercises - Great Workout Bands for Women or Men - Effective Fitness Equipment for Abs - Heavy, Medium and Light Resistance Set for Your Home Gym - Recommended Physical Therapy Bands for Rehab - Good for Upper Body Workout or Brazil Butt Lift - Enhance Your Fitness Training Today - 100% Natural Latex Loops - Protect Your Investment - Lifetime Guarantee", "description": "The Secret of Low-Impact Muscle Toning and SculptingGreat for Anyone from Beginners to Serious Athletes- Excellent for toning legs and hips- Perfect for gentle rehab and physical therapy- Vary your current weightlifting or other training programAdd Strength and Flexibility Without Bulky EquipmentTake SLEEK-TONE loop bands anywhere and have great workouts no matter how small the space or how cramped the hotel room.Easy to use and feel the benefits quickly- 3 colorful elastic loop bands are conveniently labeled with level of resistance: Light, Medium, or Heavy- Made of durable, high-quality latex- Lightweight, portable and strong- Bonus instructional pamphlet included (while supplies last) with illustrated exercises to get you startedBacked by a Lifetime No-Hassle and Free Replacement GuaranteeClick the Button at the Top of this Page to Start Sleeking Down and Toning up with SLEEK-TONE Resistance Loop Bands!", "text": "Resistance Bands - Exercise Bands for Ankles, Legs, Arms, Shoulders and Core Exercises - Great Workout Bands for Women or Men - Effective Fitness Equipment for Abs - Heavy, Medium and Light Resistance Set for Your Home Gym - Recommended Physical Therapy Bands for Rehab - Good for Upper Body Workout or Brazil Butt Lift - Enhance Your Fitness Training Today - 100% Natural Latex Loops - Protect Your Investment - Lifetime Guarantee The Secret of Low-Impact Muscle Toning and SculptingGreat for Anyone from Beginners to Serious Athletes- Excellent for toning legs and hips- Perfect for gentle rehab and physical therapy- Vary your current weightlifting or other training programAdd Strength and Flexibility Without Bulky EquipmentTake SLEEK-TONE loop bands anywhere and have great workouts no matter how small the space or how cramped the hotel room.Easy to use and feel the benefits quickly- 3 colorful elastic loop bands are conveniently labeled with level of resistance: Light, Medium, or Heavy- Made of durable, high-quality latex- Lightweight, portable and strong- Bonus instructional pamphlet included (while supplies last) with illustrated exercises to get you startedBacked by a Lifetime No-Hassle and Free Replacement GuaranteeClick the Button at the Top of this Page to Start Sleeking Down and Toning up with SLEEK-TONE Resistance Loop Bands!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x9W7XrqcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CF40J6E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00CF4IKUG", "title": "Lock-Jaw Elite Olympic Barbell Collar", "description": "Lock-Jaw Elite 2\" / 50mm Olympic Barbell Collar, Weight: 18 ounces / set Your best choice for the most extreme bumper plate workouts and competition, the Lock-Jaw Elite Barbell Collar is made of a hybrid steel & proprietary thermoset polymer resin. USE : CrossFit Competition, Intense Bumper Plate Workouts The Lock-Jaw Elite Barbell Collar features an easy-to-use design and has been enhanced through a patent pending hybrid steel skeleton. This collar has achieved the goal of the strength of steel and the convenience of resin. The Lock-Jaw Elite Barbell Collar is the best choice for bumper plate workouts, competition, or other extreme environments. SPECIFICATIONS WEIGHT 18.0 Ounces (0.5 kg per set) DIMENSIONS 3.0\" H x 3.5\" W x 2.0\" D MATERIAL Proprietary Polymer, Rubber & Steel COLOR Silver U.S. PATENT #7,513,856 MFG WARRANTY 1-Year MASTER CARTON 32 Sets", "text": "Lock-Jaw Elite Olympic Barbell Collar Lock-Jaw Elite 2\" / 50mm Olympic Barbell Collar, Weight: 18 ounces / set Your best choice for the most extreme bumper plate workouts and competition, the Lock-Jaw Elite Barbell Collar is made of a hybrid steel & proprietary thermoset polymer resin. USE : CrossFit Competition, Intense Bumper Plate Workouts The Lock-Jaw Elite Barbell Collar features an easy-to-use design and has been enhanced through a patent pending hybrid steel skeleton. This collar has achieved the goal of the strength of steel and the convenience of resin. The Lock-Jaw Elite Barbell Collar is the best choice for bumper plate workouts, competition, or other extreme environments. SPECIFICATIONS WEIGHT 18.0 Ounces (0.5 kg per set) DIMENSIONS 3.0\" H x 3.5\" W x 2.0\" D MATERIAL Proprietary Polymer, Rubber & Steel COLOR Silver U.S. PATENT #7,513,856 MFG WARRANTY 1-Year MASTER CARTON 32 Sets", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Rys7pS%2BYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CF4IKUG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lockjaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Collars"]], "price": 37.98}}
{"item_id": "B00CFPISZW", "title": "Kovea LPG Adaptor, Small, Silver", "description": "The Kovea LPG adapter allows bigger propane canisters to be used with Kovea products. Designed to be a small attachment to your canister, this adapter is perfect for those with extra propane gases.", "text": "Kovea LPG Adaptor, Small, Silver The Kovea LPG adapter allows bigger propane canisters to be used with Kovea products. Designed to be a small attachment to your canister, this adapter is perfect for those with extra propane gases.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jpR5h%2BgsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CFPISZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kovea", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B00CFPIT06", "title": "Kovea Dual Stove Adaptor, Small, Silver", "description": "Specially developed by Kovea, the Dual Adaptor allows conversion between screw type and nozzle type butane canisters. This conveniently reduces the hassle of looking for the correct canister.", "text": "Kovea Dual Stove Adaptor, Small, Silver Specially developed by Kovea, the Dual Adaptor allows conversion between screw type and nozzle type butane canisters. This conveniently reduces the hassle of looking for the correct canister.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4116nH2PpdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CFPIT06.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories"]], "price": 9.9}}
{"item_id": "B00CFRB9SS", "title": "M-Tech Law Enforcement Grey Spring Assisted Folder Pocket Knife", "description": "The unique design folding knife in stainless steel. The handle's shape settles the index finger on the underside, suitable for use. Blade style is a drop point in 440 stainless steel, making it harder, higher on the Rockwell scale and in turn extending the amount of time for it to stay sharp. Right thumb study give fast opening, and the linerlock release allows easy one-hand closing.", "text": "M-Tech Law Enforcement Grey Spring Assisted Folder Pocket Knife The unique design folding knife in stainless steel. The handle's shape settles the index finger on the underside, suitable for use. Blade style is a drop point in 440 stainless steel, making it harder, higher on the Rockwell scale and in turn extending the amount of time for it to stay sharp. Right thumb study give fast opening, and the linerlock release allows easy one-hand closing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DQd%2BWTpFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CFRB9SS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00CFRITZY", "title": "Infidel Ultra 1.5\"", "description": "Combining the supreme wearability of the Minotaur MTAC with the simplicity and convenience of The Infidel. The Infidel Ultra brings the best of both worlds into one compact holster, giving you the comfort and modular construction of the Minotaur MTAC with the versatile and streamlined attachment of the Infidel. Perfect for the individual that needs to safely take their weapon off and on throughout the course of the day, but who still craves the comfort of the Minotaur MTAC.", "text": "Infidel Ultra 1.5\" Combining the supreme wearability of the Minotaur MTAC with the simplicity and convenience of The Infidel. The Infidel Ultra brings the best of both worlds into one compact holster, giving you the comfort and modular construction of the Minotaur MTAC with the versatile and streamlined attachment of the Infidel. Perfect for the individual that needs to safely take their weapon off and on throughout the course of the day, but who still craves the comfort of the Minotaur MTAC.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AW9Ud%2BcVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CFRITZY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 88.0}}
{"item_id": "B00CFX38DG", "title": "Classic Enlan EL-01A Bee EL-01A Folding Knife G10 Handle One Hand Open Camping Tool Gift", "description": "Enlan EL-01A Blade: 8Cr13MoV (58HRC) stainless steel Handle: Black G10+Stainless Steel; Removable Money clip; Lanyard Hole Whole length: 211mm Blade's length: 93mm Lock: Liner Lock Net Weight: 155g", "text": "Classic Enlan EL-01A Bee EL-01A Folding Knife G10 Handle One Hand Open Camping Tool Gift Enlan EL-01A Blade: 8Cr13MoV (58HRC) stainless steel Handle: Black G10+Stainless Steel; Removable Money clip; Lanyard Hole Whole length: 211mm Blade's length: 93mm Lock: Liner Lock Net Weight: 155g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rx594S7iL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CFX38DG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B00CG2KXPC", "title": "Bald Eagle BE1095 Brass Jag .22 Caliber", "description": "Used in conjunction with cleaning patches, Brass Jags provide more contact area inside the barrel for the most efficient bore cleaning possible. More contact area also means less patches are needed to clean and protect. Softer brass will not damage steel barrels.", "text": "Bald Eagle BE1095 Brass Jag .22 Caliber Used in conjunction with cleaning patches, Brass Jags provide more contact area inside the barrel for the most efficient bore cleaning possible. More contact area also means less patches are needed to clean and protect. Softer brass will not damage steel barrels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318AS3gbVzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CG2KXPC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Jags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00CG672RA", "title": "Stanley Adventure Stainless Steel Flask", "description": "This basic stainless steel flask is the perfect piece to take tailgating, camping, or just to use when celebrating. It's rugged exterior makes it the perfect accessory. Holds a full 8 ounces of your favorite beverage.", "text": "Stanley Adventure Stainless Steel Flask This basic stainless steel flask is the perfect piece to take tailgating, camping, or just to use when celebrating. It's rugged exterior makes it the perfect accessory. Holds a full 8 ounces of your favorite beverage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41slJ-ZBs2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CG672RA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Stanley", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 19.07}}
{"item_id": "B00CGIC0ZM", "title": "Ganzo G704 Folding Knife Camping Knife Hunting Knife Axis Lock EDC Pocket Knife w/G10 Handle", "description": "Overall Length: 7.87\"Closed Length: 4.48\"Thickness with Clip: 0.732\"Thickness without Clip: 0.553\"Blade Length: 3.35\"Blade Thickness: 0.152\"Blade Material: 440CHandle Material: G10Locking Mechanism: AxisNet Weight: 4.76 ozHistory of GANZOGanzo Hardware is devoted to create multi-tools, knives and kitchen utensils. We provide both ready-made unique tools and custom-made high performance products. With our humanized design and high quality tools, we are confident to earn trust from all our customers.Since founded more than 20 years ago, we put all our efforts on produce high quality multi- functional tools. We have professional developing team and have already invented thousands of new style tools which obtained more than hundreds of national patents. Ganzo is a high-end brand as well as designated manufacturer of American Special Forces. The products are mainly exported to America, France, Germany, Italy, Spain, Switzerland, Australia, New Zealand and other 26 countries.", "text": "Ganzo G704 Folding Knife Camping Knife Hunting Knife Axis Lock EDC Pocket Knife w/G10 Handle Overall Length: 7.87\"Closed Length: 4.48\"Thickness with Clip: 0.732\"Thickness without Clip: 0.553\"Blade Length: 3.35\"Blade Thickness: 0.152\"Blade Material: 440CHandle Material: G10Locking Mechanism: AxisNet Weight: 4.76 ozHistory of GANZOGanzo Hardware is devoted to create multi-tools, knives and kitchen utensils. We provide both ready-made unique tools and custom-made high performance products. With our humanized design and high quality tools, we are confident to earn trust from all our customers.Since founded more than 20 years ago, we put all our efforts on produce high quality multi- functional tools. We have professional developing team and have already invented thousands of new style tools which obtained more than hundreds of national patents. Ganzo is a high-end brand as well as designated manufacturer of American Special Forces. The products are mainly exported to America, France, Germany, Italy, Spain, Switzerland, Australia, New Zealand and other 26 countries.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310Q%2BahbqqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CGIC0ZM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
