{"item_id": "B00CH4IID8", "title": "3V Gear Large Tactical Backpack MOLLE Compatible for Military Gear, Laptops, Travel, Man Bag", "description": "Velox is Latin for swift or rapid and most appropriately the name of this pack, designed for individuals on the move. While still being roomy with over 1600 cubic inches of storage space, this pack also trims down and stabilizes easily with the multiple compression straps strategically placed to compress any load. In addition to ample volume, the multiple compartments ensure that everything is adequately organized and ready for whatever rigors your mission demands. Built to exacting standards from heavy-duty 600D PVC nylon with rust resistant nylon zippers this pack can handle whatever you throw at it. And with the four uniquely sized storage compartments, with built in organizers, the Velox will swallow gear like a duffel bag but keeping it at the ready when a need arises. Whether it's a covert mission in a faraway desert or keeping up with the daily grind in an urban jungle, the VVV Gear Velox II will keep pace.Velox II Tactical Assault Pack Features:*Built to exacting standards from heavy-duty 600D PVC nylon*Roomy external zippered compartments*Main: 18\"H x 12\"W x 4.5\"D*Secondary main: 16\"H x 9.5\"W x 2.5\"D*Top front: 6\"H x 8\"W x 2.5\"D*Lower front: 10\"H x 9\"W x 2\"D pleated*Overall Size: 1628 cubic inches*Integrated nylon organizer for pens, day planner, etc.*Side- and top-mounted compression straps*Easily adjustable contoured shoulder straps*Adjustable hip and sternum strap*MOLLE and PALs compatible*Reinforced handle*Heavy duty rust resistant nylon zippers*Zipper pulls threaded with para-cord for durability and noise reduction*4 Storage compartments w/internal dividers and pockets*Expandable external pockets*EVA Molded vented back panel*Hydration compatible*MOLLE Velcro ID panel w/VVV Gear 3D PVC Logo patch", "text": "3V Gear Large Tactical Backpack MOLLE Compatible for Military Gear, Laptops, Travel, Man Bag Velox is Latin for swift or rapid and most appropriately the name of this pack, designed for individuals on the move. While still being roomy with over 1600 cubic inches of storage space, this pack also trims down and stabilizes easily with the multiple compression straps strategically placed to compress any load. In addition to ample volume, the multiple compartments ensure that everything is adequately organized and ready for whatever rigors your mission demands. Built to exacting standards from heavy-duty 600D PVC nylon with rust resistant nylon zippers this pack can handle whatever you throw at it. And with the four uniquely sized storage compartments, with built in organizers, the Velox will swallow gear like a duffel bag but keeping it at the ready when a need arises. Whether it's a covert mission in a faraway desert or keeping up with the daily grind in an urban jungle, the VVV Gear Velox II will keep pace.Velox II Tactical Assault Pack Features:*Built to exacting standards from heavy-duty 600D PVC nylon*Roomy external zippered compartments*Main: 18\"H x 12\"W x 4.5\"D*Secondary main: 16\"H x 9.5\"W x 2.5\"D*Top front: 6\"H x 8\"W x 2.5\"D*Lower front: 10\"H x 9\"W x 2\"D pleated*Overall Size: 1628 cubic inches*Integrated nylon organizer for pens, day planner, etc.*Side- and top-mounted compression straps*Easily adjustable contoured shoulder straps*Adjustable hip and sternum strap*MOLLE and PALs compatible*Reinforced handle*Heavy duty rust resistant nylon zippers*Zipper pulls threaded with para-cord for durability and noise reduction*4 Storage compartments w/internal dividers and pockets*Expandable external pockets*EVA Molded vented back panel*Hydration compatible*MOLLE Velcro ID panel w/VVV Gear 3D PVC Logo patch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qFpG3L07L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CH4IID8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3V Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 52.49}}
{"item_id": "B00CH7YX52", "title": "Resistance Bands - Workouts for Exercise, Fitness & Strength - 10\" Flat Resistance Stretch Loops - Set of Four - No Time for the Gym? Portable, Easy And Effective Rubber Latex Bear Bands Loops. Workout for Arms, Legs, Core for Women & Men + Free Fitness Club Membership & 3 Year Guarantee. Great for Pilates, P90x, Crossfit, Beachbody, Yoga, Rehab, Recovery and Therapy", "description": "The #1 Secret To Simple And Effective Workouts No Matter Where You Are: You Never Have To Set Foot In A Gym Again-Bear Bands™- Your simple, portable, easy, & effective workout. Look Great! Feel Even Better!- Personal Fitness Trainers & Physical Therapists use resistance band training for building strength, coordination & balance.Work at the level that's right for you.Whether you're rehabbing an injury, a beginner, or a hard core fitness junkie with a workout routine that wouldscare Jillian Michaels,Bear Bands™stretch loops let you work at the intensity right for your fitness level.Not sure what to do with them or how to use them?That's okay. If you're just starting a workout or rehab routine, you canbuild strength and step up in resistance as you're ready. And your freemembership to the Fitter Den™ Video Fitness Club will get you started!It's like having a personal trainer right beside you!Take yourBear Bands™anywhere with you: they are lightweight and small so they travel well!Four Varying Resistances- Color Coded and Labeled with Lt/Med/Hvy/XtraHvy so you can easily tell them apart.- 10\" x 2\" (20\" circumference)Do not use if allergic to latex.Guarantee:These loops are made of high quality natural latex, and have a 3 year guarantee. If you've gotten cheaply madebands in the past, you'll have no worries...if one breaks or tears, notify us and we'll send another immediately.Now, the bad news: you won't have access to this special limited time pricing with bonuses forever. You can get yourBear Bands™ loops set, exclusive membership, and guarantee...but you have to get this elite fitness gear NOW.Click on theAdd to Cartbutton now. Get yourBear Bands™delivered to your door so you can drive your health, fitness & good looks to the next level.Look Great. Feel Even Better!", "text": "Resistance Bands - Workouts for Exercise, Fitness & Strength - 10\" Flat Resistance Stretch Loops - Set of Four - No Time for the Gym? Portable, Easy And Effective Rubber Latex Bear Bands Loops. Workout for Arms, Legs, Core for Women & Men + Free Fitness Club Membership & 3 Year Guarantee. Great for Pilates, P90x, Crossfit, Beachbody, Yoga, Rehab, Recovery and Therapy The #1 Secret To Simple And Effective Workouts No Matter Where You Are: You Never Have To Set Foot In A Gym Again-Bear Bands™- Your simple, portable, easy, & effective workout. Look Great! Feel Even Better!- Personal Fitness Trainers & Physical Therapists use resistance band training for building strength, coordination & balance.Work at the level that's right for you.Whether you're rehabbing an injury, a beginner, or a hard core fitness junkie with a workout routine that wouldscare Jillian Michaels,Bear Bands™stretch loops let you work at the intensity right for your fitness level.Not sure what to do with them or how to use them?That's okay. If you're just starting a workout or rehab routine, you canbuild strength and step up in resistance as you're ready. And your freemembership to the Fitter Den™ Video Fitness Club will get you started!It's like having a personal trainer right beside you!Take yourBear Bands™anywhere with you: they are lightweight and small so they travel well!Four Varying Resistances- Color Coded and Labeled with Lt/Med/Hvy/XtraHvy so you can easily tell them apart.- 10\" x 2\" (20\" circumference)Do not use if allergic to latex.Guarantee:These loops are made of high quality natural latex, and have a 3 year guarantee. If you've gotten cheaply madebands in the past, you'll have no worries...if one breaks or tears, notify us and we'll send another immediately.Now, the bad news: you won't have access to this special limited time pricing with bonuses forever. You can get yourBear Bands™ loops set, exclusive membership, and guarantee...but you have to get this elite fitness gear NOW.Click on theAdd to Cartbutton now. Get yourBear Bands™delivered to your door so you can drive your health, fitness & good looks to the next level.Look Great. Feel Even Better!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pvp7BheVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CH7YX52.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 27.99}}
