{"item_id": "B00CHKMVOO", "title": "Tac Force Tf-764Bk Assisted Opening Folding Knife, 4.5-Inch Closed", "description": "Here we have a Tac-Force folding knife features a black stainless steel blade and measures 4.5\" when closed. The handle bears BLACK and features a liner lock and belt clip. Perfect for use in the field or at home this knife is a real must have.", "text": "Tac Force Tf-764Bk Assisted Opening Folding Knife, 4.5-Inch Closed Here we have a Tac-Force folding knife features a black stainless steel blade and measures 4.5\" when closed. The handle bears BLACK and features a liner lock and belt clip. Perfect for use in the field or at home this knife is a real must have.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xYEREFI1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CHKMVOO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TAC Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 9.0}}
