{"item_id": "B00CHY33IS", "title": "3 Premium High Quality Exercise Loop Bands + Workout Routine E-book - Resistance Loops Designed to Sculpt and Tone Your Body - 3 Perfect Strengths (Light, Medium, Heavy) - Unique Layering Technology Providing Ultra High Durability", "description": "Are You Taking Control of Your Body?Countless studies have proven that keeping your body fit and healthy can lead to a happier and fuller life.One of the biggest elements to a healthy life is exercising.Have you gotten a gym membership and just stopped going because you are busy and just don't have time? Don't let your life get in the way of your fitness and health. I am going to show you how you can enjoy your life wherever you are AND stay healthy and fit.We offer to you a revolutionary product that will help you shape and tone your bodywherever you are.You can take it on trips. You can take it to the couch, and you can take it to a class.The answer is resistance loop bands. This product will absolutely revolutionize your workout practices and help you to live a healthier life all of the time. It is time to take control of your life and get a product that you can use ANYWHERE.Our OfferPackage Includes:3 High Quality Resistance Loop Bands- 1 High Strength Black Band- 1 Medium Strength Grey Band- 1 Light Strength Blue Band- 1 Workout Routine E-Book- No Gym Needed- Exercise Anywhere- Safe and Healthy- Exercises IncludedWe have a 90 day, no questions asked, money back guarantee. You can return the product for any reason during this time period. We are so confident that you will LOVE these bands, that we are proud to offer this.Workout Routine E-Book Included", "text": "3 Premium High Quality Exercise Loop Bands + Workout Routine E-book - Resistance Loops Designed to Sculpt and Tone Your Body - 3 Perfect Strengths (Light, Medium, Heavy) - Unique Layering Technology Providing Ultra High Durability Are You Taking Control of Your Body?Countless studies have proven that keeping your body fit and healthy can lead to a happier and fuller life.One of the biggest elements to a healthy life is exercising.Have you gotten a gym membership and just stopped going because you are busy and just don't have time? Don't let your life get in the way of your fitness and health. I am going to show you how you can enjoy your life wherever you are AND stay healthy and fit.We offer to you a revolutionary product that will help you shape and tone your bodywherever you are.You can take it on trips. You can take it to the couch, and you can take it to a class.The answer is resistance loop bands. This product will absolutely revolutionize your workout practices and help you to live a healthier life all of the time. It is time to take control of your life and get a product that you can use ANYWHERE.Our OfferPackage Includes:3 High Quality Resistance Loop Bands- 1 High Strength Black Band- 1 Medium Strength Grey Band- 1 Light Strength Blue Band- 1 Workout Routine E-Book- No Gym Needed- Exercise Anywhere- Safe and Healthy- Exercises IncludedWe have a 90 day, no questions asked, money back guarantee. You can return the product for any reason during this time period. We are so confident that you will LOVE these bands, that we are proud to offer this.Workout Routine E-Book Included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bYW8svwbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CHY33IS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B00CI1UMC0", "title": "Real Avid Gun Boss Universal Rod System Cleaning Kit", "description": "The Gun Boss Universal cleaning kit comes in a portable, molded case with a ballistic nylon shell that fits in the palm of your hand. Its accessories fit calibers .22, .223/5.56mm, .270/.280/7mm, .30, .357/.38/9mm and .45 plus 20 and 12 ga. shotguns. The Gun Boss compact rod system has 6 threaded rod sections that can be put together at the length you need to clean guns ranging from long rifles to pistols.", "text": "Real Avid Gun Boss Universal Rod System Cleaning Kit The Gun Boss Universal cleaning kit comes in a portable, molded case with a ballistic nylon shell that fits in the palm of your hand. Its accessories fit calibers .22, .223/5.56mm, .270/.280/7mm, .30, .357/.38/9mm and .45 plus 20 and 12 ga. shotguns. The Gun Boss compact rod system has 6 threaded rod sections that can be put together at the length you need to clean guns ranging from long rifles to pistols.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SyFCYIprL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CI1UMC0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Real Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 28.2}}
{"item_id": "B00CI373FW", "title": "Handy Pocket Chain Saw", "description": "BIG BITE IN A SMALL POUCH When you can't take along a heavy bulky chain saw you want the RelyOnUs Handy Pocket Chain Saw! It fits just anywhere - on your belt, in your backpack or in your car. COMPARE IT TO THE COMPETITION: Sharper Bite - Will Not Go Dull After a Few Uses - Better Handles - sharp bi-directional cutting teeth on every third link for efficient cutting - made from heat treated Nickel-Chromium-Molybdenum Steel (AISI 8660 Alloy steel) - comfortable sturdy cloth straps are easy on your hands even cutting thick wood; allows two persons to use it together Need to trim a tree in the yard? Need to clear a campsite of roots and branches? Prune some bushes? Make firewood? The RelyOnUs pocket chain saw is always handy - no noise, no dangerous maneuvers - just get it out of its compact pouch and it does the job. Made from high quality materials the Handy Pocket Chain Saw will serve you for a long time. Don't take our word for it - we give you a Life-Time Guarantee - Replacement-By-New or, at your choice, Your Money Back - no questions asked. Get it now while supplies last", "text": "Handy Pocket Chain Saw BIG BITE IN A SMALL POUCH When you can't take along a heavy bulky chain saw you want the RelyOnUs Handy Pocket Chain Saw! It fits just anywhere - on your belt, in your backpack or in your car. COMPARE IT TO THE COMPETITION: Sharper Bite - Will Not Go Dull After a Few Uses - Better Handles - sharp bi-directional cutting teeth on every third link for efficient cutting - made from heat treated Nickel-Chromium-Molybdenum Steel (AISI 8660 Alloy steel) - comfortable sturdy cloth straps are easy on your hands even cutting thick wood; allows two persons to use it together Need to trim a tree in the yard? Need to clear a campsite of roots and branches? Prune some bushes? Make firewood? The RelyOnUs pocket chain saw is always handy - no noise, no dangerous maneuvers - just get it out of its compact pouch and it does the job. Made from high quality materials the Handy Pocket Chain Saw will serve you for a long time. Don't take our word for it - we give you a Life-Time Guarantee - Replacement-By-New or, at your choice, Your Money Back - no questions asked. Get it now while supplies last", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TaRe9kPwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CI373FW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Saws"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B00CICGI1S", "title": "Paratus 3 Day Operator's Pack Military Style MOLLE Compatible Tactical Backpack Bug Out Bag", "description": "Whether you are venturing around the world as a Black-ops operative or on a mission for solitude, the VVV Gear Paratus II Modular 3-Day Assault Pack is an excellent choice for all your tactical or preparedness needs. Well made with rugged 600 Denier PVC backed nylon, with 2 large zippered compartments plus additional interior pockets and organizers, two attached MOLLE pouches. Staying organized is easy. Multiple D-rings, carry handles, compression straps and fasten points provide for endless customization.The Paratus' dimensions are the maximum allowable for airline carry-on requirements which provide plenty of organized usable space for all your travel and adventure needs both at your destination and during travel.Features:*Built from heavy-duty 600D PVC nylon*Double stitched seams*Main compartment: 20\"H x 12\"W x 5.5\"D ( 1320 cubic inches)*Top front: 13\"H x 12\"W x 3\"D (468 cubic inches)*Two large MOLLE pouches attached to each side, (5\"x 2.5\"x 8\", 100 cubic inches)*Overall Size: 2890 cubic inches*Body contoured shoulder straps with D-Ring*Adjustable padded waist belt*External side compression straps*Heavy-Duty carry and drag handle*Two double zipper pulls on the main compartment for easy access*All zipper pulls threaded with para-cord for durability and noise reduction*MOLLE and PALs attachment point throughout*Includes VVV Gear Rapid Deployment pack*3\" x 5\" Velcro ID panel w/VVV Gear 3D PVC patch*Hydration compatibleRapid Deployment Pack Features:*MOLLE attachment straps*Heavy-duty military nylon coil zippers*Three zippered compartments*Double sewn nylon webbing carry handle*Side-release buckles", "text": "Paratus 3 Day Operator's Pack Military Style MOLLE Compatible Tactical Backpack Bug Out Bag Whether you are venturing around the world as a Black-ops operative or on a mission for solitude, the VVV Gear Paratus II Modular 3-Day Assault Pack is an excellent choice for all your tactical or preparedness needs. Well made with rugged 600 Denier PVC backed nylon, with 2 large zippered compartments plus additional interior pockets and organizers, two attached MOLLE pouches. Staying organized is easy. Multiple D-rings, carry handles, compression straps and fasten points provide for endless customization.The Paratus' dimensions are the maximum allowable for airline carry-on requirements which provide plenty of organized usable space for all your travel and adventure needs both at your destination and during travel.Features:*Built from heavy-duty 600D PVC nylon*Double stitched seams*Main compartment: 20\"H x 12\"W x 5.5\"D ( 1320 cubic inches)*Top front: 13\"H x 12\"W x 3\"D (468 cubic inches)*Two large MOLLE pouches attached to each side, (5\"x 2.5\"x 8\", 100 cubic inches)*Overall Size: 2890 cubic inches*Body contoured shoulder straps with D-Ring*Adjustable padded waist belt*External side compression straps*Heavy-Duty carry and drag handle*Two double zipper pulls on the main compartment for easy access*All zipper pulls threaded with para-cord for durability and noise reduction*MOLLE and PALs attachment point throughout*Includes VVV Gear Rapid Deployment pack*3\" x 5\" Velcro ID panel w/VVV Gear 3D PVC patch*Hydration compatibleRapid Deployment Pack Features:*MOLLE attachment straps*Heavy-duty military nylon coil zippers*Three zippered compartments*Double sewn nylon webbing carry handle*Side-release buckles", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qBEeoapqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CICGI1S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "3V Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 99.95}}
