ngth - FREE 'How To Improve Your DUs' Manual The Secret to Easy DOUBLE-UNDERS and FAT-BURNING WorkoutsYou're watching your friend at the gym doing about 150 jumps a minute. And your Crossfitter friend makes those double-unders look easier than your single-unders.Now you're a fit person; and you've practiced your rope jumping enough. But you don't seem to reach your friend's speed no matter what.What can you do? You can practice more. You can buy more books and watch more videos to learn more tricks.Or you can get abetter speed rope: terriFIT's Ultra Speed Rope, the lightweight jump rope model which has been used to break US and World jump rope speed records. The problem is not your experience, but rather your jump rope.-light and fast: best for Crossfit WODs, double-unders and advanced cardio-metal dowels for sturdier handles and smooth spinning-10' fully adjustable cable: making it easy to customize it for your needs-does NOT twist, tangle or curlA speed rope is all you need for a fast fat-burning workout and increased endurance.Designed with highly flexible, abrasion-resistant TPU black coated wire: #1 Choice for Competitive Athletes and CrossFit TrainingOur rope has been characterized as being**the perfect weight which makes the DUs that much easier**terrific quality speed rope**perfect for CrossFittersFree BONUSES($29.99 value) included to help you succeed: Rapid Results Manual for Double-Unders + Fun, Fast Fat-Burning Workout Video, Olympic Lifts Videos, etc.100% Money Back Guarantee. 120-Day Replacement Guarantee, Hassle-FreeBUY TWO ROPES, WE'LL DONATE ONE TO A CHILD IN NEED!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VWxf8-ZCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CLZF4EE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 14.99}}
