{"item_id": "B00CMALALE", "title": "550 Paracord - 5col Survival Supply: Military Spec MIL-C-5040H & PIA-C-5040 Type III Nylon Parachute Cord", "description": "5col Survival Supply MIL-C-5040h & PIA-C-5040 Type III Paracord is the highest quality parachute cord available anywhere. Our Type III 550 cord is suitable for use in parachutes, and a factory certificate of conformance is available (upon request) for all 5col Survival Supply cord. 5col Survival Supply paracord is manufactured in the United States by a company that supplies parachutes and related supplies to the US military. The cord for sale here is typically used to rig personnel parachutes. Why settle for less when you can have the best, strongest, and most reliable paracord on the market?", "text": "550 Paracord - 5col Survival Supply: Military Spec MIL-C-5040H & PIA-C-5040 Type III Nylon Parachute Cord 5col Survival Supply MIL-C-5040h & PIA-C-5040 Type III Paracord is the highest quality parachute cord available anywhere. Our Type III 550 cord is suitable for use in parachutes, and a factory certificate of conformance is available (upon request) for all 5col Survival Supply cord. 5col Survival Supply paracord is manufactured in the United States by a company that supplies parachutes and related supplies to the US military. The cord for sale here is typically used to rig personnel parachutes. Why settle for less when you can have the best, strongest, and most reliable paracord on the market?", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jinoMzHxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CMALALE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
