{"item_id": "B00CMHBJ7W", "title": "SKLZ Great Catch Football Receiving Training Aid", "description": "Learn to catch with the fingertips instead of the palms with the SKLZ Great Catch. This receiving training aid creates more reliable hands with fewer drops and bobbles because of the soft micro balls creating space between the football and palms. Build confidence, consistency and improved receiving technique. A great practice tool for every level.", "text": "SKLZ Great Catch Football Receiving Training Aid Learn to catch with the fingertips instead of the palms with the SKLZ Great Catch. This receiving training aid creates more reliable hands with fewer drops and bobbles because of the soft micro balls creating space between the football and palms. Build confidence, consistency and improved receiving technique. A great practice tool for every level.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S6l6UdseL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CMHBJ7W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Football", "Player Equipment", "Gloves", "Receiving Gloves"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B00CMPQFGE", "title": "Zippo Stainless Steel Wallet", "description": "A man's story. It's forged by setting, surroundings and context. Because where a man lives and what he's surrounded by inevitably set the rhythm for the choices he makes. The environment where he lives shapes who he is and the manner in which he maneuvers throughout the world. His surroundings engineer his life. Zippo has been engineering products for the American man for decades. It's an instrument of his existence that's been handed down from generation to generation, from east coast to west. Because no matter his story, the induction into manhood starts with Zippo. And no matter the era, the trends or the place in which he lives, Zippo makes the man.", "text": "Zippo Stainless Steel Wallet A man's story. It's forged by setting, surroundings and context. Because where a man lives and what he's surrounded by inevitably set the rhythm for the choices he makes. The environment where he lives shapes who he is and the manner in which he maneuvers throughout the world. His surroundings engineer his life. Zippo has been engineering products for the American man for decades. It's an instrument of his existence that's been handed down from generation to generation, from east coast to west. Because no matter his story, the induction into manhood starts with Zippo. And no matter the era, the trends or the place in which he lives, Zippo makes the man.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mXH9WXV%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CMPQFGE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 45.61}}
