{"item_id": "B00CMUPQE6", "title": "250' - 1000' Spools of Parachute Cord ParacordPlanet Type III Military Specification 550", "description": "ParacordPlanet paracord is your all-around tactical, crafting and utility cord. ParacordPlanet Type III commercial grade paracord is dependable, tough and long lasting. The cord is made of 550 pound test nylon and features seven-strand core for maximum strength. ParacordPlanet paracord measures at 5/32\" in diameter and is manufacturered in the United states by a certified US Government contractor. ParacordPlanet Paracord is available in over 200 different colors and lengths. ParacordPlanet Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 7 strand core and measures 5/32\" in diameter. Manufactured in the US and certified by US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "text": "250' - 1000' Spools of Parachute Cord ParacordPlanet Type III Military Specification 550 ParacordPlanet paracord is your all-around tactical, crafting and utility cord. ParacordPlanet Type III commercial grade paracord is dependable, tough and long lasting. The cord is made of 550 pound test nylon and features seven-strand core for maximum strength. ParacordPlanet paracord measures at 5/32\" in diameter and is manufacturered in the United states by a certified US Government contractor. ParacordPlanet Paracord is available in over 200 different colors and lengths. ParacordPlanet Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 7 strand core and measures 5/32\" in diameter. Manufactured in the US and certified by US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51l6Pp8oiCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CMUPQE6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
