{"item_id": "B00CN25BC0", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Thermal Conductive Glove", "description": "Our Thermal Conductive Gloves are designed with special index and thumb materials that work with touch screen devices, so you don't have to remove your gloves to access a new song or answer that important phone call.", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Thermal Conductive Glove Our Thermal Conductive Gloves are designed with special index and thumb materials that work with touch screen devices, so you don't have to remove your gloves to access a new song or answer that important phone call.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Vbl6S2-PL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CN25BC0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
