{"item_id": "B00CNK4P3I", "title": "TMS AR Tactical 3x Magnifier Scope for Red Dot Reflex Sight", "description": "A great add-on to tactical red dot sights. It converts the sights instantly into a sighting system for longer range targeting and sniping. Sometimes the combination use of red dot sight and magnifier scope will have the dot reticle out of center in the field of view of the magnifier due to natural slight misalignment of optical axis between the sight and the magnifier. This professional grade TMS magnifier scope is adjustable for windage and elevation to better align with the red dot sight without changing the actual ZERO of the sight. 30mm main tube of the magnifier works with standard 30mm scope mount of desired center height that matches that of the red dot sight. Rubber armored turret and grip area. It would be the best if you could get one of those flip mounts that rotate to stay on and off line of sight quickly. It is just that you need to be sure the center height of the mount used matches that of the red dot sight. Specifications: Magnification: 3x. Eye relief: 50mm (2inch) Weight:7.8oz. Overall length: 4 1/2inch. Accessories: lens covers", "text": "TMS AR Tactical 3x Magnifier Scope for Red Dot Reflex Sight A great add-on to tactical red dot sights. It converts the sights instantly into a sighting system for longer range targeting and sniping. Sometimes the combination use of red dot sight and magnifier scope will have the dot reticle out of center in the field of view of the magnifier due to natural slight misalignment of optical axis between the sight and the magnifier. This professional grade TMS magnifier scope is adjustable for windage and elevation to better align with the red dot sight without changing the actual ZERO of the sight. 30mm main tube of the magnifier works with standard 30mm scope mount of desired center height that matches that of the red dot sight. Rubber armored turret and grip area. It would be the best if you could get one of those flip mounts that rotate to stay on and off line of sight quickly. It is just that you need to be sure the center height of the mount used matches that of the red dot sight. Specifications: Magnification: 3x. Eye relief: 50mm (2inch) Weight:7.8oz. Overall length: 4 1/2inch. Accessories: lens covers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312OYXMsHxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CNK4P3I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 59.9}}
{"item_id": "B00CNKQWES", "title": "The Learning Journey Remote Control Shape Go Green Recycle Truck", "description": "Go Green Recycle Truck is an interactive truck that guilds your child through learning about recycling and shapes while having lots of fun. This Recycle Truck has three play modes - Learn the Colors and Shapes and Find It. that are played by inserting the plastic shapes into the their slots. Mode three allows your child to control the truck by using the infrared remote control moving it back and forth as it plays melodies and lights blink. The automatic shut-off features preserves the battery life of the required three \"AA\" batteries for the main unit (included) and the two \"AA\" batteries for the remote (not included). Ages 18+ months.", "text": "The Learning Journey Remote Control Shape Go Green Recycle Truck Go Green Recycle Truck is an interactive truck that guilds your child through learning about recycling and shapes while having lots of fun. This Recycle Truck has three play modes - Learn the Colors and Shapes and Find It. that are played by inserting the plastic shapes into the their slots. Mode three allows your child to control the truck by using the infrared remote control moving it back and forth as it plays melodies and lights blink. The automatic shut-off features preserves the battery life of the required three \"AA\" batteries for the main unit (included) and the two \"AA\" batteries for the remote (not included). Ages 18+ months.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516IB6o9CKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CNKQWES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "The Learning Journey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Dartboards"]], "price": 30.5}}
{"item_id": "B00CNMNP2S", "title": "MOSSBERG SHOTGUN AMMO SLING (25 SHELLS) ***MADE IN U.S.A.***", "description": "This black nylon 2\" no-slip sling has a large gripping ring and holds 25 shot shells in elastic loops. It features rubber gripping strips to prevent it from slipping off of your shoulder, and a 2\" diameter ring handle that you can use to comfortably take the weight off your shoulder. Easily fits shotgun shells between 12 and 20 gauge and attaches to standard 1\" sling swivels, or can be secured to the barrel or magazine tube.", "text": "MOSSBERG SHOTGUN AMMO SLING (25 SHELLS) ***MADE IN U.S.A.*** This black nylon 2\" no-slip sling has a large gripping ring and holds 25 shot shells in elastic loops. It features rubber gripping strips to prevent it from slipping off of your shoulder, and a 2\" diameter ring handle that you can use to comfortably take the weight off your shoulder. Easily fits shotgun shells between 12 and 20 gauge and attaches to standard 1\" sling swivels, or can be secured to the barrel or magazine tube.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xwC0MKCYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CNMNP2S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 19.75}}
{"item_id": "B00CNWCFVK", "title": "Concealed Carry Deep Cover Holster - With Free Trigger Guard!", "description": "MADE IN USA. Close contact concealed carry holster designed for use where 100% concealment is an absolute necessity. Ergonomic design functions safely in the office environment or for the more physically active in the warehouse, delivery truck, or outdoor professions. WHAT'S IN THE BOX: MADE IN USA. White Elastic holster rig with super tough trigger guard made of high density polyethylene (HDPE) CAUTION: Do not use holster without the trigger guard. Never use any elastic type holster (belly band, chest or ankle) without a trigger guard. Without a trigger guard it is easy to catch the trigger on the corner of an office chair while sitting down or other objects while standing or walking.", "text": "Concealed Carry Deep Cover Holster - With Free Trigger Guard! MADE IN USA. Close contact concealed carry holster designed for use where 100% concealment is an absolute necessity. Ergonomic design functions safely in the office environment or for the more physically active in the warehouse, delivery truck, or outdoor professions. WHAT'S IN THE BOX: MADE IN USA. White Elastic holster rig with super tough trigger guard made of high density polyethylene (HDPE) CAUTION: Do not use holster without the trigger guard. Never use any elastic type holster (belly band, chest or ankle) without a trigger guard. Without a trigger guard it is easy to catch the trigger on the corner of an office chair while sitting down or other objects while standing or walking.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bPgaUsVSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CNWCFVK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 29.99}}
