{"item_id": "B00CPE6Y2W", "title": "USE Seat Post Shim", "description": "The USE shim system allows you to fit a seat post into virtually any frame size. Our shims are made to 100mm length and are longer than other shims on the market giving your seat post much better support inside the frame. All shims are designed with a \"top lip\" to stop shim sliding into the frame. Shims are available in Aluminum and Thermo Plastic, despite the latter being a lighter solution its material characteristics limit the thickness of the ID - OD measurements. Aluminum is used to achieve the thinnest shims as it is a more robust material. Rolled Aluminum shim - the very thinnest shims are rolled from sheet metal. 25.4mm shims need to be so thin as they are etched down in acid to the correct tolerance and are too thin to anodize (show as silver). Shim design characteristics may affect weight. Weights are accurate to the nearest gram. Shims allow a rider to adjust the ID of a frame for a range of different sized posts.", "text": "USE Seat Post Shim The USE shim system allows you to fit a seat post into virtually any frame size. Our shims are made to 100mm length and are longer than other shims on the market giving your seat post much better support inside the frame. All shims are designed with a \"top lip\" to stop shim sliding into the frame. Shims are available in Aluminum and Thermo Plastic, despite the latter being a lighter solution its material characteristics limit the thickness of the ID - OD measurements. Aluminum is used to achieve the thinnest shims as it is a more robust material. Rolled Aluminum shim - the very thinnest shims are rolled from sheet metal. 25.4mm shims need to be so thin as they are etched down in acid to the correct tolerance and are too thin to anodize (show as silver). Shim design characteristics may affect weight. Weights are accurate to the nearest gram. Shims allow a rider to adjust the ID of a frame for a range of different sized posts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21k07WPNoLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CPE6Y2W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Seat Posts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00CPJ5464", "title": "TOMTOP Men Cycling Underwear Gel 3D Padded Bike Bicycle Pants", "description": "Specifications:Pant material: polyester & spandexPad material: silica gel & spongeColor: blackSize: M, L, XL, XXL, XXXL (optional)Pant in: 7cm/ 2.7inPad thickness: 2cm/ 0.7inPackage weight: 122-138g/ 4.3-4.8ozHow to measure:Please see the photo.Packing List:1 * Underwear pant", "text": "TOMTOP Men Cycling Underwear Gel 3D Padded Bike Bicycle Pants Specifications:Pant material: polyester & spandexPad material: silica gel & spongeColor: blackSize: M, L, XL, XXL, XXXL (optional)Pant in: 7cm/ 2.7inPad thickness: 2cm/ 0.7inPackage weight: 122-138g/ 4.3-4.8ozHow to measure:Please see the photo.Packing List:1 * Underwear pant", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51EJObM9wBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CPJ5464.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00CPQ2QVS", "title": "Outbags OB-30S Nylon IWB Conceal Carry Gun Holster for Glock 26 / 27 / 29 / 30 / 40, Ruger SR9C / SR40C, S&W M&P Compact, Taurus Millennium PT58 / PT132 / PT138 / PT140 / PT145 / PT609 / PT638 / PT709 Slim / PT740 / PT745, Ruger LC9 and SR22 with Crimson Trace, Kahr CW9 / CW40 / CW45, Walther P22 Compact / P99 Compact", "description": "When concealment is essential, the S Style is the perfect inside pants holster. The S Style is a 1/8\" thin, slim lined, holster that features a Soft Tricot Inner Lining. The removable belt clip makes the S Style available for right and left hand users. Combined with the tough and heavy duty outer shell ensures that flexibility of this holster is coupled with durability. Firearm not included. Recommended fit: Beretta 9000S, Beretta Nano, Beretta PX4 Storm Sub Compact, Bersa BP9CC / BP40CC, Bul M5 Ultra-X, Cobra FS32 / FS380, Colt Defender 90 Series 45 ACP, CZ-U CZ2075, Diamondback DP9, Glock 23 Compact / 26 / 27 / 29 / 30 / 40, H&K; P7, Hi-Point C9, Kahr CW9 / CW40 / CW45, Kahr K9 / K40 / P9, Kahr MK9 Elite Kel Tec PF9 / P11 with Crimson Trace, Mauser M2, Para Stealth, Para Warthog, Ruger LC9 / SR22 with Crimson Trace, Ruger SR9C / SR40C, S&W; 469 / 669 / 6904 / 6906 / 6946, S&W; Chiefs Special 9mm, S&W; M&P; Compact 9C / 40C /45C, Sig Sauer P224 / P239, Sig Sauer P250 Sub Compact, Springfield Armory XDs 45 ACP, Springfield XD 3\" Sub Compact, Taurus Millennium PT58 / PT132 / PT138 / PT140 / PT145 / PT609 / PT638 / PT709 Slim / PT740 / PT745, Walther P22 / P99 Compact / PPS,", "text": "Outbags OB-30S Nylon IWB Conceal Carry Gun Holster for Glock 26 / 27 / 29 / 30 / 40, Ruger SR9C / SR40C, S&W M&P Compact, Taurus Millennium PT58 / PT132 / PT138 / PT140 / PT145 / PT609 / PT638 / PT709 Slim / PT740 / PT745, Ruger LC9 and SR22 with Crimson Trace, Kahr CW9 / CW40 / CW45, Walther P22 Compact / P99 Compact When concealment is essential, the S Style is the perfect inside pants holster. The S Style is a 1/8\" thin, slim lined, holster that features a Soft Tricot Inner Lining. The removable belt clip makes the S Style available for right and left hand users. Combined with the tough and heavy duty outer shell ensures that flexibility of this holster is coupled with durability. Firearm not included. Recommended fit: Beretta 9000S, Beretta Nano, Beretta PX4 Storm Sub Compact, Bersa BP9CC / BP40CC, Bul M5 Ultra-X, Cobra FS32 / FS380, Colt Defender 90 Series 45 ACP, CZ-U CZ2075, Diamondback DP9, Glock 23 Compact / 26 / 27 / 29 / 30 / 40, H&K; P7, Hi-Point C9, Kahr CW9 / CW40 / CW45, Kahr K9 / K40 / P9, Kahr MK9 Elite Kel Tec PF9 / P11 with Crimson Trace, Mauser M2, Para Stealth, Para Warthog, Ruger LC9 / SR22 with Crimson Trace, Ruger SR9C / SR40C, S&W; 469 / 669 / 6904 / 6906 / 6946, S&W; Chiefs Special 9mm, S&W; M&P; Compact 9C / 40C /45C, Sig Sauer P224 / P239, Sig Sauer P250 Sub Compact, Springfield Armory XDs 45 ACP, Springfield XD 3\" Sub Compact, Taurus Millennium PT58 / PT132 / PT138 / PT140 / PT145 / PT609 / PT638 / PT709 Slim / PT740 / PT745, Walther P22 / P99 Compact / PPS,", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XVGjHQ51L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CPQ2QVS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00CPR8JKO", "title": "Hanson Creek Stainless Steel Water Bottle - 50% off Sale - Premium Quality 25 oz Narrow Mouth Size Great For Kids or Adults - Clean, Reusable, BPA Free, Non-Toxic. One Year Guarantee.", "description": "4 Common Water Bottle Problems Solved!You'll Have More Fun, More Convenience, Less GuiltFree of Toxins, BPA...and GrossnessThe only thing you are putting into your body when you use the Hanson Creek Stainless Steel Water Bottle is water.It's also sanitary and free of that 'who-knows-what-it-is-but-it-sure-is-GROSS' buildup that seems to grow inside a bite valve or sports cap no matter what you do to stop it.Use It Everywhere - Lasts for YearsYou'll love the durability, even with its slim, lightweight design. It slips easily into bags, cupholders, bike cages and backpacks, and has a detachable carabiner so you can clip it to just about anything. It won't leak (even on its side), so you can toss it into a bag without worrying that everything will get all wet.This bottle travels so well you'll find yourself wanting to get out more. Hiking, biking, shopping, to the gym...more fun all the way around!Won't Embarrass You In PublicWhen people notice you and your bottle, it'll be for the right reasons...Not because your bottle is making strange whistling noises when you drink from it (like many bottles with sports caps do). Yep, it's library safe!And with the narrow mouth design, you won't get that 'dribble effect' down the front of your clothes that often happens with wide-mouth bottles.It looks so good, and is so well-behaved, you'll find yourself setting your bottle on your desk for others to admire.Totally Guilt FreeSince your new bottle is eco-friendly, reusable and 100% recyclable in most areas, you'll feel twice as good about choosing this bottle.In fact, this bottle is so good, you should buy two. One for you, one for a friend. One for home/office and one for adventure. And hey, if you were here, we'd join you and your bottle for a hike!", "text": "Hanson Creek Stainless Steel Water Bottle - 50% off Sale - Premium Quality 25 oz Narrow Mouth Size Great For Kids or Adults - Clean, Reusable, BPA Free, Non-Toxic. One Year Guarantee. 4 Common Water Bottle Problems Solved!You'll Have More Fun, More Convenience, Less GuiltFree of Toxins, BPA...and GrossnessThe only thing you are putting into your body when you use the Hanson Creek Stainless Steel Water Bottle is water.It's also sanitary and free of that 'who-knows-what-it-is-but-it-sure-is-GROSS' buildup that seems to grow inside a bite valve or sports cap no matter what you do to stop it.Use It Everywhere - Lasts for YearsYou'll love the durability, even with its slim, lightweight design. It slips easily into bags, cupholders, bike cages and backpacks, and has a detachable carabiner so you can clip it to just about anything. It won't leak (even on its side), so you can toss it into a bag without worrying that everything will get all wet.This bottle travels so well you'll find yourself wanting to get out more. Hiking, biking, shopping, to the gym...more fun all the way around!Won't Embarrass You In PublicWhen people notice you and your bottle, it'll be for the right reasons...Not because your bottle is making strange whistling noises when you drink from it (like many bottles with sports caps do). Yep, it's library safe!And with the narrow mouth design, you won't get that 'dribble effect' down the front of your clothes that often happens with wide-mouth bottles.It looks so good, and is so well-behaved, you'll find yourself setting your bottle on your desk for others to admire.Totally Guilt FreeSince your new bottle is eco-friendly, reusable and 100% recyclable in most areas, you'll feel twice as good about choosing this bottle.In fact, this bottle is so good, you should buy two. One for you, one for a friend. One for home/office and one for adventure. And hey, if you were here, we'd join you and your bottle for a hike!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315QushWj3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CPR8JKO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 18.97}}
{"item_id": "B00CPX0EWO", "title": "LuminAID Solar Inflatable Light, Semi-Transparent", "description": "About the LuminAID Light: The LuminAID light is a solar-powered, inflatable lamp that packs flat and inflates to create a lightweight, waterproof lantern.The LuminAID light provides up to 16 hours of LED light and recharges in approximately 7 hours of direct sunlight. The LuminAID light is ideal for emergency use, camping, or in the home as an extra light source. Tuck it away in a first-aid kit or hook it on your backpack to take with you on your next adventure.The product is completely PVC-free and made out of a lightweight, semi-transparent material to diffuse the LED light and create a lantern effect. About the Company: The LuminAID light was designed by two design students, Andrea Sreshta and Anna Stork, shortly after the January 2010 earthquake in Haiti. When thinking about what they could design to make a difference, Andrea and Anna decided to focus on lighting because it had the potential to greatly improve the comfort, safety and survival of disaster victims. Inspired to design a simple, solar-powered lighting product that could be easily distributed in times of emergency, they developed the LuminAID light and founded LuminAID Lab to bring the technology to market. The product has been featured on the Today Show, Fox News, CNN, and in many print publications. The solar-led-inflatable technology is Patent Pending worldwide. About LuminAID's Give Light, Get Light Program: LuminAID Lab partners with organizations all over the world to distribute lights to individuals without access to electricity through their Give Light Program. The company has also worked to put lights on the ground after emergency situations both in the US and abroad. With the support of customers and partner organizations, LuminAID Lab has distributed thousands of lights all around the world to individuals in need of a better source of light. Our mission: make light more sustainable, affordable, and available for everyone. Thank you for your support of the LuminAID light!", "text": "LuminAID Solar Inflatable Light, Semi-Transparent About the LuminAID Light: The LuminAID light is a solar-powered, inflatable lamp that packs flat and inflates to create a lightweight, waterproof lantern.The LuminAID light provides up to 16 hours of LED light and recharges in approximately 7 hours of direct sunlight. The LuminAID light is ideal for emergency use, camping, or in the home as an extra light source. Tuck it away in a first-aid kit or hook it on your backpack to take with you on your next adventure.The product is completely PVC-free and made out of a lightweight, semi-transparent material to diffuse the LED light and create a lantern effect. About the Company: The LuminAID light was designed by two design students, Andrea Sreshta and Anna Stork, shortly after the January 2010 earthquake in Haiti. When thinking about what they could design to make a difference, Andrea and Anna decided to focus on lighting because it had the potential to greatly improve the comfort, safety and survival of disaster victims. Inspired to design a simple, solar-powered lighting product that could be easily distributed in times of emergency, they developed the LuminAID light and founded LuminAID Lab to bring the technology to market. The product has been featured on the Today Show, Fox News, CNN, and in many print publications. The solar-led-inflatable technology is Patent Pending worldwide. About LuminAID's Give Light, Get Light Program: LuminAID Lab partners with organizations all over the world to distribute lights to individuals without access to electricity through their Give Light Program. The company has also worked to put lights on the ground after emergency situations both in the US and abroad. With the support of customers and partner organizations, LuminAID Lab has distributed thousands of lights all around the world to individuals in need of a better source of light. Our mission: make light more sustainable, affordable, and available for everyone. Thank you for your support of the LuminAID light!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sLGyVGqgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CPX0EWO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LuminAID", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Souvenirs", "Trading Cards"]], "price": 19.88}}
{"item_id": "B00CQ3VZ8A", "title": "LUCID M7 Microdot Red Dot Sight, Black/Ruby", "description": "The LUCID M7 has been designed from the ground up to be a strong, reliable optic that offers the most in operator features and benefits that exceed the market standards. The M7 has a strong cast aluminum frame designed with a low mount built in for the pistol or AK crowd. With the available riser, the M7 will co-witness perfectly in the lower 1/3 for fast and accurate target acquisition. The 2MOA dot with a 25MOA circle reticle provides a fast aiming solution for most any situation. Weighing in at just under 5oz the M7 is completely water, fog and shock proof. We built in two modes of reticle brightness operation, auto-brightness and manual operation with the 1/2MOA windage and elevation adjustments. The M7 is fast and easy to get zeroed to the firearm. Powered by a single AAA power source (battery not included) the M7 offers over 1000 hours of battery life. The M7 also has a screw in 2x magnifier and an optional rail riser which are sold separately. As with all LUCID products, the M7 has a Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "text": "LUCID M7 Microdot Red Dot Sight, Black/Ruby The LUCID M7 has been designed from the ground up to be a strong, reliable optic that offers the most in operator features and benefits that exceed the market standards. The M7 has a strong cast aluminum frame designed with a low mount built in for the pistol or AK crowd. With the available riser, the M7 will co-witness perfectly in the lower 1/3 for fast and accurate target acquisition. The 2MOA dot with a 25MOA circle reticle provides a fast aiming solution for most any situation. Weighing in at just under 5oz the M7 is completely water, fog and shock proof. We built in two modes of reticle brightness operation, auto-brightness and manual operation with the 1/2MOA windage and elevation adjustments. The M7 is fast and easy to get zeroed to the firearm. Powered by a single AAA power source (battery not included) the M7 offers over 1000 hours of battery life. The M7 also has a screw in 2x magnifier and an optional rail riser which are sold separately. As with all LUCID products, the M7 has a Limited Lifetime Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SVgUSrNmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CQ3VZ8A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lucid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 181.46}}
{"item_id": "B00CQ6NCRO", "title": "TekMat Beretta PX4 Storm Handgun Cleaning Mat, Black", "description": "The TekMat Beretta PX4 Storm Handgun Mat allows you to show your pride for your weapon while using this high quality top gun cleaning mat to protect your gun bench, desk, kitchen table, or whatever surface you usually clean or maintain your gun on. You likely keep your gun in a soft padded case or maybe a gun cabinet with a felt lined rack or something similar to protect it so why would you scratch your gun while cleaning or repairing it by setting it on a hard surface that could easily scratch your firearm? The soft polyester top will ensure your gun doesn't get scratched while the neoprene rubber backing on the mat will keep everything in place and prevent your work surface from sliding around. This mat will also keep harmful chemicals, oil and dirt from penetrating down to your desk, bench or the area where you normally clean and work on your firearms. After the mat begins to accumulate too much dirt, chemicals, or oil just throw it in the wash on a gentle cycle, allow to air dry and it will be virtually like new. With the exploded view drawings and accompanying parts list, making repairs, disassembling your firearm, or basic cleaning can be done much faster and with greater enjoyment.", "text": "TekMat Beretta PX4 Storm Handgun Cleaning Mat, Black The TekMat Beretta PX4 Storm Handgun Mat allows you to show your pride for your weapon while using this high quality top gun cleaning mat to protect your gun bench, desk, kitchen table, or whatever surface you usually clean or maintain your gun on. You likely keep your gun in a soft padded case or maybe a gun cabinet with a felt lined rack or something similar to protect it so why would you scratch your gun while cleaning or repairing it by setting it on a hard surface that could easily scratch your firearm? The soft polyester top will ensure your gun doesn't get scratched while the neoprene rubber backing on the mat will keep everything in place and prevent your work surface from sliding around. This mat will also keep harmful chemicals, oil and dirt from penetrating down to your desk, bench or the area where you normally clean and work on your firearms. After the mat begins to accumulate too much dirt, chemicals, or oil just throw it in the wash on a gentle cycle, allow to air dry and it will be virtually like new. With the exploded view drawings and accompanying parts list, making repairs, disassembling your firearm, or basic cleaning can be done much faster and with greater enjoyment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VF-0CR9cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CQ6NCRO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TekMat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B00CQ6NDCS", "title": "TekMat Walther PPQ Handgun Cleaning Mat, Black", "description": "The TekMat Walther PPQ Handgun Mat allows you to show your pride for your weapon while using this high quality top gun cleaning mat to protect your gun bench, desk, kitchen table, or whatever surface you usually clean or maintain your gun on. You likely keep your gun in a soft padded case or maybe a gun cabinet with a felt lined rack or something similar to protect it so why would you scratch your gun while cleaning or repairing it by setting it on a hard surface that could easily scratch your firearm? The soft polyester top will ensure your gun doesn't get scratched while the neoprene rubber backing on the mat will keep everything in place and prevent your work surface from sliding around. This mat will also keep harmful chemicals, oil and dirt from penetrating down to your desk, bench or the area where you normally clean and work on your firearms. After the mat begins to accumulate too much dirt, chemicals, or oil just throw it in the wash on a gentle cycle, allow to air dry and it will be virtually like new. With the exploded view drawings and accompanying parts list, making repairs, disassembling your firearm, or basic cleaning can be done much faster and with greater enjoyment.", "text": "TekMat Walther PPQ Handgun Cleaning Mat, Black The TekMat Walther PPQ Handgun Mat allows you to show your pride for your weapon while using this high quality top gun cleaning mat to protect your gun bench, desk, kitchen table, or whatever surface you usually clean or maintain your gun on. You likely keep your gun in a soft padded case or maybe a gun cabinet with a felt lined rack or something similar to protect it so why would you scratch your gun while cleaning or repairing it by setting it on a hard surface that could easily scratch your firearm? The soft polyester top will ensure your gun doesn't get scratched while the neoprene rubber backing on the mat will keep everything