{"item_id": "B00CQF4O9U", "title": "1 Pair Outdoor Sports Full Finger Military Tactical Airsoft Hunting Cycling Bike Gloves Green M/L/XL", "description": "Color: Green( As picture)Size: M/L/XLSIZE length widthMedium 22.56cm 12.03cmLarge 23.28cm 12.41cmX-Large 24cm 12.8cmMEASURE AROUND HAND WITH THUMB EXTENDEDLENGTH MEASUREMENT IS BASED ON MIDDLE FINGER（Colors may not appear exactly as seen on photo in real life due to variations between the computer monitors and naked eye color difference.）", "text": "1 Pair Outdoor Sports Full Finger Military Tactical Airsoft Hunting Cycling Bike Gloves Green M/L/XL Color: Green( As picture)Size: M/L/XLSIZE length widthMedium 22.56cm 12.03cmLarge 23.28cm 12.41cmX-Large 24cm 12.8cmMEASURE AROUND HAND WITH THUMB EXTENDEDLENGTH MEASUREMENT IS BASED ON MIDDLE FINGER（Colors may not appear exactly as seen on photo in real life due to variations between the computer monitors and naked eye color difference.）", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51w4XICfuRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CQF4O9U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00CQJDQ90", "title": "Atsko Sno-Seal Original Beeswax Waterproofing 7-Ounce", "description": "Sno-Seal Original Beeswax Waterproofing protects leather from rain, sun, snow, and salt. The beeswax formula dries to a solid wax that \"stays put\" in the surface of the leather so it lasts longer. Our competitors' greases, oil, and animal products are able to migrate through the leather till they clog all the pores. These waterproofing products fill the natural spaces that are supposed to absorb perspiration and insulate. In addition, animal fats weaken and rot leather. The tannery worked hard to remove the fats and preserve the leather, so it's hard to imagine why you'd put it back on. Sno-Seal will help you feel more comfortable in Gore-Tex fabric lined boots because it allows the Gore-Tex-absorbed perspiration to escape out of the leather. And not only will Sno-Seal keep you warm and dry, it'll also help you from getting tired. A typical leather boot can soak up to a pound of water. That means you lift an additional 2,212 lbs. to walk one mile. Sno-Seal keeps the whole boot dry, warm and light.", "text": "Atsko Sno-Seal Original Beeswax Waterproofing 7-Ounce Sno-Seal Original Beeswax Waterproofing protects leather from rain, sun, snow, and salt. The beeswax formula dries to a solid wax that \"stays put\" in the surface of the leather so it lasts longer. Our competitors' greases, oil, and animal products are able to migrate through the leather till they clog all the pores. These waterproofing products fill the natural spaces that are supposed to absorb perspiration and insulate. In addition, animal fats weaken and rot leather. The tannery worked hard to remove the fats and preserve the leather, so it's hard to imagine why you'd put it back on. Sno-Seal will help you feel more comfortable in Gore-Tex fabric lined boots because it allows the Gore-Tex-absorbed perspiration to escape out of the leather. And not only will Sno-Seal keep you warm and dry, it'll also help you from getting tired. A typical leather boot can soak up to a pound of water. That means you lift an additional 2,212 lbs. to walk one mile. Sno-Seal keeps the whole boot dry, warm and light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410C4Z%2BI%2BpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CQJDQ90.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Atsko Sno-Seal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 7.63}}
{"item_id": "B00CQNJB0Y", "title": "Tate Labs Bar Fly 2.0 - Men's", "description": "In the mode of constantly refining, and to keep up with aftermarket computer technology, Tate Labs completely revised its 'out-in-front' Garmin computer mount with the Bar Fly 2. 0. The mount now includes a new mounting position, it accommodates two computer sizes, and it provides housing for an electronic junction box underneath. With the Bar Fly 1. 1, we were introduced to the 1/8th turn engagement technology. This tactile 'click' lock-in feature carries over to the 2. 0, but the mount itself was given a complete overhaul. The Bar Fly 2. 0 was built with two computer mounting positions that are optimized for Garmin's 200/500 computer, as well as its 510/800/810 models. Once mounted, your computer now sits level with the stem instead of above it, as was the design on the original Bar Fly. The main bracket arm was also slimmed down in order to decrease weight compared to the 1. 1. Additionally, the Bar Fly 2. 0 was designed with electronic group sets in mind. Both Shimano Di2 and Campagnolo EPS junction boxes now conveniently mount underneath the 2. 0. And, just like the Bar Fly 1. 1, the 2. 0 is still manufactured in the USA out of Delrin, which is a stiff thermoplastic used in applications where durability is an absolute must. With no screws to lose, and 'zero risk of over-clamping and crushing lightweight carbon bars,' the Bar Fly 2. 0 positions all of your Garmin devices directly in the center of the handlebar for a safe viewing position. The Tate Labs Bar Fly 2. 0 is available in the color Black and it mounts to 31. 8mm diameter handlebars.", "text": "Tate Labs Bar Fly 2.0 - Men's In the mode of constantly refining, and to keep up with aftermarket computer technology, Tate Labs completely revised its 'out-in-front' Garmin computer mount with the Bar Fly 2. 0. The mount now includes a new mounting position, it accommodates two computer sizes, and it provides housing for an electronic junction box underneath. With the Bar Fly 1. 1, we were introduced to the 1/8th turn engagement technology. This tactile 'click' lock-in feature carries over to the 2. 0, but the mount itself was given a complete overhaul. The Bar Fly 2. 0 was built with two computer mounting positions that are optimized for Garmin's 200/500 computer, as well as its 510/800/810 models. Once mounted, your computer now sits level with the stem instead of above it, as was the design on the original Bar Fly. The main bracket arm was also slimmed down in order to decrease weight compared to the 1. 1. Additionally, the Bar Fly 2. 0 was designed with electronic group sets in mind. Both Shimano Di2 and Campagnolo EPS junction boxes now conveniently mount underneath the 2. 0. And, just like the Bar Fly 1. 1, the 2. 0 is still manufactured in the USA out of Delrin, which is a stiff thermoplastic used in applications where durability is an absolute must. With no screws to lose, and 'zero risk of over-clamping and crushing lightweight carbon bars,' the Bar Fly 2. 0 positions all of your Garmin devices directly in the center of the handlebar for a safe viewing position. The Tate Labs Bar Fly 2. 0 is available in the color Black and it mounts to 31. 8mm diameter handlebars.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nqmxxhLrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CQNJB0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bar Fly", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets"]], "price": 20.95}}
