{"item_id": "B00CTFIFT2", "title": "3V Gear Outlaw Sling Pack Over the Shoulder Day Bag", "description": "For the adventurer always on the move, impossible to catch and virtually unstoppable, only the 3V Gear Outlaw Sling Pack will do. Don't miss a step with this innovative sling style pack designed to provide quick access to your mission critical gear without removing the pack. Simply sling the Outlaw from your back to your chest and access via the side oriented compartments to your neatly organized gear. Built to exacting standards from heavy-duty 600D PVC nylon with rust resistant nylon zippers this pack can handle the rigors of Every Day Carry without a hitch. When carrying a large load, the extra stabilizer strap will transform the Outlaw Gear Slinger into a hauler just as steady and stable as any daypack. Featuring three intelligently sized storage compartments (with built in organizers), hydration compatible, and sling style design allows for full range of motion whether shouldering a weapon or scrambling up a talus slope. You'll be the one with the quickest drawOutlaw Sling Pack Features:*Built to exacting standards from heavy-duty 600D PVC nylon*Main compartment: 15\" H x 8\" W x 4\" Dw/ internal organization*Top front: 4.5\" H x 7.5\" W x 2\" D w/ internal organization*Bottom front: 8.5\" H x 8\" W x 2\" D w/ internal organization*Overall Size: 684\" cubic inches*Main compartment and hydration sleeve can accept CCW accessories*Designed for left shoulder for better weapon shouldering*Bag can be worn in front and contents accessed while sitting*Water bottle pocket sized to fit 32 oz. bottle*Theft deterrent devices built-in to secure zipper pulls*Zipper pulls threaded with para-cord*MOLLE and PALs compatible*Reinforced handles*Molded EVA vented back panel and air mesh sling strap*Hydration compatible*MOLLE Velcro ID panel w/3V Gear 3D PVC Logo patch", "text": "3V Gear Outlaw Sling Pack Over the Shoulder Day Bag For the adventurer always on the move, impossible to catch and virtually unstoppable, only the 3V Gear Outlaw Sling Pack will do. Don't miss a step with this innovative sling style pack designed to provide quick access to your mission critical gear without removing the pack. Simply sling the Outlaw from your back to your chest and access via the side oriented compartments to your neatly organized gear. Built to exacting standards from heavy-duty 600D PVC nylon with rust resistant nylon zippers this pack can handle the rigors of Every Day Carry without a hitch. When carrying a large load, the extra stabilizer strap will transform the Outlaw Gear Slinger into a hauler just as steady and stable as any daypack. Featuring three intelligently sized storage compartments (with built in organizers), hydration compatible, and sling style design allows for full range of motion whether shouldering a weapon or scrambling up a talus slope. You'll be the one with the quickest drawOutlaw Sling Pack Features:*Built to exacting standards from heavy-duty 600D PVC nylon*Main compartment: 15\" H x 8\" W x 4\" Dw/ internal organization*Top front: 4.5\" H x 7.5\" W x 2\" D w/ internal organization*Bottom front: 8.5\" H x 8\" W x 2\" D w/ internal organization*Overall Size: 684\" cubic inches*Main compartment and hydration sleeve can accept CCW accessories*Designed for left shoulder for better weapon shouldering*Bag can be worn in front and contents accessed while sitting*Water bottle pocket sized to fit 32 oz. bottle*Theft deterrent devices built-in to secure zipper pulls*Zipper pulls threaded with para-cord*MOLLE and PALs compatible*Reinforced handles*Molded EVA vented back panel and air mesh sling strap*Hydration compatible*MOLLE Velcro ID panel w/3V Gear 3D PVC Logo patch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ev%2BGOomEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CTFIFT2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 37.49}}
{"item_id": "B00CTQ0V6G", "title": "Mtech USA 8\" Full Tang Survival Hunting Knife - Colored Handle w/ Sheath NEW", "description": "MTech 8\" Hunting Knife with 4.25\" 440 black coated stainless steel blade & Full tang construction. Handle is Pink and includes a glass breaker & lanyard on end of handle. Comes with MTech black nylon belt sheath.", "text": "Mtech USA 8\" Full Tang Survival Hunting Knife - Colored Handle w/ Sheath NEW MTech 8\" Hunting Knife with 4.25\" 440 black coated stainless steel blade & Full tang construction. Handle is Pink and includes a glass breaker & lanyard on end of handle. Comes with MTech black nylon belt sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G%2BicKHVNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CTQ0V6G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mtech USA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 8.5}}
{"item_id": "B00CU7DU58", "title": "Trudeau 2-Pack Cool Off Hydration Bottle, Red", "description": "Stay hydrated, with a friend! One for you and another, or one for the car and one for home. Trudeau is making it simple to stay hydrated everywhere you go! With the Cool Off Hydration Bottle you'll be able to hydrate, stay mobile and all-the-while be good to the environment. This reusable hydration bottle holds 24-ounce of your favorite beverage. It's guaranteed leak-proof. Features an easy to use twist lid with soft, pop-up runner's straw. Plus, it'll keep those cool drinks cool, for up to two hours. Purple-colored body and lid. Ergonomic, contoured bottle with soft rubber grip body detail. Includes carabineer hook for instant attachment. 5 year warranty.", "text": "Trudeau 2-Pack Cool Off Hydration Bottle, Red Stay hydrated, with a friend! One for you and another, or one for the car and one for home. Trudeau is making it simple to stay hydrated everywhere you go! With the Cool Off Hydration Bottle you'll be able to hydrate, stay mobile and all-the-while be good to the environment. This reusable hydration bottle holds 24-ounce of your favorite beverage. It's guaranteed leak-proof. Features an easy to use twist lid with soft, pop-up runner's straw. Plus, it'll keep those cool drinks cool, for up to two hours. Purple-colored body and lid. Ergonomic, contoured bottle with soft rubber grip body detail. Includes carabineer hook for instant attachment. 5 year warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gBrNlcC9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CU7DU58.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Trudeau", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 24.03}}
{"item_id": "B00CU9R4M6", "title": "ODI Vans Grip with Lock-On Clamps, Black", "description": "Two Southern California originals have teamed up to create a modern- day classic grip design. Announcing the Vans Lock-On Grips by ODI, featuring the classic VANS waffle sole pattern.", "text": "ODI Vans Grip with Lock-On Clamps, Black Two Southern California originals have teamed up to create a modern- day classic grip design. Announcing the Vans Lock-On Grips by ODI, featuring the classic VANS waffle sole pattern.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ernsGs-oL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00CU9R4M6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Odi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]], "price": 18.58}}
