{"item_id": "B00D0B7HUM", "title": "Etekcity® Portable Lightweight Large Burner Classic Camping and Backpacking Stove with Carry Case for Butane and Propane Canisters", "description": "Cooking made easyIf you love camping or hiking and need a quick and easy way to make meals without having to carry all the necessary tools and equipment to start a fire, then this item is exactly what you are looking for.This lightweight stove is for camping trips or hiking. It fits in a small container and can be stored in your bag. Even though this is compact, it unfolds and can be used for larger pans. It uses iso-butane or a propane canister as fuel.No need to go through the hassle of starting a fire! With this handy stove, your cooking problems are solved.Perks of this stove1. Easy to store and lightweight2. Breaks down and fits in a small carrying caseAdditional use and features1. Fully adjustable flame2. Stove weighs 7.9 ounces in the case3. The stoves arms measure an impressive 7\" x 7\"4. The stove does not work with 1lb disposable propane cylindersPackage contents1x 7x7 inch portable stove1x Nylon stove case", "text": "Etekcity® Portable Lightweight Large Burner Classic Camping and Backpacking Stove with Carry Case for Butane and Propane Canisters Cooking made easyIf you love camping or hiking and need a quick and easy way to make meals without having to carry all the necessary tools and equipment to start a fire, then this item is exactly what you are looking for.This lightweight stove is for camping trips or hiking. It fits in a small container and can be stored in your bag. Even though this is compact, it unfolds and can be used for larger pans. It uses iso-butane or a propane canister as fuel.No need to go through the hassle of starting a fire! With this handy stove, your cooking problems are solved.Perks of this stove1. Easy to store and lightweight2. Breaks down and fits in a small carrying caseAdditional use and features1. Fully adjustable flame2. Stove weighs 7.9 ounces in the case3. The stoves arms measure an impressive 7\" x 7\"4. The stove does not work with 1lb disposable propane cylindersPackage contents1x 7x7 inch portable stove1x Nylon stove case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mL-pKb%2BfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00D0B7HUM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 7.96}}
