{"item_id": "B00D0FVW3G", "title": "6 Shiny Black ® Fiberglass Target Practice Arrows 30\"", "description": "1/2 dozen (picture shows 1 dozen, this listing is for only 1/2 dozen) high quality Shiny Black fiberglass target practice arrows for recurve, compound (except for all-capture arrow rests), or long bows. Standard 30 inches (measured from valley of nock to back of point). Nickel-plated stainless steel glued-on bullet tip. Note: determine the arrow length you need by drawing an extra-long arrow to full draw on your bow and having someone mark the arrow one inch in front of where the arrow contacts the most forward portion of the arrow rest. If your arrow touches the most forward portion of the arrow rest at 29\", get the 30\" arrow, so on and so forth. Most recommended targets: Styrofoam / synthetic. Most recommended targets: Styrofoam / synthetic. Choose from our full range of target arrows measuring from 18 to 36\". If you're looking for target arrows with the screw-in tips, please search for \"B00BA8AH18\" on Amazon. Or just search for \"Shiny Black arrows\" to see our full arrows offerings.", "text": "6 Shiny Black ® Fiberglass Target Practice Arrows 30\" 1/2 dozen (picture shows 1 dozen, this listing is for only 1/2 dozen) high quality Shiny Black fiberglass target practice arrows for recurve, compound (except for all-capture arrow rests), or long bows. Standard 30 inches (measured from valley of nock to back of point). Nickel-plated stainless steel glued-on bullet tip. Note: determine the arrow length you need by drawing an extra-long arrow to full draw on your bow and having someone mark the arrow one inch in front of where the arrow contacts the most forward portion of the arrow rest. If your arrow touches the most forward portion of the arrow rest at 29\", get the 30\" arrow, so on and so forth. Most recommended targets: Styrofoam / synthetic. Most recommended targets: Styrofoam / synthetic. Choose from our full range of target arrows measuring from 18 to 36\". If you're looking for target arrows with the screw-in tips, please search for \"B00BA8AH18\" on Amazon. Or just search for \"Shiny Black arrows\" to see our full arrows offerings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5197FwL8QrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00D0FVW3G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Targeting Arrows"]], "price": 23.95}}
{"item_id": "B00D0HP05U", "title": "Pellet Pins Stainless Steel Tumbling Media Ultra 47's - 2.5 Lbs with Lemi Shine", "description": "Stainless Steel Pin Media is designed to clean brass cases inside and out to give a \"like new\" look. Unlike conventional corn cob or walnut media, stainless media does not create dust and also cleans the inside of the cases, primer pockets and flash holes. Stainless media will not damage brass and does not require replacement after multiple uses. This media is designed to be used in a water tight rotary tumbler along with water and cleaning solution. See \"Bullseye Reloading Pellet Pins\" videos on Youtube for use information.", "text": "Pellet Pins Stainless Steel Tumbling Media Ultra 47's - 2.5 Lbs with Lemi Shine Stainless Steel Pin Media is designed to clean brass cases inside and out to give a \"like new\" look. Unlike conventional corn cob or walnut media, stainless media does not create dust and also cleans the inside of the cases, primer pockets and flash holes. Stainless media will not damage brass and does not require replacement after multiple uses. This media is designed to be used in a water tight rotary tumbler along with water and cleaning solution. See \"Bullseye Reloading Pellet Pins\" videos on Youtube for use information.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51W5iv2CaML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00D0HP05U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 31.0}}
