{"item_id": "B00D1H5NJC", "title": "Mrsight Tactical Compact Pistol Low Profile Rifle Red Laser Dot Sight Scope with Rail Mount Black", "description": "* Red Laser Sight Scope For Pistols/Rifles* Wavelength: 650nm* Power: <1mw100m* Powered by 3pcs AG5 battery* With Detachable Picatinny Rail.* Size: 32mm x 26mm x 26mm, Mini Style* On/Off Switch Is Located In The Back Of The Red Laser Sight* Come with Detachable Picatinny Rail.* Shock Proof, Can Be Used On Real Fire Pistols And Air Pistols/Rifles", "text": "Mrsight Tactical Compact Pistol Low Profile Rifle Red Laser Dot Sight Scope with Rail Mount Black * Red Laser Sight Scope For Pistols/Rifles* Wavelength: 650nm* Power: <1mw100m* Powered by 3pcs AG5 battery* With Detachable Picatinny Rail.* Size: 32mm x 26mm x 26mm, Mini Style* On/Off Switch Is Located In The Back Of The Red Laser Sight* Come with Detachable Picatinny Rail.* Shock Proof, Can Be Used On Real Fire Pistols And Air Pistols/Rifles", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lQmlAveIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00D1H5NJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mrsight", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 14.93}}
{"item_id": "B00D1HQAAI", "title": "LUCID Kill Flash Accessory for HD7 Red Dot Sight", "description": "Designed specifically for the HD7 red dot, this accessory reduces any annoying lens glare and reflection as well as add an extra level of protection for the objective lens of the HD7. .", "text": "LUCID Kill Flash Accessory for HD7 Red Dot Sight Designed specifically for the HD7 red dot, this accessory reduces any annoying lens glare and reflection as well as add an extra level of protection for the objective lens of the HD7. .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kJ0YxcuNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00D1HQAAI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lucid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B00D2E5DLW", "title": "Outbags OB-30ANK Nylon Neoprene Ankle Holster for Glock 26 / 27 / 29 / 30 / 40, Ruger SR9C / SR40C, S&W M&P Compact, Taurus Millennium PT58 / PT132 / PT138 / PT140 / PT145 / PT609 / PT638 / PT709 Slim / PT740 / PT745, Ruger LC9 and SR22 with Crimson Trace, Kahr CW9 / CW40 / CW45, Walther P22 Compact / P99 Compact", "description": "The OB-ANK Ankle Holsters series is unlike any other ankle holster. Made in Southern California from premium nylon materials, the Outbags Ankle Holsters brings you a durable kit at a reasonable price. The OB-ANK is set apart from other substandard ankle holsters by its neoprene ankle brace. Other ankle holsters are made with elastic materials which can stretch over time. This stretching will critically affect the ankle holster's hold. The Outbags neoprene brace will never stretch and will always provide a secured fit. Firearm not included. Recommended fit: Beretta 9000S, Beretta Nano, Beretta PX4 Storm Sub Compact, Bersa BP9CC / BP40CC, Bul M5 Ultra-X, Cobra FS32 / FS380, Colt Defender 90 Series 45 ACP, CZ-U CZ2075, Diamondback DP9, Glock 23 Compact / 26 / 27 / 29 / 30 / 40, H&K; P7, Hi-Point C9, Kahr CW9 / CW40 / CW45, Kahr K9 / K40 / P9, Kahr MK9 Elite Kel Tec PF9 / P11 with Crimson Trace, Mauser M2, Para Stealth, Para Warthog, Ruger LC9 / SR22 with Crimson Trace, Ruger SR9C / SR40C, S&W; 469 / 669 / 6904 / 6906 / 6946, S&W; Chiefs Special 9mm, S&W; M&P; Compact 9C / 40C /45C, Sig Sauer P224 / P239, Sig Sauer P250 Sub Compact, Springfield Armory XDs 45 ACP, Springfield XD 3\" Sub Compact, Taurus Millennium PT58 / PT132 / PT138 / PT140 / PT145 / PT609 / PT638 / PT709 Slim / PT740 / PT745, Walther P22 / P99 Compact / PPS,", "text": "Outbags OB-30ANK Nylon Neoprene Ankle Holster for Glock 26 / 27 / 29 / 30 / 40, Ruger SR9C / SR40C, S&W M&P Compact, Taurus Millennium PT58 / PT132 / PT138 / PT140 / PT145 / PT609 / PT638 / PT709 Slim / PT740 / PT745, Ruger LC9 and SR22 with Crimson Trace, Kahr CW9 / CW40 / CW45, Walther P22 Compact / P99 Compact The OB-ANK Ankle Holsters series is unlike any other ankle holster. Made in Southern California from premium nylon materials, the Outbags Ankle Holsters brings you a durable kit at a reasonable price. The OB-ANK is set apart from other substandard ankle holsters by its neoprene ankle brace. Other ankle holsters are made with elastic materials which can stretch over time. This stretching will critically affect the ankle holster's hold. The Outbags neoprene brace will never stretch and will always provide a secured fit. Firearm not included. Recommended fit: Beretta 9000S, Beretta Nano, Beretta PX4 Storm Sub Compact, Bersa BP9CC / BP40CC, Bul M5 Ultra-X, Cobra FS32 / FS380, Colt Defender 90 Series 45 ACP, CZ-U CZ2075, Diamondback DP9, Glock 23 Compact / 26 / 27 / 29 / 30 / 40, H&K; P7, Hi-Point C9, Kahr CW9 / CW40 / CW45, Kahr K9 / K40 / P9, Kahr MK9 Elite Kel Tec PF9 / P11 with Crimson Trace, Mauser M2, Para Stealth, Para Warthog, Ruger LC9 / SR22 with Crimson Trace, Ruger SR9C / SR40C, S&W; 469 / 669 / 6904 / 6906 / 6946, S&W; Chiefs Special 9mm, S&W; M&P; Compact 9C / 40C /45C, Sig Sauer P224 / P239, Sig Sauer P250 Sub Compact, Springfield Armory XDs 45 ACP, Springfield XD 3\" Sub Compact, Taurus Millennium PT58 / PT132 / PT138 / PT140 / PT145 / PT609 / PT638 / PT709 Slim / PT740 / PT745, Walther P22 / P99 Compact / PPS,", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wExk3NzAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00D2E5DLW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B00D2SYJWM", "title": "BioLite Portable Grill Attachment", "description": "The BioLite Portable Grill attaches to the BioLite Wood Burning Campstove to provide a safe, seamless, and fun way to cook your favorite foods. The unique design allows you to keep sizzling while your fire keeps burning, all without the need for charcoal or propane.Wood Fired Flavor: Cooking with wood just tastes better. Forget the petroleum based fuels and infuse your meals with savory flavors.Easy to Refuel: Re-stoke your fire in a snap. Flip open the fuel intake lid and have direct control of your flame levels without disrupting your grill surface.Compact Portable Design: The easy-to-fold legs and the durable plastic travel cover allow you to grill and go without mess or hassle.", "text": "BioLite Portable Grill Attachment The BioLite Portable Grill attaches to the BioLite Wood Burning Campstove to provide a safe, seamless, and fun way to cook your favorite foods. The unique design allows you to keep sizzling while your fire keeps burning, all without the need for charcoal or propane.Wood Fired Flavor: Cooking with wood just tastes better. Forget the petroleum based fuels and infuse your meals with savory flavors.Easy to Refuel: Re-stoke your fire in a snap. Flip open the fuel intake lid and have direct control of your flame levels without disrupting your grill surface.Compact Portable Design: The easy-to-fold legs and the durable plastic travel cover allow you to grill and go without mess or hassle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aaXIiNKQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00D2SYJWM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BioLite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Grills"]], "price": 59.95}}
