{"item_id": "B00DAEWHZ4", "title": "Patuoxun® Mini Backpacking BBQ Camping Stove with Piezo Ignition", "description": "Description:Young people like to have a barbecue in the outdoors to get together on holiday. Today we are pleased to recommend a functional cassette cooker for barbecue. It adopts top quality and latest technology, durable and high-efficient. With new and simple design, this Fission Gas Furnace is easy to use, bringing you much convenience. With carrying hand plastic box, compact and lightweight, easy to carry. It is widely used in the outdoors, family, hotels, hotel teppanyaki oven, hot pot, cooking. What a wonderful Fission Gas Furnace for daily life!Specifications:Stove Type: portable typeIgnition: Piezo ignitionRated speed: 3000WMaterial: Aluminum alloy and stainless steelColor: As the picture shownCarrying Box Demensions: 79 x 56 x 41mmWeight: 135gPackage Contents:1 x Outdoor BBQ Camping Portable Mini Fission Gas Furnace Stove Burner Dentation1 x Portable Carrying Box", "text": "Patuoxun® Mini Backpacking BBQ Camping Stove with Piezo Ignition Description:Young people like to have a barbecue in the outdoors to get together on holiday. Today we are pleased to recommend a functional cassette cooker for barbecue. It adopts top quality and latest technology, durable and high-efficient. With new and simple design, this Fission Gas Furnace is easy to use, bringing you much convenience. With carrying hand plastic box, compact and lightweight, easy to carry. It is widely used in the outdoors, family, hotels, hotel teppanyaki oven, hot pot, cooking. What a wonderful Fission Gas Furnace for daily life!Specifications:Stove Type: portable typeIgnition: Piezo ignitionRated speed: 3000WMaterial: Aluminum alloy and stainless steelColor: As the picture shownCarrying Box Demensions: 79 x 56 x 41mmWeight: 135gPackage Contents:1 x Outdoor BBQ Camping Portable Mini Fission Gas Furnace Stove Burner Dentation1 x Portable Carrying Box", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Cdx7x-saL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DAEWHZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Backpacking Stoves"]], "price": 11.19}}
{"item_id": "B00DAMWXLO", "title": "Jump Rope - Fast Speed Cable for Mastering Double Unders - Best For Cross Fitness Training, WOD's, Boxing, MMA, Exercise and Fitness - The WOD WHIPPER(TM) Includes *FREE* Workout Ebook and Carry Case - 100% Lifetime Better Than Money Back Guarantee - © 2014", "description": "IS 2014 THE YEAR YOU MASTER THOSE DOUBLE UNDERS AND TAKE YOUR WORKOUTS TO THE NEXT LEVEL?Discover the Secret to Blasting Fat, Getting that Perfect Lean Body and Mastering those Double Unders in Half the Time and Cost with the WOD WHIPPER - The DOUBLE UNDER WONDER!We know attaining that perfect body can be hard when juggling work and homelife, so join the jump rope revolution and say goodbye to long boring cardio workouts forever!Check Out The Benefits Of This Revolutionary Jump Rope Below!- Short intense Jump Rope circuits are an effective way to burn both during and POST WORKOUT- Just 10 mins of jump roping can provide the same calorie burn as 30 mins of slow cardio- Perfect for beginners, WOD's, Cross Fitness Training, Boxing, MMA Training and Much More!JOIN THE JUMP ROPE REVOLUTION - GET YOUR MASTER OF MUSCLE SPEED JUMP ROPE TODAYLIGHTWEIGHT WIRE CABLE- For Ultra Fast Spinning to Master those Double UndersDURABLE AND ABRASIVE RESISTANT - Developed with Thermoplastic Polyurethane (TPU) Black Coated Wire for Maximum ProtectionNO TANGLING OR KINKING - Perfect stress free workout every timePORTABLE - Get your workouts in Anytime, Anyplace!GET ON TRACK - FREE EBOOK (usually $47) Featuring the Best 20 Jump Rope Workouts with Every PurchaseWORRY FREE SHOPPING - We offer a BETTER than money back guarantee, if there is an issue with your product for any reason we will REFUND you and SEND YOU A NEW ONE.SO ORDER NOW - And when you do, consider getting one for you and one for your WOD partner!", "text": "Jump Rope - Fast Speed Cable for Mastering Double Unders - Best For Cross Fitness Training, WOD's, Boxing, MMA, Exercise and Fitness - The WOD WHIPPER(TM) Includes *FREE* Workout Ebook and Carry Case - 100% Lifetime Better Than Money Back Guarantee - © 2014 IS 2014 THE YEAR YOU MASTER THOSE DOUBLE UNDERS AND TAKE YOUR WORKOUTS TO THE NEXT LEVEL?Discover the Secret to Blasting Fat, Getting that Perfect Lean Body and Mastering those Double Unders in Half the Time and Cost with the WOD WHIPPER - The DOUBLE UNDER WONDER!We know attaining that perfect body can be hard when juggling work and homelife, so join the jump rope revolution and say goodbye to long boring cardio workouts forever!Check Out The Benefits Of This Revolutionary Jump Rope Below!- Short intense Jump Rope circuits are an effective way to burn both during and POST WORKOUT- Just 10 mins of jump roping can provide the same calorie burn as 30 mins of slow cardio- Perfect for beginners, WOD's, Cross Fitness Training, Boxing, MMA Training and Much More!JOIN THE JUMP ROPE REVOLUTION - GET YOUR MASTER OF MUSCLE SPEED JUMP ROPE TODAYLIGHTWEIGHT WIRE CABLE- For Ultra Fast Spinning to Master those Double UndersDURABLE AND ABRASIVE RESISTANT - Developed with Thermoplastic Polyurethane (TPU) Black Coated Wire for Maximum ProtectionNO TANGLING OR KINKING - Perfect stress free workout every timePORTABLE - Get your workouts in Anytime, Anyplace!GET ON TRACK - FREE EBOOK (usually $47) Featuring the Best 20 Jump Rope Workouts with Every PurchaseWORRY FREE SHOPPING - We offer a BETTER than money back guarantee, if there is an issue with your product for any reason we will REFUND you and SEND YOU A NEW ONE.SO ORDER NOW - And when you do, consider getting one for you and one for your WOD partner!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51sjNnW1zCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DAMWXLO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 13.99}}
