{"item_id": "B00DATDXVQ", "title": "# 1 Bicycle Multitool - New to the USA - 3 Way design bicycle tool using HEX 4/5/6 Heads - Only 77 grams in weight - Unique \"TRI DESIGN\" shape, that works on all bikes. Made from Stainless Steel with lifetime guarantee against corrosion. Suitable for all bike models (Racers, MTB, Citybike, Kids / BMX Bike). Uses HEX 4/5/6 ; Superior design to Parktool or Topeak. Works with Trek, Giant, Scott, Specialized, Colnago, DeRosa Bicycles. In stock & ships today with Amazon.com - FREE SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $35", "description": "DO YOU WANT TO OWN THE BEST BICYCLE MULTI TOOL ON THE MARKET?New to the USA Bicycle Market ...we have a unique \"TRI shape\" bicycle tool USING hex 4/5/6 tool heads. Made from HI STRENGHT stainless steel material, that is perfect for every cycling emergency you can think of.... and only 77grams weight!KEY BENEFITS & FEATURES:-1 simple sized bicycle multitool for easy use and storage-3 Different tool heads for maximum versatility-Allows for 90 & 270 degree auto index-80mm Long leverage capability-Made from 100% stainless steel material-Certified SUS420 High Grade material-Percison engineered tool, made with hand assembly-Unique triangle shape design that fits neatly in your hand, jersey or saddle bag-Seriously light weight at only 77 grams or 2.7 ounces-Made in a world class bike component facility : Designed in the USA-Dimensions: 90mm x 34mm-Corrosion resistant surface-Superb smooth satin finish-Ships today via amazon in a durable plastic case.TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION:Our TRI TOOL contains 3 (HEX 4/5/6) heads for use on ANY bicycle on the market (Racer bike, MTB, Citybike or Single gear/Fixed wheel, Kids bicycle. Our design is simple & versatile.LIFETIME PRODUCT GUARANTEE:So that you can buy with complete peace of mind, we are happy to offer amazon customers a \"lifetime guarantee\" against corrosion on our tri-tool or your money back. Guarantee is subject to correct use as a bike tool onlyFREE SHIPPING FOR ORDE