dExtensive Lifetime of CREE LED: Up to 100,000 hoursType of Battery : 2 x 18650 Battery ( Included )Battery Features:- Suitable for Flashlight Torch / Headlamp.- Capacity: 4000mAh.- Voltage: 3.7V.- Color as picture shown.Color: BlackDimension: 50mmHeadlamp Weight: 180gSuitable for most indoor like home maintenance and outdoor activities like camping, fishing, hiking, map reading, night fishing, night flying, sailing, caving and hunting etc.AC Charger FeaturesColor: BlackPackage Content :1 x WindFire Super Bright CREE XM-L XML T6 U2 LED 1800 Lm Rechargeable 18650 Battery Headlamp1 x AC Charger 100v-240v Battery Charger ( LED indication for Power On / Charging / Full charge )2 x WindFire 4000mAh 18650 rechargeable batteriesWindFire After Service: 30 Days Money Back Guarantee, 12 Months Warranty!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NEbvvRPmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DDHHHDU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 11.19}}
