{"item_id": "B00DDP3DZ8", "title": "TETON Sports Tracker +5 Degree F Ultralight Sleeping Bag (4.1 lbs, 87\"x 34\"x 22\", Red/Grey)", "description": "Innovative PolarLite insulation keeps you warm even though entire bag is thin and light. 3-piece no gap hood pulls in perfectly around your face. Bag shapes to body lines and has a vaulted foot-box with an extra layer of fill to keep feet toasty, even in freezing weather. Zippers inside and outside of bag for easy closure. 87\" x 34\" (at widest point) provides more shoulder and leg room. Weighs 4.1 lbs.", "text": "TETON Sports Tracker +5 Degree F Ultralight Sleeping Bag (4.1 lbs, 87\"x 34\"x 22\", Red/Grey) Innovative PolarLite insulation keeps you warm even though entire bag is thin and light. 3-piece no gap hood pulls in perfectly around your face. Bag shapes to body lines and has a vaulted foot-box with an extra layer of fill to keep feet toasty, even in freezing weather. Zippers inside and outside of bag for easy closure. 87\" x 34\" (at widest point) provides more shoulder and leg room. Weighs 4.1 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318QzX6rESL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DDP3DZ8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 75.07}}
{"item_id": "B00DDZTX1Q", "title": "Survivor HK-106320 Outdoor Fixed Blade Knife 7 Overall WITH FIRE STARTER 2 Pack (2 Pack)", "description": "2 stainless-steel tanto blade, this versatile and practical military-style tanto knife is a terrific choice for knife enthusiasts. The knife also includes a thick green cord-wrapped handle that allows for a secure and comfortable grip, along with a pommel lanyard that keeps your blade handy at all times. Other features include a durable green nylon belt sheath with a Velcro securing strap, a magnesium alloy fire starter, and a total length of 7 Inch.", "text": "Survivor HK-106320 Outdoor Fixed Blade Knife 7 Overall WITH FIRE STARTER 2 Pack (2 Pack) 2 stainless-steel tanto blade, this versatile and practical military-style tanto knife is a terrific choice for knife enthusiasts. The knife also includes a thick green cord-wrapped handle that allows for a secure and comfortable grip, along with a pommel lanyard that keeps your blade handy at all times. Other features include a durable green nylon belt sheath with a Velcro securing strap, a magnesium alloy fire starter, and a total length of 7 Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wfSUvk4dL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DDZTX1Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Survivor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 11.0}}
{"item_id": "B00DE1GNJ4", "title": "Tactical Stealth Black Mossberg 500 590 835 Maverick 88 12 & 20 Gauge Shotgun Stock Buttstock With Sling Swivel + Recoil Buttpad Featuring Phoenix Technology Pistol Grip Stock Tube", "description": "Reinforced Glass Filled Zytel Construction - Black Color. Textured Back For \"Non-Slip\" & High Impact Strong A-Frame Design With Integrated Cheek Rest. Features 2 ambidextrous swivel stud attachment points and also includes a rotating push button sling swivel. Comfortable Ergonomic Design For Optimal Comfort And Performance. Made In The USA. Rugged and Easy to Use Rear Pistol Grip (Detachable from the Stock for Pistol Grip Use Only). All installation hardware and tools included. No gunsmithing. Fits Mossberg 500/590/835/Maverick 88 12 & 20 Gauge Shotguns - No Gunsmithing Required.", "text": "Tactical Stealth Black Mossberg 500 590 835 Maverick 88 12 & 20 Gauge Shotgun Stock Buttstock With Sling Swivel + Recoil Buttpad Featuring Phoenix Technology Pistol Grip Stock Tube Reinforced Glass Filled Zytel Construction - Black Color. Textured Back For \"Non-Slip\" & High Impact Strong A-Frame Design With Integrated Cheek Rest. Features 2 ambidextrous swivel stud attachment points and also includes a rotating push button sling swivel. Comfortable Ergonomic Design For Optimal Comfort And Performance. Made In The USA. Rugged and Easy to Use Rear Pistol Grip (Detachable from the Stock for Pistol Grip Use Only). All installation hardware and tools included. No gunsmithing. Fits Mossberg 500/590/835/Maverick 88 12 & 20 Gauge Shotguns - No Gunsmithing Required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DIT3nREkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DE1GNJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AR-GEAR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 54.95}}
{"item_id": "B00DEEXZ92", "title": "Custom Black Slide Cover Plates - American Flag \"Stars and Stripes\", by Fixxxer LLC, fits most Glock models", "description": "American Flag DesignFixxxer slide back plates are made of T6 aluminum, hard coat anodized. Great replacement for a plastic factory part. All designs are laser engraved.Black anodized and permanent laser engraved slide cover plates are made from durable aluminum. Slide cover plates fit all models and are easily installed.You will love the quality of FIXXXER products.Fits all Generation 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 26, 27, 30, 31, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38, 39Fixxxer LLCis proud to be an American Company. We stand behind our products, period.Disclaimer - \"GLOCK\" is a federally registered trademark of Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. Fixxxer LLC has NO affiliation in any manner with, or otherwise endorsed by, Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. The use of the word \"GLOCK \" on this page is merely to identify which firearm these parts or components are compatible with.", "text": "Custom Black Slide Cover Plates - American Flag \"Stars and Stripes\", by Fixxxer LLC, fits most Glock models American Flag DesignFixxxer slide back plates are made of T6 aluminum, hard coat anodized. Great replacement for a plastic factory part. All designs are laser engraved.Black anodized and permanent laser engraved slide cover plates are made from durable aluminum. Slide cover plates fit all models and are easily installed.You will love the quality of FIXXXER products.Fits all Generation 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 26, 27, 30, 31, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38, 39Fixxxer LLCis proud to be an American Company. We stand behind our products, period.Disclaimer - \"GLOCK\" is a federally registered trademark of Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. Fixxxer LLC has NO affiliation in any manner with, or otherwise endorsed by, Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. The use of the word \"GLOCK \" on this page is merely to identify which firearm these parts or components are compatible with.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VLFveyjOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DEEXZ92.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fixxxer LLC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 12.5}}
