{"item_id": "B00DFC9Z7O", "title": "Ispeed Mirror Pro Swim Goggle", "description": "IspeedIspeed was born in 2013 on the beautiful harbor in Boston, MA, USA. As the most energetic brand, Ispeed is committed to provide the most innovative and price-friendly sport goods. Ispeed is about the intelligent way of speed. Technological quality is the priority of the company's products. Exclusively presented on Amazon, Ispeed is offering fashion swimming goggles, swim training gloves and snorkels.New Anti-fog Swimming Goggles Electroplated and silica gel frame, adjustable,suitable for kids,children. Anti-fog is a necessary feature for an excellent multi-purpose goggle. Super comfortable.1、High-class PC glassesIts properties of Waterproof,antifogging,compression resistance,abrasion resistance, high lens transmittance and UV resisitance make you see clearly in water.2、Sophisticated buckleIt can be adjusted according to the size and shape of your face to make you comfortable.3、Fashion frameThe fashion and streamlined frame has been sophisticated made and can be chosen from more than six colours.4、Double sealing ringHigh-class silicon rubber sealing ring has double sealing ring make it is 100% waterproof.5、High hardness nose designHigh hardness materials have been used and can't be broken.6、High density silicon rubber strapSophisticated package keeps goggles in good condition and also avoid be worn by tough stuff.Product features: The international latest antifogging technology has been used and the effect is great .We also use Polycarbonate glasses and UV resisitance makes you see clearly.Designed according to the latest Ergonomics and Fluid mechanics theory and streamlined appearance decreases resistance when in water . The design of the middle head strap is double which avoids the glasses lost when you swim .", "text": "Ispeed Mirror Pro Swim Goggle IspeedIspeed was born in 2013 on the beautiful harbor in Boston, MA, USA. As the most energetic brand, Ispeed is committed to provide the most innovative and price-friendly sport goods. Ispeed is about the intelligent way of speed. Technological quality is the priority of the company's products. Exclusively presented on Amazon, Ispeed is offering fashion swimming goggles, swim training gloves and snorkels.New Anti-fog Swimming Goggles Electroplated and silica gel frame, adjustable,suitable for kids,children. Anti-fog is a necessary feature for an excellent multi-purpose goggle. Super comfortable.1、High-class PC glassesIts properties of Waterproof,antifogging,compression resistance,abrasion resistance, high lens transmittance and UV resisitance make you see clearly in water.2、Sophisticated buckleIt can be adjusted according to the size and shape of your face to make you comfortable.3、Fashion frameThe fashion and streamlined frame has been sophisticated made and can be chosen from more than six colours.4、Double sealing ringHigh-class silicon rubber sealing ring has double sealing ring make it is 100% waterproof.5、High hardness nose designHigh hardness materials have been used and can't be broken.6、High density silicon rubber strapSophisticated package keeps goggles in good condition and also avoid be worn by tough stuff.Product features: The international latest antifogging technology has been used and the effect is great .We also use Polycarbonate glasses and UV resisitance makes you see clearly.Designed according to the latest Ergonomics and Fluid mechanics theory and streamlined appearance decreases resistance when in water . The design of the middle head strap is double which avoids the glasses lost when you swim .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bU%2B9qQsAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DFC9Z7O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 11.99}}
