{"item_id": "B00DG8ZMR4", "title": "Everyday Holsters Smith & Wesson M&P Shield Hybrid Holster IWB Right Hand", "description": "About Everyday Holsters (EDH for short) Everyday Holsters was founded to deliver exceptional value in the Hybrid Holster market for the common individual at a price that is affordable. Everyday Holsters strives to deliver the most comfortable concealed carry holsters available while not taking advantage of our customers. We are a small family owned holster manufacturing company that believes in American Made products. We strongly believe in the 2nd Amendment and in the God Given right to own firearms. We strive for customer satisfaction and as such have a 2 week trial period for you to try out our holster, if you don't love it return it and we'll refund your money. Additionally the holster is Lifetime warranty against everything but stupid. We are located in Louisville, Kentucky", "text": "Everyday Holsters Smith & Wesson M&P Shield Hybrid Holster IWB Right Hand About Everyday Holsters (EDH for short) Everyday Holsters was founded to deliver exceptional value in the Hybrid Holster market for the common individual at a price that is affordable. Everyday Holsters strives to deliver the most comfortable concealed carry holsters available while not taking advantage of our customers. We are a small family owned holster manufacturing company that believes in American Made products. We strongly believe in the 2nd Amendment and in the God Given right to own firearms. We strive for customer satisfaction and as such have a 2 week trial period for you to try out our holster, if you don't love it return it and we'll refund your money. Additionally the holster is Lifetime warranty against everything but stupid. We are located in Louisville, Kentucky", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jF7BvoHQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DG8ZMR4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 35.0}}
{"item_id": "B00DG9NFVI", "title": "Strike Industries JellyFish Transparent Laser Dot Sight Optics Cover for TRIJICON RMR (NOT all models) *** FREE shipping when checkout ***", "description": "Note:Jellyfish will not fit on Dual-illuminate type models (RM03, RM04, RM05, RM05G, RM08A, RM08G, RMR-C-700064, RMR-C-700065, and RMR-C-700066)\"The RMR cover will not properly fit if rear sights are installed. Modification of RMR-JellyFish is required to use rear sights with the RMR cover.\"For more product info, please visit at www.strikeindustries.comWhen you think of Jellyfish the most common words are \"transparent\", \"waterbourne\", and \"deadly\". Those same adjectives can perfectly describe the next great innovation from Strike Industries. Having a cover for a red dot is almost a necessity. But the time wasted to remove the cover, especially in an emergency situation, is a thing of the past thanks to the Jellyfish's patent pending clear cover. You no longer have to worry about removing the protection over your Trijicon RMR, even during inclement weather such as rain or snow or even a dust storm. The Jellyfish also features a lanyard hole to attach to your red dot or your belt/holster for quick draw removal if you desire. It also has a finger grip at the rear for easy flip off removal. The Jellyfish is both rigid for strength yet flexible for ease of installation. ThePackage include:Jelly Fish X1", "text": "Strike Industries JellyFish Transparent Laser Dot Sight Optics Cover for TRIJICON RMR (NOT all models) *** FREE shipping when checkout *** Note:Jellyfish will not fit on Dual-illuminate type models (RM03, RM04, RM05, RM05G, RM08A, RM08G, RMR-C-700064, RMR-C-700065, and RMR-C-700066)\"The RMR cover will not properly fit if rear sights are installed. Modification of RMR-JellyFish is required to use rear sights with the RMR cover.\"For more product info, please visit at www.strikeindustries.comWhen you think of Jellyfish the most common words are \"transparent\", \"waterbourne\", and \"deadly\". Those same adjectives can perfectly describe the next great innovation from Strike Industries. Having a cover for a red dot is almost a necessity. But the time wasted to remove the cover, especially in an emergency situation, is a thing of the past thanks to the Jellyfish's patent pending clear cover. You no longer have to worry about removing the protection over your Trijicon RMR, even during inclement weather such as rain or snow or even a dust storm. The Jellyfish also features a lanyard hole to attach to your red dot or your belt/holster for quick draw removal if you desire. It also has a finger grip at the rear for easy flip off removal. The Jellyfish is both rigid for strength yet flexible for ease of installation. ThePackage include:Jelly Fish X1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51h9t8zetSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DG9NFVI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Rings & Covers", "Optic Covers"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B00DGAID78", "title": "Black Mountain Products Ultimate Resistance Band Set with Starter Guide", "description": "Black Mountain Products (B.M.P.) resistance bands are made from the highest quality rubber to ensure maximum life. This Black Mountain Products Ultimate set of resistance bands includes seven stackable resistance bands, two sets of handles, two door anchors, two ankle straps, carrying bag and exercise manual. This set of exercise bands optimizes the advantage of using any single or multiple (1-7) bands at once to achieve multiple levels of resistance. B.M.P.'s stackable set of exercise bands allow for a much wider range of resistance then traditional resistance bands sets. Any combination of bands may be used at one time, without the hassles of having multiple handles on each band. This increase in range and ease of use makes this set perfect for anyone from beginners and experts. Stackable bands allow you to achieve the highest levels of resistance possible.", "text": "Black Mountain Products Ultimate Resistance Band Set with Starter Guide Black Mountain Products (B.M.P.) resistance bands are made from the highest quality rubber to ensure maximum life. This Black Mountain Products Ultimate set of resistance bands includes seven stackable resistance bands, two sets of handles, two door anchors, two ankle straps, carrying bag and exercise manual. This set of exercise bands optimizes the advantage of using any single or multiple (1-7) bands at once to achieve multiple levels of resistance. B.M.P.'s stackable set of exercise bands allow for a much wider range of resistance then traditional resistance bands sets. Any combination of bands may be used at one time, without the hassles of having multiple handles on each band. This increase in range and ease of use makes this set perfect for anyone from beginners and experts. Stackable bands allow you to achieve the highest levels of resistance possible.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XivewJg0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DGAID78.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Mountain", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 54.99}}
{"item_id": "B00DGAW3LA", "title": "Shakespeare Micro Spinning Rod", "description": "If you haven't tried it yet, ultra-light fishing can be one of the most enjoyable ways to fish. The Shakespeare Micro Series rods have a variety of actions and lengths to fit any species and are perfect for fishing with lighter lures and lines.", "text": "Shakespeare Micro Spinning Rod If you haven't tried it yet, ultra-light fishing can be one of the most enjoyable ways to fish. The Shakespeare Micro Series rods have a variety of actions and lengths to fit any species and are perfect for fishing with lighter lures and lines.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21XfHqJ4oML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DGAW3LA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rods", "Spinning Rods"]]}}
