{"item_id": "B00DH0YYR0", "title": "TYR Sport Special Ops 2.0 Polarized Swimming Goggle", "description": "Go fast or go home with the Special Ops 2.0 Polarized Goggle. Our #1 all-around goggle, the Special Ops is engineered for triathlon, open water and training. Constructed with polarized lenses, the LGSPL performance goggle provides clarity, optical precision and comfort by filtering out 99.9% of the surface glare that causes eye fatigue. This racing goggle has durable, hypoallergenic DURAFIT silicone gaskets that provide a comfortable, watertight seal and maintain their shape over time. Featuring embedded anti-fog, a unibody design and a wide peripheral range for optimal sighting, these competition goggles are sure to meet the demands of a serious swimmer. Customize It: Choose your colors. Choose your gaskets. Choose your lenses. You design the goggles, we build them: (link to customizable page)\".", "text": "TYR Sport Special Ops 2.0 Polarized Swimming Goggle Go fast or go home with the Special Ops 2.0 Polarized Goggle. Our #1 all-around goggle, the Special Ops is engineered for triathlon, open water and training. Constructed with polarized lenses, the LGSPL performance goggle provides clarity, optical precision and comfort by filtering out 99.9% of the surface glare that causes eye fatigue. This racing goggle has durable, hypoallergenic DURAFIT silicone gaskets that provide a comfortable, watertight seal and maintain their shape over time. Featuring embedded anti-fog, a unibody design and a wide peripheral range for optimal sighting, these competition goggles are sure to meet the demands of a serious swimmer. Customize It: Choose your colors. Choose your gaskets. Choose your lenses. You design the goggles, we build them: (link to customizable page)\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319yNCi0b3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DH0YYR0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TYR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 21.28}}
{"item_id": "B00DH7GMO6", "title": "223 5.56 Lower Vise Block Made in USA Black", "description": "Robust designs and high performance is what to expect from Squirrel Daddy products. Our lower vise block will work with an AR-15 lower receiver that is stripped or a fully assembled. You may work on the top side or bottom side of the receiver without removing the block from the vise. With our design only the bottom part of the block will get marked up from the vise jaws, leaving the precision machined upper part undamaged so you will have a perfect fit every time.", "text": "223 5.56 Lower Vise Block Made in USA Black Robust designs and high performance is what to expect from Squirrel Daddy products. Our lower vise block will work with an AR-15 lower receiver that is stripped or a fully assembled. You may work on the top side or bottom side of the receiver without removing the block from the vise. With our design only the bottom part of the block will get marked up from the vise jaws, leaving the precision machined upper part undamaged so you will have a perfect fit every time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iBClA1eRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DH7GMO6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 9.85}}
