{"item_id": "B00DHIZ6GK", "title": "Outlander Big Packable Handy Lightweight Travel Backpack Daypack", "description": "It is a compact daypack for people on the go. When you're not using the daypack, however, it fits into an ultra-compact pouch, so you can easily pack it in your suitcase for use at their destination and/or as an extra bag for the trip home !About OutlanderSince 1988, Outlander has built affordable, reliable backpack that enables everyone make travel easier and more fun. Outlander's success extends across the globe, where they have become a leading designer and manufacturer of durable backpacks.If for any reason you are not happy with any product sold from our store , please do not hesitate to contact us and we'll do our best to solve your problem quickly and efficiently! We take full ownership and responsibility for the quality of our products.Outlander is a registered trademark. Outlander products are sold by authorized sellers only.", "text": "Outlander Big Packable Handy Lightweight Travel Backpack Daypack It is a compact daypack for people on the go. When you're not using the daypack, however, it fits into an ultra-compact pouch, so you can easily pack it in your suitcase for use at their destination and/or as an extra bag for the trip home !About OutlanderSince 1988, Outlander has built affordable, reliable backpack that enables everyone make travel easier and more fun. Outlander's success extends across the globe, where they have become a leading designer and manufacturer of durable backpacks.If for any reason you are not happy with any product sold from our store , please do not hesitate to contact us and we'll do our best to solve your problem quickly and efficiently! We take full ownership and responsibility for the quality of our products.Outlander is a registered trademark. Outlander products are sold by authorized sellers only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K4tv2mlZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DHIZ6GK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outlander", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 24.9}}
{"item_id": "B00DI1F058", "title": "SKLZ Basketball Shooting Target", "description": "See the target, make the shot with the SKLZ Shooting Target. This basketball shooting aid gives players a true target to aim for in the center of the rim while shooting from all positions on the court. The target attaches easily to the net hooks on the rim and doesn't alter the ball in flight. Works for any shot on the court.", "text": "SKLZ Basketball Shooting Target See the target, make the shot with the SKLZ Shooting Target. This basketball shooting aid gives players a true target to aim for in the center of the rim while shooting from all positions on the court. The target attaches easily to the net hooks on the rim and doesn't alter the ball in flight. Works for any shot on the court.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xvD5%2BEx1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DI1F058.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Training Equipment"]], "price": 10.25}}
