{"item_id": "B00DI2CNG6", "title": "SKLZ 360 V2 All Position Batting Tee", "description": "Promote proper swing mechanics and body positioning using the 360° Tee. It swivels to any spot for full plate coverage to practice hitting outside, inside, high and low pitches by simply repositioning the tee. The slanted rubber cup is designed to hold the ball in place in any position.", "text": "SKLZ 360 V2 All Position Batting Tee Promote proper swing mechanics and body positioning using the 360° Tee. It swivels to any spot for full plate coverage to practice hitting outside, inside, high and low pitches by simply repositioning the tee. The slanted rubber cup is designed to hold the ball in place in any position.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ZwR3vD1DL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DI2CNG6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Batting Tees"]], "price": 24.97}}
{"item_id": "B00DI2CNHU", "title": "SKLZ Travel V2 Quick Assembly Portable Batting Tee", "description": "This light yet durable portable baseball hitting tee quickly folds up and fits into any bat bag, allowing you to train no matter where you go. An adjustable height and sturdy tripod configuration make this versatile travel tee a great training aid for baseball players of all ages and skill levels.", "text": "SKLZ Travel V2 Quick Assembly Portable Batting Tee This light yet durable portable baseball hitting tee quickly folds up and fits into any bat bag, allowing you to train no matter where you go. An adjustable height and sturdy tripod configuration make this versatile travel tee a great training aid for baseball players of all ages and skill levels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21g7CLra8wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DI2CNHU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Batting Tees"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B00DI2CNIY", "title": "SKLZ 5 Position V2 Traditional Batting Training Tee", "description": "SKLZ 5 Position V2 Traditional Batting Training Tee", "text": "SKLZ 5 Position V2 Traditional Batting Training Tee SKLZ 5 Position V2 Traditional Batting Training Tee", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uMKkQLWtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DI2CNIY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Batting Tees"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B00DIHT044", "title": "Etekcity® Portable Outdoor Picnic Backpacking Canister Camp Stove with Carry Case/ Adjustable Fire/ Steel Stand, Only 7.9oz", "description": "Are you sick of packing up the grill to go camping? Are you looking for a small stove for camping and hiking trips? This Etekcity lightweight foldable stove is perfect for camping and backpacking. The stove connects to the top of portable butane and propane tanks. The unit performs much like that of a household gas stove, and is powerful enough for a frying pan or saucepan to boil water. The Stove is collapsible to ensure it does not take up much room in your bag.Adjustable flameOne of the great new features that comes along with the larger stove is the adjustable nozzle. This new function allows the user the ability to adjust the heat and even create a simmer.LightweightEven with a larger stovetop, the camping stove remains light and compact. The stove weighs just 7.9 oz once placed in the nylon case. The frame also breaks down into two pieces for smaller storage or cleaning purposes.Technical Specifications1. Stainless steel2. Use Size: 8.27 x 8.27 x 3.54in / 21 x 21 x 9cm3. Natural state dimensions: 2.76 x 2.56in / 7 x 6.5cm (not including knitted air pipe diameter x height)4. Knitted air pipe length: 13.98 in / 35cm5. Roast Mesh Diameter: 2.56inch / 6.5cm6. Steel stand: 4.33 x 3.94inch / 11 x 10cm7. Weight: 9.60 oz8. The burning cover is made of 0.5mm thick steel plate9. Power: 3000wPackage Contents1x Etekcity Outdoor Split Stove1x Steel Stand1x Carrying Case (Bag)", "text": "Etekcity® Portable Outdoor Picnic Backpacking Canister Camp Stove with Carry Case/ Adjustable Fire/ Steel Stand, Only 7.9oz Are you sick of packing up the grill to go camping? Are you looking for a small stove for camping and hiking trips? This Etekcity lightweight foldable stove is perfect for camping and backpacking. The stove connects to the top of portable butane and propane tanks. The unit performs much like that of a household gas stove, and is powerful enough for a frying pan or saucepan to boil water. The Stove is collapsible to ensure it does not take up much room in your bag.Adjustable flameOne of the great new features that comes along with the larger stove is the adjustable nozzle. This new function allows the user the ability to adjust the heat and even create a simmer.LightweightEven with a larger stovetop, the camping stove remains light and compact. The stove weighs just 7.9 oz once placed in the nylon case. The frame also breaks down into two pieces for smaller storage or cleaning purposes.Technical Specifications1. Stainless steel2. Use Size: 8.27 x 8.27 x 3.54in / 21 x 21 x 9cm3. Natural state dimensions: 2.76 x 2.56in / 7 x 6.5cm (not including knitted air pipe diameter x height)4. Knitted air pipe length: 13.98 in / 35cm5. Roast Mesh Diameter: 2.56inch / 6.5cm6. Steel stand: 4.33 x 3.94inch / 11 x 10cm7. Weight: 9.60 oz8. The burning cover is made of 0.5mm thick steel plate9. Power: 3000wPackage Contents1x Etekcity Outdoor Split Stove1x Steel Stand1x Carrying Case (Bag)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OfjUZbn4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DIHT044.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00DII7CTI", "title": "Streamlight 44931 The Siege Compact Alkaline LED Hand Lantern", "description": "", "text": "Streamlight 44931 The Siege Compact Alkaline LED Hand Lantern", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412CZ3Zwb3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DII7CTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Streamlight", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 37.29}}
{"item_id": "B00DIUM8BS", "title": "Horizon Fitness T101-04 Treadmill", "description": "Rated by the Treadmill Doctor as one of the \"Best Buys\" in its category, the new T101 treadmill combines a powerful, quiet motor and stable, comfortable platform with comprehensive console and Sonic Surround speakers with MP3 input so you play music through the console speakers. A strong frame that doesn't shake when you run will give you the confidence you need under your feet to stick with your program. Horizon Fitness treadmills have more welded steel components, making them easier to assemble and among the strongest and sturdiest around. The Perfect FLEX deck cushioning provides the right mix of shock absorption and support for less strain on your feet, ankles, knees and hips. And the COOL fit fitness fan keeps you cool as you walk, jog or run, giving you a more comfortable workout. It's easily storable, thanks to Horizon's exclusive Feather LIGHT lift, which incorporates two hydraulic shocks to assist you when raising and lowering the deck. The computer console has a 5\" green back-lit LCD display so you can quickly see your workout stats. You'll be able to challenge yourself and reach your fitness goals with 30 programming options that include a manual workout, 10 Step-goal workouts, 10 distance-based workouts, 6 calorie-goal workouts and 3 intervals workouts.", "text": "Horizon Fitness T101-04 Treadmill Rated by the Treadmill Doctor as one of the \"Best Buys\" in its category, the new T101 treadmill combines a powerful, quiet motor and stable, comfortable platform with comprehensive console and Sonic Surround speakers with MP3 input so you play music through the console speakers. A strong frame that doesn't shake when you run will give you the confidence you need under your feet to stick with your program. Horizon Fitness treadmills have more welded steel components, making them easier to assemble and among the strongest and sturdiest around. The Perfect FLEX deck cushioning provides the right mix of shock absorption and support for less strain on your feet, ankles, knees and hips. And the COOL fit fitness fan keeps you cool as you walk, jog or run, giving you a more comfortable workout. It's easily storable, thanks to Horizon's exclusive Feather LIGHT lift, which incorporates two hydraulic shocks to assist you when raising and lowering the deck. The computer console has a 5\" green back-lit LCD display so you can quickly see your workout stats. You'll be able to challenge yourself and reach your fitness goals with 30 programming options that include a manual workout, 10 Step-goal workouts, 10 distance-based workouts, 6 calorie-goal workouts and 3 intervals workouts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414zx-uY3FL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DIUM8BS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Treadmills"]], "price": 629.0}}
{"item_id": "B00DJZWLZ0", "title": "4\" Universal V Groove Soft Jaw Vise Blocks", "description": "This armorers tool is made from NO-M.A.R Polymer to protect the finish of your barrel. These Soft Jaw blocks are 4\" long, they will allow you to keep a positive grip on your barrel without the worry of leaving a mark. These are for medium to light duty gunsmith operations that require the barrel be held steady, they will resist a reasonable amount of rotational force, but would be inadequate for heavy duty twisting (such as barrel removal or installation). The V groove design will allow barrels from 1/2\" diameter to 1\" diameter to fit with ease...", "text": "4\" Universal V Groove Soft Jaw Vise Blocks This armorers tool is made from NO-M.A.R Polymer to protect the finish of your barrel. These Soft Jaw blocks are 4\" long, they will allow you to keep a positive grip on your barrel without the worry of leaving a mark. These are for medium to light duty gunsmith operations that require the barrel be held steady, they will resist a reasonable amount of rotational force, but would be inadequate for heavy duty twisting (such as barrel removal or installation). The V groove design will allow barrels from 1/2\" diameter to 1\" diameter to fit with ease...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iQywb1liL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DJZWLZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 10.95}}
{"item_id": "B00DLJMAIW", "title": "Push Button Qd Quick Detach/release 1.25\" Sling Swivel Mount", "description": "Made from High Strength Steel with Black Finish Simply push button to detach and attach swivel Swivel pin rotates freely after plugged in For use with 1 1/4inch wide slings Great for use on Quad Rail forends or other Picatinny accessory rails. Quick- detach feature provides emergency weapon install and release QD Push Button Style Stud Swivels Heavy duty alloy construction. weight: 0.9 oz.", "text": "Push Button Qd Quick Detach/release 1.25\" Sling Swivel Mount Made from High Strength Steel with Black Finish Simply push button to detach and attach swivel Swivel pin rotates freely after plugged in For use with 1 1/4inch wide slings Great for use on Quad Rail forends or other Picatinny accessory rails. Quick- detach feature provides emergency weapon install and release QD Push Button Style Stud Swivels Heavy duty alloy construction. weight: 0.9 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qTbOVvplL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DLJMAIW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 6.22}}
{"item_id": "B00DMIEZEO", "title": "Hydro Flask Flip Straw Lid", "description": "Nobody has time to unscrew a water-bottle top every time they want a drink of life-sustaining hydration. Make is easy on yourself with the Hydro Flask Flip Straw Lid, which screws onto your Wide Mouth Hydro Flask for quick and easy sipping. This BPA-free, recyclable top flips up and features a rubber stopper to prevent spills. Easy to use on the road, on the trail, or in the park, you'll never be thirsty again.", "text": "Hydro Flask Flip Straw Lid Nobody has time to unscrew a water-bottle top every time they want a drink of life-sustaining hydration. Make is easy on yourself with the Hydro Flask Flip Straw Lid, which screws onto your Wide Mouth Hydro Flask for quick and easy sipping. This BPA-free, recyclable top flips up and features a rubber stopper to prevent spills. Easy to use on the road, on the trail, or in the park, you'll never be thirsty again.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31D%2BHi81AAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DMIEZEO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hydro Flask", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottle Accessories"]], "price": 8.25}}
{"item_id": "B00DMSB0EC", "title": "Kershaw Green Smoke Blur Tanto Blade Limited Edition 1670bgtst", "description": "Kershaw Green Smoked Blur A/O.4 1/2\" closed linerlock. 3 3/8\" black coated, partially serrated, Carpenter BDZ1 high performance stainless tanto blade with dual sloped thumb studs. Features SpeedSafe torsion bar mechanism for assisted opening. Green and black double anodized smoked aluminum handles with black Trac-Tec insert grips. Lanyard hole. Black stainless pocket clip with Kershaw logo. Limited edition of 2,700 pieces. Made in USA. No two knives are exactly the same.", "text": "Kershaw Green Smoke Blur Tanto Blade Limited Edition 1670bgtst Kershaw Green Smoked Blur A/O.4 1/2\" closed linerlock. 3 3/8\" black coated, partially serrated, Carpenter BDZ1 high performance stainless tanto blade with dual sloped thumb studs. Features SpeedSafe torsion bar mechanism for assisted opening. Green and black double anodized smoked aluminum handles with black Trac-Tec insert grips. Lanyard hole. Black stainless pocket clip with Kershaw logo. Limited edition of 2,700 pieces. Made in USA. No two knives are exactly the same.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41e4mDPgggL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DMSB0EC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 83.29}}
{"item_id": "B00DMU1VVM", "title": "308 SR-25 / AR-10 Lower Receiver Vise Block Armorers Magazine Tool", "description": "This high quality armorers tool is made from durable, NO-M.A.R polymer to protect your lower receiver. This fixture will allow you to work on your lower with the upper receiver installed or removed, while clamped firmly in your shop vise. You can install this through the top or bottom of your receiver to allow easy access to trigger guard, pistol grip or buffer tube, or to work on your trigger, safety and takedown pins. This design is a universal fit that accommodates most all LR308 style receivers, even CNC machined solid billet types... The support shelf has extra clearance for those with CNC billet receivers, and fits Nemo receivers dead on. This will fit your DPMS style receiver with a bit of extra clearance below the mag well body and the support shelf. The vise block is precision CNC machined from a BEEFY 1.2\" thick slab of NO-M.A.R polymer protect the finish of your lower receiver. NO-M.A.R polymer will resist all solvents and lubricants that a receiver might be subjected to, it will not soften or swell and can be easily cleaned for a long and durable life. ========================================================================================== There are primarily two magazines styles for the .308 rifles, the original Armalite-Fairchild magazines used in the original AR 10 series, then picked up by the KAC SR-25 and the Modern Armalite 10A which is a modified M14 type magazine. It should be pointed out that RRA (and formerly Bushmaster) make rifles that use FAL :THIS BLOCK FITS THE RECEIVERS LISTED BELOW: SR-25 TYPE ( DPMS, Mega, KAC, LaRue, POF, LWRC, JP Rifles, 1950s Armalites & New 10A, Remington, Fulton-Armory, Nemo ) :THIS BLOCK DOES NOT FIT: Armalite TYPE (Armalite 10B, Noveske, Eagle Arms, Georgia Precision, Kad Engineering) FAL Magazines (Metric or Inch pattern; used by Bushmaster, RRA) G-three Magazines (CMMG .308 Lower)", "text": "308 SR-25 / AR-10 Lower Receiver Vise Block Armorers Magazine Tool This high quality armorers tool is made from durable, NO-M.A.R polymer to protect your lower receiver. This fixture will allow you to work on your lower with the upper receiver installed or removed, while clamped firmly in your shop vise. You can install this through the top or bottom of your receiver to allow easy access to trigger guard, pistol grip or buffer tube, or to work on your trigger, safety and takedown pins. This design is a universal fit that accommodates most all LR308 style receivers, even CNC machined solid billet types... The support shelf has extra clearance for those with CNC billet receivers, and fits Nemo receivers dead on. This will fit your DPMS style receiver with a bit of extra clearance below the mag well body and the support shelf. The vise block is precision CNC machined from a BEEFY 1.2\" thick slab of NO-M.A.R polymer protect the finish of your lower receiver. NO-M.A.R polymer will resist all solvents and lubricants that a receiver might be subjected to, it will not soften or swell and can be easily cleaned for a long and durable life. ========================================================================================== There are primarily two magazines styles for the .308 rifles, the original Armalite-Fairchild magazines used in the original AR 10 series, then picked up by the KAC SR-25 and the Modern Armalite 10A which is a modified M14 type magazine. It should be pointed out that RRA (and formerly Bushmaster) make rifles that use FAL :THIS BLOCK FITS THE RECEIVERS LISTED BELOW: SR-25 TYPE ( DPMS, Mega, KAC, LaRue, POF, LWRC, JP Rifles, 1950s Armalites & New 10A, Remington, Fulton-Armory, Nemo ) :THIS BLOCK DOES NOT FIT: Armalite TYPE (Armalite 10B, Noveske, Eagle Arms, Georgia Precision, Kad Engineering) FAL Magazines (Metric or Inch pattern; used by Bushmaster, RRA) G-three Magazines (CMMG .308 Lower)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hRJypU8XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DMU1VVM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B00DMUDCE6", "title": "308 AR-10 / SR-25 Upper Receiver Vise Block Armorers Gunsmith Fixture", "description": "This high quality armorers tool is made from NO-M.A.R polymer to protect the lugs and rail of your upper receiver. With care and proper handling you should be able to install any standard barrel designed to fit flat top AR type 308 receivers. This fixture will allow you to work on your upper with the bolt and charging handle installed or removed, while clamped firmly in any shop vise that opens at least 4 inches wide. You can clamp it vertically for cleaning or horizontally for barrel work with the use of the flat top rail cap, to protect your weaver rail from scratches and abrasion. This fixture comes with two Lexan poly carbonate Anti-Torque plates (pat-pend) to positively locate your upper securely in the fixture during gunsmith work. The Anti-Torque plates will allow you to securely work on your receiver on top of your workbench without the worry of scuffing or scratching your receiver and give you a firm hold to steady the receiver on any flat surface. The upper rail block is extra thick and is the full length of your receiver providing great full support when held in your vise. Your vise may have jaws that are smaller in width than your receiver, this block set will allow the pressure from the vise to be evenly distributed to the full width or your receiver, increasing the holding power and decreasing the risk of deforming your receiver by applying too much force on too small of an area. The patent pending Anti-Torque plates hold everything together, not only simplifying installation into your vise, but also eliminating the chance of block rotation during barrel removal or installation.", "text": "308 AR-10 / SR-25 Upper Receiver Vise Block Armorers Gunsmith Fixture This high quality armorers tool is made from NO-M.A.R polymer to protect the lugs and rail of your upper receiver. With care and proper handling you should be able to install any standard barrel designed to fit flat top AR type 308 receivers. This fixture will allow you to work on your upper with the bolt and charging handle installed or removed, while clamped firmly in any shop vise that opens at least 4 inches wide. You can clamp it vertically for cleaning or horizontally for barrel work with the use of the flat top rail cap, to protect your weaver rail from scratches and abrasion. This fixture comes with two Lexan poly carbonate Anti-Torque plates (pat-pend) to positively locate your upper securely in the fixture during gunsmith work. The Anti-Torque plates will allow you to securely work on your receiver on top of your workbench without the worry of scuffing or scratching your receiver and give you a firm hold to steady the receiver on any flat surface. The upper rail block is extra thick and is the full length of your receiver providing great full support when held in your vise. Your vise may have jaws that are smaller in width than your receiver, this block set will allow the pressure from the vise to be evenly distributed to the full width or your receiver, increasing the holding power and decreasing the risk of deforming your receiver by applying too much force on too small of an area. The patent pending Anti-Torque plates hold everything together, not only simplifying installation into your vise, but also eliminating the chance of block rotation during barrel removal or installation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kmHAXP4rL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DMUDCE6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.99}}
