{"item_id": "B00DNJWNIW", "title": "Fox Head Men's Dirtpaw Race Glove", "description": "A High Performing Glove without the High Price Tag. The freshly-renovated Dirtpaw uses a completely padded knuckle, padded palm and superior flex-point comfort to remain the top choice for the entry-level rider.", "text": "Fox Head Men's Dirtpaw Race Glove A High Performing Glove without the High Price Tag. The freshly-renovated Dirtpaw uses a completely padded knuckle, padded palm and superior flex-point comfort to remain the top choice for the entry-level rider.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51sPDkP24oL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DNJWNIW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Biking Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00DOES4SY", "title": "Tactical Deals 15 16 Advanced Black AR Complete Commercial Comm Spec Buttstock Butt Stock Kit with Reciever Extension Buffer Tube , Buffer , Spring , End Plate Adapter and Castle Nut", "description": "", "text": "Tactical Deals 15 16 Advanced Black AR Complete Commercial Comm Spec Buttstock Butt Stock Kit with Reciever Extension Buffer Tube , Buffer , Spring , End Plate Adapter and Castle Nut", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mLgztv60L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DOES4SY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00DOHLKNM", "title": "Ade Advanced Optics xufu2 Flip Up Front and Rear Iron Sight Combo Set", "description": "Precision Elevation Adjustments to Enhance Shooting Accuracy Extremely low profile dual aperture design Locking detent with large surface area for maximum strength Same ball detent battle proven design of popular sight Lock detent button with stepped down turns to maximize grip in adverse conditions.", "text": "Ade Advanced Optics xufu2 Flip Up Front and Rear Iron Sight Combo Set Precision Elevation Adjustments to Enhance Shooting Accuracy Extremely low profile dual aperture design Locking detent with large surface area for maximum strength Same ball detent battle proven design of popular sight Lock detent button with stepped down turns to maximize grip in adverse conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ln76NQnsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DOHLKNM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics"]], "price": 23.89}}
{"item_id": "B00DOMOCCI", "title": "The Reservoir, Emergency Water Storage System 100 Gallons", "description": "Never get stuck in a long line to buy bottled water again! Hurricanes or tropical storms may disrupt or contaminate your water service for days, but you can stay comfortably at home with an ample supply of fresh, clean, safe water, thanks to this plastic liner that turns your tub into a sanitary storage tank.Holds Up to 100 GallonsEmergency management authorities recommend having on hand at least 3 days' worth of drinking water, allowing at least 1 gallon per person/pet per day. The Reservoir gives you the capacity to meet these minimums, with plenty left over for cooking, washing and flushing.Keeps Stored Water Clean and SafeAuthorities recommend filling your bathtub with tap water. But that's a problem because it leaves water exposed to any dirt and debris that might fall in, as well as soap residues on the tub itself. The Reservoir insulates water from those contaminants with heavy-duty, food-grade plastic that meets FDA safety standards.Easy to Fill, Easy to DispenseThe Reservoir is filled simply by sliding the fill tube onto the tub faucet and turning on the water. To get water out of The Reservoir, a siphon pump is included. Give the bulb a few squeezes to get it started and the water will flow automatically until you open the vent cap. The siphon tube fits into any bottle, jug, teakettle or other container opening. Just fill and go!", "text": "The Reservoir, Emergency Water Storage System 100 Gallons Never get stuck in a long line to buy bottled water again! Hurricanes or tropical storms may disrupt or contaminate your water service for days, but you can stay comfortably at home with an ample supply of fresh, clean, safe water, thanks to this plastic liner that turns your tub into a sanitary storage tank.Holds Up to 100 GallonsEmergency management authorities recommend having on hand at least 3 days' worth of drinking water, allowing at least 1 gallon per person/pet per day. The Reservoir gives you the capacity to meet these minimums, with plenty left over for cooking, washing and flushing.Keeps Stored Water Clean and SafeAuthorities recommend filling your bathtub with tap water. But that's a problem because it leaves water exposed to any dirt and debris that might fall in, as well as soap residues on the tub itself. The Reservoir insulates water from those contaminants with heavy-duty, food-grade plastic that meets FDA safety standards.Easy to Fill, Easy to DispenseThe Reservoir is filled simply by sliding the fill tube onto the tub faucet and turning on the water. To get water out of The Reservoir, a siphon pump is included. Give the bulb a few squeezes to get it started and the water will flow automatically until you open the vent cap. The siphon tube fits into any bottle, jug, teakettle or other container opening. Just fill and go!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kUbw0c9VL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DOMOCCI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 16.95}}
