{"item_id": "B00DPKWW4O", "title": "Custom FIX Holster (Conceal & Carry), by Fixxxer Components, fits Glock 17,18,19,22,23,24,26,27,31,32,34,35", "description": "Custom GlockFIX(FastInsideXchange) Holster (conceal Carry)The kydex is molded around the trigger guard for a custom fit and fixed with a loop of cord.Usage includes attaching the cord to a stationary object such as a belt loop, nightstand, inside of a bag/purse , etc. When the pistol is drawn the holster snaps away providing a ready weapon. This allows safe carriage of a chambered pistol both on and off body.You will love the quality of FIXXXER products.Fits all Generation Glocks 17,18,19,22,23,24,26,27,31,32,34,35Fixxxer LLC is proud to be an American Company. We stand behind our products, period.FIXXXER COMPONENTS US TRADEMARK # 86021760 IC 013. US 002 009. G & SDisclaimer - \"GLOCK\" is a federally registered trademark of Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. Fixxxer LLC has NO affiliation in any manner with, or otherwise endorsed by, Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. The use of the word \"GLOCK \" on this page is merely to identify which firearm these parts or components are compatible with.", "text": "Custom FIX Holster (Conceal & Carry), by Fixxxer Components, fits Glock 17,18,19,22,23,24,26,27,31,32,34,35 Custom GlockFIX(FastInsideXchange) Holster (conceal Carry)The kydex is molded around the trigger guard for a custom fit and fixed with a loop of cord.Usage includes attaching the cord to a stationary object such as a belt loop, nightstand, inside of a bag/purse , etc. When the pistol is drawn the holster snaps away providing a ready weapon. This allows safe carriage of a chambered pistol both on and off body.You will love the quality of FIXXXER products.Fits all Generation Glocks 17,18,19,22,23,24,26,27,31,32,34,35Fixxxer LLC is proud to be an American Company. We stand behind our products, period.FIXXXER COMPONENTS US TRADEMARK # 86021760 IC 013. US 002 009. G & SDisclaimer - \"GLOCK\" is a federally registered trademark of Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. Fixxxer LLC has NO affiliation in any manner with, or otherwise endorsed by, Glock, Inc. or Glock Ges.m.b.H. The use of the word \"GLOCK \" on this page is merely to identify which firearm these parts or components are compatible with.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mIgd2u3SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DPKWW4O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00DPKYI3W", "title": "Heatmax HotHands Adhesive Toe Warmer Value Pack", "description": "Hothands Toe Warmers are rectangular shaped single-use air-activated heat packs that provide up to 8 hours of continuous warmth for the toes. Hothands warmers are single use air-activated heat packs that provide everyday warmth and are ideal for keeping your body warm when the temperature gets cold. They're available in several styles designed for hands, feet and body. Have you tried them all?.", "text": "Heatmax HotHands Adhesive Toe Warmer Value Pack Hothands Toe Warmers are rectangular shaped single-use air-activated heat packs that provide up to 8 hours of continuous warmth for the toes. Hothands warmers are single use air-activated heat packs that provide everyday warmth and are ideal for keeping your body warm when the temperature gets cold. They're available in several styles designed for hands, feet and body. Have you tried them all?.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Uocow4TGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DPKYI3W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HeatMax", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hand & Foot Warmers"]], "price": 6.01}}
{"item_id": "B00DPKZ1MO", "title": "Real Avid AR-15 Scraper Tool", "description": "A faster, easier way to clean the bolt carrier group. The AR15 Scraper removes heavy, baked-on fouling from 12 critical bolt carrier group surfaces faster and easier than brushes and solvent alone. It speed-cleans all four major parts of the bolt carrier group: the bolt, firing pin, bolt carrier and bolt cam pin. The swivel cover protects your hand from the double ended scraping edges. It's ideal for any workbench, cleaning kit, or range bag.", "text": "Real Avid AR-15 Scraper Tool A faster, easier way to clean the bolt carrier group. The AR15 Scraper removes heavy, baked-on fouling from 12 critical bolt carrier group surfaces faster and easier than brushes and solvent alone. It speed-cleans all four major parts of the bolt carrier group: the bolt, firing pin, bolt carrier and bolt cam pin. The swivel cover protects your hand from the double ended scraping edges. It's ideal for any workbench, cleaning kit, or range bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31X21s0zMGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DPKZ1MO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Real Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 16.98}}
{"item_id": "B00DPKZ1WO", "title": "Real Avid AR15 Field Guide", "description": "Disassembly, scraping, cleaning and lubricating information at a glance. Now AR15 know-how fits in your pocket. The AR15 Field Guide helps shooters maintain critical moving parts that affect AR15 reliability and performance. Coated pages are oil and solvent resistant. On the bench or in the field, our AR15 Field Guide gives shooters the right information fast. It's detailed enough for the home workshop and small enough to carry in your range bag.", "text": "Real Avid AR15 Field Guide Disassembly, scraping, cleaning and lubricating information at a glance. Now AR15 know-how fits in your pocket. The AR15 Field Guide helps shooters maintain critical moving parts that affect AR15 reliability and performance. Coated pages are oil and solvent resistant. On the bench or in the field, our AR15 Field Guide gives shooters the right information fast. It's detailed enough for the home workshop and small enough to carry in your range bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fRnYLRQyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DPKZ1WO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Real Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 12.99}}
