{"item_id": "B00DPPHTRO", "title": "Ibera Bicycle Waterproof Smartphone Case", "description": "Ibera's largest waterproof case fits the Samsung Galaxy S III, S4, HTC One and more.There are 2 velcro flaps, doubly securing the phone from the rain. The inside bag folds down several times to ensure that phones stay sealed and the rain stays out.The large 6\" touchscreen window is made of clear polyurethane and allows for easy access to touch pad controls.The phone case can be clipped onto a stem mount or handlebar mount in portrait or landscape modes for GPS and app use.3 Mounting options (each phone case comes with 1 mount):(Q1) Handlebar mount with removable bottle cage adapter (attach a bottle cage,water bottle and bottle cage not included)(Q2) Handlebar mount with removable mini handlebar (attach a light, bell, or cycling computer)(Q4) Angle adjustable stem mount (for customized viewing angles and reducing glare)Specifications:Material:Nylon with clear windowMax. Device Size:4.5\" x 2.4\" 0.5\"Screen size:6\"Weight:1.76 oz./48.1 gNote:Measure phones before ordering to ensure compatibility. Stem mounts are not compatible with traditional quill stems or specialized stems, check bikes for compatibility. Some phone cases may need to be removed for phones to fit in the bicycle phone case. Not for use with headphones or camera functions.Not for rough or off-road cycling..", "text": "Ibera Bicycle Waterproof Smartphone Case Ibera's largest waterproof case fits the Samsung Galaxy S III, S4, HTC One and more.There are 2 velcro flaps, doubly securing the phone from the rain. The inside bag folds down several times to ensure that phones stay sealed and the rain stays out.The large 6\" touchscreen window is made of clear polyurethane and allows for easy access to touch pad controls.The phone case can be clipped onto a stem mount or handlebar mount in portrait or landscape modes for GPS and app use.3 Mounting options (each phone case comes with 1 mount):(Q1) Handlebar mount with removable bottle cage adapter (attach a bottle cage,water bottle and bottle cage not included)(Q2) Handlebar mount with removable mini handlebar (attach a light, bell, or cycling computer)(Q4) Angle adjustable stem mount (for customized viewing angles and reducing glare)Specifications:Material:Nylon with clear windowMax. Device Size:4.5\" x 2.4\" 0.5\"Screen size:6\"Weight:1.76 oz./48.1 gNote:Measure phones before ordering to ensure compatibility. Stem mounts are not compatible with traditional quill stems or specialized stems, check bikes for compatibility. Some phone cases may need to be removed for phones to fit in the bicycle phone case. Not for use with headphones or camera functions.Not for rough or off-road cycling..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51nsK%2B5-69L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DPPHTRO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]]}}
