{"item_id": "B00DQ3QS7C", "title": "Solo Stove 3 Pot Set - Stainless Steel Camping & Backpacking Cookware Great for Use with Solo Stoves. Lightweight Aluminum Pot Gripper Included.", "description": "The Solo Stove 3 Pot Set is the companion pot set designed specifically for use with Solo Stoves. When nested together, the Solo Stove 3 Pot Set is an extremely compact cookware system that is easily packed away. Made with premium grade 304 stainless steel, this pot set is rugged, durable and highly functional.", "text": "Solo Stove 3 Pot Set - Stainless Steel Camping & Backpacking Cookware Great for Use with Solo Stoves. Lightweight Aluminum Pot Gripper Included. The Solo Stove 3 Pot Set is the companion pot set designed specifically for use with Solo Stoves. When nested together, the Solo Stove 3 Pot Set is an extremely compact cookware system that is easily packed away. Made with premium grade 304 stainless steel, this pot set is rugged, durable and highly functional.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CgZN27aoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DQ3QS7C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B00DQ43D1A", "title": "Basecamp Double Burner Angle Iron Camping Stove, Black", "description": "Adjustable legs to achieve level cooking surface on uneven terrain. Range style top to raise cooking vessel above frame improving combustion. Durable welded frame; thicker gas manifold system and corrosion resistant brass valves for use in the elements.", "text": "Basecamp Double Burner Angle Iron Camping Stove, Black Adjustable legs to achieve level cooking surface on uneven terrain. Range style top to raise cooking vessel above frame improving combustion. Durable welded frame; thicker gas manifold system and corrosion resistant brass valves for use in the elements.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419Sxq5RZjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DQ43D1A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 55.83}}
{"item_id": "B00DQ7UL6W", "title": "Mini Bike Pump for Bike Tires Made of Light Weight Aluminum in Best German Quality with Guarantee for High Pressure Hand Pumping for Both Presta and Schrader Valves on Road Bikes, Mountain or Racing Bikes with Free Frame Mounting Kit and Ball Needle", "description": "The Rausch Bicycle Tire PumpYou are an avid cyclist. You love the feel of the open road, the sights, the subtle smells that waft over you as you pass that field of freshly mown grass; you just dont get these feelings with any other mode of travel.You also have an appreciation for the kind of high quality bike components that you paid good money for and will get you where youre going, fast and hassle free.But stuff happens and if you ever tried to save a few bucks by buying a cheap tire pump, the first time you had to use it, you realized you bought yourself a load of frustration.You know the drill with a cheapie pump:- Endless pumping while you sweat to inflate your tire- Struggling to change from Schrader to Presta- Hard to release the pump or ripping the stem- Breakable plastic componentsThe features you will love about the Rausch pump:- Made to exacting German specifications- Quick, easy fit on both Schrader and Presta valves- Lightweight, compact, pumps up to 210 psi- Pumps both Pushing and Pulling- 30% fewer strokes needed to fill your tire- Fits road, mountain, racing, BMX bikes- Weight 6.7 oz (192g)- Length 8.98 in x diameter 1.02 in (228 mm x 26mm)If you want the kind of sheer joy and long distance efficiency from your sport that cheap plastic components cant offer, then Rauschs durable, easy to use bicycle tire pump will keep you in the saddle instead of kneeling on the side of the road.Its German designed; its the only logical choice and comes with a 30 day no-hassle money back guarantee!Simply click the orange \"Add to Cart\" button now and order your Rausch bike pump today while discounted price is still available.", "text": "Mini Bike Pump for Bike Tires Made of Light Weight Aluminum in Best German Quality with Guarantee for High Pressure Hand Pumping for Both Presta and Schrader Valves on Road Bikes, Mountain or Racing Bikes with Free Frame Mounting Kit and Ball Needle The Rausch Bicycle Tire PumpYou are an avid cyclist. You love the feel of the open road, the sights, the subtle smells that waft over you as you pass that field of freshly mown grass; you just dont get these feelings with any other mode of travel.You also have an appreciation for the kind of high quality bike components that you paid good money for and will get you where youre going, fast and hassle free.But stuff happens and if you ever tried to save a few bucks by buying a cheap tire pump, the first time you had to use it, you realized you bought yourself a load of frustration.You know the drill with a cheapie pump:- Endless pumping while you sweat to inflate your tire- Struggling to change from Schrader to Presta- Hard to release the pump or ripping the stem- Breakable plastic componentsThe features you will love about the Rausch pump:- Made to exacting German specifications- Quick, easy fit on both Schrader and Presta valves- Lightweight, compact, pumps up to 210 psi- Pumps both Pushing and Pulling- 30% fewer strokes needed to fill your tire- Fits road, mountain, racing, BMX bikes- Weight 6.7 oz (192g)- Length 8.98 in x diameter 1.02 in (228 mm x 26mm)If you want the kind of sheer joy and long distance efficiency from your sport that cheap plastic components cant offer, then Rauschs durable, easy to use bicycle tire pump will keep you in the saddle instead of kneeling on the side of the road.Its German designed; its the only logical choice and comes with a 30 day no-hassle money back guarantee!Simply click the orange \"Add to Cart\" button now and order your Rausch bike pump today while discounted price is still available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u0nXxQCfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DQ7UL6W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B00DQ8QLG0", "title": "Resistance Bands. 100% Natural Latex Exercise Bands: Set of Three (3) Loop Bands. Use with Brazil Butt Lift , P90X, and Insanity Workouts. Bonus Resistance Band Workout Video with Personal Trainers. The Best Exercise Bands for Legs, Arms, Shoulder, Ankles, and Core. Light- Medium- Heavy Resistance. Recommended by Therapists for Rehab. Professional Grade Comfort Length Longer Band. Perfect for Travel and Use At Home. No Hassle Warranty.", "description": "WHAT'S The SECRET of USING EXERCISE BANDS?Recommended for clients by Licensed Occupational Therapist-Videos show you how to use resistance band exercises for a safe and effective full body workout-Excellent for my clients physical therapy-Can be used by people of all fitness levels-Lightweight, durable, yet very effectiveWhy settle for less, learn how to effectively tone your body, and recover from injuries. These bands are the preferred latex band because they accurately duplicate the elasticity of human muscles.Traveling to a rehab clinic on a daily or weekly basis can be time consuming and uncomfortable for individuals when you can exercise in the convenience of your own home, apartment, or office. The exercise bands are constructed of a 3 inch wide, low powder formula, and are of a longer length for additional comfort. The resistance band exercises can be adapted for all fitness levels.The latex bands can be incorporated into your daily warm-up and drills to maintain tone, build strength and flexibility. Your overall level of fitness can be improved without having to find a gym and lift weights.Learn how to effectively use exercise loop bands to activate and increase circulation to hips, glute, leg, and thigh muscles. The exercise bands provide dual direction resistance to target and strengthen upper and lower body muscles and increase range of motionUSE before: to activate the body, increase circulation, and enhance muscle readinessUSE afterwards: To reduce soreness, and stretch musclesLimited Time PricingClick the ADD to CART Button Above And Get Your Resistance Band Workout Program w/lifetime video access Today!", "text": "Resistance Bands. 100% Natural Latex Exercise Bands: Set of Three (3) Loop Bands. Use with Brazil Butt Lift , P90X, and Insanity Workouts. Bonus Resistance Band Workout Video with Personal Trainers. The Best Exercise Bands for Legs, Arms, Shoulder, Ankles, and Core. Light- Medium- Heavy Resistance. Recommended by Therapists for Rehab. Professional Grade Comfort Length Longer Band. Perfect for Travel and Use At Home. No Hassle Warranty. WHAT'S The SECRET of USING EXERCISE BANDS?Recommended for clients by Licensed Occupational Therapist-Videos show you how to use resistance band exercises for a safe and effective full body workout-Excellent for my clients physical therapy-Can be used by people of all fitness levels-Lightweight, durable, yet very effectiveWhy settle for less, learn how to effectively tone your body, and recover from injuries. These bands are the preferred latex band because they accurately duplicate the elasticity of human muscles.Traveling to a rehab clinic on a daily or weekly basis can be time consuming and uncomfortable for individuals when you can exercise in the convenience of your own home, apartment, or office. The exercise bands are constructed of a 3 inch wide, low powder formula, and are of a longer length for additional comfort. The resistance band exercises can be adapted for all fitness levels.The latex bands can be incorporated into your daily warm-up and drills to maintain tone, build strength and flexibility. Your overall level of fitness can be improved without having to find a gym and lift weights.Learn how to effectively use exercise loop bands to activate and increase circulation to hips, glute, leg, and thigh muscles. The exercise bands provide dual direction resistance to target and strengthen upper and lower body muscles and increase range of motionUSE before: to activate the body, increase circulation, and enhance muscle readinessUSE afterwards: To reduce soreness, and stretch musclesLimited Time PricingClick the ADD to CART Button Above And Get Your Resistance Band Workout Program w/lifetime video access Today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PgH0IBW8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DQ8QLG0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00DQJQP24", "title": "NCAA Men's Wordmark T-Shirt", "description": "", "text": "NCAA Men's Wordmark T-Shirt", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xz0ntw%2BWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DQJQP24.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Clothing", "T-Shirts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00DQV6L6C", "title": "K-Edge Handlebar Computer Mount for Garmin - Men's", "description": "While it entered the cycling world with its simple yet efficient Chain Catcher, Idaho's K-Edge has since expanded into developing other intelligent componentry for road, mountain, and cyclocross athletes around the world. The Handlebar Computer Mount is its latest design, providing a sleek, secure, and durable platform for your Garmin head unit. Just like K-Edge's original Chain Catcher, its Handlebar Computer Mount was built to be both light and strong. It was CNC-machined from a single block of 6061 T6 aluminum, providing a solid out-in-front platform for your computer. This placement provides both a sleek 'wind-cheating' mount for your Garmin, as well as a clear view of your data in a central position between your bars. This mount has already proven itself as an invaluable component for several professional teams, as its installation is simpler and more secure than the stock plastic versions could ever afford. Additionally its weight addition to pro-caliber bikes is negligible (30g including bolts, clamp, and mount). The K-Edge mounts directly to a 31. 8mm handlebar using an all-metal, two-bolt clamp system, with the computer unit locking into the adjustable arm with a definitive 'click.' It's compatible with Garmin Edge 810, 800, 510, 500, and 200 GPS bicycle computers. Also, should you manage to somehow break the mount, K-Edge backs all of its products with a lifetime warranty against material or manufacturer defects. The K-Edge Handlebar Computer Mount for Garmin is available in a 31. 8mm clamp diameter size and in the colors Black, Gunmetal, and Red. All K-Edge products are manufactured in the USA.", "text": "K-Edge Handlebar Computer Mount for Garmin - Men's While it entered the cycling world with its simple yet efficient Chain Catcher, Idaho's K-Edge has since expanded into developing other intelligent componentry for road, mountain, and cyclocross athletes around the world. The Handlebar Computer Mount is its latest design, providing a sleek, secure, and durable platform for your Garmin head unit. Just like K-Edge's original Chain Catcher, its Handlebar Computer Mount was built to be both light and strong. It was CNC-machined from a single block of 6061 T6 aluminum, providing a solid out-in-front platform for your computer. This placement provides both a sleek 'wind-cheating' mount for your Garmin, as well as a clear view of your data in a central position between your bars. This mount has already proven itself as an invaluable component for several professional teams, as its installation is simpler and more secure than the stock plastic versions could ever afford. Additionally its weight addition to pro-caliber bikes is negligible (30g including bolts, clamp, and mount). The K-Edge mounts directly to a 31. 8mm handlebar using an all-metal, two-bolt clamp system, with the computer unit locking into the adjustable arm with a definitive 'click.' It's compatible with Garmin Edge 810, 800, 510, 500, and 200 GPS bicycle computers. Also, should you manage to somehow break the mount, K-Edge backs all of its products with a lifetime warranty against material or manufacturer defects. The K-Edge Handlebar Computer Mount for Garmin is available in a 31. 8mm clamp diameter size and in the colors Black, Gunmetal, and Red. All K-Edge products are manufactured in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ey97qAQhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DQV6L6C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "K-Edge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 38.47}}
{"item_id": "B00DS1QUFM", "title": "ZJchao(TM) Leegoal Carbon Fiber Magnetic Propeller Balancer Prop Essential for Quadcopter FPV Helicopter Airplane", "description": "Description: -The use of the N45 high performance magnet, fixed plate made of carbon fiber board material -Maglev-method was adopted on the center fixing axis to balance the tested products with zero resistance. -Fixed-wing propeller, helicopter rotor the maglev propeller balancer suitable for any size and weight, marine propeller, car wheels, turbine blades, flywheels, etc. Fit 0-80g Fixed wing propeller,marine propeller,Car wheel hub,Turbine blade,etc(helicopter not available) - Beautiful outlook and modern design - Good quality and durable - Weight:30g Package: 1 x Carbon Fiber Propeller Balancer Essential", "text": "ZJchao(TM) Leegoal Carbon Fiber Magnetic Propeller Balancer Prop Essential for Quadcopter FPV Helicopter Airplane Description: -The use of the N45 high performance magnet, fixed plate made of carbon fiber board material -Maglev-method was adopted on the center fixing axis to balance the tested products with zero resistance. -Fixed-wing propeller, helicopter rotor the maglev propeller balancer suitable for any size and weight, marine propeller, car wheels, turbine blades, flywheels, etc. Fit 0-80g Fixed wing propeller,marine propeller,Car wheel hub,Turbine blade,etc(helicopter not available) - Beautiful outlook and modern design - Good quality and durable - Weight:30g Package: 1 x Carbon Fiber Propeller Balancer Essential", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mhRGbcecL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DS1QUFM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ZJchao(TM)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 6.23}}
{"item_id": "B00DS55TAA", "title": "2\" Solvent Trap Washer for Solvent Trap Adapter", "description": "These Washers are designed to seal solvent trap adapters to make them even safer and make your cleaning experience that much easier! This 2\" washer will seal the holes on the oil filter, guaranteeing that there will be no leakage of solvents during the cleaning process.", "text": "2\" Solvent Trap Washer for Solvent Trap Adapter These Washers are designed to seal solvent trap adapters to make them even safer and make your cleaning experience that much easier! This 2\" washer will seal the holes on the oil filter, guaranteeing that there will be no leakage of solvents during the cleaning process.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CnljhXL-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DS55TAA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 2.5}}
{"item_id": "B00DSASHH2", "title": "Convertible Stainless Steel Water Bottle with 2 Interchangeable Caps - 22oz / 650ml - Double Wall / Vacuum Insulated / Sports Bottle and Thermal Bottle - Cold / Hot Fluids Safe - Healthy and Safe Backpack Bottle for Kids -100% BPA Free, Lead Free, Recyclable - Korean Top Quality Stainless Steel - FDA Approved Food Grade Eco Friendly Material - Made In Guangdong, China - Wide Mouth for Easy Cleaning - Durable and Solid Construction - Sweat Proof, Rust Proof - No Lining, No Leaching, No Toxins - Life Time Leak-Proof Guarantee - Ideal Eco Gift for All Ages", "description": "Easy and healthy solution for staying hydrated on-the-go:• Versatile: Your preference of using it as thermal or sports bottle by having 2 interchangeable caps• Healthy: You deserve the cleanest water. No more concern of BPA, toxins, metallic taste or other grossness.• Functional: Keep your drink at its best temperature you desire for long hours• Easy: Can be easily carried around in car, bike, backpack or with just one finger• Tough: One of the toughest bottle on the market. No easy dent, or deformation after accidental drop.Features:• 100% FDA approved Korean stainless steel #304 material (Top quality stainless steel manufactured in Korea.)• One piece bottle body with no separate bottom portion attached. It ensures its heavy duty toughness, virtually dent proof.• Manufactured in ISO 9001:2000 factory plant• Advanced Painting Technology - No Paint Flake-Off• The Only Insulated Water Bottle Backed by Lifetime Leak-Proof GuaranteeSpecifications:- Capacity (inside/outside): 22 oz / 25 oz- Weight(without cap): 270 g- Height(without cap): 8.85 inches- Diameter(mouth/bottom): 2 inches / 2.75 inchesThis bottle is nothing fancy, not flimsy. It simply WORKS! Click the \"Add To Cart\" Button and Get Yours Now!", "text": "Convertible Stainless Steel Water Bottle with 2 Interchangeable Caps - 22oz / 650ml - Double Wall / Vacuum Insulated / Sports Bottle and Thermal Bottle - Cold / Hot Fluids Safe - Healthy and Safe Backpack Bottle for Kids -100% BPA Free, Lead Free, Recyclable - Korean Top Quality Stainless Steel - FDA Approved Food Grade Eco Friendly Material - Made In Guangdong, China - Wide Mouth for Easy Cleaning - Durable and Solid Construction - Sweat Proof, Rust Proof - No Lining, No Leaching, No Toxins - Life Time Leak-Proof Guarantee - Ideal Eco Gift for All Ages Easy and healthy solution for staying hydrated on-the-go:• Versatile: Your preference of using it as thermal or sports bottle by having 2 interchangeable caps• Healthy: You deserve the cleanest water. No more concern of BPA, toxins, metallic taste or other grossness.• Functional: Keep your drink at its best temperature you desire for long hours• Easy: Can be easily carried around in car, bike, backpack or with just one finger• Tough: One of the toughest bottle on the market. No easy dent, or deformation after accidental drop.Features:• 100% FDA approved Korean stainless steel #304 material (Top quality stainless steel manufactured in Korea.)• One piece bottle body with no separate bottom portion attached. It ensures its heavy duty toughness, virtually dent proof.• Manufactured in ISO 9001:2000 factory plant• Advanced Painting Technology - No Paint Flake-Off• The Only Insulated Water Bottle Backed by Lifetime Leak-Proof GuaranteeSpecifications:- Capacity (inside/outside): 22 oz / 25 oz- Weight(without cap): 270 g- Height(without cap): 8.85 inches- Diameter(mouth/bottom): 2 inches / 2.75 inchesThis bottle is nothing fancy, not flimsy. It simply WORKS! Click the \"Add To Cart\" Button and Get Yours Now!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RU7PnUTGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DSASHH2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 25.97}}
{"item_id": "B00DSK5GFI", "title": "#1 Rated Hot Yoga Towel - Mat-Sized, Microfiber, Super Absorbent, Anti-slip, Injury Free, 24\" x 72\" - Best Bikram Yoga Towel - Exercise, Fitness, Pilates, and Yoga Gear; Lifetime Guarantee", "description": "The GoSweat towel soaks up your sweat.Other towels may get wet and bunch up on your yoga mat. Our uniquely designed yoga towels focus on soaking up more sweat so that your mat stays dry and you stay safe on your mat.Shandali GOSWEAT towel is better by design* Automatically soaks up your sweat* Keeps you dry and firmly on your mat* Instantly improve your yoga practice with our injury-free design* No more drenched towel* Lightweight, carry it easily to and from your yoga studio* Survives countless washings and last for years (cost-savings)* Quick-drying in minutes* Extends the life of your mat (saving you money)* Mat-size towel - 26.5 x 72 inchesYour satisfaction is guaranteed! \"The Shandali 30 day guarantee!\"We've decided to put the risk on us! After 30 days, if you don't get the result you expected, or the towel just didn't work for you. Simply send us an email and we'll refund you 100%. No questions asked!Click the'Add to Cart'button in the upper right corner of screen before we're out of stock!", "text": "#1 Rated Hot Yoga Towel - Mat-Sized, Microfiber, Super Absorbent, Anti-slip, Injury Free, 24\" x 72\" - Best Bikram Yoga Towel - Exercise, Fitness, Pilates, and Yoga Gear; Lifetime Guarantee The GoSweat towel soaks up your sweat.Other towels may get wet and bunch up on your yoga mat. Our uniquely designed yoga towels focus on soaking up more sweat so that your mat stays dry and you stay safe on your mat.Shandali GOSWEAT towel is better by design* Automatically soaks up your sweat* Keeps you dry and firmly on your mat* Instantly improve your yoga practice with our injury-free design* No more drenched towel* Lightweight, carry it easily to and from your yoga studio* Survives countless washings and last for years (cost-savings)* Quick-drying in minutes* Extends the life of your mat (saving you money)* Mat-size towel - 26.5 x 72 inchesYour satisfaction is guaranteed! \"The Shandali 30 day guarantee!\"We've decided to put the risk on us! After 30 days, if you don't get the result you expected, or the towel just didn't work for you. Simply send us an email and we'll refund you 100%. No questions asked!Click the'Add to Cart'button in the upper right corner of screen before we're out of stock!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i2fFhdsqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DSK5GFI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Towels"]], "price": 29.95}}
