{"item_id": "B00DT5A0M6", "title": "Barnett Vengeance Crank Cocking Device", "description": "- Designed to be fully integrated into the stock of the bow for a low profile, comfortable fit.The handle easily adjusts to right or left hand and with the turn of a thumbscrew, may be removed after each usage. Reduces cocking tension to 16lbs.- Compatible with the following models:Wildcat seriesQuad seriesPanzer VGhost seriesBuck CommanderPenetrator", "text": "Barnett Vengeance Crank Cocking Device - Designed to be fully integrated into the stock of the bow for a low profile, comfortable fit.The handle easily adjusts to right or left hand and with the turn of a thumbscrew, may be removed after each usage. Reduces cocking tension to 16lbs.- Compatible with the following models:Wildcat seriesQuad seriesPanzer VGhost seriesBuck CommanderPenetrator", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513JLhh6YKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DT5A0M6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Cocking Devices"]], "price": 76.85}}
{"item_id": "B00DT5XGJ0", "title": "Fenix PD35 850 lumen led flashlight - Ultimate Package with 2 x 18650 Batteries & Charger", "description": "Everyone has been waiting for this one! I have been a huge fan of the PD32 since the first version came out. Then came the PD32UE which is a great light but very \"floody\" The PD35 solves that problem! This light is incredible. If you are a firefighter, EMT or LEO, this is the light for you. If you are just a person who wants a kick a$$ light that ounce for ounce outperforms lights costing hundreds more....this is the light for you. This package comes with TWO Ultrafire 18650 batteries and a wall charger. The light only uses ONE battery but we give you a backup ready to go at all times in the charger for those times when you need extended run time. Are compact size and mighty output really mutually exclusive? Not in the case of PD35. Weighting only 87 grams and less than 14 centimeters long, PD35 delivers a stunning 850-lumen maximum output from one 18650 battery. Six outputs including strobe mode cover from daily use to outdoor and professional use while a simple press on the side switch is all you need to select output. Portable becomes powerful with this go-everywhere, category-changing model from Fenix. Uses one 18650 rechargeable Li-ion battery or two 3V CR123A Lithium batteries 139mm (Length) x 25.4mm (Diameter) 87-gram weight (excluding the battery) Digitally regulated output - maintains constant brightness Low-voltage warning function to remind you to replace the battery Reverse polarity protection guards against improper battery installation ver-heat protection to avoid high-temperature of the surface Anti-roll, slip-resistant body design Tactical tail switch with momentary-on function Side switch on the head Made of durable aircraft-grade aluminum Premium Type III hard-anodized anti-abrasive finish Toughened ultra-clear glass lens with anti-reflective coating", "text": "Fenix PD35 850 lumen led flashlight - Ultimate Package with 2 x 18650 Batteries & Charger Everyone has been waiting for this one! I have been a huge fan of the PD32 since the first version came out. Then came the PD32UE which is a great light but very \"floody\" The PD35 solves that problem! This light is incredible. If you are a firefighter, EMT or LEO, this is the light for you. If you are just a person who wants a kick a$$ light that ounce for ounce outperforms lights costing hundreds more....this is the light for you. This package comes with TWO Ultrafire 18650 batteries and a wall charger. The light only uses ONE battery but we give you a backup ready to go at all times in the charger for those times when you need extended run time. Are compact size and mighty output really mutually exclusive? Not in the case of PD35. Weighting only 87 grams and less than 14 centimeters long, PD35 delivers a stunning 850-lumen maximum output from one 18650 battery. Six outputs including strobe mode cover from daily use to outdoor and professional use while a simple press on the side switch is all you need to select output. Portable becomes powerful with this go-everywhere, category-changing model from Fenix. Uses one 18650 rechargeable Li-ion battery or two 3V CR123A Lithium batteries 139mm (Length) x 25.4mm (Diameter) 87-gram weight (excluding the battery) Digitally regulated output - maintains constant brightness Low-voltage warning function to remind you to replace the battery Reverse polarity protection guards against improper battery installation ver-heat protection to avoid high-temperature of the surface Anti-roll, slip-resistant body design Tactical tail switch with momentary-on function Side switch on the head Made of durable aircraft-grade aluminum Premium Type III hard-anodized anti-abrasive finish Toughened ultra-clear glass lens with anti-reflective coating", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VmcN2BdIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DT5XGJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B00DTV22AI", "title": "Olympic Lock-Jaw Barbell Collar", "description": "The Lock Jaw Olympic Collar is perfect for use with all Olympic Plates. Constructed with hardened nylon resin frames and injection-molded pressure pads, these nearly unbreakable collars will maximize your workouts and minimize the danger of going big with Crossfit-style workouts. Designed by LOCK-JAW specifically for Body-Solid. Fits all 2\" Olympic Bars. Designed for use with all Olympic Plates. Hardened nylon resin frame. Injection molded pressure pads.", "text": "Olympic Lock-Jaw Barbell Collar The Lock Jaw Olympic Collar is perfect for use with all Olympic Plates. Constructed with hardened nylon resin frames and injection-molded pressure pads, these nearly unbreakable collars will maximize your workouts and minimize the danger of going big with Crossfit-style workouts. Designed by LOCK-JAW specifically for Body-Solid. Fits all 2\" Olympic Bars. Designed for use with all Olympic Plates. Hardened nylon resin frame. Injection molded pressure pads.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mwHQWPeKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DTV22AI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lock Jaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Collars"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B00DTVP9MG", "title": "Gadsden Sure Plug - Glock Grip plug for Medium & Large Frame Pistols", "description": "This Plug is Laser engraved. This is a Sure plug Brand product in retail packaging. it is a NEW Backstrap Channel Plug designed for use with Glock pistols. This plug will Fit MODELS 17,18,19,20,21,22,23,24,25,31,32,34,35, 37,38. The Backstrap Channel plug was designed to guide the magazine into the magazine well to stop the magazine from snagging on structures within the pistol. The secondary function of the insert is to stop dirt and debris from entering the backstrap channel; this stops the dirt and debris from potentially interfering with the trigger mechanism. Easy installation, just snaps right in. SPECS: Advanced Polymer Material Color: Black use with the following firearm calibers and Models: 9mm, 10mm, 40/357 sig, 45 acp, 45 GAP caliber pistols. 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 31, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38. The Sure Plug will NOT fit the SF models. This Plug will not fit the Gen 4 Models The Sure Plug is an essential accessory for use with the Glock pistol. It is an inexpensive part that serves several important purposes on the firearm. As a aide in guiding a magazine into the magazine well, it will decrease the time required for those crucial magazine changes. It will provide the user with the assurance that the magazine will not hang-up on the bottom rear of the magazine well by providing a smooth, rounded surface to guide magazines into place. The Flush fit of the plug also eliminates the possibility of snagging on the open cavity. The cavity on the backside of the handle (pistol grip), just behind the magazine well, is hollow and open at both the top and bottom. This opening can allow debris such as Dust, Dirt, Sand, Snow, Lint and Water to reach the trigger assembly and firing pin of the glock hand gun. The addition of this simple and inexpensive hand gun part can eliminate the potential problems created by this debris. This alone is probably the biggest reason to purchase this accessory.", "text": "Gadsden Sure Plug - Glock Grip plug for Medium & Large Frame Pistols This Plug is Laser engraved. This is a Sure plug Brand product in retail packaging. it is a NEW Backstrap Channel Plug designed for use with Glock pistols. This plug will Fit MODELS 17,18,19,20,21,22,23,24,25,31,32,34,35, 37,38. The Backstrap Channel plug was designed to guide the magazine into the magazine well to stop the magazine from snagging on structures within the pistol. The secondary function of the insert is to stop dirt and debris from entering the backstrap channel; this stops the dirt and debris from potentially interfering with the trigger mechanism. Easy installation, just snaps right in. SPECS: Advanced Polymer Material Color: Black use with the following firearm calibers and Models: 9mm, 10mm, 40/357 sig, 45 acp, 45 GAP caliber pistols. 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 31, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38. The Sure Plug will NOT fit the SF models. This Plug will not fit the Gen 4 Models The Sure Plug is an essential accessory for use with the Glock pistol. It is an inexpensive part that serves several important purposes on the firearm. As a aide in guiding a magazine into the magazine well, it will decrease the time required for those crucial magazine changes. It will provide the user with the assurance that the magazine will not hang-up on the bottom rear of the magazine well by providing a smooth, rounded surface to guide magazines into place. The Flush fit of the plug also eliminates the possibility of snagging on the open cavity. The cavity on the backside of the handle (pistol grip), just behind the magazine well, is hollow and open at both the top and bottom. This opening can allow debris such as Dust, Dirt, Sand, Snow, Lint and Water to reach the trigger assembly and firing pin of the glock hand gun. The addition of this simple and inexpensive hand gun part can eliminate the potential problems created by this debris. This alone is probably the biggest reason to purchase this accessory.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418wcFWHfSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DTVP9MG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B00DTVQE7K", "title": "Sure Plug 1 Laser Engraved US Flag - Designed for Gen 1-3 Glock models 17,18,19,20,21,22,23,24,25,31,32,34,35, 37,38", "description": "This laser engraved plug is designed to fit MODELS 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 31, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38. Easy installation, just snaps right in. The Sure Plug 1 will NOT fit the SF models nor the Gen 4 Models. It will provide the user with the assurance that the magazine will not hang-up on the bottom rear of the magazine well by providing a smooth, rounded surface to guide magazines into place. The Flush fit of the plug also eliminates the possibility of snagging on the open cavity. The cavity on the backside of the handle (pistol grip), just behind the magazine well, is hollow and open at both the top and bottom. This opening can allow debris such as Dust, Dirt, Sand, Snow, Lint and Water to reach the trigger assembly and firing pin of the glock hand gun. The addition of this simple and inexpensive hand gun part can eliminate the potential problems created by this debris.", "text": "Sure Plug 1 Laser Engraved US Flag - Designed for Gen 1-3 Glock models 17,18,19,20,21,22,23,24,25,31,32,34,35, 37,38 This laser engraved plug is designed to fit MODELS 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 31, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38. Easy installation, just snaps right in. The Sure Plug 1 will NOT fit the SF models nor the Gen 4 Models. It will provide the user with the assurance that the magazine will not hang-up on the bottom rear of the magazine well by providing a smooth, rounded surface to guide magazines into place. The Flush fit of the plug also eliminates the possibility of snagging on the open cavity. The cavity on the backside of the handle (pistol grip), just behind the magazine well, is hollow and open at both the top and bottom. This opening can allow debris such as Dust, Dirt, Sand, Snow, Lint and Water to reach the trigger assembly and firing pin of the glock hand gun. The addition of this simple and inexpensive hand gun part can eliminate the potential problems created by this debris.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mzj4J6ZAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DTVQE7K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B00DUUNRHK", "title": "Mini Bike Pump from 4MyCycle® - Portable & Lightweight with Frame Mounting Kit - Deluxe Black CNC Aluminum Alloy - High Pressure Compact Micro Air Pump for Mountain, Hybrid & BMX Bicycle Tires - Presta & Schrader Compatible", "description": "Ever Been Stranded Miles From Home with a Flat Tire and No Way To Pump It Up?AWFUL! - Did That Occur Because...• Your Pump was at Home because It Was Too Big and Heavy?• Your Pump Was Useless - Insufficient Pressure?• It Had Fallen Off The Bike Mount and was Gone?The 4MyCycle Mini Bike Pump Solves All Your Pump Problems - Never Ride Without It!>Constructed of 100% CNC Aluminum, this pump is perhaps the lightest, toughest and most rugged frame mounted pump available on Amazon today weighing in at an amazing 3.28 ounces. As you know, every ounce counts climbing those hills! An Integrated Dust Cap keeps the valve head clean and a Secure Frame Mounting Kit with positive Mounting Clips and Rubber Securing Band ensures that your pump arrives with you ready to use, no matter the terrain or action you have encountered on the way.Features & Specifications• Light Weight, Compact Construction• Weighs in at a tiny 3.28 ounces! • Only 7.5 inches long - easily Frame Mounted or stows in most bike frame bags• Barrel construction - CNC Aluminum • Handle construction - CNC Aluminum • Head construction - CNC Aluminum • Valve Lock Tab - CNC Aluminum • Integrated dust cap• Capacity 7bar/100psi • Frame mount kit double mounting method ensures you don't lose your pump on rough rides • Handle lock keeps pump secure until you twist it open ready for use • Schrader and Presta Valve compatible • Needle attachment for inflating balls • Hassle-free PET recyclable blister packLIFETIME REPLACEMENT WARRANTY!!! Click the Yellow \"Add To Cart Button\" at the Top of This Page NOW to Order the Only Pump You Will Ever Need For Your Bike", "text": "Mini Bike Pump from 4MyCycle® - Portable & Lightweight with Frame Mounting Kit - Deluxe Black CNC Aluminum Alloy - High Pressure Compact Micro Air Pump for Mountain, Hybrid & BMX Bicycle Tires - Presta & Schrader Compatible Ever Been Stranded Miles From Home with a Flat Tire and No Way To Pump It Up?AWFUL! - Did That Occur Because...• Your Pump was at Home because It Was Too Big and Heavy?• Your Pump Was Useless - Insufficient Pressure?• It Had Fallen Off The Bike Mount and was Gone?The 4MyCycle Mini Bike Pump Solves All Your Pump Problems - Never Ride Without It!>Constructed of 100% CNC Aluminum, this pump is perhaps the lightest, toughest and most rugged frame mounted pump available on Amazon today weighing in at an amazing 3.28 ounces. As you know, every ounce counts climbing those hills! An Integrated Dust Cap keeps the valve head clean and a Secure Frame Mounting Kit with positive Mounting Clips and Rubber Securing Band ensures that your pump arrives with you ready to use, no matter the terrain or action you have encountered on the way.Features & Specifications• Light Weight, Compact Construction• Weighs in at a tiny 3.28 ounces! • Only 7.5 inches long - easily Frame Mounted or stows in most bike frame bags• Barrel construction - CNC Aluminum • Handle construction - CNC Aluminum • Head construction - CNC Aluminum • Valve Lock Tab - CNC Aluminum • Integrated dust cap• Capacity 7bar/100psi • Frame mount kit double mounting method ensures you don't lose your pump on rough rides • Handle lock keeps pump secure until you twist it open ready for use • Schrader and Presta Valve compatible • Needle attachment for inflating balls • Hassle-free PET recyclable blister packLIFETIME REPLACEMENT WARRANTY!!! Click the Yellow \"Add To Cart Button\" at the Top of This Page NOW to Order the Only Pump You Will Ever Need For Your Bike", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BaKr-mWYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DUUNRHK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 17.98}}
