{"item_id": "B00DVKUDPI", "title": "Patriot Pantry Emergency Survival Food Supply - 72 Hour Kit - 20 Servings", "description": "Patriot Pantry has set the industry standard for delicious tasting and nutritious food.The 72 Hour Kit provides one adult with 20 servings of healthy, delicious storable food for 3 days. Packaged in convenient and lightweight 4-Serving mylar pouches, the low-head dehydrated food seals in the flavor and high-nutritional value.The 72 Emergency Food Supply Contains:Independence Hall Chicken Soup - 4 servingsGranny's Homestyle Potato Soup - 4 ServingsLumberjack Vegetable Beef Stew - 4 ServingsSouthwest Enchilada soup - 4 ServingsTraveler's Stew - 4 ServingsGreat for emergency preparedness, camping, hiking, or to serve as a quick and cost-effective meal for your family - taste the difference in the quality of the Patriot Pantry brand compared to the competition!Larger serving sizes, less sodium, higher quality ingredients than many of the other \"survival foods\" on the market!", "text": "Patriot Pantry Emergency Survival Food Supply - 72 Hour Kit - 20 Servings Patriot Pantry has set the industry standard for delicious tasting and nutritious food.The 72 Hour Kit provides one adult with 20 servings of healthy, delicious storable food for 3 days. Packaged in convenient and lightweight 4-Serving mylar pouches, the low-head dehydrated food seals in the flavor and high-nutritional value.The 72 Emergency Food Supply Contains:Independence Hall Chicken Soup - 4 servingsGranny's Homestyle Potato Soup - 4 ServingsLumberjack Vegetable Beef Stew - 4 ServingsSouthwest Enchilada soup - 4 ServingsTraveler's Stew - 4 ServingsGreat for emergency preparedness, camping, hiking, or to serve as a quick and cost-effective meal for your family - taste the difference in the quality of the Patriot Pantry brand compared to the competition!Larger serving sizes, less sodium, higher quality ingredients than many of the other \"survival foods\" on the market!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S%2BOTmNM9L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DVKUDPI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00DVM34NO", "title": "Power Weight Lifting Hooks - Best Weightlifting Strap Hooks for Gym Training Workout Like Deadlift & Shrugs - Crown Gear Ultimate Grips Powerlifting Hook with Cushioned Neoprene Wrist Straps - Comes in Pair - 1 Year Hassle-free Replacement Warranty", "description": "Go beyond your grip strength and complete more reps at a higher weight with the ultimate weightlifting hooks.Increase your reps overnight with the ultimate Crown Gear weightlifting hooks. Many weightlifters are limited by their grip strength, which prevents them from increasing their reps or the weight they use. Our weightlifting hooks allow you to work beyond your grip strength, so you don't have to put your training on hold while your hands catch up.Designed to combine comfort and practicality, Crown Gear weightlifting hooks use high quality materials to create a premium product. Our hooks are solid steel with a non-slip coating, improving grip within the hook bowl. Hooks are attached using at a cushioned wrist support so you don't have to compromise on comfort or safety. Durable stitching, high quality fabrics and industrial strength velcro give the whole package a pull rating of up to 600 lb (272kg).Crown Gear Weightlifting hooks with cushioned wrist straps :-Suitable for men and women-Solid steel hooks with non-slip coating-Heavy duty, durable fabric & Cushioned wrist support-Up to 600lb / 272kg pull rating-Free Bonus - Crown Gear Torque Grip Pads1 Year Hassle Free Replacement GuaranteeDiscount Promotion Ends Soon, Click On the \"Add to Cart\" Button On Top of the Page to Own Yours Now!", "text": "Power Weight Lifting Hooks - Best Weightlifting Strap Hooks for Gym Training Workout Like Deadlift & Shrugs - Crown Gear Ultimate Grips Powerlifting Hook with Cushioned Neoprene Wrist Straps - Comes in Pair - 1 Year Hassle-free Replacement Warranty Go beyond your grip strength and complete more reps at a higher weight with the ultimate weightlifting hooks.Increase your reps overnight with the ultimate Crown Gear weightlifting hooks. Many weightlifters are limited by their grip strength, which prevents them from increasing their reps or the weight they use. Our weightlifting hooks allow you to work beyond your grip strength, so you don't have to put your training on hold while your hands catch up.Designed to combine comfort and practicality, Crown Gear weightlifting hooks use high quality materials to create a premium product. Our hooks are solid steel with a non-slip coating, improving grip within the hook bowl. Hooks are attached using at a cushioned wrist support so you don't have to compromise on comfort or safety. Durable stitching, high quality fabrics and industrial strength velcro give the whole package a pull rating of up to 600 lb (272kg).Crown Gear Weightlifting hooks with cushioned wrist straps :-Suitable for men and women-Solid steel hooks with non-slip coating-Heavy duty, durable fabric & Cushioned wrist support-Up to 600lb / 272kg pull rating-Free Bonus - Crown Gear Torque Grip Pads1 Year Hassle Free Replacement GuaranteeDiscount Promotion Ends Soon, Click On the \"Add to Cart\" Button On Top of the Page to Own Yours Now!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j22hjgLIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DVM34NO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Machine Accessories", "Exercise Machine Attachments"]], "price": 35.0}}
{"item_id": "B00DW444C6", "title": "Ushoppingcart 5/10/15/20 PCS Converter Presta to Schrader Bicycle Bike Valve Adaptor Tube Pump Tools", "description": "Product Feature:100% Brand New and high qualityLight, easy and convenient to installConvert a Presta valve to a Schrader valveAlso turn a UK valve into a US valveUsed with a Bicycle Pump or a Air Compressor.Material: Zinc Alloy ( Copper Plated )Size:Approx.1.5cm x 0.9cm x0.7cm.(L*Big headdiameter*Small head diameter)Color: Gold", "text": "Ushoppingcart 5/10/15/20 PCS Converter Presta to Schrader Bicycle Bike Valve Adaptor Tube Pump Tools Product Feature:100% Brand New and high qualityLight, easy and convenient to installConvert a Presta valve to a Schrader valveAlso turn a UK valve into a US valveUsed with a Bicycle Pump or a Air Compressor.Material: Zinc Alloy ( Copper Plated )Size:Approx.1.5cm x 0.9cm x0.7cm.(L*Big headdiameter*Small head diameter)Color: Gold", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gn23q6zJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DW444C6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
