{"item_id": "B00DYFS3IY", "title": "BV Adjustable Kickstand for Bicycles with Concealed Spring-Loaded Latch", "description": "The KA76 kickstand is a unique patented design that features a hidden adjustability latch. The spring-loaded latch lifts up, allowing the foot to smoothly glide along the kickstand and lock into place when the latch is closed. A steel hexagonal bolt prevents the foot from sliding off completely and deters vandals. Adjust the kickstand without any tools, anywhere, anytime.Made of aluminum alloy, the kickstand is designed to fit most lightweight, midweight and cruiser bicycles 24\" to 29\" and easily installs with a bottom bracket mount that fits on a bike's chain stay neck. Riders can adjust their bikes to rest at any angle, which is great for balancing bikes in places where the ground is uneven. It is available in ED black or V-Polished silver.The reinforced plastic foot has a non-slip sole to prevent slipping on wet surfaces and sinking in mud.SpecificationsMaterial:Aluminum AlloyBicycle size:24\"-29\"Dimensions:14\"-16.5\" x 0.5\"-2\" x 1.5\"Weight:0.56 lbs.", "text": "BV Adjustable Kickstand for Bicycles with Concealed Spring-Loaded Latch The KA76 kickstand is a unique patented design that features a hidden adjustability latch. The spring-loaded latch lifts up, allowing the foot to smoothly glide along the kickstand and lock into place when the latch is closed. A steel hexagonal bolt prevents the foot from sliding off completely and deters vandals. Adjust the kickstand without any tools, anywhere, anytime.Made of aluminum alloy, the kickstand is designed to fit most lightweight, midweight and cruiser bicycles 24\" to 29\" and easily installs with a bottom bracket mount that fits on a bike's chain stay neck. Riders can adjust their bikes to rest at any angle, which is great for balancing bikes in places where the ground is uneven. It is available in ED black or V-Polished silver.The reinforced plastic foot has a non-slip sole to prevent slipping on wet surfaces and sinking in mud.SpecificationsMaterial:Aluminum AlloyBicycle size:24\"-29\"Dimensions:14\"-16.5\" x 0.5\"-2\" x 1.5\"Weight:0.56 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qQpgS5c9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DYFS3IY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Drivetrain Components", "Bottom Brackets"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B00DYN1NWO", "title": "Yes4All (single or combo) 6\", 8\", 10\", and 12\" diameter GONG TARGET for Pistol & Rifle Shooting Practice up to 0.2 rifle", "description": "Notice: The material won't withstand any riffle round more than .2", "text": "Yes4All (single or combo) 6\", 8\", 10\", and 12\" diameter GONG TARGET for Pistol & Rifle Shooting Practice up to 0.2 rifle Notice: The material won't withstand any riffle round more than .2", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316GdIjUG6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DYN1NWO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00DYP9TAU", "title": "Panlong Roswheel Cycling Bicycle Bike Front Tube Top Tube Cell Phone Bag Frame Bag Phone Holder for iPhone Samsung HTC Nokia and other Smartphones", "description": "This top tube bag with transparent PVC window for cell phone is a great companion for your riding.Features:1. Clear, high sensitivity PVC window designed for smartphones.2. Easy access to all functions without opening the case, such as GPS navigation, reading messages, answering calls, etc.3. Features a headphone hole and an audio extension line, allowing you to listen to the music while riding.4. PE cotton filling of the main bag body.5. U-shaped double zipper.6. Anti-slip leather at the bottom.7. Both sides have the reflective strip for safe riding at night.8. Suitable for all types of bikes.Specifications:Color: Blue, Red, GreenSize: S, M, L (for 4.2'', 4.8'', 5.5'')Material: 600D+PU+PVCPackage includes:1 * Bicycle front tube bag1 * Audio extension cable", "text": "Panlong Roswheel Cycling Bicycle Bike Front Tube Top Tube Cell Phone Bag Frame Bag Phone Holder for iPhone Samsung HTC Nokia and other Smartphones This top tube bag with transparent PVC window for cell phone is a great companion for your riding.Features:1. Clear, high sensitivity PVC window designed for smartphones.2. Easy access to all functions without opening the case, such as GPS navigation, reading messages, answering calls, etc.3. Features a headphone hole and an audio extension line, allowing you to listen to the music while riding.4. PE cotton filling of the main bag body.5. U-shaped double zipper.6. Anti-slip leather at the bottom.7. Both sides have the reflective strip for safe riding at night.8. Suitable for all types of bikes.Specifications:Color: Blue, Red, GreenSize: S, M, L (for 4.2'', 4.8'', 5.5'')Material: 600D+PU+PVCPackage includes:1 * Bicycle front tube bag1 * Audio extension cable", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Cx20rUnDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DYP9TAU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00DYYE3SE", "title": "Keep on Kovers cleat cover for Speedplay zero or Light Action Cleats (Cleats in the photo is sold seperately)", "description": "Keep On Kovers are designed to stay on your Speedplay Zero or Light Action cleats at all times. Clip in or out as usual. No more hunting for covers at breaks. No need to take them off when break is over. Just put them on and forget them. These are not made for X series cleats. Each pack come with 2 cleat cover. Each cleat cover weigh about 0.04lbs (Cleats in the photo is sold seperately)", "text": "Keep on Kovers cleat cover for Speedplay zero or Light Action Cleats (Cleats in the photo is sold seperately) Keep On Kovers are designed to stay on your Speedplay Zero or Light Action cleats at all times. Clip in or out as usual. No more hunting for covers at breaks. No need to take them off when break is over. Just put them on and forget them. These are not made for X series cleats. Each pack come with 2 cleat cover. Each cleat cover weigh about 0.04lbs (Cleats in the photo is sold seperately)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ibz4ggEdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DYYE3SE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Cleat Covers"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B00DZG8RKG", "title": "Armed Ops Tactical AR15 Quick Deploy System Micro Series Military Grade Flip Up Iron Sights Precision Machined from High Strength Aircraft Aluminum, Automatic Deployment Front and Rear Combo Set Flip up Backup Ar15 Flattop A2 Post Back up BUIS Iron Sight Picatinny & Weaver Mount AR-15 M4 M-4 M16 223 308", "description": "Armed Ops Tactical Military Grade Flip up Front and Rear Sight Combo Set Specs: ► T6 6061 Aircraft Aluminum Body ► Attaches To A Milspec 1913 Picatinny Rail ► Thumb Nut With Locking Retention ► Front Sight With Adjustable Post ► Rear Sight With Adjustable Windage And Two Appertures ► Flip Up Feature ► Front Sight: Weight: 1.5 oz Height: 1.7\" Width: 1.5\" Length: 1\" ► Rear Sight: Weight: 1.9 oz Height: 1.74\" Width: 1.5\" Length: 1\" 100% Money back Guarantee if not fully satisfied", "text": "Armed Ops Tactical AR15 Quick Deploy System Micro Series Military Grade Flip Up Iron Sights Precision Machined from High Strength Aircraft Aluminum, Automatic Deployment Front and Rear Combo Set Flip up Backup Ar15 Flattop A2 Post Back up BUIS Iron Sight Picatinny & Weaver Mount AR-15 M4 M-4 M16 223 308 Armed Ops Tactical Military Grade Flip up Front and Rear Sight Combo Set Specs: ► T6 6061 Aircraft Aluminum Body ► Attaches To A Milspec 1913 Picatinny Rail ► Thumb Nut With Locking Retention ► Front Sight With Adjustable Post ► Rear Sight With Adjustable Windage And Two Appertures ► Flip Up Feature ► Front Sight: Weight: 1.5 oz Height: 1.7\" Width: 1.5\" Length: 1\" ► Rear Sight: Weight: 1.9 oz Height: 1.74\" Width: 1.5\" Length: 1\" 100% Money back Guarantee if not fully satisfied", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41coxdAshsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00DZG8RKG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00E0FJICW", "title": "Magnetic Magazine Release Tool AR-15 .223 / 5.56", "description": "This is a brand new AR-15 magnetic magazine release tool for the Mag-Lock or Bullet Button. The Mag-Tool Low Profile is made from a high quality hard Polyoxymethylene plastic (POM). It has a strong 4mm rare earth magnet that attaches on the Mag-Lock or a standard Bullet Button. The MTLP has a nice square top textured surface which gives it a more appealing tactical look. This tool has a low profile and is ultra light. Now you have an easier alternative way to release your fixed 10 round AR magazine.", "text": "Magnetic Magazine Release Tool AR-15 .223 / 5.56 This is a brand new AR-15 magnetic magazine release tool for the Mag-Lock or Bullet Button. The Mag-Tool Low Profile is made from a high quality hard Polyoxymethylene plastic (POM). It has a strong 4mm rare earth magnet that attaches on the Mag-Lock or a standard Bullet Button. The MTLP has a nice square top textured surface which gives it a more appealing tactical look. This tool has a low profile and is ultra light. Now you have an easier alternative way to release your fixed 10 round AR magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tFk6eX4HL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E0FJICW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B00E0LEE4S", "title": "Magpul CTR Commercial Stock (Black) + Free MSP Silicone Gun & Reel Cloth", "description": "", "text": "Magpul CTR Commercial Stock (Black) + Free MSP Silicone Gun & Reel Cloth", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Gt6QKAmPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E0LEE4S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 75.95}}
{"item_id": "B00E0WWH1Y", "title": "Buy Jump Ropes Double Unders Jump Rope", "description": "USA Made Ultra Speed Ropes! Very Fast and SmoothWe invented the design of the Ultra Speed Cable jump rope in 1998. There are many copies of our design on the market, but we have the best design.We use USA made tough nylon coated cable. Cable from the other companies is stiff and kinks easily. Ours has great flexibility and is very kink resistant.Huge variety of colors for handles and cables to choose from. This gives you the jump rope in your gym that you can personalize and recognize.Originally used by competitive rope jumpers untilCrossfittersdiscovered their value for doing the difficultDouble Unders.Since that time, this rope has been a favorite in many CrossFit Gyms around the world. Has been used to set multiple National and World records. 5-7 jumps a second!\"These are hands-down the fastest and most durable ropes I've found. I've tried many different jump ropes and no matter what the price, they always seemed to break. The Ultra Speed Cable ropes hold up better than anything else and they are really affordable too I highly recommend these ropes. Tommy Hackenbruck, 2nd Fittest Man on the Planet. CrossFit Affiliate Owner Avid Cross Fitter and fitness enthusiast. on the 2004 Utah Fiesta Bowl.", "text": "Buy Jump Ropes Double Unders Jump Rope USA Made Ultra Speed Ropes! Very Fast and SmoothWe invented the design of the Ultra Speed Cable jump rope in 1998. There are many copies of our design on the market, but we have the best design.We use USA made tough nylon coated cable. Cable from the other companies is stiff and kinks easily. Ours has great flexibility and is very kink resistant.Huge variety of colors for handles and cables to choose from. This gives you the jump rope in your gym that you can personalize and recognize.Originally used by competitive rope jumpers untilCrossfittersdiscovered their value for doing the difficultDouble Unders.Since that time, this rope has been a favorite in many CrossFit Gyms around the world. Has been used to set multiple National and World records. 5-7 jumps a second!\"These are hands-down the fastest and most durable ropes I've found. I've tried many different jump ropes and no matter what the price, they always seemed to break. The Ultra Speed Cable ropes hold up better than anything else and they are really affordable too I highly recommend these ropes. Tommy Hackenbruck, 2nd Fittest Man on the Planet. CrossFit Affiliate Owner Avid Cross Fitter and fitness enthusiast. on the 2004 Utah Fiesta Bowl.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E58zzRUsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E0WWH1Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 9.45}}
