{"item_id": "B00E1L78P4", "title": "NightRider Lumia 550 Headlight", "description": "The NightRider Lumia 550 Headlight raises the bar for self contained lights. It features a new lightweight body combined with increased thermal properties ensuring a brighter longer lasting LED. The newly designed handlebar mount makes certain it remains rock solid weather on the roads or trails.4 Light Levels Plus Flash Mode.Lock Out Mode.USB Rechargeable.System Includes: LED Headlamp, Internal Li-Ion Battery, Handlebar Mount - Fits up to 31.8mm, USB Charging Cable.", "text": "NightRider Lumia 550 Headlight The NightRider Lumia 550 Headlight raises the bar for self contained lights. It features a new lightweight body combined with increased thermal properties ensuring a brighter longer lasting LED. The newly designed handlebar mount makes certain it remains rock solid weather on the roads or trails.4 Light Levels Plus Flash Mode.Lock Out Mode.USB Rechargeable.System Includes: LED Headlamp, Internal Li-Ion Battery, Handlebar Mount - Fits up to 31.8mm, USB Charging Cable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TLGLTB1lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E1L78P4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NiteRider", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 76.0}}
{"item_id": "B00E1NQ21S", "title": "Cygolite Expilion 800 USB Bicycle Headlight", "description": "The one piece design that started it all is brighter than ever for 2014, with up to 800 lumens of class leading brightness. Featuring a powerful 2nd generation Cree XM-L LED and custom TIR optics the Expilion 800 lights up any road or trail. The included helmet and handlebar mounting options give avid riders a light fit for all rides. Its convenient swappable battery stick can be switched on-the-fly when your ride goes longer ensuring you never get left in the dark. Stay safe on the road with Steady Pulse illumination that alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path. Class leading illumination, convenient USB charging and run time flexibility with swappable batteries makes the Expilion 800 the choice for any avid rider that needs an all around light.", "text": "Cygolite Expilion 800 USB Bicycle Headlight The one piece design that started it all is brighter than ever for 2014, with up to 800 lumens of class leading brightness. Featuring a powerful 2nd generation Cree XM-L LED and custom TIR optics the Expilion 800 lights up any road or trail. The included helmet and handlebar mounting options give avid riders a light fit for all rides. Its convenient swappable battery stick can be switched on-the-fly when your ride goes longer ensuring you never get left in the dark. Stay safe on the road with Steady Pulse illumination that alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path. Class leading illumination, convenient USB charging and run time flexibility with swappable batteries makes the Expilion 800 the choice for any avid rider that needs an all around light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41b9yCqZeiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E1NQ21S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cygo Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B00E1NQ3DU", "title": "Cygolite Metro 500 USB Bicycle Headlight", "description": "Upgraded for 2014, the Metro 500 features 6 modes, new custom TIR optics and increased output that lights up the demanding roads with its powerful 500 lumen 5 watt LED. Recharge conveniently through a USB port to save you the cost of replacing batteries ride after ride. New 24/7 Safety Technology features night and day specific modes for added safety: 2-in-1, Steady Pulse illumination alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path at night while new DayLightning mode boosts 600 lumens of lightning like flashes to demand motorist's attention in broad daylight. Compact, rechargeable and super bright, the Metro 500 is the commuters' choice of light.", "text": "Cygolite Metro 500 USB Bicycle Headlight Upgraded for 2014, the Metro 500 features 6 modes, new custom TIR optics and increased output that lights up the demanding roads with its powerful 500 lumen 5 watt LED. Recharge conveniently through a USB port to save you the cost of replacing batteries ride after ride. New 24/7 Safety Technology features night and day specific modes for added safety: 2-in-1, Steady Pulse illumination alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path at night while new DayLightning mode boosts 600 lumens of lightning like flashes to demand motorist's attention in broad daylight. Compact, rechargeable and super bright, the Metro 500 is the commuters' choice of light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ty9j%2BjjZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E1NQ3DU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cygo Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B00E1NQ4P2", "title": "Cygolite Metro 360 USB Bicycle Headlight", "description": "Upgraded for 2014, the Metro 360 features 6 modes, new custom TIR optics and increased output that lights up the demanding roads with its powerful 360 lumen 4 watt LED. Recharge conveniently through a USB port to save you the cost of replacing batteries ride after ride. New 24/7 Safety Technology features night and day specific modes for added safety: 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path while new DayLightning mode boosts 500 lumens of lightning like flashes to demand motorist's attention during the day. Compact, rechargeable and super bright, the Metro 360 is geared for any commute.", "text": "Cygolite Metro 360 USB Bicycle Headlight Upgraded for 2014, the Metro 360 features 6 modes, new custom TIR optics and increased output that lights up the demanding roads with its powerful 360 lumen 4 watt LED. Recharge conveniently through a USB port to save you the cost of replacing batteries ride after ride. New 24/7 Safety Technology features night and day specific modes for added safety: 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path while new DayLightning mode boosts 500 lumens of lightning like flashes to demand motorist's attention during the day. Compact, rechargeable and super bright, the Metro 360 is geared for any commute.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41n%2Bdr%2B6N5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E1NQ4P2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cygo Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 48.55}}
{"item_id": "B00E1NQ696", "title": "Cygolite Metro 360/Hotshot 2W Combo Light Set", "description": "The Metro 360 headlight and Hotshot tail light makes one of the brightest USB rechargeable light sets for everyday riding, firing 360 lumens of intense light forward and shooting 2 watts of powerful flashes back. This 2014 combo set features upgrades to both headlight and tail lights from the previous year. The Metro features bright output and more efficient optics for better beam spread. New 24/7 Safety technology features night and days specific modes for added safety: 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path at night ,while new DayLightning mode boosts 500 lumens of lightning like flashes to demand motorist's attention in broad daylight. A walking mode is also added for emergency use as a flashlight when needed. The Hotshot's adjustable flash speeds and 2watt brightness bring motorist awareness to a whole new level while incorporating a new low battery indicator and 2 screw design seat post mount for extra secure and trouble free mounting. With their powerful illumination and exclusive safety features, the Metro360 and Hotshot combo set brightens your ride and saves you the cost of replacement batteries year after year.", "text": "Cygolite Metro 360/Hotshot 2W Combo Light Set The Metro 360 headlight and Hotshot tail light makes one of the brightest USB rechargeable light sets for everyday riding, firing 360 lumens of intense light forward and shooting 2 watts of powerful flashes back. This 2014 combo set features upgrades to both headlight and tail lights from the previous year. The Metro features bright output and more efficient optics for better beam spread. New 24/7 Safety technology features night and days specific modes for added safety: 2-in-1 Steady Pulse illumination alerts motorists with flashes while constantly lighting your path at night ,while new DayLightning mode boosts 500 lumens of lightning like flashes to demand motorist's attention in broad daylight. A walking mode is also added for emergency use as a flashlight when needed. The Hotshot's adjustable flash speeds and 2watt brightness bring motorist awareness to a whole new level while incorporating a new low battery indicator and 2 screw design seat post mount for extra secure and trouble free mounting. With their powerful illumination and exclusive safety features, the Metro360 and Hotshot combo set brightens your ride and saves you the cost of replacement batteries year after year.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V82qeyxjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E1NQ696.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cygo Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B00E1NQ6T6", "title": "Cygolite 2014 Hotshot 2W SL USB Rechargeable Tail Light", "description": "The Hotshot SL is the streamlined form of the Hotshot 2W, one of the hottest tail lights available. The Hotshot SL boasts the same powerful 2 watt red LED like the original Hotshot and an integrated Li-ion battery for convenient USB charging that eliminates battery costs and waste. Exclusive features such as OSP technology (patent pending) lets you quickly fine tune each of the 3 Flash speeds to your preference with the push of a button, while lasting up to 200 hours on a single charge. The Hotshot SL is Cygolite's best safety tail light streamlined for the price conscious rider.", "text": "Cygolite 2014 Hotshot 2W SL USB Rechargeable Tail Light The Hotshot SL is the streamlined form of the Hotshot 2W, one of the hottest tail lights available. The Hotshot SL boasts the same powerful 2 watt red LED like the original Hotshot and an integrated Li-ion battery for convenient USB charging that eliminates battery costs and waste. Exclusive features such as OSP technology (patent pending) lets you quickly fine tune each of the 3 Flash speeds to your preference with the push of a button, while lasting up to 200 hours on a single charge. The Hotshot SL is Cygolite's best safety tail light streamlined for the price conscious rider.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vag0Bvk3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E1NQ6T6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cygo Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 27.95}}
