{"item_id": "B00E20K6A8", "title": "Finish Line No Drip Chain Luber", "description": "The Finish Line No Drip Chain Luber works with any lubricant and on all bike chains. Fast, even application of lubricant. No mess or drips onto braking surfaces. Each Wicking pad is good for 25+ applications. Saves Money - use up to 50% less lube.", "text": "Finish Line No Drip Chain Luber The Finish Line No Drip Chain Luber works with any lubricant and on all bike chains. Fast, even application of lubricant. No mess or drips onto braking surfaces. Each Wicking pad is good for 25+ applications. Saves Money - use up to 50% less lube.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FNIoy2JTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E20K6A8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Finish Line", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Bike Lube"]], "price": 8.64}}
