{"item_id": "B00E2217I6", "title": "Plano Molding Company All Weather Tactical Gun Case, 42-Inch", "description": "The All Weather Tactical gun cases provide the highest level of protection for your firearms. With rugged, industrial-strength construction and continuous Dri-Loc Seal, All Weather cases create a watertight and airtight shield that protects your guns even in the most extreme conditions, including airline cargo holds.", "text": "Plano Molding Company All Weather Tactical Gun Case, 42-Inch The All Weather Tactical gun cases provide the highest level of protection for your firearms. With rugged, industrial-strength construction and continuous Dri-Loc Seal, All Weather cases create a watertight and airtight shield that protects your guns even in the most extreme conditions, including airline cargo holds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TFfftJoWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E2217I6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano Molding Company", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 68.88}}
{"item_id": "B00E221A88", "title": "Plano Molding Company All Weather Tactical Gun Case, 36-Inch", "description": "The All Weather Tactical gun cases provide the highest level of protection for your firearms. With rugged, industrial-strength construction and continuous Dri-Loc Seal, All Weather cases create a watertight and airtight shield that protects your guns even in the most extreme conditions, including airline cargo holds.", "text": "Plano Molding Company All Weather Tactical Gun Case, 36-Inch The All Weather Tactical gun cases provide the highest level of protection for your firearms. With rugged, industrial-strength construction and continuous Dri-Loc Seal, All Weather cases create a watertight and airtight shield that protects your guns even in the most extreme conditions, including airline cargo holds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TFfftJoWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E221A88.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano Molding Company", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 68.88}}
{"item_id": "B00E3EL8NC", "title": "Huntpro® Rail Mounted Push Button Qd Quick Release 1.25\" Sling Swivel with Base Mount", "description": "The set includes one push-button style sling swivel pin and one base for Picatinny rails Simply push button to detach and attach swivel Fit on 20mm weaver rails. Swivel pin rotates freely after plugged in For use with 1 1/4inch wide slings Great for use on Quad Rail forends or other Picatinny accessory rails. Quick- detach feature provides emergency weapon install and release Accepts QD Push Button Style Stud Swivels Heavy duty alloy construction. Allen wrench included Base length: 1inch Swivel set weight: 2 oz. About Ade Advanced Optics: Ade Advanced Optics first made its appearance in the firearms accessory industry by doing private label production for several major manufacturers and retailers. During this period, Ade Advanced Optics began receiving requests from numerous customers for access to the affordable, high quality products that Ade Advanced Optics was capable of producing. By soliciting feedback from both clients and end users, Ade Advanced Optics was able to overcome the challenges a new company often faces when entering a global market and industry, especially one as co", "text": "Huntpro® Rail Mounted Push Button Qd Quick Release 1.25\" Sling Swivel with Base Mount The set includes one push-button style sling swivel pin and one base for Picatinny rails Simply push button to detach and attach swivel Fit on 20mm weaver rails. Swivel pin rotates freely after plugged in For use with 1 1/4inch wide slings Great for use on Quad Rail forends or other Picatinny accessory rails. Quick- detach feature provides emergency weapon install and release Accepts QD Push Button Style Stud Swivels Heavy duty alloy construction. Allen wrench included Base length: 1inch Swivel set weight: 2 oz. About Ade Advanced Optics: Ade Advanced Optics first made its appearance in the firearms accessory industry by doing private label production for several major manufacturers and retailers. During this period, Ade Advanced Optics began receiving requests from numerous customers for access to the affordable, high quality products that Ade Advanced Optics was capable of producing. By soliciting feedback from both clients and end users, Ade Advanced Optics was able to overcome the challenges a new company often faces when entering a global market and industry, especially one as co", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dKEyb8aJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E3EL8NC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 4.94}}
{"item_id": "B00E3FU8NW", "title": "Ade Advanced Optics® Quick Flip to Side 90 Degree 30mm/1 Inch Tactical Qd Pivot FTS Mount with 1\" Inserts for Aimpoint, Eotech, Magnifier, Scope 3x 4x 5x", "description": "The Tactical Flip-to-Side Mount was created to work with your 30mm Magnifier in conjunction with a reflex or holographic weapon sight. The spring assisted flip to side motion of this mount was created so the shooter can use the magnifier for long distance shots and quickly move it to the side to use the 1x magnification of a reflex sight under CQB conditions. This Flip to Side 30mm/1inch Mount gives the shooter versatility in the field. This mount is constructed with durable aluminum to withstand the stresses of combat. Features: Spring assist flip to the side action Made from durable aluminum Fits 30mm and 1 inch magnifiers Specifications: Picatinny Weaver mount fits both 30mm and 1 inch magnifiers(use the provided 1 inch insert) Aircraft Grade Aluminum Matte black Finish Solid No Wiggle Attachment to Rail Weatherproof and Shockproof Weight: 4.6oz Package Includes: FTS Flip to Side Mount 1 Allen Wrench for Mounting Magnifier 1 inch insert to turn it to a inch mount from 30mm mount", "text": "Ade Advanced Optics® Quick Flip to Side 90 Degree 30mm/1 Inch Tactical Qd Pivot FTS Mount with 1\" Inserts for Aimpoint, Eotech, Magnifier, Scope 3x 4x 5x The Tactical Flip-to-Side Mount was created to work with your 30mm Magnifier in conjunction with a reflex or holographic weapon sight. The spring assisted flip to side motion of this mount was created so the shooter can use the magnifier for long distance shots and quickly move it to the side to use the 1x magnification of a reflex sight under CQB conditions. This Flip to Side 30mm/1inch Mount gives the shooter versatility in the field. This mount is constructed with durable aluminum to withstand the stresses of combat. Features: Spring assist flip to the side action Made from durable aluminum Fits 30mm and 1 inch magnifiers Specifications: Picatinny Weaver mount fits both 30mm and 1 inch magnifiers(use the provided 1 inch insert) Aircraft Grade Aluminum Matte black Finish Solid No Wiggle Attachment to Rail Weatherproof and Shockproof Weight: 4.6oz Package Includes: FTS Flip to Side Mount 1 Allen Wrench for Mounting Magnifier 1 inch insert to turn it to a inch mount from 30mm mount", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314K4vcHKYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E3FU8NW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 26.53}}
{"item_id": "B00E3VBO5W", "title": "NiteRider Lumina 700 Light", "description": "Smaller...Lighter...Brighter sums up the new Lumina Series. Building off the widely popular Cordless Series, the USB rechargeable Lumina raises the bar for self contained lights. Luminas feature a new, lightweight body combined with increased thermal properties, ensuring a brighter, longer lasting LED. All Luminas feature a newly designed handlebar mount making certain it remains rock solid whether on the trail or pavement. Features: - 1:30HR High - 4 Light levels - Flashing Light setting - Weight: 172 Grams - 6:00 hour charge time - LED Headlamp - Internal Li-Ion Battery - Handlebar Mount Fits up to 31.8mm - Helmet Mount - USB Charging Cable", "text": "NiteRider Lumina 700 Light Smaller...Lighter...Brighter sums up the new Lumina Series. Building off the widely popular Cordless Series, the USB rechargeable Lumina raises the bar for self contained lights. Luminas feature a new, lightweight body combined with increased thermal properties, ensuring a brighter, longer lasting LED. All Luminas feature a newly designed handlebar mount making certain it remains rock solid whether on the trail or pavement. Features: - 1:30HR High - 4 Light levels - Flashing Light setting - Weight: 172 Grams - 6:00 hour charge time - LED Headlamp - Internal Li-Ion Battery - Handlebar Mount Fits up to 31.8mm - Helmet Mount - USB Charging Cable", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lxCgW2vKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E3VBO5W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NiteRider", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 88.49}}
{"item_id": "B00E3XWNG4", "title": "Barsony Single Magazine Pouch for Compact, Sub-Compact 9mm 40 45 Guns.", "description": "", "text": "Barsony Single Magazine Pouch for Compact, Sub-Compact 9mm 40 45 Guns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cpktx7UDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E3XWNG4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Holders"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B00E4HTDR6", "title": "Genuine Gurkha Kukri - AEOF Afghan Kukri, Authentic British Gurkha Afghan Issue Khukuri - Handmade by GK&CO.Kukri House In Nepal", "description": "This is the current issue Kukri for Gurkhas who are in Afghan war. Therefore the name derived after the Afghanistan. The Gurkhas are deployed since the war started for Enduring Operation Freedom in Afghanistan. The Regiment is decided to carry new kukri fit to the Afghan environment. Therefore the Afghan Kukri AEOF is issued to Gurkhas. The blade is made of Highly Graded Carbon with balanced water puring temper on the edge of the blade therefore its very strong. Besides carrying the knife in combat and training, this blade can be used to chop wood or bone and cleaning bushes. The blade is made of Highly Graded Carbon (5160 Steel, Car spring) with balanced water temper on the edge of the blade therefore its very strong; It has very sharp edge (As it is made of carbon steel you can also sharpen as you wish). Blade is 11\" from guard to tip made of Highly Grade Carbon Steel (Steel 5160, Car spring), Thickness of the blade is about 3/8 inch at the thickest part of spine. Handle is 5.5\" (from pommel to Guard) Made of white Rose wood. Overall length is about 16.5 inches (tip to pommel). The scabbard is made of Cotton Covered in natural buffalo leather. The scabbard has double frogs which are leather loops used to attach to the belt. Weight: 1.76 lbs or 28.21Oz (Kukri & Sheath with two small knives). Karda & Chakmak: These are the two small knives that come with all traditional Kukris. When you buy this item you will also get these two unique knives. The Chakmak is the thick piece of metal without an edge. It is used in a way similar to a strop to hone the edge of the kukri while in the field. The Karda is the sharpened one that is used for general purposes and for more detailed work. The dimensions of Karda & Chakmak are: 2.2\" blade (Appox) with a 2 inch handle (Appox)This is handcrafted kukri therefore please note that each one might have slight variations in measurement", "text": "Genuine Gurkha Kukri - AEOF Afghan Kukri, Authentic British Gurkha Afghan Issue Khukuri - Handmade by GK&CO.Kukri House In Nepal This is the current issue Kukri for Gurkhas who are in Afghan war. Therefore the name derived after the Afghanistan. The Gurkhas are deployed since the war started for Enduring Operation Freedom in Afghanistan. The Regiment is decided to carry new kukri fit to the Afghan environment. Therefore the Afghan Kukri AEOF is issued to Gurkhas. The blade is made of Highly Graded Carbon with balanced water puring temper on the edge of the blade therefore its very strong. Besides carrying the knife in combat and training, this blade can be used to chop wood or bone and cleaning bushes. The blade is made of Highly Graded Carbon (5160 Steel, Car spring) with balanced water temper on the edge of the blade therefore its very strong; It has very sharp edge (As it is made of carbon steel you can also sharpen as you wish). Blade is 11\" from guard to tip made of Highly Grade Carbon Steel (Steel 5160, Car spring), Thickness of the blade is about 3/8 inch at the thickest part of spine. Handle is 5.5\" (from pommel to Guard) Made of white Rose wood. Overall length is about 16.5 inches (tip to pommel). The scabbard is made of Cotton Covered in natural buffalo leather. The scabbard has double frogs which are leather loops used to attach to the belt. Weight: 1.76 lbs or 28.21Oz (Kukri & Sheath with two small knives). Karda & Chakmak: These are the two small knives that come with all traditional Kukris. When you buy this item you will also get these two unique knives. The Chakmak is the thick piece of metal without an edge. It is used in a way similar to a strop to hone the edge of the kukri while in the field. The Karda is the sharpened one that is used for general purposes and for more detailed work. The dimensions of Karda & Chakmak are: 2.2\" blade (Appox) with a 2 inch handle (Appox)This is handcrafted kukri therefore please note that each one might have slight variations in measurement", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aTzUA1WXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E4HTDR6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 66.99}}
{"item_id": "B00E4W6RKM", "title": "Made In USA Tactical Model 4/15 Machined Black Oxide Finished Steel 3 Prong Break Brake Shroud Cage With 1/2 x 28 TPI Thread Pattern For .223 5.56 Rifle", "description": "Official Product of AR-GEAR, Brand New.Length : 1.75 inch ; Weight : 1.8 oz. Made in USA. The 3 prong design.Easy To Install - Fits Standard 1/2\"x 28 Threads.CNC Machined High Quality Steel Made In USA With Premium Black Oxide Finish.Military/Law Enforcement Quality.Three-Prong Design.No Ports On Bottom Of Brake To Ensure No Dust Printing.", "text": "Made In USA Tactical Model 4/15 Machined Black Oxide Finished Steel 3 Prong Break Brake Shroud Cage With 1/2 x 28 TPI Thread Pattern For .223 5.56 Rifle Official Product of AR-GEAR, Brand New.Length : 1.75 inch ; Weight : 1.8 oz. Made in USA. The 3 prong design.Easy To Install - Fits Standard 1/2\"x 28 Threads.CNC Machined High Quality Steel Made In USA With Premium Black Oxide Finish.Military/Law Enforcement Quality.Three-Prong Design.No Ports On Bottom Of Brake To Ensure No Dust Printing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21qYaiOb--L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E4W6RKM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AR-GEAR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.95}}
