{"item_id": "B00E58FN7I", "title": "Genuine Gurkha Kukri - 5\" Blade Panawal Khukuri- Handmade by GK&CO.Kukri House Factory in Nepal.", "description": "5\" Blade Panawal Angkhola Wooden Handle Kukri\"Panawal\" refers to full tang handle, this kukri has a full tang handle so the kukri is named as Panawal kukri. The blade is made by the continue beating process. The 5\" blade is made of highly graded carbon steel (spring of truck, Car) with water pouring temper on the blade so it is very strong. 4\"full tang handle is made of Indian rose-wood and fixed with two metal rivets. Scabbard is made of water-buffalo leather. This Kukri can be use for cutting wood, firewood, meat, clearing bushes etc. Due to small size this Kukri can be a best tool for camping. The craftsmanship on this knife is amazing so if you are looking for the finest quality for desktop or small work or Gift, you will be not disappointed.Specification of 5\" Blade Panawal Angkhola Kukri:This is handcrafted kukri therefore please note that each one might have slight variations in measurement.Blade size & Type: 5 Inches (12.7cm) Handmade, Highly Grade Carbon Steel, Semi-polished bladeHandle size: 4 Inches (10.16cm) full tang handle made of Rose Wood.Thickness at the Spine: 5/16\" Appoximately (7mm).Overall Length: 9 Inches (22.86cm) from tip of the blade to pommel of the handle (Aprox)Weight: Approximately 12.35 oz, 0.77 lb or 375 grams, Blade and SheathScabbard: made of Cotton Covered in Buffalo Leather.Origin: Dharan, East NepalShipping weight: 1.5 lb or 675 Grams.Blade Hardness: spine: 22-25 RC, Belly: 45-46 RC, Edge: 58-60 RC, Steel Type: 5160 Car Spring", "text": "Genuine Gurkha Kukri - 5\" Blade Panawal Khukuri- Handmade by GK&CO.Kukri House Factory in Nepal. 5\" Blade Panawal Angkhola Wooden Handle Kukri\"Panawal\" refers to full tang handle, this kukri has a full tang handle so the kukri is named as Panawal kukri. The blade is made by the continue beating process. The 5\" blade is made of highly graded carbon steel (spring of truck, Car) with water pouring temper on the blade so it is very strong. 4\"full tang handle is made of Indian rose-wood and fixed with two metal rivets. Scabbard is made of water-buffalo leather. This Kukri can be use for cutting wood, firewood, meat, clearing bushes etc. Due to small size this Kukri can be a best tool for camping. The craftsmanship on this knife is amazing so if you are looking for the finest quality for desktop or small work or Gift, you will be not disappointed.Specification of 5\" Blade Panawal Angkhola Kukri:This is handcrafted kukri therefore please note that each one might have slight variations in measurement.Blade size & Type: 5 Inches (12.7cm) Handmade, Highly Grade Carbon Steel, Semi-polished bladeHandle size: 4 Inches (10.16cm) full tang handle made of Rose Wood.Thickness at the Spine: 5/16\" Appoximately (7mm).Overall Length: 9 Inches (22.86cm) from tip of the blade to pommel of the handle (Aprox)Weight: Approximately 12.35 oz, 0.77 lb or 375 grams, Blade and SheathScabbard: made of Cotton Covered in Buffalo Leather.Origin: Dharan, East NepalShipping weight: 1.5 lb or 675 Grams.Blade Hardness: spine: 22-25 RC, Belly: 45-46 RC, Edge: 58-60 RC, Steel Type: 5160 Car Spring", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fWw2n6QGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E58FN7I.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B00E594XZ0", "title": "G&G CM16 Raider DST Airsoft Rifle, Large", "description": "G&G;, shoot the finest Airsoft rifles and pistols on the planet. Years of development go into making the best performing and highest quality Airsoft guns you can buy. Load the bbs and wind the gear up on the bottom so that it loads the bbs. If the gear is not winded the bbs will not feed.", "text": "G&G CM16 Raider DST Airsoft Rifle, Large G&G;, shoot the finest Airsoft rifles and pistols on the planet. Years of development go into making the best performing and highest quality Airsoft guns you can buy. Load the bbs and wind the gear up on the bottom so that it loads the bbs. If the gear is not winded the bbs will not feed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lzXJILLmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E594XZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "G&amp;G", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 150.0}}
{"item_id": "B00E5NAMWO", "title": "HealthPro Ultra Lightweight Super Strong Folding Titanium Spork", "description": "The HealthPro Titanium Folding Spork is made of titanium, one of the toughest alloys on the planet. Titanium is widely used in aircraft construction because of its lightness and extreme strength, yet it is also used in surgical and dental implants. Its high biocompatibility means that it is very non-toxic and is not rejected by the body. Great for your next outing, no matter where it is.And we have three or more reasons why you need a Titanium Folding Spork. First, titanium is tasteless and odorless, which means it won't affect your food's taste. Also, it has very low thermal conductivity, which means your Titanium Folding Spork will resist getting too cold or too hot (depending on your food of choice). Titanium is also super strong and light weight, which means you can stab it right into the food you wish to eat. We tried it with meats and fruits and it worked well, however we don't recommend trying people or rocks. Finally, you need a Titanium Folding Spork because it is awesome. And you are awesome, too - the perfect match!Specifications~Material: food grade titanium~Dishwasher safe: Yes~Non-corrosive, non-magnetic~Hypoallergic~Length: 3.5\" folded, 6\" opened~Weight: 0.6 oz", "text": "HealthPro Ultra Lightweight Super Strong Folding Titanium Spork The HealthPro Titanium Folding Spork is made of titanium, one of the toughest alloys on the planet. Titanium is widely used in aircraft construction because of its lightness and extreme strength, yet it is also used in surgical and dental implants. Its high biocompatibility means that it is very non-toxic and is not rejected by the body. Great for your next outing, no matter where it is.And we have three or more reasons why you need a Titanium Folding Spork. First, titanium is tasteless and odorless, which means it won't affect your food's taste. Also, it has very low thermal conductivity, which means your Titanium Folding Spork will resist getting too cold or too hot (depending on your food of choice). Titanium is also super strong and light weight, which means you can stab it right into the food you wish to eat. We tried it with meats and fruits and it worked well, however we don't recommend trying people or rocks. Finally, you need a Titanium Folding Spork because it is awesome. And you are awesome, too - the perfect match!Specifications~Material: food grade titanium~Dishwasher safe: Yes~Non-corrosive, non-magnetic~Hypoallergic~Length: 3.5\" folded, 6\" opened~Weight: 0.6 oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21KusInwf1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E5NAMWO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Flatware"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B00E5S2JGQ", "title": "New Windproof Stainless Steel Metal Match Lighter Gas Oil Fire Starter Keychain for Camping Outdoor~Matchbox Fire Start", "description": "Features:•Mini shape, light weight, space-saving and easy to carry•Applicable at anywhere, anytime and any condition, including moist weather or low temperature•Simplicity of operation•High quality, can be used for thousands of times.•A necessary survival tool for outdoor camping, traveling, hiking etcSpecification:•Material: Stainless steel•Color: Silver•Size: approx. 4.8 x 3 x 1cm (L*W*H)•Note: Once the flame become weaker, you need to add a little lighter fluid to the canister. (The lighter fluid can be gas or kerosene, and neither of them is included in the package).", "text": "New Windproof Stainless Steel Metal Match Lighter Gas Oil Fire Starter Keychain for Camping Outdoor~Matchbox Fire Start Features:•Mini shape, light weight, space-saving and easy to carry•Applicable at anywhere, anytime and any condition, including moist weather or low temperature•Simplicity of operation•High quality, can be used for thousands of times.•A necessary survival tool for outdoor camping, traveling, hiking etcSpecification:•Material: Stainless steel•Color: Silver•Size: approx. 4.8 x 3 x 1cm (L*W*H)•Note: Once the flame become weaker, you need to add a little lighter fluid to the canister. (The lighter fluid can be gas or kerosene, and neither of them is included in the package).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fgB8HvL%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E5S2JGQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vktech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 4.64}}
{"item_id": "B00E62XXRA", "title": "Paracord Planet 10', 25', 50', 100' Hanks & 250', 1000' Spools of Parachute 550 Cord Type III 7 Strand Paracord Over 200 Colors", "description": "Paracord Planet paracord is your all-around tactical, crafting and utility cord. Paracord Planet Type III commercial grade paracord is dependable, tough and long lasting. The cord is made of 550 pound test nylon and features seven-strand core for maximum strength. Paracord Planet paracord measures at 5/32\" in diameter and is manufacturered in the United states by a certified US Government contractor. Paracord Planet Paracord is available in over 200 different colors and lengths. Paracord Planet Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 7 strand core and measures 5/32\" in diameter. Manufactured in the US and certified by US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "text": "Paracord Planet 10', 25', 50', 100' Hanks & 250', 1000' Spools of Parachute 550 Cord Type III 7 Strand Paracord Over 200 Colors Paracord Planet paracord is your all-around tactical, crafting and utility cord. Paracord Planet Type III commercial grade paracord is dependable, tough and long lasting. The cord is made of 550 pound test nylon and features seven-strand core for maximum strength. Paracord Planet paracord measures at 5/32\" in diameter and is manufacturered in the United states by a certified US Government contractor. Paracord Planet Paracord is available in over 200 different colors and lengths. Paracord Planet Type III 550 lb. Paracord is 100% nylon, 7 strand core and measures 5/32\" in diameter. Manufactured in the US and certified by US Government contractor and has a 550 lb test strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61jkfQJFdvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E62XXRA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00E675IM8", "title": "Steel Tanker Style Black Muzzle Brake for .223/5.56MM Made In USA", "description": "Tanker style steel muzzle brake (black) for your .223/5.56 barrel. 100% manufacture in Ontario California USA. Material: Steel (12L13) Process: Precision-CNC Machining Weight: 4.1 oz Length: 2.25 in (+/- 2%) Width: 0.85 in (+/- 2%) Thread: 1/2\"-28 Coating: Black (Manganese Phosphate) Crush Washer: INCLUDED Processes Performed Per Specification Phosphate: MIL-DTL-16232G (DOD-P-16232F) Type: M (Manganese) Manganese Phosphate is intended to produce highly corrosion resistant, non-metallic, manganese phosphate coatings on iron and steel surfaces. The coatings have great adherence and provide substantial protection from rust by bonding the final finish of stain, oil, wax or paint to the treated articles. The treatment produces a uniform coating and is especially suitable for rust proofing threaded pieces and articles with small holes or recesses.", "text": "Steel Tanker Style Black Muzzle Brake for .223/5.56MM Made In USA Tanker style steel muzzle brake (black) for your .223/5.56 barrel. 100% manufacture in Ontario California USA. Material: Steel (12L13) Process: Precision-CNC Machining Weight: 4.1 oz Length: 2.25 in (+/- 2%) Width: 0.85 in (+/- 2%) Thread: 1/2\"-28 Coating: Black (Manganese Phosphate) Crush Washer: INCLUDED Processes Performed Per Specification Phosphate: MIL-DTL-16232G (DOD-P-16232F) Type: M (Manganese) Manganese Phosphate is intended to produce highly corrosion resistant, non-metallic, manganese phosphate coatings on iron and steel surfaces. The coatings have great adherence and provide substantial protection from rust by bonding the final finish of stain, oil, wax or paint to the treated articles. The treatment produces a uniform coating and is especially suitable for rust proofing threaded pieces and articles with small holes or recesses.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XFsq0HweL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E675IM8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00E6LB0JE", "title": "223 5.56 Aluminum Upper Vise Block Black", "description": "Our precision fitting and attractive anodize finish vise block is the right choice for professional armorers or your first build. Safely perform barrel work on any flat top upper by rotating it into the horizontal position with retainer pins removed. You will need to supply a piece of hard maple wood to protect the top rail from the opposing vise jaw face.", "text": "223 5.56 Aluminum Upper Vise Block Black Our precision fitting and attractive anodize finish vise block is the right choice for professional armorers or your first build. Safely perform barrel work on any flat top upper by rotating it into the horizontal position with retainer pins removed. You will need to supply a piece of hard maple wood to protect the top rail from the opposing vise jaw face.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xbOvr%2BzZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E6LB0JE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00E6MIV0O", "title": "Estone 4pcs Outdoor Camping Hiking Cookware Backpacking Cooking Picnic Bowl Pot Pan Set", "description": "100% Brand new and high qualityBoth the pot and pan have folding handles for space saving and compactness.This set is perfect for camping, backpacking, hiking, emergency preparedness, or as part of a survival kit.When the cook set is fitted together (with the lid on the pot) for travel and storage, it contains room to carry a stove, matches, seasoning, salt, pepper, a sponge and many other things to keep your overall space consumption to a minimum.The handle is foldable and easy for storage, with silicone tube cover to protect your from burningA mesh bag was included as a giftMaterial: Aluminum alloyFoldable size: 17 x 14cm (H x D)Small lid size: 11.5 x 6cmBig lid size: 13 x 6.5cmSmall pot size: 12.5 x 10.5cmBig pot size: 14 x 11cmColor: GrayPackage includes:Cooking Set x 1 setMesh bag x1", "text": "Estone 4pcs Outdoor Camping Hiking Cookware Backpacking Cooking Picnic Bowl Pot Pan Set 100% Brand new and high qualityBoth the pot and pan have folding handles for space saving and compactness.This set is perfect for camping, backpacking, hiking, emergency preparedness, or as part of a survival kit.When the cook set is fitted together (with the lid on the pot) for travel and storage, it contains room to carry a stove, matches, seasoning, salt, pepper, a sponge and many other things to keep your overall space consumption to a minimum.The handle is foldable and easy for storage, with silicone tube cover to protect your from burningA mesh bag was included as a giftMaterial: Aluminum alloyFoldable size: 17 x 14cm (H x D)Small lid size: 11.5 x 6cmBig lid size: 13 x 6.5cmSmall pot size: 12.5 x 10.5cmBig pot size: 14 x 11cmColor: GrayPackage includes:Cooking Set x 1 setMesh bag x1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vx7ebrXwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E6MIV0O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Estone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 21.86}}
{"item_id": "B00E6OOK0C", "title": "Morakniv Classic Craftsmen 611 Utility Knife with Carbon Steel Blade and Finger Guard, 3.9-Inch", "description": "Morakniv Classic series of knives, developed by Mora of Sweden for over a century, have been proven reliable by generations of carpenters and wood carvers. The Classic Craftsmen 611 features a 3.9-inch carbon steel blade, red birch wood handle and single-sided finger protection. Mora knives made from high carbon steel achieve high hardness, sharpen easily and are exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended. Sheath included.", "text": "Morakniv Classic Craftsmen 611 Utility Knife with Carbon Steel Blade and Finger Guard, 3.9-Inch Morakniv Classic series of knives, developed by Mora of Sweden for over a century, have been proven reliable by generations of carpenters and wood carvers. The Classic Craftsmen 611 features a 3.9-inch carbon steel blade, red birch wood handle and single-sided finger protection. Mora knives made from high carbon steel achieve high hardness, sharpen easily and are exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended. Sheath included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oXbtTXvjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E6OOK0C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morakniv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 16.46}}
{"item_id": "B00E77XVSK", "title": "CoiTAC® Steel Fishbone Style Black Muzzle Brake for .223/5.56MM Made In USA", "description": "Fishbone style steel muzzle brake (black) for your .223/5.56 barrel. 100% manufacture in USA. Material: Steel (12L13) Weight: 4.3 oz Length: 2.83 in (+/- 2%) Width: 0.98 in (+/- 2%) Thread: 1/2\"-28 Coating: Black (Manganese Phosphate) Crush Washer: INCLUDED Processes Performed Per Specification Phosphate: MIL-DTL-16232G (DOD-P-16232F) Type: M (Manganese) Manganese Phosphate is intended to produce highly corrosion resistant, non-metallic, manganese phosphate coatings on iron and steel surfaces. The coatings have great adherence and provide substantial protection from rust by bonding the final finish of stain, oil, wax or paint to the treated articles. The treatment produces a uniform coating and is especially suitable for rust proofing threaded pieces and articles with small holes or recesses.", "text": "CoiTAC® Steel Fishbone Style Black Muzzle Brake for .223/5.56MM Made In USA Fishbone style steel muzzle brake (black) for your .223/5.56 barrel. 100% manufacture in USA. Material: Steel (12L13) Weight: 4.3 oz Length: 2.83 in (+/- 2%) Width: 0.98 in (+/- 2%) Thread: 1/2\"-28 Coating: Black (Manganese Phosphate) Crush Washer: INCLUDED Processes Performed Per Specification Phosphate: MIL-DTL-16232G (DOD-P-16232F) Type: M (Manganese) Manganese Phosphate is intended to produce highly corrosion resistant, non-metallic, manganese phosphate coatings on iron and steel surfaces. The coatings have great adherence and provide substantial protection from rust by bonding the final finish of stain, oil, wax or paint to the treated articles. The treatment produces a uniform coating and is especially suitable for rust proofing threaded pieces and articles with small holes or recesses.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sOcZCgwUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E77XVSK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CoiTAC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 20.25}}
