{"item_id": "B00E86K2YG", "title": "Sawyer Fast Fill Adapter", "description": "Sawyer's Fast Fill Adapter for Hydration Packs makes it easy to refill your Sawyer Squeeze Water Filter via the drinking tube. It makes refilling quick, easy and hassle free. Adapters attach to the drinking tube on your hydration reservoir so you don't even have to remove the reservoir from your backpack.", "text": "Sawyer Fast Fill Adapter Sawyer's Fast Fill Adapter for Hydration Packs makes it easy to refill your Sawyer Squeeze Water Filter via the drinking tube. It makes refilling quick, easy and hassle free. Adapters attach to the drinking tube on your hydration reservoir so you don't even have to remove the reservoir from your backpack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iYm6ejTeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00E86K2YG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sawyer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 13.85}}
