{"item_id": "B00EA0QLJ0", "title": "Harbinger Women's Padded Cotton Lifting Straps, Pink", "description": "Lift heavier, longer and in style with our pink padded cotton lifting straps. the 21 1/2in extended length strap provides a stronger wrap on the bar, while the extra 1 1/2in width increases contact on grip surface and both result in less grip fatigue, so you can lift more weight and more reps. Plush Neotek pad cushions wrists. Merrowed end tabs prevent fraying and heavy duty stitching enhances durability.", "text": "Harbinger Women's Padded Cotton Lifting Straps, Pink Lift heavier, longer and in style with our pink padded cotton lifting straps. the 21 1/2in extended length strap provides a stronger wrap on the bar, while the extra 1 1/2in width increases contact on grip surface and both result in less grip fatigue, so you can lift more weight and more reps. Plush Neotek pad cushions wrists. Merrowed end tabs prevent fraying and heavy duty stitching enhances durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sxt-j6yHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EA0QLJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Harbinger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weight Racks", "Free-Weight Racks"]], "price": 7.2}}
