{"item_id": "B00EA8INRU", "title": "Global Sportsman Tactical Micro Compact Mini Open Reflex Red Dot Reticle CQB Lightweight Sight with Integral Weaver-Picatinny Mount for Pistol / Rifle / Shotgun with Lens Cleaning Kit", "description": "Official Products of The Global Sportsman, Brand New. Lithium CR2032 Battery, Protective Cover, Windage & Elevation Dial Tool, And Lens Cleaning Kit All Included. Glare Free, Shock Proof & Fully Coated With An Anodized Finish For Heavy Duty Recoil And Includes A Lifetime Manufacturer's Warranty. Lightweight Super Compact And Crystal Clear. Parallax Free & Unlimited Eye Relief Provides The Shooter A Wide Field Of View And The Ability To Operate With Both Eyes Open. Perfect For Rifles, Pistols, Shotguns, Paintball, Airsoft Or Crossbows With a 7/8\" Weaver-Picatinny Rail.", "text": "Global Sportsman Tactical Micro Compact Mini Open Reflex Red Dot Reticle CQB Lightweight Sight with Integral Weaver-Picatinny Mount for Pistol / Rifle / Shotgun with Lens Cleaning Kit Official Products of The Global Sportsman, Brand New. Lithium CR2032 Battery, Protective Cover, Windage & Elevation Dial Tool, And Lens Cleaning Kit All Included. Glare Free, Shock Proof & Fully Coated With An Anodized Finish For Heavy Duty Recoil And Includes A Lifetime Manufacturer's Warranty. Lightweight Super Compact And Crystal Clear. Parallax Free & Unlimited Eye Relief Provides The Shooter A Wide Field Of View And The Ability To Operate With Both Eyes Open. Perfect For Rifles, Pistols, Shotguns, Paintball, Airsoft Or Crossbows With a 7/8\" Weaver-Picatinny Rail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41acDj7nFVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EA8INRU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GS-Global Sportsman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EA8IVGI", "title": "Tactical Mosin Nagant M44 Carbine Rifle Brake Break Black Finish", "description": "Official Product of AR-GEAR, Brand New. Mosin Nagant M44 Brake. Black Finish, solid precision machined construction to military quality standards. The Brake will reduce recoil & climb dramatically, which will improve control. It's ported sides have been tested to give you the maximum recoil reduction than any other brake on the market today resulting in quicker recovery & follow-up. Allows side venting of gasses so as to help protect your night vision, reduce pressure and volume of gasses and will reduce your dust signature. Military quality, measures 4 inches long and just 7.34 oz, the installation of this brake couldnt be simpler and requires no gunsmithing- just slides and bolts right on with the included 2 set screws.", "text": "Tactical Mosin Nagant M44 Carbine Rifle Brake Break Black Finish Official Product of AR-GEAR, Brand New. Mosin Nagant M44 Brake. Black Finish, solid precision machined construction to military quality standards. The Brake will reduce recoil & climb dramatically, which will improve control. It's ported sides have been tested to give you the maximum recoil reduction than any other brake on the market today resulting in quicker recovery & follow-up. Allows side venting of gasses so as to help protect your night vision, reduce pressure and volume of gasses and will reduce your dust signature. Military quality, measures 4 inches long and just 7.34 oz, the installation of this brake couldnt be simpler and requires no gunsmithing- just slides and bolts right on with the included 2 set screws.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DC4GfzSmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EA8IVGI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AR-GEAR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B00EA8IXES", "title": "Tactical Ruger 10 22 10/22 10-22 Heavy Duty Heat Treated Steel Short Style Break Brake", "description": "Official Product of AR-GEAR, Brand New. Blued Steel Construction (Black Color) - Length: 2.5\", N.W. (OZ): 1.8 6 Slot Brake For Maximum Recoil Reduction And Flip. The Slots/Openings Redirect Propellant Gases To Counter The Recoil And Unwanted Rising. Easy To Install - Slips On Around Your Original Front Sight And Tightens In Place By Set Screw (loctite not included). Upgrade In Look And Performance.", "text": "Tactical Ruger 10 22 10/22 10-22 Heavy Duty Heat Treated Steel Short Style Break Brake Official Product of AR-GEAR, Brand New. Blued Steel Construction (Black Color) - Length: 2.5\", N.W. (OZ): 1.8 6 Slot Brake For Maximum Recoil Reduction And Flip. The Slots/Openings Redirect Propellant Gases To Counter The Recoil And Unwanted Rising. Easy To Install - Slips On Around Your Original Front Sight And Tightens In Place By Set Screw (loctite not included). Upgrade In Look And Performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31evIgjgGYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EA8IXES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AR-GEAR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EA8IYFQ", "title": "Tactical Ruger 10 22 10/22 10-22 Heavy Duty Heat Treated Steel Long Style Break Brake", "description": "Official Product of AR-GEAR, Brand New. Blued Steel Construction (Black Color) - Length: 3.5\", N.W. (OZ): 2.5 6 Holes In The Middle & 5 Front Slots On The Brake For Maximum Recoil Reduction And Flip. The Slots/Openings Redirect Propellant Gases To Counter The Recoil And Unwanted Rising. Easy To Install - Slips On Around Your Original Front Sight And Tightens In Place By Set Screw (loctite not included). Upgrade In Look And Performance.", "text": "Tactical Ruger 10 22 10/22 10-22 Heavy Duty Heat Treated Steel Long Style Break Brake Official Product of AR-GEAR, Brand New. Blued Steel Construction (Black Color) - Length: 3.5\", N.W. (OZ): 2.5 6 Holes In The Middle & 5 Front Slots On The Brake For Maximum Recoil Reduction And Flip. The Slots/Openings Redirect Propellant Gases To Counter The Recoil And Unwanted Rising. Easy To Install - Slips On Around Your Original Front Sight And Tightens In Place By Set Screw (loctite not included). Upgrade In Look And Performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WIG%2BMkdkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EA8IYFQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AR-GEAR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EAHYZD2", "title": "Yoga Full Toe Socks (Various Colors), 2 Pairs Value Pack Set", "description": "Have you tried going for your practice and your feet are slipping everywhere because of your sweat or slippery floors? Have you experience before that your feet are cold and it is difficult for your muscle to engage properly or even relax?Yoga socks with non-slip dot pattern can provide the added balance, control and grip for you to practice yoga and pilates with peace of mind.Who Can Benefit from Yoga Socks Full Toe- Those who wish to have more grip for their yoga and pilates practice- Those who want to protect their feet and stay hygiene while still having the barefoot feeling- If you are new to yoga, you will find the props useful particularly during your first few sessions- Those who wish to cover their feet due to cold feet, slippery feet and have more traction- Even experienced yoga and pilates practitioner may choose to use yoga socks for more control and warm feelingBenefits of Yoga Socks Full Toe with Non-Slip Dots- Help provide warmness if you practice yoga or pilates in a chilly condition- If you need to cover your feet for reasons of hygiene or injury- Increased toe strength by encouraging the toes to spread- The sole of each sock is covered with little grippy dots designed to create more traction and protection from dirty mats- Portable - allow you to practice without a mat- Minimize risk of injury by providing warm environment for muscles, tendons and ligamentsProduct Information- 80% Cotton, 14% Spandex, 6% PVCClick the Add to Cart Button to Start enjoy your practice more with more traction!", "text": "Yoga Full Toe Socks (Various Colors), 2 Pairs Value Pack Set Have you tried going for your practice and your feet are slipping everywhere because of your sweat or slippery floors? Have you experience before that your feet are cold and it is difficult for your muscle to engage properly or even relax?Yoga socks with non-slip dot pattern can provide the added balance, control and grip for you to practice yoga and pilates with peace of mind.Who Can Benefit from Yoga Socks Full Toe- Those who wish to have more grip for their yoga and pilates practice- Those who want to protect their feet and stay hygiene while still having the barefoot feeling- If you are new to yoga, you will find the props useful particularly during your first few sessions- Those who wish to cover their feet due to cold feet, slippery feet and have more traction- Even experienced yoga and pilates practitioner may choose to use yoga socks for more control and warm feelingBenefits of Yoga Socks Full Toe with Non-Slip Dots- Help provide warmness if you practice yoga or pilates in a chilly condition- If you need to cover your feet for reasons of hygiene or injury- Increased toe strength by encouraging the toes to spread- The sole of each sock is covered with little grippy dots designed to create more traction and protection from dirty mats- Portable - allow you to practice without a mat- Minimize risk of injury by providing warm environment for muscles, tendons and ligamentsProduct Information- 80% Cotton, 14% Spandex, 6% PVCClick the Add to Cart Button to Start enjoy your practice more with more traction!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519Sm3t2iML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EAHYZD2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Clothing", "Women", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00EAUY1UQ", "title": "Chinese Military Issue Ak47 Style Heavy Duty Canvas/leather Rifle Sling", "description": "Military Issue AK47 Style Heavy Duty Canvas/Leather Rifle Sling This is a genuine Chinese military issue sling built to last a lifetime. Adjustable for length to accommodate any rifle that has sling swivels or shooting positions, adjustable out to 48'. With heavy duty aluminium hardware, wear-resistant canvas and leather tabs. Fits AK47, AK74, SKS, Galil, MAK-90, Saiga, AKS, AKM, Maadi and other AK rifles... Also as fitted to the Mosin Nagant M91/30 Sniper rifle used by Jude Law in the Film \"Enemy at the Gates\" Grade I, new never issued; measures 1\" Wide x 48\" Long", "text": "Chinese Military Issue Ak47 Style Heavy Duty Canvas/leather Rifle Sling Military Issue AK47 Style Heavy Duty Canvas/Leather Rifle Sling This is a genuine Chinese military issue sling built to last a lifetime. Adjustable for length to accommodate any rifle that has sling swivels or shooting positions, adjustable out to 48'. With heavy duty aluminium hardware, wear-resistant canvas and leather tabs. Fits AK47, AK74, SKS, Galil, MAK-90, Saiga, AKS, AKM, Maadi and other AK rifles... Also as fitted to the Mosin Nagant M91/30 Sniper rifle used by Jude Law in the Film \"Enemy at the Gates\" Grade I, new never issued; measures 1\" Wide x 48\" Long", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DoK8PVX4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EAUY1UQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 20.0}}
{"item_id": "B00EAY366W", "title": "Outbags OB-2MP Double / Two Pack Magazine Clip Pouch for Single and Double Stacked 9mm, 40 S&W, 45 ACP 6-10 Round Clips.", "description": "Double/two pack magazine pouch for most 9mm, 40 S&W;, 45 ACP single and double stacked magazine clips. Max 10 rounds or 6 inches in length. Handmade in Southern California, USA!", "text": "Outbags OB-2MP Double / Two Pack Magazine Clip Pouch for Single and Double Stacked 9mm, 40 S&W, 45 ACP 6-10 Round Clips. Double/two pack magazine pouch for most 9mm, 40 S&W;, 45 ACP single and double stacked magazine clips. Max 10 rounds or 6 inches in length. Handmade in Southern California, USA!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ooOh8hDkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EAY366W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B00EB0DWXC", "title": "Global Sportsman AR15 AR-15 M4 M16 Rifle .223 5.56x45mm Caliber Ammo Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresight Boresighter - Batteries Included - Safety Practice Sight Alignment - Great For The Range And For Ensuring Your Gun Is Still Zeroed In After Travel", "description": "Official Product Of The Global Sportsman, Brand New.Projects A Straight Red Laser Beam Allowing Precise Optical Adjustments To Sight In Your Scopes & Sights Without Firing Any Ammo.Great For The Range And For Ensuring Your Gun Is Still Zeroed In After Travel.Easy To Use - Simply Place LR44 Batteries In End Cap (Included), Twist End Cap To Activate And Place In Chamber.Wavelength 635-655NW ; Laser Output Less Than 5mw.Precision Made With Brass Finish For .223-5.56x45mm Dimensions.", "text": "Global Sportsman AR15 AR-15 M4 M16 Rifle .223 5.56x45mm Caliber Ammo Cartridge Laser Bore Sighter Boresight Boresighter - Batteries Included - Safety Practice Sight Alignment - Great For The Range And For Ensuring Your Gun Is Still Zeroed In After Travel Official Product Of The Global Sportsman, Brand New.Projects A Straight Red Laser Beam Allowing Precise Optical Adjustments To Sight In Your Scopes & Sights Without Firing Any Ammo.Great For The Range And For Ensuring Your Gun Is Still Zeroed In After Travel.Easy To Use - Simply Place LR44 Batteries In End Cap (Included), Twist End Cap To Activate And Place In Chamber.Wavelength 635-655NW ; Laser Output Less Than 5mw.Precision Made With Brass Finish For .223-5.56x45mm Dimensions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VsK9qWjyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EB0DWXC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GS-Global Sportsman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.94}}
{"item_id": "B00EB5OU0Q", "title": "Caldwell AR Pic Rail Brass Catcher", "description": "The AR-15 Pic Rail Brass Catcher attaches to the Picatinny Rail of any AR with a MIL-SPEC anodized aluminum clamp and captures the ejected brass during operation. The clamp and wire frame are fully adjustable to work with almost any scope mount, optic or sight and allows brass to enter bag without disruption to bolt function or interrupt cycling. The quick detent locking attachment feature allows for quick installation and removal of the brass catcher; which allows for quick checking or clearing of the rifle chamber. The large capacity of 100 rounds prevents brass from being scattered around your shooting area and works great in preventing hot brass from landing on shooter or other people next to the shooter. Convenient zipper at bottom of mesh bag makes emptying simple.", "text": "Caldwell AR Pic Rail Brass Catcher The AR-15 Pic Rail Brass Catcher attaches to the Picatinny Rail of any AR with a MIL-SPEC anodized aluminum clamp and captures the ejected brass during operation. The clamp and wire frame are fully adjustable to work with almost any scope mount, optic or sight and allows brass to enter bag without disruption to bolt function or interrupt cycling. The quick detent locking attachment feature allows for quick installation and removal of the brass catcher; which allows for quick checking or clearing of the rifle chamber. The large capacity of 100 rounds prevents brass from being scattered around your shooting area and works great in preventing hot brass from landing on shooter or other people next to the shooter. Convenient zipper at bottom of mesh bag makes emptying simple.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l1cqbvN%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EB5OU0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 39.47}}
{"item_id": "B00EB5OUS8", "title": "Lockdown Gun Concealment Magnet", "description": "Full frame pistols hang securely, even upside down, Attach your gun under a desk for quick and convenient access, Perfect for gun storage at a hunting cabin or against any wall or gun safe where space is at a premium, Works on most magnetic handguns, Mounts anywhere: vertical, horizontal, hanging upside down, or at an angle, Use one magnet for handguns or 2 for a shotgun or rifle, Over molded non-marring rubber, Low profile for easy concealment, Includes: 2 wood screws, 2 drywall screws and anchors and magnetic mount.", "text": "Lockdown Gun Concealment Magnet Full frame pistols hang securely, even upside down, Attach your gun under a desk for quick and convenient access, Perfect for gun storage at a hunting cabin or against any wall or gun safe where space is at a premium, Works on most magnetic handguns, Mounts anywhere: vertical, horizontal, hanging upside down, or at an angle, Use one magnet for handguns or 2 for a shotgun or rifle, Over molded non-marring rubber, Low profile for easy concealment, Includes: 2 wood screws, 2 drywall screws and anchors and magnetic mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ab8AI06jL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EB5OUS8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lockdown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 20.4}}
{"item_id": "B00EB6OGN6", "title": "SKLZ Dribble Stick Basketball Dribble Trainer", "description": "Perfect the dribble and improve your coordination with the SKLZ Dribble Stick. A proven basketball training system that is designed to also increase the player's agility and build one's confidence. The adjustable arms allow for multiple drills and game situations.", "text": "SKLZ Dribble Stick Basketball Dribble Trainer Perfect the dribble and improve your coordination with the SKLZ Dribble Stick. A proven basketball training system that is designed to also increase the player's agility and build one's confidence. The adjustable arms allow for multiple drills and game situations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IuOjEStTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EB6OGN6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Training Equipment"]], "price": 61.8}}
{"item_id": "B00EB6OGP4", "title": "SKLZ Court Vision Basketball Dribble Goggles", "description": "Have better ball control and improve court awareness with the SKLZ Court Vision Dribble Goggles. The goggles restricts downward vision forcing the player to learn to dribble by feel which increases confidence on the court. They're comfortable to wear and mold to the player's face.", "text": "SKLZ Court Vision Basketball Dribble Goggles Have better ball control and improve court awareness with the SKLZ Court Vision Dribble Goggles. The goggles restricts downward vision forcing the player to learn to dribble by feel which increases confidence on the court. They're comfortable to wear and mold to the player's face.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31J9Vr0fkWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EB6OGP4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Training Equipment"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00EBN9TTA", "title": "Soft Vise Jaw Pads with 4\" Wide V Groove Gunsmithing Tools", "description": "Premium 4\" light duty vise jaw pads are very handy when trying to hold a barrel or any other type part that needs the light touch. Special polymer prevents the jaws from leaving a mark on what is being held. Our vise jaw pads are resistant to chemicals used for gun cleaning.", "text": "Soft Vise Jaw Pads with 4\" Wide V Groove Gunsmithing Tools Premium 4\" light duty vise jaw pads are very handy when trying to hold a barrel or any other type part that needs the light touch. Special polymer prevents the jaws from leaving a mark on what is being held. Our vise jaw pads are resistant to chemicals used for gun cleaning.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZoH3vq-xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EBN9TTA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00ECAWN22", "title": "Pedometer for Walking Measures Step Count Calories Used Distance and Exercise Time with Advanced 3d Technology Plus 30 Day Memory Function . 60% Off Special Offer Pedometers for Walking Steps and Miles with Calorie Counter and Target Measuring Feature", "description": "The Greatest Gift In The World Is Your Health Preserve It Walk NowWalk Now Pedometers Give You The EdgeWhy You Should Choose This Pedometer* Advanced 3D Technology Greatly Increases Accuracy* This Advanced Technology means it can be worn in a number of positions * Measures Walking Distance and Step and Calorie Count* Allows for setting of Targets and shows progress towards your Target* 30 Day Memory Function* Belt Clip Included** Step Error Correction Technology avoids counting sudden movement as an exercise activity* Ligthweight and Super Easy To Use* Pedometers for Walking , Steps and Miles, Calorie Count , Training Distance and MoreAdvantages Of Using PedometersBy setting targets and recording progress the chances of achieving goals are so much greater. Watching progress is a great motivator and drives consistently higher levels . A summary of 26 studies by the Harvard Medical School shows that pedometer users walk 2000 more steps per day than non users. Walking is One of the healthiest activities . Walk NowGuaranteeYou will love your 'Walk Now' pedometer . In the rare event that it does not perform to your expectations you have our ironclad money back guarantee . Simply return for a full refund.Our Pedometers undergo rigorous testing to meet the high Standards we setThe Greatest Gift in Life Is Your Health . Look After and Cherish ItWalk Now and You Will Look and Feel BetterClick the 'Add To Cart Button ' at the Top Right Hand Corner and Get Walking Now", "text": "Pedometer for Walking Measures Step Count Calories Used Distance and Exercise Time with Advanced 3d Technology Plus 30 Day Memory Function . 60% Off Special Offer Pedometers for Walking Steps and Miles with Calorie Counter and Target Measuring Feature The Greatest Gift In The World Is Your Health Preserve It Walk NowWalk Now Pedometers Give You The EdgeWhy You Should Choose This Pedometer* Advanced 3D Technology Greatly Increases Accuracy* This Advanced Technology means it can be worn in a number of positions * Measures Walking Distance and Step and Calorie Count* Allows for setting of Targets and shows progress towards your Target* 30 Day Memory Function* Belt Clip Included** Step Error Correction Technology avoids counting sudden movement as an exercise activity* Ligthweight and Super Easy To Use* Pedometers for Walking , Steps and Miles, Calorie Count , Training Distance and MoreAdvantages Of Using PedometersBy setting targets and recording progress the chances of achieving goals are so much greater. Watching progress is a great motivator and drives consistently higher levels . A summary of 26 studies by the Harvard Medical School shows that pedometer users walk 2000 more steps per day than non users. Walking is One of the healthiest activities . Walk NowGuaranteeYou will love your 'Walk Now' pedometer . In the rare event that it does not perform to your expectations you have our ironclad money back guarantee . Simply return for a full refund.Our Pedometers undergo rigorous testing to meet the high Standards we setThe Greatest Gift in Life Is Your Health . Look After and Cherish ItWalk Now and You Will Look and Feel BetterClick the 'Add To Cart Button ' at the Top Right Hand Corner and Get Walking Now", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gKPYjMdAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ECAWN22.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]], "price": 21.95}}
{"item_id": "B00ECH6KAQ", "title": "60 cm / 24 in Bullseye Archery and Gun Targets by Longbow Targets (4, 10, 25, & 100 Packs)", "description": "Develop your archery and shooting skills with Longbows new Bull's-eye Targets. These heavy paper targets are manufactured to the strict 60cm archery standards (approximately 24 in). Each color ring edge is printed to an exacting 6cm from ring edge to ring edge. Buy in bulk and save. These targets can also be used for many gun and archery applications.", "text": "60 cm / 24 in Bullseye Archery and Gun Targets by Longbow Targets (4, 10, 25, & 100 Packs) Develop your archery and shooting skills with Longbows new Bull's-eye Targets. These heavy paper targets are manufactured to the strict 60cm archery standards (approximately 24 in). Each color ring edge is printed to an exacting 6cm from ring edge to ring edge. Buy in bulk and save. These targets can also be used for many gun and archery applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RQ-nsErTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ECH6KAQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Longbow Targets", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00ECIKNIA", "title": "Model 47 Tactical Black Oxide Finished Steel Made in The USA Demon Break Brake Device With 14x1 LH Left Hand Thread Pattern For 7.62x39 mm Rifle Variants", "description": "Official Product of AR-GEAR, Brand New.Device is Threaded to Fit standard 14 x 1 Left Hand Thread Models.Machined from Top Quality Steel and Finished in Black Oxide.Length : 2.4 inch ; Weight : 1.3 oz. Made in USA and Counts as 1 US922r Compliant Part.The Six Pronged Tips are Shaped to Breach Wood, Sheet Rock, and Glass for Any Tactical Situation.The Slots/Openings Redirect Propellant Gases to Counter the Recoil and Unwanted Rising of the Barrel Fire. Highly Detailed & Military / Law Enforcement Quality.", "text": "Model 47 Tactical Black Oxide Finished Steel Made in The USA Demon Break Brake Device With 14x1 LH Left Hand Thread Pattern For 7.62x39 mm Rifle Variants Official Product of AR-GEAR, Brand New.Device is Threaded to Fit standard 14 x 1 Left Hand Thread Models.Machined from Top Quality Steel and Finished in Black Oxide.Length : 2.4 inch ; Weight : 1.3 oz. Made in USA and Counts as 1 US922r Compliant Part.The Six Pronged Tips are Shaped to Breach Wood, Sheet Rock, and Glass for Any Tactical Situation.The Slots/Openings Redirect Propellant Gases to Counter the Recoil and Unwanted Rising of the Barrel Fire. Highly Detailed & Military / Law Enforcement Quality.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SndVTOtYL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ECIKNIA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AR-GEAR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 29.95}}
