{"item_id": "B00EDIGBGW", "title": "HumanX Palm Grips", "description": "Train harder longer with fingerless hand protection wrap around hand design for total palm coverage with no leather bunching between fingers. Use for pull ups, toes to bar and any other movement that stresses your grip.", "text": "HumanX Palm Grips Train harder longer with fingerless hand protection wrap around hand design for total palm coverage with no leather bunching between fingers. Use for pull ups, toes to bar and any other movement that stresses your grip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x0toJ0TrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EDIGBGW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Wraps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00EDIGD5Q", "title": "Harbinger Lifting Grips", "description": "2 in 1 Training Tool Palm Protector and Lifting Strap lays flat as palm protection OR wrap around bar with paten-pending BioForm clay between hand and bar, transferring the load in a leather hook style lifting strap. Our Exclusive Un Glove design offers full finger range of motion while the super tough Harbinger Spider Grip Durahide leather prevents calluses and blisters. Instructions for use included in each package.", "text": "Harbinger Lifting Grips 2 in 1 Training Tool Palm Protector and Lifting Strap lays flat as palm protection OR wrap around bar with paten-pending BioForm clay between hand and bar, transferring the load in a leather hook style lifting strap. Our Exclusive Un Glove design offers full finger range of motion while the super tough Harbinger Spider Grip Durahide leather prevents calluses and blisters. Instructions for use included in each package.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HGOehfMXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EDIGD5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Wraps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00EDS1DCO", "title": "Genuine Italian Officer's Wool Blanket", "description": "This is the real genuine deal and best military surplus wool blanket that was ever made and will always be the blanket that everyone talks about. This blanket is superior in all ways and is a perfect item to be stored in your survival shelter, kept in the trunk of your vehicle in case of emergencies, stored with your outdoor camping gear, and with your disaster preparedness items. It is 100% wool and will keep you toasty warm even in the coldest of temperatures. This blanket will outlast all other military wool blankets but they are becoming rarer by the day and are very tough to find. Make sure you take advantage of this authentic wool blanket while they are available and get yours! Please note blankets have been stored with moth balls for an extended period of time to preserve them so you may need to air them out. Washing in cold water and letting them hang dry in the sun and wind for awhile is also greatly helpful in removing the smell of moth balls. We also recommend having it professionally cleaned. Get the best Army blanket when you order the Genuine 100% Wool Italian Military Officer's Blanket!", "text": "Genuine Italian Officer's Wool Blanket This is the real genuine deal and best military surplus wool blanket that was ever made and will always be the blanket that everyone talks about. This blanket is superior in all ways and is a perfect item to be stored in your survival shelter, kept in the trunk of your vehicle in case of emergencies, stored with your outdoor camping gear, and with your disaster preparedness items. It is 100% wool and will keep you toasty warm even in the coldest of temperatures. This blanket will outlast all other military wool blankets but they are becoming rarer by the day and are very tough to find. Make sure you take advantage of this authentic wool blanket while they are available and get yours! Please note blankets have been stored with moth balls for an extended period of time to preserve them so you may need to air them out. Washing in cold water and letting them hang dry in the sun and wind for awhile is also greatly helpful in removing the smell of moth balls. We also recommend having it professionally cleaned. Get the best Army blanket when you order the Genuine 100% Wool Italian Military Officer's Blanket!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lX406MGYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EDS1DCO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EE79EZM", "title": "COOLING TOWEL - Stay Cool with the Advanced Hyper-Absorbent Cool Sports Towel - Highly Effective, Golf Towel, Gym Towel, Yoga Towel - - Top Quality Cool Towel Designed For All Sports Players . - The Ideal Gym and Workout Sweat Towel and Absorbent Chamois Towel For Swimmers and Divers or Those Who Just Want To Chill!", "description": "How to Stay Nice and Cool in the Heat and While Playing SportsReally Hot and Sticky conditions can be Uncomfortable and Sometimes Debilitating, Whether you're at Work, Rest or PlayYou Don't have to Sweat it Out - You Can Relax and Chill Out with the Amazing Cooling Towel- The Cooling Towel is Easy to Use - Just Wet - Wring Our and Shake - and you're Cool- When Wet the Towel's Advanced Cooling Fabric Activates and Cools to around 30 below average body temperature- Handy Hygienic Container allows you to Carry your Cooling Towel with at all times and have it on hand, During Your Sporting Activities, at Work or Simply Just Chilling Out- Stays Cool for several hours and when necessary Simply Re-wet, Wring Out, Give it a Shake and You're Cool AgainThis amazing cooling towel is designed to cool the body at times of excessive heat and during strenuous sporting activities and is flexible and adaptable to serves you well as a Golf Towel, Gym or Workout Towel, Walking, Running or Climbing Towel and the Hyper-Absorbency helps to wick sweat from your body and is an drying towel for Swimmers and Divers- Easily Carried in it's own Special, Convenient, Hygienic Plastic Container- Make Sure You Have One at Home, at Work, at the Gym and at the Sports Club*SPECIAL BONUS*This Top Quality Cooling Towel comes with a Special Bonus of the following Digital eBooks entitled: \"FITNESS: Guide To Staying healthy\", - \"A BEGINNER'S GUIDE TO YOGA\" and \"HIDDEN SECRETS of SUPER PERFECT ABS\" - all ready to download after purchase. - Details on your Cooling Towel PackagePLUS You Have Our No-Quibble Lifetime GuaranteeJust CLICK the \"Add to Cart\" Order Button at the Top Right of the Page NOW!Why Not BUY TWO for your firends and Get FREE Shipping!", "text": "COOLING TOWEL - Stay Cool with the Advanced Hyper-Absorbent Cool Sports Towel - Highly Effective, Golf Towel, Gym Towel, Yoga Towel - - Top Quality Cool Towel Designed For All Sports Players . - The Ideal Gym and Workout Sweat Towel and Absorbent Chamois Towel For Swimmers and Divers or Those Who Just Want To Chill! How to Stay Nice and Cool in the Heat and While Playing SportsReally Hot and Sticky conditions can be Uncomfortable and Sometimes Debilitating, Whether you're at Work, Rest or PlayYou Don't have to Sweat it Out - You Can Relax and Chill Out with the Amazing Cooling Towel- The Cooling Towel is Easy to Use - Just Wet - Wring Our and Shake - and you're Cool- When Wet the Towel's Advanced Cooling Fabric Activates and Cools to around 30 below average body temperature- Handy Hygienic Container allows you to Carry your Cooling Towel with at all times and have it on hand, During Your Sporting Activities, at Work or Simply Just Chilling Out- Stays Cool for several hours and when necessary Simply Re-wet, Wring Out, Give it a Shake and You're Cool AgainThis amazing cooling towel is designed to cool the body at times of excessive heat and during strenuous sporting activities and is flexible and adaptable to serves you well as a Golf Towel, Gym or Workout Towel, Walking, Running or Climbing Towel and the Hyper-Absorbency helps to wick sweat from your body and is an drying towel for Swimmers and Divers- Easily Carried in it's own Special, Convenient, Hygienic Plastic Container- Make Sure You Have One at Home, at Work, at the Gym and at the Sports Club*SPECIAL BONUS*This Top Quality Cooling Towel comes with a Special Bonus of the following Digital eBooks entitled: \"FITNESS: Guide To Staying healthy\", - \"A BEGINNER'S GUIDE TO YOGA\" and \"HIDDEN SECRETS of SUPER PERFECT ABS\" - all ready to download after purchase. - Details on your Cooling Towel PackagePLUS You Have Our No-Quibble Lifetime GuaranteeJust CLICK the \"Add to Cart\" Order Button at the Top Right of the Page NOW!Why Not BUY TWO for your firends and Get FREE Shipping!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416SmOFJVNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EE79EZM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Towels"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B00EEIXPJM", "title": "USA GunClub Easy Use Mount Anywhere Shotgun or Rifle Rack", "description": "For easy access to rifle, this mount anywhere rifle rack mounts to any surface. Fits all rifles and shotguns. Strong steel construction, soft rubbery coating hydrophobic plastic coated. Rack will not collect moisture and protects the finish on guns from getting scratched. Mounting screws included.", "text": "USA GunClub Easy Use Mount Anywhere Shotgun or Rifle Rack For easy access to rifle, this mount anywhere rifle rack mounts to any surface. Fits all rifles and shotguns. Strong steel construction, soft rubbery coating hydrophobic plastic coated. Rack will not collect moisture and protects the finish on guns from getting scratched. Mounting screws included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21caWh8hNKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EEIXPJM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 19.99}}
