{"item_id": "B00EJ3PGAI", "title": "The Friendly Swede Bundle of 2 Premium 350 Lb Paracord Round Braid Bracelets with Stainless Steel D Shackle In Retail Packaging -Lifetime Warranty", "description": "CONTENTS OF THE FRIENDLY SWEDE RETAIL PACKAGING:2 x Branded Premium 350 Lb Paracord Round Braid Bracelets with Stainless Steel D Shackle2 x Spare boltSUITABLE FOR:8-inch bracelet fits 6-7 inch wrists9-inch bracelet fits 7-8 inch wristsCircumference needs to be approx 1 inch larger than your wrist for a good fitINTENDED USE / GENERAL INFO:Specifications and quality guaranteed by The Friendly SwedeAll bracelets are 100% tied and assembled by handLifetime Warranty*Note: Not all colors are the same size range , so check each color for proper sizing details.*Note: Our bracelets have a true rated load of 350 lb (350 spec). Bracelets similar/inferior to these are commonly/incorrectly marketed as \"Type III 550 spec\". We give you what is described. Our cords may still carry >550lb but 350lb is the guaranteed rated load.***If bracelet is dissembled, reassembly is not recommended and not likely to be successful unless you have experience making this type of paracord bracelet***THE FRIENDLY SWEDE - Selected Accessories:If you for any reason are not happy with any product supplied by The Friendly Swede, please do not hesitate to contact us and we will do our best to solve your problem ASAP! At The Friendly Swede we take full ownership and responsibility for the quality of our products. The Friendly Swede - USPTO serial: 85494642, 85511082, 85521942 - is a registered trademark protected by US Trademark Law. All products supplied by The Friendly Swede are exclusively manufactured by The Friendly Swede.", "text": "The Friendly Swede Bundle of 2 Premium 350 Lb Paracord Round Braid Bracelets with Stainless Steel D Shackle In Retail Packaging -Lifetime Warranty CONTENTS OF THE FRIENDLY SWEDE RETAIL PACKAGING:2 x Branded Premium 350 Lb Paracord Round Braid Bracelets with Stainless Steel D Shackle2 x Spare boltSUITABLE FOR:8-inch bracelet fits 6-7 inch wrists9-inch bracelet fits 7-8 inch wristsCircumference needs to be approx 1 inch larger than your wrist for a good fitINTENDED USE / GENERAL INFO:Specifications and quality guaranteed by The Friendly SwedeAll bracelets are 100% tied and assembled by handLifetime Warranty*Note: Not all colors are the same size range , so check each color for proper sizing details.*Note: Our bracelets have a true rated load of 350 lb (350 spec). Bracelets similar/inferior to these are commonly/incorrectly marketed as \"Type III 550 spec\". We give you what is described. Our cords may still carry >550lb but 350lb is the guaranteed rated load.***If bracelet is dissembled, reassembly is not recommended and not likely to be successful unless you have experience making this type of paracord bracelet***THE FRIENDLY SWEDE - Selected Accessories:If you for any reason are not happy with any product supplied by The Friendly Swede, please do not hesitate to contact us and we will do our best to solve your problem ASAP! At The Friendly Swede we take full ownership and responsibility for the quality of our products. The Friendly Swede - USPTO serial: 85494642, 85511082, 85521942 - is a registered trademark protected by US Trademark Law. All products supplied by The Friendly Swede are exclusively manufactured by The Friendly Swede.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51sFwpLCYtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EJ3PGAI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 6.66}}
{"item_id": "B00EJX6EEA", "title": "Fab Defense Mako FDE Flat Dark Earth MWG Magwell Mag Well Texturized Grip Funnel AR15 M16 M4 + Ultimate Arms Gear Rifle/Shotgun/Pistol/Gun Care and Reel Silicone Lubricated Cleaning Cloth 12\" x 14\"", "description": "Official Product of Fab Defense Mako and Global Sportsman, Brand New.MWG .223 Rifle Well Grip Fits Most .223 Rifle Mag Wells - Simple Installation - No Gunsmithing or modifications to the weapon needed. Simply Tighten Into Place Utilizing 3 Set Screw. Light Weight - Constructed of Reinforced Polymer Composite. Some Rifles Require Slight Modifications to the MWG - Some Sanding / Shaving of the Inside Lips of the MWG to make it fit.Ultimate Arms Gear Silicone Gun Cloth is an Essential Part of Every Shooter's Arsenal. Lubricated with Safe, Non-Toxic, Food-Grade Silicone, Our Cloths Wipe Away The Fingerprints and Body Oils that Cause Rust. Size: 12\" x 14\" Inches. Color: Yellow.", "text": "Fab Defense Mako FDE Flat Dark Earth MWG Magwell Mag Well Texturized Grip Funnel AR15 M16 M4 + Ultimate Arms Gear Rifle/Shotgun/Pistol/Gun Care and Reel Silicone Lubricated Cleaning Cloth 12\" x 14\" Official Product of Fab Defense Mako and Global Sportsman, Brand New.MWG .223 Rifle Well Grip Fits Most .223 Rifle Mag Wells - Simple Installation - No Gunsmithing or modifications to the weapon needed. Simply Tighten Into Place Utilizing 3 Set Screw. Light Weight - Constructed of Reinforced Polymer Composite. Some Rifles Require Slight Modifications to the MWG - Some Sanding / Shaving of the Inside Lips of the MWG to make it fit.Ultimate Arms Gear Silicone Gun Cloth is an Essential Part of Every Shooter's Arsenal. Lubricated with Safe, Non-Toxic, Food-Grade Silicone, Our Cloths Wipe Away The Fingerprints and Body Oils that Cause Rust. Size: 12\" x 14\" Inches. Color: Yellow.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DXNDxqTYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EJX6EEA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FAB DEFENSE-MAKO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.94}}
{"item_id": "B00EKY54P8", "title": "MTECH USA MT-20-30 4.75-Inch Overall Neck Knife", "description": "Measuring 4.75\" overall, this neck knife from M-Tech offers a 2.8mm thick, 2\" drop point stainless steel blade with a stone washed finish. This full-tang construction knife has a tan colored G-10 handle for superior strength and comes complete with a Kydex sheath that fits snuggly around the blade and has a ball chain for secure and safe carry.", "text": "MTECH USA MT-20-30 4.75-Inch Overall Neck Knife Measuring 4.75\" overall, this neck knife from M-Tech offers a 2.8mm thick, 2\" drop point stainless steel blade with a stone washed finish. This full-tang construction knife has a tan colored G-10 handle for superior strength and comes complete with a Kydex sheath that fits snuggly around the blade and has a ball chain for secure and safe carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ldURg3xVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EKY54P8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B00EL0DB24", "title": "German Army Military Green Emergency Soldier Water Filter 99.99999 Purification Life Straw Ultralight 1.65oz 15 microns NO CHEMICALS", "description": "Designed to provide you with safe, clean drinking water in any situationReduces turbidity by filtering particles of 15 micronsRemoves 99.99999% bacteria, parasites7\" long and weighs only 1.65 oz which is convenient to carry and keepContains NO chemicals", "text": "German Army Military Green Emergency Soldier Water Filter 99.99999 Purification Life Straw Ultralight 1.65oz 15 microns NO CHEMICALS Designed to provide you with safe, clean drinking water in any situationReduces turbidity by filtering particles of 15 micronsRemoves 99.99999% bacteria, parasites7\" long and weighs only 1.65 oz which is convenient to carry and keepContains NO chemicals", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JdSakNPlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EL0DB24.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B00ELLCO1M", "title": "Decodyne™ Fruit Infused Water Bottle 25 Ounce - BPA Free - Made of durable Eastman Tritan™ - The Fun & Healthy Way to Enjoy Your Water.", "description": "Are you looking for a tasty and healthy alternative to sugary pop and sodas?The Decodyne™ infusion Water Bottle lets you add a fruity splash by flavoring it with the fruit infuser.This is a very easy to use fruit infuser that will help you stay hydrated with a tasty and healthy alternative to sugary sodas and store bought fruit juice.All you do Just add a variety of fruits or vegetables to the water for a refreshing drink that'll keep you hydrated and saying goodbye to bottled water.Add lemons, limes, strawberries, cucumbers, apples or even fresh mint. Revolutionary high tech material is extremely impact resistant and 100-percent BPA free.", "text": "Decodyne™ Fruit Infused Water Bottle 25 Ounce - BPA Free - Made of durable Eastman Tritan™ - The Fun & Healthy Way to Enjoy Your Water. Are you looking for a tasty and healthy alternative to sugary pop and sodas?The Decodyne™ infusion Water Bottle lets you add a fruity splash by flavoring it with the fruit infuser.This is a very easy to use fruit infuser that will help you stay hydrated with a tasty and healthy alternative to sugary sodas and store bought fruit juice.All you do Just add a variety of fruits or vegetables to the water for a refreshing drink that'll keep you hydrated and saying goodbye to bottled water.Add lemons, limes, strawberries, cucumbers, apples or even fresh mint. Revolutionary high tech material is extremely impact resistant and 100-percent BPA free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jlghtEHuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ELLCO1M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00ELNGSVM", "title": "Mirrycle Incredibell Adjustabell 2 Bike Bell", "description": "This is truly an adjustable bell. You can even use it on your ski poles, hiking sticks, or your cane. The dinger of the bell adjusts to any position around the dome, make it possible to use your thumb or any finger to ring the bell.", "text": "Mirrycle Incredibell Adjustabell 2 Bike Bell This is truly an adjustable bell. You can even use it on your ski poles, hiking sticks, or your cane. The dinger of the bell adjusts to any position around the dome, make it possible to use your thumb or any finger to ring the bell.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GVg9o3JeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ELNGSVM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mirrycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Bells"]], "price": 5.59}}
{"item_id": "B00ELQQKI0", "title": "UTAC All-Metal RAS RIS Rail Mounted Tactical High output 200 Lumen LED Flashlight w/ Green Laser Sight & Batteries installed", "description": "UTAC RAS RIS Rail Mounted Tactical High output 200 Lumen LED Flashlight w/ Laser Sight & Batteries installedSuper bright 200 Lumen CREE LED bulbAnodized aircraft aluminum constructionIntegral Picatinny-Weaver mounting system mounts the flashlight and allows speedy installation and removal of the flashlightToggle mode selector sets 3 operation modes: flashlight only, flashlight/laser sight simultaneously and laser sight only.Toggle switch turns on/off beam of the flashlight or/and laser sight. The flashlight and or laser can be contant on or memnetary on.532nm green laser sight is fully adjustable for windage and elevation with included Allen wrench.2 x CR123 3 Volt lithium batteries (included).Battery run time: approximately 2.5 hoursWeight: 5.5 oz (Batteries installed)Size: 3.3\"Lx 2.5\"W x 3\"HThe flashlight fits onto Picatinny and Weaver rails including RAS/RIS.Please note the green beam in the picture is drawn to show the laser beam path and you will not see a green beam like it during actual use of the laser sight.", "text": "UTAC All-Metal RAS RIS Rail Mounted Tactical High output 200 Lumen LED Flashlight w/ Green Laser Sight & Batteries installed UTAC RAS RIS Rail Mounted Tactical High output 200 Lumen LED Flashlight w/ Laser Sight & Batteries installedSuper bright 200 Lumen CREE LED bulbAnodized aircraft aluminum constructionIntegral Picatinny-Weaver mounting system mounts the flashlight and allows speedy installation and removal of the flashlightToggle mode selector sets 3 operation modes: flashlight only, flashlight/laser sight simultaneously and laser sight only.Toggle switch turns on/off beam of the flashlight or/and laser sight. The flashlight and or laser can be contant on or memnetary on.532nm green laser sight is fully adjustable for windage and elevation with included Allen wrench.2 x CR123 3 Volt lithium batteries (included).Battery run time: approximately 2.5 hoursWeight: 5.5 oz (Batteries installed)Size: 3.3\"Lx 2.5\"W x 3\"HThe flashlight fits onto Picatinny and Weaver rails including RAS/RIS.Please note the green beam in the picture is drawn to show the laser beam path and you will not see a green beam like it during actual use of the laser sight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XWVNUvRML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ELQQKI0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00ELVDM0Y", "title": "Monstrum Tactical 90 Lumens LED Flashlight with Rail Mount and Detachable Remote Pressure Switch", "description": "The Monstrum F08 is a compact, lightweight rail mounted flashlight suitable for a wide range of firearms from pistols to shotguns to tactical rifles. Only 3.7 inches in length and 2.5 ounces in weight, it mounts securely to any Weaver or Picatinny rail. Crafted from aircraft grade aluminum, it is both sturdy and lightweight. A detachable remote pressure switch and one CR123A battery are included with purchase.", "text": "Monstrum Tactical 90 Lumens LED Flashlight with Rail Mount and Detachable Remote Pressure Switch The Monstrum F08 is a compact, lightweight rail mounted flashlight suitable for a wide range of firearms from pistols to shotguns to tactical rifles. Only 3.7 inches in length and 2.5 ounces in weight, it mounts securely to any Weaver or Picatinny rail. Crafted from aircraft grade aluminum, it is both sturdy and lightweight. A detachable remote pressure switch and one CR123A battery are included with purchase.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ADVUEtp2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ELVDM0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EM5VTOA", "title": "Otis Technology Ripcord for .45 Cal and 44 Mag, 22.5-Inch", "description": "For Times in the field when you just can't reach your Otis cleaning system and need a quick and effective clean-reach for the Ripcord. This convenient tool cleans from Breech-to-Muzzle in one quick and easy pass. The molded rubberized core and Nomex fibers together create a more effective way to trap and remove fouling. Available in .223/5.56, 308/7.62, 9, & 45.", "text": "Otis Technology Ripcord for .45 Cal and 44 Mag, 22.5-Inch For Times in the field when you just can't reach your Otis cleaning system and need a quick and effective clean-reach for the Ripcord. This convenient tool cleans from Breech-to-Muzzle in one quick and easy pass. The molded rubberized core and Nomex fibers together create a more effective way to trap and remove fouling. Available in .223/5.56, 308/7.62, 9, & 45.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HymkTFeoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EM5VTOA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Snakes"]], "price": 13.15}}
{"item_id": "B00EM5VTP4", "title": "Otis Technology Ripcord for .22Cal .223 Cal/5.56mm, 36-Inch", "description": "For Times in the field when you just can't reach your Otis cleaning system and need a quick and effective clean-reach for the Ripcord. This convenient tool cleans from Breech-to-Muzzle in one quick and easy pass. The molded rubberized core and Nomex fibers together create a more effective way to trap and remove fouling. Available in .223/5.56, 308/7.62, 9, & 45.", "text": "Otis Technology Ripcord for .22Cal .223 Cal/5.56mm, 36-Inch For Times in the field when you just can't reach your Otis cleaning system and need a quick and effective clean-reach for the Ripcord. This convenient tool cleans from Breech-to-Muzzle in one quick and easy pass. The molded rubberized core and Nomex fibers together create a more effective way to trap and remove fouling. Available in .223/5.56, 308/7.62, 9, & 45.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518kXBs85UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EM5VTP4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Otis Technology", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Snakes"]], "price": 12.55}}
{"item_id": "B00EM6K0B2", "title": "JOOLA Table Tennis Tour Case, Blue", "description": "The new JOOLA Tour Case with 18 top of the line 3 Star JOOLA Table Tennis Balls provides every Table Tennis player with the essential tool for effectively carrying and storing their equipment. The durable foam lined protective case preserves a total of 18 balls and 2 of your favorite rackets with maximized coverage. The Easy Open Double Snap Lock System allows you to securely close the case keeping the contents clean, dry and safe. Included with the JOOLA Tour Case you have high quality JOOLA 3-Star Table Tennis Balls that are specifically designed for a consistent bounce, superior spin, long volley and extended ball play. With 18 balls, all of your friends can experience the best of the best and you will always be able to tell your balls apart with the unique set of 9 orange and 9 white balls. After a long day of training you can rely on the durable foam lined construction of our JOOLA Tour Case to ensure ultimate protection of all of your top line table tennis rackets and balls.", "text": "JOOLA Table Tennis Tour Case, Blue The new JOOLA Tour Case with 18 top of the line 3 Star JOOLA Table Tennis Balls provides every Table Tennis player with the essential tool for effectively carrying and storing their equipment. The durable foam lined protective case preserves a total of 18 balls and 2 of your favorite rackets with maximized coverage. The Easy Open Double Snap Lock System allows you to securely close the case keeping the contents clean, dry and safe. Included with the JOOLA Tour Case you have high quality JOOLA 3-Star Table Tennis Balls that are specifically designed for a consistent bounce, superior spin, long volley and extended ball play. With 18 balls, all of your friends can experience the best of the best and you will always be able to tell your balls apart with the unique set of 9 orange and 9 white balls. After a long day of training you can rely on the durable foam lined construction of our JOOLA Tour Case to ensure ultimate protection of all of your top line table tennis rackets and balls.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BRhjqIReL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EM6K0B2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Joola", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Table Tennis", "Table Tennis Sets"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EM6K1FW", "title": "JOOLA Expert Table Tennis Tour Case Set, Blue", "description": "The new JOOLA Expert Table Tennis Tour Case Set provides every Table Tennis player with the essential tools for effectively carrying and storing their equipment while including competition ready equipment. The durable foam lined protective case preserves a total of 18 JOOLA 3 star balls and 2 JOOLA Rosskopf Smash Recreational rackets with maximized coverage. The Easy Open Double Snap Lock System allows you to securely close the case keeping the contents clean, dry and safe. Included with the JOOLA Tour Case you have high quality JOOLA 3-Star Table Tennis Balls that are specifically designed for a consistent bounce, superior spin, long volley and extended ball play. With 18 balls, all of your friends can experience the best of the best and you will always be able to tell your balls apart with the unique set of 9 orange and 9 white balls. The 2 Rosskopf Smash rackets included in the set feature the popular flared handle and five ply blade with the renowned PULS System for extreme speed and control. After a long day of training you can rely on the durable foam lined construction of our JOOLA Tour Case to ensure ultimate protection of all of your top line table tennis rackets and balls.", "text": "JOOLA Expert Table Tennis Tour Case Set, Blue The new JOOLA Expert Table Tennis Tour Case Set provides every Table Tennis player with the essential tools for effectively carrying and storing their equipment while including competition ready equipment. The durable foam lined protective case preserves a total of 18 JOOLA 3 star balls and 2 JOOLA Rosskopf Smash Recreational rackets with maximized coverage. The Easy Open Double Snap Lock System allows you to securely close the case keeping the contents clean, dry and safe. Included with the JOOLA Tour Case you have high quality JOOLA 3-Star Table Tennis Balls that are specifically designed for a consistent bounce, superior spin, long volley and extended ball play. With 18 balls, all of your friends can experience the best of the best and you will always be able to tell your balls apart with the unique set of 9 orange and 9 white balls. The 2 Rosskopf Smash rackets included in the set feature the popular flared handle and five ply blade with the renowned PULS System for extreme speed and control. After a long day of training you can rely on the durable foam lined construction of our JOOLA Tour Case to ensure ultimate protection of all of your top line table tennis rackets and balls.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YTZZjALGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EM6K1FW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Joola", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Table Tennis", "Table Tennis Sets"]], "price": 59.95}}
