{"item_id": "B00EOUMRX0", "title": "1911 Aluminum Barrel Bushing Removal Wrench", "description": "Precision machined and anodized aluminum barrel bushing wrench fits the 1911 45 auto style. Squirrel Daddy's barrel bushing wrench is stylish, durable and fits your hand comfortably. Our 1911 barrel bushing wrench is machined from aluminum barstock so it will be long lasting and reliable tool for daily gun maintenance.", "text": "1911 Aluminum Barrel Bushing Removal Wrench Precision machined and anodized aluminum barrel bushing wrench fits the 1911 45 auto style. Squirrel Daddy's barrel bushing wrench is stylish, durable and fits your hand comfortably. Our 1911 barrel bushing wrench is machined from aluminum barstock so it will be long lasting and reliable tool for daily gun maintenance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DX2B-hgQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EOUMRX0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EOY3ZY6", "title": "BV Bicycle Wedge Top Tube Bag with Flip-Top Opening", "description": "With a streamlined wedge shape design, the top tube bag is perfect for a daily commute or day trip. The compact compartment minimizes bulk and wind resistance.The flip-top cover allows easy access to the main compartment and is held securely during rides with a Velcro tab.The compact size stores additional cycling essentials such as tools, snacks, personal items, or small cameras. A mesh pocket holds a phone, a wallet, or keys.The bag sits on the top tube and has a soft non-scratch base that won't damage paint on bikes. It attaches to both the top tube and the bike stem with Velcro straps. The flip-top is lined with reflective trim for nighttime safety.Made of durable 600D polyester, the top tube bag has reinforced rigid sides for shock protection.SpecificationsMaterial:600D Polyester + TarpaulinMount:VelcroCapacity:0.5 LDimensions:6.5\" x 2.5\" x 3.75\" (16.5 cm x 6.4 cm x 9.5 cm)Weight:2.6 oz (75 g)Item No:BV-TB121.", "text": "BV Bicycle Wedge Top Tube Bag with Flip-Top Opening With a streamlined wedge shape design, the top tube bag is perfect for a daily commute or day trip. The compact compartment minimizes bulk and wind resistance.The flip-top cover allows easy access to the main compartment and is held securely during rides with a Velcro tab.The compact size stores additional cycling essentials such as tools, snacks, personal items, or small cameras. A mesh pocket holds a phone, a wallet, or keys.The bag sits on the top tube and has a soft non-scratch base that won't damage paint on bikes. It attaches to both the top tube and the bike stem with Velcro straps. The flip-top is lined with reflective trim for nighttime safety.Made of durable 600D polyester, the top tube bag has reinforced rigid sides for shock protection.SpecificationsMaterial:600D Polyester + TarpaulinMount:VelcroCapacity:0.5 LDimensions:6.5\" x 2.5\" x 3.75\" (16.5 cm x 6.4 cm x 9.5 cm)Weight:2.6 oz (75 g)Item No:BV-TB121.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412j848CsSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EOY3ZY6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BV", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00EP6UPYQ", "title": "TAC-FORCE Assisted Opening Sawback Bowie Rescue Black Glass Breaker Knife NEW!", "description": "This Knife is Great for work, camping, hunting. Really useful and come in handy. Minimum age is 18.", "text": "TAC-FORCE Assisted Opening Sawback Bowie Rescue Black Glass Breaker Knife NEW! This Knife is Great for work, camping, hunting. Really useful and come in handy. Minimum age is 18.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BV263MegL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EP6UPYQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 12.19}}
{"item_id": "B00EPGLHES", "title": "Camelbak Podium Chill Water Bottle 21oz Carbon", "description": "CamelBak Podium Chill is a high performance insulated sport bottle that keeps your water cooler longer. A double-walled bottle construction uses closed cell foam technology to keep your water cold twice as long as a standard bottle. The patented spill-proof, self-sealing Jet Valve allows the user to hydrate immediately without having to open or close a drinking interface and the bottle's streamlined ergonomic design offers excellent squeezability without compromising bottle grip. The large aperture of the drinking nozzle generates an exceptional water flow rate and is easy to remove for thorough cleaning. The Podium Chill also has a lockout dial with easy to read graphics for leak-proof transport.", "text": "Camelbak Podium Chill Water Bottle 21oz Carbon CamelBak Podium Chill is a high performance insulated sport bottle that keeps your water cooler longer. A double-walled bottle construction uses closed cell foam technology to keep your water cold twice as long as a standard bottle. The patented spill-proof, self-sealing Jet Valve allows the user to hydrate immediately without having to open or close a drinking interface and the bottle's streamlined ergonomic design offers excellent squeezability without compromising bottle grip. The large aperture of the drinking nozzle generates an exceptional water flow rate and is easy to remove for thorough cleaning. The Podium Chill also has a lockout dial with easy to read graphics for leak-proof transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o2soL79pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EPGLHES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 8.48}}
{"item_id": "B00EPGLNXS", "title": "Camelbak Products Big Chill Water Bottle", "description": "CamelBak Podium Big Chill 25 oz. is a high performance insulated sport bottle that keeps your water cooler longer. A double-walled bottle construction uses closed cell foam technology to keep your water cold twice as long as a standard bottle. The patented spill-proof, self-sealing Jet Valve allows the user to hydrate immediately without having to open or close a drinking interface and the bottle's streamlined ergonomic design offers excellent squeezability without compromising bottle grip. The large aperture of the drinking nozzle generates an exceptional water flow rate and is easy to remove for thorough cleaning. The Podium Chill also has a lockout dial with easy to read graphics for leak-proof transport.", "text": "Camelbak Products Big Chill Water Bottle CamelBak Podium Big Chill 25 oz. is a high performance insulated sport bottle that keeps your water cooler longer. A double-walled bottle construction uses closed cell foam technology to keep your water cold twice as long as a standard bottle. The patented spill-proof, self-sealing Jet Valve allows the user to hydrate immediately without having to open or close a drinking interface and the bottle's streamlined ergonomic design offers excellent squeezability without compromising bottle grip. The large aperture of the drinking nozzle generates an exceptional water flow rate and is easy to remove for thorough cleaning. The Podium Chill also has a lockout dial with easy to read graphics for leak-proof transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41su%2Bcs30hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EPGLNXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamelBak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B00EPN268M", "title": "Mag-Lock / Bullet Button Installation and Removal Tool AR-15 .223 / 5.56", "description": "This is a brand new high quality Mag-Lock or Bullet Button installation and removal tool. It is used to install or remove the inner nut of the Mag-Lock or Bullet Button. This tool is made from high quality aircraft aluminum with a black anodized finish. IMPORTANT INFORMATION When installing or removing your magazine release lock the center nut that screws into your magazine release catch should turn smoothly without ANY resistance. If the threads on your magazine release catch have some sort of liquid thread locking solution do not use this tool or you will break the prongs and you will not be able to return this item. Besides that, this tool works great for installing and removing a Bullet Button from your firearm and makes the process move convenient.", "text": "Mag-Lock / Bullet Button Installation and Removal Tool AR-15 .223 / 5.56 This is a brand new high quality Mag-Lock or Bullet Button installation and removal tool. It is used to install or remove the inner nut of the Mag-Lock or Bullet Button. This tool is made from high quality aircraft aluminum with a black anodized finish. IMPORTANT INFORMATION When installing or removing your magazine release lock the center nut that screws into your magazine release catch should turn smoothly without ANY resistance. If the threads on your magazine release catch have some sort of liquid thread locking solution do not use this tool or you will break the prongs and you will not be able to return this item. Besides that, this tool works great for installing and removing a Bullet Button from your firearm and makes the process move convenient.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512jf5EBIDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EPN268M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EQITMSI", "title": "Global Sportsman Model 10/15 Tactical Baffled Short Competition Grade Made In The USA Steel Break Brake Device For 5/8\"x24 TPI Thread Pattern For LR308 .308 Rifle + Crush Washer", "description": "Official Product of The Global Sportsman, Brand New. Made In USA Of Black Mil Spec Phosphate Coated Steel. 1\" Round x Length : 2.37\" ; Weight: 3.3 oz. Can be installed to a 5/8\"x24 thread in seconds with no permanent alterations to your rifle.Significantly Reduces Pressure, Recoil and Break Climb To Improve Accuracy And Performance.No Ports On Bottom Of Brake To Ensure No Dust Printing.Optimized Baffles For Maximum Brake Performance And Low Noise From Shooter's Position. Crush Washer Hardware Included.", "text": "Global Sportsman Model 10/15 Tactical Baffled Short Competition Grade Made In The USA Steel Break Brake Device For 5/8\"x24 TPI Thread Pattern For LR308 .308 Rifle + Crush Washer Official Product of The Global Sportsman, Brand New. Made In USA Of Black Mil Spec Phosphate Coated Steel. 1\" Round x Length : 2.37\" ; Weight: 3.3 oz. Can be installed to a 5/8\"x24 thread in seconds with no permanent alterations to your rifle.Significantly Reduces Pressure, Recoil and Break Climb To Improve Accuracy And Performance.No Ports On Bottom Of Brake To Ensure No Dust Printing.Optimized Baffles For Maximum Brake Performance And Low Noise From Shooter's Position. Crush Washer Hardware Included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CkeCb-abL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EQITMSI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GS-Global Sportsman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 28.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EQUVFTU", "title": "Bell Lumina 200 Headlight", "description": "Three LED bulbs in the Lumina 200 headlight light the way in the Bell Lumina 200 - keep your bicycle journey lit and safe.", "text": "Bell Lumina 200 Headlight Three LED bulbs in the Lumina 200 headlight light the way in the Bell Lumina 200 - keep your bicycle journey lit and safe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414%2BJCfZ5CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EQUVFTU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00ERAL4KO", "title": "SureFire P3X Fury Click Switch Dual Output LED Flashlight", "description": "The P3X Fury uses a high-efficiency, virtually failure-proof LED to deliver your choice of either 15 or 1,000 lumens of perfectly focused light. The 15-lumen level is excellent for general work at close-to-medium distances and also lets you greatly extend the runtime per set of batteries, a valuable option when you're miles from civilization. At either setting the high-strength polymer micro-textured reflector delivers a smooth, comparatively wide beam with a brighter central area and generous peripheral light. The Fury is activated with a click-type tailcap switch: press for momentary-on low, press further to click constant-on low; return to off and press or click on again within two seconds for high. The high-strength aerospace aluminum body is smoothly sculpted for a comfortable, secure grip and is hard anodized to military specifications for extreme resistance to scratches, abrasion and corrosion.", "text": "SureFire P3X Fury Click Switch Dual Output LED Flashlight The P3X Fury uses a high-efficiency, virtually failure-proof LED to deliver your choice of either 15 or 1,000 lumens of perfectly focused light. The 15-lumen level is excellent for general work at close-to-medium distances and also lets you greatly extend the runtime per set of batteries, a valuable option when you're miles from civilization. At either setting the high-strength polymer micro-textured reflector delivers a smooth, comparatively wide beam with a brighter central area and generous peripheral light. The Fury is activated with a click-type tailcap switch: press for momentary-on low, press further to click constant-on low; return to off and press or click on again within two seconds for high. The high-strength aerospace aluminum body is smoothly sculpted for a comfortable, secure grip and is hard anodized to military specifications for extreme resistance to scratches, abrasion and corrosion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Tmc88INZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ERAL4KO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SureFire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 159.95}}
{"item_id": "B00ES0NC9O", "title": "Projekt Fixie - Bullhorn Pursuit Style Handle Bar w/ Drop 25.4 x 40cm", "description": "Projekt Fixie messenger style bullhorn handlebars are anodized for a deep vibrant hue and color. The colors are UV-protected and will not fade. The bullhorn handlebars are designed with extreme durability and great performance. Works well with any kind of cycling, not limited to road, single-speed, track, or fixed gear. We aim to combine high quality products and high quality design to give you stellar performance and durability in all our products. Handlebars are compatible with Projekt Fixie handlebar tape and are capable of withstanding extreme weather conditions.", "text": "Projekt Fixie - Bullhorn Pursuit Style Handle Bar w/ Drop 25.4 x 40cm Projekt Fixie messenger style bullhorn handlebars are anodized for a deep vibrant hue and color. The colors are UV-protected and will not fade. The bullhorn handlebars are designed with extreme durability and great performance. Works well with any kind of cycling, not limited to road, single-speed, track, or fixed gear. We aim to combine high quality products and high quality design to give you stellar performance and durability in all our products. Handlebars are compatible with Projekt Fixie handlebar tape and are capable of withstanding extreme weather conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31r7L2KM4cL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00ES0NC9O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 19.89}}
