{"item_id": "B00EU9UBJ2", "title": "UKARMS 1:1 Scale Metal Version 1911 Pistol Spring Airsoft Gun 8945 FPS-280", "description": "If you are tired off all the cheap spring pistols that are made out of plastic then it's time to look into the Spring Meta Airsoft Pistol. This amazing gun is made out of metal and plastic parts giving it a more sturdy and weighty feel to it just like the real thing. The Spring Metal Pistol features a working hammer that actually pulls back when the gun is cocked and releases when fired. But the thing that really makes this gun unique is how easy it is to disassemble it. Without using any tools you can take the slide off which allows you to clean and oil the gun parts. So if you're looking for a more serious spring pistol then the Spring Metal Special Agent Pistol is right up your alley. Features:1:1 Real Scale /High Performance /Spring Powered /Metal (80%) and Plastic (20%) Construction /Working Hammer /Easy Disassembly /Heavy Weight /Hop-Up Fixed /Shooting Safety /Use 6mm Plastic BBs Includes:Spring Metal S&W; 1911 Pistol Airsoft Gun 8945 /A Bag of BBs Specifications:FPS: 270~280 w/6mm .12g BB /Magazine Capacity: 18 /Size:9\"", "text": "UKARMS 1:1 Scale Metal Version 1911 Pistol Spring Airsoft Gun 8945 FPS-280 If you are tired off all the cheap spring pistols that are made out of plastic then it's time to look into the Spring Meta Airsoft Pistol. This amazing gun is made out of metal and plastic parts giving it a more sturdy and weighty feel to it just like the real thing. The Spring Metal Pistol features a working hammer that actually pulls back when the gun is cocked and releases when fired. But the thing that really makes this gun unique is how easy it is to disassemble it. Without using any tools you can take the slide off which allows you to clean and oil the gun parts. So if you're looking for a more serious spring pistol then the Spring Metal Special Agent Pistol is right up your alley. Features:1:1 Real Scale /High Performance /Spring Powered /Metal (80%) and Plastic (20%) Construction /Working Hammer /Easy Disassembly /Heavy Weight /Hop-Up Fixed /Shooting Safety /Use 6mm Plastic BBs Includes:Spring Metal S&W; 1911 Pistol Airsoft Gun 8945 /A Bag of BBs Specifications:FPS: 270~280 w/6mm .12g BB /Magazine Capacity: 18 /Size:9\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61crb%2BqFSKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EU9UBJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00EV52HJ2", "title": "ProSource Ultra Deluxe Revolutionary Sports Medicine Roller", "description": "This ProSource roller is a great addition to your pre or post workout routine. Through simple techniques, you may control the amount of pressure \"the bumps\" apply to your body. \"The bumps\" are evenly spaced to one another, so several of them simultaneously contact your body during most exercises. However, with a slight shift of your body, you can reduce your area of contact with the ProSource Roller, which increases pressure and provides deeper, more penetrating relief. Perfect for massaging last, quads, lower back, upper back or any other large muscle group.", "text": "ProSource Ultra Deluxe Revolutionary Sports Medicine Roller This ProSource roller is a great addition to your pre or post workout routine. Through simple techniques, you may control the amount of pressure \"the bumps\" apply to your body. \"The bumps\" are evenly spaced to one another, so several of them simultaneously contact your body during most exercises. However, with a slight shift of your body, you can reduce your area of contact with the ProSource Roller, which increases pressure and provides deeper, more penetrating relief. Perfect for massaging last, quads, lower back, upper back or any other large muscle group.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gwo4g7npL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EV52HJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProSource", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B00EVUKOZG", "title": "Stainless Mark III 22/45 LCI Replacement Insert", "description": "This high quality stainless steel replacement insert for the 22/45 and Mark III series pistol will allow you to remove the exististing plastic parts and simplify cleaning. Installs in minutes; this part ships with color instructions, set screw and allen wrench to get the job done. Improve the appeance and make cleaning easy by upgrading your pistol today. *Note: This part disables the Loaded Chamber Indicator feature. Before ordering please check to see if your state requires this feature by law. MKIII MKIII 22-45 MKIII 22-45 Competition MKIII 22-45 Government Target MKIII 22-45 Target MKIII Competition MKIII Government Target MKIII Target MKIII LITE MKIII Hunter", "text": "Stainless Mark III 22/45 LCI Replacement Insert This high quality stainless steel replacement insert for the 22/45 and Mark III series pistol will allow you to remove the exististing plastic parts and simplify cleaning. Installs in minutes; this part ships with color instructions, set screw and allen wrench to get the job done. Improve the appeance and make cleaning easy by upgrading your pistol today. *Note: This part disables the Loaded Chamber Indicator feature. Before ordering please check to see if your state requires this feature by law. MKIII MKIII 22-45 MKIII 22-45 Competition MKIII 22-45 Government Target MKIII 22-45 Target MKIII Competition MKIII Government Target MKIII Target MKIII LITE MKIII Hunter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EK7VVodEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EVUKOZG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 21.99}}
{"item_id": "B00EVX5OLC", "title": "SGT KNOTS Tarred Twine / Bank Line - 1 Pound - #12, #15, #18, #21, #24, #30, #36, #42", "description": "SGT KNOTS Tarred Twisted Nylon Twine / Bank Line is a far superior grade of twine, of even diameter and strength. Made from 100% nylon fibers and dyed under pressure with a unique process for complete penetration and lasting color, this twine boasts excellent resistance to abrasion, oil, gasoline and other strength-reducing chemicals. Suitable for trot lines and nets.", "text": "SGT KNOTS Tarred Twine / Bank Line - 1 Pound - #12, #15, #18, #21, #24, #30, #36, #42 SGT KNOTS Tarred Twisted Nylon Twine / Bank Line is a far superior grade of twine, of even diameter and strength. Made from 100% nylon fibers and dyed under pressure with a unique process for complete penetration and lasting color, this twine boasts excellent resistance to abrasion, oil, gasoline and other strength-reducing chemicals. Suitable for trot lines and nets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51F50o3ap%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EVX5OLC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Decoy Accessories"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EVYJK3O", "title": "SKLZ ShotLoc Basketball Shooting Trainer", "description": "SKLZ ShotLoc", "text": "SKLZ ShotLoc Basketball Shooting Trainer SKLZ ShotLoc", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AfEr7VvML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EVYJK3O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Training Equipment"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00EVYJKKM", "title": "SKLZ MagnaCoach Basketball Coaching Tool", "description": "The SKLZ Basketball MagnaCoach magnet tags make changing matchups as easy as sliding a magnet into the perfect position. It includes a full court diagram on one side and then a stats area on the back for tracking fouls (individual and team), timeouts and other game plan changes. The traditional way of recording stats is with a book, usually handled by an assistant or someone at the scorer's table. This is a great tool for the solo coach that needs to do it all.", "text": "SKLZ MagnaCoach Basketball Coaching Tool The SKLZ Basketball MagnaCoach magnet tags make changing matchups as easy as sliding a magnet into the perfect position. It includes a full court diagram on one side and then a stats area on the back for tracking fouls (individual and team), timeouts and other game plan changes. The traditional way of recording stats is with a book, usually handled by an assistant or someone at the scorer's table. This is a great tool for the solo coach that needs to do it all.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xUxWlND7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EVYJKKM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Accessories"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EW0CG2Y", "title": "Magnesium Fire Starter - Military Quality with Flint Striker Rod & Mini Saw Tool - Light Weight Fits in Any Bag or Pocket - Great for Hiking and Outdoors - Must Have for Survivalists and Preppers - EDC Survival Essentials- Lifetime Guarantee", "description": "#1 Most Popular Fire StarterNever worry about matches again...Compact, easy to use magnesium fire starter is great for starting fires in a pinch. Comes with solid magnesium core and built in striker. Also includes a free mini tool for scraping the shavings and striking the flint.First starter instructions are printed on the packaging.Note: The firestarter ships with an corrosion protector on the striker flint. Before first use be sure to wipe off with a cloth.Great For...Preppers - Because you never know when you might need it.Campers - Start a fire anywhere at anytime.Survival Situations - When you must have a fire for warmth and light.Hikers - When your hike doesn't end back at camp.Start Hundreds of Fires - Even When WetMagnesium is highly flammable and can start fires even in wet and damp environments. Yet it's safe enough to carry with you everywhere you go.It is only flammable when in shaving form and lights easily with the flint/steel sparks from the striker that are eight times hotter than matches.The amount of magnesium in this fire starter will last for hundreds of fires and most importantly will work to start a fire when you need it the most.", "text": "Magnesium Fire Starter - Military Quality with Flint Striker Rod & Mini Saw Tool - Light Weight Fits in Any Bag or Pocket - Great for Hiking and Outdoors - Must Have for Survivalists and Preppers - EDC Survival Essentials- Lifetime Guarantee #1 Most Popular Fire StarterNever worry about matches again...Compact, easy to use magnesium fire starter is great for starting fires in a pinch. Comes with solid magnesium core and built in striker. Also includes a free mini tool for scraping the shavings and striking the flint.First starter instructions are printed on the packaging.Note: The firestarter ships with an corrosion protector on the striker flint. Before first use be sure to wipe off with a cloth.Great For...Preppers - Because you never know when you might need it.Campers - Start a fire anywhere at anytime.Survival Situations - When you must have a fire for warmth and light.Hikers - When your hike doesn't end back at camp.Start Hundreds of Fires - Even When WetMagnesium is highly flammable and can start fires even in wet and damp environments. Yet it's safe enough to carry with you everywhere you go.It is only flammable when in shaving form and lights easily with the flint/steel sparks from the striker that are eight times hotter than matches.The amount of magnesium in this fire starter will last for hundreds of fires and most importantly will work to start a fire when you need it the most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oaaDWHXLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EW0CG2Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 6.99}}
