{"item_id": "B00EXJ4OME", "title": "Buy Jump Ropes Surge Jump Rope", "description": "Surge Jump Rope 6-7 jumps a second This is our newest design! Top End jump rope used by many of the top jumpers in the world. Made specifically for speed and double unders. The metal handles are very light and easy to control. The shape of the handles allow for comfort and control. Extremely Durable and Fast. Use only indoors or on a protective mat. The Science Behind The Surge Jump Rope Feels like the rope turns itself. A jumper is trying to produce rotation in the handle's axle. He does this by moving the handle in a circular motion with the cable trailing behind. This puts tension on the cable creating the centripetal force that causes it to rotate around the handle. This motion permits the jumper to move her hands in more of a reciprocating (up and down) motion rather than a circular motion by implementing theories of a crank mechanism. It our belief that this causes less fatigue, can produce faster rotation, and allows the jumper to maintain a more consistent speed (assuming that maintaining a consistent pace in a reciprocating motion (like drumming) is easier than while in a circular motion). The advantage to having two bearings is that it handles the axial load much more efficiently. With 1 bearing, there is the addition of detrimental axial torque. The added axial torque on the bearing will cause it to wear out faster, and adds friction so it spins less freely. Radial bearings are not designed with axial torque in mind. It is assumed that they will take only axial load and/or thrust load. Overall, the design causes the handle to be very rigid and feel 'solid' in your hand.", "text": "Buy Jump Ropes Surge Jump Rope Surge Jump Rope 6-7 jumps a second This is our newest design! Top End jump rope used by many of the top jumpers in the world. Made specifically for speed and double unders. The metal handles are very light and easy to control. The shape of the handles allow for comfort and control. Extremely Durable and Fast. Use only indoors or on a protective mat. The Science Behind The Surge Jump Rope Feels like the rope turns itself. A jumper is trying to produce rotation in the handle's axle. He does this by moving the handle in a circular motion with the cable trailing behind. This puts tension on the cable creating the centripetal force that causes it to rotate around the handle. This motion permits the jumper to move her hands in more of a reciprocating (up and down) motion rather than a circular motion by implementing theories of a crank mechanism. It our belief that this causes less fatigue, can produce faster rotation, and allows the jumper to maintain a more consistent speed (assuming that maintaining a consistent pace in a reciprocating motion (like drumming) is easier than while in a circular motion). The advantage to having two bearings is that it handles the axial load much more efficiently. With 1 bearing, there is the addition of detrimental axial torque. The added axial torque on the bearing will cause it to wear out faster, and adds friction so it spins less freely. Radial bearings are not designed with axial torque in mind. It is assumed that they will take only axial load and/or thrust load. Overall, the design causes the handle to be very rigid and feel 'solid' in your hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413RXtaM8zL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EXJ4OME.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buy Jump Ropes", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B00EYI95AK", "title": "CNC Warrior AK 47 Slant Brake", "description": "Standard AK slant brake design helps reduce muzzle rise while firing. Counts as 1 US922r compliance part. Mfg by CNC Warrior LLC Made in USA", "text": "CNC Warrior AK 47 Slant Brake Standard AK slant brake design helps reduce muzzle rise while firing. Counts as 1 US922r compliance part. Mfg by CNC Warrior LLC Made in USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HlbHaOTFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EYI95AK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00EYV59EI", "title": "Johnson Enterprises, LLC Tactical Heavy Duty Model 4/15 Machined Matte Steel 6 Prong Impact Defense Shark Break Brake Muzzle Device with Crush Washer for 1/2 X 28 TPI Thread Pattern for .223 556 5.56", "description": "Black oxide finish, solid precision machined construction. The AR muzzle brake will reduce recoil & climb which will improve shooting and control. The AR Shark muzzle brake redirects propellant gasses and reduces recoil and flash dramatically. Wraps around your threaded barrel and threads on 1/2\"x28 thread pitch.", "text": "Johnson Enterprises, LLC Tactical Heavy Duty Model 4/15 Machined Matte Steel 6 Prong Impact Defense Shark Break Brake Muzzle Device with Crush Washer for 1/2 X 28 TPI Thread Pattern for .223 556 5.56 Black oxide finish, solid precision machined construction. The AR muzzle brake will reduce recoil & climb which will improve shooting and control. The AR Shark muzzle brake redirects propellant gasses and reduces recoil and flash dramatically. Wraps around your threaded barrel and threads on 1/2\"x28 thread pitch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uyuXXSnnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EYV59EI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Johnson Enterprises, LLC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 19.99}}
