{"item_id": "B00EZZBH0S", "title": "BV Bicycle Commuter Rear Carrier Rack for 26\", 28\" and 29\" (700c) Frames, Carries Up To 55 lbs, Frame Mounted", "description": "This sleek streamlined bicycle rack is great for casual cycling and commuting to work or school. Its lightweight style carries up to 55 lbs. (25 kg) for heavier top and side loads when cycling.It has an attachable reflector adapter, and is compatible with most panniers and strap-attached bags.The seat stay rods are length adjustable so you bend them for a customized fit on your bicycle! This allows you to mount to lower or higher seat stay holes or by the seat post.The rack's top plate acts as a rear fender and splash guard for any wet condition. This carrier rack is made of heat-treated, TIG-welded anodized aluminum so it can withstand seasonal conditions outside.Note: Please check bicycle to ensure that it has mounting holes on the rear dropout and seat stays.*Allows top mounting bags to be mounted with panniers simultaneously, and fits most 24\", 26\", 28\", and 700c bicycles.Specifications:Material:Durable lightweight heat-treated aluminumDimensions:13.5\" x 5.25\" x 14.5\" (34.3cm x 13.3cm x 36.8cm)Compatibility:Most panniers and strap-attached bagsLoad weight:Carries up to 55 lbsRack Weight1.2 lbs (544 g)", "text": "BV Bicycle Commuter Rear Carrier Rack for 26\", 28\" and 29\" (700c) Frames, Carries Up To 55 lbs, Frame Mounted This sleek streamlined bicycle rack is great for casual cycling and commuting to work or school. Its lightweight style carries up to 55 lbs. (25 kg) for heavier top and side loads when cycling.It has an attachable reflector adapter, and is compatible with most panniers and strap-attached bags.The seat stay rods are length adjustable so you bend them for a customized fit on your bicycle! This allows you to mount to lower or higher seat stay holes or by the seat post.The rack's top plate acts as a rear fender and splash guard for any wet condition. This carrier rack is made of heat-treated, TIG-welded anodized aluminum so it can withstand seasonal conditions outside.Note: Please check bicycle to ensure that it has mounting holes on the rear dropout and seat stays.*Allows top mounting bags to be mounted with panniers simultaneously, and fits most 24\", 26\", 28\", and 700c bicycles.Specifications:Material:Durable lightweight heat-treated aluminumDimensions:13.5\" x 5.25\" x 14.5\" (34.3cm x 13.3cm x 36.8cm)Compatibility:Most panniers and strap-attached bagsLoad weight:Carries up to 55 lbsRack Weight1.2 lbs (544 g)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NJde86xVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00EZZBH0S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BV", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B00F00YPPG", "title": "FireSteel Miniature (3-Pack)", "description": "FireSteel Specifications Size: 3/20 inch diameter by 2 inches long (3.8 x 50.8mm). Weight: .13 ounces (3.7 grams). 5500 F (3000 C) sparks that will start a fire in the toughest conditions. Composition: FireSteel.com premium firesteel metals. Don't let our smallest firesteel fool you - it makes plenty of sparks to start a fire when you need one because it is made of the same special ferrocerium formula used by its larger FireSteel.com FireSteel relatives. This Miniature FireSteel is just 3/20 of an inch thick and 2 inches long. This FireSteel.com FireSteel is about as thin and short as you can go yet still give a good shower of sparks for firemaking. FireSteel Specifications", "text": "FireSteel Miniature (3-Pack) FireSteel Specifications Size: 3/20 inch diameter by 2 inches long (3.8 x 50.8mm). Weight: .13 ounces (3.7 grams). 5500 F (3000 C) sparks that will start a fire in the toughest conditions. Composition: FireSteel.com premium firesteel metals. Don't let our smallest firesteel fool you - it makes plenty of sparks to start a fire when you need one because it is made of the same special ferrocerium formula used by its larger FireSteel.com FireSteel relatives. This Miniature FireSteel is just 3/20 of an inch thick and 2 inches long. This FireSteel.com FireSteel is about as thin and short as you can go yet still give a good shower of sparks for firemaking. FireSteel Specifications", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21CTjE8Tn7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F00YPPG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B00F0NQ4KW", "title": "Avalanche Trailblazer Crossbow Wooden Stock 150-lb.", "description": "Trailblazer Wooden Stock 150 lb Crossbow An awesome entry-level crossbow, this Avalanche Crossbow features a classic wooden stock and fiberglass limbs that offer pure performance. The 11\"\" power stroke of the bow has a 150-lb. draw weight which delivers arrow speeds of up to 210 FPS with a 16\"\" aluminum arrow. Hit your target with precision accuracy using the built-in adjustable sights. It even offers a mounting rail for adding a scope or red-dot sight. 5.61 lbs (Scope not included)", "text": "Avalanche Trailblazer Crossbow Wooden Stock 150-lb. Trailblazer Wooden Stock 150 lb Crossbow An awesome entry-level crossbow, this Avalanche Crossbow features a classic wooden stock and fiberglass limbs that offer pure performance. The 11\"\" power stroke of the bow has a 150-lb. draw weight which delivers arrow speeds of up to 210 FPS with a 16\"\" aluminum arrow. Hit your target with precision accuracy using the built-in adjustable sights. It even offers a mounting rail for adding a scope or red-dot sight. 5.61 lbs (Scope not included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ujI7fxyHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F0NQ4KW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Panther Trading", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Crossbows"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B00F0NQWPO", "title": "BudK Red Guardian Fantasy Sword with Sheath", "description": "Sleek, dangerous, tactical! Measuring 28\"\" overall, this sword is one solid piece of cold hard, stainless steel with a heat-treated black baked finish. The blade features fantasy cut outs, teeth like serrations, and a piercing point, and slides smoothly into the included nylon blade sheath. The red simulated leather wrapped handle adds a sure grip for easy maneuverability. If there is a sword that screams to be picked up, this one is it!", "text": "BudK Red Guardian Fantasy Sword with Sheath Sleek, dangerous, tactical! Measuring 28\"\" overall, this sword is one solid piece of cold hard, stainless steel with a heat-treated black baked finish. The blade features fantasy cut outs, teeth like serrations, and a piercing point, and slides smoothly into the included nylon blade sheath. The red simulated leather wrapped handle adds a sure grip for easy maneuverability. If there is a sword that screams to be picked up, this one is it!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WdAjW%2BKkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F0NQWPO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Swords"]], "price": 19.81}}
{"item_id": "B00F0NS3MY", "title": "BudK Hungry Hank Bowie Knife", "description": "The Hungry Hank knife is one hunk of a knife that won't break your bank account! This is a heavy duty knife for a small price.", "text": "BudK Hungry Hank Bowie Knife The Hungry Hank knife is one hunk of a knife that won't break your bank account! This is a heavy duty knife for a small price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RPJ%2Bkc%2BLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F0NS3MY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 20.65}}
{"item_id": "B00F0NS4XW", "title": "Jungle Bowie Sawback Knife", "description": "The Jungle Bowie knife is 17\" overall and features a 12\" sharp stainless steel sawback blade. Features hardwood handle with solid brass tanguard and pommel. This knife will give anyone who crosses its path a good case of \"jungle fever.\" Comes complete with quality leather sheath.", "text": "Jungle Bowie Sawback Knife The Jungle Bowie knife is 17\" overall and features a 12\" sharp stainless steel sawback blade. Features hardwood handle with solid brass tanguard and pommel. This knife will give anyone who crosses its path a good case of \"jungle fever.\" Comes complete with quality leather sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41df-OoYD1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F0NS4XW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "General Edge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 16.0}}
