{"item_id": "B00F110GGG", "title": "Strike Industries Charging Handle T6-7075 Forged", "description": "*** NOTE: Our FDE color is the same as Daniel Defense's FDE which is approved by US SOCOM.*** The new ARCH or A.R. Charging Handle from Strike Industries is a T-6 7075 Aluminum forged hard anodized charging handle that functions with easy. With its high polished surface, its ergonomic design makes for a smooth, clean charge. The quality of the ARCH is second to none, it's built for durability. Its gas busting ability diverts harmful gases, oil and dirt away from the shooter. Once you place the ARCH on your rifle, you will see, feel, and know the quality of the ARCH!", "text": "Strike Industries Charging Handle T6-7075 Forged *** NOTE: Our FDE color is the same as Daniel Defense's FDE which is approved by US SOCOM.*** The new ARCH or A.R. Charging Handle from Strike Industries is a T-6 7075 Aluminum forged hard anodized charging handle that functions with easy. With its high polished surface, its ergonomic design makes for a smooth, clean charge. The quality of the ARCH is second to none, it's built for durability. Its gas busting ability diverts harmful gases, oil and dirt away from the shooter. Once you place the ARCH on your rifle, you will see, feel, and know the quality of the ARCH!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aFncEEB3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F110GGG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00F17RS70", "title": "Magpul Industries MBUS Pro, Back-Up Sight, Front, Black", "description": "The MBUS Pro is a corrosion resistant all-steel back-up sighting solution that delivers maximum functionality and strength with minimum bulk at a price that's even smaller than its size. The dual aperture, windage adjustable Rear and no-tool, elevation adjustable Front excel in all 1913 Pica tinny rail mounting applications, including rail-height gas blocks.", "text": "Magpul Industries MBUS Pro, Back-Up Sight, Front, Black The MBUS Pro is a corrosion resistant all-steel back-up sighting solution that delivers maximum functionality and strength with minimum bulk at a price that's even smaller than its size. The dual aperture, windage adjustable Rear and no-tool, elevation adjustable Front excel in all 1913 Pica tinny rail mounting applications, including rail-height gas blocks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sOPCzT-3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F17RS70.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MAGPUL INDUSTRIES CORPORATION", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B00F1F4KEQ", "title": "Pump Me Up! Bike Pump - Mini Floor Pump - Premium Lightweight Aluminum Portable Compact Pump - CNC Machined - Presta And Schrader Valve Compatible - Bike Frame Mounting Attachment Kit Included - Extremely Compact & Portable Superior Design Mini Bike Pump - The Best No Risk - No Questions Asked - Lifetime Warranty & Money Back Guarantee", "description": "Not All Portable Bike Pumps Are Hard To Use!Are you looking for an extremely portable bike pump that is super compact enough to fit on your bike frame but has the power to deliver enough air for any bike tire without you having to use a lot of effort and strength?The Pump Me Up! Mini Floor Pump by Geared2U is less than 10 inches long but has a superior design that makes it easy to use with very little exertion - you can put up to 100 psi into any bike tire!Here's The Advantages Of The Pump Me Up! Mini Floor Pump:Although it is truly a mini bike pump when stored, it has a telescopic design that delivers an enormous volume of air. It also has a comfortable and fold-able \"T\" handle and a retractable foot pad so you get maximum power and stability when operating. It does the work - not you!- Unlike other bike pumps, this premium portable bike pump has a flexible hose and threaded tire valve connector so you can't over torque your tire valve stem. Using this bike pump protects your tire valve from any damage.- A superior seal during pumping means you don't lose air. The hose tip is super easy for switching between Presta and Schrader tire valves so there's no need to carry separate adapters or take apart the pump head to change the configuration.- Made from High Quality Aluminum and CNC machined to exacting precision, this bike pump is tough and durable and designed to last.- The included bike frame mounting attachment kit fits on any bike frame so you can take it wherever you go and you're always protected!The Best No Risk - No Questions Asked - Lifetime Warranty & Money Back Guarantee!The Geared2U Mini Floor Pump is guaranteed for life. If you're not 100% satisfied, we'll give you a full refund - no questions asked.Click The \"Add To Cart Button\" NOW!! So You Can Cycle With The Security Of A Portable Floor Pump!", "text": "Pump Me Up! Bike Pump - Mini Floor Pump - Premium Lightweight Aluminum Portable Compact Pump - CNC Machined - Presta And Schrader Valve Compatible - Bike Frame Mounting Attachment Kit Included - Extremely Compact & Portable Superior Design Mini Bike Pump - The Best No Risk - No Questions Asked - Lifetime Warranty & Money Back Guarantee Not All Portable Bike Pumps Are Hard To Use!Are you looking for an extremely portable bike pump that is super compact enough to fit on your bike frame but has the power to deliver enough air for any bike tire without you having to use a lot of effort and strength?The Pump Me Up! Mini Floor Pump by Geared2U is less than 10 inches long but has a superior design that makes it easy to use with very little exertion - you can put up to 100 psi into any bike tire!Here's The Advantages Of The Pump Me Up! Mini Floor Pump:Although it is truly a mini bike pump when stored, it has a telescopic design that delivers an enormous volume of air. It also has a comfortable and fold-able \"T\" handle and a retractable foot pad so you get maximum power and stability when operating. It does the work - not you!- Unlike other bike pumps, this premium portable bike pump has a flexible hose and threaded tire valve connector so you can't over torque your tire valve stem. Using this bike pump protects your tire valve from any damage.- A superior seal during pumping means you don't lose air. The hose tip is super easy for switching between Presta and Schrader tire valves so there's no need to carry separate adapters or take apart the pump head to change the configuration.- Made from High Quality Aluminum and CNC machined to exacting precision, this bike pump is tough and durable and designed to last.- The included bike frame mounting attachment kit fits on any bike frame so you can take it wherever you go and you're always protected!The Best No Risk - No Questions Asked - Lifetime Warranty & Money Back Guarantee!The Geared2U Mini Floor Pump is guaranteed for life. If you're not 100% satisfied, we'll give you a full refund - no questions asked.Click The \"Add To Cart Button\" NOW!! So You Can Cycle With The Security Of A Portable Floor Pump!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Vrr8rV4bL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F1F4KEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00F1IW2G6", "title": "Callaway Tournament Gift Set", "description": "The Callaway Tournament Set is the perfect gift for any avid golfer and packs a lot of value into one box. This set features a premium Water Bottle with a spill-proof Bite Valve and other useful golf accessories to take to the course. The Tournament Set also includes a Pro-Line Putt Align Tool, Divot Repair Tool, Odyssey Poker Chip Ball Marker, High Performance Tees and a 2-pack of Callaway Warbird Golf Balls.", "text": "Callaway Tournament Gift Set The Callaway Tournament Set is the perfect gift for any avid golfer and packs a lot of value into one box. This set features a premium Water Bottle with a spill-proof Bite Valve and other useful golf accessories to take to the course. The Tournament Set also includes a Pro-Line Putt Align Tool, Divot Repair Tool, Odyssey Poker Chip Ball Marker, High Performance Tees and a 2-pack of Callaway Warbird Golf Balls.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51r6QEli3ML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F1IW2G6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Callaway", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B00F1IW2IE", "title": "Callaway Executive Gift Set", "description": "The Callaway Executive Set is the perfect gift for any avid golfer and packs a lot of value into one box. This set features a premium stainless steel Travel Mug and other useful golf accessories to take to the course. The Executive Set also includes a highly durable, fleece lined 7\" X 7\" Valuables Pouch, Pro-Line Putt Align Tool, Odyssey Poker Chip Ball Marker, High Performance Tees and a 2-pack of Callaway Warbird Golf Balls.", "text": "Callaway Executive Gift Set The Callaway Executive Set is the perfect gift for any avid golfer and packs a lot of value into one box. This set features a premium stainless steel Travel Mug and other useful golf accessories to take to the course. The Executive Set also includes a highly durable, fleece lined 7\" X 7\" Valuables Pouch, Pro-Line Putt Align Tool, Odyssey Poker Chip Ball Marker, High Performance Tees and a 2-pack of Callaway Warbird Golf Balls.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MTF27eMyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F1IW2IE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Callaway", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf"]], "price": 23.95}}
{"item_id": "B00F1U0URC", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SAT001-CP Flashback Knife with a Straight Edge Assisted Folding 3.5-Inch Drop Point Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish", "description": "The SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SAT001-CP Flashback Knife is an ideal everyday carry that opens faster and with more purpose than any other assisted knife available. Made of AUS 8 stainless steel with an attractive satin finish, the 3.5-inch straight edge blade has a drop point shape that sharpens easily and makes quick work of any task. When you start to open the blade, SOG's patented S.A.T. 2.0 (SOG Assisted Technology) takes over and high-tension coil springs propel the blade the rest of the way open for fast, easy, one-handed access. A Piston lock utilizes a movable bar wedged between the blade tang and knife handle to securely lock the blade in place when in the open position. The ergonomically contoured and well balanced handle has a satin and black finish, made of glass-reinforced nylon with a stainless steel wrap and fits comfortably in your hand. The Flashback hides in your pocket with SOG's trademark low-carry reversible bayonet pocket clip, yet is easily accessible. This knife has an overall length of 8-Inch, blade thickness of 0.125-Inch and weight of 3.7-ounces. The SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SAT001-CP Flashback Knife comes with a limited lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials. Each SOG product is created with the help of company founder and chief engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SAT001-CP Flashback Knife with a Straight Edge Assisted Folding 3.5-Inch Drop Point Blade and GRN Handle, Satin Finish The SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SAT001-CP Flashback Knife is an ideal everyday carry that opens faster and with more purpose than any other assisted knife available. Made of AUS 8 stainless steel with an attractive satin finish, the 3.5-inch straight edge blade has a drop point shape that sharpens easily and makes quick work of any task. When you start to open the blade, SOG's patented S.A.T. 2.0 (SOG Assisted Technology) takes over and high-tension coil springs propel the blade the rest of the way open for fast, easy, one-handed access. A Piston lock utilizes a movable bar wedged between the blade tang and knife handle to securely lock the blade in place when in the open position. The ergonomically contoured and well balanced handle has a satin and black finish, made of glass-reinforced nylon with a stainless steel wrap and fits comfortably in your hand. The Flashback hides in your pocket with SOG's trademark low-carry reversible bayonet pocket clip, yet is easily accessible. This knife has an overall length of 8-Inch, blade thickness of 0.125-Inch and weight of 3.7-ounces. The SOG Specialty Knives & Tools SAT001-CP Flashback Knife comes with a limited lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials. Each SOG product is created with the help of company founder and chief engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SaM6sYX0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F1U0URC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 56.99}}
