{"item_id": "B00F2ISW32", "title": "BudK Genuine Gurkha Kukri Knife", "description": "This new collector's item is the king of edged weapons!! This knife is the national symbol and constant companion of the great Gurkha Warriors who fought many mighty battles with this weapon leading the way. The cut out of this knife is an example of the religious symbol of the Gurkha Goddess of Might. The handle is constructed of exotic haldina cordifolia hardwood. The 12\" curved carbon steel blade is an amazing 1/4\" thick. Includes artificial leather sheath and two accessory fixed blade knives each measuring 4\" overall.", "text": "BudK Genuine Gurkha Kukri Knife This new collector's item is the king of edged weapons!! This knife is the national symbol and constant companion of the great Gurkha Warriors who fought many mighty battles with this weapon leading the way. The cut out of this knife is an example of the religious symbol of the Gurkha Goddess of Might. The handle is constructed of exotic haldina cordifolia hardwood. The 12\" curved carbon steel blade is an amazing 1/4\" thick. Includes artificial leather sheath and two accessory fixed blade knives each measuring 4\" overall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BoI%2BrOdqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F2ISW32.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 26.95}}
