{"item_id": "B00F2U1CTQ", "title": "Venum \"Challenger\" Mouthguard, Red Devi", "description": "Specifically designed to prevent and reduce injuries to your teeth, arches, lips, joint, jaw and gums. All the layout has been deviced to take a perfect custom fit of your teeth to maximize your security and protection. We used an advanced gel frame for a better comfort and added an exclusive breathing channel for an increased performance during the fight! The lower rubber frame brakes the shock wave and disperses it in the direction of your strongest teeth. In order to meet the expectations of every fighters we designed it in collaboration with the best UFC fighters as: Wanderlei Silva, Carlos Condit, Lyoto Machida.", "text": "Venum \"Challenger\" Mouthguard, Red Devi Specifically designed to prevent and reduce injuries to your teeth, arches, lips, joint, jaw and gums. All the layout has been deviced to take a perfect custom fit of your teeth to maximize your security and protection. We used an advanced gel frame for a better comfort and added an exclusive breathing channel for an increased performance during the fight! The lower rubber frame brakes the shock wave and disperses it in the direction of your strongest teeth. In order to meet the expectations of every fighters we designed it in collaboration with the best UFC fighters as: Wanderlei Silva, Carlos Condit, Lyoto Machida.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41czOpldExL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F2U1CTQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Venum", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Mouthguards"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00F3EJQZS", "title": "Emergency Survival Mylar Thermal 2 Person Sleeping Bag - Accommodates 2 Adults - 64\" X 87\"- by Grizzly Gear", "description": "Emergency 2 Person Sleeping Bag by Grizzly Gear is made of the same Mylar material as our emergency blanket but is formed into a sleeping bag to prevent heat loss even more efficiently.This compact sleeping bag provides warmth (retains and reflects up to 90 of body heat), a waterproof and windproof shelter barrier, and a covering to help reduce shock when someone is injured. Grizzly Gear Emergency Thermal Sleeping Bag to be used as emergency shelter. Also great for camping, hiking, and surviving the cold outdoors. Excellent as liner of sleeping bag.", "text": "Emergency Survival Mylar Thermal 2 Person Sleeping Bag - Accommodates 2 Adults - 64\" X 87\"- by Grizzly Gear Emergency 2 Person Sleeping Bag by Grizzly Gear is made of the same Mylar material as our emergency blanket but is formed into a sleeping bag to prevent heat loss even more efficiently.This compact sleeping bag provides warmth (retains and reflects up to 90 of body heat), a waterproof and windproof shelter barrier, and a covering to help reduce shock when someone is injured. Grizzly Gear Emergency Thermal Sleeping Bag to be used as emergency shelter. Also great for camping, hiking, and surviving the cold outdoors. Excellent as liner of sleeping bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wj6dPHN%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F3EJQZS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B00F3EZPM6", "title": "Emergency Survival Mylar Thermal Reflective Cold Weather Shelter Tube Tent - Accommodates 2 Adults - 8' X 3'- by Grizzly Gear", "description": "Emergency Thermal Tent by Grizzly Gear is made of the same Mylar material as our emergency blanket but is formed into a tube tent to prevent heat loss even more efficiently.This compact tube tent provides warmth (retains and reflects up to 90 of body heat), a waterproof and windproof shelter barrier, and a covering to help reduce shock when someone is injured. Grizzly Gear's Emergency Thermal Tent is to be used as emergency shelter. Also great for camping, hiking, and surviving the cold outdoors.", "text": "Emergency Survival Mylar Thermal Reflective Cold Weather Shelter Tube Tent - Accommodates 2 Adults - 8' X 3'- by Grizzly Gear Emergency Thermal Tent by Grizzly Gear is made of the same Mylar material as our emergency blanket but is formed into a tube tent to prevent heat loss even more efficiently.This compact tube tent provides warmth (retains and reflects up to 90 of body heat), a waterproof and windproof shelter barrier, and a covering to help reduce shock when someone is injured. Grizzly Gear's Emergency Thermal Tent is to be used as emergency shelter. Also great for camping, hiking, and surviving the cold outdoors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Dql3KaLvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F3EZPM6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B00F3J3CQ2", "title": "Target Mounting Kit", "description": "Each Kit Contains(2) lengths 12\" 1/4\" Proof Chain(2) 2-1/4\" 3/8-16 Carriage Bolts(2) 3/8-16 Nuts(4) 3/8-16 Nylock Nuts(6) 3/8 Flat WashersMake sure to view all pictures to see how this mounting kit works.", "text": "Target Mounting Kit Each Kit Contains(2) lengths 12\" 1/4\" Proof Chain(2) 2-1/4\" 3/8-16 Carriage Bolts(2) 3/8-16 Nuts(4) 3/8-16 Nylock Nuts(6) 3/8 Flat WashersMake sure to view all pictures to see how this mounting kit works.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZxeEO397L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F3J3CQ2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 10.09}}
{"item_id": "B00F3MWTY0", "title": "4MyCycle® Bike Cover 190T Size Large Heavy Duty - Bicycle Cover - Bike Storage Cover - Bike Cover Waterproof - Bike Covers for Rain - Sport Bike Cover - Bicycle Cover Waterproof Outdoor - Suits Adult Sized Mountain Road and Cruiser Bikes - Royal Blue & Silver", "description": "Are You: Leaving Your Bike out in the Rain, Snow or Sun? Getting wet or dirty before you even start riding? Seeing your bike depreciating in value?Fix That Now - Get a 4MyCycle Bike Cover 190T!!!Made from 190T PU Coated Polymer fabric with heat sealed seams, this cover provides the highest quality all weather protection for your bike, including UPF 50+ fabric -- protection for your bike surfaces against damaging UV. Waterproof cover is fitted with high mounted integrated moisture release vents to dispel condensation build-up when storing for extended periods. Secure fitting with elastic skirt and secure webbing with clasp. Metal eyelets at base of cover for fitting of security devices - cable locks and D Locks. Storage bag includedFeatures:- Superior All Weather Protection against Sun, Dust, Dirt, Rain, Snow and Ice - Dispels Condensation via High Point Moisture Release Vents - Durable - Constructed of 190T Long Life Polymer fabric - Performs well in heat and cold - Maximum UV Protection, Metal Eyelets for fitting locking devices - Military Style Webbing and Clasp adjusts for snug fitting & resists very strong wind gusts - Complimentary Storage Bag keeps cover secure and cleanProduct Specification:- Suitable for Adult sized Road or Mountain bike - Dimensions: 78\"L x 44\"H x 27\"W - Elastic hem front and back - Webbing strap with nylon clasp for wind security - Constructed of Quality 190T Polymer fabric - Two meshed moisture release vents located at highest point minimize condensation - All seams double folded and double stitched and heat sealed to ensure water-tightness Click the Yellow \"Add To Cart Button\" at the Top of This Page NOW to Order Your 4MyCycle Bike Cover", "text": "4MyCycle® Bike Cover 190T Size Large Heavy Duty - Bicycle Cover - Bike Storage Cover - Bike Cover Waterproof - Bike Covers for Rain - Sport Bike Cover - Bicycle Cover Waterproof Outdoor - Suits Adult Sized Mountain Road and Cruiser Bikes - Royal Blue & Silver Are You: Leaving Your Bike out in the Rain, Snow or Sun? Getting wet or dirty before you even start riding? Seeing your bike depreciating in value?Fix That Now - Get a 4MyCycle Bike Cover 190T!!!Made from 190T PU Coated Polymer fabric with heat sealed seams, this cover provides the highest quality all weather protection for your bike, including UPF 50+ fabric -- protection for your bike surfaces against damaging UV. Waterproof cover is fitted with high mounted integrated moisture release vents to dispel condensation build-up when storing for extended periods. Secure fitting with elastic skirt and secure webbing with clasp. Metal eyelets at base of cover for fitting of security devices - cable locks and D Locks. Storage bag includedFeatures:- Superior All Weather Protection against Sun, Dust, Dirt, Rain, Snow and Ice - Dispels Condensation via High Point Moisture Release Vents - Durable - Constructed of 190T Long Life Polymer fabric - Performs well in heat and cold - Maximum UV Protection, Metal Eyelets for fitting locking devices - Military Style Webbing and Clasp adjusts for snug fitting & resists very strong wind gusts - Complimentary Storage Bag keeps cover secure and cleanProduct Specification:- Suitable for Adult sized Road or Mountain bike - Dimensions: 78\"L x 44\"H x 27\"W - Elastic hem front and back - Webbing strap with nylon clasp for wind security - Constructed of Quality 190T Polymer fabric - Two meshed moisture release vents located at highest point minimize condensation - All seams double folded and double stitched and heat sealed to ensure water-tightness Click the Yellow \"Add To Cart Button\" at the Top of This Page NOW to Order Your 4MyCycle Bike Cover", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L7zYhhIzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F3MWTY0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Covers"]], "price": 20.98}}
