YxjXKCGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F3O25TM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Covers"]], "price": 26.98}}
{"item_id": "B00F3ZT84Q", "title": "Filtered 500ml Water Bottles - FDA Approved - BPA Free - Carbon Filter - 300 Bottles of Fresh Clean Filtered Water - Easy to Change Filter - Available in Blue, Yellow, Pink, Red, Purple Colored Filters and Clip - Durable Eco Friendly Recyclable Bottle", "description": "Filtered Water Bottle - Karabiner - easy change filter - various colours - durable BPA free plastic+ Inbuilt tethering ring with quick fit and quick release Karabiner+ available with various color filters and clips - blue, yellow, pink, red and purple+ Improves the flavor of water+ Easily removable filter for fast filling+ 12 month money back guarantee (excluding filter)Drink good tasting water without the expense of buying bottled spring waterThis high quality filter water bottle will provide you with good tasting water wherever you are with health and ECO benefits over spring waterFeatures:- Filters out chlorine and chloramines- Does not filter out fluoride- BPA free and hence no risk from synthetic estrogen- Reduces particulates, including sediment, sand, rust, grit- Carbon replaceable filter- Each filter lasts 2 months or for 40 gallons / 150 litres- Protective cap keeps spout clean- Pull up drink spout- Squeeze to drink bottle- Durable plastic- No leakage when fully closed- Quick fit and quick release clip- Money savingBenefits:- Easy portability and access by using the clip- Fluoride from water source is good for your teeth- Eliminates plastic bootle waste- No more shopping for water- Color coding for easy user identification- Quick refill capabilityThe BSB Homeware filter water bottle .Like all BSB Homeware products, the filter water bottle (excluding the filter) is protected by a 12 month, no questions asked, money back guarantee.Get your filter water bottle now and enjoy more affordable good tasting water while helping the planet by using less plastic", "text": "Filtered 500ml Water Bottles - FDA Approved - BPA Free - Carbon Filter - 300 Bottles of Fresh Clean Filtered Water - Easy to Change Filter - Available in Blue, Yellow, Pink, Red, Purple Colored Filters and Clip - Durable Eco Friendly Recyclable Bottle Filtered Water Bottle - Karabiner - easy change filter - various colours - durable BPA free plastic+ Inbuilt tethering ring with quick fit and quick release Karabiner+ available with various color filters and clips - blue, yellow, pink, red and purple+ Improves the flavor of water+ Easily removable filter for fast filling+ 12 month money back guarantee (excluding filter)Drink good tasting water without the expense of buying bottled spring waterThis high quality filter water bottle will provide you with good tasting water wherever you are with health and ECO benefits over spring waterFeatures:- Filters out chlorine and chloramines- Does not filter out fluoride- BPA free and hence no risk from synthetic estrogen- Reduces particulates, including sediment, sand, rust, grit- Carbon replaceable filter- Each filter lasts 2 months or for 40 gallons / 150 litres- Protective cap keeps spout clean- Pull up drink spout- Squeeze to drink bottle- Durable plastic- No leakage when fully closed- Quick fit and quick release clip- Money savingBenefits:- Easy portability and access by using the clip- Fluoride from water source is good for your teeth- Eliminates plastic bootle waste- No more shopping for water- Color coding for easy user identification- Quick refill capabilityThe BSB Homeware filter water bottle .Like all BSB Homeware products, the filter water bottle (excluding the filter) is protected by a 12 month, no questions asked, money back guarantee.Get your filter water bottle now and enjoy more affordable good tasting water while helping the planet by using less plastic", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41in93f%2BYeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F3ZT84Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 25.1}}
