{"item_id": "B00F4FCCI4", "title": "Paracord 850 Lb. 100ft (Black) Mold, Mildew, and UV Resistant. Average Test Strength @ 855.8 Made in the USA By a Certified Military Contractor.", "description": "This is a certified 850 pound test Paracord. Made by a Certified Military Contractor for all US Armed forces since 1943. This Contractor also offers MIL-SPECS: MIL-C-5040G, MIL-C-7515F, MIL-C-43256, MIL-C-43307, MIL-R-24677.", "text": "Paracord 850 Lb. 100ft (Black) Mold, Mildew, and UV Resistant. Average Test Strength @ 855.8 Made in the USA By a Certified Military Contractor. This is a certified 850 pound test Paracord. Made by a Certified Military Contractor for all US Armed forces since 1943. This Contractor also offers MIL-SPECS: MIL-C-5040G, MIL-C-7515F, MIL-C-43256, MIL-C-43307, MIL-R-24677.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bEjpRPdbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F4FCCI4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B00F4O3H7K", "title": "Cutters Gloves Men's Prime Hero Baseball Batting Glove", "description": "The Prime Hero is the batting glove for the serious players looking for the ultimate performance and feel. Combining C-TACK Performance Grip and Premium Micro-Tex Etched Cabretta Leather on the palm creating the ultimate combination of grip and feel. C-TACK helps minimize grip pressure causing less muscle tension leading to quicker bat speed and smoother swings. Back of hand designed with precurved fingers for natural grip on a bat, and premium smooth Cabretta leather fingers and thumb for added comfort. Designed for maximum comfort and flexibility, the Prime Hero provides a lightweight, pro-level grip and comfort for all levels of play.", "text": "Cutters Gloves Men's Prime Hero Baseball Batting Glove The Prime Hero is the batting glove for the serious players looking for the ultimate performance and feel. Combining C-TACK Performance Grip and Premium Micro-Tex Etched Cabretta Leather on the palm creating the ultimate combination of grip and feel. C-TACK helps minimize grip pressure causing less muscle tension leading to quicker bat speed and smoother swings. Back of hand designed with precurved fingers for natural grip on a bat, and premium smooth Cabretta leather fingers and thumb for added comfort. Designed for maximum comfort and flexibility, the Prime Hero provides a lightweight, pro-level grip and comfort for all levels of play.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gFwMc8tOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F4O3H7K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Player Equipment", "Gloves & Mitts", "Batting Gloves"]]}}
