{"item_id": "B00F6N0YNE", "title": "Fisher-Price Laugh and Learn Singin Soccer Ball", "description": "Get ready to kick up some learning fun with the Singin' Soccer Ball. Baby will love discovering numbers, counting, colors and opposites and learning about teamwork and taking turns. The soft, baby-friendly ball is easy to grasp and roll, with fun sounds, songs and tunes to encourage play. It's even machine washable after electronics are removed.", "text": "Fisher-Price Laugh and Learn Singin Soccer Ball Get ready to kick up some learning fun with the Singin' Soccer Ball. Baby will love discovering numbers, counting, colors and opposites and learning about teamwork and taking turns. The soft, baby-friendly ball is easy to grasp and roll, with fun sounds, songs and tunes to encourage play. It's even machine washable after electronics are removed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ws5sf8wyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F6N0YNE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fisher-Price", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Soccer", "Balls"]], "price": 17.7}}
{"item_id": "B00F6YYU3S", "title": "Gatorade Squeeze Water Sports Bottle 32oz Pack of 2", "description": "These 32 oz bottles are the ones seen on sidelines everywhere. A clear strip on the side lets you see how much fluid you have left. The self-sealing gasket top means that you no longer have to pull the top before drinking, just point and squeeze Sporting a new, hands free pressure-release tip and easy grip design, this infamous green bottle dispenses in a quick and easy way putting you right back in the game without any delay.", "text": "Gatorade Squeeze Water Sports Bottle 32oz Pack of 2 These 32 oz bottles are the ones seen on sidelines everywhere. A clear strip on the side lets you see how much fluid you have left. The self-sealing gasket top means that you no longer have to pull the top before drinking, just point and squeeze Sporting a new, hands free pressure-release tip and easy grip design, this infamous green bottle dispenses in a quick and easy way putting you right back in the game without any delay.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Q5qM%2BtD1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F6YYU3S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gatorade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 8.0}}
