{"item_id": "B00F9M0Z3Q", "title": "Golden Power Fiberglass Practice/hunting Arrows W/changeable Point for Recurve Bow or Traditional Bow", "description": "OD: 8.0 mmarrow length: 30\" 76.2 CMWeight: 38gVans: 3 inch TPU materialDeflection: 450 SPSuitable range: Up to 55 lbs100gr target point with standard thread, changeable for broadhead.Packing: Bulk Packing, the vane may be bent when you open the package, it is recoverable when entering hotwater.Note: Pls note these arrows is suitable for recurve & traditional bow.We have other similar arrows for compound bow, pls search asin: B00ESTOEW4.We are original manufacturer for archery items, including arrows, broadheads, accessories etc.We could provide OEM & ODM service. If you want to wholesale these kind of products for reselling, please contact us because we always keep plenty stocking items for wholesalers and retailers.", "text": "Golden Power Fiberglass Practice/hunting Arrows W/changeable Point for Recurve Bow or Traditional Bow OD: 8.0 mmarrow length: 30\" 76.2 CMWeight: 38gVans: 3 inch TPU materialDeflection: 450 SPSuitable range: Up to 55 lbs100gr target point with standard thread, changeable for broadhead.Packing: Bulk Packing, the vane may be bent when you open the package, it is recoverable when entering hotwater.Note: Pls note these arrows is suitable for recurve & traditional bow.We have other similar arrows for compound bow, pls search asin: B00ESTOEW4.We are original manufacturer for archery items, including arrows, broadheads, accessories etc.We could provide OEM & ODM service. If you want to wholesale these kind of products for reselling, please contact us because we always keep plenty stocking items for wholesalers and retailers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vuQCt1wdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00F9M0Z3Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Hunting Arrows"]]}}
