{"item_id": "B00FDZMC9Y", "title": "Samsung Galaxy Centura Android Prepaid Phone (TracFone)", "description": "The Samsung Galaxy Centura is the first ever Android phone available for Tracfone service. The Centura includes Triple Minutes for life but also gives you the added bonus of three separate balances; minutes, texts and data. Each time you add minutes to your Centura you will receive triple the amount of minutes along with texts and data. Example: Add 200 Minutes and Receive 600 Minutes and 600 Texts and 600 MB of Data. The Centura has a 3.5\" touchscreen, 3MP Camera with video, bluetooth, access to the Google Play store, Wi-Fi, GPS, and much more. THIS PHONE IS FOR USE WITH TRACFONE SERVICE ONLY!", "text": "Samsung Galaxy Centura Android Prepaid Phone (TracFone) The Samsung Galaxy Centura is the first ever Android phone available for Tracfone service. The Centura includes Triple Minutes for life but also gives you the added bonus of three separate balances; minutes, texts and data. Each time you add minutes to your Centura you will receive triple the amount of minutes along with texts and data. Example: Add 200 Minutes and Receive 600 Minutes and 600 Texts and 600 MB of Data. The Centura has a 3.5\" touchscreen, 3MP Camera with video, bluetooth, access to the Google Play store, Wi-Fi, GPS, and much more. THIS PHONE IS FOR USE WITH TRACFONE SERVICE ONLY!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uHsDECSKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FDZMC9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Samsung", "categories": [["Cell Phones & Accessories", "Cell Phones", "No-Contract Cell Phones", "Phones"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Cell Phone Accessories"]], "price": 85.09}}
{"item_id": "B00FE0YD7W", "title": "BikingMyWay® High Volume High Pressure (300PSI) Convertible Hand Bike Pump with Gauge - Frame Mounting Kit Included - Portable Bike Suspension Fork Pump - Lightweight Bike Shock Pump - Also Works as High Volume Tire Pump - CNC Machined Schrader and Presta Flip Head - Alloy Made Barrels - Best Valued Mini Bike Pump - Money Back Guaranteed", "description": "Don't want to be stuck, away from home with a flat tire because you forget to check the pressure before hitting the road and/or your pump is too bulky, too heavy to carry?Don't want to spend extra hard-earned dollars for a separate expensive shock pump, in addition to regular tire pump, for the suspension fork and rear shock?Feeling disappointed when finding that you can't pump your bike equipped with Presta valve at gas station?Our Premium Quality Dual Function Mini Bike Pump is here to save you all the trouble!It's very easy to carry -lightweight (~ 200g) and compact (200mm in length, 30mm in diameter). It also comes with a frame mounting kit which fits on most bikes.It works as high pressure pump for suspension fork and rear shock, and high volume pump for tires.Its Swivel hose fits both Schrader valve and Presta valve.Its patented 2-stage design makes inflating tires much easier by starting from high volume (\"HI-V\") mode, followed by high pressure (\"HI-P\") mode.IMPORTANT NOTESNOTE 1: The highest pressure of the pump is 300PSI. As a result, the indicator of the gauge may not move until the air pressure reaches above 50PSI. When pumped to 20 - 30 PSI, it's reasonable that the indicator doesn't move.NOTE 2: Sometimes it takes over 100PSI to get the Presta valve to open, at that point the gauge falls back to the actual pressure.NOTE 3: The pump has 2 barrels working inside under High Volume Mode (HI-V). Once switched to High Pressure Mode (HI-P), it only needs 1 barrel - the air will be released from 1 of 2 barrels.Best Choice in High Pressure for Shock and High Volume for Tire - Must Have for Cyclists! Be Prepared with Your Rides!Buy One Right Now! Buy One for Your Family and Friends, Whoever Loves Riding and Rides A Lot!", "text": "BikingMyWay® High Volume High Pressure (300PSI) Convertible Hand Bike Pump with Gauge - Frame Mounting Kit Included - Portable Bike Suspension Fork Pump - Lightweight Bike Shock Pump - Also Works as High Volume Tire Pump - CNC Machined Schrader and Presta Flip Head - Alloy Made Barrels - Best Valued Mini Bike Pump - Money Back Guaranteed Don't want to be stuck, away from home with a flat tire because you forget to check the pressure before hitting the road and/or your pump is too bulky, too heavy to carry?Don't want to spend extra hard-earned dollars for a separate expensive shock pump, in addition to regular tire pump, for the suspension fork and rear shock?Feeling disappointed when finding that you can't pump your bike equipped with Presta valve at gas station?Our Premium Quality Dual Function Mini Bike Pump is here to save you all the trouble!It's very easy to carry -lightweight (~ 200g) and compact (200mm in length, 30mm in diameter). It also comes with a frame mounting kit which fits on most bikes.It works as high pressure pump for suspension fork and rear shock, and high volume pump for tires.Its Swivel hose fits both Schrader valve and Presta valve.Its patented 2-stage design makes inflating tires much easier by starting from high volume (\"HI-V\") mode, followed by high pressure (\"HI-P\") mode.IMPORTANT NOTESNOTE 1: The highest pressure of the pump is 300PSI. As a result, the indicator of the gauge may not move until the air pressure reaches above 50PSI. When pumped to 20 - 30 PSI, it's reasonable that the indicator doesn't move.NOTE 2: Sometimes it takes over 100PSI to get the Presta valve to open, at that point the gauge falls back to the actual pressure.NOTE 3: The pump has 2 barrels working inside under High Volume Mode (HI-V). Once switched to High Pressure Mode (HI-P), it only needs 1 barrel - the air will be released from 1 of 2 barrels.Best Choice in High Pressure for Shock and High Volume for Tire - Must Have for Cyclists! Be Prepared with Your Rides!Buy One Right Now! Buy One for Your Family and Friends, Whoever Loves Riding and Rides A Lot!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51F8ZQTJz5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FE0YD7W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 30.0}}
{"item_id": "B00FF7SHSU", "title": "United Cutlery BV124 Savage Jungle Hunter Machete, Black", "description": "Don't brave the jungles without this brand new Jungle Hunter from Black Savage. Crafted of one solid piece of cold, rock-hard AUS-8 stainless steel, this full-tang beast measures in at a whopping 25\" overall. The razor sharp blade features cut-out designs, heavy sawback serrations and a durable baked-on black finish. The oversized, rubberized handle is textured for a sure, confident grip and features a lanyard. Includes a durable nylon belt sheath for convenient storage and easy transport.", "text": "United Cutlery BV124 Savage Jungle Hunter Machete, Black Don't brave the jungles without this brand new Jungle Hunter from Black Savage. Crafted of one solid piece of cold, rock-hard AUS-8 stainless steel, this full-tang beast measures in at a whopping 25\" overall. The razor sharp blade features cut-out designs, heavy sawback serrations and a durable baked-on black finish. The oversized, rubberized handle is textured for a sure, confident grip and features a lanyard. Includes a durable nylon belt sheath for convenient storage and easy transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41n3v0p-8IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FF7SHSU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 23.5}}
{"item_id": "B00FFAYVKK", "title": "Kidd 1022 Bolt Extractor for Ruger 10/22", "description": "Upgrade your Ruger 10-22 bolt with a precision made KIDD 10-22 extractor. Our aggressive extractor will remove even stubborn 10-22 cases from your barrel chamber. It was designed using the latest AutoCad Computer Aided Design software and offers the geometry you have come to expect from Kidd Innovative Design. This extractor is cut from hardened (60c) A2 Tool Steel using the latest wire EDM (electrical discharge machine) machining technology. This allows tolerances to be held to .0002\". This ensures proper extraction and reliable ejection from tight match chambers. For the quick upgrade for your Ruger 10-22 rifle or for the \"ultimate\" 10-22 build this product is KIDD quality no matter the use. Packaging includes: extractor and spring", "text": "Kidd 1022 Bolt Extractor for Ruger 10/22 Upgrade your Ruger 10-22 bolt with a precision made KIDD 10-22 extractor. Our aggressive extractor will remove even stubborn 10-22 cases from your barrel chamber. It was designed using the latest AutoCad Computer Aided Design software and offers the geometry you have come to expect from Kidd Innovative Design. This extractor is cut from hardened (60c) A2 Tool Steel using the latest wire EDM (electrical discharge machine) machining technology. This allows tolerances to be held to .0002\". This ensures proper extraction and reliable ejection from tight match chambers. For the quick upgrade for your Ruger 10-22 rifle or for the \"ultimate\" 10-22 build this product is KIDD quality no matter the use. Packaging includes: extractor and spring", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51m0eB2rsoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FFAYVKK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B00FGKGKCG", "title": "Srixon Marathon Golf Balls (12-Pack), White", "description": "The Marathon is designed with distance and durability bred into its core. The large, highly resilient Energetic Gradient Growth core delivers extreme distance while the strong ionomer covers protects it from harsh elements. This value offering is one of the longest and most durable golf balls we have ever made.", "text": "Srixon Marathon Golf Balls (12-Pack), White The Marathon is designed with distance and durability bred into its core. The large, highly resilient Energetic Gradient Growth core delivers extreme distance while the strong ionomer covers protects it from harsh elements. This value offering is one of the longest and most durable golf balls we have ever made.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SIH22o%2BIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FGKGKCG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Srixon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Distance Balls"]], "price": 14.82}}
