{"item_id": "B00FI1HMUW", "title": "SKLZ Kool 'N Fit Sport Performance Spray", "description": "SKLZ Kool 'N Fit Sport is a powerful spray used before, during and after athletic activity for quicker warm-up, better performance and faster recovery. It is a quick drying, non-staining, hypo-allergenic formula developed at the request of professional sports teams, athletes, trainers and coaches to get an edge over the competition.", "text": "SKLZ Kool 'N Fit Sport Performance Spray SKLZ Kool 'N Fit Sport is a powerful spray used before, during and after athletic activity for quicker warm-up, better performance and faster recovery. It is a quick drying, non-staining, hypo-allergenic formula developed at the request of professional sports teams, athletes, trainers and coaches to get an edge over the competition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fCbV7TQGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FI1HMUW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "Hot & Cold Therapy"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B00FIKIK7C", "title": "Bicycle Adjustable Aluminium Alloy Bike Bicycle Kickstand Side Kickstand Fit for 20\" 24\" 26\"- Black", "description": "Description Features:Introductions:It waterproof and wear-resisting.The bicycle foot hold is made of aluminum alloy material, with top quality and very strong, makes your bicycle convenient to parking!Specifications:1. Axial Length: 3.94in/10cm2. Material: aluminum alloy3. Weight: 320g/11.2oz4.Color:black, white", "text": "Bicycle Adjustable Aluminium Alloy Bike Bicycle Kickstand Side Kickstand Fit for 20\" 24\" 26\"- Black Description Features:Introductions:It waterproof and wear-resisting.The bicycle foot hold is made of aluminum alloy material, with top quality and very strong, makes your bicycle convenient to parking!Specifications:1. Axial Length: 3.94in/10cm2. Material: aluminum alloy3. Weight: 320g/11.2oz4.Color:black, white", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jeqL9sAlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FIKIK7C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TOPCABIN", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 13.45}}
{"item_id": "B00FJ1ITDA", "title": "Compression Shorts - Men's Boxer Brief - Best for Running, Cycling, Basketball", "description": "Looking for comfortable and breathable Compression Shorts that do not restrict movement?How Does CompressionZ Compression Shorts Help You- Faster and easier recovery after your workout, as increase in oxygen helps remove lactic acid- More effective warm up as your muscles get warmed faster due to increasing blood flow- Improve your performance with better muscle support and muscle efficiency- Breathable and comfortable as we use anti itch material- Complete your runs or workouts without injury- Promotes blood circulation for travel, and helps to reduce swelling in legs- Retains shape even after multiple washes- Anti bacterial material to reduce odor- Allows greater flexibility & motion with no skin chafing or irritation- Can be worn under jeans, pants or running shorts as a base layerWho Is This Suitable For- Runners- Joggers- CrossFit- Athletes- Cyclists- Tough Mudders- Field Sports- Cross Training- Gym Workouts- Hiking/ Trekking- Office workers- If you are on your feet for long hours- Travelers on plane / long distance travelKindly refer to the size chart in the product images above - Please note that this range of compression wear has a tight fit. For a less tight fit, please select the next size upBuy 2 or more (for friends and family, and keep an extra pair at home, the office, or in your gym bag) & receive free shipping!Click on the 'Add to Cart' button now as price will increase after the promotional period", "text": "Compression Shorts - Men's Boxer Brief - Best for Running, Cycling, Basketball Looking for comfortable and breathable Compression Shorts that do not restrict movement?How Does CompressionZ Compression Shorts Help You- Faster and easier recovery after your workout, as increase in oxygen helps remove lactic acid- More effective warm up as your muscles get warmed faster due to increasing blood flow- Improve your performance with better muscle support and muscle efficiency- Breathable and comfortable as we use anti itch material- Complete your runs or workouts without injury- Promotes blood circulation for travel, and helps to reduce swelling in legs- Retains shape even after multiple washes- Anti bacterial material to reduce odor- Allows greater flexibility & motion with no skin chafing or irritation- Can be worn under jeans, pants or running shorts as a base layerWho Is This Suitable For- Runners- Joggers- CrossFit- Athletes- Cyclists- Tough Mudders- Field Sports- Cross Training- Gym Workouts- Hiking/ Trekking- Office workers- If you are on your feet for long hours- Travelers on plane / long distance travelKindly refer to the size chart in the product images above - Please note that this range of compression wear has a tight fit. For a less tight fit, please select the next size upBuy 2 or more (for friends and family, and keep an extra pair at home, the office, or in your gym bag) & receive free shipping!Click on the 'Add to Cart' button now as price will increase after the promotional period", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OXO2vhVOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FJ1ITDA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B00FK38RD4", "title": "TANDEMKROSS Sub-2000 \"Eagle Eye\" Rear Open Sight", "description": "This all-metal combat sight replaces your stock KelTec Sub-2000 plastic ghost ring. Most shooters today like to use 3rd party optics and red dots and still have their iron sights ready to go. The stock plastic ghost ring cannot be moved and often interferes with field of view when using optics. Spring loaded, the TANDEMKROSS Sub-2000 \"Eagle Eye\" rear sight upgrade allows you to switch from optic to iron sights and back again with a flick of your finger. Simple and easy to install this sight will not interfere the folding feature of your the Sub-2000. Improve your aim and your Sub-2000 today with the TANDEMKROSS \"Eagle Eye\".", "text": "TANDEMKROSS Sub-2000 \"Eagle Eye\" Rear Open Sight This all-metal combat sight replaces your stock KelTec Sub-2000 plastic ghost ring. Most shooters today like to use 3rd party optics and red dots and still have their iron sights ready to go. The stock plastic ghost ring cannot be moved and often interferes with field of view when using optics. Spring loaded, the TANDEMKROSS Sub-2000 \"Eagle Eye\" rear sight upgrade allows you to switch from optic to iron sights and back again with a flick of your finger. Simple and easy to install this sight will not interfere the folding feature of your the Sub-2000. Improve your aim and your Sub-2000 today with the TANDEMKROSS \"Eagle Eye\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BDHF7VIFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FK38RD4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Rifle Scope Accessories"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B00FK8WAUK", "title": "Camelbak Products Podium Water Bottle", "description": "CamelBak Podium 21 oz. revolutionized the sport bottle by offering an innovative design that simplifies high performance hydration. The patented spill-proof, self-sealing Jet Valve allows the user to hydrate immediately without having to open or close a drinking interface and the bottle's streamlined ergonomic design offers excellent squeezability without compromising bottle grip. The large aperture of the drinking nozzle generates an exceptional water flow rate and is easy to remove for thorough cleaning. The Podium also has a lockout dial with easy to read graphics for leak-proof transport.", "text": "Camelbak Products Podium Water Bottle CamelBak Podium 21 oz. revolutionized the sport bottle by offering an innovative design that simplifies high performance hydration. The patented spill-proof, self-sealing Jet Valve allows the user to hydrate immediately without having to open or close a drinking interface and the bottle's streamlined ergonomic design offers excellent squeezability without compromising bottle grip. The large aperture of the drinking nozzle generates an exceptional water flow rate and is easy to remove for thorough cleaning. The Podium also has a lockout dial with easy to read graphics for leak-proof transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S2S15f0lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FK8WAUK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00FK8X4RS", "title": "Jarv Bluetooth 4.0 Cycling Speed and Cadence Bike Sensor for IPhone 4S, IPhone 5/5C/5S , new IPod touch and other iOS Bluetooth devices- Black", "description": "The Jarv Bluetooth 4.0 Cycling Speed and Cadence Bike Sensor is designed for the iPhone 4S, iPhone 5/5C/5S, iPod touch 5, and other iOS bluetooth devices. The bike sensor together with 3rd party iOS App turns your iPhone into a professional cycling computer. It connects wirelessly via Bluetooth Smart technology to your iOS device without the need for any adapter and delivers accurate real-time cadence and speed data. The Bluetooth Smart Bike Sensor works with most iOS fitness and sports Apps.", "text": "Jarv Bluetooth 4.0 Cycling Speed and Cadence Bike Sensor for IPhone 4S, IPhone 5/5C/5S , new IPod touch and other iOS Bluetooth devices- Black The Jarv Bluetooth 4.0 Cycling Speed and Cadence Bike Sensor is designed for the iPhone 4S, iPhone 5/5C/5S, iPod touch 5, and other iOS bluetooth devices. The bike sensor together with 3rd party iOS App turns your iPhone into a professional cycling computer. It connects wirelessly via Bluetooth Smart technology to your iOS device without the need for any adapter and delivers accurate real-time cadence and speed data. The Bluetooth Smart Bike Sensor works with most iOS fitness and sports Apps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KfhS7xVzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FK8X4RS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B00FKUKIW0", "title": "Grill Plate Bushbox XL", "description": "This extra large grill plate turns the Bushbox XL into an outdoor grill - or a balcony grill.", "text": "Grill Plate Bushbox XL This extra large grill plate turns the Bushbox XL into an outdoor grill - or a balcony grill.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rTLJCn3UL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FKUKIW0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 17.49}}
{"item_id": "B00FKUKJK6", "title": "Trivets (Set) Bushbox XL", "description": "Two additional stainless steel trivets for the Bushbox XL. Replacement for the original trivets (which come with the Bushbbox XL) or as additional trivets to be used as Trangia holders, to handle the hot Bushbox XL etc.", "text": "Trivets (Set) Bushbox XL Two additional stainless steel trivets for the Bushbox XL. Replacement for the original trivets (which come with the Bushbbox XL) or as additional trivets to be used as Trangia holders, to handle the hot Bushbox XL etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Aba0dNRRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FKUKJK6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 13.42}}
{"item_id": "B00FL67OVG", "title": "Charging Handle - Laser Engraved - PSALM 144:1", "description": "Mil-Spec Charging handle manufactured from Aircraft grade aluminum and then Type 3 hardcoat anodized. Permanently Laser engraved. The latch and spring are already installed. This Item is ready to be used in your AR style rifle and will provide a unique custom look to you rifle.", "text": "Charging Handle - Laser Engraved - PSALM 144:1 Mil-Spec Charging handle manufactured from Aircraft grade aluminum and then Type 3 hardcoat anodized. Permanently Laser engraved. The latch and spring are already installed. This Item is ready to be used in your AR style rifle and will provide a unique custom look to you rifle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KELghopJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FL67OVG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B00FL7NHXY", "title": "Trigger Knife Kit by Klecker Knives - Great for training kids on proper knife handling - Cool Colors Available like Glow In The Dark, Red, Blue, Black, Green, Pink, Purple & Orange - No Hassle Guarantee - Great Stocking Stuffer - FREE SHIPPING WITH THREE OR MORE KNIFE KITS", "description": "The Trigger Knife kit is perfect for teaching knife safety to a youngster, while also teaching them how it works.It's easy for your child to break apart the pieces and assemble it themselves but we encourage you to help them.Features & Benefits* Use this kit to help teach your child knife safety and responsible knife ownership skills.* Made from PVC plastic just like model cars and airplanes are.* All edges are rounded for safety, similar to a plastic butter knife.* Assembly is easy and comes with simple to follow instructions.* Lot's of great colors to choose from.* Mix and Match colors for a unique look or to support your favorite team!* You can even paint and decorate them further to make it all their own.Adults love them also- They make great letter openers!* Red, White & Blue for an All-American themed knife* Green & Yellow for a John Deer fan.* Blue & Yellow for the Michigan fan.* Green & White for a New York Jets fan.* Blue & White for the Dallas Cowboys fan.* Yellow, Red & Blue for the Steelers fan.* You get the idea, just combine the colors to make their team favorite.Wall-Of-Fame!- After you get your knife, come back to add your review to Amazon & post your child's photo with the knife they made to be include in our Wall-Of-Fame. Show everyone your creativity on your unique Trigger Knife! Or better yet, upload a video review right here on Amazon.Trigger Knife Kits are great because they not only give a youngster the feeling that he's just like 'Uncle Bob' with his pocket knife, it also provides an opportunity to learn some basic assembly skills and basic knife safety in the process.Select a Color, or Several Colors, and \"Add To Cart Button\" Now to get some for your child!", "text": "Trigger Knife Kit by Klecker Knives - Great for training kids on proper knife handling - Cool Colors Available like Glow In The Dark, Red, Blue, Black, Green, Pink, Purple & Orange - No Hassle Guarantee - Great Stocking Stuffer - FREE SHIPPING WITH THREE OR MORE KNIFE KITS The Trigger Knife kit is perfect for teaching knife safety to a youngster, while also teaching them how it works.It's easy for your child to break apart the pieces and assemble it themselves but we encourage you to help them.Features & Benefits* Use this kit to help teach your child knife safety and responsible knife ownership skills.* Made from PVC plastic just like model cars and airplanes are.* All edges are rounded for safety, similar to a plastic butter knife.* Assembly is easy and comes with simple to follow instructions.* Lot's of great colors to choose from.* Mix and Match colors for a unique look or to support your favorite team!* You can even paint and decorate them further to make it all their own.Adults love them also- They make great letter openers!* Red, White & Blue for an All-American themed knife* Green & Yellow for a John Deer fan.* Blue & Yellow for the Michigan fan.* Green & White for a New York Jets fan.* Blue & White for the Dallas Cowboys fan.* Yellow, Red & Blue for the Steelers fan.* You get the idea, just combine the colors to make their team favorite.Wall-Of-Fame!- After you get your knife, come back to add your review to Amazon & post your child's photo with the knife they made to be include in our Wall-Of-Fame. Show everyone your creativity on your unique Trigger Knife! Or better yet, upload a video review right here on Amazon.Trigger Knife Kits are great because they not only give a youngster the feeling that he's just like 'Uncle Bob' with his pocket knife, it also provides an opportunity to learn some basic assembly skills and basic knife safety in the process.Select a Color, or Several Colors, and \"Add To Cart Button\" Now to get some for your child!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YHx4ya-IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FL7NHXY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B00FLKSYWU", "title": "Model 10 Tactical Competition Compact Style Steel Muzzle Brake Pressure Reducer Device with Crush Washer - 5/8\"x24 TPI Threaded for .308 Rifle - 308 Break", "description": "Black oxide finish, solid precision machined construction. The AR muzzle brake will reduce recoil & climb which will improve shooting and control. The AR competition muzzle brake redirects propellant gasses and reduces recoil and flash dramatically. Wraps around your threaded barrel and threads on 5/8\"x24 pitch.", "text": "Model 10 Tactical Competition Compact Style Steel Muzzle Brake Pressure Reducer Device with Crush Washer - 5/8\"x24 TPI Threaded for .308 Rifle - 308 Break Black oxide finish, solid precision machined construction. The AR muzzle brake will reduce recoil & climb which will improve shooting and control. The AR competition muzzle brake redirects propellant gasses and reduces recoil and flash dramatically. Wraps around your threaded barrel and threads on 5/8\"x24 pitch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TnJAhSCML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FLKSYWU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Johnson Enterprises, LLC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B00FM0E9FA", "title": "Fox Outfitters Comfort Series Self Inflating Mattress - Perfect Foam Sleep Pad for Backpacking, Hiking, Camping", "description": "Self-inflating Air Mats by Fox Outfitters are carefully designed for serious campers and backpackers. Crafted on a foundation of time-tested materials and components, our self-inflating mattresses are lightweight, compressible and now softer than ever, making them a perfect travel companion. These light and versatile foam core pads are great for cold temperatures or those looking for a comfortable and lightweight self-inflating pad. We've taken outdoor living to a new level of comfort by covering our mats with a lightweight fabric that's amazingly soft and plush. Next-to-skin softness improves upon an already luxurious mattress that uses innovative die-cut foams to provide comfort and support where you need it most. Our designs incorporate premium fabrics that include an internal polyurethane coating and durable air valves for years of use. Each pad is individually inflated and tested. Whether you're out for a weekend with the family or on a solo trip through challenging terrain, our self-inflating air mats will help you stay comfortable all night.Long Dimensions: 25\" x 77\" x 2\"Regular Dimensions: 20\" x 72\" x 2\"", "text": "Fox Outfitters Comfort Series Self Inflating Mattress - Perfect Foam Sleep Pad for Backpacking, Hiking, Camping Self-inflating Air Mats by Fox Outfitters are carefully designed for serious campers and backpackers. Crafted on a foundation of time-tested materials and components, our self-inflating mattresses are lightweight, compressible and now softer than ever, making them a perfect travel companion. These light and versatile foam core pads are great for cold temperatures or those looking for a comfortable and lightweight self-inflating pad. We've taken outdoor living to a new level of comfort by covering our mats with a lightweight fabric that's amazingly soft and plush. Next-to-skin softness improves upon an already luxurious mattress that uses innovative die-cut foams to provide comfort and support where you need it most. Our designs incorporate premium fabrics that include an internal polyurethane coating and durable air valves for years of use. Each pad is individually inflated and tested. Whether you're out for a weekend with the family or on a solo trip through challenging terrain, our self-inflating air mats will help you stay comfortable all night.Long Dimensions: 25\" x 77\" x 2\"Regular Dimensions: 20\" x 72\" x 2\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UJaQzQjJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FM0E9FA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00FM0GRC8", "title": "Fox Outfitters Lightweight Series Self Inflating Mattress - Perfect Foam Sleep Pad for Backpacking, Hiking, Camping", "description": "Self-inflating Air Mats by Fox Outfitters are carefully designed for serious campers and backpackers. Crafted on a foundation of time-tested materials and components, our self-inflating mattresses are lightweight, compressible and now softer than ever, making them a perfect travel companion. These light and versatile foam core pads are great for cold temperatures or those looking for a comfortable and lightweight self-inflating pad. We've taken outdoor living to a new level of comfort by covering our mats with a lightweight fabric that's amazingly durable. This weight reduction improves upon an already portable mattress that uses innovative die-cut foams to provide comfort and support where you need it most. Our designs incorporate premium fabrics that include an internal polyurethane coating and durable air valves for years of use. Each pad is individually inflated and tested. Whether you're out for a weekend with the family or on a solo trip through challenging terrain, our self-inflating air mats will help you stay comfortable all night.Long Dimensions: 25\" x 77\" x 1.5\"Regular Dimensions: 20\" x 72\" x 1.5\"", "text": "Fox Outfitters Lightweight Series Self Inflating Mattress - Perfect Foam Sleep Pad for Backpacking, Hiking, Camping Self-inflating Air Mats by Fox Outfitters are carefully designed for serious campers and backpackers. Crafted on a foundation of time-tested materials and components, our self-inflating mattresses are lightweight, compressible and now softer than ever, making them a perfect travel companion. These light and versatile foam core pads are great for cold temperatures or those looking for a comfortable and lightweight self-inflating pad. We've taken outdoor living to a new level of comfort by covering our mats with a lightweight fabric that's amazingly durable. This weight reduction improves upon an already portable mattress that uses innovative die-cut foams to provide comfort and support where you need it most. Our designs incorporate premium fabrics that include an internal polyurethane coating and durable air valves for years of use. Each pad is individually inflated and tested. Whether you're out for a weekend with the family or on a solo trip through challenging terrain, our self-inflating air mats will help you stay comfortable all night.Long Dimensions: 25\" x 77\" x 1.5\"Regular Dimensions: 20\" x 72\" x 1.5\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31R-d5z9AML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FM0GRC8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00FM7R1WG", "title": "ZTE Valet Android Prepaid Phone (TracFone)", "description": "With a 3.5\" touch screen that lets you navigate features with ease, this TRACFONE ZTE Valet Z665C no-contract cell phone helps you stay connected and productive on the go. A 3.0MP camera allows you to capture and share images with family and friends.", "text": "ZTE Valet Android Prepaid Phone (TracFone) With a 3.5\" touch screen that lets you navigate features with ease, this TRACFONE ZTE Valet Z665C no-contract cell phone helps you stay connected and productive on the go. A 3.0MP camera allows you to capture and share images with family and friends.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q-dYdR-KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FM7R1WG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ZTE", "categories": [["Cell Phones & Accessories", "Cell Phones", "No-Contract Cell Phones", "Phones"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Cell Phone Accessories"]], "price": 55.98}}
{"item_id": "B00FM8GE1E", "title": "B's Dry Fire Snap Caps (TM) - Dummy 12 & 20 Gauge Training Rounds", "description": "B's Dry Fire Snap Caps are the best looking, and the best value in Snap Caps, period! Snap Caps are the best way to safely train you and your loved ones in the safe operation of your 12 gauge. The repeated \"exercising\" you get by practicing perfect loading form helps to develop \"muscle memory\". This is key in not only consistently handling your firearm in the proper manner, but also trains you to be able to react properly in a self defense situation. Each cap is carefully hand assembled in the USA by me, B. Since you are purchasing from an individual instead of a large company, quality and attention to detail in each cap is my number one priority. These caps are weighted to feel exactly like real shells, but are differentiated by their bright white \"primer\". They are also likely the most durable snap cap you will find, since they aren't made of brittle plastic that will eventually (or rather quickly) chip and crack. They are not spray painted, so they won't \"flake\" into your firearm like other brands. Cleaning them is easy. Just use a paper towel and a little rubbing alcohol - good as new! Caution should be exercised in the choosing of your color. Never, ever purchase snap caps that are the same color as your real ammunition!", "text": "B's Dry Fire Snap Caps (TM) - Dummy 12 & 20 Gauge Training Rounds B's Dry Fire Snap Caps are the best looking, and the best value in Snap Caps, period! Snap Caps are the best way to safely train you and your loved ones in the safe operation of your 12 gauge. The repeated \"exercising\" you get by practicing perfect loading form helps to develop \"muscle memory\". This is key in not only consistently handling your firearm in the proper manner, but also trains you to be able to react properly in a self defense situation. Each cap is carefully hand assembled in the USA by me, B. Since you are purchasing from an individual instead of a large company, quality and attention to detail in each cap is my number one priority. These caps are weighted to feel exactly like real shells, but are differentiated by their bright white \"primer\". They are also likely the most durable snap cap you will find, since they aren't made of brittle plastic that will eventually (or rather quickly) chip and crack. They are not spray painted, so they won't \"flake\" into your firearm like other brands. Cleaning them is easy. Just use a paper towel and a little rubbing alcohol - good as new! Caution should be exercised in the choosing of your color. Never, ever purchase snap caps that are the same color as your real ammunition!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JL73sYyiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FM8GE1E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 37.99}}
