{"item_id": "B00FNQUCHM", "title": "Kamagon Exercise Ball", "description": "THE NEXT STEP IN THE EVOLUTION OF FITNESS Intensify your next workout using the Kamagon Ball's patented Hydro-Inertia technology. The use of fluid resistance wakes up more muscle fibers than traditional, static weight training using the same amount of resistance. The Kamagon Ball is a unique core stability product that bridges a necessary gap in the functional training market. Fill the Kamagon Ball with water to adjust the weight and create a \"\"hydro-inertia\"\" that uses a greater number of muscle fibers when performing basic to advanced exercises. Water lines imprinted on the ball allow for accurate water measurement. Use the Kamagon Ball for full body workouts engaging a full range of motion exercises. The Kamagon Ball increases strength and explosive power, improves athletic performance and overall fitness, helps promote rehabilitation and prevent injury and is ideal for all ages and skill level. It's an easy to use, safe, and fun way to improve your overall body strength and fitness. The 9” model holds up to 13 lbs. of water and includes the Kamagon Total Body Challenge Workout DVD and Kamagon Workout Guide. The 14” model holds up to 45 lbs. of water and includes the Kamagon Workout DVD.", "text": "Kamagon Exercise Ball THE NEXT STEP IN THE EVOLUTION OF FITNESS Intensify your next workout using the Kamagon Ball's patented Hydro-Inertia technology. The use of fluid resistance wakes up more muscle fibers than traditional, static weight training using the same amount of resistance. The Kamagon Ball is a unique core stability product that bridges a necessary gap in the functional training market. Fill the Kamagon Ball with water to adjust the weight and create a \"\"hydro-inertia\"\" that uses a greater number of muscle fibers when performing basic to advanced exercises. Water lines imprinted on the ball allow for accurate water measurement. Use the Kamagon Ball for full body workouts engaging a full range of motion exercises. The Kamagon Ball increases strength and explosive power, improves athletic performance and overall fitness, helps promote rehabilitation and prevent injury and is ideal for all ages and skill level. It's an easy to use, safe, and fun way to improve your overall body strength and fitness. The 9” model holds up to 13 lbs. of water and includes the Kamagon Total Body Challenge Workout DVD and Kamagon Workout Guide. The 14” model holds up to 45 lbs. of water and includes the Kamagon Workout DVD.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MxMbP5izL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FNQUCHM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00FNY73X0", "title": "Pump Me Up! Bike Pump - Premium Portable Mini Bike Pump With Hidden Flexible Hose - Never Damage Another Tire Valve - Aluminum CNC Construction - Presta And Schrader Compatible - 130 PSI High Pressure Capacity Bike Pump - For Mountain, Road Or BXM Bikes - Lightweight & Extremely Tough - Bike Frame Mounting Kit Included - The Best No Risk - No Questions Asked - Lifetime Warranty & Money Back Guarantee", "description": "Portable, Strong and Guaranteed for Life!Do you need a bike pump that is powerful enough to give you the tire pressure you need but compact enough to take with you for when you need it the most?Then this is exactly the pump you've been looking for!The premium quality professional Pump Me Up! Bike Pump easily gives you all the pressure you need. It's compact enough to attach to your bike frame with the included frame mount kit or in a bike bag so you can take it anywhere with ease.Why Choose The Pump Me Up! Bike Pump? Here's why:- Superior quality aluminum alloy construction and computer controlled manufacturing process (CNC) gives you exceptional toughness, durability and precision. No plastic parts susceptible to breakage.- Super simple to use Presta and Schrader tire valve hose connector so you can use it on any bike tire. Quickly & effortlessly switch between either tire valve types.- The attached Hidden Flexible Hose and Screw On Valve Connector means your Tire Valve Stem is completely protected during operation. Unlike other models there is no risk of damage to your valve stem due to uncontrolled torque so don't have to worry about damaging your tire.- Many compact bicycle pumps can't provide more than 60 PSI. This model can deliver up to 130 PSI which means it's great for emergency tire repair or routine topping up to get that smoother, faster, more efficient ride.- Easily attaches to your bike frame (attachment included).This Bike Pump easily and effortlessly handles any inflation jobs you have. Pump up a bike tire or your favorite ball, this compact bike pump can handle them all! Its needle attachment even lets you inflate sports balls!Like every Geared2U Bike Pump, you're protected with a 100% no risk, no questions asked lifetime warranty.Click The \"Add To Cart Button\" NOW To Get The Ultimate Compact Bike Pump!", "text": "Pump Me Up! Bike Pump - Premium Portable Mini Bike Pump With Hidden Flexible Hose - Never Damage Another Tire Valve - Aluminum CNC Construction - Presta And Schrader Compatible - 130 PSI High Pressure Capacity Bike Pump - For Mountain, Road Or BXM Bikes - Lightweight & Extremely Tough - Bike Frame Mounting Kit Included - The Best No Risk - No Questions Asked - Lifetime Warranty & Money Back Guarantee Portable, Strong and Guaranteed for Life!Do you need a bike pump that is powerful enough to give you the tire pressure you need but compact enough to take with you for when you need it the most?Then this is exactly the pump you've been looking for!The premium quality professional Pump Me Up! Bike Pump easily gives you all the pressure you need. It's compact enough to attach to your bike frame with the included frame mount kit or in a bike bag so you can take it anywhere with ease.Why Choose The Pump Me Up! Bike Pump? Here's why:- Superior quality aluminum alloy construction and computer controlled manufacturing process (CNC) gives you exceptional toughness, durability and precision. No plastic parts susceptible to breakage.- Super simple to use Presta and Schrader tire valve hose connector so you can use it on any bike tire. Quickly & effortlessly switch between either tire valve types.- The attached Hidden Flexible Hose and Screw On Valve Connector means your Tire Valve Stem is completely protected during operation. Unlike other models there is no risk of damage to your valve stem due to uncontrolled torque so don't have to worry about damaging your tire.- Many compact bicycle pumps can't provide more than 60 PSI. This model can deliver up to 130 PSI which means it's great for emergency tire repair or routine topping up to get that smoother, faster, more efficient ride.- Easily attaches to your bike frame (attachment included).This Bike Pump easily and effortlessly handles any inflation jobs you have. Pump up a bike tire or your favorite ball, this compact bike pump can handle them all! Its needle attachment even lets you inflate sports balls!Like every Geared2U Bike Pump, you're protected with a 100% no risk, no questions asked lifetime warranty.Click The \"Add To Cart Button\" NOW To Get The Ultimate Compact Bike Pump!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B1q-j8xbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FNY73X0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 35.49}}
{"item_id": "B00FO9U43U", "title": "BalanceFrom GoYoga All-Purpose 1/2-Inch Extra Thick High Density Anti-Tear Exercise Yoga Mat with Carrying Strap (Blue)", "description": "Overview:With double sided non-slip surfaces, BalanceFrom All-Purpose Premium exercise yoga mat comes with an excellent slip resistant advantage to prevent injuries. Exceptional resilience allow you to keep your balance during any exercise style. moisture resistant technology makes the mat to be easily washed with soap and water. Easy strapping and light weight feature are added to this mat for easy transport and storage. BalanceFrom All-Purpose Premium exercise yoga mat is manufactured and sold exclusively by BalanceFrom Amazon store.Dimensions:71\" long 24\" wide ensures comfort for people of all shapes and sizes. With high density foam material, the 1/2'' thick premium mat comfortably cushions spine, hips, knees and elbows on hard floors.Warranty:All genuine BalanceFrom products come with a 2-year warranty and 100% BalanceFrom Satisfaction Guarantee to make your purchase worry free. Simply contact us or your vendor if you have any questions. Customer satisfaction is our highest priority.AT A GLANCE:-1/2-inch extra thick-Excellent non-slip traction and cushion-A free carrying strap is included-Light weight and portable-2-year warranty", "text": "BalanceFrom GoYoga All-Purpose 1/2-Inch Extra Thick High Density Anti-Tear Exercise Yoga Mat with Carrying Strap (Blue) Overview:With double sided non-slip surfaces, BalanceFrom All-Purpose Premium exercise yoga mat comes with an excellent slip resistant advantage to prevent injuries. Exceptional resilience allow you to keep your balance during any exercise style. moisture resistant technology makes the mat to be easily washed with soap and water. Easy strapping and light weight feature are added to this mat for easy transport and storage. BalanceFrom All-Purpose Premium exercise yoga mat is manufactured and sold exclusively by BalanceFrom Amazon store.Dimensions:71\" long 24\" wide ensures comfort for people of all shapes and sizes. With high density foam material, the 1/2'' thick premium mat comfortably cushions spine, hips, knees and elbows on hard floors.Warranty:All genuine BalanceFrom products come with a 2-year warranty and 100% BalanceFrom Satisfaction Guarantee to make your purchase worry free. Simply contact us or your vendor if you have any questions. Customer satisfaction is our highest priority.AT A GLANCE:-1/2-inch extra thick-Excellent non-slip traction and cushion-A free carrying strap is included-Light weight and portable-2-year warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ynBIZVJgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FO9U43U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00FOPO0AW", "title": "Bushbox Outdoor Pocket Stove", "description": "Bushbox's famous multi-fuel pocket stove. Can be used with wood, other organic material, a standard Trangia burner or Esbit. Comes with two trivets for any pot size. Can also be used as a windshield/pot support for other burners. Very small and lightweight, fits into any pocket. Comes with an ash pan for soil protection. Folds flat, fits into any pocket. Made in Germany from 100% stainless steel.", "text": "Bushbox Outdoor Pocket Stove Bushbox's famous multi-fuel pocket stove. Can be used with wood, other organic material, a standard Trangia burner or Esbit. Comes with two trivets for any pot size. Can also be used as a windshield/pot support for other burners. Very small and lightweight, fits into any pocket. Comes with an ash pan for soil protection. Folds flat, fits into any pocket. Made in Germany from 100% stainless steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BmNGv0S9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FOPO0AW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 29.9}}
{"item_id": "B00FP5SHGO", "title": "VIPERTEK VTS-880 - 15,000,000 V Mini Stun Gun - Rechargeable with LED Flashlight (Black)", "description": "The VIPERTEK VTS-880 mini stun gun really packs a punch! Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound, an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. If the sight and sound doesn't stop him, a jolt from this stun gun certainly will bring an attacker down! When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. Due to restrictions in some states, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, Connecticut, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County,IA VIPERTEK is a registered US trademark.", "text": "VIPERTEK VTS-880 - 15,000,000 V Mini Stun Gun - Rechargeable with LED Flashlight (Black) The VIPERTEK VTS-880 mini stun gun really packs a punch! Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound, an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. If the sight and sound doesn't stop him, a jolt from this stun gun certainly will bring an attacker down! When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. Due to restrictions in some states, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, Connecticut, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County,IA VIPERTEK is a registered US trademark.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ypaeqVfaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FP5SHGO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vipertek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 12.99}}
