{"item_id": "B00FPGLSOQ", "title": "Giro Revel Cycling Helmet", "description": "The Revel's confident style and superior ventilation combine with a compact design that complements nearly any ride. Top-level features like In-Mold construction coupled with the ease and comfort of our Acu Dial™ fit system mean it's equipped to ride it all, from downtown streets to twisting climbs to singletrack trails.Universal Fit Size: 21.25\"-24\"/54-61cm.", "text": "Giro Revel Cycling Helmet The Revel's confident style and superior ventilation combine with a compact design that complements nearly any ride. Top-level features like In-Mold construction coupled with the ease and comfort of our Acu Dial™ fit system mean it's equipped to ride it all, from downtown streets to twisting climbs to singletrack trails.Universal Fit Size: 21.25\"-24\"/54-61cm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uO22c90yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FPGLSOQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Giro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]], "price": 44.99}}
{"item_id": "B00FPOR5KO", "title": "Yoga Mat - 72\" Extra Long, Thick, Non Slip Mat for Yoga and Exercise - High Density, More Cushion for Added Comfort - Cool, Hot, Stylish, Best Custom Design - Perfect for Workouts and Yoga At Home or for Travel - 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed", "description": "-The Secret to a More Enjoyable Workout-Why Choose our Yoga Mat?We take pride in saying we provide you with the most high quality and comfortable mat for your yoga and exercise needs. This *Extra Long* mat gives you plenty of room to stretch out during your routine without having to worry about running out of space. The Full \" thickness of the mat will keep your knees from getting sore during the workout.• Extra Thick 6mm• Extra Long 72\"• Unique Textured Non-Slip Surface• Eco-friendly, Recyclable, Biodegradable• Extremely Durable• Easy to roll up and light to carryOther yoga mats claim to be extra thick when they are only half the thickness of our full 6mm thick mat. You can be certain that you will be comfortable while exercising when you buy this mat.Our mat is perfect for exercise at home, in the studio, or if you are traveling. It has a custom printed sunrise design to help you stand out from those boring solid color yoga mats. Our mat is made only of the highest quality environmentally friendly neoprene rubber that is long lasting and easy to clean.• Vibrant and Elegant Green Color• High Quality ECO PVC• High Density Material• WaterproofWe are so certain you will love this mat that it is backed by a 7 day 100% satisfaction guarantee!*Limited Time Pricing* - Buy Now to Save!Click the Add to Cart Button Now to Improve the Quality of Your Workouts!", "text": "Yoga Mat - 72\" Extra Long, Thick, Non Slip Mat for Yoga and Exercise - High Density, More Cushion for Added Comfort - Cool, Hot, Stylish, Best Custom Design - Perfect for Workouts and Yoga At Home or for Travel - 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed -The Secret to a More Enjoyable Workout-Why Choose our Yoga Mat?We take pride in saying we provide you with the most high quality and comfortable mat for your yoga and exercise needs. This *Extra Long* mat gives you plenty of room to stretch out during your routine without having to worry about running out of space. The Full \" thickness of the mat will keep your knees from getting sore during the workout.• Extra Thick 6mm• Extra Long 72\"• Unique Textured Non-Slip Surface• Eco-friendly, Recyclable, Biodegradable• Extremely Durable• Easy to roll up and light to carryOther yoga mats claim to be extra thick when they are only half the thickness of our full 6mm thick mat. You can be certain that you will be comfortable while exercising when you buy this mat.Our mat is perfect for exercise at home, in the studio, or if you are traveling. It has a custom printed sunrise design to help you stand out from those boring solid color yoga mats. Our mat is made only of the highest quality environmentally friendly neoprene rubber that is long lasting and easy to clean.• Vibrant and Elegant Green Color• High Quality ECO PVC• High Density Material• WaterproofWe are so certain you will love this mat that it is backed by a 7 day 100% satisfaction guarantee!*Limited Time Pricing* - Buy Now to Save!Click the Add to Cart Button Now to Improve the Quality of Your Workouts!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412cBsDCpeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FPOR5KO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]], "price": 31.99}}
{"item_id": "B00FQ4PB4U", "title": "Ispeed Silicone Long Hair Swim Cap", "description": "IspeedIspeed was born in 2013 on the beautiful harbor in Boston, MA, USA. As the most energetic brand, Ispeed is committed to provide the most innovative and price-friendly sport goods. Ispeed is about the intelligent way of speed. Technological quality is the priority of the company's products. Exclusively presented on Amazon, Ispeed is offering fashion swimming goggles, swim training gloves and snorkels.Covering the ears, it can prevent the ear vibration and with ladies' long hair wrapped in the swimming caps, it effectively protects hair and reduces the damage to the hair caused by water.", "text": "Ispeed Silicone Long Hair Swim Cap IspeedIspeed was born in 2013 on the beautiful harbor in Boston, MA, USA. As the most energetic brand, Ispeed is committed to provide the most innovative and price-friendly sport goods. Ispeed is about the intelligent way of speed. Technological quality is the priority of the company's products. Exclusively presented on Amazon, Ispeed is offering fashion swimming goggles, swim training gloves and snorkels.Covering the ears, it can prevent the ear vibration and with ladies' long hair wrapped in the swimming caps, it effectively protects hair and reduces the damage to the hair caused by water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GcHW4%2BjnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FQ4PB4U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]], "price": 12.99}}
