{"item_id": "B00FSXE9KG", "title": "Browning Black Label Shock N' Awe Tomahawk", "description": "Browning Shock 'n' Awe Tomahawk, a combat axe beast! From the Browning Black Label Tactical Blades line, the Shock 'n' Awe Tomahawk, rugged and fierce. Use it for crashing your way out of a downed helicopter... or just splitting kindling at your campsite. It's finely forged and intimidating as heck! Features: Blade is 2 3/4; \"l., the other end a penetration spike Forged from sword-grade 1055 stainless steel with Black powder-coat finish; Handle with spike pommel. Wrapped with Black nylon paracord; Blade-tech polymer sheath with Tek-Lok belt clip.; Measures 10 1/2; \"l. overall, weighs 1 lb., 2 ozs. A combat-worthy tool... get your hands on it today! Browning Shock 'n' Awe Tomahawk WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Axes. Axes cannot be shipped to D.C.; MA; Miami-Dade and Sarasota counties, FL; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Axes.", "text": "Browning Black Label Shock N' Awe Tomahawk Browning Shock 'n' Awe Tomahawk, a combat axe beast! From the Browning Black Label Tactical Blades line, the Shock 'n' Awe Tomahawk, rugged and fierce. Use it for crashing your way out of a downed helicopter... or just splitting kindling at your campsite. It's finely forged and intimidating as heck! Features: Blade is 2 3/4; \"l., the other end a penetration spike Forged from sword-grade 1055 stainless steel with Black powder-coat finish; Handle with spike pommel. Wrapped with Black nylon paracord; Blade-tech polymer sheath with Tek-Lok belt clip.; Measures 10 1/2; \"l. overall, weighs 1 lb., 2 ozs. A combat-worthy tool... get your hands on it today! Browning Shock 'n' Awe Tomahawk WARNING: You must be 18 or older to purchase Axes. Axes cannot be shipped to D.C.; MA; Miami-Dade and Sarasota counties, FL; Canada or Puerto Rico. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering Axes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ptqAnauNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FSXE9KG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BROWNING BLACK LABEL", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Axes"]], "price": 60.39}}
{"item_id": "B00FTHGZU8", "title": "BV Bicycle 5-LED Headlight and Taillight", "description": "The BV 5 LED Safety Light Set mounts quickly onto most bicycle handlebars and seat posts (rubber sizing shims are included). Great for places where visibility and safety are a concern. Visible to motorists over 1500 feet away. 3 LEDs on each light face forward and 2 LEDs face out to the sides, increasing peripheral lighting. The taillight is angle adjustable. Each light has a quick-release system that makes it easy to remove from its mount when your bike is locked. Prevent theft by taking them with you. Clips also attach to gear bags, allowing flexible placement. 3 modes (steady, blinking and fast blinking) help to alert drivers of your presence on dark roads. Up to 65 hours. (Batteries not included) Note: When installing the light onto the mount, please ensure that there is a click indicating that the locking tab is in place. Please contact us at 877-985-5888 if further instruction is needed. Specifications for each light 3 modes: Steady, blinking, fast blinking (20 Lumens) Run Time: 30 hours steady, 65 hours flashing (Tested using standard alkaline batteries) Batteries: 2 x AAA for each light (not included) Water resistant: Yes Mount type: Toolless Headlight (+ quick-release clip), Bracket Taillight (+ quick-release clip) Dimensions (without mount): 2.75\" x 1.5\" x 1.2\" (7 cm x 3.8 cm x 3 cm) Weight (with mount): 1.7 oz (48 g).", "text": "BV Bicycle 5-LED Headlight and Taillight The BV 5 LED Safety Light Set mounts quickly onto most bicycle handlebars and seat posts (rubber sizing shims are included). Great for places where visibility and safety are a concern. Visible to motorists over 1500 feet away. 3 LEDs on each light face forward and 2 LEDs face out to the sides, increasing peripheral lighting. The taillight is angle adjustable. Each light has a quick-release system that makes it easy to remove from its mount when your bike is locked. Prevent theft by taking them with you. Clips also attach to gear bags, allowing flexible placement. 3 modes (steady, blinking and fast blinking) help to alert drivers of your presence on dark roads. Up to 65 hours. (Batteries not included) Note: When installing the light onto the mount, please ensure that there is a click indicating that the locking tab is in place. Please contact us at 877-985-5888 if further instruction is needed. Specifications for each light 3 modes: Steady, blinking, fast blinking (20 Lumens) Run Time: 30 hours steady, 65 hours flashing (Tested using standard alkaline batteries) Batteries: 2 x AAA for each light (not included) Water resistant: Yes Mount type: Toolless Headlight (+ quick-release clip), Bracket Taillight (+ quick-release clip) Dimensions (without mount): 2.75\" x 1.5\" x 1.2\" (7 cm x 3.8 cm x 3 cm) Weight (with mount): 1.7 oz (48 g).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pj0NSn58L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FTHGZU8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BV", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B00FTU1QT0", "title": "Kineti-Tech Muzzle Brake with Sound Redirect 1/2 X 28 brake with 13/16 X 16 threaded Sleeve", "description": "2 Piece Muzzle Brake with Sound Director. Threaded 1/2\" X 28 with 13/16\" X 16 Sleeve This 2 piece design provides a great recoil reduction as well as A sound director. Redirects sound forward to greatly reduce the \"at ear point blast\" compared to with the sleeve removed. Design to redirect propellant gases with the effect of countering flash recoil and unwanted rising of the barrel during firing. Quality made here in the USA of A311 StressProof Steel. Item is 2.25\" and really sets off the look of the gun....very nice. Many optional accessories available from Kineti-Tech.", "text": "Kineti-Tech Muzzle Brake with Sound Redirect 1/2 X 28 brake with 13/16 X 16 threaded Sleeve 2 Piece Muzzle Brake with Sound Director. Threaded 1/2\" X 28 with 13/16\" X 16 Sleeve This 2 piece design provides a great recoil reduction as well as A sound director. Redirects sound forward to greatly reduce the \"at ear point blast\" compared to with the sleeve removed. Design to redirect propellant gases with the effect of countering flash recoil and unwanted rising of the barrel during firing. Quality made here in the USA of A311 StressProof Steel. Item is 2.25\" and really sets off the look of the gun....very nice. Many optional accessories available from Kineti-Tech.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51TKxvfwvzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FTU1QT0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 78.95}}
