{"item_id": "B00FUSLI4E", "title": "AR-15 BLK Pin Upper & Lower Receiver Vise Block Combo Gunsmith Tool", "description": "Great Combo pack for the Gunsmith that demands quality & value! Made in the USA Craftsmanship can't be beat by the cheap imports... Build a new rifle or tear down your old one, this kit is the basis for a solid AR15 build or modification.", "text": "AR-15 BLK Pin Upper & Lower Receiver Vise Block Combo Gunsmith Tool Great Combo pack for the Gunsmith that demands quality & value! Made in the USA Craftsmanship can't be beat by the cheap imports... Build a new rifle or tear down your old one, this kit is the basis for a solid AR15 build or modification.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X6fL6sa0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FUSLI4E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 25.99}}
