{"item_id": "B00FW2F2RM", "title": "Snappy's Snap Caps 12 Gauge High Brass 4 Pack Training Dummy Rounds 2-3/4\"", "description": "Snappy's Snap Caps are the ORIGINAL snap caps that feature ultra realistic weight and feel for superior training simulations. They are hand assembled in the USA with the utmost care and are extremely durable compared to other major competitive brands. These snap caps will never chip or flake inside your barrel after repeated usage. Identical weight and feel to a real 12 gauge shotgun round. The #1 REALISTIC Action Proving Dummy Rounds on the market! NOTE: It is highly recommended to use these Snap Caps on carpeted floors, grass or any soft surface. Ejecting the shells onto any hard surface will prematurely wear out the shells.", "text": "Snappy's Snap Caps 12 Gauge High Brass 4 Pack Training Dummy Rounds 2-3/4\" Snappy's Snap Caps are the ORIGINAL snap caps that feature ultra realistic weight and feel for superior training simulations. They are hand assembled in the USA with the utmost care and are extremely durable compared to other major competitive brands. These snap caps will never chip or flake inside your barrel after repeated usage. Identical weight and feel to a real 12 gauge shotgun round. The #1 REALISTIC Action Proving Dummy Rounds on the market! NOTE: It is highly recommended to use these Snap Caps on carpeted floors, grass or any soft surface. Ejecting the shells onto any hard surface will prematurely wear out the shells.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41maS53JafL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FW2F2RM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]]}}
