s.A premium product, Crown Gear weightlifting gloves are easy to remove and comfortable to wear. Durable and practical, they allow you to work beyond your natural grip limit, so you can work out the muscle groups you're targeting, not just your hands. Leather panels linked with stretch material give a close fit while allowing ease of movement so these gloves will be comfortable and effective throughout your workout.The Most Technically Innovative Workout gloves Ever Made:-Ultimate Grip on the Bar - Articulated Rubber Grip Design for Natural, Flexed Hand Position-Comfort & Control - Rubber Padding Provides Extreme Comfort, Better Traction, Vibration Reduction and Sturdiness- Extra Long Wrist Wrap Integrates the Entire Hand for Maximum Stability and Wrist Support During Heavy Weight Exercises- \"Pull-Off\" Overlap System for Easy Removal-Soft Genuine Leather and Longer Finger Coverage that Prevent Calluses and Blisters on Hands- FREE BONUS - \"Crown Gear Torque Grip Pads\" enable you to achieve the strongest, moisture-free, and most slip-proof grip1 Year Hassle Free Replacement GuaranteeDiscount Promotion Ends Soon, Click On the \"Add to Cart\" Button On Top of the Page to Own Yours Now!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51j0vBbRhLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FWJ1TXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Gymnastics", "Accessories", "Hand Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00FWJG3M8", "title": "Wailea Fitness Premium Resistance Exercise Bands / Exercise Loops Pack of 3", "description": "Now is the time to get started.Burn calories! Burn that fat!You have no idea how this will change the way you look. Only you can decide to change your life. The ultimate choice in toning your body - arms, legs, hips, abs -Wailea Fitness Premium Resistance Exercise Bands. Get the body you've always raved out! The best thing about this? You can exercise at your home or in the office or anywhere convenient. No need to waste your time driving to the gym or invest on gym equipment.Wailea Resistance Bands comes in pack of 3 - lime green, navy blue, classic redInvest 15 minutes of each day and in no time, you'll get heads turning to see your remarkable figure.You must act now! Stop procrastinating and get your fitness bands.", "text": "Wailea Fitness Premium Resistance Exercise Bands / Exercise Loops Pack of 3 Now is the time to get started.Burn calories! Burn that fat!You have no idea how this will change the way you look. Only you can decide to change your life. The ultimate choice in toning your body - arms, legs, hips, abs -Wailea Fitness Premium Resistance Exercise Bands. Get the body you've always raved out! The best thing about this? You can exercise at your home or in the office or anywhere convenient. No need to waste your time driving to the gym or invest on gym equipment.Wailea Resistance Bands comes in pack of 3 - lime green, navy blue, classic redInvest 15 minutes of each day and in no time, you'll get heads turning to see your remarkable figure.You must act now! Stop procrastinating and get your fitness bands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qmmZaYd8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FWJG3M8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 9.99}}
