{"item_id": "B00FX8ESAW", "title": "Black High Density Foam Roller + Deluxe Drawstring Carrying Case - Extra Firm Roller - 6\" X 36\" Full Round", "description": "Pain Relief and Muscle Soft Tissue Massage with this High Density Foam RollerThis high quality foam roller can give you the relief that you need. It has been proven that foam rollers can stretch and relax your muscles. This is true for everyday pain and strain for your muscles or after your workout. If you are not using a foam roller, you are welcoming unnecessary pain.Why Foam Rolling?Foam rolling is a self-myofascial release (SMR) technique that is used by athletes and physical therapists to inhibit overactive muscles. This form of stretching utilizes the concept of autogenic inhibition to improve soft tissue extensibility, thus relaxing the muscle and allowing the activation of the antagonist muscle.There is a reason why physical therapy clinics and gyms around the United States use our rollers. Being made right here in the USA, we only work with the best material and the best doctors to create a product that is perfect for home and gym use.The high density roller can put extra pressure on the muscles that need it so that you can relax any muscle in your body.Our OfferWhile supplies last, we are including a beautiful and functional carrying case with this purchase. If this message is still here, then we still have a few available. This item is for sale by us on another product listing, but we thought it would be a great addition for this purchase.Hurry and add this product to the cart so that you can get this case with your purchaseIncluded- (1) 6\" X 36\" High Density Foam Roller- (1) Drawstring Carrying Case", "text": "Black High Density Foam Roller + Deluxe Drawstring Carrying Case - Extra Firm Roller - 6\" X 36\" Full Round Pain Relief and Muscle Soft Tissue Massage with this High Density Foam RollerThis high quality foam roller can give you the relief that you need. It has been proven that foam rollers can stretch and relax your muscles. This is true for everyday pain and strain for your muscles or after your workout. If you are not using a foam roller, you are welcoming unnecessary pain.Why Foam Rolling?Foam rolling is a self-myofascial release (SMR) technique that is used by athletes and physical therapists to inhibit overactive muscles. This form of stretching utilizes the concept of autogenic inhibition to improve soft tissue extensibility, thus relaxing the muscle and allowing the activation of the antagonist muscle.There is a reason why physical therapy clinics and gyms around the United States use our rollers. Being made right here in the USA, we only work with the best material and the best doctors to create a product that is perfect for home and gym use.The high density roller can put extra pressure on the muscles that need it so that you can relax any muscle in your body.Our OfferWhile supplies last, we are including a beautiful and functional carrying case with this purchase. If this message is still here, then we still have a few available. This item is for sale by us on another product listing, but we thought it would be a great addition for this purchase.Hurry and add this product to the cart so that you can get this case with your purchaseIncluded- (1) 6\" X 36\" High Density Foam Roller- (1) Drawstring Carrying Case", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51H%2B-qQp-nL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FX8ESAW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00FXJ90TU", "title": "ARMSTAC® G4 Stubby Vertical Forward Rubberized Grip (Black) with ARMSTAC® Lifetime Warranty", "description": "A vertical forward grip is a vertical grip that is designed to attach to a firearm for the forward hand (or \"off hand\"). These aid in the maneuverability of the firearm, since the natural angle of a persons outstretched hand is more oriented to grasping objects at a vertical angle, rather than a horizontal one perpendicular to the body. This specially designed \"stubby\" grip allows for the benefits of using a vertical grip while reducing its size and space. A quality constructed item complete with a rubberized finish for improved tactile grip and low light reflection. The serrated bottom end cap is made up of a lightweight aluminium. No screws or nuts required, simply unscrew the bottom end cap to lower the locking peg, slide the grip over the rails to a desired positions and screw the bottom end cap to raise the locking peg to ensure a secure fit.", "text": "ARMSTAC® G4 Stubby Vertical Forward Rubberized Grip (Black) with ARMSTAC® Lifetime Warranty A vertical forward grip is a vertical grip that is designed to attach to a firearm for the forward hand (or \"off hand\"). These aid in the maneuverability of the firearm, since the natural angle of a persons outstretched hand is more oriented to grasping objects at a vertical angle, rather than a horizontal one perpendicular to the body. This specially designed \"stubby\" grip allows for the benefits of using a vertical grip while reducing its size and space. A quality constructed item complete with a rubberized finish for improved tactile grip and low light reflection. The serrated bottom end cap is made up of a lightweight aluminium. No screws or nuts required, simply unscrew the bottom end cap to lower the locking peg, slide the grip over the rails to a desired positions and screw the bottom end cap to raise the locking peg to ensure a secure fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317UhG-MpJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FXJ90TU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B00FYX4TW8", "title": "BioLite KettlePot", "description": "The BioLite KettlePot allows you to bring a single piece of cookware without sacrificing functionality or space. Whether you are making a pot of coffee to start your day or cooking a meal for four at the end of a long hike, the BioLite KettlePot is a true grab-and-go system.2-in-1 Functionality: Why add bulk when you can bundle? Safely pour hot liquids or cook a full meal, all using the same device. It is easy to use and safe to handle.Featherlite & Foodsafe: Keep the weight down with our ultra-thin stainless steel. It is more durable than anodized aluminum and easier to clean without worry of scratching off material.Carries your BioLite Wood Burning Campstove: The KettlePot becomes an instant hard carrying case minimizing volume in your pack while protecting your BioLite Wood Burning CampStove. (campstove sold separately)Includes: Stainless Steel Pot, Kettle Lid, Bowl, Stuff Sack", "text": "BioLite KettlePot The BioLite KettlePot allows you to bring a single piece of cookware without sacrificing functionality or space. Whether you are making a pot of coffee to start your day or cooking a meal for four at the end of a long hike, the BioLite KettlePot is a true grab-and-go system.2-in-1 Functionality: Why add bulk when you can bundle? Safely pour hot liquids or cook a full meal, all using the same device. It is easy to use and safe to handle.Featherlite & Foodsafe: Keep the weight down with our ultra-thin stainless steel. It is more durable than anodized aluminum and easier to clean without worry of scratching off material.Carries your BioLite Wood Burning Campstove: The KettlePot becomes an instant hard carrying case minimizing volume in your pack while protecting your BioLite Wood Burning CampStove. (campstove sold separately)Includes: Stainless Steel Pot, Kettle Lid, Bowl, Stuff Sack", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yI6Z1SMaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FYX4TW8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BioLite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B00FZ5BJ8W", "title": "K-Edge Stem Mount for Garmin Computer - Adjustable or Fixed", "description": "Your Garmin cost a small fortune and you take it on all your rides. But, how many times do you cringe when you hit a bump or pothole? Those little rubber o-rings and plastic mounts never seem to be quite strong enough. And, you want to take it on all your mountain bike rides to record every detail of your life on a bike. The K-Edge Stem Mount - adjustable for the Garmin Computer makes that pesky plastic mount obsolete and secures your Garmin for any road or trail. Unlike K-Edge's handlebar mounts, the K-Edge Stem Mount fits above the stem directly on the steerer tube. It fits a standard 1 1/8-inch steerer tube. It replaces a standard 5mm spacer, and it locked securely in place by the top compression cap. This model features an adjustable tilt and is best suited for stems that have a 20degree rise or drop. The mount works well with larger Garmin devices such as the 510 or 810. It was initially designed with mountain biking in mind, but is equally ideal for triathlon and other cycling disciplines where hydration systems, maps, or bags may take up handlebar space. Designed from CNC machined aluminum platform, it also features an injection molded polymer interface with the recognizable locking point and the distinctive \"click\" when the Garmin is securely engaged. It is compatible with all quarter-turn Garmin Edge computer and may be oriented for the Forerunner 310XT. It is not compatible with the 901Xt however. The K-Edge Stem Mount - adjustable for Garmin Computers is available in Red, Gunmetal, and Black.", "text": "K-Edge Stem Mount for Garmin Computer - Adjustable or Fixed Your Garmin cost a small fortune and you take it on all your rides. But, how many times do you cringe when you hit a bump or pothole? Those little rubber o-rings and plastic mounts never seem to be quite strong enough. And, you want to take it on all your mountain bike rides to record every detail of your life on a bike. The K-Edge Stem Mount - adjustable for the Garmin Computer makes that pesky plastic mount obsolete and secures your Garmin for any road or trail. Unlike K-Edge's handlebar mounts, the K-Edge Stem Mount fits above the stem directly on the steerer tube. It fits a standard 1 1/8-inch steerer tube. It replaces a standard 5mm spacer, and it locked securely in place by the top compression cap. This model features an adjustable tilt and is best suited for stems that have a 20degree rise or drop. The mount works well with larger Garmin devices such as the 510 or 810. It was initially designed with mountain biking in mind, but is equally ideal for triathlon and other cycling disciplines where hydration systems, maps, or bags may take up handlebar space. Designed from CNC machined aluminum platform, it also features an injection molded polymer interface with the recognizable locking point and the distinctive \"click\" when the Garmin is securely engaged. It is compatible with all quarter-turn Garmin Edge computer and may be oriented for the Forerunner 310XT. It is not compatible with the 901Xt however. The K-Edge Stem Mount - adjustable for Garmin Computers is available in Red, Gunmetal, and Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RPIogE34L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00FZ5BJ8W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Stems"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B00FZVFOM8", "title": "SPRING SALE - ADDITIONAL 50% OFF - Maximum Safety LED Bike Headlight Taillight, Fits ALL Bikes! Try It Risk Free! Be Seen & Stay Safe On The Road, Super Bright, Front Or Back, Easy Install No Tools Needed! Water Resistant, Street/Kids/Mountain Bikes LIFETIME GUARANTEE Xtreme Bright", "description": "This Almost Magical Bike Headlight Lights Up Roadway Turns Before you Make Them, The Secret to See And Being Seen! Xtreme Bright's main focus has always been to delivery the best quality; longest lasting and brightest bicycle light and we have delivered. Cheap lights don't give you the brightness or the distance needed to see the road ahead or potential dangers ahead. This super bright light will protect you from cars on the road, our flashing safety setting will have you seen and noticed from far away. The unique design of the mounting bracket allows you to install in seconds and will keep it attached even on the bumpiest roads or off-road. The waterproof enclosure keeps your light completely dry and will never malfunction due to water or moisture. Never worry about someone stealing your like, in two seconds you can remove the light from it's bracket and take it with you and even use it as a flashlight when needed. The bottom line is bike headlights are needed so you can easily see close and far away the road ahead and so cars on the road can easily see you and no one does it better then Xtreme Bright!-Range Up To 500 Feet! Zoomable Up To 1000 X! The Light is Made of The Highest Quality Aluminum Detaches in Seconds, Use as a Flashlight! The Only Bicycle Light that is Backed by a 100%, NO Questions, NO Hassle Money Back or Replacement Guarantee. The Best and The Brightest LED Bicycle Light on The Market Today. Never Worry About Seeing The Road Ahead or Anyone On The Road Seeing You From Far Away. -Super Bright LED Light!-WATERPROOF, Never Get Wet and Malfunction!-Installs Quickly and Easily, NO TOOLS REQUIRED!-Amazing Safety Features F