{"item_id": "B00G32BXR8", "title": "Lerway® CCAV-S Cycling Bike Bicycle Hollow Out Seat Saddle", "description": "Product Details:Size: 285mm x 128mmWeight:: 179gRail: Hollow Composite AlloyFeatures:The Saddle maximizes comfort and performance -- and proves that a saddle can be comfortable without any paddingNew 'twin-tail' version of the spyder's patened designplaced cutouts tuned for up to 78% more flex, which literally translates to additional shock absorptionARC FLEX rail bosses especially tuned to match the characteristic of the shell suspend the rails and allow flex on impact for further shock absorptionRaised saddle rails incorporated to allow more room for the saddle base to flex, which directly translate to better shock absorption, without fear of the base cominginto contact with the seat postPackage included:1 x Cycling Bike Bicycle Hollow Out Seat Saddle", "text": "Lerway® CCAV-S Cycling Bike Bicycle Hollow Out Seat Saddle Product Details:Size: 285mm x 128mmWeight:: 179gRail: Hollow Composite AlloyFeatures:The Saddle maximizes comfort and performance -- and proves that a saddle can be comfortable without any paddingNew 'twin-tail' version of the spyder's patened designplaced cutouts tuned for up to 78% more flex, which literally translates to additional shock absorptionARC FLEX rail bosses especially tuned to match the characteristic of the shell suspend the rails and allow flex on impact for further shock absorptionRaised saddle rails incorporated to allow more room for the saddle base to flex, which directly translate to better shock absorption, without fear of the base cominginto contact with the seat postPackage included:1 x Cycling Bike Bicycle Hollow Out Seat Saddle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eQK7I4yrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00G32BXR8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B00G3BYU0G", "title": "maglula - Universal 9mm to 45ACP Pistol Magazine Loader & Unloader - UpLULA", "description": "The UpLULA� is a military-quality universal pistol magazine loader and unloader designed for loading and unloading virtually all* 9mm Luger up to .45ACP magazines, single and double stack and 1911's of all manufacturers. It will also load most .380ACP double-stack mags. The UpLULA� loader does it all easily, reliably, and painlessly!Specifications:- Loads all* 9mm Luger, .357 Sig, 10mm, .40, and .45ACP cal. single and double stack magazines., including 1911 mags, of all manufacturer, and also loads most .380ACP double-stack mags- One size fits all. No inserts, spacers or adjustments at all- Easy loading; the rounds just drop in with no fingers pushing or pressing them- No more pain ! Load hundreds of rounds painlessly- Protects your fingers and mags- Up to one round per sec. loading rate. 1/3 the time loading mags compared with thumb loading- Fits in hand and pocket, weighs only 2.3 oz- Highly durableColor: Black", "text": "maglula - Universal 9mm to 45ACP Pistol Magazine Loader & Unloader - UpLULA The UpLULA� is a military-quality universal pistol magazine loader and unloader designed for loading and unloading virtually all* 9mm Luger up to .45ACP magazines, single and double stack and 1911's of all manufacturers. It will also load most .380ACP double-stack mags. The UpLULA� loader does it all easily, reliably, and painlessly!Specifications:- Loads all* 9mm Luger, .357 Sig, 10mm, .40, and .45ACP cal. single and double stack magazines., including 1911 mags, of all manufacturer, and also loads most .380ACP double-stack mags- One size fits all. No inserts, spacers or adjustments at all- Easy loading; the rounds just drop in with no fingers pushing or pressing them- No more pain ! Load hundreds of rounds painlessly- Protects your fingers and mags- Up to one round per sec. loading rate. 1/3 the time loading mags compared with thumb loading- Fits in hand and pocket, weighs only 2.3 oz- Highly durableColor: Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41q3YV5qgAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00G3BYU0G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagLula", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 35.95}}
{"item_id": "B00G3NH3OO", "title": "532nm Tactical Green Laser Sight Hunting Rifle Dot Scope with On/off Swith Picatinny/weaver Mounts + Barrel Mount", "description": "• - Material: Aluminum alloy • - Wavelength: 532nm • - Output power: 5mW • - Powered by 1 x CR123A battery (non-rechargeable battery) • - With tail-cap switch & pressure switch • - With \"8\" figured mount for Laser 1\"(25.4mm) and Scope 1\"(25.4mm) • - Remote coiled pressure switch: Press pressure pad to On and release to Off • - Cap switch: Twisting the cap tight for continuous On and loose for off • Accessories: • - 2 x Standard mount • - 2 x Switch", "text": "532nm Tactical Green Laser Sight Hunting Rifle Dot Scope with On/off Swith Picatinny/weaver Mounts + Barrel Mount • - Material: Aluminum alloy • - Wavelength: 532nm • - Output power: 5mW • - Powered by 1 x CR123A battery (non-rechargeable battery) • - With tail-cap switch & pressure switch • - With \"8\" figured mount for Laser 1\"(25.4mm) and Scope 1\"(25.4mm) • - Remote coiled pressure switch: Press pressure pad to On and release to Off • - Cap switch: Twisting the cap tight for continuous On and loose for off • Accessories: • - 2 x Standard mount • - 2 x Switch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iG7XP6ZRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00G3NH3OO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B00G4HE35G", "title": "SOL Escape Bivvy TACTICAL Breathable Survival Sleeping Bag - Olive Drab", "description": "Now In Tactical Olive Drab! The Tactical Survival Revolution Has Begun - At Last, A Breathable Survival Sleeping Bag in Tactical!! The SOL Escape Bivvy is nothing less than a revolution in backcountry shelters. The complaint with most ultralight emergency shelters is the same: condensation builds up inside as you get warm, leaving your clothes soaking wet. With the Escape Bivvy, condensation is no longer an issue, and you never again have to choose between staying dry and staying warm. The proprietary fabric lets moisture escape at the same time that it keeps rain, snow, and wind on the outside - all while reflecting your body heat back to you. Waterproof seams plus a drawstring hood closure and side zip mean you can seal out the elements entirely or use the bivvy like a traditional sleeping bag, and the high-visibility orange exterior makes it easy for rescuers to spot you even in areas with high tree cover.FEATURES:BreathableReflects Body HeatWindproof & Water ResistantTactical Green (an Olive Drab color)Weight: 8.5 oz: Size: 36\" x 84\" Outer", "text": "SOL Escape Bivvy TACTICAL Breathable Survival Sleeping Bag - Olive Drab Now In Tactical Olive Drab! The Tactical Survival Revolution Has Begun - At Last, A Breathable Survival Sleeping Bag in Tactical!! The SOL Escape Bivvy is nothing less than a revolution in backcountry shelters. The complaint with most ultralight emergency shelters is the same: condensation builds up inside as you get warm, leaving your clothes soaking wet. With the Escape Bivvy, condensation is no longer an issue, and you never again have to choose between staying dry and staying warm. The proprietary fabric lets moisture escape at the same time that it keeps rain, snow, and wind on the outside - all while reflecting your body heat back to you. Waterproof seams plus a drawstring hood closure and side zip mean you can seal out the elements entirely or use the bivvy like a traditional sleeping bag, and the high-visibility orange exterior makes it easy for rescuers to spot you even in areas with high tree cover.FEATURES:BreathableReflects Body HeatWindproof & Water ResistantTactical Green (an Olive Drab color)Weight: 8.5 oz: Size: 36\" x 84\" Outer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510NHx9edwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00G4HE35G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOL", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Bivy Sacks"]], "price": 42.95}}
