{"item_id": "B00G6J8KR4", "title": "Cutters Gloves Men's Prime Command Baseball Batting Glove", "description": "The Prime Command is the batting glove for the traditional player seeking a lightweight all leather batting glove. Made with Premium Micro-Tex Etched Cabretta Leather Palm for improved dexterity and feel and a flexible breathable back. Cutters lightest weight batting glove provides the natural hand grip you're looking for.", "text": "Cutters Gloves Men's Prime Command Baseball Batting Glove The Prime Command is the batting glove for the traditional player seeking a lightweight all leather batting glove. Made with Premium Micro-Tex Etched Cabretta Leather Palm for improved dexterity and feel and a flexible breathable back. Cutters lightest weight batting glove provides the natural hand grip you're looking for.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51i0p%2BMIrrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00G6J8KR4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Player Equipment", "Gloves & Mitts", "Batting Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00G6JBCJW", "title": "Cutters Gloves Men's Lead-Off Baseball Batting Glove", "description": "The Lead-Off is for hitters seeking a lightweight batting glove with enhanced grip. Strategically placed C-TACK Performance Grip on fingers and thumb for increased grip and synthetic palm patches for added durability in common wear sports. C-TACK helps minimize grip pressure causing less muscle tension leading to quicker bat speed and smoother swings. With Rev Tack Recharge, restore C-TACK grip upon wiping with a damp cloth or the Lead Off is machine washable and dryable.", "text": "Cutters Gloves Men's Lead-Off Baseball Batting Glove The Lead-Off is for hitters seeking a lightweight batting glove with enhanced grip. Strategically placed C-TACK Performance Grip on fingers and thumb for increased grip and synthetic palm patches for added durability in common wear sports. C-TACK helps minimize grip pressure causing less muscle tension leading to quicker bat speed and smoother swings. With Rev Tack Recharge, restore C-TACK grip upon wiping with a damp cloth or the Lead Off is machine washable and dryable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mLOeA2mqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00G6JBCJW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Player Equipment", "Gloves & Mitts", "Batting Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00G6QQXMG", "title": "Yoga Mat - Omkara Eco Friendly Mat for Yoga and Pilates - Lotus Design", "description": "Yoga Mat by OmkaraOmkara Lotus Flower design yoga mat creates your own peaceful and fulfilling sacred space. A full 1/4 Inch think for extra comfort. Perfect for home or studio use, these thick mats will provide the cushioning your body needs to enhance proper alignment and maintain poses. Your hands and feet will love the stability that the light-tack non-slip texture brings to your practice. These lightweight, latex-free mats are free of all six of the most harmful phthalates. Comes with our 100% LIFETIME SATISFACTION GUARANTEE when purchased on Amazon.com.Click the Add to Cart Button Now!", "text": "Yoga Mat - Omkara Eco Friendly Mat for Yoga and Pilates - Lotus Design Yoga Mat by OmkaraOmkara Lotus Flower design yoga mat creates your own peaceful and fulfilling sacred space. A full 1/4 Inch think for extra comfort. Perfect for home or studio use, these thick mats will provide the cushioning your body needs to enhance proper alignment and maintain poses. Your hands and feet will love the stability that the light-tack non-slip texture brings to your practice. These lightweight, latex-free mats are free of all six of the most harmful phthalates. Comes with our 100% LIFETIME SATISFACTION GUARANTEE when purchased on Amazon.com.Click the Add to Cart Button Now!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mfK%2BXyAEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00G6QQXMG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]], "price": 17.97}}
{"item_id": "B00G6XIFRU", "title": "Shockwave Technologies Raptor Grip for Mossberg 500 Shotgun Birdshead Pistol Handle", "description": "The Shockwave Technologies Raptor Grip is MADE IN AMERICA. With its enhanced texture, you gain a great hold on your weapon. And its glass-filled polymer construction is virtually indestructible.This is a new style of bird's head grip (aka birdshead grip aka witness protection grip aka chicken head grip aka bad ass grip) developed and manufactured by Shockwave Technologies, LLC in the U.S.A.The Raptor Grip is molded of a super-tough glass-filled polymer and fits:* Mossberg 500 12-gauge firearms (aka 500A)* Mossberg 500 20-gauge firearms (aka 500C)* Mossberg 590 and 590A1 firearms* Mossberg 835 firearms* Mossberg 535 firearms* Mossberg 600 (New Haven) firearms* Maverick 88 12-gauge firearms* Coast to Coast model CC 660 Master Mag (12-gauges and 20-guages)Unique angle of the Raptor Grip minimizes felt recoil, allowing maximum control shot after shot. It also just looks badass. Order yours today. Yes, mounting hardware is included. (Requires a 1/4″ hex wrench for installation.)Firearm shown is not included, however.Note that a pistol-grip-only Mossberg/Maverick 12-gauge with a 14″ barrel and the Raptor Grip installed measures 26.5″ in overall length (measured parallel to the bore). Learn more at www.shockwavetechnologies.com. The grip itself adds 5.25″ to the length of the weapon (measured parallel to the bore).Of course, the Raptor Grip also fits 12-gauges and 20-gauges with 18.5″, 20″, and longer barrels.Note that there is no predefined hole for a sling swivel stud on the Raptor Grip. This allows you to put your sling swivel wherever you want it on the grip-not just where we think it should go. Be sure to drill a 1/8″ pilot hole.", "text": "Shockwave Technologies Raptor Grip for Mossberg 500 Shotgun Birdshead Pistol Handle The Shockwave Technologies Raptor Grip is MADE IN AMERICA. With its enhanced texture, you gain a great hold on your weapon. And its glass-filled polymer construction is virtually indestructible.This is a new style of bird's head grip (aka birdshead grip aka witness protection grip aka chicken head grip aka bad ass grip) developed and manufactured by Shockwave Technologies, LLC in the U.S.A.The Raptor Grip is molded of a super-tough glass-filled polymer and fits:* Mossberg 500 12-gauge firearms (aka 500A)* Mossberg 500 20-gauge firearms (aka 500C)* Mossberg 590 and 590A1 firearms* Mossberg 835 firearms* Mossberg 535 firearms* Mossberg 600 (New Haven) firearms* Maverick 88 12-gauge firearms* Coast to Coast model CC 660 Master Mag (12-gauges and 20-guages)Unique angle of the Raptor Grip minimizes felt recoil, allowing maximum control shot after shot. It also just looks badass. Order yours today. Yes, mounting hardware is included. (Requires a 1/4″ hex wrench for installation.)Firearm shown is not included, however.Note that a pistol-grip-only Mossberg/Maverick 12-gauge with a 14″ barrel and the Raptor Grip installed measures 26.5″ in overall length (measured parallel to the bore). Learn more at www.shockwavetechnologies.com. The grip itself adds 5.25″ to the length of the weapon (measured parallel to the bore).Of course, the Raptor Grip also fits 12-gauges and 20-gauges with 18.5″, 20″, and longer barrels.Note that there is no predefined hole for a sling swivel stud on the Raptor Grip. This allows you to put your sling swivel wherever you want it on the grip-not just where we think it should go. Be sure to drill a 1/8″ pilot hole.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51t7imVXfIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00G6XIFRU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]]}}
