{"item_id": "B00G8QGOKA", "title": "Continental Grand Prix 4000S II Tire", "description": "Vektran and Black Chili? Sounds like some kind of explosive...but the only thing blowing up will be your riding performance. Continental's Grand Prix 4000S II not only sport Vektran technology to increase puncture protection, but they feature Black Chili carbon particles that reduce rolling resistance, maintain traction, and reduce wear. Plus, colored sidewalls look totally fly and will give the peeps in the pack something to remember when you drop them. Vektran technology makes for a tougher tire for puncture resistance Colored sidewall options are just plain awesome Black Chili compound makes this rubber corner better and last longer 225 grams is racing or training light", "text": "Continental Grand Prix 4000S II Tire Vektran and Black Chili? Sounds like some kind of explosive...but the only thing blowing up will be your riding performance. Continental's Grand Prix 4000S II not only sport Vektran technology to increase puncture protection, but they feature Black Chili carbon particles that reduce rolling resistance, maintain traction, and reduce wear. Plus, colored sidewalls look totally fly and will give the peeps in the pack something to remember when you drop them. Vektran technology makes for a tougher tire for puncture resistance Colored sidewall options are just plain awesome Black Chili compound makes this rubber corner better and last longer 225 grams is racing or training light", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qgn85UsNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00G8QGOKA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00GBIP2P8", "title": "GRG Stainless Steel AR15 .223 1/2x28 Competition Muzzle Break Brake Device", "description": "Stainless Steel AR15 .223 1/2x28 Competition Muzzle Break Brake Device", "text": "GRG Stainless Steel AR15 .223 1/2x28 Competition Muzzle Break Brake Device Stainless Steel AR15 .223 1/2x28 Competition Muzzle Break Brake Device", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XVpCPAFRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GBIP2P8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "FieldSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B00GBMUANI", "title": "Lifeline 85-Piece Large Hard Shell First Aid Kit", "description": "This compact first aid kit comes packaged in a sturdy hard shell foam case for easy storage and portability. Kit contains basic first aid supplies. Each kit contains 85 pieces of first aid, contents include; Hard Shell foam carry case, carabiner, first aid guide, scissors, tweezers, 2 vinyl gloves, 14 alcohol prep pads, 3 sting relief pad, 6 antiseptic towelette, 20 small bandages, 10 regular sized bandages, knuckle bandage, 2 knee/elbow bandages, 10 wound closure strips, 7 sterile gauze pads, combine dressing, conforming gauze roll, triangle bandage, adhesive tape roll, emergency whistle.", "text": "Lifeline 85-Piece Large Hard Shell First Aid Kit This compact first aid kit comes packaged in a sturdy hard shell foam case for easy storage and portability. Kit contains basic first aid supplies. Each kit contains 85 pieces of first aid, contents include; Hard Shell foam carry case, carabiner, first aid guide, scissors, tweezers, 2 vinyl gloves, 14 alcohol prep pads, 3 sting relief pad, 6 antiseptic towelette, 20 small bandages, 10 regular sized bandages, knuckle bandage, 2 knee/elbow bandages, 10 wound closure strips, 7 sterile gauze pads, combine dressing, conforming gauze roll, triangle bandage, adhesive tape roll, emergency whistle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51EhweRefEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GBMUANI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lifeline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 16.0}}
{"item_id": "B00GC1N6AM", "title": "Bravo Company BCM Gunfighter Charging Handle with Mod 4 Medium Latch, 5.56mm", "description": "The BCMGUNFIGHTER Charging Handle and extended latches feature internal redesigns to direct the force off of the roll pin and into the body of the charging handle during support hand only manipulations. This new design has a built in backstop engineered into the extended latch and into the charging handle. As the latch is opened up, its' travel is limited by these flat surface backstops. With this travel limiting feature, the stress is taken off the roll pin and is now redirected into the entire body of the charging handle.", "text": "Bravo Company BCM Gunfighter Charging Handle with Mod 4 Medium Latch, 5.56mm The BCMGUNFIGHTER Charging Handle and extended latches feature internal redesigns to direct the force off of the roll pin and into the body of the charging handle during support hand only manipulations. This new design has a built in backstop engineered into the extended latch and into the charging handle. As the latch is opened up, its' travel is limited by these flat surface backstops. With this travel limiting feature, the stress is taken off the roll pin and is now redirected into the entire body of the charging handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xaM67-nFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GC1N6AM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bravo Company", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 38.5}}
