{"item_id": "B00GGR0XD0", "title": "#1 Rechargeable LED, 100% LIFETIME GUARANTEE Money Back, FREE SHIPPING on the HIGH INTENSITY USB Rechargeable Bike Light with TWO FREE TAIL LIGHTS - Magnus Innovation's \"Vision I\" Fits ALL Bikes, Water Proof, Easy Install (NoTools), Quick Release Front & Back Mount - 50% OFF TODAY Limited Time Offer, BUY NOW", "description": "Guaranteed to be SEEN by Cars. Maximum Visibility at NightThe USB Rechargeable headlight is high-powered with a 3-Watt LED and 300 lumens that can light up roads up to 40 feet and visible to motorists over 1500 feet away. Also, equipped with a robust quick-release front mounting system that's designed with 2 adjustable size rubber spacers to fit all bikes. Front mount bracket has the ability angle adjust the light 360 degrees. Combined with 2 FREE 13 Lux LED rear tail light that is built-in with a sturdy silicone quick-release rear mounting system and a adjustable strap to fit all bikes. The bike lights are made with aircraft grade aluminum alloy that is scratch resistant and indestructible. Both headlight and tail light includes 3 modes, waterproof, and energy-efficient LEDs. The headlight uses a USB Rechargeable Lithium Ion battery & both tail lights uses 4 CR2032 Cell batteries. (included)\"Buy from people, not the internet. Innovation around the people experience.\"Magnus Innovation Vision & Purpose:Magnus Innovation, meaning \"GREAT\" in latin, believes our deepest purpose as an organization is to focus on a \"Magnus\" experience for our people. Our vision is deeply embedded in our core values, guiding all of our decisions, actions, processes & practices to positively impact the well-being of our people: customers, community, business organizations & team members.The \"Magnus\" Experience:100% focus on authentic connections and communication. We believe in engineering our products with the customer experience in mind, and if needed, open mindedness to innovate breakthrough designs contingent on customer feedback.While Supplies Last, Click the \"Add to Cart\" button above TODAY & ride safer!", "text": "#1 Rechargeable LED, 100% LIFETIME GUARANTEE Money Back, FREE SHIPPING on the HIGH INTENSITY USB Rechargeable Bike Light with TWO FREE TAIL LIGHTS - Magnus Innovation's \"Vision I\" Fits ALL Bikes, Water Proof, Easy Install (NoTools), Quick Release Front & Back Mount - 50% OFF TODAY Limited Time Offer, BUY NOW Guaranteed to be SEEN by Cars. Maximum Visibility at NightThe USB Rechargeable headlight is high-powered with a 3-Watt LED and 300 lumens that can light up roads up to 40 feet and visible to motorists over 1500 feet away. Also, equipped with a robust quick-release front mounting system that's designed with 2 adjustable size rubber spacers to fit all bikes. Front mount bracket has the ability angle adjust the light 360 degrees. Combined with 2 FREE 13 Lux LED rear tail light that is built-in with a sturdy silicone quick-release rear mounting system and a adjustable strap to fit all bikes. The bike lights are made with aircraft grade aluminum alloy that is scratch resistant and indestructible. Both headlight and tail light includes 3 modes, waterproof, and energy-efficient LEDs. The headlight uses a USB Rechargeable Lithium Ion battery & both tail lights uses 4 CR2032 Cell batteries. (included)\"Buy from people, not the internet. Innovation around the people experience.\"Magnus Innovation Vision & Purpose:Magnus Innovation, meaning \"GREAT\" in latin, believes our deepest purpose as an organization is to focus on a \"Magnus\" experience for our people. Our vision is deeply embedded in our core values, guiding all of our decisions, actions, processes & practices to positively impact the well-being of our people: customers, community, business organizations & team members.The \"Magnus\" Experience:100% focus on authentic connections and communication. We believe in engineering our products with the customer experience in mind, and if needed, open mindedness to innovate breakthrough designs contingent on customer feedback.While Supplies Last, Click the \"Add to Cart\" button above TODAY & ride safer!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ktWwi2iGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GGR0XD0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 64.77}}
{"item_id": "B00GGREKW0", "title": "Black Ops Tactical Sniper Air Rifle Combo air rifle", "description": "Introducing the Tactical Sniper Pellet Gun. Just when you thought you had seen it all now you can own the perfect combination of power and accuracy in this gun. This gun started with a durable synthetic stock now it has an added adjustable bipod and a 4 x 32 stock to complete the package. It is also topped off with a fully adjustable rear stock. This gun has looks, accuracy and power at a great price! Break barrel design for performance and durability.", "text": "Black Ops Tactical Sniper Air Rifle Combo air rifle Introducing the Tactical Sniper Pellet Gun. Just when you thought you had seen it all now you can own the perfect combination of power and accuracy in this gun. This gun started with a durable synthetic stock now it has an added adjustable bipod and a 4 x 32 stock to complete the package. It is also topped off with a fully adjustable rear stock. This gun has looks, accuracy and power at a great price! Break barrel design for performance and durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51uxzUsMvqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GGREKW0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]]}}
