{"item_id": "B00GJW1HDM", "title": "Jumbl™ Bluetooth Hands-Free Calling & A2DP Audio Streaming Adapter/Receiver for 3.5mm Devices - Converts Wired 3.5mm Headphones into Wireless Music Streaming Stereo Earphones - w/Built-In Mic - White", "description": "DescriptionIf you still have a pair of wired headphones or earphones, you are surely familiar with its drawbacks. Simple things like wire length, wire tangle, and the need to remove your device from your pocket to control it are all little nuisances that add up to a diminished calling/music listening experience.No Strings AttachedBeing Jumbl™, we’ve got just the solution for you! Our clever Bluetooth dongle converts any standard 3.5mm earphones into fully wireless ones in a snap. This brings you the freedom of wireless range, and smart ergonomic controls enable you many common controls without the need to ever touch the device itself.More Capabilities On CallBut the buck doesn't stop here. This tiny device is packed with features and technologies way beyond its size. Enhanced phone calling comes thanks to built-in dual microphones with titanium drivers, designed for echo cancellation and background noise filtration. A nifty clip allows you to attach the dongle anywhere on your clothing for optimal microphone and controls positioning. It also eliminates the hassle of removing your device from your pocket to control your music or phone calls.Features at your FingertipsBig, ergonomic quick-control buttons are smartly laid out on the dongle for most common device controls. Wirelessly and effortlessly start and stop music playback, skip songs, select music, answer incoming phone calls, and redial previous phone calls. This is especially useful when exercising, as it allows you to focus on your fitness goals and not on your device. Our Jumbl™ Bluetooth adapter even runs as long as you do! On a single charge, the built-in 120mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery keeps you going for 10 hours of music playback, 12 hours of hands-free call time, and up to 150 hours of standby. USB charging cable included.", "text": "Jumbl™ Bluetooth Hands-Free Calling & A2DP Audio Streaming Adapter/Receiver for 3.5mm Devices - Converts Wired 3.5mm Headphones into Wireless Music Streaming Stereo Earphones - w/Built-In Mic - White DescriptionIf you still have a pair of wired headphones or earphones, you are surely familiar with its drawbacks. Simple things like wire length, wire tangle, and the need to remove your device from your pocket to control it are all little nuisances that add up to a diminished calling/music listening experience.No Strings AttachedBeing Jumbl™, we’ve got just the solution for you! Our clever Bluetooth dongle converts any standard 3.5mm earphones into fully wireless ones in a snap. This brings you the freedom of wireless range, and smart ergonomic controls enable you many common controls without the need to ever touch the device itself.More Capabilities On CallBut the buck doesn't stop here. This tiny device is packed with features and technologies way beyond its size. Enhanced phone calling comes thanks to built-in dual microphones with titanium drivers, designed for echo cancellation and background noise filtration. A nifty clip allows you to attach the dongle anywhere on your clothing for optimal microphone and controls positioning. It also eliminates the hassle of removing your device from your pocket to control your music or phone calls.Features at your FingertipsBig, ergonomic quick-control buttons are smartly laid out on the dongle for most common device controls. Wirelessly and effortlessly start and stop music playback, skip songs, select music, answer incoming phone calls, and redial previous phone calls. This is especially useful when exercising, as it allows you to focus on your fitness goals and not on your device. Our Jumbl™ Bluetooth adapter even runs as long as you do! On a single charge, the built-in 120mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery keeps you going for 10 hours of music playback, 12 hours of hands-free call time, and up to 150 hours of standby. USB charging cable included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u6T-wYy3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GJW1HDM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Cell Phones & Accessories", "Accessories", "Headsets", "Bluetooth Headsets"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Fitness Trackers"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B00GKT4IS0", "title": "Premium Tactical A2 Birdcage Muzzle Brake with Black Oxide Coated Stainless Steel Crush Washer Threaded 5/8\"-24 .308 .300 Blackout 7.6x39, 6.8 Spc Ar10 Made in the USA", "description": "This will fit other popular calibers such as AR-10, .308, 7.62x39, 6.8 SPC I & II, 6.5 Grendel, 300 AAC Blackout / Black Out and 9MM.This IS NOT your standard Tactical A2 Muzzle BrakeThese have been coated in BLACK OXIDE rather than the standard Phosphate.The Black Oxide gives these Tactical Brake's the true Black color only the most expensive and sought after muzzle devices possess.The A2 Tactical Bird cage is the standard muzzle device of the US Armed Forces and found on most USGI rifles (because it's works).*** Made In The USA ***Rousch Sports Premium Tactical A2 Muzzle brake Specifications: CNC machined Heat Treated Steel Standard US Military 5 Slot Design Premium Black Oxide Finish 5/8\"x24 Tpi Application: AR-10, .308, 7.62x39, 6.8 SPC I & II, 6.5 Grendel, 300 AAC Blackout / Black Out and 9MM Length 1.75\" Crush Washer Included Will accommodate application of USGI bayonet", "text": "Premium Tactical A2 Birdcage Muzzle Brake with Black Oxide Coated Stainless Steel Crush Washer Threaded 5/8\"-24 .308 .300 Blackout 7.6x39, 6.8 Spc Ar10 Made in the USA This will fit other popular calibers such as AR-10, .308, 7.62x39, 6.8 SPC I & II, 6.5 Grendel, 300 AAC Blackout / Black Out and 9MM.This IS NOT your standard Tactical A2 Muzzle BrakeThese have been coated in BLACK OXIDE rather than the standard Phosphate.The Black Oxide gives these Tactical Brake's the true Black color only the most expensive and sought after muzzle devices possess.The A2 Tactical Bird cage is the standard muzzle device of the US Armed Forces and found on most USGI rifles (because it's works).*** Made In The USA ***Rousch Sports Premium Tactical A2 Muzzle brake Specifications: CNC machined Heat Treated Steel Standard US Military 5 Slot Design Premium Black Oxide Finish 5/8\"x24 Tpi Application: AR-10, .308, 7.62x39, 6.8 SPC I & II, 6.5 Grendel, 300 AAC Blackout / Black Out and 9MM Length 1.75\" Crush Washer Included Will accommodate application of USGI bayonet", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KicM6JnlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GKT4IS0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B00GLACKNI", "title": "Premium Crossfit Jump Rope for Mastering Double Unders. Comes with a Carrying Bag, Rapid Results Manual Ebook + A FREE Extra Cable - LIMITED TIME OFFER", "description": "\"Do You Want to Discover Your True Potential?\"Why The Fitskuad Speed Jump Rope is The Last Speed Jump Rope Will Ever Need to Buy!?Jumping Rope is the SECRET Boxers have been using for years to increase their speed, their reactions and coordination and is the tool of choice forCrossfit, MMA and *HIIT professionals. Jumping rope is suitable forbeginners to pro athleteswanting to improve their fitness, it offers afull body workout, creates muscle tone and definitionand you can pack a jump rope easily wherever you travel.What does The FitSkuad Speed Jump Rope have that makes it so special?- Light, Strong Aluminum Handles With Foam Grip - Easy To Hold And Portable- 6 Inch Long Handles - Give You A Best Feel Of The Jump Rope- Double Ball Bearing System and Thin Cable That Travels Fast Through The Air - For That ExtraBoost Of Speed- Helps You Focus On The Exercise And Gives You The Powerful Feeling Of The Perfect Cardio- Easily Master Double Unders, Triple Unders And Even Quadruple Unders- Saves You Time - 10 Minutes Of Jumping Rope Equals 30 Minutes Of JoggingThese combined help you reach speeds of up to 320 jump per minute and make you become a double unders master a lot easier.FREE BONUSES ($29 Value)included to help you succeed: Double Unders Manual, a Carrying Bag, Extra Cable.1 Year Limited WarrantyWe Apologize If We're Sold Out. Because Of The High Demand For Our Speed Jump Rope, We Tend To Run Out Of Inventory Fast.Go to the top right of the page and hit the yellow button TO get your FitSkuad Speed Jump Rope And Start Your Workout NOW!", "text": "Premium Crossfit Jump Rope for Mastering Double Unders. Comes with a Carrying Bag, Rapid Results Manual Ebook + A FREE Extra Cable - LIMITED TIME OFFER \"Do You Want to Discover Your True Potential?\"Why The Fitskuad Speed Jump Rope is The Last Speed Jump Rope Will Ever Need to Buy!?Jumping Rope is the SECRET Boxers have been using for years to increase their speed, their reactions and coordination and is the tool of choice forCrossfit, MMA and *HIIT professionals. Jumping rope is suitable forbeginners to pro athleteswanting to improve their fitness, it offers afull body workout, creates muscle tone and definitionand you can pack a jump rope easily wherever you travel.What does The FitSkuad Speed Jump Rope have that makes it so special?- Light, Strong Aluminum Handles With Foam Grip - Easy To Hold And Portable- 6 Inch Long Handles - Give You A Best Feel Of The Jump Rope- Double Ball Bearing System and Thin Cable That Travels Fast Through The Air - For That ExtraBoost Of Speed- Helps You Focus On The Exercise And Gives You The Powerful Feeling Of The Perfect Cardio- Easily Master Double Unders, Triple Unders And Even Quadruple Unders- Saves You Time - 10 Minutes Of Jumping Rope Equals 30 Minutes Of JoggingThese combined help you reach speeds of up to 320 jump per minute and make you become a double unders master a lot easier.FREE BONUSES ($29 Value)included to help you succeed: Double Unders Manual, a Carrying Bag, Extra Cable.1 Year Limited WarrantyWe Apologize If We're Sold Out. Because Of The High Demand For Our Speed Jump Rope, We Tend To Run Out Of Inventory Fast.Go to the top right of the page and hit the yellow button TO get your FitSkuad Speed Jump Rope And Start Your Workout NOW!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51iNTZ8ciUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GLACKNI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 29.95}}
