{"item_id": "B00GLWD4YK", "title": "25 Pack - 12\"x18\" Silhouette Splatterburst Target - Instantly See Your Shots Burst Bright Florescent Yellow Upon Impact!", "description": "See your shots instantly with Splatterburst Targets! Impact holes burst bright florescent yellow providing instant feedback. Whether shooting inside or outside, these high visibility targets make it easy to see your shots without walking downrange. The bright yellow bullet holes are visible in all light conditions without the aid of binoculars or spotting scopes, great for people with reduced vision. Made of heavy duty non-adhesive tag board, they withstand shot after shot. Excellent for all firearms, including: rifles, pistols, shotguns, bb, and pellet guns. Try a Splatterburst Target and you will see the difference! - Search \"Splatterburst Targets\" to view all our targets and packs.", "text": "25 Pack - 12\"x18\" Silhouette Splatterburst Target - Instantly See Your Shots Burst Bright Florescent Yellow Upon Impact! See your shots instantly with Splatterburst Targets! Impact holes burst bright florescent yellow providing instant feedback. Whether shooting inside or outside, these high visibility targets make it easy to see your shots without walking downrange. The bright yellow bullet holes are visible in all light conditions without the aid of binoculars or spotting scopes, great for people with reduced vision. Made of heavy duty non-adhesive tag board, they withstand shot after shot. Excellent for all firearms, including: rifles, pistols, shotguns, bb, and pellet guns. Try a Splatterburst Target and you will see the difference! - Search \"Splatterburst Targets\" to view all our targets and packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BKwmvCAOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GLWD4YK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B00GLX4KZ6", "title": "50 Pack - 12\"x 18\" Silhouette Splatter Target - Instantly See Your Shots Burst Bright Florescent Yellow Upon Impact!", "description": "See your shots instantly with Splatterburst Targets! Impact holes burst bright florescent yellow providing instant feedback. Whether shooting inside or outside, these high visibility targets make it easy to see your shots without walking downrange. The bright yellow bullet holes are visible in all light conditions without the aid of binoculars or spotting scopes, great for people with reduced vision. Made of heavy duty non-adhesive tag board, they withstand shot after shot. Excellent for all firearms, including: rifles, pistols, shotguns, bb, and pellet guns. Try a Splatterburst Target and you will see the difference! - Search \"Splatterburst Targets\" to view all our targets and packs.", "text": "50 Pack - 12\"x 18\" Silhouette Splatter Target - Instantly See Your Shots Burst Bright Florescent Yellow Upon Impact! See your shots instantly with Splatterburst Targets! Impact holes burst bright florescent yellow providing instant feedback. Whether shooting inside or outside, these high visibility targets make it easy to see your shots without walking downrange. The bright yellow bullet holes are visible in all light conditions without the aid of binoculars or spotting scopes, great for people with reduced vision. Made of heavy duty non-adhesive tag board, they withstand shot after shot. Excellent for all firearms, including: rifles, pistols, shotguns, bb, and pellet guns. Try a Splatterburst Target and you will see the difference! - Search \"Splatterburst Targets\" to view all our targets and packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BKwmvCAOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GLX4KZ6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 33.99}}
{"item_id": "B00GM8V8P0", "title": "Single Pistol Case - Secure Premium Hard Plastic Gun Cases - Easy to Lock - Locking System Seals Case Tight - Fits Full Size Handgun - Foam Interior - Great for Transport in Car - Fits most Glock, Smith and Wesson (S&W), Ruger, Colt, Beretta, etc.", "description": "FINALLY... An Affordable Plastic Gun Case That Can Actually Be SEALED When Locked!What's the biggest problem with plastic gun cases?The flip locks! Even when you add a lock, the flip locks can be flipped open, allowing the case to be easily pried open from the sides and the gun taken.Premium Tactical Supply is proud to present the PTS Single Pistol Case.It's a solid handgun case, made of durable hard plastic - and with a tight sliding lock mechanism that keeps a tight seal on the gun case.This handgun case isn't designed to replace a gun safe - but it is more secure than the typical plastic flip lock case.The sliding locks don't allow the case to be pried open the same way that flip locks do.The case is designed to fit a full size handgun and magazines.It's a great way to take your gun to the range or for travel in your car. If locks are applied to both slide locks, it meets TSA requirements for checking a pistol into your baggage when flying.It's recommended to lock the case with a slim pistol cable lock, as shown in the sample photos, or with padlocks with a longer than 1\" shackle.The cable/padlock opening is .26\" (6.6mm). A cable such as ASIN:B005EOV2A4 UTG 0.21 x 15-Inch Ultra Strong Firearm Cable Lock should fit.This case does not come with a lock.Premium Tactical Supply offers a lifetime warranty for all their cases- if during normal use the locking mechanism or case hinge fails, just send back the case with your receipt and we'll award you a new case free of charge (you pay for shipping).Act now! Scroll to the top and click \"Add to Cart\" to the right.", "text": "Single Pistol Case - Secure Premium Hard Plastic Gun Cases - Easy to Lock - Locking System Seals Case Tight - Fits Full Size Handgun - Foam Interior - Great for Transport in Car - Fits most Glock, Smith and Wesson (S&W), Ruger, Colt, Beretta, etc. FINALLY... An Affordable Plastic Gun Case That Can Actually Be SEALED When Locked!What's the biggest problem with plastic gun cases?The flip locks! Even when you add a lock, the flip locks can be flipped open, allowing the case to be easily pried open from the sides and the gun taken.Premium Tactical Supply is proud to present the PTS Single Pistol Case.It's a solid handgun case, made of durable hard plastic - and with a tight sliding lock mechanism that keeps a tight seal on the gun case.This handgun case isn't designed to replace a gun safe - but it is more secure than the typical plastic flip lock case.The sliding locks don't allow the case to be pried open the same way that flip locks do.The case is designed to fit a full size handgun and magazines.It's a great way to take your gun to the range or for travel in your car. If locks are applied to both slide locks, it meets TSA requirements for checking a pistol into your baggage when flying.It's recommended to lock the case with a slim pistol cable lock, as shown in the sample photos, or with padlocks with a longer than 1\" shackle.The cable/padlock opening is .26\" (6.6mm). A cable such as ASIN:B005EOV2A4 UTG 0.21 x 15-Inch Ultra Strong Firearm Cable Lock should fit.This case does not come with a lock.Premium Tactical Supply offers a lifetime warranty for all their cases- if during normal use the locking mechanism or case hinge fails, just send back the case with your receipt and we'll award you a new case free of charge (you pay for shipping).Act now! Scroll to the top and click \"Add to Cart\" to the right.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VeOePzy5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GM8V8P0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 16.97}}
{"item_id": "B00GMCOVJ6", "title": "Whistle - Pro whistle with lanyard necklace - Coach and referee first choice of all official sports organizations worldwide- also great for life emergency, security and survival- on sale online now made with ABS not tin or stainless steel. Similar to Fox 40, very reliable, product guarantee. By Rush Sports", "description": "The One and Only Whistle You'll Ever Need!Get the Very Best and the One and Only Whistle You'll Ever Need here-High Quality Made Whistle-Made with ABS not Steel-No Moveable Parts-2 Chamber Design, Pea less Design, Nothing to Jam, Break, or Freeze.-Loud and Effective- The Harder You Blow the Louder the Sound.-Very Comfortable-Comes with Lanyard and Cushioned Mouth Guard (CMG)-Clean Look and FeelWhen you purchase the AVA Pro Whistle you can rest assure that your AVA Pro Whistle will work 100% of the time. Made with high quality ABS material, this 2 chamber, pea less design is the one and only whistle you'll ever need and ensures to work ALL THE TIME! This Professional Whistle comes with a Cushioned Mouth Guard (CMG) that can be removed if desired and a very comfortable lanyard. Great for personal use in emergency situations.Do you feel unsafe walking alone to your car at night after work? Do you feel safe jogging thru the park alone? Are you a Senior Citizen who lives at home by yourself? Are you an avid hiker or camper? Fear no more, you can draw attention to yourself easily by using the AVA Pro Whistle.Coach J.C.-\"After all these years of coaching, I finally found a whistle that works great! Well worth the price!\"Arthur T.-\"Simple to use and it gets the job done! The best thing is that it still works well when it gets wet...no brainer, every lifeguard needs one.\"Chelsea H.-\"Being a Crossing guard at the school, I can now get the students and car drivers attention easily. I've been looking for a whistle like this one for a long time.\"AVA Pro Whistle uses:-Officials-Referees-Coaches-Lifeguards-Security-Hikers-CampersAVA Pro Whistle comes with a 100% Satisfaction Replacement Lifetime Guarantee!!!Click the Yellow Add to Cart Button to Get Your AVA Pro Whistle Today!", "text": "Whistle - Pro whistle with lanyard necklace - Coach and referee first choice of all official sports organizations worldwide- also great for life emergency, security and survival- on sale online now made with ABS not tin or stainless steel. Similar to Fox 40, very reliable, product guarantee. By Rush Sports The One and Only Whistle You'll Ever Need!Get the Very Best and the One and Only Whistle You'll Ever Need here-High Quality Made Whistle-Made with ABS not Steel-No Moveable Parts-2 Chamber Design, Pea less Design, Nothing to Jam, Break, or Freeze.-Loud and Effective- The Harder You Blow the Louder the Sound.-Very Comfortable-Comes with Lanyard and Cushioned Mouth Guard (CMG)-Clean Look and FeelWhen you purchase the AVA Pro Whistle you can rest assure that your AVA Pro Whistle will work 100% of the time. Made with high quality ABS material, this 2 chamber, pea less design is the one and only whistle you'll ever need and ensures to work ALL THE TIME! This Professional Whistle comes with a Cushioned Mouth Guard (CMG) that can be removed if desired and a very comfortable lanyard. Great for personal use in emergency situations.Do you feel unsafe walking alone to your car at night after work? Do you feel safe jogging thru the park alone? Are you a Senior Citizen who lives at home by yourself? Are you an avid hiker or camper? Fear no more, you can draw attention to yourself easily by using the AVA Pro Whistle.Coach J.C.-\"After all these years of coaching, I finally found a whistle that works great! Well worth the price!\"Arthur T.-\"Simple to use and it gets the job done! The best thing is that it still works well when it gets wet...no brainer, every lifeguard needs one.\"Chelsea H.-\"Being a Crossing guard at the school, I can now get the students and car drivers attention easily. I've been looking for a whistle like this one for a long time.\"AVA Pro Whistle uses:-Officials-Referees-Coaches-Lifeguards-Security-Hikers-CampersAVA Pro Whistle comes with a 100% Satisfaction Replacement Lifetime Guarantee!!!Click the Yellow Add to Cart Button to Get Your AVA Pro Whistle Today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GeLzAv1aL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GMCOVJ6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Coach & Referee Gear", "Whistles"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B00GMMPIK2", "title": "Sanrenmu 7010LUC-SA 710 Pocket EDC Folding Knife", "description": "Sanrenmu 7010LUC-SA Pocket knifeGood finish. Great feel. Great Control. Give a tryStainless steel construction, 8Cr13Mov bladeOpened Length: 6.5\"Closed Length: 3.74\"Thickness with Clip: 0.5\"Thickness without Clip: 0.36\"Blade Length: 2.8\"Blade Thickness: 0.0955\"Blade Material: 8Cr13MoV Handle Material: Stainless SteelLocking Mechanism: Frame LockNet Weight: 3.17oz", "text": "Sanrenmu 7010LUC-SA 710 Pocket EDC Folding Knife Sanrenmu 7010LUC-SA Pocket knifeGood finish. Great feel. Great Control. Give a tryStainless steel construction, 8Cr13Mov bladeOpened Length: 6.5\"Closed Length: 3.74\"Thickness with Clip: 0.5\"Thickness without Clip: 0.36\"Blade Length: 2.8\"Blade Thickness: 0.0955\"Blade Material: 8Cr13MoV Handle Material: Stainless SteelLocking Mechanism: Frame LockNet Weight: 3.17oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JEOQXr7hL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GMMPIK2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B00GMOXRV2", "title": "AR15 M4 CoiTAC® Magazine Lock Button California Legal Compliant Made In USA", "description": "The CA Legal Magazine Button is a product that allows the shooter to drop a magazine with the use of a tool. It prevents finger manipulation of the mag release, and creates a condition allowable under current individual interpretations of California law. . This does not create a detachable mag situation, but creates an attachable-fixed magazine condition. A bullet tip can be used as the tool, as can any small object such as Allen wrench, or small screwdriver. This button can not be used with magazines greater than 10 rounds in capacity. To do so in the state of California on an unregistered assault weapon, would be a felony. The CA Legal Magazine Button installs in less than a minute, requires no gunsmithing, or cutting on any part of the rifle. The installation is not permanent, and can be reversed just as quickly. Made in USA Product", "text": "AR15 M4 CoiTAC® Magazine Lock Button California Legal Compliant Made In USA The CA Legal Magazine Button is a product that allows the shooter to drop a magazine with the use of a tool. It prevents finger manipulation of the mag release, and creates a condition allowable under current individual interpretations of California law. . This does not create a detachable mag situation, but creates an attachable-fixed magazine condition. A bullet tip can be used as the tool, as can any small object such as Allen wrench, or small screwdriver. This button can not be used with magazines greater than 10 rounds in capacity. To do so in the state of California on an unregistered assault weapon, would be a felony. The CA Legal Magazine Button installs in less than a minute, requires no gunsmithing, or cutting on any part of the rifle. The installation is not permanent, and can be reversed just as quickly. Made in USA Product", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BhAH4uN2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GMOXRV2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Locks"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00GMWK3V6", "title": "Emergency Mylar Thermal Blankets Silver Survival Reflective Rescue Sleeping Bag / Sheet - Portable Body Cover That Generates Warm Heat From Insulation - Great for Hikers / Hiking / Camping / Snowboarding / Snowboarders - 100% Lifetime Guaranteed", "description": "Protect You and Your Family From the Blistering Cold in EmergenciesNobody can ever predict when an emergency situation will occur but we can definitely prepare for one. Shacke emergency blankets are small and portable and should be a part of everyone's preparedness kit. They are ideal for your car, hiking bags, at home, at the office, and for camping. All your family and friends should have one close by for emergency situations.These blankets are ideally used to help generate massive heat by trapping your own body heat inside so that you stay warm while keeping the cold out. They are made of a reflective Mylar material that is also waterproof to block the rain out. It takes only less than 1 minute for it work and start warming you up. They are ideal when you are stranded on the side of the road, camping in the middle of nowhere, or can't depend on electrical heating. They are large enough to wrap around your body to form a sleeping bag.Shacke Thermal Blankets Are Different Because:- Size: 54 inches x 84 inches- Portable and easy to carry or store- Waterproof to withstand harsh rains- Can be stringed into a makeshift tent- Can wrap around a human body as a sleeping bagOur thermal blankets are backed by a 100% Lifetime Guaranteed. We always stand behind our products and our customers.Click On The Yellow\"ADD TO CART\"Button To Get Your Shacke Thermal Blanket Today!", "text": "Emergency Mylar Thermal Blankets Silver Survival Reflective Rescue Sleeping Bag / Sheet - Portable Body Cover That Generates Warm Heat From Insulation - Great for Hikers / Hiking / Camping / Snowboarding / Snowboarders - 100% Lifetime Guaranteed Protect You and Your Family From the Blistering Cold in EmergenciesNobody can ever predict when an emergency situation will occur but we can definitely prepare for one. Shacke emergency blankets are small and portable and should be a part of everyone's preparedness kit. They are ideal for your car, hiking bags, at home, at the office, and for camping. All your family and friends should have one close by for emergency situations.These blankets are ideally used to help generate massive heat by trapping your own body heat inside so that you stay warm while keeping the cold out. They are made of a reflective Mylar material that is also waterproof to block the rain out. It takes only less than 1 minute for it work and start warming you up. They are ideal when you are stranded on the side of the road, camping in the middle of nowhere, or can't depend on electrical heating. They are large enough to wrap around your body to form a sleeping bag.Shacke Thermal Blankets Are Different Because:- Size: 54 inches x 84 inches- Portable and easy to carry or store- Waterproof to withstand harsh rains- Can be stringed into a makeshift tent- Can wrap around a human body as a sleeping bagOur thermal blankets are backed by a 100% Lifetime Guaranteed. We always stand behind our products and our customers.Click On The Yellow\"ADD TO CART\"Button To Get Your Shacke Thermal Blanket Today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51sTfC4X73L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GMWK3V6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 5.12}}
