{"item_id": "B00GMZHUXW", "title": "[3 PACK] Magnesium Fire Starter - with Extra Long Chains and Strikers - Light Weight and Pocket Size - for Hiking and Other Outdoor Activities - A Must Have for the Survivalist Prepper - EDC Emergency Survival Essentials in Retail Packaging - Lifetime Warranty", "description": "The Friendly Swede Magnesium Fire Starters [3 PACK]Create fire any time, any place, any conditionsThe Friendly Swede's Magnesium Firestarters are an essential piece of any survival/outdoor kit - waterproof, durable and easy to use. Never leave home without one!CONTENTSThree 3\" x 1\" Solid Magnesium and Flint BlocksThree Metal StrikersThree 17.5\" ChainsINSTRUCTIONS1. Using the flat edge of the striker, shave the magnesium block to create a small pile of magnesium.2. Prepare your tinder next to the magnesium pile.3. Hold the flat edge of the striker against the top of the flint at a 45° angle. Slide firmly down the flint to create sparks. Allow sparks to fall onto magnesium pile.4. Use magnesium to ignite tinder. Place burning tinder into fire. Don't suffocate the fire - build fire slowly using small pieces of wood.* Note: Firestick is covered in protective oil. Wipe off oil before use.CAUTIONNot suitable for children under 10.For outdoor use only - use in controlled environment.Never leave your fire unattended.THE FRIENDLY SWEDE PROMISEAt The Friendly Swede we do everything we can to make sure our customers are happy with their purchases. If for any reason you are not happy with any product supplied by The Friendly Swede, please do not hesitate to contact us and we will do our best to solve your problem ASAP!There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "text": "[3 PACK] Magnesium Fire Starter - with Extra Long Chains and Strikers - Light Weight and Pocket Size - for Hiking and Other Outdoor Activities - A Must Have for the Survivalist Prepper - EDC Emergency Survival Essentials in Retail Packaging - Lifetime Warranty The Friendly Swede Magnesium Fire Starters [3 PACK]Create fire any time, any place, any conditionsThe Friendly Swede's Magnesium Firestarters are an essential piece of any survival/outdoor kit - waterproof, durable and easy to use. Never leave home without one!CONTENTSThree 3\" x 1\" Solid Magnesium and Flint BlocksThree Metal StrikersThree 17.5\" ChainsINSTRUCTIONS1. Using the flat edge of the striker, shave the magnesium block to create a small pile of magnesium.2. Prepare your tinder next to the magnesium pile.3. Hold the flat edge of the striker against the top of the flint at a 45° angle. Slide firmly down the flint to create sparks. Allow sparks to fall onto magnesium pile.4. Use magnesium to ignite tinder. Place burning tinder into fire. Don't suffocate the fire - build fire slowly using small pieces of wood.* Note: Firestick is covered in protective oil. Wipe off oil before use.CAUTIONNot suitable for children under 10.For outdoor use only - use in controlled environment.Never leave your fire unattended.THE FRIENDLY SWEDE PROMISEAt The Friendly Swede we do everything we can to make sure our customers are happy with their purchases. If for any reason you are not happy with any product supplied by The Friendly Swede, please do not hesitate to contact us and we will do our best to solve your problem ASAP!There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519E8O1F32L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GMZHUXW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 13.99}}
