{"item_id": "B00GOPNO6C", "title": "Coleman Expedition First Aid Kit (205-Piece), Red", "description": "The Coleman Expedition First Aid Kit is the ultimate first aid kit for large groups or long treks. This 205 piece kit features components most often needed in the field. All items are housed in a durable, semi-hard case. The unique EZ Find System keeps the items organized and allows room for customization so you can be sure you have what you need in an emergency. Perfect kit for your home, RV or automobile.", "text": "Coleman Expedition First Aid Kit (205-Piece), Red The Coleman Expedition First Aid Kit is the ultimate first aid kit for large groups or long treks. This 205 piece kit features components most often needed in the field. All items are housed in a durable, semi-hard case. The unique EZ Find System keeps the items organized and allows room for customization so you can be sure you have what you need in an emergency. Perfect kit for your home, RV or automobile.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Eqk2ZJLBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GOPNO6C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 22.9}}
