{"item_id": "B00GPG5W5Q", "title": "LIMITED TIME SUMER SALE! | SAVE 50% | No More Wings Magnetic Metal Collar Stays Kit (Includes 6 Pairs of High Quality Stainless Steel 430 Collar Stays in Sizes 2\", 2.5\", 2.75\" AND Neodymium Magnets!). Prevent Your Shirt Collars From Looking Like Wings! Our Stainless Steel Collar Stays and Magnets Are Packaged Together at a Competitive Price.", "description": "Business casual doesn't have to mean travolta and saturday night fever!we love business casual too, but all too often we see dress shirt collars that look like they are ready for take off or landing. our no more wings magnetic collar stays help you get that \"buttoned up\" look.- full set of 6 magnetic metal collar stays (a total of 12 stays) - our kit includes 2 pair each of the following sizes: 2\", 2.5\", 2.75\" - our kit also includes the powerful neodymium magnets that other kits do not include. Get that \"buttoned up look... Without the buttons. Business casual is awesome. We love not having to wear a tie every day! However, if you aren't wearing a tie or a button up collar, then your shirt needs some help keeping those collars from spreading out. Our kit of no more wings magnetic metal collar stays which include the magnets do just that.our high quality stainless steel collar stays with neodymium magnets are the highest quality and will make you look great! - our kit comes with multiple sizes to fit all different shirt styles - our kit comes with larger size neodymium magnets (9mm x 3mm) that hold the collar in place and make you look good! (other kits don't include the magnets or they are so tiny they won't hold your collar in place - save money by buying our all in one kitwe have a 30 day no hassle satisfaction guarantee and we provide exceptional customer service!click the yellow \"add to cart\" button at the top of this page to get out of the 70's and make business casual look... Well more business", "text": "LIMITED TIME SUMER SALE! | SAVE 50% | No More Wings Magnetic Metal Collar Stays Kit (Includes 6 Pairs of High Quality Stainless Steel 430 Collar Stays in Sizes 2\", 2.5\", 2.75\" AND Neodymium Magnets!). Prevent Your Shirt Collars From Looking Like Wings! Our Stainless Steel Collar Stays and Magnets Are Packaged Together at a Competitive Price. Business casual doesn't have to mean travolta and saturday night fever!we love business casual too, but all too often we see dress shirt collars that look like they are ready for take off or landing. our no more wings magnetic collar stays help you get that \"buttoned up\" look.- full set of 6 magnetic metal collar stays (a total of 12 stays) - our kit includes 2 pair each of the following sizes: 2\", 2.5\", 2.75\" - our kit also includes the powerful neodymium magnets that other kits do not include. Get that \"buttoned up look... Without the buttons. Business casual is awesome. We love not having to wear a tie every day! However, if you aren't wearing a tie or a button up collar, then your shirt needs some help keeping those collars from spreading out. Our kit of no more wings magnetic metal collar stays which include the magnets do just that.our high quality stainless steel collar stays with neodymium magnets are the highest quality and will make you look great! - our kit comes with multiple sizes to fit all different shirt styles - our kit comes with larger size neodymium magnets (9mm x 3mm) that hold the collar in place and make you look good! (other kits don't include the magnets or they are so tiny they won't hold your collar in place - save money by buying our all in one kitwe have a 30 day no hassle satisfaction guarantee and we provide exceptional customer service!click the yellow \"add to cart\" button at the top of this page to get out of the 70's and make business casual look... Well more business", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z8k5Qu1wL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GPG5W5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Collars"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B00GPQEKZO", "title": "LaserLyte Tip Over Can (3-Pack)", "description": "LaserLyte introduces the innovative and entertaining Laser-Plinking-Can 3-Pack Set. When hit with a laser from any of the LaserLyte training cartridges or other laser trainer tools, the cans react by jumping up and falling over just as a real can would. This reaction is all powered by a 9V battery (included) and a spring loaded plunger released by a solenoid. To reset the cans, simply stand them up and depress the plunger. The LaserLyte Laser Plinking Can Set provides hours of training and entertainment indoors or outdoors without the cost of ammunition or the clean-up of cans after the fact. Laser Plinking Can Set is sold in a three-pack with three 9-V batteries included. One battery will tip the can over about 8,000 times. The LaserLyte Laser Plinking Can gets sport shooters and professionals on the target faster, increasing accuracy and overall hits. Specifications: - Battery: 9V - Battery Life: 8,000 Tip Overs - Length: 3.82\" - Diameter: 2\" - Weight: 4.25 oz.", "text": "LaserLyte Tip Over Can (3-Pack) LaserLyte introduces the innovative and entertaining Laser-Plinking-Can 3-Pack Set. When hit with a laser from any of the LaserLyte training cartridges or other laser trainer tools, the cans react by jumping up and falling over just as a real can would. This reaction is all powered by a 9V battery (included) and a spring loaded plunger released by a solenoid. To reset the cans, simply stand them up and depress the plunger. The LaserLyte Laser Plinking Can Set provides hours of training and entertainment indoors or outdoors without the cost of ammunition or the clean-up of cans after the fact. Laser Plinking Can Set is sold in a three-pack with three 9-V batteries included. One battery will tip the can over about 8,000 times. The LaserLyte Laser Plinking Can gets sport shooters and professionals on the target faster, increasing accuracy and overall hits. Specifications: - Battery: 9V - Battery Life: 8,000 Tip Overs - Length: 3.82\" - Diameter: 2\" - Weight: 4.25 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WzUfytiJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GPQEKZO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 81.44}}
{"item_id": "B00GR7DABG", "title": "MetroFlash Ignita USB Rechargeable HeadLight with USB Cable (Black)", "description": "Ideal for cycling at night, the Metroflash Ignita headlight is your key to see and be seen on the roads and enjoying a safe ride. The Ignita is equipped with 2 extremely bright SMD White LEDs and is uniquely designed to be visible from all angles thus ensuring that the cyclist can clearly see the road in advance and is highly visible from afar. By pressing the center button you can easily switch into four different lighting modes: Super Bright 1.5 hours, Boost 3 hours, Constant 6 hours and Flashing 12 hours. The bracket included with the light can be mounted simply and tool-free onto your bike, helmet or bag. The Ignita's innovative technology design allows you to recharge the batteries in your laptop or any device in your home with USB ports for 2-3 hours. A yellow light indicates when power is lower than 20%, red light when charging, and green when battery is fully charged. The battery is designed with a protector to ensure it will last as long as possible. The light is water resistant and designed to withstand harsh weather conditions. The Ignita is available in either black or white and includes rechargeable batteries, a micro USB cable, 2 cable ties, a helmet strap, seat post bracket, manual, and rubber pad. The Ignita is the perfect solution for the daily commuter or night rider helping you stay safe and seen on the road.", "text": "MetroFlash Ignita USB Rechargeable HeadLight with USB Cable (Black) Ideal for cycling at night, the Metroflash Ignita headlight is your key to see and be seen on the roads and enjoying a safe ride. The Ignita is equipped with 2 extremely bright SMD White LEDs and is uniquely designed to be visible from all angles thus ensuring that the cyclist can clearly see the road in advance and is highly visible from afar. By pressing the center button you can easily switch into four different lighting modes: Super Bright 1.5 hours, Boost 3 hours, Constant 6 hours and Flashing 12 hours. The bracket included with the light can be mounted simply and tool-free onto your bike, helmet or bag. The Ignita's innovative technology design allows you to recharge the batteries in your laptop or any device in your home with USB ports for 2-3 hours. A yellow light indicates when power is lower than 20%, red light when charging, and green when battery is fully charged. The battery is designed with a protector to ensure it will last as long as possible. The light is water resistant and designed to withstand harsh weather conditions. The Ignita is available in either black or white and includes rechargeable batteries, a micro USB cable, 2 cable ties, a helmet strap, seat post bracket, manual, and rubber pad. The Ignita is the perfect solution for the daily commuter or night rider helping you stay safe and seen on the road.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KzlQvdxZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GR7DABG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]]}}
