{"item_id": "B00GSOXHAW", "title": "Zoic Men's Ether Shorts", "description": "Best-selling shorts because they're packed with features and built to last, delivering performance for all types of riders in any trail conditions: cross country, all mountain, free ride, downhill and even urban and commuting. Our Ether shorts offer the 3 for 1 value of the ZOIC Removable Padded Liner (RPL) System: a fully integrated baggy bike short that separates into a versatile technical short and a high-quality padded cycling liner.", "text": "Zoic Men's Ether Shorts Best-selling shorts because they're packed with features and built to last, delivering performance for all types of riders in any trail conditions: cross country, all mountain, free ride, downhill and even urban and commuting. Our Ether shorts offer the 3 for 1 value of the ZOIC Removable Padded Liner (RPL) System: a fully integrated baggy bike short that separates into a versatile technical short and a high-quality padded cycling liner.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TlunUDpFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GSOXHAW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
