{"item_id": "B00GTNB7K4", "title": "Bushbox XL Combination Kit", "description": "The combination bought by most customers in a bundle for an attractive price: Bushbox XL, Universal Grate (can be used as a grill, Trangia platform or as a grate for charcoal or wood pellets) plus our heavy duty outdoor bag! UK Preppers Guide Bushbox XL Review", "text": "Bushbox XL Combination Kit The combination bought by most customers in a bundle for an attractive price: Bushbox XL, Universal Grate (can be used as a grill, Trangia platform or as a grate for charcoal or wood pellets) plus our heavy duty outdoor bag! UK Preppers Guide Bushbox XL Review", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vLMdpQVcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GTNB7K4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Backpacking Stoves"]], "price": 97.7}}
{"item_id": "B00GTNMM4E", "title": "Wahoo RFLKT+ Bike Computer for iPhone 5S, 5C, 5 and 4S", "description": "", "text": "Wahoo RFLKT+ Bike Computer for iPhone 5S, 5C, 5 and 4S", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51RazjOUf5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GTNMM4E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 129.99}}
{"item_id": "B00GU0HIP4", "title": "MetroFlash Nocturna USB Rechargeable Taillight with USB Cable", "description": "Increase your visibility to motorist and defend you and your bike against rear collisions! The Metroflash Nocturna MF-N600 rear light achieves these safety measures by providing 220 degrees rear coverage for your bike making sure motorists will notice you from up to a mile distance. The four eye-catching modes; super bright, constant, flashing and chasing can be activated by pressing the soft-touch button. Super bright offers a maximum output with the shortest battery life, Flashing and chasing feature various stages of flashing motion and intensity while the chasing mode has the longest battery life. The Nocturna has a total battery life ranging from 3-25 hours depending on your mode selection. The red LED lamps are designed with lasting efficiency and built to withstand all weather conditions. Low battery? No worries! With the Nocturna you can use the included USB cable to charge the battery at work, school, or on the go. Just plug the USB cable into your laptop port and it will be ready for use on the commute home. The battery is powered by rechargeable Lithium-ion polymer with a built-in protector and low power indicator. A yellow light will be shown when power is lower than 20%, red light when battery is charging and green light when battery is fully charged. Mounting the Nocturna is very simple. The light comes with FlexTight brackets that attach to the seatpost and tool-free installation onto helmets. The Nocturna is available in One Size, color red. Each light includes the FlexTight mounting bracket, pad, ring, cable tie, velcro, strap, manual and USB cable. The Nocturna MF-N600 will help you stand out in the crowded streets and guarantee you'll be noticed at night!", "text": "MetroFlash Nocturna USB Rechargeable Taillight with USB Cable Increase your visibility to motorist and defend you and your bike against rear collisions! The Metroflash Nocturna MF-N600 rear light achieves these safety measures by providing 220 degrees rear coverage for your bike making sure motorists will notice you from up to a mile distance. The four eye-catching modes; super bright, constant, flashing and chasing can be activated by pressing the soft-touch button. Super bright offers a maximum output with the shortest battery life, Flashing and chasing feature various stages of flashing motion and intensity while the chasing mode has the longest battery life. The Nocturna has a total battery life ranging from 3-25 hours depending on your mode selection. The red LED lamps are designed with lasting efficiency and built to withstand all weather conditions. Low battery? No worries! With the Nocturna you can use the included USB cable to charge the battery at work, school, or on the go. Just plug the USB cable into your laptop port and it will be ready for use on the commute home. The battery is powered by rechargeable Lithium-ion polymer with a built-in protector and low power indicator. A yellow light will be shown when power is lower than 20%, red light when battery is charging and green light when battery is fully charged. Mounting the Nocturna is very simple. The light comes with FlexTight brackets that attach to the seatpost and tool-free installation onto helmets. The Nocturna is available in One Size, color red. Each light includes the FlexTight mounting bracket, pad, ring, cable tie, velcro, strap, manual and USB cable. The Nocturna MF-N600 will help you stand out in the crowded streets and guarantee you'll be noticed at night!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FsYA2%2BVKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GU0HIP4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00GUTLAY0", "title": "Rechargeable Hand Warmer. These Reheatable Hand Warmers are Battery Operated and Reusable Many Times Over. Work as a Charger For Most Mobile Devices and Cell Phones Via USB. Built-in Micro Led Flashlight. Great for Arthritis and Raynaud´s Sufferers.", "description": "3 in 1: Rechargeable Hand Warmer, External Battery Charger and Mini Led FlashlightWhy purchase a low heat, one time disposable hand warmer when you can get the both of best worlds: A high quality, high heat producing and rechargeable and reusable hand warmer to heat your hands during those cold days and seasons. Charge at night, use on cold days, and repeat! Same hand warmer, many times over.Looking for a nice looking and comfortable-in-your-hand grip, with low and high heat option hand warmer?Then look no further! The EnerHandz, is the perfect choice for you if you are looking for a long lasting, rechargeable and reusable hand warmer with many other built in functions.Made of high quality steel casing this hand warmer will be your companion for a long time. Each full charge will heat up your hand warmer for 5 to 6 hours depending on your choice of preference between the low and high heat settings.Out of Battery Again? No More!How many times have you had to make an important call or check an important email just to grab your portable device and notice you are out of battery! Well worry no more. The EnerHandz hand warmer also works as an external, portable rechargeable battery pack so in case you ever need to recharge any of your mobile devices like your iPhone, iPod, iPad, Samsung phone or any other portable device that has a usb cable, you just pull it out of your pocket or bag and plug it in and presto you get a quick battery charge.Lost Something in The Dark?The EnerHandz also has a neat led micro flashlight built in, so in case you ever need to look for something in the dark like when you drop something at the movies, or to light your room to look for something without awakening your significant other or children, guess what? Just take out your useful EnerHandz Gadget and light away!", "text": "Rechargeable Hand Warmer. These Reheatable Hand Warmers are Battery Operated and Reusable Many Times Over. Work as a Charger For Most Mobile Devices and Cell Phones Via USB. Built-in Micro Led Flashlight. Great for Arthritis and Raynaud´s Sufferers. 3 in 1: Rechargeable Hand Warmer, External Battery Charger and Mini Led FlashlightWhy purchase a low heat, one time disposable hand warmer when you can get the both of best worlds: A high quality, high heat producing and rechargeable and reusable hand warmer to heat your hands during those cold days and seasons. Charge at night, use on cold days, and repeat! Same hand warmer, many times over.Looking for a nice looking and comfortable-in-your-hand grip, with low and high heat option hand warmer?Then look no further! The EnerHandz, is the perfect choice for you if you are looking for a long lasting, rechargeable and reusable hand warmer with many other built in functions.Made of high quality steel casing this hand warmer will be your companion for a long time. Each full charge will heat up your hand warmer for 5 to 6 hours depending on your choice of preference between the low and high heat settings.Out of Battery Again? No More!How many times have you had to make an important call or check an important email just to grab your portable device and notice you are out of battery! Well worry no more. The EnerHandz hand warmer also works as an external, portable rechargeable battery pack so in case you ever need to recharge any of your mobile devices like your iPhone, iPod, iPad, Samsung phone or any other portable device that has a usb cable, you just pull it out of your pocket or bag and plug it in and presto you get a quick battery charge.Lost Something in The Dark?The EnerHandz also has a neat led micro flashlight built in, so in case you ever need to look for something in the dark like when you drop something at the movies, or to light your room to look for something without awakening your significant other or children, guess what? Just take out your useful EnerHandz Gadget and light away!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319fYETdBGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GUTLAY0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hand & Foot Warmers"]], "price": 37.97}}
