{"item_id": "B00GWA7V4A", "title": "Hoppe's 5.56mm/.223-Calibre AR Rifle Brush Multi-Pack (Chamber Brush, Chamber Mop, Bore Brush)", "description": "Multi-Pack AR style 5.56mm Dual Diameter Phosphor Bronze/Stainless Steel Chamber Brush, Phosphor Bronze Bore Brush and Cotton Swab.", "text": "Hoppe's 5.56mm/.223-Calibre AR Rifle Brush Multi-Pack (Chamber Brush, Chamber Mop, Bore Brush) Multi-Pack AR style 5.56mm Dual Diameter Phosphor Bronze/Stainless Steel Chamber Brush, Phosphor Bronze Bore Brush and Cotton Swab.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51B3E1bNx%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GWA7V4A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Brushes"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B00GWSQFPS", "title": "Jarv Premium Bluetooth® 4.0 Smart Heart Rate Monitor for Samsung Galaxy S4, Galaxy S5, Note 3, Nexus 4 , Nexus 5 , Nexus 7, Moto X, Moto Q, Motorola Droid RAZR MAXX and Other Android Devices Using OS 4.3 or Later", "description": "The Jarv Premium Bluetooth Smart heart rate monitor is a wireless heart rate monitor that uses Bluetooth 4.0 BLE technology to transmit data to your bluetooth device. The heart rate monitor together with 3rd party Apps turns your Phone or tablet into a mobile training device..great for runners, cyclists, and other fitness enthusiasts. It connects wirelessly via Bluetooth Smart technology to your device without the need for an adapter and delivers accurate real-time heart rate data. The Bluetooth Smart heart rate monitor WORKS WITH MOST ANDROID DEVICES USING OS 4.3 OR LATER and APPS USING THE LATEST BLE (bluetooth low energy) TECHNOLOGY. For a complete list of compatible devices visit Jarvmobile.com/faq Adjustable Soft Strap, Transmitter and long life Battery INCLUDED.", "text": "Jarv Premium Bluetooth® 4.0 Smart Heart Rate Monitor for Samsung Galaxy S4, Galaxy S5, Note 3, Nexus 4 , Nexus 5 , Nexus 7, Moto X, Moto Q, Motorola Droid RAZR MAXX and Other Android Devices Using OS 4.3 or Later The Jarv Premium Bluetooth Smart heart rate monitor is a wireless heart rate monitor that uses Bluetooth 4.0 BLE technology to transmit data to your bluetooth device. The heart rate monitor together with 3rd party Apps turns your Phone or tablet into a mobile training device..great for runners, cyclists, and other fitness enthusiasts. It connects wirelessly via Bluetooth Smart technology to your device without the need for an adapter and delivers accurate real-time heart rate data. The Bluetooth Smart heart rate monitor WORKS WITH MOST ANDROID DEVICES USING OS 4.3 OR LATER and APPS USING THE LATEST BLE (bluetooth low energy) TECHNOLOGY. For a complete list of compatible devices visit Jarvmobile.com/faq Adjustable Soft Strap, Transmitter and long life Battery INCLUDED.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411Y75Gn3gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GWSQFPS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jarv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Heart Rate Monitors"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B00GWZ27N0", "title": "Magpul MOE® 1911 Grip Panels", "description": "The instructors for Magpul's training division wanted a 1911 grip with advanced features, improved control characteristics, and Magpul value. These grips were designed with their input and testing. Constructed of heavy-duty reinforced polymer, MOE 1911 Grip Panels have a unique diamond-shaped cross section to prevent twisting in the hand, aggressive magazine release cut-out, aggressive texture for positive control, and are compatible with ambidextrous safeties. The grips are designed to fit full size framed 1911s with standard grip screw bushings. Available in black only, with additional fitments and materials coming. Made in U.S.A.", "text": "Magpul MOE® 1911 Grip Panels The instructors for Magpul's training division wanted a 1911 grip with advanced features, improved control characteristics, and Magpul value. These grips were designed with their input and testing. Constructed of heavy-duty reinforced polymer, MOE 1911 Grip Panels have a unique diamond-shaped cross section to prevent twisting in the hand, aggressive magazine release cut-out, aggressive texture for positive control, and are compatible with ambidextrous safeties. The grips are designed to fit full size framed 1911s with standard grip screw bushings. Available in black only, with additional fitments and materials coming. Made in U.S.A.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i8yZZRiEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GWZ27N0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MAGPUL INDUSTRIES CORPORATION", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 18.3}}
{"item_id": "B00GWZ56U6", "title": "NuoYa001 Fit For Rifle/Pistol Bore Snake Gun Cleaning .22 .223 5.56 Brass Weighted Cord", "description": "Feature : -Color:green+black-Brushes and swabs bore in one quick pass-Built-in bore brushes-Multiple short brushes embedded in the floss pass easily through the shortest action or port-Initial floss area (inside the barrel) removes loose grit and debris prior to the scrubbing action of the brush-Main floss, with 160 times more floss than a patch, supercleans the bore-Brass weighted drop-through cord slips easily down barrel; No assembly required-Grasp and pull the cleaning cord through the barrel.-One pull through does it all.-Lightweight and compact-No exposed metal to damage sensitive rifling or crownSolvent compatiblePackage Weight:0.4kg (0.882lb.)Package Size:20cm x 15cm x 5cm (7.87in x 5.91in x 1.97in)", "text": "NuoYa001 Fit For Rifle/Pistol Bore Snake Gun Cleaning .22 .223 5.56 Brass Weighted Cord Feature : -Color:green+black-Brushes and swabs bore in one quick pass-Built-in bore brushes-Multiple short brushes embedded in the floss pass easily through the shortest action or port-Initial floss area (inside the barrel) removes loose grit and debris prior to the scrubbing action of the brush-Main floss, with 160 times more floss than a patch, supercleans the bore-Brass weighted drop-through cord slips easily down barrel; No assembly required-Grasp and pull the cleaning cord through the barrel.-One pull through does it all.-Lightweight and compact-No exposed metal to damage sensitive rifling or crownSolvent compatiblePackage Weight:0.4kg (0.882lb.)Package Size:20cm x 15cm x 5cm (7.87in x 5.91in x 1.97in)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51L7IkhQ7yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GWZ56U6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B00GXAFK9C", "title": "SKLZ Quickster Baseball Combo Net System, 7x7 Feet", "description": "SKLZ Quickster Baseball Net Combo System", "text": "SKLZ Quickster Baseball Combo Net System, 7x7 Feet SKLZ Quickster Baseball Net Combo System", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51QkttUtCML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GXAFK9C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Practice Nets"]], "price": 169.99}}
{"item_id": "B00GXL0KYG", "title": "Mag-Tool Oval (Gen 2) Magnetic Bullet Button Magazine Release Tool AR-15 .223 / 5.56", "description": "This is a brand new AR-15 magnetic magazine release tool for the Mag-Lock or Bullet Button. The Mag-Tool Oval Gen 2 was released on 11/26/13. This newer version is smaller than the Mag-Tool Oval Generation 1. It was redesigned for a better and snug fit. The Mag-Tool Oval is made from a high quality hard Polyoxymethylene plastic (POM). It has a strong 4mm rare earth magnet that attaches to the Mag-Lock or a standard Bullet Button. The Mag-Tool Oval has a nice top square textured surface which gives it a more appealing and tactical look. This tool is small and ultra light. Now you have an easier alternative way to release your fixed 10 round AR-15 magazine.", "text": "Mag-Tool Oval (Gen 2) Magnetic Bullet Button Magazine Release Tool AR-15 .223 / 5.56 This is a brand new AR-15 magnetic magazine release tool for the Mag-Lock or Bullet Button. The Mag-Tool Oval Gen 2 was released on 11/26/13. This newer version is smaller than the Mag-Tool Oval Generation 1. It was redesigned for a better and snug fit. The Mag-Tool Oval is made from a high quality hard Polyoxymethylene plastic (POM). It has a strong 4mm rare earth magnet that attaches to the Mag-Lock or a standard Bullet Button. The Mag-Tool Oval has a nice top square textured surface which gives it a more appealing and tactical look. This tool is small and ultra light. Now you have an easier alternative way to release your fixed 10 round AR-15 magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jplMsCP5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GXL0KYG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B00GXUQ2QM", "title": "Stainless Steel Pint Cups (Pack of 5) - Multi-use 16oz Cups Made from Premium 18/8 SS. BPA & Toxin Free", "description": "Perfect for a drink of water, juice, iced coffee, beer, smoothies, milk or any other beverage, Fox Outfitters 16 oz Stainless Steel pint cups are the favored multi-use cup for any occasion. Forget those wasteful red plastic cups. Grab your stainless steel cups the next time you head out for a picnic, concert, BBQ, beach trip or just have friend over for dinner. With a stackable design, these cups are easy to toss into your backpack or cooler when you go camping or hiking. They also stack well inside your kitchen cupboard. Unlike glass cups, these durable stainless steel cups won't break or shatter. Dishwasher safe and highly reusable, you'll no longer need to buy wasteful plastic cups that not only make your drink taste bad, they also end up in our landfills.", "text": "Stainless Steel Pint Cups (Pack of 5) - Multi-use 16oz Cups Made from Premium 18/8 SS. BPA & Toxin Free Perfect for a drink of water, juice, iced coffee, beer, smoothies, milk or any other beverage, Fox Outfitters 16 oz Stainless Steel pint cups are the favored multi-use cup for any occasion. Forget those wasteful red plastic cups. Grab your stainless steel cups the next time you head out for a picnic, concert, BBQ, beach trip or just have friend over for dinner. With a stackable design, these cups are easy to toss into your backpack or cooler when you go camping or hiking. They also stack well inside your kitchen cupboard. Unlike glass cups, these durable stainless steel cups won't break or shatter. Dishwasher safe and highly reusable, you'll no longer need to buy wasteful plastic cups that not only make your drink taste bad, they also end up in our landfills.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4147m8DjgZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GXUQ2QM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B00GY18CA4", "title": "SKLZ Baseball Bullet Band and Power Handle Combo Set", "description": "The SKLZ Baseball Power Combo provides resistance training for throwing and swing strength. The Bullet Band resistance trainer allows players to work on key throwing muscles while maintaining a throwing grip. It also engages stabilizer muscles for injury prevention. Take it anywhere and attach to any stable fixture or door with the dual-purpose anchor. The Power Handle provides swing resistance, which helps build arm and upper body strength and core rotational speed -keys to increasing your swing speed and power. Develop core momentum behind your swing while magnifying the force behind your connection with the ball.", "text": "SKLZ Baseball Bullet Band and Power Handle Combo Set The SKLZ Baseball Power Combo provides resistance training for throwing and swing strength. The Bullet Band resistance trainer allows players to work on key throwing muscles while maintaining a throwing grip. It also engages stabilizer muscles for injury prevention. Take it anywhere and attach to any stable fixture or door with the dual-purpose anchor. The Power Handle provides swing resistance, which helps build arm and upper body strength and core rotational speed -keys to increasing your swing speed and power. Develop core momentum behind your swing while magnifying the force behind your connection with the ball.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lh5XztyqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GY18CA4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B00GY18CS6", "title": "SKLZ Square Up Visual Shooting Mechanics Trainer", "description": "The SKLZ Square Up is a visual rotation trainer which straps onto a basketball quickly and easily. The yellow triangles provide a visual aid to teach the correct ball rotation. The strap shape encourages correct hand placement and gives a player instant visual feedback.", "text": "SKLZ Square Up Visual Shooting Mechanics Trainer The SKLZ Square Up is a visual rotation trainer which straps onto a basketball quickly and easily. The yellow triangles provide a visual aid to teach the correct ball rotation. The strap shape encourages correct hand placement and gives a player instant visual feedback.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nUAMQ4KtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GY18CS6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Training Equipment"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00GZ99EES", "title": "NiteCore P12 High Intensity LED Long Throw Tactical Flashlight, Black", "description": "FeaturesPremium CREE XM-L2 (T6) LEDMaximum output of950 lumensSecond generation 'Crystal Coating Technology' combined with 'Precision Digital Optics Technology' provide extreme reflector performanceBoasts a peak beam intensity of 12,450cd and a throw distance of up to 222 metersHigh efficiency circuit board provides up to 520 hours runtime on lowSide switch interface provides one-handed operation and easy access to all functionsSide switch features an indicator light which displays reaming battery power (patented)Power indicator 's secondary function displays battery voltage (accurate to 0.1V)Intelligent memory function stores preferred brightness settingHigh-efficiency regulation circuit provides unwavering outputToughened ultra-clear mineral glass with anti-reflective coatingConstructed from aero grade aluminum alloy with HAIII military grade hard-anodized finishWaterproof in accordance with IPX-8 (two meters submersible)Impact resistant to 1.5 metersStainless steel titanium-plated clip includedTail stand capabilityDimensionsLength: 139mm (5.47\")Head Diameter: 25.4mm (1\")Tail Diameter: 25.4mm (1\")Weight: 88grams (3.10oz)(without battery)Accessories-Quality holster,-clip,-tactical ring,-lanyard,-spare tail cap,-spare O-ring2X EdisonBright CR123A lithium Batteries included", "text": "NiteCore P12 High Intensity LED Long Throw Tactical Flashlight, Black FeaturesPremium CREE XM-L2 (T6) LEDMaximum output of950 lumensSecond generation 'Crystal Coating Technology' combined with 'Precision Digital Optics Technology' provide extreme reflector performanceBoasts a peak beam intensity of 12,450cd and a throw distance of up to 222 metersHigh efficiency circuit board provides up to 520 hours runtime on lowSide switch interface provides one-handed operation and easy access to all functionsSide switch features an indicator light which displays reaming battery power (patented)Power indicator 's secondary function displays battery voltage (accurate to 0.1V)Intelligent memory function stores preferred brightness settingHigh-efficiency regulation circuit provides unwavering outputToughened ultra-clear mineral glass with anti-reflective coatingConstructed from aero grade aluminum alloy with HAIII military grade hard-anodized finishWaterproof in accordance with IPX-8 (two meters submersible)Impact resistant to 1.5 metersStainless steel titanium-plated clip includedTail stand capabilityDimensionsLength: 139mm (5.47\")Head Diameter: 25.4mm (1\")Tail Diameter: 25.4mm (1\")Weight: 88grams (3.10oz)(without battery)Accessories-Quality holster,-clip,-tactical ring,-lanyard,-spare tail cap,-spare O-ring2X EdisonBright CR123A lithium Batteries included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ft6bUNAPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00GZ99EES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nitecore", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B00H0Q1XXU", "title": "Rousch Model 4/15 Mil-Spec Charging Handle Assembly 7075 Aluminum Made In The USA .223 5.56 7.62X39 300 Blackout 9MM 6.8 SPC 6.5 Grendel and many others.", "description": "Mil-Spec Charging Handle Assembly. Made from 7075 Aluminum. Type III hard anodized for superior durability and corrosion resistance. MADE IN THE USA. Will fit all true Mil-Spec uppers and 99.99% of all billet uppers. Calibers that this handle can be used on include but are not limited to 5.56, .223, 7.62X39, 300 Blackout, 9MM, 6.8 SPC, 6.5 Grendel. Quality Parts At Wholesale Prices. Rousch Sports", "text": "Rousch Model 4/15 Mil-Spec Charging Handle Assembly 7075 Aluminum Made In The USA .223 5.56 7.62X39 300 Blackout 9MM 6.8 SPC 6.5 Grendel and many others. Mil-Spec Charging Handle Assembly. Made from 7075 Aluminum. Type III hard anodized for superior durability and corrosion resistance. MADE IN THE USA. Will fit all true Mil-Spec uppers and 99.99% of all billet uppers. Calibers that this handle can be used on include but are not limited to 5.56, .223, 7.62X39, 300 Blackout, 9MM, 6.8 SPC, 6.5 Grendel. Quality Parts At Wholesale Prices. Rousch Sports", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vOmUKFkCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H0Q1XXU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00H27XAAG", "title": "Deluxe 300 Blackout Case Trimming Jig", "description": "Precision deluxe case cutting jig with high impact plastic guard for 300 Blackout and others with similar case length. Affordable and precision products is what our company is known for and this is one of our many quality products with a price that is unbeatable. For a .223/5.56 cartridge to be accurately cut off and have the neck perfectly plum to the cartridge bottom, precise alignment is required. This can only be achieved with our design because the fixture is cut to fit the actual taper of the cartridge. Additionally, our case length will be exact each and every time you cut. Since precise cuts require a tapered bed for cartridge alignment the case cannot be pushed forward after its cut. You just lift the back end of the cut case up and toss it in a can and grab another, place it into the fixture, apply a little backward force so the case bottom rests on the stop for precise case length registration. Clear guard is placed so it does not interfere with your hand, and it can be easily removed. 100% Made in the USA", "text": "Deluxe 300 Blackout Case Trimming Jig Precision deluxe case cutting jig with high impact plastic guard for 300 Blackout and others with similar case length. Affordable and precision products is what our company is known for and this is one of our many quality products with a price that is unbeatable. For a .223/5.56 cartridge to be accurately cut off and have the neck perfectly plum to the cartridge bottom, precise alignment is required. This can only be achieved with our design because the fixture is cut to fit the actual taper of the cartridge. Additionally, our case length will be exact each and every time you cut. Since precise cuts require a tapered bed for cartridge alignment the case cannot be pushed forward after its cut. You just lift the back end of the cut case up and toss it in a can and grab another, place it into the fixture, apply a little backward force so the case bottom rests on the stop for precise case length registration. Clear guard is placed so it does not interfere with your hand, and it can be easily removed. 100% Made in the USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ojeZq7YxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H27XAAG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00H2K4TJO", "title": "CNC Warrior M92/M85 PAP Muzzle Detent Pin and Spring", "description": "Pin fits in front to retain muzzle devices in position. High quality steel pin, black oxide finish, backed by CNC Warrior's 100% quality guarantee. Spring and retaining pin included. Installation instructions included. It is recommended that this product be installed by a professional gunsmith. Length: 1 3/8 inches. Mfg by CNC Warrior LLC Pin and Spring MADE IN USA", "text": "CNC Warrior M92/M85 PAP Muzzle Detent Pin and Spring Pin fits in front to retain muzzle devices in position. High quality steel pin, black oxide finish, backed by CNC Warrior's 100% quality guarantee. Spring and retaining pin included. Installation instructions included. It is recommended that this product be installed by a professional gunsmith. Length: 1 3/8 inches. Mfg by CNC Warrior LLC Pin and Spring MADE IN USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MJjoVtq-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H2K4TJO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 9.79}}
{"item_id": "B00H2SF8F0", "title": "HemingWeigh Black High Density Foam Roller", "description": "Reward yourself and your body with a HemingWeigh Black High Density Foam Roller, and see why this is the most popular Foam Roller found in yoga studios, fitness clubs, schools, and at home!*We atHemingWeightake pride in supplying the most high quality Foam Rollers that provide the most comfort for your yoga and Exercise workouts. This high quality Foam Roller will last longer than most standard Foam Rollers. Our new Foam Roller is one of the firmest Foam Rollers on the market.*When shopping around for a Foam Roller, note that what many other companies call a Foam Roller isn't firm. These ''knock-off'' Foam Rollers are shorter and weigh less, indicative of their inferior quality.A firmer Foam Roller is good for all types of yoga, and exercise especially for restorative poses, Perfect for developing core stabilization, lower body balance and stamina, Helps Increase Circulation, and Helps Relieve Stress & Muscle Tightness. When used correctly, this foam roller can help athletes avoid many sports-related injuries. Increase range and/or flexibility of motion, and relieve muscle and joint pain.The moisture-resistant skin is easy to clean after use.", "text": "HemingWeigh Black High Density Foam Roller Reward yourself and your body with a HemingWeigh Black High Density Foam Roller, and see why this is the most popular Foam Roller found in yoga studios, fitness clubs, schools, and at home!*We atHemingWeightake pride in supplying the most high quality Foam Rollers that provide the most comfort for your yoga and Exercise workouts. This high quality Foam Roller will last longer than most standard Foam Rollers. Our new Foam Roller is one of the firmest Foam Rollers on the market.*When shopping around for a Foam Roller, note that what many other companies call a Foam Roller isn't firm. These ''knock-off'' Foam Rollers are shorter and weigh less, indicative of their inferior quality.A firmer Foam Roller is good for all types of yoga, and exercise especially for restorative poses, Perfect for developing core stabilization, lower body balance and stamina, Helps Increase Circulation, and Helps Relieve Stress & Muscle Tightness. When used correctly, this foam roller can help athletes avoid many sports-related injuries. Increase range and/or flexibility of motion, and relieve muscle and joint pain.The moisture-resistant skin is easy to clean after use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316PRCsX7QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H2SF8F0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Foam Rollers"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B00H31YY6U", "title": "Super G Grip w/ Storage Compartment Ar Rifles Mag416-blk", "description": "Super G MOE+ Grip Grip Black w/ Storage Compartment AR Rifles MAG416-BLK", "text": "Super G Grip w/ Storage Compartment Ar Rifles Mag416-blk Super G MOE+ Grip Grip Black w/ Storage Compartment AR Rifles MAG416-BLK", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418VNZYuBHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H31YY6U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SuperG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 20.78}}
{"item_id": "B00H3JO9OY", "title": "Exercise Bands. Resistance Bands. Premium 12 Piece Heavy Duty Set. Great For P90X, Yoga, And CrossFit. Extra Large Handles. Soft Padded Leg Straps. Strong Large Door Anchor..... Bonus E-Book With Over 50 Full Page Resistance Routines!", "description": "Fit By Resistance - 12 Piece Exercise Band Sets Are Awesome!Need To Work Out But Short On Time?- Workout In The Comfort Of Your Home.- No Need To Go To The Gym Every Day.- Portable And Light - Take Them With You.Fast Fit Bands Are The Best On The Market!100% premium imported, dipped and double layered Malaysian latex provides an unmatched, premium product. More latex means better resistance and longer life. The 'Dipped' process creates a superior rubber latex tube. Super strong, heavy duty accessories. Nothing cheap here!5 Premium Heavy Double Layered Bands- Yellow Band, 7-10 lbs.- Green Band, 14-16 lbs.- Red Band, 25-27 lbs.- Blue Band, 44-46 lbs.- Black Band, 49-52 lbs.Weight Comparisons Are An Estimate Only.Unbeatable Support And Warranty- No Worry Purchasing With Fit By Resistances 60 Day, 100% Satisfaction Guaranty- Lifetime Replacement Program. If Any Part Breaks, We Will Replace That Part For Free.- Custom E-Book That Will Help You Get The Most Out Of Your New Product.Remember, by purchasing from Fit By Resistance, you help us raise money for Breast Cancer Research.Don't Settle For Inferior Quality. Make The Best Choice Possible & Order Today!", "text": "Exercise Bands. Resistance Bands. Premium 12 Piece Heavy Duty Set. Great For P90X, Yoga, And CrossFit. Extra Large Handles. Soft Padded Leg Straps. Strong Large Door Anchor..... Bonus E-Book With Over 50 Full Page Resistance Routines! Fit By Resistance - 12 Piece Exercise Band Sets Are Awesome!Need To Work Out But Short On Time?- Workout In The Comfort Of Your Home.- No Need To Go To The Gym Every Day.- Portable And Light - Take Them With You.Fast Fit Bands Are The Best On The Market!100% premium imported, dipped and double layered Malaysian latex provides an unmatched, premium product. More latex means better resistance and longer life. The 'Dipped' process creates a superior rubber latex tube. Super strong, heavy duty accessories. Nothing cheap here!5 Premium Heavy Double Layered Bands- Yellow Band, 7-10 lbs.- Green Band, 14-16 lbs.- Red Band, 25-27 lbs.- Blue Band, 44-46 lbs.- Black Band, 49-52 lbs.Weight Comparisons Are An Estimate Only.Unbeatable Support And Warranty- No Worry Purchasing With Fit By Resistances 60 Day, 100% Satisfaction Guaranty- Lifetime Replacement Program. If Any Part Breaks, We Will Replace That Part For Free.- Custom E-Book That Will Help You Get The Most Out Of Your New Product.Remember, by purchasing from Fit By Resistance, you help us raise money for Breast Cancer Research.Don't Settle For Inferior Quality. Make The Best Choice Possible & Order Today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dXvFdW9wL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H3JO9OY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00H3L53BA", "title": "Speedminton S65 Badminton Set", "description": "The Speedminton S65 Badminton SetThe Speedminton S65 is a great starter set. Included is two aluminum rackets, a mixed tube of speeders, one wind ring, and two speedlights. In the mixed speeder tube, you will find all four speeder types for various levels of play. With the easy set up and simple rules, you can play this game in the park, beach or any wide open space! And with the glowing Night Speeder, you can even play in the dark. Within a few hits, you’ll be rallying in no time! Not only will you have a blast playing but you’ll be getting a good workout too, you can burn up to 700 calories per hour playing. With one hit, you’re hooked!", "text": "Speedminton S65 Badminton Set The Speedminton S65 Badminton SetThe Speedminton S65 is a great starter set. Included is two aluminum rackets, a mixed tube of speeders, one wind ring, and two speedlights. In the mixed speeder tube, you will find all four speeder types for various levels of play. With the easy set up and simple rules, you can play this game in the park, beach or any wide open space! And with the glowing Night Speeder, you can even play in the dark. Within a few hits, you’ll be rallying in no time! Not only will you have a blast playing but you’ll be getting a good workout too, you can burn up to 700 calories per hour playing. With one hit, you’re hooked!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51E%2B7IcYZeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H3L53BA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Badminton", "Complete Sets"]], "price": 49.99}}
