{"item_id": "B00H5AC0W4", "title": "Golf Glove, Premium Cabretta Leather Golf Glove, Men's left Hand or Men's right Hand, regular fit", "description": "Get the ultimate comfort and feel with this Cabretta Leather glove from Alpha Impact Premium Range Golf Glove!The premium leather in this Golf Glove was selected from only the finest raw materials. Uniquely treated to minimize the effects of perspiration and staining, this Glove assures you of superior suppleness, round after round. Maximum feel, consistent fit and lasting wearability are sought after by discriminating Golfers. By utilising finger air flow technology, Alpha Impact has produced their ultimate leather golf glove to provide players with cool comfort throughout their game.The perforated double line design flexes and expands with movement of the fingers causing air within the glove to be forced out and replaced with cool air from outside, maintaining a cycle of fresh air to cool the hands.The increased grip and control allows for harder swings to be made with more control, increasing distance. A breakthrough towards the tanning technology of the leather provides a luxurious soft feel throughout.", "text": "Golf Glove, Premium Cabretta Leather Golf Glove, Men's left Hand or Men's right Hand, regular fit Get the ultimate comfort and feel with this Cabretta Leather glove from Alpha Impact Premium Range Golf Glove!The premium leather in this Golf Glove was selected from only the finest raw materials. Uniquely treated to minimize the effects of perspiration and staining, this Glove assures you of superior suppleness, round after round. Maximum feel, consistent fit and lasting wearability are sought after by discriminating Golfers. By utilising finger air flow technology, Alpha Impact has produced their ultimate leather golf glove to provide players with cool comfort throughout their game.The perforated double line design flexes and expands with movement of the fingers causing air within the glove to be forced out and replaced with cool air from outside, maintaining a cycle of fresh air to cool the hands.The increased grip and control allows for harder swings to be made with more control, increasing distance. A breakthrough towards the tanning technology of the leather provides a luxurious soft feel throughout.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s00oSMKmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H5AC0W4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Gloves"]], "price": 10.99}}
