{"item_id": "B00H6U1L14", "title": "Monstrum Tactical 4x30 Ultra-Compact Rifle Scope with Illuminated Range Finder Reticle, and Built-In Red Laser Sight", "description": "The S430-B Rifle Scope is an ultra compact scope for close to mid range shooting, providing crystal clear targeting at 4 times magnification. At only 6 inches long and 13 ounces, it's a sleek and lightweight option for any flattop Weaver/Picatinny firearm, even mounting comfortably atop the standard AR carry handle. The S430-B comes equipped with a glass range finder reticle with BDC markings for on-the-fly range estimation and long distance targeting and an independently operated, integrated red laser sight for faster, more flexible acquisition of close quarter targets. The reticle illuminates in red or amber with adjustable intensity levels and can be seen in black without illumination, for clear targeting regardless of lighting or environment. The scope has an integrated mount that secures quickly to any Picatinny or Weaver rail equipped flat top rifle, with a see through design that allows for simultaneous use of low profile iron sights. Fashioned from aircraft grade aluminum, the scope is compact and lightweight, yet with a sturdy, weatherproof design. It is 6\" in length, 3.5\" inches in width, 2.5\" in height, and 13 ounces in weight. It has a Field of View at 100 yards of 26.5 feet, an eye relief of 3.5 inches, an exit pupil of 7.5mm, and a click value of 1/4 MOA. It comes with lens covers and one 3V CR2032 battery.", "text": "Monstrum Tactical 4x30 Ultra-Compact Rifle Scope with Illuminated Range Finder Reticle, and Built-In Red Laser Sight The S430-B Rifle Scope is an ultra compact scope for close to mid range shooting, providing crystal clear targeting at 4 times magnification. At only 6 inches long and 13 ounces, it's a sleek and lightweight option for any flattop Weaver/Picatinny firearm, even mounting comfortably atop the standard AR carry handle. The S430-B comes equipped with a glass range finder reticle with BDC markings for on-the-fly range estimation and long distance targeting and an independently operated, integrated red laser sight for faster, more flexible acquisition of close quarter targets. The reticle illuminates in red or amber with adjustable intensity levels and can be seen in black without illumination, for clear targeting regardless of lighting or environment. The scope has an integrated mount that secures quickly to any Picatinny or Weaver rail equipped flat top rifle, with a see through design that allows for simultaneous use of low profile iron sights. Fashioned from aircraft grade aluminum, the scope is compact and lightweight, yet with a sturdy, weatherproof design. It is 6\" in length, 3.5\" inches in width, 2.5\" in height, and 13 ounces in weight. It has a Field of View at 100 yards of 26.5 feet, an eye relief of 3.5 inches, an exit pupil of 7.5mm, and a click value of 1/4 MOA. It comes with lens covers and one 3V CR2032 battery.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qDA2-Vu2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H6U1L14.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00H73KXXC", "title": "NuoYa001 wholesale 6pcs/lot Archery Arrow Nocks Fletched Arrows Fiberglass for hunting Target Practice Shaft Glass Fiber high quality", "description": "This arrow was made of top quality materials .It has good performance , low hand shock with good speed.NOTE: This is NOT a toy, do NOT shoot at people", "text": "NuoYa001 wholesale 6pcs/lot Archery Arrow Nocks Fletched Arrows Fiberglass for hunting Target Practice Shaft Glass Fiber high quality This arrow was made of top quality materials .It has good performance , low hand shock with good speed.NOTE: This is NOT a toy, do NOT shoot at people", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51v1YY%2BV-OL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H73KXXC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NuoYa", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Targeting Arrows"]], "price": 11.18}}
{"item_id": "B00H7BOKB0", "title": "Mag Lula SR25/DPMS Magazine Loader and Unloader", "description": "The SR25/DPMS LULA Loader/Unloader loads 5, 10, 20, & 25 round SR25 type metal and polymer 7.62/.308 magazines. It does not fit early AR10 waffle magazines. It is simple to use in the loading or unloading mode. The loader/unloader eliminates thumb pain and wear on feed lips. It also prolongs magazine life, is lightweight and small enough to fit in your pocket. Made from durable reinforced polymer and is reliable in all weather.", "text": "Mag Lula SR25/DPMS Magazine Loader and Unloader The SR25/DPMS LULA Loader/Unloader loads 5, 10, 20, & 25 round SR25 type metal and polymer 7.62/.308 magazines. It does not fit early AR10 waffle magazines. It is simple to use in the loading or unloading mode. The loader/unloader eliminates thumb pain and wear on feed lips. It also prolongs magazine life, is lightweight and small enough to fit in your pocket. Made from durable reinforced polymer and is reliable in all weather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rcP5B6DZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H7BOKB0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagLula", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 28.68}}
{"item_id": "B00H7HP3YC", "title": "New Manufacture Military Surplus Steel Ammo Can Double Pack with 50 Caliber Ammo Can (M2A1) and 30 Caliber Ammo Can (M19A1)", "description": "This is a pack of one .50 caliber and one .30 caliber ammo cans. These are the same as the used cans that you can get at your local army/navy supply store, only they are brand new. You don't have to worry about dings, bad seals, or rust. Stock up and use these to store your boxed or loose ammunition, cleaning kits, airsoft accessories, tools, and just about anything that you want to stay airtight and watertight. You can even lock these things with a lock if you like. In addition, the lids are completely removable.", "text": "New Manufacture Military Surplus Steel Ammo Can Double Pack with 50 Caliber Ammo Can (M2A1) and 30 Caliber Ammo Can (M19A1) This is a pack of one .50 caliber and one .30 caliber ammo cans. These are the same as the used cans that you can get at your local army/navy supply store, only they are brand new. You don't have to worry about dings, bad seals, or rust. Stock up and use these to store your boxed or loose ammunition, cleaning kits, airsoft accessories, tools, and just about anything that you want to stay airtight and watertight. You can even lock these things with a lock if you like. In addition, the lids are completely removable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qNqE3npCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H7HP3YC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Solid Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 39.98}}
{"item_id": "B00H7SK7YW", "title": "Liroyal Credit Card Folding Safety Knife", "description": "Same size as a credit card. Slimmer and lighter than an ordinary knife, updated features. The extra long stainless steel blade ensures longer lasting rust free sharpness and the super light polypropylene body includes a built-in protective sheath that helps prevent injury or blunting.", "text": "Liroyal Credit Card Folding Safety Knife Same size as a credit card. Slimmer and lighter than an ordinary knife, updated features. The extra long stainless steel blade ensures longer lasting rust free sharpness and the super light polypropylene body includes a built-in protective sheath that helps prevent injury or blunting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oryBO3GlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00H7SK7YW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "vt innovation", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 3.34}}
