{"item_id": "B00HA2ZKCO", "title": "Sport-Brella Versa-Brella All Position Umbrella with Universal Clamp, Midnight Blue", "description": "With this ultra-aerodynamic umbrella you can be shaded in style. Easily attach the heavy-duty clamp of the Versa-Brella to any round or square surface and instantly add maximum sun protection to every activity. Table, chair, bleacher, stroller, golf cart, boat. You name it, you can shade it.", "text": "Sport-Brella Versa-Brella All Position Umbrella with Universal Clamp, Midnight Blue With this ultra-aerodynamic umbrella you can be shaded in style. Easily attach the heavy-duty clamp of the Versa-Brella to any round or square surface and instantly add maximum sun protection to every activity. Table, chair, bleacher, stroller, golf cart, boat. You name it, you can shade it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yZJA7IMDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HA2ZKCO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Shelters"]], "price": 17.99}}
