{"item_id": "B00HAMHU9A", "title": "Paracord Planet 1/8\" Shock Cord in Various Colors - Choose from 10, 25, 50, and 100 Feet, Made in USA", "description": "Description: Made from a Nylon sleeve that will protect the cord and its characteristics which is much better than a polypropylene sleeve which may deteriorate to direct sunlight.History: Originated to provide lightweight suspension for aircraft undercarriages before World War I to help absorb shock during transport and also assisted in old-style parachutes in deploying chutes when the ripcord was pulled.Make items: Hammock, bungee cords/straps, beading, necklaces, bracelets, seat/chair covers, cargo net, make a creative display, and other crafted projects.Storing items: In your garage, shed, attic, basement, storage unit, your vehicle, and much more.Assist with: Moving furniture, tent repair, storage, securing items, creating a hanging rack, organization, holding items together, moving items such as furniture, and more.Have on hand when: Traveling, camping, kayaking, biking, boating, hunting, and for general use.", "text": "Paracord Planet 1/8\" Shock Cord in Various Colors - Choose from 10, 25, 50, and 100 Feet, Made in USA Description: Made from a Nylon sleeve that will protect the cord and its characteristics which is much better than a polypropylene sleeve which may deteriorate to direct sunlight.History: Originated to provide lightweight suspension for aircraft undercarriages before World War I to help absorb shock during transport and also assisted in old-style parachutes in deploying chutes when the ripcord was pulled.Make items: Hammock, bungee cords/straps, beading, necklaces, bracelets, seat/chair covers, cargo net, make a creative display, and other crafted projects.Storing items: In your garage, shed, attic, basement, storage unit, your vehicle, and much more.Assist with: Moving furniture, tent repair, storage, securing items, creating a hanging rack, organization, holding items together, moving items such as furniture, and more.Have on hand when: Traveling, camping, kayaking, biking, boating, hunting, and for general use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61ZhR1KtllL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HAMHU9A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00HB1SYCC", "title": "Pearce Grips Magazine Extension for S&W M&P Shield", "description": "The Pearce PG-MPS provides control and comfort without sacrificing conceal ability. It blends with the contours and texture of the handgun to maintain a factory appearance. They are made from High Impact Polymer and withstand drop tests at temperatures from -20 F to 350 F. These units replace the magazine base plate. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine and provide better comfort by adding approximately 3/4 inch of gripping surface.", "text": "Pearce Grips Magazine Extension for S&W M&P Shield The Pearce PG-MPS provides control and comfort without sacrificing conceal ability. It blends with the contours and texture of the handgun to maintain a factory appearance. They are made from High Impact Polymer and withstand drop tests at temperatures from -20 F to 350 F. These units replace the magazine base plate. They do not alter the capacity of the magazine and provide better comfort by adding approximately 3/4 inch of gripping surface.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Hkm19OFPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HB1SYCC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.88}}
{"item_id": "B00HBZGT6G", "title": "Paracord Hero 10' 20' 50' 100' Hanks Parachute 550 Cord Type III 7 Strand Paracord - Largest Paracord Selection", "description": "Paracord Hero 550 Cord Paracord is proudly manufactured and distributed in the USA. We are proud to have you visiting our page on Amazon, allow us to be your last stop on your paracord search, with great prices quality paracord and more.Our 550 Cord Paracord has a minimum breaking strength of 550lbs, measuring at approximately 1/8\" in diameter. It's a must have for your next camping, hiking or outdoor adventure. You're not an out doors person? That's fine to parachute cord has many uses such as making paracord bracelets, paracord dog collors, paracord key chains, lanyards and much much more. Check out our storefront for many creations or crafting kits.", "text": "Paracord Hero 10' 20' 50' 100' Hanks Parachute 550 Cord Type III 7 Strand Paracord - Largest Paracord Selection Paracord Hero 550 Cord Paracord is proudly manufactured and distributed in the USA. We are proud to have you visiting our page on Amazon, allow us to be your last stop on your paracord search, with great prices quality paracord and more.Our 550 Cord Paracord has a minimum breaking strength of 550lbs, measuring at approximately 1/8\" in diameter. It's a must have for your next camping, hiking or outdoor adventure. You're not an out doors person? That's fine to parachute cord has many uses such as making paracord bracelets, paracord dog collors, paracord key chains, lanyards and much much more. Check out our storefront for many creations or crafting kits.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61FY928BtEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HBZGT6G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
