{"item_id": "B00HE1GZOS", "title": "TaylorMade JetSpeed Stand Bag", "description": "5-Way Top with handle (9.5\" x 8.25\"). 5.5 lbs. 4 pt. shoulder strap with Full length dividers. Zip-off ball pocket for embroidery. Removable ball pocket for customization. Embroidered logos. Pen sleeve. Nylon webbing trunk handle. Anti-split stand system. EVA ergonomically molded hip pad. 7 total pockets, featuring 1 velour-lined. Insulated cooler sleeve and Umbrella Sleeve. Rain hood. Towel loop. Cart compatible base.", "text": "TaylorMade JetSpeed Stand Bag 5-Way Top with handle (9.5\" x 8.25\"). 5.5 lbs. 4 pt. shoulder strap with Full length dividers. Zip-off ball pocket for embroidery. Removable ball pocket for customization. Embroidered logos. Pen sleeve. Nylon webbing trunk handle. Anti-split stand system. EVA ergonomically molded hip pad. 7 total pockets, featuring 1 velour-lined. Insulated cooler sleeve and Umbrella Sleeve. Rain hood. Towel loop. Cart compatible base.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lMV87RZML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HE1GZOS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TaylorMade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Club Bags", "Stand Bags"]], "price": 90.16}}
{"item_id": "B00HECWIZC", "title": "Presta Bicycle MTB Valve Caps French High Pressure Anodized Dust Cover 4 Colors", "description": "* Brand new and high quality.* Lightweight and lovely design.* Valve cap with sealing ring,more durable than the original one.* Prevent dirt and water get into the inside of valves and potentially jamming or contaminating the selling surfaces and causing a leak.* These are for the valve with the twiddly bit you unscrew to inflate the tyre, they will not fit car type valves. Valve Type : PrestaMaterial: Aluminium alloyColors:Silver/Golden/Blue/Red.PACKAGE INCLUDE1/2/4 X Presta Valve Cap", "text": "Presta Bicycle MTB Valve Caps French High Pressure Anodized Dust Cover 4 Colors * Brand new and high quality.* Lightweight and lovely design.* Valve cap with sealing ring,more durable than the original one.* Prevent dirt and water get into the inside of valves and potentially jamming or contaminating the selling surfaces and causing a leak.* These are for the valve with the twiddly bit you unscrew to inflate the tyre, they will not fit car type valves. Valve Type : PrestaMaterial: Aluminium alloyColors:Silver/Golden/Blue/Red.PACKAGE INCLUDE1/2/4 X Presta Valve Cap", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iTgp0tsHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HECWIZC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Valve Caps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00HENTKCA", "title": "Paracord Planet 100 Feet 3/32\" (2.38mm Diameter) Tactical 4-Strand Core Nylon Cord - 275 LB Tensile Strength - Made in the USA", "description": "Like working with paracord but want to work with something a little smaller? 275 Tactical paracord is great for those projects where you prefer to use a smaller diameter paracord. Being only 3/32\" of an inch in diameter, it works great for making bracelets for younger children. 275 Paracord is known as the younger brother of 550 paracord as it is half its size.Specifics:• 275 pound tensile strength• 4 strand inner core• Commercial Grade• Multiple purposes• Lightweight, durable, and versatile• Will not rot, mildew, or fade to UV sunlight• Colors will not run or bleedUse for: Making arts and crafts such as neckalces or bracelets, beading, DIY projects, camping, fishing, hunting, survival situations, biking, backpacking, and so much more!", "text": "Paracord Planet 100 Feet 3/32\" (2.38mm Diameter) Tactical 4-Strand Core Nylon Cord - 275 LB Tensile Strength - Made in the USA Like working with paracord but want to work with something a little smaller? 275 Tactical paracord is great for those projects where you prefer to use a smaller diameter paracord. Being only 3/32\" of an inch in diameter, it works great for making bracelets for younger children. 275 Paracord is known as the younger brother of 550 paracord as it is half its size.Specifics:• 275 pound tensile strength• 4 strand inner core• Commercial Grade• Multiple purposes• Lightweight, durable, and versatile• Will not rot, mildew, or fade to UV sunlight• Colors will not run or bleedUse for: Making arts and crafts such as neckalces or bracelets, beading, DIY projects, camping, fishing, hunting, survival situations, biking, backpacking, and so much more!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SGpoxjbaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HENTKCA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B00HESG0ZA", "title": "BlizeTec Rescue Survival Knife: Best 5-in-1 Tactical Pocket Folding Knife with LED Light, Seatbelt Cutter, Glass Breaker & Magnesium Fire Starter; A MUST HAVE for Emergency Escape/Camping/Hunting/Hiking/Outdoor; Quality Stainless Steel & Lifetime Warranty", "description": "Always Be Prepared: A Multi-Functional Emergency Rescue Knife With All You Need!Any time you bump into an unexpected situation, either in the forest or trapped in your vehicle, you can always count on the BlizeTec rescue knife. The survival knife is made of durable 420 stainless steel - making it ultra sharp. The main blade is accompanied by a build in seatbelt cutter, emergency LED light, glass breaker and magnesium fire starter. This multi-tool is created for all purposes. A MUST HAVE for traveler & outdoor enthusiasts. Your ultimate all in one survival tool for disaster preparedness & emergency escape. So, don't travel without it.Overall Features & Benefits* Incredibly light weight (5.46oz) & easy to carry* The knife comes with a belt clip so you can carry it around easily* Ultra sharp knife made of quality stainless steel material and anodized aluminum handle* 5-in-1 multi tool emergency survival knife* LED light can work up to 12 hrs with new batteries; button style battery cell: model no LR621; Diameter 6.5 MM, Quantity: 4 PCS* Include nylon pouch with premium gift box* Perfect for camping, emergency, survival or missions trips* Invest in Quality. A great gift for the ones you love* 100% RISK FREE back by a Lifetime WarrantyAll the Essentials for Emergency PreparednessThis is not your original rescue knife. BlizeTec folding knife is equipped with some of the most vital features a survivor must possess while keeping the size handy. The sharp serrated blade can safely cut through just about anything you'll encounter in the field: created for a multitude of uses in any harsh environment.CLICK the \"ADD to CART\" button NOW and Always be Protected!", "text": "BlizeTec Rescue Survival Knife: Best 5-in-1 Tactical Pocket Folding Knife with LED Light, Seatbelt Cutter, Glass Breaker & Magnesium Fire Starter; A MUST HAVE for Emergency Escape/Camping/Hunting/Hiking/Outdoor; Quality Stainless Steel & Lifetime Warranty Always Be Prepared: A Multi-Functional Emergency Rescue Knife With All You Need!Any time you bump into an unexpected situation, either in the forest or trapped in your vehicle, you can always count on the BlizeTec rescue knife. The survival knife is made of durable 420 stainless steel - making it ultra sharp. The main blade is accompanied by a build in seatbelt cutter, emergency LED light, glass breaker and magnesium fire starter. This multi-tool is created for all purposes. A MUST HAVE for traveler & outdoor enthusiasts. Your ultimate all in one survival tool for disaster preparedness & emergency escape. So, don't travel without it.Overall Features & Benefits* Incredibly light weight (5.46oz) & easy to carry* The knife comes with a belt clip so you can carry it around easily* Ultra sharp knife made of quality stainless steel material and anodized aluminum handle* 5-in-1 multi tool emergency survival knife* LED light can work up to 12 hrs with new batteries; button style battery cell: model no LR621; Diameter 6.5 MM, Quantity: 4 PCS* Include nylon pouch with premium gift box* Perfect for camping, emergency, survival or missions trips* Invest in Quality. A great gift for the ones you love* 100% RISK FREE back by a Lifetime WarrantyAll the Essentials for Emergency PreparednessThis is not your original rescue knife. BlizeTec folding knife is equipped with some of the most vital features a survivor must possess while keeping the size handy. The sharp serrated blade can safely cut through just about anything you'll encounter in the field: created for a multitude of uses in any harsh environment.CLICK the \"ADD to CART\" button NOW and Always be Protected!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W8xync2wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HESG0ZA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 38.98}}
{"item_id": "B00HFJBWQ0", "title": "Ispeed 70 oz Sport Hydration Pack", "description": "The sport Hydration Pack from Ispeed offers hands-free hydration with everything you need to enjoy two or more hours in the saddle or on a run. With 70-ounce capacity, an essentials pocket that fits a multitool or wallet, a stash pocket, an elastic cord system for shedding layers, and reflective accents, the pack has it all. The back panel and harness is made of diamond mesh and lightweight mesh for comfort and breathability. The hydration is BPA Free and FDA Approved.", "text": "Ispeed 70 oz Sport Hydration Pack The sport Hydration Pack from Ispeed offers hands-free hydration with everything you need to enjoy two or more hours in the saddle or on a run. With 70-ounce capacity, an essentials pocket that fits a multitool or wallet, a stash pocket, an elastic cord system for shedding layers, and reflective accents, the pack has it all. The back panel and harness is made of diamond mesh and lightweight mesh for comfort and breathability. The hydration is BPA Free and FDA Approved.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51exMZxjGML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HFJBWQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 28.99}}
