{"item_id": "B00HFZU85U", "title": "Primos Hook-Up Magnetic Box Call", "description": "The Primos Hook Up Magnetic Turkey Box Call utilizes a magnetically attached paddle and box system that eliminates the need for tuning or adjustment. The super-strong, rare-earth magnetic holds the paddle perfectly in place, every time. The box call's patented magnetic hinge design provides correct tension for realistic cuts, purrs and yelps. The removable paddle also allows for quiet carry in the field. Gobble strap included.", "text": "Primos Hook-Up Magnetic Box Call The Primos Hook Up Magnetic Turkey Box Call utilizes a magnetically attached paddle and box system that eliminates the need for tuning or adjustment. The super-strong, rare-earth magnetic holds the paddle perfectly in place, every time. The box call's patented magnetic hinge design provides correct tension for realistic cuts, purrs and yelps. The removable paddle also allows for quiet carry in the field. Gobble strap included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Va2q9rUvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HFZU85U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Turkey"]], "price": 20.28}}
{"item_id": "B00HH6VBEO", "title": "[2 PACK] Premium Silicone Swim Caps with Comfort Ear Pockets - Unisex for Men and Women Including Long Hair Swimmers - Maximum Durability - Anti-Hair Pull Design By The Friendly Swede - Lifetime Warranty", "description": "Premium Silicone SWIM CAPS 2 Pack FromThe Friendly SwedeMake a splash this summer with The Friendly Swede's amazing two pack of Premium quality silicone Swim Caps. Swim in style and comfort with our sleek, hydrodynamic contoured design.FEATURES:- 100% high quality silicone- Ergonomic Ear Pockets- Stretchy and durableDue to their high quality silicone material, our caps have greater durability than latex swimming caps - they won't easily rip or tear.Specially designed Ear Pockets to keep hair dry keep water and away from ears, combating Swimmer's Ear.Lightweight and comfortable for adults and teenagers. Suitable for men and women, recreational, competitive and fitness swimmers. Easy to put on and take off, even for swimmers with long hair. Design prevents caps from moving while swimming.Sleek design helps you swim faster and more efficiently - recommended by top US swim instructors.CONTENTS2 x Silicone Swim CapsZiplock Carry BagProduct Care InstructionsTHE FRIENDLY SWEDE PROMISEAt The Friendly Swede we do everything we can to make sure our customers are happy with their purchases. If for any reason you are not happy with any product supplied by The Friendly Swede, please do not hesitate to contact us and we will do our best to solve your problem ASAP!There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "text": "[2 PACK] Premium Silicone Swim Caps with Comfort Ear Pockets - Unisex for Men and Women Including Long Hair Swimmers - Maximum Durability - Anti-Hair Pull Design By The Friendly Swede - Lifetime Warranty Premium Silicone SWIM CAPS 2 Pack FromThe Friendly SwedeMake a splash this summer with The Friendly Swede's amazing two pack of Premium quality silicone Swim Caps. Swim in style and comfort with our sleek, hydrodynamic contoured design.FEATURES:- 100% high quality silicone- Ergonomic Ear Pockets- Stretchy and durableDue to their high quality silicone material, our caps have greater durability than latex swimming caps - they won't easily rip or tear.Specially designed Ear Pockets to keep hair dry keep water and away from ears, combating Swimmer's Ear.Lightweight and comfortable for adults and teenagers. Suitable for men and women, recreational, competitive and fitness swimmers. Easy to put on and take off, even for swimmers with long hair. Design prevents caps from moving while swimming.Sleek design helps you swim faster and more efficiently - recommended by top US swim instructors.CONTENTS2 x Silicone Swim CapsZiplock Carry BagProduct Care InstructionsTHE FRIENDLY SWEDE PROMISEAt The Friendly Swede we do everything we can to make sure our customers are happy with their purchases. If for any reason you are not happy with any product supplied by The Friendly Swede, please do not hesitate to contact us and we will do our best to solve your problem ASAP!There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mYkhFmQeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HH6VBEO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]], "price": 19.99}}
