ng through timberIN NO TIME.No other hand chainsaw or folding saw couldCOMPARE.You Won't Find A Better Pocket Chain Saw on the market.Why LIEUTNNT chainsaw?1.Cutting woods with Maximum Efficiency.92+ SUPER SUPER SHARP Teeth and Comfortable handle Ensure HIGHEST PERFORMANCE.2.BUILT TO LAST. Made with Highest Quality Steel.3.Extreme Portability and weighs nothing! Comes with belt loop pouch easily fits into camping pack.Our pocket chain saw is NOT for DOING EXERCISE but GETTING THE JOB DONE!60 Day Money Back GuaranteeIf within 60 days you're not 100% happy with your purchase,let us know and we'll refund your entire purchase price...no questions asked!Special Guarantee To You TodayIf within 60 days you could find another hand chain saw which works better than ours,send us a short video and we'll refund your entire purchase price (including shipping costs).Very Important...Read This:We Apologize If We're Sold Out. Because Of The Extremely High Demand For Our LIEUTNNT Hand Chain Saw,We Tend To Run Out Of Inventory Fast.Order Your LIEUTNNT Chain Saw Now While It's Still In Stock!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512lRlnXgJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HHLBFX6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Saws"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B00HI0PXMA", "title": "SNIPER Tactical Smart Polymer Picatinny/weaver Rear Flip Up Backup AR15 AR-15 M16 M4 M-4 Flattop Sight", "description": "Tactical Rear Polymer Iron Sights. • Equipped with Locking Retention Allen Wrench and Clever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Condition • Integral Picatinny Mounting Deck to Fit All Flat Tops • Dual Aiming Apertures for All Shooting Requirements • Precision Windage Adjustments • Clever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Conditions • User Friendly Locking With allen Wrench for Easy Installation", "text": "SNIPER Tactical Smart Polymer Picatinny/weaver Rear Flip Up Backup AR15 AR-15 M16 M4 M-4 Flattop Sight Tactical Rear Polymer Iron Sights. • Equipped with Locking Retention Allen Wrench and Clever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Condition • Integral Picatinny Mounting Deck to Fit All Flat Tops • Dual Aiming Apertures for All Shooting Requirements • Precision Windage Adjustments • Clever and Robust Flip-up Posi-lock Design to Guarantee Zero in the Most Extreme Combat Conditions • User Friendly Locking With allen Wrench for Easy Installation", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xX0bLNZlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HI0PXMA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SNIPER", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 15.5}}
{"item_id": "B00HIC3I34", "title": "Voberry Refillable Permanent Match Box Lighter Lites Keyring Gifted Fire w/o Lighter - Camping Hiking Outdoor Living Fire Lighter", "description": "Product Features:1. Keyring carried,refillable permanent match lighter2. Small size and light weight3. Works with ordinary lighter fluid and can be lite over 15000 times4. Ideal for outdoor activities such as camping, fishing, hunting, and so on5. Material: plastic internal and metal external6. Refillable with ordinary lighter fluid(not included) and can be lit over 15000 times7. Comes with a key-ring attached8. Voberry is a protected TrademarkPackage Included1 x Match Box Lighter", "text": "Voberry Refillable Permanent Match Box Lighter Lites Keyring Gifted Fire w/o Lighter - Camping Hiking Outdoor Living Fire Lighter Product Features:1. Keyring carried,refillable permanent match lighter2. Small size and light weight3. Works with ordinary lighter fluid and can be lite over 15000 times4. Ideal for outdoor activities such as camping, fishing, hunting, and so on5. Material: plastic internal and metal external6. Refillable with ordinary lighter fluid(not included) and can be lit over 15000 times7. Comes with a key-ring attached8. Voberry is a protected TrademarkPackage Included1 x Match Box Lighter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L3ktIvoNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HIC3I34.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Voberry", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 1.41}}
{"item_id": "B00HJ6O4A0", "title": "Camco 42805 60\" x 78\" Handy Mat with Strap", "description": "This Handy Mat is perfect to take with you wherever you go. Includes built-in handles and convenient pockets on both sides. Folds out to 60\" x 78\" and folds to a compact 10.5\" x 15\". Perfect for picnics, beaches, RVing and outings. Durable polypropylene is weather-proof and mold- and mildew-resistant. UV-stabilized for years of use. Easily cleans with soap and water.", "text": "Camco 42805 60\" x 78\" Handy Mat with Strap This Handy Mat is perfect to take with you wherever you go. Includes built-in handles and convenient pockets on both sides. Folds out to 60\" x 78\" and folds to a compact 10.5\" x 15\". Perfect for picnics, beaches, RVing and outings. Durable polypropylene is weather-proof and mold- and mildew-resistant. UV-stabilized for years of use. Easily cleans with soap and water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417k8bKeOLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HJ6O4A0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Blankets"]], "price": 12.51}}
{"item_id": "B00HJOZMP8", "title": "Sweatbands, Yoga Headband, for Women, Men, Teens, Ideal for Yoga, Zumba, Fitness, Sports.", "description": "Trendy Reversible Sports Headband In Black/Orange.These headbands are made out of high quality stretch cotton that fit all sizesThis headband has a very modern sporty look. Black on side Fiery Orange on the other. ZoneTwelve Headbands add style to your sports outfit. Reversible colours mean you can flaunt it how you feel. This is a quality reversible sports headband. Comes with signature ZoneTwelve logo on both sides.- Made out of high quality cotton.- Good elasticity, suitable for all people.- Great for sports, Tennis, Yoga, Zumba etc.- Breathable cotton, comfortable to wear.- Fashionable, sporty and look great.- Two different looks in one headband.- Can be worn in many different ways.Your trusty ZoneTwelve reversible headband will serve as your favourite headband for years to come.This product has a hassle free 30 day money back guaranteePurchase with full confidence now", "text": "Sweatbands, Yoga Headband, for Women, Men, Teens, Ideal for Yoga, Zumba, Fitness, Sports. Trendy Reversible Sports Headband In Black/Orange.These headbands are made out of high quality stretch cotton that fit all sizesThis headband has a very modern sporty look. Black on side Fiery Orange on the other. ZoneTwelve Headbands add style to your sports outfit. Reversible colours mean you can flaunt it how you feel. This is a quality reversible sports headband. Comes with signature ZoneTwelve logo on both sides.- Made out of high quality cotton.- Good elasticity, suitable for all people.- Great for sports, Tennis, Yoga, Zumba etc.- Breathable cotton, comfortable to wear.- Fashionable, sporty and look great.- Two different looks in one headband.- Can be worn in many different ways.Your trusty ZoneTwelve reversible headband will serve as your favourite headband for years to come.This product has a hassle free 30 day money back guaranteePurchase with full confidence now", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510hBXsfG6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HJOZMP8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Headbands"]], "price": 14.99}}
