{"item_id": "B00HK2P6YG", "title": "Exercise Bands 11 Piece Resistance Bands Set - Stackable, Complete with Door Anchor, Ankle Strap Handles, Carrying Case and Lifetime Warranty - by Omkara", "description": "Exercise Bands by OmkaraOmkara resistance bands are made from the highest quality rubber to ensure maximum life. Any combination of bands may be used at one time with this set of stackable resistance bands. Omkara exercise bands optimizes the advantage of using any single or multiple (1-5) bands at once to achieve multiple levels of resistance. Exercise without the hassles of having multiple handles on each band! This increase in range and ease of use makes this set perfect for anyone from beginners and experts. Meet the highest resistance possible with Omkara Stackable Resistance Bands.All Omkara Yoga products come with our exclusive 100% LIFETIME SATISFACTION GUARANTEE when purchased on Amazon.com.Click the Add to Cart Button Now!", "text": "Exercise Bands 11 Piece Resistance Bands Set - Stackable, Complete with Door Anchor, Ankle Strap Handles, Carrying Case and Lifetime Warranty - by Omkara Exercise Bands by OmkaraOmkara resistance bands are made from the highest quality rubber to ensure maximum life. Any combination of bands may be used at one time with this set of stackable resistance bands. Omkara exercise bands optimizes the advantage of using any single or multiple (1-5) bands at once to achieve multiple levels of resistance. Exercise without the hassles of having multiple handles on each band! This increase in range and ease of use makes this set perfect for anyone from beginners and experts. Meet the highest resistance possible with Omkara Stackable Resistance Bands.All Omkara Yoga products come with our exclusive 100% LIFETIME SATISFACTION GUARANTEE when purchased on Amazon.com.Click the Add to Cart Button Now!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lq6X4nMYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HK2P6YG.jpg", "metadata"