{"item_id": "B00HLG9QOM", "title": "Procella Golf Umbrella 62-Inch Large Windproof Rainproof Double Canopy Auto Open (Navy Blue & White)", "description": "The Secret of Never Having to Buy Another Golf Umbrella!Are you tired of golf umbrellas that are difficult to open, turn inside out in windy conditions and easily break apart?Procella Umbrella Presents The Best Golf Umbrella to Protect Yourself and Your Golf Bag From Strong Wind, Rain and Sun.Whatever the weather, we've got you covered! This umbrella is designed to be much larger than a standard umbrella, to protect both the golfer and his/her cart.While originally designed for the golfer on the course, it is also used by non-golfers in cities and elsewhere to provide better protection than smaller umbrellas that might not fully protect against the weather.Features:- Windproof construction with double canopy vent mesh system that doesn't flip inside out- Strong frame with reinforced fiberglass- Pinch-less Auto-Open feature makes it easy to open the umbrella with one hand- Large enough to cover at least two adults or one adult and your golf bag/cart- 100% Money Back Guarantee if you are not satisfied. No expensive charges for returning the umbrella like others haveThe big, specially designed, mesh linedcanopy vents allow the wind to pass through and keep out the rain! Simple and effective!The high quality frame and 14 mm shaft, made from fiberglass, give the Procella golf umbrella amazing strength with minimum weight, whilstthe rubberizedhandle has been designedwith comfort in mind.- 62\" arch span- 52\" edge to edge straight line- 39\" length when closed- Lightweight and durableThe ONLY Golf Umbrella Backed by our Lifetime No-Hassle Free Money Back Guarantee!Click on the Orange \"Add to Cart\" button at the top of the page NOW to place your order before we run out of stock!", "text": "Procella Golf Umbrella 62-Inch Large Windproof Rainproof Double Canopy Auto Open (Navy Blue & White) The Secret of Never Having to Buy Another Golf Umbrella!Are you tired of golf umbrellas that are difficult to open, turn inside out in windy conditions and easily break apart?Procella Umbrella Presents The Best Golf Umbrella to Protect Yourself and Your Golf Bag From Strong Wind, Rain and Sun.Whatever the weather, we've got you covered! This umbrella is designed to be much larger than a standard umbrella, to protect both the golfer and his/her cart.While originally designed for the golfer on the course, it is also used by non-golfers in cities and elsewhere to provide better protection than smaller umbrellas that might not fully protect against the weather.Features:- Windproof construction with double canopy vent mesh system that doesn't flip inside out- Strong frame with reinforced fiberglass- Pinch-less Auto-Open feature makes it easy to open the umbrella with one hand- Large enough to cover at least two adults or one adult and your golf bag/cart- 100% Money Back Guarantee if you are not satisfied. No expensive charges for returning the umbrella like others haveThe big, specially designed, mesh linedcanopy vents allow the wind to pass through and keep out the rain! Simple and effective!The high quality frame and 14 mm shaft, made from fiberglass, give the Procella golf umbrella amazing strength with minimum weight, whilstthe rubberizedhandle has been designedwith comfort in mind.- 62\" arch span- 52\" edge to edge straight line- 39\" length when closed- Lightweight and durableThe ONLY Golf Umbrella Backed by our Lifetime No-Hassle Free Money Back Guarantee!Click on the Orange \"Add to Cart\" button at the top of the page NOW to place your order before we run out of stock!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EMAaQVG-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HLG9QOM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Umbrellas"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00HNEAC8Q", "title": "Geared2U Bike Helmet Mirror - Lightweight Helmet Mount Bicycle Mirror - Perfect For Any Type Of Cycling - Know What's Around You To Keep You & Your Loved Ones Safe - The Best - No Risk - No Questions Asked - Lifetime Warranty", "description": "Are you nervous about staying safe while bike riding on today's congested roads?Have you had a close call on a bike because a vehicle surprised you from behind?With the Geared2U Helmet Mounted Bike Mirror you won't be surprised. You'll always be able to see what's coming behind you - without having to turn your head from the road in front of you.This high quality Bike Mirror keeps you safe because:- The mirror is convex so you see a wider field of view behind you at a glance but it's size means it won't obstruct your forward view either - so you can keep yourself safe from dangers in all directions!- The shaft length is designed specifically to put the mirror at the ideal distance from your eyes so you can immediately see what's there just at a glance. You don't need to strain or focus your eyes on the mirror when you should be looking at the road in front of you!- The Geared2U bike helmet mirror has screw-tightened joints designed specifically to hold the mirror in place. It won't move so you don't lose your field of view while riding and you aren't distracted having to adjust like other products that shake lose.- The mirror plate is adjustable through 360 degrees so you can position it exactly how you need it!Wearing the premium helmet mounted bike mirror means you always have warning for what is going on behind you. You don't have to shift your shoulders or look over your shoulder to get a good view which means your body position remains focused on the road ahead. This eliminates the danger of becoming unstable due to sudden body movements when surprised by a close, overtaking vehicle.Click the \"Add To Cart Button\" NOW and make your bike riding, or your loved one's bike riding safer today!", "text": "Geared2U Bike Helmet Mirror - Lightweight Helmet Mount Bicycle Mirror - Perfect For Any Type Of Cycling - Know What's Around You To Keep You & Your Loved Ones Safe - The Best - No Risk - No Questions Asked - Lifetime Warranty Are you nervous about staying safe while bike riding on today's congested roads?Have you had a close call on a bike because a vehicle surprised you from behind?With the Geared2U Helmet Mounted Bike Mirror you won't be surprised. You'll always be able to see what's coming behind you - without having to turn your head from the road in front of you.This high quality Bike Mirror keeps you safe because:- The mirror is convex so you see a wider field of view behind you at a glance but it's size means it won't obstruct your forward view either - so you can keep yourself safe from dangers in all directions!- The shaft length is designed specifically to put the mirror at the ideal distance from your eyes so you can immediately see what's there just at a glance. You don't need to strain or focus your eyes on the mirror when you should be looking at the road in front of you!- The Geared2U bike helmet mirror has screw-tightened joints designed specifically to hold the mirror in place. It won't move so you don't lose your field of view while riding and you aren't distracted having to adjust like other products that shake lose.- The mirror plate is adjustable through 360 degrees so you can position it exactly how you need it!Wearing the premium helmet mounted bike mirror means you always have warning for what is going on behind you. You don't have to shift your shoulders or look over your shoulder to get a good view which means your body position remains focused on the road ahead. This eliminates the danger of becoming unstable due to sudden body movements when surprised by a close, overtaking vehicle.Click the \"Add To Cart Button\" NOW and make your bike riding, or your loved one's bike riding safer today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vNDHzzXdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HNEAC8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Mirrors"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B00HNPN1YW", "title": "#1 Best Selling Bike Safety Light Set to fit the Rear of ANY BIKE- Fully Weatherproof & Water Resistant with a 5 Year Money Back Guarantee. Each light used 9 PREMIUM GRADE (LED) Lights for MAXIMUM SAFETY . Superior technology to offer HIGH VISABILITY to rated 1,800 Lumen (LM) Flux. Supplied with a removable bracket to adjust the angle of the light. Our (LED) Bike Light Set is fully (CE) & (RoHS) Certified. Each order recieves a FREE e-BOOK on Bike Maintanence written by The London Cyclist. Each Light comes with AAA Battery's fitted : All orders over $35 qualify for FREE Shipping . In STOCK & Ships TODAY with Amazon.com .... Be Safe, Be Seen, BUY TODAY & LIGHT UP YOUR BIKE FOR 2014!", "description": "STAY SAFE AND BE SEEN ON YOUR BIKE IN THE CITY OR ON THE OPEN ROAD?Across the globe the incidence of Bike related fatalty is on the rise. Cyclists need to be SEEN TO BE SAFE! Our (LED) BIKE LIGHT SET will help you to be seen on the road and keep you Cycling in safety. San Sero also offer a LIFETIME MONEY BACK GUARANTEEKEY BENEFITS & FEATURES:-Quality (LED) Bike light Set: Red & Clear Colours-Each light has 9 X LED bulbs with 4 Flash Modes-Fully water resistant with On/Off Switch at Back-Fully (CE) & RoHS Rated: Supplied with AAA Batteries-Size:92mm Long x 51mm Wide: Weight 70g-Uses Long-life RED (LED) Bulbs rated to 1,800 luminous flux-Weatherproof Design to fit on ANY BIKE : Road,MTB,BMX,City, Fixie-Features lens optics to increase visible distance & side LED to allow 180 degree safety visability-Easy fit bracket to fit to ANY BIKE seatpost & adjustable angle to suit-In STOCK & Ships TODAY with AmazonSUPERIOR DESIGN & PRICE:Our bike light set is made from durable (ABS) material made in a ISO 9001 accredited facility. You'll see the quality & performance of this product when you buy it.FREE BIKE e-BOOK:Each order receives a copy of \"Bike Maintenance Made Easy - Written By The London Cyclist\". This will help you to prepare and maintain your bike for every season.LIFETIME GUARANTEE:So you can buy with complete peace of mind, once you register your purchase with San Sero, we are happy to offer Amazon.com customers a LIFETIME GUARANTEE on our LED bike light set or your money back.FREE SHIPPING:All orders over $35 qualify for FREE DELIVERY on Amazon.com so click the Add To Cart button above and buy this offer today from San Sero!", "text": "#1 Best Selling Bike Safety Light Set to fit the Rear of ANY BIKE- Fully Weatherproof & Water Resistant with a 5 Year Money Back Guarantee. Each light used 9 PREMIUM GRADE (LED) Lights for MAXIMUM SAFETY . Superior technology to offer HIGH VISABILITY to rated 1,800 Lumen (LM) Flux. Supplied with a removable bracket to adjust the angle of the light. Our (LED) Bike Light Set is fully (CE) & (RoHS) Certified. Each order recieves a FREE e-BOOK on Bike Maintanence written by The London Cyclist. Each Light comes with AAA Battery's fitted : All orders over $35 qualify for FREE Shipping . In STOCK & Ships TODAY with Amazon.com .... Be Safe, Be Seen, BUY TODAY & LIGHT UP YOUR BIKE FOR 2014! STAY SAFE AND BE SEEN ON YOUR BIKE IN THE CITY OR ON THE OPEN ROAD?Across the globe the incidence of Bike related fatalty is on the rise. Cyclists need to be SEEN TO BE SAFE! Our (LED) BIKE LIGHT SET will help you to be seen on the road and keep you Cycling in safety. San Sero also offer a LIFETIME MONEY BACK GUARANTEEKEY BENEFITS & FEATURES:-Quality (LED) Bike light Set: Red & Clear Colours-Each light has 9 X LED bulbs with 4 Flash Modes-Fully water resistant with On/Off Switch at Back-Fully (CE) & RoHS Rated: Supplied with AAA Batteries-Size:92mm Long x 51mm Wide: Weight 70g-Uses Long-life RED (LED) Bulbs rated to 1,800 luminous flux-Weatherproof Design to fit on ANY BIKE : Road,MTB,BMX,City, Fixie-Features lens optics to increase visible distance & side LED to allow 180 degree safety visability-Easy fit bracket to fit to ANY BIKE seatpost & adjustable angle to suit-In STOCK & Ships TODAY with AmazonSUPERIOR DESIGN & PRICE:Our bike light set is made from durable (ABS) material made in a ISO 9001 accredited facility. You'll see the quality & performance of this product when you buy it.FREE BIKE e-BOOK:Each order receives a copy of \"Bike Maintenance Made Easy - Written By The London Cyclist\". This will help you to prepare and maintain your bike for every season.LIFETIME GUARANTEE:So you can buy with complete peace of mind, once you register your purchase with San Sero, we are happy to offer Amazon.com customers a LIFETIME GUARANTEE on our LED bike light set or your money back.FREE SHIPPING:All orders over $35 qualify for FREE DELIVERY on Amazon.com so click the Add To Cart button above and buy this offer today from San Sero!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XRm6TEkvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HNPN1YW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B00HO02TVC", "title": "Gerber 31-002554 Bear Grylls Compact Fire Starter", "description": "The Bear Grills Compact Fire Starter gives its user a necessary boost in getting a fire going in a survival scenario. A key factor to surviving in the wild is the ability to build a fire. With the Compact Fire Starter in a pocket or attached to a keychain or backpack, maintaining constant access to fire-starting potential is a cinch. Its simple, 2-piece design produces high quality fire-starting sparks using the easy-grip Ferro cerium rod when it matters most. Made of durable anodized aluminum with a textured rubber grip and water-resistant design, the Bear Grills Compact Fire Starter is capable of operation regardless of the elements.", "text": "Gerber 31-002554 Bear Grylls Compact Fire Starter The Bear Grills Compact Fire Starter gives its user a necessary boost in getting a fire going in a survival scenario. A key factor to surviving in the wild is the ability to build a fire. With the Compact Fire Starter in a pocket or attached to a keychain or backpack, maintaining constant access to fire-starting potential is a cinch. Its simple, 2-piece design produces high quality fire-starting sparks using the easy-grip Ferro cerium rod when it matters most. Made of durable anodized aluminum with a textured rubber grip and water-resistant design, the Bear Grills Compact Fire Starter is capable of operation regardless of the elements.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lAvqqPYPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HO02TVC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 18.95}}
{"item_id": "B00HO8Y9T4", "title": "3CERA® Huge Ferrocerium Rod Flint Fire Starter Magnesium Tool Kits Camping Hiking tool", "description": "Ferrocerium rod is made from Iron, Magnesium and mostly of an alloy of rare earth metals called mischmetal with an excellent pyrophoric percentage : 98%min. Specifications: Diameter: 8mm Length: 85mm Material: Ferrocerium", "text": "3CERA® Huge Ferrocerium Rod Flint Fire Starter Magnesium Tool Kits Camping Hiking tool Ferrocerium rod is made from Iron, Magnesium and mostly of an alloy of rare earth metals called mischmetal with an excellent pyrophoric percentage : 98%min. Specifications: Diameter: 8mm Length: 85mm Material: Ferrocerium", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QBVZ%2BT7PL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HO8Y9T4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00HOAZWG6", "title": "Uncle Mike's Tactical 3-Gun Competition Bag", "description": "Made from 1000 D nylon fabric, the 3-Gun bag has been designed to hold all your gear needed for competition in one place. Protected storage for your rifle, shotgun and pistol. The self-adjusting magazine storage area is capable of holding 10 AR-15 magazines and 4 pistol magazines. This do-it-all bag has multiple carry options including a shoulder strap, carry handle and a harness system. It has even been designed to fit inside of a Pelican 1750 for travel.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Tactical 3-Gun Competition Bag Made from 1000 D nylon fabric, the 3-Gun bag has been designed to hold all your gear needed for competition in one place. Protected storage for your rifle, shotgun and pistol. The self-adjusting magazine storage area is capable of holding 10 AR-15 magazines and 4 pistol magazines. This do-it-all bag has multiple carry options including a shoulder strap, carry handle and a harness system. It has even been designed to fit inside of a Pelican 1750 for travel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310tKL%2BAtsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HOAZWG6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 163.99}}
{"item_id": "B00HOB00J4", "title": "Uncle Mike's Tactical Competition Pistol Case", "description": "Born for the Competitor and equal to no other. The Uncle Mike's Tactical Pistol Case has all tactical pistols covered. Made from 1000 D, rip-stop nylon fabric, you can be sure your firearms will be well protected. This Tactical Pistol Case features six self-adjusting magazine pockets and can fit into the pocket of the Uncle Mike's 3 Gun Competition Bag.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Tactical Competition Pistol Case Born for the Competitor and equal to no other. The Uncle Mike's Tactical Pistol Case has all tactical pistols covered. Made from 1000 D, rip-stop nylon fabric, you can be sure your firearms will be well protected. This Tactical Pistol Case features six self-adjusting magazine pockets and can fit into the pocket of the Uncle Mike's 3 Gun Competition Bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hq15b23oL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HOB00J4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 41.12}}
{"item_id": "B00HPQ22XK", "title": "VIPERTEK VTS-191 - 25,000,000 V Heavy Duty Stun Gun - Rechargeable with LED Tactical Flashlight (Black)", "description": "The VIPERTEK VTS-191 stun gun really packs a punch! Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound, an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. If the sight and sound doesn't stop him, a jolt from this stun gun certainly will bring an attacker down! When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. Due to restrictions in some states, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, Connecticut, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County,IA VIPERTEK is a registered US trademark.", "text": "VIPERTEK VTS-191 - 25,000,000 V Heavy Duty Stun Gun - Rechargeable with LED Tactical Flashlight (Black) The VIPERTEK VTS-191 stun gun really packs a punch! Just test firing this unit into the air is often enough to stop an attacker. As the bright electric current pulsates between the test prongs and creates an intimidating electrical sound, an attacker with any sense at all will be stopped in his tracks. If the sight and sound doesn't stop him, a jolt from this stun gun certainly will bring an attacker down! When an attacker is touched by the stun gun it will disrupt the message the brain sends to the voluntary muscles. Simply touching an attacker will deliver a high voltage shock causing loss of balance and muscle control, confusion, and disorientation bringing him to his knees and making him incapable of further aggressive activity. Due to restrictions in some states, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, Connecticut, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County,IA VIPERTEK is a registered US trademark.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mh8JJF0BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HPQ22XK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 18.98}}
