{"item_id": "B00HRTEZB2", "title": "Black Credit Card Knife (Black Blade) Best Tactical Folding Knives by Muzitao©", "description": "Black Credit Card KnifeThe black credit card knife from Muzitao is a very handy tool to keep in your wallet or purse. Useful when you are out and want to cut food, tags, open packages and many other uses you won't even realize until you need it.SizeA superlight and supersharp folding utility knife. These folding knives are the same size as a credit card and fit into any credit card sized slot in your purse, wallet or handbag.InstructionsThe survival credit card knife can be transformed from a card into a functional knife in three quick and easy steps. The whole process can be done in less than 5 seconds.Step 1:The first step is to turn and release the safety catch found at the tip of the blade. Turn it until the green disappears. The push the bottom of the blade to flip it up.Step 2:Turn the knife over and flip over the left-hand smaller tab.Step 3:Flip down the right-side tab over the smaller tab and push to lock in place. You're done!FeaturesSlimmer and lighter than an ordinary knife. It has a unique safety lock which keeps the blade pinned down and is child-proof. The extra long stainless steel blade ensures longer lasting rust free sharpness and the superlight polypropylene body includes a built-in protective sheath that helps prevent injury or blunting.**Warning: TSA**Due to TSA guidelines we advise you to pack your folding credit card knife in your checked luggage to avoid confiscation at security.", "text": "Black Credit Card Knife (Black Blade) Best Tactical Folding Knives by Muzitao© Black Credit Card KnifeThe black credit card knife from Muzitao is a very handy tool to keep in your wallet or purse. Useful when you are out and want to cut food, tags, open packages and many other uses you won't even realize until you need it.SizeA superlight and supersharp folding utility knife. These folding knives are the same size as a credit card and fit into any credit card sized slot in your purse, wallet or handbag.InstructionsThe survival credit card knife can be transformed from a card into a functional knife in three quick and easy steps. The whole process can be done in less than 5 seconds.Step 1:The first step is to turn and release the safety catch found at the tip of the blade. Turn it until the green disappears. The push the bottom of the blade to flip it up.Step 2:Turn the knife over and flip over the left-hand smaller tab.Step 3:Flip down the right-side tab over the smaller tab and push to lock in place. You're done!FeaturesSlimmer and lighter than an ordinary knife. It has a unique safety lock which keeps the blade pinned down and is child-proof. The extra long stainless steel blade ensures longer lasting rust free sharpness and the superlight polypropylene body includes a built-in protective sheath that helps prevent injury or blunting.**Warning: TSA**Due to TSA guidelines we advise you to pack your folding credit card knife in your checked luggage to avoid confiscation at security.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ky0sB8W3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HRTEZB2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00HS5IGW4", "title": "HemingWeigh® Balance Disc", "description": "Reward yourself and your body with a HemingWeigh Balance Disc, and see why this is the most popular Balance Disc found in yoga studios, fitness clubs, schools, and at home!*We atHemingWeightake pride in supplying the most high quality Balance Discs that provide the most comfort for all your yoga and Exercise workouts. This high quality deluxe Balance Disc will last longer than most standard Balance Discs.*When shopping around for a Balance Disc, note that what many other companies call a Balance Disc is much flimsier than this Balance Disc. These ''knock-off'' Balance Discs are smaller and weigh less, indicative of their inferior quality.A Balance Disc is good for all types of yoga, and exercise especially for restorative poses.This Balance Disc is great for Balance Stability, Coordination and Flexibility.Improves Posture, and helps with Core and Ab Strengthening.The ergonomic design encourages proper posture while sitting ,standing, kneeling, or through low-impact strength trainingHelps Shape and tone your lower body.Examples of injuries where a balance disc can be used to improve proprioception include:Sprained ankleArthritisKnee anterior cruciate injuryAfter knee anterior cruciate surgeryAfter knee meniscus (cartilage) surgeryFollowing joint replacement surgeryCollateral knee ligament injuryBalance Disc's Help Children to Concentrate in ClassBalance Discs are frequently used in schools to assist children who find it difficult to sit still. Additionally balance training exercises have been shown to help children with Dyspraxia, Dyslexia and ADHD.The Moisture-resistant skin is easy to clean after use.", "text": "HemingWeigh® Balance Disc Reward yourself and your body with a HemingWeigh Balance Disc, and see why this is the most popular Balance Disc found in yoga studios, fitness clubs, schools, and at home!*We atHemingWeightake pride in supplying the most high quality Balance Discs that provide the most comfort for all your yoga and Exercise workouts. This high quality deluxe Balance Disc will last longer than most standard Balance Discs.*When shopping around for a Balance Disc, note that what many other companies call a Balance Disc is much flimsier than this Balance Disc. These ''knock-off'' Balance Discs are smaller and weigh less, indicative of their inferior quality.A Balance Disc is good for all types of yoga, and exercise especially for restorative poses.This Balance Disc is great for Balance Stability, Coordination and Flexibility.Improves Posture, and helps with Core and Ab Strengthening.The ergonomic design encourages proper posture while sitting ,standing, kneeling, or through low-impact strength trainingHelps Shape and tone your lower body.Examples of injuries where a balance disc can be used to improve proprioception include:Sprained ankleArthritisKnee anterior cruciate injuryAfter knee anterior cruciate surgeryAfter knee meniscus (cartilage) surgeryFollowing joint replacement surgeryCollateral knee ligament injuryBalance Disc's Help Children to Concentrate in ClassBalance Discs are frequently used in schools to assist children who find it difficult to sit still. Additionally balance training exercises have been shown to help children with Dyspraxia, Dyslexia and ADHD.The Moisture-resistant skin is easy to clean after use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51n2njJ4jkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HS5IGW4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Balance Boards"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B00HT352M2", "title": "Venum Elite Boxing Gloves", "description": "So our \"Elite\" boxing gloves was fully handmade in Thailand with a 100% Skintex leather conception in order to bring you the highest fighting experience at the best price. We used triple density foam for an unbelievable balanced shock distribution: fight after fight, you will be able to increase your striking level while minimizing the stressful sensation at the impact areas.", "text": "Venum Elite Boxing Gloves So our \"Elite\" boxing gloves was fully handmade in Thailand with a 100% Skintex leather conception in order to bring you the highest fighting experience at the best price. We used triple density foam for an unbelievable balanced shock distribution: fight after fight, you will be able to increase your striking level while minimizing the stressful sensation at the impact areas.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jK3dbdkFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HT352M2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Gloves", "Training Gloves"]]}}
