{"item_id": "B00HYQI4A6", "title": "TaylorMade Project (a) 1-Dozen Golf Balls", "description": "Our close connection with Tour professionals is based on respect and trust. We respect their input, and they trust our ability to use it to create the best performing clubs and balls for players of their caliber. That gave rise to our Tour Preferred line of products, long revered by the finest players in the world for striking the ultimate balance of look, feel, sound and performance. Our Tour Preferred line of golf balls includes the Tour Preferred and theTour Preferred X.The Tour Preferred and Tour Preferred X models are engineered with similar performance off the tee and around the green. The Tour Preferred model is for players seeking more spin on iron shots.REACTTM Core - Promotes fast speed off the driver and soft feel throughout the bag.Spin MantleTM Technology - Inner layers designed to promote consistent approach shot spin.New Soft TechTM Cover - New softer cover material promotes improved greenside spin and control.Seemless LDP 322 Dimple Pattern - Promotes penetrating ball flight for more distance into the wind.", "text": "TaylorMade Project (a) 1-Dozen Golf Balls Our close connection with Tour professionals is based on respect and trust. We respect their input, and they trust our ability to use it to create the best performing clubs and balls for players of their caliber. That gave rise to our Tour Preferred line of products, long revered by the finest players in the world for striking the ultimate balance of look, feel, sound and performance. Our Tour Preferred line of golf balls includes the Tour Preferred and theTour Preferred X.The Tour Preferred and Tour Preferred X models are engineered with similar performance off the tee and around the green. The Tour Preferred model is for players seeking more spin on iron shots.REACTTM Core - Promotes fast speed off the driver and soft feel throughout the bag.Spin MantleTM Technology - Inner layers designed to promote consistent approach shot spin.New Soft TechTM Cover - New softer cover material promotes improved greenside spin and control.Seemless LDP 322 Dimple Pattern - Promotes penetrating ball flight for more distance into the wind.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413muMrI5WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00HYQI4A6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TaylorMade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Distance Balls"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B00I00AGGA", "title": "#1 Front Bike Light! High quality front mount bicycle headlight / flashlight. Now with our FREE rear EZ Grip rear bike light included! - Fits Any Bike / Street / Mountain or Children's Bike - Attaches Easily - Quality Aluminum Construction - Waterproof - Great Safety & Emergency Features - Lumenx mountable bicycle light now available on Amazon. Free Shipping!", "description": "Are you looking for a high quality mountable bicycle light?Lumenx offers the BEST quality LED Bicycle light on Amazon. Now available with a FREE EZ Grip rear tail light! ($15 value. Limited supplies. BUY TODAY. 100% Money Back Guaranteed.- Portable and easy to install, no tools required- Durable military grade aluminum- Waterproof with advanced \"O\" ring seal- Convenient safety featuresAdvanced Focusing Lens designLumenx uses only LEDs that are shockproof with a higher light output and life span than competitive incandescent bulbs.- Bright CREE Q5 bulb- Up to 500 Feet light visibility- 1X - 2000X zoom and flash modeCommitment to QualityOur mountable bicycle light is guaranteed to be made of the highest quality materials and gives you the highest safety and security possible.Lumenx is dedicated to highest level of quality in compliance with ANAI (American National Standards Institute) industry standards for the flashlight category.Lumenx looks for ways to provide consumers with the best light solutions possible. ANSI Standards help measure these types of qualities and much more so that consumers can make better buying decisions.Your purchase is backed by our no hassle, 2 year money back guarantee.Click add to cart today and get a FREE clip-on rear tail light. $15 value free. Limited supplies so act fast.", "text": "#1 Front Bike Light! High quality front mount bicycle headlight / flashlight. Now with our FREE rear EZ Grip rear bike light included! - Fits Any Bike / Street / Mountain or Children's Bike - Attaches Easily - Quality Aluminum Construction - Waterproof - Great Safety & Emergency Features - Lumenx mountable bicycle light now available on Amazon. Free Shipping! Are you looking for a high quality mountable bicycle light?Lumenx offers the BEST quality LED Bicycle light on Amazon. Now available with a FREE EZ Grip rear tail light! ($15 value. Limited supplies. BUY TODAY. 100% Money Back Guaranteed.- Portable and easy to install, no tools required- Durable military grade aluminum- Waterproof with advanced \"O\" ring seal- Convenient safety featuresAdvanced Focusing Lens designLumenx uses only LEDs that are shockproof with a higher light output and life span than competitive incandescent bulbs.- Bright CREE Q5 bulb- Up to 500 Feet light visibility- 1X - 2000X zoom and flash modeCommitment to QualityOur mountable bicycle light is guaranteed to be made of the highest quality materials and gives you the highest safety and security possible.Lumenx is dedicated to highest level of quality in compliance with ANAI (American National Standards Institute) industry standards for the flashlight category.Lumenx looks for ways to provide consumers with the best light solutions possible. ANSI Standards help measure these types of qualities and much more so that consumers can make better buying decisions.Your purchase is backed by our no hassle, 2 year money back guarantee.Click add to cart today and get a FREE clip-on rear tail light. $15 value free. Limited supplies so act fast.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BrCMeI8aL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I00AGGA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Reflective Gear"]], "price": 25.77}}
{"item_id": "B00I00KIJK", "title": "Ez Grip Bike Light - Lumenx - Bike Like with Free Tailight - Fits Any Bike / Street / Mountain or Children's Bike - Attaches Easily - Aluminum Construction - Waterproof - Great Safety & Emergency Features - Lifetime Guarantee", "description": "Are you looking for an easy to install front and rear bike light for your kids?EZ Grip bike light is the smart and easy choice!We are proud to offer a simple solution to help keep you and your kids safe while riding. Our unique trademarked EZ Grip bike light is backed by the highest quality LED and superior quality materials.We use only the VERY best LED's available. EZ Grip bike light offers the best performance for the price.Super bright safety bike lightsNew high quality dual energy efficient LEDs1 Red LED (rear light) and 1 white LED (front light) for added safetyQuality flexible silicone water resistant bodyHighest Quality LED lightsSuper bright dual LEDs with 90 lumens provide up to 150M safe useFour modes: Constant, Strobe, Disco strobe, Epileptic Fit StrobeEnergy SavingBatteries Included (one for each bike light)Long lasting CR2032 lithium coin cell 3V batteries130 hours of flashing and 25 hours of constant lightAssemblingEasy integrated clip feature allow for quick mountingFits around any handlebar, seat post, frame tube, etc.Kid friendly - no assembly tools neededLimited time 50% off for value 2-pack. Normally $14.99 each. You get both a front and rear light for the price of one.Click Add to Cart now while supplies last.Don't buy other cheap imitation bike lights. Buy with confidence, with our money back life time guarantee.", "text": "Ez Grip Bike Light - Lumenx - Bike Like with Free Tailight - Fits Any Bike / Street / Mountain or Children's Bike - Attaches Easily - Aluminum Construction - Waterproof - Great Safety & Emergency Features - Lifetime Guarantee Are you looking for an easy to install front and rear bike light for your kids?EZ Grip bike light is the smart and easy choice!We are proud to offer a simple solution to help keep you and your kids safe while riding. Our unique trademarked EZ Grip bike light is backed by the highest quality LED and superior quality materials.We use only the VERY best LED's available. EZ Grip bike light offers the best performance for the price.Super bright safety bike lightsNew high quality dual energy efficient LEDs1 Red LED (rear light) and 1 white LED (front light) for added safetyQuality flexible silicone water resistant bodyHighest Quality LED lightsSuper bright dual LEDs with 90 lumens provide up to 150M safe useFour modes: Constant, Strobe, Disco strobe, Epileptic Fit StrobeEnergy SavingBatteries Included (one for each bike light)Long lasting CR2032 lithium coin cell 3V batteries130 hours of flashing and 25 hours of constant lightAssemblingEasy integrated clip feature allow for quick mountingFits around any handlebar, seat post, frame tube, etc.Kid friendly - no assembly tools neededLimited time 50% off for value 2-pack. Normally $14.99 each. You get both a front and rear light for the price of one.Click Add to Cart now while supplies last.Don't buy other cheap imitation bike lights. Buy with confidence, with our money back life time guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kgQIvLVIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I00KIJK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B00I00MP0U", "title": "Millett Tactical QRF-S Quick Release Standard Height Red Dot Scope Mount", "description": "The QRF Quick Release Mount is a robust and durable mounting solution. It is noted for its rapid attachment, return to zero function, no tools required and ability to attach in the dark with ease.", "text": "Millett Tactical QRF-S Quick Release Standard Height Red Dot Scope Mount The QRF Quick Release Mount is a robust and durable mounting solution. It is noted for its rapid attachment, return to zero function, no tools required and ability to attach in the dark with ease.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lyXS2M1-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I00MP0U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Millett Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B00I0HQ4MS", "title": "Workout Gloves - With Wrist Support Wraps - Best Weightlifting Apparel For Weight Lifting & Strength Training - Protect Your Hands With Gym Gear & Equipment For Men & Women - Dedicated To Growth, Exercise & Fitness - One Year Fully Guaranteed - FREE WORKOUT BONUS With Purchase", "description": "Build a Body You Can Be Proud Of...With B Nooch Premium Gym Gloves- Did your last pair of another brand's workout gloves fall apart after only 2-4 weeks of wear?- Tired of gym gloves that offer little support and almost no padding?- Have other gloves hurt more than they've helped your workouts?B Nooch Is a Global Lifestyle Brand & We Are \"Dedicated To Your Growth\"- We Are Proud To Deliver Gloves That Are Exactly What You Asked Us For:- We keep your hands protected, dry, comfortable & cool- Super flexible & long lasting gloves that keep your grip strong- Easily washable materials- Great craftsmanship with an understated styleLIMITED TIME - FREE BONUS GIFT - Fitness Guru Vince Del Monte's Training & Nutrition Guide *Delivered in PDF Format via Amazon's Email System*- \"The 8-8-16 Hyper-Growth Protocol\" shows you exactly how to pack on the maximum lean muscle possible in the shortest space of time.- Vince is a Muscle Building Expert, WBFF Pro Fitness Model and is featured in ESPN, AskMen.com, Men's Health & Inside Fitness- 4-week muscle-building workout - workout sheets, nutritional meal plan & supplement guide- This $97 value is yours to keep as our way of saying thank you!B Nooch Premium Gym Gloves Are Backed By a One Year No-Hassle Free Replacement Guarantee. And If Your Gloves Don't Fit Properly, We Will Replace Them With a Pair That Does!Click \"ADD TO CART\" At The Top Of The Page To Get Your B Nooch Gym Gloves with Amazon's Fast Delivery Service! Use Amazon Prime for Free 2nd Day Delivery. Hurry, SPECIAL SALE & FREE BONUS End Soon, So Buy Now!", "text": "Workout Gloves - With Wrist Support Wraps - Best Weightlifting Apparel For Weight Lifting & Strength Training - Protect Your Hands With Gym Gear & Equipment For Men & Women - Dedicated To Growth, Exercise & Fitness - One Year Fully Guaranteed - FREE WORKOUT BONUS With Purchase Build a Body You Can Be Proud Of...With B Nooch Premium Gym Gloves- Did your last pair of another brand's workout gloves fall apart after only 2-4 weeks of wear?- Tired of gym gloves that offer little support and almost no padding?- Have other gloves hurt more than they've helped your workouts?B Nooch Is a Global Lifestyle Brand & We Are \"Dedicated To Your Growth\"- We Are Proud To Deliver Gloves That Are Exactly What You Asked Us For:- We keep your hands protected, dry, comfortable & cool- Super flexible & long lasting gloves that keep your grip strong- Easily washable materials- Great craftsmanship with an understated styleLIMITED TIME - FREE BONUS GIFT - Fitness Guru Vince Del Monte's Training & Nutrition Guide *Delivered in PDF Format via Amazon's Email System*- \"The 8-8-16 Hyper-Growth Protocol\" shows you exactly how to pack on the maximum lean muscle possible in the shortest space of time.- Vince is a Muscle Building Expert, WBFF Pro Fitness Model and is featured in ESPN, AskMen.com, Men's Health & Inside Fitness- 4-week muscle-building workout - workout sheets, nutritional meal plan & supplement guide- This $97 value is yours to keep as our way of saying thank you!B Nooch Premium Gym Gloves Are Backed By a One Year No-Hassle Free Replacement Guarantee. And If Your Gloves Don't Fit Properly, We Will Replace Them With a Pair That Does!Click \"ADD TO CART\" At The Top Of The Page To Get Your B Nooch Gym Gloves with Amazon's Fast Delivery Service! Use Amazon Prime for Free 2nd Day Delivery. Hurry, SPECIAL SALE & FREE BONUS End Soon, So Buy Now!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417R3mcAXLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I0HQ4MS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]], "price": 35.95}}
{"item_id": "B00I0RSVQK", "title": "Kershaw 6034 Emerson Designed CQC-6K Knife", "description": "Kershaw Knives and Emerson Knives have joined forces on a series of knives that combine the precision engineering of Kershaw with Emerson's uncompromising functional design. The CQC-6K features a modified clip-point blade for versatile cutting ability. The blade has two finishes: a satin finish on the grind and a stonewashed finish on the upper. The handle's front scale of textured G-10 offers a secure grip and the handle's stainless steel back has a solid frame lock. The CQC-6K is a manual opener using either the thumb disk or the patented Emerson \"wave shaped feature.\" This opening feature enables the knife to be opened as it is removed from the pocket. By the time the knife has been fully withdrawn from the pocket, the blade is deployed and ready for use. A small wave-shaped tab on the top of the blade is built to catch on the pocket seam, opening the knife as it comes out of the pocket. This instant-open feature is a favorite among military, rescue and law enforcement knife users. The pocketclip is reversible for left- or right-handed carry.", "text": "Kershaw 6034 Emerson Designed CQC-6K Knife Kershaw Knives and Emerson Knives have joined forces on a series of knives that combine the precision engineering of Kershaw with Emerson's uncompromising functional design. The CQC-6K features a modified clip-point blade for versatile cutting ability. The blade has two finishes: a satin finish on the grind and a stonewashed finish on the upper. The handle's front scale of textured G-10 offers a secure grip and the handle's stainless steel back has a solid frame lock. The CQC-6K is a manual opener using either the thumb disk or the patented Emerson \"wave shaped feature.\" This opening feature enables the knife to be opened as it is removed from the pocket. By the time the knife has been fully withdrawn from the pocket, the blade is deployed and ready for use. A small wave-shaped tab on the top of the blade is built to catch on the pocket seam, opening the knife as it comes out of the pocket. This instant-open feature is a favorite among military, rescue and law enforcement knife users. The pocketclip is reversible for left- or right-handed carry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21cGOm6iu0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I0RSVQK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 33.35}}
{"item_id": "B00I1MYCHG", "title": "Zepp 3D Baseball Swing Analyzer", "description": "", "text": "Zepp 3D Baseball Swing Analyzer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BwP6OSKjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I1MYCHG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zepp", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Batting Trainers"]], "price": 114.0}}
{"item_id": "B00I1WVRBK", "title": "ThruNite® TN12 2014 Edition 1050 Lumen Single CREE XM-L2 U2 LED EDC Flashlight Black", "description": "Feature and Specification:- Improved UI for more lumens- Cree XM-L2 U2 LED with a lifespan of 50,000 hours- Uses one 18650 rechargeable battery or two CR123A batteries.- Max output:1050 lumens with XM-L2 U2- Working voltage: 2.7V-9V- 143mm (Length)*25.4mm (Diameter)- 82g weight (without batteries)- Reverse polarity protection design to protect from improper battery installation- Versatile mode 1050lm(90min) 800lm(1.5hour) 280lm(5hours) 20lm(74 hours) 0.3lm(1585hours)- Aircraft-grade aluminum body- Premium Type III hard-anodized anti-abrasive finish- Toughened ultra-clear glass lens with anti-reflective coating- Smooth reflector gives perfect beam and throw.OperationTurn ON/OFFPress the tail switch gently for momentary on or until it clicks to turn on the light.Press again to turn the light off.Changing ModesWith the light turns on, press the side switch to circle through five different mode outputs from firefly mode, low, medium,high and Max.Strobe:With the light turns on, press and hold the side switch for about 1 second to enter into strobe mode(13HZ).A single press on the side switch will return the flashlight to general lighting mode from strobe.", "text": "ThruNite® TN12 2014 Edition 1050 Lumen Single CREE XM-L2 U2 LED EDC Flashlight Black Feature and Specification:- Improved UI for more lumens- Cree XM-L2 U2 LED with a lifespan of 50,000 hours- Uses one 18650 rechargeable battery or two CR123A batteries.- Max output:1050 lumens with XM-L2 U2- Working voltage: 2.7V-9V- 143mm (Length)*25.4mm (Diameter)- 82g weight (without batteries)- Reverse polarity protection design to protect from improper battery installation- Versatile mode 1050lm(90min) 800lm(1.5hour) 280lm(5hours) 20lm(74 hours) 0.3lm(1585hours)- Aircraft-grade aluminum body- Premium Type III hard-anodized anti-abrasive finish- Toughened ultra-clear glass lens with anti-reflective coating- Smooth reflector gives perfect beam and throw.OperationTurn ON/OFFPress the tail switch gently for momentary on or until it clicks to turn on the light.Press again to turn the light off.Changing ModesWith the light turns on, press the side switch to circle through five different mode outputs from firefly mode, low, medium,high and Max.Strobe:With the light turns on, press and hold the side switch for about 1 second to enter into strobe mode(13HZ).A single press on the side switch will return the flashlight to general lighting mode from strobe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-2h%2BKzDeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I1WVRBK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B00I3JJIZI", "title": "Men's Sublimation Print Gel 3-D Padded Cycling Biking Short", "description": "", "text": "Men's Sublimation Print Gel 3-D Padded Cycling Biking Short", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31q1fX1PtmL._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I3JJIZI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Compression Shorts"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B00I3RXNB0", "title": "Type-III 6pc Liquid Filled Clip-On Compass Set for Watchband or Paracord Bracelets", "description": "These pocket sized compasses are a perfect accent to your tactical watch or paracord bracelet. They fit up to a 3/4\" watchband and 550 cord, they clip on with relative ease. Additionally they include a degree dial surrounding the compass. They double as emergency compasses, and because they are liquid filled they are extremely accurate. Attach them to your gear or paracord projects. You can also hand them out to your group before a hiking expedition so nobody loses their way.Note: multiple quantity orders will be shipped in bulk unless individual packaging is requested.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "text": "Type-III 6pc Liquid Filled Clip-On Compass Set for Watchband or Paracord Bracelets These pocket sized compasses are a perfect accent to your tactical watch or paracord bracelet. They fit up to a 3/4\" watchband and 550 cord, they clip on with relative ease. Additionally they include a degree dial surrounding the compass. They double as emergency compasses, and because they are liquid filled they are extremely accurate. Attach them to your gear or paracord projects. You can also hand them out to your group before a hiking expedition so nobody loses their way.Note: multiple quantity orders will be shipped in bulk unless individual packaging is requested.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ik5lrQ%2BWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I3RXNB0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 6.45}}
{"item_id": "B00I3T5R08", "title": "(3 Set) Type-III Firestarter Flint Toggle w/ Loop Knife and Striker for Paracord Projects", "description": "The set comes with a solid magnesium toggle and a loop knife with striker. The toggle/knife combo is perfect for paracord bracelets and projects. The serrated striker makes sparking the flint easy. Don't be without fire ever again, start your campfires the first time every time. This item is for true pyromaniacs and is not a toy.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "text": "(3 Set) Type-III Firestarter Flint Toggle w/ Loop Knife and Striker for Paracord Projects The set comes with a solid magnesium toggle and a loop knife with striker. The toggle/knife combo is perfect for paracord bracelets and projects. The serrated striker makes sparking the flint easy. Don't be without fire ever again, start your campfires the first time every time. This item is for true pyromaniacs and is not a toy.*This product is exclusive to Type-III Products. It comes in a sealed package with our trademarked logo and header card.*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31W38w1gtqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I3T5R08.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00I4ES4TI", "title": "American 45 Degree Offset Rapid Transition BUIS Backup Iron Sights For AR15 AR 15 M4 - Comes With Manual", "description": "American Defense Group's\"Rapid Acquisition Offset Sights\"are designed to allow the user to quickly transition from a magnified optic to iron sights for close range shooting (or BUIS) without the need to break your cheek weld or move your hands off the rifle.When mounted to a picatinny rail the RAOS are positioned roughly 45 degrees off center, which allows you to bring the sights into alignment by simply canting your rifle slightly to the side. This unique set up allows for lightning fast transitions between long & close range targets without the need to mess with your primary optics settings.RAOS are manufactured to the highest quality standards & are quality control checked in the USA. These areNOTcheap Chinese made toys. As part of our durability testing the RAOS were put through a5,000 round torture test& have been deployed on Competition rifles as well as duty rifles for Military and Law enforcement personnel.ADG's goal was to produce the highest quality rapid transition sights possible and bring them to market for a price that would not break the bank of the shooters who support us.SPECS:- Designed for the AR-15/M4 platform.- 45 degree offset with same height above bore as standard M4/M16A4 sights.- MOA elevation & windage adjustments.- Low profile design will not interfere with primary optic.- Mounts directly to the top picatinny rail of your rifle using a flat head screw. (No special tools needed)- Machined from 7075 aluminum alloy bar stock. (lighter & stronger than 6061 T6 aluminum)- Mil-Spec Type III Hard Anodized finish.- Weight: Rear sight - 3 ounces (85g) / Front sight - 1.5 ounces (44g).- Comes with DIGITAL, printable manual for installation & zeroing of the sights.", "text": "American 45 Degree Offset Rapid Transition BUIS Backup Iron Sights For AR15 AR 15 M4 - Comes With Manual American Defense Group's\"Rapid Acquisition Offset Sights\"are designed to allow the user to quickly transition from a magnified optic to iron sights for close range shooting (or BUIS) without the need to break your cheek weld or move your hands off the rifle.When mounted to a picatinny rail the RAOS are positioned roughly 45 degrees off center, which allows you to bring the sights into alignment by simply canting your rifle slightly to the side. This unique set up allows for lightning fast transitions between long & close range targets without the need to mess with your primary optics settings.RAOS are manufactured to the highest quality standards & are quality control checked in the USA. These areNOTcheap Chinese made toys. As part of our durability testing the RAOS were put through a5,000 round torture test& have been deployed on Competition rifles as well as duty rifles for Military and Law enforcement personnel.ADG's goal was to produce the highest quality rapid transition sights possible and bring them to market for a price that would not break the bank of the shooters who support us.SPECS:- Designed for the AR-15/M4 platform.- 45 degree offset with same height above bore as standard M4/M16A4 sights.- MOA elevation & windage adjustments.- Low profile design will not interfere with primary optic.- Mounts directly to the top picatinny rail of your rifle using a flat head screw. (No special tools needed)- Machined from 7075 aluminum alloy bar stock. (lighter & stronger than 6061 T6 aluminum)- Mil-Spec Type III Hard Anodized finish.- Weight: Rear sight - 3 ounces (85g) / Front sight - 1.5 ounces (44g).- Comes with DIGITAL, printable manual for installation & zeroing of the sights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GvKjxdpEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I4ES4TI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00I5T58UK", "title": "Schrade SCHF27 Extreme Survival Full Tang Fixed Blade Knife and Tool", "description": "Fixed Blade 8Cr13Mov Steel, Full Tang, Lanyard Hole, Removable Knife - Founded by Stewart Taylor in 1975, Taylor Brands has been manufacturing, designing and distributing high-quality stainless steel knives and accessories since their inception.", "text": "Schrade SCHF27 Extreme Survival Full Tang Fixed Blade Knife and Tool Fixed Blade 8Cr13Mov Steel, Full Tang, Lanyard Hole, Removable Knife - Founded by Stewart Taylor in 1975, Taylor Brands has been manufacturing, designing and distributing high-quality stainless steel knives and accessories since their inception.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21LBpo4Y8FL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I5T58UK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schrade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 32.33}}
{"item_id": "B00I7KSX9A", "title": "Millett Tactical M-Force 1x24mm Red Dot Sight with Cantilever Mount", "description": "Millett Tactical Series Red Dots. The most reliable, rugged red dots you'll find when looking for speed and accuracy in a sight for your tactical fire arm. Whether you are putting this on an AR flat top, shotgun or pistol, the Tactical Series Red Dots are the answer. The M-Force is a multi-purpose 5 MOA red dot sight which features 10 selectable brightness settings, flip-up scope caps and a 30mm one-piece cantilever mount for optimum sight height for AR flat tops.", "text": "Millett Tactical M-Force 1x24mm Red Dot Sight with Cantilever Mount Millett Tactical Series Red Dots. The most reliable, rugged red dots you'll find when looking for speed and accuracy in a sight for your tactical fire arm. Whether you are putting this on an AR flat top, shotgun or pistol, the Tactical Series Red Dots are the answer. The M-Force is a multi-purpose 5 MOA red dot sight which features 10 selectable brightness settings, flip-up scope caps and a 30mm one-piece cantilever mount for optimum sight height for AR flat tops.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Q8Gxh0d0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I7KSX9A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Millett Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 146.49}}
{"item_id": "B00I873EZA", "title": "Xtreme Rollers X1 Exercise System", "description": "This revolutionary Xtreme Rollers exercise system can give you a full body workout in 12 minutes a day. It is a compact, easy to carry system. The revolutionary Xtreme Roller exercise system uses nine omni-directional casters to keep your body guessing and work every major muscle group.", "text": "Xtreme Rollers X1 Exercise System This revolutionary Xtreme Rollers exercise system can give you a full body workout in 12 minutes a day. It is a compact, easy to carry system. The revolutionary Xtreme Roller exercise system uses nine omni-directional casters to keep your body guessing and work every major muscle group.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PjyUJtFvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I873EZA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Xtreme Rollers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Home Gyms"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B00I8XZ4HA", "title": "Hydracentials Slim Grip 25oz Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Flip Cap Leak Proof Design- BPA Free - Eco Friendly - Leak Proof - Top Rated Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Straw (Blue)", "description": "Hydracentials Slim, Sleek, and Stylish Easy Grip Stainless Steel Water BottleKeep Your Favorite Beverage Cool, Crisp, Refreshing, and Tasting Great Even On the Go!- Holds 25oz of your beverage- Keeps your drink cool for hours- Stainless Steel keeps your beverage clean, crisp and toxin free! BPA Free, it won't leech toxins into your drink!The Stainless Steel Material and Sleek, Slim Easy Grip Design Make it effortless to enjoy your favorite beverageThe Hydracentials Stainless Steel Water Bottle is stands out among a crowd for it's sleek, slim and easy grip design.The slim design and easy grip grooves allow for easy handling and use. It's great for kids too!The secure twist on top allows you to easily attach to backpacks or bags.The flip up spout cap allows for easy use and flips down for a secure leak proof closureProduct Details- Made from durable and reusable 100% stainless steel will keep the bottle in great condition.- Wide mouth opening and detachable straw allows for easy cleaning- Hand washing with soap and water.- Do NOT put in the microwave.-Fits easily is most cup holders Product Dimensions: 10\" H x 2.75\" W Capacity: 25oz (750ml)This product is designed for cold beverages only.Seller Warranty1 year Guarantee.Get Your Hydracentials Stainless Steel Water Bottle at the low discounted price now!", "text": "Hydracentials Slim Grip 25oz Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Flip Cap Leak Proof Design- BPA Free - Eco Friendly - Leak Proof - Top Rated Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Straw (Blue) Hydracentials Slim, Sleek, and Stylish Easy Grip Stainless Steel Water BottleKeep Your Favorite Beverage Cool, Crisp, Refreshing, and Tasting Great Even On the Go!- Holds 25oz of your beverage- Keeps your drink cool for hours- Stainless Steel keeps your beverage clean, crisp and toxin free! BPA Free, it won't leech toxins into your drink!The Stainless Steel Material and Sleek, Slim Easy Grip Design Make it effortless to enjoy your favorite beverageThe Hydracentials Stainless Steel Water Bottle is stands out among a crowd for it's sleek, slim and easy grip design.The slim design and easy grip grooves allow for easy handling and use. It's great for kids too!The secure twist on top allows you to easily attach to backpacks or bags.The flip up spout cap allows for easy use and flips down for a secure leak proof closureProduct Details- Made from durable and reusable 100% stainless steel will keep the bottle in great condition.- Wide mouth opening and detachable straw allows for easy cleaning- Hand washing with soap and water.- Do NOT put in the microwave.-Fits easily is most cup holders Product Dimensions: 10\" H x 2.75\" W Capacity: 25oz (750ml)This product is designed for cold beverages only.Seller Warranty1 year Guarantee.Get Your Hydracentials Stainless Steel Water Bottle at the low discounted price now!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TJNS2XMWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00I8XZ4HA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 2.99}}
