{"item_id": "B00IDBOU4U", "title": "Emergency Mylar Thermal Blankets (5 Pack)", "description": "5 Pack, Specially Designed Emergency Rescue / Survival Blanket Provides Compact Secure Protection In All Weather Conditions. Made of a Rugged Durable Insulated Mylar Material. Consistently Retains and Reflects 90% of Body Heat. Individually Sealed Packaging. Folded to Compact Wallet Size For Easy Storage.", "text": "Emergency Mylar Thermal Blankets (5 Pack) 5 Pack, Specially Designed Emergency Rescue / Survival Blanket Provides Compact Secure Protection In All Weather Conditions. Made of a Rugged Durable Insulated Mylar Material. Consistently Retains and Reflects 90% of Body Heat. Individually Sealed Packaging. Folded to Compact Wallet Size For Easy Storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QKtwPtzgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IDBOU4U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mylar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 5.19}}
{"item_id": "B00IDCW9Z6", "title": "Solo Stove Pot 1800: Stainless Steel Companion Pot for Solo Stove Titan. Great for Backpacking, Camping, Survival", "description": "The lightweight Solo Stove Pot 1800 is the companion pot crafted specifically for use with the Solo Stove Titan. When nested, the Solo Stove Titan fits inside the Solo Stove Pot 1800 for easy storage. Made with premium grade 304 stainless steel, the Solo Stove Pot 1800 is more durable than aluminum pots and arguably, a safer and healthier choice. The Solo Stove Pot 1800 features:- Easy to use lid with a rubber coated lift tab (lockable in the upright position)- Pour spout for easy pouring- Double fold out handles- Volume markings in oz and mL- Folding/Removeable bail- Black nylon stuff sack with drawstring", "text": "Solo Stove Pot 1800: Stainless Steel Companion Pot for Solo Stove Titan. Great for Backpacking, Camping, Survival The lightweight Solo Stove Pot 1800 is the companion pot crafted specifically for use with the Solo Stove Titan. When nested, the Solo Stove Titan fits inside the Solo Stove Pot 1800 for easy storage. Made with premium grade 304 stainless steel, the Solo Stove Pot 1800 is more durable than aluminum pots and arguably, a safer and healthier choice. The Solo Stove Pot 1800 features:- Easy to use lid with a rubber coated lift tab (lockable in the upright position)- Pour spout for easy pouring- Double fold out handles- Volume markings in oz and mL- Folding/Removeable bail- Black nylon stuff sack with drawstring", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VbXMScvuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IDCW9Z6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]], "price": 45.99}}
{"item_id": "B00IDEBFUY", "title": "Solo Stove Tripod: Compact Lightweight Aluminum Tripod with Adjustable Hang Chain. Perfect for Camping, Backpacking, Survival", "description": "Use the Tripod along with the Solo Stove Titan and Solo Stove Pot 1800 for increased cooking stability. Lightweight and compact, the Tripod is easy to setup and disassemble. The adjustable hang chain allows you to control the height at which your pot hangs over your flame giving you a more flexible outdoor cooking experience.", "text": "Solo Stove Tripod: Compact Lightweight Aluminum Tripod with Adjustable Hang Chain. Perfect for Camping, Backpacking, Survival Use the Tripod along with the Solo Stove Titan and Solo Stove Pot 1800 for increased cooking stability. Lightweight and compact, the Tripod is easy to setup and disassemble. The adjustable hang chain allows you to control the height at which your pot hangs over your flame giving you a more flexible outdoor cooking experience.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rfl8sgzIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IDEBFUY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B00IDEM9LS", "title": "Solo Stove Titan & Solo Pot 1800 Camp Stove Combo: Woodburning Backpacking Stove Great for Camping and Survival", "description": "The patented Solo Stove Titan is the larger version of the original Solo Stove. It is a unique wood burning stove that incorporates a secondary combustion for a more efficient and cleaner burn. The bottom vents allow air to enter and flow up the bottom of the grate to feed the primary combustion, a top down smolder. In addition, air entering in from the bottom vents heats up within the inner wall and rises up and out the top firebox vents causing a secondary combustion at the top of the stove. The Solo Stove Titan actually cooks the smoke out of the wood and then burns the smoke twice! This technique makes for a cleaner burn, less smoke and higher efficiency.Forget the Fuel:Our stoves cook your meals with nothing but the twigs you collect on your journey, eliminating the need for heavy, expensive, polluting petroleum gas. It's easy to light, fast to boil and clean to use.Gasify your Wood:A unique gasification and secondary combustion process lets our stoves achieve a highly efficient and more complete burn. This means you'll use fewer twigs to achieve a boil. It also means less smoke while cooking.Travel Lighter:The Solo Stove Titan only weighs 16.5 oz and eliminates the need to carry fuel canisters - a great way to lighten your load. It also nests inside most pots leaving you with more space in your pack.Stay Green:By using renewable resources for fuel instead of petroleum, you're reducing your carbon footprint. You'll also keep fuel canisters out of the landfill.Be Prepared:The Solo Stove is great for emergency situations.Solo Stove Pot 1800 included", "text": "Solo Stove Titan & Solo Pot 1800 Camp Stove Combo: Woodburning Backpacking Stove Great for Camping and Survival The patented Solo Stove Titan is the larger version of the original Solo Stove. It is a unique wood burning stove that incorporates a secondary combustion for a more efficient and cleaner burn. The bottom vents allow air to enter and flow up the bottom of the grate to feed the primary combustion, a top down smolder. In addition, air entering in from the bottom vents heats up within the inner wall and rises up and out the top firebox vents causing a secondary combustion at the top of the stove. The Solo Stove Titan actually cooks the smoke out of the wood and then burns the smoke twice! This technique makes for a cleaner burn, less smoke and higher efficiency.Forget the Fuel:Our stoves cook your meals with nothing but the twigs you collect on your journey, eliminating the need for heavy, expensive, polluting petroleum gas. It's easy to light, fast to boil and clean to use.Gasify your Wood:A unique gasification and secondary combustion process lets our stoves achieve a highly efficient and more complete burn. This means you'll use fewer twigs to achieve a boil. It also means less smoke while cooking.Travel Lighter:The Solo Stove Titan only weighs 16.5 oz and eliminates the need to carry fuel canisters - a great way to lighten your load. It also nests inside most pots leaving you with more space in your pack.Stay Green:By using renewable resources for fuel instead of petroleum, you're reducing your carbon footprint. You'll also keep fuel canisters out of the landfill.Be Prepared:The Solo Stove is great for emergency situations.Solo Stove Pot 1800 included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Zj923dzsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IDEM9LS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 135.99}}
{"item_id": "B00IFHFJXI", "title": "Ivation Battery-Powered Handheld Portable Shower - Turns Water From Bucket/Basin/Sink Into Steady, Gentle Stream - Suitable for Indoor/Outdoor Use, Pet Washing, Car Washing, Camping, Baby Showering - Powered by Built-In Lithium 2200mAh Rechargeable Battery", "description": "Just Add WaterHere is a waterproof, battery-powered portable shower that can serve multiple purposes indoors or out. By drawing water from virtually any bucket, basin or sink, the Ivation portable shower system turns a pool of water into a gentle shower-like stream on demand. This level of mobility and shower-anywhere capability is great for many uses such as on-the-go showering for campers and hikers; accessible poolside or beach showering; gentle bathtub showering for toddlers/babies, eliminating the need to use the strong overheard shower stream; an easy, portable water stream for home car washers; outdoor horse cleaning, and even house-pet washing in the bathtub.Rechargeable via USBFor a true go-anywhere shower, a built-in rechargeable 2200mAh lithium battery powers the Ivation portable shower for up to 60 minutes on a single charge. Charging is easy via USB connection to a computer or laptop, or with a 12v car adapter (Not Included). Couple that with the included suction cup and hanging hook, and you've got a shower ready when you are. The suction cup works on most flat surfaces, and allows parents to use both hands when showering their children. Use the S-shaped hook when camping to hang the lightweight, 1.4-pound Ivation showerhead on any nearby branch, and voila! You've got yourself a modern \"crying tree.\"Get clean. With cleaner water.The Ivation portable shower features a built-in water filtration system that cleans the water while the shower is in use. This does not affect the flow of water, which runs through the 6.5-foot hose at a consistent 2.5i/minute. For the camper or hiker, the filtration system in a brilliant innovation, turning lake or pool water into clean shower water.", "text": "Ivation Battery-Powered Handheld Portable Shower - Turns Water From Bucket/Basin/Sink Into Steady, Gentle Stream - Suitable for Indoor/Outdoor Use, Pet Washing, Car Washing, Camping, Baby Showering - Powered by Built-In Lithium 2200mAh Rechargeable Battery Just Add WaterHere is a waterproof, battery-powered portable shower that can serve multiple purposes indoors or out. By drawing water from virtually any bucket, basin or sink, the Ivation portable shower system turns a pool of water into a gentle shower-like stream on demand. This level of mobility and shower-anywhere capability is great for many uses such as on-the-go showering for campers and hikers; accessible poolside or beach showering; gentle bathtub showering for toddlers/babies, eliminating the need to use the strong overheard shower stream; an easy, portable water stream for home car washers; outdoor horse cleaning, and even house-pet washing in the bathtub.Rechargeable via USBFor a true go-anywhere shower, a built-in rechargeable 2200mAh lithium battery powers the Ivation portable shower for up to 60 minutes on a single charge. Charging is easy via USB connection to a computer or laptop, or with a 12v car adapter (Not Included). Couple that with the included suction cup and hanging hook, and you've got a shower ready when you are. The suction cup works on most flat surfaces, and allows parents to use both hands when showering their children. Use the S-shaped hook when camping to hang the lightweight, 1.4-pound Ivation showerhead on any nearby branch, and voila! You've got yourself a modern \"crying tree.\"Get clean. With cleaner water.The Ivation portable shower features a built-in water filtration system that cleans the water while the shower is in use. This does not affect the flow of water, which runs through the 6.5-foot hose at a consistent 2.5i/minute. For the camper or hiker, the filtration system in a brilliant innovation, turning lake or pool water into clean shower water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L7yDs2aDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IFHFJXI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Showers"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B00IGAQ7KS", "title": "Monster Fitness Premium Exercise Mat", "description": "Monster Fitness Exercise Mat. Engineered with Sustainability, high quality material which will not peel, flake or fade. Eco Safe, Free from Phthalates and Latex.* Durable .1/2\" thick foam mat* Comfortable and durable* Durable & long-lasting material* Non-slip gripping surface* Comfortable and portableThis is a very light weight mat. Because it is made from Nitrile/Buna N Rubber (NBR) foam.It holds up even when exposed to moisture, chemicals, or oil-based products. While it is easyto clean, this eco mat is also free of toxic materials and does not release dangerous gases back into the atmosphere.While keeping the body and mind in excellent condition is the ultimate goal of yoga, keeping the earth in good shapeis also a primary consideration for many of its health conscious practitioners. For this reason, it is exciting that Monster Fitness is now offering an eco mat.FeaturesComfortably cushions spine, hips, knees, and elbows on hard floorsSuperior wear and longevityNon-sticky, even when wet from light perspirationHelps learner easily achieve desired positionIndividual & illuminating colors that define your inner selfMat CareWhether your mat is brand new, slightly used, or looking a little tattered, proper care can prolong its life even if its new.To clean your pvc mat effectively and efficiently,use a mat wash and sponge.Lightly spray your mat with the mat wash (without saturating it) and wipe it down gently with a sponge.Wait a few seconds before rolling up your mat and you're done!", "text": "Monster Fitness Premium Exercise Mat Monster Fitness Exercise Mat. Engineered with Sustainability, high quality material which will not peel, flake or fade. Eco Safe, Free from Phthalates and Latex.* Durable .1/2\" thick foam mat* Comfortable and durable* Durable & long-lasting material* Non-slip gripping surface* Comfortable and portableThis is a very light weight mat. Because it is made from Nitrile/Buna N Rubber (NBR) foam.It holds up even when exposed to moisture, chemicals, or oil-based products. While it is easyto clean, this eco mat is also free of toxic materials and does not release dangerous gases back into the atmosphere.While keeping the body and mind in excellent condition is the ultimate goal of yoga, keeping the earth in good shapeis also a primary consideration for many of its health conscious practitioners. For this reason, it is exciting that Monster Fitness is now offering an eco mat.FeaturesComfortably cushions spine, hips, knees, and elbows on hard floorsSuperior wear and longevityNon-sticky, even when wet from light perspirationHelps learner easily achieve desired positionIndividual & illuminating colors that define your inner selfMat CareWhether your mat is brand new, slightly used, or looking a little tattered, proper care can prolong its life even if its new.To clean your pvc mat effectively and efficiently,use a mat wash and sponge.Lightly spray your mat with the mat wash (without saturating it) and wipe it down gently with a sponge.Wait a few seconds before rolling up your mat and you're done!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hdvP4LbYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IGAQ7KS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Mats"]], "price": 22.99}}
{"item_id": "B00IGE5O3U", "title": "Airsoft Paintball Tactical Vertical Foregrip with Pup Out Bipod + Steel Inserted Leg + Side Rail for Attaching Flashlight/laser for Airsoft Rifle", "description": "Weight: 190g Height: 154mm (Bipod Retracted)", "text": "Airsoft Paintball Tactical Vertical Foregrip with Pup Out Bipod + Steel Inserted Leg + Side Rail for Attaching Flashlight/laser for Airsoft Rifle Weight: 190g Height: 154mm (Bipod Retracted)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lEBSgQ2gL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IGE5O3U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 10.59}}
{"item_id": "B00IGICMVS", "title": "H&R1871 NEF Pardner Pump Shotgun Scope Base Rail Mount with 14 Ring Slot Picatinny Weaver", "description": "A light weight low profile scope base rail for H&R1871; Pardner pump shotgun. The rail has 14 ring slots which make it easier to set up eye relief and find more desired placement of scopes or red dot sights on top of the receiver. The scope rail is compatible with both Picatinny and weaver rings and also will mount tactical red dot sights with Picatinny mount. Machined from extruded aluminum alloy. Mounting screws are included with the unit.Rail type: Picatinny and weaverNumber of ring slots: 14Overall length: 5 7/8\"Finish: Anodized matte blackWeight: 1.4oz", "text": "H&R1871 NEF Pardner Pump Shotgun Scope Base Rail Mount with 14 Ring Slot Picatinny Weaver A light weight low profile scope base rail for H&R1871; Pardner pump shotgun. The rail has 14 ring slots which make it easier to set up eye relief and find more desired placement of scopes or red dot sights on top of the receiver. The scope rail is compatible with both Picatinny and weaver rings and also will mount tactical red dot sights with Picatinny mount. Machined from extruded aluminum alloy. Mounting screws are included with the unit.Rail type: Picatinny and weaverNumber of ring slots: 14Overall length: 5 7/8\"Finish: Anodized matte blackWeight: 1.4oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eEAiZkeNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IGICMVS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B00IGRSBMS", "title": "Tennis Vibration Dampeners (6 Pack)", "description": "Vibration Dampeners (6 Pack)Great novelty vibration dampeners to brighten your day. This tennis racquet vibration dampener set will be the talk of the court. Keep them all for yourself or give them away. Make a great gift for tennis fanatics. They are also excellent for kidsRed- Best all-round (all-court game).Black- Explosive power.Yellow- Speed and endurance.White- Egg Bomb (big servers).Blue- 3-pronged attack (quick net play).Pig- Defensive style.Tennis ElbowThe main use of these vibration dampeners is to lessen the racket vibration when you hit the ball. When the ball is struck the vibration travels from your racket to your hand and up your arm. Most people have heard of tennis elbow. A stiff racket can produce a lot of vibration and this can lead to tennis elbow. Having a flexible racket and a vibration dampener will lessen the chances of tennis elbow.The range of different vibration dampeners in this set give you a spectrum of dampening effect. Generally the larger the dampener the more it will dull the vibration. You can try each dampener until you find your desired level of feel and comfortability.Other Uses:• Gifts for tennis fanatics• For kids as gifts or motivational tools• Prizes in contests and competitions• To identify different rackets• To make people smile!Vibration Dampener Tennis, Squash and BadmintonNot just for tennis rackets. You can use these vibration dampeners in any strung racket.", "text": "Tennis Vibration Dampeners (6 Pack) Vibration Dampeners (6 Pack)Great novelty vibration dampeners to brighten your day. This tennis racquet vibration dampener set will be the talk of the court. Keep them all for yourself or give them away. Make a great gift for tennis fanatics. They are also excellent for kidsRed- Best all-round (all-court game).Black- Explosive power.Yellow- Speed and endurance.White- Egg Bomb (big servers).Blue- 3-pronged attack (quick net play).Pig- Defensive style.Tennis ElbowThe main use of these vibration dampeners is to lessen the racket vibration when you hit the ball. When the ball is struck the vibration travels from your racket to your hand and up your arm. Most people have heard of tennis elbow. A stiff racket can produce a lot of vibration and this can lead to tennis elbow. Having a flexible racket and a vibration dampener will lessen the chances of tennis elbow.The range of different vibration dampeners in this set give you a spectrum of dampening effect. Generally the larger the dampener the more it will dull the vibration. You can try each dampener until you find your desired level of feel and comfortability.Other Uses:• Gifts for tennis fanatics• For kids as gifts or motivational tools• Prizes in contests and competitions• To identify different rackets• To make people smile!Vibration Dampener Tennis, Squash and BadmintonNot just for tennis rackets. You can use these vibration dampeners in any strung racket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QslPx5D%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IGRSBMS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Racquet Sports", "Tennis", "Accessories", "Racquet Accessories", "Vibration Dampeners"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00IH19WM6", "title": "SKLZ Pro X Tee Single - Industrial Grade Baseball Batting Tee", "description": "The Pro X Tee Single is an industrial grade batting tee that helps players build a solid swing. It provides unmatched durability for individual or team use. The dual wrapped tee top and sturdy base provide unmatched durability for years of use.", "text": "SKLZ Pro X Tee Single - Industrial Grade Baseball Batting Tee The Pro X Tee Single is an industrial grade batting tee that helps players build a solid swing. It provides unmatched durability for individual or team use. The dual wrapped tee top and sturdy base provide unmatched durability for years of use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Lg%2BJArR9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IH19WM6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Batting Tees"]], "price": 82.88}}
{"item_id": "B00IH19WNU", "title": "SKLZ Travel DLX Tee", "description": "The SKLZ Travel Tee DLX is a durable and portable baseball hitting tee that helps build a solid swing and contact. It quickly folds out for easy setup and folds down and fits easily into a bat bag. The dual-wrapped tee top provides \"give\" and stability.", "text": "SKLZ Travel DLX Tee The SKLZ Travel Tee DLX is a durable and portable baseball hitting tee that helps build a solid swing and contact. It quickly folds out for easy setup and folds down and fits easily into a bat bag. The dual-wrapped tee top provides \"give\" and stability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o89mlyqcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IH19WNU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Training Equipment", "Batting Tees"]], "price": 36.99}}
