{"item_id": "B00IKNSIVM", "title": "Strike Industries AMBI Hex Selector Switch 90 Degrees", "description": "The HEX is a machined, heat-treated steel safety selector with textured lever. The pads are grooved for a more secure grip. The HEX will give you a customized look and clean and smooth operation function. With gloves or barehanded, the HEX is easy to access. Mounting hardware included. Available with a Matte Black finish.", "text": "Strike Industries AMBI Hex Selector Switch 90 Degrees The HEX is a machined, heat-treated steel safety selector with textured lever. The pads are grooved for a more secure grip. The HEX will give you a customized look and clean and smooth operation function. With gloves or barehanded, the HEX is easy to access. Mounting hardware included. Available with a Matte Black finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31D5LI4lA2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IKNSIVM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 24.95}}
