{"item_id": "B00IL2QSBO", "title": "Pinemeadow Golf Realtree Stand Bag", "description": "The Real Tree Stand Bag features an ultra lightweight, durable nylon construction for protecting your clubs and all your gear. The dual shoulder strap design and auto deploy legs make it easy to carry this versatile bag that is wrapped in authentic Real Tree camouflage material.", "text": "Pinemeadow Golf Realtree Stand Bag The Real Tree Stand Bag features an ultra lightweight, durable nylon construction for protecting your clubs and all your gear. The dual shoulder strap design and auto deploy legs make it easy to carry this versatile bag that is wrapped in authentic Real Tree camouflage material.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51RA3ykyiFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IL2QSBO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pinemeadow Golf", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Club Bags", "Stand Bags"]], "price": 82.9}}
{"item_id": "B00IL2QSCS", "title": "Pinemeadow Golf Realtree Cart Bag", "description": "The Real Tree Cart Bag features a micromesh top with 14 Club dividers for protecting and organizing your clubs. The body of the bag has 11 easy access pockets and two quick draw pockets for all of your gear, wrapped in authentic Real Tree camouflage material.", "text": "Pinemeadow Golf Realtree Cart Bag The Real Tree Cart Bag features a micromesh top with 14 Club dividers for protecting and organizing your clubs. The body of the bag has 11 easy access pockets and two quick draw pockets for all of your gear, wrapped in authentic Real Tree camouflage material.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YDMXOj5pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IL2QSCS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pinemeadow Golf", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Club Bags", "Cart Bags"]], "price": 101.74}}
