{"item_id": "B00IQANCRO", "title": "Gamo P-900 Break Barrel Air Pistol with IGT Technology", "description": "Gamo .177 caliber Break Barrel Air Pistol with IGT Technology. The Break Barrel P-900 IGT is a new Gamo air pistol. In order to enhance the authentic look and feel to an already proven design and recognized craftsmanship, these Break Barrel powered pellet pistol are equipped with a true IGT technology, Rubberized grip and Fiber Optics sight.", "text": "Gamo P-900 Break Barrel Air Pistol with IGT Technology Gamo .177 caliber Break Barrel Air Pistol with IGT Technology. The Break Barrel P-900 IGT is a new Gamo air pistol. In order to enhance the authentic look and feel to an already proven design and recognized craftsmanship, these Break Barrel powered pellet pistol are equipped with a true IGT technology, Rubberized grip and Fiber Optics sight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412uP29ozXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IQANCRO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Pistols"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B00IQKYGPG", "title": "Tactical Bolt Catch + Roll Pin Made in the USA Model 4/15 .223 5.56 Battery Assist", "description": "Specifications:•Made of More Durable Steel. (Not Aluminum)•Black Parkerized Finish. 1-3/4\" long 3/4\" wide .•Fits All Mil-spec Lower receivers in 5.56/.223•Features Larger Thumb Pads• Easier to Operate•Easy to Install •Comes Complete With New Roll Pin.", "text": "Tactical Bolt Catch + Roll Pin Made in the USA Model 4/15 .223 5.56 Battery Assist Specifications:•Made of More Durable Steel. (Not Aluminum)•Black Parkerized Finish. 1-3/4\" long 3/4\" wide .•Fits All Mil-spec Lower receivers in 5.56/.223•Features Larger Thumb Pads• Easier to Operate•Easy to Install •Comes Complete With New Roll Pin.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41m%2Bl3ebgpL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IQKYGPG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 12.75}}
