{"item_id": "B00IUJ71TQ", "title": "Black Credit Card Knife (Silver Blade) Best Tactical Folding Knives by Muzitao©", "description": "Black Credit Card KnifeThe black credit card knife from Muzitao is a very handy tool to keep in your wallet or purse. Useful when you are out and want to cut food, tags, open packages and many other uses you won't even realize until you need it.SizeA superlight and supersharp folding utility knife. These folding knives are the same size as a credit card and fit into any credit card sized slot in your purse, wallet or handbag.InstructionsThe survival credit card knife can be transformed from a card into a functional knife in three quick and easy steps. The whole process can be done in less than 5 seconds.Step 1:The first step is to turn and release the safety catch found at the tip of the blade. Turn it until the green disappears. The push the bottom of the blade to flip it up.Step 2:Turn the knife over and flip over the left-hand smaller tab.Step 3:Flip down the right-side tab over the smaller tab and push to lock in place. You're done!FeaturesSlimmer and lighter than an ordinary knife. It has a unique safety lock which keeps the blade pinned down and is child-proof. The extra long stainless steel blade ensures longer lasting rust free sharpness and the superlight polypropylene body includes a built-in protective sheath that helps prevent injury or blunting.**Warning: TSA**Due to TSA guidelines we advise you to pack your folding credit card knife in your checked luggage to avoid confiscation at security.", "text": "Black Credit Card Knife (Silver Blade) Best Tactical Folding Knives by Muzitao© Black Credit Card KnifeThe black credit card knife from Muzitao is a very handy tool to keep in your wallet or purse. Useful when you are out and want to cut food, tags, open packages and many other uses you won't even realize until you need it.SizeA superlight and supersharp folding utility knife. These folding knives are the same size as a credit card and fit into any credit card sized slot in your purse, wallet or handbag.InstructionsThe survival credit card knife can be transformed from a card into a functional knife in three quick and easy steps. The whole process can be done in less than 5 seconds.Step 1:The first step is to turn and release the safety catch found at the tip of the blade. Turn it until the green disappears. The push the bottom of the blade to flip it up.Step 2:Turn the knife over and flip over the left-hand smaller tab.Step 3:Flip down the right-side tab over the smaller tab and push to lock in place. You're done!FeaturesSlimmer and lighter than an ordinary knife. It has a unique safety lock which keeps the blade pinned down and is child-proof. The extra long stainless steel blade ensures longer lasting rust free sharpness and the superlight polypropylene body includes a built-in protective sheath that helps prevent injury or blunting.**Warning: TSA**Due to TSA guidelines we advise you to pack your folding credit card knife in your checked luggage to avoid confiscation at security.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IEjgRaudL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IUJ71TQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 8.99}}
