{"item_id": "B00IX42BHU", "title": "Model 4/15 .223 5.56 556 Carbine Combo: Stealth Black Precision Machined Aluminum 2-Piece Weaver/Picatinny Aluminum Mount Forend System + 5 Position Folding Ergonomic Front Handle With Storage Cavity + Removable Bipod - Combo Combination Package Kit Set", "description": "Official Product, Brand New. 2 pc Carbine Length Easy Installation- Replaces your existing Forend. No Gunsmithing Required! Hardcoat Anondized-Aluminum Construction. Installs Just Like the Factory Plastic Forends - Drop in Quick Hassle Free Installation! Installs In Seconds No Gunsmithing Needed. A Favorite With Military Law Enforcement.Simple Locking Push Button To Fold Or Open. Storage Cavity At the Base For Spare Batteries/Smaller Tools.", "text": "Model 4/15 .223 5.56 556 Carbine Combo: Stealth Black Precision Machined Aluminum 2-Piece Weaver/Picatinny Aluminum Mount Forend System + 5 Position Folding Ergonomic Front Handle With Storage Cavity + Removable Bipod - Combo Combination Package Kit Set Official Product, Brand New. 2 pc Carbine Length Easy Installation- Replaces your existing Forend. No Gunsmithing Required! Hardcoat Anondized-Aluminum Construction. Installs Just Like the Factory Plastic Forends - Drop in Quick Hassle Free Installation! Installs In Seconds No Gunsmithing Needed. A Favorite With Military Law Enforcement.Simple Locking Push Button To Fold Or Open. Storage Cavity At the Base For Spare Batteries/Smaller Tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415IXh%2BS9FL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IX42BHU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]]}}
