k, Backpack, Helmet and More- Other Applications: Hiking Lighting, Camping Lighting, Emergency Lighting, Night Outdoor Activities and More", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GTdNjvsrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IY2G5CS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 17.95}}
