{"item_id": "B00IZ3IY5W", "title": "50 Pack 18\" x 10\" Silhouette Splatter Target - Multi-Color -GlowShot Targets - See Your Hits Instantly", "description": "GlowShot 18 x 10\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Attach the target to any surface. Search GlowShot for all our Target Sizes and Packs.", "text": "50 Pack 18\" x 10\" Silhouette Splatter Target - Multi-Color -GlowShot Targets - See Your Hits Instantly GlowShot 18 x 10\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Attach the target to any surface. Search GlowShot for all our Target Sizes and Packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TFWGq84HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IZ3IY5W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B00IZMS5OI", "title": "Ab Wheel - Abdominal Exercise Roller (Blue)", "description": "Ab Wheel. Just what you need to Strengthen and tone your abs, shoulders, arms, and back .* Helps to get ripped abs and sculpted arm* Excellent way in which to obtain a more toned set of abdominal muscles.* You'll work every major upper body muscleThe ab wheel is a simple piece of ab exercise equipment that definitely confirms the clichd saying looks can be deceiving.Although it appears innocent enough and is normally used for fairly easy stomach exercises,with a bit of adaptation the abwheel can also be used for some of the most advanced stomach exercises on the planet.In fact this little wheel is so goodfor building the six pack muscles of the rectus abdominis and outer obliques it beats any other piece of equipment that you will see in the gym.Features- Dual wheels for greater stability- Comfortable, easy grip handles- Easy assembly", "text": "Ab Wheel - Abdominal Exercise Roller (Blue) Ab Wheel. Just what you need to Strengthen and tone your abs, shoulders, arms, and back .* Helps to get ripped abs and sculpted arm* Excellent way in which to obtain a more toned set of abdominal muscles.* You'll work every major upper body muscleThe ab wheel is a simple piece of ab exercise equipment that definitely confirms the clichd saying looks can be deceiving.Although it appears innocent enough and is normally used for fairly easy stomach exercises,with a bit of adaptation the abwheel can also be used for some of the most advanced stomach exercises on the planet.In fact this little wheel is so goodfor building the six pack muscles of the rectus abdominis and outer obliques it beats any other piece of equipment that you will see in the gym.Features- Dual wheels for greater stability- Comfortable, easy grip handles- Easy assembly", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aBJ6UY2IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IZMS5OI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00IZSM5DY", "title": "A Bicycle Headlight That Fits In Your Pocket?! 2 Super Bright White LED Lights - Waterproof - Mount Or Remove In Seconds - Fits Any Bike Or Scooter - Flashing Setting - Silicone - Small, Lightweight Size Makes It Perfect For Students, Commuters, Kids Of Any Age! The Lightning Frog Bicycle Light by Huggabe Comes With A Lifetime Guarantee!", "description": "Do You Or A Loved One Ride?Many favor cycling over driving for short distances, as they should, this not only helps the environment, but also can provide health benefits for the rider. However, unlike cars, bicycles don't come with a headlight to ensure the rider's safety. If you or a loved one ride after dark, it's crucial to invest in a good bike light.Are You Visible?The majority of cyclists are NOT properly visible to other vehicles on the road. Reflectors are not enough to keep you and your loved ones safe from disaster, you MUST use a bike headlight, in fact, in many places it's not only a good idea, but the law.The Lightning Frog Bike Light is a great option for daily commuters, recreational riders, kids bikes, and college students.Why Choose The Lightning Frog?• Features 2 EXTRA bright LED lights with flashing mode• Can be seen from far distances AND can light your path• Attaches or detaches in 5 seconds! So easy a CHILD can do it• Completely water/mud/dust proof• Light weight - Won't affect steering• Small enough to put in your pocket• 100% Money back guarantee if you don't LOVE itOh, And Did We Mention How Cute It Is?At less than HALF the price of some other bike lights, there's really no reason to gamble with the safety of you and your loved ones.Click the add to cart button today and get ready to meet your new companion!", "text": "A Bicycle Headlight That Fits In Your Pocket?! 2 Super Bright White LED Lights - Waterproof - Mount Or Remove In Seconds - Fits Any Bike Or Scooter - Flashing Setting - Silicone - Small, Lightweight Size Makes It Perfect For Students, Commuters, Kids Of Any Age! The Lightning Frog Bicycle Light by Huggabe Comes With A Lifetime Guarantee! Do You Or A Loved One Ride?Many favor cycling over driving for short distances, as they should, this not only helps the environment, but also can provide health benefits for the rider. However, unlike cars, bicycles don't come with a headlight to ensure the rider's safety. If you or a loved one ride after dark, it's crucial to invest in a good bike light.Are You Visible?The majority of cyclists are NOT properly visible to other vehicles on the road. Reflectors are not enough to keep you and your loved ones safe from disaster, you MUST use a bike headlight, in fact, in many places it's not only a good idea, but the law.The Lightning Frog Bike Light is a great option for daily commuters, recreational riders, kids bikes, and college students.Why Choose The Lightning Frog?• Features 2 EXTRA bright LED lights with flashing mode• Can be seen from far distances AND can light your path• Attaches or detaches in 5 seconds! So easy a CHILD can do it• Completely water/mud/dust proof• Light weight - Won't affect steering• Small enough to put in your pocket• 100% Money back guarantee if you don't LOVE itOh, And Did We Mention How Cute It Is?At less than HALF the price of some other bike lights, there's really no reason to gamble with the safety of you and your loved ones.Click the add to cart button today and get ready to meet your new companion!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CevX9o%2BwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00IZSM5DY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 13.95}}
