{"item_id": "B00J0IS5LE", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Lightweight M4 AR-15 AR15 Rifle Carbine Machined 2 Piece Aluminum Accessory Mount Oval Designed Ports", "description": "Official Product of Ultimate Arms Gear, Brand New. Carbine Length (Approximately 6.7 inch). For Attaching Accessories Such As Flashlights,Bipods,Optics Etc. Black Anodized Precision Machined Aluminum Construction - Oval Ports. Easy Installation - No Gunsmithing Required ! 2 Piece Design, Hardware Screws and Allen Key Included !", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Lightweight M4 AR-15 AR15 Rifle Carbine Machined 2 Piece Aluminum Accessory Mount Oval Designed Ports Official Product of Ultimate Arms Gear, Brand New. Carbine Length (Approximately 6.7 inch). For Attaching Accessories Such As Flashlights,Bipods,Optics Etc. Black Anodized Precision Machined Aluminum Construction - Oval Ports. Easy Installation - No Gunsmithing Required ! 2 Piece Design, Hardware Screws and Allen Key Included !", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BhIpOFTRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00J0IS5LE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 28.95}}
