ment.--Only one button on the device for Telephone Answering Function (hands free)2.Amazing sound--Experience your tunes in high definition and surprising fullness realized through a 4W driver and bass port - outclassing than other similar-sized portable speakers.-- Apply AVS(Air vibration system) technology, making the low frequency amazing.3.Easy use--\"one cable\" technology: not use any messy cable, music and charge function can be realized together connecting the same line (cable).4.Travel Easier--With ultra-portable compact size, makes it easy to carry and store while on-the-go. No hesitated to put in your backpack, Enjoy your journeyWhat's in the Box:1 x Omaker M1 Speaker1 x USB Cable1 x User's ManualWarranty:Every sale includes an 12-month, worry-free guarantee to prove the importance we set on quality.Just remember:We are the maker,Quality first is our tenet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41je-DEDfvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00J3QHG72.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B00J42849O", "title": "OnCore Golf Technology MA 1.0 Golf Balls", "description": "OnCore Golf is proud to bring to you the world's only hollow metal core golf ball. Our technology is the first major upgrade in golf ball design in decades. The MA- 1.0's patented metallic core combines high strength and high modulus for optimum energy transfer and enhanced rifle spin. The result is maximum accuracy in flight and laser straight putting on the greens. The MA- 1.0's ground-breaking design outperforms traditional rubber core golf balls and makes the game more enjoyable for 99% of players. OnCore Golf has engineered a game changer by fusing science, art, and design into a distinct product unlike anything the golf world has ever seen!", "text": "OnCore Golf Technology MA 1.0 Golf Balls OnCore Golf is proud to bring to you the world's only hollow metal core golf ball. Our technology is the first major upgrade in golf ball design in decades. The MA- 1.0's patented metallic core combines high strength and high modulus for optimum energy transfer and enhanced rifle spin. The result is maximum accuracy in flight and laser straight putting on the greens. The MA- 1.0's ground-breaking design outperforms traditional rubber core golf balls and makes the game more enjoyable for 99% of players. OnCore Golf has engineered a game changer by fusing science, art, and design into a distinct product unlike anything the golf world has ever seen!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yX45BaVeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00J42849O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00J5HDEPC", "title": "Senbowe™ Mini Lightweight Wireless Stereo Sports/Running & Gym/Exercise Bluetooth Earbuds Headphones Headsets w/Microphone for Iphone 5S 5C 4S 4, Ipad 2 3 4 New iPad, Ipod, Android, Samsung Galaxy, Smart Phones Bluetooth Devices", "description": "Importance:Few customers commented the headset can't connect with their phones, this is because they don't hold the switch button long time enough.Some customers turned on the headset and see it blinks blue-red few times, then it start blinking blue fast, thought it is in pairing condition, It's wrong.The correct instruction is you have to press the power button and count from 1 to 10 and then release the button, you could see blue and red light blinks few times first, then blue light flash fast, and then see the blue-red light blinks alternately or hear a beep. Now it can be found by your phone.Specifications:Support Profile : Headset/HandsFree/A2DP/AVRCP,tablet, but for laptop and computer you need to buy a bluetooth adaptorbluetooth version: V3.0+EDR Range: 10MTalking Time: 4 hoursMusic Time: 5 hoursStandby Time: 180 hoursbattery capacity:45mAh.Color: BlackNote:1. Before you start using the headset, please use the USB charge cable to charge it first.2. Pairing, press the power button of the headset for 10 seconds or longer until you see the blue-red light blinking alternately or hear a beep.3. Make sure you turned on the bluetooth on your phone, search headset model on it. The headset support the laptop which with built-in bluetooth adapter or inserted in a third party bluetooth adapter.4. Select the Bluetooth model and click connect. Enter the password or code 0000 if needed.5. when the connection is successful, the headset will beeep and appears in your phone menu.Buy it. You'll love it.", "text": "Senbowe™ Mini Lightweight Wireless Stereo Sports/Running & Gym/Exercise Bluetooth Earbuds Headphones Headsets w/Microphone for Iphone 5S 5C 4S 4, Ipad 2 3 4 New iPad, Ipod, Android, Samsung Galaxy, Smart Phones Bluetooth Devices Importance:Few customers commented the headset can't connect with their phones, this is because they don't hold the switch button long time enough.Some customers turned on the headset and see it blinks blue-red few times, then it start blinking blue fast, thought it is in pairing condition, It's wrong.The correct instruction is you have to press the power button and count from 1 to 10 and then release the button, you could see blue and red light blinks few times first, then blue light flash fast, and then see the blue-red light blinks alternately or hear a beep. Now it can be found by your phone.Specifications:Support Profile : Headset/HandsFree/A2DP/AVRCP,tablet, but for laptop and computer you need to buy a bluetooth adaptorbluetooth version: V3.0+EDR Range: 10MTalking Time: 4 hoursMusic Time: 5 hoursStandby Time: 180 hoursbattery capacity:45mAh.Color: BlackNote:1. Before you start using the headset, please use the USB charge cable to charge it first.2. Pairing, press the power button of the headset for 10 seconds or longer until you see the blue-red light blinking alternately or hear a beep.3. Make sure you turned on the bluetooth on your phone, search headset model on it. The headset support the laptop which with built-in bluetooth adapter or inserted in a third party bluetooth adapter.4. Select the Bluetooth model and click connect. Enter the password or code 0000 if needed.5. when the connection is successful, the headset will beeep and appears in your phone menu.Buy it. You'll love it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BHxEegzGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00J5HDEPC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Senbowe", "categories": [["Cell Phones & Accessories", "Accessories", "Headsets", "Bluetooth Headsets"], ["Cell Phones & Accessories", "Accessories", "Headsets", "Wired Headsets"], ["Electronics", "Accessories & Supplies", "Audio & Video Accessories", "Headphones"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems"]], "price": 14.59}}
{"item_id": "B00J6Q33HQ", "title": "Foregrip -Best \"Vertical Tactical Foregrip\"TM By Aspen Ridge Sports Foregrip. Best 5 Year Warranty on the Market! Warranty only offered By Aspen Ridge Sports Store.", "description": "FOREGRIPS IMPROVE YOUR AIM AND WILL INCREASE YOUR COMFORT WHEN YOU USE A FOREGRIP.BEST FOREGRIP TO MAINTAIN A STEADY HOLD-Solid Mount-Highest Quality Material Available-Holds Up To Heavy UsageComfortable Solid Mount that will increase control, stability of your aim and comfortable grip that Lasts.The \"Vertical Tactical Foregrip\"TM by Aspen Ridge Sports is a solidly constructed foregrip that will give you years of reliability on your Airsoft, rifle or shotgun.The \"Vertical Tactical Forgrip\"TM is constructed of solid composite material design to handle the abuse expected of any airsoft rifle or shotgun. This foregrip was designed to handle the shock from heavy usage and still be mounted tightly on your gun while increasing the comfort of your wrist from the position of the ForegripBenefits-Ergonomic Handle that provides a comfortable grip to steady your aimStorage Compartment that stores extra batteries to support flashlights or Red Dot Scope-Pressure Switch Area to mount your switch so you can activate your light or laser without taking your hand of the \"Vertical Tactical Foregrip\"TM-With the \"Vertical Tactical Foregrip\"TM your hand will always be in the same position versus a traditional hold.The Only Foregrip Backed By A 5 Year No-Hassle Free Replacement Guarantee only offered by Aspen Ridge Sports store Not By Any Other Store on AmazonClick the Add To Cart Button at the Top of the Page to own your own \"Vertical Tactical Foregrip\"TM Watch Out for Imitations, Aspen Ridge Sports store is the Only one who offers the warranty for the original \"Vertical Tactical ForegripTM\"", "text": "Foregrip -Best \"Vertical Tactical Foregrip\"TM By Aspen Ridge Sports Foregrip. Best 5 Year Warranty on the Market! Warranty only offered By Aspen Ridge Sports Store. FOREGRIPS IMPROVE YOUR AIM AND WILL INCREASE YOUR COMFORT WHEN YOU USE A FOREGRIP.BEST FOREGRIP TO MAINTAIN A STEADY HOLD-Solid Mount-Highest Quality Material Available-Holds Up To Heavy UsageComfortable Solid Mount that will increase control, stability of your aim and comfortable grip that Lasts.The \"Vertical Tactical Foregrip\"TM by Aspen Ridge Sports is a solidly constructed foregrip that will give you years of reliability on your Airsoft, rifle or shotgun.The \"Vertical Tactical Forgrip\"TM is constructed of solid composite material design to handle the abuse expected of any airsoft rifle or shotgun. This foregrip was designed to handle the shock from heavy usage and still be mounted tightly on your gun while increasing the comfort of your wrist from the position of the ForegripBenefits-Ergonomic Handle that provides a comfortable grip to steady your aimStorage Compartment that stores extra batteries to support flashlights or Red Dot Scope-Pressure Switch Area to mount your switch so you can activate your light or laser without taking your hand of the \"Vertical Tactical Foregrip\"TM-With the \"Vertical Tactical Foregrip\"TM your hand will always be in the same position versus a traditional hold.The Only Foregrip Backed By A 5 Year No-Hassle Free Replacement Guarantee only offered by Aspen Ridge Sports store Not By Any Other Store on AmazonClick the Add To Cart Button at the Top of the Page to own your own \"Vertical Tactical Foregrip\"TM Watch Out for Imitations, Aspen Ridge Sports store is the Only one who offers the warranty for the original \"Vertical Tactical ForegripTM\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Mz5uwViRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00J6Q33HQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Marker Parts & Upgrades", "Grips"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B00J6ZBZVS", "title": "THE PATRIOT Monkey Fist Self Defense Keychain 1\" Steel Ball Double Line 550lb Tensile Strength Military Paracord (Length 6 5/8\")", "description": "Self Defense KeychainAwesomely effective, yet very discreet self defense keychain. Most people don't recognize this as a weapon and see it simply as a keychain. You can even take it on the plane!UsesCustomers have bought this product primarily as a self defense keychain to have on them when out and about. You can take it walking, running, camping, shopping or travelling. In dark and lonely places like car parks, quiet streets and public spaces having your hand around this self defense keychain will make you feel safer.How To Use It!If you search on Youtube for \"monkey fist self defense\" you'll see a lot of helpful and entertaining videos on how best to use it. The video with the hockey helmet is particularly good! The monkey keychains can easily break bones so even if blocked, the impact will cause damage.Why Choose The Monkey Fist?The monkey ball keychain is more effective and more reliable than pepper spray or tazers. If you miss or are not effective with your pepper spray or tazer you DON'T get a second chance. With the monkeyfist you can keep swining like crazy until you hit something or discourage the attacker.Paracord Monkey Fist Keychain ConstructionThe Muzitao Monkey Fist Self Defense Keychains are made using 500lb tensile srength military paracord. This means it can support uo to 500lb of weight or force without breaking. The 1\" stainless steel ball bearing in the monkey knot is heavier than you might think and on the end of the lanyard, is a devastating weapon in anyone's hands!", "text": "THE PATRIOT Monkey Fist Self Defense Keychain 1\" Steel Ball Double Line 550lb Tensile Strength Military Paracord (Length 6 5/8\") Self Defense KeychainAwesomely effective, yet very discreet self defense keychain. Most people don't recognize this as a weapon and see it simply as a keychain. You can even take it on the plane!UsesCustomers have bought this product primarily as a self defense keychain to have on them when out and about. You can take it walking, running, camping, shopping or travelling. In dark and lonely places like car parks, quiet streets and public spaces having your hand around this self defense keychain will make you feel safer.How To Use It!If you search on Youtube for \"monkey fist self defense\" you'll see a lot of helpful and entertaining videos on how best to use it. The video with the hockey helmet is particularly good! The monkey keychains can easily break bones so even if blocked, the impact will cause damage.Why Choose The Monkey Fist?The monkey ball keychain is more effective and more reliable than pepper spray or tazers. If you miss or are not effective with your pepper spray or tazer you DON'T get a second chance. With the monkeyfist you can keep swining like crazy until you hit something or discourage the attacker.Paracord Monkey Fist Keychain ConstructionThe Muzitao Monkey Fist Self Defense Keychains are made using 500lb tensile srength military paracord. This means it can support uo to 500lb of weight or force without breaking. The 1\" stainless steel ball bearing in the monkey knot is heavier than you might think and on the end of the lanyard, is a devastating weapon in anyone's hands!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dOtU35OQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00J6ZBZVS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 10.49}}
{"item_id": "B00J73KY34", "title": "Premium Silicone Swim Cap for Long Hair + FREE Nose Clip , LIMITED TIME OFFER!", "description": "New Premium Swim Cap - Specially Designed for Women with Long HairWho said you can't look cool while swimming and protect your precious hair at the same time? TheSwim Elite's Silicone Swim Cap for Women with Long Hairfits comfortably and looks classy.Features:• Ergonomic Ear Pockets• ONE SIZE FITS ALL. Never slips off your head• Allergy-free, odorles, eco-friendly• Made out of state-of-the-art silicone• Comes in a Protective and Convenient Zip Bag that you can take anywhere. This way, your swim cap will last for years.Why is this silicone swim cap different?This cap is specially designed for long haired women and HAS A MORE NATURAL AND SMOOTHER FIT THAN REGULAR CAPS.YOU CAN EASILY FIT IT ON YOUR HEAD IN JUST 3 SIMPLE STEPS and doesn't come off unexpectedly. By preventing contact with harmful chlorine and other unwanted chemicals in the water, it keeps your hair healthy!The Premium High Quality Silicone allows your hair to breathe more than in regular latex caps. You'll notice the difference.It ELIMINATES THE COMMON HEADACHE swimmers experience!Get It Now&Try; It! If You Don't Like It, Don't Keep It!RISK FREE 90 DAYS 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!Click the\"Add to Cart\" Buttonnow to get the*Special Bonus Gift: Swim Elite's Nose Clip(value 9.95$)for a more enjoyable swimming experience.[ TIP !] Buy TWO and get FREE SHIPPING Everywhere!*This Special Bonus is available until we're out of stock so \"Add to Cart\" now!", "text": "Premium Silicone Swim Cap for Long Hair + FREE Nose Clip , LIMITED TIME OFFER! New Premium Swim Cap - Specially Designed for Women with Long HairWho said you can't look cool while swimming and protect your precious hair at the same time? TheSwim Elite's Silicone Swim Cap for Women with Long Hairfits comfortably and looks classy.Features:• Ergonomic Ear Pockets• ONE SIZE FITS ALL. Never slips off your head• Allergy-free, odorles, eco-friendly• Made out of state-of-the-art silicone• Comes in a Protective and Convenient Zip Bag that you can take anywhere. This way, your swim cap will last for years.Why is this silicone swim cap different?This cap is specially designed for long haired women and HAS A MORE NATURAL AND SMOOTHER FIT THAN REGULAR CAPS.YOU CAN EASILY FIT IT ON YOUR HEAD IN JUST 3 SIMPLE STEPS and doesn't come off unexpectedly. By preventing contact with harmful chlorine and other unwanted chemicals in the water, it keeps your hair healthy!The Premium High Quality Silicone allows your hair to breathe more than in regular latex caps. You'll notice the difference.It ELIMINATES THE COMMON HEADACHE swimmers experience!Get It Now&Try; It! If You Don't Like It, Don't Keep It!RISK FREE 90 DAYS 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!Click the\"Add to Cart\" Buttonnow to get the*Special Bonus Gift: Swim Elite's Nose Clip(value 9.95$)for a more enjoyable swimming experience.[ TIP !] Buy TWO and get FREE SHIPPING Everywhere!*This Special Bonus is available until we're out of stock so \"Add to Cart\" now!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jGnqzZbkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00J73KY34.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B00J77V5LK", "title": "550 Paracord - Midwest Cord Nylon Type III 7 Strand Parachute Cord - 250+ Color Options - Best Length Options", "description": "Midwest Cord Brand Paracord is 100% Made in the USA Nylon 7 Inner Strand 550 Lb Test Strength Parachute Cord. The Highest Quality Type III Paracord for Survival Bracelets, Preppers, Camping Gear and More! Midwest Cord Paracord Comes with Heat Sealed Ends, no frayed ends! 550 Paracord Averages 4mm in Diameter, but overall diameter and thickness varies between colors. Die Lots may change over time, so colors can vary slight between batches. If you need a perfect match for a big project, make sure to order enough in one order, all cord shipped in a single order is garunteed to be from the same Die Lot!", "text": "550 Paracord - Midwest Cord Nylon Type III 7 Strand Parachute Cord - 250+ Color Options - Best Length Options Midwest Cord Brand Paracord is 100% Made in the USA Nylon 7 Inner Strand 550 Lb Test Strength Parachute Cord. The Highest Quality Type III Paracord for Survival Bracelets, Preppers, Camping Gear and More! Midwest Cord Paracord Comes with Heat Sealed Ends, no frayed ends! 550 Paracord Averages 4mm in Diameter, but overall diameter and thickness varies between colors. Die Lots may change over time, so colors can vary slight between batches. If you need a perfect match for a big project, make sure to order enough in one order, all cord shipped in a single order is garunteed to be from the same Die Lot!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61umCkCHuJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00J77V5LK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
