{"item_id": "B00J8EJ3KM", "title": "Gogogu Multifunction Digital Pocket 3D Pedometer With 30 Day Memory Silver", "description": "Gogogu pocket 3D pedometer boasts a slim design that fits in any pocket and large easy to use buttons. unlike conventional pedometers, won't miss steps. records your daily steps, stairs climbed, distance, calories burned and exercise time with the world's most advanced Tri-Axis technology. counts up to 10 million steps with built-in memory for 30 days of activity.", "text": "Gogogu Multifunction Digital Pocket 3D Pedometer With 30 Day Memory Silver Gogogu pocket 3D pedometer boasts a slim design that fits in any pocket and large easy to use buttons. unlike conventional pedometers, won't miss steps. records your daily steps, stairs climbed, distance, calories burned and exercise time with the world's most advanced Tri-Axis technology. counts up to 10 million steps with built-in memory for 30 days of activity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41i-jqqShTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00J8EJ3KM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00J8OL7OW", "title": "Natural Silicone Swimming Cap - Perfect To Keep Hair Dry - Recreational, Competitive and Fitness Swimmers - The Premium Silicone Swim Caps With Beautiful Design Highly Elastic & Large Stretch - Greater Durability Than Latex Swimming Caps - Unisex Women and Men - Eco-Friendly, Non-Allergenic & Best Quality Custom Manufacturing - Lightweight And Comfortable For Lady & Gentlemen Adults And Children, Girls and Boys", "description": "Guaranteed to go Through Water, Snow or Mud - or we Pull the Plug! The Best Swim Caps to Improve and Protect- One size fits all with a beautiful stylish design- Long lasting and durable, using premium quality 100% silicone materials- Highly elastic making it an easy fit with less snagging and pulling- Keeps hair dry and out of your face- Also suitable for women, girls and menWhat Makes THT Swim Caps Different from the Rest?- Keep your hair dry and protected from contaminated water or chlorine with our classic size fit for adults and children- Prevent overpressure and keep water away from your ears with our ergonomic ear pockets that produce a watertight seal- Swim faster with less resistance, and reduce drag through our hydro dynamic wrinkle-free design that just perfectly fits- 100% premium quality silicone with maximum stretch and durability for a more comfortable swimming experience- Quick and easy to take on and off without snagging or pulling hairImproved Performance and Protects Hair- Packaged in a quality zip bag for protection and convenience- Proper care instructions for your swim cap will be provided- Non-allergenic- Eco-friendly- Non-toxic- Odourless", "text": "Natural Silicone Swimming Cap - Perfect To Keep Hair Dry - Recreational, Competitive and Fitness Swimmers - The Premium Silicone Swim Caps With Beautiful Design Highly Elastic & Large Stretch - Greater Durability Than Latex Swimming Caps - Unisex Women and Men - Eco-Friendly, Non-Allergenic & Best Quality Custom Manufacturing - Lightweight And Comfortable For Lady & Gentlemen Adults And Children, Girls and Boys Guaranteed to go Through Water, Snow or Mud - or we Pull the Plug! The Best Swim Caps to Improve and Protect- One size fits all with a beautiful stylish design- Long lasting and durable, using premium quality 100% silicone materials- Highly elastic making it an easy fit with less snagging and pulling- Keeps hair dry and out of your face- Also suitable for women, girls and menWhat Makes THT Swim Caps Different from the Rest?- Keep your hair dry and protected from contaminated water or chlorine with our classic size fit for adults and children- Prevent overpressure and keep water away from your ears with our ergonomic ear pockets that produce a watertight seal- Swim faster with less resistance, and reduce drag through our hydro dynamic wrinkle-free design that just perfectly fits- 100% premium quality silicone with maximum stretch and durability for a more comfortable swimming experience- Quick and easy to take on and off without snagging or pulling hairImproved Performance and Protects Hair- Packaged in a quality zip bag for protection and convenience- Proper care instructions for your swim cap will be provided- Non-allergenic- Eco-friendly- Non-toxic- Odourless", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LpqVtmvJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00J8OL7OW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Swim Caps"]], "price": 12.98}}
{"item_id": "B00JA9NPCW", "title": "Swimming Goggles Perfect To Provide The Greatest Visibility Indoors Or In Low Light With Long Lasting Anti Fog Technology - The Best Swim Goggles On The Market With Beautiful Design Highly Soft And Durable Silicone Seal & Head Strap - Eco-Friendly, Non-Allergenic & High Quality Custom Manufacturing - Lightweight And Comfortable For Adults And Children, Man & Woman, Girls And Boys - 100% Satisfaction Money Back Guarantee.", "description": "Looking For the Best Swim Goggles?Here's Why Our Goggles Are The Only Ones You'll Ever Need... Or Your Money Back!An excellent multi-purpose goggle with a shatter-resistant, polycarbonate lens with UV protection and anti-fog feature. Comes with one piece soft frame construction with integrated hypoallergenic seals and a high-performance silicone split head strap. Super comfortable.What Makes THT Swim Goggles Different from the Rest?- Keep your eyes safe and provide the greatest visibility indoors or in low light with Long Lasting Anti Fog Technology- Beautiful Design with PVC Frame & Silicone Strap- Protect Your Precious Eyes from the Dangers of UV Light with our High Quality Lenses. Antifog lenses- 100% Premium Quality Silicone for Maximum Stretch & Durability. Eyeglass quality, shatter resistant polycarbonate lens. light weight- Eco-friendly, Odourless, & Non-toxic. Designed specifically to be kid safe.", "text": "Swimming Goggles Perfect To Provide The Greatest Visibility Indoors Or In Low Light With Long Lasting Anti Fog Technology - The Best Swim Goggles On The Market With Beautiful Design Highly Soft And Durable Silicone Seal & Head Strap - Eco-Friendly, Non-Allergenic & High Quality Custom Manufacturing - Lightweight And Comfortable For Adults And Children, Man & Woman, Girls And Boys - 100% Satisfaction Money Back Guarantee. Looking For the Best Swim Goggles?Here's Why Our Goggles Are The Only Ones You'll Ever Need... Or Your Money Back!An excellent multi-purpose goggle with a shatter-resistant, polycarbonate lens with UV protection and anti-fog feature. Comes with one piece soft frame construction with integrated hypoallergenic seals and a high-performance silicone split head strap. Super comfortable.What Makes THT Swim Goggles Different from the Rest?- Keep your eyes safe and provide the greatest visibility indoors or in low light with Long Lasting Anti Fog Technology- Beautiful Design with PVC Frame & Silicone Strap- Protect Your Precious Eyes from the Dangers of UV Light with our High Quality Lenses. Antifog lenses- 100% Premium Quality Silicone for Maximum Stretch & Durability. Eyeglass quality, shatter resistant polycarbonate lens. light weight- Eco-friendly, Odourless, & Non-toxic. Designed specifically to be kid safe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dmgbFnkeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00JA9NPCW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 18.99}}
