{"item_id": "B00JHG3P96", "title": "Pearce Grips PG-42 Grip Extension for Glock 42", "description": "The Pearce PG-42 grip extension enhances control and comfort without sacrificing conceal ability. These units blend with the contours and texture of the handgun to maintain a factory appearance. Made from High Impact Polymer; they withstand drop tests at temperatures from -20 F to 350 F. These units replace the magazine base plate. This extension will not alter the capacity of the magazine. It will add approximately 3/4 inch additional gripping surface.", "text": "Pearce Grips PG-42 Grip Extension for Glock 42 The Pearce PG-42 grip extension enhances control and comfort without sacrificing conceal ability. These units blend with the contours and texture of the handgun to maintain a factory appearance. Made from High Impact Polymer; they withstand drop tests at temperatures from -20 F to 350 F. These units replace the magazine base plate. This extension will not alter the capacity of the magazine. It will add approximately 3/4 inch additional gripping surface.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bpMlx7FGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00JHG3P96.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.15}}
