{"item_id": "B00JJSHIWM", "title": "Stainless Steel Water Bottle by Eco-Sports - 27 OZ. (750 ML) Durable - Built To Last A Lifetime, BPA Free and Toxin FREE ~ With Loop Cap PLUS BONUS Carabiner - 100% Money Back Guarantee!", "description": "17 MILLION barrels of oil are Used To Produce Plastic Water Bottles each year......that is enough oil to keep one million cars fueled for a WHOLE entire year.....That sounds bad. But then just think, most of those will actually be tossed right into a trash can without a second thought instead of being recycled.By using your new 27 ounce EcoSports bottle, you fully support a healthy balance between an active lifestyle and your love for protecting the environment from complete, unnecessary waste. You will be spreading the word without making a sound. You will be sure to be doing your part to keep plastic out of our landfills, rivers and most importantly oceans with your brand new, high quality Stainless Steel bottle.Your new EcoSports stainless steel bottle is built for life. The sturdy Stainless Steel construction is designed to impact resistance. Eco Sports Bottles have three distinct design features:- A level bottle base that will NOT bulge nor expand- A specifically design opening keeps liquids from leaking around the corner of your mouth because it fits the contours of your lips- Rounded corners, for ease of cleaning and zero small hiding places for bacteria to hang aroundMeasurements(with cap on) Bottle stands 10 inches tallBottles measure 2 3/4 inches diameterBottle mouth opening is 1 inch diameterPerfect for ALL cupholders!We 100% stand behind our Stainless Steel Bottles. If for any reason you are not 100% satisfied with your purchase, within 30 days, please return for a no-questions asked, full refund. Imported from China.", "text": "Stainless Steel Water Bottle by Eco-Sports - 27 OZ. (750 ML) Durable - Built To Last A Lifetime, BPA Free and Toxin FREE ~ With Loop Cap PLUS BONUS Carabiner - 100% Money Back Guarantee! 17 MILLION barrels of oil are Used To Produce Plastic Water Bottles each year......that is enough oil to keep one million cars fueled for a WHOLE entire year.....That sounds bad. But then just think, most of those will actually be tossed right into a trash can without a second thought instead of being recycled.By using your new 27 ounce EcoSports bottle, you fully support a healthy balance between an active lifestyle and your love for protecting the environment from complete, unnecessary waste. You will be spreading the word without making a sound. You will be sure to be doing your part to keep plastic out of our landfills, rivers and most importantly oceans with your brand new, high quality Stainless Steel bottle.Your new EcoSports stainless steel bottle is built for life. The sturdy Stainless Steel construction is designed to impact resistance. Eco Sports Bottles have three distinct design features:- A level bottle base that will NOT bulge nor expand- A specifically design opening keeps liquids from leaking around the corner of your mouth because it fits the contours of your lips- Rounded corners, for ease of cleaning and zero small hiding places for bacteria to hang aroundMeasurements(with cap on) Bottle stands 10 inches tallBottles measure 2 3/4 inches diameterBottle mouth opening is 1 inch diameterPerfect for ALL cupholders!We 100% stand behind our Stainless Steel Bottles. If for any reason you are not 100% satisfied with your purchase, within 30 days, please return for a no-questions asked, full refund. Imported from China.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dsmABgPYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00JJSHIWM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B00JNV6CEK", "title": "(Free Ebook) Running-Walking-Workout Belt With Separate Pouch For Phone or Valuables--And Another For Gel Packs, Energy Bars Etc. You Can Even Fit A Samsung Note 2, s5 or Iphone In With Its Case--Non Bounce, Adjustable Belt--Money Back Guarantee", "description": "You'll Never Have to Leave Your Phone or Valuables In Your Car or Locker Again* 2 Custom pouches. They can hold almost any size phone from any carrier. The Pouches are made to hold and protect your phone, wallet, keys, snacks etc. They are lined and padded so nothing gets scratched, smashed or damaged.* Reflective strip. It can keep you visible to others outdoors in low light or even almost not light conditions.* Custom earphone access. Each pouch has access points to insert earphone jacks for almost any kind of phone you may have (top, bottom, left or right).* Race tag holder. Toggle strings can hold a race tag or if they're not needed, strings can be put into hidden pocket for later use.30 Day Unconditional Money Back GuaranteeThis way, you'll never risk a dime. If it doesn't do everything we stated, we'll send your money back.- No questions asked.- No hard feelings either.Free Ebook to Help Increase Your Speed and StaminaYou will receive automatically free with your running/workout belt, an ebook called \"Sprints and Marathons\" (it normally retails for $27.00). It will help improve your speed and stamina (whether you're a beginner or expert).This book will also help you to train and breath properly, and overall get better results. And it's yours to keep, even if you return the belt.So click the orange add to cart button at the top right corner of the page now. These belts sellout fast and often. (And they're not sold in stores). So don't miss out. Click the button now!", "text": "(Free Ebook) Running-Walking-Workout Belt With Separate Pouch For Phone or Valuables--And Another For Gel Packs, Energy Bars Etc. You Can Even Fit A Samsung Note 2, s5 or Iphone In With Its Case--Non Bounce, Adjustable Belt--Money Back Guarantee You'll Never Have to Leave Your Phone or Valuables In Your Car or Locker Again* 2 Custom pouches. They can hold almost any size phone from any carrier. The Pouches are made to hold and protect your phone, wallet, keys, snacks etc. They are lined and padded so nothing gets scratched, smashed or damaged.* Reflective strip. It can keep you visible to others outdoors in low light or even almost not light conditions.* Custom earphone access. Each pouch has access points to insert earphone jacks for almost any kind of phone you may have (top, bottom, left or right).* Race tag holder. Toggle strings can hold a race tag or if they're not needed, strings can be put into hidden pocket for later use.30 Day Unconditional Money Back GuaranteeThis way, you'll never risk a dime. If it doesn't do everything we stated, we'll send your money back.- No questions asked.- No hard feelings either.Free Ebook to Help Increase Your Speed and StaminaYou will receive automatically free with your running/workout belt, an ebook called \"Sprints and Marathons\" (it normally retails for $27.00). It will help improve your speed and stamina (whether you're a beginner or expert).This book will also help you to train and breath properly, and overall get better results. And it's yours to keep, even if you return the belt.So click the orange add to cart button at the top right corner of the page now. These belts sellout fast and often. (And they're not sold in stores). So don't miss out. Click the button now!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519vaAUBkHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00JNV6CEK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 31.97}}
