e Strap- 1 Door Anchor- 1 Carrying CaseMost importantly to us is the customer service you'll receive when you place your order today. We provide you the highest value for money resistance bands. If for any reason at all it's not right for you, you have 60 days to let us know and we'll give you 100% of your money back - no questions asked.Click the \"Add to Cart\" button at the top of this page to order today.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51p0dEAbkAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00JQDFSGS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 32.99}}
