{"item_id": "B00JU7F3KG", "title": "Modular MOLLE Utility Pouch", "description": "The 3V Gear Sidekick Utility Pouch offers up a big time storage option for all your extras. Pistol mag's, ammo, binoculars, cameras, EDC or survival gear; this is their home. Attach this to any of your MOLLE compatible tactical gear for additional storage and customization.Rugged 600 Denier PVC backed polyester construction provides a strong water resistant pouch for your valuable gear. The MOLLE webbing platform on the back panel features reinforced straps with metal snap closures. Internal pockets allow for additional organization and internal elastic loops are perfect for spare firearm magazines.3V Gear Sidekick Utility Pouch Features:*Internal pockets/elastic for mag's, flashlights, tools or survival gearDual cord zipper pulls for effortless access without a soundRugged 600 Denier PVC backed polyester constructionReinforced MOLLE attachment pointsMeasures: 6\" L x 2.25\" W x 6.5\" HWeight: 5.0 oz.", "text": "Modular MOLLE Utility Pouch The 3V Gear Sidekick Utility Pouch offers up a big time storage option for all your extras. Pistol mag's, ammo, binoculars, cameras, EDC or survival gear; this is their home. Attach this to any of your MOLLE compatible tactical gear for additional storage and customization.Rugged 600 Denier PVC backed polyester construction provides a strong water resistant pouch for your valuable gear. The MOLLE webbing platform on the back panel features reinforced straps with metal snap closures. Internal pockets allow for additional organization and internal elastic loops are perfect for spare firearm magazines.3V Gear Sidekick Utility Pouch Features:*Internal pockets/elastic for mag's, flashlights, tools or survival gearDual cord zipper pulls for effortless access without a soundRugged 600 Denier PVC backed polyester constructionReinforced MOLLE attachment pointsMeasures: 6\" L x 2.25\" W x 6.5\" HWeight: 5.0 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kkw6m82aL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00JU7F3KG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 10.25}}
{"item_id": "B00JVUXQW4", "title": "Decodyne™ Freezer Water Bottle - Double Wall - Instant Cooler Water Bottle - Filled with Unique Honeycomb Shaped Freezable Gel", "description": "The Decodyne™ Freezer water bottle are crafted with a fun \"crystal-frosty\" appearance, which actually consist of non-toxic freezer gel, sealed into the side walls of your bottle.That's where the secret of gel freezer bottles lie. By placing these handy water bottles into your freezer for about two hours the freezer gel freezes, offering you a unique way to keep your beverage icy cold.Although they are hand wash only, these water bottles are durable and convenient for home or when you are on the go", "text": "Decodyne™ Freezer Water Bottle - Double Wall - Instant Cooler Water Bottle - Filled with Unique Honeycomb Shaped Freezable Gel The Decodyne™ Freezer water bottle are crafted with a fun \"crystal-frosty\" appearance, which actually consist of non-toxic freezer gel, sealed into the side walls of your bottle.That's where the secret of gel freezer bottles lie. By placing these handy water bottles into your freezer for about two hours the freezer gel freezes, offering you a unique way to keep your beverage icy cold.Although they are hand wash only, these water bottles are durable and convenient for home or when you are on the go", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4155oDq%2BUQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00JVUXQW4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B00JX96CQA", "title": "#1 LED Tail Light! 100% LIFETIME GUARANTEE Money Back, 2-FOR-1 DEAL, Batteries Included, High Intensity Multi-Purpose Rear Bike Light - Magnus Innovation's \"Bold\" Fits on Bikes, Helmets, Backpacks, Easy Install (No Tools), Waterproof - 50% OFF TODAY Limited Time Offer, BUY NOW", "description": "Guaranteed to be SEEN by Cars. Maximum Visibility at NightThe bike tail light is high-powered with a 13 Lux red LED that is visible to motorists over 200 meters away. The innovative upward design of the silicone mount specifically angles the super bright beam to penetrate the eye level of all motorist. The tail light is made with the high quality aluminum alloy that is shock and scratch resistant. In addition with the gaps designed on both sides of the aluminum housing, you will always be seen up to 240 wide range. Also, the mounting system is equipped with a easy to install robust silicone mount strap with the two different apertures that tightly secure around the all size seat posts. Combined with a FREE extra tail light and 4 CR2032 batteries included for more convenience and ready to use right out of the box. The tail light includes 3 modes, weather resistance, and energy-efficient LEDs that last up to 50 hours on steady and 150 hours on flash mode.\"Buy from people, not the internet. Innovation around the people experience.\"Magnus Innovation Vision & Purpose:Magnus Innovation, meaning \"GREAT\" in latin, believes our deepest purpose as an organization is to focus on a \"Magnus\" experience for our people. Our vision is deeply embedded in our core values, guiding all of our decisions, actions, processes & practices to positively impact the well-being of our people: customers, community, business organizations & team members.The \"Magnus\" Experience:100% focus on authentic connections and communication. We believe in engineering our products with the customer experience in mind, and if needed, open mindedness to innovate breakthrough designs contingent on customer feedback.While Supplies Last, Click the \"Add to Cart\" button above TODAY & ride safer!", "text": "#1 LED Tail Light! 100% LIFETIME GUARANTEE Money Back, 2-FOR-1 DEAL, Batteries Included, High Intensity Multi-Purpose Rear Bike Light - Magnus Innovation's \"Bold\" Fits on Bikes, Helmets, Backpacks, Easy Install (No Tools), Waterproof - 50% OFF TODAY Limited Time Offer, BUY NOW Guaranteed to be SEEN by Cars. Maximum Visibility at NightThe bike tail light is high-powered with a 13 Lux red LED that is visible to motorists over 200 meters away. The innovative upward design of the silicone mount specifically angles the super bright beam to penetrate the eye level of all motorist. The tail light is made with the high quality aluminum alloy that is shock and scratch resistant. In addition with the gaps designed on both sides of the aluminum housing, you will always be seen up to 240 wide range. Also, the mounting system is equipped with a easy to install robust silicone mount strap with the two different apertures that tightly secure around the all size seat posts. Combined with a FREE extra tail light and 4 CR2032 batteries included for more convenience and ready to use right out of the box. The tail light includes 3 modes, weather resistance, and energy-efficient LEDs that last up to 50 hours on steady and 150 hours on flash mode.\"Buy from people, not the internet. Innovation around the people experience.\"Magnus Innovation Vision & Purpose:Magnus Innovation, meaning \"GREAT\" in latin, believes our deepest purpose as an organization is to focus on a \"Magnus\" experience for our people. Our vision is deeply embedded in our core values, guiding all of our decisions, actions, processes & practices to positively impact the well-being of our people: customers, community, business organizations & team members.The \"Magnus\" Experience:100% focus on authentic connections and communication. We believe in engineering our products with the customer experience in mind, and if needed, open mindedness to innovate breakthrough designs contingent on customer feedback.While Supplies Last, Click the \"Add to Cart\" button above TODAY & ride safer!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Oy-qBNltL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00JX96CQA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 27.77}}
{"item_id": "B00JXI2QD4", "title": "Cool Downz Cooling Towel", "description": "Beat the heat with this cooling towel, which provides instant cooling relief while exercising or relaxing on a hot day. Made from a hyper-evaporative material that retains water while remaining dry to the touch. The towel becomes considerably cooler than the outside air when wet. Cools for 1-4 hours depending on conditions. Re-wet the towel in hot or cold water and wring it out. Within minutes, it's cool again. It's also larger and less expensive than other similar brands like: Frogg Toggs, Mission Enduracool and Chill-its. Perfect for all sports, exercising, yard work, hiking, golf and any other activity when it's hot.", "text": "Cool Downz Cooling Towel Beat the heat with this cooling towel, which provides instant cooling relief while exercising or relaxing on a hot day. Made from a hyper-evaporative material that retains water while remaining dry to the touch. The towel becomes considerably cooler than the outside air when wet. Cools for 1-4 hours depending on conditions. Re-wet the towel in hot or cold water and wring it out. Within minutes, it's cool again. It's also larger and less expensive than other similar brands like: Frogg Toggs, Mission Enduracool and Chill-its. Perfect for all sports, exercising, yard work, hiking, golf and any other activity when it's hot.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rSGmPGWwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00JXI2QD4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "Hot & Cold Therapy"]], "price": 5.99}}
