{"item_id": "B00K3DRJD0", "title": "One Point Sling \"SofSling\" One Point Bungee Sling by Aspen Ridge Sports One point Sling for Paintball Guns, Rifles and Shotguns with 5 Year Unconditional Warranty From Aspen Ridge Sports Store Only", "description": "\"SofSling\" One Point Bungee Sling by Aspen Ridge SportsThe \"SofSling\" Single Point Sling is an adjustable sling that keeps your paintball gun secured to your person with enough slack (bungee) to make it quickly deployable.- Reduce shock from carrying because bungees absord the shock from activities.- Keeps Your Paintball Gun at the ready, while still being able to quickly engage a target.- The \"SofSling\" Single Point Sling is an adjustable sling that keeps your gun secured to your person with enough slack (bungee) to make it quickly deployable.Main BenefitThe Aspen Ridge Sport \"SofSling\" take the shock out of your shoulder when dropping your primary airsoft gun to 2nd gun or any other tasks required while carrying your gun. Sling features 2 release mechanisms: a metal snap hook that attaches to a hook and a quick-release buckle. The quick-release buckle is easily reached by your free hand.Benefits- Heavy Duty 1 1/2\" Nylon Webbing to stand up to the abuse dished out by use in all types of environments and weather- Aluminum 1/2\" snap hook attachment- Fully adjustable sling- *You will need some means to hook the sling onto your gun!*5 Year Unconditional WarrantyClick The \"Add To Cart\" Below Right Now to Purchase Your Own \"SofSling\" One Point Bungee Sling To Buy Now", "text": "One Point Sling \"SofSling\" One Point Bungee Sling by Aspen Ridge Sports One point Sling for Paintball Guns, Rifles and Shotguns with 5 Year Unconditional Warranty From Aspen Ridge Sports Store Only \"SofSling\" One Point Bungee Sling by Aspen Ridge SportsThe \"SofSling\" Single Point Sling is an adjustable sling that keeps your paintball gun secured to your person with enough slack (bungee) to make it quickly deployable.- Reduce shock from carrying because bungees absord the shock from activities.- Keeps Your Paintball Gun at the ready, while still being able to quickly engage a target.- The \"SofSling\" Single Point Sling is an adjustable sling that keeps your gun secured to your person with enough slack (bungee) to make it quickly deployable.Main BenefitThe Aspen Ridge Sport \"SofSling\" take the shock out of your shoulder when dropping your primary airsoft gun to 2nd gun or any other tasks required while carrying your gun. Sling features 2 release mechanisms: a metal snap hook that attaches to a hook and a quick-release buckle. The quick-release buckle is easily reached by your free hand.Benefits- Heavy Duty 1 1/2\" Nylon Webbing to stand up to the abuse dished out by use in all types of environments and weather- Aluminum 1/2\" snap hook attachment- Fully adjustable sling- *You will need some means to hook the sling onto your gun!*5 Year Unconditional WarrantyClick The \"Add To Cart\" Below Right Now to Purchase Your Own \"SofSling\" One Point Bungee Sling To Buy Now", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dp6zAieHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00K3DRJD0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 19.99}}
