{"item_id": "B00K8J1JL2", "title": "Perfect Pocket Saw - 24\" Survival Pocket Chainsaw with Camouflage Pouch, Snap Buckle Closure and Belt Loop - Best for Emergencies, Camp, Backpackers, Hunters & Garden - A Must for Your Survival Gear Cache - Tough Nylon Handles - Guaranteed For Life!", "description": "Be Prepared For An Unexpected EmergencyPerfect Pocket Saw: A Simple Tool For Demanding SituationsIf the power is out after a storm or you're in the wilderness in need of firewood the Perfect Pocket Saw can be your friend or maybe even a life saver. It is compact, lightweight and ready to use with no electricity or gas, surprisingly simple in design, easy to use without complicated instructions.• Lightweight packable and easily storable.• High strength alloy steel heat treated, resist rusting and corrosion.• Engineered to cut through small branches and trees.• Durable, reusable and the steel teeth can be sharpened.• Also suitable for simple garden use around the home.• Also suitable for simple garden use around the home.• Simple to maintain and care for. Clean loose leaves, twigs and debris from the teeth, wipe clean and periodically oil the teeth with a little bar and chain oil, WD 40 or for an environmentally friendly solution you can use a little vegetable oil.Click the Add to Cart button to Buy Now", "text": "Perfect Pocket Saw - 24\" Survival Pocket Chainsaw with Camouflage Pouch, Snap Buckle Closure and Belt Loop - Best for Emergencies, Camp, Backpackers, Hunters & Garden - A Must for Your Survival Gear Cache - Tough Nylon Handles - Guaranteed For Life! Be Prepared For An Unexpected EmergencyPerfect Pocket Saw: A Simple Tool For Demanding SituationsIf the power is out after a storm or you're in the wilderness in need of firewood the Perfect Pocket Saw can be your friend or maybe even a life saver. It is compact, lightweight and ready to use with no electricity or gas, surprisingly simple in design, easy to use without complicated instructions.• Lightweight packable and easily storable.• High strength alloy steel heat treated, resist rusting and corrosion.• Engineered to cut through small branches and trees.• Durable, reusable and the steel teeth can be sharpened.• Also suitable for simple garden use around the home.• Also suitable for simple garden use around the home.• Simple to maintain and care for. Clean loose leaves, twigs and debris from the teeth, wipe clean and periodically oil the teeth with a little bar and chain oil, WD 40 or for an environmentally friendly solution you can use a little vegetable oil.Click the Add to Cart button to Buy Now", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tGSp81%2BxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00K8J1JL2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Saws"]], "price": 10.95}}
