{"item_id": "B00KHJ93NE", "title": "[2 PACK] 100% Microfiber Yoga Towels and Travel Towels - Super Absorbent and Lightweight - Lifetime Warranty", "description": "The Friendly Swede 100% Microfiber Yoga Towels and Travel TowelsWhen practicing yoga, sports, travelling, camping or going to the pool, never be without The Friendly Swede's 100% Microfiber TowelsABOUT THIS PRODUCTOnce you try The Friendly Swede Microfiber Towels, you'll never go back to cotton! Microfiber is the ultimate material for yoga, travel, sports, camping and backpacking towels.Incredibly lightweight and compact, our microfiber towels are very portable and practical.The Friendly Swede towels are made of a 80% Polyester and 20% polyamide microfiber weave that gives strength, durability and comfort.Microfiber is super-absorbent. Our towels can hold up to 4x their own weight in water and dry in minutes.CONTENTS80% Polyester 20 % polyamide towel, grey80% Polyester 20 % polyamide towel, blueNote - These towels are machine washable. Wash separately the first 3-4 times as color may bleed. Never use bleach or fabric softener or wash with cotton.OUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them.This Product is sold with The Friendly Swede Lifetime Warranty. Please see our Amazon Storefront Page for more information about our Lifetime Warranty. The Friendly Swede is a registered trademark protected by US Trademark Law.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "text": "[2 PACK] 100% Microfiber Yoga Towels and Travel Towels - Super Absorbent and Lightweight - Lifetime Warranty The Friendly Swede 100% Microfiber Yoga Towels and Travel TowelsWhen practicing yoga, sports, travelling, camping or going to the pool, never be without The Friendly Swede's 100% Microfiber TowelsABOUT THIS PRODUCTOnce you try The Friendly Swede Microfiber Towels, you'll never go back to cotton! Microfiber is the ultimate material for yoga, travel, sports, camping and backpacking towels.Incredibly lightweight and compact, our microfiber towels are very portable and practical.The Friendly Swede towels are made of a 80% Polyester and 20% polyamide microfiber weave that gives strength, durability and comfort.Microfiber is super-absorbent. Our towels can hold up to 4x their own weight in water and dry in minutes.CONTENTS80% Polyester 20 % polyamide towel, grey80% Polyester 20 % polyamide towel, blueNote - These towels are machine washable. Wash separately the first 3-4 times as color may bleed. Never use bleach or fabric softener or wash with cotton.OUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them.This Product is sold with The Friendly Swede Lifetime Warranty. Please see our Amazon Storefront Page for more information about our Lifetime Warranty. The Friendly Swede is a registered trademark protected by US Trademark Law.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aydY38-QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00KHJ93NE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]], "price": 19.99}}
