y The Friendly Swede The Friendly Swede Speed Jump Ropes BundleGet your beach body back this summer with The Friendly Swede's Pack of 2 Crossfit Skipping Ropes - the fastest and easiest way to burn calories, lose weight and build and tone muscle.Our bundle of fast, tangle-free ropes allow you to perfect your technique for Double Unders, Crossovers, Scissors and Criss-crosses - jump easier, longer and more effectively.ABOUT THIS PRODUCTSPEED ROPES - Super fast internal bearings design to allow faster, smoother jumpingTANGLE FREE - Ropes won't kink or tangle during useDURABLE - TPU-coated steel wire for maximum durability - extra bearings to extend life of ropesADJUSTABLE - 10 feet adjustable cords, suitable for athletes up to 6'5\"CONTENTS2 x Speed Jump Ropes2 x Extra Bearings SetsSport TowelTravel PouchAdjustment / Bearing Replacement Instruction Booklet**Adjustment requires a screwdriver and wire cutters - if wire cutters are unavailable, use inclded cable ties to secure ropes.OUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them.Ropes are sold withThe Friendly Swede Lifetime Warranty. Please see our Amazon Storefront Page for more information about our Lifetime Warranty. The Friendly Swede is a registered trademark protected by US Trademark Law.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-1QK9gjJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00KQG9K18.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Jump Ropes"]], "price": 15.99}}
