{"item_id": "B00KWR4CIM", "title": "[2 PACK] Premium Running Belts - Expandable & Water Resistant Pockets - Fits Most Phones - Adjustable and Stretchable Waistband - Bounce-Free Design - Durable and Lightweight - Lifetime Warranty (Hot Pink + Purple)", "description": "The Friendly Swede Running Belts (2 Pack)Take your essentials with you, with The Friendly Swede's Premium Running BeltsThe perfect way to carry your essentials when out and about - expandable, water resistant pockets in a lightweight belt allow you to easily carry your phone, keys, cards, money and energy bars. Dual pockets allow you to separate your phone and keys to avoid scratching.Belts are great for runners, cyclists and hikers, but can also be used for traveling and sightseeing.Strong adjustable elastic waistband ensures belts stay in place and don't bounce or chafe during use.Product Features• 1.5\" thick belt made of an elastic polyester weave• Fits 27\" - 43\" waists• Weighs 2.4 Ounces• Hand washing preferred• Strong and durable buckleCONTENTS2 x Running belt with dual pocketsOUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "text": "[2 PACK] Premium Running Belts - Expandable & Water Resistant Pockets - Fits Most Phones - Adjustable and Stretchable Waistband - Bounce-Free Design - Durable and Lightweight - Lifetime Warranty (Hot Pink + Purple) The Friendly Swede Running Belts (2 Pack)Take your essentials with you, with The Friendly Swede's Premium Running BeltsThe perfect way to carry your essentials when out and about - expandable, water resistant pockets in a lightweight belt allow you to easily carry your phone, keys, cards, money and energy bars. Dual pockets allow you to separate your phone and keys to avoid scratching.Belts are great for runners, cyclists and hikers, but can also be used for traveling and sightseeing.Strong adjustable elastic waistband ensures belts stay in place and don't bounce or chafe during use.Product Features• 1.5\" thick belt made of an elastic polyester weave• Fits 27\" - 43\" waists• Weighs 2.4 Ounces• Hand washing preferred• Strong and durable buckleCONTENTS2 x Running belt with dual pocketsOUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514WsDd33SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00KWR4CIM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00KWXBZPE", "title": "Ouddy Mini Bike Pump - Compact & Portable Micro Bike Pump - Road, Mountain Or BMX Bike Tire Pump - Presta & Schrader Compatible - Premium CNC Aluminum - Lightweight & Compact - Lifetime Warranty - The Last Bike Pump You'll Ever Need", "description": "You'll find this to be one of the best bike accessory purchases you'll make. Here's why: - We use only high quality aluminum alloy so you get the most durable construction but lightest bike pump (incredibly only 3.28 oz) - It's portable size (7.7 inches long, .78 inch diameter) and mounting kit means it can fit perfectly on your bike frame under your bottle cage without any interference or it can be easily carried in a bike bag. - It's specifically designed to optimize air flow with every pump which means minimum resistance when pumping up a tire - it's much easier than using other mini bike pumps. - Perfect fit for your tire valve - easily compatible with Presta and Schrader Valves - quickly re-configure the pump head so there's no need to carry two pumps or additional adapters. - Unlike many other manufacturers, our process is automated and computer controlled (CNC) for perfect precision. You get a pump that is easy to use, extremely efficient and a perfect fit on your tires. Designing for portability means you can take it anywhere without effort in case you need to perform an emergency repair, or just put more pressure in your tire and it comes with a needle valve for inflating sports balls as well!", "text": "Ouddy Mini Bike Pump - Compact & Portable Micro Bike Pump - Road, Mountain Or BMX Bike Tire Pump - Presta & Schrader Compatible - Premium CNC Aluminum - Lightweight & Compact - Lifetime Warranty - The Last Bike Pump You'll Ever Need You'll find this to be one of the best bike accessory purchases you'll make. Here's why: - We use only high quality aluminum alloy so you get the most durable construction but lightest bike pump (incredibly only 3.28 oz) - It's portable size (7.7 inches long, .78 inch diameter) and mounting kit means it can fit perfectly on your bike frame under your bottle cage without any interference or it can be easily carried in a bike bag. - It's specifically designed to optimize air flow with every pump which means minimum resistance when pumping up a tire - it's much easier than using other mini bike pumps. - Perfect fit for your tire valve - easily compatible with Presta and Schrader Valves - quickly re-configure the pump head so there's no need to carry two pumps or additional adapters. - Unlike many other manufacturers, our process is automated and computer controlled (CNC) for perfect precision. You get a pump that is easy to use, extremely efficient and a perfect fit on your tires. Designing for portability means you can take it anywhere without effort in case you need to perform an emergency repair, or just put more pressure in your tire and it comes with a needle valve for inflating sports balls as well!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PNZk5dXyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00KWXBZPE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B00KYC0DQU", "title": "Camping Water Bottle - Best for Sports Water Bottle and Accessories", "description": "THE SECRET TO FORMING A WATER HABIT AND WHY THIS H2O BOTTLE WILL HELPAlways carry a water bottle with you wherever you go. This H2O water bottle will make it easier to always have access to water. The easier access you have to water, the more likely you will drink it.There are so many reasons to drink water: Water keeps you hydrated and increases your energy level, helps skin look better, helps energize muscles, helps your kidneys, and helps maintain normal bowel function.You will be happy with this water bottle with the comfort grip, which makes it easy to hold. Push-pull lid. Easy to clean, hand wash only. BPA-free. Made in USA - 27 oz - Lightweight squeezable. Great for camping, biking, walking, exercise. Bottle can be recycled.If you are not 100% satisfied with the H2O water bottle, we have a lifetime money-back guarantee. No questions asked.CLICK THE \"ADD TO CART\" BUTTON NOW AT THE TOP OF YOUR SCREEN TO PURCHASE", "text": "Camping Water Bottle - Best for Sports Water Bottle and Accessories THE SECRET TO FORMING A WATER HABIT AND WHY THIS H2O BOTTLE WILL HELPAlways carry a water bottle with you wherever you go. This H2O water bottle will make it easier to always have access to water. The easier access you have to water, the more likely you will drink it.There are so many reasons to drink water: Water keeps you hydrated and increases your energy level, helps skin look better, helps energize muscles, helps your kidneys, and helps maintain normal bowel function.You will be happy with this water bottle with the comfort grip, which makes it easy to hold. Push-pull lid. Easy to clean, hand wash only. BPA-free. Made in USA - 27 oz - Lightweight squeezable. Great for camping, biking, walking, exercise. Bottle can be recycled.If you are not 100% satisfied with the H2O water bottle, we have a lifetime money-back guarantee. No questions asked.CLICK THE \"ADD TO CART\" BUTTON NOW AT THE TOP OF YOUR SCREEN TO PURCHASE", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YuywcZLYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00KYC0DQU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B00KYIECY8", "title": "Silicone 7 LED Bike Lights - Bundle of 2 Lights (Headlight and Tail Light) - Super Bright - Fits All Handlebars and Seatposts - Water and Shock Resistant - Instant Installation and Removal - Lifetime Warranty", "description": "The Friendly Swede 7 LED Bike Light BundleBe safe and be seen with The Friendly Swede's premium quality bike lights.ABOUT THIS PRODUCTWith 7 super bright LEDs on each light, The Friendly Swede's Bike Lights give you maximum visibility at night and in bad weather.Intelligent placement of LEDs allows you to be seen from all angles, not just from oncoming and following traffic.Thanks to their stretchable silicone casing, the lights can be securely fastened on your handlebars, seatpost or frame, and can be installed and removed in seconds.To ensure durability and weather resistance, the battery housing and the circuits have been designed with two-tier protection - an outer layer of high quality silicone and a tough plastic inner shell.Lights can also be used for walkers, baby strollers and a variety of other purposes.CONTENTS2 x The Friendly Swede 7 LED Bike Lights (white and red)OUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "text": "Silicone 7 LED Bike Lights - Bundle of 2 Lights (Headlight and Tail Light) - Super Bright - Fits All Handlebars and Seatposts - Water and Shock Resistant - Instant Installation and Removal - Lifetime Warranty The Friendly Swede 7 LED Bike Light BundleBe safe and be seen with The Friendly Swede's premium quality bike lights.ABOUT THIS PRODUCTWith 7 super bright LEDs on each light, The Friendly Swede's Bike Lights give you maximum visibility at night and in bad weather.Intelligent placement of LEDs allows you to be seen from all angles, not just from oncoming and following traffic.Thanks to their stretchable silicone casing, the lights can be securely fastened on your handlebars, seatpost or frame, and can be installed and removed in seconds.To ensure durability and weather resistance, the battery housing and the circuits have been designed with two-tier protection - an outer layer of high quality silicone and a tough plastic inner shell.Lights can also be used for walkers, baby strollers and a variety of other purposes.CONTENTS2 x The Friendly Swede 7 LED Bike Lights (white and red)OUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PPORr1zQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00KYIECY8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B00KYJI7TS", "title": "Premium Portable Bike Pump - Fits Presta and Schrader Valves - Sturdy Aluminium Alloy Construction - Integrated Flexible Hose - Also Includes Frame Mounting Kit, Plastic Tire Lever Set, Aluminium Tapered Nozzle, Carrying Bag and 3 Inflating Needles - Lifetime Warranty", "description": "The Friendly Swede Premium Portable Bike PumpCompact, lightweight, durable, easy to use, this little portable power package handles pumping your tires with ease.Product features• Color: Black• Capacity: 130 psi• Size: 9.7 by 1.0 inches collapsed, 22.3 by 1.0 inches extended• Weight: 6.3 ounces• Head: Presta/Schrader compatible• Logo: Laser printedThis powerful yet lightweight pump easily inflates your tires anytime. The integrated flexible hose makes pumping more convenient and protects the valve stem from damage. Easy to reach desired pressure.Switch between Presta and Schrader mode within seconds by adjusting the pump head.CONTENTS1 x Bicycle Pump1 x Frame mounting kit (2 screws, 2 rubber buckles, 1 frame mount)2 x Plastic Tire lever1 x Aluminium tapered nozzle1 x Carrying bag3 x Inflating needleOUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "text": "Premium Portable Bike Pump - Fits Presta and Schrader Valves - Sturdy Aluminium Alloy Construction - Integrated Flexible Hose - Also Includes Frame Mounting Kit, Plastic Tire Lever Set, Aluminium Tapered Nozzle, Carrying Bag and 3 Inflating Needles - Lifetime Warranty The Friendly Swede Premium Portable Bike PumpCompact, lightweight, durable, easy to use, this little portable power package handles pumping your tires with ease.Product features• Color: Black• Capacity: 130 psi• Size: 9.7 by 1.0 inches collapsed, 22.3 by 1.0 inches extended• Weight: 6.3 ounces• Head: Presta/Schrader compatible• Logo: Laser printedThis powerful