{"item_id": "B00L185JS8", "title": "Bands - Best Elastic Exercise Fitness Workout Loop Band Sets - 100% Natural Latex Material - Home Gym Equipment System - Low Impact Physical Therapy Aids Rehabilitation and Immobility - Resistance Training, Legs, Arms, Shoulders and Body - Ideal for P90x, Insanity, Yoga, Pilates, Asylum, and Beachbody. Burn Fat, Lose Weight and Feel Great - Free X-heavy Band and Light Breathable Carry Pouch - Life Time Guarantee - Buy Now 60% Off Limited Time", "description": "The Secret to Never Having to Buy Another Band!The Best Quality Loop Bands for Your Investment* Best Quality 100% Natural Latex Material* Tested and Certified to EN-71, SGS Certification* Non-toxic, and Environmentally Friendly* 4 Resistance Bands - Red, Blue, Green and Grey* Individually Marked - Light, Medium, Heavy, and X-Heavy* Increase Workout Intensity in the Home or Gym* Variable Resistance Band Weights to Suit all Levels of Fitness* Ideal for Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation* Won't Over Stretch* Won't ever Snap* One Time Purchase* Light Weight Breathable Carry Case* Band Size - 50x5cmsWant to enjoy the benefits of regular exercise but don't have the time or can't afford costly gym memberships? Are you tied to your home through immobility or child care? Working long hours or travelling and just can't make or find a gym?Get an intense workout no matter where you are. No Gym necessary, simply unzip your lightweight portable gym band bag in the comfort of your own home or hotel room and you're good to go!Limited Bonuses* Free Grey X-Heavy Band* Stylish Breathable Carry CaseComplete peace of mind - We are so confident in the quality of our product we offer a no hassle life time replacement guarantee.Don't wait on this, limited bonuses, price will be going up soon.Once you click the buy button you can get started within 24hrs.", "text": "Bands - Best Elastic Exercise Fitness Workout Loop Band Sets - 100% Natural Latex Material - Home Gym Equipment System - Low Impact Physical Therapy Aids Rehabilitation and Immobility - Resistance Training, Legs, Arms, Shoulders and Body - Ideal for P90x, Insanity, Yoga, Pilates, Asylum, and Beachbody. Burn Fat, Lose Weight and Feel Great - Free X-heavy Band and Light Breathable Carry Pouch - Life Time Guarantee - Buy Now 60% Off Limited Time The Secret to Never Having to Buy Another Band!The Best Quality Loop Bands for Your Investment* Best Quality 100% Natural Latex Material* Tested and Certified to EN-71, SGS Certification* Non-toxic, and Environmentally Friendly* 4 Resistance Bands - Red, Blue, Green and Grey* Individually Marked - Light, Medium, Heavy, and X-Heavy* Increase Workout Intensity in the Home or Gym* Variable Resistance Band Weights to Suit all Levels of Fitness* Ideal for Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation* Won't Over Stretch* Won't ever Snap* One Time Purchase* Light Weight Breathable Carry Case* Band Size - 50x5cmsWant to enjoy the benefits of regular exercise but don't have the time or can't afford costly gym memberships? Are you tied to your home through immobility or child care? Working long hours or travelling and just can't make or find a gym?Get an intense workout no matter where you are. No Gym necessary, simply unzip your lightweight portable gym band bag in the comfort of your own home or hotel room and you're good to go!Limited Bonuses* Free Grey X-Heavy Band* Stylish Breathable Carry CaseComplete peace of mind - We are so confident in the quality of our product we offer a no hassle life time replacement guarantee.Don't wait on this, limited bonuses, price will be going up soon.Once you click the buy button you can get started within 24hrs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Tmq3zyC4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00L185JS8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B00L1N7FDK", "title": "Fox Outfitters Ultralight Series Self Inflating Mattress - Perfect Foam Sleep Pad for Backpacking, Hiking, Camping (Long)", "description": "Built for the OutdoorsSelf-inflating Air Mats by Fox Outfitters are carefully designed for serious campers and backpackers. Crafted on a foundation of time-tested materials and components, our self-inflating mattresses are lightweight, compressible and now softer than ever, making them a perfect travel companion.Lightweight and DurableThese light and versatile foam core pads are great for cold temperatures or those looking for a comfortable and lightweight self-inflating pad. We've taken outdoor living to a new level of comfort by covering our mats with a lightweight fabric that's amazingly durable. This weight reduction improves upon an already portable mattress that uses innovative die-cut foams to provide comfort and support where you need it most.Premium MaterialsOur designs incorporate premium fabrics that include an internal polyurethane coating and durable air valves for years of use. Each pad is individually inflated and tested. Whether you're out for a weekend with the family or on a solo trip through challenging terrain, our self-inflating air mats will help you stay comfortable all night.SizesLong: 25\" x 77\" x 1.5\"Regular: 20\" x 72\" x 1.5\"", "text": "Fox Outfitters Ultralight Series Self Inflating Mattress - Perfect Foam Sleep Pad for Backpacking, Hiking, Camping (Long) Built for the OutdoorsSelf-inflating Air Mats by Fox Outfitters are carefully designed for serious campers and backpackers. Crafted on a foundation of time-tested materials and components, our self-inflating mattresses are lightweight, compressible and now softer than ever, making them a perfect travel companion.Lightweight and DurableThese light and versatile foam core pads are great for cold temperatures or those looking for a comfortable and lightweight self-inflating pad. We've taken outdoor living to a new level of comfort by covering our mats with a lightweight fabric that's amazingly durable. This weight reduction improves upon an already portable mattress that uses innovative die-cut foams to provide comfort and support where you need it most.Premium MaterialsOur designs incorporate premium fabrics that include an internal polyurethane coating and durable air valves for years of use. Each pad is individually inflated and tested. Whether you're out for a weekend with the family or on a solo trip through challenging terrain, our self-inflating air mats will help you stay comfortable all night.SizesLong: 25\" x 77\" x 1.5\"Regular: 20\" x 72\" x 1.5\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410zKEFWA%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00L1N7FDK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00L4ZCPRG", "title": "[3 PACK] Ball Pump Kit - Includes 3 Pumps, 9 Inflating Needles, 3 Flexible Hoses, 3 Plastic Adapters for Exercise Balls, Inflatable Toys and More - (Colors - Blue, Green and Red) Lifetime Warranty", "description": "The Friendly Swede Complete Ball Pump Kit 3 PackFeeling flat? You need The Friendly Swede's 3 Pack of sports ball pumps.ABOUT THIS PRODUCTSmall, easily portable and durable, the simple, yet clever design of The Friendly Swede ball pumps make them an essential part of any sports kit.With two types of inflating nozzle, these pumps are suitable for almost any type or size of valve - sports balls, yoga balls, inflatable pool toys, airbeds etc can all be quickly and easily pumped up.Built-in needle storage means you'll never lose or forget your needle when you must need it (does NOT fit the tapered nozzles).Flexible removable hoses make pumping easier, and minimize risk of needle damage.CONTENTS3 x Sports ball pump (blue,green, red)9 x Inflating needle3 x Plastic adapter3 x Flexible hoseOUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "text": "[3 PACK] Ball Pump Kit - Includes 3 Pumps, 9 Inflating Needles, 3 Flexible Hoses, 3 Plastic Adapters for Exercise Balls, Inflatable Toys and More - (Colors - Blue, Green and Red) Lifetime Warranty The Friendly Swede Complete Ball Pump Kit 3 PackFeeling flat? You need The Friendly Swede's 3 Pack of sports ball pumps.ABOUT THIS PRODUCTSmall, easily portable and durable, the simple, yet clever design of The Friendly Swede ball pumps make them an essential part of any sports kit.With two types of inflating nozzle, these pumps are suitable for almost any type or size of valve - sports balls, yoga balls, inflatable pool toys, airbeds etc can all be quickly and easily pumped up.Built-in needle storage means you'll never lose or forget your needle when you must need it (does NOT fit the tapered nozzles).Flexible removable hoses make pumping easier, and minimize risk of needle damage.CONTENTS3 x Sports ball pump (blue,green, red)9 x Inflating needle3 x Plastic adapter3 x Flexible hoseOUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51exONzD4wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00L4ZCPRG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Inflation Devices & Accessories"]], "price": 9.49}}
{"item_id": "B00L8HGYX6", "title": "Premium Parachute Hammock PLUS Hanging Straps [PAIR] - 100% Nylon Silk Ultra-Strong Parachute Hammock, with paracord hammock cords - product includes 2 x Poly-Filament Webbing Hanging Straps/Hammock Suspension system - Lifetime Warranty (Purple)", "description": "The Friendly Swede Premium Parachute Hammock and Tree StrapsTake it easy with The Friendly Swede's 100% Nylon Silk Parachute Hammocks and tree straps.A comfortable and relaxing way to enjoy the great outdoors - The Friendly Swede's Premium Parachute Hammocks can be put up in seconds, are easily adjustable and super-convenientProduct includes a pair of hanging straps, specially designed to work on a range of surfaces and to avoid damage to trees, and hanging instructions to ensure stress-free assemblyHammocks are washable and dry in minutes - total weight of hammocks less than 1.5lb (600g)CONTENTS100% Nylon Silk Hammock with paracord and carabiners (total length 12ft)2 x Poly-Filament Webbing Hanging Straps with metal O rings (8ft each)Hanging InstructionsNotes:Supports weights up to 350lb (160kg)Children under the age of 7 should not use the hammock without adult supervisionOUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them. This Product is sold withThe Friendly Swede Lifetime Warranty.Please see our Amazon Storefront Page for more information about our Lifetime Warranty.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "text": "Premium Parachute Hammock PLUS Hanging Straps [PAIR] - 100% Nylon Silk Ultra-Strong Parachute Hammock, with paracord hammock cords - product includes 2 x Poly-Filament Webbing Hanging Straps/Hammock Suspension system - Lifetime Warranty (Purple) The Friendly Swede Premium Parachute Hammock and Tree StrapsTake it easy with The Friendly Swede's 100% Nylon Silk Parachute Hammocks and tree straps.A comfortable and relaxing way to enjoy the great outdoors - The Friendly Swede's Premium Parachute Hammocks can be put up in seconds, are easily adjustable and super-convenientProduct includes a pair of hanging straps, specially designed to work on a range of surfaces and to avoid damage to trees, and hanging instructions to ensure stress-free assemblyHammocks are washable and dry in minutes - total weight of hammocks less than 1.5lb (600g)CONTENTS100% Nylon Silk Hammock with paracord and carabiners (total length 12ft)2 x Poly-Filament Webbing Hanging Straps with metal O rings (8ft each)Hanging InstructionsNotes:Supports weights up to 350lb (160kg)Children under the age of 7 should not use the hammock without adult supervisionOUR PROMISE TO YOUWe are totally obsessive about quality and customer service - if you have any questions please get in touch and we will do everything we can to solve them. This Product is sold withThe Friendly Swede Lifetime Warranty.Please see our Amazon Storefront Page for more information about our Lifetime Warranty.There's a reason they call us \"The Friendly Swede\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZqSs7orxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00L8HGYX6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]]}}
